#. ~ Help message in menu "Description of map symbols"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<2>: Description of map symbols"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid "            There are many others out there… search for them!"
msgstr "            此外还有许多其它类型的地点……找找看吧！"

#. ~ Help message in menu "Vehicles and Driving"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<r|R>: Vehicles and Driving"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid "\"Offroad\" is a rough estimate of how efficient your vehicle moves when not on pavement.  Your vehicle's safe speed, top speed, and acceleration are multiplied by roughly the offroad percentage value when your vehicle is not on the pavement.  The offroad percentage decreases as vehicle mass increases, and increases with the size and number of wheels.  Tank treads will give your vehicle an excellent offroad percentage but your vehicle will be slower due to the treads' very high rolling drag."
msgstr "“越野效率”是大致衡量你的车辆在非铺装路面上的行驶效率的指标。当车辆在非铺装路面行驶时，车辆的安全速度、最高速度和加速度会大致乘以越野效率的百分比值。越野效率会随着车辆质量的增加而降低，并随着车轮尺寸和数量的增加而提高。履带会使你的车辆获得极高的越野效率，但也会因履带自身极高的滚动阻力而降低车辆的行驶速度。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "List of item types and data"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<1>: List of item types and data"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid ""
"(       Firearm\n"
"This weapon may be loaded with ammunition with <press_reload>, unloaded with <press_unload>, and fired with <press_fire>.  Some have automatic fire, which may be used with <press_select_fire_mode> at a penalty to accuracy.  The color corresponds to the type; handguns are gray, shotguns are red, submachine guns are cyan, rifles are brown, assault rifles are blue, and heavy machine guns are light red.  Each has a dispersion rating, a bonus to damage, a rate of fire, and a maximum load.  Note that, while most firearms load fully in one action, shotguns must be loaded one shell at a time."
msgstr ""
"(       枪械\n"
"所有的枪械都可以按\"<press_reload>\"键装填，按\"<press_unload>\"键清空，按\"<press_fire>\"键开火射击，可以连发的按\"<press_select_fire_mode>\"键连发。不同枪械的颜色也不同，灰色为手枪，红色为霰弹枪，蓝绿色为冲锋枪，棕色为步枪，蓝色为突击步枪，浅红色为重机枪。每种枪械都有不同的命中率、伤害值、射速和最大装弹量。需要注意的是虽然大多数的枪械一次装填完成，但是霰弹枪一次只能装填一发子弹。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "List of item types and data"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<1>: List of item types and data"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid ""
")       Container\n"
"These items may hold other items.  Some are passable weapons.  Many will be listed with their contents, e.g. \"plastic bottle > water.\"  Those containing comestibles may be eaten with <press_eat>; this may leave an empty container."
msgstr ""
")       容器\n"
"这些物品可以用来储存其他的物品，有些可以存放武器，而其中的内容物通常显示在物品名中，比如\"塑料瓶 > 净水\"等。装有消耗品的容器可以按\"<press_eat>\"键直接使用，使用完会得到一个空容器。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "List of item types and data"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<1>: List of item types and data"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid ""
"*       Thrown weapon; simple projectile or grenade\n"
"These items are suited for throwing, and many are only useful when thrown, such as grenades, Molotov cocktails, or tear gas.  Once activated, be certain to throw these items by pressing <press_throw>, then the letter of the item."
msgstr ""
"*       投掷武器；单纯的投射物或者手雷\n"
"这些物品适合投掷，并且多数只适合用来投掷，比如手雷、燃烧瓶或是催泪瓦斯。一旦激活，确保这些物品被扔出去。按\"<press_throw>\"键，然后按物品对应按键来扔出。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "Crafting"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<k|K>: Crafting"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid "-> Applied Science is the chemistry skill; use this to craft mundane things like lye and various acids, or weaponized chemicals and various beneficial elixirs."
msgstr "-> 应用科学技能主要是化学技能。你能使用这个技能来制造各种常见的酸碱，或者把化学物质转变为武器和各种有用的药物。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "Crafting"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<k|K>: Crafting"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid "-> Electronics lets you make a wide variety of tools with intricate uses."
msgstr "-> 电子学技能使你能够制造许多具有复杂用途的电子工具。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "Crafting"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<k|K>: Crafting"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid "-> Fabrication is the generic artisan skill, used for a wide variety of gear."
msgstr "-> 制造技能是通用的工匠技术，用于制造各类物品。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "Crafting"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<k|K>: Crafting"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid "-> Food Handling is used to make tasty recipes; more intricate (and usually more nutritious) recipes require higher levels of the Food Handling skill."
msgstr "-> 食品加工技能可以用于制作美味的食物。更加复杂的菜谱能够产出更加营养的食物，但是也需要更高的食品加工技能。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "Crafting"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<k|K>: Crafting"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid "-> Tailoring is used to create basic clothing, and armor later on."
msgstr "-> 裁缝技能用于制造简单的衣物，在后期则可以制造各式护甲。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "List of item types and data"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<1>: List of item types and data"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid ""
"/       Large weapon\n"
";       Small weapon or tool\n"
",       Tiny item\n"
"These are all generic items, useful only to be wielded as a weapon.  However, some have special uses; they will show up under the TOOLS section in your inventory.  Press <press_apply> to use these."
msgstr ""
"/       大型武器\n"
";       小型武器或工具\n"
",       微型工具\n"
"\n"
"这类物品通常都是近战武器或者工具，当然有些也有特殊的功能；当你查看物品栏时会显示在\"工具\"一栏，按\"<press_apply>\"键来使用物品。"

#. ~ Help message in menu "Vehicles and Driving"
#. ~ Help message in menu "<r|R>: Vehicles and Driving"
#: data/core/help.json data/help/texts.json
msgid "10-30 MPH, or 16-48 KPH, is a good speed for beginning drivers, who tend to fumble the controls.  As your Driving skill improves, you will fumble less and less.  To simply maintain course and speed, hit <press_pause>."
msgstr "对于初学者来说，10-30英里/小时，或者16-48公里/小时，是比较适合的速度，适宜摸索熟悉驾驶方法。当你的驾驶技能提高，你的失误会越来越少。若仅为维持当前的方向和车速，按\"<press_pause>\"键。"

