#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "'Tis but a scratch?'  Bandage and disinfect it anyway to speed up healing."
msgstr "\"不过是点擦伤\"？还是包扎消毒一下，这样可以加速伤口的恢复。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A door is not the only way in or out of most places."
msgstr "门不是进出大多数地方的唯一途径。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A full stomach will not solve your starvation.  Give it time and eat regularly."
msgstr "饱餐一顿并不能立刻解决营养不良的问题。规律饮食，假以时日。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A pillow or stuffed animal will make it easier to fall asleep."
msgstr "枕头，或者毛绒玩具，让你入睡更舒适。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A survivor saved is a friend earned.  Most of the time…"
msgstr "救人一命，胜交一友。大多数时候…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Adhesive bandages are much quicker to use, but not as effective.  Perfect for minor wounds."
msgstr "创可贴使用比绷带快得多，只是效果不如绷带好。非常适合小伤口。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Afraid of wildlife?  Yell until it goes away.  But beware of what comes instead."
msgstr "害怕野生动物？大喊大叫直到吓到它离开你。但也要小心被声音引来的怪物。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "An armored enemy?  Don't give up, maybe it has some weaknesses that can be exploited."
msgstr "敌人穿了护甲？不要放弃，也许它有些可以利用的弱点。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Animals and zombies are not friends.  You can take advantage of that."
msgstr "野生动物和丧尸可不是朋友。你可以利用这点。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Arterial bleeding from a gunshot?  A tourniquet can save you from death."
msgstr "枪击导致动脉大出血？及时使用止血带可以使你免于死亡。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Athletics skill helps with swimming, climbing, and max stamina.  Don't neglect it!"
msgstr "运动技能可以提升游泳、攀爬和最大耐力。不要忽视它哟！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Auto-pickup settings can save you time when you need it.  It's fully customizable too."
msgstr "自动拾取设置能够在你需要时节省时间。当然条件可以完全自定义。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Balance armor versus encumbrance, and try not to wear bags in combat"
msgstr "平衡好护甲和累赘。在近战中就是丢下背包也能帮上大忙"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Bare ground is hard to sleep on and will make you much colder.  Try gathering a pile of leaves."
msgstr "地板太硬，无法入睡？试着垫些一堆树叶干草。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Be mindful of what, when, and how much you eat.  A balanced diet is crucial in the long run."
msgstr "注意你吃什么，何时吃，吃多少。为长远计，均衡饮食至关重要。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Being skilled does not mean being proficient.  Gain proficiency to become a master in specific areas."
msgstr "掌握一项技能并不意味着样样精通。获取专长来成为特定领域的大师。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Being wet makes the cold far worse.  Find some rainproof gear"
msgstr "淋湿会让寒冷更加难以忍受。找些防雨装备吧"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Binoculars make it easier to scout the terrain, gun scopes work too."
msgstr "用双筒望远镜更容易侦察地形，枪瞄也行。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Blinded creatures can still detect you in melee, and will remember where they last saw you."
msgstr "失明的生物仍然能在近战中察觉到你,并会记得最后一次见到你的地方。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Books carry knowledge and often recipes.  You need practical skills to utilize them.  Practice."
msgstr "书籍记载着知识，而且常有制造配方。但你需要实践经验来使用它。多练习。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Broken limb?  Improvised splints are ok, but hospitals might have better tech for it."
msgstr "腿摔断了？自制夹板也许够用，但医院里会有更合适的治疗手段。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Cameras can blind enemies with their flash in melee.  Say cheese and die!"
msgstr "在混战中可以用摄像头的闪光灯闪敌人一眼。说CHEESE!然后死吧！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Check what you can craft from time to time, even if you don't have components right now."
msgstr "多查看一下你所能制造的物品，即便你还没有找齐材料。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Cold food lasts longer.  Find a cool basement or make a root cellar."
msgstr "冰冷的食物保质期更长。找个凉快的地下室或者建个储藏地窖。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Crafting is faster if you have an actual place for it, preferably a workshop bench."
msgstr "制造物品时，如果有个踏实地方——最好是工作台，便可加快速度。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Crouching is quieter than walking and will let you hide behind some furniture."
msgstr "相比走路，蹲着能让你更安静地移动，还能方便地躲在家具背后。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Crouching or going prone make you harder to hit in ranged combat."
msgstr "蹲着或趴下有助于你在远距离战斗中更难被击中。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Did you *only* take everything not nailed down?  Go back for the nails!"
msgstr "你*只*拿走了那些没有被钉牢的物品吗？回去拿钉子！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Different characters, professions, hobbies, and scenarios can spice up your game.  Roleplay!"
msgstr "不同角色、职业、爱好和场景可以为你的游戏增添乐趣。来Role Play！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Different enemies require different weapons.  Diversify your loadout, and always have a backup"
msgstr "不同的敌人需要不同的武器。让你的装备多样化，并始终准备一个备用方案"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Dissecting bodies will help in gaining knowledge about the weaknesses of the opponents."
msgstr "解剖尸体将有助于了解敌人的弱点。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't be too greedy.  Loot doesn't matter if you're dead."
msgstr "别太贪心。死了，拿得再多又如何呢。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't fight against the odds.  There's no shame in running to survive."
msgstr "不要以寡敌众。为了活命而逃跑没什么丢人的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't get surrounded!  Always have an exit plan."
msgstr "别被包围！记得一直留好退路。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't smoke in bed!"
msgstr "别在床上抽烟！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't wait until it's too late!  Run away and live to fight another day."
msgstr "别等到感叹为时已晚！跑！为了活着，为了明天，还要战斗。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Drugs are great for quick morale boosts and more, but be aware of addiction and overdose."
msgstr "毒品能够暂时提升你的心情和属性，甚至能救命！但要小心上瘾和过量。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Dying is part of the experience.  Try again with what you've learned."
msgstr "死亡也是游戏体验的一部分。利用所学到的经验再试一次。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Eat well or your health might suffer.  Fast food is only good in a pinch."
msgstr "合理饮食，否则你的健康会受损。垃圾食品只适合在危急时食用。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Enemies can see you peeking, but they won't get a chance to shoot you."
msgstr "你偷看，敌人也能看见，只不过没机会用枪射你。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Every sensei was once a student.  NPCs can teach you and vice versa."
msgstr "每个大神都曾经是菜鸟。同伴可以教你，反之亦然。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Excessive item counts in proximity to your character can cause slowdown.  Don't be a hoarder!"
msgstr "靠近你角色的物品数量过多可能会导致游戏卡顿。别当囤积者!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Exercising daily increases your cardio fitness and therefore your stamina pool."
msgstr "运动锻炼会增强你的心肺功能，从而增加你的耐力。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal pipe."
msgstr "著名遗言：让我们用金属棍子戳一戳这个放电丧尸。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Feeling bad after waking up?  Exercise and clean living are key to a healthy lifestyle."
msgstr "醒来后感觉怪怪的？尝试更健康的饮食，你的健康会有所改善。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Feeling unwell?  Allow yourself to rest, even for a few days as needed.  Heal now, explore later."
msgstr "感觉不舒服？让自己休息一下，即便会花几天功夫。及时治疗，稍后探索。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Fight on your conditions whenever you can.  Use terrain, traps, and fire to your advantage."
msgstr "尽量对你有利的情况下战斗。充分利用地形、陷阱和火焰为你带来的优势。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Fight smarter, not harder.  Even simple traps can turn the tide in your favor."
msgstr "要聪明地战斗，而不是蛮干。即使是简单的陷阱，也能扭转局势，从而占上风。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Fires can spread easily, especially with an abundance of fuel."
msgstr "火势很容易蔓延，特别是在可燃物很多的时候。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."
msgstr "大灾变前的食物不会永远保持新鲜。记住这一点。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "For free in the construction menu: a crafting spot, a firewood source, and a practice target."
msgstr "建造菜单中无需材料就能标记：地面制造点，柴火源，练习目标。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Foraging isn't easy.  It takes survival skill, perception, and a lot of luck."
msgstr "觅食可不容易。这需要生存技能、观察力，还有很多很多运气。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food doesn't rot, but may be inedible if not defrosted."
msgstr "冷冻食品不会腐坏，但是有的不解冻就没法食用。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food?  Put it by a fire or heat it up by activating a pan."
msgstr "食物冻上了？把它放在火堆旁或者用锅加热一下。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Going prone can make it harder for shrapnel to hit you."
msgstr "趴下弹片更难击中你。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Grabbed enemies can't dodge. If something won't sit still, try making it."
msgstr "被抓住的敌人难以闪躲。如果有什么不安分的东西，可以试着这么做。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Grenades create very fine shrapnel which isn't great against armor.  Pipebombs on the other hand…"
msgstr "手榴弹会产生非常细的小碎片，对装甲不太有效。另一方面，管状炸弹嘛……"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Handguns are powerful and easy to use even when you're badly wounded.  Always keep one handy."
msgstr "手枪威力大，使用方便，即使你受了重伤也能使用。务必随身携带一把。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Holsters, quivers, sheaths, and ammo pouches can be much faster than using a backpack."
msgstr "枪套、箭袋、刀鞘和弹药袋用起来比背包快多了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Hope for the best but prepare for the worst.  A backup stash of necessities can save the day."
msgstr "抱最好的希望，做最坏的准备。备用的必需品可以让你转危为安。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If a wound gets dirty, find some antiseptic quick!  Infections can be deadly."
msgstr "如果伤口被弄脏应赶紧找点消毒药！要是感染可能要你命。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If it's too dark to see, you'll suffer penalties to dodge, melee, and aiming."
msgstr "要是太黑了看不清，你格挡、近战和瞄准都会受到影响。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If the weather's too bad, you might just want to stay home."
msgstr "天气太差的话，你还是呆家里比较好。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you like archery but lack the strength, consider a crossbow."
msgstr "如果你喜欢射箭但力量不足，可以考虑使用弩。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you're breaking in, be sure you also know how to get back out."
msgstr "如果你准备破门而入，一定要知道怎么出去。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you're stuck inside with a broken leg, read some books to pass the time."
msgstr "如果你因为断腿被困在室内，可以读一些书来打发时间。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Insecticide is really good at killing bugs, even the big ones."
msgstr "杀虫剂在杀虫方面真的很有效，即使是那些大的虫子也不例外。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "It can take days or even weeks to put on weight after you've lost too much."
msgstr "恢复你丢失太多的体重可能需要几天甚至几周的时间。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "It's a good idea to keep books around the house.  You never know when you'll be laid up."
msgstr "在家放点书倒也不错。毕竟谁知道那天你会倒下难起。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Just because a place is dangerous doesn't mean it's worth looting."
msgstr "仅仅因为一个地方很危险并不意味着值得去那里搜刮。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Just because they're all monsters doesn't mean they're friends.  Take advantage of infighting."
msgstr "它们全是怪物，并不代表它们之间会是朋友。不妨制造个内斗。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Keep a few spare weapons and pieces of armor around your base.  Switching is easier than repairing."
msgstr "在你的基地附近备几件武器和护甲。切换比修理更方便。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Keep essentials in your clothing pockets in case you have to ditch your backpack."
msgstr "把关键物品放在衣服口袋里，以防你不得不扔掉背包。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Knowledge can't replace practical skill and experience, but it will help you get them faster."
msgstr "理论知识不能代替实践技能和经验，但了解理论让你能更快地获得实践经验。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Large targets are easier to hit."
msgstr "靶子越大，正好打。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Learn to use zone sorting to sort your loot in one go.  Y to set up zones, O to sort items."
msgstr "学会使用区域管理来一步到位地对物资进行分类。按 Y 键设置区域，按 O 键整理物品。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Learning how to play?  Visit the keybindings menu and learn your ropes."
msgstr "新手入门？查看按键设置菜单可以了解游戏中各种快捷键的诀窍。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Length matters… at least when it comes to shoving a shovel in your backpack."
msgstr "长度很重要……至少在你试图朝背包里塞铲子时就会明白。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Light itself doesn't draw zombies, it's the sight, noise, or smell of the living."
msgstr "光亮本身并不吸引丧尸，而是需要看到、听到或者嗅到你。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Like to gamble?  Use mutagen!  Be a winner today!"
msgstr "喜欢赌一把？试试诱变剂，今天就摇身一变人生赢家！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Long trip ahead?  Auto travel and auto drive to your desired destination."
msgstr "要长途旅行吗？使用自动移动和自动驾驶功能可以让你你轻松移动到目的地。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Major blood loss?  Drink plenty, supplement iron, and rest to regenerate your red blood cells."
msgstr "大出血了？多喝水，补点铁，再休息下，让红细胞再生。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Makeshift weapons can break easily, but they are weapons, and can be made again."
msgstr "临时的简易自制武器很容易坏，但它们依旧是武器，可以很容易的再次制造出来。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Many items have contextual uses.  Use the item action menu to find out what you can do with them."
msgstr "许多物品都对应的使用功能。用物品使用菜单可以查看使用它们的用途。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Many items have special actions.  Try to find out what they do."
msgstr "许多物品都有特殊的功能。试着找出它们的用途。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Mark the items you carry as favorites so you can easily identify new items and drop them in bulk."
msgstr "将随身携带的物品标记为收藏，以便轻松识别新物品并将其批量丢下。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Moose may not be your friend."
msgstr "驼鹿可能不是你的朋友。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Most adults are too heavy to climb drainpipes, so go find or make a stepladder!"
msgstr "通常成年人太重，爬不了水管，那就找一个或造一个小梯子吧！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of pills."
msgstr "绝大部分药物无法立刻生效，不要因为感觉药物没起效就吞下整瓶药。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running away."
msgstr "大多数丧尸都只会穿过载具而不会绕着走。逃跑的时候要记住这一点。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Murky water is unsafe to drink, water might be safe, clean water is always safe."
msgstr "「浑浊的水」不适合喝；「水」也许是安全的；「干净的水」总是安全的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Mutagen can dramatically improve your stats.  Bionics can help a little, too."
msgstr "突变剂可以大幅提升你的属性，生化插件也能提升一些。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Mutant meat is toxic, but surely a little bit would be OK."
msgstr "变异的肉有毒！但吃一点没问题吧..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Mutant meat isn't good for you, but if you're hungry, surely you can eat just a little…"
msgstr "变异肉对你不好，但如果你饿了，当然可以吃一点……"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "NSAIDs are all the same type of drug and their effects don't stack, but they do with acetaminophen."
msgstr "非甾体抗炎药都是同一类药物，它们的效果不会叠加，但会与乙酰氨基酚叠加。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Need experience with crafting and such?  Use the training recipes to master the ins and outs."
msgstr "需要手工艺或者如此类的经验吗？使用烹饪食谱以掌握各项细节。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "No bandages nearby?  Empty your hands and let the time pass to apply pressure to the wound."
msgstr "身边没有绷带吗？清空双手，等待，可对伤口施压止血。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Nobody told the vending machines that the world ended.  Save those cash cards!"
msgstr "可没人告诉自动售货机这已经是世界末日了。存着那些现金卡！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Not much survives a hit from a very fast car."
msgstr "没有什么能在极速汽车的拥抱下苟活。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Out of resources?  Breaking or disassembling stuff can yield interesting components."
msgstr "材料用光了？破坏或者拆解其它物品，说不定可以得到有趣的部件。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Over the counter pain medication is weak, but it's not habit forming. It may keep you in the fight."
msgstr "非处方止痛药效果较弱，但不会成瘾；或许能让你坚持下去。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Overconfidence is a treacherous killer.  Leave yourself some leeway for unforeseen circumstances."
msgstr "过度自信是个阴险的杀手。多为意外情况留些余地。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Pain can drastically slow you down and reduces your stats.  Check your speed in the character menu."
msgstr "疼痛会大大减慢你的速度并降低你的属性值。可以在角色菜单中查看当前速度。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Pain medication doesn't reduce pain, it is a buffer against it for the entirety of its duration."
msgstr "止痛药并不是减轻疼痛，而只是整个作用期间对疼痛的一种缓冲。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Pick your fights and don't let them pick you.  Don't bite what you can't chew."
msgstr "主动选择你的战斗，而不是陷入被动。别惹那些让你吃不了兜着走的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Poison, radiation, and blood loss will negatively impact your lifestyle."
msgstr "毒素、辐射和失血会对你的生活造成不良影响。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Power move.  You can take control and play as your NPC follower."
msgstr "控制移动。你可以操控跟随你的NPC。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Priorities for survival: shelter, water, food, then everything else."
msgstr "生存优先级：住所，水，食物，然后才是其他。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Prolonged physical exhaustion results in weariness.  Overworking causes loss of productivity."
msgstr "长时间的体力消耗会积累疲惫。过度劳累会导致产能下降。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Put a funnel over a jug or barrel to collect rainwater over time."
msgstr "在水容器上放一个漏斗，下雨时能收集雨水。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Rain ponchos are lightweight, easy to store, and can keep you dry in a storm."
msgstr "雨衣非但轻还易于存放，重要的是让你免受暴雨侵袭。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Remember that the sidebar is customizable and widgets can be added and removed from it."
msgstr "别忘了侧边栏是可自定义的，可以在其中添加和删除一些板块。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Routine kills.  Stay alert!  Don't let your guard down."
msgstr "枯燥的日常操作会最终害死你。保持警惕！不要放松。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Save time.  Instead of using a recipe, place water in a container on a fire to boil it."
msgstr "节约时间。与其使用制造菜单，不如直接把装满水的容器放在火上烧开。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Scared of melee?  Throw some things at enemies and use reach weapons like spears."
msgstr "害怕贴脸近战？向敌人投掷物品，并使用像长矛这样的远距攻击武器。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Skillful management of your stamina is crucial for your survival.  Conserve it when you can."
msgstr "娴熟地把握你的耐力对生存至关重要。尽可能多保留这些体力。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Some animals can be tamed, especially when young.  Try finding some pet food."
msgstr "有些宠物可以驯养，尤其趁它们年幼的时候。试试找一些宠物可以吃的食物吧。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Some foods can be eaten frozen.  Some foods become mushy after defrosting."
msgstr "有的干货在冷冻状态下也可以吃。有的食物解冻后则会变得黏糊。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Some mutations allow you to leap.  This makes it easy to get out of melee, or up onto a roof."
msgstr "一些变异可以实现跳跃这个动作。意味着更易于脱离近战了，甚至还能跳到屋顶。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Some negative traits have their upsides."
msgstr "一些负面特质也有好的一面。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Sometimes you just can't run.  Always try to keep a handgun on you for emergencies."
msgstr "有时候你就是跑不了。尽量随身带一把手枪以备不时之需。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Spraypaint can be used to blind enemies, and is especially effective against robots."
msgstr "喷漆可以用来致盲敌人，并且对机器人尤为有效。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Stun guns will cause even zombies to release their grabs, but effectiveness falls off with size."
msgstr "电击枪甚至能够让僵尸松开抓握，但效果会对方体型增大而降低。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Switching to a sidearm is often faster than reloading."
msgstr "切换到副武器通常比重新装填更快。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Tear gas stuns anything that breathes.  It blinds anything with eyes, except robots and arthropods."
msgstr "催泪瓦斯会使所有要呼吸的生物昏迷。它会使任何有眼睛的生物失明，机器人和节肢动物除外。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Terrain that slows you down will also slow down your enemies."
msgstr "减慢你速度的地形也会减慢你的敌人的速度。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The Archer's Form proficiency lowers the strength requirement on bows by up to 6."
msgstr "弓术基础专业可以最多降低弓的力量需求6点。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The action menu can help you determine what you can do.  There are also some rare actions there."
msgstr "行动菜单能帮你确认你目前所能进行的行动。其中还有一些不被你了解的行动选项。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The best gun in the world is useless without ammo."
msgstr "世界上最好的枪如果没有弹药也不过是根烧火棍。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The number of zombies in a city is large but finite.  You can (eventually) kill them all."
msgstr "一个城市的丧尸虽然很多，但数量有限。你可以（最终）把它们全部杀光。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The worse you're hurt, the slower you'll heal. Try not to push yourself too far."
msgstr "伤得越重，恢复也会越慢。不要把自己逼得太紧。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The zone activity manager can make your life easier.  Do more in one go."
msgstr "区域活动管理器可以让你过得更轻松。一次做更多事。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There are a million ways to use a garbage bag."
msgstr "垃圾袋，有一百万种的利用方式。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There are billions of them and one of you, but only you have a working brain."
msgstr "他们数量成万上亿倍于你孤身一人，但你还有且仅有一个能正常运作的脑子。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There are fungi you want to eat, and those you want to burn.  You'll know the difference."
msgstr "有些蘑菇能吃，有些只能烧掉。你会慢慢学会区分它们的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There are some unbound keybindings that might prove useful for your needs.  Check them out."
msgstr "也许某些未分配按键的快捷功能可能符合你的需要。去看一下。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There's got to be some cool stuff in those top-secret underground labs, right?"
msgstr "在那些绝密的地下实验室里肯定有一些很酷的东西，对吧？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There's usually more than one way to do things.  Think outside the box."
msgstr "达成目标的方式通常不止一种。试着跳出框框思考。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Thirsty on a long winter journey?  Take a thermos with you."
msgstr "冬天出远门怕渴？带上保温杯。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Too cold to sleep well at night?  A pile of clothes will make it better."
msgstr "晚上太冷睡不着？有一堆衣物就不用担心。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Trouble with sticky or slippery floors?  Try using them against your enemies."
msgstr "被黏糊或是光滑的地板困扰？试试利用它们对抗你的敌人吧。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Turnout gear protects from fire but not from overheating."
msgstr "消防服能够抵御火焰，但是不能抵御高温。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Twohanded weapons are hard to use when things are grabbing you.  Keep something smaller on hand too!"
msgstr "当有人抓住你时，双手武器很难使用。手边也要准备一些小型武器！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."
msgstr "洞穴或地下室之类的地下空间一年到头都很凉爽，而且从不结冰。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Use the fire, sludge, and acid some enemies spread to your advantage."
msgstr "利用敌人散布的火焰、污泥和酸来为你所用。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Use your map wisely.  Prioritize looting places that will get you what you need."
msgstr "合理地使用地图。优先去那些能让你得到所需物品的地点。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Verticality is a thing.  If you can get to a roof somehow, it may save your life."
msgstr "充分利用垂直空间。如果你能爬上屋顶，这也许能救你一命。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want less micro-management?  The zone manager can change your game."
msgstr "不想要过多微操管理？区域管理可以改变你的游戏体验。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want to protect your gear from acid?  Try wearing a raincoat over it."
msgstr "不想自己的装备被酸侵蚀吧？试着穿一件雨衣在外面吧。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Weariness can be debilitating.  Don't go into combat if you're tired!"
msgstr "疲惫而虚弱。如果你累了，就别去战斗了！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wet and angry?  A dry towel will bring your smile back."
msgstr "因为潮湿而心情不爽？一条干毛巾会让你重新微笑起来。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "When looking around, use T to move to a destination or item automatically."
msgstr "在观察四周菜单中，按 \"T\" 键自动移到目的地或物品。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/core/tips.json data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid "When the whole town is one big supermarket, a shopping cart becomes your best friend."
msgstr "当整个城镇都成了一座大超市时，购物车会是你最好的朋友。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "When you are prone, you use the bipod of a rifle for better accuracy."
msgstr "当你趴下时，你能利用枪械的双脚架以提高射击精度。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Where applicable, use blacklists, whitelists, and filters for a better quality of life."
msgstr "适当时多多使用黑名单、白名单和过滤器来提升游戏体验。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Where did my lighter go again?  Manage your containers to store specific items in them."
msgstr "我的打火机又到哪里去了？管理容器以在其中存储特定物品。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Why walk when you can use a car?  Or a bike?  Or rollerblades?"
msgstr "为什么要双脚走路，明明你可以选择开车？或是骑自行车？或是溜冰？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Winners don't do drugs.  They're too valuable.  Winners trade drugs for more bullets."
msgstr "赢家不会去吸毒。这东西价格高昂。他们会用毒品换取更多子弹。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wounds heal over time.  Bandages and antiseptic speed that up."
msgstr "伤口会随着时间的推移而愈合。包扎和消毒可以加快这一过程。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can automate repetitive tasks such as foraging, mining, or mopping for your convenience."
msgstr "为了减少不必要的操作，你可以设置自动执行重复性任务，如采集、挖掘或拖地。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can crouch or go prone to hide behind objects and reduce the sound you make when you move."
msgstr "你可以蹲下或俯卧来躲在家具后面，并减少移动时发出的声音。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can make unusual things from usual stuff.  Go full MacGyver style if needed."
msgstr "用寻常的材料可以做出不寻常的物件。如有必要，尽情发挥你的想象力。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can make your own safe mode rules in the pause menu."
msgstr "你可以在暂停菜单中制定自定义安全模式规则。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can throw things while peeking around corners."
msgstr "你可以在窥查拐角的时候扔东西。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use markers to rename items, making it easier to stay organized."
msgstr "你可以使用标记来重命名物品，从而更容易保持有序。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse in your inventory and few other menus."
msgstr "你可以在物品栏和其他一些菜单中使用鼠标。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse to move to a destination by double-clicking it."
msgstr "你可以双击鼠标左键移动到光标所在位置。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can view local keybindings in most sub-menus by pressing the question mark (?) key."
msgstr "你可以按 \"?\" 键在大多数子菜单中查看局部快捷键。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't have to sit right next to fire to use it."
msgstr "使用火堆可以不必紧挨着。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't need to grab every piece of loot you see.  There's always more to find."
msgstr "你不需要看到什么都捡起来。总会有更多可以找到。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't win, you just do a little better each time."
msgstr "你不是在赢，只是每次都稍微做得好一点。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You won't use mutated body parts like fangs and horns to attack if they're covered up."
msgstr "如果突变的身体部位被遮住了，比如牙齿和角，你就不能用它们来攻击。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You're on fire?  Stop and wait to put it out.  Better yet, go prone first."
msgstr "身上着火了？原地不动可以尝试扑灭火焰。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Your enemy is often slower than you.  Walk to conserve stamina and run only when you must."
msgstr "你敌人的速度往往比你慢。步行以保持体力，只在万不得已时才跑步。"

