msgid "We definitely need more ammo."
msgstr "我们真的需要更多弹药。"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "We need to go deeper!"
msgstr "我们需要再深入些！"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Eloquent"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
