#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "What a Larp!"
msgstr "真人角色扮演真不错！"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "What are they hiding?"
msgstr "他们在隐瞒什么？"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "What doesn't kill you, makes you stranger"
msgstr "杀不死你的东西，只会使你变得更加诡异"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Lumberjack"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "What is a forest for a man with an axe?"
msgstr "对一个拿着斧头的人来说，森林是什么？"

