#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "What's up doc?  Hunting wabbits?"
msgstr "出什么事了，老哥？在打兔子吗？"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Way of the Sword"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "When the sword is once drawn, the passions of men observe no bounds of moderation."
msgstr "剑一出鞘，人的激情就没有止境。"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Double Barrel, Double Fun"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "When you want to hit your target nine times with one shot."
msgstr "当你想一枪击中你的目标九次的时候。"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Cold Steel"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "While you were partying, I studied the blade."
msgstr "当你在开派对的时候，我在研究刀刃。"

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Freeman's favorite"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Wield a crowbar"
msgstr "手持撬棍"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Robin Hood"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Wilhelm Tell?  Never heard of."
msgstr "威廉·退尔？没听过这号人物。"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "With great power…"
msgstr "能力越大……"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Jack of All Trades"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "With the right amount of glue, there is nothing I can't do."
msgstr "只要给我适量的胶水，没有什么是我做不了的。"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Soldier"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Without me, my rifle is useless.  Without my rifle, I am useless.  I will keep my rifle clean and ready, even as I am clean and ready.  We will become part of each other."
msgstr "离开了我，我的步枪将一无是处；离开了我的步枪，我将一无是处。我将保证它时刻整洁并能随时战斗，就像我一样整洁并时刻准备战斗那样。我们将彼此成为互相的一部分。"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Yeet!"
msgstr "耶！"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Heisenberg"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "You all know who I am.  I'm the cook.  Say my name."
msgstr "你们都知道我是谁。我就是毒师。说出我的名字。"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Funeral House"
#: data/json/achievements.json
