#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Teleportitis"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Causes you to teleport uncontrollably."
msgstr "使你不由自主的传送。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Close Tear"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Closes a tear in reality and transfers strange energy to the artifact user."
msgstr "关闭时空裂隙，并将奇特的神秘能量传递给神器使用者。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Time Stop"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Grants you a few turns of super speed."
msgstr "使你加速一段时间。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Darkness"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Grants you the Darkness effect."
msgstr "使你获得黑暗效果。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Hurtall"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Hurts you for random damage."
msgstr "随机对你造成伤害。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Darkness"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Persistent shadows invade your field of view."
msgstr "你感到持续不断的暗影涌入你的视野。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Force Pull"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Pull objects."
msgstr "吸引所有物体。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Slow"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Slows you for a few turns."
msgstr "使你减速一段时间。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Vortex"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Space twists and deforms around you."
msgstr "你周围的空间扭曲变形。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Time Stop"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Stale golden light floods the world, and reality stands still."
msgstr "你感到世界被一道陈腐的金光淹没，现实停滞不前。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Call of Tindalos"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Summon hostile hounds of Tindalos."
msgstr "召唤廷达罗斯猎犬"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Vortex"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Summon vortexes."
msgstr "召唤涡旋"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Teleportitis"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "The world loses coherence, with images of nearby places forming and disappearing around you."
msgstr "你感到宇宙失去了连续性，附近地区的景象在你身边不断形成又消失。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Slow"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "The world shifts blue, and reality accelerates around you."
msgstr "你感到世界仿佛蓝移了一般，现实在你身边加速流逝。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Call of Tindalos"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "The world unravels into geometric shapes, and between the chaos you spot a horrid prowling beast."
msgstr "你感到世界被分解成几何图形，在混乱中你看见了一只可怕的潜行野兽。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Hurtall"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "You feel hollow inside."
msgstr "你感到体内一阵空虚。"

#. ~ Description of "amber ring"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A band of gold with a smooth piece of amber set into it.  A strange worm is encased in the amber, making a perfect spiral with its sealed body.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一根金带，上面镶嵌着一块光滑的琥珀。琥珀中包裹着一条奇怪的蠕虫，用它密封的身体形成了一个完美的螺旋。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ancient burial shroud"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A cloak of thin, faded cloth.  The faint silhouette of a long-dead humanoid is barely visible on it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一件薄薄的、褪色的布斗篷。一个早已死去的人形生物的微弱轮廓在上面几乎看不见。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ancient harp"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A harp made of black wood.  Faint hypnotic notes ring in the air each time you touch it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"黑木制成的竖琴。每次触摸它时，空气中都会响起微弱的催眠音符。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ornate fur coat"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, finely crafted coat made of the fur of an unidentifiable creature.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一件厚重、制作精美的外套，由一种无法识别的生物的毛皮制成。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ancient bronze helmet"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A helmet with an imposing face plate.  Though the corrosion has completely defaced the symbols written on the sides, it seems sturdy.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"带有气势磅礴的面板的头盔。虽然腐蚀已经完全污损了侧面写的符号，但它看起来很坚固。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ancient club"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A misshapen rod of gnarled, knotted wood.  The knots in the wood exhibit a strange fractal pattern.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一根畸形的棒子，由粗糙的打结的木头组成。木材中的结呈现出奇怪的分形图案。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "pair of ancient leather boots"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A pair of ancient leather boots.  Though the flaps of leather are crudely sewn together, the red hue it is dyed with is striking.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一双古老的皮靴。虽然皮革翻盖被粗略地缝合在一起，但它染成的红色色调却引人注目。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ancient athame"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A ritual knife used by some ancient civilization.  Unreadable runes are carved into the handle.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一些古代文明使用的仪式刀。不可读的符文被刻在手柄上。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "pair of ornate leather gloves"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A set of worn leather gloves embossed with gold.  The unidentifiable leather it is made from is oddly soft.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一套用金色压花的破旧皮手套。它由无法识别的皮革制成，非常柔软。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ancient stone mask"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A sinister mask made of a smooth green stone.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"由光滑的绿色石头制成的阴险面具。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ancient spear"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy wooden pole with a sharp metal spike on the end.  The handle has the symbol of a blue sun on it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一根坚固的木杆，末端有一个锋利的金属钉。手柄上有蓝太阳的象征。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ancient sword"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A sword made out of a striking black metal.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一把由醒目的黑色金属制成的剑。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "ancient staff"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A well-balanced stick of treated wood with metal caps.  A red stone is embedded in the handle.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一根平衡良好的处理过的木棍，带有金属盖。手柄上嵌着一颗红色的石头。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#. ~ Description of "royal robe"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"An ornately decorated robe with an unfamiliar royal symbol on it.  The humanoid figure on the seal has two pairs of eyes.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一件装饰华丽的长袍，上面有一个陌生的皇家标志。海豹上的人形人物有两双眼睛。它是同类中唯一的一个。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

