#. ~ Description of "The Architect's Cube"
#: data/json/artifact/premade_artifacts.json
msgid "This is a solid cube that is much heavier than its size suggests.  When you look at it, it pulls your gaze inward until you fall through the sky, showing you a top-down view of your position with the surroundings revealed."
