#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Whether at the gym or on the streets, you've had some experience with unarmed combat."
msgstr "无论是在健身房还是街头，你都有过徒手格斗的经验。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Fist Fighting" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Whether at the gym or on the streets, you've had some experience with unarmed combat."
msgstr "无论是在健身房还是街头，你都有过徒手格斗的经验。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Opioid Dependence" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Whether by pill, pipe, or needle, you wound up chasing the dragon.  Your dealer's long dead, so you're going to need to get your fix before withdrawals set in."
msgstr "无论是吃药、吸食还是打针，你最终成了追龙人。你的毒贩早已不在，所以你得在戒断症状出现前弄到你的药。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Opioid Dependence" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
