msgid "Whether by pill, pipe, or needle, you wound up chasing the dragon.  Your dealer's long dead, so you're going to need to get your fix before withdrawals set in."
msgstr "无论是吃药、吸食还是打针，你最终成了追龙人。你的毒贩早已不在，所以你得在戒断症状出现前弄到你的药。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Melee Style" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Whether for school, ren faires, or fitness, you've learned how to handle some kind of medieval weapon.  You start with a weapon-based martial arts style of your choosing."
msgstr "无论是为了上学、参加集市还是健身，你都学会了如何使用某种中世纪武器。你从自己选择的以武器为基础的武术风格开始。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Melee Style" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Whether for school, ren faires, or fitness, you've learned how to handle some kind of medieval weapon.  You start with a weapon-based martial arts style of your choosing."
msgstr "无论是为了上学、参加集市还是健身，你都学会了如何使用某种中世纪武器。你从自己选择的以武器为基础的武术风格开始。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lockpicking (Beginner)" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Whether it was for fun, innocent utility, or criminal intent, you learned the basics of how to silently pick locks.  Now, being able to get into secured places just got a lot more useful."
msgstr "无论是出于好玩无害的动机还是出于犯罪目的，你学会了无声撬锁所需要的基本知识。而现在，能够进入防护严密地点的能力变得更有用了。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lockpicking (Beginner)" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Whether it was for fun, innocent utility, or criminal intent, you learned the basics of how to silently pick locks.  Now, being able to get into secured places just got a lot more useful."
msgstr "无论是出于好玩无害的动机还是出于犯罪目的，你学会了无声撬锁所需要的基本知识。而现在，能够进入防护严密地点的能力变得更有用了。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Offroad Driving" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Whether you're into dirtbikes, ATVs, or dune buggies, you have experience driving on terrain that isn't well-suited to wheels."
msgstr "无论你是喜欢越野摩托车、沙滩车还是沙滩越野车，你都有在不适合车轮行驶的地形上驾驶的经验。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Offroad Driving" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Whether you're into dirtbikes, ATVs, or dune buggies, you have experience driving on terrain that isn't well-suited to wheels."
msgstr "无论你是喜欢越野摩托车、沙滩车还是沙滩越野车，你都有在不适合车轮行驶的地形上驾驶的经验。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Handloading" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You figured you could save money on ammo by learning to make your own.  Now that the factories are shut down, your abilities just went from handy to lifesaving."
msgstr "你觉得自己可以通过学习复装弹药来省子弹钱。现在工厂都关了，这从一种手艺变成了救命的能力。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Handloading" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You figured you could save money on ammo by learning to make your own.  Now that the factories are shut down, your abilities just went from handy to lifesaving."
msgstr "你觉得自己可以通过学习复装弹药来省子弹钱。现在工厂都关了，这从一种手艺变成了救命的能力。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Martial Arts" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You have received some martial arts training.  You start with an unarmed martial arts style of your choosing."
msgstr "你在道场里接受过一些武术训练。你能够在空手道、柔道、合气道、太极拳、跆拳道及古希腊搏击中选择一项，作为你的起始武术。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Martial Arts" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
