#. ~ Description of profession "Metalworking" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You know a bit about crafting things with metal, whether hot or cold."
msgstr "你对金属工艺，无论是热加工还是冷加工，都有一定的了解。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Metalworking" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You know a bit about crafting things with metal, whether hot or cold."
msgstr "你对金属工艺，无论是热加工还是冷加工，都有一定的了解。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Electronics" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You know a thing or two about working on electronics."
msgstr "你在电子设备维修方面略知一二。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Electronics" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You know a thing or two about working on electronics."
msgstr "你在电子设备维修方面略知一二。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Skating" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You suffer lower penalties to dodging and are less likely to fall down if hit in melee combat while riding a skateboard or wearing skates."
msgstr "你擅长滑冰。当你穿着滚轴溜冰鞋或者直排轮滑鞋时，你受到的闪避惩罚更少，在近战中被击中时摔倒的几率也更小。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Skating" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You suffer lower penalties to dodging and are less likely to fall down if hit in melee combat while riding a skateboard or wearing skates."
msgstr "你擅长滑冰。当你穿着滚轴溜冰鞋或者直排轮滑鞋时，你受到的闪避惩罚更少，在近战中被击中时摔倒的几率也更小。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You used to play baseball.  Hopefully you can still remember how to use a bat when your life depends on it."
msgstr "你以前偶尔打过棒球。也许你是学校棒球队的一员，但这从来不是你的兴趣所在。希望你还能记得如何使用球棒，当你的生命取决于它的时候。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You used to play baseball.  Hopefully you can still remember how to use a bat when your life depends on it."
msgstr "你以前偶尔打过棒球。也许你是学校棒球队的一员，但这从来不是你的兴趣所在。希望你还能记得如何使用球棒，当你的生命取决于它的时候。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Sleeping Pill Dependence" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You'd been having trouble falling asleep, so you started taking prescription sleep meds.  Now you can hardly seem to fall asleep at all without them, and you'll need plenty of rest to face the days ahead."
msgstr "你一直难以入睡，所以你开始服用处方安眠药。现在，如果没有它们，你几乎无法入睡，而你需要充足睡眠来面对未来的挑战。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Sleeping Pill Dependence" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You'd been having trouble falling asleep, so you started taking prescription sleep meds.  Now you can hardly seem to fall asleep at all without them, and you'll need plenty of rest to face the days ahead."
msgstr "你一直难以入睡，所以你开始服用处方安眠药。现在，如果没有它们，你几乎无法入睡，而你需要充足睡眠来面对未来的挑战。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Chemistry" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You're acquainted with the basics of chemistry."
msgstr "你充满了大自然的活力。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Chemistry" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You're acquainted with the basics of chemistry."
msgstr "你充满了大自然的活力。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Trapping" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You're experienced with setting traps and snares for small game or pests."
msgstr "你擅长为小型猎物或害虫设置陷阱和圈套。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Trapping" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You're experienced with setting traps and snares for small game or pests."
msgstr "你擅长为小型猎物或害虫设置陷阱和圈套。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Amphetamine Dependence" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You're not entirely sure what happened last night, but you woke up on the floor and everything has completely gone to shit.  This is not the first time this has happened to you.  With any luck, it will not be the last."
msgstr "你不完全确定昨晚发生了什么，但你醒来时躺在地板上，而且一切都彻底乱了。这已经不是你第一次遇到这种情况了。幸运的话，也不会是最后一次。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Amphetamine Dependence" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You're not entirely sure what happened last night, but you woke up on the floor and everything has completely gone to shit.  This is not the first time this has happened to you.  With any luck, it will not be the last."
msgstr "你不完全确定昨晚发生了什么，但你醒来时躺在地板上，而且一切都彻底乱了。这已经不是你第一次遇到这种情况了。幸运的话，也不会是最后一次。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Piloting" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You're probably one of the last people alive who knows how to safely operate a flying vehicle.  It remains to be seen whether you'll live long enough to make use of that skill."
msgstr "你可能是最后一个知道如何安全驾驶飞行器的人了。但你是否能活到使用这种技能还有待观察。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Piloting" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You're probably one of the last people alive who knows how to safely operate a flying vehicle.  It remains to be seen whether you'll live long enough to make use of that skill."
msgstr "你可能是最后一个知道如何安全驾驶飞行器的人了。但你是否能活到使用这种技能还有待观察。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bushcraft" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You're proficient in a variety of core survival skills."
msgstr "你精通多种核心生存技能。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bushcraft" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You're proficient in a variety of core survival skills."
msgstr "你精通多种核心生存技能。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Sewing" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You're proficient with most of the basics of making clothing and cloth goods."
msgstr "你精通长剑，手握利器便能杀人。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Sewing" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You're proficient with most of the basics of making clothing and cloth goods."
msgstr "你精通长剑，手握利器便能杀人。"

#. ~ Description of profession "First Aid" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You're trained in quickly dealing with urgent injuries.  In the absence of any medical professionals, that'll have to do."
msgstr "你受过训练，有急救经验。在没有专业医疗人员的情况下，这也能凑活。"

#. ~ Description of profession "First Aid" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You're trained in quickly dealing with urgent injuries.  In the absence of any medical professionals, that'll have to do."
msgstr "你受过训练，有急救经验。在没有专业医疗人员的情况下，这也能凑活。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Arts and Crafts" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You've got a fair bit of experience making odds and ends out of basic materials."
msgstr "你在用基本材料制作零碎物品方面颇有经验。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Arts and Crafts" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You've got a fair bit of experience making odds and ends out of basic materials."
msgstr "你在用基本材料制作零碎物品方面颇有经验。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Parkour" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground.  It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, because now that the end has come, you're running for your life."
msgstr "你已经练了很多年的跑酷，世界就是你的游乐场。当你说跑步是你的生命时并没有撒谎。这很好，因为现在世界已经终结了，你正在为你的生存而奔跑。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Parkour" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground.  It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, because now that the end has come, you're running for your life."
msgstr "你已经练了很多年的跑酷，世界就是你的游乐场。当你说跑步是你的生命时并没有撒谎。这很好，因为现在世界已经终结了，你正在为你的生存而奔跑。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Boating License" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You've trained in how to pilot marine craft, as well as general boating and swimming safety."
msgstr "你接受过驾驶船舶以及一般划艇和游泳安全方面的培训。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Boating License" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You've trained in how to pilot marine craft, as well as general boating and swimming safety."
msgstr "你接受过驾驶船舶以及一般划艇和游泳安全方面的培训。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Archery" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You've used a bow before and maybe taken a class or two."
msgstr "你以前用过弓，可能还上过一两节课。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Archery" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You've used a bow before and maybe taken a class or two."
msgstr "你以前用过弓，可能还上过一两节课。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Homebrewing" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Your white lightning could knock out an elephant, but you're drinking alone now."
msgstr "你酿造出的\"白色闪电\"可以醉倒一头大象，但现在你只能一个人独酌了。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Homebrewing" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Your white lightning could knock out an elephant, but you're drinking alone now."
msgstr "你酿造出的\"白色闪电\"可以醉倒一头大象，但现在你只能一个人独酌了。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Super Stun Gun"
#: data/json/bionic_spells.json
msgid "A blast of electricity from your Super Stun Gun bionic."
msgstr "从你身上的超级电击枪里射出来的一束电流。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/bionic_spells.json
msgid "Super Stun Gun"
msgstr "超级电击枪"

#. ~ Message of spell "Super Stun Gun"
#: data/json/bionic_spells.json
msgid "You discharge energy from your Super Stun Gun."
msgstr "你使用你的超级电击枪释放出一股强大的能量。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Super Stun Gun"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "an arc of electricity"
#: data/json/bionic_spells.json data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "a crackle"
msgstr "噼啪声"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Power Storage"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A Compact Bionics Module that increases your power capacity by 100 kJ.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using powered bionics.  You will also need a power supply, found in various CBMs."
msgstr "小型生化电池插件，可以为你增加 100kJ 的生化能量储备上限。你至少需要一个储能模块才能使用耗能型生化插件，同时你还需要至少一种供能型生化插件，为自己充能。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Power Storage Mk. II"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A Compact Bionics Module that increases your power capacity by 250 kJ."
msgstr "小型生化电池插件，可以为你增加 250kJ 的生化能量储备上限。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Itchy Metal Thing"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A bionic of some sort, so badly installed that you cannot even tell what it was originally supposed to be.  Sometimes it itches horribly."
msgstr "一个生化插件，它安装的太糟糕了，使它无法发挥原先的作用，但有了一个新效果：让你奇痒难忍。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electromagnetic Leak"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A broken implant that sends electromagnetic impulses that reduce other implants capacity to store charge."
msgstr "一个损坏的生化插件，它会不断发出电磁脉冲，降低其他储能生化插件的容量。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Bionic-Induced Deformity"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A combination of poor surgical installation and unpleasant scarring has lead to the malfunctioning bionic catastrophe you call your face.  People who mind that you look like a dime-store Frankenstein will react poorly to your appearance."
msgstr "你的脸部因为一次拙劣的生化手术留下了失效的生化插件以及恐怖的疤痕。那些外貌协会成员会因为你这张山寨弗兰肯斯坦的脸而反感你。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Infolink"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A compact communications device has been built into your ears, enabling you to communicate over radio waves."
msgstr "您的耳朵内置了一个紧凑的通信设备，使您能够通过无线电波进行通信。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Monomolecular Blade"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A deadly foot-long blade made of advanced material now resides inside your forearm, capable of being extended through the back of your wrist at the cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will prevent you from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr "约30厘米长的单分子刀片隐藏在你的前臂内侧，通过手腕背部的电源驱动。异常锋利，伸展时会妨碍你抱拿握其他物品。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Blood Filter"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A filtration system near your liver allows you to actively filter out chemical impurities, primarily drugs.  It will have limited impact on viruses.  Note that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in your system will be affected."
msgstr "你的心脏旁被植入了一个过滤系统，让你能够主动过滤掉血液中的化学杂质，主要是药物和毒品。但该系统对病毒效果不佳。需要注意的是该系统并非定向过滤系统，你体内的所有药物和毒品都会受到影响。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Emetic Inducer"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A malfunctioning bionic attached to your digestive system causes intermittent nausea, making it difficult to keep food down."
msgstr "附着在消化系统上的生化插件出现故障会导致间歇性恶心，使食物难以下咽。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Visual Disruptor"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A malfunctioning bionic which causes occasional visual distortion and pixelation."
msgstr "一个出现故障的生化插件。导致你偶尔会出现视觉失真和像素化。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Acidic Discharge"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A malfunctioning bionic which occasionally discharges acid into your muscles, causing sharp pain and minor damage."
msgstr "一个出故障的生化插件，会不时向你的肌肉里释放酸液，造成刺痛和微小的伤害。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electrical Discharge"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A malfunctioning bionic which occasionally discharges electricity through your body, causing pain and brief paralysis but no damage."
msgstr "一个出故障的生化插件，时不时的漏电，这会造成疼痛和短暂全身麻痹瘫痪，不过不会产生伤害。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electrical Drain"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A malfunctioning bionic.  It doesn't perform any useful function, but will occasionally draw power from your batteries."
msgstr "一个出故障的生化插件。它没有任何益处，而且会不时的从你的储能系统中吸能。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Noisemaker"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A malfunctioning bionic.  It will occasionally emit a loud burst of noise."
msgstr "一个出现故障的生化插件。它偶尔会发出一阵滋滋滋的巨大噪音。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Thalamic Buffer"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A microcomputer wired to the thalamus that assists the brain in sorting and prioritizing sensory input.  It grants +2 perception when active, but -1 when not."
msgstr "一个连接到丘脑的微型计算机，帮助大脑整理和优先处理感官输入。激活时提供 +2 感知，但没开时 -1。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Calorie Tracker"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A module implanted in your body measures your calorie intake and expenditure at all times."
msgstr "一个植入你体内的模组/模块，可以随时测量你的卡路里摄入和消耗。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Alarm System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A motion-detecting alarm system will notice almost all movement within a fifteen-foot radius, and will silently alert you.  This is very useful during sleep, or if you suspect a cloaked pursuer."
msgstr "一个运动侦测警报系统，可以侦测到半径15英尺(约4.6米)范围内的所有运动，并且为你提供无声的警报。在睡觉时很有用，或者当你怀疑自己被隐身怪物追踪时。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Weather Reader"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A multitude of scientific instruments and sensors collect environmental data.  The data is compiled and presented as a simple readout of the current weather.  It also passively tells you the local air temperature."
msgstr "一堆科学装置和感应器的集合。用来收集周围环境的数据，这些数据随后将会被分析并汇总成为易于读取的天气情况报告。它还可随时显示周围的环境温度。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Bionic Short Circuit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A poorly-wired bionic which fails to serve its intended purpose, this malfunctioning device periodically short-circuits, causing systemic muscle tremors."
msgstr "一个安装失败的生化插件未能达到其预期目的，该设备周期性地短路，导致全身肌肉震颤。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Magnetic Repulsor"
#. ~ Description of "Magnetic Repulsor CBM"
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A powerful electromagnetic system housed in the palms which, when powered up, will expend power to greatly increasing the force of thrown magnetic objects."
msgstr "一种强大的电磁系统安装在手掌里，启动后会消耗能量，大幅增强抛出磁性物体的力量。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "EMP Projector"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A ranged EMP generator system is implanted in your right arm and the palm of your right hand.  The system fires precise, single-target pulses that require time to aim.  Extremely effective against electronic targets but mostly useless otherwise."
msgstr "你的右臂和右掌被手术植入了一套远程电磁脉冲发生器系统。这套系统能发射精准的单目标脉冲，需要时间瞄准。对电子目标特别有效，但对其它目标没什么作用。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Taste Modifier"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A set of highly sensitive sensors is installed in your mouth, and a small yet sophisticated analyzer is installed in the cavity of your skull.  The active bionic will nullify the taste of all comestibles with negative enjoyment value at the cost of draining bionic power."
msgstr "你的嘴里被安装了一套高度敏感的传感器，头骨腔中安装了一个小而精密的分析仪。开启后将消耗生化能量使所有难吃的食物不再具有负面心情效果。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Sleep Mode"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A set of miniscule devices are embedded in your brain stem and hypothalamus.  When active, they allow the user to fall asleep almost instantly and at-will.  The downside, however, is that the user will remain asleep no matter what happens to their body until they complete their natural sleep cycle, unless a sleep alarm from a differet bionic device is triggered."
msgstr "一组微小设备被植入你的脑干和下丘脑。当它们激活时，用户可以几乎瞬间并随意入睡。然而，缺点是，无论身体发生什么情况，用户都会保持睡眠状态，直到完成自然的睡眠周期，除非触发来自其他仿生设备的睡眠警报。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "LED Tattoo"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A small LED display just beneath your dermal layer can be illuminated on command to show patterns of your choice at dim or bright luminosity.  It doesn't provide enough light to comfortably read or craft, but it can suffice if you have nothing else."
msgstr "一个小型LED显示屏植入了你的皮肤层下面，可以根据指令照明，在昏暗或明亮的亮度显示你选择的图案。它不能提供足够的光来舒适地阅读或制造物品，但如果你没有其他光源，它也勉强够用。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Remote Controller"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A small module connected to your brain allows you to interface with nearby devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr "一个连接到你大脑的小模块，可以与附近有无线功能的设备联动。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Adrenaline Pump"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A stimulator system has been surgically implanted alongside your adrenal glands, allowing you to trigger your body's adrenaline response at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr "在你肾上腺内经过手术被植入了一套刺激装置，消耗生化能量可以触发你的身体的肾上腺素反应。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Radiation Scrubber System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters have been surgically implanted throughout your body, allowing you to purge yourself of absorbed radiation at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr "你的身体经过手术被植入了一套先进的压电式血液透析装置，使你可以通过消耗生化能量来清除体内的辐射。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A system of surgical grade scalpels is implanted in your forearms, extending from just above your wrists.  They allow you to make automated precise cuts and can also be used as a high-quality butchering tool."
msgstr "你的前臂至手腕被手术植入了一组外科手术刀。这让你能够进行全自动的精确切割。它也可以作为高级屠宰工具使用。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Active Defense System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A thin forcefield surrounds your body, continually draining power.  Everything loses velocity when penetrating this field, which results in reduced amount of dealt damage at the cost of your bionic energy.  Bullets and stabbing attacks will lose more velocity than cutting attacks and those in turn more than bashing attacks."
msgstr "一层围绕着你的身体的薄薄力场，不断地消耗着能量。任何东西在穿过这个力场时都会失去速度，造成更少的伤害，但同时也会造成额外的能量消耗。子弹和扎刺攻击会比切割攻击失去更多的速度，而这些攻击又会比钝击失去更多的速度。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Offensive Defense System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A thin forcefield surrounds your body, continually draining power.  This field does not deflect attacks, but rather delivers a strong shock, damaging unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."
msgstr "当该系统激活时，一层护盾会围绕你的身体并持续消耗能量。这层护盾不会格挡或偏移任何攻击，但是会电击徒手或使用金属武器攻击你的目标。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Acidic Discharge"
msgstr "自体排酸"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Active Defense System"
msgstr "主动防御系统"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Adrenaline Pump"
msgstr "肾上腺素泵"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Aero-Evaporator"
msgstr "湿气凝水器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Air Filtration System"
msgstr "空气过滤系统"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Alarm System"
msgstr "警报系统"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Blackout Lenses"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "An additional layer of tinting for the protective lenses CBM which can make the lenses dark enough to effectively blind the user when active."
msgstr "CBM保护镜片上增加了一层额外的染色，激活时，这层染色可以让镜片变得很暗，几乎让使用者看不见东西。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Arms Alloy Plating"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "An advanced protective meshwork has been woven into the flesh on your arms and hands, protecting them from physical trauma."
msgstr "先进的防护网状合金已经编织进你手臂和双手的肌肉中，保护其免受物理创伤。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Legs Alloy Plating"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "An advanced protective meshwork has been woven into the flesh on your legs and feet, protecting them from physical trauma."
msgstr "先进的防护网状合金已经编织进你腿部和双脚的肌肉中，保护其免受物理创伤。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Air Filtration System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "An advanced system of filters have been surgically implanted throughout your airway.  They provide minor protection from smoke and irritants even while unpowered, and when powered will filter out most all harmful airborne compounds."
msgstr "一套先进的过滤系统已经通过手术植入你的气道中。即使不通电，它们也能提供对烟雾和刺激物的轻微保护，而一旦通电，就可以过滤掉几乎所有有害的空气化合物。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Synaptic Regeneration System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "An electromagnetic stimulator has been surgically implanted on the back of your head and along your spine, continually draining power.  As long as it's active, you will not suffer from sleep deprivation, although you may still feel sleepy; and if you're sleep deprived already, it will gradually reduce the symptoms of lacking sleep."
msgstr "一套电磁刺激装置被植入到你的后脑和脊柱上，不断地消耗着生化能量。当被激活时，你就不会受到睡眠不足的惩罚，尽管你仍会困倦；如果你已经睡眠不足了，它将逐渐减轻睡眠不足的症状。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Throwing Assist"
#. ~ Description of "Throwing Assist CBM"
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "An implant that works on simple physics rather than electronics, this CBM replaces the ulnar collateral ligaments with assistive biocompatible tethers that automatically constrict and relax to improve the user's throwing distance and accuracy."
msgstr "这个植入物依靠简单的物理原理而不是电子设备，它用辅助性生物兼容的拉线替代了尺骨侧副韧带，可以自动收紧和放松，从而提升使用者的投掷距离和精准度。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Arms Alloy Plating"
msgstr "合金装甲-手臂"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Artificial Night Generator"
msgstr "人工黑夜制造机"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Time Dilation"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "At the cost of all stored bionic power, you may increase your body speed and reactions dramatically, essentially freezing time.  You are still delicate, however, and violent or rapid movements may damage you due to friction."
msgstr "通过消耗体内所有储存的生化插件能量，你可以极大的提升自己的速度和反应能力，就好像把时间冻结了一样。要记住的是，超高速下运动产生的空气摩擦可能会导致你受伤。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
