msgstr "多重消化系统"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Integrated AR System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Extremely thin lenses provide user with augmented reality overlay allowing the user to zoom, and it displays handy information about local topology."
msgstr "为用户提供叠加增强显示的超薄镜头，可以缩放视野，展示一些有用的信息。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Facial Distortion"
msgstr "变脸系统"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Finger Lighter"
msgstr "指尖打火机"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Finger-Mounted Laser"
msgstr "指端激光枪"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerhack"
msgstr "指端黑客仪"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerpick"
msgstr "指端开锁器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingertip Razors"
msgstr "指尖剃刀"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Flashbang Generator"
msgstr "闪光弹生成器"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Protective Lenses"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Frames along your cheekbones and eyesockets can, at a moment's notice, deploy protective lenses which seal your eyes behind polarized ballistic glass, providing protection from glare, bright flashes, physical attacks, and even environmental sources."
msgstr "沿着你的颧骨和眼眶的框架可以随时弹出保护镜片，把你的眼睛隔在偏光防弹玻璃后面，防止眩光、强光闪光、身体攻击，甚至环境因素伤害。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Glowy Thing"
msgstr "发光物"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Heat Drain"
msgstr "热能吸取"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Hydraulic Muscles"
msgstr "液压肌肉"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Night Vision"
msgstr "植入式夜视仪"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Stun Gun"
msgstr "超级电击枪"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Wired Reflexes"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted nerve stimulators grant you a +2 bonus to dexterity while this bionic is active, but a -1 penalty when it is not."
msgstr "植入式神经刺激器在激活时让你的敏捷+2，但没激活时会有-1的惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Wire-Induced Stiffness"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Improperly installed wires cause a physical stiffness in most of your body, causing increased encumbrance."
msgstr "错误安装的导线会导致你全身大部僵直，从而增加你的累赘度。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Squeaky Ankles"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "In a cruel twist of fate, a poorly executed CBM surgery has given you a pair of useless bionics which make squeaking noises when you walk."
msgstr "命运难料，你经历了一次失败的生化插件安装手术，除了使得生化插件失效，还让你在行走时发出吱吱的响声。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Probability Travel"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Increases your body's wavelength, allowing you to quantum tunnel through walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, but each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr "让你的身体波长进行改变，使得你可以量子隧穿墙壁，出现在另一边。待机时功耗非常小，但每穿透一格墙壁时消耗250点能量。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Infolink"
msgstr "脑内无线电"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Infrared Vision"
msgstr "红外视觉"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Repair Nanobots"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Inside your body is a fleet of tiny dormant robots.  While activated they will flit about your body, repairing damage at 1 HP per minute and stopping bleeding at the cost of extra power and stored calories.  No power is consumed if there is nothing to heal."
msgstr "你体内有一群微型纳米机器人。开启时会不断消耗能量，绕行你的周身，并通过消耗额外能量和卡路里来以每分钟 1 HP 的速度修复伤害以及止血。没有治疗需要时不会消耗能量。"

