#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A fond memory of throating some prey animal bubbles up."
msgstr "一段咬开猎物喉咙的美妙回忆出现在你的梦里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A terrifyingly real dream has you killing game with your bare teeth."
msgstr "一场真实而恐怖的梦境，你梦见自己正在用锋利的獠牙咬穿猎物的喉咙。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A warm, sunny spot high up where you can watch your prey.  What a great dream!"
msgstr "你在一个温暖，阳光明媚的高地俯视着你的猎物。真是一个美梦啊！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "After an exciting and tasty hunt, you retire to your nest.  Mmm, yes, nest."
msgstr "在一场激动人心、美味多汁的狩猎之后，你回到了你的爱巢。嗯，是的，\"巢\"。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "After recruiting a new packmate, you expand your spacious den to accommodate them."
msgstr "你梦见自己招募到了一个新伙伴，你扩展了自己宽敞的巢穴来容纳他们。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Ah, the wolf-slaying dream again.  That's a good one…"
msgstr "哈，又是一个杀狼的梦。这个还不错……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "An unstoppable hunger like a black hole devours you from within."
msgstr "一种像黑洞一样无法阻挡的饥饿由里及外地吞噬着你。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "As you dream, your reflection looks rather catlike."
msgstr "在梦中，你不自觉地走起了猫步。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Boing!  and you've pounced another yummy critter."
msgstr "扑通！你又抓到了一个美味的可怜虫。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "FIGHT.  FEED.  FORWARD."
msgstr "战斗！进食！前行！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Fire rages around you, licking at your bark and engulfing the saplings and bushes near your roots.  The once chatty forest is quiet in its wake."
msgstr "你梦见火焰在你四周肆虐，舔舐你的树皮，吞没你根旁的幼苗和灌木。曾经喋喋不休的森林也随之安静。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "For some reason you dream of your shoes.  They don't fit, and nothing seems to help…"
msgstr "不知为何，你梦见了自己的鞋子。它们再也不合脚了，而且无论如何都帮不了你……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Hoof.  Talon.  Tooth.  Fight.  Feed.  Forward."
msgstr "巨蹄。利爪。尖牙。战斗。进食。前进。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In a dream you catch a glimpse of a strangely cattle-like image of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你瞥见了自己变成奇怪的牛的样子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In a dream, you see a curiously birdlike reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见自己奇怪的像鸟一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In the dream, you fatten yourself up with all the food you can find to prepare for your next winter hibernation."
msgstr "在梦中，你用你能找到的所有食物把自己养胖，为下个冬眠做准备。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see a group of rats that look almost like yourself."
msgstr "在你的梦中，你看到了一群和你自己长的差不多的老鼠。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see a very spiderlike version of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像蜘蛛一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see an odd, slimy reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像软泥一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream, you see a strangely fishlike image of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见自己奇怪的像鱼一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream, you stalk and kill a young wolf, using only your teeth and claws."
msgstr "梦中，你悄悄地杀死了一只幼狼——只用牙齿和爪子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dreams, you blindly run through the pipes of the city, navigating the familiar byways via smell alone."
msgstr "在睡梦中，你闭着眼都能在城市的管道中穿行，光靠气味就能在熟悉的小道上辨识方向。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dreams, your fangs slip through flesh like scalpels.  You quickly crawl away to let your clumsy prey bleed out."
msgstr "在你的梦里，你的尖牙像手术刀一样刺穿肉体。你迅速地爬开，让你笨拙的猎物流血而死。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your sleep you feel verdant energy growing within you."
msgstr "在睡梦中，你感觉到自己体内正生长着青翠的能量。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Mmm.  The shellfish dream again.  Yum!"
msgstr "嗯……又是这个贝壳梦。好美味！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "NO!  You will not allow this corruption to prevail!"
msgstr "不！你不会让这腐化战胜自己的！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Non-Mycus sometimes reject the Marloss.  Our colonial efforts flourish with broad-minded guidance."
msgstr "非马卡斯们时而排斥马洛斯莓。吾等开拓者应以慈悲为怀，引导其实现繁荣。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Oh boy!  This hidey hole sure is swell."
msgstr "哦天哪！这个藏身洞可真大。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "On land and in the water, you control all that your tongue can reach."
msgstr "不论在陆地还是水中，你能控制你能触及的一切，而你的舌头也能挺能触及的。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Once we finish the burrow we'll settle down and start a little family.  Maybe just a dozen boys and a dozen girls.  Nice and cosy."
msgstr "一旦我们挖完洞，我们就能安顿下来，建立一个小小的家庭。也许只有十几个男孩和十几个女孩。又好又舒服。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Our colonists are limitless.  We shall adapt to this world, as we adapt to all."
msgstr "吾等开拓者无穷无尽。吾等将改造这个世界，一如吾等所曾改造过的所有一切。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow add together, don't they?"
msgstr "红色，蓝色，黄色会混在一起，不是吗？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow cancel each other out, don't they?"
msgstr "红色，蓝色，黄色会相互抵消，不是吗？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Regret haunts your dreams, for your past wrongs real or imagined."
msgstr "悔恨困扰着你的梦境，无论是你过去的真实过错还是想象中的过错。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Sneaky sneak under the floorboards.  We will sneak all their crumbs for us.  But later, back to sleep for now."
msgstr "偷偷溜到地板下面。我们会偷偷把他们的面包屑都偷走。但稍后再说，现在得先回去睡觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Something chases you through a maze of unfamiliar tunnels.  At last, it has you cornered, so you turn around and show it your teeth…"
msgstr "有什么东西在陌生的隧道迷宫里追着你跑。终于，把你逼到绝路，于是你转身露出你的啮齿……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The herd moves along and you with them, finding greener pastures."
msgstr "兽群不断的前进，奔向更加青翠的草场，你是其中之一。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The seething masses attempt to wall non-Mycus away from the Marloss.  We will adapt and defeat them."
msgstr "狂信之众试图将非马卡斯们与马洛斯隔绝开来。吾等将适应并击败它们。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The thought of being out of water, forced to crawl unsupported, terrifies you."
msgstr "你梦见自己被捉出水面，在地上不停扑腾，这个噩梦吓坏了你。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The transition from your lifelike dreams of living as a plant to reality shocks you."
msgstr "梦里变成一株植物的感觉正在逐渐变为现实，这种感觉让你毛骨悚然。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The walking plants seek to harness us as a food source.  We will not allow that."
msgstr "那些会走路的植物把吾等当作食物。吾等将阻止它们。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The world can be whole again, and only you have the courage to make it so."
msgstr "世界可以再次完整，而唯有你有勇气把它办到。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The years seem to fly past as you dream of carving great underground fastnesses."
msgstr "你在梦中构筑牢固的地下要塞，时光飞逝，度年如日。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Tinnitus follows you into your dreams, where it becomes a chorus of crickets."
msgstr "耳鸣会跟着你进入梦境，变成蟋蟀们的合唱。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "We have been waiting a long time for a place such as this."
msgstr "吾等为此时此地已等待多时。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "We will raise bountiful orchards and beautiful gardens."
msgstr "吾等将建起丰美的果园及美丽的花园。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "When you wake up you panic about drowning from being out of water."
msgstr "当你醒来的时候，骤然感觉到一阵窒息，就像鱼儿跳出水面的感觉一样。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "While dreaming you look into a mirror and see a frighteningly insectoid reflection."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像昆虫一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "While dreaming, a reflection of yourself appears almost like an octopus."
msgstr "在梦里，你发现自己的倒影几乎就和一只章鱼一模一样。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "While dreaming, you see a distinctively lizard-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见自己像蜥蜴一样的独特倒影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "While dreaming, you see a distinctively rabbit-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "梦里，你看见自己像兔子一样的独特身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "While dreaming, you see yourself dressed in a hospital gown, receiving treatment."
msgstr "在梦里，你看到自己穿着病号服，在医院接受治疗。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "While dreaming, you see yourself in a pond, your face has widened and is covered in mucus."
msgstr "在梦中，你能在池塘里看见自己的倒影，你的脸变宽了，浑身都是粘液。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "While dreaming, you see yourself weighted down under massive backpack/tent upon your back, as you pass by a mirrored surface."
msgstr "在梦中，每当你经过一个镜面时，你都能看到自己被背上的巨大背包帐篷压下。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Whilst dreaming, you see a disturbingly bestial version of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像野兽般的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Will your burrow be warm enough for the family in winter?"
msgstr "你家的地洞在冬天够暖和吗？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are acutely aware that most of you is sleeping, leaving you to contemplate your situation as you rest."
msgstr "你清楚地意识到，你的大部分身体正在沉睡，这让你在休息时得以反思自己的处境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are confused by a plantlike image of yourself in a dream."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像植物一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are disturbed when your birdlike dreams are more lifelike than reality."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成一只飞鸟，梦境中的场景变得比现实世界还要真实了，这让你心烦意乱。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are frightened of the outside after your vivid dream of cave life."
msgstr "从穴居生活的生动梦境中醒过来后，你发现自己很怕在户外活动了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are many animals, and yet one."
msgstr "你是无数动物的集合体，然而你还是你。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are perfect, and in your dreams, a million others just like you kneel before your superiority."
msgstr "你很完美，在你梦里，有百万个像你一样的，在你的卓越面前跪拜。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of becoming a lizard hybrid."
msgstr "你很惊恐的梦到自己变成了一个蜥蜴人。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of serving the hive queen mindlessly."
msgstr "你很惊恐地从梦中醒来，梦中你变成了一个没有自主意识、服务于蜂后的工蜂。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You blissfully recall days spent lounging in the sun."
msgstr "你愉快的梦到在太阳底下的日子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You can't quite work out what the dream is about… it just keeps changing."
msgstr "你不太能理解你的怪梦……它不停的在变幻。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You creep along, your flexile body transforming shape and color to remain hidden."
msgstr "你缓慢爬行，柔韧的身体不断变换形状和颜色以保持隐蔽。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You crush those who would disagree with your leadership."
msgstr "你打压那些不认可你领导的家伙。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You curl up some more in your nest.  Geez, shredded paper really *is* comfy."
msgstr "你继续蜷缩在你的巢穴中。哎呀，碎纸真的是舒服。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream about the moon."
msgstr "你梦到月亮。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream about the zoo, for some reason."
msgstr "你不知道为什么，梦到了动物园。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream in smells more vivid than sight ever was."
msgstr "你的梦里闻到的味道，比看到的景象还要生动。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream in sounds and smells, not images."
msgstr "你梦见声音和气味，而不是图像。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a cold winter night.  Your jacket is too big to put on."
msgstr "你梦见一个寒冷的冬夜。你的夹克太大了，穿不上。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a feast and excitedly chitter with your pincers… wait, what?"
msgstr "你面见了一场盛宴，并兴奋地用你的螯喀嚓喀嚓地……等等，啥？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a fortress, sheltering humanity from the zombies.  You're in charge, of course."
msgstr "你梦见一座保护人类免受丧尸侵害的堡垒。当然，由你领导。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a home in the forests."
msgstr "你做了一个生动鲜明的梦，梦见自己生活在森林之中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a hospital where doctors try out experimental treatments."
msgstr "你梦见在一家医院中，医生们尝试着实验疗法。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a massive block of cheese bigger than you."
msgstr "你梦见一大块比你整个人还大的奶酪。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a mate, and a dance, and a mother devoured by her own young."
msgstr "你梦见了一个伴侣、一场舞蹈，还有一位被自己孩子吞噬的母亲。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a strange quest for a bush that grows gray apples."
msgstr "你梦见自己正在奇怪地寻找一种能够长出灰色苹果的灌木丛。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a vast dark ocean.  The thought of returning to it seems…undesirable."
msgstr "你梦见一片广阔而黑暗的海洋。想到要回到那里，似乎……并不令人向往。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a world one hundred million years gone."
msgstr "你梦见自己在山脚下挖了个洞安家。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of an endless spiral you can't help but follow."
msgstr "你梦见一个无尽的螺旋，不由自主地被吸引去追随。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being a primitive cave dweller."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成了一个原始穴居人。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being cozy in a dark place."
msgstr "你梦见在黑暗中的你更加自在。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being in two places at once, and four, and yet you are all a greater whole."
msgstr "你梦见同时出现在两个地方，甚至四个地方，但你本身却是一个更伟大的整体。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being swaddled safe in the embrace of the soil."
msgstr "你梦见自己在山脚下挖了个洞安家。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of blood and guts.  For some reason, it makes you feel weirdly excited."
msgstr "你梦见了鲜血与脏器。不知怎么的，这让你感到异常兴奋。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of brushing the fur on your back against a tree."
msgstr "你梦见你在对着树蹭背上的毛皮。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of chasing a beautiful butterfly."
msgstr "你梦见追逐一只美丽的蝴蝶。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of communing with an ancient pine.  Trees are the true survivors of this world, it tells you."
msgstr "你梦见和一棵古老的松树联结交流。它告诉你，树木才是这个世界真正的幸存者。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of cracking seeds with your beak and swallowing them dry."
msgstr "你梦见你突袭城堡，绑架走了公主。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of crawling along the world when you realize you can see three hundred and sixty degrees around yourself."
msgstr "你梦见自己环绕世界爬行，突然意识到自己能看到360度的周遭。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of crushing zombies with your pincer."
msgstr "你梦见自己用钳子夹住丧尸。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of curling up inside a shell to sleep."
msgstr "你梦见自己蜷缩在壳里睡觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of cutting yourself with a knife and watch in fascination as it heals in seconds."
msgstr "你梦见用刀自残，并着迷地看着伤口在几秒内愈合。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of death, always at your heels, and your flesh changing to escape it."
msgstr "你梦到死亡，老像影子一样跟着你，你的肉体不断变化来躲避它。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of defending the herd from a pack of predators."
msgstr "你梦见自己从水中跳出来捕捉猎物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of digging a hole under a hill to make your home."
msgstr "你梦见自己在山脚下挖了个洞安家。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of finally finding the perfect place to make your den."
msgstr "梦中，你终于找到了絮窝的理想地点。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of flying."
msgstr "你梦见你在飞行。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of foraging in the woods… mouth-first?"
msgstr "你梦见自己在丛林中搜寻草料……还用的嘴？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of friends and family crowded around, chattering noisily, grooming one another, and sharing blood."
msgstr "你梦见朋友和家人们挤在一起，叽叽喳喳，互相梳理毛发，分享鲜血。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of grabbing something in an oversized claw."
msgstr "你梦想着用超大的爪子抓住东西。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of grazing in an open field."
msgstr "你梦见自己在旷野中吃草。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of having that success you knew you deserved, back before all this."
msgstr "你梦到自己回到了过去的世界，幸福地追求自己的梦想。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of jumping the gate and leading your herd to freedom."
msgstr "你梦到你带领你的族群跃过大门奔向自由。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of laying eggs in the soft soil."
msgstr "你梦见在松软的土壤中产卵。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of leaping from the water to catch your prey."
msgstr "你梦见自己从水中跳出来捕捉猎物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living as a terrifying octopus mutant."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成了一只很吓人的章鱼变异人。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living deep inside a dark cave."
msgstr "你梦见你生活在一个很深很黑的山洞里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living on the ocean floor."
msgstr "你梦见自己生活在深海之中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of outrunning the apocalypse."
msgstr "你梦见自己跑步速度超越了世界末日。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of pursuing and killing a rat, for some reason."
msgstr "梦里，你追逐并杀掉了一只老鼠……不过为什么？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of ravens calling as you pad away from the remains of a kill."
msgstr "梦里，你追逐并杀掉了一只老鼠……不过为什么？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of recruiting a cult of fishfolk to serve your needs."
msgstr "你梦见自己招募了一群鱼人邪教徒来为你服务。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of rotten food, decomposed until it's almost mush."
msgstr "你梦到腐烂的食物，烂到几乎成泥糊的地步。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of running down familiar streets and rooftops, mentally mapping out every escape route as you go."
msgstr "你梦见在熟悉的街道和屋顶上奔跑，一边跑一边在脑子里规划每一条逃生路线。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of sharing your roots with a vast forest, all plants provided for as the canopy grows ever upwards."
msgstr "你梦见自己与一片广袤的森林共同分享根部，当树冠不断向上生长时，所有的植物都得到了满足。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of sneaking into someone's home to listen to them sleep."
msgstr "你梦见偷偷溜进别人家里听他们睡觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of something biting you but being stopped by your hard outer shell."
msgstr "你梦见有什么东西咬你，但被你坚硬的外壳阻止了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of something flashing in the distant dark, and you understand every word."
msgstr "你梦见远处黑暗中有光芒闪烁，并且你理解每一个字。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of stalking some sort of lizard… no, that can't be right, can it?"
msgstr "在梦中，你悄悄地跟踪着一群蜥蜴……不，这不正常吧，不是吗？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of standing still in the rain, drinking in the falling drops… with your feet?"
msgstr "你梦见自己伫立雨中，啜饮着洒落的雨滴……用脚？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of still waters, rain, and a chorus of voices raised in song."
msgstr "你梦见宁静的水面、雨 ，以及齐声高歌的合唱。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of swimming in the open ocean"
msgstr "你梦见自己在海洋里遨游。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into a fresh kill."
msgstr "你梦见自己的爪子撕碎了新鲜的猎物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into your prey, and the sweet taste of raw flesh."
msgstr "你梦见偷偷溜进别人家里听他们睡觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the buzzing of a fly that you cannot see.  It makes you hungry."
msgstr "你梦见一只看不见的苍蝇在嗡嗡叫着。它令你感到饥饿。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the changeling.  Again."
msgstr "你梦到自己调包偷换孩童。又一次。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the crack of bone and the taste of raw meat."
msgstr "你梦见了月亮，突然有了一种想要嚎叫的冲动。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the hunt to end all hunts."
msgstr "你梦到了终结所有狩猎的狩猎。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the hunt, the feed, and your pack."
msgstr "你梦见狩猎、进食以及你的族群。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the moon and feel a sudden urge to howl."
msgstr "你梦见了月亮，突然有了一种想要嚎叫的冲动。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the sun shining down on your leaves."
msgstr "你梦到了捕猎，进食，还有你的狼群。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the tropics."
msgstr "你梦到热带雨林。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of walking along the sea floor."
msgstr "你梦见自己在海洋之中漫步。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of warm breath and fresh blood."
msgstr "你梦见温暖的呼吸和新鲜的血液。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of washing your hands and face."
msgstr "你梦见在黑暗中的你更加自在。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of your legions of undead admirers, their attentions, and the wonderful pain."
msgstr "你梦到了那一大群无数不死崇拜者，它们对你的关注，以及那美妙的疼痛感觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of your wings carrying you through the night sky, and the comforting presence of moon and stars above."
msgstr "你梦见自己的翅膀带你穿越夜空，头顶还有月亮和星星的陪伴，很安心。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of… sneaking."
msgstr "你梦见你在……潜行。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream you are lithe in the sunlight and radiant with grace."
msgstr "你梦见自己在阳光下躺着，优雅地闪耀着。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream you crawl out from under a rock.  And then immediately crawl back in."
msgstr "你梦到自己从石头底下爬出来。然后马上又爬了回去。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream you're safely at home with a bustling family."
msgstr "你梦见你和一群热闹的家人们安全地呆在家里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You easily bound from the street to a roof…oh, only a dream."
msgstr "你纵身一跃，从大街上跳到了屋顶……啊，只是个梦而已。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You excitedly web up an interloper and prepare to feast… nope, dream."
msgstr "你兴奋地网住了一个闯入者，准备享用盛宴……呃，一个梦而已。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel a yearning…"
msgstr "你内心有种渴望……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel beautiful, and yet riven with worry…"
msgstr "你梦见自己很漂亮，但又被烦恼所撕裂……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel like you're cracking a combination lock."
msgstr "你梦见自己好像在破解一把组合锁。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel nothing but disgust as you dream of strangling your old self."
msgstr "你没什么感觉，只是感到厌恶——梦见你正掐死过去的自己时。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel warm."
msgstr "你在梦中感到十分温暖。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel… OK."
msgstr "你感觉……不错。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You find it hard to control your limbs after dreaming of amorphous blob life."
msgstr "你从变成变形怪的梦中醒来以后，发现自己几乎无法控制自己的四肢了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You find it hard to wake from a vivid dream of grazing on a farm."
msgstr "你很不情愿的从一个逼真的梦中醒来，梦中你安静地吃着草。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You flutter through the air, listening for echoes to guide you through your dream."
msgstr "你在空中飞翔，倾听回声指引你进入梦境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a comforting and warm dream of living as a rabbit."
msgstr "你做了一个舒适而温暖的梦，梦见自己像兔子一样生活。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a comforting dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr "你做了一个舒适的梦，梦见自己在和一群小鱼伙伴们一起畅游。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a confusing and scary dream of becoming a plant."
msgstr "你做了一个困惑而吓人的梦，梦见自己变成了一株植物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a confusing dream of growing in a garden."
msgstr "你做了一个令人困扰的梦，在梦中你正在一个花园中茁壮成长。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream about running from dogs."
msgstr "你做了一个躲开猎狗追捕的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of bathing in the sun on a rock."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，梦里你在岩石上晒太阳。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of eating insects."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，梦里你吃下昆虫。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of living in a supermarket lobster tank."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，梦里你生活在超市放龙虾的鱼缸里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of someone invading your territory."
msgstr "你做了一个不愉快的梦，梦中有人侵犯了你的领地。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr "你做了一个令人困扰的梦，梦见自己在和一群小鱼伙伴们一起畅游。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of undergoing strange medical procedures."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，好像接受了诡异的医疗手术。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbingly lifelike dream of living as a lizard."
msgstr "你做了一个很令人困惑很逼真的梦，梦见自己俨然如一只蜥蜴一样活着。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a dream of doctors and nurses doing unnatural things to your body, which brings you perverse pleasure."
msgstr "你做了一个怪梦。医生和护士对你的身体动了一个非常恐怖手术，但是给了你一种奇特的快感。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a dream of working in a hive."
msgstr "你做了一个梦，梦见自己在一个巢穴中行走。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a horrible nightmare of being caught out in the sunlight."
msgstr "在一个恐怖的噩梦中，你被扔到了阳光里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a nightmare of being all alone, but then your family flies home to comfort you."
msgstr "你做了一个噩梦，自己孤身一人，但随后你的家人们飞回家来安慰你。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a puckish dream."
msgstr "你做了个恶作剧的梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a realistic dream of flying south with your flock for the winter."
msgstr "你做了一个逼真的梦，梦里在和一群伙伴为了躲避寒冬一起向南飞着。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about animals."
msgstr "你做了一个关于动物的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about bears."
msgstr "你做了一个关于熊的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about being a patient in a frightening hospital."
msgstr "你做了一个被禁闭在恐怖医院里的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about being the Easter Bunny."
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦见自己是只复活节兔子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about birds."
msgstr "你做了一个关于飞鸟的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about cats."
msgstr "你做了一个关于猫的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about cattle."
msgstr "你做了一个关于牛的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about crabs."
msgstr "你做了一个关于螃蟹的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about fish."
msgstr "你做了一个关于鱼的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about frogs in a pond near your childhood home."
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦见你童年家附近池塘里的青蛙。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about insects."
msgstr "你做了一个关于昆虫的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about living in a cave."
msgstr "你做了一个关于洞穴生活的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about lizards."
msgstr "你做了一个关于蜥蜴的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about plants."
msgstr "你做了一个关于植物的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about rabbits."
msgstr "你做了一个关于兔子的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about rats."
msgstr "你做了一个关于老鼠的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about sea creatures."
msgstr "你做了一个关于海洋生物的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about slime."
msgstr "你做了一个关于变形怪的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about snails and slugs in your garden."
msgstr "你做了一个关于花园中的蜗牛和蛞蝓的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about spiders."
msgstr "你做了一个关于蜘蛛的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about wolves."
msgstr "你做了一个关于狼的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of carrying a house on your back."
msgstr "你做了一个背着房子的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of living in sludge."
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦见自己生活在一个烂泥潭中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of spinning webs."
msgstr "你有一个奇怪的梦，梦见织网。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream."
msgstr "你做了一个怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of being a medical anomaly, as your heartbeat syncs with the steady drip of an IV line."
msgstr "你做了一个与医疗异常现象有关的生动的梦，在梦中你的心跳与平稳的静脉点滴同步化了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of hunting in the woods."
msgstr "你做了一个在树林里打猎的生动的梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of shedding your carapace.  It feels good."
msgstr "你做了一个生动的梦，梦到脱掉了自己的甲壳，感觉真好。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have an upsetting dream about falling and being unable to get back up."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，梦见自己正在坠落，再也爬不起来了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have strange dreams of soaring through the sky."
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦里你飞翔在天空中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You hear the sirens again, but this time you stay in your hole in the wall.  Nobody will think to look there!"
msgstr "你又听见警笛了，但是这次你藏在你墙中的洞穴中。没人会想到在这里寻找！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You howl loud and long, ecstatic after securing a whole cache of supplies."
msgstr "你梦见自己狂喜地大声嚎叫，找到了一大批物资。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You leap from rooftop to rooftop, effortlessly avoiding your pursuers while making your way to safety."
msgstr "你梦见自己从一个屋顶跳到另一个屋顶，毫不费力地避开追击者，同时逃向安全的地方。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You lie in a pile with your brothers and sisters.  Someone keeps moving around, nearly waking you up."
msgstr "你和兄弟姐妹们挤在一堆里躺着，有个老是在动，差点把你弄醒。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You pant, terrified at the thought of that FUNGUS destroying your home!"
msgstr "你气喘吁吁，因那种真菌可能毁坏你的家而感到恐惧！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You relax in your web; it's not vibrating, so dinner hasn't arrived yet."
msgstr "你梦见在自己的网里放松，网没有震动，所以晚餐还没到。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You scream in fear while you dream of being chased by a cat"
msgstr "你梦见自己正在被一只猫追捕，太吓人了！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You see yourself reflected in the beauty of the forest."
msgstr "你在梦中看见了自己美丽的身影，森林的美景全都在你身上映射出来。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You see yourself, five years from now, as the leader of a successful city."
msgstr "你梦见了五年后的自己，一位成功的受人敬仰的市长。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You sit at the bottom of the sea, staring without thought at all the world passing by overhead."
msgstr "你坐在海底，木愣地凭目光注视着整个世界在你头顶流逝。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You sneak into a house, only to discover a full, intact cupboard of cat food!"
msgstr "你梦见自己潜入一间房子，却发现了一个装满了金枪鱼罐头的完好无损的橱柜！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You startle as the shadow of a bird passes over your web, but it's only a dream."
msgstr "当一只鸟的影子掠过你的蛛网，你惊讶地跳了一下；不过，这只是个梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You stir, saddened that your beautiful hatchlings were only a dream."
msgstr "你好失落，你那些刚刚孵化的漂亮幼崽只是一场梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You swim with fish.  You fly with birds.  You run with the beasts of the land.  You change with the changing of seasons.  You are everything."
msgstr "你梦见自己和鱼一起游。和鸟一起飞。和这片土地上的野兽一起跑。你会随着季节的变化而变化。你就是一切。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You taste iron all night long, like you've bitten your tongue."
msgstr "你梦见整晚都尝到铁锈味，就像咬了舌头一样。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You taste the blood of another, and know that it will be yours."
msgstr "你尝到了，别人的血，你也知道，最终会轮到你的血。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You terrifyingly dream of being led to a slaughterhouse by a farmer."
msgstr "你做了一个很糟糕的梦，梦见自己正被农夫领着走向屠宰场。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in a web and consuming insects."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己正趴在网上畅享美味昆虫。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in the sewers."
msgstr "你做了一个生动鲜明的梦，梦见自己生活在下水道里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of running with your pack, hunting a wild animal."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己正在和狼伙伴们合作追捕一只猎物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of sharing a kill with your pack."
msgstr "你做了一个生动的梦，梦见自己和兽群们一同分享猎物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wake up with your legs pumping as you hop along in your sleep."
msgstr "你在梦中蹦蹦跳跳，醒来时双腿还不停地抽搐。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You weave between the zombies' legs, too small for them to catch.  The gas station isn't far now, with all its soda and chips and- UGH, dream…"
msgstr "你在丧尸的腿间穿梭，它们根本抓不住身材小巧的你。加油站就在眼前，以及里面的汽水和薯片还有——呃，是个梦……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You were once many cells living as one, now you are one living as many."
msgstr "你曾经是许多细胞融作的一体，现在你是一个以多重形式存在的个体。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wish others could understand, and join your struggle…"
msgstr "你希望别人能理解你对森林的爱，并和你一起奋斗……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wonder if you could find one of those 'salmon runs', or if they were just a legend…"
msgstr "你在梦中四处寻找那些可以\"嘴接鲑鱼\"的地方，或者那只是一个传说……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wonder if your nest will be good enough."
msgstr "你梦见你在纠结自己建造的鸟巢是否足够结实。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You've never felt so lithe and powerful."
msgstr "你从来没有感到如此轻盈，强大。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your body flows slightly faster than you expected… oh, just a dream."
msgstr "你觉得体内的血液流动地比你预期中要快……哦，只是一个梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your disturbingly lifelike dream has you pollinating plants."
msgstr "你做了一个很令人不安而又十分逼真的梦，梦中你在给花儿授粉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream is filled with creatures, and yet all seem like you."
msgstr "你的梦境充斥了各种生物，而且你看上去和它们都有点像。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream of living in the dark for years is almost real."
msgstr "你梦见自己在黑暗中生活了很多很多年，这种感觉以假乱真。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream of raiding a giant beehive has you licking your… muzzle in anticipation."
msgstr "在梦中，你疯狂的舔食着一个蜂巢，用着你那……长长的嘴，预料之中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
