#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The jet injector's chemicals wear off.  You feel AWFUL!"
msgstr "注射的化学药剂药效开始消退了。你觉得好糟糕！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Exsanguination"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The monster is drinking your blood!"
msgstr "这只怪物正在吸食你的血液！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Exsanguination"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The monster is drinking your blood, you vile feral!"
msgstr "那个怪物正在喝你的血，可恶的家伙！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Short of Breath"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The pollen makes it hard to breathe!"
msgstr "花粉让人呼吸困难！"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "World Rejection, Dimensional Rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The rejection you feel from all around you has become a little easier to bear."
msgstr "你感到周围的世界对你的排斥减弱了。"

