msgstr "你服用了暴龙诱变剂。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Theropod Mutation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You consumed theropod mutagen."
msgstr "你消耗了兽脚类诱变剂。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Troglobite Mutation"
