msgstr "你摘下了变色隐形眼镜。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MARLOSS_R_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You daydream about luscious pink berries as big as your fist."
msgstr "你幻想着和你的拳头一样大的、甜美的粉色浆果。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MARLOSS_B_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You daydream about nutty cyan seeds as big as your hand."
msgstr "你幻想着和你的手掌一样大的、坚果味的青色种子。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MARLOSS_Y_ADDICTION"
