#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_FALLOUT_MESSAGE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/anamolous_weather_eocs.json
msgid "The wind carries the scent of burning wood and plastic, heralding the arrival of unnaturally dark clouds which scatter ash across the landscape, almost like black snow…"
msgstr "风带来了燃烧的木头和塑料的气味，预示着那些不自然的乌云即将到来，它们在景观中洒下灰烬，几乎像黑雪一样……"

