#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_CRUSHING_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_AVIAN_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_RAPTOR_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
