msgid "Something ancient lurks behind your eyes, a patient and deadly hunter."
msgstr "你的眼睛背后潜伏着某种古老的东西，它是一个耐心而致命的猎手。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "Something is devouring you, and in turn you must devour."
msgstr "有些东西正在吞噬你，而反过来你也必须去吞噬。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "Stay calm, stay alert, and wait for your time to strike."
msgstr "保持冷静，保持警觉，等待时机来临。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "The dull scavengers of earth wax crafty to vex it and swell monstrous to plague it.  Things have learnt to walk that ought to crawl."
msgstr "地球上那些迟钝的食腐动物变得狡猾起来，扰乱大地，膨胀成怪物般的大小，给大地带来灾难。本该爬行的东西，却学会了行走。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LOSE_MUTATING_GRADUAL"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "The everpresent churning in your tortured flesh finally ceases.  Is it over?"
msgstr "你饱受折磨的肉体中那永恒的翻腾终于停止了。结束了吗？"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
