msgstr "你处于发热或寒冷状态。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "You dream of a pair of ragged claws, scuttling across the floors of silent seas…"
msgstr "你梦想着有一双破烂的爪子，在寂静的海底地板上疾驰而过…"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "You have the inexplicable urge to run for miles and miles…"
msgstr "你莫名地有种想跑上数英里的冲动…"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "You just need to find your herd, then it will all be OK."
msgstr "你只需找到你的群体，一切都会好起来的。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "Your heart hammers at the thrill of a foreign thought, the thrill of taking wing,"
msgstr "你心中因一个异国想法的激动而狂跳，因振翅高飞的激动而狂跳，"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "Your legs are heavy, your sweat like slime…"
msgstr "你的双腿沉重不堪，汗水黏糊糊的…"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "Your mind expands, like it's bursting out of your skull, but is it really you?."
msgstr "你的思维如脱缰野马般膨胀，但那真的是你吗？。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTATING_GRADUAL_SELECTOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_gradual_eocs.json
msgid "Your skin itches.  Something grips you by the brain stem.  It's time."
msgstr "你的皮肤开始发痒。有什么东西紧紧抓住了你的脑干。是时候了。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
msgid "LIXA Back Teleport"
msgstr "神器传送"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
