#. ~ Description of spell "LIXA Back Teleport"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
msgid "Teleports the victim backwards."
msgstr "传送怪物。"

#. ~ Description of spell "LIXA Forward Teleport"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
msgid "Teleports the victim forwards."
msgstr "传送怪物。"

#. ~ Description of spell "LIXA Unfold Entry"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
msgid "Teleports the victim to the unfolded chamber."
msgstr "将受害者传送到展开的房间。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_unfold_return"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
msgid "There is a soft sound, like a champagne cork popping in an empty concert hall.  The world is as it was again.  The LIXA device still hums quietly as it finishes powering down."
msgstr "一阵轻柔的声音响起，就像空荡的音乐厅里香槟塞砰然爆开的声音。世界又恢复了原样。LIXA设备仍在安静地嗡嗡作响，同时完成关机。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_UNFOLD_ENTRY"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
msgid "You step into a space that unfolds around you, becoming endless and completely flat.  Every side of every surface is on display.  You look down at your hands; you can see the front, the back, the insides and outsides of every vein and bone, all in the same place on one surface.  You can't imagine what has happened to your eyes to let you understand what you are seeing.  Or your brain."
msgstr "传送受害者至展开的空间 你踏入一个在你周围展开的空间，它变得无边无际且完全平坦。每个表面的每一面都清晰可见。你低头看着自己的手；你能看到每条血管和每块骨骼的正反面以及内外侧，所有这些都在一个平面的同一位置上。你无法想象你的眼睛发生了什么变化，才能让你理解你所看到的。或者你的大脑发生了什么变化。"

#. ~ Success message in teleportation in nested effect in switch statement in
