msgstr "紧急排气"

#. ~ Description of fault "Fused internals"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Excessive heat has rendered this weapon inoperable."
msgstr "这把武器因为过热而无法使用。"

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Fail to feed"
msgstr "存储游戏数据失败"

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Fatal containment failure"
msgstr "热防护致命故障"

#. ~ Description of fault "Blackpowder fouling"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Firing blackpowder loads from a gun fouls it, which reduces reliability and, if left uncleaned, leads to rust.  It fouls the gun much faster than the use of modern smokeless powder cartridges.  Fouling is only a significant impact on reliability at high levels, but black powder fouling accumulates quickly."
msgstr "枪械发射黑火药弹药会残留残渣，降低枪械可靠性并且若不及时清理会使得枪械生锈。黑火药会比现代无烟火药更快的污染枪膛。残渣只会在堆积过高时影响枪械可靠性，但使用黑火药会在枪管中迅速堆积残渣。"

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Fouling"
msgstr "枪膛残渣"

#. ~ Description of fault "Fouling"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Fouling is caused by firing gunpowder loads repeatedly, which reduces reliability and can eventually cause damage to the gun.  Fouling accumulates slowly (unless blackpowder is used) due to the design of modern smokeless powder found in the vast majority of retail cartridges and it is not a significant problem until high levels of fouling are reached due to firing thousands of rounds without cleaning your firearm."
msgstr "枪械发射弹药时会残留残渣，降低枪械可靠性并且若不及时清理最终会损害枪膛。残渣只会在枪膛中缓慢堆积（除非使用黑火药弹药）。由于现代大部分在售弹药都采用无烟火药因此残渣堆积不是大问题，除非你发射上千发弹药而且从不清理枪膛导致残渣过多。"

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Fused internals"
msgstr "内部构件熔融"

#. ~ Description of fault "Fatal containment failure"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "It got hot."
msgstr "烫烫烫"

#. ~ Description of fault "Double feed"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Magazine of the gun tried to put two rounds in the chamber at once."
msgstr "那杆枪的弹匣试图一次将两发子弹装入膛室。"

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Overheat safety"
msgstr "过热保护"

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Spent casing in chamber"
msgstr "弹壳卡膛"

