#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A large section of metal tubing, balanced on spring supports to prevent any vibration from affecting the laser inside."
msgstr "一大段金属管，通过弹簧支撑保持平衡，以防止任何振动影响内部的激光器。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  It bears the letters LIXA in proud silver."
msgstr "一个智能卡读卡器。上面用醒目的银色字母印着“LIXA”。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  It is a forbidding black, with no symbols of any sort to identify it."
msgstr "一个智能卡读卡器。它外观漆黑，没有任何标识符号。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rewired card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  The casing is damaged, and repaired with tape."
msgstr "一个智能卡读卡器。外壳受损，用胶带进行了修复。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "PPE lockup card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  The label above it reads 'SECURE PPE LOCKER'."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。贴在上面的便利贴上写着：\"仅限合作社成员\"。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "whiteboard"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A wide space of whiteboard, for writing on with washable markers.  No one has washed it in a long time, though; it is covered in dense scrawls of equations and waveform diagrams."
msgstr "一块宽阔的白板，可以用可擦除的记号笔在上面写字。不过，已经很久没人擦过它了；上面布满了密密麻麻的方程式和波形图。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial green carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a green color, for laying down on bare concrete, with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "坚固、低绒毛、高耐久性的绿色地毯，用于铺设在裸露的混凝土上。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wall of flat space"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "From a distance, this looks like where the chamber ends; a flat wall, with a very detailed painting of a tunnel behind it.  But as you get closer, you can see how it ripples, like lazy water, and notice angles of the space beyond that a flat image could never give."
msgstr "从远处看，这似乎就是房间的尽头；一面平坦的墙，墙上绘有一幅非常精细的隧道画作。但当你走近时，你会发现它像平静的水面一样泛起涟漪，并注意到墙后空间的角度，这是平面图像永远无法呈现的。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "leaking laser chamber"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Gobbets of congealed light drip from the gash in the side of this chamber like hot marmalade."
msgstr "一滴滴凝结的光从这房间侧面的裂缝中滴落，宛如热果酱。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "PPE lockup card reader"
msgstr "读卡器（损坏）"

#. ~ Query message for terrain "card reader"'s examine action
#. ~ Query message for terrain "rewired card reader"'s examine action
#. ~ Query message for terrain "PPE lockup card reader"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "Swipe your ID card?"
msgstr "刷一下你的钥匙卡？"

#. ~ Message when terrain "card reader"'s examine action would be redundant
#. ~ Message when terrain "rewired card reader"'s examine action would be
#. redundant
#. ~ Message when terrain "PPE lockup card reader"'s examine action would be
#. redundant
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "The nearby doors are already opened."
msgstr "附近的门已经开了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "unfolded machinery"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "This inscrutable device is filled with wires, boards, and connections.  You can see every one of them, and it gives you a headache."
msgstr "这个神秘的装置里布满了电线、电路板和连接线。你能看到每一条，看得你头疼。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fractal compressor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "This space is infinite, and has no beginning or end.  But you can see both right here, in this churning mass of angles."
msgstr "这个空间是无限的，没有起点也没有终点。但你在这片由无数角度交织而成的混沌之中，却能同时看到这两者。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "You can see every side of every crack in this worn concrete, all the way down.  You can't look at it for too long."
msgstr "你能看到这块破旧混凝土上每一条裂缝的每一面，一直看到最深处。但你不能盯着它看太久。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "unfolded laser chamber"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "You can see the inside surface of this tube, and what it contains.  Thick, slimy red light oozes within it."
msgstr "你可以看到这根管子的内表面，以及里面所装的东西。管子里渗出一种黏稠的红色液体。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "photonic conduit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "You can see through the metal casing of this tube, into the blazing light coursing through it."
msgstr "透过这根管的金属外壳，你可以看到炽热的光线在其中穿行。"

#. ~ Message when terrain "card reader"'s examine action succeeds
#. ~ Message when terrain "rewired card reader"'s examine action succeeds
#. ~ Message when terrain "PPE lockup card reader"'s examine action succeeds
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"You insert your ID card.\n"
"<color_light_green>The nearby doors unlock.</color>"
msgstr ""
"你插入了钥匙卡。\n"
"<color_light_green>附近的门解锁了。</color>"

#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "unfolded laser chamber"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "a hollow pop, followed by a sickly wet squelching as congealed light slowly leaks out of the tube."
msgstr "一声空洞的爆裂声，接着是令人作呕的湿滑的挤压声，凝固的光线从管中缓缓渗出。"

