#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wall wirings"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "Electric wires embedded in the wall."
msgstr "安装在墙上用来供电的电线。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_ground_solar_panel_v2"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "Four high-performance solar panels arrayed together to provide energy when exposed to direct sunlight."
msgstr "四块高性能太阳能电池板排列在一起，在直接阳光照射下提供能量。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_ground_solar_panel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "Four solar panels arrayed together to provide energy when exposed to direct sunlight."
msgstr "四块太阳能电池板排列在一起，在直接暴露于阳光下时提供能量。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "hydraulic press"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "If you really want to squash something a lot, this is exactly the right industrial tool for you.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "如果你真的很想挤压一些东西，这对你来说就是一个很好的工业工具。你懂的，它的力量非常大。已接通电源，可以使用了。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "stationary water purifier"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "This device effectively sterilizes water.  Activate it to clean all water in a connected tank, at the cost of some electricity."
msgstr "该设备有效地对水进行消毒。 激活它以清洁连接水箱中的所有水，但需要一些电力。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "air compressor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "This durable tank is topped with a motor that will cram as much air into the tank as possible.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "这个坚固的气罐顶部安装着一台压缩机，能将尽可能多的空气抽进罐中。已接通电源，可以使用了。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "folding solar panel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "This folding solar panel has been unfolded and is ready to charge connected devices using the power of the sun."
msgstr "这款折叠式太阳能电池板已展开，准备利用太阳能为连接的设备充电。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "advanced folding solar panel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "This high-end solar panel has been unpacked and is ready to supply power, provided it's out in the sun."
msgstr "这款高端太阳能电池板已拆封，只要在阳光下即可供电。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "router table"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "This table has an inset router, a rotating motor with an exchangeable blade head for cutting specific profiles and grooves.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "这张桌子有一个嵌入式刳刨机、一个旋转电机和一个可更换的刀头，用于切割特定的轮廓、凹槽和材料。已接通电源，可以使用了。"

