#. ~ Description of vehicle part "diesel generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
msgid "A bulky generator typically used to power job sites.  It will provide power by burning diesel, kerosene, or other compatible fuels."
msgstr "一种通常用于为工作现场供电的大型发电机。它通过燃烧柴油、煤油或其他兼容燃料来提供电力。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "portable gas-powered generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
msgid "A small gas-powered generator.  If filled up and turned on, it will provide enough power for camping or running basic appliances."
msgstr "一台小型燃气发电机。如果加满油并开启，它将提供足够的电力供露营或运行基本电器使用。"

