#. ~ Description of furniture "yellow indoor plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A decorative potted plant with a yellow flower, it looks to have wilted and died some time ago."
msgstr "一盆开黄花的装饰性盆栽，里面的植物看上去已经枯萎，在不久以前就已经枯死了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "seed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A freshly planted seed.  If properly tended to, it could grow into a healthy plant."
msgstr "一颗刚刚种下的种子。在得到正确的照料之后，它可以健康生长成对应作物。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  Can be used for planting crops."
msgstr "一个装满了土壤的园圃，底部铺设了用来排水的板条。可用来种植作物。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with seed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This one contains a planted seed, and will need attention to grow fully."
msgstr "一个装满了土壤的园圃，底部铺设了用来排水的板条。上面有颗刚刚种下的种子，需要细心照料才能完全长成。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with harvestable plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This one has a fully grown plant, and will need closer examination to harvest."
msgstr "一个装满了土壤的园圃，底部铺设了用来排水的板条。上面有株可收获的作物，需要靠近仔细查看来收获。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with mature plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This one has a matured plant that should be ready for harvest before long."
msgstr "一个装满了土壤的园圃，底部铺设了用来排水的板条。上面有株成熟作物，不久就可以收获了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with seedling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This one has a seed that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr "一个装满了土壤的园圃，底部铺设了用来排水的板条。上面有颗已经发芽长成幼苗的种子。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "seedling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A seed that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr "一颗刚刚开始发芽的种子。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "indoor plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A small potted plant, used for decoration indoors.  It appears to have dried up and died a while ago."
msgstr "一株用于室内装饰小型盆栽。它似乎早已干涸，里面的植物死了有段时间了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stooking spot"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A space has been cleared out here for grain drying.  Place fresh stalks of grain in this spot and examine to set up a stook."
msgstr "这里已经腾出了一块地方用来干燥谷穗，检查一下以堆放新鲜的谷穗。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "sprout"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A tiny little sprout that has just begun to grow."
msgstr "一个刚刚开始生长的嫩芽。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mutant sapling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A twisted and gnarled little tree.  Its shape is at once alien and familiar."
msgstr "一棵扭曲而多节的小树，它的形状既陌生又熟悉。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "grain stook"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "Sheaves of cut grain have been stood upright in a self-supporting A-frame to dry, keeping the seeds off the ground and out of reach of vermin."
msgstr "一捆捆割下的谷穗被摆成可以自支撑的A形秸秆堆，使种子远离地面和害虫。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with dead plants"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "Somewhere beneath this heap of dying plants you can see the shape of wooden furniture.  Left without care, the plants it used to nurture have shriveled and died."
msgstr "在这堆枯萎的植物下面，你可以看到一些木质家具的轮廓。由于无人照料，那些曾经被它们滋养过的植物已经干枯死亡了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mutant tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "This bizarre tree spreads its twisted branches at odd angles toward the sky.  If you squint, it almost looks like a human figure with its arms raised to catch the sun."
msgstr "这棵奇怪的树把扭曲的树枝以奇怪的角度伸向天空。如果你斜视它的话，它看起来几乎就像一个举起双臂来捕捉阳光的人。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "overgrown plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "This patch of green used to be a cultivated field or some sort of monocrop agriculture.  Neglected for too long, it has been overtaken by nature."
msgstr "这片绿色的区域过去曾是农田，或者是某种单一作物的种植区。由于长期无人打理，它已被大自然所占据。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mature plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "This plant has matured, and will be ready to harvest before long."
msgstr "这株作物已经成熟，不久就可以收获了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "harvestable plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "This plant is fully grown and ready to be harvested.  Identifying how to harvest it requires closer examination."
msgstr "这株作物已经完全长成，可以收获了。具体如何收获它还需要你靠近仔细查看。"

