#. ~ Description of furniture "spider egg sac"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid "A bulbous mass of off-white spider eggs.  Upon watching closer, you can see them moving a bit.  Really gross."
msgstr "一团球状的白色蜘蛛卵。仔细观察时，你可以看到它们在微微地移动。真恶心。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "ruptured egg sac"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid "A disgusting, ruptured sac of giant spider eggs.  The thought of all those massive baby spiders pouring out of it is almost terrifying on its own."
msgstr "一个巨大的已经裂开的恶心的蜘蛛卵袋。光是想到巨大的蜘蛛宝宝从里面涌出来的念头就足够可怕了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "spider egg sac"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid "A gigantic sac of spider eggs, each one larger than your fist.  They're definitely moving around.  Really gross, just seeing it makes your skin crawl."
msgstr "一些巨大的蜘蛛卵袋，每一个都比你的拳头大。它们肯定在四处移动。真恶心，一看到它就会让你浑身起鸡皮疙瘩。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "spider egg sac"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid "A sizable, off-white sac of large eggs.  Upon watching closer, you can see them moving slightly.  Gross."
msgstr "一些巨大的白色卵囊。仔细观察时，你可以看到它们在微微地移动。真恶心。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid "ruptured egg sac"
msgstr "蜘蛛卵袋（破裂）"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid "spider egg sac"
msgstr "蜘蛛卵袋"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_rad_leak"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "A metal vent."
msgstr "一个金属通风口。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_toxic_leak"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "A metal vent.  Toxic-looking clouds seep from it."
msgstr "一个金属通风口，你能看到毒雾从里面渗出。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_toxic_belch"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "A metal vent.  Toxic-looking clouds stream from it."
msgstr "一个金属通风口，你能看到毒雾从里面喷出。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_cold_air2_blast"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "A metal vent.  You can feel cold air blasting out of it."
msgstr "一个金属通风口，你能感觉到冷空气从里面渗出。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "metal grate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "A metal vent.  You can feel cool air seeping out of it."
msgstr "一个金属通风口，你能感觉到冷空气从里面渗出。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_hot_air2_stream"
#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_hot_air2_blast"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "A metal vent.  You can feel hot air seeping out of it."
msgstr "一个金属通风口，你能感觉到热空气从里面渗出。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fog"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "A misty cloud of fog."
msgstr "一团浓雾。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_fog_breather"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "A misty cloud of water vapor."
msgstr "一团水蒸气。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bubbles"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "A stinking gas bubbles up out of the water here."
msgstr "从这里冒出一股刺鼻的气体。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bubbles"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "The sewage bubbles here, releasing a terrible-smelling gas."
msgstr "这里的污水冒出泡沫，散发出一股难闻的气味。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "bubbles"
msgstr "气泡"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "metal grate"
msgstr "金属栅格"

#. ~ Description of furniture "ground crafting spot"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid "A cleared spot on the ground for crafting."
msgstr "一个便宜的塑料花盆，可以用来种植。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "seeing this is a bug"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid "Seeing this is a bug.  If seen, please report and destroy."
msgstr "看到这是一个bug。如果看到，请报告并销毁。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fake workbench hands"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid "This fake workbench holds the stats for working on a wielded item."
msgstr "这个假工作台保存了用于处理一个使用过的物品的统计数据。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid "fake workbench hands"
msgstr "假工作台手"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid "ground crafting spot"
msgstr "地面制造点"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fireplace"
#. ~ Description of furniture "stone fireplace"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A common fixture for safely hosting a fire indoors, with a chimney to vent the smoke to the outside."
msgstr "一个常见的家具，用于在室内安全地生火，还有一个烟囱将烟雾排出到室外。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "portable stove"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A foldable metal stove for hosting wood-fueled fires.  Good for cooking or heating food, and safe to use indoors."
msgstr "一个可折叠的金属炉子，用来存放木材生火。适合用来烹调或加热食物，在室内能安全使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fire barrel (200 L)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A huge metal barrel used to safely contain a fire.  It has multiple holes punched in the sides for air supply."
msgstr "一个用来烧火的巨型金属桶。它的桶壁上有多个孔以保障空气供应。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fire barrel (100 L)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A large metal barrel used to safely contain a fire.  It has multiple holes punched in the sides for air supply."
msgstr "一个用来烧火的大金属桶。它的桶壁上有多个孔以保障空气供应。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "makeshift brazier"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A metal bucket with holes, in which you can safely start a fire.  It's too small to fit any fuel item larger than some splintered wood."
msgstr "一个由金属罐制成的小型自制火炉。它太小了，装不下任何比碎木体积更大的燃料。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "brazier"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A raised metal dish in which to safely burn things."
msgstr "一个金属盆，用于安全的燃烧物品。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fire ring"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A ring of stones to safely contain a fire."
msgstr "一圈石头，用来安全的控制火势。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "clay oven"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A simple clay oven with a chimney, with a firebrick alcove in the middle that can be used to cook food or just to contain a fire."
msgstr "一种简单的陶土烤箱，带有烟囱，中间有个砖砌的壁龛，可以用来烹饪或只是用来控制火势。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wood stove"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A simple metal stove for hosting wood-fueled fires.  Good for cooking or heating food, and safe to use indoors."
msgstr "一个简单的金属炉子，用来存放木材生火。适合用来烹调或加热食物，在室内能安全使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "hobo stove"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A small improvised wood stove, made from a metal can.  It's too small to fit any fuel much larger than splintered wood."
msgstr "一个由金属罐制成的小型自制火炉。它太小了，装不下任何比碎木体积更大的燃料。"

