msgstr "墓碑（磨损）"

#. ~ Description of furniture "capacitor bank"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "A bank of heavy metal cylinders connected by large wires."
msgstr "一排用粗电缆连接起来的重金属圆筒。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "ground cable"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "A bunch of loose cables snake along the floor."
msgstr "许多四散的电缆在地板上蜿蜒而行。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "chemical mixer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "A large vat with a motorized mixing device for combining large quantities of chemicals."
msgstr "一个用于合成大量化学品的带有机动混合装置的大桶。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mobile antenna"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "A stark black directional antenna, seemingly part of a monitoring setup.  An LED mounted on its back lights up with a lazy and irregular rhythm."
msgstr "一台漆黑的定向天线，似乎是监控装置的一部分。它背后的一个LED灯正缓慢而不规则地闪烁着。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "electrical conduit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "A thick bundle of electrical wiring protected by a metal conduit."
msgstr "一束被金属导管保护的粗电缆。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "robotic arm"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "An automated robotic arm used in assembly lines, which appears to be more general-purpose than specially designed assemblers.  Despite being functionless now, the parts could be useful."
msgstr "一个用于装配线的自动机械臂，看起来似乎比专门设计的装配机械臂更为通用。尽管它现在已经没用了，但拆解它可以获得不少有用的零件。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "control station"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "Assorted electronic interfaces and screens.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "各种电子终端和屏幕。你可以拆解它获得零件。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "electronic machinery"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "Assorted electronic machinery.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "各种电子机械。你可以拆解它获得零件。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "heavy machinery"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "Assorted heavy machinery.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "各式重型机械。你可以拆解它获得零件。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "light machinery"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "Assorted light machinery.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "各式轻型机械。你可以拆解它获得零件。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "old machinery"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "Assorted old, rusty machinery.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "各式老旧生锈的机器。你可以拆解它获得零件。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "nuclear fuel cell"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "This fuel assembly consists of cylindrical rods put into bundles.  A uranium oxide ceramic is formed into pellets and inserted into Zircaloy tubes that are bundled together.  The Zircaloy tubes are pressurized with helium to minimize pellet-cladding interaction which can lead to fuel rod failure over long periods.  This fuel cell is used in nuclear power stations to produce heat to power turbines."
msgstr "这种燃料组件由成束的圆柱棒组成。氧化铀陶瓷被制成小球，并放入捆绑在一起的锆合金管中。锆合金管用氦气加压，以尽量减少颗粒与外层之间的相互作用，延缓燃料棒逐渐失效的速率。这种燃料电池被用于核电站，用来产生热量来推动涡轮机。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
msgid "This generator is broken and will not help you produce usable electricity."
msgstr "这台发电机已经坏了，不能帮你发电。"

