#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A 5-meter tall wooden flagpole.  You could hoist up a flag here."
msgstr "一根5米高的木质旗杆。你可以在这里升旗。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "flagpole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A 6-meter tall metal flagpole.  You could hoist up a flag here."
msgstr "一根6米高的金属旗杆。你可以在这里升旗。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "small boulder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A big rock.  Should be easy to roll around, but too heavy to carry with you.  It can be used as a primitive anvil, or broken into a bunch of smaller rocks."
msgstr "一块大石头。大概很容易滚动，但它太重了，无法被你带走。它可作为简易铁砧使用，也可以被砸碎成一堆更小的石头。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "large boulder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A boulder that's taller than a man.  Now how are you going to move this?"
msgstr "一块比你还高的巨石。什么，难道你还在想着搬动它？"

#. ~ Description of furniture "canvas flap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A canvas flap door that can be pulled aside."
msgstr "可以被拉开的帆布门帘。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "open canvas flap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A canvas flap door that has been pulled aside."
msgstr "被拉开的帆布门帘。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "pillow fort"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A comfy place to hide from the world.  Not very defensible, though."
msgstr "一处能让你暂时逃避残酷现实的舒适空间。但不是很坚固。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "open beaded curtain"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A curtain of wooden beads that has been pulled aside."
msgstr "被拉开的木珠子窗帘。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "beaded curtain"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A curtain of wooden beads, thick enough that you can't see through them.  They could be pulled aside effortlessly."
msgstr "一个由木珠子组成的窗帘，厚度足以阻挡你的视线。可以被毫不费力地拉开。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cardboard floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A flat floor made of sheets of cardboard duct-taped together, covering a plastic sheet on the ground."
msgstr "一块平坦的地板，由粘在塑料板上的纸板箱制成。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cardboard fort"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A fort built by tipping a cardboard box on its side, lining it with blankets, and partly weather-sealing it with a plastic sheet."
msgstr "纸盒子堆叠成的\"堡垒\"，以毛毯衬里，部分屋顶被塑料薄膜盖住。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "groundsheet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A government-issue plastic groundsheet to keep your feet dry, it was clearly made by the lowest bidder."
msgstr "一块由政府发行的塑料防潮布，可以让你保持干燥，但它显然是由出价最低的投标者制造的。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "canvas flap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A heavy canvas flap door that can be pulled aside."
msgstr "可以被拉开的厚重帆布门帘。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "open canvas flap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A heavy canvas flap door that has been pulled aside."
msgstr "被拉开的厚重帆布门帘。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "large animalskin flap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A large animal-skin flap that can be pulled aside."
msgstr "一扇可以被拉开的大型兽皮门帘。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "open animalskin flap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A large animal-skin flap that has been pulled aside."
msgstr "一扇已经被拉开的大型兽皮门帘。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "large skin groundsheet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A large animal-skin groundsheet to keep your feet dry inside the shelter."
msgstr "一个大型的动物皮地垫，可让您在避难所内保持双脚干燥。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "groundsheet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A large plastic groundsheet to keep your feet dry inside the tent."
msgstr "一块用于帐篷内的大型塑料防潮布，可以让你的脚保持干燥。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "large skin wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A large tent wall made out of stretched animal skin.  It'll keep the rain out, but anything trying to get in could rip through it fairly easily."
msgstr "用拉伸的动物皮制成的大帐篷墙。它可以挡住雨水，但任何试图进入的东西都很容易撕裂它。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "utility pole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A long wooden post which used to support overhead power lines and other public utilities, but it doesn't work anymore."
msgstr "一根用来支撑架空输电线和其他公共设施的长木桩，但是没有供电后它毫无用途。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bike rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A loop of metal in the shape of an upside down U used to securely park bikes."
msgstr "一个呈倒U型的金属环，用来安全的停放自行车。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "pile of rocky rubble"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A loose pile of rocks.  Useless?"
msgstr "一堆松散的石头。大概没什么用？"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cardboard wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A pile of cardboard boxes that have been filled with rags and junk and stacked together like bricks to form a wall."
msgstr "一堆里面塞满了破布和垃圾的纸板箱，像砖块一样堆放在一起形成了一堵墙。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cardboard door"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A pile of cardboard boxes that have been filled with rags and junk and stacked together like bricks to form a wall.  The largest box has been cut open and folded to form a makeshift door, which is closed."
msgstr "一堆里面塞满了破布和垃圾的纸板箱，像砖块一样堆在一起形成了一堵墙。最大的箱子被切开并折叠起来，形成了一扇简易门。它是关着的。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cardboard door"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A pile of cardboard boxes that have been filled with rags and junk and stacked together like bricks to form a wall.  The largest box has been cut open and folded to form a makeshift door, which is open."
msgstr "一堆里面塞满了破布和垃圾的纸板箱，像砖块一样堆在一起形成了一堵墙。最大的箱子被切开并折叠起来，形成了一扇简易门。它是开着的。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "radioactive slag"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A pile of melted slag from a destroyed nuclear reactor.  What are you doing looking at it?  Get the hell out of here, you nutcase!"
msgstr "一堆被摧毁的核反应堆的熔渣。你还盯着这个看什么？赶紧跑啊，你这个疯子！"

#. ~ Description of furniture "pile of trashy rubble"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A pile of trash topped with dirt and grass.  It smells gross, but one man's trash…"
msgstr "一堆垃圾和泥土青草混在一起，味道很让人恶心，不过常言道：\"一个人的垃圾是……\""

#. ~ Description of furniture "metal wreckage"
#. ~ Description of furniture "metal wreckage from a plane"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A pile of various bent and twisted metals.  Some of it looks pretty rusty, you wouldn't want to cut yourself on this."
msgstr "一堆弯折扭曲成各种样子的废金属。其中一些生锈的很严重了，你不会想在上面割伤自己的。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "pile of rubble"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A pile of various metals, bricks, and other building materials.  You could clear it with a shovel."
msgstr "一堆各式废金属、砖块和其他建筑材料。你可以用铲子把它清理干净。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "groundsheet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A plastic groundsheet to keep your feet dry inside the tent."
msgstr "一块用于帐篷内的塑料防潮布，可以让你的脚保持干燥。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "medium boulder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A pretty big boulder, but still small enough for a man to see and climb over.  It could be a struggle to move it.  It can be used as a primitive anvil, or broken into a bunch of smaller rocks."
msgstr "一块相当大的石头，但还没有大到阻挡视线，你依然可以爬过它。移动它是个艰巨的挑战。它可作为简易铁砧使用，也可以被砸碎成一堆更小的石头。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "street light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A raised light source which used to illuminate streets and their surrounding area, but it's useless without electricity."
msgstr "一个曾经被高高架起用来照亮街道四周的路灯，断电后它毫无用处。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short stack of adobe bricks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A short stack of adobe bricks, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一小堆土坯砖，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short stack of bricks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A short stack of bricks, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一小堆砖头，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short stack of logs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A short stack of logs, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一小堆原木，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short stack of long sticks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A short stack of long sticks, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一小堆长木棍，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short stack of pipes"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A short stack of pipes, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一小堆钢管，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short stack of planks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A short stack of planks, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一小堆木板，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short stack of rebar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A short stack of rebar, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一小堆钢筋，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short stack of sticks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A short stack of sticks, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一小堆木棍，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "traffic light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A signaling device positioned at road intersections and pedestrian crossings to control the flow of traffic, but it's useless without electricity."
msgstr "一个设置在道路交叉口和人行横道的用来指挥交通的信号装置，断电后它毫无用处。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "scrap metal bridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A simple bridge made of riveted sheet metal."
msgstr "一座由铆接金属板制成的简易桥梁。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cardboard roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A sloped roof made of cardboard boxes, stuffed with scrap cardboard and paper and layered atop each other.  Sheets of plastic are carefully arranged on top to shed water.  It looks like it could last a season or two at least before crumbling."
msgstr "一块倾斜的屋顶，由纸板箱制成，里面塞满了叠在一起的废纸板和纸屑。一块块塑料板被小心地排列在顶部来排水。看起来它在彻底倒塌前至少可以撑过一两个季节。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stack of adobe bricks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A stack of adobe bricks as high as your shoulders."
msgstr "一堆齐肩高的土坯砖。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stack of bricks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A stack of bricks as high as your shoulders."
msgstr "一堆齐肩高的砖头。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stack of logs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A stack of logs as high as your shoulders."
msgstr "一堆齐肩高的原木。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stack of long sticks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A stack of long sticks as high as your shoulders."
msgstr "一堆齐肩高的长木棍。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stack of pipes"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A stack of pipes as high as your shoulders."
msgstr "一堆齐肩高的钢管。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stack of planks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A stack of planks as high as your shoulders."
msgstr "一堆齐肩高的木板。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stack of rebar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A stack of rebar as high as your shoulders."
msgstr "一堆齐肩高的钢筋。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stack of sticks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A stack of sticks as high as your shoulders."
msgstr "一堆齐肩高的木棍。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "room divider"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A tall piece of furniture used to divide rooms into separate areas."
msgstr "一件高大的家具，用于将房间分成独立的区域。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "canvas wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A tent wall made of stretched, heavy-duty, waterproof cloth."
msgstr "由拉伸的重型防水布制成的帐篷壁。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "canvas wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A tent wall made of stretched, waterproof cloth."
msgstr "一种由拉伸的防水布制成的帐篷壁。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "animalskin wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A tent wall made out of stretched animal skin.  It'll keep the rain out, but anything trying to get in could rip through it fairly easily."
msgstr "用拉伸的兽皮做成的帐篷壁。它可以挡雨，但它挡不住任何想要撕开它并进来的生物。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tatami mat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A type of mat used as a flooring material in traditional Japanese-style rooms."
msgstr "传统日式房间中铺在地板上的一种垫子。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tall stack of adobe bricks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "Adobe bricks stacked well above your head."
msgstr "堆得比你头高的土坯砖。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "animalskin flap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An animal-skin flap that can be pulled aside."
msgstr "可以被拉开的兽皮门帘。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "open animalskin flap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An animal-skin flap that has been pulled aside."
msgstr "被拉开的兽皮门帘。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "animalskin floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An animal-skin groundsheet to keep your feet dry inside the shelter."
msgstr "一块用于遮蔽处内的兽皮防潮布，可以让你的脚保持干燥。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tall mound of broken glass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of broken glass heaped well above your head, unsafe to climb.  Just looking at it feel like you'll get tetanus."
msgstr "一堆玻璃碎片，堆得比你人还高，穿过它很危险。光是看着它就让你有种得了破伤风的感觉。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mound of broken glass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of broken glass shards heaped up to your shoulders, not safely traversable.  Just looking at it feel like you'll get tetanus."
msgstr "及肩高的一堆玻璃碎片，穿过它很危险。光是看着它就让你有种得了破伤风的感觉。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mound of clay"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of clay heaped up to your shoulders, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一片及肩高的黏土堆，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tall mound of clay"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of clay heaped well above your head, difficult to climb over."
msgstr "一堆黏土，堆得比你人还高，很难爬过去。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mound of dirt"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of dirt heaped up to your shoulders, not easily traversable.  If examined more closely, it's quite favorable for planting seeds and the like."
msgstr "一片最高到肩膀的泥土堆，土质松软，不易通过。这种地方非常适宜种植等活动。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mound of dirt with seed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of dirt heaped up to your shoulders, not easily traversable.  Someone has planted a seed here."
msgstr "一片最高到肩膀的泥土堆，土质松软，不易通过。有人在这里埋下了种子。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mound of dirt with harvestable plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of dirt heaped up to your shoulders, not easily traversable.  There is a fully grown plant, and will need closer examination to harvest."
msgstr "一片最高到肩膀的泥土堆，土质松软，不易通过。长有一株硕果累累的植物，等待着收获。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mound of dirt with mature plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of dirt heaped up to your shoulders, not easily traversable.  There is a matured plant here, that should be ready for harvest before long."
msgstr "一片最高到肩膀的泥土堆，土质松软，不易通过。有一株作物在这里茁壮成长，不久后应该就可以收获了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mound of dirt with seedling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of dirt heaped up to your shoulders, not easily traversable.  There is a seed here, that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr "一片最高到肩膀的泥土堆，土质松软，不易通过。种有一颗已经开始发芽了的种子。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tall mound of dirt"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of dirt heaped well above your head, difficult to climb over."
msgstr "一片高过你头顶的泥土堆，很难爬上去。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mound of gravel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of gravel heaped up to your shoulders, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一片及肩高的砾石堆，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tall mound of gravel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of gravel heaped well above your head, difficult to climb over."
msgstr "一堆砾石，堆得比你人还高，很难爬过去。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short mound of clay"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of heaped clay, not easily traversable."
msgstr "一片黏土堆，不易通过。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short mound of dirt"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of heaped dirt, not easily traversable.  If examined more closely, it's quite favorable for planting seeds and the like."
msgstr "一块开好垄的泥土地，不容易穿行。仔细检查，可以发现它很适合种植。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short mound of dirt with seed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of heaped dirt, not easily traversable.  Someone has planted a seed here."
msgstr "一片堆积的泥土，土质松软，不易穿越。有人在这里埋下了种子。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short mound of dirt with harvestable plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of heaped dirt, not easily traversable.  There is a fully grown plant, and will need closer examination to harvest."
msgstr "一片堆积的泥土，土质松软，不易穿越。长有一株硕果累累的植物，等待着收获。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short mound of dirt with mature plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of heaped dirt, not easily traversable.  There is a matured plant here, that should be ready for harvest before long."
msgstr "一片堆积的泥土，土质松软，不易穿越。有一株作物在这里茁壮成长，不久后应该就可以收获了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short mound of dirt with seedling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of heaped dirt, not easily traversable.  There is a seed here, that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr "一片堆积的泥土，土质松软，不易穿越。种有一颗已经开始发芽了的种子。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short mound of broken glass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "An area of heaped glass shards, not safely traversable.  Just looking at it feel like you'll get tetanus."
msgstr "一堆玻璃碎片，穿过它很危险。光是看着它就让你有种得了破伤风的感觉。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short mound of gravel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
