#. ~ Description of furniture "anaerobic digester"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A 1000 L anaerobic digester."
msgstr "一个 1000 升的厌氧消化器。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "filled anaerobic digester"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A 1000L anaerobic digester."
msgstr "一个 1000 升的厌氧消化器。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "reinforced vending machine (off)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A bit tougher to crack open than a regular vending machine.  Out of order, for lack of power.  That just makes it all the sweeter of a target, doesn't it?"
msgstr "比普通的自动售货机更难打开。这只会使它成为一个更甜蜜的目标，不是吗？"

#. ~ Description of furniture "reinforced vending machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A bit tougher to crack open than a regular vending machine.  That just makes it all the sweeter of a target, doesn't it?"
msgstr "比普通的自动售货机更难打开。这只会使它成为一个更甜蜜的目标，不是吗？"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stationary scutcher"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A bulky, simple-hinged wooden device to break up the hard parts of fiber plants, with nail combs on the back for separating them out."
msgstr "一台笨重的简易铰链木制装置，用于分解植物纤维中坚硬部分，背部有个钉梳，用来将纤维分开。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mitre saw"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A circular sawblade on an arm that can slide and rotate in several directions, this is a staple tool for nearly any carpentry.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "一台安装在机械臂上的圆锯，可以在多个方向上滑动旋转，是木匠的标配工具。可以拆卸下来接入电源使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "grappling hook"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A dangling piece of rope, hooked securely to something above you.  If you want to take it down, you'll have to climb up to where it's anchored."
msgstr "一根悬空的绳子，牢牢地绑在你身上。你可以爬上去，也可以把它弄下来。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bronze anvil"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A heavy block of oddly-shaped bronze with a pritchel hole and hardy hole.  It's used for metalworking."
msgstr "一块沉重的、形状奇特的青铜，上面有一个冲凿孔和一个插模孔。用于金属加工。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "anvil"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A heavy block of oddly-shaped metal with a pritchel hole and hardy hole.  It's used for metalworking."
msgstr "一块沉重的、形状奇特的金属，上面有一个冲凿孔和一个插模孔。用于金属加工。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "hanging meathook"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A hefty hook suspended from a chain for stringing up corpses."
msgstr "一个沉重的钩子悬挂在链子上，用于把尸体串起来。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A hefty tool that will take in a board and cut it smooth and flat to a specific width, particularly great if working with raw lumber stock, but also good just for shaving wood down to size.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "一台笨重机器，能把木板切割成特定厚度并抛光。特别适合用来处理原木，但也能用来把木块切削加工成合适的尺寸。可以拆卸下来接入电源使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "clay kiln"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A kiln designed to bake clay pottery and bricks."
msgstr "一个用来烧制各类陶制器具和砖块的炉子。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "screw press"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A large screw press for manually pressing oil out of fruit or seed paste.  The paste is placed in wetted bags and pressed down by the force of the screw mechanism."
msgstr "一种大型螺旋压榨机，用于手动从果实或种子糊中榨油。糊状物料被放入湿袋子中，并通过螺旋机构的力量向下挤压。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "spinning wheel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A large wooden device with a mechanical wheel used to combine fibers together into a stronger material."
msgstr "一个带有机械滚轮的大型木制装置，用于将纤维纺织在一起形成更坚固的材料。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "rope and tackle hoist"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A loop of rope hangs here, looped through a quality tackle to give a significant mechanical advantage while lifting heavy objects."
msgstr "一圈绳索穿过坚固的滑轮组悬挂住，在起重时提供显著的省力效果。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "rope hoist"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A loop of rope hangs here, using a sturdy horizontal support as a basic pulley.  While crude, it gives you some mechanical advantage for lifting things."
msgstr "一圈绳索绕在坚固的水平支撑上，作为基本的滑轮。虽然很粗糙，但也能方便地起重一些物品。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "disconnected catalytic cracking reactor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A makeshift extraction system, or as makeshift as you can consider something that was purpose-built in a laboratory by a group of experts.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "一套临时的催化裂解系统，或者说是那种实验室的研究人员建造的临时制取装置。可以拆走并接入你自己的电网使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Beverly shear"
#. ~ Description of "Beverly shear"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "A massive bench-mounted device with a short guillotine blade mounted to a long lever.  Designed for making straight or curved cuts through sheet metal up to 3 millimeters thick."
msgstr "一台巨大的安装在长凳上的机器，较短的旋转铡刀安装在一根长杠杆上。设计用来对最高厚度达3毫米的金属板进行直线或曲线切割。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "metal butchering rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A metal butchering rack designed to hang a carcass in the air.  It can be deconstructed and folded for easy transportation."
msgstr "一个金属屠宰架子，可以将清理内脏后的胴体悬挂在半空中。它能够被拆除并折叠起来便于携带。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "metal charcoal kiln"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled metal charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A metal kiln designed to burn wood and organic material into charcoal in the absence of oxygen.  Much more efficient than its archaic rock counterpart."
msgstr "一座金属炭窑，将木头材质和其他有机材料在缺氧环境下燃烧制成木炭。相比于古老的石头炭窑，它要高效得多。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active metal smoking rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A metal rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste."
msgstr "一个用来熏制食物的金属架子，熏制食物能够长期保存，而且风味更佳。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "metal smoking rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A metal rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  Works as a charcoal smoker in crafting recipes."
msgstr "一个用来熏制食物的金属架子，熏制食物能够长期保存，而且风味更佳。在制作物品时可当作木炭烤架的替代品使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "rock forge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A metalworking station made of rock, typically used in combination with an anvil.  Works as a charcoal forge in crafting recipes."
msgstr "一个石头搭建的一般和铁砧搭配使用的金属加工装置。在制作物品时可当作木炭锻炉的替代品使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "forge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A metalworking station typically used in combination with an anvil."
msgstr "一个一般和铁砧搭配使用的金属加工装置。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "drill press"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A powerful drill mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely down.  Useful in all kinds of projects from industrial fabrication to home woodworking.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "一台安装在滑轨上的强力钻机，可以用它精确钻孔。可用于从工业制造到家庭木工的各种工作。可以拆卸下来接入电源使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "charcoal kiln"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A primitive rock kiln designed to burn wood and organic material into charcoal in the absence of oxygen.  It isn't especially efficient compared to a modern metal variant."
msgstr "一座原始的石头炭窑，将木材和有机材料在缺氧环境下燃烧制成木炭。与现代的金属炭窑相比，它显得不是那么高效。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "band saw"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A ribbonlike sawblade runs in a single direction in this tool, allowing precise cuts at almost any angle.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "一台朝一个方向运行的带型链锯。它可以按任意角度进行精确切割。可以拆卸下来接入电源使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "table saw"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A rotating sawblade set into a large, flat table, for making straight measured cuts.  It's a key tool in any carpenter's arsenal.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "一台安装在大平台上的旋锯，能够笔直切割出精确的直线，各类木工设备中的关键利器之一。可以拆走并接入你自己的电网使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fermenting vat"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled fermenting vat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A sealable 50-liter vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."
msgstr "一个可以被密封的50升发酵罐，可用于食醋或者各种酒类的发酵。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wooden fermenting vat"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled wooden fermenting vat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A sealable 50-liter wooden vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."
msgstr "一个可以被密封的50升木制发酵桶，可用于食醋或者各种酒类的发酵。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "aluminum stepladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A short, foldable aluminum ladder.  Can help you climb to a rooftop, or maybe slow something down."
msgstr "一种短且可折叠的铝制梯子。可以帮助你爬到屋顶，或者作为障碍物减慢他人的速度。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wooden stepladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A short, foldable wooden ladder.  Can help you climb to a rooftop, or maybe slow something down."
msgstr "一种短且可折叠的木质梯子。可以帮助你爬到屋顶，或者作为障碍物减慢他人的速度。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "small anvil"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A small handcrafted anvil."
msgstr "一块手持小镜子，也可以作为反光镜安装在载具上。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "water mill"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A small water-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour."
msgstr "小型水动力磨，可以把含淀粉的物品加工成面粉。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active water mill"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A small water-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  Its brake has been removed and it is turning."
msgstr "小型水动力磨，可将含淀粉的物品加工成面粉。它的制动装置已经移除，正在转动。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wind mill"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A small wind-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour."
msgstr "小型风动力磨，可以把含淀粉的物品加工成面粉。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active wind mill"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A small wind-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  Its brake has been removed and it is turning."
msgstr "小型风动力磨，可将含淀粉的物品加工成面粉。它的制动装置已经移除，正在转动。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "computer console"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A standalone computer terminal, the screen glowing with dim artificial light.  If examined closely, you can read what's on the screen and perform any allowed functions.  It might even be possible to hack it, given the skills."
msgstr "一台独立的计算机终端，屏幕上闪烁着昏暗的人工光源。如果靠近检查，你可以阅读屏幕上的信息并进行允许的操作。如果你有足够的技能，甚至可能可以破解它。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken console"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A standalone computer terminal.  It doesn't seem to be working.  It's the broken screen and shattered circuit boards telling you that."
msgstr "一台独立的计算机终端。破碎的屏幕和电路板告诉你它似乎已经无法工作了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "chain hoist"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A sturdy chain and heavy tackle hang well-supported from the ceiling here, ready to lift most heavy items you could think of using mechanical advantage."
msgstr "一条结实的钢链和固定在稳固的天花板上，可以用来举起你能想到的大多数重物。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "jointer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A table-shaped tool with a rotating blade that will cut down, smooth out, and square off a board to make it very smooth and nice indeed.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "一张安装有旋转刀刃工具的桌子，能把木板切割成形、抛光，使之变得非常光滑、美观。可以拆卸下来接入电源使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "vine leading up"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A thick vine is rigidly anchored to something above you.  It looks quite alive.  If you want to take it down, you'll have to climb up to where it's anchored."
msgstr "一根厚厚的藤条牢牢地固定在你上方的某个东西上。它看起来很有活力。你可以爬上去，也可以把它拆下来。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "web leading up"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A thick, dangling strand of slightly sticky web, the other end is tied securely to something above you.  You could use it to climb up."
msgstr "一缕粗壮的、悬垂的略带粘性的网，另一端牢牢地绑在你上方的东西上。 你可以用它来爬上去。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "butchering rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A wooden butchering rack designed to hang a carcass in the air."
msgstr "一个木制屠宰架，可以将清理内脏后的胴体悬挂在空中。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active smoking rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A wooden rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  It is lit and smoking."
msgstr "一个用来熏制食物的木头架子，熏制食物能够长期保存，而且风味更佳。它已经被点燃，正在熏制食物。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "smoking rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A wooden rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  Works as a charcoal smoker in crafting recipes."
msgstr "一个用来熏制食物的木头架子，熏制食物能够长期保存，而且风味更佳。在制作物品时可当作木炭烤架的替代品使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "arc furnace"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled arc furnace"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An arc furnace designed to burn a powdery mix of coke and limestone to create calcium carbide."
msgstr "一个用于煅烧粉末状焦炭石灰混合物来制取电石的电弧炉。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "automated gas console"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An automated gas flow control console."
msgstr "自助加油机控制台。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken automated gas console"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An automated gas flow control console.  It's broken.  This is not a good thing."
msgstr "自助加油机控制台。坏了，这不是一件好事。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "heavy anvil"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An enormously heavy block of oddly-shaped metal with all the accoutrements a blacksmith could ask for.  It's used for heavy-duty metalworking."
msgstr "一块极其沉重、形状奇特的金属，包含铁匠所需的所有装置。用于重型金属加工。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "still"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An essential component for brewing and chemistry that allows for refining liquid mixtures."
msgstr "一个酿造业和化工业所必不可少的能够精炼液体混合物的重要设备。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "power lathe"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An industrial-grade lathe, for turning chunks of metal and other hard things into round chunks of metal and other hard things.  It's really heavy but you could take this down and use it for your own purposes if you wanted."
msgstr "工业级车床，用于将金属块和其他硬质物体加工成圆形金属块和其他硬质物体。  它确实很重，但如果您愿意，您可以将其取下并用于您自己的目的。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken vending machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An upright metal cabinet with a see-through door.  It's smashed open, so you can take whatever you want for free."
msgstr "带有透明门的直立金属柜。 它被砸开了，所以你可以免费拿走任何你想要的东西。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "vending machine (off)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An upright metal cabinet with a see-through door.  Out of order, for lack of power."
msgstr "带有透明门的直立金属柜。 它被砸开了，所以你可以免费拿走任何你想要的东西。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "vending machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An upright metal cabinet with a see-through door.  The goods inside can be yours if you have money on a cash card."
msgstr "带有透明门的直立金属柜。 如果你的现金卡上有钱，里面的货物可以是你的。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json data/json/items/fake.json data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "Beverly shear"
msgid_plural "Beverly shears"
msgstr[0] "旋剪机"

#. ~ Description of furniture "hydraulic press"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "If you really want to squash something a lot, this would be exactly the right industrial tool for you.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "如果你真的很想挤压一些东西，这对你来说就是一个很好的工业工具。可以拆卸下来接入电源使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "air compressor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "This durable tank is topped with a motor that will cram as much air into the tank as possible.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "这个坚固的气罐顶部安装着一台压缩机，能将尽可能多的空气抽进罐中。可以拆卸下来接入电源使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "manual tire changer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "This floor-mounted machine contains all the levers, clamps and mounts required to remove or fit a tire, plus an integrated foot pump to inflate it."
msgstr "一台落地式机器，包含拆卸或安装轮胎所需的各类杠杆、夹具和安装件，以及一个内置脚压式充气泵。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "router table"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "This table has an inset router, a rotating motor with an exchangeable blade head for cutting specific profiles and grooves and stuff.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr "这张桌子上安装着一台嵌入式刳刨机、一台旋转电机和一个可更换的刀头，能够切割出特殊轮廓、凹槽和其他形状。可以拆卸下来接入电源使用。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "firefly terrarium"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "While many survivors would have focused on trying to bring back electric lights, whoever lives here has apparently decided to make use of the changes wrought by the Cataclysm to provide light.  This vivarium contains soil, strange plants you don't recognize immediately, and most strikingly, a giant mutant firefly."
msgstr "虽然许多幸存者专注于尝试恢复电力照明，但住在这里的，不管是谁，显然都决定利用大灾变带来的变化提供光源。这个生态箱里包含了土壤、难以辨认的陌生植物，还有最引人注目的，一只巨大的变异萤火虫。"

