#. ~ Description of furniture "composting midden"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-triffid.json
msgid "A hole has been dug into the roots here, and a pretty unpleasant smell emits from it."
msgstr "这里的根茎中被挖出了一个深坑，一股难闻的气味从里面散发出来。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "illuminating plant bulb"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-triffid.json
msgid "A small plant grows among the roots here, its green, onion-like bulb illuminating the area around it."
msgstr "这里的根茎中长出了一株小植物，它顶端绿色葱状的鳞茎照亮了周围的地区。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "brambles"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-triffid.json
msgid "A wall of tangled roots blocks the path here, you'd have destroy it to get past."
msgstr "一堵纠缠在一起的根茎组成的墙挡住了这条路，你必须摧毁它才能通过。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-triffid.json
msgid "brambles"
msgstr "荆棘"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-triffid.json
msgid "composting midden"
msgstr "堆肥坑"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-triffid.json
msgid "illuminating plant bulb"
msgstr "发光的植物根茎"

