msgstr[0] "打砸次数"

#. ~ Description of furniture "portable generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
msgid "A small, portable generator, one that people buy for a camp."
msgstr "一台小巧便携的发电机，是人们为露营而购买的那种。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active backup generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
msgid "A ubiquitous piece of compact machinery meant for running anything from the bathroom lights to electric stoves and other necessities when grid electricity is unavailable.  This one is currently running.  You can hear it humming slightly when you are very close."
msgstr "一种无处不在的紧凑型机械，用来在电网不通时，运行从浴室灯到电炉到其他任何必需的东西。它目前正在运作。当你离得很近时，可以听到它轻微的嗡嗡声。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "military diesel generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
msgid "Big and powerful generator, painted in camo."
msgstr "一台巨大且强大的发电机，外表涂有迷彩漆。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "diesel generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
msgid "Big and powerful generator, used for street works."
msgstr "一台大型且功率强大的发电机，用于道路施工。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "powerful gasoline generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
msgid "Big and powerful, yet portable generator."
msgstr "体积庞大且功能强大，但又便于携带的发电机。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
msgid "active backup generator"
msgstr "备用发电机（开）"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
msgid "portable generator"
msgstr "传送门发生器"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
msgid "powerful gasoline generator"
msgstr "传送门发生器"

#. ~ Description of furniture "M224 mortar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_military.json
msgid "A 60mm mortar tube deployed and ready for use, provided you're skilled enough with launchers to understand the firing tables."
msgstr "一个 60 毫米迫击炮管已部署到位，随时可以使用，但前提是你得足够熟练掌握发射装置的操作，并且能理解相关的射击表。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_military.json data/json/items/gun/60mm.json
msgid "M224 mortar"
msgid_plural "M224 mortar"
msgstr[0] "灰泥"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_60MM_SHOT" in furniture "M224 mortar"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_military.json
msgid "There is some 60mm propellant left over."
msgstr "还剩了一些没倒完！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_60MM_SHOT" in furniture "M224
#. mortar"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_military.json
msgid "You fire the M224 mortar."
msgstr "你点燃了炭窑。"

#. ~ Message when furniture "M224 mortar"'s examine action fails its condition
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_military.json
msgid "You have absolutely no idea how to use this mortar."
msgstr "你根本不知道怎么让这辆载具动起来。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "nether lichen"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "A bed of orange, flowering lichen, covering the surface of the yellow ichor.  Every now and then, a flower disappears into the liquid, but seems to reappear the moment you look away."
msgstr "一片橘黄色的盛开苔藓，表面覆盖黄色的汁液。有时花朵消失化为了汁液，但恍惚之间又重新出现。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "nether grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "A bed of waist high segmented blue plants that remind you of grass.  As you wade past, they react to your movement and always swivel to face you."
msgstr "一片及腰的蓝色植物，像草。你穿过，它们也一直转动着面向你。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tall nether grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "A clump of tall, segmented blue plants that remind you of grass.  As you approach, they bend towards you, hugging your body and making movement difficult."
msgstr "一簇较高的分段蓝色植物，像草。靠近后它们弯曲向你拥抱，使你的行动更加困难。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "decaying tube"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "A decomposing fleshy stalagmite extends from the ceiling to the floor."
msgstr "腐烂的肉质石笋从天花板延伸到地板。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing decaying tube"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "A decomposing fleshy stalagmite extends from the ceiling to the floor.  Countless glowing spores weft from within, coating everything nearby."
msgstr "腐烂的肉质石笋从天花板延伸到地板。 无数发光的孢子从内部纬向，覆盖了附近的一切。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "nether patchwork"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "A peculiar plant that is hard to distinguish, resembling a tangled mess of different terrestrial flowers and weeds firmly wedged into the monstrous flesh.  It pulses rhythmically as it rearranges its form into even weirder shapes."
msgstr "难以辨认的奇特植物，类似一团由各种陆地花草嵌入怪物血肉组成的物质。它在有节律的跳动，变成越来越诡异的形状。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "beautiful nether lily"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "A very tall, mesmerizing blood red flower.  Its beautiful, pristine form is rooted firmly on the innards of the beast.  The flesh around it is decayed, being consumed to feed its ornate, magnanimous body.  You feel an urge to sit and admire this priceless miracle of life."
msgstr "一枝修长、呈迷人血红色的花。它深深扎根于这头猛兽，吸收周围的血肉，供给给它华丽而优雅的身体。你感到一种冲动，想要坐下来好好端详这无价的生命奇迹。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC "admire_lily_effect" in
#. furniture "beautiful nether lily"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "You admire the lily.  Isn't it beautiful?"
msgstr "你十分欣赏异界百合。是不是很漂亮？"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC "admire_lily_effect" in
#. furniture "beautiful nether lily"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "You bow to the lily, and gain immense satisfaction in having done so."
msgstr "你拜倒在异界百合身下，并中获得极大的满足。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC "admire_lily_effect" in
#. furniture "beautiful nether lily"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "You focus on the lily and realize it truly is perfection *incarnate*."
msgstr "你全神贯注在异界百合上，并意识到它确实是完美的*化身*。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC "admire_lily_effect" in
#. furniture "beautiful nether lily"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "You worship the lily, and feel truly fulfilled."
msgstr "你十分崇拜异界百合，并感到真正的满足。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "beautiful nether lily"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "a chilling scream!"
msgstr "一声毛骨悚然的尖叫！"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "beautiful nether lily"
msgstr "美丽的异界百合"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "decaying tube"
msgstr "腐烂管道"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "glowing decaying tube"
msgstr "发光腐烂管道"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "nether grass"
msgstr "异界草"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "nether lichen"
msgstr "异界苔藓"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "nether patchwork"
msgstr "异界缝合体"

