#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "tall nether grass"
msgstr "茂密异界草丛"

#. ~ Description of furniture "display fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A big glass chamber, designed to display different food in multiple rows, while cooling it at the same time.   Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一个巨大的玻璃容器，设计用于将不同种类的食物以多排的形式展示出来，同时还能对其进行冷却处理。如果你想要将其与电网连接起来，可以对其进行拆解。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "chest freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A chest freezer.  Big and power efficient, this is the dream for every cataclysm survivor.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一个大型冷冻柜。体积庞大且能耗低，这是每一个灾难幸存者梦寐以求的物件。如果你想要将其接入电网，可以对其进行拆解。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "display chest freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A commercial chest freezer, used to show off ice creams, frozen veggies, pizza, or anything else a consumer may want frozen and preserved.  Conveniently tall enough for any curious child to gaze in at the sweets.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一款商用冷藏柜，用于展示冰淇淋、冷冻蔬菜、披萨等各类需要冷冻保存的商品。其高度适中，足以让任何好奇的孩子凑近观看里面的甜品。如果您想将其接入电网，可以对其进行拆解。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "glass door freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A commercial upright freezer, used to show ice creams, frozen veggies, pizza, or anything else a consumer may want frozen and preserved.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一台商用立式冷冻柜，用于展示冰淇淋、冷冻蔬菜、披萨等任何消费者可能想要冷冻保存的物品。如果您想将其接入电网，可以对其进行拆解。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "heavy-duty fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A heavy, bulky refrigerator, used in professional kitchens.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一台体积庞大、重量较重的商用冰箱。如果您想将其接入电网，可以对其进行拆解。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "heavy-duty freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A heavy-duty upright freezer, one that is used in a professional kitchen.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一台重型立式冰柜，专为专业厨房设计的。如果您想将其接入电网，可以将其拆解。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "single glass door fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A modern refrigerator with a thick sheet of glass for a door, used in stores to show off the goods while keeping them cool.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一种现代冰箱，门上有一层经过特殊处理的绝缘厚玻璃。如果通电，它会冷却里面的东西，以延长它们的保质期。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "double glass door fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A modern refrigerator with two glass doors, to fit twice as much goods for consumers.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一款现代化的带双层玻璃门的冰箱，能为消费者储存两倍多的物品。如果您想将其接入电网，可以对其进行拆解。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "chest minifreezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A small chest freezer, used to store a small amount of perishables for a long time, if you're willing to dig them out each time that is.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一个小型的冷藏柜，用于长期储存少量易腐物品，不过每次使用前都需要先取出里面的物品。如果你愿意的话，可以将其拆解以便接入电网。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "minifridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A small fridge, often used in places where full-size fridge would be too big or too much a hassle to transport, or when you only need a small amount of items chilled.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一款小型冰箱，通常用于那些使用大型冰箱会显得过于庞大或运输起来过于不便的场合，或者是在您只需要少量物品冷藏的情况下使用。如果您想将其接入电网，可以对其进行拆解。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "minifreezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A small upright freezer, used to store a small amount of perishables long term.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一台小型的立式冰箱，用于长期储存少量易腐物品。如果您想将其接入电网，可以对其进行拆解。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "refrigerator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "A standard household refrigerator.  If powered, it will cool its contents to extend the time before they spoil.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr "一个标准家用冰箱， 通电后，它会冷却里面的食物以延长它们腐坏的时间"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "chest minifreezer"
msgid_plural "chest minifreezers"
msgstr[0] "迷你冰柜"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "display chest freezer"
msgstr "样本冷藏库"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "refrigerator"
msgstr "冰箱"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass dresser"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass cabinet with its doors slightly ajar.  Inside is a row of hangers bearing neatly folded and entirely rigid clothing."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃橱柜，柜门半开。里面是一排衣架，上面挂着排列整齐、坚硬无比的衣服。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass cupboard"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass cupboard.  The doors are fused shut, but it presumably contains glasses."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃橱柜，柜门紧紧合上，隐约可察觉到内部有些餐具。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of a child.  It is difficult to make out their facial features, but it seems as if they are smiling."
msgstr "一个孩童的黑色玻璃人像，很难分辨出面部表情，不过大致看上去在微笑。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of a person covering their face with their hands."
msgstr "一个人用手遮住脸的黑色玻璃人像。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of a someone frozen halfway through falling backwards, and suspended on a single leg."
msgstr "一个黑色的玻璃人像，像是一个人在向后摔倒的中途被冻住了一般，它的一条腿悬在空中。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of someone clutching at their neck.  A delicate spray of connected glass droplets emerges between their fingers."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃雕像，被谁掐住了脖子，手指间有易碎的呈滴落状相连的玻璃。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of someone doubled over in laughter."
msgstr "一个笑弯了腰的黑色玻璃雕像。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of someone in a fighting stance, their face twisted with howls of rage and anger.  They're gripping some sort of weapon that isn't there."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃雕像，处于立姿准备战斗。他们的脸因愤怒而扭曲，并紧紧握住手中的武器，虽然那里什么都没有。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of someone in a firing posture.  Their jagged fingers are frozen squeezing a trigger that isn't there."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃雕像，摆出射击的姿势。它粗糙锐利的手指僵在扣扳机的位置，而那里其实并没有扳机。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of someone kneeling in prayer."
msgstr "一个跪地祈祷者的黑色玻璃塑像。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of someone leaning into the space to their right, their fingers bent as if interlaced with someone else's."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃雕像，身子依靠向右边，手指弯曲好像在与其他什么人交错。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure.  Their features are too jagged to make out clearly, but they remind you of someone you knew."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃雕像。外轮廓太过参差不齐难以清晰辨认，但总让你想起你认识的人。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass refrigerator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass refrigerator, its door hanging open.  Inside is a seamless surface with protrusions resembling fresh fruit and plastic bottles."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃冰箱，柜门大开。内部完整无缝，突兀地出现几件物品，像是新鲜水果或是塑料瓶等物件。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass sculpture of a bed.  The rumpled covers are jagged, and splinter at the touch."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃雕刻出的床。表面凹凸不平，一碰就碎。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass box"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A box of thin black glass.  Its edges are glisteningly sharp."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃盒子，边缘锋利，闪烁着光芒。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "ring of black stones"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A circle of smooth glass pebbles.  Inside are frozen tendrils of fire, slightly translucent.  It seems colder as you approach."
msgstr "光滑的玻璃鹅卵石围成一圈。里面是冰冻的火卷须，微微半透明。靠近它似乎会更冷。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass water heater"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A cylinder of thick black glass.  The top has burst apart, and rivulets of black sand run down the side."
msgstr "从这场阵雨的头上流下十几股薄薄的黑色玻璃，上面像珍珠一样串着冰冻的水滴。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass flower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A delicate little thing; a wispy stem slightly bowed under the weight of translucent petals.  The tiny barbs that line it are almost impossible to see, until it crumbles in your fingers."
msgstr "一件精致的小物件；纤细的茎在半透明花瓣的重压下微微弯曲。它上面的小倒刺几乎看不见，直到捏碎在你的手指里。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass fireplace"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A fireplace of pitted glass bricks.  The fire inside has been frozen in glass at the moment it began to leap beyond the grate."
msgstr "带坑的玻璃砖砌成的壁炉。里面的火从开始跳出格栅的那一刻起就被玻璃冻住了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass sink"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A glass basin and tap.  The inside stops halfway down in sheet of concentric ripples, with the tiny spire of a splashing droplet at the center "
msgstr "一个玻璃制成的洗手池和水龙头。内部在中间停在一片同心的波纹中，中心是飞溅的液滴的小尖顶"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass desk"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A glass desk.  There are a handful of shapes atop it that suggest pens, paper, and miscellaneous knickknacks that are too jagged to identify."
msgstr "一个玻璃桌，上面有一些形状，似乎有笔、纸和各种锯齿状的小摆设，无法辨认。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass dishwasher"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A glass dishwasher, its door hanging open.  Inside, glass plates and utensils are half buried in black sand."
msgstr "一台玻璃洗碗机，门开着。里面的玻璃板和餐具半埋在黑色的沙子里。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass birdbath"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A glass pedestal and bowl.  Inside, frozen in the midst of washing itself in the black sand, is the delicate figure of a bird."
msgstr "一个玻璃底座和碗。里面是一只精致的鸟，在黑色的沙子中被冻住了。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass oven"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A glass sculpture of a gas oven.  Bristling from the burner is a crown of jagged shards in the rough shape of an uncontrolled fire."
msgstr "一个燃气烤炉的玻璃雕塑，喷出冠部锯齿碎片，外表粗糙，就像失去控制的火焰。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass mailbox"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A glass sculpture of a mailbox.  The door is open; inside is a pile of envelopes, all razor-edged."
msgstr "信箱的玻璃雕塑。门是开着的；里面是一堆边缘锋利的信封。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass display rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A glass sculpture of a shelving unit.  The angled shelves are covered in jagged miscellany, most of which is firmly fused in place."
msgstr "一个展架单元的玻璃雕塑。倾斜的架子上布满了锯齿状的杂物，其中大部分都牢固地融合在一起。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass washer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A glass washing machine.  The inside is completely filled with black sand, some of which has spilled onto the floor."
msgstr "一个玻璃洗衣机，内部全是黑色沙子，还洒出了一些到地板上。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bookcase"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A heavy bookshelf, laden with books fused into the shelves and each other.  You can make out titles on the spines, but the alphabet they're written in is unfamiliar."
msgstr "一个沉重的书架，上面放满了书，已经融合在书架上了。你可以在书脊上辨认出标题，但它们用着的字符。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass sofa"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A long bench, padded with cold glass cushions."
msgstr "一条长长的沙发凳，有玻璃制成的冰冷坐垫。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bench"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A long, low slab of black glass.  You can't tell if the fissures here and there on the surface are natural cracks, or carved names."
msgstr "一块又长又低的黑色玻璃台。你无法判断表面上的裂缝是天然裂隙还是雕刻的名字。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass dryer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A mechanical dryer of black glass.  The door hangs open, and inside, you can see a jumble of what might once have been clothes, now smashed to pieces."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃烘干机器，门开着，在里面，你可以看到一堆曾经可能是衣服的东西，现在已经碎成了小块。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass garden"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A planter of dark glass.  Sharp, twisting glass sprouts emerge from the black soil within."
msgstr "深色玻璃的花盆。锋利、扭曲的玻璃芽从里面的黑色土壤中冒出来。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass chair"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A simple glass chair.  The seat is very thin, and crunches ominously under any weight."
msgstr "简单的玻璃椅子，坐位很薄，在任何重量下都吱嘎作响。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass table"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A slab of smooth black glass on four stout legs.  In a few places, there is shallowly rounded mass, like liquid spilled on the surface."
msgstr "一块光滑的黑色玻璃，有四条粗壮的桌腿。在一些地方，有浅的圆形物质，就像液体洒在表面上一样。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "incomplete plush doll"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A soft plush torso, empty of features, is lying on this sofa."
msgstr "一具躺在沙发上的柔软的毛绒躯干，看不出任何特征。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass locker"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A tall glass cabinet.  Whatever was inside will stay that way; the door is seamless with the frame."
msgstr "一个高大的玻璃柜，里面的东西都应该会保持原样，门的外部没有一点缝隙。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass lantern"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A tall glass pole with a translucent shade atop it.  You know it could not possibly turn on, but in the corner of your eye, you think you might see a soft glow."
msgstr "一根高高的玻璃杆，上面有一个半透明的阴影。你知道它不可能点亮，但余光扫过，你似乎看到了柔和的光芒。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass counter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A thick cube of black glass.  On the surface, fused in place, are statues of utensils and miscellany."
msgstr "一块厚厚的黑玻璃立方体。摆有融合在一起的玻璃制的器皿和杂物。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass toilet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A toilet made of black glass.  The lid, perhaps mercifully, is fused shut."
msgstr "黑色玻璃制成的马桶。桶盖或许是出于仁慈，有被好好地合上。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bathtub"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A tub made from black glass, with a frozen column of onyx pouring from the tap."
msgstr "一个黑色玻璃制成的浴缸，水龙头下流出的是凝固的玛瑙柱。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass armchair"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "An armchair that was presumably once very plush and comfortable.  Now the overstuffed cushions are hard, cold, and slippery."
msgstr "一个扶手椅，可以想象是很柔软舒适的，但现在这些软垫材料却质感光滑，又硬又冷。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass shower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "From the head of this shower descend a dozen streams of thin black glass, with frozen droplets strung from them like pearls."
msgstr "花洒头中流下十几股薄薄的黑色玻璃，上面像珍珠一样串着凝固的玻璃液滴。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "Most of a black glass human figure.  The face and much of the head is missing, as if scooped out, and the inner surface is perfectly smooth."
msgstr "只是一个黑色玻璃雕像，脸与头的部分已经缺失了，就像被平整地舀掉了一块，内表面十分光滑。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bookcase"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "This bookcase is missing a book."
msgstr "这个书架上缺失了一本书。"

