#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged heavy-duty military Blackhawk rotors"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "A set of four military-grade helicopter rotor blades, used to provide lift by rotation.  It has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr "一组四个军用级直升机旋翼桨叶，用于通过旋转提供升力。  在水下呆了一段时间后，它开始降解。  绝对无法挽回。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged aisle"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "A waterlogged aisle.  It has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr "一条被水淹没的过道。  在水下呆了一段时间后，它开始降解。  绝对无法挽回。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged quarterpanel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "A waterlogged half-height metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle but allows people to see over it.  It has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr "一堵浸满水的半高金属墙。  将僵尸挡在车外，但允许人们看到它。  在水下呆了一段时间后，它开始降解。  绝对无法挽回。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "A waterlogged metal framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size.  It has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr "浸水的金属框架。  其他车辆部件可以安装在其上，并且可以连接到其他框架以增加车辆的尺寸。  在水下呆了一段时间后，它开始降解。  绝对无法挽回。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "A waterlogged metal roof.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr "浸水的金属屋顶。  绝对无法挽回。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged board"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "A waterlogged metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle and prevents people from seeing through it.  It has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr "浸满水的金属墙。  将僵尸挡在车外并防止人们看穿它。  在水下呆了一段时间后，它开始降解。  绝对无法挽回。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged windshield"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "A waterlogged sheet of glass that lets you see outside the vehicle.  It has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr "一块浸水的玻璃，可以让你看到车外。  在水下呆了一段时间后，它开始降解。  绝对无法挽回。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "waterlogged bucket seat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "A waterlogged soft upholstered car seat, contoured to hold one person.  It has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr "一种浸满水的软垫汽车座椅，其轮廓可容纳一个人。  在水下呆了一段时间后，它开始降解。  绝对无法挽回。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged aisle"
msgstr "积水的过道"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged board"
msgstr "浸水板"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged bucket seat"
msgstr "浸水的桶形座椅"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged frame"
msgstr "浸水的框架"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged heavy-duty military Blackhawk rotors"
msgstr "浸水严重的重型军用黑鹰直升机旋翼"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
