msgid "You finish cutting the metal."
msgstr "你完成了金属切割工作。"

#. ~ Prying message of terrain "closed wood door"
#. ~ Prying message of terrain "closed wood door with peephole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-doors.json
msgid "You notice the door is unlocked, so you simply open it."
msgstr "你发现这扇门并没有上锁，于是你直接打开了。"

#. ~ Prying message of terrain "closed wood door with an electronic lock"
#. ~ Prying message of terrain "closed wood door"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-doors.json
msgid "You pry open the door."
msgstr "你撬开了门。"

#. ~ Prying message of terrain ""
#. ~ Prying message of terrain "closed metal door"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-doors.json
msgid "You pry open the metal door."
msgstr "你撬开了金属门。"

#. ~ Prying message of terrain "boarded up door"
#. ~ Prying message of terrain "boarded up damaged door"
#. ~ Prying message of terrain "boarded up door with peephole"
#. ~ Prying message of terrain "boarded up reinforced door"
#. ~ Prying message of terrain "boarded up damaged reinforced door"
#. ~ Prying message of terrain "boarded up damaged door with peephole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-doors.json
msgid "You pry the boards from the door."
msgstr "你撬开了门上的加固板。"

#. ~ Prying failure of terrain "closed wood door with an electronic lock"
#. ~ Prying failure of terrain "closed wood door"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-doors.json
msgid "You pry, but can't pry open the door."
msgstr "你试图撬开门，但是没能成功。"

