#. ~ Description of terrain "simple concrete wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "A durable and uniform concrete wall.  This one has an embrasure, so you can shoot or use reach weapons through it while staying safe."
msgstr "一堵坚固而均匀的混凝土墙。这堵墙上有个射击孔，可以让你对外面的敌人射击和使用长距武器，同时能保护你。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced concrete wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "A section of wall with a nice small hole, letting you shoot your machine gun from the safety of your reinforced bunker."
msgstr "一段带有射击孔的墙，可以让你在加固掩体内安全地用机枪射击敌人。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "palisade wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "An age-old type of fortification consisting of hefty lumber staked into the ground and cabled together.  This section in particular has an embrasure, so you can shoot or use reach weapons through it while staying safe."
msgstr "一种历史悠久的防御工程，由沉重的木材深深插入地下并紧密连接在一起。这段墙上有个射击孔，可以让你对外面的敌人射击和使用长距武器，同时能保护你。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "stone wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "The small opening on this stone wall allows you to shoot and use reach weapons against enemies on the other side, while also providing cover for you."
msgstr "这堵石墙有一个射击孔，可以让你对外面的敌人射击和使用长距武器，同时能保护你。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "adobe wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "This adobe brick wall has an embrasure that lets you shoot and use reach weapons against enemies on the outside, while also protecting you."
msgstr "这堵土坯墙有一个射击孔，可以让你对外面的敌人射击和使用长距武器，同时能保护你。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "brick wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "This brick wall has an embrasure that lets you shoot and use reach weapons against enemies on the outside, while also protecting you."
msgstr "这堵砖墙有一个射击孔，可以让你对外面的敌人射击和使用长距武器，同时能保护你。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "log wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "This timber wall has a hole that lets you shoot through and use reach weapons against enemies on the other side, while also protecting you."
msgstr "这堵原木墙有一个射击孔，可以让你对外面的敌人射击和使用长距武器，同时能保护你。高度易燃。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "log wall with a wide opening"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "This timber wall previously had an embrasure, but now the hole is so big that you can climb through it."
msgstr "这堵原木墙之前有一个射击孔，但这个洞已经被砸得大到可以爬过去，让它变得毫无意义。高度易燃。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "This wooden wall has a hole that lets you shoot and use reach weapons against enemies on the other side."
msgstr "这堵木板墙有一个射击孔，可以让你对外面的敌人射击和使用长距武器。高度易燃。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden wall with a wide opening"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "This wooden wall previously had an embrasure, but the hole has been smashed wide enough that you can climb through it."
msgstr "这堵木墙之前有一个射击孔，但这个洞已经被砸得大到可以爬过去，让它变得毫无意义。高度易燃。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid "adobe wall with embrasure"
msgstr "土坯墙（射击孔）"

