#. ~ Description of terrain "rope fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A barrier made of rope, it's nothing complicated.  Mildly suggests where not to go."
msgstr "一扇绳索编织而成的网状围栏，并不复杂。和善地提醒你此路不通。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barbed wire fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A barrier made of sharp barbed wire.  The more persuasive brother of the wire fence."
msgstr "一扇由锋利的带刺铁丝制成的网状围栏。比它的铁丝网兄弟的说服力要高那么一点。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wire fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A barrier made of wire, it's nothing complicated.  Mildly suggests where not to go."
msgstr "一扇由铁丝制成的网状围栏，并不复杂。和善地提醒你此路不通。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "picket fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A barrier made of wood, it's nothing complicated.  Mildly suggests where not to go."
msgstr "一扇木制的栅栏，并不复杂。和善地提醒你此路不通。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed metal gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A closed metal gate."
msgstr "一扇关闭的金属门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed wooden gate"
#. ~ Description of terrain "closed wooden split rail gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A commercial quality gate made of wood with a latch system."
msgstr "一扇商用等级的大门，用木头制成，上面有着一道门闩。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed wooden privacy gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A commercial quality gate made of wood with a latch system.  It is tall enough to prevent people from seeing into your yard."
msgstr "一扇商业级的木制门，带有门闩。它很高，可以防止人们看到你的院子。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open wooden gate"
#. ~ Description of terrain "open wooden split rail gate"
#. ~ Description of terrain "open wooden privacy gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A commercial quality gate made of wood with a latch system.  The gate is wide open, allowing anything to travel through."
msgstr "一扇商用等级的大门，用木头制成，上面有着一道门闩。这扇大门已经敞开，可以随意进出。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "chickenwire fence post"
#. ~ Description of terrain "fence post"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A couple of posts that can support a fence.  They look lonely without the fence."
msgstr "一根用于支撑栅栏的柱子。没有栅栏时就孤零零的立在那里。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "woven wattle fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A flimsy barrier made of woven sticks.  Suitable for small animals."
msgstr "用编织的枝条做成的脆弱屏障。能挡住小型动物。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed wire gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_vitrified.json
msgid "A gate for a chain link fence with a latch system to stay closed."
msgstr "一扇勾花围栏的大门，上面有着一道门闩。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open wire gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_vitrified.json
msgid "A gate for a chain link fence with a latch system to stay closed.  The latch is undone, so the gate has swung open."
msgstr "一扇勾花围栏的大门，上面有着一道门闩。门闩被解开了，现在大门敞开。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "locked wire gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A gate for a chain link fence.  This one has a locked padlock on the latch system.  With the right tools, you could cut the metal fence or pick the lock.  You could also examine the fence to see if it looks climbable."
msgstr "勾花围栏的大门。这扇门的门闩上有一个锁着的挂锁。使用合适的工具，你可以将金属栅栏切割开或尝试开锁。你也可以靠近点检查围栏是否可以攀爬。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed chickenwire gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A gate for a chickenwire fence with a simple latch system to stay closed."
msgstr "一扇带有简单门闩的铁丝网围栏的门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open chickenwire gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A gate for a chickenwire fence with a simple latch system to stay closed.  The latch is undone, so the gate has swung open."
msgstr "一扇铁丝网围栏的大门，带有一道简单的门闩。门闩松开了，所以门就打开了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open palisade gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A hanging palisade gate, hoisted by a nearby pulley system.  You probably shouldn't be underneath when it comes down."
msgstr "一个悬挂的篱笆门，被附近的滑轮系统悬挂起来。当它降下来的时候你可不应该站在下面。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "palisade gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A large doorway consisting of long logs cabled together, best used as part of a longer wall.  Can act as a door if some type of pulley system were rigged on an adjacent palisade wall."
msgstr "一个由长原木紧密连接组成的门板，最好用作较长墙壁的一部分。 如果在相邻的篱笆墙上安装某种类型的滑轮系统，可以当作大门使用。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden privacy fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A rather stout fence made of planks and fence posts, it is tall enough to prevent people from seeing into your yard."
msgstr "一种相当坚固的栅栏，由木板和栅栏柱组成，它很高，可以防止人们看到你的院子。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "split rail fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A rather stout fence made of planks and fence posts, suitable for containing livestock like horses, cows and pigs."
msgstr "一种相当坚固的栅栏，由木板和栅栏柱组成，适合圈养马、牛和猪等牲畜。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed retractable gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A retractable security gate with a latch system to stay closed."
msgstr "一扇可伸缩的安全门，上面有着一道门闩。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open retractable gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A retractable security gate with a latch system to stay closed.  The latch is undone, so the gate has retracted up."
msgstr "一扇可伸缩的卷帘门，上面有着一道门闩。门闩被解开了，现在大门敞开。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "locked retractable gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A retractable security gate.  The latch on this one is locked.  With the right tools, you could cut the metal fence or disable the lock."
msgstr "一扇可伸缩的安全门。这扇门已经被锁上了。使用正确的工具，你可以切断金属栅栏或者开锁。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "guard rail"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A section of metal railing, put in place to prevent people from falling or taking the easy way out."
msgstr "一段金属栏杆，放置在适当的位置，以防止人员坠落或轻易离开。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal railing"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A section of metal railing."
msgstr "一段金属栏杆。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "glass railing"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A section of railing made out of glass."
msgstr "一段玻璃制栏杆。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "cattle feeder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A section of tall steel with a solid base and feed spaces above to allow livestock to reach the contained food."
msgstr "一段钢制饲料槽，有钢制的坚固基底，上面留够空间让家畜够到里面装的食物。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "railing"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A section of wooden railing."
msgstr "一段木栏杆。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal post"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A set of metal posts that can hold more serious fences."
msgstr "一根金属桩，可以支撑起更复杂的围栏。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "narrow fence posts"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A set of narrow wooden posts for a woven wattle fence."
msgstr "一排窄木桩，用于枝条围栏。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A simple metal fence."
msgstr "一面简单的金属栅栏。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed screen door"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A simple wooden doorway with screen mesh."
msgstr "一扇朴素的木制纱门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open screen door"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A simple wooden doorway with screen mesh.  The door is open."
msgstr "一扇朴素的木制纱门。门是开着的。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "chain link fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_vitrified.json
msgid "A tall fence made of woven wires.  There aren't any gaps big enough for you to fit through, so you'll have to cut it, climb it, or find a way around."
msgstr "一种由金属丝编织而成的高栅栏。缝隙大小不足以你通过，所以你必须割开它或爬过去，或找一条路绕过去。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "chickenwire fence"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A tall, rather flimsy fence made of planks and woven wire, suitable for containing small livestock like chickens."
msgstr "一种相当脆弱的高围栏，由木板和编织铁丝制成，适合圈养小型牲畜，比如鸡。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "screen mesh wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A tall, rather flimsy wall made of planks and screen mesh, suitable for keeping the bugs out."
msgstr "一种相当脆弱的高墙，由木板和纱网制成，可以用来阻挡蚊虫。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete railing"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "A waist-high concrete barrier."
msgstr "一道齐腰高的混凝土屏障。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "makeshift portcullis"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "An immense gateway cobbled together from various bits of steel and metal scraps."
msgstr "一扇由各式各样的钢制和金属碎片拼接而成的巨大闸门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open metal gate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
msgid "An open metal gate."
msgstr "一扇开启的金属门。"

