#. ~ Description of terrain "overgrown floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flesh.json
msgid "A bare concrete floor, almost completely covered by twitching filaments of gray flesh."
msgstr "一层裸露的混凝土地板，几乎完全被不断抽搐的细小灰色肉丝所覆盖。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "overgrown wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flesh.json
msgid "A concrete wall overgrown by a grotesque grid of veins and knotted flesh."
msgstr "一堵混凝土墙，上面长满了奇形怪状的网格状血管和打结的肉。"

