#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A bare and cold concrete floor that can support a roof, could still insulate from the outdoors but roof collapse is possible if supporting walls are broken down."
msgstr "一片光秃且冰冷的混凝土地板，有屋顶可以与户外隔绝，但支撑墙若被破坏，屋顶可能会坍塌。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor, overhead light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A bare and cold concrete floor with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "一片光秃且冰冷的混凝土地板，天花板上有一盏还能工作的灯。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A bare and cold concrete floor with a streak of red paint, could still insulate from the outdoors but roof collapse is possible if supporting walls are broken down."
msgstr "一片光秃且冰冷的混凝土地板，涂着些红色油漆线条。有屋顶隔绝户外，但若支撑墙被破坏，屋顶可能会坍塌。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A bare and cold concrete floor with a streak of yellow paint and a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above, could still insulate from the outdoors but roof collapse is possible if supporting walls are broken down."
msgstr "一片光秃且冰冷的混凝土地板，涂着些黄色油漆线条，天花板上有一盏还能工作的灯。有屋顶隔绝户外，但若支撑墙被破坏，屋顶可能会坍塌。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A bare and cold concrete floor with a streak of yellow paint, could still insulate from the outdoors but roof collapse is possible if supporting walls are broken down."
msgstr "一片光秃且冰冷的混凝土地板，涂着些黄色油漆线条。有屋顶隔绝户外，但若支撑墙被破坏，屋顶可能会坍塌。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "simple metal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A crudely welded-together metal floor with steel trusses and supporting girders.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "一片由钢桁架和支撑梁草草焊接而成的金属地板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "radiation platform"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A dual-purpose platform that exposes items placed on it to a radioactive source by temporarily hoisting the radioactive material stored within, while also safely containing all objects to avoid contaminating its surroundings.  Operated from an external console."
msgstr "一种双重用途的平台，能暂时升高内部存储的放射性物质，使放置在其上的物品暴露于辐射中，同时也能安全的容纳所有物体，以避免污染周围环境。通过外部控制台操作。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt floor, overhead light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A floor consisting of finely mixed earth that has been tamped down, with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "一种由材质细腻的土壤夯实而成的地板，天花板上有一盏还能工作的灯。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A floor consisting of finely mixed earth that has been tamped down.  It can support a roof."
msgstr "由材质细腻的土壤夯实而成的泥土地板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "paper floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A floor made of ambiguous pulpy matter, covered in sticky wasp saliva."
msgstr "一片由模糊的浆状物质制成的地板，上面覆盖了粘乎乎的黄蜂唾液。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "paper floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A floor made of ambiguous pulpy matter, covered in sticky wasp saliva.  It has, or at least had, a roof of similar a material."
msgstr "一片由模糊的浆状物质制成的地板，上面覆盖了粘乎乎的黄蜂唾液。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wax floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A floor section made entirely out of wax."
msgstr "一片完全由蜡制成的地板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "hard paper floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A hardened cardboard floor made of chewed-up trees and resin mixed with wasp saliva.  It has, or at least had, a roof of a similar material."
msgstr "一片坚硬的纸板地板，由嚼碎的树木和树脂混合黄蜂唾液制成。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sand"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A large area of fine sand that could be useful in a number of ways, if it was extracted properly."
msgstr "一大片优质细砂，如果开采得当，可以在很多方面发挥作用。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "clay"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A large area of malleable clay, suitable for kiln firing if it was extracted properly."
msgstr "一大片可塑粘土，如果开采得当，可用于烧窑。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mound of clay"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A mound of clay soil."
msgstr "一堆黏土。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rebar roof cage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A network of architecturally sound rebar in order to support a floor and roof support, looks like it's missing the poured concrete."
msgstr "建筑完备的钢筋网格，用于支撑地板和屋顶，看来尚未浇筑水泥。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "moss"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A patch of moist, spongy moss."
msgstr "一块潮湿的海绵状苔藓。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "brick floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A relatively flat area made of tightly placed bricks.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "一片相对平坦的地方，由紧密铺设的砖块构成。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rock floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A relatively flat area of rock and stone.  Looks stable enough to be mined with the proper mining gear.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "相对平坦的岩石区。看来稳定程度足堪采矿设备的开掘。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "warped stone floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A rough stone floor.  Its patterns constantly shift as if your mind can't quite understand what it's really seeing.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "一块粗糙的石头地板。它表面的纹路不断变化，仿佛你的大脑不能完全理解自己真正看到的是什么。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "linoleum tile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A section of flooring made out of a tough, gray, rubbery material.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "用坚硬的、灰色的橡胶材料制成的地板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "linoleum tile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A section of flooring made out of a tough, rubbery material.  Colored a simple white.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "用坚硬的橡胶材料制成的地板。涂上简单的白色。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "small rebar roof cage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A series of structural supports crafted from rebar in order to allow the pouring of concrete for a more stable floor and roof support."
msgstr "一系列由钢筋制成的支撑结构，以便于混凝土浇筑更稳固的地面和屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "junk metal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A simple roof of rusty scrap metal bolted and wire-tied to a makeshift frame.  Very fashionable in post-apocalyptic shantytowns.  Hope you like the sound of rain on corrugated metal.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "一片由生锈的废金属制成的简易屋顶和地板，被螺栓和铁丝绑在一个简易框架上。在世界末日后的棚户区非常流行。希望你喜欢雨点打在褶皱金属板上的声音。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "marble floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A smooth and flat flooring made of marble tiles.  Beautiful and expensive.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "一块光滑平坦的大理石地板，美丽且昂贵。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "thick slag"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A thick layer of slag piled up and cooled here, knee high to a grown man."
msgstr "一层厚厚的炉渣在这里堆积并冷却下来，足足有成年人膝盖那么高。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "jagged slag"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A thick, jagged layer of slag, cooled into spiky projections."
msgstr "一层厚厚的、参差不齐的炉渣堆积起来，冷却后形成了尖锐的凸起状物。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "thin slag"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A thin layer of slag coats the floor in rippling waves.  It has cooled completely solid."
msgstr "一层薄薄的炉渣覆盖在地板上，形成起伏的波纹状。它已经完全冷却凝固了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "paper brood cap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A thin paper floor, protecting the pupating wasp larva until it's ready to emerge."
msgstr "一片薄薄的纸地板，保护黄蜂幼虫，直到它准备好破蛹而出。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "primitive floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A timber floor and supports that can support a roof."
msgstr "原木地板和支架，撑起着草皮屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sidewalk"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "An area of common poured concrete, damaged by frost heaves and large cracks due to lack of maintenance, covered by a canvas floor.  May support a roof."
msgstr "现浇混凝土路面。因为缺乏维护而毁于冻胀和大裂缝。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open air"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "An area of open air."
msgstr "这里是空中。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mud"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "An area of wet, slick mud."
msgstr "一块泥泞湿滑的泥地。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "An extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured concrete, capable of providing protection from the elements.  It can support a roof, but that still requires supporting walls, otherwise it may very well cave in."
msgstr "一片由精心架设的钢筋和浇筑的混凝土制成的极其坚固的地板，能够提供对自然环境的防护。匹配的屋顶仍然需要支撑墙，否则它可能会崩塌。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "strong concrete floor, overhead light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "An extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured concrete, with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "一片由精心架设的钢筋和浇筑的混凝土制成的极其坚固的地板，天花板上有一盏还能工作的灯。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "utility light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "An industrial floodlight set up to illuminate the surroundings.  Smashing it doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."
msgstr "一台用于照亮周围环境的工业泛光灯。砸碎它似乎不会产生任何可回收的物品。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built reinforced concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "An unfinished construction of rebar and poured concrete; the floor hasn't been smoothed and the roof support isn't quite filled in yet."
msgstr "未完成的钢筋混凝土结构，地板尚未整平，屋顶也还没盖严实。"

