#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A bare and cold concrete floor."
msgstr "一片光秃且冰冷的混凝土地板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "blue floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A blue section of flooring."
msgstr "一块蓝色地面。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "grave"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A dirt grave, with some grass growing on it.  At least some of the dead do actually rest in peace."
msgstr "一个泥土坟墓，上面长着一些草。至少有些死者确实安息了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A floor consisting of finely mixed earth that has been tamped down."
msgstr "由材质细腻的土壤夯实而成的泥土地板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "stone masonry floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A floor of carefully cut and laid stones, joined with mortar."
msgstr "一层由精心切割并铺设的石块组成的地面，用灰浆连接在一起。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "grave"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A fresh grave, covered with stones, either to keep something from digging it up or to keep one inside from digging out of it.  Or both.  Two planks mark this place of someone's eternal rest."
msgstr "一座新坟，用石头盖着既防止他人挖开又防止里面的东西挖出来。有两块木板标志着这里是某人的永恒安息之地。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mound of upturned dirt"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A giant hill of dirt that looks like you could crawl inside for shelter."
msgstr "一个大土丘，看起来可以爬进去当掩蔽。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "green floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A green section of flooring."
msgstr "一块绿色地面。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rubber mulch"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A large area mulched with shredded rubber.  It's a softer place to land than regular dirt."
msgstr "一大块覆盖着碎橡胶的地板。一块比普通的泥土更柔软的地方。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "orifice"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A large round orifice, with trails of fresh and dried-up strange green liquid with a strongly acidic odor covering its inner sides."
msgstr "一个巨大的圆形孔口，有新鲜及干燥的奇怪绿色液体的痕迹，其中散发出一股浓烈的酸味。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal floor gangway"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A metal gangway bridging a short gap.  Sturdy enough to act as a floor, but not sufficient to support additional flooring."
msgstr "用于连接短距离间隙的金属舷梯。坚固到足以当作地板，但无法支撑额外的地板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mound of sand"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A mound of sand."
msgstr "一堆沙子。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A newer segment of poured concrete with surface finishes for aesthetics and resistance to freeze-thaw cycles."
msgstr "一种新式的水泥浇筑块，表面处理兼顾了美观与抗冻－融循环功能。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A newer segment of poured concrete with surface finishes for aesthetics and resistance to freeze-thaw cycles.  Covered with a streak of yellow paint."
msgstr "一种新式的水泥浇筑块，表面处理兼顾了美观与抗冻－融循环功能。外部涂上一层黄色的油漆。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "glassed sand"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A patch of sand with a crust of natural glass atop it from exposure to intense heat."
msgstr "一块暴露在高温下的沙子，上面有一层天然的玻璃外壳。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "red floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A red section of flooring."
msgstr "一块红色地面。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rock floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A relatively flat area of rock and stone.  Looks stable enough to be mined with the proper mining gear."
msgstr "相对平坦的岩石区。看来稳定程度足堪采矿设备的开掘。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "linoleum tile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A section of flooring made out of a tough, gray, rubbery material."
msgstr "用坚硬的、灰色的橡胶材料制成的地板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "linoleum tile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A section of flooring made out of a tough, rubbery material.  Colored a simple white."
msgstr "用坚硬的橡胶材料制成的地板。涂上简单的白色。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pavement"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A segment of asphalt, slowly degrading from cracks, frost heaves, and lack of maintenance."
msgstr "一段铺了柏油的路面，因为裂缝、冻胀和缺乏维护而逐渐老化。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "deck coating"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A thick metal hull coating, covered with a military-grade epoxy mix.  Used for runways, and can't be melted by jet engine nozzles."
msgstr "一层厚厚的金属船体涂层，覆盖着军用级环氧树脂混合物。用作航母跑道，不会被喷气发动机的高温熔化。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "white deck coating"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A thick metal hull covering, covered with a military-grade epoxy mix and painted white."
msgstr "一层厚厚的金属船体涂层，覆盖着被漆成白色的军用级环氧树脂混合物。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "yellow deck coating"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A thick metal hull covering, covered with a military-grade epoxy mix and painted yellow."
msgstr "一层厚厚的金属船体涂层，覆盖着被漆成黄色的军用级环氧树脂混合物。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "red deck coating"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A thick metal hull covering, covered with a military-grade epoxy mix, and painted red."
msgstr "一层厚厚的金属船体涂层，覆盖着被漆成红色的军用级环氧树脂混合物。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "paper thin slag"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A thin splatter of slag coats the ground here, having cooled completely into something like pitted stone."
msgstr "这里地上散落着一层薄薄的炉渣，它已经完全冷却，变成了类似坑洼状的石头。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal grate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A walkway that can be used as a protective covering over drains, or even as a filter."
msgstr "用于下水道保护层的金属栅栏，甚至能避免杂质进入下水道。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A wooden floor created from boards, packed tightly together and nailed down.  Common on patios."
msgstr "由扎紧的木板钉牢而成的木质楼板。常见于露台。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden floor gangway"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A wooden gangway bridging a short gap.  Sturdy enough to act as a floor, but not sufficient to support additional flooring."
msgstr "用于连接短距离间隙的木制舷梯。坚固到足以当作地板，但无法支撑额外的地板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sidewalk"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "An area of common poured concrete, damaged by frost heaves and large cracks due to lack of maintenance."
msgstr "现浇混凝土路面。因为缺乏维护而毁于冻胀和大裂缝。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "upturned dirt"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "An area of loose dirt, not easily traversable.  If examined more closely, it's quite favorable for planting seeds and the like."
msgstr "一块被翻耕过的泥土地，不易穿行。这种地方非常适合播种。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "elevator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "An elevator section of the flight deck."
msgstr "飞行甲板上的一个电梯。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "An extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured concrete, capable of providing protection from the elements.  As for the matching roof, it still requires supporting walls, otherwise it may very well cave in."
msgstr "一片由精心架设的钢筋和浇筑的混凝土制成的极其坚固的地板，能够提供对自然环境的防护。匹配的屋顶仍然需要支撑墙，否则它可能会崩塌。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gelatinous ground"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "An incursion of a large area of otherworldly substrate, it feels like walking on hardened gelatin."
msgstr "一大块异界物质侵入了此处，感觉就像是在硬化凝胶上行走。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "odd fault"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "An unnaturally humanoid-shaped hole, it seems oddly familiar.  You feel a strange urge to examine it closer, as if it belongs to you somehow."
msgstr "一个不自然的人形洞，看上去有种奇怪的熟悉感觉。你觉得自己有种想要靠近仔细观察的冲动，仿佛它本来就和你是一体的一般。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "High-quality and tough checkered metal flooring to reduce the risk of slips and falls."
msgstr "高质量的坚固网纹金属地板，可降低滑倒和摔倒的风险。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "It's dirt, suitable for digging or tilling."
msgstr "这是泥土，适合挖掘或耕种。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rocky soil"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "Many stones are protruding from beneath the ground.  This would not be good farmland."
msgstr "许多石头从地底下凸出出来。这样的地方不适合耕种。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "yellow pavement"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "Streaks of carefully aligned yellow paint mark the road to inform drivers not to cross.  No one is enforcing these rules anymore."
msgstr "禁止司机跨越的双黄线。再也没有人来执行这些规则了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "forest floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "The soil here is tightly packed around a network of tree roots and buried under a thick mat of rotting leaves and other debris."
msgstr "这里的土壤紧紧包裹在树根形成的网络中，并被埋在厚厚的腐烂树叶和其他杂物之下。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TERRAIN_FAULT" in terrain "odd
#. fault"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "This wall is perfectly vertical.  Odd, twisted holes are set in it, leading as far back into the solid rock as you can see.  The holes are humanoid in shape, but with long, twisted, distended limbs."
msgstr ""
"这面墙完美的垂直于地面。\n"
"在坚固的岩石上你能够看到上面有一些扭曲的洞。\n"
"那些洞有人的形状，但又有许多长又扭曲的肿胀肢体。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pedestrian crossing"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "White polymer lines painted on the pavement which indicate places where pedestrians should cross the road."
msgstr "在人行道上漆上白色聚合物线，指示行人应该过马路的地方。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "blue floor"
msgstr "蓝色地板"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "concrete"
msgstr "混凝土"

#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "glassed sand"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "black glass dust"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_vitrified.json
