msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。黄色背景的面板上显示着原子和电击枪的符号，刷一下保安钥匙卡来开门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Freight hauler access card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom and a truck.  You could swipe a transporter's badge near it to unlock the gates."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。面板上显示着原子和卡车的符号。刷一下货运工钥匙卡来开门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Maintenance: blue zone card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom and a wrench on a blue background.  You could swipe a maintenance employee badge near it to unlock the gates."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。蓝色背景的面板上显示着原子和扳手的符号。刷一下维护工钥匙卡来开门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Maintenance: green zone card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom and a wrench on a green background.  You could swipe a maintenance employee badge near it to unlock the gates."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。绿色背景的面板上显示着原子和扳手的符号。刷一下维护工钥匙卡来开门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Maintenance: ocher zone card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom and a wrench on a ocher background.  You could swipe a maintenance employee badge near it to unlock the gates."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。赭色背景的面板上显示着原子和扳手的符号。刷一下维护工钥匙卡来开门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom inside a flask that is universally known to indicate SCIENCE.  An ominous red LED reminds you of a robot gone haywire from an old sci-fi flick.  You could swipe a scientific ID badge near it if you do not fear the machine."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。面板上显示着众所周知的表示科学的原子在烧瓶里的符号。一个不祥的红色LED灯让你想起科幻片中失控的机器人。如果你不害怕这台机器，你可以刷一下科研钥匙卡。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom inside a flask that is universally known to indicate SCIENCE.  The stark red LED blinks askance at your geek cred.  You could swipe a scientific ID badge near it to unlock the gates to discovery."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。面板上显示着众所周知的表示科学的原子在烧瓶里的符号。鲜明的红色LED灯闪烁着，展现出极客风格。刷一下科研钥匙卡来打开发现之门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Facility entrance card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom inside a flask that is universally known to indicate SCIENCE.  You could swipe a visitor's pass near it to unlock the gates."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。面板上显示着众所周知的表示科学的原子在烧瓶里的符号。刷一下访客钥匙卡来开门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  The symbol of a gear in front of a bulging bicep is emblazoned on the matte black surface with an illegible heavy industrial company title.  A red LED blinks on the card reader.  Perhaps an industrial ID card could still open it."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。哑光的黑色表面上印有一个雄壮的二头肌齿轮符号，以及一个难以辨认的重工业公司的名称。读卡器上有一个红色的LED灯闪烁着。也许一张工业钥匙卡仍然可以打开它。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  The universal symbol of an eagle driving a tank, biting a grenade pin, stands rampant in front of an American flag.  A small, red LED remains constant, as if watching you, waiting.  You could swipe a military ID card in front of the reader if you dared."
msgstr "一台智能卡读卡器。面板上显示着美国国旗和一只驾驶着坦克的雄鹰，咬着手榴弹插销的图案。一只小小的红色LED灯保持亮起，仿佛在看着你，等待着你。如果你敢的话，你可以在读卡器前刷一下军用钥匙卡。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gate pulley"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A system of ropes and pulleys that allows a single person to raise heavy doors or gates."
msgstr "一整套绳索和滑轮系统，一人就能拉起沉重的门或大门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barn door pulley"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A system of ropes and pulleys that allows a single person to raise heavy doors."
msgstr "一整套绳索和滑轮系统，一人就能拉起沉重的门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gate pulley"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A system of ropes and wooden pulleys that allows a single person to raise heavy doors or gates."
msgstr "一整套绳索和木制滑轮系统，一人就能拉起沉重的门或大门。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "intercom"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "An intercom panel.  For when you want to scare the crap out of someone, or just talk to them over the intercom system, if you're boring like that."
msgstr "一个对讲机面板。当你想吓唬某人，或者只是无聊到想要通过内部对讲系统跟他们说话时，可以使用它。"

