#. ~ Description of terrain "backboard"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-recreational.json
msgid "A basketball backboard."
msgstr "一块篮板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "slide"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-recreational.json
msgid "A children's slide.  It's too small for you to slide on comfortably."
msgstr ""
"一个儿童滑滑梯，对你来说小得不能舒舒服服地滑溜下来。\n"
"\"呜，飞机飞啦。\""

#. ~ Description of terrain "backboard"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-recreational.json
msgid "A metal backboard."
msgstr "一块金属篮板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "monkey bars"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-recreational.json
msgid "A set of monkey bars to be used by children to train their arm strength, or, in happier days, to just have fun."
msgstr "一套攀爬架，孩子们能用它锻炼臂力，或者只是在更高兴的日子里玩得开心。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sandbox"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-recreational.json
msgid "Children used to play in this sandbox.  The population of lice probably diminished considerably now that they no longer do."
msgstr "孩子们曾在这个沙坑里玩耍。但现在他们不这样做了，也许虱子的数量将因此减少。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-recreational.json
msgid "backboard"
msgstr "篮板"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-recreational.json
msgid "monkey bars"
msgstr "攀爬架"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-recreational.json
msgid "sandbox"
msgstr "沙坑"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-recreational.json
msgid "slide"
msgstr "滑道"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pseudo terrain"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-regional-pseudo.json
msgid "This should never actually show up, it should have been replaced with regional terrain."
msgstr "这实际上根本不应该出现，它应该被替换为区域地形。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pseudo terrain"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-regional-pseudo.json
msgid "This should never actually show up, it's a pseudo terrain.  For use where clean, curated grass is the only expected terrain - modified by whatever the biome equivalent is."
msgstr "这实际上不应该出现，它是一种伪地形。用于预期只有干净、精心修剪的草地（由相应的生物群落进行修改）的地方。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pseudo terrain"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-regional-pseudo.json
msgid "This should never actually show up, it's a pseudo terrain.  For use where people have trampled away grass, or otherwise cleared plant life."
msgstr "这条描述不应该出现，这是一个伪地形。用于人们践踏草地或以其他方式清除植物的地方。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pseudo terrain"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-regional-pseudo.json
msgid "This should never actually show up, it's a pseudo terrain.  For use where plants have been planted and grass/groundcover kept clear."
msgstr "这实际上不应该出现，它是一种虚拟地形。用于种植植物且保持草地/地面植被清洁的地方。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-regional-pseudo.json
msgid "pseudo terrain"
msgstr "虚拟地形"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat section of concrete rooftop."
msgstr "一片平坦的混凝土屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "treated wooden roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat section of flame-resistant wooden rooftop."
msgstr "一片平坦的防火木制屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "shingle flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat section of rooftop covered with shingles."
msgstr "一片平坦的木瓦屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat section of wooden rooftop."
msgstr "一片平坦的木制屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat surface made of ambiguous pulpy matter, covered in sticky wasp saliva."
msgstr "一片由模糊的浆状物质制成的屋顶，上面覆盖了粘乎乎的黄蜂唾液。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat surface made of hardened, ambiguous pulpy matter, covered in sticky wasp saliva."
msgstr "一片由坚硬、模糊的浆状物质制成的屋顶，上面覆盖了粘乎乎的黄蜂唾液。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tar paper flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat, gray section of rooftop covered with tar paper."
msgstr "一片平坦的灰色沥青纸屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat, gray section of rooftop."
msgstr "一片平坦的灰色屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "skylight"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A giant sheet of glass inserted into the roof to let light pass through."
msgstr "一块镶嵌在屋顶上的巨大玻璃，光线可以通过。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A high-quality and sturdy section of metallic rooftop."
msgstr "一片高质量的坚固金属屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "downspout"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A length of gutter running from the roof to the ground, you could place a container underneath it to collect rainwater.  It might be possible to climb up here, but it's too flimsy to support an adult."
msgstr "一段从屋顶延伸到地面的排水管，你可以在下面放个容器接雨水。也许能顺着它爬上去，但这东西太不结实了，承受不了一个成年人的重量。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "brick roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of brick rooftop."
msgstr "一片平坦的砖屋顶"

#. ~ Description of terrain "canvas roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of canvas rooftop."
msgstr "一片平坦的帆布屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rock roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of flat natural rock."
msgstr "一块平坦的天然石头。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of flat, sheet metal rooftop."
msgstr "一片平坦的金属屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "warped roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of flat, stone-like rooftop.  It is patterned with grooves and lines that constantly shift."
msgstr "一片平坦的石头屋顶。它表面的纹路和线条不断变化。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tile flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of flat, tiled rooftop."
msgstr "一片平坦的瓦片屋顶"

#. ~ Description of terrain "thatched roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of roof made out of straw."
msgstr "一片用稻草制成的屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sod roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of rooftop made out of sod."
msgstr "一片草皮制成的屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gutter drop"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A spot in the gutter where the water flows into a downspout.  It might be possible to climb down here, but it's too flimsy to support an adult."
msgstr "一处连接落水管的排水槽。也许能从这里爬下去，但这东西太不结实了，承受不了一个成年人的重量。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "red metal roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A sturdy section of metallic rooftop, painted red for visibility and weather resistance."
msgstr "一块坚固的金属屋顶部分，涂成红色以提高可见度和耐候性。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "skylight frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A wooden skylight frame."
msgstr "一个木制天窗窗框。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rain gutter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "Channels water from the roof towards the ground, it looks flimsy."
msgstr "一段收集屋顶雨水的管道，看上去很脆弱。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dead treetop"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "The bare upper branches of a dead tree.  There's just enough room to perch here."
msgstr "枯树顶部光秃的枝干，这里的空间刚好够坐下。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "giant fern top"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "The top of a willow tree.  There is enough room to perch up here, but only just."
msgstr "一棵柳树的树顶。上面的空间刚好够勉强落脚。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "giant fern top"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "The top of some unearthly gigantic fern.  There is enough room to perch up here, but only just."
msgstr "一些奇异巨大蕨类植物的顶部，这里的空间刚好够坐下，但也就那么一点点。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "treetop"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "The upper branches of a tree.  There's just enough room to perch here."
msgstr "树的顶部枝干，这里的空间刚好够坐下。"

