#. ~ Description of terrain "covered pit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A deep pit with a plank placed across it, looks sturdy enough to cross safely.  The plank could be removed to make it dangerous again."
msgstr "上面铺着木板的深坑，看上去它的坚固程度足够安全通行。上面的木板可以在通过后移走，这样就可以继续坑人了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "slime"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A disgusting, slippery mess.  Could be used to stash things, because who'd want to touch it?"
msgstr "看上去让人作呕的滑溜溜的泥浆，能用来藏东西，因为谁会碰这玩意？"

#. ~ Description of terrain "corpse filled pit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A giant trench full of corpses, maybe even a mass graveyard.  The bodies could be dug out, but nothing in here looks remotely usable."
msgstr "一个填满尸体的大壕沟，甚至可能更像是个乱坟坑。这些尸体可以被挖出来，但没一个看起来有点用的。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "large den"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A large den that burrowing animals such as bears and foxes call home."
msgstr "熊和狐狸等穴居动物的大巢穴。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "spiked pit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A narrow trench full of very pointy things that would easily puncture a body."
msgstr "布尖锐物的窄沟，那些尖锐物能轻易刺穿躯体。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "shallow pit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A pit that could be dug even deeper or filled up.  Also useful as a starting foundation for some constructions."
msgstr "一个坑，能挖得更深或填满。也可以作为某些建筑的起始基础。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "covered glass pit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A plank has been placed carefully to allow traversal over this ditch full of large glass shards.  The plank could be removed to make it dangerous again."
msgstr "上面铺着木板的深坑，看上去它的坚固程度足够安全通行，底下满是吓人的玻璃碎片。可以移走木板再恢复为陷阱。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dead drop pit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A seemingly innocuous shallow pit.  Careful inspection reveals a black canister half-buried in the exposed soil."
msgstr "一个看起来并不危险的浅坑。仔细检查发现，一个黑色罐子被半埋在裸露的土壤中。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "small den"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A small den that burrowing animals such as groundhogs or hares call home."
msgstr "土拨鼠或野兔等穴居动物的小巢穴。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "A steep hole that could seriously injure something if it fell in, potentially fatal if it was filled with sharp and dangerous things.  Deep enough for more advanced construction projects, and possibly to reach groundwater if constructed properly."
msgstr "一个陡峭的坑洞，掉进去会受重伤，如果布满危险的尖锐物，则可能致命。深度足以用于更高级的建设项目，如果构建得当，也许能连通地下水。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "glass pit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "Looks like a ton of broken glass was dumped into this pit.  Might not fatal to fall in, but it wouldn't be pleasant to try to crawl out."
msgstr "这坑底简直就像是倒进了一吨的碎玻璃！掉进去未必致命，但别指望能轻松愉快地爬出来。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "covered spiked pit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "Menacing with sharp spears along the bottom, this pit has a plank across it to allow someone or something to cross safely.  The plank could be removed to make it dangerous again."
msgstr "上面铺着木板的深坑，底下满是唬人的锋利长矛，看上去它的坚固程度足够让人员货物安全通行。可以移走木板再恢复为陷阱。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_BEM_human_sample_deliver" in
#. terrain "dead drop pit"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "You don't have anything to deliver."
msgstr "你没有什么要送的。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BEM_human_sample_deliver" in terrain
#. "dead drop pit"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "You prepare the drop as instructed"
msgstr "你按照指示准备好情报。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "corpse filled pit"
msgstr "深坑（填满尸体）"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "covered glass pit"
msgstr "玻璃陷坑（加盖）"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "covered pit"
msgstr "深坑（加盖）"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "covered spiked pit"
msgstr "尖刺陷坑（加盖）"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "dead drop pit"
msgstr "情报秘密传递坑"

#. ~ Name of a trap
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json data/json/traps.json
msgid "glass pit"
msgstr "玻璃陷坑"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "large den"
msgstr "大巢穴"

#. ~ Name of a trap
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json data/json/traps.json
msgid "pit"
msgstr "深坑"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "shallow pit"
msgstr "浅坑"

#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "slime"
msgid_plural "slimes"
msgstr[0] "变形怪"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json
msgid "small den"
msgstr "小巢穴"

#. ~ Name of a trap
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-traps.json data/json/traps.json
msgid "spiked pit"
msgstr "尖刺陷坑"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed bramble roots"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "A bramble of roots covering a large hole.  They could easily be pulled apart."
msgstr "一团纠缠在一起的树根，遮住了一个洞。它们很容易被扯开。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open bramble roots"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "A bramble of roots, pulled apart to reveal a hole."
msgstr "一团纠缠在一起的树根，它们被扯开并露出一个洞。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "root floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "A dirt floor covered with roots."
msgstr "一块覆盖根须的泥土地。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "downward root slope"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "A downward-facing slope of root-covered dirt."
msgstr "由覆盖根须的泥土铺成的向下斜坡。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken bark wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "A formerly solid wall of bark, now almost completely destroyed and waiting to collapse."
msgstr "曾经是一堵坚固的树皮墙，但现在几乎完全被毁坏，马上就要塌了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bark"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "A solid piece of bark covers the floor here."
msgstr "这里的地板上覆盖着一块坚硬的树皮。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "chipped bark wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "A solid wall of bark enclosing the trunk of a massive tree.  Some of it has been broken away."
msgstr "一堵坚固的实心树皮墙，围成一棵大树的树干。它上面已经有些破口了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "solid bark wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "A solid wall of bark, enclosing the trunk of a massive tree.  It will probably burn quite well."
msgstr "一堵坚固的实心树皮墙，围成一棵大树的树干。它可能会烧得很好。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "solid wood wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "A solid wall of naturally grown wood.  Likely very flammable."
msgstr "自然生长的树木构成的实心墙。可能非常易燃。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "upward root slope"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "An upward-facing slope of root-covered dirt."
msgstr "由覆盖根须的泥土铺成的向上斜坡。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "branches with leaves"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "Thin branches emerge here, covered with thick, large leaves."
msgstr "这里长出了许多树枝，上面覆盖着大大的厚树叶。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "bark"
msgstr "树皮"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "branches with leaves"
msgstr "带叶树枝"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "broken bark wall"
msgstr "树皮墙（破碎）"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "chipped bark wall"
msgstr "树皮墙（缺口）"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "closed bramble roots"
msgstr "纠缠根系（关）"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "downward root slope"
msgstr "向下树根土坡"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "open bramble roots"
msgstr "纠缠根系（开）"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "root floor"
msgstr "树根地板"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "solid bark wall"
msgstr "树皮墙"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "solid wood wall"
msgstr "木墙"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "upward root slope"
msgstr "向上树根土坡"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ballistic glass wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A ballistic glass barrier, consisting of layers of laminated glass.  Its heavyweight construction is tough enough that even bullets that get through are unlikely to fully shatter it."
msgstr "这是一种弹道玻璃屏障，由多层夹层玻璃组成。其坚固的结构足以承受重击，即便子弹穿透其中，也不太可能将其完全击碎。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "glass wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A barrier made of glass, it's nothing complicated, and looks extremely fragile."
msgstr "一扇木制的栅栏，并不复杂。和善地提醒你此路不通。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "laminated glass wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A barrier made of laminated safety glass.  It's a lot tougher than regular glass, and is designed to break into fragments that are nowhere near as sharp."
msgstr "一种由夹层安全玻璃制成的防护屏障。这种玻璃比普通玻璃要坚固得多，而且其设计使得一旦破裂，产生的碎片也不会像普通玻璃那样锋利。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "smoothed rock"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A block of stone that's been smoothed and shaped, commonly granite or marble for funerary chapels and mausoleums."
msgstr "一大块经过细心打磨和成型的岩石，经常是在葬礼教堂和陵墓中使用的花岗岩和大理石。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete wall with ropes"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A boxlike wall of concrete with ropes attached to the exterior edges."
msgstr "一堵盒子形状的混凝土墙，外缘安装了一根绳索。用来训练跑酷。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pillar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete column that helps keep the mine's ceiling and walls from collapsing."
msgstr "一根有助于防止矿井天花板和墙壁倒塌的混凝土支柱。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "column"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete column."
msgstr "一根混凝土支柱。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "black concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted black."
msgstr "一堵被漆成黑色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "blue concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted blue."
msgstr "一堵被漆成蓝色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "brown concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted brown."
msgstr "一堵被漆成棕色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "cyan concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted cyan."
msgstr "一堵被漆成青色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gray concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted gray."
msgstr "一堵被漆成灰色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "green concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted green."
msgstr "一堵被漆成绿色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "orange concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted orange."
msgstr "一堵被漆成橙色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pink concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted pink."
msgstr "一堵被漆成粉色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "purple concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted purple."
msgstr "一堵被漆成紫色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "red concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted red."
msgstr "一堵被漆成红色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "white concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted white."
msgstr "一堵被漆成白色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "yellow concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A concrete wall, painted yellow."
msgstr "一堵被漆成黄色的混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken log wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A destroyed log wall, with only a supporting log left, ready to collapse.  Looks repairable if the damage was replaced and patched together with nails and planks."
msgstr "一堵毁坏的原木墙，只剩一根木头支着，随时可能倒塌。如果用钉子和木板把损坏的部分替换和修补起来，看来还能复原。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "root wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A dirt wall covered with roots."
msgstr "一堵覆盖根须的土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "simple concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A durable and uniform concrete wall, quite drab without decoration.  More than capable of supporting a roof, as well as keeping out most anything, save for vehicles."
msgstr "一面耐久很高且强度均匀的混凝土墙，没有装饰显得很单调。不但能支撑屋顶，而且抵挡大部分东西伤害，除了车辆撞击。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A finished wall of planks and support beams, capable of supporting an upper level or roof.  Highly flammable."
msgstr "一堵由木板和支撑梁筑成的墙，能支撑上层或屋顶。依旧非常易燃。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built log wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A half-constructed wall of notched logs that interlock to provide stability.  Needs a few more logs to hold up a roof.  Looks flammable."
msgstr "一堵建造到一半的墙，由带有凹口的原木互锁而成，十分稳定。需要更多的原木才能支撑住屋顶。看起来很易燃。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "large metal support"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A heavy-duty metal support beam."
msgstr "一根大型金属支撑梁。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "paper wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A huge wall of ambiguous pulpy matter, covered in sticky wasp saliva.  You could smash it down effortlessly."
msgstr "一堵由纤维物质制成的巨大的墙，上面覆盖了粘乎乎的黄蜂唾液。你可以毫不费力地砸碎它。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "small metal support"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A metal support beam."
msgstr "一根金属支撑梁。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "chipped log wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A moderately damaged log wall, it could probably be patched up with some planks and nails."
msgstr "一堵中等损坏的原木墙，可以用一些木板和钉子修补。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken wood wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A number of planks are missing and the structure is beginning to sag and fall apart.  It's going to need quite a bit of work to repair."
msgstr "缺失了一些木板而且结构开始倾倒崩裂。修复这堵墙颇需要一番功夫。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built simple metal wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A partially-built makeshift metal wall that could potentially support a roof if it were completed."
msgstr "一堵部分完成的简易金属墙，如果完工的话还可以支撑屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built wattle-and-daub wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A partially-complete wattle-and-daub wall with some of the wooden strip lattice in place.  It still requires the rest of the lattice and supporting wet compound to be filled in."
msgstr "一堵部分完成的木骨泥墙，搭建了一些木条格栅。它还需要加上其他部分的格栅并涂上湿泥糊。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built simple concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A partially-poured concrete wall that could probably keep anything behind it quite safe if it were finished."
msgstr "一堵部分浇筑的混凝土墙，若能全部完成，保证墙后平安。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced black concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted black."
msgstr "一堵被漆成黑色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced blue concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted blue."
msgstr "一堵被漆成蓝色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced cyan concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted cyan."
msgstr "一堵被漆成棕色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced gray concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted gray."
msgstr "一堵被漆成灰色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced green concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted green."
msgstr "一堵被漆成绿色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced orange concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted orange."
msgstr "一堵被漆成橙色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced pink concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted pink."
msgstr "一堵被漆成粉色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced purple concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted purple."
msgstr "一堵被漆成紫色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced red concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted red."
msgstr "一堵被漆成红色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced white concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted white."
msgstr "一堵被漆成白色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced yellow concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A reinforced concrete wall, painted yellow."
msgstr "一堵被漆成黄色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wattle-and-daub wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A relatively primitive wall made by daubing together a lattice of wooden strips using some combination of wet soil, clay, sand, animal dung, and straw."
msgstr "一堵十分简陋的墙，将木条格栅用一些湿泥、黏土、沙子、动物粪便和稻草之类混和物糊起来制成。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "simple metal wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A relatively simple wall made of cobbled-together scrap metal.  It's still capable of blocking intruders and supporting a roof with adjacent walls."
msgstr "一堵由金属废料拼凑的简陋墙壁。它同样能阻挡入侵者并配合邻近的墙壁支撑屋顶。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bollard"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A set of concrete and steel bollards sticking out of the ground, designed to protect areas against vehicle ram attacks.  It requires a few more steps for you to walk between the bollards."
msgstr "一组由混凝土和钢筋制成的路桩，从地面突出，用于保护区域免受车辆撞击。你需要多走几步才能穿过路桩。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pony wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A short divider wall consisting of a wooden support structure with drywall.  Painted an all-too-common and neutral off-white or cream color.  Looks flammable."
msgstr "一堵使用木质结构与石膏板的分隔矮墙，被涂成了最常见的米白或奶白色。看起来依旧易燃。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "simple black concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A simple concrete wall, painted black."
msgstr "一堵被漆成黑色的简易混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "simple blue concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
