#. ~ Description of terrain "abstract stone wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Encompasses most stone-like walls.  If you see this in-game, it's a bug."
msgstr "念动波法术的一部分。如果你看到的话是bug。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "abstract glass wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Encompasses most wall-sized glass panes.  If you see this in-game, it's a bug."
msgstr "该物品用于烧焦的人类尸体的占位符。如果你看到这个，说明游戏出bug了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "abstract wooden wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Encompasses most wood-like walls.  If you see this in-game, it's a bug."
msgstr "念动波法术的一部分。如果你看到的话是bug。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "abstract column"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Encompasses rock columns.  If you see this in-game, it's a bug."
msgstr "该物品用于人类尸体的占位符。如果你看到这个，说明游戏出bug了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built brick wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Half of a brick wall.  It requires some more resources and effort before it'd be considered a suitable wall."
msgstr "半截砖墙。在它算得上真正的墙壁之前，还需要多费点儿资源和操劳。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built stone wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Half of a sturdy stone wall.  Some work still needs to be done before it can be considered a suitable wall."
msgstr "半截坚固的石墙。在它算得上真正的墙壁之前，还需要做一些工作。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built adobe wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Half of an adobe brick wall.  It requires some more resources and effort before it'd be considered a suitable wall."
msgstr "半截土坯砖墙。在它算得上真正的墙壁之前，还需要多费点儿资源和操劳。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "laminated glass with open shutters"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Hanging metal shutters that haven't been deployed, exposing the wired glass.  It appears as though the metal shutters can only be closed from the inside."
msgstr "悬挂着未拉上的金属百叶窗，露出了强化玻璃。看来金属百叶窗似乎只能从内部操作。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "laminated glass with closed shutters"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Metal shutters cover this safety glass barrier, blocking out the view and adding some sturdy protection.  They should be openable, but only from the inside."
msgstr "金属百叶窗覆盖在这层安全玻璃屏障上，遮挡了视野，并提供了牢固的防护。它们应该可以从内部打开，但只能从里面操作。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built reinforced concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Poured concrete with methodically placed rebar sticking out, which isn't practical for supporting roofs or shelter.  It needs more resources before it could be considered complete."
msgstr "内嵌整齐钢筋骨架的浇筑混凝土，并不适合支撑屋顶或掩体。还需要更多资源才算完整。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced brown concrete wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Reinforced concrete wall painted brown."
msgstr "被漆成棕色的强化混凝土墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal bars"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "Thick, heavy bars from the floor to the ceiling, interlaced wall to wall.  Not made to support roofs, but great for blocking paths."
msgstr "厚重的栅栏从地面直抵天花板，交错在墙与墙之间。不能支撑屋顶，但用来挡路挺不错。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "burnt wall"
