#. ~ Description of terrain "window with closed curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed glass window with the curtains shut, blocking sunlight and visibility."
msgstr "一扇紧闭的玻璃窗，窗帘拉得严严实实，遮挡了阳光，也阻挡了视线。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barred window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed glass window with the curtains shut, blocking sunlight and visibility.  It's protected by steel security bars."
msgstr "一扇紧闭的玻璃窗，窗帘拉得严严实实，遮挡了阳光，也阻挡了视线。它还被坚固的钢质防护栏所保护。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "window without curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed glass window without any curtains."
msgstr "带帘钢化玻璃窗"

#. ~ Description of terrain "plastic window with closed curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed makeshift plastic window with a closed curtain."
msgstr "带帘塑料窗（拉上窗帘）"

#. ~ Description of terrain "plastic window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed makeshift plastic window with an opened curtain."
msgstr "强化塑料窗（拉上窗帘）"

#. ~ Description of terrain "plastic window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed makeshift plastic window with an opened curtain.  It has been blocked out with duct tape."
msgstr "一个封闭的临时塑料窗，上面挂着一块敞开的窗帘。它已经被用胶带封住了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed makeshift plastic window."
msgstr "简易门（关）"

#. ~ Description of terrain "taped plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed makeshift plastic window.  It has been blocked out with duct tape."
msgstr "一个封闭的临时塑料窗。它已经被用胶带封住了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed window with curtains on the inside that can be drawn closed to block visibility and shut out any light."
msgstr "一扇挂着花哨窗帘的紧闭的窗户。可以拉上窗帘来阻挡视野和所有的光线。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barred window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A closed window with curtains.  It's protected by steel security bars."
msgstr "一扇装有窗帘的封闭窗户。它还配有钢制防护栏以提供额外的安全保障。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barricaded picture window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass picture window completely covered over with planks.  Adding a few spikes and metal plating would further increase its durability."
msgstr "一扇经过多次加固的窗户，木板经过细心摆放，完全遮挡了视线。并加上一些铁刺和金属板可以进一步提高坚固程度。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "boarded up picture window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass picture window that has been covered with nailed-down planks, blocking sunlight and visibility.  It's not much stronger, but it could be further reinforced with strategically placed planks."
msgstr "一扇钉满了木板的玻璃窗，挡住了阳光和视线。它并没有太强的防御力，但你可以合理放置更多的木板来进一步加固。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "picture window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass picture window, the kind that doesn't open."
msgstr "一扇玻璃镶嵌的观景窗，这种窗户是不能开启的。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barred picture window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass picture window, the kind that doesn't open.  It's protected by steel security bars."
msgstr "一扇玻璃镶嵌的观景窗，这种窗户是不能开启的。它被坚固的钢质防护栏所保护着。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barred picture window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass picture window, the kind that doesn't open.  It's protected by steel security bars.  It has a small sticker in one corner, reading 'Protected by AtmoWeb, leading AI in terminating crime'."
msgstr "一大片玻璃插在窗框上，外侧安装着许多安全护栏，让你没法从这里爬进去。一般安装在高价值的商店内，或在犯罪率高的街区。它的角落贴着一张贴纸，上面写着\"此处受AtmoWeb安防公司保护，AI安防领导者。\""

#. ~ Description of terrain "picture window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass picture window, the kind that doesn't open. It has a small sticker in one corner, reading 'Protected by AtmoWeb, leading AI in terminating crime'."
msgstr "一大片玻璃插在窗框上，外侧安装着许多安全护栏，让你没法从这里爬进去。一般安装在高价值的商店内，或在犯罪率高的街区。它的角落贴着一张贴纸，上面写着\"此处受AtmoWeb安防公司保护，AI安防领导者。\""

#. ~ Description of terrain "barricaded window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass window completely covered over with planks."
msgstr "一扇玻璃窗被木板完全遮住了。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "boarded up window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass window that has been covered with nailed-down planks, blocking sunlight and visibility.  It's not much stronger, but it could be further reinforced with strategically placed planks."
msgstr "一扇钉满了木板的玻璃窗，挡住了阳光和视线。它并没有太强的防御力，但你可以合理放置更多的木板来进一步加固。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "taped window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass window that has been covered with tape."
msgstr "灌注了魔力的木头。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass window with curtains on the inside that can be drawn closed to block visibility and shut out any light.  It's open and you might be able to crawl through."
msgstr "一扇在室内挂着花哨窗帘的窗户。可以拉上窗帘来阻挡视线和阳光。它是开着的，你可以爬过去。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "taped window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A glass window with curtains on the inside.  This one has been blocked out with duct tape"
msgstr "一扇在室内挂着花哨窗帘的窗户。这扇窗户被强力胶带封得严严实实。你可以通过割断胶带的方式将胶带移除。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barricaded plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A makeshift plastic window completely covered over with planks."
msgstr "一个临时制作的塑料窗，上面完全覆盖着木板。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "boarded up plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A makeshift plastic window that has been covered with nailed-down planks, blocking sunlight and visibility.  It's not much stronger, but it could be further reinforced with strategically placed planks."
msgstr "一扇钉满了木板的玻璃窗，挡住了阳光和视线。它并没有太强的防御力，但你可以合理放置更多的木板来进一步加固。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open plastic window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A makeshift plastic window with an open curtain.  It's open and can be crawled through."
msgstr "一扇常见于普通住宅的小窗户。它是开着的，可以爬过去。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A makeshift window composed of a sheet of clear acrylic secured in a wooden frame.  It's open and can be crawled through."
msgstr "一扇简易窗户，由一片半透明的硬质塑料板固定在木制窗框上。只能应付一时之需。它是开着的，可以爬过去。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "high stained glass window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A stone wall with a high window containing breathtaking craftsmanship of stained glass featuring an alluring azure oceanic abyss."
msgstr "一堵石墙，上面有扇制造工艺让人惊叹的彩色玻璃窗，上面表现了如蓝宝石一般深邃的海洋深渊。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "stone wall with high stained glass window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A stone wall with a high window containing breathtaking craftsmanship of stained glass featuring an elegant emerald landscape."
msgstr "一堵石墙，上面有扇制造工艺让人惊叹的彩色玻璃窗，上面表现了如绿宝石一般优雅的田野景色。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "stone wall with high stained glass window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A stone wall with a high window containing breathtaking craftsmanship of stained glass featuring an otherworldly radiant ruby flower blooming."
msgstr "一堵石墙，上面有扇制造工艺让人惊叹的彩色玻璃窗，上面表现了如红宝石一般闪耀的怒放鲜花。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "taped porthole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A thick, round window surrounded with a strong metal frame.  It's sealed closed, and has been blocked out with duct tape."
msgstr "一扇厚厚的圆形窗户，四周用坚固的金属框完全封死。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "porthole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A thick, round window surrounded with a strong metal frame.  It's sealed closed."
msgstr "一扇厚厚的圆形窗户，四周用坚固的金属框完全封死。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barricaded window frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A window completely covered over with planks.  Adding a few spikes and metal plating would further increase its durability."
msgstr "一扇经过多次加固的窗户，木板经过细心摆放，完全遮挡了视线。并加上一些铁刺和金属板可以进一步提高坚固程度。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A wooden window frame filled with shattered glass.  You might get hurt if you crawl through the jagged shards.  You could smash out the remaining pieces, or take your time and quietly remove them."
msgstr "一扇里面塞满了碎玻璃的木制窗框。如果不怕被那些锋利的玻璃碎片划伤的话，可以试着爬过去。你可以用蛮力直接砸掉碎片，或者花点时间安静地把它们取出来。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "empty window frame with closed curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "An empty window frame consisting of planks and nails, with closed curtains.  If you examined the curtains more closely, you could peek through the drapes or tear down everything.  You could install a sheet of glass, or even board it up for protection.  You could also convert it into a wall if you took the time to construct it."
msgstr "一扇由木板和钉子组成的空窗框，上面挂着拉上的窗帘。如果你靠得足够近，可以透过缝隙观察，或者将其撕下。你可以安装一块玻璃，或者用木板封死来加固它。你也可以花点工夫将它建造成一堵墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "empty window frame with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "An empty window frame consisting of planks and nails, with open curtains.  You could install a sheet of glass, or even board it up for protection.  You could also convert it into a wall if you took the time to construct it."
msgstr "一扇由木板和钉子组成的空窗框，窗帘敞开着。你可以安装一块玻璃，或者用木板封死来加固它。你也可以花点工夫将它建造成一堵墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "empty window frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "An empty window frame made of planks and nails.  You could install a sheet of glass, or board it up for protection.  You could also convert it into a solid wall if you took the time to construct it."
msgstr "一扇用木板和钉子制成的空窗框。你可以安装一块玻璃，或者用木板封死来加固它。你也可以花点工夫将它建造成一堵墙。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barred window frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "An empty window frame protected by steel security bars."
msgstr "一个装有钢质防护栏的空窗框。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "boarded up window frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "An empty window frame that has been covered with nailed-down planks, blocking sunlight and visibility.  It's not a very strong barrier, but it could be further reinforced with strategically placed planks."
msgstr "一扇钉满了木板的空窗框，挡住了阳光和视线。它并没有太强的防御力，但你可以合理放置更多的木板来进一步加固。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open window"
#. ~ Description of terrain "open window without curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "An open glass window without any curtains."
msgstr "无帘窗（开）"

#. ~ Description of terrain "taped picture window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "Duct tape covers this glass picture window, blocking sunlight and visibility."
msgstr "强力胶带将整扇窗户封得严严实实，挡住了阳光和视线。你可以通过割断胶带的方式将胶带移除。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "taped picture window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "Duct tape covers this picture window, blocking out any sunlight and visibility. It has a small sticker in one corner, reading 'Protected by AtmoWeb, leading AI in terminating crime'."
msgstr "强力胶带将整扇窗户封得严严实实，挡住了阳光和视线。你可以通过割断胶带的方式将胶带移除。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "armored picture window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "This glass picture window has been fully barricaded with planks and further reinforced with metal plating."
msgstr "这扇玻璃观景窗已经用木板完全封堵起来，并且还用金属板进行了进一步加固。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "armored window"
