#. ~ Description of terrain "rope leading up"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A dangling end of rope, the other end tied securely to something above you.  You could climb up it."
msgstr "绳子的一端悬垂，另一端牢固地绑在你上方的东西上。 你可以爬上它。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "downward slope"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A downward-facing slope."
msgstr "一个向下的斜坡。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A flight of stairs leading down."
msgstr "一段向下的楼梯。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "stairs"
#. ~ Description of terrain "low stairs (beginning section)"
#. ~ Description of terrain "low stairs (end section)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A flight of stairs leading up."
msgstr "一段向上的楼梯。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "manhole cover"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A heavy iron manhole cover, zealously blocking the entrance to a sewer or other underground area.  Impossible to lift by hand, you'll need some kind of heavy-duty prying tool."
msgstr "这是一个沉甸甸的铁井盖，好心挡住了下水道或是其它地下区域的入口。不可能用手掀开，得用些那种重型撬具。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A ladder leading down."
msgstr "向下的梯子。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A ladder leading up and down."
msgstr "向上及下的梯子。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A ladder leading up."
msgstr "往上的梯子。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "manhole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A manhole.  The heavy iron cover has been removed, revealing an entrance to the underworld of hidden tunnels beneath the streets where sewage and rainwater frolic freely.  Or maybe it just leads to a lower floor."
msgstr "这是一个下水井。沉重的铁井盖盖在通往地下排水管道的入口处上，污水雨水在那里肆意横流——也可能通往的不是下水道，只是带你到下一层搂。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A number of planks are missing and the structure is beginning to sag and fall apart.  It's going to need quite a bit of work to repair this staircase."
msgstr "这段木楼梯上的一些木板不见了，整体结构开始倾倒崩裂。修复这段楼梯颇需要一番功夫。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A wooden staircase leading down."
msgstr "一段向下的木楼梯。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A wooden staircase leading up"
msgstr "一段向上的木楼梯。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "upward slope"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "An upward-facing slope."
msgstr "一个向上的斜坡。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built wooden stairs"
