#. ~ Description of terrain "monster teeth"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "A fractal array of uncountable, bristling teeth that seem impossibly sharp, even at a conceptual level.  An iridescent haze surrounds it, as if light itself cannot help but be separated in their presence.  You surmise you could extract some for your own use, if you had an appropriate tool to remove them from the wall they're imbedded in."
msgstr "一堆如分形排列的不计其数，颗颗林立的牙齿，难以置信的锋利，似乎达到了概念的极限。一片色彩斑斓的薄雾将其笼罩，光线似乎也已经跟它融为一体。你猜想，如果使用合适的工具将它们从嵌入的墙上弄下来，你或许可以收集一些供自己使用。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "monster hemolymph"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "A shallow stream of glowing yellow ichor streaks through the beast.  Peering into it, you can see dark shadows moving under the surface."
msgstr "一条充满黄色汁液的浅溪，在缓缓流淌着。仔细端详，你可以发现移动于下方的黑色暗影。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flesh wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "A thick wall of fleshy cartilage.  With the proper tools, you could smash right through it."
msgstr "一堵厚厚的肉墙，部分是软骨。如果有合适的工具，你应该能砸碎它。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "cartilage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "A thin, transparent cartilage webbing."
msgstr "一扇较薄的透明软骨带。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bone wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "An amazingly durable, impregnable wall of bone stands before you, forming the outer shell of the eldritch monster."
msgstr "一面立在你面前的骨墙，坚固牢靠，形成了这诡异怪兽的外壳。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bone floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "An impossibly hard, impregnable bone structure covers the internals of the beast."
msgstr "一种骨质结构，硬度惊人、坚不可摧，铺满了这头怪兽的内侧。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "nether brain"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "An oozing pile of wrinkled, decomposing flesh."
msgstr "一滩皱巴巴的大脑，上面已经腐烂。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "cartilage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "Riiiiip!"
msgstr "喀！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flesh wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "This section of flesh seems hollowed out.  You can see silky, translucent larvae wriggling inside, consuming flesh at a prodigious pace."
msgstr "这一截肉墙有个孔洞。透过洞你看见丝状物缠绕交错、半透明的幼虫在其中蠕动，以惊人的速度进食着血肉。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flesh floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "Walking over the innards of this monstrous beast, you can still feel movement underneath your feet."
msgstr "行走在这头畸形怪兽的内部时，你感觉到脚下有什么东西在动。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flesh wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "Warm to the touch, the tainted flesh of this monstrous being still twitches."
msgstr "随着温暖的触感，你能感觉到扭曲肉墙的感染血肉仍在抽动。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "bone floor"
msgstr "骨地板"

