#. ~ Harvest message
#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/harvest.json data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "<mi-go_harvest>"
msgstr "<mi-go_harvest>"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "As you hack away at the chitinous amalgamation you can't help but follow the tunnel the (male?) dragonfly's tail bore into the flesh of its mate, ending up at a formless amalgamation of eyes, jaws, eggs, and ganglia deep within.  Love truly knows no bounds."
msgstr "当你砍开这只融合怪的身体时，你不得不沿着它（雄性？）尾巴的生殖腔刺进了它配偶的肉里，刀刃最终停在了一团杂乱无章，由数不清的眼睛、下颚、卵和神经节的融合物上。爱真是永无止境。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "What appeared to be insect hairs on the chitin of this creature look more like tiny feathers as you pare them back.  Inside is a bundle of bubble-like tissue sacs that appear to be floating, which doesn't fit with what you know about real bees."
msgstr "在剥皮时，你发现这只生物的甲壳上的附带的昆虫毛发看起来更像是小羽毛。里面是一团气泡状组织构成的气囊，看起来像是漂浮在空中，这与你所知道的真正的蜜蜂解剖结构不符。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You carefully crack open its exoskeleton to get at the flesh beneath."
msgstr "你小心地切开它的外骨骼，好获取下方的肉。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You carefully crack open the hive structure and drain the liquid."
msgstr "你小心地打开蜂巢结构并排出液体。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You crack open its hard shell to get at the flesh beneath."
msgstr "你切开它的外壳，好获取下方的肉。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You gut and fillet the fish."
msgstr "你把鱼掏除内脏并切成片。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You laboriously dissect the colossal insect.  <acidant_harvest>"
msgstr "你费力地解剖了这只体型巨大的昆虫。<acidant_harvest>"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You laboriously hack and dig through the remains of the fungal mass."
msgstr "你费力地砍开并仔细摸索了这只真菌生物的残骸。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You messily hack apart the colossal mass of fused, rancid flesh.  Strangely, some of the meat looks fresh."
msgstr "你胡乱地劈开了那团巨大、腐烂的融合血肉。奇怪的是，其中有些肉看起来还很新鲜。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You messily hack apart the hulking mass of fused, rancid flesh, taking note of anything that stands out."
msgstr "你笨手笨脚地将这一大坨的腐烂肉块砍开，并小心观察是否有什么突出的特殊物品。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You search for any salvageable hardware in what's left of this failed experiment."
msgstr "你尝试从这失败的实验体中搜寻还能再次使用的生化插件。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You search for any salvageable hardware in what's left of this flesh and metal monster.  Much of it is just scrap metal, but some of the electronics look surprisingly intact."
msgstr "你试图在这只半血肉半金属的怪物残骸中寻找任何可回收的生化插件。其中大部分只剩下金属废料，但有些电子元件似乎还完好无损。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest_dissect.json
msgid "The myriad bodies have merged into such a confusing tangle of flesh that it's hard to even tell what you're cutting into."
msgstr "无数尸体已经混杂成一片混乱的肉团，甚至很难分辨你正在切割的是什么。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest_dissect.json
msgid "With cuts and pulls equally similar to both extraction and vandalism, you scrape together the most important parts of the creature."
msgstr "通过既可称为收割或破坏的屠宰拉扯手法，你勉强凑合地屠宰下这只生物最主要的部分。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest_dissect.json
msgid "You search for any salvageable hardware in what's left of the cyborg."
msgstr "你尝试从这可怖的食尸鬼中搜寻还能再次使用的生化插件。"

