#. ~ Description of ".22 FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 30gr FMJ bullet.  The .22LR round is extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  This type is marginally better at piercing through targets, but deals even less damage as a result."
msgstr "30格令的 .22 LR 全金属被甲弹。.22 LR弹的威力极小，射程短，后坐力可忽略不计。这种型号穿透目标的能力稍微强一些，但因此造成的伤害更小。"

#. ~ Description of ".22 LR"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 40gr unjacketed bullet.  The .22LR round is extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  It is most useful for target practice and hunting small animals."
msgstr "40格令的 .22 LR 铅制无被甲弹。.22 LR弹的威力极小，射程短，后坐力可忽略不计。这种型号的最大用处是用于训练枪法以及猎杀小型动物。"

