#. ~ Description of ".22 rat-shot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid "A .22 caliber cartridge loaded with very small pieces of shot contained within a fragmenting plastic capsule.  It has an extremely short range and poor penetration ability, but the spread of shot can hit targets with greater ease."
msgstr "一种.22口径的弹药，将许多小颗粒霰弹装在一个易碎塑料胶囊里。它的射程很短且穿透力很弱，但霰弹的散布更容易命中目标。"

