#. ~ Description of ".38 Super JHP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/38super.json
msgid ".38 Super ammunition with a 115gr JHP bullet.  The .38 Super round was developed from .38 ACP in 1929 to penetrate body armor of the era.  The caliber saw some resurgence in popularity amongst competition shooters in the 1980's prior to the proliferation of double stack 9mm pistols."
msgstr ".38 Super弹药，配备115格令的JHP（软头硬尾）弹头。.38 Super弹药是在1929年从.38 ACP弹药发展而来，旨在穿透当时的防弹衣。在20世纪80年代，双层9毫米手枪大量出现之前，这种口径的弹药在竞技射击爱好者中的受欢迎程度有所回升。"

#. ~ Description of ".38 Super FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/38super.json
msgid ".38 Super ammunition with a 124gr FMJ bullet.  The .38 Super round was developed from .38 ACP in 1929 to penetrate body armor of the era.  The caliber saw some resurgence in popularity amongst competition shooters in the 1980's prior to the proliferation of double stack 9mm pistols."
msgstr ".38 Super弹药，配备124格令的全金属弹头（FMJ）。.38 Super弹药于1929年由.38 ACP发展而来，旨在穿透当时的防弹衣。在20世纪80年代双层9毫米手枪普及之前，这种口径的弹药在竞赛射击者中曾一度再度流行。"

