#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M576 buckshot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid "A 40x46mm buckshot load, designed for use in thick vegetation or room clearing.  Due to the limitations of weapons built to fire 40x46mm grenades, it's much less powerful than you'd expect."
msgstr "一款40x66mm 猎鹿榴弹，用于丛林茂密地形或者是室内作战。由于受限于能发射40x46mm榴弹武器的局限性，它的威力比你想象的要小得多。"

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M433 HEDP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid "A low velocity 40x46mm high explosive dual-purpose grenade.  It can penetrate 2 inches of steel armor, and the fragmentation of the projectile body also makes it suitable for use against infantry."
msgstr "一款低初速的40x46mm HEDP 高爆两用榴弹。它能够击穿2英寸(约5厘米)厚的钢板，而击中目标时产生的大量破片使它也能作为反步兵弹药使用。"

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M651 tear gas"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid "A low velocity 40x46mm tear gas canister.  It is effective for riot control and driving infantry from entrenched positions, and is able to penetrate thin wood."
msgstr "一款低初速的40x46mm催泪瓦斯榴弹。在防暴行动及将敌方步兵驱离防御阵地时十分有效，而且能穿透薄木板。"

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M1006 sponge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid "A low velocity less-lethal 40x46mm round with a foam and plastic projectile intended to cause pain and disorientation to the target.  May still injure or kill."
msgstr "一款低初速低杀伤的40x46mm榴弹，弹头内装着泡沫和塑料弹丸，目的是使得受攻击目标疼痛并迷失方向。但仍可能造成伤害并导致死亡。"

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm .410 scrap nest"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid "A set of four .410 'scrap-shot' shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "一套包含四枚.410“散弹”弹丸和一个装入40毫米适配器的较大手枪底火。通过内部点火组件一次性发射所有四发弹丸，该组件由底火引爆。"

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm .410 hornet's nest"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid "A set of four .410 000 shotshells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "一套包含四枚.410 000霰弹和一枚装入40毫米适配器的霰弹枪大底火。通过内部点火组件一次性发射全部四发子弹，该组件由底火引爆。"

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm .410 bird's nest"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid "A set of four .410 birdshot shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "一套装有4枚.410霰弹和一枚大容量手枪底火的40毫米转接器。通过内部点火组件，底火引爆后，可一次性发射全部四发子弹。"

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm .410 slug's nest"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid "A set of four .410 slug shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "一套包含四枚.410霰弹和一枚装入40毫米适配器的手枪大底火。通过内部击发组件，底火引爆后，可一次性发射全部四发子弹。"

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm .22 LR beehive"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid "A set of ten .22 LR bullets compressed into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all ten rounds simultaneously."
msgstr "十发 .22 LR 弹被装入了一个 40mm 榴弹适配器中。能够将十发子弹同时击发。"

