#. ~ Description of ".45 Colt LFN cowboy"
#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
msgid ".45 Long Colt ammunition with a 250gr lead flat nose bullet.  Originally designed for the Colt Single Action Army, and still used for modern reproduction revolvers.  This ammunition is loaded to be safer in antiques and for cowboy action shooting, and is thus less powerful than other, hotter loads."
msgstr ".45 长柯尔特弹药，配有 250 克铅扁头子弹。  最初为柯尔特单动陆军设计，至今仍用于现代复制左轮手枪。  这种弹药的装载是为了在古董和牛仔动作射击中更安全，因此比其他更热的弹药威力较小。"

#. ~ Description of ".45 Colt +P JHP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
msgid "Jacketed .45 Colt ammunition with a 225gr hollow point bullet, loaded much hotter than regular loads for this cartridge.  Hollowpoints in this venerable caliber were issued by the occasional police department looking for extra lethality before the '97 North Hollywood shootout.  Since then they were mostly used for home defense, and now by the post-apocalyptic cowboy."
msgstr "带有 225 克空心子弹的 0.45 Colt 夹套弹药，其装载温度比该弹药筒的常规装载温度高得多。  在97年北好莱坞枪战之前，警察部门偶尔会发行这种令人尊敬的口径的空心枪，以寻求额外的杀伤力。  从那时起，它们主要用于家庭防御，现在则被后世界末日的牛仔使用。"

#. ~ Description of ".45 Colt JHP, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
msgid "Jacketed .45 Colt ammunition with a 225gr hollow point bullet, loaded much hotter than regular loads for this cartridge.  The resource scarcity of the Cataclysm inspired someone to hand-reload this one with black powder, bringing the round closer to its original incarnation.  It's kind of poetic, when you think about it."
msgstr "带有 225 克空心子弹的 0.45 Colt 夹套弹药，其装载温度比该弹药筒的常规装载温度高得多。  大灾变的资源稀缺激发了有人用黑火药手动重新装填这枚子弹，使这轮子弹更接近其原始形态。  当你想到它时，它有点诗意。"

#. ~ Description of ".45 Colt +P FMJ, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
msgid "Jacketed .45 Long Colt ammunition with a 225gr bullet.  Originally designed for the Colt Single Action Army, and still used for modern reproduction revolvers."
msgstr "带 225 克子弹的 0.45 Long Colt 夹套弹药。  最初为柯尔特单动陆军设计，至今仍用于现代复制左轮手枪。"

#. ~ Description of ".45 Colt FMJ, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
msgid "Jacketed .45 Long Colt ammunition with a 225gr bullet.  Originally designed for the Colt Single Action Army, and still used for modern reproduction revolvers.  The resource scarcity of the Cataclysm inspired someone to hand-reload this one with black powder, bringing the round closer to its original incarnation.  It's kind of poetic, when you think about it."
msgstr "带 225 克子弹的 0.45 Long Colt 夹套弹药。  最初为柯尔特单动陆军设计，至今仍用于现代复制左轮手枪。  大灾变的资源稀缺激发了有人用黑火药手动重新装填这枚子弹，使这轮子弹更接近其原始形态。  当你想到它时，它有点诗意。"

