#: data/json/items/ammo/500.json
msgid ".500 S&W Magnum"
msgid_plural ".500 S&W Magnum"
msgstr[0] ".500 S&W 马格南弹"

#. ~ Description of ".500 S&W Magnum"
#: data/json/items/ammo/500.json
msgid ".500 S&W Magnum ammunition with a 500gr bullet.  The .500 S&W Magnum round is a colossally powerful handgun cartridge capable of killing almost any target with one hit.  It has extremely high damage, and recoil to match."
msgstr "500格令的.500 S&W 马格南弹，这款子弹的威力无比巨大，足以一枪击杀大多数目标，还能让你像西部牛仔那样吹吹枪口冒出来的白烟。但与其恐怖威力为之相对的后坐力也是十分巨大。"

