#. ~ Description of ".50 Beowulf XTP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/50_beowulf.json
msgid ".50-caliber Beowulf ammunition, loaded with a copper-jacketed 350-grain eXtreme Terminal Performance bullet.  Developed in 2001 as a powerful short- to medium-range chambering for AR-15 style rifles, this stout cartridge had gained some popularity as a hunting round before the Cataclysm.  This particular version of the cartridge is coated in a layer of polymer, encouraging commendable terminal ballistics, penetrative capabilities, and overall expansion from its 12.7x42mm projectile."
msgstr ".50口径贝奥武夫弹，装载350格令\"极致终端性能\"铜甲弹头。这种坚固的子弹在2001年被研发用于中短程膛室的AR-15型步枪，在大灾变之前作为狩猎子弹小有名气。这种特殊版本的子弹涂有一层聚合物，给它的12.7x42mm弹头带来了值得称赞的终端弹道、穿透能力和整体膨胀表现。"

#. ~ Description of ".50 Beowulf Xtreme Penetrator"
#: data/json/items/ammo/50_beowulf.json
msgid ".50-caliber Beowulf ammunition, loaded with a solid-copper 420-grain Xtreme Penetrator bullet.  Developed in 2001 as a powerful short- to medium-range chambering for AR-15 style rifles, this stout cartridge had gained some popularity as a hunting round before the Cataclysm.  With a blunt nose construction for better initial energy transfer, this 12.7mm-wide bullet's solid copper design allows it to punch through entry barriers while resulting in a larger wound column."
msgstr ".50 口径贝奥武夫弹药，装有实心铜 420 粒 Xtreme Penetrator 子弹。  这种粗壮的弹药筒于 2001 年开发，作为 AR-15 型步枪的强大短程到中程膛室，在大灾变之前作为狩猎弹而受到一定程度的欢迎。  这款 12.7 毫米宽的子弹采用钝头结构，可实现更好的初始能量转移，其实心铜设计使其能够穿透进入障碍物，同时形成更大的缠绕柱。"

