#. ~ Description of "5.7x28mm SB193"
#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
msgid "A subsonic cartridge derived from the 5.7x28mm, designed for silenced firearms.  It offers good armor penetration at the cost of slightly less damage."
msgstr "5.7x28mm 手枪弹的亚音速衍生版本，供微声武器使用。这种子弹通过稍稍降低威力的改进来获得良好的装甲穿彻性能。"

