msgid_plural "RA119 5x50mm penetrators"
msgstr[0] "5x50mm RA119 穿甲弹"

#. ~ Description of "RA110 5x50mm flechette"
#: data/json/items/ammo/5x50.json
msgid "The Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round is a fin-stabilized steel needle packed into a plastic sabot which breaks apart shortly after the round clears the chamber.  The resulting cartridge is far lighter and produces lower recoil than a conventional round, while the projectile makes up for its low mass with extreme velocity and long range."
msgstr "Rivtech 5x50mm 箭弹是一种装有尾翼稳定钢针的塑料弹托，在子弹穿过弹膛后不久就会破裂。  由此产生的弹药筒比传统弹药要轻得多，产生的后坐力也更低，而弹丸则以极高的速度和远射程弥补了其低质量的缺点。"

#. ~ Description of "5x50mm flechette, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/5x50.json
msgid "The Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round is a fin-stabilized steel needle packed into a plastic sabot which breaks apart shortly after the round clears the chamber.  The resulting cartridge is far lighter and produces lower recoil than a conventional round, while the projectile makes up for its low mass with extreme velocity and long range.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a lucky survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm corporate spy, leading to slightly inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr "180 格令的 10mm Auto 全金属被甲弹。10mm Auto 弹是一款威力强大的手枪弹，也是更加流行的 .40 S&W 弹的前身。这枚弹药应该是由幸存者或大灾变前的业余爱好者手工重新装填的，与工厂生产的弹药相比，性能稍差。"

#. ~ Description of "RA119 5x50mm penetrator"
#: data/json/items/ammo/5x50.json
msgid "The Rivtech 5x50mm penetrator round is a fin-stabilized armor-penetrating tungsten needle packed into a plastic sabot which breaks apart shortly after the round clears the chamber.  The resulting cartridge is far lighter and produces lower recoil than a conventional round, while the projectile makes up for its low mass with extreme velocity and long range."
msgstr "Rivtech 5x50mm 侵彻弹是一种尾翼稳定的穿甲钨针，装在塑料弹托中，在子弹穿过弹膛后不久就会破裂。  由此产生的弹药筒比传统弹药要轻得多，产生的后坐力也更低，而弹丸则以极高的速度和远射程弥补了其低质量的缺点。"

#. ~ Description of "M720A1 60mm mortar shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/60mm.json
msgid "A high explosive cartridge with a tapered nose and fins at the base.  It is designed to be fired from a mortar and used at long range against troops or light vehicles."
msgstr "一种高爆炸药筒，底部有锥形头部和翅片。  它设计用于用迫击炮发射，用于远距离攻击部队或轻型车辆。"

#. ~ Description of "M768 60mm mortar shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/60mm.json
msgid "A high explosive cartridge with a tapered nose and fins at the base.  It is designed to be fired from a mortar and used at long range against troops or light vehicles.  The M768 is a modern update to the older, less effective M720A1."
msgstr "一种高爆炸药筒，底部有锥形头部和翅片。  它设计用于用迫击炮发射，用于远距离攻击部队或轻型车辆。  M768 是对较旧的、效率较低的 M720A1 的现代更新。"

#. ~ Item name
