msgid "An 84x245mm High Explosive Dual Purpose anti-materiel cartridge for the Carl Gustaf M3 and other 84mm recoilless rifles.  Designed to be highly effective against vehicles and structures."
msgstr "84x245mm 高爆双用途反器材弹药筒，适用于 Carl Gustaf M3 和其他 84mm 无后坐力步枪。  旨在对车辆和结构高效有效。"

#. ~ Description of "84x245mm HE"
#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
msgid "An 84x245mm High Explosive anti-personnel cartridge for the Carl Gustaf M3 and other 84mm recoilless rifles.  Designed to be highly effective against personnel."
msgstr "适用于卡尔·古斯塔夫 M3 和其他 84 毫米无后坐力步枪的 84x245 毫米高爆杀伤人员弹药筒。  旨在对人员非常有效。"

#. ~ Description of "84x245mm smoke"
#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
msgid "An 84x245mm smoke marker cartridge for the Carl Gustaf M3 and other 84mm recoilless rifles.  Commonly used for signaling, target designation, and for screening troop movements."
msgstr "适用于 Carl Gustaf M3 和其他 84 毫米无后坐力步枪的 84x245 毫米烟雾标记弹。  通常用于发出信号、指定目标和筛选部队行动。"

