#. ~ Description of "shotgun beanbag"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A beanbag round for shotguns.  Designated 'less-lethal' and intended to disable, but remember that 'less-lethal' does not mean 'non-lethal'."
msgstr "一枚霰弹枪使用的防暴霰弹。宣称\"低致命性\"并旨在使目标瘫痪，但请记住，\"低致命性\"并不意味着\"非致命性\"。"

