msgid "A heavy metal slug used to give a shotgun the range capabilities of a rifle.  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate."
msgstr "一种沉重的金属独头霰弹，装填在霰弹枪里使其拥有步枪般的射程，威力极大但精准度不高。"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A mass of lightweight pellets packed into a double ought shell.  While still lethal at point blank, the cartridge is intended for hunting birds, trading damage for an increased chance of scoring a hit on the wing."
msgstr "大量轻质颗粒装入双层外壳中。  虽然在空战时仍具有致命性，但该弹药筒是用于狩猎鸟类，以伤害换取击中机翼的机会增加。"

#. ~ Description of "wax slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A round of 12 gauge birdshot that has had the crimp opened and wax poured in.  This binds the pellets together, allowing them to stay wadded together in flight and behave more like a slug, though without quite the same ballistic performance."
msgstr "一轮 12 号鸟弹，其卷边打开并倒入蜡。这将弹丸粘合在一起，使它们在飞行中保持团团在一起，并且表现得更像鼻涕虫，尽管没有完全相同的弹道性能。"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread makes it very accurate at short range.  Favored by SWAT forces."
msgstr "一种填满了金属圆珠的弹药，威力极强，同时由于这种弹药的散射特性，使其在近距离射击时的命中率很高，因此深受SWAT部队的喜爱。"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, reloaded"
#. ~ Description of "00 shot, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread makes it very accurate at short range.  SWAT forces wouldn't use this homebrew shell, but a sovereign citizen looking to fend off SWAT probably would."
msgstr "一种填满了金属圆珠的霰弹，威力极强，同时由于这种弹药的散射特性，使其在近距离射击时的命中率很高，SWAT部队也许不会使用这枚手工复装弹的弹药，但是对抗SWAT特警的觉醒公民也许会选择使用它。"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A shotgun shell filled with black gunpowder and whatever scrap metal was lying around.  The logical conclusion of ammunition bootlegging.  It'll kill zombies just fine, but your gun will suffer for it."
msgstr "一种塞进了各种金属废料的霰弹，弹丸材料完全因地制宜。自然是某人自制的弹药。它可以很好地杀死丧尸，但你的枪肯定也不好受。"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything in their path."
msgstr "一种填充镁颗粒或碎片的霰弹枪弹，主要用作紧急求救信号弹或者起火工具。当该弹药发射时，枪管会射出高温火花和火焰，点燃其路径上的一切。"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell, reloaded"
#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything in their path.  This one was made in somebody's garage.  Are you sure you want to shoot this?"
msgstr "一种填充镁颗粒或碎片的霰弹枪弹，主要用作紧急求救信号弹或者起火工具。当该弹药发射时，枪管会射出高温火花和火焰，点燃其路径上的一切。这个某个人手工复装弹型号。你确定要用这个吗？"

#. ~ Description of "flechette shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  The spread makes it very accurate at short range, but the ballistic performance of the unstabilized flechettes is poor, especially against armor."
msgstr "一种填充微型钢镖的霰弹。由于这种弹药的散射特性，使其在近距离射击时的命中率很高。"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A shotgun shell filled with whatever scrap metal was lying around.  More damaging than birdshot, but fairly inaccurate."
msgstr "一种塞进了各种金属废料的霰弹，弹丸材料完全因地制宜。威力比猎鸟弹稍微强点，就是不太准。"

#. ~ Description of "explosive slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "A shotgun shell shooting a small explosive.  Banned in several states.  While an explosive from a shotgun sounds impressive, its practical applications are limited at best.  The loss in mass in order to accommodate an explosive give it much less impact force compared to traditional ammunition.  The relatively small size of the slug can only accommodate a limited amount of explosives, resulting in a fairly underwhelming explosion.  These traits make it a utility tool for damaging barriers and disrupting other explosive devices, rather than something for anti-personnel use."
msgstr "一种发射小型爆炸弹头的霰弹。在数个州被禁用。虽然能爆炸的霰弹听起来很强，但其实际应用场景十分有限。与传统弹药相比，为了容纳炸药而损失的弹头质量使其产生的冲击力要小得多，而弹头相对较小的尺寸只能容纳十分有限的炸药，导致爆炸强度相当低。这些特点使其成为破障和干扰其他爆炸装置的实用工具，而非用于杀伤人员。"

