#. ~ Description of "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "A bottle of flammable liquid with a long fuse inserted, ready to be used in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, use it light the fuse.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your inventory to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr "一瓶塞着一块长长引线的易燃液体，随时可以使用带有改进托架的弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用该物品将点燃它，当然你需要口袋里有打火机或火柴来点燃它。点燃后投掷会引发大火。"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready improvised grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "A grenade made from explosives sealed inside a metal canister, modified with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一枚由金属罐封装爆炸物制成的榴弹，加装了固定引信，可用于带有改装托架的投石杖发射。若想不借助投石杖投掷此物，请使用它以折断引信并激活榴弹。随后你将有5秒时间，把它扔出去会是个好主意。"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready small improvised grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "A grenade made from explosives sealed inside a small metal canister, modified with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling.  To throw this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一枚由小型金属罐封装爆炸物制成的榴弹，加装了固定引信，可用于投石杖发射。若想不借助投石杖投掷此物，请使用它以折断引信并激活榴弹。随后你将有5秒时间，把它扔出去会是个好主意。"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready improvised HE grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "A grenade made from high explosive sealed inside a metal canister, modified with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have some amount of time before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一枚由金属罐封装高爆炸药制成的榴弹，加装了固定引信，可用于带有改装托架的投石杖发射。若想不借助投石杖投掷此物，请使用它以折断引信并激活榴弹。随后你将有一定时间余裕，把它扔出去会是个好主意。"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "A military-grade fragmentary hand grenade, modified with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have five seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一个军用破片手雷，随时可以使用带有改进托架的弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用此物品以拔掉插销，之后你有五秒钟的时间将它投掷出去。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready grenade"
