#. ~ Description of "diesel generator"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
msgid "A bulky generator typically used to power job sites.  Once set up and plugged in, it will provide power by burning diesel, kerosene, or other compatible fuels."
msgstr "通常用于为作业现场供电的大型发电机。  一旦安装并插入电源，它将通过燃烧柴油、煤油或其他兼容燃料提供电力。"

#. ~ Description of "portable gas-powered generator"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
msgid "A small gas-powered generator.  It just needs to be plugged in, filled up, and turned on."
msgstr "小型燃气发电机。  只需要插入电源、充满电并打开即可。"

#. ~ Description of "gas-powered generator"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
msgid "This 12,000 watt gasoline generator should provide enough energy to power an entire home."
msgstr "这台 12,000 瓦的汽油发电机应该可以提供足够的能量来为整个家庭供电。"

#. ~ Description of "display fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A big glass chamber, designed to display different food in a multiple rows, while cooling it at the same time.  While you might not need to actually display any of your food, it cools the food as good as any another fridge.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "一个大玻璃室，设计用于多排展示不同的食物，同时冷却它。  虽然您可能不需要实际展示任何食物，但它可以像任何其他冰箱一样冷却食物。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "chest minifreezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A compact version of a chest freezer, designed as a mobile solution for freezing food, but it's pretty tricky to pull anything out from the bottom.  Perfect choice to put in your closet and forget for a year.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "卧式冷冻柜的紧凑型，设计用于冷冻食物的移动解决方案，但从底部取出任何东西是相当棘手的。  完美的选择，可以放在衣柜里，让你忘记一年。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "minifreezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A compact version of an upright freezer, designed as a mobile solution for freezing food.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "一台结构紧凑的车载冰柜，设计用于运输各种需要冰冻的食物。能够隔热，减少外界气温的影响。"

#. ~ Description of "display freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A disconnected commercial chest freezer with a glass lid.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "带玻璃盖的断开式商用卧式冷冻柜。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "glass door freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A disconnected commercial freezer with a glass door, used to present different frozen goods.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "带玻璃门的断开式商用冰柜，用于展示不同的冷冻食品。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "single glass door fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A disconnected commercial refrigerator with a transparent glass door, designed to show off any cold drinks and similar goods in a grocery store while still keeping them cool.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "带有透明玻璃门的断开式商用冰箱，旨在展示杂货店中的任何冷饮和类似商品，同时仍保持凉爽。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "double glass door fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A disconnected commercial refrigerator with two transparent glass doors, designed to show off any cold drinks and similar goods in a grocery store while still keeping them cool.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "带有两个透明玻璃门的断开式商用冰箱，旨在展示杂货店中的任何冷饮和类似商品，同时仍保持凉爽。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A disconnected commercial refrigerator, used in many professional kitchens.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "一种断开式商用冰箱，用于许多专业厨房。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "household freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A disconnected household freezer.  Great choice if you need to freeze some discount meat.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "断开连接的家用冰柜。  如果您需要冷冻一些折扣肉，这是一个不错的选择。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "household fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A disconnected household refrigerator.  General choice to store some perishables for an average family.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "断开连接的家用冰箱。  对于普通家庭来说，存储一些易腐烂物品的一般选择。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "minifridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A disconnected minifridge, similar to ones in some luxury limousines.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "一个断开连接的迷你冰箱，类似于一些豪华轿车上的迷你冰箱。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A heavy-duty upright freezer.  Big as a closet, heavy as a tank, can probably fit enough meat to feed a little colony for a week, but consumes power like no other.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "重型立式冰箱。  像壁橱一样大，像坦克一样重，可能可以容纳足够的肉来喂养一个小群体一周，但消耗的电力却无与伦比。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Description of "chest freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "A hefty chest freezer, designed to store plenty of perishables for less power than a standing unit.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "大型卧式冷冻柜，旨在存储大量易腐物品，且比立式冷冻柜的功耗更低。  激活以部署并连接到您的电网。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "household freezer"
msgid_plural "household freezers"
msgstr[0] "家用热水器"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "household fridge"
msgid_plural "household fridges"
msgstr[0] "家用冰箱"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Temporal Distortion"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "A slight temporal distortion appears to be centered around you"
msgstr "轻微的时间扭曲似乎以您为中心"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "artifact_teleportitis_aura"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "Strange Pressure"
msgstr "奇怪的压力"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "artifact_slow_aura"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "Temporal Distortion"
msgstr "时间扭曲"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Strange Pressure"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "You feel a strange force pressing you inwards and inside-out"
msgstr "你感到一股奇怪的力量将你向内、由内而外地压着"

#. ~ Description of "large belt loop"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching large tools and weapons to a load-bearing vest."
msgstr "一个 MOLLE 兼容的环，用于将大型工具和武器连接到承重背心上。"

#. ~ Description of "small belt loop"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching small tools to a load-bearing vest."
msgstr "一个 MOLLE 兼容的环，用于将小工具连接到承重背心上。"

#. ~ Description of "medium belt loop"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching tools and some weapons to a load-bearing vest."
msgstr "一个 MOLLE 兼容的环，用于将工具和一些武器连接到承重背心上。"

#. ~ Description of "triple stacker ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A collection of 6 pockets, 3 wide and 2 deep, designed to hold rifle magazines and keep them accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a vest or can be strapped directly to your chest."
msgstr "一个六联弹药袋，宽三列深两排，用来保证步枪弹匣的可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#. ~ Description of "ammo satchel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A fabric ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a single large magazine close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在腰上的弹匣包。可装一个大型弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#. ~ Description of "chest ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your chest and hold a single magazine close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在胸口上的弹匣包。可装一个弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#. ~ Description of "leg ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your leg and hold two magazines close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在腿上的弹匣包，能够装下两个弹匣，保证弹药随手取用。"

#. ~ Description of "large quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A large leather quiver trimmed with metal, worn on the back, that can hold a large amount of arrows or crossbow bolts.  It's even long enough for atlatl or fishing spears."
msgstr "一个佩戴在后背、可容纳60支箭的皮革大箭筒，有着金属镶边。使用它以存储箭矢或弩矢。"

#. ~ Description of "large pipe quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A large makeshift quiver fashioned from 3 pipes, worn on the back.  Heavier and thinner than a typical large quiver, it can't hold as many arrows, though it's still long enough for fishing or atlatl spears."
msgstr "由 3 根管子制成的大型临时箭袋，戴在背上。  它比典型的大箭袋更重、更薄，虽然它的长度仍然足够用于钓鱼或使用atlatl矛，但它不能容纳那么多的箭。"

#. ~ Description of "gas mask pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A large pouch capable of holding a gas mask and an additional filter, keeping both accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为防毒面具和额外的过滤器而设计的大口袋，保证其可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#. ~ Description of "large birchbark quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A large quiver woven from strips of birchbark, worn on the back, that can hold a large number of arrows or crossbow bolts.  It's long enough to also store atlatl and fishing spears."
msgstr "一个佩带在后背、可容纳60支箭的桦树皮大箭筒。使用它以存储箭支或弩矢。"

#. ~ Description of "leather chest ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A leather ammo pouch that can be strapped to your chest and hold a single magazine close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在胸口上的皮革弹匣包。可装一个弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#. ~ Description of "quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A leather quiver worn at the waist that can hold twelve arrows or fifteen bolts."
msgstr "一个可佩戴在腰部、可容纳20支箭的皮革箭筒。使用它以存储箭支或弩矢。"

#. ~ Description of "nylon quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A lighter and more durable quiver made of nylon, with straps to attach to a MOLLE system."
msgstr "由尼龙制成的更轻、更耐用的箭筒，可安装到MOLLE系统上。"

#. ~ Description of "tactical tool pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A low profile pouch designed to keep your tools accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a vest or can be strapped directly to your chest."
msgstr "一个专为工具而设计的小口袋，保证其可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#. ~ Description of "simple cloth quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A makeshift back-worn quiver jury-rigged out of fabric too soft to really do the job well.  It can't hold as many arrows as a proper large quiver, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr "一个用过软的织物临时凑合而成的背负式箭筒。虽然它无法像专业的箭筒那样装载大量箭矢，但总比没有好。"

#. ~ Description of "pipe quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A makeshift quiver fashioned from sections of pipe strapped together and worn at the waist.  Heavier and thinner than a typical quiver, it can only hold six arrows or eight bolts."
msgstr "一个由数段管道捆扎而成、系在腰间的简易箭袋。它比普通箭袋更重也更薄，只能容纳六支箭或八支弩箭。"

#. ~ Description of "H2O pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A pouch designed to hold a water bottle with an additional front tactical pocket.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个设计用来装水瓶的口袋，前面还有个战术口袋。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#. ~ Description of "tactical grenade pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A pouch designed to hold one hand grenade, keeping it both accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个设计用来装一枚手榴弹的袋，既能方便取用，也能稳妥固定。配有MOLLE绑带，可挂于腰带或战术背心上。"

#. ~ Description of "tactical shotshell pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A pouch designed to hold shotgun shells or .308 rounds, keeping them accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为霰弹和.308弹而设计的口袋，保证其可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#. ~ Description of "gadget pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A pouch designed to keep gadgets and small items accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为小型物品的可及性和安全性而设计的口袋。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#. ~ Description of "canteen pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A pouch designed to keep your canteen accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为水壶的可及性和安全性而设计的口袋。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#. ~ Description of "tactical radio pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A pouch designed to keep your radio accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为无线电的可及性和安全性而设计的口袋。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A quiver woven from strips of birch bark, worn at the waist."
msgstr "一个可佩戴在腰部、可容纳20支箭的桦树皮箭筒。使用它以存储箭支或弩矢。"

#. ~ Description of "ankle ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A small fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your ankle and hold a single small magazine.  It's a bit awkward to use."
msgstr "一个绑在脚踝上的弹匣包。可装一个小型弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#. ~ Description of "ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A small pouch that can be used to store most types of small ammunition; rockets, however, will not fit.  Use insert to store ammunition."
msgstr "一个小袋子，可以用来存储大多数的小型弹药，但是装不下火箭弹。使用它来存储弹药。"

#. ~ Description of "multi-function quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A specialized quiver with a bag and straps to store a takedown bow as well as a small pouch for archery accessories, perfect for a bowhunter on the go."
msgstr "一个可以轻易存放16支箭的大号棉制箭筒。它有个口袋和绑带，可以装下一把可拆卸的弓，还有个用来装弓箭配件的小口袋。使用它来存储弓箭或弩矢，激活它来收拔弓。"

#. ~ Description of "tactical holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A sturdy holster designed to be worn vertically, to keep a small profile on a tactical vest.  This makes it a little more awkward to draw from than a normal holster."
msgstr "一个结实的枪套，设计成垂直佩戴以便在战术背心上占据较小空间。这使得它比普通枪套更难拔出。"

#. ~ Description of "leather ammo satchel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A sturdy leather ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a single large magazine close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在腰上的皮革弹匣包。可装一个大型弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#. ~ Description of "flashlight pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A tiny pouch designed to keep your flashlight accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为手电筒而设计的小口袋，保证其可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#. ~ Description of "javelin bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "An deep leather bag with a wide mouth, designed to store javelins within easy reach."
msgstr "一个开口的中世纪款式标枪包，易于存取标枪。"

#. ~ Description of "denim quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "An improvised back-worn quiver that can hold a small number of arrows.  The material isn't ideal for the job, but it's better than plain cotton."
msgstr "一个简易的背负式箭筒，可以容纳少量的箭矢。虽然这种材质并不太理想，但总比纯棉的好。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "breacher load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "Breaching shotgun magnets."
msgstr "破门霰弹枪磁铁"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "H2O pouch"
msgid_plural "H2O pouches"
msgstr[0] "战术水袋"

#. ~ Description of "chest rig"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "Popularized during the Vietnam War, chest rigs like these are typically plain, barebones affairs consisting of three or more pouches in a row, with straps to secure them on your chest.  This one can hold four magazines in its pouches."
msgstr "这是一种在越南战争期间开始流行的携行具。这种携行具都很朴素，通常是由三个或以上的袋子组成的简单装备，用带子固定在你的胸前。这个携行具能容纳四个弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "load bearing vest with sling"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "heavy load bearing vest with sling"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "breacher load bearing vest"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survivor harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/utility.json
msgid "Rifle sling."
msgstr "步枪背带"

