msgid "Stash item"
msgstr "存入物品"

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "javelin bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "Stash javelins"
msgstr "存储标枪"

#. ~ Description of "tac vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "This light vest is meant to carry your magazines, shells and pistols.  They are popular amongst law enforcement, but less so than combination tactical vests incorporating Kevlar."
msgstr "这款轻便的背心可以让你携带弹匣，霰弹及手枪。它们很受执法部门的欢迎，但不如加入了凯夫拉纤维的战术背心。"

#. ~ Description of "light load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "This lightweight harness covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a few pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be easily separated."
msgstr "一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的轻型背带，设计用来安装些小口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be easily separated."
msgstr "一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的重型背带，设计用来安装大量口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy load bearing vest with sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be easily separated.  This one has a single point sling wrapped around the shoulders using a system to keep your weapon extra secure."
msgstr "一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的重型背带，设计用来安装大量口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离。这个型号有个穿在肩上的单点背带，附带系统能够保证挂在上面的武器更加稳固。"

#. ~ Description of "breacher load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  This one has a single point sling wrapped around the shoulders using a system to keep your weapon extra secure, as well as a set of strong magnets attached to the torso and waist to hold a breaching shotgun."
msgstr "一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的重型背带，设计用来安装大量口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。这个型号有个穿在肩上的单点背带，附带系统能够保证挂在上面的武器更加稳固，以及一套安装在躯干和腰部的强力磁铁，可以吸住一把破门霰弹枪。"

#. ~ Description of "load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "This vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be easily separated."
msgstr "一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的背带，设计用来安装些口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离。"

#. ~ Description of "load bearing vest with sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "This vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be easily separated.  This one has a single point sling wrapped around the shoulders using a system to keep your weapon extra secure."
msgstr "一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的背带，设计用来安装些口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离。这个型号有个穿在肩上的单点背带，附带系统能够保证挂在上面的武器更加稳固。"

