#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A long, stretchy pair of Kevlar sleeves with thumbholes.  These were often used by loggers and landscapers for protection from thorns and chainsaw accidents."
msgstr "长长的弹性凯夫拉纤维袖子，带有拇指孔。  伐木者和园艺师经常使用它们来防止荆棘和电锯事故。"

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of arm guards crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr "一对由经过精心清理并裁剪过的酸蚁硅化甲壳制成的护臂，防酸但很脆弱。"

#. ~ Description of "chitin arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of arm guards made from the exoskeletons of insects.  Light and durable."
msgstr "一对由昆虫甲壳制成的护臂，轻便耐用。"

#. ~ Description of "tire arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of arm guards made from thick chunks of tire secured by simple strings; the loose collection of rubber plates provides decent but not the most convenient protection."
msgstr "一套用轮胎片做成的护臂，碎片之间用小绳子固定。这些松垮的橡胶小片片能提供不错的防护，但是还不够完美。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of bronze bracers with a simple leather lining."
msgstr "一对有着简易皮内衬的青铜护臂。"

#. ~ Description of "elbow pads"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of elbow pads made of stout plastic and spandex."
msgstr "一对由坚固的塑料和氨纶制成的护肘。"

#. ~ Description of "2-by-arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of improvised arm guards made from broken pieces of a plank that are tied to your arms with rags and string.  They offer good protection, but are really uncomfortable to wear."
msgstr ""
"一对用布条绑上了木板的强化双臂护手，能够提供良好的防护，但穿起来很累赘。\n"
"\"看起来和骨折用的夹板没什么区别，但是请遵医嘱。\""

#. ~ Description of "leather vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of light leather bracers, often used in archery."
msgstr "一对轻皮革护臂，用于射箭。"

#. ~ Description of "hard arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of neoprene arm sleeves covered with molded plastic sheaths."
msgstr "一双氯丁橡胶护臂，外面套了一个模具成形的塑料外壳，能承受更多伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "neoprene arm sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of soft neoprene arm sleeves.  Often used in contact sports."
msgstr "一对柔软的橡胶护臂，身体接触较多的运动员经常穿戴它以防止运动损伤。"

#. ~ Description of "leather arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A set of tough leather braces and poleyns that provide protection against blades and teeth alike."
msgstr "一套坚韧的皮革牙套和牙套，可针对刀片和牙齿提供保护。"

#. ~ Description of "paper vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Bracers made of stacked sheets of paper held together with duct tape."
msgstr ""
"一对将许多纸张叠在一起，然后用胶带粘牢的纸护臂。\n"
"\"书籍是人类防御的装备 —— 高尔基\""

#. ~ Description of "plate pauldrons"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Domed steel plates that strap down over the shoulders, offering solid protection at the cost of mobility."
msgstr "圆顶形钢板固定在肩膀上，以牺牲一定的活动性为代价，提供坚实的保护。"

#. ~ Description of "riot bracers"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Hard forearm guards used by riot police."
msgstr "防暴警察使用的硬质护臂。"

#. ~ Description of "tire bracers"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Improvised forearm guards made of thick chunks of tire held together with duct tape."
msgstr "一对将许多块轮胎片叠在一起，然后用胶带粘牢的护臂。"

#. ~ Description of "sheet metal bracers"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Leather bracers with sheet metal affixed over them, perfect for a metal concert at the end of the world."
msgstr "皮革护腕上贴有金属板，非常适合世界末日的金属音乐会。"

