#. ~ Description of "quilted sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Medieval cloth armor for the arms consisting of a pair of quilted sleeves stuffed with batting.  Adjustable ties along their length allow them to be worn under or over other gear.  Activate to change thier fit."
msgstr "中世纪的手臂布甲，由一对填充有棉絮的绗缝袖子组成。  长度可调节的系带让它们可以穿在其他装备下面或上面。  激活以改变他们的配合。"

#. ~ Description of "plate arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Overlapping steel plates which strap to the upper and lower arms.  They don't cover the shoulders."
msgstr "搭接的钢板固定在上臂和下臂上。它们不覆盖肩膀。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Protective sleeves made of interlocking links of low-quality steel wire.  The fit can be adjusted to allow them to serve as outerwear."
msgstr "保护套由低品质钢丝互锁环制成。  可以调整合身性，使其可以用作外套。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Protective sleeves made of interlocking links of steel wire.  The fit can be adjusted to allow them to serve as outerwear."
msgstr "保护套由钢丝互锁环制成。  可以调整合身性，使其可以用作外套。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail sleeves (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Protective sleeves made of interlocking links of steel wire.  The fit can be adjusted to fit closer to the body."
msgstr "保护套由钢丝互锁环制成。  可以调整贴合度以更贴合身体。"

#. ~ Description of "leather pauldrons"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Shoulder guards made of thick leather.  They're a little restrictive, but provide important protection."
msgstr "厚皮制的肩甲。虽略微影响活动灵活性，但能提供关键的防护。"

#. ~ Description of "carpet bracers"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Small squares of carpet rolled around your lower arms.  The bare minimum to hopefully stop a bite or two."
msgstr "可以包裹住你下臂的小块地毯。希望它至少能抗上丧尸们的一两口咬伤吧。"

#. ~ Description of "carpet arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Small squares of carpet rolled around your upper and lower arms.  Armor of the truly desperate or crafty."
msgstr "裹住上臂和手肘的小张地毯。身处绝望时灵光乍现制作的防具。"

#. ~ Description of "cloth-padded sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "The sleeves of a thick shirt, with a bunch of cloth sewn in to act as extra padding."
msgstr "一对厚棉衬衫袖子，缝上了一束布料提供额外保护。只有袖套，没有和衬衫连在一起。"

