#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "Front and back nylon armor with soft armor inserts for groin and butt protection.  Specifically designed to be attached to a heavy plate carrier."
msgstr "前后尼龙装甲带有软装甲插入物，可保护腹股沟和臀部。  专门设计用于连接到重型板载体。"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic collar"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "Front and back nylon collar assemblies with soft armor inserts for neck protection.  Specifically designed to be attached to a heavy plate carrier."
msgstr "前后尼龙项圈组件带有软铠插件，可保护颈部。  专门设计用于连接到重型板载体。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy plate carrier"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "Heavy-duty ballistic armor used by the US Army, known as the IOTV.  This vest has pockets on the front, back, and sides for armor plates; additional protection for the lower back; and attachment points for optional shoulder, groin, and neck protection."
msgstr "美国陆军使用的重型弹道装甲，称为 IOTV。  这件背心的正面、背面和侧面都有用于放置装甲板的口袋；对下背部的额外保护；以及用于可选肩部、腹股沟和颈部保护的连接点。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "half plate carrier"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "Low-profile magazine storage."
msgstr "轻薄弹匣袋"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic shoulder protectors"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "Nylon pads with bulky armor inserts protecting the deltoid and upper arm.  Specifically designed to be attached to a heavy plate carrier."
msgstr "尼龙垫带有笨重的装甲插入物，可保护三角肌和上臂。  专门设计用于连接到重型板载体。"

