#. ~ Description of "fiberglass ballistic plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "Several layers of woven fiberglass stacked and laminated together with epoxy to form an armor plate for a giant's torso.  In a pinch, this could be used in an oversized plate carrier to provide a modicum of protection."
msgstr "数层玻璃纤维布用环氧树脂粘合压制而成，形成一块用于巨人躯干的装甲板。在紧急情况下，它可以装入超大号载板背心，提供些许防护。"

#. ~ Description of "fiberglass ballistic plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "Several layers of woven fiberglass stacked and laminated together with epoxy to form an armor plate for the torso.  In a pinch, this could be used in a plate carrier to provide a modicum of protection."
msgstr "多层编织玻璃纤维与环氧树脂堆叠并层压在一起，形成躯干的装甲板。  在紧要关头，这可以用在板载体中以提供一定程度的保护。"

#. ~ Description of "fiberglass ballistic side plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "Several layers of woven fiberglass stacked and laminated together with epoxy to form an armor plate shaped for the side of the torso.  In a pinch, this could be used in a plate carrier to provide a modicum of protection."
msgstr "多层编织玻璃纤维与环氧树脂堆叠并层压在一起，形成适合躯干侧面形状的装甲板。  在紧要关头，这可以用在板载体中以提供一定程度的保护。"

