#. ~ Description of "40mm ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid "A pouch consisting of four sleeves sized specifically for grenade launcher ammunition.  Nylon loops across the back allow it to be attached to MOLLE webbing."
msgstr "一个设有四个专用插槽的袋，尺寸恰好适配榴弹发射器弹药。背面带有尼龙环，可挂载于MOLLE织带上。"

#. ~ Description of "large grenade pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid "A pouch with individual sleeves for holding up to four hand grenades, with straps for attaching it to your belt or other webbing."
msgstr "一个设有独立插槽的袋，可容纳最多四枚手榴弹，配有绑带可挂于腰带或其他织带上。"

#. ~ Description of "military 5.56 bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid "A simple bag on a strap, partitioned into pouches for four STANAG 30-round magazines or twelve 10-round 5.56x45mm stripper clips.  When full, this bandolier is more encumbering than proper kit and slower to reload from, but it at least offers a quick and cheap means of resupplying ammunition."
msgstr "入门级的弹挂，分为4个口袋，总共可以装下4个30发STANAG弹匣或是12个10发5.56x45mm弹夹。装满时比专用装备更累赘且不易取用。但它至少能为你提供便捷廉价的弹药供应。"

#. ~ Description of "wrist bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid "A small fabric bandolier for rifle cartridges, designed to be worn around the wrist."
msgstr "一个小型子弹带，保证步枪子弹随手可得。设计穿在手腕上。"

#. ~ Description of "pistol bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
