#. ~ Description of "MOLLE webbing belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid "A 2-inch nylon webbing belt commonly used by military forces.  MOLLE-compatible pouches can be attached to the webbing for extra storage."
msgstr "一条2英寸(约5厘米)宽的尼龙编织腰带，常被军队使用。MOLLE兼容的口袋可以安装在腰带上，以增加存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "police duty belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid "A black leather belt used by police officers.  It has several pouches and a holder for a baton."
msgstr "一条警察佩戴的黑色皮带。它上面有几个袋子和一个警棍的插销。"

