#. ~ Description of "leather belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid "A leather belt.  Designed to look good and hold up a pair of pants, but you should be able to attach a small tool or weapon to one of the belt loops."
msgstr "一条皮革腰带。款式好看，可以兜起一条裤子，但你应该能将一个小型工具或武器安装在腰带环上。"

#. ~ Description of "suspenders"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid "A pair of black suspenders, which reach over the wearer's shoulders and hook to their waist.  Gives a wonderful western feel!"
msgstr "一条黑色吊带，可以绕过穿戴者的肩膀，扣在腰上。给人一种美妙的西部片感觉！"

#. ~ Description of "holster suspenders"
