#. ~ Description of "survivor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
msgid "Body armor handmade from a durable coverall with quilted Kevlar lining and a rubberized coating.  It provides good all-around protection from many of the hazards of the Cataclysm."
msgstr "防弹衣采用耐用的连体服手工制成，配有绗缝凯夫拉尔衬里和橡胶涂层。  它提供了良好的全方位保护，抵御大灾变的许多危险。"

#. ~ Description of "light survivor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
msgid "Body armor handmade from a durable coverall with quilted Kevlar lining.  It's tough and chemical-resistant, but not waterproofed and it likely won't stand up to gunfire."
msgstr "防弹衣采用耐用的连体服手工制成，配有绗缝凯夫拉纤维衬里。  它坚固且耐化学腐蚀，但不防水，而且可能无法承受枪火。"

#. ~ Description of "survivor firesuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
msgid "Handcrafted armor made from a flame-resistant jumpsuit with additional Kevlar padding and strategically placed butyl rubber coating.  It protects from brief exposure to flames as well as many other Cataclysmic hazards, though additional armor will be needed to stop bullets."
msgstr "手工制作的盔甲，由阻燃连身裤制成，带有额外的凯夫拉尔衬垫和精心布置的丁基橡胶涂层。  它可以防止短暂暴露于火焰以及许多其他灾难性危险，但需要额外的装甲来阻挡子弹。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
msgid "light survivor suit"
msgid_plural "light survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者套装（轻型）"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
msgid "survivor firesuit"
msgid_plural "survivor firesuits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者套装（防火）"

