#. ~ Description of "plastic cephalopod sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A bunch of slender tubes of plastic sheeting.  These could be used to keep the many arms of a cephalopod reasonably safe from environmental hazards."
msgstr "一些用塑料薄膜卷成的细管子。可以用来包裹头足类动物的多条触手，避免它们受到外界环境的伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "cephalopod socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A collection of thigh socks sewn too slender for human legs, but ideal for keeping the many arms of a cephalopod warm."
msgstr "一套缝制得过细的长筒袜，不适合人类腿部，但非常适合为头足类生物的众多腕足保暖。"

#. ~ Description of "steel-toed sneakers"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A descendant of the classic steeltoed boot, this modern footwear has become popular amongst working class people over the last couple of decades."
msgstr "作为经典钢头靴的后代产物，过去几十年中，这种现代运动鞋在工人大众中广受欢迎。"

#. ~ Description of "geta"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of Japanese clogs consisting of solid wooden soles and toe straps to hold them on."
msgstr "一双日本木屐，由实心木底和固定用的脚趾带组成。"

#. ~ Description of "chitin sollerets"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of bizarre-looking boot covers made from overlapping layers of giant arthropod shell."
msgstr "一对看起来怪异的靴子套，由重叠的巨型节肢动物外壳层制成。"

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin sollerets"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of bizarre-looking boot covers made from overlapping layers of giant arthropod shell.  The material seems unusually hard, with an almost glassy sheen."
msgstr "一对看起来怪异的靴子套，由重叠的巨型节肢动物外壳层制成。  这种材料看起来异常坚硬，几乎带有玻璃般的光泽。"

#. ~ Description of "tabi"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of black tabi, as worn with traditional Japanese clothes."
msgstr "一双黑色分趾袜，常与传统日式服饰搭配穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "bag socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of disposable plastic bags, adapted to be used as socks."
msgstr "一对用可回收塑料袋稍加修改制成的袜子。"

#. ~ Description of "motorcycle boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of durable boots used by dirt bikers and motorcyclists."
msgstr "一套为摩托车手和越野自行车手所使用的靴子。"

#. ~ Description of "bowling shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of flat-soled shoes for use in bowling alleys."
msgstr "一双设计用于增加湿滑地面抓地力的平底鞋。"

#. ~ Description of "heels"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of high heeled shoes, impractical for running or fighting."
msgstr "一双高跟鞋，不适合跑步或打斗。"

#. ~ Description of "rollerblades"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of inline skates.  Very fast on flat floors, but they make it hard to move on rough terrain, take hits, or dodge effectively."
msgstr "一双直排轮滑鞋。在平地上移动速度很快，但是在崎岖地形上会让你举步维艰，难以攻击并且更难躲闪。"

#. ~ Description of "rubber boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of rubber work boots, often used while cleaning with caustic materials."
msgstr "一双橡胶靴，在清理腐蚀性物质时经常使用。"

#. ~ Description of "heelys (off)"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of sneakers with integrated wheels hidden in their very thick soles.  Currently the wheels are retracted, making these almost normal lace-up athletic shoes."
msgstr "一双自带滑轮的运动鞋。目前滑轮被收起来，使它和普通的系带运动鞋一样。"

#. ~ Description of "heelys (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of sneakers with integrated wheels, currently the wheels are out, allowing you to swiftly roll around on flat terrain.  You should probably pop them back in before you try fighting or going off-road."
msgstr "一双自带滑轮的运动鞋。目前滑轮在外面，让你在平坦的地形上快速滑行。在你准备打架或越野前，你可能应该把滑轮收回去。"

#. ~ Description of "turnout boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of steel-toed rubber boots, the sort worn by firefighters."
msgstr "一双钢头橡胶靴，消防员穿的那种。"

#. ~ Description of "gi tabi"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of white tabi, as used by martial arts practitioners."
msgstr "一双白色分趾袜，为武道练习者所穿。"

#. ~ Description of "boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A relatively lightweight pair of leather boots."
msgstr "一件简单的皮靴。"

#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A snug-fitting pair of stockings made from thin and lightweight Nomex fabric."
msgstr "一双由轻薄的芳纶织物制成的防火袜子。"

#. ~ Description of "fur moccasins"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A type of traditional Native American footwear sewn out of fur."
msgstr "一种美洲特色的皮鞋，后跟很矮，通常由皮革或毛皮制成。"

#. ~ Description of "moccasins"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A type of traditional Native American footwear sewn out of leather."
msgstr "一种美洲特色的皮鞋，后跟很矮，通常由皮革或毛皮制成。"

#. ~ Description of "plate sollerets"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Also known as sabatons, these steel boot covers are meant to be strapped on over a pair of shoes."
msgstr "这些钢制靴套也称为马靴，旨在绑在一双鞋子上。"

#. ~ Description of "rollerskates"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "An old-fashioned pair of leather rollerskates with steel frames.  While quite fast on flat floors, they make it difficult to take hits or to move on rough terrain."
msgstr "一双老样式钢架皮制滚轴溜冰鞋。在平地上移动速度很快，但是在崎岖地形上会让你举步维艰，难以攻击并且更难躲闪。"

#. ~ Description of "EOD foot protectors"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Armored foot protectors constructed from steel and Nomex for use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians."
msgstr "一双用钢材和芳纶纤维制成的装甲防护靴，供爆炸物处理技术人员使用。"

#. ~ Description of "sneakers"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Athletic shoes, designed for running."
msgstr "一双样式时髦的皮鞋。但它并不是为跑步而设计的。"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Boots made of durable nylon duck with faux fur lining for warmth."
msgstr "一双毛皮内衬的靴子，十分暖和。"

#. ~ Description of "knee-high boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Boots with a cuff that extends up to the knee.  Their heels are sensibly low, but still don't look terribly suited to running away from monsters during the end of the world."
msgstr "靴口延伸至膝盖的靴子。  他们的鞋跟明显很低，但看起来仍然不太适合在世界末日期间逃离怪物。"

#. ~ Description of "disposable bowling socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Cheap socks designed to be worn once and then thrown away.  They keep your feet clean, but are too thin to give any protection."
msgstr "一双廉价的一次性袜子。只能让脚不弄脏，但是太薄了，没法提供任何防护。"

#. ~ Description of "motorcycle police boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Custom-made knee-high leather boots issued to motor officers.  Warm, durable and quite tough."
msgstr "为摩托警官定制的及膝皮靴。温暖、耐用、相当坚韧。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "EOD foot protectors"
msgid_plural "pairs of EOD foot protectors"
msgstr[0] "拆弹防护靴"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "heelys (off)"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Extend wheels"
msgstr "放下滑轮"

#. ~ Description of "dress shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Fancy leather shoes, not designed for running."
msgstr "一双样式时髦的皮鞋。但它并不是为跑步而设计的。"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur foot wraps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Faux fur patches tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being barefoot, but still better than nothing."
msgstr "裹在脚上的人造皮，比光脚好不了多少，但也总比光着要好。"

#. ~ Description of "wool foot wraps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Felt patches tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being barefoot, but still better than nothing."
msgstr "裹在脚上的羊毛，比光脚好不了多少，但也总比光着要好。"

#. ~ Description of "fur foot wraps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Fur pelts tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being barefoot, but still better than nothing."
msgstr "裹在脚上的毛皮，比光脚好不了多少，但也总比光着要好。"

#. ~ Description of "clown shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Gigantic shoes fit for a clown.  They would be very difficult to run in, and fighting in them seems like a terrible idea."
msgstr "小丑们穿着的超大的鞋子。穿上就别想走路了。"

#. ~ Description of "steel-toed boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Heavy boots made of chemical-resistant treated leather with steel toecaps.  Great for the jobsite or for stomping the undead"
msgstr "重型靴子采用经过耐化学处理的皮革制成，配有钢制鞋头。  非常适合工作现场或踩踏不死生物"

#. ~ Description of "thigh-high boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "High-heeled boots that extend all the way up past the knees, these are the sort of thing you would have seen on a stripper or at a halloween party."
msgstr "高跟靴子一直延伸到膝盖以上，这是你在脱衣舞娘或万圣节派对上看到的那种东西。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden clogs"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Known as klompen in the Netherlands and sabots in France, these wooden shoes have endured through the ages due to their simple design and durability."
msgstr "著名的荷兰木鞋，一整块原木雕琢而成。木鞋因其设计简单而经久耐用，历经千年仍旧被人们所使用。\"走起路来有马蹄般清脆的响声。\""

#. ~ Description of "fur boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Leather boots, lined with fur for warmth."
msgstr "一双毛皮内衬的靴子，十分暖和。"

#. ~ Description of "leather foot wraps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Leather patches tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being barefoot, but still better than nothing."
msgstr "裹在脚上的皮革，比光脚好不了多少，但也总比光着要好。"

#. ~ Description of "slip-on shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Lightweight cloth shoes with no ties, meant to be worn without socks."
msgstr "轻便的布鞋，没有系带，适合不穿袜子穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "cord sandals"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Lightweight sandals made from wound cord.  They offer little in the way of protection, but keep you cool during warmer months."
msgstr "一双用线编成的轻飘飘的凉鞋。几乎无法提供有效防护，但在最热的日子里可以为你提供一点慰藉。"

#. ~ Description of "lowtop tennis shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Lightweight shoes made of cloth and rubber."
msgstr "重量很轻的鞋，由布和橡胶制成。"

#. ~ Description of "thigh socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Long socks that reach above the knees."
msgstr "一双长度及膝的棉袜，保暖效果很棒。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Nomex foot wraps"
msgid_plural "pairs of Nomex foot wraps"
msgstr[0] "诺梅克斯阻燃裹脚布"

#. ~ Description of "foot wraps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Rags tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being barefoot, but still better than nothing."
msgstr "裹在脚上的布条，比光脚好不了多少，但也总比光着要好。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "heelys (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Retract wheels"
msgstr "收起滑轮"

#. ~ Description of "straw sandals"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Sandals made from straw cordage.  Not very comfortable, but can keep your feet safe."
msgstr ""
"草绳编织的凉鞋，不舒服，但总比用脚底板排雷好。\n"
"\"此乃中国东汉末年潮流热销爆款草鞋。\""

#. ~ Description of "ankle socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Short socks, commonly used for sports.  These are designed to protect your feet from friction, not temperature."
msgstr "一双运动型短袜。为了保护你的脚不被擦伤而设计，保暖性很差。"

#. ~ Description of "flip-flops"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Simple sandals.  Somewhat difficult to run in."
msgstr "一双样式简单的拖鞋。穿着它很难跑步。"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Simple shoes woven from strips of flexible bark from a birch tree.  They're not especially comfortable, but might be better than going barefoot."
msgstr "由桦树皮条编织而成的简单鞋子。不太舒服，但总比赤脚来得好。"

#. ~ Description of "golf shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Snug sport shoes with hard ridges on the bottom."
msgstr "一双舒适的运动鞋，鞋底有些坚硬的鞋钉增加抓地力。"

#. ~ Description of "socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Socks.  Put 'em on your feet."
msgstr "一双穿在脚上的棉制袜子。"

#. ~ Description of "slippers"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Soft indoor shoes that keep your feet warm.  They're not great for much else."
msgstr ""
"软软的鞋子，让你的脚得到温暖，但并不适合跑步。\n"
"\"走起路来Pia Pia 的！\""

#. ~ Description of "combat boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Solid but surprisingly lightweight boots made from a combination of suede and nylon duck.  Possibly the most important part of a service member's uniform."
msgstr "坚固且重量惊人的轻盈，采用麂皮与高强尼龙材质合成。对于现役军人而言，这或许是其制服中最重要的装备。"

#. ~ Description of "cleats"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Sport shoes with hard undersides and studs on the bottom designed to dig into grass."
msgstr "一双硬底的运动鞋，底部设计有鞋钉，可以让你稳稳地走在草地上。"

#. ~ Description of "western boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Stiff leather cowboy boots with pointed toes and a low heel.  The wide cuffs could be used as ad hoc pockets, or maybe even holsters."
msgstr "硬质皮革牛仔靴，尖头低跟。  宽袖口可以用作临时口袋，甚至可以用作皮套。"

#. ~ Description of "Nomex foot wraps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Strips of fireproof fabric that can be tied around the feet.  These leave a lot to be desired, but they might be better than nothing."
msgstr "可以绑在脚上的防火织物条。  这些还有很多不足之处，但总比没有好。"

#. ~ Description of "leather sandals"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Sturdy leather hiking sandals with a heel strap, suitable for outdoor adventuring in warm weather."
msgstr "结实的皮制登山凉鞋，有着一根脚踝带。几乎无法提供有效防护，但透气性堪称一流，夏日首选。"

#. ~ Description of "expensive flip-flops"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "These flip-flops are branded with a designer logo.  It does not make them any easier to run in."
msgstr "这些人字拖印有设计师徽标。  这并不会让它们更容易跑进去。"

#. ~ Description of "hiking boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Tough yet light boots made of leather facing over sythetic uppers, intended for outdoor activity."
msgstr "坚固而轻便的靴子，采用皮革制成，鞋面采用合成材料，适合户外活动。"

#. ~ Description of "wool socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Warm socks made of wool."
msgstr "一双羊毛制成的袜子，非常暖和。"

#. ~ Description of "winter boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Wool-lined boots designed for warmth."
msgstr "一双为保暖而设计的羊毛内衬靴子。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "heelys (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "You pop the wheels back in."
msgstr "你把轮子放回去了。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "heelys (off)"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "You pop the wheels out."
msgstr "你把轮子取出来了。"

