#. ~ Description of "splint arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/brigandine.json
msgid "A pair of arm guards made of tough fabric sandwiched between alternating strips of steel."
msgstr "一对由坚韧织物制成的护臂，夹在交替的钢条之间。"

#. ~ Description of "brigandine gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/brigandine.json
msgid "A pair of gloves made of tough fabric, with steel plates of various size and shape riveted for additional protection, while still remaining relatively unhindering"
msgstr "一副由坚韧织物制成的手套，铆接有各种尺寸和形状的钢板以提供额外的保护，同时仍然保持相对无障碍"

#. ~ Description of "splint leg guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/brigandine.json
msgid "A pair of leg guards made of tough fabric sandwiched between alternating strips of steel.  Can be comfortably worn over chainmail for extra protection."
msgstr "一对由坚韧织物制成的护腿，夹在交替的钢条之间。  可以舒适地佩戴在链甲上以提供额外的保护。"

#. ~ Description of "brigandine vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/brigandine.json
msgid "Body armor made from tough fabric with steel plates riveted on the inside."
msgstr "防弹衣由坚韧的织物制成，内部铆有钢板。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/brigandine.json
msgid "brigandine gloves"
