#. ~ Variant name of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "2A flag"
msgid_plural "2A flags"
msgstr[0] "阿富汗国旗"

#. ~ Description of variant "Haitian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A bicolor horizontal flag of blue and red, with a white rectangle in the center featuring a coat of arms."
msgstr "一面蓝红双色水平旗帜，中间有个白色矩形盾徽。"

#. ~ Description of variant "vampire cape" of item "costume cape"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black cloak with a red lining, part of a halloween costume.  It's scalloped along the bottom hem, making it look vaguely like bat wings."
msgstr "一件带有红色衬里的黑色斗篷，是万圣节服装的一部分。  它的下摆饰有扇形图案，看起来隐隐约约像蝙蝠翅膀。"

#. ~ Description of variant "bloody handprint flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black flag bearing the image of a bloody handprint."
msgstr "一面黑色旗帜，上面印有血手印。"

#. ~ Description of variant "US Army logo flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black flag depicting a gold and white star above the words \"U.S. ARMY\"."
msgstr "一面黑色旗帜，上面有一颗金色和白色的星星，上面写着“美国陆军”字样。"

#. ~ Description of variant "peace flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black peace sign is all that adorns this large white flag."
msgstr "这面大白旗上装饰着黑色的和平标志。"

#. ~ Description of variant "superhero cape" of item "costume cape"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A bright red cape, part of a superhero costume."
msgstr "亮红色斗篷，超级英雄服装的一部分。"

#. ~ Description of variant "monk's cloak" of item "costume cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A brown cloak made of cheap synthetic fabric with a faux-burlap texture.  It looks like the kind of thing a warrior-monk might have worn in some far-away galaxy."
msgstr "一种棕色斗篷，由廉价的合成纤维制成，具有人造粗麻布的纹理。  它看起来就像是某个遥远星系中的武僧可能会穿的那种东西。"

#. ~ Description of "costume cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A cheap rayon cloak with a hood, the kind you'd see vampires and witches wearing on halloween."
msgstr "一件带兜帽的廉价人造丝斗篷，就是万圣节时吸血鬼和女巫穿的那种。"

#. ~ Description of "costume cape"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A cheap rayon cloak, the kind you'd see vampires and witches wearing on halloween."
msgstr "廉价的人造丝斗篷，就是万圣节吸血鬼和女巫穿的那种。"

#. ~ Description of "hologram cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A cloak woven with metallic fibers and covered with hexagonal sheets of reflective carbide.  When activated, it will create a holographic decoy of its wearer."
msgstr "一件由金属纤维制成的披风，表面覆盖着许多能反射光线的六边形的碳化物。开启后，会生成一个和穿戴者一模一样的全息投影。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Gambian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag consisting of horizontal red, blue, and green stripes separated by two thin stripes of white."
msgstr "一面红蓝绿水平组成的旗帜，由两条白色细条分隔开。"

#. ~ Description of "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag displaying a potentially inflammatory political symbol."
msgstr "带有潜在煽动性政治符号的旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Papuan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag divided diagonally from the upper hoist side corner to the lower fly side corner, the upper triangle is red with the soaring raggiana bird and the lower triangle is black with the Southern Cross of four white larger five pointed stars and the smaller star."
msgstr "一面国旗，被对角线分为左下的黑色和右上的红色区域。右上红色区域内有一只翱翔的鸟，左下的黑色区域内有四颗大一颗小的白色星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Panamanian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag divided into four rectangles, going clockwise from the top left it features a blue star, a red rectangle, a red star, and a blue rectangle."
msgstr "一面旗帜，分为四个区域从左上角沿顺时针分别是蓝星，红色矩形，红星，蓝色矩形。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Zambian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag featuring green field with an orange fish eagle in flight over a rectangular block of three vertical stripes colored from left to right in red, black and orange."
msgstr "一面绿底旗帜，右下侧有三根竖直的红黑橙条带，上面有一只张开翅膀的鱼鹰。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Icelandic flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a blue field with the white edged red Nordic cross that extends to the edges, the vertical part of the cross is shifted to the hoist side."
msgstr "一面蓝底旗帜，白边红色北欧十字延伸到旗帜边缘，十字的竖直部分靠向旗杆一侧。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sri Lankan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a golden field with two panels the smaller hoist side panel has only two vertical bands of teal and orange and the larger fly side panel is the maroon field depicting the golden lion holding the kastane sword."
msgstr "一面金色背景的旗帜，旗杆侧只有纯色的蓝绿色与橘色条带，另一侧有大块褐红色区域，里面有一只拿剑的金狮。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Turkmen flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a green field with a vertical red stripe near the hoist side, containing five carpet guls stacked above two crossed olive branches; a white waxing crescent moon and five white five pointed stars appear in the upper field, to the fly side of the red stripe."
msgstr "一面绿底旗帜，左侧有一条红色竖条，包含五面地毯式旗帜，堆叠在两个橄榄枝上，其稍右侧有白色的新月和五角星图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Guyanese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a green field with the black edged red isosceles triangle based on the hoist side superimposed on the larger white edged golden triangle, also based on the hoist side, pointed toward the fly-side."
msgstr "一面以绿色基调的旗帜，靠近旗杆一侧有个白边金色三角形，其内部有个黑边红色等腰三角形。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jordanian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a horizontal triband of black, white and green; with a red chevron based on the hoist side containing a white seven-pointed star."
msgstr "黑色、白色和绿色水平三带的旗帜; 葫芦侧面有一个红色的人字形，上面有一个白色的七角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tuvaluan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a light blue field with a union jack in the canton and nine yellow stars on the fly half of the flag."
msgstr "一面浅蓝底的旗帜，左上有英国旗帜，右上有九颗黄色的星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Norwegian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a red field charged with a white fimbriated dark blue Nordic cross that extends to the edges, the vertical part of the cross is shifted to the hoist side."
msgstr "一面红色背景的旗帜，中间有一个深蓝色的北欧十字，红色与深蓝区域间有细的白色条带。十字稍微偏向旗杆侧。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tunisian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a red field with a centered white sun disc containing a red five pointed star surrounded by a red crescent."
msgstr "一面红底旗帜，中间的白色圆形中间有一个红色新月和星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Danish flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a red field with a white Nordic cross over it."
msgstr "一面红色的国旗，中间有个白色的天主十字。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Trinidad and Tobago flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a red field with a white fimbriated black diagonal band from the upper hoist side to the lower fly side."
msgstr "一面红色旗帜，从旗杆上侧沿对角线到另一侧有一道白色镶边的黑色。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Turkish flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a red field with a white star and crescent slightly left of center."
msgstr "一面红底旗帜，有白色星星和新月稍微偏向左侧。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Timorese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a red field with the black isosceles triangle based on the hoist side bearing a white five pointed star in the center superimposed on the larger yellow triangle, also based on the hoist-side, that extends to the center of the flag."
msgstr "一面红色底的旗帜，旗杆侧有一个黄色三角形，上面又覆盖有一个黑色三角形。其中有一个白色五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tongan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a red field with the white rectangle on the upper hoist side corner bearing the red Greek Cross in the center."
msgstr "一面红色背景的国旗，左上角的白色区域内有一个红色雅典十字。"

#. ~ Description of variant "South Korean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a white field with a centered red and blue taegeuk surrounded by four trigrams."
msgstr "一面白色旗帜，中间是红色，围绕着四个卦象符号。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Japanese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of a white field with a red circle in the center piece."
msgstr "白色领域的旗帜，中间有一个红色圆圈。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Thai flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of five horizontal stripes of red, white, purple, white and red, the middle stripe being twice as wide as the others."
msgstr "一面红白紫白红水平条带旗帜，中间是其他的两倍宽。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Uruguayan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of four horizontal stripes of blue with the upper hoist side corner bearing the sun of may in the center over a white field."
msgstr "一面五道蓝色条带的旗帜，左上角的纯白区域内有一轮太阳。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Zimbabwean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of seven horizontal stripes of green, yellow, red, black, red, yellow and green with a black edged white isosceles triangle base on the hoist side bearing a Zimbabwe bird superimposed on a red five pointed star."
msgstr "一面水平条带按绿黄红黑红黄绿排列的旗帜，旗杆侧有白色三角形，交界处有黑色细条，里面有一颗红色五角星，还有一只赞比亚鸟在五角星中间。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Croatian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag of three horizontal stripes of red, white, and blue and a checkered red and white coat of arms shield, above which stands a crown of a dark and light blue pattern."
msgstr "有红白蓝水平条纹的旗帜，中间有个盾辉图案，上面有红白棋盘花纹，盾辉上方有深蓝与浅蓝交错的冠状图样。"

#. ~ Description of variant "New Zealand flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a blue ensign with a Union Jack in the first quarter and four five-pointed red stars with white borders on the fly."
msgstr "一面蓝色国旗，旗杆侧上部是英国国旗，右侧是四颗有白边的红色五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Swedish flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a blue field charged with a yellow Nordic cross that extends to the edges, the vertical part of the cross is shifted to the hoist side."
msgstr "一面蓝色背景的旗帜，中间有个黄色的北欧十字，竖直部分稍微偏向旗杆侧。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nauruan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a blue field with the thin yellow narrow horizontal stripe across in the center and the large white twelve pointed star on the bottom of the stripe and near the hoist side."
msgstr "一面蓝底旗帜，有一个窄的黄色水平箭头穿过中心，旗杆侧底部靠近条带的地方有一颗十二角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Marshallese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a blue field with two diagonal stripes of orange and white radiating from the lower hoist side corner to the upper fly side corner and the large white star with four large rays and twenty small rays on the upper hoist side corner above the stripes."
msgstr "一面有橘白两色条带从旗杆侧左下到右上的蓝底旗帜，旗杆侧上方有一颗白色星星，发出四条较大光线和二十条较小的光线。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Latvian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a carmine red field bisected by a narrow white stripe."
msgstr "一面洋红色为主体的旗帜，中间有白色的窄条带。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Kazakhstani flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a gold sun above a soaring golden steppe eagle, both centered on a turquoise field."
msgstr "一面旗帜，上面有一个金色的太阳，上面是一只翱翔的金色草原鹰，两者都以绿松石原为中心。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Saudi Arabian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a green field with the shahada or Muslim creed written in the Thuluth script in white above a horizontal sword, having its tip pointed to the left."
msgstr "一面绿底旗帜，上面是一把水平的剑，剑尖指向左侧，上面用白色的 Thuluth 文字书写了清真言或穆斯林信条"

#. ~ Description of variant "Maldivian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a green rectangle centered on a red field; charged with a white crescent."
msgstr "一面红色基基底上有着绿色矩形的旗帜，还有一轮白色的新月在上边。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Filipino flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal bicolor of blue and red with a white equilateral triangle based at the hoist containing three, five pointed gold stars at its vertices, and an eight rayed gold sun at its center."
msgstr "一面蓝红双色水平旗帜，旗杆侧有一个白色三角，里面有一个发出八条光线的金色太阳，三个角处各有一个金色五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Liechtensteiner flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal bicolor of blue and red, charged with a gold crown in the canton."
msgstr "一面蓝红双色水平旗帜，左上角有一个金色的皇冠。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Kiribati flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal bicolor of red and blue with the yellow frigate bird flying over the rising sun with seventeen rays centered on the upper half and three white wavy horizontal stripes on the lower half."
msgstr "一面红蓝双色水平条纹的旗帜，上半部有一轮发射17到光线的升起的太阳，一只金色的鸟飞于其上。旗帜下半部有三条白色的波浪状条纹。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Singaporean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal bicolor of red and white, in the canton is a crescent facing the fly and a pentagon of five stars."
msgstr "一面红白双色水平旗，有一个朝向旗飘侧新月和组成五边形的五颗星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sammarinese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal bicolor of white and light blue; charged with the national coat of arms in the center."
msgstr "一面白色浅蓝双色水平旗帜，中间有一个国徽。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Polish flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal bicolor of white and red."
msgstr "一面白红双色水平旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nicaraguan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of azure and white with the coat of arms centered on the white band."
msgstr "一面海蓝与白色交错的三色旗，中间有一个国徽。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Malawian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of black, red, and green; charged with a red rising sun with rays centered on the black stripe."
msgstr "一面黑红绿三色旗帜，在黑色条带中有发光的红日。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Surinamese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of green and red with large white border with the large yellow five pointed star centered on the red band."
msgstr "一面绿红绿三道旗，交界处有白色细条，红色区域较大，中间有颗金色的五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Kuwaiti flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of green, white and red; with a black trapezium based on the hoist side."
msgstr "一面绿白红三色水平旗帜，靠近旗杆一侧有一个黑色的梯形。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nigerien flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of orange, white and green; charged with an orange circle in the center."
msgstr "一面橙白绿三色水平条带旗帜，中间有一个橘色的圆。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Libyan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of red, black, and green charged with a white crescent and five pointed star centered on the black stripe."
msgstr "一面红黑绿三色水平旗帜，中间的黑色条带中有白色的新月和五颗星星的图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Laotian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of red, blue and red, charged in the center a white circle."
msgstr "一面红蓝红水平三色旗帜，中间有一个白色的圆。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Paraguayan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of red, white and blue with a coat of arms in the center white band."
msgstr "一面红白蓝水平三色条带旗帜，中间有一个国徽。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Luxembourger flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of red, white and light blue."
msgstr "一面红白浅蓝的水平三色旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Dutch flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of red, white, and cobalt blue."
msgstr "一面红白钴蓝三色水平条带旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Lebanese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of red, white, and red, charged in the center is a green cedar tree."
msgstr "一面红白红水平条带旗帜，中间有绿色雪松树图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Myanma flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of yellow, green and red charged with a large white five pointed star at the center."
msgstr "一面黄绿红水平三色条带旗帜，中间有一个白色五星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Lithuanian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal triband of yellow, green and red."
msgstr "一面黄绿红水平三色条带旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Slovenian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal tricolor flag of white, blue, and red charged with a small coat of arms at the hoist side."
msgstr "一面白蓝红三色水平旗帜，红色区域的旗杆侧有盾徽图案"

#. ~ Description of variant "Slovakian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal tricolor flag of white, blue, and red; charged with coat of arms at the hoist side."
msgstr "一面白蓝红三色水平旗帜，旗杆侧有盾徽图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Palestinian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal tricolor of black, white, and green with a red triangle based at the hoist."
msgstr "一面黑白绿三色水平旗帜，并在旗杆侧有一个红色三角形。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Kenyan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal tricolor of black, white-edged red, and green with two crossed white spears behind a red, white, and black Maasai shield."
msgstr "一面旗帜，具有黑色、白边红绿三色旗，红白黑马赛盾牌后面有两根交叉的白色长矛。 "

#. ~ Description of variant "Sierra Leonean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal tricolor of light green, white and light blue."
msgstr "一面绿白蓝三色水平旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Serbian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal tricolor of red, blue, and white charged with the lesser coat of arms left of center."
msgstr "一面红蓝白三色水平旗帜，中央左侧带有较小的盾形纹章。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Syrian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal tricolor of red, white, and black charged with two green stars at the center."
msgstr "一面红白黑三色水平旗帜，黑色中间有两颗绿色的星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Omani flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a horizontal tricolor of white, red and green with a vertical red stripe at the hoist, charged with the national emblem in the canton."
msgstr "一面白红绿三色水平旗帜，旗杆侧有一个竖直红色条带，并有一个国徽在上面。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Palauan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a light blue field with the large yellow disk shifted slightly to the hoist-side of center."
msgstr "一面浅蓝背景国旗，有一个黄色圆形，稍微偏向旗杆一侧。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Vincentian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a pale triband of blue, gold, and green, with three green diamonds in the center arranged to form a v shape."
msgstr "一面蓝金绿三色数条其，中间较大的金色区域有三个绿色的菱形按V字排列。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Kyrgyz flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a red field charged with a yellow sun with forty uniformly spaced rays, the sun is crossed by two sets of three lines."
msgstr "一面红底旗帜，上有一个黄色的太阳，发射四十束整齐的光线，被两组三道线十字交叉穿过。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Montenegrin flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a red field surrounded by a golden border charged with the coat of arms at the center of a two headed eagle."
msgstr "一面红色基底旗帜，边缘包裹金色边，中间有只双头鹰，体内有个盾徽图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Moroccan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a red field with a green pentagram, a five-pointed linear star."
msgstr "一面中间有五角星的红底旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Macedonian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a stylized yellow sun on a red field, with eight broadening rays extending from the center to the edge of the field."
msgstr "一种旗帜，在红色的背景上有一个黄色太阳，从中心到边缘有八条扩展的射线。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Maltese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a vertical bicolor of white and red with the representation of the George Cross edged in red on the upper hoist-side corner of the white band."
msgstr "一面白红双色竖直条纹旗帜，在靠旗杆一侧白色条带底边有一个乔治十字架。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nigerian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a vertical bicolor triband of green, white and green."
msgstr "一面绿白绿双色三道旗。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mongolian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a vertical triband of red and blue with a Soyombo symbol centered on the hoist-side of the red band."
msgstr "一面红蓝红竖直三色条旗帜，靠旗杆侧红色条带中有一个索永布图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Malian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a vertical tricolor of green, gold and red."
msgstr "一面绿金红三色竖直条纹组成的旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mexican flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a vertical tricolor of green, white and red, with the national coat of arms centered on the white band."
msgstr "一面绿白红竖直三色旗帜，中间有个国家盾徽标志。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Senegalese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a vertical tricolor of green, yellow and red; charged with a green five pointed star at the center."
msgstr "一面绿黄红竖直三色旗帜， 中央有一颗绿色的五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Portuguese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a vertically striped bicolor of green and red, with the lesser coat of arms of centered over the color boundary."
msgstr "一面绿红竖直双色旗帜，分界处有一个国徽。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Qatari flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a white band on the hoist side, separated from a maroon area on the fly side by nine white triangles which act as a serrated line."
msgstr "一面旗帜，旗杆侧为白色，更大面积的另一侧为栗色，中间由竖直的锯齿状分界隔开。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Namibian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a white edged red diagonal band radiating from the lower hoist side corner.  The upper triangle is blue, charged with a gold sun with rays and the lower triangle is green."
msgstr "一面旗帜，白色包边的红色条带从旗杆侧底部沿对角线延伸到另一侧。上部分的三角是蓝色的，有散发光芒的金色太阳。下部分三角是绿色的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Pakistani flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a white star and crescent on a dark green field, with a vertical white stripe at the hoist."
msgstr "一面深绿背景上的旗帜，有白色星星和新月图案。近旗杆一侧有竖直白色条带。"

#. ~ Description of variant "North Korean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a wide red stripe at the center, bordered by a narrow white stripe both above and below, followed by a blue stripe.  The central red stripe carries a five pointed red star within a white circle near the hoist."
msgstr "一面红色为主体，蓝色条带于上下两侧的水平旗帜，红色与蓝色间有细的白色条纹。中间有一块白色圆形，里面有一颗红色的五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tanzanian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features a yellow edged black diagonal band divided diagonally from the lower hoist side corner, the upper triangle is green and the lower triangle is light blue."
msgstr "一面旗帜，其特征是一条黄边黑色对角线带从下吊边角沿对角线分开，上三角为绿色，下三角为浅蓝色。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Liberian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features eleven horizontal stripes alternating red and white, in the canton is a white star on a blue field."
msgstr "一面十一条红白条纹水平交错的旗帜，左上角的蓝色方形小区域内有一颗白色的星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Togolese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features five equal horizontal bands of green alternating with yellow with a red canton bearing a white five pointed star."
msgstr "一面绿黄交错的五色条带旗，左上角的红色区域内有一颗白色五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Seychellois flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features five oblique bands of blue, yellow, red, white, and green radiating from the bottom of the hoist side."
msgstr "一面旗帜，有五个斜带，分别是蓝色、黄色、红色、白色和绿色，从旗杆侧底部向外辐射。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Malaysian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features fourteen horizontal stripes alternating red and white, a yellow crescent and fourteen-point star on a blue field in on the canton."
msgstr "一面由十四红白条纹交错组成的旗帜，在靠旗杆上侧的蓝色区域中有黄色新月和十四角星星"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ugandan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features six equal horizontal bands of black, yellow, red, black, yellow, and red, a white disc is superimposed at the center with a grey crowned crane, facing the hoist side."
msgstr "一面黑黄红黑黄交错的五道旗，中间红黑条带中有一个白色的圆，里面有一只面朝旗杆侧的冠顶鹤。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Bissau Guinean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features two horizontal bands of gold and green with a red vertical band charged with a black star on the hoist side."
msgstr "一面由金绿两色组成的水平旗帜，左侧一边有红色竖条，内有有颗黑色的星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Madagascan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features two horizontal bands of red and green with a white vertical band on the hoist side."
msgstr "一面红绿水平条纹旗帜，靠旗杆一侧有竖直白色条。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mauritanian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that features two red stripes flanking a green field with a golden upward-pointed crescent and star charged in the center."
msgstr "一面两根红色条带分部飘于绿色基底上下边缘的旗帜，中间有向上的星星和新月图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jamaican flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a gold diagonal cross which divides the field into four triangles of green and black."
msgstr "一面旗帜，带有金色对角线十字架，将场地分为绿色和黑色四个三角形。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Spanish flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a horizontal triband flag of red, yellow and red charged with the Spanish coat of arms off centered toward the hoist."
msgstr "一面红黄红水平三道旗帜，旗杆侧中间有一个西班牙盾徽。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Indian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a horizontal triband of saffron, white, and green with a navy blue wheel with twenty four spokes in the center."
msgstr "一面橘黄，白，绿组成的水平三条旗帜，中间有个有着二十四根辐条的海蓝色轮状图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Iranian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a horizontal tricolor of green, white and red with the national emblem in red centered on the white band."
msgstr "一面绿白红水平三色旗帜，白色中间有一个红色国徽图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sudanese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a horizontal tricolor of red, white, and black with a green triangle based at the hoist."
msgstr "一面红白黑三色水平旗帜，旗杆侧有一个绿色的三角形。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Somali flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a single white five pointed star centered on a cyan field."
msgstr "一面青色背景上有白色五角星的旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Solomon Islands flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a thin, yellow stripe dividing diagonally from the lower hoist side corner to the upper fly side corner, the upper triangle is blue with five white five pointed stars arranged in an x pattern and the lower triangle is green."
msgstr "一面旗帜，有一条黄色细条纹，从旗杆侧下方到右上呈对角线划分，上面的三角形是蓝色的，五颗白色的五颗尖星呈 x 形排列，下面的三角形是绿色的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Italian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a tricolor vertical stripes of green, white, and red."
msgstr "具有绿色、白色和红色三色垂直条纹的旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Israeli flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a white field bearing two horizontal blue stripes and a blue central Shield of David."
msgstr "一面旗帜，白色领域带有两条水平的蓝色条纹和一个蓝色的中央大卫盾牌。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Djiboutian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that has a white triangle in the left portion with light blue and green color running horizontally."
msgstr "一面旗帜，水平方向浅蓝与绿色，左侧部分有个白色的三角形。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Grenadian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag that is diagonally divided field of yellow, green, yellow, green with a red border, in addition to the six yellow stars in the border, there is a central star in a red disk and, at the hoist, a nutmeg symbol."
msgstr "一面对角分为黄绿色的旗帜，边缘为红色条带，其中还有六颗黄色星星星，中间的红色区域内还有一颗星，边缘是一个肉豆蔻图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Holy See flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a bicolor of gold and white with the crossed keys of Saint Peter and the Papal Tiara centered in the white band."
msgstr "一面金白双色旗帜，在白色部分有圣彼得的交叉钥匙和教皇皇冠图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Czech flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a blue triangle at the hoist and a horizontal white and red color on it."
msgstr "一面旗帜，由白红两色水平构成，左侧有个大大的蓝色三角。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Indonesian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a horizontal bicolor of red and white."
msgstr "一面红白双色水平旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Honduran flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a horizontal triband of turquoise and white with five turquoise five pointed stars arranged in an x pattern centered on the white band."
msgstr "一面浅蓝与白色水平三条纹旗帜，中间有按X型排列的五颗浅蓝色星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Saint Lucian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a light blue field with a small golden isosceles triangle in front of a large white-edged black isosceles triangle in the center."
msgstr "一面浅蓝背景的旗帜，中间有一个小的金色等腰三角形，在它后面有一个更大写的白边的黑色三角形。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Micronesian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a light blue field with four white five-pointed stars arranged in the diamond pattern in the center."
msgstr "一面浅蓝基底上有四颗白色五角星的旗帜，五角星的中间围着钻石的图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Samoan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a red field and a blue rectangle on the upper hoist side quadrant bearing the Southern Cross of four white larger five pointed stars and the smaller star in the center."
msgstr "一面红底旗帜，旗杆上侧有深蓝矩形区域，内部有四颗大一颗小的白色五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Taiwanese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a red field and blue canton with a white sun in the canton."
msgstr "一面红色背景的旗帜，左上角有一面蓝底青天白日旗。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Vietnamese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a red field and large yellow star in the center."
msgstr "一面红色背景的旗帜，中间有一颗大的黄色五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Dominican flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a white cross and a coat of arms in the center with a pattern of blue and red on the outside of the cross."
msgstr "一面旗帜，上面有白色十字，中间有个盾形纹章，十字外面是蓝红两色。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Central African flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with horizontal stripes of blue, white, green and yellow coloration and one vertical red stripe down the middle with a star in the upper left corner."
msgstr "一面旗帜，有蓝色、白色、绿色和黄色的水平条纹，中间被一条垂直的红色条纹隔开，左上角有一颗黄色的星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "rainbow Gadsden flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with six horizontal stripes depicting the colors of the rainbow.  Atop them sits a coiled snake with its fangs bared.  Below it, the words \"DONT TREAD ON ME\"."
msgstr "带有六个水平条纹的旗帜，描绘了彩虹的颜色。  在它们的上方坐着一条盘绕的蛇，它的獠牙裸露在外。  下面写着“别踩我”。"

#. ~ Description of variant "United Kingdom flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with white fimbriated asymmetric red cross on a blue field with a white fimbriated counterchanged saltire of red and white.  Also known as the Union Jack."
msgstr "一面蓝色背景旗帜，白色边缘的红色米字形是它的特点。"

#. ~ Description of "snuggie"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A fuzzy housecoat, halfway between a blanket and a bathrobe.  It's quite warm."
msgstr "一件毛茸茸的家居服，介于毯子和浴袍之间。  天气很暖和。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Dominica flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A green flag with a running tricolor cross of yellow, black, and white, in the center stands a red circle with a parrot in the middle surrounded by green stars."
msgstr "一面绿色的旗帜，黄黑白三色细带组成的十字盖在上面。中心是一个红色的园，里面有一只鹦鹉，围绕着一圈绿色的星星。"

#. ~ Description of "denim cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy denim cape worn over the body.  It is warm, sturdy, and comes with a hood."
msgstr "一件厚重的牛仔斗篷披在身上。  它温暖、坚固，并配有兜帽。"

#. ~ Description of "leather cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy leather cape that offers a degree of protection as well as warmth."
msgstr "厚重的皮革斗篷，提供一定程度的保护和温暖。"

#. ~ Description of "wool cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy woolen cape for inclement weather."
msgstr "适合恶劣天气的厚重羊毛斗篷。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ukrainian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal bicolor flag of blue and yellow."
msgstr "一面蓝黄双色水平旗帜"

#. ~ Description of variant "South African flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal bicolor flag of red and blue with a black isosceles triangle based on the hoist side and a green pall, a central green band that splits into a horizontal Y, centered over the partition lines and was edged in both white against the red and the blue bands and yellow against the triangle, in which the arms of the Y ends at the corners of the hoist and embraces the triangle on the hoist side."
msgstr "一面红蓝水平双色旗，中间有一个绿色的Y型，分岔朝旗杆一侧，与红色与蓝色区域交界处有白色细条。分岔中间夹有黑色区域，交界处有黄色细条。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Vanuatuan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal bicolor flag of red and green with a golden pall, fimbriated in black, with a black chevron filling the left hand space and two gold crossed namele cycad fronds encircled in a gold boar tusk centered on the chevron."
msgstr "一面红绿双色旗帜，中间有黄色的Y型图案，分岔朝旗杆侧，交界处有黑色条带，分岔里的黑色有一根环状金色野猪牙，里面有两片铁苏叶。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Monegasque flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal bicolor flag of red and white."
msgstr "一面红白水平双色旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Uzbek flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal triband flag of azure, white and green, separated by two narrow red stripes.  A white crescent and three rows of twelve white five pointed stars are situated on the left side of the upper azure stripe."
msgstr "一面青白绿水平三道旗，交界处有两条红色细条，左上有新月和三行白色五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Basotho flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal triband of blue, white and green charged with a black mokorotlo centered on the white band."
msgstr "一面蓝白绿水平三色条纹旗，白色中间有顶莫克罗托帽的标志。"

#. ~ Description of variant "German flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of black, red, and gold."
msgstr "一面黑红金三色水平旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "South Sudan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of black, red, and green, fimbriated with white stripes with a blue equilateral triangle based on the hoist side bearing a gold star."
msgstr "一面黑红绿三色水平旗帜，带有白色条纹的流苏，带有一个蓝色的等边三角形，旗杆侧有一颗金星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Estonian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of blue, black, and white."
msgstr "一面蓝黑白水平三色旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Emirati flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of green, white and black with a vertical red bar at the hoist."
msgstr "一面绿白黑三色水平旗帜，旗杆侧有竖直红色条带。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sao Tomean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of green, yellow and green with a red triangle based at the hoist and two five pointed black stars of in the yellow stripe."
msgstr "一面绿黄绿三色水平旗帜，旗杆侧有一个红色三角，黄色条带里有两个五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Gabonese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of green, yellow, and blue."
msgstr "一面绿黄蓝三色水平旗帜"

#. ~ Description of variant "Rwandan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of light blue, yellow and green charged with a sun-yellow sun in the upper fly side corner."
msgstr "一面浅蓝黄绿三色水平旗帜，右上侧有一个黄色的太阳图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ghanaian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of red, gold, and green, a black star standing in its center."
msgstr "一面红金绿水平三色旗帜，中间有颗黑色的星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Yemenis flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of red, white and black."
msgstr "一面红白黑三色水平旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Egyptian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of red, white, and black with a yellow eagle in the center."
msgstr "一面旗帜，红白黑三色水平排列，中间有一只黄色的鹰。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tajikistani flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of red, white, and green, with a yellow crown surmounted by an arc of seven stars at the center."
msgstr "一面红白绿三色水平旗帜，中间的黄色皇冠中文按弧线形排列着七颗星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Venezuelan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of yellow, blue and red with an arc of eight white five pointed stars centered on the blue band."
msgstr "一面黄蓝红三色水平旗帜，红色条带的中间有呈弧形排列的八颗白色五角星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ecuadorian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of yellow, blue, and red with its coat of arms in the center."
msgstr "一面旗帜，黄蓝红三色水平排列，中间有个盾牌形印章。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Equatorial Guinean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag, with green, white and red stripes and a blue triangle at the hoist with a coat of arms in the center."
msgstr "一面水平方向的绿白红三色旗，左侧有一个蓝色三角形，旗帜中间有一个盾形印章。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ethiopia flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontally running tricolor flag of green, yellow, and red, in the center is a blue circle and a yellow star."
msgstr "一面绿黄红水平三色旗帜，中间是一个蓝色圆环和一颗黄色星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "leather flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontally striped black and blue leather flag with a white band in the middle and red heart in a corner.  The black represents leather; the blue represents devotion, loyalty, and community; the white represents purity and innocence; and the red heart represents love for the community."
msgstr "一面巨大的由黑色和蓝色组成的抖SM自豪旗帜。一面水平条纹的黑蓝旗，中间有一条白带，一角有红心。黑色代表捆绑，蓝色代表奉献，忠诚和社区；白色代表纯洁和天真；而红心代表对社区的爱。"

#. ~ Description of "American flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large banner decorated with red and white striped representing the thirteen colonies, and fifty white stars representing the states over a field of blue."
msgstr "一面大横幅，上面装饰着红白条纹，代表十三个殖民地，五十颗白色星星代表蓝色的田野上的各州。"

#. ~ Description of variant "bear flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black and orange international bear brotherhood flag.  The flag displays seven horizontal stripes of colors ranging from black to brown representing the colors of different bear species, you can see a black bear paw in the upper right corner."
msgstr "一面巨大的由黑色和橙色组成的国际熊熊兄弟会大旗。旗子上显示了七条横条纹，颜色从黑色到棕色不等，代表了不同熊种的颜色，你可以在右上角看到一只黑熊的爪子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "labrys lesbian flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black and purple labrys lesbian flag.  On the flag you can see a labrys, a type of double-headed axe, superimposed on a downward-pointing black triangle, set against a violet background."
msgstr ""
"一面巨大的由黑色和紫色组成的女同性恋双头斧旗帜。在旗帜上你可以看到一把双头斧（神话中亚马逊女战士常用武器）叠加在一个黑色倒三角形上，以紫色作为背景。\n"
"\n"
"—— 百合无限好，只是生不了。虽然生不了，还是无限好。"

#. ~ Description of variant "POW/MIA flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black flag decorated with the silhouette of a prisoner of war beneath a guard tower, surrounded by barbed wire.  Text above reads, \"POW*MIA\" and below, \"YOU ARE NOT FORGOTTEN\"."
msgstr "一面巨大的黑色旗帜，装饰着战俘的轮廓，位于警卫塔下方，四周环绕着铁丝网。  上面的文字写着“POW*MIA”，下面的文字写着“你没有被遗忘”。"

#. ~ Description of variant "homemade anarchist flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black flag hand-painted with a white letter A, its cross, legs, and head extending from the circle around it like points of a star."
msgstr "一面手绘着白色字母 A 的黑色大旗，其十字架、腿和头从周围的圆圈中延伸出来，就像星星的点一样。"

#. ~ Description of variant "skull flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black flag printed with a white skull, a symbol often deployed by authoritarian extremists."
msgstr "一面印有白色头骨的黑色大旗，这是独裁极端分子经常使用的标志。"

#. ~ Description of variant "jolly roger flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black flag printed with the white skull and crossbones long associated with piracy."
msgstr "一面巨大的黑色旗帜，上面印有长期以来与海盗有关的白色骷髅和交叉骨。"

#. ~ Description of variant "molon labe flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black flag with a white spartan helmet printed on it beneath greek letters spelling out \"MOLON LABE\"."
msgstr "一面巨大的黑色旗帜，上面印有白色斯巴达头盔，下方印有希腊字母“MOLON LABE”。"

#. ~ Description of variant "black flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black flag with no decoration of any kind.  Perhaps unsurprisingly, anarchists have had trouble settling on a single banner, but the black flag endures as a symbol of outrage against the state."
msgstr "一面没有任何装饰的大黑旗。  也许并不奇怪，无政府主义者很难确定单一的旗帜，但黑旗作为对国家的愤怒的象征而持久存在。"

#. ~ Description of variant "aromantic flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black, grey, white and green aromantic flag.  The green and light green stripes cover everyone under the aromantic spectrum, while represents nonromantic forms of love and attraction, and the gray and black represent all sexualities under the aromantic spectrum."
msgstr "一面巨大的由黑色、灰色、白色和绿色组成的芳香旗帜，绿色和浅绿色条纹涵盖了芳香族光谱下的每个人，同时代表非芳香族形式的爱和吸引，而灰色和黑色代表芳香族光谱下的所有性取向。"

#. ~ Description of variant "non-binary flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large black, purple, white, and yellow non-binary flag.  Yellow for those whose gender exists outside of and without reference to the binary, white for those who have many or all genders, purple for those who feel their gender is between or a mix of female and male, and black for those who feel they are without gender."
msgstr "一面巨大的由黑色，紫色，白色和黄色组成的非二元性别旗帜。黄色代表性别存在于二元以外的人，白色代表那些性别多种或所有性别的人，紫色代表那些觉得自己的性别介于男性和女性之间或混合的人，黑色代表那些认为自己没有性别的人。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Maine flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large blue flag featuring a moose and pine tree emblem on a shield supported by a farmer and a sailor, above is the north star and the Latin motto \"Dirigo\" (\"I direct\"), below the shield reads out the state of \"Maine\"."
msgstr "由农民和水手支撑的盾牌上有一面巨大的蓝色旗帜，上面有驼鹿和松树标志，上面是北极星和拉丁语座右铭“Dirigo”（“我指挥”），盾牌下面写着“缅因州”。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Vermont flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large blue flag featuring a shield with wreaths on both sides, a pine tree in a green field along with a cow and bales of wheat reside within the shield representing Vermont."
msgstr "一面蓝色的大旗，两边都有花圈，绿色田野中的一棵松树，还有一头牛和一捆小麦，一面佛蒙特州的盾牌。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Connecticut flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large blue flag featuring a white baroque shield with three grapevines, each bearing three bunches of purple grapes on a field of royal blue, below the shield reads \"Qui Transtulit Sustinet\", which is Latin for \"He who transplanted sustains\" which represents the state of Connecticut."
msgstr "一面蓝色的大旗，上面有一个白色的巴洛克盾牌，上面有三根葡萄藤，每根葡萄藤上都挂着三串紫色葡萄，上面是一片宝蓝色，盾牌下方写着\"Qui Transtulit Sustinet\"，这是拉丁文的\"移民并且维持下去的人\"，代表着康涅狄格州。"

#. ~ Description of variant "New Hampshire flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large blue flag with New Hampshire's state seal of the frigate Raleigh surrounded by laurel leaves and nine stars against a field of blue."
msgstr "一面大蓝旗，带有新罕布什尔州护卫舰罗利号的州徽，周围环绕着月桂叶和九颗星，和大片蓝色相映衬。"

#. ~ Description of variant "genderfluid flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large blue, black, purple, white and pink genderfluid flag.  The genderfluid flag has a pink stripe for femininity, a blue stripe for masculinity, a purple stripe for both masculinity and femininity, a black stripe for lack of gender, and a white stripe for all genders."
msgstr ""
"一面巨大的由蓝、黑、紫、白、粉组成的性别流动旗帜。性别流动旗上的粉色条纹代表女性，蓝色条纹代表男性，紫色条纹代表男性和女性，黑色条纹表示没有性别，白色条纹表示所有性别。\n"
"注：性别流动是指在不断改变自己性别认同的群体"

#. ~ Description of variant "polysexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large blue, green, and pink polysexual flag.  Pink for people on the female-spectrum, blue for people on the male-spectrum, and green for non-binary or genderqueer people."
msgstr "一面巨大的由蓝色，绿色和粉色组成的多性恋旗帜，粉色代表女性，蓝色代表男性，绿色代表非二元和变性的人。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sovereign citizen flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large flag clearly inspired by the stars and stripes of the USA, but the red stripes are vertical, the blue's been swapped for white, and all the stars are blue instead.  This flag is one of the symbols of a loosely affiliated movement of people who believe that they are in one way or another exempt from compliance with the usual laws of the land.  Given the state of things, it is distinctly possible that they have had the last laugh."
msgstr "一面大国旗明显受到美国星条旗的启发，但红色条纹是垂直的，蓝色被替换为白色，所有星星都是蓝色的。  这面旗帜是松散附属运动的象征之一，这些运动相信自己在某种程度上可以免受当地通常法律的约束。  考虑到目前的情况，他们很可能笑到了最后。"

#. ~ Description of variant "2A flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large flag colored a mottled taupe, like old parchment.  It is printed with the full text of the second amendment of the United States constitution in a font attempting to mimic the handwriting on that document.  It's kind of a lot of words to put on a flag, and the fact that it's in script makes it almost totally illegible."
msgstr "一面大旗呈斑驳的灰褐色，就像旧羊皮纸一样。  它以试图模仿该文件上的笔迹的字体印有美国宪法第二修正案的全文。  在一面旗帜上写了很多字，而且它是用脚本写成的，这使得它几乎完全难以辨认。"

#. ~ Description of variant "anarchist flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large flag divided diagonally, red to the upper left, and black to the lower right.  The black stands for the negation of authority and the state, while the red symbolizes the blood of revolutionaries and the hope of a new dawn."
msgstr "一面大旗沿对角线分开，左上方为红色，右下方为黑色。  黑色代表对权威和国家的否定，红色象征革命者的鲜血和新黎明的希望。"

#. ~ Description of variant "prison bars flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large flag printed with something resembling the US flag, only the stripes are vertical and in black and gray instead of red and blue.  They're meant to look like prison bars, and a downcast man is gripping them and staring plaintively from the other side."
msgstr "一面印有类似美国国旗的大国旗，只是条纹是垂直的，并且是黑色和灰色的，而不是红色和蓝色的。  它们本来应该看起来像监狱的铁栅栏，而一个沮丧的男人正抓着它们，从另一边哀怨地凝视着它们。"

#. ~ Description of "national flag"
#. ~ Description of "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large flag, made to fly in even the worst conditions."
msgstr "一面巨大的国旗，即使在最糟的情况下也能飘扬。"

#. ~ Description of variant "agender flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large green grey and black agender flag.  The black and white stripes represent complete absence of gender, grey represents being semi-genderless, and green represents non-binary gender."
msgstr "一面巨大的由绿色、灰色、和黑白组成的无性恋旗帜。黑白条纹表示没有性别，灰色表示半无性别，而绿色则表示非二元性别。"

#. ~ Description of variant "genderqueer flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large green, white, and purple genderqueer flag.  Lavender, a mixture of blue and pink to represent androgynes and androgyny, white to represent agender identity, and green, the inverse of lavender, to represent all those who fall outside of the gender binary."
msgstr "一面巨大的由绿色，白色和紫色组成的性别酷儿旗帜。薰衣草色，蓝色和粉红色的混合物，代表着双性恋和雌雄同体，白色代表性别认同，绿色作为薰衣草色的反面，代表所有不属于性别二元论的人。"

#. ~ Description of variant "agender flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large green, white, grey and black agender flag.  The black and white stripes represent complete absence of gender, grey represents being semi-genderless, and green represents non-binary gender.  The symmetry of the pattern makes it so that it's correct no matter how it flies."
msgstr "一面巨大的由绿色，白色，灰色和黑色组成的变性人旗帜。黑白条纹表示没有性别，灰色表示半无性别，而绿色表示非二元性别。图案的对称性代表了无论怎样飞翔都是正确的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "US Navy flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large navy blue flag printed with the seal of the U.S. Department of the Navy, a bald eagle atop an anchor with its wings spread before a three-masted sailing ship.  A gold banner beneath bears the text, \"UNITED STATES NAVY\"."
msgstr "一面巨大的海军蓝色旗帜印有美国海军部的印章，一只秃鹰站在锚上，在一艘三桅帆船前张开翅膀。  下面的金色横幅上写着“美国海军”。"

#. ~ Description of variant "bisexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large pink and blue bisexual flag.  The pink stripe represents homosexuality, while the blue stripe represents heterosexuality.  The purple stripe, the \"overlap\" of the blue and pink stripes, purple represents attraction regardless of sex or gender a.k.a bisexuality."
msgstr "一面巨大的由粉色和蓝色组成的双性恋旗帜。粉色条纹表示同性恋，而蓝色条纹表示异性恋。紫色的条纹，是粉色和蓝色的\"重叠\"，紫色表示不分性别，也就是双性恋。"

#. ~ Description of variant "feminism flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large pink flag marked with the female symbol in black, a clenched fist in the middle of its central circle."
msgstr "一面巨大的粉红色旗帜，上面标有黑色的女性符号，中央圆圈中间有一个紧握的拳头。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pansexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large pink, blue and yellow pansexual flag.  The pan-pride flag uses pink for people on the female-spectrum, blue for people on the male-spectrum, and yellow for non-binary or genderqueer people."
msgstr "一面巨大的由粉色、蓝色和黄色组成的泛性恋旗帜。泛性恋骄傲旗帜用粉色表示喜欢女性的人，蓝色表示喜欢男性的人，黄色则表示喜欢非二元性别的人。"

#. ~ Description of variant "lesbian flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large pink, white and orange lesbian flag.  The dark orange representing \"gender non-conformity\", orange for \"independence\", light orange for \"community\", white for \"unique relationships to womanhood\", pink for \"serenity and peace\", dusty pink for \"love and sex\", and dark rose for \"femininity\"."
msgstr "一面巨大的由粉红色、白色和橙色组成的女同性恋旗帜。深橙色代表\"性别不一致\"，橙色代表\"独立\"，浅橙色代表\"社区\"，白色代表\"与女性的独特关系\"，粉红色代表\"宁静与和平\"，灰粉色代表\"爱与自由\"，暗玫瑰色代表\"女性气质\"。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large plastic trash bag with holes cut out for the head and arms."
msgstr "一个改造过的大塑料垃圾袋，在头部和手臂的位置开了洞。"

#. ~ Description of variant "asexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large purple, white, grey and black asexual flag.  Black for asexuality (feeling no sexual attraction), grey for grey-asexuality and demisexuality (feeling sexual attraction only sometimes), white for non-asexual partners and allies, and purple for community."
msgstr "一面巨大的由紫、白、灰和黑色组成的无性恋旗帜。黑色代表无性恋（没有那种世俗的欲望.jpg）灰色代表半无性恋（只是有时有那种世俗的欲望），白色代表非无性恋朋友或盟友，紫色代表社区。"

#. ~ Description of "pride flag"
#. ~ Description of variant "pride flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large rainbow flag, The colors reflect the diversity of the LGBT community and the spectrum of human sexuality and gender."
msgstr "一面大彩虹旗，颜色反映了LGBT群体的多样性以及人类性行为和性别的光谱。"

#. ~ Description of variant "progress pride flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large rainbow flag, The colors reflect the diversity of the LGBT community and the spectrum of human sexuality and gender.  On the left side you can see a chevron that features black, brown, light blue, pink, and white stripes to bring those communities to the forefront; \"the arrow points to the right to show forward movement, while being along the left edge shows that progress still needs to be made\"."
msgstr "一面巨大的彩虹旗，颜色反映了LGBT社区的多样性以及人类性行为和性别的光谱。在左边，你可以看到一个以黑色、棕色、浅蓝色、粉红色和白色条纹组成的大V字，带领社区走到了最前沿；\"箭头向右表示向前发展，箭头靠左表示仍需努力\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "USSR flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large red flag with a gold hammer and sickle beneath a star in the upper left corner.  The tools represent the alliance between the workers and peasants, while the star is the symbol of the Communist Party of the Soviet Union.  The USSR fell in 1991, but for many, the flag endures as a symbol of the promise (or threat) of communism."
msgstr "左上角有一颗大红旗，上面有金锤子和镰刀。  工具代表工农联盟，星星是苏联共产党的象征。  苏联于 1991 年解体，但对许多人来说，这面旗帜一直是共产主义承诺（或威胁）的象征。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Che Guevara flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large red flag with a man's face printed on it in a graphic style, all in black.  He has tousled hair and a beard, and wears a beret adorned with a star."
msgstr "一面大红旗，上面印有图形风格的男人脸，全部为黑色。  他有着凌乱的头发和胡须，戴着一顶饰有星星的贝雷帽。"

#. ~ Description of variant "SPQR flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large red flag with the gold letters \"SPQR\" on it, framed by a laurel wreath.  The letters stand for Senatus Populusque Romanus, a latin phrase referring to the government of Rome."
msgstr "一面大红旗，上面刻有金色字母“SPQR”，周围环绕着月桂花环。  这些字母代表 Senatus Populusque Romanus，这是一个拉丁短语，指的是罗马政府。"

#. ~ Description of variant "USMC flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large scarlet flag depicting the Corps emblem: A gold eagle carrying a globe and anchor.  A ribbon trailing from the eagle's mouth reads \"SEMPER FIDELIS\", and a larger one below the emblem reads \"UNITED STATES MARINE CORPS\"."
msgstr "一面大猩红色旗帜，描绘军团徽章：一只携带地球仪和锚的金鹰。  鹰嘴里拖出的一条丝带上写着“SEMPER FIDELIS”，徽章下方一条较大的丝带写着“UNITED STATES MARINE CORPS”。"

#. ~ Description of variant "US Air Force flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large ultramarine flag decorated with thirteen stars in a ring around a bald eagle above a shield.  The shield bears a stylized yellow and red aircraft with eight lightning bolts radiating from it, and a banner beneath reads, \"UNITED STATES AIR FORCE\"."
msgstr "一面巨大的群青旗，上面装饰着十三颗星星，围绕着盾牌上方的秃鹰。  盾牌上有一架风格化的黄色和红色飞机，上面有八个闪电，下面有一条横幅，上面写着“美国空军”。"

#. ~ Description of variant "US Army flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large white flag displaying the United States War Office Seal - a collection of arms and armor - in blue above a red banner reading \"UNITED STATES ARMY\".  At the bottom of the flag, the number 1775 commemorates the year that the continental army was created."
msgstr "一面巨大的白旗，上面印有美国陆军部印章（一系列武器和盔甲），上面是蓝色的红色横幅，上面写着“美国陆军”。  旗帜底部的数字1775纪念大陆军的创建年份。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Rhode Island flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large white flag of Rhode Island that features a golden anchor in the middle of it surrounded by thirteen gold stars, below the anchor is a blue banner that reads \"hope\"."
msgstr "罗得岛的一面大白旗，中间有一个金色的锚，周围环绕着十三颗金星，锚下方是一条蓝色的横幅，上面写着\"希望\"。"

#. ~ Description of "state flag"
#. ~ Description of variant "Massachusetts flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large white flag with a shield featuring an American Native and a star which represents the state of Massachusetts."
msgstr "一面大白旗，上面有代表美国原住民的盾牌和代表马萨诸塞州的星星图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "transgender flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large white, pink, and blue transgender flag.  The stripes at the top and bottom are light blue, the traditional color for baby boys.  The stripes next to them are pink, the traditional color for baby girls.  The white stripe is for people that are nonbinary, feel that they don't have a gender.  The pattern is such that no matter which way you fly it, it is always correct, signifying finding correctness in one's life."
msgstr "一面巨大的白色，粉色和蓝色组成的变性者旗帜。顶部和底部的条纹是浅蓝色代表男婴，旁边的粉红色代表女婴。白色的是为非二元者准备的，他们觉得自己没有性别。这个图案代表了这样一种含义，无论你想要怎样生活，都是正确的。代表了一个人在生活中找到了何为正确。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Gadsden flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large yellow flag depicting a coiled snake with its fangs bared.  Below it, the words \"DONT TREAD ON ME\"."
msgstr "一面巨大的黄色旗帜，上面画着一条盘绕的蛇，露出獠牙。  下面写着“别踩我”。"

#. ~ Description of variant "intersex flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large yellow, and purple intersex flag.  It displays a purple circle on a yellow field.  Yellow and purple were chosen as colors as they were viewed as free from gender associations and were historically used to represent intersex people.  The circle is described as \"unbroken and unornamented, symbolizing wholeness and completeness, and our potentialities\"."
msgstr "一面巨大的由黄色和紫色组成的双性人旗帜。他在黄色背景上印有一个紫色圆圈。选择了黄色和紫色，因为他们被视为没有性别关联，并且在历史上被用来表示双性人。这个圆圈被描述为\"完美无瑕，象征了整体性和完整性，以及我们的潜力\"。"

#. ~ Description of "rain poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A lightweight transparent PVC rain poncho with a hood.  It folds into a very compact form when not in use."
msgstr "这条使用太空时代材料制成的毯子可以覆盖你身上大部分重要部位。不用时，它可以折叠成非常紧凑的形状。"

#. ~ Description of "fur cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A long and heavy fur cape with a hood."
msgstr "带有兜帽的又长又重的毛皮斗篷。"

#. ~ Description of "cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A long hooded cape that covers much of the body."
msgstr "一条厚重的毛毯，可以用来当被子，也可以穿在身上进行保暖。"

#. ~ Description of "ferraiolo"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A long, crimson cape that reaches the ankles.  Worn by Catholic priests for ceremonious occasions."
msgstr "一件长长的，覆盖脚踝的深红色斗篷。天主教神父在隆重场合常穿着它主持仪式。"

#. ~ Description of "straw cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A long, mantled cape made of layers of dry grass strung together and carefully draped over each other.  It looks like something out of a samurai film."
msgstr "一种长长的、披着斗篷的斗篷，由多层干草串在一起并小心地相互覆盖而成。  它看起来就像武士电影中的东西。"

#. ~ Description of "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  It is turned on, and continually draining power from a UPS.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "一件塑料披风，镶嵌有照相机和LED灯。当被激活并穿戴之后，你将会在普通视觉上完全隐身。它已经开启，不断地消耗UPS电量。激活它来关闭。"

#. ~ Description of "FB51 optical cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  You must be carrying a unified power supply, or UPS, to use it.  Activate to toggle visibility."
msgstr "一件塑料披风，镶嵌有照相机和LED灯。当被激活并穿戴之后，你将会在普通视觉上完全隐身。你需要一个统一化电源，或者说UPS，来供电使用它。激活它以切换隐身模式。"

#. ~ Description of variant "wizard cloak" of item "costume cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A plush blue cloak with a silvery lining.  The cheap fabric is decorated with glittery stars."
msgstr "带有银色衬里的毛绒蓝色斗篷。  廉价的布料上装饰着闪闪发光的星星。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Swiss flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A red square flag with a white cross in the center."
msgstr "一面红色旗帜，中间有个白色的十字。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Peruvian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A simple flag that features a vertical triband of red, white, and red."
msgstr "一面红白红竖直三色条纹旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Russian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A simple horizontal tricolor flag of white, blue and red."
msgstr "一面白蓝红三色水平旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of "grass poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A simple primitive cape made of woven grass."
msgstr "用草编织而成的简单原始的斗篷。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Romanian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A simple vertical tricolor flag of blue, yellow, and red."
msgstr "一面蓝黄红竖直三色旗帜"

#. ~ Description of "wool poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A simple wool garment worn over the torso and upper arms."
msgstr "一件简单的羊毛衣服，穿在躯干和上臂上。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Fijian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A sky blue flag with a Union Jack in the hoist and a shield centered in the outer half of it with the cross of Saint George within it."
msgstr "一面天蓝色的旗帜，边缘有个英国国旗，外侧有个盾牌徽章，里面有个圣乔治十字架。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Democratic Republic Congo flag" of item "national
#. flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A sky blue flag with a yellow star in the upper left canton, diagonally running across the flag is a red strip and yellow fimbriation."
msgstr "一面天蓝色的旗帜，左上方有颗黄色的星星，红色与黄色条纹沿对角线穿过国旗。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Greek flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A striped colored flag of four white and five blue alternating horizontal stripes, with a white cross on the upper left corner."
msgstr "一面由四条白色五条蓝色交替组成的条纹旗帜，左上部有个白色的十字架。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pro-nuke flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A stylized mushroom cloud above the words \"NUKE 'EM ALL\" adorns this flag."
msgstr "“NUKE 'EM ALL”字样上方有一朵风格化的蘑菇云装饰着这面旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Swazi flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A triband flag of blue with a yellow outline and red in the middle, in the center is a Nguni shield and two spears."
msgstr "一面蓝黄红三色旗帜，黄色在边缘，红色在中间。在正中是一个恩古尼盾牌和两根矛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hungarian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A tricolor flag consisting of horizontal red, white and green."
msgstr "一面红白绿水平三色旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Irish flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A tricolor flag featuring vertical stripes of green, white, and orange."
msgstr "一面绿白橙三色竖纹旗帜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "French flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
