msgstr "一面红金绿竖直三色旗。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Guatemalan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A vertical triband flag that features a central band of white that holds the nation's coat of arms nestled between two bands of light blue."
msgstr "一面浅蓝夹白色的三色竖条旗帜，白色中间有个国徽。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Moldovan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A vertical tricolor of blue, yellow and red charged with the coat of arms centered on the yellow band."
