#. ~ Description of variant "Cabo Verde flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "It has a thin red line in the center, surrounded by white and blue.  To the left lies an oval of gold stars."
msgstr "白红白三色细条穿过蓝色的旗帜主体，靠左的地方有一圈金星围成了椭圆的形状。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Brazilian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "It has a yellow diamond on a light green base.  In the center of the diamond sits a blue orb with a curved, white line."
msgstr "浅绿色的旗面上有一颗黄色的菱形。菱形中心有一个蓝色的球体，球体上面有一条弯曲的白线。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Bosnian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "It has a yellow triangle over a navy blue background, with white stars running along one side."
