#. ~ Description of variant "incomprehensible flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "This large flag is adorned with a jumble of words and images, the product of either a diseased mind or somebody whose politics were on a level beyond your understanding.  Hate symbols and militant slogans share space with corporate logos, demands for sexual, gender, and racial liberation, and there are even a few cartoon characters on here."
