#. ~ Description of "yukata"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A Japanese robe similar to a Kimono, it's made of lightweight cotton, perfect for the Summer."
msgstr "类似于和服的日本长袍，由轻质棉制成，非常适合夏季穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "grim reaper's robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A black hooded grim reaper's robe with a face cover to hide the user's lack of facial skin.  It pairs nicely with a scythe.  Use it to remove the face cover and show yourself before your victims."
msgstr "一条带黑色头巾的死神长袍，带有面罩，以掩盖使用者所缺少的面部皮肤。它和镰刀特别搭配。使用它来取下面罩，向你的受害者展示自己。"

#. ~ Description of "emergency jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A bright, cheaply made FEMA-issue windbreaker jacket with a hood.  It's not much, but it might keep you from freezing until rescue arrives, assuming anyone's coming..."
msgstr "一件联邦紧急事务管理署分发的，有着鲜艳的红色反光条的廉价应急防风夹克，带了一顶兜帽。政府统一定制了一个谁穿都不会合身的尺寸，但能够帮助你保持体温并让搜救人员及时发现你。"

#. ~ Description of "cheap ghost's robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A cheap ghost costume comprised of a white sheet with two eye holes cut out.  A simple hat is worn underneath to keep the sheet in place."
msgstr "一条廉价鬼袍，由一条白色床单上开两个孔制成。上面有顶简单的帽子，用来固定床单。"

#. ~ Description of "nun habit"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A dark piece of clerical clothing.  Typically worn by Christian nuns."
msgstr "深色的神职人员服装。 通常由基督教修女穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "plague robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A dark robbed cassock worn by plague doctors."
msgstr "瘟疫医生穿的破旧深色袍服。"

#. ~ Description of variant "dobok" of item "gi"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A distinctive cloth jacket worn by practitioners of the Korean art of Taekwando.  It's lightweight, but sturdy enough to go to the mat."
msgstr "韩国跆拳道艺术练习者所穿的独特布夹克。  它很轻，但足够坚固，可以放在垫子上。"

#. ~ Description of "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A double-breasted uniform to protect against the heat of the kitchen."
msgstr "一件用来隔绝厨房高温的双排扣制服。"

#. ~ Description of "gi"
#. ~ Description of variant "gi" of item "gi"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A durable cloth jacket used as the top half of a uniform in many Japanese martial arts."
msgstr "一种耐用的布夹克，在许多日本武术中用作制服的上半部分。"

#. ~ Description of "combat blouse"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A fitted camouflage jacket, referred to as a blouse because it is worn untucked as part of a modern military uniform."
msgstr "合身的迷彩夹克，称为衬衫，因为它是现代军装的一部分，不塞进裤子里穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "tuxedo"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A full-body tuxedo.  Makes the apocalypse feel a little more classy."
msgstr ""
"一套全身燕尾服。\n"
"\"在末日来临之时也要有绅士风范。\""

#. ~ Description of "longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A full-length coat made of tough, rain-repellant material.  It has several pockets."
msgstr "由坚韧、防雨材料制成的长款外套。  它有几个口袋。"

#. ~ Description of "fur longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A full-length coat made of warm animal fur."
msgstr "由温暖的动物毛皮制成的长款外套。"

#. ~ Description of "leather longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A full-length leather coat with many pockets for storage."
msgstr "一件结实的全身长棉制防尘风衣，提供比较可观的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "turnout coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A heavy protective coat worn by firefighters, highly resistant to heat and flame."
msgstr "一件消防员经常穿的重型防护服，能防护高温和火焰。"

#. ~ Description of "peacoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A heavy wool coat, warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr "一件厚重的羊绒大衣，带着几个很深的口袋。"

#. ~ Description of "army winter jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A hooded jacket with lots of pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  Favored by the military."
msgstr "一件上面缝着不少口袋的外套，有防寒衬里。军队指定用品。"

#. ~ Description of "jean jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket made from denim."
msgstr "一件用牛仔布制成的夹克。"

#. ~ Description of "flannel jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket made from flannel, favored by outdoorsy types."
msgstr "由法兰绒制成的夹克，深受户外人士的青睐。"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket made of fake animal fur.  While not as fancy as a fur coat, its garish appearance still makes quite a statement."
msgstr "由人造动物毛皮制成的夹克。  虽然不像皮草大衣那么花哨，但其花哨的外观仍然很引人注目。"

#. ~ Description of "tactical jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket with a hood and several pockets."
msgstr "带兜帽和多个口袋的夹克。"

#. ~ Description of "varsity jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A letterman jacket, the type that the jocks in a highschool or a college would wear."
msgstr "莱特曼夹克，高中或大学的运动员会穿的类型。"

#. ~ Description of "windbreaker"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A light synthetic jacket with a hood.  Not very warm, but will keep out the rain."
msgstr "一件带有兜帽的化纤夹克，轻便耐用。保暖效果一般，但能够防雨。"

#. ~ Description of "nylon bomber jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A lightweight nylon bomber jacket."
msgstr "轻质尼龙飞行员夹克。"

#. ~ Description of "greatcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A long overcoat made from durable heavyweight wool."
msgstr "由耐用的厚重羊毛制成的长外套。"

#. ~ Description of "lab coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A long white coat with several large pockets.  Comes with a very nice pocket protector."
msgstr "一件多用于科学家实验时穿着的长长的白色大褂，两侧有几个大口袋。"

#. ~ Description of "thawb"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A long, loose-fitting robe with wide sleeves.  A traditional Arab garment."
msgstr "一件有着长而宽松的大袖管的阿拉伯传统服饰。"

#. ~ Description of "robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A long, plush housecoat, perfect for lounging around the house."
msgstr "长款毛绒家居服，非常适合在家里闲逛。"

#. ~ Description of "tunic"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A long-sleeved top that drapes almost to the knees."
msgstr "长袖上衣几乎垂至膝盖。"

#. ~ Description of "haori"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A loose coat with wide sleeves that is typically worn unfastened over a kimono."
msgstr "一种穿在和服上的宽松的大衣，袖子宽大。它是乌黑色的，上面有稀疏的、雅致的金色刺绣。"

#. ~ Description of "tangzhuang"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A loose-fitting Chinese jacket with a mandarin collar and frog ties down the front.  These were once common street fashion in China, but have long since become associated with martial arts from that country."
msgstr "宽松的中式夹克，中式领子，正面有青蛙领结。  这些曾经是中国常见的街头时尚，但早已与中国的武术联系在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "rag tunic"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A makeshift knee-length robe with a string tied around the waist to keep it all in place."
msgstr "一件粗制滥造的束腰外衣，用一根束腰带固定在位置上。"

#. ~ Description of "wizard robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A mysterious and arcane-looking robe.  It has a hood and some pockets for your magical artifacts."
msgstr "一件神秘的魔法长袍，象征着穿戴者在法师界中的地位。它带有一顶兜帽和一些口袋，用来装你的魔法物品。"

#. ~ Description of "cassock"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A piece of clerical clothing, usually worn by Christian priests."
msgstr "一件通常是由基督教牧师穿着的神职人员服装。"

#. ~ Description of "Santa jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A red jacket, trimmed with white faux fur, commonly used by bearded men on Christmas.  Warm and has a couple of small pockets."
msgstr "一件装饰着白色人造毛皮的红色夹克，常被那个在圣诞节出现的长胡子男人使用。保暖而且还有两个小口袋。"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A rugged full-length longcoat that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件耐用的、等身长的无袖防尘大衣，让你的手臂不受束缚。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "sexy Santa jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A short red jacket with white faux fur as trim.  It's sleeveless, so Santa can show off his guns when he comes down your chimney this year."
msgstr "一件红色短夹克，镶着白色人造毛边。它是无袖的，所以圣诞老人今年从你家烟囱下来的时候，可以秀一把他的肌肉。"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless tunic"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A sleeveless cloth garment that covers the torso and legs."
msgstr "一件无袖连身衣，覆盖了躯干和腿部。"

#. ~ Description of "leather jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A soft leather jacket.  It's tough, but not as heavy-duty as the kind favored by motorcyclists."
msgstr "柔软的皮夹克。  它很坚固，但不像摩托车手喜欢的那种重型。"

#. ~ Description of "bathrobe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A terrycloth housecoat generally worn on the way to or from the bath."
msgstr "毛圈布家居服，通常在往返浴室的路上穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "leather riding jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick and heavy leather jacket used most commonly by motorcyclists, equestrians, and other Road Warriors."
msgstr "一件厚重的皮革夹克，是摩托车手、马术骑手和澳洲义务警员通常会穿的那种。"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick faux fur longcoat, falling below your knees.  Has many pockets for storing things."
msgstr "一件结实的全身长厚人造毛皮制防尘风衣，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless fur longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick fur full-length longcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚实的无袖毛皮防尘风衣，让你的手臂有足够的伸展自由。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless leather longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick leather full-length longcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚实的无袖皮革防尘风衣，让你的手臂有足够的伸展自由。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless faux fur longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick, sleeveless faux fur longcoat, falling below your knees.  Has many pockets for storing things."
msgstr "一件结实的全身长厚人造毛皮制无袖防尘风衣，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#. ~ Description of "light jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thin jacket with a hood.  It's good for brisk weather, not so much for rain."
msgstr "一件有兜帽的棉制轻型夹克，没有什么储存空间，还不保暖，但非常轻便舒适。适合在天气凉爽时穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "kasaya"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A traditional ankle-length Buddhist robe, stitched together from three pieces of traditional saffron dyed cloth."
msgstr "袈裟是一种传统的长及脚踝的佛教僧袍，由三块藏红花染色的传统布料缝合而成。"

#. ~ Description of "kimono"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A traditional ankle-length Japanese robe, wrapped around the body with a sash."
msgstr "一件长至脚踝的传统日式长袍，穿好后还得缠上腰带。"

#. ~ Description of "samghati"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A traditional, double-layered Buddhist coat.  Used as an outer cloak for various occasions."
msgstr "一件传统的佛教双层大衣，在各种场合作为外衣穿戴。"

#. ~ Description of "jean vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A vest made from denim."
msgstr "由牛仔布制成的背心。"

#. ~ Description of "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A vintage piece of a military uniform from the 20th century, or possibly a newer reproduction of one.  It's a comfortable jacket made of lightweight poplin"
msgstr "一件 20 世纪军装的复古单品，或者可能是军装的更新版复制品。  这是一款由轻质府绸制成的舒适夹克"

#. ~ Description of "rain coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A vinyl coat with a hood and two very large pockets, meant to provide protection from rain."
msgstr "一件带有兜帽和两个大口袋的乙烯基外套，旨在提供防雨保护。"

#. ~ Description of "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A warm jacket made of animal fur, once a symbol of wealth."
msgstr "由动物毛皮制成的保暖夹克，曾经是财富的象征。"

#. ~ Description of "fur vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A warm vest made of animal fur."
msgstr "一个由皮革制成的钱包。"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A warm vest made of fake animal fur."
msgstr "一件用充满气的动物毛皮制造而成的救生衣。"

#. ~ Description of "winter coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A warm, padded coat with deep pockets and a hood."
msgstr "一件有着深口袋和兜帽的棉大衣，非常保暖。"

#. ~ Description of "ghost's robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A white hooded ghost's robe characteristic of souls that haunt the living world."
msgstr "一条带白色头巾的鬼袍，看上去像是出没于活者世界的鬼魂。"

#. ~ Description of "kittel"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A white, knee-length cotton robe, traditionally worn by Jews on special occasions."
msgstr "一件及膝的白色棉制长袍，是犹太人在特殊场合穿着的传统服饰。"

#. ~ Description of "waistcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "An elegant waistcoat.  Ideal for those occasions when wearing only a shirt would be too casual and a suit would be overdoing it."
msgstr "一件优雅的背心。当穿衬衫太随意，穿正装又太过的时候，就选择它吧。"

#. ~ Description of "ski jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "An insulated, breathable hoodie made for alpine skiing.  Very warm, and with sizable pockets."
msgstr "一件专为高山滑雪而设计的保暖透气连帽衫。非常暖和，带有很大的口袋。"

#. ~ Description of "gutskin parka"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "An intricately sewn coat of treated and split intestines, prized for its light weight and waterproof qualities among the indigenous peoples of the arctic."
msgstr "一件经过精心缝制的防寒大衣，使用处理过的割开的动物肠子制成。因其轻便防水，在北极的土著居民中备受青睐。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "tactical jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Arm pocket."
msgstr "手臂口袋。"

#. ~ Description of "hakama"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Japanese pants traditionally worn with kimono or kendogi, they have wide legs and seven distinctive pleats."
msgstr "日本裤子传统上与和服或剑道服搭配穿着，具有宽腿和七个独特的褶皱。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Santa jacket"
msgid_plural "Santa jackets"
msgstr[0] "圣诞夹克"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "tactical jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/armor/storage.json
