#. ~ Description of "overgrown iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "A chunk of otherworldly carapace that looks like it was at one point shaped like armor, but is now bulky and overgrown with sharp pieces jutting out haphazardly.  Scarred into the outer surface you can barely make out the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  It looks like you could force it into a ballistic vest."
msgstr "一块来自异界的甲壳，看起来曾被整形成装甲板的模样，但现在十分笨重，长满了随意伸出的尖锐碎片。外表面嵌着一道深深的疤痕，你勉强能够分辨出那是\"打击面\"的字样。看起来你可以把它强行塞进防弹背心中。"

#. ~ Description of "iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into the outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  It looks like you could force it into a ballistic vest."
msgstr "一块来自异界的甲壳，看起来被整形成防弹装甲板的模样，稍稍有些弧度。外表面的划痕标记出\"打击面\"的字样。看起来你可以把它塞进防弹背心中。"

#. ~ Description of "undergrown iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into the outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  The armor coverage is spotty and it appears to be oozing and pulsing like it is in pain."
msgstr "一块来自异界的甲壳，看起来被整形成防弹装甲板的模样，稍稍有些弧度。外表面的划痕标记出\"打击面\"的字样。装甲板上布满了斑痕，它似乎在疼痛中不停跳动着渗出粘液。"

#. ~ Description of "plate of scarred flesh"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "A chunk of otherworldly flesh that seems to have been forced into the shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  There is no armor left on this plate, just a mass of writhing alien flesh oozing in pain.  However, it looks like it is slowly growing back."
msgstr "一块来自异界的血肉，看起来被整形成防弹装甲板的模样，稍稍有些弧度。装甲板上以及完全没有甲壳了，只剩下一大团不断抽搐着渗出粘液的异界血肉。然而它看起来正在慢慢恢复。"

#. ~ Description of "resonating gorget"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "A heavy-duty gorget or collar made from odd materials that hums slightly.  It feels damp to the touch and there is a mechanical button of some kind on the front.  The inside reads \"CAREFUL CHOKING HAZARD!  THIS WAY DOWN\"."
msgstr "一个坚固耐用的护喉，由某种奇怪的材料制成，发出微弱的蜂鸣声，触感潮湿，正面有某种机械按钮。内侧写着\"小心窒息危险！此面朝下\"的字样。"

#. ~ Description of "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "A slimy layer of liquid has completely engulfed your body from the neck down and seems to move with you - the sensation is uncomfortable.  The liquid appears bound to the resonating collar at your neck; the inside of the collar reads \"CAREFUL CHOKING HAZARD!  THIS WAY DOWN\".  The ooze flows freely, covering your entire body but never crossing the gorget to get to your head."
msgstr "一层粘糊糊的液体从脖子以下完全吞没了你的身体，似乎在跟着你移动，感觉很不舒服。液体似乎受到你护喉的约束，明显在一同振动，内侧写着\"小心窒息危险！从此面脱下\"的字样。软泥可以在你全身自由地流动，但决不会穿过护喉碰到你的头部。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "resonating gorget"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "Activate the device"
msgstr "激活设备"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "Deactivate the device"
msgstr "关闭设备"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "resonating gorget"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "Murky ooze begins to leak out of the gorget and engulf your body from the neck down!"
msgstr "浑浊的软泥从护喉中渗出，把你脖子以下的身体完全吞没！"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "The gorget hums and the liquid gets sucked back into it."
msgstr "护喉嗡嗡作响，液体被吸了回去。"

