#. ~ Description of "welding goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A dark pair of goggles.  They make seeing very difficult, but protect you from bright flashes."
msgstr "一副深色护目镜。让你看不太清四周，但能够保护你免受眩光影响。"

#. ~ Description of "ski goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A large pair of light-reactive goggles that completely seal off your eyes.  In addition to blocking glare without impeding vision in the dark, they provide excellent protection from environmental dangers."
msgstr "一副特别针对恶劣的气候和有害物质、可为眼睛提供全方位的防护的大型护目镜。"

#. ~ Description of "bifocal glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and far-sighted.  You can use them to focus sunlight."
msgstr "一副可调焦点的眼镜，针对同时近视及远视的人群。你可以用它来聚焦阳光。"

#. ~ Description of "bifocal sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of bifocal sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes of those who are both near-sighted and far-sighted."
msgstr "一副可调焦点的太阳镜，能够保护你免受眩光影响，针对同时近视及远视的人群。"

#. ~ Description of "eclipse glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of cardboard-framed glasses with UV and IR-filtered lenses topped with a layer of aluminum coating.  They allow safe viewing of extremely bright and harmful sources of light, like the sun during a solar eclipse."
msgstr "一副用硬纸板作为镜框的眼镜，在已经过UV及IR镀膜的镜片外又再用一层铝箔覆盖。这让佩戴者能够用眼睛安全直视非常亮的会伤眼的光源，例如日食时的太阳。"

#. ~ Description of "fit-over sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of fit-over sunglasses designed to be worn over a pair of corrective glasses.  Good for keeping the glare out of your eyes."
msgstr "一副外罩式太阳镜，可罩在普通眼镜外边，避免你的眼睛被太阳光刺激导致眩目。"

#. ~ Description of "transition reading glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of glasses for the far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else.  Contains photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken when exposed to ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the lenses fade back."
msgstr "一副变色眼镜，针对远视人群。含有感光变色染料，当暴露于太阳光的紫外线下时，会使镜片中的染料激活变暗。当紫外线减弱时，镜片会褪色。"

#. ~ Description of "reading glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of glasses for the far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else.  You can use them to focus sunlight."
msgstr "一副远视眼镜，用与远视眼者佩戴来纠正视力。你可以用它来聚焦阳光。"

#. ~ Description of "eyeglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of glasses for the near-sighted.  The concave lenses diffuse the sunlight, rendering them useless for starting fires."
msgstr "一副近视眼镜。凹透镜将阳光散射，所以无法用于生火。"

#. ~ Description of "glass goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of old-fashioned goggles with thick glass lenses, somewhat similar to those worn by the pilots of open-cockpit aircraft.  They're not airtight, but might still offer some protection."
msgstr "一副带有厚玻璃镜片的老式护目镜，有点类似于开放式驾驶舱飞机的飞行员所戴的护目镜，看起来做工更粗糙。无法保护你的眼睛免受物理伤害，但可以防止有害化学物质进入。"

#. ~ Description of "safety glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of plastic glasses, used in workshops, sports, chemistry labs, and many other places.  Provides great protection from damage."
msgstr "一副塑料护目镜。用于工作室，运动以及化学实验室等地方。为眼睛提供了不错的伤害防护。"

#. ~ Description of "stylish bifocal glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of stylish bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and far-sighted."
msgstr "一副时髦的可调焦点的眼镜，针对同时近视及远视的人群。"

#. ~ Description of "stylish transition bifocal glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of stylish bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and far-sighted.  Contains photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken when exposed to ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the lenses fade back."
msgstr "一副可调焦点的时髦变色眼镜，针对同时近视及远视的人群。含有感光变色染料，当暴露于太阳光的紫外线下时，会使镜片中的染料激活变暗。当紫外线减弱时，镜片会褪色。"

#. ~ Description of "stylish bifocal sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of stylish bifocal sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes of those who are both near-sighted and far-sighted."
msgstr "一副时髦的可调焦点的太阳镜，能够保护你免受眩光影响，针对同时近视及远视的人群。"

#. ~ Description of "stylish reading glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of stylish glasses for the far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else."
msgstr "一副时髦的远视眼镜，用与远视眼者佩戴来纠正视力。"

#. ~ Description of "stylish corrective glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of stylish glasses for the near-sighted.  The concave lenses diffuse the sunlight, rendering them useless for starting fires."
msgstr "一副时髦的近视眼镜。凹透镜将阳光散射，所以无法用于生火。"

#. ~ Description of "stylish reading sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of stylish sunglasses, looks good while keeping the glare out of the eyes of those who are far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else."
msgstr "一副时髦的太阳眼镜，看起来非常时尚，能够保护你免受眩光影响，针对远视人群。"

#. ~ Description of "stylish corrective sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of stylish sunglasses, looks good while keeping the glare out of the eyes of those who are near-sighted."
msgstr "一副时髦的太阳眼镜，看起来非常时尚，能够保护你免受眩光影响，针对近视人群。"

#. ~ Description of "stylish sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of stylish sunglasses.  Look good while keeping the glare out of your eyes."
msgstr "一副时髦的太阳镜，看起来非常时尚，同时可以防止太阳光刺激导致的眩目。"

#. ~ Description of "reading sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes of those who are far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else."
msgstr "一副太阳眼镜，能够保护你免受眩光影响，针对远视人群。"

#. ~ Description of "corrective sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes of those who are near-sighted."
msgstr "一副太阳眼镜，能够保护你免受眩光影响，针对近视人群。"

#. ~ Description of "sunglasses"
