#. ~ Description of "wool coif"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "A cloth coif with neck and forehead protection.  Resting on your shoulders, it serves as padding for a helmet.  Though it's pretty warm, it is constructed of layered wool quilting and provides substantial protection even on its own."
msgstr "保护颈部和前额的布头巾，有点像修女穿的那种。它下部垂在肩上，作为头盔的衬垫。它很暖和。它由层叠羊毛绗缝制成，本身就提供不错的防御。"

#. ~ Description of "quilted arming pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "A facsimile of padded armor once used in the middle ages, these pants are made of quilted fabric filled with dense stuffing.  Though the design is centuries old, it looks like their time may have come round again."
msgstr "这种裤子是中世纪曾使用过的加垫盔甲的仿制品，由填充了密集填充物的绗缝面料制成。虽然设计已有数百年历史，但它看起来似乎又重新流行起来了。"

#. ~ Description of "quilted gambeson (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "A medieval coat of quilted armor made of a few layers of durable cloth with stuffing sewn in between.  These versatile garments could serve as protection on their own, or be used as part of a set, with mail or leather worn beneath.  Activate it to tighten the fit."
msgstr "一种中世纪的绗缝盔甲外套，由几层耐用的布料制成，中间缝有填充物。  这些多功能服装可以单独用作保护，也可以作为套装的一部分使用，里面穿有锁子甲或皮革。  激活它以收紧配合。"

#. ~ Description of "quilted gambeson"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "A medieval jacket of quilted armor made of a few layers of durable cloth with stuffing sewn in between.  These versatile garments could serve as protection on their own, or be used as part of a set, with mail or leather worn on the outer layers.  Activate it to loosen the ties and wear it as outerwear instead."
msgstr "一种中世纪的绗缝盔甲夹克，由几层耐用的布料制成，中间缝有填充物。  这些多功能服装可以单独用作保护，也可以作为套装的一部分使用，外层穿锁子甲或皮革。  激活它以松开领带并将其作为外套穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "quilted coif"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "A medieval-style head covering made of quilted fabric padded with stuffing.  It offers some protection on its own, and might also serve as padding for a proper helmet."
msgstr "一种中世纪风格的头罩，由绗缝织物制成，填充有填充物。  它本身提供了一些保护，也可以作为合适头盔的衬垫。"

#. ~ Description of "quilted surcoat (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "A simple vest of medieval padded armor, made by sewing stuffing between quilted fabric.  It can serve as standalone protection or be worn over other armor.  Activate it to tighten the fit."
msgstr "一种简单的中世纪衬垫盔甲背心，通过在绗缝织物之间缝制填充物制成。  它可以作为独立的保护，也可以穿在其他盔甲上。  激活它以收紧配合。"

#. ~ Description of "quilted surcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "A simple vest of medieval padded armor, made by sewing stuffing between quilted fabric.  It can serve as standalone protection or be worn under armor.  Activate it to loosen its fit."
msgstr "一种简单的中世纪衬垫盔甲背心，通过在绗缝织物之间缝制填充物制成。  它可以作为独立的保护，也可以穿在盔甲下。  激活它以松开其配合。"

#. ~ Description of "wool aketon"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "A thick cloth jack, intended to be worn below metal armor.  This one is made of layered wool quilting and it provides fairly decent protection on its own."
msgstr "一件厚外套，专门穿在金属盔甲下面。由许多层羊毛绗缝制成，本身就能提供可观的防御。"

#. ~ Description of "wool aketon vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "A thick cloth vest, intended to be worn below metal armor.  This one is made of layered wool quilting and it provides fairly decent protection on its own."
msgstr "一件厚背心，专门穿在金属盔甲下面。由许多层羊毛绗缝制成，本身就能提供可观的防御。"

#. ~ Description of "wool arming gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "Tough cloth gloves made of layered wool quilting, thin enough to wear under metal gauntlets.  They help to keep your hands safe during a fight."
msgstr "层叠绗缝羊毛制成的坚韧手套，薄度适合戴在金属护手下。它们有助于在格斗中保护你的手。"

#. ~ Description of "wool arming pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "Tough cloth pants worn alongside an aketon underneath metal armor.  This one is made of layered wool quilting and it provides fairly decent protection on its own."
msgstr "一条穿在金属盔甲下的衬铠裤子，由绗缝羊毛层叠制成，提供可靠的防护。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "quilted gambeson"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "You loosen the fit of your gambeson."
msgstr "你从 %s 上取下了物品。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "quilted surcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid "You loosen the fit of your surcoat."
msgstr "你从 %s 上取下了物品。"

