#. ~ Description of "claw gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid "A pair of well-made black stretch vinyl gloves with black steel claws connected to the fingers.  Used in BDSM performances or as part of a costume, they're not likely to help in a fight."
msgstr "一副制作精良的黑色弹性塑料手套，手指上安装着黑色的钢爪。通常用于BDSM表演或作为COS服装的一部分。"

#. ~ Description of "beekeeping gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
