#. ~ Description of "ballistic mandible guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A ballistic jaw guard designed to be attached on a military helmet, but easily adjustable to helmets with any kind of rail system installed."
msgstr "一个下颌防护装置，原本设计用于安装在军用头盔上，但可轻松调节以适配各种带滑轨的头盔。"

#. ~ Description of "mesh nape protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A common mesh nape protector intended to be attached on a hard hat or helmet to protect against the sun while letting the cold wind refresh your nape."
msgstr "一种常见的颈背保护装置，用于安装在安全帽或头盔上，在遮蔽阳光的同时让凉风能吹到你的后颈。"

#. ~ Description of "nape protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A common nape protector intended to be attached on a hard hat or helmet to protect against the sun and dust."
msgstr "一种常见的颈背保护装置，用于安装在安全帽或头盔上，以防止阳光和灰尘。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic chin guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A common plastic chin guard designed to be attached to the straps of any common hard hat or helmet."
msgstr "一个普通的塑料下巴护具，可以安装在任何常见安全帽或头盔的带子上。"

#. ~ Description of "shield visor"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A common shield visor intended to be attached on a hard hat or helmet."
msgstr "一个普通的防护面罩，可以安装在安全帽或头盔上。"

#. ~ Description of "sun shield"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A common sun shield intended to be put over a hard hat to protect the user from the sun."
msgstr "一种常见的防晒面罩，用于戴在安全帽上，以保护用户免受阳光照射。"

#. ~ Description of "counterweight pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A counterweight pouch attachable to the back of a hard hat or helmet to balance the weight on your head.  You can store batteries or some other very small items in it."
msgstr "一个配重袋，可安装在安全帽或头盔的后部，以平衡头部的重量。你也可以在其中存放电池，或其他一些非常小的物品。"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar nape protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A custom-made Kevlar strengthened nape protector intended to be attached on a hard hat or helmet to protect your nape against cuts and slashing attacks."
msgstr "一种定制的凯夫拉加强型颈背保护装置，用于安装在安全帽或头盔上，以保护颈背免受割伤和砍伤。"

#. ~ Description of "enhanced night vision goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A new and rare high-resolution thermal NVG device, designed to be mounted on a compatible helmet.  Lets you see in the dark, and detects heat signatures emitted by (un)living organisms.  Currently raised up and out of the way."
msgstr "一种罕见的新型高分辨率热 NVG 设备，设计用于安装在兼容的头盔上。  让您在黑暗中看到东西，并检测（非）生物体发出的热信号。  目前已升起且不碍事。"

#. ~ Description of "enhanced night vision goggles (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A new and rare high-resolution thermal NVG device, designed to be mounted on a compatible helmet.  Lets you see in the dark, and detects heat signatures emitted by (un)living organisms.  It is turned on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "一种罕见的新型高分辨率热 NVG 设备，设计用于安装在兼容的头盔上。  让您在黑暗中看到东西，并检测（非）生物体发出的热信号。  它已打开，并且不断耗尽电池电量。  用它来将其关闭。"

#. ~ Description of "attachable ear muffs (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A pair of ear muffs attachable to a hard hat or helmet to reduce noise exposures to safe levels.  Activate to put ear muffs into a standby position, letting you clearly hear again."
msgstr "一对可安装在硬帽或头盔上的耳罩，可将噪声暴露降低到安全水平。激活它来使耳罩进入待机状态，让你再次清晰地听到声音。"

#. ~ Description of "attachable ear muffs"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A pair of ear muffs attachable to a hard hat or helmet to reduce noise exposures to safe levels.  Activate to put ear muffs into a working position, blocking most sounds."
msgstr "一对可安装在硬帽或头盔上的耳罩，可将噪声暴露降低到安全水平。激活它来使耳罩进入工作状态，阻挡大部分声音。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic face shield"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A plastic face shield with a mounting bracket intended to be attached over a hard hat or helmet.  It doesn't protects you as much as one made from thermoplastic, but it's cheaper and more common."
msgstr "一个带有安装支架的塑料面罩，可以安装在安全帽或头盔上。它的保护效果不如热塑面罩，但更便宜而且更常见。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic mandible guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A plastic jaw guard designed to be strapped to any common hard hat or helmet, it was probably part of some costume before the world ended."
msgstr "一个塑料护颌，可以绑在任何常见的安全帽或头盔上，它可能是世界末日之前某些服装的一部分。"

#. ~ Description of "face shield"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A thermoplastic face shield with a mounting bracket intended to be attached over a hard hat or helmet."
msgstr "一个带有安装支架的热塑性面罩，可以安装在安全帽或头盔上。"

#. ~ Description of "EOD face shield"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A thick polycarbonate and plexiglass face shield with a mounting bracket intended to be attached to a ballistic helmet for protection from blast and fragmentation in 'non-permissive environments'."
msgstr "厚聚碳酸酯和有机玻璃面罩，带有安装支架，旨在连接到防弹头盔上，以防止“不允许的环境”中的爆炸和碎片。"

#. ~ Description of "panoramic night vision goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "Advanced GPNVG with four image intensifier tubes, allowing for a large field of view at night, designed to be mounted on a compatible helmet.  Currently raised up and out of the way."
msgstr "先进的 GPNVG 配有四个图像增强管，可在夜间提供大视野，设计用于安装在兼容的头盔上。  目前已升起且不碍事。"

#. ~ Description of "panoramic night vision goggles (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "Advanced GPNVG with four image intensifier tubes, allowing for a large field of view at night, designed to be mounted on a compatible helmet.  It is turned on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "一个系在可调整的带子上的LED手电筒，可以把它穿在头上或者系在头盔上。它已经被开启，不断耗电来产生光亮。激活来关闭它。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "EOD face shield"
msgid_plural "EOD face shields"
msgstr[0] "排爆面罩"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "Kevlar nape protector"
msgid_plural "Kevlar nape protectors"
msgstr[0] "凯夫拉后颈护具"

#. ~ Description of "night vision goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "Last generation double-tube night vision device, designed to be mounted on a compatible helmet.  Currently raised up and out of the way."
msgstr "最新一代双管夜视装置，设计用于安装在兼容的头盔上。  目前已升起且不碍事。"

#. ~ Description of "night vision goggles (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "Last generation single-tube night vision device, designed to be mounted on a compatible helmet.  Limited field of view while activated.  It is turned on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "一个系在可调整的带子上的LED手电筒，可以把它穿在头上或者系在头盔上。它已经被开启，不断耗电来产生光亮。激活来关闭它。"

