#. ~ Description of "soviet tanker helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A Soviet era tanker helmet.  Its distinctive foam pads are meant to protect a tank driver from bumps against the cramped interior."
msgstr "苏联时代的油轮头盔。  其独特的泡沫垫旨在保护坦克驾驶员免受狭窄车内碰撞的影响。"

#. ~ Description of "helmet liner"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A cloth liner worn inside a helmet to help keep your head warm in cold climates.  It might also provide some padding against helmets that didn't have any."
msgstr "一个垫在头盔里的保暖内衬。"

#. ~ Description of "conical helm"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A conical iron helm with additional protection for the neck, associated with the Mongol Empire."
msgstr "一件锥形的铁制头盔，在颈部有额外的保护，源自蒙古帝国。"

#. ~ Description of "firefighter helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A distinctive helmet worn by firefighters to protect from falling debris.  More than just a piece of firefighting equipment, it serves as a badge of honor and respect."
msgstr ""
"一顶消防员配发的特制头盔，由盔壳、面罩、披肩、缓冲层等部分组成，具备防尖锐物品冲击、防腐蚀、防热辐射、反光、绝缘、轻便等性能。\n"
"\"烈火雄心，尸海纵横。\""

#. ~ Description of "baseball helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A hard plastic helmet that covers the head and ears, designed to protect against a baseball to the head."
msgstr "一顶坚硬的塑料头盔，覆盖了头部和耳朵。用来保护选手不被棒球直接命中头部。"

#. ~ Description of "army helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A heavy helmet that provides excellent protection from all sorts of damage.  It is labeled as an advanced combat helmet."
msgstr "一顶沉重的头盔，能很好地保护你免受各种伤害。上面有个标记写着\"先进作战头盔\"。"

#. ~ Description of "football helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A heavy polycarbonate helmet normally worn by football players.  It comes with a visor to protect the eyes."
msgstr "一个沉重的聚碳酸酯头盔，通常由足球运动员佩戴，有一个护目板来保护眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr "一对由经过精心清理并裁剪过的酸蚁硅化甲壳制成的头盔，防酸但很脆弱。"

#. ~ Description of "riding helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet designed to protect from falls and kicks involving horses, has a small peak to protect from glare."
msgstr "一顶设计来防护马匹踢击或是从马匹摔落伤害的头盔，有一个防止太阳眩光的顶罩。"

#. ~ Description of "jockey skull cap"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet designed to protect from falls and kicks involving horses."
msgstr "一顶设计来防护马匹踢击或是从马匹摔落伤害的头盔。"

#. ~ Description of "kettle helm"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet fashioned in the shape of a cap with a wide brim.  It leaves the face and neck exposed, but offers a bit of cover from glare and rain."
msgstr "头盔形状为宽边帽形。  它使脸部和颈部暴露在外，但提供了一点遮挡眩光和雨水的保护。"

#. ~ Description of "pot helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet made from a soup pot.  It's not very good protection, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"一个扣在头上、勉强可以称为头盔的锅子，防护性能不佳，但聊胜于无。\n"
"\"流行于中东极端反政府游击队的'爆'款头盔。\""

#. ~ Description of "chitin helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet made from the exoskeletons of insects.  Covers the entire head; very light and durable."
msgstr "一顶由昆虫甲壳制成的头盔，覆盖了整个头部。轻巧又耐用。"

#. ~ Description of "leather helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet made of shaped and hardened leather."
msgstr "经过硬化定型处理的皮革头盔。"

#. ~ Description of "full-face motorcycle helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet that covers the entire head along with glareproof visors, offering the best protection for when you ride around on your motorcycle.  Activate to raise the visor."
msgstr "一个带有防眩光面罩的全包式头盔，为你的摩托骑行提供最好的防护。激活它以升起面罩。"

#. ~ Description of "full-face motorcycle helmet (raised visor)"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet that covers the entire head along with glareproof visors, offering the best protection when you ride around on your motorcycle.  The visor is raised.  Activate to put down the visor."
msgstr "一个带有防眩光面罩的全包式头盔，为你的摩托骑行提供最好的防护。面罩已经升起。激活它以放下面罩。"

#. ~ Description of "sheet metal helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A helmet that looks like a crude bucket with the face cut out.  It comes with a bevor to distribute some of the weight to your shoulders, as well as cloth padding to keep your bell from being rung."
msgstr "一个头盔，看起来像一个粗糙的铁桶，面前有开口。带有将一些重量分配到肩膀上，同时防止你被像大钟一样敲得嗡嗡响的布垫。"

#. ~ Description of "pot helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A huge makeshift helmet made from a canning pot."
msgstr "一个使用水浴锅制成的还凑合的超大号头盔。为了那些真正走投无路的人型猪头熊。（注：南方公园S10E6）"

#. ~ Description of "tactical helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A lightweight black helmet that provides excellent protection from all sorts of damage.  It has a military rail system for attachments."
msgstr "一顶轻型黑色头盔，能很好地保护你免受各种伤害。它有一套用于安装附件的军用导轨系统。"

#. ~ Description of "airsoft helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A lightweight helmet that is fashioned to look like a real military helmet, but is made of plastic and only protects against BB's and other light threats.  It has a military rail system for attachments."
msgstr "一顶轻便的头盔，外形仿照真正的军用头盔，但是由塑料制成，只能防止BB弹和其他轻微的威胁。它有一套用于安装附件的军用导轨系统。"

#. ~ Description of "kabuto"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A medieval Japanese helmet with a scowling face mask that provides excellent protection to the entire head and face."
msgstr "一顶日本武士中将领级别所装备的兜冑，可以为头部与面部提供出色的防御能力。"

#. ~ Description of "visored plate helm (raised)"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A medieval helmet made of steel platemail.  It provides excellent coverage for the head and neck, though at the moment not the face.  Activate it to lower the visor."
msgstr ""
"夏雷尔盔，激活它以调节面甲。\n"
"一款中世纪晚期流行的德式头盔，覆盖了头部和眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of "visored plate helm"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A medieval helmet made of steel platemail.  It provides excellent coverage for the head and neck.  Activate it to raise the visor."
msgstr ""
"夏雷尔盔，激活它以调节面甲。\n"
"一款中世纪晚期流行的德式头盔，覆盖了头部和眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of "barbute helm"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A medieval helmet that provides excellent protection for the head, with a Y shaped opening for the face."
msgstr "一顶有着标志性\"Y\"字型开面的步兵钢盔，起源于15世纪的意大利，外型与古希腊科林斯人佩戴的头盔类似，非常坚固。"

#. ~ Description of "great helm"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A medieval helmet that provides excellent protection to the entire head, at the cost of great encumbrance."
msgstr ""
"一顶平顶的、全覆式、只留很小的眼睛与嘴部开口的封闭的头盔，欧洲军队的骑士们在公元1220年到1540年之间广泛的配备这种头盔，有效的防护利器与钝器造成的伤害。\n"
"\"头盔两边没有翅膀，虽然不够拉风但是不用担心挂在树枝上了。\""

#. ~ Description of "flak helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A simple helmet meant to protect the head from fragmentation and impacts.  Its simple steel construction renders it outdated by modern military standards."
msgstr "一种旨在保护头部免受碎片和冲击伤害的简单头盔。其简单的钢结构对于现代的军事标准来说已经过时了。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A solid, single piece closed bronze helmet with a slit for the eyes."
msgstr "一顶坚固的整体成型的封闭式青铜头盔，在眼部有个开口。"

#. ~ Description of "pickelhaube"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A spiked helmet once worn by German military officers.  The spike is ornamental."
msgstr "一个在十九世纪和二十世纪广泛被德国的军队、 消防队员、警察配备的标志性尖顶头盔，亦被普鲁士与其他军队使用。"

#. ~ Description of "turban helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A style of helmet once used in the Middle East, cylindrical on the top with protection for the nose and ears but nothing lower."
msgstr "中东曾经使用过的一种头盔，顶部呈圆柱形，可以保护鼻子和耳朵，但下部没有任何保护。"

#. ~ Description of "bike helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "A thick foam helmet.  Designed to protect against concussion."
msgstr "一顶厚实的泡沫塑料头盔。设计用来防止佩戴者摔出脑震荡。"

#. ~ Description of "skid lid"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "Also called a crash helmet, this piece of headgear is often worn by bikers and extreme sportsmen who prefer to keep their faces uncovered."
msgstr "这种头盔也称为防撞头盔，通常由喜欢裸露脸部的骑自行车者和极限运动员佩戴。"

#. ~ Description of "galea"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "An Imperial Roman helmet, with distinct projections protecting the sides of the head."
msgstr "一顶罗马帝国头盔，有其独特的突出部以保护头部两侧。"

#. ~ Description of "tactical full helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "An all-encompassing black helmet that covers your entire face and neck, providing excellent protection from all sorts of damage."
msgstr "一顶全覆盖式的黑色头盔，覆盖面部和颈部，保护你免受各种伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "Corinthian helm"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "An ancient Greek bronze helmet that provides excellent protection for the head, with slits for the eyes and mouth."
msgstr "一顶古希腊青铜头盔，为头部提供了极好的保护，在眼部及嘴部留有缝隙。"

#. ~ Description of "nasal helm"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "An early medieval helmet with a projection guarding the nose, to better protect the face without obstructing vision.  Proper Viking gear, unlike the stereotypical horned helm."
msgstr "一顶中世纪早期的头盔，有保护鼻子的突起，防护良好的同时又不遮挡视线。可能是更适用的维京人装备，而不是刻板印象中的带角头盔。"

#. ~ Description of "pot great helm"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "An enclosed helmet made from a stock pot with a blanket stuffed inside to cushion it.  There are strings tied to the handles to help fasten it to your body, but it's hot and unwieldy."
msgstr "一个由汤锅制成的封闭式头盔，前面被粗略地刻出一个了\"T\"字，里面塞了一条毯子来做衬垫。锅把上系着绳子，以便能够绑在你身上，但穿起来十分受限，令人窒息。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "Corinthian helm"
msgid_plural "Corinthian helms"
msgstr[0] "科林斯盔"

#. ~ Description of "head guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid "Lightweight sports headgear designed to protect the head while sparring, a frequent sight in boxing gyms and dojos."
msgstr "一顶轻型格斗头盔，用来在拳击对练时保护选手头部。"

