#. ~ Description of "western gun belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A Western-style gun belt as worn by cowboys and gunfighters in the movies and on TV. Has loops across the back to hold spare ammo.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一条西部风格的枪背带，就是电影电视中牛仔和枪手穿的那种。在背部有绳圈，可以放下备用子弹。激活以收拔枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "large nylon holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger firearms, but made with nylon instead of leather.  Activate to holster/draw a gun"
msgstr "一个带扣具组成的腰带式枪套，用于存放于较大的枪械，但是由尼龙而不是皮革制作的。激活它来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "large holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger firearms.  Slightly more cumbersome than a standard holster due to the straps that hold it flat against your leg.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一个挂在臀部的皮枪套，包含用于大型枪械的皮带及锁扣。由于枪械被皮带平放在腿旁，使得它比标准枪套要更加累赘。激活它来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "shoulder holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A comfortable quick-draw holster for larger pistols.  One side holsters a gun, and the other side holds two magazines.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一对设计舒适的快拔枪套，用于大型手枪。一侧用来装枪，另一侧用来装两个弹匣。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "fast draw holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A comfortable quick-draw holster for small guns.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一个设计舒适的快拔枪套，用于小型枪械。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "single point sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A harness going over your shoulder and across your chest.  Designed to connect to a rifle at a single point with the rifle hanging off your front.  Great for fighting, not great for travel.  Activate to holster/draw your weapon."
msgstr "一条背在肩上斜跨过胸口的背带。设计用于和步枪单点连接，将其悬挂在你身前。利于战斗，但不便携行。激活它来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "baldric holsters"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A leather harness which can hold up to six pistol-sized guns in total, available for quick drawing.  Historically, similar harnesses were used by pirates to carry multiple loaded flintlock pistols at once, as reloading them is a lengthy process.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一根斜挎的皮枪套，可同时容纳最多六支手枪尺寸的枪械，枪械可快速拔出。历史上海盗们使用类似的皮枪套来同时携带多把燧发手枪，因为重新装弹耗时漫长。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "back holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A leather holster, big enough for a rifle or other large gun.  Designed to be strapped to the back.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一个皮革枪套，大的能装下步枪或其他大型枪械，正确用法是用带子跨在背部.激活来放入/取出枪支。"

#. ~ Description of "holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A leather strap worn on the hip for holding pistol-sized guns.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一个挂在臀部的皮枪套，可以放一把手枪尺寸的枪械。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A modified army harness, repurposed to carry several small and a single medium sized drone alongside the tools to maintain them."
msgstr "一种改进的军用背带，重新用于携带几架小型和一架中型无人机以及维护它们的工具。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A series of connectors meant to hold a medium sized drone on your back."
msgstr "一条用于将中型无人机固定在背上的背带。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A series of connectors meant to store a small drone."
msgstr "一条用于将小型无人机固定在背上的背带。"

#. ~ Description of "ankle holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A small concealed holster worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to holster/draw a small pistol."
msgstr "一个穿在脚踝上的枪套。不经过练习用起来很笨拙。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "bow sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A somewhat complicated set of straps and fabric to keep your bow close to hand and (mostly) out of harm's way.  Activate to holster/draw your bow."
msgstr "一套较为复杂的由带子和布料组成的装备。让你随手取用弓，同时保护（大部分）弓身。激活它来收拔弓。"

#. ~ Description of "belly band holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A wide elastic belly belt with a built-in holster for a pistol and a spare magazine.  It is very awkward to use without practice.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一种宽而有弹性的腹部腰带，带有内置手枪套和弹匣袋。不经练习就使用它的话会感到非常不方便。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "deep concealment holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "An elastic band with numerous provisions for concealing a very small pistol close to the body.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一条弹性皮带，可以在紧贴身体的地方隐藏一把非常小的手枪，只有专业人士才能使用自如。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Gadget pouch"
msgstr "小背带"

#. ~ Description of "nylon holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Holster made from nylon, rather than leather.  A bit stronger and lighter, but not as fashionable.  Activate to draw/holster a gun."
msgstr "尼龙制成的枪套，而不是皮革。稍微更坚固且更轻，但也没那么时尚了。激活以拔出/放入枪械。"

#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Medium drone strap"
msgstr "中号无人机背带"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Quick access pouches."
msgstr "快取口袋"

#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Small drone holder"
msgstr "小型无人机背带"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Tool clip"
msgstr "工具夹"

#. ~ Description of "front-to-back double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Two holsters attached together by a strap, one in front of the other.  The placement means that drawing a gun out of the front holster is slower than the other holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "两个枪套，一个重叠在另一个前面。这也意味着从任何一个枪套中拿取，都会比普通枪套更慢。激活以放入/取出枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "side-by-side double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Two holsters attached together by a strap, right next to each other.  The placement means that drawing guns out of either one is slower than a regular holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "两个枪套，由条带并排连接在一起。这也意味着从任何一个枪套中拿取，都会比普通枪套更慢。激活以放入/取出枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "nylon front-to-back double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Two nylon holsters attached together by a strap, one in front of the other.  The placement means that drawing a gun out of the front holster is slower than the other holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "两个尼龙枪套，一个重叠在另一个前面。这也意味着从任何一个枪套中拿取，都会比普通枪套更慢。激活以放入/取出枪械。"

#. ~ Description of "nylon side-by-side double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
