#. ~ Description of "beekeeping hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A beekeeping hood.  Keeps the bees out, but lets fresh air in."
msgstr "一顶防蜂兜帽，阻止蜜蜂进入的同时能通风透气。"

#. ~ Description of "ninja cowl"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A cloth hood that covers the mouth, leaving only the wearer's eyes exposed."
msgstr "布兜帽遮住嘴巴，只露出佩戴者的眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of "leather hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A cowl made to fit over the head, leaving only the face exposed.  It is quite thick and may be of some use in combat."
msgstr "罩在头上，只露出脸。  它相当厚，在战斗中可能会有一些用处。"

#. ~ Description of "gutskin hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A hood sewn from treated and split intestines, the perfect companion for a gutskin parka."
msgstr "一件用处理过的割开的动物肠衣制成的兜帽，是爱斯基摩肠制大衣的完美伴侣。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail coif"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A protective hood made of interlocking steel rings that drape down to cover the neck.  It is of poor quality."
msgstr "由互锁钢环制成的防护罩，可垂下来遮盖颈部。  它的质量很差。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail coif"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A protective hood made of interlocking steel rings."
msgstr "由互锁钢环制成的防护罩。"

#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant cowl"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A snug fitting garment that protects your head and neck, made from lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric.  Tough yet breathable, it is light and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr "一件能保护你头部和颈部的贴身服装，由很轻的芳纶防火织物制成。结实又透气，穿在其他衣服下既轻便又舒适。"

#. ~ Description of "rain hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A waterproof hood made to be worn in bad weather."
msgstr "一件天气不好时穿戴的防水兜帽。"

