#. ~ Description of "shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A bulky calcareous shell, with most of the torso tucked up inside."
msgstr "一个巨大的石灰质外壳，大部分躯干都藏在里面。"

#. ~ Description of "feathers"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A coat of soft plumage, growing right out of the skin to cover the head and much of the body."
msgstr "一层柔软的羽毛，从皮肤中长出来，覆盖头部和身体的大部分。"

#. ~ Description of "summer coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A covering of fur that has thinned out for the summer."
msgstr "夏季变得稀疏的毛皮覆盖物。"

#. ~ Description of "patchwork armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A dense calico of scale and fur compete with variegated skin, feathers, and horn buds across this armored hide."
msgstr "浓密的鳞片和皮毛与覆盖在这片装甲兽皮上的杂色皮肤、羽毛和角芽相互竞争。"

#. ~ Description of "shaggy fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A heavy shag carpet of fur, somewhere between a ballistic vest and attic insulation."
msgstr "一层厚厚的毛绒地毯，强度介于防弹背心和阁楼保温棉之间。"

#. ~ Description of "patchwork skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A hideous amalgam of scale, skin, and fur, knotted with osteoderms and patches of shining scales."
msgstr "鳞片、皮肤和毛皮的可怕混合物，由骨皮和闪闪发光的鳞片打结。"

#. ~ Description of "stinger"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A hypodermic barb of glass-sharp chitin."
msgstr "一根由玻璃般锋利的角质物制成的皮下注射针状刺。"

#. ~ Description of "roomy shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A large mollusk shell, big enough for its owner to retract their body into or even store a few items inside."
msgstr "一个巨大的软体动物壳，大到足以让主人将身体缩进里面，甚至可以在里面存放一些物品。"

#. ~ Description of "light fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A light coat of fur growing in patches all over the body."
msgstr "全身各处斑块状生长的薄毛皮。"

#. ~ Description of "incisors"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pair of chisel-like incisors which protrude from the upper and lower jaw."
msgstr "一对凿状门牙，从上颌和下颌突出。"

#. ~ Description of "saber teeth"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pair of enormous protruding fangs, strong enough to punch through bone."
msgstr "一对巨大的尖牙突出，足以刺穿骨头。"

#. ~ Description of "fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pair of fangs sharp and sturdy enough to use in combat."
msgstr "一对锋利而坚固的尖牙，足以在战斗中使用。"

#. ~ Description of "hooves"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pair of hard, solid hooves sheathing the unguligrade feet in a protective layer of horn."
msgstr "一对坚硬而坚固的蹄子将非古利动物的脚包裹在一层角的保护层中。"

#. ~ Description of "fresh antlers"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pair of short antlers, still covered in fuzzy velvet.  Until they're fully grown in, they likely won't be much use outside of a grapple."
msgstr "一对短鹿角，仍然覆盖着毛茸茸的天鹅绒。  在它们完全长大之前，它们在格斗之外可能不会有太大用处。"

#. ~ Description of "horns"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pair of short horns protruding from the scalp."
msgstr "一对短角从头皮上伸出。"

#. ~ Description of "nacreous shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pearlescent mollusk shell, beautiful to behold and large enough for its owner to hide inside of or store a few items."
msgstr "珠光软体动物的贝壳，看起来很漂亮，而且足够大，可以让主人隐藏在里面或存放一些物品。"

#. ~ Description of "phelloderm"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pliable but hefty layer of living plant matter."
msgstr "一层柔软而厚重的活植物物质。"

#. ~ Description of "bionic filtration system"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A powered system of filters working to keep the airways clear of dust, smoke, and airborne toxins."
msgstr "一套由过滤器组成的动力系统，用于保持呼吸道畅通，过滤粉尘、烟雾和空气中的毒素。"

#. ~ Description of "protective bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A powerful layer of bark, thicker in parts."
msgstr "一层强大的树皮，局部比较厚。"

#. ~ Description of "sclerotin right pincer"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A powerful tool for snatching fish or breaking open shells."
msgstr "一只强力的蟹螯。这个大钳子无论是抓鱼还是开蚌壳都很好用。"

#. ~ Description of "antlers"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A regal pair of branching antlers."
msgstr "一条带有毛皮内衬的厚实裤子。非常保暖。"

#. ~ Description of "drill beak"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A sharp, pointed beak.  The surrounding structure seems fully capable of absorbing the shock of it jackhammering into wood or bone."
msgstr "一只尖锐且锋利的喙。其周边的结构能够高效地吸收它像电钻般凿穿木材或骨骼时产生的震动冲击。"

#. ~ Description of "scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A sheen of scales covering most of the skin.  They are tough, but remain smooth and flexible."
msgstr "鳞片的光泽覆盖了大部分皮肤。  它们很坚韧，但保持光滑和灵活。"

#. ~ Description of "rabbit fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A soft, fluffy coating of fur.  It isn't the best protection against predators, but stays warm in bad weather."
msgstr "一层柔软蓬松的毛皮覆盖。虽然防不住捕食者的利爪，但在恶劣天气里还能保持温暖。"

#. ~ Description of "crushing beak"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A stout, curved beak, like a parrot's.  It's sharp and looks like it could deliver a formidable bite."
msgstr "像鹦鹉一样粗壮且弯曲的喙。非常锋利，具有极强的咬合力。"

#. ~ Description of "mane"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A thick ruff of fur around the throat."
msgstr "喉部周围有一圈浓密的毛发。"

#. ~ Description of "thick scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A tough hide plated with scales and bony ridges."
msgstr "坚韧的兽皮，覆盖着鳞片和骨脊。"

#. ~ Description of "sclerotized carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A tremendous crustacean shell that covers the body in articulated plates."
msgstr "巨大的甲壳动物外壳，用铰接板覆盖身体。"

#. ~ Description of "fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A warm furry hide."
msgstr "一个水龙头。"

#. ~ Description of "tail club"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A weighty knob of fused vertebrae and osteoderms weighing down the tip of the tail like a ball and chain."
msgstr "由融合椎骨与皮内成骨构成的沉重肿块，如球链般坠于尾尖。"

#. ~ Description of "vampire fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A wicked pair of fangs, pointed and surgically sharp."
msgstr "一对可怕的毒牙，如外科手术刀般尖利。"

#. ~ Description of "sleek scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "An iridescent sheen of fine scales growing over the skin."
msgstr "皮肤上生长着虹彩般的细鳞片。"

#. ~ Description of "chitin carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Armored plates of chitin which form a hardened shell around much of the body."
msgstr "几丁质装甲板在身体的大部分周围形成坚硬的外壳。"

#. ~ Description of "distributed bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Bark evenly spread evenly across the body."
msgstr "树皮均匀覆盖全身。"

#. ~ Description of "latticed bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Bark, latticed to provide strong but uneven protection."
msgstr "树皮呈网状排列，提供坚固但分布不均的防护。"

#. ~ Description of "consolidated bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Bark, thicker around the trunk."
msgstr "树干周围的树皮更厚。"

#. ~ Description of "cranial reinforcement"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Bolted to the bone, a set of interlocking subdermal plates protect the skull and cervical vertebrae from trauma."
msgstr "一组互锁的皮下板用螺栓固定在骨头上，保护颅骨和颈椎免受创伤。"

#. ~ Description of "rigid eyestalks"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Compound eyes on rigid stalks which can fold back against the head."
msgstr "复眼长在坚硬的茎上，可以向后折叠抵住头部。"

#. ~ Description of "curled horns"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Curled horns, like those of a ram."
msgstr "角卷曲，像公羊的角。"

#. ~ Description of "toe claws"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Curved claws adorn the feet, ideal for gripping perch and prey alike."
msgstr "脚上有弯曲的爪子，非常适合抓住鲈鱼和猎物。"

#. ~ Description of "toe talons"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Curved talons adorn the feet like sickles, perfect for the killing blow."
msgstr "弯曲的爪子像镰刀一样装饰在脚上，非常适合致命一击。"

#. ~ Description of "protective lenses"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Highly protective lenses which can retract into frames bolted right into the user's skull.  They provide near-total protection for the eyes and even function underwater."
msgstr "高度防护的镜片可以缩回到用螺栓固定在用户头骨上的框架中。  它们为眼睛提供近乎全面的保护，甚至在水下也能发挥作用。"

#. ~ Description of "claws"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Long, sharp claws at the tips of the fingers."
msgstr "你的指甲从指尖长出，形成了又尖又利的爪。"

#. ~ Description of "nails"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Long, sharp fingernails, thickened and durable enough to be dangerous.  On close examination, these don't quite look human."
msgstr "指甲长而锋利，又厚又耐用，足以造成危险。  仔细观察，这些看起来不太像人类。"

#. ~ Description of "long horns"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Long, stabbing horns protruding from the skull."
msgstr "长而刺人的角从头骨中伸出。"

#. ~ Description of "wide mouth"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Most people's mouths aren't as wide as their head.  This one is."
msgstr "大多数人的嘴并不像他们的头那么宽。  这个是。"

#. ~ Description of "shark teeth"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Rows of jagged teeth, essentially a biological chainsaw.  They're best used in deep water."
msgstr "一排锯齿状的牙齿，本质上是一把生物电锯。  它们最好在深水中使用。"

#. ~ Description of "sparse scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Scales, like those of a fish or a snake, grow in patches over the skin."
msgstr "鳞片就像鱼或蛇的鳞片一样，在皮肤上成片地生长。"

#. ~ Description of "jumbled skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Skin like a spilled tub of paints, splattered in abstract shapes of hide, fur, and scale."
msgstr "皮肤就像一桶被泼洒出的油漆，溅成一滩滩甲壳、毛皮和兽皮的抽象形状。"

#. ~ Description of "fingertip razors"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Small steel blades peek from beneath the fingernails, like a manicure from hell."
msgstr "小钢刀片从指甲下面露出来，就像来自地狱的美甲。"

#. ~ Description of "reticulae"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Soft, flexible scales cover the lower legs and feet.  Though not especially tough, they provide some protection."
msgstr "小腿和脚上覆盖着柔软、有弹性的鳞片。  虽然不是特别坚固，但它们提供了一些保护。"

#. ~ Description of "fresh chitin carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The exoskeleton is soft and vulnerable.  It would be best to hide until it hardens."
msgstr "柔软且脆弱的几丁质甲壳。你最好先让它避避风头，等它完全硬化。"

#. ~ Description of "sleek fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The fur of a proud hunter."
msgstr "一位骄傲猎手身上的皮毛。"

#. ~ Description of "gray fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The shaggy fur of a wild beast."
msgstr "一种强壮的野生动物的毛皮。"

#. ~ Description of "sucker hooks"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The suckers on the paddle-shaped feeding tentacles bear swiveling hooks of wickedly sharp chitin, perfect for snaring prey."
msgstr "桨状捕食触手上的吸盘带有锋利的甲壳质旋转钩，非常适合诱捕猎物。"

#. ~ Description of "mandibles"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "These are much better than puny human mouthparts."
msgstr "这些比人类的小口器要强得多。"

#. ~ Description of "fresh sclerotized carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "This recently-molted carapace is still soft, and will need time to harden before it provides proper protection."
msgstr "刚蜕皮成型的骨质厚甲，还是软的。还需要一些时间来硬化才能提供防护能力。"

#. ~ Description of "barbed tongue"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Though this tongue fits neatly within the mouth, it can extend to an astonishing length.  Sharp chitin barbs like a grotesque parody of a cat's tongue line the surface, and the barb at the tip looks more like a whaler's harpoon than something that belongs in a mouth."
msgstr "虽然这条舌头恰好适合口腔，但它可以延伸到惊人的长度。  锋利的几丁质倒刺就像猫舌头的怪诞模仿，尖端的倒刺看起来更像是捕鲸者的鱼叉，而不是属于嘴里的东西。"

#. ~ Description of "compound eyes"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Thousands of ommatidea tesselate into a pair of eyes.  Each jewel-hard hexagonal lens picks up the dominant color in its field of view, rendering a single pixel to the image composited by the viewer's brain."
msgstr "成千上万的小眼镶嵌成一双眼睛。  每个宝石般坚硬的六边形镜片都会拾取视野中的主色，将单个像素渲染到观看者大脑合成的图像上。"

#. ~ Description of "ocular scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Transparent scales seal the corneas behind a firm but flexible lens.  It's enough to keep water and most irritants at bay, and it would be very difficult to sneak up on one who sleeps with their eyes open."
msgstr "透明的鳞片将角膜密封在坚固但灵活的晶状体后面。  这足以阻止水和大多数刺激物的进入，并且很难偷偷接近睁着眼睛睡觉的人。"

#. ~ Description of "epicuticle"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Unnaturally smooth skin made of soft chitin.  Though soft and pliable, it's tougher than human flesh."
msgstr "由柔软的甲壳素制成的异常光滑的皮肤。  虽然柔软而柔韧，但它比人肉更坚韧。"

#. ~ Description of "scruffy fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "While still formidable, this furry hide has lost a lot of its bulk to better endure the summer months."
msgstr "虽然仍大得可怕，这张毛皮已经去除了绝大多数的体积，可以更好地适应夏季。"

#. ~ Description of "folding fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your fangs have properly developed, and are prepared for the kill.  They are easier to use against prey that is vulnerable or webbed."
msgstr "毒牙已经伸出，做好了杀戮的准备。"

