#. ~ Description of "barrette"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A barrette with lots of ornaments."
msgstr "一个有很多装饰的条形发夹。"

#. ~ Description of "leather collar"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A black leather 'collar' with a bell dangling from the front.  Don't worry, the bell is silent."
msgstr "一个黑色皮革的项圈，前面挂了一个不会发出声音的装饰铃铛，非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Description of "cowrie bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A bracelet made of cowrie shells, valued in many African cultures such as the Yoruba.  If you want, you could meditate with this."
msgstr "由贝壳制成的手镯，在约鲁巴等许多非洲文化中都很有价值。  如果你愿意的话，你可以用这个来冥想。"

#. ~ Description of "marshal badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A bright silver star strikes fear into the eyes of ne'er-do-wells."
msgstr ""
"一只闪亮的星形徽章，标志着佩戴者是名执法官。\n"
"\"耀眼的光芒直刺恶徒恐惧的双眼。\""

#. ~ Description of "pearl collar"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A collar made from round and lustrous pearls, its former owner must have been a wealthy individual."
msgstr "一条由光彩迷人的浑圆珍珠制成的项链，它的前主人一定是个有钱人吧。"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur kitty collar"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A decorative 'collar' made out of faux fur, complete with a little bell hanging from the front.  Don't worry, it's silent."
msgstr "一个人造毛皮制成的装饰用的项圈，前面还配了一个不会响的小铃铛，非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Description of "fur kitty collar"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A decorative 'collar' made out of fur, complete with a little bell hanging from the front.  Don't worry, it's silent."
msgstr "一个毛皮制成的装饰用的项圈，前面还配了一个不会响的小铃铛，非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Description of "gold bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A fancy golden bracelet."
msgstr "一个时髦的金手镯。"

#. ~ Description of "gold ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A flashy gold ring."
msgstr "一个华丽的金戒指。"

#. ~ Description of "platinum bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A flawless platinum bracelet."
msgstr "一只完美无瑕的铂金手镯。"

#. ~ Description of "wedding ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A flawless ring, ensnaring a diamond with twists of pure gold.  It's a constant reminder that the wearer is married."
msgstr "一枚无瑕的戒指，中间用缠结的纯金线嵌住一颗钻石。这是它的佩戴者已经结婚成家的长久证明。"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur cat tail"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A fuzzy garishly colored tail weighted down with tiny beads of plastic.  Sways behind you when you walk."
msgstr "一个小珠子吊着一条亮色毛绒绒的尾巴，当你走路时会随之摆动！非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Description of "fuzzy cat ears"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A fuzzy pair of brownish cat ears on a headband.  It does nothing, but there's no reason not to look good even if no one's looking."
msgstr "一副棕色绒绒的猫耳发箍。它没有任何实际作用，但即便没人关注，好看总没坏处。"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur cat ears"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A fuzzy pair of garishly colored cat ears on a headband.  It does nothing, but there's no reason not to look good even if no one's looking."
msgstr "一对毛绒绒的亮色猫耳头带，非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Description of "fuzzy cat tail"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A fuzzy tawny tail weighted down with tiny beads of plastic.  Sways behind you when you walk."
msgstr "一串塑料小珠子吊着一条黄色毛茸茸的尾巴，当你走动时会随之摇摆，非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Description of "gold tiara"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A glittering gold tiara adorned with jewels."
msgstr "一顶闪亮的镶有祖母绿的金头饰。"

#. ~ Description of "leather cat tail"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A glossy black leather tail weighted down with tiny beads of plastic.  Sways behind you when you walk."
msgstr "一个小珠子吊着一条漆黑光滑的皮制尾巴，当你走路时会随之摆动，非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Description of "signet ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A gold and silver ring with a wide stamp attached to the band.  A long time ago, the stamp was legible, but now the pattern is too worn to discern its former use."
msgstr "一枚金银制成的戒指，上面连接着一个宽大的印章。印章很久以前曾经清晰可辨，但是现在已经磨损严重，看不出过去的用途了。"

#. ~ Description of "gold hairpin"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A gold hairpin, designed by the rich, for the rich."
msgstr "一根纯金发夹，专为富人设计的奢侈品。"

#. ~ Description of "diamond and gold ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A gold ring with a sparkling diamond mounted on top of it.  Back in the old days, this could have been worth a fortune."
msgstr "一个金戒指，顶部有一颗闪光的钻石，在大灾变之前可以值很大一笔钱。"

#. ~ Description of "gold watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A gold-plated steel self-winding wristwatch, suitable for a retirement present.  Tells the time and looks good."
msgstr "一块镀金的自动发条手表，适合作为退休礼物送人。能够看时间并且很美观。"

#. ~ Description of "copper hairpin"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A hairpin made from copper."
msgstr "一只铜制的发夹。"

#. ~ Description of "jade brooch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A hand-crafted jade brooch of Oriental origin."
msgstr "一个手工制作的远东风格的翡翠胸针。"

#. ~ Description of "gold locket"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A heart-shaped gold locket with a frame inside to store photographs or small objects."
msgstr "一条心形的金质盒式小吊坠，有一个可以存放照片或其他小物件的夹层。"

#. ~ Description of "friendship bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A homemade bracelet crafted from colorful knickknacks.  It's not very expensive, but it's the effort that makes it special."
msgstr "一根用五颜六色的小装饰品制成的自制手链。不是很值钱，但是礼轻情义重。"

#. ~ Description of "SWAT badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A matte-finish silver shield identifies the wearer as an authority who goes in when the bots just aren't enough."
msgstr "一个亚光处理的银制盾牌状徽记，标志着佩戴者是名在情况恶化到机器人警察都无法应对时出现的S.W.A.T单位成员。"

#. ~ Description of "gold medal"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A medal awarded for achieving first place in some event.  Before everything fell apart, this was likely a source of great pride for its owner.  Now it's just another shiny bauble."
msgstr "一块某个活动的冠军奖章。在过去的一切分崩离析之前，它是它主人自傲的本钱，然而现在它只是一个闪闪发光的小玩意。"

#. ~ Description of "silver medal"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A medal awarded for achieving second place in some event.  Before everything fell apart, this was likely a source of pride for its owner.  Now it's just another shiny bauble."
msgstr "一块授予某个赛事第二名的奖牌。在世界末日前这会是它主人的骄傲，事到如今它只是一个闪光的装饰品。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze medal"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A medal awarded for achieving third place in some event.  It might be worth something if it was made of bronze; this one is made from brass."
msgstr "在某项赛事中获得第三名而颁发的奖牌。 如果它是青铜制成的，它可能会值一些钱； 这个是黄铜制成的。"

#. ~ Description of "service medal"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A medal awarded to military personnel for heroism, wounds suffered in combat, or distinguished service."
msgstr "授予英雄主义、战中负伤或功绩杰出军人的勋章。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jehovah's Witnesses necklace" of item "holy
#. symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with a Jehovah's Witnesses Bible symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the faith of the Jehovah's Witnesses.  The pendant is shaped like a small black Bible, and reads: 'Jehovah's Witnesses, Proclaimers of God's Kingdom', and on the other side, 'No Blood Transfusion!  See medical directive in wallet or purse'."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是耶和华见证人的圣经符号。它是耶和华见证人信仰的象征。吊坠的形状像一本黑色的小圣经，上面写着： \"耶和华见证人，上帝之国的宣讲者\"，另一面是\"禁止输血！请看钱包或皮包里的医疗指示\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "cross necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with a plain cross symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of Christian faith, no matter the denomination."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是一个普通的十字架符号。它是基督教信仰的象征，不管是什么教派。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Adventist Bible necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Adventist Bible symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Adventist Christian faith.  The cross means the Sacrifice of Christ for humanity and also the Gospel of Salvation, the open book means the Holy Bible, placed prominently at the bottom to represent how God's word is fundamental to Adventism, and the flame is the symbolic meaning of the Holy Spirit, the Messenger of Truth."
msgstr "项链由细金链制成，吊坠带有复临圣经符号。  它是复临基督教信仰的象征。  十字架意味着基督为人类所做的牺牲，也意味着救赎的福音，打开的书意味着圣经，放在底部显着的位置，代表上帝的话语是复临主义的基础，火焰是真理的使者圣灵的象征意义。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Unity of the Brethren necklace" of item "holy
#. symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Agnus Dei symbol of the Unity of the Brethren as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Moravian Church Christian faith, where the round pendant displays the image of the 'Lamb of God', and reads: 'Our Lamb has Conquered, Let Us Follow Him'."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是弟兄合一会行羔羊颂的符号。它是摩拉维亚弟兄会基督教信仰的象征，其中的圆形吊坠描绘了\"上帝的羔羊\"形象，并写道：\"我们的羔羊已被征服，让我们跟随祂\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ankh necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Ankh Cross symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Kemetist faith.  While the Coptic Church of Egypt inherited the ankh as a form of the Christian cross, symbolizing eternal life through Christ, the source of its major use in modern times was through a new religious movement attempting to revive the ancient polytheistic beliefs of Ancient Egypt.  It means 'eternal life'."
msgstr "一条由细密金链金链制成的项链，有一个安卡十字作为吊坠。 它是凯美特信仰的象征。虽然埃及科普特教会继承了安卡作为基督教十字架的一种形式，象征着基督带来的永生，但它在现代主要被一种新的宗教运动使用，试图复兴古埃及多神教信仰。它意味着\"永生\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Baha'i Star necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Baha'i Star symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Baha'i faith.  The Baha'i nine-pointed star reflects the importance of the number for the Faith.  The number nine is the highest single digit number, which symbolizes wholeness and the fulfillment of the expectations of all prior religions."
msgstr "一根由细金链制成的项链，吊坠为巴哈伊之星标志，是巴哈伊信仰的象征。巴哈伊的九芒星反映了数字对信仰的重要性。数字九是最高的个位数，它象征着整体性和实现所有先前宗教的期望。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Baptist necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Baptist symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Baptist Christian faith.  It doesn't display any idol or symbol, instead, in the oval pendant, it reads: 'All Scripture is God-breathed and is useful for teaching.  Timothy 3:16-17', in a water-like background, denoting the Waters of Baptism."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，有浸信会的标志作为挂坠，是浸信会基督信仰的象征。它上边没有任何偶像或符号，而在椭圆形的吊坠上写着：\"所有的文书已经由上帝默示的，也对教导是有益的。\"其如水的背景，代指浸信会洗礼用的圣水。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Brethren Cross necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Brethren Cross symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Plymouth Brethren Christian faith, which displays the symbols of the Cross (representing the Resurrection of Christ), the Circle (which represents the Earth and Union), and the wave (which denotes The Waters of Baptist)."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠上有弟兄会的十字架符号。它是普利茅斯弟兄会基督教信仰的象征，展示了十字架（代表基督的复活）、圆环（代表地球和联合）和波浪（表示施洗者的水）等符号。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Calvinist Cross necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Calvinist Cross symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Calvinist Christian faith.  While Calvin rejected the images of saints and the crucifix (that is, the image of the body of Christ upon the cross), it allowed a plain Calvinist cross.  The pendant is a plain cross with the symbol of a tulip, denoting the TULIP Calvinist acronym for the five essential doctrines of Total depravity, Unconditional election, Limited atonement, Irresistible grace, and Perseverance of the saints."
msgstr "一条用细密金链打造的项链，有一个加尔文十字作为吊坠，这是加尔文派基督教信仰的象征。加尔文派则拒绝接受圣徒的形象和十字架（也就是基督的身体在十字架上的形象），只允许一个简单的加尔文十字架，上面有一个郁金香的标志。郁金香（TULIP）是加尔文派五个基本教义的缩写，即：完全的堕落，无条件的选择，有限的赎罪，不可抗拒的恩典。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Cao Dai necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Cao Dai symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of Caodaism faith.  In Vietnamese, 'Cao' literally means 'high', while 'Dai' means 'tower', 'palace' or 'abode'. The combined verbal image is used to represent both a heavenly place and a Supreme Being envisioned as creating all religions and beings on the earth.  The visual symbol used by Caodaism followers for this Supreme Being is an all-seeing eye, the Cao Dai."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是高台教的标志，是高台教信仰的象征。在越南，\"Cao\"字面意思是\"高\"，而\"Dai\"意思是\"塔\"、\"宫殿\"或\"居所\"。这个组合的语言形象既用来代表一种天国，也代表一个被设想为创造地球上所有宗教和生命的最高存在。高台教的信徒对这个最高存在的视觉符号是一只能看清一切的眼睛，即Cao Dai。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Catholic Crucifix necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Catholic Crucifix symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Roman Catholic Christian faith.  The main difference between the Catholic Crucifix and a Protestant Cross is that the Catholic Crucifix has a central figure hanging on them, but Protestant crosses do not depict such images."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，有一个天主教十字架吊坠，是罗马天主教派基督信仰的象征。天主教与新教十字架最大的不同在于，天主教十字架会有悬挂的人形形象，而新教十字架不会有这种描绘。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Celtic Cross necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Celtic Cross symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol a variety of Christian faith denominations, such as the Anglicans or Presbyterians.  Featuring a nimbus or ring that emerged in Ireland, France and Great Britain in the Early Middle Ages, it is a type of ringed cross.  It became widespread through its use in the stone high crosses erected across the islands, especially in regions evangelized by Irish missionaries, from the ninth through the 12th centuries."
msgstr "一根细密金链打造的项链，吊坠为凯尔特人的十字架符号。它是各种基督教信仰教派的象征，如圣公宗或长老会。它以中世纪早期在爱尔兰、法国和英国出现的神圣光环图案为特色，是一种带有环形的十字架。从9世纪到12世纪，它因为在整个岛屿，特别是在爱尔兰传教士传教的地区，被用于打造大量石制高十字架而广泛传播。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Confucius necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Confucius symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Confucianism faith and philosophical system.  The Confucius symbol represents the man who began the religion, as he is one of, if not the most important person to come from Confucianism.  Popular among martial artists and young people because of anime."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠为孔子的标志，是儒家信仰和哲学体系的象征。孔子的标志代表了这门宗教的开创者，因为他是儒家思想中最重要的人之一，甚至没有之一。不过因为某些动漫的宣传，这种项链只在武术家和年轻人之间受欢迎。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Coptic Cross necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Coptic Cross symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Coptic Christian faith.  The typical form of the 'Coptic cross' used in the Coptic Church is made up of two bold lines of equal length that intersect at the middle at right angles.  Each line terminates in three points, representing the Trinity of the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit.  Altogether, the cross has 12 points symbolizing the Apostles, whose mission was to spread the Gospel message throughout the world."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是科普特十字架的标志。它是科普特基督教信仰的一个象征。科普特教会使用的典型\"科普特十字架\"是由两条等长的粗线组成的，在中间以直角相交。每条线末端有三个分支，代表圣父、圣子和圣灵的三位一体。十字架总共有12个点，象征着使徒，他们的使命是在全世界传播福音信息。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Crescent Moon and Star necklace" of item "holy
#. symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Crescent Moon and Star symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of both the Sunni and Shia Islam faith.  The crescent of the new moon signifies the beginning and end of fasting during Ramadan."
msgstr "一条由细密金链制成的项链，吊坠是新月和星星的标志，是逊尼派和什叶派伊斯兰教信仰的象征。弯曲的新月标志着斋月期间斋戒的开始和结束。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Cross and Flame necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Cross and Flame symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Methodist Christian faith.  The cross and flame is the official symbol of the Methodist Church since 1968.  The symbol relates the Methodist church to God through Christ (cross) and the Holy Spirit (flame).  The flame is a reminder of Pentecost when witnesses were unified by the power of the Holy Spirit and saw 'tongues of fire'."
msgstr "一条用细密金链打造的项链，带有十字架和火焰的符号吊坠。 它是卫理公会基督教信仰的象征。 自1968年以来，十字架和火焰一直是卫理公会教堂的官方象征。 该符号将卫理公会教会通过基督（十字架）和圣灵（火焰）与上帝联系起来。 圣火让人们想起五旬节，当时见证者因圣灵的能力而合一，并看到了\"火舌\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Cross of Leviathan necklace" of item "holy
#. symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Cross of Leviathan symbol as a pendant.  The Leviathan Cross is sometimes referred to the Cross of Satan.  Depicted on the bottom is an infinity sign, and above is a double cross.  The Double cross symbolizes protection and balance between persons.  The infinity sign underlines the constant and infinite nature and most likely symbolizes the eternal universe, this may have been used by Anton LaVey in The Satanic Bible to as a mockery of the cross, to show that humans are their own centrum of balance."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是利维坦十字架的标志，有时也被称为撒旦的十字架。底部描绘的是一个无限的符号，上面是一个双十字架。双十字架象征着保护和人与人之间的平衡，无限符号强调了恒定和无限的性质，很可能象征着永恒的宇宙，这可能被安东·拉维在《撒旦圣经》中用来作为对十字架的嘲弄，以表明人类才是他们自己平衡的中心。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Dharmachakra necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Dharmachakra symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Hindu, Jain and Buddhist faiths.  Also known as Dharma Wheel, the circle, the round shape of the wheel, represents the perfection of the Dharma, the Buddha's teaching.  The rim of the wheel represents meditative concentration and mindfulness, which hold practice together.  The hub represents moral discipline."
msgstr "由细金链制成的项链，带有法轮金刚符号作为吊坠。它是印度教，耆那教和佛教信仰的象征。法轮，圆圈，车轮的圆形代表着佛法的完美，佛陀的教诲。轮辋代表冥想专注和正念，将实践集中到一起。而轮毂则代表道德纪律。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Dodecagram necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Dodecagram symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Greek Hellenist faith.  The Dodecagram, or twelve pointed star, is one of the more widespread symbols of Hellenism.  The twelve points represent the twelve Olympic Gods and thus the symbol serves its purpose as a dedicational symbol well."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是十二宫符号，是希腊多神教信仰的一个象征。十二宫，或称十二芒星，是希腊教中比较普遍的符号之一。十二个尖代表了十二个奥林匹克神，因此这个符号很好地实现了其作为宣传符号的目的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Eckankar necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Eckankar symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Eckankar faith.  Eckankar teaches that 'spiritual liberation' in one's lifetime is available to all and that it is possible to achieve Self-Realization (the realization of oneself as Soul) and God-Realization (the realization of oneself as a spark of God) in one's lifetime though a series of Eckankar teachings."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是艾康卡尔的标志，是1965年新宗教艾康卡尔（Eckankar）信仰的象征。艾康卡尔教导说，所有人都可以在一生中获得\"精神解放\"，通过一系列艾康卡尔教义，可以在一生中达到自我实现（灵魂的醒悟）和上帝实现（认识到自己是上帝的火花）。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Episcopal Shield necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Episcopalian Shield symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Episcopalian Christian faith.  The shield of the Episcopal Church was adopted by its General Convention in 1940 and depicts the red cross of St. George, patron saint of England, dividing the silver field of the English flag into four rectangles.  The colors red, white, and blue are also, coincidentally, the colors of the flags of both the United States and the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠为美国圣公会的盾牌标志。它是基督教普世圣公宗在北美教区信仰的象征。圣公会的盾牌由其大会于1940年通过，描绘了英格兰守护神圣乔治的红色十字架，将英国国旗的银色领域分为四个矩形。巧合的是，红、白、蓝三色也是美国和大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国国旗的颜色。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Faravahar necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Faravahar symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Zoroastrianism faith.  While there is no total understanding of the meanings of that ancient symbol, it depicts a bearded man with one hand reaching forward.  He stands above a pair of wings that are outstretched from a circle which are believed to represent eternity."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是法拉瓦哈的符号。它是琐罗亚斯德教信仰的象征。虽然对这个古老符号的含义没有完全的理解，但它描绘了一个大胡子男人，一只手向前伸。他站在一对翅膀上面，这对翅膀从一个圆圈中伸出来，被认为代表着永恒。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Compass Rose necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Golden Compass Rose symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Anglican Christian faith.  Anglicanism was the State Religion of the United Kingdom before the Cataclysm.  The compass symbolizes the worldwide spread of the Anglican Faith.  Surmounting the shield, at the North, is a mitre, the symbol of apostolic order essential to all Churches and Provinces constituting the Anglican Communion."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠为金色罗盘玫瑰标志。它是英国圣公宗基督教信仰的象征。在大灾变之前，英国圣公宗是英国的国教。罗盘象征着英国圣公宗信仰在全世界的传播。罗盘的中央是一面盾牌，盾牌的上方，即北方，是一顶长袍，象征着构成圣公宗的所有教会和省份所必需的使徒秩序。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hand of Ahimsa necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Hand of Ahimsa symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Jainist faith and philosophical system.  The hand with a wheel on the palm symbolizes Ahimsa in Jainism.  The word in the middle is 'ahimsa' (non-injury).  The wheel represents the dharmachakra, which stands for the resolve to halt the samsara through the relentless pursuit of Ahimsa."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是不害之手的标志，是耆那教信仰和哲学体系的一个象征。手掌上有一个轮子的手便是耆那教的\"不害\"。中间的字是\"ahimsa\"（不伤害），轮子代表达摩法轮。它代表通过对\"不杀生\"的不懈追求来停止轮回的决心。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ichthys necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Ichthys symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of many Christian faith, and also the symbol of adherents of the Primitivist Christianism, a denomination that believed that Christianism had been too separated from its original meaning and they should return to the initial, pure form of Christianism.  In general, it is a representation of a fish used in ancient times as a pagan fertility talisman or amulet or as a Christian symbol for the Greek word ichthys interpreted as an acrostic in which the Greek letters are the initials of the words 'I esous Christos th eou hy ios s oter', meaning 'Jesus Christ Son of God Savior'."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠为耶稣鱼符号。它是许多基督教信仰的象征，也是原始基督教信徒的象征，该教派认为基督教已经过于脱离其最初的意义，他们应该回归到基督教最初的、纯粹的形式。一般来说，它只是代表一条鱼，在古代被用作基督异教徒的暗号或护身符，但希腊语的ichthys被解释为\"I esous Christos th eou hy ios s oter\"的首字母缩写，意思是\"耶稣基督上帝之子救世主\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Khanda necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Khanda symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Sikh faith.  The Khanda symbol depicts the Sikh doctrine of Deg Tegh Fateh in emblematic form.  It is also part of the design of the 'Sikh national flag', the Nishan Sahib.  A double edged sword (also called Khanda) is placed at the top of a Nishan Sahib flag as an ornament or finial."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠为汗达符号，锡克教信仰的一个象征。汗达符号以符号语言描述了\"善业与佩剑得胜\"的锡克教义。它也是锡克教三角黄底国旗设计的一部分。一把双刃剑（也叫Khanda，汗达）被放在国旗的顶部，作为装饰品或顶边。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Lotus of Buddha necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Lotus of Buddha symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Buddhist faith, representing a figure of Siddhartha Gautama, the Buddha, meditating on top of a lotus flower."
msgstr "由细金链制成的项链，以佛莲花符号作为吊坠。它是佛教信仰的象征，代表佛陀悉达多·乔达摩（Siddhartha Gautama）的形象，在莲花上冥想。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Lutheran Seal necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Luther Seal symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Lutheran Christian faith: The cross mean that humanity was saved from sin because Jesus died on the cross, the heart means that humanity lives because Jesus shed his blood for it, and the flower means that humanity has peace from its faith, and the background means that they have hope that they will be with Jesus in heaven one day."
msgstr "一条用细密金链打造的项链，上面有个路德教印章作为吊坠。它是路德教派基督信仰的象征：十字架意味着耶稣牺牲自己将人类从罪恶中拯救出来。心脏意味着耶稣流干自己的血让人类继续活着，花朵意味着人类从信仰中得到了和平，背景意味着人们有望某天升上天堂与耶稣同在。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Menorah necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Menorah symbol as a pendant, where each branch is equivalent to each seven days of The Creation.  It is a symbol of the Jewish faith.  The symbol of the menorah dates to Jewish tradition: After the Maccabees' victory over the Greeks, there was only enough oil to burn a menorah (lamp) for one day in the Temple of Judea.  Miraculously, the oil burned for eight days, and lighting the Hanukkah menorah commemorates this miracle and Jewish Holliday."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是犹太教的烛台标志，其中每个分支相当于《创世记》的每一个七天。它是犹太教信仰的一个象征。烛台的象征可以追溯到犹太传说：马加比人战胜希腊人后，犹太圣殿里的油只够烧一天的烛台。但油奇迹般地燃烧了八天，人们会在犹太教节日——光明节点燃这种烛台以纪念那个奇迹。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Om necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Om symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Hindu faith, as Om is a sacred sound, syllable, mantra, or an invocation in Hinduism.  Om is the prime symbol of Hinduism, variously said to be the essence of the supreme Absolute, consciousness, Atman, Brahman, or the Cosmic world.  In Indian traditions, Om serves as a sonic representation of the divine, a standard of Vedic authority and a central aspect of soteriological doctrines and practices."
msgstr "一根由细密金链制成的项链，有一个\"唵\"符号作为吊坠，是印度教信仰的标志，因为唵在印度教中是神圣的声音、音节、真言或祷告。唵是印度教最主要的符号，被不同地称为至高的绝对，意识，我，梵天，或是宇宙的核心精髓。在印度传统中，唵作为神圣之声的代表，吠陀权威的标准，也是救赎教义和实践的核心。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Orthodox Cross necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Orthodox Cross symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Eastern and Oriental Orthodox Christian faith.  The topmost of the three crossbeams represents Pilate's inscription which in the older Greek tradition is 'The King of Glory', based on John's Gospel.  The middle crossbeam is the main bar to which the victim's hands are fixed, while the bottom crossbeam represents the footrest which prolongs the torture."
msgstr "一根以东正教十字架符号为吊坠的细金项链。它是东方和东方东正统基督教信仰的象征。三根横梁中最上面的一根代表彼拉多的题词，在古老的希腊传说中是\"荣耀之王\"，出自《约翰福音》。中间的横梁是固定受害者双手的主杆，而下面的横梁代表延长酷刑的脚踏板。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Pentagram necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Pentagram symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of mysticism and magic, often believed to be related to dark magic and Satanism.  Popular among temperamental teens, Wiccas, witches, modern wizards, cosplayers, goths and emos."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，以五角星符号为吊坠。它是神秘主义和魔法的象征，通常被认为与黑魔法和撒旦主义有关。在脾气暴躁的青少年、巫师、女巫、现代巫师、COSPLAYER、哥特亚文化和情绪化朋克间很受欢迎。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Presbyterian Cross necklace" of item "holy
#. symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Presbyterian Cross symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Presbyterian Christian faith.  The Presbyterian Cross emphasize the resurrection and that Christ is not continually dying, but died once and is alive for all eternity, alongside the flames, which represent the Holy Spirit."
msgstr "一根由细密金链打造的项链，吊坠是长老会的十字架标志。它是基督教长老会信仰的一个象征。长老会的十字架强调复活，强调基督不是不断地死亡，而是死过一次并永远活着，旁边是代表圣灵的火焰。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Quaker Star necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Quaker Star symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Quaker Christian faith, but also a symbolic neckwear of hard work and peace.  The star was first worn by British Quakers during the Franco-Prussian War in 1870.  Quaker relief workers at the time wanted an identification to differentiate themselves and their supplies from other groups who were carrying out similar efforts.  This symbols carries the meaning of Quaker work for peace and the relief of suffering caused by war at the time."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，以贵格会之星的标志作为吊坠。它是贵格会基督教信仰的象征，也是勤劳与和平的象征颈饰。这颗星在1870年普法战争期间由英国贵格会成员首次佩戴。当时的贵格会救援人员希望有一个标识，以区别于其他正在进行类似工作的团体和他们的物资。这个标志承载了有着贵格会为和平而工作的含义，以及对当时战争所造成痛苦的救济。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sigil of Baphomet necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Sigil of Baphomet symbol as a pendant.  The Sigil of Baphomet is the official insignia of the Church of Satan.  It first appeared on the cover of The Satanic Mass L.P in 1968 and later on the cover of The Satanic Bible in 1969.  The sigil has been called a 'material pentagram', representational of carnality and earthly principles.  The Church described the symbol as the 'preeminent visual distillation of the iconoclastic philosophy of Satanism'."
msgstr "一根由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是巴弗灭的标志，撒旦教会的官方标志。它第一次出现在1968年的《撒旦弥撒》的封面上，后来又在1969年的《撒旦圣经》封面上出现。这个标志被称为\"物质五角星\"，代表着肉体和世俗的原则。教会将这个符号描述为\"对撒旦主义标志性哲学的卓越视觉提炼\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Square and Compass necklace" of item "holy
#. symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Square and Compass symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Freemasonry Orders of builders and merchants.  The Square and Compass is the single and most identifiable symbol of Freemasonry.  Both the square and compasses are architect's tools and are used in masonry as emblems to teach symbolic lessons."
msgstr "一条由细密金链制成的项链，有一个方尺和圆规符号作为吊坠，是建筑商和商人共济会秩序的象征。方尺和圆规是唯一也是最能代表共济会的符号，它们都是建筑师的工具，在砖石建筑中用作标志来教授象征性的课程。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Star of David necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Star of David symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Jewish faith.  The Star of David became officially associated with Judaism when it was chosen as the symbol to appear on a flag at the First Zionist Congress in 1897.  At that time, it became the symbol of the Jewish people, Zionism, and the Jewish communities throughout the world."
msgstr "一根由细金链制成的项链，吊坠为大卫之星的符号。它是犹太教信仰的一个象征。当大卫之星在1897年第一次犹太复国主义大会上被选为旗帜上的标志时，它就正式与犹太教联系起来。那时，它就成为了犹太民族、犹太复国主义和全世界犹太社区的象征。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tau Cross necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Tau Cross symbol as a pendant.  It is a general symbol for Christian faith.  The Tau Cross is representative of salvation and of life, due in part to its association with the sparing of believers in the Bible.  As Tau is the last letter in the Hebrew alphabet, it symbolizes the revealed Word of God, its completion and perfection.  It also can be said to symbolize the Last Day…"
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠为T型十字架符号。它是基督教信仰的常见象征。T型十字是救赎和生命的代表，部分原因是它与《圣经》中对信徒的饶恕有关。由于Tau是希伯来字母表的最后一个字母，它象征着上帝的启示，它的完成和完美，也可以说是象征着最后一天……"

#. ~ Description of variant "Torii necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Torii symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of Shinto faith, where the Torii denotes the entrance to Shinto Shrines and the respect towards the Shinto beliefs and culture."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是鸟居的标志，是神道教信仰的象征。鸟居表示神道教神社的入口以及对神道教信仰和文化的尊重。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ying Yang necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Ying Yang symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of both Confucian and Taoist faiths and philosophical systems.  Yin is a symbol of earth, femininity, darkness, passivity, and absorption.  It is present in even numbers, in valleys and streams, and is represented by the tiger, the color orange, and a broken line.  Yang is conceived of as heaven, maleness, light, activity, and penetration, and together, they represent balance between opposites."
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，有阴阳符饰作为吊坠，是道家信仰和哲学体系的象征。阴是大地、女性、黑暗、被动和吸收，它存在于偶数、山谷和溪流中，并由老虎、橙色和一条断线代表。 而阳象征高天、男性、光明、活动和渗透。它们一起代表着对立面之间的平衡。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Zia Sun necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Zia Sun symbol as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the strength and union of the Zia Native Americans.  The Zia Sun symbol represent the four cardinal directions, the four seasons of the year, the four period of each day (morning, noon, evening, and night), and the four seasons of life (childhood, youth, middle age, and old age)."
msgstr "一根由细金链制成的项链，以齐亚太阳符号为吊坠。它象征着齐亚美洲原住民的力量和联合。齐亚太阳符号代表四个基本方向，一年中的四个季节，每天的四个时段（早上、中午、晚上和夜晚），以及生命的四个季节（童年、青年、中年和老年）。"

#. ~ Description of variant "St. Virgin Mary necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the figure of Saint Virgin Mary as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Roman Catholic Church and also of the Orthodox Church, displaying the figure of Saint Virgin Mary, mother of Jesus Christ, surrounded by light."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，有一个圣母玛利亚的形象作为吊坠，同时是天主教和东正教的象征。它展现着圣母玛利亚，耶稣基督的母亲，被光明所围绕的样子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Flying Spaghetti Monster necklace" of item "holy
#. symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the figure of the Giant Spaghetti Flying Monster as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Pastafarian faith, a religion like any other.  It has the figure of the Giant Spaghetti Flying Monster in the center, with the following text: 'Pasta be Upon Us'."
msgstr "一条由细密金链金链制成的项链，有一团巨大的浮空意面作为吊坠，这是飞天意面神教的象征，如同其他宗教一般。吊坠刻有一行字：\"蒸煮在上\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Justo Takayama necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the figurine of Blessed Justo Takayama dressed like a samurai as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Roman Catholic Church, displaying the figure of the Blessed Justo Takayama dressed as a samurai, with some text inscribed in Japanese and English at the back.  It reads: 'Blessed Justus Takayama Ukon, Holy Daimyo, Pray for Us'."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，有武士打扮的儒斯定高山右近的形象作为吊坠，是天主教的象征。高山右近在日本广泛传播基督信仰，儒斯定是他的受洗名。吊坠上还刻印有一行字：\"受神庇佑的儒斯定高山右近，神圣的大名，为我们祈祷\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "St. John necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the figurine of Saint John the Baptist as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Roman Catholic Church and also of the Orthodox Church, displaying the figure of Saint John the Baptist performing a baptism, with the following text inscribed in the pendant: 'Saint John the Baptist, Pray for Us'."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，有施洗者圣约翰的形象作为吊坠，同时是天主教和东正教的象征。它刻画着圣约翰施洗的情景。吊坠上还印着一行字，写着：\"施洗者圣约翰，为我们祈祷\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "St. Joseph necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the figurine of Saint Joseph as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Roman Catholic Church and also of the Orthodox Church, displaying the figure of Saint Joseph holding the infant Jesus, surrounded by light, with the following text inscribed in the pendant: 'Saint Joseph, Pray for Us'."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，有圣约瑟夫的形象作为吊坠，同时是天主教和东正教的象征。它描绘着圣约瑟夫抱着婴儿耶稣，被光环绕的场景。吊坠上印着一行字，写着：\"圣约瑟夫保佑我们\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "St. Nicholas necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the figurine of Saint Nicholas as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Roman Catholic Church and also of the Orthodox Church, displaying the figure of Saint Nicholas taking care of children, with the following text inscribed in the pendant: 'Saint Nicholas, Pray for Us'."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，有圣尼古拉的形象作为吊坠，同时是天主教和东正教的象征。它描绘着圣尼古拉照顾孩子的样子。吊坠上还刻印有一行字：\"圣尼古拉，为我们祈祷\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "St. Paul necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the figurine of Saint Paul as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Roman Catholic Church and also of the Orthodox Church, displaying the figure of Saint Paul holding a sword, surrounded by flowers, with the following text inscribed in the pendant: 'Saint Paul, Pray for Us'."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，有圣保罗的形象作为吊坠，同时是天主教和东正教的象征。吊坠上圣保罗手握长剑，被鲜花所环绕。还刻印有一行字：\"圣保罗保佑我们\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "St. Cyprian necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the figurine of both Saint Cyprian of Antioch and Saint Justina as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Roman Catholic Church and also of the Orthodox Church, displaying the figure of Saint Cyprian and Saint Justina reading a book, with the following text inscribed in the pendant: 'Saint Cyprian of Antioch and Saint Justina, Pray for Us'."
msgstr "一根由细密金链打造的项链，吊坠是安提阿的圣西普良与圣朱斯蒂纳的塑像。 它是罗马天主教会的象征，也是东正教会的象征，展示了圣西普良与圣朱斯蒂纳阅读书籍的形象。吊坠上刻有以下文字：\"安提阿的圣西普良与圣朱斯蒂纳，为我们祈祷\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "St. Peter necklace" of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the figuring of Saint Peter as a pendant.  It is a symbol of the Roman Catholic Church and also of the Orthodox Church, displaying the figure of Saint Peter observing the Earth, with the following text inscribed in the pendant: 'Saint Peter, Pray for Us'."
msgstr "一根用细密金链打造的项链，有圣彼得的形象作为吊坠，同时是天主教和东正教的象征。它描绘着圣彼得注视大地的样子。吊坠上还刻印有一行字：\"圣彼得，为我们祈祷\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "The All Seeing Eye necklace" of item "holy
#. symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the threatening Eye and Pyramid symbol as a pendant.  It is apparently a symbol of the once famous New World Order, the Illuminati, but you can't tell if it is just a joke, or something real…"
msgstr "一条由细金链制成的项链，吊坠是有一只令人不安的眼睛和金字塔的图案。这显然是曾经著名的新世界秩序——光明会的象征，但你无法判断这只是一个玩笑，还是真实的东西……"

#. ~ Description of "cowrie necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of cowrie shells, valued in many African cultures such as the Yoruba.  If you want, you could meditate with this."
msgstr "由贝壳制成的项链，在约鲁巴等许多非洲文化中都很有价值。  如果你愿意的话，你可以用这个来冥想。"

#. ~ Description of "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A necklace made of fine gold chain, bearing the symbol of a faith that endures, despite everything."
msgstr "一条用细密金链打造的金项链，有着一个被遗忘的信仰的徽记。"

#. ~ Description of "silver bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A nice silver bracelet."
msgstr "一个漂亮的银手镯。"

#. ~ Description of "copper earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A pair of copper earrings."
msgstr "铜耳环"

#. ~ Description of "gold earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A pair of shiny gold earrings."
msgstr "一对闪亮的金耳环。"

#. ~ Description of "silver earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A pair of shiny silver earrings."
msgstr "一对闪亮的红宝石银耳环。"

#. ~ Description of "gold necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A pendant with a fine gold chain."
msgstr "在桌椅上进餐"

#. ~ Description of "silver necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A pendant with a fine silver chain."
msgstr "带有精美银链的吊坠。"

#. ~ Description of "copper ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A plain copper ring.  Not very shiny, and not very popular."
msgstr "一个朴素的铜戒指，既不闪闪发光，款式也不怎么流行。"

#. ~ Description of "radiation badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A plastic badge with an embedded filmstrip.  The text on the badge says the filmstrip changes color as it is exposed to radiation, and never goes back to how it initially looked.  Wear on your lapel so you can notice if it changes."
msgstr "一块佩戴在胸前、嵌入了检测辐射剂量的色条的徽章。徽章上的文字说明如果有辐射就会通过变色来提醒你，且无法变回原来的颜色。将它穿在身上就能看到它的颜色是否变化。"

#. ~ Description of "doctor badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A plastic name tag marking the wearer as a real doctor of the medical kind."
msgstr "一种塑料名牌，标明佩戴者是真正的医生。"

#. ~ Description of "fancy watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A rather large and expensively-made wristwatch.  Tells the time in elegantly wrought gold with silver detailing.  It's really the only timepiece suitable for someone of your exquisitely discerning tastes."
msgstr ""
"一块奢华、高档的腕表。上面采用优雅精致的金银装饰告诉你当前的时间。适合拥有极度挑剔品味的成功人士。\n"
"\"曾经犹豫过很久也没买的手表，如今就这样免费得到了，事实证明我是一个极富远见的成功人士。\""

#. ~ Description of "leather cat ears"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A shiny pair of black cat ears on a headband.  It does nothing, but there's no reason not to look good even if no one's looking."
msgstr "一对闪亮的黑色猫耳头带，非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Description of "silver hairpin"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A shiny silver hairpin with a tiny bee engraved onto it."
msgstr "一只闪耀的银发夹，上面刻着一只小蜜蜂。"

#. ~ Description of "tie clip"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A shiny silver tie clip, a great match for a necktie."
msgstr "一枚样式时髦的银色领带夹，看上去和你的窄领带很配。"

#. ~ Description of "beaded bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple bracelet of string and wooden beads.  Also doubles as a set of prayer beads, if you're so inclined."
msgstr "一根由线和木头珠子制成的简单手链。也可当做念珠使用，如果你想的话。"

#. ~ Description of "copper necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple chain of copper, with a clasp in the middle to create a necklace."
msgstr "一串简单的铜链，中间有个刚好能戴在脖子上的卡扣。"

#. ~ Description of "beaded necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple necklace made of string and wooden beads.  Also doubles as a set of prayer beads, if you're so inclined."
msgstr "一根由线和木头珠子制成的简单项链。也可以当做念珠使用，如果你想的话。"

#. ~ Description of "handmade holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple necklace representing a religious faith."
msgstr "一个简单朴素的木制项链，有着一个被遗忘的信仰的徽记。"

#. ~ Description of "beaded earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple pair of earrings made of string and wooden beads."
msgstr "一对由线和木头珠子制成的简单耳环。"

#. ~ Description of "wrist watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple wristwatch on a plastic band.  Tells the time and has an alarm clock feature."
msgstr ""
"一个款式简约的腕表，表带是塑料材质。可以计时，还有闹钟功能。\n"
"\"即便灾变后的世界只有无尽黑夜（Dark days Ahead），但有一个手表还能提醒你黎明还有多远。\""

#. ~ Description of "silver ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple, silver ring."
msgstr "一只简单的银戒指。"

#. ~ Description of "small relic"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A small relic from a forgotten saint.  As extraordinary as the world has become, it may have some power yet."
msgstr "一件发掘自被遗忘的某圣地的小巧圣物。既然世界已经发生了如此巨变，也许它也蕴藏着某种不同寻常的力量。"

#. ~ Description of "silver locket"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A small silver locket with a frame inside to store photographs or small objects."
msgstr "一条银质的盒式小吊坠，有一个可以存放照片或其他小物件的夹层。"

#. ~ Description of "silver tiara"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A sparkling silver tiara adorned with gems."
msgstr "一顶闪亮的镶有石榴石的银头饰。"

#. ~ Description of "collar pin"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A staple accessory for gentlemen.  Keeps your shirt collar in place and provides a more aesthetically pleasing arc to your necktie."
msgstr "一件绅士的小配件。用于固定领带在衬衫上的位置，使你的领带有更优雅的弧线。"

#. ~ Description of "detective badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A tarnished golden shield gives an air of authority to the wearer."
msgstr "一只失去光泽的金色盾形徽章，标志着佩戴者是名刑侦警探。"

#. ~ Description of "deputy badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A tarnished silver star gives an air of authority to the wearer."
msgstr "一只失去光泽的银色星形徽章，标志着佩戴者是名维护法律与治安的警员。"

#. ~ Description of "gold cufflinks"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A tasteful pair of gold buttons with toggles on the back.  These are meant to be worn in the buttonholes in the cuffs of a dress shirt."
msgstr "一对雅致的金色纽扣，背面带有开关。  这些应该戴在正装衬衫袖口的纽扣孔中。"

#. ~ Description of "diver's watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A waterproof, self-winding watch on a stainless steel watchband.  Tells the time and current temperature.  Activate to check the digital thermometer."
msgstr "一块防水的自动发条手表，不锈钢表带。在水中也可以查看时间和温度。使用它来查看数字温度计。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "Adventist Bible necklace"
msgid_plural "Adventist Bible necklaces"
msgstr[0] "基督复临项链"

#. ~ Description of "purity ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "Also known as a promise ring, this ring is worn as a sign of chastity.  This one bears the inscription, \"Love is patient.\""
msgstr ""
"也被称作承诺戒指或恋爱戒指，情侣通常戴上它来表明自己的洁身自好。\n"
"这枚戒指上镌刻着铭文：\"爱是恒久忍耐。（注：《新约圣经》林前 13:4--8）\""

#. ~ Description of "hair beads"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "An assortment of beads used to decorate locs or braids."
msgstr "一堆各式各样的小型齿轮和发条装置。"

#. ~ Description of "silver watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
