#. ~ Description of "plate leg guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A full assembly of platemail for the legs.  Steel cuisses, poleyns, and greaves, with leather straps to secure each piece and connect it as part of a set."
msgstr "一套完美复刻的中世纪式腿部防具，用皮革条把护腿甲片，护膝甲片，护胫甲片连结成一体，一双完美坚实的战争工艺品。"

#. ~ Description of "turnout trousers"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A heavy pair of protective overalls worn by firefighters as protection against heat."
msgstr "一件消防员经常穿的重型防护裤。能防护高温和火焰。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A knee-length skirt made of interlocking steel rings.  It can be adjusted to be worn as outerwear."
msgstr "一条由互锁钢环制成的及膝裙。可以通过调整将其作为外衣穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail skirt (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A knee-length skirt made of interlocking steel rings.  It can be adjusted to be worn closer to the body."
msgstr "一条由互锁钢环制成的及膝裙。可以通过调整使其更贴身地穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar leggings"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of Kevlar leggings designed to protect the legs from abrasion when riding a motorcycle."
msgstr "一条 Kevlar 紧身裤，旨在保护腿部在骑摩托车时免受磨损。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of bronze shin and knee guards with a simple leather lining."
msgstr "一对有着简易皮内衬的青铜护胫。"

#. ~ Description of "chitin greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of guards for the lower legs and knees made from the exoskeletons of insects."
msgstr "一对由昆虫甲壳制成的护腿。"

#. ~ Description of "2-by-shin guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of improvised shin guards made from broken pieces of a plank that are tied to your shins with rags and string."
msgstr "一对用碎布和绳子将木板碎片绑在小腿上做成的简易护腿。"

#. ~ Description of "tire greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of improvised shin guards made from thick chunks of rubber strung together and tied over the legs."
msgstr "一对用碎布和绳子将木板碎片绑在小腿上做成的简易护腿。"

#. ~ Description of "armored jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of jeans reinforced with extra fabric and metal sheets.  It's not the most durable armor, but it offers decent protection."
msgstr "一条用额外织物和金属片加固的牛仔裤。  它不是最耐用的装甲，但它提供了不错的保护。"

#. ~ Description of "knee pads"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of knee pads made of stout plastic and spandex."
msgstr "一副由坚固的塑料和氨纶制成的护膝。"

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of leg guards crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr "一对由经过精心清理并裁剪过的酸蚁硅化甲壳制成的护腿，防酸但很脆弱。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic shin guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of polyurethane leg guards with neoprene backing.  These were used in sport, policing, and even on some job sites."
msgstr "一对带有橡胶衬垫的聚氨酯护腿。它们曾被用于体育运动、警务工作，甚至在某些施工现场也能见到。"

#. ~ Description of "fencing pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of reinforced pants used by fencers to prevent injuries.  They don't cover the lower leg."
msgstr "一条用于避免击剑时发生意外的防护裤，没有覆盖到小腿。"

#. ~ Description of "motorcycle jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of thick jeans interwoven with Kevlar for added durability and sporting integrated kneepads and flank protection, typically worn by motorcyclists to protect from road rash."
msgstr "一条嵌入了凯夫拉纤维以增加耐久度，并提供了一体化的护膝和侧腹保护的厚牛仔裤，摩托车手通常会穿这条牛仔裤，以防出车祸时受伤。"

#. ~ Description of "chainsaw chaps"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of tough chaps made of Kevlar.  Chainsaw kickbacks are potentially fatal; personal protective equipment like these chaps help protect your femoral arteries.  The layered Kevlar is designed to fray on contact with the chain and bind up the tool."
msgstr "一条由凯夫拉纤维制成的坚固耐用的裹腿。链锯失控能够致命；诸如此类的个人防护设备能保护你的股动脉。分层的凯夫拉纤维在与链条接触时会磨损，并缠住链条。"

#. ~ Description of "leather chaps"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of tough leather chaps, meant to tie on over pants for extra protection."
msgstr "一副坚韧的皮制护腿，套在裤子外面穿，能提供额外的防护。"

#. ~ Description of "leather leg guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A set of soft leather cuisses, poleyns, and greaves that strap on over the legs, providing excellent protection from cutting and stabbing attacks."
msgstr "一套柔软的皮革短靴、波林靴和护腿，绑在腿上，提供出色的保护，防止割伤和刺伤。"

#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant cephalopod sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A set of tubes of loosely woven Kevlar which should fit over a cephalopod's many arms."
msgstr "一套由松散编织的凯夫拉制成的管状护套，应可套上头足类生物的众多腕足。"

#. ~ Description of "tire tasset (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A skirt made of salvaged chunks of rubber strung together and tied around the waist.  It can be adjusted to fit closer to the body."
msgstr "一条用回收的橡胶块制成的裙子，串在一起并系在腰上。  它可以调整以更贴合身体。"

#. ~ Description of "tire tasset"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A skirt made of salvaged chunks of rubber strung together and tied around the waist.  It can be adjusted to fit over bulky armor."
msgstr "一条用回收的橡胶块制成的裙子，串在一起并系在腰上。  它可以调整以适应笨重的装甲。"

#. ~ Description of "plate tasset (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A skirt of steel faulds that hangs over the hips.  It can be adjusted to fit closer to the body."
msgstr "一条悬挂在臀部上方的钢制裙子。  它可以调整以更贴合身体。"

#. ~ Description of "plate tasset"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A skirt of steel faulds that hangs over the hips.  It can be adjusted to fit over bulky armor."
msgstr "一套覆盖在臀部的钢制裙甲。它可以调节尺寸，以便穿在厚重的盔甲之外。"

#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant tail sleeve"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A slender tube of loosely woven Kevlar which should help protect the wearer's tail from cuts and scrapes."
msgstr "一根由松散编织的凯夫拉制成的细长管状护套，有助于保护穿戴者的尾巴免受割伤和擦伤。"

#. ~ Description of "leather tail sleeve"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A tube of leather which should help protect the wearer's tail from cuts and scrapes."
msgstr "一根皮革管，应能帮助保护穿戴者的尾巴免受割伤和擦伤。"

