#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "EOD trousers"
msgid_plural "EOD trousers"
msgstr[0] "拆弹防护裤"

#. ~ Description of "riot shin guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "Hard armor for the feet and lower legs used by riot police."
msgstr "防暴警察使用的硬质护臂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "Kevlar leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of Kevlar leggings"
msgstr[0] "凯夫拉紧身裤"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail chausses"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "Protective leggings made of interlocking links of low-quality steel wire, covering from the thighs to the tops of the feet."
msgstr "由低品质钢丝互锁链接制成的防护绑腿，覆盖从大腿到脚背。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail chausses"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "Protective leggings made of interlocking links of steel wire, covering from the thighs to the tops of the feet."
msgstr "由钢丝互锁连接制成的防护绑腿，覆盖从大腿到脚尖。"

#. ~ Description of "paper greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "Shin guards made of stacked paper sheets held together with duct tape."
msgstr ""
"一对将许多纸张叠在一起，然后用胶带粘牢的纸护臂。\n"
"\"书籍是人类防御的装备 —— 高尔基\""

#. ~ Description of "carpet leg guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "Small squares of carpet rolled around your shins and thighs.  Perfect for wading through the local furniture store."
msgstr "裹住大腿与小腿的小张地毯，挺适合在逛本地家具店时候穿的。"

#. ~ Description of "carpet greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "Small squares of carpet rolled around your shins.  These might protect you from the corner of a table."
msgstr "裹住胫部的小块地毯。没什么防御力，看起来只能避免你被桌角磕伤。"

#. ~ Description of "tactical EOD trousers"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "This is a heavy pair of trousers armored in Kevlar, Nomex, and foam padding, for use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians in 'non-permissive environments'.  While it offers near complete coverage in fragmentation resistant materials, it still offers insufficient protection from ballistic threats.  These trousers are lighter than normal EOD armor to provide more maneuverability."
msgstr "这是一条厚重的裤子，采用 Kevlar、Nomex 和泡沫填充材料，供爆炸物处理技术人员在“不允许的环境”中使用。  虽然它提供了近乎完全的防碎片材料覆盖，但它仍然不足以抵御弹道威胁。  这些裤子比普通 EOD 装甲更轻，可提供更多的机动性。"

#. ~ Description of "EOD trousers"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "This is a heavy pair of trousers armored in Kevlar, Nomex, and foam padding, for use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians.  While it offers near complete coverage in fragmentation resistant materials, it still offers insufficient protection from ballistic threats."
msgstr "这是一条厚重的裤子，采用 Kevlar、Nomex 和泡沫填充材料，供爆炸物处理技术人员使用。  虽然它提供了近乎完全的防碎片材料覆盖，但它仍然不足以抵御弹道威胁。"

