#. ~ Description of "basketball shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of athletic shorts.  Comfortable and light."
msgstr "一条棒球短裤，多为棒球运动员比赛或训练时所穿。舒适且轻便。"

#. ~ Description of "leather pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of black leather pants.  Very tough, but cumbersome and without much storage."
msgstr "一条黑色皮革长裤。非常结实耐用，但有点累赘，而且没有多少存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "slacks"
#. ~ Description of "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of cotton pants.  Less durable than denim, but a little more comfortable."
msgstr "一条棉质裤子。不如牛仔裤耐穿，但会更舒服一些。"

#. ~ Description of "mail carrier shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
