msgstr "一条深蓝色短裤，通常是邮政人员的工作服。"

#. ~ Description of "jorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of denim shorts."
msgstr "一条牛仔短裤。"

#. ~ Description of "skinny jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of form-fitting jeans.  There's some stretch to the fabric, but they're thinner and a little more restrictive than the normal kind."
msgstr "一条合身的牛仔裤。  面料有一定的弹性，但比普通面料更薄，限制也更多一些。"

#. ~ Description of "fur hot pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of fur short shorts."
msgstr "一件简单的毛皮短裤。"

#. ~ Description of "leather hot pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of hip-hugging leather short shorts."
msgstr "一件简单的皮革短裤。"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of long cotton pants lined with warm imitation fur."
msgstr "一条棉质长裤，内衬着十分保暖的人造毛皮。"

#. ~ Description of "cargo pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of pants lined with pockets, offering lots of storage."
msgstr ""
"一条长而宽松、衬有很多口袋的裤子，曾称为\"战斗裤\"并在二战期间被英军与美军广泛装备，因为穿戴舒适、携物方便，如今成为城市一族的最爱。\n"
"\"城市战术通勤系列。\""

#. ~ Description of "ski pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of pants meant for alpine skiing."
msgstr "一条适合高山滑雪时使用的保暖长裤。"

#. ~ Description of variant "striped pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of pants with black and white stripes."
msgstr "一条带有水平黑白相间条纹的裤子。"

#. ~ Description of "Santa pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of red pants with white faux fur trim, commonly used by bearded men on Christmas.  Somewhat warm and has two deep pockets."
msgstr "一条装饰着白色人造毛皮的红色长裤，常被那个在圣诞节出现的长胡子男人使用。有些保暖而且还有两个深口袋。"

#. ~ Description of "Santa shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of red shorts with white trim.  For when Santa is on summer vacation."
msgstr "一条白色镶边的红色短裤。也许是圣诞老人放暑假时穿的。"

#. ~ Description of "shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of short pants that leave the lower legs exposed."
msgstr "一条露出小腿的短裤。"

#. ~ Description of "cargo shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of shorts lined with pockets, offering decent storage."
msgstr "一条短而宽松、衬有很多口袋的裤子，曾称为\"战斗裤\"并在二战期间被英军与美军广泛装备，因为穿戴舒适、携物方便，如今成为城市一族的最爱，这件是短裤款式。"

#. ~ Description of "police breeches"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of tight-fitting police breeches.  They offer plenty of mobility for motorized officers."
msgstr "一条紧身的警用马裤。能让摩托警官行动自如。"

#. ~ Description of "hot pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of very short shorts."
msgstr "一件简单的毛皮短裤。"

#. ~ Description of "grass skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A primitive skirt made from grass."
msgstr "一条原始风格的草裙."

#. ~ Description of "leather skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A short leather skirt."
msgstr "啦啦队超短裙"

#. ~ Description of "Boston-Chan skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A short skirt for the Boston-Chan costume."
msgstr "波士顿酱cosplay套装中的短裙。"

#. ~ Description of "skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A short, breezy cotton skirt.  Easy to move in, but only has a single small pocket."
msgstr "一条青春又清凉的棉短裙。穿进去很容易，但它只有一个小口袋。"

#. ~ Description of "denim skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A skirt made from denim."
msgstr "一件用牛仔布制成的夹克。"

#. ~ Description of "army pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A tough pair of camouflage pants, lined with pockets."
msgstr "一条结实的长裤，外面有许多口袋。深受军人喜爱。"

#. ~ Description of "army winter pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A tough pair of pants lined with pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  Favored by the military."
msgstr "一条厚实的长裤，上面缝着不少口袋，有防寒衬里。军队指定用品。"

#. ~ Description of "antarvasa"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A traditional, ankle-length Buddhist skirt.  The bottom protrudes, and appears in the rough shape of a triangle."
msgstr "安陀会是一种传统佛教的长至脚踝的裙子。其底部向外突出，大致成三角形。"

#. ~ Description of "hiking pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A water-resistant pair of lightweight, flexible hiking pants with a good number of pockets."
msgstr "一条防水的轻便灵活的登山裤，口袋数量不少。"

#. ~ Description of "breeches"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of stiff yet baggy material.  Comfortable, but lacks pockets."
msgstr "一条精心制造的老款式裤子，使用的布料没什么弹性，所以制成较为宽松的尺寸。穿着舒适，但没有口袋。"

#. ~ Description of "long skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "An ankle-length skirt."
msgstr "一条到脚踝的裙子"

#. ~ Description of "nanoskirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Apparently the microskirt wasn't short enough."
msgstr "一件比超短裙还要更加暴露的纳米短裙。显然对于某些人，超短裙仍然不够短。"

#. ~ Description of "wool loincloth"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Bits of wool stitched together and tied into a makeshift loincloth.  Covers your modesty, but not much else."
msgstr ""
"一条用几片羊毛毡片缝制的自制遮羞布。\n"
"\"在末世中守住最后的节操。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Boston-Chan skirt"
msgid_plural "Boston-Chan skirts"
msgstr[0] "波士顿酱短裙"

#. ~ Description of "tactical pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Coated in more pockets than is probably either necessary or healthy and looking like they belong within a SWAT locker, these rugged combat pants possess a water-repellent coating, tough double-stitched seams, reinforced belt loops, and articulated knees."
msgstr "这种坚固的战斗裤拥有比必要或舒适更多的口袋，看起来就像属于特警的储物柜，具有防水涂层、坚韧的双缝接缝、加固皮带环和铰接式膝盖。"

#. ~ Description of "utility kilt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Common among American nerds and rivetheads, the utility kilt is a durable canvas kilt with a large front pocket."
msgstr "实用短裙是一种耐用的帆布短裙，前面有一个大口袋，在美国书呆子和铆钉迷中很常见。"

#. ~ Description of "work pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Durable pocketed pants made of chemical-resistant synthetics, perfect for the jobsite."
msgstr "耐用的多口袋裤子，由耐化学品的合成材料制成，非常适合工地穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "leather loincloth"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Leather patches stitched together and tied into a makeshift loincloth.  Covers your modesty, but not much else."
msgstr ""
"一条用几片皮革缝制的自制遮羞布。\n"
"\"在末世中守住最后的节操。\""

#. ~ Description of "zubon"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Loose-fitting pants made for use in martial arts."
msgstr "一件纯白色的武道服，在练习武术时使用。"

#. ~ Description of "sweatpants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Loose-fitting pants ostensibly designed for exercise, though they frequently wind up as pajamas."
msgstr "宽松裤表面上是为锻炼设计的，但到头来，它们经常被当作睡衣穿。"

#. ~ Description of "leather kilt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "No true Scotsman would leave home without his kilt."
msgstr ""
"一条苏格兰男性短裙，这是一种从腰部到膝盖的短裙，用花呢制造而成，布面有连续的大方格。\n"
"\"穿上之后感觉自己成为了真正的纯爷们。\""

#. ~ Description of "kilt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "No true Scotsman would leave home without his kilt.  Kilts lack pockets and thus a belt and sporran are necessary accessories."
msgstr "真正的苏格兰人不会不带苏格兰短裙就出门。  短裙没有口袋，因此腰带和短裙是必要的配饰。"

#. ~ Description of "loincloth"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Rags stitched together and tied into a makeshift loincloth.  Covers your modesty, but not much else."
msgstr ""
"一条用几片破布缝制的自制遮羞布。\n"
"\"在末世中守住最后的节操。\""

