#. ~ Description of variant "screaming mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A black hood with a white facemask molded to look like a screaming phantom."
msgstr "一个黑色的兜帽，配有一个做成尖叫幽灵样子的白色面具。"

#. ~ Description of "bandana"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A cotton bandana, worn over the mouth for warmth and minor protection from dust and other contaminants.  It can be adjusted to wear it on the head instead."
msgstr "一条可以覆盖在嘴上的棉制方巾，可以保暖并减少吸入尘土和有害物质。"

#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant balaclava"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A face covering that helps protect from slashes and cuts, in addition to the cold."
msgstr "一个把脸盖得严实的面罩，有助于防止脸部被割伤，而且很保暖。"

#. ~ Description of "white beard"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A fake white beard that straps over the mouth.  Perfect for your Santa costume!"
msgstr "一条戴在嘴上的假白胡子。和你的圣诞老人套装很配！"

#. ~ Description of "pumpkin mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A flimsy plastic pumpkin mask to wear over your head."
msgstr "一个可以带在头上南瓜面具，看起来很廉价，只由一层薄塑料制成。"

#. ~ Description of variant "zombie mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A flimsy rubber zombie mask.  It can't compare to the real thing."
msgstr "一个很薄的橡胶僵尸面具，完全比不上真的僵尸脸。"

#. ~ Description of "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A flimsy rubber zombie mask.  When zombies were still works of fiction."
msgstr "一个单薄的皮制丧尸面具，当然，是大灾变前虚构作品中的丧尸形象。"

#. ~ Description of variant "president mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A full-head mask that looks like one of the former leaders of the USA, back when that was a thing."
msgstr "一个全包面具，可能让你看起来像弗兰肯斯坦的怪物。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Frankenstein's Monster mask" of item "zombie
#. mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A full-head mask that looks like the head of Frankenstein's monster."
msgstr "一个全包面具，可能让你看起来像弗兰肯斯坦的怪物。"

#. ~ Description of variant "green mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A green skinned full-face mask.  Sssssmokin'!"
msgstr "一个绿色皮肤的全脸面具，很像《面具》里的那个。"

#. ~ Description of variant "plague doctor mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A mask that looks like a long white beak."
msgstr "一个看起来像迈阿密杀手的鸡面具。"

#. ~ Description of "skull mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A plastic mask that covers the face."
msgstr "一张戴在脸上的塑料面具。"

#. ~ Description of "hockey mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A protective face mask made of thick plastic.  Commonly worn by hockey goalies."
msgstr "一个曲棍球守门用的厚塑料防护面具。"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A protective reinforced Kevlar mask that covers the face.  Provides excellent protection from ballistic threats."
msgstr "一个凯夫拉加固的防护面具，提供出色的防护并减少子弹的威胁。"

#. ~ Description of variant "chicken mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A rubber chicken mask that looks like a killer in Miami would wear."
msgstr "一个看起来像迈阿密杀手的鸡面具。"

#. ~ Description of "dust mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A simple piece of cotton that straps over the mouth.  Provides a small amount of protection from airborne illness and dust."
msgstr "一个能抵挡灰尘与病原体入侵的简单口罩。"

#. ~ Description of "face veil"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A simple piece of fabric that covers your face."
msgstr "一块简单的棉布盖住你的脸。"

#. ~ Description of "skull balaclava"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A skull-print balaclava covering the head and face."
msgstr "一条覆盖头部和面部的骷髅头骨图案的面罩，通常用于摩托车骑手，或是COS服装的一部分。"

#. ~ Description of "rioter mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A t-shirt with the sleeves tied behind the back of one's head.  These are usually worn by rioters to hide their identity."
msgstr ""
"一个将头套进T恤的领口，然后把袖子从后面扎住裹在头上而成的简易面罩，通常由制造骚乱的暴徒们隐藏身份使用。\n"
"\"推荐使用美国国旗图案的T恤衫。\""

