#. ~ Description of "boiled leather cow barding with caparison"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "A full barding for cows consisting of boiled leather and cloth undercovering.  This caparison depicts a battle between a monstrous dragon and regal griffin.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "一套全身牛铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰描述了一只恶龙与一匹皇家狮鹫之间的战斗。你可以将这套牛铠套在一头友好的牛身上。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "A heavy covering of chainmail, suitably made for cows as protection.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "一套厚厚的铁环链甲，专门为保护牛打造。你可以将这套牛铠穿在一头友好的牛身上。"

#. ~ Description of "steel cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "A heavy covering of steel plate and leather, suitably made for cows as protection.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的钢板，专门为保护牛而打造。你可以将这套牛铠穿在一头友好的牛身上。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "A heavy covering of strategically-placed bronze plates and leather, suitably made for cows as protection.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的青铜板，专门为保护牛而打造。你可以将这套牛铠穿在一头友好的牛身上。"

#. ~ Description of "iron cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "A heavy covering of strategically-placed iron plates and leather, suitably made for cows as protection.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
