#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "A large prayer shawl worn by observant Jews during morning prayers and certain other occasions."
msgstr "一种大型的祈祷披肩，是虔诚的犹太教徒在晨祷或其他某些场合穿戴的。"

#. ~ Description of "fur scarf"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "A long strip of fur that once might have been fashionable.  Now it's an invaluable tool for winter survival."
msgstr "一条曾经或许时髦过的毛皮长条。如今它成了冬季生存的宝贵工具。"

#. ~ Description of "wimple"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "A loose cloth headwrap and veil.  Typically worn by Christian nuns."
msgstr "一件宽松的布制头巾和面纱。通常由基督教修女穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "headscarf"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
