#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "A sheet of woven grass.  It's a bit itchy, but it might help keep warm in a survival situation."
msgstr "一张草编垫子。有点扎人，但在求生情况下或许能帮忙保暖。"

#. ~ Description of "knit cowl"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "A snuggly woolen cowl, essentially a really bulky neck gaiter, but it fits more loosely."
msgstr "一条舒适的羊毛围脖，本质上就是一个很厚实的脖套，但戴起来比较宽松。"

#. ~ Description of "plate aventail"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
