msgstr "一种钢制护颈，可环绕脖子以提供额外防护。"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar neck gaiter (raised)"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "A stretchy knit neck protector consisting of a tube of Kevlar.  It can be worn about the throat and the lower part of the face, or you could activate it to pull it down off of your mouth."
msgstr "一种弹性针织颈部防护套，由凯夫拉纤维制成。可以戴在脖子和下半张脸，也可以（激活）拉下来露出口鼻。"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar neck gaiter"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "A stretchy knit neck protector consisting of a tube of Kevlar.  It can be worn about the throat, or activated to cover the lower half of the face as well."
msgstr "一种由凯夫拉制成的弹性针织颈部防护套。可戴于喉部，也可（激活）覆盖面部下半部分。"

#. ~ Description of "neck gaiter (raised)"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
