#. ~ Description of "axe ring holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A combination of leather and a metal ring to hold an axe on your waist."
msgstr "一条带着金属环的皮带，可以在你的腰间收纳一把斧头。"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A handcrafted knife sheath made from birch bark with a strap attached.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个用桦树皮制成的自制刀鞘，大小足够容纳匕首，或是类似的小型刀具，自带一条背带。使用来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark ankle sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A handcrafted small concealed knife sheath worn on the ankle, made from birch bark.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个用桦树皮制成的穿在脚踝上的自制小型刀鞘。不经过练习用起来很笨拙。使用来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "baldric"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A heavy leather belt looped over one shoulder with an open scabbard at the hip which can hold most reasonably-sized swords."
msgstr "一条厚重的皮带斜挂在一肩，腰间配有开放的剑鞘，可以容纳大多数适中尺寸的剑。"

#. ~ Description of "leather bokken saya"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A large, adjustable leather sheath for holding a bokken.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个巨大的可调节剑鞘，大小足够容纳大型刀剑类武器。使用来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "bokken saya"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A large, adjustable plastic sheath for holding a bokken.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个巨大的可调节剑鞘，大小足够容纳大型刀剑类武器。使用来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "nylon scabbard"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A large, adjustable sheath for holding swords and other large blades, made with nylon.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个巨大的可调节剑鞘，由尼龙制成，大小足够容纳大型刀剑类武器。使用来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "scabbard"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A large, adjustable sheath for holding swords and other large blades.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个巨大的可调节剑鞘，大小足够容纳大型刀剑类武器。使用来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "back scabbard"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A leather scabbard, big enough for almost any sword.  Designed to be strapped to the back, it's very difficult to draw from without considerable practice.  Activate to sheath/draw a sword."
msgstr "一个皮制的剑鞘，足够容纳大部分剑类武器，剑鞘通过肩带系在后背，不经过一定练习很难将武器快速拔出。使用它来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A leather sheath for holding knives and other small blades.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个巨大的可调节剑鞘，大小足够容纳大型刀剑类武器。使用来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "spear strap"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A leather strap tied around the torso for toting spears while keeping your hands free.  You have to duck to get through doors while one's in it, though.  Activate to holster/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一根系在身上的皮带子，可以拴住长矛，解放双手。小心别卡在门框上。激活它来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "throwing knives leg sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A nylon strap knife sheath worn on the thigh, made to hold 6 very thin knives, such as throwing knives, close at hand.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个能绑在大腿上的尼龙刀鞘，能装下6把小刀随手取用。通常用来存放飞刀。使用来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "ankle sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A small concealed knife sheath worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个穿在脚踝上的小型刀鞘。不经过练习用起来很笨拙。使用来收拔武器。"

#. ~ Description of "garter sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "A small knife sheath meant to be worn under clothing, trading speed for concealability.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个穿在脚踝上的小型刀鞘。不经过练习用起来很笨拙。使用来收拔武器。"

