#. ~ Description of "leather backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A backpack made of leather.  Though a bit heavier than other materials, it is certainly quite durable."
msgstr "一个由皮革制成的背包。虽然比其他材质略重，但确实非常耐用。"

#. ~ Description of "denim backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A backpack made out of soft but durable denim."
msgstr "一款由柔软但耐用的牛仔布制成的背包。"

#. ~ Description of "leather pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A bag stitched together from leather scraps.  Doesn't hold an awful lot but is easy to wear."
msgstr "这是一个由皮革简单缝制成的耐用小袋子，提供少量储存空间。"

#. ~ Description of "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable buckled straps.  Provides some extra storage for outdoor activities."
msgstr "一个可以绑在大腿和臀部上的绑腿包，有着可调节的扣带。为户外运动提供一些额外的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic shopping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A bag used to carry groceries home."
msgstr "一个能携带各类杂货的购物袋。"

#. ~ Description of "net backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A bag woven together from strings, with straps to wear it on back.  Lighter than a standard backpack, but more awkward to carry when loaded and unable to hold small or heavy items."
msgstr "一个用绳子编织成的包，有条能让你背在身上的带子。比标准背包轻，但在装满时更显累赘，而且无法携带过小或过重的物品。"

#. ~ Description of "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A durable nylon bag marketed towards military personnel.  It has clips on the top and back, making it easy to attach a strap and wear it comfortably as a fanny pack.  MOLLE webbing on the back lets you affix it to body armor or a backpack."
msgstr "一个耐用尼龙小包，受众主要是军人。顶部和背面都有夹子，便于固定在带子上，可当作一个舒适的腰包穿戴。背面的MOLLE织带可以让你将其固定在防弹衣或背包上。"

#. ~ Description of "purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A fancy leather purse from a well-known designer.  A bit cumbersome to wear, but provides some storage."
msgstr "一位著名设计师设计的精美皮包。穿戴略显累赘，但能提供一些存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "straw basket"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A handmade straw basket.  Carry it with you for extra storage."
msgstr "一个手工编织的干草篮。随身携带可以让你获得额外的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "travelpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A hiking pack used for short trips."
msgstr "用于短途旅行的登山包。"

#. ~ Description of "duffel bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A huge duffel bag.  Provides plenty of storage, but is severely encumbering."
msgstr "一个巨大的无纺布编织袋，提供了极其可观的存储空间，但相当的累赘。"

#. ~ Description of "military rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A huge military rucksack, provides a lot of storage."
msgstr "一个广泛用于士兵行军、远足者旅行的结实耐用的大背包，提供非常可观的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "dry duffel bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A huge watertight duffel bag.  Capable of floating.  Provides plenty of storage, but is severely encumbering."
msgstr "一个很大的防水行李袋，放在水里都不会沉下去。提供大量的存储空间，但特别的累赘。"

#. ~ Description of "suitcase"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A huge wheeled suitcase used mainly for transporting clothes and other possessions during trips, provides a decent amount of storage but hauling it around is neither fast nor comfortable."
msgstr "一个主要用于旅行期间存放衣物和杂物的巨大轮式旅行箱，提供充足的存储空间，但拉起来很累赘。"

#. ~ Description of "jerrypack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A jerrycan modified to be worn in a similar manner to a backpack."
msgstr ""
"一个五加仑装的油桶绑上带子，剪个大口，然后背到背上，成为了一个背包。\n"
"\"天才的造物！\""

#. ~ Description of "swag bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large canvas sack re-purposed for makeshift storage."
msgstr ""
"一个大型帆布袋，进过重新改造用于临时存储。\n"
"\"和黑白条纹衫及小偷面具配合很搭。\""

#. ~ Description of "wicker backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large handmade straw basket with a lid and shoulder straps to wear it like a backpack.  Less comfortable than a proper backpack, but will do the job."
msgstr "一个大的手工草编篮子，有盖子和肩带，可以像背包一样穿。不如一个合适的背包舒服，但一样能用。"

#. ~ Description of "hiking backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large hiking backpack with plenty of storage space."
msgstr "一个大容量的登山背包，提供了很大的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "large tactical backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large multi-compartment backpack that offers great lower back support."
msgstr "一个大型战术背包，内设多个隔间，对背部下方的支撑性能优异。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large sheet tied into a crude, over-the-shoulder sling."
msgstr "用一块小床单折叠起来的简易过肩吊袋，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#. ~ Description of "loop of rope"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A length of rope tied with a sliding knot into a loop.  You can slip all sorts of large objects in and carry them as a bundle; if you want to tie a single item more securely you'd have to disassemble this loop.  It takes a while to untie it and get things out, and attackers might pull the whole thing undone if you're not careful."
msgstr "一段用滑结系成圈的绳子。你可以把各种各样的大件物品塞进去，把它们捆扎携带；如果你想更牢固地系上单件物品，你就必须拆解这个绳圈。解开它并把东西拿出来需要一段时间，而如果你不注意的话，受到攻击可能会把整捆东西都解开。"

#. ~ Description of "utility vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A light vest covered in pockets and straps for storage."
msgstr "一件有着可以存东西的口袋及肩带的轻型背心。"

#. ~ Description of "dive bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A lightweight mesh backpack, commonly worn by swimmers and divers."
msgstr "一件很轻的潜水员用网眼背包，提供比较可观的储物空间。"

#. ~ Description of "dry bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A lightweight watertight backpack, commonly worn by swimmers and divers."
msgstr "一个轻便的防水背包，常常用于游泳或潜水运动。"

#. ~ Description of "longarm bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A long duffel bag.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles.  Quite cumbersome."
msgstr "一个长长的无纺布编织袋，提供了能放进长柄武器和步枪的存储空间，但相当的累赘。"

#. ~ Description of "leather double rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A long soft leather rifle case.  Provides storage for 2 long arms and rifles.  Includes 3 accessory pockets and a strap."
msgstr "一个长长的皮制步枪枪袋，提供了能放进两把长柄武器和步枪的存储空间。自带三个附件袋和一根背带。"

#. ~ Description of "leather rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A long soft leather rifle case.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles.  Includes a small pocket, strap and handle."
msgstr "一个长长的皮制步枪枪袋，提供了能放进长柄武器和步枪的存储空间。自带一个小口袋，一根背带和一个提柄。"

#. ~ Description of "double rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A long soft rifle case.  Provides storage for 2 long arms and rifles.  Includes 3 accessory pockets and a strap."
msgstr "一个长长的步枪枪袋，提供了能放进两把长柄武器和步枪的存储空间。自带三个附件袋和一根背带。"

#. ~ Description of "rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A long soft rifle case.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles.  Includes a small pocket, strap and handle."
msgstr "一个长长的步枪枪袋，提供了能放进长柄武器和步枪的存储空间。自带一个小口袋，一根背带和一个提柄。"

#. ~ Description of "box backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A makeshift backpack comprised of a wooden box and a pair of ropes."
msgstr "一个简易背包，由一个木箱和一对绳索组成。"

#. ~ Description of "pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A makeshift bag, cobbled together from rags.  Really gets in the way, but provides a decent amount of storage."
msgstr "一个用布条拼凑而成的简易袋子。用起来很碍事，但提供了一定的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "suitcase"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A mid-sized wheeled suitcase used mainly for transporting clothes and other possessions during trips, provides a decent amount of storage but hauling it around is not exactly comfortable."
msgstr "一个带滚轮的中型旅行箱，主要用于旅行时存放衣物和杂物，提供了充足的存储空间，但拉起来很累赘。"

#. ~ Description of "backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A nylon backpack with a zipper pocket."
msgstr "一个带有一个拉链口袋的背包。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift knapsack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A pair of pants with the bottom ends tied with string, and then passed through the belt loops so the knapsack can be carried on the back."
msgstr "一条底部被绳索绑起来的裤子，绳索接着穿过皮带扣，使得整条裤子能够像背包背在背上，提供比较可观的储物空间。"

#. ~ Description of "laundry basket"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A plastic basket meant for storing and hauling clothing."
msgstr "一个用来存放和搬运衣物的塑料篮。"

#. ~ Description of "debug pocket universe"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A pocket universe.  Can store approximately 384 * 10^6 bugs."
msgstr "一个调试用的口袋宇宙。可以储存大约 384 * 10^6 个bug。"

#. ~ Description of "drop leg pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A pouch that can be worn on the thighs using buckled straps.  This variety is favored by the military."
msgstr "一个用扣带绑在大腿上的战术口袋，深受军队人员喜爱。"

#. ~ Description of "diving pouches"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A set of pouches that can be worn on the thighs using buckled neoprene rig.  This variety is favored by the divers."
msgstr "一对用氯丁橡胶腿环固定在大腿上的口袋，深受潜水者的喜爱。"

#. ~ Description of "camera bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A simple bag used to hold a camera, with a small pocket on the side for accessories.  Comes with a carry strap."
msgstr "一个能用来装照相机的简单袋子，侧面有一个小口袋用来装相机配件。自带一根背带。"

#. ~ Description of "sling pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A simple single-sling backpack.  Easier to access than a normal backpack, but can't comfortably hold as much."
msgstr "一个单肩挎包，相比普通背包更加轻便，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#. ~ Description of "ankle wallet pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A small concealed wallet pouch worn on the ankle.  If you strap it under your clothes, it can help you keep your wallet hidden and safe."
msgstr "一个能够绑在脚踝上的隐蔽小钱包。如果你把它穿在其他衣物下方，它能把你的钱藏好不被发现。"

#. ~ Description of "fanny pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A small fabric bag worn on the waist, with the pouch in front for easy access.  Once used as a visual shorthand for unstylish geeks and silly tourists, it was making a decent comeback before the apocalypse."
msgstr "一个穿在腰上的小布袋，正前方有个便于取用的小口袋。它曾被当作没品位极客和愚蠢游客的视觉标志，但在世界末日到来之前，就已经某种程度上重新流行起来。"

#. ~ Description of "armband pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A small pouch that can be worn on the upper arm using buckled straps.  This is a favored item among sports & camping enthusiasts.  Use it to adjust it to fit your leg."
msgstr "一个可以用系带扣在上臂的小袋子。这是一件深受运动和野营爱好者喜爱的装备。使用它将其调成能绑在大腿上的大小。"

#. ~ Description of "small leg purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A small purse that can be worn on the upper leg using buckled straps, easier to use than on the arm.  For those who want to wear a dress without pockets while carrying their phone and money.  Use it to adjust it to fit your arm."
msgstr "一个小钱包，可以用扣带绑在大腿上，比绑在手臂上时更容易使用。适合那些想穿着没有口袋的连衣裙，但又需要携带手机和零钱的人。使用它将其调成能绑在手臂上的大小。"

#. ~ Description of "golf bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A tall canvas and plastic bag with fold-out legs used for golfing.  It even has straps to be worn on the back and a slot for an umbrella."
msgstr "一个细长的带有可折叠支架的高尔夫球背包，采用帆布和塑料制成。它甚至还配有一条背带和雨伞挂钩。"

#. ~ Description of "big trapper pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A wooden frame with waterproofed cloth stretched around it, and a drawstring at the top to hold things in.  It has straps to wear it on your back."
msgstr "一个木制框架，四周铺着防水布，顶部有根拉绳，可以装下不少东西。它有一对背带可以背在你的背上。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "tourniquet (arm)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "tourniquet (leg)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "messenger bag"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "adjustable sling"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "adjustable sling (front)"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json data/json/items/gunmod/sling.json data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Adjust"
msgstr "调节"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "small leg purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Adjust on the arm"
msgstr "调成绑臂"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "armband pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Adjust on the leg"
msgstr "调成绑腿"

#. ~ Description of "high-volume rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Also known as a \"bigpack\", this gigantic rucksack is prized by packrats, but it would be inadvisable to attempt any physical activity while wearing it."
msgstr "一个旅行背包，特点就是大。它巨大的容量受到松鼠党的一致好评，但是这也可能让太多的重物压断你的腰。"

#. ~ Description of "trapper pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "An L-shaped wooden frame with a waterproofed cloth sack attached to it.  There's a drawstring to hold things in and straps to carry it on your back."
msgstr "一个L形木制框架，上面有个防水布袋。顶部有根拉绳，可以装下不少东西，还有一对背带可以背在背上。"

#. ~ Description of "pack frame"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "An L-shaped wooden frame with straps to secure a large item to it."
msgstr ""
"一个L型木制框架，有绑带可以固定住一件大型物品。\n"
"\"可以把你打到的猎物背回家，太重可能会把框压坏\""

#. ~ Description of "tactical dump pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "An expandable pouch secured with straps.  Provides a bit of extra storage with minimal encumbrance."
msgstr "一个可以张开的战术横腰袋，提供额外的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "long leather rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "An extra long soft leather rifle case.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles.  Includes a small pocket, strap and handle."
msgstr "一个特别加长的皮制步枪枪袋，提供了能放进长柄武器和步枪的存储空间。自带一个小口袋，一根背带和一个提柄。"

#. ~ Description of "bookstrap"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "An old-fashioned book strap carrier.  Guaranteed to make you feel like a proper scholar."
msgstr "一条老式书包带。保证让你觉得自己是一个真正的学者。"

#. ~ Description of "daypack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "An ultralight nylon backpack intended for one-day hiking trips.  Waterproof, slim, and spacious."
msgstr "一种超轻的尼龙背包，常用于单日的徒步旅行。这个防水背包在轻便的外表下还拥有很大的存储空间。"

#. ~ Description of "petpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Before the Cataclysm this would allow your four-legged friend to see the world, now it's used to shield them from the world."
msgstr "在大灾变来临前，这个背包可以让你带着你四条腿的朋友见识这个世界，但现在它也可以用来保护他们免遭世界的伤害。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Center pocket."
msgstr "主口袋"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Front pocket."
msgstr "前口袋"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "H&K operational briefcase (empty)"
msgid_plural "H&K operational briefcases (empty)"
msgstr[0] "H&K特工公文包（空）"

#. ~ Description of "messenger bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Light and easy to wear, but doesn't offer much storage."
msgstr "一个常见的呈长方形、比较大的挎包，常见于邮递员投送报纸、信件时候所配备，提供比较可观的存储空间。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "MOLLE assault pack"
