msgstr "轻质短袖连体衣。  它很舒适，并且有足够的口袋空间。"

#. ~ Description of "work coveralls"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "A long-sleeved jumpsuit made of chemical-resistant synthetics.  Offers solid protection from everyday dangers on the job and plenty of pockets for easy storage."
msgstr "由防水帆布制成的全套连体裤。提供坚固的保护，避免工作中的日常危险，还有许多的存储口袋。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mummy suit" of item "long-sleeved jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
