#. jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "A long-sleeved jumpsuit printed all over with the stars and stripes of the US flag."
msgstr "一件印有美国国旗星条图案的长袖连体服。"

#. ~ Description of variant "ninja costume" of item "long-sleeved jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "A one-piece costume meant to resemble the popular depiction of a ninja."
msgstr "一种连体服装，旨在模仿流行的忍者形象。"

#. ~ Description of "denim overalls"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of denim pants with a front apron and shoulder straps across the back.  They're tough and have plenty of storage space."
msgstr "一条牛仔布制成的裤子，前面带围兜，背面有肩带交叉设计。它们坚固耐用，并且具有充足的储物空间。"

#. ~ Description of "XS subject suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "A short-sleeved yellow garment resembling a hospital gown, sized for a very young child.  A variety of plastic snaps pin its two halves together around the body and could seemingly be adjusted to fit just about anyone, or anything..."
msgstr "类似医院病号服的短袖黄色服装，尺寸适合很小的孩子。  各种塑料按扣将其两半固定在身体周围，并且似乎可以调整以适合任何人或任何东西......"

