#. ~ Description of "riot armor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A full suit of black plastic body armor plates used by riot police.  Cleverly placed velcro straps secure each piece, resulting in slightly less encumbrance then its constituent parts.  MOLLE webbing is attached to the torso and the word POLICE is emblazoned across the front."
msgstr "防暴警察使用的全套黑色塑料装甲板。巧妙地将尼龙搭扣带子固定在每一块上，使之比每件单独穿着时的累赘略少。大腿上系有MOLLE织带，正面印有\"警察\"字样。"

#. ~ Description of "suit of leather armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A full suit of thick leather armor.  It's fairly heavy, but could be deconstructed into its constituent parts if desired."
msgstr "全套厚重的皮甲。  它相当重，但如果需要的话可以分解成其组成部分。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A full-body suit of medieval chain armor, complete with a hood, gloves, and chausses."
msgstr "中世纪链甲全身套装，配有兜帽、手套和马裤。"

#. ~ Description of "conductive NBC suit"
#. ~ Description of "conductive NBC suit (unzipped)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A glossy boiler suit complete with rubber gloves and steel-toed boots, this getup is the sort of thing you might see in a documentary about Chernobyl.  It lacks any branding, but a label on the inside explains that the suit is flame-resistant, chemical resistant, and when paired with a gas mask, could provide protection from biological agents and radioactive particles.  A bold warning mentions that suit only protects from electric shock while the wearer is grounded and the suit is worn properly."
msgstr "一套光滑的连衫裤，配有橡胶手套和钢头靴子，这种装束可能是您在有关切尔诺贝利的纪录片中看到的那种服装。  它没有任何品牌标识，但内部的标签解释说，该套装具有阻燃性和耐化学性，与防毒面具搭配使用时，可以提供针对生物制剂和放射性粒子的防护。  一个大胆的警告提到，只有当穿着者接地并且正确穿着防护服时，防护服才能防止电击。"

#. ~ Description of "cleansuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A hooded boiler suit, complete with bulky gloves and boots, that covers everything but the face in impermeable rubber fabric.  Though not designed to stand up to combat, it should protect from chemicals, radiation, and other environmental hazards.  A tag advises the user to wear an activated gas mask while working in these conditions."
msgstr "连帽连衫裤，配有笨重的手套和靴子，用不渗透的橡胶织物覆盖除脸部以外的所有部位。  虽然它的设计目的不是为了对抗战斗，但它应该能够防止化学物质、辐射和其他环境危害。  标签建议用户在这些条件下工作时佩戴激活的防毒面具。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail hauberk"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A knee-length long-sleeved tunic made of interlocking low-quality steel rings.  It can be adjusted to be worn as outerwear."
msgstr "一种及膝的长袖外衣，由互锁的劣质钢环制成。  它可以调整为外套穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail hauberk (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A knee-length long-sleeved tunic made of interlocking low-quality steel rings.  It can be adjusted to fit closer to the body."
msgstr "一种及膝的长袖外衣，由互锁的劣质钢环制成。  它可以调整以更贴合身体。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail hauberk"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A knee-length long-sleeved tunic made of interlocking steel rings.  It can be adjusted to be worn as outerwear."
msgstr "由互锁钢环制成的及膝长袖甲。  它可以调整为外套穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail hauberk (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A knee-length long-sleeved tunic made of interlocking steel rings.  It can be adjusted to fit closer to the body."
msgstr "由互锁钢环制成的及膝长袖外衣。  它可以调整以更贴合身体。"

#. ~ Description of "track touring suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A lightweight leather bodysuit with padding in high-impact areas, meant for motorcyclists out on the track.  Though weaker than more modern Kevlar motorcycle gear, it is lightweight and can be worn under other gear."
msgstr "一种皮革紧身衣，在高冲击区域有衬垫，专为巡回赛赛道上的摩托车手设计。皮革很硬，但使它比其他轻型护甲更坚固，更具防护。"

#. ~ Description of "military flight suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A long-sleeved jumpsuit worn by military pilots.  It's made of nomex, rendering it fireproof."
msgstr "军事飞行员穿的长袖连衣裤。  它由 nomex 制成，具有防火性能。"

#. ~ Description of "dress uniform"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A military officer's dress uniform from before the Cataclysm, complete with rank and ribbons.  Just looking at it gives you an air of authority.  Perhaps not the most practical military wear, but a very stylish option."
msgstr "大灾变前的军官制式礼服，配有军衔和缎带。只要看看它，你就会有一种权威感。也许不是最实用的军装，但却是非常时尚的选择。"

#. ~ Description of "activity suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A single-piece brown and orange environmental suit, tailored in a way that slightly recalls a military flight suit.  It requires a separate gas mask for full protection."
msgstr "一件棕色和橙色的环境防护服，裁剪样式让人想起一件军用飞行服。它的背面印着\"X.E.D.R.A\"的字母，右臂上的白色肩章画着一个箭头射进一环套一环的同心圆内。上半部分被随意地系在腰间。"

#. ~ Description of "activity suit (unzipped)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A single-piece brown and orange environmental suit, tailored in a way that slightly recalls a military flight suit.  The upper portion has been tied around the waist casually."
msgstr "一件棕色和橙色的环境防护服，裁剪样式让人想起一件军用飞行服。它的背面印着\"X.E.D.R.A\"的字母，右臂上的白色肩章画着一个箭头射进一环套一环的同心圆内。上半部分被随意地系在腰间。"

#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A snug body suit made from thin and lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric.  Tough yet breathable, it is light and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr "一套由轻薄的芳纶防火织物制成的紧身服。结实但透气，穿在其他衣服下既轻便又舒适。"

#. ~ Description of "suit of boiled leather armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A suit of armor constructed in a similar fashion to plate mail, but made of leather which has been boiled until stiff.  It's lighter and cooler than standard leather, but less flexible, making it harder to move in."
msgstr "一套盔甲，其构造与板甲类似，但由煮至坚硬的皮革制成。  它比标准皮革更轻、更凉爽，但灵活性较差，因此移动起来更加困难。"

#. ~ Description of "tire suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A suit of armor made from thick chunks of rubber tire secured by simple strings; the loose collection of rubber plates provides decent but not the most convenient protection."
msgstr "一套用轮胎片做成的装甲，碎片之间用小绳子固定。这些松垮的小片片能提供不错的防护，但是还不够完美。"

#. ~ Description of "suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A suit of formal attire.  Makes the apocalypse a truly gentlemanly experience."
msgstr ""
"一套笔挺的全身棉制商务正装西服。\n"
"\"在末日来临之时也要有绅士风范。\""

#. ~ Description of "full plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A suit of medieval plate armor, covering everything but the head and neck.  It's made of low-quality steel that doesn't look like it'll hold together long.  This would likely be uncomfortable without something soft underneath."
msgstr "一套中世纪钢甲，覆盖除头部和颈部以外的所有部位。  它是由劣质钢材制成的，看起来不会长期固定在一起。  如果下面没有柔软的东西，这可能会不舒服。"

#. ~ Description of "full plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A suit of medieval plate armor, covering everything but the head and neck.  This would likely be uncomfortable without something soft underneath."
msgstr "一套中世纪钢甲，覆盖除头部和颈部以外的所有部位。  如果下面没有柔软的东西，这可能会不舒服。"

#. ~ Description of "beekeeping suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A white suit commonly worn by professional beekeepers with straps on your ankles and wrists to prevent bees from flying in.  It's not a very tough fabric, but it's lightweight and has plenty of storage thanks to a chest pocket."
msgstr ""
"一套白色套装，通常是职业养蜂人穿戴，在袖口和脚踝处有系带防止蜜蜂飞入蛰伤。这件衣服使用的织物并不坚固，但很轻便，此外胸口的大袋子提供了不少的存储空间。\n"
"\"防的是小蜜蜂，而不是巨型蜜蜂和巨型黄蜂。\""

#. ~ Description of "entry suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "An aluminized whole-body garment worn by firefighters and foundry workers as protection against flames."
msgstr "一件消防员经常穿的重型防护服，能防护高温和火焰。需要额外配套的防化面具才能完全防护烟雾。"

#. ~ Description of "hazmat suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "An impermeable full-body garment with a clear plastic face shield, rubber gloves, and boots, looking like a soft, puffy space suit.  It looks fragile, but a tag on the interior explains that it will provide excellent protection from radiation, pathogens, chemicals, toxins, and even electrical discharge, so long as it's in good condition."
msgstr "一种不渗透的全身服装，配有透明塑料面罩、橡胶手套和靴子，看起来像柔软、蓬松的太空服。  它看起来很脆弱，但内部的标签说明，只要它状况良好，它就能提供出色的保护，免受辐射、病原体、化学物质、毒素甚至放电的影响。"

#. ~ Description of "ō-yoroi"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "An ornamental suit of Japanese samurai armor."
msgstr ""
"一套日本武士盔甲，华丽、沉重，最早起源于日本平安中期，防护性能出色，区别于武士战斗时普遍装备的胴丸，大铠更倾向于装饰作用。\n"
"\"武士の魂。\""

#. ~ Description of "canine bite suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Designed to stop the injuries of dog bites, this thick, one piece suit is often used in the rehabilitation of abused animals and in training dogs by the police and military.  A base layer of aramid fabric has had strips of soft body armor sewn into it to mimic quilting, and to soften the blunt of animals jumping, slashing, or pouncing on the wearer."
msgstr "设计来防止犬类咬伤的的厚实一体式防护服，常用于警察或军队收容受虐动物或训练犬只。基层是凯夫拉材质，上面层叠缝有防护甲条从而卸掉动物飞扑、猛抓或撞击时的力道。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Faraday chainmail"
msgid_plural "Faraday chainmails"
msgstr[0] "法拉第锁环服"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Faraday platemail"
msgid_plural "Faraday platemails"
msgstr[0] "硬化装甲板"

#. ~ Description of "Faraday chainmail"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Jury-rigged armor made by affixing a full-body suit of chainmail over a rubber cleansuit, with copper wire threaded through to create a low impedence route to the ground that doesn't travel through the wearer.  It is hot, heavy, and uncomfortable, and the plastic face shield doesn't help."
msgstr "临时装备的盔甲，通过在橡胶洁净服上贴上全身链甲套装而制成，铜线穿过以形成一条不穿过佩戴者的低阻抗路径到地面。  天气又热又重又不舒服，而且塑料面罩也无济于事。"

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Leg and body armor crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr "一副由经过精心清理并裁剪过的酸蚁硅化甲壳制成的全身护甲，防酸但很脆弱。"

#. ~ Description of "chitin armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Lightweight leg and body armor made from the exoskeletons of giant arthropods."
msgstr "一件由昆虫甲壳制成的护甲。"

#. ~ Description of "WS-47G moisture retention suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "The WebbStar moisture retention suit utilizes advanced technology to prevent up to 30% of moisture loss through perspiration.  The suit is powered by the micro-motions of the body, especially breathing and walking motions.  Because of this, your walking speed is impaired while wearing it."
msgstr ""
"WebbStar牌保湿衣采用最新科技，能减少30%因流汗引起的水分流失。这件衣服由身体的微运动充能，特别是呼吸和行走动作。因此穿着时会减慢你的步行速度。\n"
"\"这款曾经被一些顾客戏称为逃出克隆岛的家伙们的专用服装。\""

#. ~ Description of "Faraday platemail"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "This full suit of medieval platemail, complete with a chain hood and plastic face shield, has been strapped over some kind of cleansuit and strung with copper wiring."
msgstr "这套全套中世纪板甲套装，配有链罩和塑料面罩，绑在某种洁净服上，并用铜线串起来。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "WS-47G moisture retention suit"
msgid_plural "WS-47G moisture retention suits"
msgstr[0] "WS-47G 保湿衣"

