#. ~ Description of "thick wetsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A bulky wetsuit for colder water or more dangerous environments.  The rubbery neoprene outer offers some protection from bumps and scrapes."
msgstr "适用于较冷水域或较危险环境的笨重潜水服。  橡胶氯丁橡胶外层提供一定程度的保护，防止碰撞和刮擦。"

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A full-body wetsuit for swimming in temperate conditions."
msgstr "适合在温带条件下游泳的全身潜水服。"

#. ~ Description of "full-face diving mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A full-face diving mask that covers the face and eyes.  Can be equipped with any common scuba regulator to protect from drowning and other dangers, though the process needs some time and knowledge."
msgstr "一种完全包裹面部和眼睛的潜水面罩。可以配备任何常见的水肺调节器，以防止溺水和其他危险，尽管这个过程需要一些时间和知识。"

#. ~ Description of "modular full-face diving mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A high-end modular full-face diving mask that covers the face and eyes.  Can be equipped with proprietary adapters for scuba tanks or rebreather cartridges to protect from drowning and other dangers."
msgstr "一个高端模块化的全包式潜水面罩，覆盖面部和眼睛。可以配备专有的水肺罐或再呼吸器墨盒适配器，以防止溺水和其他危险。"

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A long-sleeved neoprene jacket.  Keeps you warm and protected from the elements."
msgstr "一件长袖氯丁橡胶夹克。让你保持温暖，抵御恶劣天气。"

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit long-sleeved shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A long-sleeved neoprene shirt.  Good for surfing and other water sports."
msgstr "一件长袖氯丁橡胶衬衫。适合冲浪和其他水上运动。"

#. ~ Description of "rashguard shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A long-sleeved rashguard shirt.  Commonly used to protect against rashes from abrasion or sun exposure."
msgstr "一件长袖防晒衬衫。通常用来防止摩擦或日晒引起的皮疹。"

#. ~ Description of "spring suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A long-sleeved spring wetsuit with pink color details and cleavage-enhancing, hip-accentuating construction.  Not as protective as a full-body suit, but also less restrictive."
msgstr "一件长袖的保暖潜水衣，上面有着粉红色的点缀。流线型的贴身设计充分彰显出你前凸后翘的傲人身材。虽然这件衣服安全性上没有全身潜水服好，但是其胜在轻便不勒身。"

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A neoprene hood commonly worn by divers."
msgstr "一条忍者常用的黑色兜帽。"

#. ~ Description of "faraday sharksuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A one-piece chainmail suit used by SCUBA divers for protection against shark bites.  It has been conductively interconnected, protecting against electricity."
msgstr "一件潜水员用来防止被鲨鱼咬伤、覆及全身的一体链甲套装。内部有电传导系统，有效防护电击。"

#. ~ Description of "diving gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of flexible neoprene-silicone rubber gloves, suitable for underwater use."
msgstr "一双富有弹性的氯丁橡胶手套，适合水下使用。"

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of light and stretchy neoprene pants.  Good for surfing and other water sports."
msgstr "一条轻便有弹力的氯丁橡胶长裤。适合冲浪和其他水上运动。"

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of light and stretchy neoprene shorts.  Good for use on the beach."
msgstr "一条轻便有弹力的氯丁橡胶短裤。适合在海滩上使用。"

#. ~ Description of "diving boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of neoprene diving boots with rubber soles."
msgstr "一双橡胶鞋底的氯丁橡胶潜水靴。"

#. ~ Description of "swim fins"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of rubber flippers worn on the feet, which improve swimming speed while greatly impeding the wearer's ability to walk."
msgstr "一双穿在脚上的橡胶脚蹼，可以提高游泳速度，但走起路来非常困难。"

#. ~ Description of "swim briefs"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of skin-tight swim shorts, also known as jammers.  Commonly used by male competitive swimmers."
msgstr "一条蓝色泳裤。通常用于男子游泳运动员。"

#. ~ Description of "diving socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of split-toe neoprene diving socks with thin rubber soles."
msgstr "一双分趾氯丁橡胶潜水袜，薄橡胶鞋底。"

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit technical shorts (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of stretchy neoprene shorts with large pockets.  Can be worn over a wetsuit or adjusted to be worn alone."
msgstr "一条带有大口袋的弹性氯丁橡胶短裤。 可穿在潜水衣外面，也可调整为单独穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit technical shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of stretchy neoprene shorts with large pockets.  They can be worn alone or adjusted to wear over a wetsuit."
msgstr "一条带有大口袋的弹性氯丁橡胶短裤。 可单独穿着，也可调整后穿在潜水衣外面。"

#. ~ Description of "swimming trunks"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of swimming trunks, with netting."
msgstr "一件男性平角泳裤，有绳子可以绑。"

#. ~ Description of "thick diving gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of thick neoprene-silicone rubber gloves, suitable for underwater use."
msgstr "一双厚厚的高延展性的氯丁橡胶手套，适合水下使用。"

#. ~ Description of "speedo"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of very short swim briefs.  Commonly used by male competitive swimmers and bodybuilders."
msgstr "一条黑色超短泳裤。通常用于男子游泳和健美运动员。"

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A short-sleeved neoprene shirt.  Good for use on the beach."
msgstr "一件短袖氯丁橡胶衬衫。适合在海滩上使用。"

#. ~ Description of "bikini top"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A simple bikini top."
msgstr "一件女性游泳时穿着的泳装胸罩。"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless spring suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A sleeveless spring wetsuit with an ocean blue color and cleavage-enhancing, hip-accentuating construction.  Not as protective as a full-body suit, but also less restrictive."
msgstr "一件无袖的保暖潜水衣，上面有着海蓝色的点缀。流线型的贴身设计充分彰显出你前凸后翘的傲人身材。虽然这件衣服安全性上没有全身潜水服好，但是其胜在轻便不勒身。"

#. ~ Description of "swim goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A small pair of goggles made for swimming."
msgstr "一副符合光学和医用标准，水下视物清晰、视野宽阔的游泳镜。"

#. ~ Description of "thick wetsuit hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A thick neoprene hood, commonly worn by divers in cold weather."
msgstr "厚厚的氯丁橡胶兜帽，通常由潜水员在寒冷的天气中佩戴。"

#. ~ Description of "swim cap"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A tightly fitted, skin-tight head garment made of spandex.  Commonly used by recreational and competitive swimmers."
msgstr "一顶用氨纶制成的紧身头巾。通常是水中娱乐时或是竞技游泳运动员使用。"

#. ~ Description of "sharksuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A-one piece chainmail suit used by SCUBA divers for protection against shark bites."
msgstr "一件潜水员用来防止被鲨鱼咬伤的一体链甲套装。"

