#. ~ Description of "armored jean jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A denim jacket reinforced with sheet metal plates."
msgstr "一件用金属薄板加固的牛仔夹克"

#. ~ Description of "armored jean vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A denim vest reinforced with sheet metal plates."
msgstr "加装了金属插板的牛仔背心。"

#. ~ Description of "leather cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A durable breastplate made of thick leather."
msgstr "一件厚皮革制成的背心。"

#. ~ Description of "tire armor jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A heavy leather jacket reinforced with chunks of thick rubber tire.  Thick and highly resistant to blunt force."
msgstr "用大块厚橡胶轮胎加固的厚重皮夹克。  厚且高度耐钝力。"

#. ~ Description of "armored riding jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A heavy-duty leather jacket with sheet metal plates secured over it for increased protection."
msgstr "重型皮夹克，其上固定有金属板以增强保护。"

#. ~ Description of "motorcycle armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A light jacket made of a stretch mesh covered in plastic pads meant for motorcyclists.  Made to be much more comfortable to wear than leather alternatives, but the underlying spandex isn't protective at all."
msgstr "一种由弹性织网制成的轻便夹克，上面覆盖着塑料衬垫，供摩托车手穿着。与皮革版相比，它的穿着更加舒适，但其底层的氨纶面料根本没有防护力。"

#. ~ Description of "fencing jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A padded jacket with a zipper on the back, used by fencers to prevent accidents."
msgstr "一件拉链在背后、防止击剑时发生意外的厚夹克。"

#. ~ Description of "carpet cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A rectangular length of tough carpet with a hole cut out for your head and tied around the waist.  It's decently protective for its weight and quite the fashion statement."
msgstr ""
"一张长方形的粗糙地毯，上面开了个洞让你套在头上，拴住腰部固定。相对于它的重量来说，防护力就有点不够看了。\n"
"\"至少…看起来挺酷\""

#. ~ Description of "padded vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A sleeveless cotton shirt with fabric sewn overtop for extra protection."
msgstr "一件无袖棉衬衫。穿着很方便。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A solid breastplate made from bronze.  It's weaker than steel, but still quite protective."
msgstr "由青铜制成的坚固胸甲。  它比钢弱，但仍然具有相当的保护作用。"

#. ~ Description of "plate cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A solid steel breastplate.  Even as full armor went into decline, cuirasses remained in use among cavalry in Europe."
msgstr "一件钢制的胸腹部护甲，一套盔甲的核心部位。就算在全身覆甲的潮流被时代所淘汰之后，钢制胸甲仍然在欧洲的骑兵部队中有被装备。"

#. ~ Description of "hard chest guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A solid vest of plastic padding protecting your torso."
msgstr "一件结实的塑料内衬的护胸，用来保护你的躯干。"

#. ~ Description of "underarm protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A sturdy cotton plastron that protects much of the torso, the dominant shoulder, and underarm while fencing."
msgstr "一件结实的棉质胸甲，能在击剑时保护大部分躯干、肩膀主要部分和腋下。"

#. ~ Description of "padded sweatshirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A thick cotton sweatshirt with fabric sewn overtop, providing a modicum of extra protection."
msgstr "厚棉质运动衫，上面缝有布料，提供一点额外的保护。"

#. ~ Description of "lamé"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A thin, lightweight conductive vest with the zipper on the back used by fencers for electronic scoring.  Its outer layer is a woven mix of sturdy cotton and stainless steel strands."
msgstr "一件轻薄的导电背心，背部有拉链，用于在击剑时电子计分。它的最外层是由结实的棉布和不锈钢丝交织而成的。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A vest made of countless links of low-quality steel chain.  It's lightweight enough to fit under outerwear, and can be adjusted for a closer fit."
msgstr "由无数节劣质钢链组成的背心。  它的重量足够轻，可以穿在外套里面，并且可以调节以达到更贴身的效果。"

#. ~ Description of "armored leather vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "An armored vest made from thick leather and metal plates."
msgstr "一件由厚皮革和金属板制成的护甲背心。"

#. ~ Description of "tire cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "An improvised breastplate made from thick chunks of rubber secured by simple strings."
msgstr "一件用金属碎片做成的护甲，碎片之间用小绳子固定。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "Armor made of countless links of steel wire woven into the shape of a vest.  It's flexible enough to fit under outerwear, and can be adjusted for a looser fit."
msgstr "由无数钢丝编织成背心形状的铠甲。  它足够灵活，可以穿在外套下，也可以调节至宽松的版型。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail vest (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "Armor made of countless links of steel wire woven into the shape of a vest.  It's lightweight enough to fit under outerwear, and can be adjusted for a closer fit."
msgstr "由无数钢丝编织成背心形状的铠甲。  它的重量足够轻，可以穿在外套里面，并且可以调节以达到更贴身的效果。"

#. ~ Description of "lorica segmentata"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "Body armor in the ancient roman style, made of overlapping metal strips connected to internal leather straps."
msgstr "一件古罗马片甲，由互相重叠的金属片连接而成，内部由皮带联结。"

#. ~ Description of "mirror armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "Broad steel plates known as mirrors have been fitted onto a leather vest, providing a fair amount of protection to the body.  The design was once popular throughout Asia and the Middle East, and might work best over chainmail or cloth armor."
msgstr "被称为镜子的宽钢板被安装在皮背心上，为身体提供相当程度的保护。  这种设计曾经在整个亚洲和中东流行，并且可能最适合链甲或布甲。"

#. ~ Description of "football armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "Heavy polycarbonate armor for your upper torso.  Normally worn by football players."
msgstr "一件沉重的聚碳酸酯护甲，通常由美式橄榄球球员穿着。"

#. ~ Description of "crude paper breastplate"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "Jury-rigged body armor made from thickly-stacked paper and rolls of duct tape."
msgstr "一件由一叠叠厚纸和胶带制成的简易护甲。"

#. ~ Description of "riot guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "Padded plastic armor for the hips, torso, and shoulders.  If it were combined with some arm and shin guards, it'd be a full set of riot armor.  It sports MOLLE webbing for accessory attachments, and the word POLICE is painted across the front."
msgstr "臀部、躯干和肩膀的带衬垫塑料装甲。  如果再加上一些护臂护腿，那就是全套的防暴盔甲了。  它采用 MOLLE 织带作为配件附件，正面涂有 POLICE 字样。"

