#. ~ Description of magazine "heavy plutonium tool battery"
#. ~ Description of "heavy plutonium tool battery"
#: data/json/items/battery.json
msgid "A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilize an exotic nanocompound.  It is universally compatible with all kinds of industrial-grade equipment and large tools.  Although it stores a huge amount of power, it cannot be recharged."
msgstr "这种电池使用一根钚-244棒来稳定一种奇特的纳米复合材料，兼容各种工业级设备和大型电动工具。虽然它储存了大量的能量，但它不能被再次充电。"

#. ~ Description of magazine "watch battery"
#. ~ Description of "watch battery"
#: data/json/items/battery.json
msgid "A coin-shaped battery designed for use in small devices like watches and calculators"
msgstr "一种专为手表和计算器等小型设备设计的硬币状电池"

#. ~ Description of magazine "disposable watch battery"
#. ~ Description of "disposable watch battery"
#: data/json/items/battery.json
