msgstr "一种专为手表、计算器等小型设备设计的硬币状电池。此款电池不可充电。"

#. ~ Description of magazine "heavy tool battery"
#. ~ Description of "heavy tool battery"
#: data/json/items/battery.json
msgid "A heavy battery pack, universally compatible with all kinds of industrial-grade equipment and portable tools."
msgstr "这是一种大型电池，适用于各种工业级设备和大型电动工具。"

#. ~ Description of magazine "tool battery"
#. ~ Description of "tool battery"
#: data/json/items/battery.json
msgid "A rechargeable battery pack, big enough to run a cordless drill or other handheld power tool."
msgstr "一款可充电电池组，容量足以驱动无线电钻或其他手持电动工具。"

#. ~ Description of magazine "lithium battery"
#. ~ Description of "lithium battery"
#: data/json/items/battery.json
msgid "A rechargeable lithium battery small enough to fit in many handheld devices but powerful enough to run complex electronics.  These are newer and can store much more power than the old dry cell batteries."
msgstr "一款可充电锂电池，体积小巧足以适配众多手持设备，却拥有驱动复杂电子设备所需的强大能量。这类新型电池相比老式干电池，能存储更多电能。"

