#. ~ Description of "Sleep Mode CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A CBM that completely shuts down all communication between the user's brain and the rest of their body when they fall asleep, preventing them from waking up under any circumstance until their natural sleep cycle completes.  An inability to trigger its effects manually makes it useless as an anesthesia substitute."
msgstr "这个CBM完全关闭使用者入睡时大脑与身体其他部位之间的所有通信，防止他们在任何情况下醒来，直到他们的自然睡眠周期结束。由于无法手动触发其效果，因此无法作为麻醉替代品使用。"

#. ~ Description of "Recoil Compensators CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A CBM that contains shock absorbers and kinetic braces which greatly reduce the recoil of guns."
msgstr "一个包含减震器和动力支架的CBM，可大大减少枪械后坐力。"

#. ~ Description of "Acidic Discharge CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A CBM that has been breached in several places.  Some acid is leaking from it."
msgstr "一个有几处已经破损的生化插件。一些酸液正从中泄漏出来。"

#. ~ Description of "abstract faulty bionic module"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A CBM that is broken beyond repair; you can't do anything with it."
msgstr "一个彻底损坏的CBM，你不能用它做任何事。"

#. ~ Description of "Power Storage CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A Compact Bionics Module consisting of a miniaturized battery which increases the user's maximum bionic power by 100 units.  Once installed, it will likely require some sort of charger CBM to power it."
msgstr "紧凑型仿生模块，内含微型电池，可将用户最大仿生功率提升100单位。安装后，该模块可能需要某种充电器CBM进行供电。"

#. ~ Description of "Power Storage Mk. II CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A Compact Bionics Module consisting of a miniaturized battery which increases the user's maximum bionic power by 250 units.  Once installed, it will likely require some sort of charger CBM to power it."
msgstr "紧凑型仿生模块，内置微型电池，可将用户最大仿生功率提升250单位。安装后需搭配专用充电器CBM进行供电。"

#. ~ Description of "Unified Power System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A Unified Power System that is wired into the user's bionic power banks.  Objects that run on a UPS can now directly draw power from the bionic power supply."
msgstr "一套UPS系统，连接到了使用者的生化能量槽上。使用UPS的物品现在可以直接使用生化能量了。"

#. ~ Description of "Battery System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A battery draining attachment to make use of the energy contained in normal, everyday batteries."
msgstr "这套电池系统可以利用普通电池来恢复生化能量。"

#. ~ Description of "Internal Chronometer CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A bionic module containing an atomic clock, complete with a silent alarm clock function."
msgstr "一个包含了一个原子钟的生化插件，具有无声闹钟功能。"

#. ~ Description of "Sonic Resonator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A bionic module that allows the user's entire body to resonate at very high power, creating a short-range shockwave.  While it will not do much damage to creatures, solid objects such as walls and doors will be damaged."
msgstr "这个生化插件能使使用者的全身在极高的能量下产生共振，产生一道短距冲击波。虽然这道冲击波无法对生物造成多少伤害，但其能够损坏坚硬的物体，比如说墙壁或者门。"

#. ~ Description of "Infrared Vision CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A bionic module that extends the user's range of vision into the infrared, allowing them to see warm-blooded creatures in the dark and through smoke."
msgstr "这个生化插件将受体的视觉扩展到红外波段，使其能够在黑暗中或透过烟雾看见恒温动物。"

#. ~ Description of "Shockwave Generator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A bionic module that generates a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby creatures.  Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun upon impact with impassable terrain, and knock back any creatures they collide with."
msgstr "生化插件可以产生一道强力的冲击波，击退所有附近的生物并造成短暂的眩晕，如果撞击在无法通行的地形上将造成额外的伤害和眩晕，被击退生物碰撞到的其他生物也会被一同击退。"

#. ~ Description of "Protective Lenses CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A bionic package that seals the user's eye sockets with highly-protective mirrored lenses which can retract into their frames at will."
msgstr "这个生化插件将用高防护性的镜状晶体封闭受体的眼眶，并将泪管重新导向口腔。当使用者哭泣的时候，如果不选择把眼泪吐出来，就只能选择自食其泪了。"

#. ~ Description of "Active Defense System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A bionic that projects a thin forcefield around the user's body.  Everything loses velocity when penetrating this field, which results in a reduced amount of dealt damage at the cost of user's bionic energy.  Bullets and stabbing attacks will lose more velocity than cutting attacks, and those in turn more than bashing attacks."
msgstr "一个能在受体周围投射出一层薄薄的力场屏障的生化插件。任何穿透这个力场的东西都会失去速度，降低造成的伤害，但同时也会造成额外的能量消耗。子弹和刺击会比斩击失去更多的速度，而这些攻击又会比钝击失去更多的速度。"

#. ~ Description of "Radioactive Leak CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A broken CBM that has been leaking radiation into its user.  The danger seems to have been sealed off during the removal process, but you definitely shouldn't put it back."
msgstr "这个破损的CBM一直在泄漏辐射。辐射危险似乎已经在移除过程中被隔绝，但你绝对不应该把它放回体内。"

#. ~ Description of "Taste Fouler CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A broken and mis-wired module that would cause food and drink to taste terrible if installed."
msgstr "一个坏掉的、接线错误的生化插件，会让食物和饮料的味道变得糟糕。"

#. ~ Description of "Electromagnetic Leak CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A broken implant that sends electromagnetic impulses that reduce other implants' capacity to store charge."
msgstr "一个会不断发出电磁脉冲，降低其他储能生化插件容量的损坏生化插件。"

#. ~ Description of "Power Overload CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A bunch of defective power circuits that are prone to short-circuiting."
msgstr "一堆故障的功率电路，随时会短路。"

#. ~ Description of "Flashbang Generator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A combination of LEDs and speakers that create a flash and sound comparable to a flashbang grenade, deafening and blinding nearby enemies."
msgstr "这套LED灯和扩音器组成的系统能够产生如同闪光弹一样的闪光和巨响，对周围的敌人产生致盲致聋的效果。"

#. ~ Description of "Shotgun Arm CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A concealed, single shot 12 gauge shotgun that is implanted inside the left forearm.  Perfect in a pinch."
msgstr "一把单发12号口径霰弹枪被隐蔽地植入到左臂内部，以备不时之需。"

#. ~ Description of "Monomolecular Blade CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A deadly foot-long blade made of advanced material that is installed inside the forearm, capable of being extended through the back of the user's wrist at the cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will prevent the user from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr "约30厘米长的先进材料刀片隐藏在受体的前臂内部，使用少量能量可以从手腕背部伸出。异常锋利，伸展时会妨碍使用者拿取其他物品。"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Visual Impairment CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A defective bionic that impairs vision."
msgstr "这个故障的生化插件减弱了受体的视力。"

#. ~ Description of "Blood Filter CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A filtration system that is installed in the heart and can actively filter out chemical impurities, primarily drugs, with limited impact on viruses.  Note that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in the system will be affected."
msgstr "受体的心脏植入了一个过滤系统，使其能够主动过滤掉血液中的化学杂质，主要包括药物和毒品。但该系统对病毒效果不佳。需要注意的是该系统并非定向过滤系统，受体体内的所有药物和毒品都会受到影响。"

#. ~ Description of "Repair Nanobots CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A fleet of tiny, dormant robots.  While activated, they will flit about the user's body, repairing damage and stopping bleeding at the cost of power."
msgstr "一群微型纳米机器人。开启时会不断消耗能量，绕行使用者的周身，修复伤害以及止血。"

#. ~ Description of "Electrical Discharge CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A formerly-functional CBM that is now a mess of naked wires and burnt resistors."
msgstr "一个已经变成了一堆乱七八糟的裸露电线和烧毁电阻的生化插件。"

#. ~ Description of "Cloaking System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A high-power system that uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make the user blend into their surroundings, rendering them fully invisible to eyes and optical sensors.  However, this doesn't prevent detection from other means such as infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr "一套高耗能的隐身系统，由无数的迷你摄像机和LED灯组成，让使用者能与周围环境融为一体，进入可见光隐身状态。但是，隐形系统也无法屏蔽红外视觉或声呐之类的探测。"

#. ~ Description of "Teleportation Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A highly experimental unit that folds space over short distances, instantly transporting the user's body up to 25 feet in a random direction at the cost of much power.  Note that prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side effects."
msgstr "这个高度实验性质的生化插件可将空间折叠，进行短距离传送。通过消耗大量能量，使用者可以传送至25英尺(约7.6米)外随机方向的一个地方。需要注意的是长期或者频繁使用可能有危险的副作用。"

#. ~ Description of "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A hydraulic muscle support system that when active, increases the user's strength by 20."
msgstr "一套液压肌肉支持系统，启用时力量+20。"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic-Induced Deformity CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A jumble of broken metal pieces that were removed during reconstructive surgery."
msgstr "从手术中取出的一堆金属碎片。"

#. ~ Description of "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A length of poorly installed wiring that would cause stiffness."
msgstr "一根错误安装的电线，会造成身体的僵直。"

#. ~ Description of "Endocrine Enervator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A malfunctioning bionic that causes fatigue by altering the unfortunate user's brain chemistry."
msgstr "一个改变了它倒霉受体的脑部化学过程，使得受体感到疲劳的故障生化插件。"

#. ~ Description of "Noisemaker CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A malfunctioning bionic.  When installed, it occasionally emits a loud burst of noise."
msgstr "一个出现故障的生化插件。当安装在身上时，它偶尔会发出一阵巨大的噪声。"

#. ~ Description of "Leaky Bionic CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A mess of pierced pipes and broken seals, something unpleasant is leaking from it."
msgstr "一堆穿孔的管子和破裂的密封件，一些令人不快的东西从里面漏了出来。"

#. ~ Description of "Thalamic Buffer CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A microcomputer which is meant to be housed inside the skull and wired to the thalamus, where it helps the user proritize and filter sensory input.  It grants +2 perception while active, but -1 when not.  This bionic is integrated into the brain and cannot be removed once installed."
msgstr "一款微型计算机，设计用于植入颅骨内部并连接至丘脑，协助使用者对感官输入进行优先级排序与过滤。激活时可提升感知力+2，关闭时则降低感知力-1。该仿生装置与大脑深度融合，一旦植入便无法移除。"

#. ~ Description of "Fingerhack CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A miniature electrohack, surgically embedded in a finger of the user's right hand.  This is an all-purpose hacking unit used to override control panels and the like, but not computers.  Computer proficiency is important, and a failed use may cause damage."
msgstr "一台微型电子黑客仪，通过手术植入到右手的一根手指中。这种通用黑客单元可以用于覆写控制面板及类似的系统，但是不能用于电脑。使用者的计算机专长对成功至关重要，每次失败的尝试都有可能造成身体损伤。"

#. ~ Description of "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A module containing nanotubes that are embedded in the palm of the user's hand to pump any available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of impurities, and convert it into potable water.  Water container not included."
msgstr "这个模块包含了一套纳米管，能够植入到掌心，用于从尸体中提取可用的液体，净化并转换为可饮用的净水。不过，你必须有个装水的容器。"

#. ~ Description of "Alarm System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A motion-detecting alarm system will notice almost all movement within a fifteen-foot radius, and will silently alert the user.  This is very useful during sleep, or if the user suspects a cloaked pursuer."
msgstr "一个运动侦测警报系统，可以侦测到半径15英尺(约4.6米)范围内的所有运动，并且为使用者提供无声的警报。在睡觉时很有用，或者当使用者怀疑自己被隐身怪物追踪时。"

#. ~ Description of "Weather Reader CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A multitude of scientific instruments and sensors collects environmental data.  The data are compiled and presented as a simple readout of the current weather.  It also passively tells the user their external temperature."
msgstr "一堆科学装置和感应器的整合系统。用来收集周围环境的数据，这些数据随后将会被分析并汇总成为易于读取的目前天气的情况报告。它还可被动显示使用者的外部温度。"

#. ~ Description of "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors, implanted throughout the user's body to protect from external electrical discharge."
msgstr "一套微型压电电容网络，植入到全身用于防御外部电击的伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "Internal Climate Control CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A network of thermal piping which eases the effects of high and low ambient temperatures once activated."
msgstr "这套导热管网在启动后能够缓解环境温度对体温的影响。"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Eyes CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of artificial eyes with internal cameras and bioconnectors that link them to the optic nerve.  These will cure almost any vision problem so long as they're active, but will render the user blind if unpowered.  They also feature zoom lenses that allow the user to see much farther, and can even act as a scope when using ranged weapons."
msgstr "一副内置摄像头的人工眼球，通过生物连接器与视神经相连。只要保持供电，它们几乎能治愈所有视力问题，但一旦断电，使用者将陷入失明状态。这些眼球还配备变焦镜头，能让使用者看得更远，甚至在使用远程武器时可充当瞄准镜使用。"

#. ~ Description of "Squeaky Ankles CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of defective bionics that make squeaking noises."
msgstr "一对发出吱吱噪音的故障生化插件。"

#. ~ Description of "Visual Disruptor CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of defective ocular bionics that cause visual distortion and pixelation."
msgstr "一对故障的眼部生化插件，会造成视觉失真和像素化。"

#. ~ Description of "Self-Locking Thumbs CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of faulty, self-locking thumb bionics."
msgstr "一对故障的自锁大拇指生化插件。"

#. ~ Description of "Finger Lighter CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of powerful fire starters which extend from the tip of both hands' index fingers."
msgstr "一对强大的喷火器，植入到了受体双手的食指中。"

#. ~ Description of "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A powerful implanted electromagnet that allows the user to indiscriminately pull all nearby magnetic objects towards them.  Unlucky bystanders might be injured or killed by flying objects."
msgstr "一个强力电磁铁，植入到了受体的右手当中，使受体能够无差别地吸引周围所有磁性物品。不明真相的围观群众可能会被到处乱飞的物品击伤甚至击毙。"

#. ~ Description of "EMP Projector CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A ranged EMP generator system that is implanted in the user's right arm and hand.  The system fires precise, single-target pulses that require time to aim.  Extremely effective against electronic targets, but mostly useless otherwise."
msgstr "一套远程电磁脉冲发射器系统，被植入在受体右臂和右手下。这套系统能发射精准的单目标脉冲，需要时间瞄准。对电子目标特别有效，但对其它目标没什么作用。"

#. ~ Description of "Cable Charger System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A retractable set of electrical leads.  While active, it will recharge bionic power when connected to a battery via jumper cable."
msgstr "受体臀部上方安装了一个复杂的接口，启动后可以通过跨接电缆与电池连接并恢复生化能量。"

#. ~ Description of "Recycler Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A series of filters and reservoirs implanted into the urinary tract, allowing the user's body to reclaim water from metabolic waste while the device is active.  The result is a greatly reduced need for hydration."
msgstr "一系列的过滤器和处理器被植入到受体的消化系统中，使其能够重新吸收废弃液体和少量营养物质，最终大幅度降低受体的饮食需求。"

#. ~ Description of "Cerebral Booster CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of bionic coprocessors that are implanted in the user's brain, granting a +2 bonus to intelligence while powered, but a -1 penalty when not.  It takes over and replaces numerous cognitive functions once installed and cannot be removed."
msgstr "一套生物处理芯片，植入使用者的脑中，提供 +2 智力。它一经安装就接管替代了许多的认知功能，并且不能够移除。"

#. ~ Description of "Wired Reflexes CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of bionic nerve stimulators that greatly enhance reaction times, granting a +2 bonus to dexterity when active, and a -1 penalty when not."
msgstr "这套生化神经电极能够极大地缩短反应时间。敏捷+2。"

#. ~ Description of "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of bionic processors and databanks, loaded with martial arts combat programs.  While active, the CQB module will improve the user's hand-to-hand combat skills, but prevents them from improving them through combat experience."
msgstr "一套存有海量武术程序的数据库和处理器。开启时，它的近战模块会提升使用者的徒手格斗技能，但是使用者将无法从战斗中获得经验。"

#. ~ Description of "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of bionic processors that augment the user's nervous system, allowing them to dodge attacks beyond normal human capability."
msgstr "一套生化处理器，能够增强使用者的神经系统，使其能够以远超常人的水平回避攻击。"

#. ~ Description of "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "A set of bionic stimulators that enhance the user's nervous system, granting a 10% boost to speed."
msgstr "这套生化神经电极能增强神经系统，为行动速度带来10%的提升。"

#. ~ Description of "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of bionic stimulators which augment the user's haematopoiesis system, allowing them to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic power.  It is designed for continuous use and may cause unpleasant side effects when turned off."
msgstr "这个生化激励系统增强了受体的造血系统，使其能够消耗生化能量加速白细胞的生成。它应当保持持续运行，开启后再关闭可能造成不良影响。"

#. ~ Description of "Integrated Multimeter CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of electrical leads to be embedded in the user's fingers, connected to a multimeter unit in their hand.  Allows the user to measure voltage, resistance, and current using their fingertips, and provides slight protection against electric shocks."
msgstr "在使用者的手指上嵌入一组电线，这些电线与他们手上的一个万用表装置相连。这样用户就能用手指来测量电压、电阻和电流，并且还能获得一定程度的防电击保护。"

#. ~ Description of "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of highly-advanced quantum storage drives used to enhance memory.  While active, they increase the rate that the user learns skills.  Once it is installed, it will partially replace the functionality of the hippocampus, and thus cannot be removed without risk of severe permanent amnesia and difficulty forming new memories."
msgstr "一组用于增强内存的高度先进的量子存储驱动器。激活时，加快使用者学习技能的速度。一旦安装完毕，它将取代部分海马体的功能，将其移除会造成严重的永久性失忆并且难以形成新的记忆。"

#. ~ Description of "Taste Modifier CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of highly-sensitive sensors implanted in the user's mouth, combined with a sophisticated analyzer.  While active, it will block all unpleasant taste and texture at the cost of bionic energy."
msgstr "一套极其敏感的传感器被植入到了使用者的口腔，附有一个复杂的分析装置。开启时，它可以通过消耗生化能量来屏蔽不佳的味道和质感。"

#. ~ Description of "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of hinges, springs, and other synthetic augments for the skeletal structure.  These artificial enhancers strengthen the knees and elbows, allowing the user to carry more weight.  The reinforcement also provides 2 bashing armor to the torso, legs and arms."
msgstr "一副由各种铰链，弹簧，和其他合成材料增强过的骨架被植入了使用者的体内。这些生化强化装置加强了膝盖和肘部关节，让使用者能够携带更多的重量。它同时也为躯干、手部、及腿部提供2点钝击防护。"

#. ~ Description of "Cranial Reinforcement CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of interlocking subdermal plates, slightly cushioned where they overlap, which bolt securely to the skull and cervical vertebrae to provide a modicum of protection from trauma."
msgstr "一组相互咬合的皮下板片，在重叠处略带缓冲，通过螺栓牢固地固定在颅骨和颈椎上，以提供最低限度的创伤防护。"

#. ~ Description of "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of myomer fibers that enhance the user's muscular system, granting a +2 bonus to strength when active, but a -1 penalty when not."
msgstr "一套能够增强使用者肌肉系统的生化纤维，力量+2。"

#. ~ Description of "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of powerful heatsinks and supermaterials woven into the user's flesh.  While powered, this system will prevent external heat damage up to 2000 degrees Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect the internal body temperature."
msgstr "一套强力散热片和超织物被植入了受体体内，供电时可以防护低于2000华氏度（约1093摄氏度）的外部高温伤害。注意，这不会影响受体的内部体温。"

#. ~ Description of "Terranian Sonar CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of precision sonar equipment, implanted in the user's feet to allow the detection of below-ground movement, buried traps, and unstable terrain."
msgstr "一套植入在脚掌上的精密声纳设备，可以探测地下生物的移动、掩埋的陷阱和不稳定的地形。"

#. ~ Description of "Joint Servo CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of servomotors installed on the leg joints to provide power-assisted movement.  They are optimized for running, but walking also requires less effort while this bionic is active.  However, when it's offline it will hamper the user's movement."
msgstr "一套安装在腿部关节上的伺服电机，能为运动提供辅助动力。它们能提高跑步速度，同时当该生化插件开启时，步行也会更加轻松。然而，当它关闭时，未工作的移动部件会阻碍行动。"

#. ~ Description of "Visceral Armorgel CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of small packets of sintered gel which are to be installed inside the thoracic and abdominal cavities to protect the organs and spine.  Functionally, this will not reduce incoming damage, but instead allow the user to withstand greater injury to the torso."
msgstr "一组小包烧结凝胶，将安装在胸腔和腹腔内以保护器官和脊柱。  从功能上讲，这不会减少传入的伤害，而是让用户的躯干承受更大的伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "Directional EMP CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of small parabolic EMP field generators that are mounted in the palm of the user's right hand.  They can be used to instantly fire a wide, but short-ranged blast which will disable electronics and robots."
msgstr "一套小型电磁脉冲抛射器，被植入受体的右手掌心，可以用于瞬时发射一道大范围近程EMP冲击来瘫痪掉电子器械和机器人。"

#. ~ Description of "Fingertip Razors CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of ten double-edged, four centimeter long razor-sharp claws that are implanted underneath the fingernails.  They deal a small amount of unarmed slashing damage whenever the user's fingertips are uncovered."
msgstr "一套由十个四厘米长的利刃组成的，剃刀般锋利的爪子，植入进受体的指甲之下。当受体的指尖没有被盖住时，徒手攻击时可以用它们造成少量额外的斩击伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "Radiation Biomonitor CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of tiny implanted sensors which can diagnose the presence and severity of acute radiation syndrome.  They are also able to detect ionizing radiation within the user's environment."
msgstr "一套微型植入式传感器，能够诊断急性辐射综合征的存在及其严重程度。它们还能检测使用者环境中的电离辐射。"

#. ~ Description of "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A set of torsion ratchets that replace the user's joints to slowly generate power when they move.  These can be toggled to generate more power, but movement will require more effort."
msgstr "一套会替换使用者的关节的动力齿轮，能在其移动时缓慢恢复生化能量。启动即可开始产生能量，但是移动会更加费力。"

#. ~ Description of "Calorie Tracker CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A small medical implant that passively tracks your calorie expenditure and consumption."
msgstr "一种小型医疗植入物，可以被动跟踪您的卡路里消耗。"

#. ~ Description of "Remote Controller CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A small module that connects to the user's brain and allows them to interface with nearby devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr "一个连接至受体大脑的小模块，可以与附近有无线功能的设备联动。"

#. ~ Description of "Intravenous Needletip CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A small tube with a retractable needle that terminates in a net of tiny hoses instead of a plunger.  When installed, it allows the user to draw substances directly into their bloodstream akin to a regular syringe."
msgstr "一个带有可伸缩针头的小型注射管，但针管末端是网状细管而非柱状活塞。安装后，使用者可以通过注射管将针剂直接引入血液之中，达成类似注射针筒的功能。"

#. ~ Description of "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A small, but powerful LED flashlight that is mounted between the user's eyes."
msgstr "一颗小型高功率LED灯，植入于两眼之间。"

#. ~ Description of "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A small, high-powered laser that is embedded in the user's fingertip.  This long-range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very accurate, and has the potential to start fires."
msgstr "一个小型大功率激光发射器嵌在指尖上。这种远程武器伤害不高，但是异常精准，还有可能点燃目标。"

#. ~ Description of "Integrated Circuitry Toolset CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A soldering iron, multimeter, and set of fine screwdrivers implanted in the user's hands.  Contains all the tools required for manipulating bench-scale electrical circuits, and provides slight protection against electric shocks."
msgstr "一个电烙铁、一个万用表以及一套精致的螺丝刀被植入使用者的手中。它包含了操作实验台规模电路所需的所有工具，并能起到一定的防电击保护作用。"

#. ~ Description of "Adrenaline Pump CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A stimulator system that is implanted alongside the adrenal glands, allowing the user to trigger their body's adrenaline response at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr "一套刺激器系统植入到了受体的肾上腺附近，使其能够使用生化能量触发身体的肾上腺素反应。"

#. ~ Description of "Integrated Multitool CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A surgically-implanted set of compact tools and a welder which runs off the user's power banks.  Includes screwdriving heads, a multi-purpose knife, a low-power impact wrench and a nail prying tool."
msgstr "一套小型工具和一台焊机通过外科手术植入了你的体内，并使用体内的生化能量供能。这套工具包括螺丝刀、多功能刀、低功耗冲击扳手和撬钉工具。"

#. ~ Description of "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters that are implanted throughout the body, allowing the user to purge themself of absorbed radiation at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr "一种先进的压电式血液透析装置，植入了受体的体内，使之可以通过消耗生化能量来清除体内的辐射。"

#. ~ Description of "Air Filtration System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A system of complex filters to be installed throughout the user's airways.  These will restrict breathing slightly, but will offer decent protection from smoke, dust, and airborne contaminants when unpowered, and unparalleled protection when powered."
msgstr "一套将植入使用者整个呼吸道的复杂过滤系统。它将略微限制呼吸，但在未通电时能提供对烟雾、粉尘和空气污染物的良好防护，通电后则提供无与伦比的防护。"

#. ~ Description of "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A system of surgical-grade scalpels that is implanted in the user's fingers.  They allow for automated precise cuts and can be used as a high-quality butchering tool."
msgstr "一套外科级别的手术刀植入在用户的手指上。能够自动进行精确切割。也可以用作高级屠宰工具。"

