#. ~ Description of "Motor Control Overstimulator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "The result of poor configuration, this bionic module frequently causes debilitating muscle spasms."
msgstr "作为胡乱安装的后果，这个生化插件经常造成肌肉痉挛，使人虚弱。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
msgid_plural "Thermal Dissipation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "热能防护CBM"

#. ~ Description of "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Thin armor made of carbon nanotubes, implanted just beneath the skin.  It reduces cutting, stabbing and ballistic damage."
msgstr "被植入到皮肤下方的薄层碳纳米管装甲。削弱收到的斩击，刺击和子弹伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "Nictitating Membrane CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Thin membranes that cover the user's eyes while underwater, negating any vision penalties."
msgstr "在水下会自动覆盖受体眼球的人造瞬膜，能消除所有水下视觉惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of "Electrical Drain CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This CBM was wired incorrectly and would drain power from any system connected to it."
msgstr "该生化插件因为接线错误，会不断消耗所连接系统内的生化能量。"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Short Circuit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This bionic is poorly wired and occasionally short-circuits."
msgstr "这个生化插件的接线很乱，偶尔会短路。"

#. ~ Description of "Integrated AR System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This bionic module integrates augmented reality interface into user's eyes."
msgstr "这个生化插件将增强显示界面整合到使用者的视野当中。\"这下可以安心以高达形态出击了\""

#. ~ Description of "Implanted Night Vision CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This bionic module modifies the user's eyes to amplify existing light, allowing them to see in the dark."
msgstr "这个生化插件通过放大微弱光线的方式改造使用者的眼球，增强夜视能力。"

#. ~ Description of "Expanded Digestive System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This module contains three synthetic stomachs and industrial-grade intestines which replace the user's corresponding organs.  Not only will these extract much more nutrition from food, but also increase the user's resistance to foodborne illness, and occasionally allow the digestion of rotten food.  Installing this CBM will correct any abnormalities in the user's digestive system."
msgstr "这个生化插件包含三个人造胃囊和工业级人造肠道，用来替换使用者所对应的器官。这套系统不仅可以从食物中吸收更多营养，还能提高使用者对食源性疾病的抵抗力，偶尔也能消化腐败食物。安装此CBM将纠正患者消化系统的任何异常。"

#. ~ Description of "Metabolic Interchange CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This module interconnects the user's digestive system and power supply, letting them replenish bionic energy by burning calories."
msgstr "这个模组将受体的消化系统和电源连接起来，使其能够通过消耗卡路里恢复生化能量。"

#. ~ Description of "Sensory Dulling CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This module lets the user's nervous system inhibit pain signals, allowing them to dull their senses at will.  However, the use of this system may cause delayed reaction times and drowsiness."
msgstr "这个模组通过使受体的神经系统抑制疼痛信号，使受体能够随意抑制感官输入。不过，使用该系统可能会导致反应迟钝和嗜睡等症状。"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Nostril CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This thing was up someone's nose, they're probably glad to be rid of it."
msgstr "这东西曾经在某人的鼻子里，他们可能很高兴摆脱它。"

#. ~ Description of "Aero-Evaporator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This unit draws moisture from the surrounding air, which slowly trickles directly into the user's blood stream.  It may fail in very dry environments."
msgstr "这个插件可以从周围的空气中吸收水蒸气，并将其直接低速注入血液之中。在非常干燥的地区，此仪器可能效果不佳。"

#. ~ Description of "Facial Distortion CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, this bionic module lets the user alter their facial structure so as to subtly affect the reactions of others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."
msgstr "通过控制电化学脉冲，这套生化插件能使受体改变其面部结构，从而悄无声息地影响他人的反应。这将使你在各类社交互动上获得少许加成。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Throwing Assist CBM"
msgid_plural "Throwing Assist CBMs"
msgstr[0] "投掷辅助CBM"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
