#. ~ Description of "Artificial Night Generator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 2-tile radius of the user through destructive interference."
msgstr "开启时，这个生化插件会通过干扰光线消除附近15格内所有的光源。"

#. ~ Description of "Targeting System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "While active, this bionic provides a visual HUD synced to sensors in the user's hands that greatly aid in targeting ranged weapons."
msgstr "在工作状态下，这款仿生设备会为用户呈现与手部传感器同步的可视化操作指示器，这极大地有助于瞄准远程武器。"

#. ~ Description of "Heat Drain CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of extra damage and recharging the user's bionic power reserves slightly."
msgstr "当使用者成功徒手攻击恒温生物一次，你有一定几率吸取目标体内的热能，造成少量的额外伤害并增加少量的生化能量。"

#. ~ Description of "Electroshock Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is a chance that a successful hit will shock the user's opponent, inflicting extra damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr "当使用者徒手搏斗或者使用可导电的武器时，有一定几率消耗部分能量电击对手，造成额外伤害并暂时使目标失去行动能力。"

#. ~ Description of "Enhanced Hearing CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "While this bionic is active, the user's hearing will be drastically improved, allowing them to hear ten times better than the average person.  Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before they can damage the user's hearing."
msgstr "当这个生化插件启用时，使用者的听力将极大提高，使其能够达到相当于普通人10倍的听力。此外，高分贝的声音将在使用者听力受到损伤前自动减弱。"

#. ~ Description of "Olfactory Mask CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "While this system is powered, the user's body will produce very little odor, making it nearly impossible for creatures to track them by scent."
msgstr "当该系统激活时，使用者的身体只会产生很少的气味，使得其他生物几乎不可能通过气味来跟踪他们。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBM"
msgid_plural "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBMs"
msgstr[0] "感电僵硬CBM"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
