#. ~ Description of "Itchy Metal Thing CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "You can't recognize what this is supposed to be, but you imagine it'd be a very awkward thing to have in one's body."
msgstr "你不知道这是什么，但是你可以想象到它在你的身体里时会令你非常不舒服。"

#. ~ Item name
