#. ~ Description of "fetid goop"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "A foul-smelling goop.  It has a disgusting texture and a powerful smell that overwhelms every other smell around it."
msgstr "一团散发着恶臭的黏液。它有一种令人作呕的质感和强烈刺激的臭味，这臭味能够盖过四周所有其他气味。"

#. ~ Description of "cow pie"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "A fresh cow pie; this could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
