msgid "The dust left over by winged insects such as butterflies or moths.  It's mostly chitin but may also contain dirt and other gross materials."
msgstr "蝴蝶或飞蛾等有翅膀的昆虫留下的粉尘。其主要成分为甲壳素，但也可能含有泥土和其他恶心的材料。"

