msgid "A heavy hardback book explaining the process of essential oil making, with schematics for the equipment to do it.  Good luck, and don't blow yourself up!"
msgstr "一本沉重的精装书，详细描述了精油的制作过程，并附有设备原理图。祝你好运，别把自己炸了！"

