#. ~ Description of "lab journal-x-|xp"
#: data/json/items/book/chemistry.json
msgid "Someone has gone through and edited this sheaf of lab notes, seemingly in an attempt to scrub any reference to the names of the staff who worked on it.  Despite the heavy-handed redactions, it still contains useful information on several types of mutagen and their development."
msgstr "有人仔细阅读并编辑了这叠实验室笔记，似乎是为了删除任何涉及其工作人员姓名的内容。  尽管经过严格的编辑，它仍然包含有关几种诱变剂及其开发的有用信息。"

