#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
msgid "robotics kit instructions"
msgid_plural "copies of robotics kit instructions"
msgstr[0] "机器人玩具套装说明书"

#. ~ Description of "Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
msgid "A well-thumbed hardbound book which illustrates simple strategies and techniques for close quarters combat encounters."
msgstr "一个被翻旧了的精装书，里面有插画来说明简单的近身格斗策略和技巧。"

#. ~ Description of "CQB Monthly"
#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
msgid "An in-depth look at various styles of close quarters fighting.  There's an amusing essay about dirty tricks in the front section."
msgstr "一本深入讲解各种不同风格的室内近距离战斗的教科书，里面有一篇有趣的文章，讲的是近战中的\"肮脏的把戏\"。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
msgid "CQB Monthly"
msgid_plural "issues of CQB Monthly"
msgstr[0] "CQB月刊文选"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
msgid "Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgstr[0] "CQC指南"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A Handful of Dust"
msgid_plural "copies of A Handful of Dust"
msgstr[0] "一掬尘土"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A Short History of the Jewish People: From Legendary Times to to Modern Statehood"
msgid_plural "copies of A Short History of the Jewish People: From Legendary Times to to Modern Statehood"
msgstr[0] "犹太人简史：从传奇时代到现代国家"

#. ~ Description of "Siddur"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A Siddur, or prayerbook, contains the set order of prayers for Jewish religious services.  This one is comprehensive, divided into morning, afternoon, and evening prayers for both weekdays and Shabbat, along with separate sections for minor and major holidays."
msgstr "一本西杜尔(Siddur)祈祷书，包含了犹太教宗教仪式的固定祈祷顺序。这本书很全面，分为平日和安息日的早晨、下午和晚上的祈祷，以及小节日和大节日的单独部分。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hell in Jewish Literature" of item "Judaica
#. hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A analysis of rabbinic discussions of Gehinnom, the Jewish afterlife for the cleansing of sins, including how big it is, how hot it is, who goes there, how long they stay there, whether there is any relief from their punishments in the meantime, and exactly what shape Gehinnom is."
msgstr "分析拉比们对Gehinnom的讨论，这是犹太人用来清洗罪恶的死后，包括它有多大，有多热，谁去那里，他们在那里呆了多久，在此期间他们的惩罚是否得到了缓解，以及Gehinnor到底是什么形状。在犹太教中，Gehinnom指的是不悔改的灵魂在死后去往的一个地方，在那里他们会被净化，去除精神上的污秽，然后才能回到上帝的面前。"

#. ~ Description of "experimental novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A bizarre play about the philosophy of existential absurdity.  Or maybe it's about two guys waiting for their friend to show up.  It's confusing."
msgstr "一本关于存在及其荒谬性的哲学的奇怪的戏剧，或者也许是两人在等待他们的朋友来。真让人困惑不已。（注：《等待戈多》）"

#. ~ Description of variant "Zohar: The Book of Splendor: Basic Readings from
#. the Kabbalah" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A book of Jewish mysticism often attributed to the great rabbi Shimon bar Yochai, the Zohar is the central work of Kabbalah.  This is an abridged version containing selected passages from the full text."
msgstr "《佐哈尔》是一本关于犹太神秘主义的书，通常被认为是伟大的拉比西蒙·巴尔·约柴 (Shimon bar Yochai) 的著作，它是卡巴拉的核心著作。  这是一个删节版本，包含全文中选定的段落。"

#. ~ Description of "book of classic literature"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A book of classic literature, timeless and enjoyable but a bit dense to read."
msgstr "一本关于经典文学的书，永不过时。但读起来有些难懂。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mimekor Yisrael, Book One: The National Tales" of
#. item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A collection of Jewish folktales, from Ashmedai king of demons to golem-making rabbis, from the Torah scholar who showed Aristotle the futility of philosophy to how Satan refused to bow to Adam because Adam was created from the dust of the earth, from martyrs murdered by Christian persecutors to General Joab single-handedly killing two thousand Amalekites so that when the blood ran out like a river through the city gates his troops knew to stop besieging the city and assault it, and dozens more besides."
msgstr "犹太民间故事集，从恶魔之王阿什梅代到制作傀儡的拉比，从向亚里士多德展示哲学徒劳的托拉学者，到撒旦拒绝向亚当鞠躬，因为亚当是从地球的尘埃中创造出来的，从被迫害基督教的人杀害的烈士，到约押将军单枪匹马杀死了两千名亚玛力人，以至于当血像河流一样从城门流出来时，他的部队知道要停止围攻城市并攻击它，此外还有几十人。"

#. ~ Description of "book of essays"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A collection of essays by various authors from around the world, including works by Churchill, Mailer, Eco, and Voltaire."
msgstr "一本由著名作家撰写的优美华丽的散文集。包括丘吉尔、梅勒、艾柯、伏尔泰的作品。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Miriam's Tambourine: Jewish Folktales from Around
#. the World" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A collection of over fifty Jewish folktales, from classics like the story of Miriam's well or Rabbi Loew and the golem or the life of the Baal Shem Tov, to Jewish versions of modern cultural classics like Snow White or Sinbad."
msgstr "收录了五十多个犹太民间故事，从米里亚姆井的故事、勒夫拉比和傀儡的故事或巴尔谢姆托夫的生活等经典，到白雪公主或辛巴达等现代文化经典的犹太版本。"

#. ~ Description of "book of plays"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A collection of plays by various authors from around the world, including scripts by Wilde, Beckett, Checkov, and Shakespeare."
msgstr "一本收纳了诸多名家的经典戏剧的书，包括王尔德、贝克特、契科夫和莎士比亚。"

#. ~ Description of "book of poetry"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A collection of poetry by various authors from around the world, including writings by Dickinson, Goethe, Thoreau, and Yeats."
msgstr "一本收罗了来自世界各地不同作者的作品的诗集，包括狄金森、歌德、梭罗和叶芝的著作。"

#. ~ Description of variant "OU Manual for Checking Fruits and Vegetables" of
#. item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A comprehensive guide to checking produce for insect infestation and how to prepare produce according to Jewish dietary law."
msgstr "一份全面的指南，用于检查农产品是否受到虫害，以及如何根据犹太饮食法准备农产品。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Megillat Esther: The Book of Esther" of item
#. "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A comprehensive work for celebrating Purim, this book contains the complete Book of Esther in Hebrew, multiple English translations, commentary on each of its chapters, and commentary on certain verses by a group of Conservative rabbis.  Cursed be Haman (booo)!"
msgstr "这本书全面介绍了普珥节的由来，其中包括希伯来语版《以斯帖记》、多个英文翻译版、对每一章节的评论，以及一群保守派拉比对特定经文进行的评论。诅咒哈曼（啧啧）！"

#. ~ Description of variant "Standing Again at Sinai: Judaism from a Feminist
#. Perspective" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A critique of Jewish practice by a Jewish feminist theologian."
msgstr "犹太女权主义神学家写的犹太习俗批判。"

#. ~ Description of "mystery novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A detective investigates an unusual murder in a secluded location."
msgstr "描述了一个侦探在偏僻地点调查变态杀人狂的凶杀案线索的故事。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Reviving Synagogue Communities Using Smart Tech"
#. of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A discussion of ways to use modern technology to alleviate the administrative burden on clergy and synagogue staff but without losing the human touch that leads to a proper religious community."
msgstr "这本书讨论了如何利用现代技术减轻教士和犹太教堂工作人员的行政负担，但又不失人文关怀，从而形成一个符合传统的宗教社区。"

#. ~ Description of "black box transcript"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A full flight log for a military aircraft.  Nothing of interest stands out."
msgstr "一个军用飞机的完整飞行日志，没什么特别的。"

#. ~ Description of "buddy novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A gripping tale of two friends struggling to survive on the streets of New York City."
msgstr "一本讲述了两个朋友如何在纽约街头挣扎生存的小说。"

#. ~ Description of "Atwixt a Brace of Cacti"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A grizzled clodhopper interviews a mess of rangehands, flummoxing longhorns and tenderfoot alike in a flusteration of jawing."
msgstr "一个缠人的乡巴佬的对一帮海盗们的访谈记录，充满了让长角牛和旱鸭子们焦躁不安张嘴困惑不已的各种海盗术语。"

#. ~ Description of "erotic novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A hackneyed fictional narrative concealing low-grade literary smut."
msgstr "这是一本陈词滥调，文字低劣的书，有着流水账一般的文笔，充满了大量下流的情色描写。"

#. ~ Description of "grimoire"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A hefty book with a thick leather cover and metal clasps.  Both covers are completely empty, though on the first page there is an author's name written in English: \"Abdul Alhazred\"; below it the book title is written in Arabian: \"العزيف\", and below it in Greek: \"Νεκρονομικόν\".  The book looks very old and sinister."
msgstr "一本有厚皮革封面和金属扣的厚书。两侧封面都是空白的，不过扉页上书写着作者的英文名字：\"阿卜杜·阿尔哈兹莱德\"；在其下方用阿拉伯语写着书名：\"العزيف\"，然后下方又用希腊语写着：\"Νεκρονομικόν\"。这本书看起来既古老又邪恶。"

#. ~ Description of variant "From the Maccabees to the Mishnah" of item
#. "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A history of the development of Rabbinic Judaism, from the Jewish Revolt in the first century to the writing of the Mishnah, and how Judaism and Christianity fully separated."
msgstr "拉比犹太教的发展史，从一世纪的犹太起义到密西拿的写作，以及犹太教和基督教如何完全分离。"

#. ~ Description of "photo album"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A leather album full of photos of somebody's family.  You don't know any of the people in them, but seeing these pictures still makes you think of happier times."
msgstr ""
"一本皮革封面的相册，装满了某个陌生人的家族照片，充满着往日美好时光的记忆。\n"
"\"看到这些照片感到很温馨。\""

#. ~ Description of variant "On the Doorposts of Your House" of item "Judaica
#. hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A list of prayers, meditations, and rituals for use at home, from lighting the Shabbat candles to welcoming a new child into the household."
msgstr "一份在家里使用的祈祷、冥想和仪式清单，从点燃安息日蜡烛到欢迎新孩子进入家庭。"

#. ~ Description of "Stinky Bart Puts on Starch"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A local bandit, driven by sadistic impulses, begins offering unlicensed dentistry to brave frontiersmen with few options and fewer teeth."
msgstr "一个当地强盗，在自虐冲动驱使下，开始向勇敢的开拓者们提供无证牙医服务，选项很少而牙齿更少的服务。"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Observant Life: The Wisdom of Contemporary
#. Judaism for Contemporary Jews" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A long discussion of the ways in which Judaism's ancient rituals, traditions, and ethical practices are still relevant and meaningful in the modern world.  Unfortunately, there's no discussion of post-apocalyptic Judaism."
msgstr "关于犹太教古老的仪式、传统和伦理实践在现代世界中的相关性和意义的长篇讨论。 遗憾的是，书中没有讨论末世后的犹太教。"

#. ~ Description of "patient treatment records"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A massive stack of medical records that contain every gory detail."
msgstr "一大叠病例记录，包含了许多血淋淋的治疗过程。"

#. ~ Description of variant "When Bad Things Happen to Good People" of item
#. "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A meditation on meaningless tragedy and why the disaster and sorrow in the world is unevenly distributed.  Written decades before the Cataclysm, but the author was obviously on to something."
msgstr "对毫无意义的悲剧的思考，以及为什么世界上的灾难和悲伤分布不均。  写于大灾变前几十年，但作者显然有所作为。"

#. ~ Description of "Rural Digest-Examiner"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A newsweekly covering regional events.  There is an article on the winter's snowstorms and several letters to the editor concerning the community response."
msgstr "一本报道了本地事件的新闻周刊，上面有一篇有关冬季的暴风雪的文章，还有几封涉及社区反应的读者来信。"

#. ~ Description of "frequency list"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A notepad with a number of frequencies scribbled on it."
msgstr "一个写满了不同电台频率的记事本。"

#. ~ Description of "Cat's Cradle"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A paperback edition of Kurt Vonnegut's fourth novel, in which the threat of nuclear destruction isn't much of an influence on human nature."
msgstr "库尔特·冯内古特第四本小说的平装本，书中核毁灭对人性并没有太大的影响。（注：书中核弹的制造者在核弹被扔向人类时正在玩\"猫的摇篮\"，一种翻花绳游戏）"

#. ~ Description of "satire novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A political satire of the pre-apocalypse world.  Looking back on it from this side of Armageddon makes it seem all the more ridiculous."
msgstr ""
"一片对大灾变之前的政治讽刺小说。\n"
"\"大灾变后讽刺加倍。\""

#. ~ Description of variant "Beyond Breaking the Glass: A Spiritual Guide to
#. Your Jewish Wedding, Revised Edition" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A practical guide to throwing a Jewish wedding, including checklists, a timeline, and ways to make traditional rituals resonate with modern wedding guests."
msgstr "举办犹太婚礼的实用指南，包括清单、时间表以及让传统仪式与现代婚礼宾客产生共鸣的方法。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Siddur Tisha b'Av" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A prayerbook for Tisha b'Av, the most solemn day in the Jewish year.  This one also contains the full text of the book of Lamentations and selected commentaries."
msgstr "提沙节的祈祷书，这是犹太一年中最庄严的一天。这本书还包含了《哀歌集》的全文和精选的评论。"

#. ~ Description of "drama novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A real book for real adults."
msgstr "一本货真价实的书，适合真正的成年人阅读。"

#. ~ Description of "ruined book"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A ruined book.  Someone has thoroughly ruined this book by ripping pages out and covering the remainder in… is that paint?"
msgstr "一本毁了的书。  Someone has thoroughly ruined this book by ripping pages out and covering the remainder in… is that paint?"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary:
#. Deuteronomy" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume is for the book of Deuteronomy."
msgstr "由学者和学者撰写的一系列律法注释，包括传统的希伯来语文本、翻译和各种注释。这卷书是为《申命记》而编撰的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary:
#. Exodus" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume is for the book of Exodus."
msgstr "由学者和学者撰写的一系列律法注释，包括传统的希伯来语文本、翻译和各种注释。这卷书是为《出埃及记》而编撰的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary:
#. Genesis" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume is for the book of Genesis."
msgstr "由学者和学者撰写的一系列律法注释，包括传统的希伯来语文本、翻译和各种注释。这卷书是为《创世记》而编撰的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary:
#. Leviticus" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume is for the book of Leviticus."
msgstr "由学者和学者撰写的一系列律法注释，包括传统的希伯来语文本、翻译和各种注释。这卷书是为《利未记》而编撰的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary:
#. Numbers" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume is for the book of Numbers."
msgstr "由学者和学者撰写的一系列律法注释，包括传统的希伯来语文本、翻译和各种注释。这卷书是为《民数记》而编撰的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Coming to Terms with America: Essays on Jewish
#. History, Religion, and Culture" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A series of fifteen essays by Jonathan Sarna on Jews' attempt to be both distinctively Jewish but also definitely American, covering the American Revolution through to contemporary times."
msgstr "这是乔纳森·萨尔纳的十五篇系列文章，关于犹太人试图既成为犹太人又成为美国人，从美国革命到当代。"

#. ~ Description of "Ranch Prospectus"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A short paper of the economic viability of constructing an agricultural outpost."
msgstr "一本薄薄的企划书，里面列举了如何盘活一间大型农场基地的各种企划方案。"

#. ~ Description of "Visions in Solitude"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A small book detailing 'visions' a prisoner had on death row."
msgstr "这是本描述了一位死刑犯在监狱中的\"梦想\"的书。"

#. ~ Description of "priest's diary"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A small book filled with journal entries in Latin.  You can read Latin, right?"
msgstr "一本写满了拉丁语的日记小册子。你会拉丁语的，对吧？"

#. ~ Description of "war novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A story about a Bosnian citizen who goes through many hardships and near death during the breakup of Yugoslavia."
msgstr "关于一个波斯尼亚公民在南斯拉夫解体过程中历尽艰难命悬一发的故事。"

#. ~ Description of "crime novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A story about three people in the fictional city of Los Santos: a gangster, an upper-class man, and a psychopath.  They eventually band together to pull off the biggest heist in the city's history"
msgstr "一个关于洛杉都这个虚构城市中三个人物的故事，一个流氓，一个上流社会男子和一个精神病患，最终联合起来，策划了这座城市历史上最大的抢劫案。"

#. ~ Description of "comic book"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A super-hero comic."
msgstr ""
"一本漫画书，典型的美式超级英雄漫画，剧情并不复杂，充满着各色熟知的人物与精彩的打斗场面。\n"
"\"布鲁斯·韦恩与克拉克·肯特的爱恨情仇简史。\""

#. ~ Description of variant "A Short History of the Jewish People: From
#. Legendary Times to to Modern Statehood" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A survey-level study of Jewish history, from Biblical times through to the 1990s.  At only 250 pages long, it is by necessity very brief on any individual topic."
msgstr "从圣经时代到20世纪90年代犹太历史的调查研究。这本书只有250页，对任何一个主题都必须非常简短。"

#. ~ Description of "thriller novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A suspenseful tale of betrayal and revenge."
msgstr "一个关于背叛和复仇的悬疑故事。"

#. ~ Description of "road novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A tale about a group of friends who wander the USA in the 1960s against a backdrop of jazz, poetry and drug use."
msgstr "一个讲述一群铁哥们在19世纪60年代的美国四处漂泊的故事，故事背景里充满了各种爵士乐、诗歌和毒品滥用的描写。"

#. ~ Description of "spy novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A tale of intrigue and espionage among Nazis, no, Commies, no, Iraqis!"
msgstr ""
"一本充满了阴谋和谍战的故事，对手的阵营扑朔迷离，剧情紧张刺激。\n"
"\"对手是纳粹……不，是共党，不，是伊拉克人！\""

#. ~ Description of "war novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A thrilling narrative of survival in a prisoner of war camp during the Second World War, filled with riveting subplots about rat farming and dysentery."
msgstr "讲述了一个惊心动魄的在二战战俘营中挣扎求生的故事，包含了如何饲养老鼠和痢疾等各种吸引人的情节。"

#. ~ Description of "collector's edition book"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A unique, valuable book that has been kept as a collector's item."
msgstr "被作为收藏品保存的，一本独特且有价值的书。"

#. ~ Description of "The Vendetta Riders"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A wild young man, fast on the draw, who thinks he has nothing to lose, falls in with a group of gun runners."
msgstr "一个狂野的年轻人，拔枪很快，认为自己一无所有，和一群同样的持枪骑手一起行动的故事。"

#. ~ Description of "crime novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "After their diamond heist goes wrong, the surviving criminals begin to suspect that one of them is a police informant."
msgstr "一本犯罪小说，在钻石抢劫计划失败后，幸存的罪犯开始怀疑，他们之中出了一名警察线人，充满着经典的桥段。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Along Came a Rider"
msgid_plural "copies of Along Came a Rider"
msgstr[0] "赛马师来了"

#. ~ Description of variant "I and Thou" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "An English translation of Martin Buber's philosophical work on the relationships of human beings to each other and to God."
msgstr "马丁 · 布伯哲学著作《人与人、人与上帝之间的关系》的英译本。"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Way of Humanity: According to Chasidic
#. Teachings" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "An English translation of lectures given by Martin Buber on six traditional Chasidic stories from the 18th and 19th centuries."
msgstr "Martin Buber关于十八至十九世纪六个有关犹太哈西德派传统故事讲座，这本为英文翻译本。"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Guide for the Perplexed" of item "Judaica
#. hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "An English translation of the great sage Rabbi Moses ben Maimon's work finding common points between natural philosophy and Talmudic scholarship.  Contains the famous Thirteen Principles of Faith, accepted by many Jews as a summary of the fundamental beliefs of Judaism."
msgstr "伟大的圣人拉比摩西·本·迈蒙作品的英译本，寻找自然哲学和塔木德学术之间的共同点。包含著名的信仰十三原则，被许多犹太人接受为犹太教基本信仰的总结。"

#. ~ Description of variant "In This Hour" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "An English translation of works written by Rabbi Abraham Joshua Heschel during the Nazi rule of Germany and Rabbi Heschel's exile in England, concerning historic and current persecution and his vision for Jewish education."
msgstr "亚伯拉罕·约书亚·赫舍尔拉比在纳粹德国统治期间和赫舍尔拉比流亡英国期间所写的作品的英文译本，涉及历史和当前的迫害以及他对犹太教育的愿景。"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Jewish War: Revised Edition" of item "Judaica
#. softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "An account of the Roman conquest of Judea and the destruction of the Temple written by Josephus, the first century Judean rebel turned Roman negotiator."
msgstr "约瑟夫斯 (Josephus) 撰写的关于罗马征服犹太和圣殿被毁的记述，约瑟夫斯是一世纪的犹太叛军，后来成为罗马谈判代表。"

#. ~ Description of "book of tall tales"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "An entertaining collection of early American folklore, featuring tales of larger than life individuals and their amazing adventures."
msgstr "一本有趣的故事书，收录了各种美国民间传说，讲述那些勇往无前之人的冒险传奇。"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Origins of Judaism: An Archaeological-
#. Historical Reappraisal" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "An examination of the archeological evidence behind the beginning of many Jewish traditions, including eschewing pork, adopting tefillin and placing mezuzot on doorposts, and circumcision."
msgstr "对许多犹太传统开始背后的考古证据的研究，包括避免猪肉、采用特菲林、在门柱上放置mezuzot以及割礼。"

#. ~ Description of "swashbuckling novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "An exciting seventeenth century tale of how an enslaved Irish doctor and his comrades-in-chains escape and become heroic pirates of the Robin Hood variety."
msgstr "一个发生在17世纪的激动人心的故事，讲述了一个被奴役的爱尔兰医生和他的被困同伴如何逃脱并成为如同罗宾汉一样著名的海盗。"

#. ~ Description of variant "This Is Real and You Are Completely Unprepared"
#. of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "An in-depth discussion of the High Holy Days, starting with the Three Weeks and Nine Days before Tisha b'Av and continuing all the way through Sukkot, as a single period of rising and falling emotion, wherein each individual prepares themselves to stand before God.  A very well-known book that some people read every year and others mean to get around to finally reading this year."
msgstr "从提沙节前的三周和九天开始，一直到住棚节，作为一个情绪上升和下降的单一时期，深入讨论神圣的日子，每个人都准备站在上帝面前。这是一本非常著名的书，有些人每年都会读，而另一些人则打算在今年抽出时间最终阅读。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Living a Jewish Life" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Anita Diamant's survey-level discussion of the daily practices and rituals of Jewish life.  Originally mostly superseded by the free availability of information on the internet, it's much more useful now for everyone who feels bad that they didn't attend their synagogue often enough before it was overrun."
msgstr "安妮塔 · 迪亚曼对犹太人日常生活习惯和仪式的调查级讨论。最初，互联网上的免费信息大部分都被取代了，现在，对于那些在犹太教堂被占用之前没有经常去犹太教堂的人来说，这种方式更加有用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Atwixt a Brace of Cacti"
msgid_plural "copies of Atwixt a Brace of Cacti"
msgstr[0] "在一对仙人掌中间"

#. ~ Description of "Gore Longitude"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Award-winning author Cornac McCaffordy weaves a chilling tale of horror and strife, following the compellingly lucrative, seductively dangerous bounty hunting and scalping trade across the western frontier."
msgstr "一部由获奖作家科纳克·麦肯迪所编撰的充满恐怖和冲突的毛骨悚然的小说，讲述了在西部拓荒边境进行的利润丰厚、危险诱人的赏金狩猎和倒卖交易。"

#. ~ Description of "fantasy novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Basic sword & sorcery."
msgstr "一本内容基本上都是各种剑术和巫术的书。"

#. ~ Description of "Riot on the Range"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Best selling author El Amor paints a visceral study in red with his latest western saga: Riot on the Range."
msgstr "畅销书作家艾尔·阿莫尔用他最新的西部传奇小说《牧场暴乱》深入肺腑地描绘出鲜红的西部风土人情。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Beyond Breaking the Glass: A Spiritual Guide to Your Jewish Wedding, Revised Edition"
msgid_plural "copies of Beyond Breaking the Glass: A Spiritual Guide to Your Jewish Wedding, Revised Edition"
msgstr[0] "《打破玻璃之外：犹太婚礼的精神指南》，修订版"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Biblical Literacy: The Most Important People, Events and Ideas of the Hebrew Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of Biblical Literacy: The Most Important People, Events and Ideas of the Hebrew Bible"
msgstr[0] "圣经文学：希伯来圣经中最重要的人物、事件和思想"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Blood Diodes"
msgid_plural "copies of Blood Diodes"
msgstr[0] "血色二极管"

#. ~ Description of "Rogue's Virtue"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Can Victoria reform the fugitive from justice who wooed her with false pretenses and true passion?"
msgstr "维多利亚能成功让那个用虚假借口和真实激情追求她的逃犯浪子回头吗？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Captain Gosnold and the Sea Rovers of Buzzards Bay"
msgid_plural "copies of The Sea Rovers"
msgstr[0] "戈斯戈尔德船长和秃鹫湾的海盗们"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Cat's Cradle"
msgid_plural "copies of Cat's Cradle"
msgstr[0] "猫的摇篮"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Catch-22"
msgid_plural "copies of Catch-22"
msgstr[0] "第二十二条军规"

#. ~ Description of "unmarked notebook"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Chemical formulae and complex diagrams handwritten in blue ball-point pen fill this notebook nearly cover to cover alongside uncomfortably detailed drawings of dissected pigs and humans.  What little text there is seems to describe steps in some sort of chemistry project, started and aborted again and again until on one dog-eared page toward the end, the nameless author outlines the collection of \"vital tissues\" and instructions for their use in some sort of experiment."
msgstr "一本蓝色圆珠笔手写的化学公式和复杂图解几乎写满了这本笔记本，书页中还穿插着解剖猪和人体、细节逼真到令人不安的图纸。为数不多的文字似乎在描述某个化学项目的步骤——项目反复启动又中止，直到靠近末尾一张卷角的书页上，那位无名作者勾勒出了“活体组织”的采集方法，以及将它们用于某项实验的操作说明。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Cloven Kisses"
msgid_plural "copies of Cloven Kisses"
msgstr[0] "魔蹄之吻"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Come Fly the Treacherous Skies"
msgid_plural "copies of Come Fly the Treacherous Skies"
msgstr[0] "来飞过这险恶的天空"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Coming to Terms with America: Essays on Jewish History, Religion, and Culture"
msgid_plural "copies of Coming to Terms with America: Essays on Jewish History, Religion, and Culture"
msgstr[0] "《接受美国：犹太历史、宗教和文化随笔》"

#. ~ Description of variant "Shulchan Arukh" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Compiled by Rabbi Yosef Karo in the 16th century, the Shuchan Arukh is the most widely-consulted and authoritative compilation of Jewish law lasting into the present day.  If you need to convene a post-Cataclysmic Beit Din, keep this with you and you'll be set."
msgstr "《犹太法典：Shulchan Arukh》编纂于16世纪，由拉比约瑟夫·卡罗（Rabbi Yosef Karo）完成，是迄今为止最广泛、权威的犹太法律汇编。如果你需要召集一个后灾变时代的犹太法庭，请随身准备这本书。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Computer Gaming"
msgid_plural "issues of Computer Gaming"
msgstr[0] "电脑游戏杂志"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Conquer Me Sweetly"
msgid_plural "copies of Conquer Me Sweetly"
msgstr[0] "征服我吧甜心"

#. ~ Description of "TIME magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Current events concerning a bunch of people who're all (un)dead now."
msgstr ""
"一些关于一群名人的周刊报道。\n"
"\"称为（不）死者报道更为贴切。\""

#. ~ Description of variant "People Love Dead Jews: Reports from a Haunted
#. Present" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Dara Horn's exploration of the modern rise of antisemitism, why there is so much interest in Jewish tragedy and comparatively little interest in Jewish culture, and why non-Jews feature so often and so prominently in popular stories of the Holocaust.  It would probably have been riveting and insightful before the Cataclysm made such concerns mostly irrelevant."
msgstr "达拉·霍恩（Dara Horn）探讨了反犹太主义的现代兴起，为什么人们对犹太悲剧如此感兴趣，而对犹太文化相对较少，以及为什么非犹太人在大屠杀的流行故事中如此频繁且如此突出。  在大灾变使这些担忧变得无关紧要之前，这可能是引人入胜且富有洞察力的。"

#. ~ Description of "romance novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Drama and mild smut."
msgstr "一本剧情跌宕起伏、还带有一些情色描写的小说。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Dubliner's Debutante"
msgid_plural "copies of Dubliner's Debutante"
msgstr[0] "杜布利纳的初次亮相"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Envying Heaven"
msgid_plural "copies of Envying Heaven"
msgstr[0] "妒天记"

#. ~ Description of "Tall, Dark, and Gruesome"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Fatima's obsession with the dead threatens to consume her when she falls in love with a restless ghost.  In this provocative romp celebrated author Kea Dekker gently lifts the thin veil separating cold bodies from warm."
msgstr "法蒂玛对死者的痴迷可能将她吞噬，她爱上了一个不愿安息的鬼魂。在这部挑逗的浪漫小说中，著名作家凯亚·德克尔轻轻地掀开分隔在冰冷尸体和温暖人体之间的薄纱。"

#. ~ ISBN 9780802130112
#. ~ Description of "The Master and Margarita"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Featuring a cast that includes Satan, Pontius Pilate, Jesus Christ, vampires, a talking cat, and the literary elite of Moscow, this novel by Mikhail Bulgakov explores philosophical issues on the nature of good and evil."
msgstr "一部由米哈伊尔·布尔加科夫创作的探讨了善恶本质的哲学问题的政治讽刺小说，书中角色包括了撒旦、本丢·彼拉多、耶稣基督、吸血鬼、一只会说话的猫和莫斯科的文艺精英们。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "From the Maccabees to the Mishnah"
msgid_plural "copies of From the Maccabees to the Mishnah"
msgstr[0] "从马卡比到米什纳"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Glimpses of Solomon in Yellow"
msgid_plural "copies of Solomon in Yellow"
msgstr[0] "瞥见黄衣所罗门"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "God in Search of Man : A Philosophy of Judaism"
msgid_plural "copies of God in Search of Man : A Philosophy of Judaism "
