#. ~ Description of "Your Inner Psychic"
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "Could you secretly have psychic powers?  Learn to see auras, attune to your chakras, and get down and dirty with your astral self."
msgstr "你体内有隐藏的灵能吗？学会观察光环，调谐你体内的查克拉，让自己躺下，释放出星体自我。"

