msgid "The Healing Power of Crystals"
msgid_plural "copies of The Healing Power of Crystals"
msgstr[0] "水晶的治疗能力"

#. ~ Description of "Essential Secrets"
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "The secret to happiness is simple: aromatherapy.  Surround yourself with products from our line of essential oils, using the discount code HAPPY for 10 percent off your first purchase, and you too can have it all."
msgstr "幸福的秘诀很简单：芳香疗法。用我们的精油系列产品包围你自己，使用折扣码HAPPY，首次购买就可以享受10%的折扣，你也可以拥有这一切。"

#. ~ Description of "Advanced Witchcraft"
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "This book apparently contains instructions for summoning and battling powerful spirits from other realms.  It doesn't say anything about zombies, though."
msgstr "这本书显然包含了从其他位面召唤并打败强大精灵的方法。不过，它没有提到丧尸。"

#. ~ Description of "Witchcraft for Beginners"
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "This book starts with a spell for self-confidence (hang some lavender above your bathroom mirror), and works its way up to a hex for an ex (slash their tires)."
msgstr "这本书从一个提高自信的法术开始（在你浴室的镜子上挂一些薰衣草），然后一直将前女友变形的法术（割破她们的轮胎）。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "Weaponizing Crystals"
msgid_plural "copies of Weaponizing Crystals"
msgstr[0] "以水晶作武器"

#. ~ Description of "Beyond The Veil"
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "What happens beyond death might be a mystery to the unlearned, but with careful use of a crystal ball, available for purchase on our website, you too can see beyond the veil."
msgstr "死后会发生什么对未学的人来说可能是个谜，但是仔细使用我们网站上提供的水晶球，你也可以看到纱幕之外的东西。"

#. ~ Description of "Weaponizing Crystals"
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "While this book claims crystals can be used to cast offensive spells, you suspect it might be more effective to just throw them."
msgstr "虽然这本书声称水晶可以用来施放攻击性法术，但你怀疑直接把它们丢出去可能更有效。"

#. ~ Description of "Ancient Alien Secrets"
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "Who made the Bermuda Triangle?  How did they build Stonehenge?  What did the alien king whisper in Cleopatra's ear that passionate night in the dunes?  These answers and more in the Alien Theorists' latest exposé."
msgstr "谁创造了百慕大三角？他们是怎么建造巨石阵的？在沙丘边那个充满激情的夜晚，外星人国王在埃及艳后耳边低语了什么？这些答案和更多外星人理论成果的首次曝光。"

#. ~ Description of "The Healing Power of Crystals"
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "Why waste time with 'doctors' or 'medicine'?  This guide will teach you to harness the innate healing power of crystals and nurture your soul."
msgstr "为什么要把时间浪费在\"医生\"或\"药物\"上？本指南将教你如何利用水晶天生的治疗能力，滋养你的灵魂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
msgid "Witchcraft for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of Witchcraft for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "巫术初学者入门"

