#. ~ Snippet of item "Fahrenheit 451"
#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
msgid "Some joker has gently burnt the exterior edge of this paperback dystopia.  It's still perfectly readable."
msgstr "一些爱开玩笑的人轻轻地烧焦了这边平装本反乌托邦小说的外部边缘。书仍然是完整可读的。"

#. ~ ISBN 9780241467992
#. ~ Item name
