#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
msgid "A collection of essays and advice on style, beauty, and motherhood.  Part memoir, part lifestyle guide, this book reflects the author's experience growing up as a woman of color in Brooklyn."
msgstr "一本关于风格、美貌和母性的散文和建议集。一部分是回忆录，一部分是生活指南，这本书反映了作者作为一位有色人种女性在布鲁克林区成长的经历。"

