#. ~ Description of "The Guide to Reflective Conflict Resolution"
#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
msgid "The back cover of this hardbound book reads: \"Why should professionals care about reflective practice?  How do its principles and methods increase competence?  What characteristics distinguish reflective practitioners?\""
msgstr "这本精装书的封底写道：\"为什么专业人士应该关心反思性实践？它的原则和方法如何提高能力？反思性实践者有哪些特点？\""

#. ~ Item name
