#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 8" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Bhagavadgitâ: Sanatsugâtîya and Anugitâ."
msgstr "它包含《薄伽梵歌：Sanatsugâtîya》和《Anugitâ》。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 19" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Fo-sho-hing-tsan-king: a life of Buddha, by Ashvaghosha, and the Bodhisattva."
msgstr "它包含阿什瓦格萨（Ashvaghosha）和菩萨的《佛陀兴赞王：佛陀的一生》。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 6" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Holy Qur'an part 1/2, from chapters I to XVI."
msgstr "它包含《古兰经》第 1/2 部分，从第一章到第十六章。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 9" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Holy Qur'an, part 2/2, from chapters XVII to CXIV."
msgstr "它包含《古兰经》第 2/2 部分，第 XVII 章至第 CXIV 章。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 7" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
