msgstr "它包含毗湿奴学院。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 25" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Laws of Manu, with extracts from seven commentaries."
msgstr "它包含《摩努法则》以及七篇评论的摘录。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 33" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Minor Law-Books: Brihaspati."
msgstr "它包含小法律书籍：Brihaspati。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 35" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Questions of King Milinda, part 1/2."
msgstr "它包含米琳达国王的问题，第 1/2 部分。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 36" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Questions of King Milinda, part 2/2."
msgstr "它包含米琳达国王的问题，第 2/2 部分。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 3" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Sacred Books of China, part 1/6, the texts of Confucianism: The Shû King (Classic of History), Book of Thang, Books of Yu, Books of Hsiâ, Books of Shang, Books of Kâu, Shih King, the Book of Odes (Classic of Poetry, I - Odes of the Temple and the Altar, II - Minor Odes of the Kingdom, III - Major Odes of the Kingdom, IV - Lessons from the States) and The Hsiâo King (Classic of Filial Piety)."
msgstr "它包含中国圣书，第 1/6 部分，儒家文本：《蜀王》（历史经典）、《唐书》、《虞书》、《夏书》、《商书》、《九书》、《诗王》、《诗经》（诗经）、I - 宫坛诗、II - 小国诗、III - 大国诗、IV - 国家的教训）和《孝王》（孝经）。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 16" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Sacred Books of China, part 2/6, the texts of Confucianism: Yi King (I Ching)."
msgstr "它包含《中国圣书》第 2/6 部分，以及儒家思想的文本：《易经》。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 27" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
