msgid "It contains The Sacred Books of China, part 3/6, the texts of Confucianism: The Li Ki I (Book of Rites)."
msgstr "它包含中国圣书，第 3/6 部分，儒家文本：礼记 I（礼记）。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 28" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Sacred Books of China, part 4/6, the texts of Confucianism: The Li Ki II (Book of Rites)."
msgstr "它包含《中国圣书》第 4/6 部分，以及儒家思想的文本：《礼记 II》。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 2" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Sacred Laws of the Aryas (Dharmasastra), part 1/2: Âpastamba, Gautama, Vâsishtha and Baudhâyana."
msgstr "它包含《圣法》（Dharmasastra），第 1/2 部分：âpastamba、Gautama、Vâsishtha 和 Baudhâyana。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 14" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
