msgstr "它包含《雅利安人的神圣律法》，第 2/2 部分：Vâsishtha、Baudhâyana 和 Parisishta。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 21" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Saddharma-Pundarika (or The Lotus of the True Law)."
msgstr "它包含《Saddharma-Pundarika》（或《真法莲花》）。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Book of the East Vol. 1" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Upanishads, part 1/2: Khândogya Upanishad, Talavakâra (or Kena-Upanishad), Aitareya-Âranyaka, Kaushîtaki-Brâhmana and Vâjasaneyi-Sâmhita Upanishad."
msgstr "续《奥义书》第 1/2 部分：Laungya Upanhada、Talavakara（或 Kena-Unava（或 Kena-Unyaka）、Thethareya 是相同的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 15" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains The Upanishads, part 2/2: Katha Upanishad, Mundaka Upanishad, Taittiriya Upanishad, Brhadaranyaka Upanishad, Svetasvatara Upanishad, Prasna Upanishad and Maitrayani Upanishad."
msgstr "它包含奥义书，第 2/2 部分：Katha Upanishad、Mundaka Upanishad、Taittiriya Upanishad、Brhadaranyaka Upanishad、Svetasvatara Upanishad、Prasna Upanishad 和 Maitrayani Upanishad。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 4" of item "Holy
