msgstr "它包含《Zend-Avesta》，第 3/3 部分：Yasna、Visparad、Afrinagân、Gâhs 和其他片段。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nag Hammadi Codex XIII" of item "Nag Hammadi
#. Codex"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains Trimorphic Protennoia, On the Origin of the World, and various fragmented texts."
msgstr "它包含《Trimorphic Protennoia》、《论世界的起源》以及各种碎片文本。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nag Hammadi Codex VIII" of item "Nag Hammadi
#. Codex"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains Zostrianos and the Letter of Peter to Philip."
msgstr "它包含佐斯特里亚诺斯和彼得给菲利普的信。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 50" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains a nice general index to the names and subject-matter of the Sacred Books of the East."
msgstr "它包含一个关于东方圣书的名称和主题的很好的综合索引。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nag Hammadi Codex VI" of item "Nag Hammadi Codex"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Acts of Peter and the Twelve Apostles, The Thunder/Perfect Mind, Authoritative Teaching, the Context of Our Great Power, fragments of Plato's Republic, The Discourse of the Eight and Ninth, the Prayer of Thanksgiving, and Asclepius."
msgstr "它包含《彼得行传》和《十二使徒行传》、《雷霆/完美心灵》、《权威教导》、《我们伟大力量的背景》、《柏拉图理想国》片段、《第八和第九使徒的话语》、《感恩祈祷》和《阿斯克勒庇俄斯》。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nag Hammadi Codex IV" of item "Nag Hammadi Codex"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Apocryphon of John (version 1) and Holy Book of the Great Invisible Spirit."
msgstr "它包含约翰次经（版本 1）和伟大的无形圣灵的圣书。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nag Hammadi Codex II" of item "Nag Hammadi Codex"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Apocryphon of John (version 1), the Gospel of Thomas, the Gospel of Phillip, the Hypostasis of the Archons, On the Origin of the World, the Exegesis of the Soul, and the Book of Thomas the Contender."
msgstr "它包含《约翰次经》（版本 1）、《托马斯福音》、《菲利普福音》、《执政官的地位》、《世界的起源》、《灵魂的诠释》和《竞争者托马斯之书》。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nag Hammadi Codex III" of item "Nag Hammadi
#. Codex"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Apocryphon of John (version 2), Holy Book of the Great Invisible Spirit, Eugnostos the Blessed, The Sophia of Jesus Christ, and the Dialogue of the Savior."
msgstr "它包含《约翰次经》（第二版）、《伟大的无形圣灵的圣书》、《受祝福的尤格诺斯托斯》、《耶稣基督的索菲亚》和《救世主的对话》。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 49" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Buddhist Mahayana Texts, part 1/2: Buddha-karita of Aśvaghosa, the Buddhist Mahayana Texts, part 2/2: Longer Sukhâvati-vyuha and Shorter Sukhâvati-vyuha, Vagrakkhedika, the longer Pragnâ-pâramitâ-hridaya-sutra, the shorter Pragnâ-pâramitâ-hridaya-sutra and the Amitâyur dhyâna-sutra."
msgstr "它包含佛教大乘经典，第 1/2 部分：Aśvaghosa 的 Buddha-karita，佛教大乘经典，第 2/2 部分：较长的 Sukhâvati-vyuha 和较短的 Sukhâvati-vyuha、Vagrakkhedika、较长的 Pragnâ-pâramitâ-hridaya-sutra、较短的 Pragnâ-pâramitâ-hridaya-sutra 和阿弥陀佛禅经。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 11" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Buddhist Suttas: Mahā-parinibbāna Suttanta, Dhamma-kakka-ppavattana Sutta, Tevigga Sutta'anta, Âkankheyya Sutta'a, Ketokhila Sutta'a, Mahâ-Sudassana Sutta'anta and Sabbâsava Sutta'a."
msgstr "它包含佛教经：Mahā-parinibbāna Suttata、Dhamma-kakka-ppavattana Sutta、Tevigga Sutta'anta、Âkankheyya Sutta'a、Ketokhila Sutta'a、Mahā-Sudassana Sutta'anta 和 Sabbâsava Sutta'a。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 10" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Dhammapada: a collection of verses, and the Sutta-Nipâta: a collection of discourses, being one of the canonical books of the Buddhists."
msgstr "它包含《法句经》：诗句集和《经尼帕多》：经论集，是佛教经典之一。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 29" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Grihya-sutras, part 1/2, rules of Vedic domestic ceremonies: Sankhyayana-Grihya-sutra, Āsvalāyana-Grihya-sutra, Paraskara-Grihya-sutra and Khadia-Grihya-sutra."
msgstr "它包含 Grihya-sutras，第 1/2 部分，以及吠陀家庭仪式的规则：Sankhyayana-Grihya-sutra、Āsvalāyana-Grihya-sutra、Paraskara-Grihya-sutra 和 Khadia-Grihya-sutra。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 30" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Grihya-sutras, part 2/2, rules of Vedic domestic ceremonies: Gobhila, Hiranyakesin, Apastamba and Yajna Paribhashasutras."
msgstr "它包含 Grihya-sutras，第 2/2 部分，以及吠陀国内仪式的规则：Gobhila、Hiranyakesin、Apastamba 和 Yajna Paribhashasutras。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 42" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "It contains the Hymns of the Atharvaveda, together With Extracts From the Ritual Books and the Commentaries."
