#. ~ Description of "Luther's Catechism"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "The Luther's Small Catechism and the Luther's Large Catechism into one single large, hardcover book.  It contains a summary of Christian doctrine and was intended to be used as a teaching tool for laypeople, particularly parents and pastors, to instruct them in the basic principles of the Christian faith."
msgstr "将《路德小教义问答》和《路德大教义问答》合为一本大型精装书。  它包含基督教教义的摘要，旨在作为外行人，特别是父母和牧师的教学工具，指导他们基督教信仰的基本原则。"

