#. ~ Description of "Westminster Catechism"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "The Westminster Shorter Catechism and the Westminster Larger Catechism into one single large, hardcover book.  It serves as the doctrinal standard in the Reformed tradition of Protestant Christianity, a concise and systematic summary of Christian beliefs, intended to be used for teaching and instruction (and also one of the Four Forms of Unity, depending on the denomination).  This catechism is also divided into a series of questions and answers, covering various aspects of theology, morality, and Christian living."
msgstr "将威斯敏斯特小教理问答和威斯敏斯特大教理问答合并为一本大型精装书。  它是新教基督教改革宗传统中的教义标准，是基督教信仰的简明而系统的总结，旨在用于教学和指导（也是统一的四种形式之一，具体取决于教派）。  这个教理问答还分为一系列问题和答案，涵盖了神学、道德和基督徒生活的各个方面。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "The Zara Avesta"
msgid_plural "copies of the Zara Avesta"
msgstr[0] "扎拉阿维斯塔"

#. ~ Description of "Torah"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "The five books of Moses, written on animal skin by a trained scribe in accordance with the laws and customs of traditional Jewish calligraphy and bound onto wooden rollers.  Once very expensive, it would now be beyond price, if there are any Jewish communities left to use it."
msgstr "摩西五经，由训练有素的抄写员按照传统犹太书法抄写在兽皮上，并以木筒装订。它曾经极度昂贵，如今则是无价之宝——如果还有犹太人要用到它。"

#. ~ Description of "The Kojiki"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "The oldest extant chronicle of Japan's myths and history, the stories contained in the Kojiki are part of the inspiration behind Shinto practices."
msgstr "记录日本神话和历史的、现存最古老的编年史书籍，其中包含了古事记故事背后、神道的做法灵感的一部分。"

#. ~ Description of "The Book of Mormon"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "The sacred text of the Latter Day Saint movement of Christianity, originally published in 1830 by Joseph Smith."
msgstr "摩门教（耶稣基督后期圣徒教会）的教义文本，该书最早于1830年由约瑟夫史密斯出版发行。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "Theogony"
msgid_plural "copies of the Theogony"
msgstr[0] "神谱"

#. ~ Description of "Dianetics"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This book is the canonical text of Scientology.  Written by a science fiction author, it contains self-improvement techniques and musings on psychology called Dianetics."
msgstr "这是一本山达基教（又称科学教、科学神教）的教典，其中介绍了一种被称作\"戴尼提\"的、自我提升和心灵冥想的技巧。不巧的是，它是由一位科幻作家创作的。"

#. ~ Description of "Siddur"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is a lightweight collection of prayers and blessings that are recited by Jews during various parts of their daily lives, religious ceremonies, and festivals."
msgstr "这是犹太人在日常生活、宗教仪式和节日的各个部分背诵的祈祷和祝福的轻量级集合。"

#. ~ Description of "Book of the Counsels of Zoroaster"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is a rare English translation of the 'Book of the Counsels of Zoroaster', also known as 'Pand-namag i Zardust', a post-Sasanian compendium of apothegms intended to instruct every Zoroastrian male, upon his attaining the age of fifteen years, in fundamental religious and ethical principles, as well as in the daily duties incumbent upon him."
msgstr "这是《琐罗亚斯德教诲之书》的罕见英文译本，也被称为“Pand-namag i Zardust”，是一部后萨珊王朝的格言纲要，旨在指导每一位年满 15 岁的琐罗亚斯德教男性基本的宗教和道德原则，以及他所肩负的日常职责。"

#. ~ Description of "Buluotuo"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is very rare English translation of the Buluotuo, a sacred epic in Moism, the religion of most Zhuang people, the largest ethnic minority of China.  This book addresses the creation of the Universe and life as well as how to live a religiously meritorious life inside Moism.  This book also contains information on entities, deities, gods, godesses, prayers, practices and rituals of Moism."
msgstr "这是《布洛陀》的非常罕见的英文译本，这是一部墨教的神圣史诗，墨教是中国最大的少数民族，大多数壮族人的宗教。  本书讲述了宇宙和生命的创造，以及如何在墨家思想中过上有宗教功德的生活。  本书还包含有关墨派的实体、神灵、男神、女神、祈祷、实践和仪式的信息。"

#. ~ Description of "Orthodox Tewahedo Biblical Canon"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is very rare English translation of the Orthodox Tewahedo Biblical Canon, a collection of religious texts that form the basis of the Ethiopian Orthodox Church's faith and doctrine, probably acquired by a immigrant, collector or theologist.  This canon is distinct from the Protestant and Catholic biblical canons, as it contains additional books that are not part of the Hebrew Bible or the Old Testament."
msgstr "这是东正教特瓦赫多圣经正典的非常罕见的英文译本，这是构成埃塞俄比亚东正教信仰和教义基础的宗教文本集，可能是由移民、收藏家或神学家获得的。  该正典与新教和天主教圣经正典不同，因为它包含不属于希伯来圣经或旧约的其他书籍。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 1, Tractate Berakhot (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 1 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Berakhot.  It is concerned with rules relating to the Shema and the Amidah."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第一卷，对应Berakhot第二节的内容。主要讲跟Shema与Amidah相关的规则。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 10, Tractate Maasrot" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 10 of 51, containing Tractate Maasrot.  It discusses the separation of the harvest into tithes, and the portions given to the Tribe of Levi, the poor, or the people of Jerusalem."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十卷，对应Maasrot的内容。它主要讨论将收获分成十份，以及将部分分给Levi部落、穷人或耶路撒冷人。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 11, Tractate Maaser Sheni" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 11 of 51, containing Tractate Maaser Sheni.  It discusses the practice of consuming a portion of the yearly harvest in Jerusalem, or exchanging it for money used to buy food in Jerusalem to hold a feast."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十一卷，对应Maaser Sheni的内容。它主要讨论在耶路撒冷吃掉一部分年收成的习俗，或者用这些收成换成钱在耶路撒冷购买食物以举行宴会。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 12, Tractate Challah" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 12 of 51, containing Tractate Challah.  It discusses the practice of baking bread with the first portion of harvested grain and tithing it as an offering."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十二卷，对应Challah的内容。它主要讨论用收获的谷物的第一部分烘烤面包并将其作为供品的做法。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 13, Tractates Orlah & Bikkurim" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 13 of 51, containing Tractates Orlah and Bikkurim.  Both tractates discuss the practice of letting a fruit tree grow for three years before harvesting it."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三卷，对应Orlah & Bikkurim的内容。这两部分都在讨论让一棵果树在收获前生长三年的做法。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 14, Tractate Shabbat (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 14 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Shabbat.  It discusses the thirty-nine types of prohibited labor"
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十四卷，对应Shabbat第一部分的内容。它主要讨论三十九种禁止的行为。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 15, Tractate Shabbat (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 15 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Shabbat.  It discusses the prohibitions of carrying items or transporting animals on Shabbat."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十五卷，对应Shabbat第二部分的内容。它主要讨论在安息日禁止携带物品或运送动物。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 16, Tractate Shabbat (Part 3)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 16 of 51, containing the third part of Tractate Shabbat.  It discusses the positive commandments of Shabbat, such as lighting candles and eating a festive meal, and continues the discussion of prohibited types of labor."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十六卷，对应Shabbat第一部分的内容。它主要讨论安息日的允许行为，如点燃蜡烛和吃节日大餐，并继续讨论禁止类型的劳动。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 17, Tractate Eruvin (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 17 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Eruvin.  It discusses the ways to expand the allowable areas in which one may carrying items or transport items on Shabbat."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十七卷，对应Eruvin第一部分的内容。它主要讨论扩大允许在安息日携带物品或运输物品的区域的方法。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 18, Tractate Eruvin (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 18 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Eruvin.  It continues discussing the ways to expand the allowable areas in which one may carrying items or transport items on Shabbat."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十八卷，对应Eruvin第二部分的内容。它继续讨论扩大安息日可携带物品或运输物品的容许范围的方法。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 19, Tractate Pesachim (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 19 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Pesachim.  It discusses laws relating to Passover, such as the proper disposal of leaven and the preparation of unleavened bread."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十九卷，对应Pesachim第一部分的内容。它主要讨论有关逾越节的规定，例如妥善取出酵母准备无酵面包。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 2, Tractate Berakhot (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 2 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Berakhot.  It discusses rules relating to prayers, primarily those before or after eating but it also touches on prayers that occur on special occasions such as hearing thunder or being unexpectedly delivered from danger."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二卷，对应Berakhot第二节的内容。它讨论有关祷告，主要是在就餐前的祷告，但也讨论其他特殊场景的祷告，比如聆听闪电或意外身处危险时的祷告。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 20, Tractate Pesachim (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 20 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Pesachim.  It continues the discussion of laws relating to Passover, such as whether servants are allowed to slaughter the Passover sacrifice or what to do if the Seder occurs on a Friday night."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十卷，对应Pesachim第二部分的内容。它继续讨论与逾越节有关的法律，例如是否允许仆人宰杀逾越节祭品，或者如果逾越节家宴在星期五晚上举行，该怎么办。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 21, Tractate Shekalim" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 21 of 51, containing Tractate Shekalim.  It discusses the taxes paid to maintain the Temple and the priesthood."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十一卷，对应Shekalim的内容。它讨论维持圣殿和祭司职位所缴纳的税款。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 22, Tractate Yoma" of item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 22 of 51, containing Tractate Yoma.  It discusses the rituals and laws related to Yom Kippur, primarily concerned with the Temple service."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十二卷，对应Yoma的内容。它讨论与赎罪日有关的仪式和法律，主要与寺庙服务有关。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 23, Tractate Sukkah" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 23 of 51, containing Tractate Sukkah.  It discusses the rituals and laws related to Sukkot, such as dwelling in the Sukkah and the four species of plants."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十三卷，对应Sukkah的内容。它讨论与Sukkot有关的礼法和规定，例如在Sukkot中的住房和四种植物。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 24, Tractate Beitzah" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 24 of 51, containing Tractate Beitzah.  It discusses laws common to all Torah-derived holidays, such as prohibitions on work and the proper preparation of food."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十四卷，对应Beitzah的内容。它主要讨论所有摩西五经衍生节日所共有的规定，例如工作的禁忌和准备食物的规定。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 25, Tractate Rosh Hashanah" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 25 of 51, containing Tractate Rosh Hashanah.  It discusses rituals and laws related to Rosh Hashanah, such as blowing the shofar, as well as the proper way to celebrate the festival of a new month."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十五卷，对应Rosh Hashanah的内容。它讨论了与犹太新年有关的仪式和法律，比如吹羊角号，以及庆祝新月的正确方式。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 26, Tractate Taanit" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 26 of 51, containing Tractate Taanit.  It discusses laws related to fasting, as well as proper method of praying for rain to avoid famine."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十六卷，对应Taanit的内容。它讨论了有关斋戒的规定，以及祈求降雨避免饥荒的正确方法。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 27, Tractate Megillah" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 27 of 51, containing Tractate Megillah.  It discusses laws of reading the Book of Esther on Purim, as well as commentary on the story of Esther itself."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十七卷，对应Megillah的内容。它讨论了在普珥节阅读以斯帖书的规定，以及对以斯帖书本身内容的评述。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 28, Tractate Chagigah" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 28 of 51, containing Tractate Chagigah.  It discusses the practice of offering ritual sacrifices at the Temple on festival days, with frequent interruptions to discuss the Book of Genesis."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十八卷，对应Chagigah的内容。它讨论了在节日的日子里在寺庙里举行祭祀仪式的做法，经常被打断来讨论《创世记》。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 29, Tractate Moed Katan" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 29 of 51, containing Tractate Moed Katan.  It discusses Chol HaMoed, the minor holidays in between the first and last days of Sukkot and Passover.  It also has the famous story of the Oven of Akhnai, from which the principle is derived that \"The Torah is not in heaven\"."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十九卷，对应Moed Katan的内容。它讨论了住棚节和逾越节第一天和最后一天之间的小节日Chol HaMoed。它记录了著名的阿赫奈烤炉的故事，从中得出了“托拉不在天堂”的原则。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 3, Tractate Pe'ah" of item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 3 of 51, containing Tractate Pe'ah.  It discusses agriculture, of harvesting, and providing food for the poor."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三卷，对应Pe'ah的内容。主要讲述了农业，收获，以及向贫困的人施与食物。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 30, Tractate Yevamot (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 30 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Yevamot.  It deals with the laws of Yibbum, often translated as \"Levirate marriage,\" the requirement of a man to marry his brother's widow."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第六卷，对应Yevamot第一部分的内容。它涉及到 Yibbum 的法律，通常被翻译成“夫兄弟婚”，一个男人必须和他兄弟的遗孀结婚。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 31, Tractate Yevamot (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 31 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Yevamot.  It continues the discussion of the laws of Yibbum, often translated as \"Levirate marriage,\" and the circumstances in which it does or does not apply."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十一卷，对应Yevamot第二部分的内容。它继续讨论Yibbum的法律，通常被翻译为“夫兄弟婚”，以及在什么情况下它适用或不适用。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 32, Tractate Ketubot (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 32 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Ketubot.  It discusses the marriage contract (Ketubah), and the marital obligations between husband and wife."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十二卷，对应Ketubot第一部分的内容。它讨论了婚姻契约(Ketubah) ，以及夫妻之间的婚姻义务。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 33, Tractate Ketubot (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 33 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Ketubot.  It continues the discussion of the marriage contract, as well as divorce and giving formal testimony."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十三卷，对应Ketubot第二部分的内容。它继续讨论婚姻约定，以及离婚和正式证词。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 34, Tractate Nedarim" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 34 of 51, containing Tractate Nedarim.  It deals with the making and breaking of vows and the conditions under which vows are automatically void."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十四卷，对应Nedarim的内容。它涉及誓言的制定和违背，以及誓言自动失效的条件。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 35, Tractate Nazir (Part 1)" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 35 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Nazir.  It deals with Nazirites, who make vows to abstain from wine, cutting their hair, and avoiding contact with the dead."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第六卷，对应Nazir第一部分的内容。它主要关于拿撒勒人，他们发誓不喝酒，剪头发，避免与死者接触。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 36, Tractate Nazir (Part 2)" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 36 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Nazir.  It continues the discussion of Nazirite vows, as well as the transmission of ritual impurity between objects."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十六卷，对应Nazir第二部分的内容。它继续讨论拿撒勒人的誓言，以及在物体之间传递不洁的仪式。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 37, Tractate Sotah (Part 1)" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 37 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Sotah.  It contains a discussion of the sotah, or \"bitter water\", ritual for a woman suspected of adultery by her husband."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十七卷，对应Sotah第一部分的内容。它包含关于sotah，或是“苦水”的讨论，一个被丈夫怀疑通奸的女人的仪式。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 38, Tractate Sotah (Part 2)" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 38 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Sotah.  It continues a discussion of the sotah, as well as a long discussion over the entrance of the Israelites into the land of Israel."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十八卷，对应Sotah第二部分的内容。它继续了关于sotah的讨论，并展开了关于以色列人进入以色列地的长长讨论。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 39, Tractate Gittin (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 39 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Gittin.  It discusses the Get, the formal document of divorce, and the specifications for its preparation and writing."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十九卷，对应Gittin第一部分的内容。它讨论了Get这个正式离婚的文件，以及其准备和写作的规范。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 4, Tractate Demai" of item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 4 of 51, containing Tractate Demai.  It discusses rules for dubiously-tithed produce."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四卷，对应Demai的内容。讨论了产品交税的疑点。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 40, Tractate Gittin (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 40 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Gittin.  It continues the discussion of the Get, as well the process of  \"Tikkun Olam\", or repairing the world."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第六卷，对应Gittin第二部分的内容。它继续讨论Get，以及“ Tikkun Olam”，或称作修复世界的过程。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 41, Tractate Kiddushin" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 41 of 51, containing Tractate Kiddushin.  It discusses the laws of betrothal and the rules governing interactions between unmarried men and women."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十一卷，对应Kiddushin的内容。它讨论了订婚法和未婚男女之间互动的规则。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 42, Tractate Bava Kamma" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 42 of 51, containing Tractate Bava Kamma.  It discusses torts and the proper ways to deal with damages inflicted on people and property."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十二卷，对应Bava Kamma的内容。它讨论了侵权行为以及对人身和财产造成损害的正确处理方法。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 43, Tractate Bava Metzia" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 43 of 51, containing Tractate Bava Metzia.  It discusses interpersonal disputes such as lost property, renting, and obligations of workers and employers, with a digression into how great sages who spend their lives studying Torah are.  It also reiterates the story of the Oven of Akhnai."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十三卷，对应Bava Meztia的内容。它讨论了人与人之间的纠纷，比如财产损失、租赁、工人和雇主的义务等等，并且离题了研究摩西五经的圣人们是多么伟大。它还重申了阿克奈烤炉的故事。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 44, Tractate Bava Basra" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 44 of 51, containing Tractate Bava Basra.  It discusses business relationships and the laws of inheritance."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十四卷，对应Bava Basra的内容。它讨论了商业关系和继承法。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 45, Tractate Sanhedrin (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 45 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Sanhedrin.  It discusses the selection of judges and the formation of courts."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十五卷，对应Sanhedrin第一部分的内容。它讨论了法官的选任和法院的形成。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 46, Tractate Sanhedrin (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 46 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Sanhedrin.  It continues the discussion of judges, the punishments administered by the courts, and ends with a discussion of who will have a place in Olam Haba, the afterlife."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十六卷，对应Sanhedrin第一部分的内容。它继续讨论判决，法院实施的惩罚，并以对谁将在 Olam Haba，即来世拥有一席之地的讨论结尾。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 47, Tractate Shevuot" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 47 of 51, containing Tractate Shevuot.  It discusses formal oaths, such as those taken by witnesses in court."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十七卷，对应Shevuot的内容。它讨论了正式的誓言，例如证人在法庭上的誓言。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 48, Tractate Avodah Zara (Part 1)"
#. of item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 48 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Avodah Zara.  It discusses forbidden idolatry and the laws regulating contact and commerce with idolators."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十八卷，对应Avodah Zara第一部分的内容。它讨论了偶像崇拜禁忌以及与偶像崇拜者接触和交易的律令规定。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 49, Tractate Avodah Zara (Part 2)"
#. of item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 49 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Avodah Zara.  It continues the discussion of contact and commerce with idolators, including the prohibition on buying or consuming wine that may have been used in sacrifices to idols."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十九卷，对应Avodah Zara第二部分的内容。它继续讨论与偶像崇拜者的接触和贸易的规定，包括禁止购买或消费可能祭祀过偶像的葡萄酒。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 5, Tractate Kilayim" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 5 of 51, containing Tractate Kilayim.  It discusses prohibitions on the mixing of different kinds, such as wearing wool and linen clothing or planting anything other than grapes in a vineyard."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第五卷，对应Kilayim的内容。讨论了其他种类的禁忌，如穿着羊毛和亚麻衣服或在葡萄园中种其他作物。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 50, Tractates Makkot & Horayot" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 50 of 51, containing Tractates Makkot and Horayot.  Tractate Makkot discusses punishments administered by a court of law and Tractate Horayot discuss redress for errors committed by the court and how to atone for sins committed by kings, high priests, and other officials."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第五十卷，对应Makkot & Horayot的内容。Makkot 部分讨论由法院实施的惩罚，Horayot 部分讨论对法院所犯错误的补救，以及弥补国王、大祭司和其他官员所犯的罪行。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 51, Tractate Niddah" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 51 of 51, containing Tractate Niddah.  It discusses the ritual status of a menstruating woman, the prohibition on marital relations, and different kinds of bloody discharges."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第五十一卷，对应Niddah的内容。它讨论了经期妇女的仪式地位，婚姻关系的禁忌，以及各种不同流血的规定。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 6, Tractate Shevi'it (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "This is volume 6a of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Shevi'it.  It discusses the Shemitah year, the seventh year where fields must lie fallow."
