msgid "A teenage influencer becomes fast friends with someone who may or may not be an actual demon."
msgstr "一位青年意见领袖交到了一个新密友。这个朋友很可能（是/不是）一只真正的恶魔。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "book of fairy tales"
#: data/json/items/book/young.json
msgid "A well illustrated fairy tale about a war between the birds and the beasts, with particulars on the wartime conduct and eventual fate of the bat."
msgstr "这是一本有着不错插图的童话故事书，讲述了鸟类和野兽之间的战争，着重描绘蝙蝠在战争之中的行为和最终命运。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "book of fairy tales"
