msgid "An Irish fairy tale in which a Celtic poet marries a princess who has been cursed with the head of a pig."
msgstr "一个爱尔兰童话故事，讲述了一个凯尔特诗人娶了一个被诅咒长成猪头的公主。"

#. ~ Description of "book of fairy tales"
