#. ~ Description of "Summer Variables"
#: data/json/items/book/young.json
msgid "In this book written primarily for young adults, a woman's modest summer internship results in an incredible discovery that attracts the attention of unsavory elements."
msgstr "在这本主要为年轻人写的书中，一位少女在参加一次不太重要的暑期实习时有了一次令人难以置信的发现，吸引了一些不良分子的注意。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "book of fairy tales"
#: data/json/items/book/young.json
msgid "In this fairy tale, a strong man frightens an ogre by squeezing water out of a stone."
