msgid "This book, titled \"The Rattlesnake's Vengeance\" is a collection of Cherokee myths and legends.  \"285D\" is hand-written in pencil on the title page."
msgstr "这本书名为《响尾蛇的复仇》，是切诺基族神话和传说的故事集。标题页上用铅笔手写了\"285D\"。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "book of fairy tales"
#: data/json/items/book/young.json
