#: data/json/items/book/young.json
msgid "This fable book is titled \"The Rabbit Herd.\"  Inside are woodcut illustrations of a peasant boy playing his flute for a mob of mischievous hares."
msgstr "这本寓言书的题目是《野兔群》。书中画着一幅农家男孩为一群淘气的野兔吹长笛的木版画插图。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "book of fairy tales"
#: data/json/items/book/young.json
