msgstr "这本童话书中讲述了一个《杰克和豌豆》故事的本地变体。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "book of fairy tales"
#: data/json/items/book/young.json
msgid "This fairy tale book is titled \"Little Red Cap.\"  It details a red-cloaked child's various encounters with talking wolves."
msgstr "这本童话书的标题是《小红帽》。它描述了一个穿红斗篷的小女孩与一只会说话的大灰狼的各种遭遇。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "book of fairy tales"
#: data/json/items/book/young.json
msgid "This fairy tale is about a wolf who eats so much salted meat she becomes trapped in the butcher's cellar."
msgstr "这个童话故事讲的是一只狼吃了太多咸肉，最终被困在屠夫的地窖里。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "book of fairy tales"
#: data/json/items/book/young.json
msgid "This illustrated fairy tale relates how a city mouse did visit his cousin in the country, and how each regarded the other's quality of life."
msgstr "这个童话小说讲述了一只城市老鼠拜访他在乡下的表亲的，以及他们如何看待对方的生活质量的故事。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "book of fairy tales"
#: data/json/items/book/young.json
msgid "Titled \"The Fleeing Pancake\", this collection of silly folk tales is suitable for small children."
