#. ~ Description of "lazy lobster casserole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid "A classic New England casserole made with butter, lobster, and crackers, in roughly that order."
msgstr "新英格兰经典砂锅菜，用黄油、龙虾和饼干制作，大致按上面顺序烹饪。"

#. ~ Description of "eggplant parmigiana"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid "A good portion of tasty eggplant parmigiana."
msgstr "一份美味的帕尔马干酪茄子。"

#. ~ Description of "fish noodle casserole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid "Fish noodle casserole is a casserole primarily made with pasta and canned tuna, with canned peas and corn sometimes added."
msgstr "金枪鱼烤面是一种主要由意大利面和罐装金枪鱼制成的砂锅面，有时还会加入罐装豌豆和玉米。"

#. ~ Description of "hot corn casserole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid "It's cheesy and indulgent, although the mix of tender kernels of corn, veggies, fresh herbs, and a pop of heat keep it in check so it's not too heavy for the apocalypse."
msgstr "它是俗气的和放纵的，尽管嫩玉米粒、蔬菜、新鲜香草的混合和一股热量控制住了它，所以对于世界末日来说它不会太重。"

#. ~ Description of "cheesy baked spinach casserole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid "This cheesy spinach casserole is cheesy, packed with hearty spinach, and totally delicious."
msgstr "这道芝士焗菠菜煲充满了浓郁的菠菜味，而且非常美味。"

#. ~ Item name
