#. ~ Description of "chunk of mutant fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "A chunk of raw fat butchered from a heavily-mutated animal.  It smells, if anything, even more disgusting than the rest of the mutant.  There are little puddles of unidentified oils dripping from it."
msgstr "一块从严重变异的动物身上切下的生脂肪。它闻起来甚至比其他变异部位更恶心。有些不明油脂从中滴落下来形成小滩。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of human fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "A chunk of raw fat, harvested from a human body."
msgstr "一块从人身上切下来的生肥肉。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "A chunk of raw fat.  You could eat it as-is, but it is better used as an ingredient in other foods or projects."
msgstr "一块生肥肉。你可以就这么吃掉，但最好经过加工，与其他食材一同使用。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of tainted fat"
#. ~ Description of "chunk of tainted human fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "A rotten glob of fat, rapidly breaking down into putrid slime and certainly useless for cooking.  You could eat it, but it will poison you."
msgstr "一团黄色的浆糊状脂肪，源自某种非自然生物。你可以吃，但是会让你中毒。"

#. ~ Description of "tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "A smooth block of cleaned and rendered animal fat.  It will remain edible for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr "一块清洗后熬制的白色动物脂肪。可以保存很久并食用，而且在很多食物和物品的制造配方中会用到。"

#. ~ Description of "mutant tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered fat, sourced from a mutant animal.  It will remain edible for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr "一块清洗后熬制的白色变异动物脂肪。可以保存很久并食用，而且在很多食物和物品的制造配方中会用到。"

#. ~ Description of "mutant humanoid tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered fat, sourced from a mutant humanoid.  It won't rot for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr "一块清洗后熬制的白色变异人脂肪。可以保存很久并食用，而且在很多食物和物品的制造配方中会用到。"

#. ~ Description of "human tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered human fat.  It will remain edible for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr "一块清洗后熬制的白色人类脂肪。可以保存很久并食用，而且在很多食物和物品的制造配方中会用到。"

#. ~ Description of "coconut oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "Despite the name, coconut oil is solid at room temperature.  Smelling vaguely tropical, it was popular as a natural, meat-free alternative to products like shortening or lard."
msgstr "尽管有这个名字，椰子油在室温下是固体。  它闻起来带有淡淡的热带气息，作为起酥油或猪油等产品的天然无肉替代品而广受欢迎。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable shortening"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "Hydrogenated vegetable oil, pure white and solid at room temperature.  This product was developed in the early 20th century as an alternative to lard, and can readily stand in for it in most recipes."
msgstr "氢化植物油，常温下呈纯白色固体。  该产品于 20 世纪初开发，作为猪油的替代品，在大多数食谱中可以轻松替代猪油。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of mutant humanoid fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "Raw fat butchered from a heavily-mutated humanoid."
msgstr "从一只严重变异的类人生物身上切下的生肥肉。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable cooking oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "Thin yellow vegetable oil used for cooking."
msgstr "一些淡黄色的烹饪用油。"

