#. ~ Description of "pumpkin yeast bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "A festive autumnal bread with a golden color in either rolls or sliced loaves of bread."
msgstr "一种金黄色的秋日庆典面包，可以是面包卷或是切片长面包的形状。"

#. ~ Description of "hardtack pudding"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "An old recipe from the American Civil War, designed to make hardtack more palatable.  The hardtack is crushed and combined with water and flour to make dough, followed by kneading in pieces of fruit.  The dough is then boiled into bread pudding chunks and topped with sweeteners.  Soldiers would call this a dessert."
msgstr "美国内战时期的老菜谱，旨在使压缩饼干更加美味。将压缩饼干碾碎并与水和面粉混合制成面团，与水果丁揉在一起。然后将面团煮成面包布丁块，并在上面撒上甜味剂。士兵们会称之为甜点。"

#. ~ Description of "canned pineapple"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Canned pineapple rings in water.  Quite tasty."
msgstr "糖水菠萝罐头，蛮好吃的。"

#. ~ Description of "Jerusalem artichoke fruit dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Chopped Jerusalem artichoke combined with any fruit that is in season or at hand.  Surprisingly tasty."
msgstr "切碎的洋姜与当季或者手头刚好有的水果结合在一起。出乎意料地美味。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated fruit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Dehydrated fruit flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will remain edible for an incredibly long time.  They are useful for several cooking recipes."
msgstr "一些片状脱水水果，如果储存妥善，这种干燥的食物可以保存非常长的时间。"

#. ~ Description of "fruit leather"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Dried strips of sugary fruit paste."
msgstr "一些甜甜的条状果泥干，由水果碾成泥再做成片状，利于保存，口感独特。"

#. ~ Description of "fruit jam"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Fresh fruit cooked with sugar to make it last longer."
msgstr "一些加糖熬煮后使保质期更长、更利于保存的酱状水果。"

#. ~ Description of "fruit in syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Fruit slices soaked in a sugar syrup to preserve freshness and appearance."
msgstr "水果片浸泡在糖水里，以保持新鲜和美观。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked blueberry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "It's like blueberry jam, only without sugar."
msgstr "这就像蓝莓果酱，只是不加糖。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked fruit"
