#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A Lachesis mutus pill, prepared through the dilution of the venom of the bushmaster snake with 10^1000 parts water.  These pills are claimed to be an effective treatment for sore throat."
msgstr "一片\"丛林王\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^1000份水稀释一份棕蛇毒液制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗咽喉肿痛。"

#. ~ Description of "broad-spectrum antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A broad-spectrum antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the spread of infection.  It contains nearly toxic levels of antibiotics, but can treat any bacterial infections you may encounter.  One dose lasts twelve hours."
msgstr "一份广谱抗生素，用于预防和治疗感染。带有一定毒性，但是能够治疗你能遇到的任何感染。一剂药持续十二小时。"

#. ~ Description of "antiparasitic drug"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A broad-spectrum chemical tablet designed to eliminate parasitic infestations in living creatures.  Though designed for use on pets and livestock, it will likely work on humans as well."
msgstr "一种广谱的抗寄生虫药片，用来清除生物体内的寄生虫。"

#. ~ Description of "skunk spray neutralizing solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A combination of hydrogen peroxide, baking soda, and dish soap that works together to transform skunk spray thiocetates into odorless acids."
msgstr "过氧化氢、小苏打和洗洁精的组合，共同作用将臭鼬喷雾硫代乙酸盐转化为无味的酸。"

#. ~ Description of "fluoxetine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A common and popular antidepressant.  It will elevate mood, and can profoundly alter the effects of other drugs.  It is only rarely habit-forming, though adverse reactions are not uncommon."
msgstr "一种广泛使用的广谱抗抑郁药物。可以使心情愉快，并强烈的影响其他药物的效果。只有极低的成瘾性，即使如此，不良反应也是挺普遍的。"

#. ~ Description of "antacid tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A common stomach soother in flavored tablet form.  Makes you less likely to vomit."
msgstr "一种常见的调味胃药，可以减轻你的呕吐情况。"

#. ~ Description of "debug chloroform soaked rag"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A debug item that lets you put NPCs (or yourself) to sleep."
msgstr "调试用物品，可让NPC或自己入睡。"

#. ~ Description of "alprazolam"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A fast-acting benzodiazepine with a powerful sedative effect.  It is dangerously addictive, and withdrawal from regular use should be gradual."
msgstr "一种起效迅速的苯二氮䓬类药物，具有强效镇静作用。具有危险的成瘾性，长期使用后应逐步戒断。"

#. ~ Description of "flavored bone meal tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Due to some sweeteners mixed in to counteract the powdery texture and the taste of ash, it's almost as palatable as the pre-Cataclysm tablets."
msgstr "一份用骨粉制成的自制钙补充剂。由于添加了甜味剂来抵消原本的粉状口感和骨灰味道，它现在几乎和大灾变前的药片一样可口。"

#. ~ Description of "bone meal tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Tastes horrible and is hard to swallow but it does its job."
msgstr "一份用骨粉制成的自制钙补充剂。尝起来口感很糟糕，很难下咽，但它起码管点用。"

#. ~ Description of "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A homeopathic pill, prepared through the repeated dilution of an active ingredient with water.  The label purports that these pills are able to maintain general wellness."
msgstr "一片顺势疗法药丸，通过用水反复稀释活性成分制成。标签上声称这些药片能保持身体总体健康。"

#. ~ Description of "Dakin's solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A makeshift antiseptic made from bleach and water.  The volatile chlorine compounds break down quickly, so it won't stay good for long."
msgstr "由漂白剂和水制成的临时防腐剂。  挥发性氯化合物会很快分解，因此不会长久保存。"

#. ~ Description of "cocaine topical cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A medical cream that provides both vascular restriction and anesthetic properties.  It won't get you high, but if used too frequently it may still be habit-forming."
msgstr "一种兼具血管收缩和麻醉效果的医用乳膏。它不会让你兴奋，但如果使用过于频繁，仍可能产生依赖。"

#. ~ Description of "cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A mixture of dried tobacco leaf, pesticides, and chemical additives, rolled into a filtered paper tube.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  Highly addictive and hazardous to health, but lung cancer is kind of the least of your concerns at this point."
msgstr "将制备好的干燥烟草和添加剂香料混合在一起，卷成一个纸卷，用来吸食。刺激感知，并降低食欲。高度容易上瘾并危害健康，至于肺癌之类的问题，起码现在你还不需要担心。"

#. ~ Description of "narrow-spectrum antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A narrow-spectrum antibiotic used to suppress infections and prevent them from spreading.  It isn't broad enough to purge most infections outright, but it boosts the body's resistance against them.  One dose lasts twelve hours."
msgstr "一种窄谱抗生素，用于预防和抑制感染。功效还不足以彻底治愈感染，但可增强体内免疫力。一剂药持续十二小时。"

#. ~ Description of "flu shot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A pharmaceutical flu shot designed for mass vaccinations, still in its packaging.  Purported to provide immunity to influenza, for the flu season for which it was developed."
msgstr "一支用于大规模疫苗接种的医用流感疫苗，尚未开封。旨在为出厂时的流感季节中流行的毒株提供免疫。"

#. ~ Description of "potassium iodide tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A potassium iodide tablet.  If taken prior to exposure, they help to mitigate injury caused by radiation absorption."
msgstr "一片碘化钾。在接触辐射前使用，可减少辐射产生的不良影响。"

#. ~ Description of "oxycodone"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A potent opioid pain relief medication in an immediate release tablet.  Oxycodone is highly addictive."
msgstr "一种强效阿片类止痛药，剂型为速释片。羟考酮具有高度成瘾性。"

#. ~ Description of "hemostatic powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A powdered antihemorrhagic compound that reacts with blood to immediately form a gel-like substance that stops bleeding."
msgstr "一些接触正在流血的伤口就立即形成一种能止血的凝胶状物质的止血粉。"

#. ~ Description of "antiseptic powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A powdered form of chemical antiseptic, this bismuth formic iodide cleans wounds quickly and painlessly."
msgstr "一些粉末形式的化学抗菌剂，这些碘化铋甲酸消毒粉可以轻松无痛的清洁伤口。"

#. ~ Description of "antiseptic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A powerful antiseptic commonly used to disinfect wounds."
msgstr "一份强效的抗菌剂，用于给伤口消毒。"

#. ~ Description of "antifungal drug"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A powerful chemical tablet designed to eliminate fungal infections in living creatures.  One dose lasts four hours."
msgstr "一种强力的化学药片，可以彻底清除生物体内的真菌感染。药效持续四小时。"

#. ~ Description of "lithium tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A prescription mood stabilizer in the form of lithium carbonate.  This drug has long been used to treat bipolar disorder, and if taken once daily, helps to dampen the severity of mood swings."
msgstr "一种处方情绪稳定剂，成分为碳酸锂。该药长期以来用于治疗双相情感障碍，每日服用一次有助于减轻情绪波动的严重程度。"

#. ~ Description of "dextroamphetamine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A prescription stimulant commonly prescribed for attention deficit disorder, often with levoamphetamine included.  It can be addictive if abused."
msgstr "一种处方兴奋剂，常用于治疗注意缺陷障碍，通常含有左旋安非他命。如滥用可能产生成瘾性。"

#. ~ Description of "zolpidem"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A prescription-strength sedative with a variety of psychoactive side effects.  Used in the treatment of insomnia."
msgstr "一种处方级镇静剂，具有多种精神活性副作用。用于治疗失眠。"

#. ~ Description of "hand-rolled cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A roll-your-own cigarette.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  Despite being hand crafted, it's still highly addictive and hazardous to health."
msgstr "一根你自己卷的香烟，刺激感知，并且降低进食欲望。即便自产自销，依旧无法掩盖会导致上瘾且有害健康的事实。"

#. ~ Description of "naloxone"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A small plastic device with a nozzle on one end and a plunger on the other.  The drug inside can be administered nasally to rapidly reverse and block the effect of opioids, which could save someone's life during an overdose."
msgstr "一种小型塑料装置，一端带有喷嘴，另一端带有推杆。内部的药物可通过鼻腔给药，迅速逆转并阻断阿片类药物的作用，在过量用药时可能挽救生命。"

#. ~ Description of "injectable iron"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A small vial of dark yellow liquid containing soluble iron for injection."
msgstr "一小瓶暗黄色的液体，含有可溶性铁元素的注射液。"

#. ~ Description of "vitamin C supplement"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A small white tablet promising more vitamin C than a human can conceivably absorb."
msgstr "一种白色的小药片所含的维生素 C 含量超过了人类的吸收量。"

#. ~ Description of "saline solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A solution of sterilized water and salt for intravenous infusion or washing contaminants from one's eyes."
msgstr "一份生理盐水溶液，可以用于静脉注射，或者冲洗眼中的污物。"

#. ~ Description of "opium tar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A sticky blob of painkiller derived from the poppy plant.  It lacks the potency of a modern pharmaceutical formulation, but is every bit as addictive."
msgstr "一种从罂粟植物中提取的粘稠止痛剂。它虽不及现代制药配方那般强效，但成瘾性却丝毫不弱。"

#. ~ Description of "diazepam"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A strong benzodiazepine drug used to treat muscle spasms, anxiety, seizures, and panic attacks."
msgstr "一种强大的苯二氮卓类药物，用于治疗肌肉痉挛、焦虑、癫痫和恐慌发作。"

#. ~ Description of "epinephrine autoinjector"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A syringe filled with a shot of epinephrine, also called adrenaline.  It serves as a powerful stimulant when you inject yourself with it.  Asthmatics can use it in an emergency to clear an asthma attack."
msgstr "一支装有肾上腺素（也叫肾上腺素）的注射器。注射后能起到强效兴奋剂的作用。哮喘患者在紧急情况下可用它来缓解哮喘发作。"

#. ~ Description of "tramadol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A tablet containing 50mg of a slow-acting opioid.  It is slow-acting and relatively mild, but will last much longer than other opioids."
msgstr "一种含有50毫克缓释阿片类药物的药片。其作用缓慢，相对温和，但持续时间比其他阿片类药物更长。"

#. ~ Description of "Prussian blue tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A tablet containing oxidized ferrous ferrocyanide salts.  Capable of purging nuclear contaminants from the body if taken after radiation exposure."
msgstr "含有亚铁氰化铁盐的药片。能够清除体内的核辐射污染，接触辐射后服用。"

#. ~ Description of "pink tab"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A tiny pink tabs resembling a postage stamp, dosed with some sort of drug.  Really only useful for entertainment.  Will cause hallucinations."
msgstr "类似邮票的粉红色小纸片，加入了某种药物。只是消遣性毒品，会引起幻觉。"

#. ~ Description of "calcium tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A white calcium tablet.  Widely used by elderly people with osteoporosis as a method to supplement calcium before the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"一种白色的钙片。在大灾变之前广泛用于给骨质疏松的老人补充钙质。\n"
"\"经过全新科技配方研制而成，一片顶五片儿，一口气上五楼不费劲儿。\""

#. ~ Description of "acetaminophen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Acetaminophen, a mild painkiller that works well in conjunction with NSAID-based painkillers like aspirin.  Take to relieve pain and swelling."
msgstr "对乙酰氨基酚是一种温和的止痛药，适合与阿司匹林等非甾体抗炎药搭配使用，可用于缓解疼痛和肿胀。"

#. ~ Description of "cough syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Acetaminophen, dextromethorphan HBr, and diphenhydramine served in the form of a foul-tasting syrup.  It promises to fight flu symptoms like coughs, fever, and body aches, and thanks to the inclusion of a potent antihistamine, it should fight allergies and put you to sleep as well."
msgstr "一种含有对乙酰氨基酚、氢溴酸右美沙芬和苯海拉明的口服液，味道不佳。宣称可对抗咳嗽、发热和身体酸痛等流感症状，且因含有强效抗组胺成分，还可缓解过敏并帮助入睡。"

#. ~ Description of "aspirin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Acetylsalicylic acid, an NSAID that can treat pain and fever.  It is a blood thinner, and may exacerbate bleeding."
msgstr "乙酰水杨酸，一种非甾体抗炎药，可治疗疼痛和发热。具有抗凝血作用，可能加重出血。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An Aesculus hippocastanum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of horse chestnut with 10^30 parts water.  These pills are meant to treat dysentery and hemorrhoids."
msgstr "一片\"七叶树\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^30份水稀释一份马栗制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗痛经和痔疮。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An Allium cepa homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one part onion with 10^30 parts water.  The label states that these pills can ameliorate symptoms of asthma, gastrointestinal disorders, and bronchitis.  You briefly wonder if it can cure fungal infections."
msgstr "一片\"洋葱\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^30份水稀释一份洋葱制成。标签声称这些药丸可以改善哮喘，胃肠道疾病和支气管炎的症状。你想知道它们是否可以治愈真菌感染。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An Arsenicum album homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one part arsenic trioxide with 10^24 parts water.  Purported to treat anxiety, various digestive disorders, and arsenic poisoning."
msgstr "一片\"白砷\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^24份水稀释一份三氧化二砷制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗焦虑、各种消化系统疾病和砷中毒。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An Arum tryphillum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of the jack-in-the-pulpit plant with 10^30 parts water.  The label claims that the pills are able to treat voice loss."
msgstr "一片\"阿鲁姆泰菲利姆\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^30份水稀释一份黄花菖蒲制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗失音症状。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An Oscillococcinum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one part duck offal with 10^400 parts water.  The label purports that these pills are able to treat flu-like symptoms and maintain general wellness."
msgstr "一片\"欧斯洛可舒能\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^400份水稀释一份鸭内脏制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗类似流感症状并保持身体健康。"

#. ~ Description of "morphine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An addictive narcotic used to treat intense pain in hospital settings.  You'll need a syringe to inject it, but it will take effect almost immediately."
msgstr "一种用于医院环境中治疗剧烈疼痛的成瘾性麻醉剂。你需要注射器来使用它，但药效几乎会立即生效。"

#. ~ Description of "nicotine patch"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An adhesive patch that promises to fight cravings and help smokers quit by slowly delivering nicotine into the body over the course of 16 hours as a replacement for smoking."
msgstr "一种透皮贴剂，宣称可通过在16小时内缓慢向体内释放尼古丁来替代吸烟，从而帮助吸烟者抑制烟瘾并戒烟。"

#. ~ Description of "Panaceus"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An apple-red gel capsule the size of your thumbnail, filled with a thick, oily liquid that shifts from black to purple at unpredictable intervals, flecked with tiny gray dots.  Given the place you got it from, it's either very potent, or highly experimental.  Holding it, all the little aches and pains seem to fade, just for a moment…"
msgstr "一颗红如苹果的胶囊，和你拇指甲差不多大小，内部充满了一种厚厚的油状液体，这种液体毫无规律地从黑色变成紫色，上面布满了灰色小点。从你获得它的地方看来，它要么有特别的药效，要么就是实验用品。那怕只是将它握在手中一瞬间，你都觉得一切疼痛仿佛消失了一般……"

#. ~ Description of "injectable prophylactic antivenom"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An experimental, cutting-edge antivenom in the form of a small amber vial, designed to be injected a few hours before venom exposure.  It was developed in top secret by the military in response to increasing biological/chemical warfare."
msgstr "一种实验性的尖端抗毒药，装在琥珀色的小型玻璃管内，用于在暴露于毒素下的几小时前注射。军方在不断增加的生化战争威胁下秘密开发了这一药物。"

#. ~ Description of "heroin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An extremely strong opioid narcotic derived from morphine.  It is incredibly addictive, the risk of overdose is extreme, and the drug is contraindicated for nearly all medical purposes."
msgstr "一种提取自吗啡的非常强大的阿片类麻醉药物。非常容易上瘾，过量使用时会有致命危险，它被禁用于几乎所有医疗用途。"

#. ~ Description of "wintergreen oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An ointment infused with wintergreen oil.  Has mild antiseptic properties, and can ease the pain caused by wounds."
msgstr "一份加入了冬青油的软膏。具有微弱的抗菌作用，可以缓解受伤引起的疼痛。"

#. ~ Description of "codeine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An opioid in tablet form, used in the suppression of pain, cough, and other ailments.  While relatively weak for a narcotic, it is still addictive, with a potential for overdose."
msgstr "一种片剂形式的阿片类药物，用于抑制疼痛、咳嗽及其他症状。虽然作为麻醉剂而言相对较弱，但仍有成瘾性，并存在过量使用的风险。"

#. ~ Description of "diphenhydramine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An over-the-counter allergy medication.  These tablets are meant to be taken once per day and can cause drowsiness."
msgstr "一种非处方抗过敏药物。这些药片需每日服用一次，可能引起嗜睡。"

#. ~ Description of "melatonin tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "An over-the-counter melatonin supplement.  One tablet before bed is commonly recommended to improve sleep quality, especially for those suffering from sleep deprivation."
msgstr "一种非处方褪黑激素补充剂。  通常建议睡前服用一粒药片以改善睡眠质量，特别是对于那些睡眠不足的人。"

#. ~ Description of "chlorpromazine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Anti-psychotic medication.  Used to stabilize brain chemistry, it can arrest hallucinations and other symptoms of psychosis.  Carries a sedative effect."
msgstr "抗精神病药物。用来稳定大脑内化学平衡，可以用于抑制幻觉和精神分裂。有镇静效果。"

#. ~ Description of "antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the spread of infection.  It's the safest way to cure any infections you might have.  One dose lasts twelve hours."
msgstr "用于阻隔感染传播的抗菌药物，可安全治愈任何感染。一剂持续十二小时。"

