#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "bifocal transition contact lenses
#. (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "bifocal contact lenses (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "bifocal transition contact lenses
#. (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "plano transition contact lenses
#. (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "plano transition contact lenses
#. (daily)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Apply contact lenses"
msgstr "戴隐形眼镜"

#. ~ Description of "cattail jelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Clear jelly harvested from cattails.  Can be used to protect a wound from contamination, and works as a painkiller."
msgstr "从香蒲秆中获得的透明凝胶，可保护伤口免受污染，并且能当作止痛剂使用。"

#. ~ Description of "cannabis shatter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular style of concentrate is in a thin sheet and shatters like glass at room temperature.  Arguably one of the better styles of concentrate compared to wax, crumble, or distillate.  Normal cannabis contains around 20% THC; this shatter should be around 55% THC."
msgstr "一份高度浓缩的大麻精油，又被称为大麻脂。这种精油在室温下凝聚成薄片状，像玻璃一样易碎。与大麻蜡，大麻粉或大麻提取液相比，它可以说是一种更好的浓缩方式。普通大麻的THC含量约为20%，而这块大麻脂的THC含量至少在55%左右。"

#. ~ Description of "cannabis wax"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular style of concentrate is yellow and waxy at room temperature.  Normal cannabis contains around 20% THC; this wax should be around 45% THC."
msgstr "一份高度浓缩的大麻精油，又被称为大麻脂。这种特殊的浓缩液在室温下呈黄色蜡状。普通大麻的THC含量约为20%，而这块大麻蜡的THC含量至少在45%左右。"

#. ~ Description of "cannabis distillate"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Concentrated cannabis extract.  This style of extract goes through the most processing, eliminating most if not all harmful ingredients.  Normal cannabis contains around 20% THC; this distillate should be around 88% THC.  Can be smoked using a refillable electronic cigarette."
msgstr "一份高度浓缩的大麻精油。这种精油经过了最多步骤的加工处理，去除了几乎所有有害成分。普通大麻的THC含量约为20%，而这种大麻提取液的THC含量至少在88%左右。可以用可重新填充的电子烟吸食。"

#. ~ Description of "bismuth subsalicylate"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Creamy pink syrup that tastes of bubblegum and chalk.  It is used to treat digestive issues such as nausea and heartburn."
msgstr "一种粉红色乳状糖浆，带有泡泡糖和白垩土的味道。用于治疗恶心和胃灼热等消化问题。"

#. ~ Description of "cocaine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Crystalline extract of the coca leaf, or at least, a white powder with some of that in it.  It is a highly addictive stimulant."
msgstr "古柯叶的结晶提取物，或者至少是一种含有部分该成分的白色粉末。它是一种高度成瘾性的兴奋剂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Dakin's solution"
msgid_plural "Dakin's solution"
msgstr[0] "达金溶液"

#. ~ Description of "non-drowsy cough syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Daytime cold and flu medication consisting primarily of dextromethorphan HBr and acetaminophen.  It promises to suppress coughing, aching, headaches and fever without causing excessive drowsiness."
msgstr "一种日间感冒和流感药物，主要成分为氢溴酸右美沙芬和对乙酰氨基酚。宣称可抑制咳嗽、疼痛、头痛和发热，且不会引起过度嗜睡。"

#. ~ Description of "crack"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Deprotonated cocaine crystals, incredibly addictive and deleterious to brain chemistry."
msgstr "高纯度的可卡因结晶，非常容易上瘾，容易伤害大脑。"

#. ~ Description of "hydrogen peroxide"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Dilute hydrogen peroxide, a liquid sold for household cleaning and first aid, though it's not the most effective antiseptic.  It foams a little when in contact with organic matter, but is otherwise harmless."
msgstr "稀释的过氧化氢，可当抗菌剂，或用来漂白头发与织物。与有机物接触时会轻微起泡，不过基本无害。"

#. ~ Description of "gummy vitamin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in a fruit-flavored chewy candy form.  An option of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  Excess use can cause hypervitaminosis."
msgstr "一些水果口味耐嚼软糖形式的基本膳食营养。当饮食营养不均衡时的最终解决方案，过多使用会导致维生素过多症。"

#. ~ Description of "multivitamin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in pill form.  An option of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  Excess use can cause hypervitaminosis."
msgstr "身体必需的各种膳食营养成分被方便地包装成丸状。是无法平衡饮食时的最后手段。过量使用可引起维生素过多症。"

#. ~ Description of "ibuprofen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Ibuprofen, a mild NSAID analgesic.  It relieves pain and swelling, but raises blood pressure more than other NSAIDs."
msgstr "布洛芬，一种温和的非甾体抗炎镇痛药。可缓解疼痛和肿胀，但相比其他非甾体抗炎药更易升高血压。"

#. ~ Description of "rolling tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Loose, fine-cut tobacco leaves.  Popular in Europe and among hipsters.  Highly addictive and hazardous to health.\n"
"Can either be rolled into a cigarette with some rolling papers or smoked through a pipe."
msgstr "松散，细切的烟叶。在欧洲和嬉皮士人群中流行。令人上瘾，对身体有害。可以卷成香烟或者找个大烟管直接开吸。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift antiseptic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Makeshift antiseptic made from ethanol.  It can be used to disinfect wounds, though it's not as effective as the real thing."
msgstr "由乙醇制成的临时防腐剂。  它可以用来消毒伤口，但效果不如真品。"

#. ~ Description of "joint"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a piece of paper and ready for smokin'."
msgstr ""
"一些大麻，或说是飞草，这是一个将之用纸卷起来随时可以抽的\"好东西\"。\n"
"\"$m0k3 W33d 3v3ryd@y（每迗磕大痲）——！\""

#. ~ Description of "metaprolol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Metaprolol, a classic beta blocker.  It lowers blood pressure and decouples heart rate from stressful events such as anxiety or pain."
msgstr "美托洛尔是一种典型的β-受体阻滞剂，可降低血压并避免焦虑或疼痛等压力导致的心率上升。"

#. ~ Description of "chewing tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Mint-flavored chewing tobacco.  While absolutely terrible for your health, it was once a favorite amongst baseball players, cowboys, and other macho types."
msgstr "薄荷味的咀嚼烟草。虽然对你的健康十分不利，它曾经是棒球运动员，牛仔，或者其他的男子汉最喜欢的食物之一。"

#. ~ Description of "naproxen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Naproxen, a slow-acting over-the-counter pain medicaton.  It takes up to an hour to kick in, but lasts longer than other NSAIDs."
msgstr "萘普生，一种非处方缓释止痛药。需长达一小时才能起效，但持续时间比其他非甾体抗炎药更长。"

#. ~ Description of "caffeine pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Once favored by truckers and students who couldn't get a prescription and didn't want to break the law, of these pills is equivalent to a strong cup of coffee."
msgstr "一种曾深受卡车司机和学生青睐的药片，他们既无法获得处方，又不想违法。每片效果相当于一杯浓咖啡。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Panaceus"
msgid_plural "Panaceii"
msgstr[0] "万能药"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Prussian blue tablet"
msgid_plural "Prussian blue tablets"
msgstr[0] "普鲁士蓝药片"

#. ~ Description of "cigar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Rolled, cured tobacco leaf, addictive and hazardous to health."
msgstr ""
"一份卷式烤烟，会上瘾，对身体有害。\n"
"\"绅士大亨们经常一边抽着这玩意一边高谈阔论。\""

#. ~ Description of "bifocal contact lenses (daily)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Small plastic case with two daily-use soft contact lenses, buffered in saline solution.  They are a great replacement for wearing glasses and sit comfortably on the surface of the eye.  The lenses are designed to help anyone with <color_light_blue>both nearsightedness and farsightedness</color>, and should be discarded after <color_light_blue>16 hours</color> of use."
msgstr "小塑料盒，装有两片日常使用的软性隐形眼镜，缓冲在盐水溶液中。  它们是佩戴眼镜的绝佳替代品，并且舒适地放置在眼睛表面。  这些镜片旨在帮助任何<color_light_blue>近视和远视</color>的人，并且应在使用<color_light_blue>16小时</color>后丢弃。"

#. ~ Description of "myopia contact lenses (daily)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Small plastic case with two daily-use soft contact lenses, buffered in saline solution.  They are a great replacement for wearing glasses and sit comfortably on the surface of the eye.  They sit comfortably on the surface of the eye.  The lenses are designed to help anyone with <color_light_blue>nearsightedness</color>, and should be discarded after <color_light_blue>16 hours</color> of use."
msgstr "小塑料盒，装有两片一次性的软性隐形眼镜，用盐水溶液缓冲。 它们是佩戴眼镜的绝佳替代品，并且舒适地放置在眼睛表面。 它们舒适地位于眼睛表面。 这些镜片旨在帮助任何患有<color_light_blue>近视</color>的人，并且应在使用<color_light_blue>16 小时</color>后丢弃。"

