#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Small plastic case with two extended-wear soft contact lenses, buffered in saline solution.  This high-tech pair darkens in response to light, making it easier to see in bright environments.  They sit comfortably on the surface of the eye.  The lenses are designed to help anyone with <color_light_blue>nearsightedness</color>, and should be discarded after <color_light_blue>a week</color> of use."
