#. ~ Description of "mugwort oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Some essential oil made from mugwort, which may kill parasites when ingested.  Consume it with water!"
msgstr "从艾蒿中提取出来的一些精油。可以口服，用以驱除体内的寄生虫。用水送服！"

#. ~ Description of "thyme oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Some essential oil made from thyme, which can act as a mildly irritating antiseptic."
msgstr "从百里香中提取的精油，可以作为轻度刺激性的抗菌剂。"

#. ~ Description of "saline eye drops"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Sterile saline eye drops.  Can be used to treat dry eyes, or to wash out contaminants."
msgstr "无菌的生理盐水滴眼液，可以用来治疗眼部干燥，也可以洗掉进入眼中的污染物。"

#. ~ Description of "nicotine gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Sugar-free chewing gum that slowly delivers nicotine over the course of an hour.  It's designed for smokers who want to quit, but that doesn't mean it can't be habit-forming."
msgstr "一种无糖口香糖，可在长达一小时内缓慢释放尼古丁。专为想戒烟的吸烟者设计，但这并不意味着它不会产生依赖。"

#. ~ Description of "caffeinated chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Sugar-free chewing gum with added caffeine.  It's a nice pick-me-up, one stick is equivalent to a strong cup of tea."
msgstr "添加了咖啡因的无糖口香糖。不错的提神方式，一条口香糖抵得上一杯浓茶。"

#. ~ Description of "marijuana"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "The dried flower buds and leaves harvested from a psychoactive variety of hemp plant.  Used to reduce nausea, relieve pain, sleep easier, and elevate mood.  It can be habit-forming."
msgstr "干燥后的花蕾、叶子，采集自各种大麻植物。用来减轻恶心，刺激食欲，提升心情值。它可以致瘾，并可能有不良反应。"

#. ~ Description of "electronic cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "This battery-operated device vaporizes a liquid that contains flavorings and nicotine.  A less harmful alternative to traditional cigarettes, but it's still addictive.  It can't be reused once it's empty."
msgstr "这个电池驱动的装置将尼古丁和调味剂的混合液蒸腾起来，虽然比燃烧型的卷烟伤害低一点，但是同样上瘾。它是一次性使用的，耗尽后无法复装。"

#. ~ Description of "crystal meth"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Tiny crystals of methamphetamine, one of the most potent and addictive stimulants around.  This sample is quite pure and should lead to a strong, reliable high."
msgstr "甲基苯丙胺的微小晶体，是目前最强效、最具成瘾性的兴奋剂之一。这批样品纯度很高，应能带来强烈而稳定的欣快感。"

#. ~ Description of "speed"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Tiny off-white crystals of methamphetamine.  Their coloration suggests dubious purity, but even poor-quality meth is still one of the post potent and addictive stimulants around."
msgstr "微小的灰白色甲基苯丙胺晶体。其色泽暗示纯度存疑，但即便品质低劣，它仍是现存最强烈且最具成瘾性的兴奋剂之一。"

