#. ~ Description of "crustacean infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid " A red colored mutagenic infusion."
msgstr "一种红色的诱变剂引物。"

#. ~ Description of "chimera mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A chemical slurry that seems to change color in the light."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，看起来有点畏惧光线。"

#. ~ Description of "crustacean mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A crustacean mutagen."
msgstr "一种甲壳诱变剂。"

#. ~ Description of "antimutagenic purgative"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A dangerous infusion that binds to mutagen present in the bloodstream and allows it to be excreted.  Violently."
msgstr "一种与血液中的诱变剂结合并使其排出体外的危险疗法。"

#. ~ Description of "misshapen fetus"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A deformed human fetus.  Eating this would be the most vile thing you can think of, and just might cause you to mutate."
msgstr "一个原本可以成为人类但畸形了的胚胎，看上去恶心极了。有勇气吃掉它的人，很可能发生某种变化。"

#. ~ Description of "sylvan mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A glittering green-black liquid."
msgstr "晶莹的绿黑色液体"

#. ~ Description of "mutated leg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A malformed human leg.  This would be gross to eat, and probably cause mutations."
msgstr ""
"一条有着病态颜色的人类生物的畸形大腿，食用后会导致DNA变异。\n"
"\"散发着令人作呕的味道。\""

#. ~ Description of "mutated arm"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A misshapen human arm.  Eating this would be incredibly disgusting and probably cause you to mutate."
msgstr "变异的人类手臂，丧心病狂的人才去吃，吃了后会恶心，并且导致DNA突变。"

#. ~ Description of "chiropteran mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A murky black liquid that smells of blood."
msgstr "一种浑浊的黑色液体，闻起来有血腥味。"

#. ~ Description of "cephalopod infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion as black as ink."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出像墨水一样的黑色。"

#. ~ Description of "beast infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion as red as a matador's cape."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出像斗牛士斗篷一样的红色。"

#. ~ Description of "canine infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion as white as a full moon."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出如满月般的白色。"

#. ~ Description of "murine infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion colored a dull gray-brown."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出青草的绿色。"

#. ~ Description of "alpha infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion strongly resembling blood."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出像鲜血一样颜色。"

#. ~ Description of "chimera infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that churns with iridescence."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出混合在一起的彩虹色。"

#. ~ Description of "chiropteran infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that looks and smells like blood."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，看上去像是一滩菠菜糊。"

#. ~ Description of "medical infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that looks like a mixture of bodily fluids."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，看上去像是各种体液的混合物。"

#. ~ Description of "batrachian infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that looks like pond water… are the shadows in it moving?"
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，看上去像是池水……里面的阴影在动吗？"

#. ~ Description of "plant infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that looks like pureed spinach."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，看上去像是一滩菠菜糊。"

#. ~ Description of "slime infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that seems to jiggle slightly."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，看起来有点畏惧光线。"

#. ~ Description of "troglobite infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that seems to recoil from the light."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，看起来有点畏惧光线。"

#. ~ Description of "theropod infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that seems to shift slightly whenever you look at it."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，看上去像是一滩菠菜糊。"

#. ~ Description of "reptilian infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that shifts between various shades of green."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，在不同深浅的绿色之间变幻。"

#. ~ Description of "insect infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that's a beautiful amber color."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出美丽的琥珀色。"

#. ~ Description of "rattine infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that's a rather unappealing beige."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出毫无吸引力的米黄色。"

#. ~ Description of "ursine infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion that's the color of honey, and is just as thick."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出蜂蜜色，也同蜂蜜一般的浓稠。"

#. ~ Description of "bovoid infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion the color of grass."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出青草的绿色。"

#. ~ Description of "piscine infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion the color of the ocean, with white foam at the top."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出大海一般深邃的蓝色。"

#. ~ Description of "avian infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion the color of the pre-Cataclysmic skies."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出大灾变前天空的颜色。"

#. ~ Description of "aranean infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion with pale filaments suspended in it."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，里面隐约悬浮着一些白色的丝状物。"

#. ~ Description of "gastropod infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion with the consistency of snot."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，看上去像鼻涕一样浓稠。"

#. ~ Description of "sylvan infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion, glittering moss green."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出引人注目的森林绿色。"

#. ~ Description of "feline infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion, yellow and highly reflective."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出反光度相当高的黄色。"

#. ~ Description of "abstract IV mutagen flavor"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed mutagenic infusion."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物。"

#. ~ Description of "mutagenic infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A processed, purified, and condensed dose of mutagenic drugs.  This will cause you to acquire random mutations over time."
msgstr "一剂经过加工、纯化与浓缩的诱变药物。将随时间推移使你获得随机变异。"

#. ~ Description of "abstract mutagen flavor"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A rare substance of uncertain origins.  Causes you to mutate."
msgstr "一种罕见的未知来源物质，会导致你基因变异。"

#. ~ Description of "batrachian mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A shadowy mutagen that looks like it might be full of tiny swimming tadpoles."
msgstr "内含许多阴影的诱变剂，看起来好像里面满是游来游去的小蝌蚪。"

#. ~ Description of "mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A syrupy black goop that reeks of noxious chemicals.  Drinking this may cause you to mutate randomly."
msgstr "一种散发着有害化学气味的黑色粘稠糖浆。喝下它可能会使你发生随机变异。"

#. ~ Description of "gastropod mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A thick, colorless slime."
msgstr "粘稠无色粘液"

#. ~ Description of "congealed blood"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A thick, soupy red liquid.  It looks and smells disgusting, and seems to bubble with an intelligence of its own…"
msgstr "浓稠黏糊的红色液体。看着闻着都恶心，而且仿佛有生命一般地冒着泡……"

#. ~ Description of "lagomorph mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A whitish fluid that smells of fresh-cut grass."
msgstr "一种略带白色的液体，闻起来有新鲜割草的味道。"

#. ~ Description of "purifier smart shot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "An experimental stem cell treatment, offering limited control over which mutations are purified.  The liquid sloshes strangely inside of this syringe."
msgstr "一种实验性干细胞治疗剂，能够有限地指定所要被净化的变异特性。注射器里的液体正奇怪地在针管内晃动。"

#. ~ Description of "alpha mutagen"
#. ~ Description of "theropod mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "An extremely rare mutagen cocktail."
msgstr "一种极度罕见的混合诱变剂。"

#. ~ Description of "lagomorph infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "An orange colored mutagenic infusion."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，呈现出橙色。"

#. ~ Description of "purifier"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "This chunky, flesh-hued liquid helps revert the mutated to baseline humanity, but cannot remove active mutagen present in the bloodstream.  Not for use on animals."
msgstr "这种粘稠的血色液体有助于将变异后的人类恢复到原始状态，但无法去除血液中的诱变剂。不适合用于其他动物。"

#. ~ Description of "purifier infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "This thick, flesh-hued injection does wonders for returning mutants to humanity, but cannot remove active mutagens from the bloodstream.  Not for use on animals."
msgstr "这种粘稠的血色液体有助于将变异后的人类恢复到原始状态，但无法去除血液中的诱变剂。不适合用于其他动物。"

