#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "A French lung dish, made by poaching the lungs before pan-frying them with onion, tomato, seasonings, and a generous amount of wine."
msgstr "一种法式肺脏料理，先将肺煮熟，然后与洋葱、番茄、调味料和大量葡萄酒一起煎。"

#. ~ Description of "töttchen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "A German peasant dish that converts many less-desirable meat cuts and organs into a palatable meal with the liberal application of butter, sugar, and wine."
msgstr "一种德国农家菜，将许多不太受欢迎的肉块和器官变为可口的菜肴，主要是靠大量使用黄油、糖和酒。"

#. ~ Description of "liver & onions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "A classic way to serve liver."
msgstr "一道经典的食用肝脏的菜式。"

#. ~ Description of "deviled kidney"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious way to prepare kidneys, originating from Victorian England.  You had to make some substitutions in the devilling sauce, but it still came out damn good."
msgstr "一种烹饪肾脏的美味方法，起源于维多利亚时代的英国。虽然你只能用别的调料来替代\"魔鬼酱\"，但最后的味道依然很棒。"

#. ~ Description of "leverpostej"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "A traditional Danish pate.  Probably better if you spread it on some bread."
msgstr "一种传统丹麦菜肴，采用绞碎的内脏肉制成的肉酱。最好是抹在面包上吃。"

#. ~ Description of "humble pie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Also known as 'Umble' pie, made with chopped organ meats.  Not half bad, and full of vitamins!"
msgstr "又被称为\"卑微者的馅饼\"，采用切碎的内脏做馅。虽然在以前只有地位低微的人会吃，但尝起来还不赖，甚至还充满了维生素！"

#. ~ Description of "scrambled eggs and brain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Brain and eggs, why didn't you ever think to put these together?"
msgstr "脑花加蛋，以前怎么就没想到把它们凑一对儿呢？"

#. ~ Description of "stuffed heart"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Chunks of heart filled with vegetables and spices."
msgstr "充满蔬菜和香料的心形块状物。"

#. ~ Description of "canned heart"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Chunks of heart preserved in a can."
msgstr "罐装保存的心脏块。"

#. ~ Description of "fried brain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "I don't know what you were expecting.  It's brain.  It's deep-fried.  Enjoy!"
msgstr "你可别对它抱太大期望了。这依然是个脑子，只是被油炸了一遍，好好享受吧！"

#. ~ Description of "canned liver"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Livers preserved in a can.  Chock-full of B vitamins!"
msgstr "在罐子里密封保存的肝脏。富含维生素B！"

#. ~ Description of "grilled sweetbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Not sweet like the name would suggest, but delicious all the same!"
msgstr "吃起来一点也不甜，但仍然美味。（注：杂碎英文被称为sweetbread）"

#. ~ Description of "sausage casing"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Sausage casings made from animal intestines.  Ready to be used for forming meat products."
msgstr "用动物的肠子制成的肠衣，可以用来装香肠。"

#. ~ Description of "artificial sausage casing"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Sausage casings made from plastic bags.  Ready to be used for forming meat products."
msgstr "用塑料制成的肠衣，可以用来装香肠。"

#. ~ Description of "deep-fried tripe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Some people don't enjoy the taste or texture of organ meat, so deep-frying is a great way to disguise both."
msgstr "有些人不喜欢内脏肉的味道或质地，所以油炸是解决这种问题的好方法。"

#. ~ Description of "stewed tripe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Stomach lining, cut up and stewed for an hour in broth.  Better than it sounds."
msgstr "胃，切碎，放进汤里慢慢煨，吃起来比听起来更美味。"

#. ~ Description of "fried heart"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Tasty deep-fried heart, retaining most of its texture and gaining that delicious fried taste."
msgstr "美味可口的油炸心脏，保留了大部分原始口感，同时增添了诱人的焦香风味。"

#. ~ Description of "fried liver"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Tasty deep-fried liver, a Southern delicacy."
msgstr "美味的炸猪肝，一道南方美食。"

#. ~ Description of "faux gras"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Though this meal is technically not foie gras, you have a feeling neither the French nor animal rights groups are likely to criticize it now."
msgstr "虽然不是真正字面上的\"鹅\"肝酱，但你感觉，无论是法国人还是动保组织，现在都不太可能以任何方式批评它。"

