msgstr "尼古丁浓缩液"

#. ~ Description of "48x-"Locutus""
#: data/json/items/comestibles/serums.json
msgid "Little, sealed ampule with some white, semi-transparent liquid of unknown origin.  Label on it says \"48x-\"Locutus\"\", whatever that means."
msgstr "密封的小安瓿，里面有一些来源不明的白色半透明液体。  上面的标签写着“48x-“Locutus””，不管是什么意思。"

#. ~ Description of "bone broth"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A broth made from boiling bones, with vinegar added to extract more calcium."
msgstr "用骨头熬制的肉汤，味道鲜美，营养丰富，醋的加入从骨头中提取出了更多的钙质。"

#. ~ Description of "three sisters stew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A hearty stew made of the traditional 'three sisters' plants corn, beans, and pumpkins.  Variations of this dish were a staple of many Native American cultures through the centuries up until current times.  This Abenaki recipe has wild rice added to it."
msgstr "由玉米、豆子和南瓜制成的炖菜。美洲土著人发现，将这三种植物混搭种植可以增加收成，称之为\"三姐妹\"。几个世纪以来，这道菜的演化同样见证着许多美洲土著文化的变迁。在这个来自阿贝内基的食谱中，还在其中加入了野生稻米。"

#. ~ Description of "blood soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A mushy, brown semi-liquid soup made from blood and flour."
msgstr "一份糊状的、棕色的粘稠羹汤，由血液和面粉制成。"

#. ~ Description of "mushroom soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A mushy, gray semi-liquid soup made from mushrooms."
msgstr "灰色的半流体，看来放了不少蘑菇。"

#. ~ Description of "fish soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious hearty fish soup."
msgstr "一份营养丰富且美味的鱼汤。"

#. ~ Description of "meat soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious hearty meat soup."
msgstr "一份营养丰富且美味的肉汤。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious hearty vegetable soup."
msgstr "一份营养丰富且美味的蔬菜汤。"

#. ~ Description of "woods egg soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious soup packed with eggs and vegetables."
msgstr "一份营养丰富的美味炖汤，里面有蛋和蔬菜。"

#. ~ Description of "woods meat soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious soup packed with meat and vegetables."
msgstr "一份营养丰富的美味炖汤，里面有肉和蔬菜。"

#. ~ Description of "Cullen skink"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A rich and tasty fish chowder from Scotland, made with preserved fish and creamy milk."
msgstr "一道苏格兰传统美食，由美味的浓鱼汤配以熏鱼及奶油制成。"

#. ~ Description of "lobster stew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A rich and tasty lobster stew from New England, made with fresh lobster, milk, cream, and butter."
msgstr "一道来自新英格兰的美味龙虾炖菜，由新鲜龙虾、牛奶、奶油和黄油制成。"

#. ~ Description of "chicken and dumplings"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A soup with chicken chunks and balls of dough.  Not bad."
msgstr "罐装鸡汤，能看到鸡块和小面团。味道不错。"

#. ~ Description of "curry with meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A spicy South Asian dish filled with chunks of meat and vegetables."
msgstr "一种辛辣的南亚菜肴，里面有肉块和蔬菜。"

#. ~ Description of "curry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A spicy South Indian dish filled with vegetables."
msgstr "一种充满蔬菜的辛辣菜肴，源自印度南部。"

#. ~ Description of "hellfire stew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "An old recipe from the American Civil War, designed to make hardtack more palatable.  The hardtack is crushed and combined with water to make it soggy, then fried up with melted chunks of fat until browned, and seasoned with salt and pepper.  Surprisingly edible, considering its ingredients."
msgstr "美国内战时期的老菜谱，旨在使压缩饼干更加美味。将压缩饼干碾碎并与水混合使其变湿，然后用融化的脂肪块煎至棕色，并用盐和胡椒调味。尽管成分十分奇怪，但味道意外地不错。"

#. ~ Description of "chicken noodle soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Chicken chunks and noodles swimming in a salty broth.  Rumored to help cure colds."
msgstr ""
"一份鸡丁和面条泡在咸味肉汤里，美味，据说可以帮助治愈感冒。\n"
"\"再好的鸡汤也无法治愈灾变带来的心灵创伤。\""

#. ~ Description of "tomato soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Condensed tomato soup.  Not very filling, but it goes well with grilled cheese."
msgstr "清淡的红番茄汤。不太饱肚子，但加上烤奶酪就能当午餐了。"

