msgstr[0] "卡伦浓汤"

#. ~ Description of "instant chicken noodle soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Instant chicken noodle soup made from dehydrated noodles and chicken reconstituted with water.  Not the most exciting meal but better than plain water."
msgstr "一份即食鸡汤方便面，由脱水面饼和脱水鸡肉加水调制而成。这算不上让人振奋的一餐，但总比白开水好。"

#. ~ Description of "instant chicken noodle soup powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Instant chicken noodle soup powder made from dehydrated noodles and chicken.  Mix with water to create a mildly improved meal."
msgstr "即食鸡肉方便面调料，由脱水面饼和脱水鸡肉制成。与开水混合后，可以制成稍稍改善的一餐。"

#. ~ Description of "instant spring vegetable soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Instant spring vegetable soup made from dehydrated noodles and vegetables reconstituted with water.  Not the most exciting meal but better than plain water."
msgstr "一份即食春菜汤方便面，由脱水面饼和脱水蔬菜加水调制而成。这算不上让人振奋的一餐，但总比白开水好。"

#. ~ Description of "instant spring vegetable soup powder"
