msgid_plural "sugar"
msgstr[0] "糖"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "thyme"
msgid_plural "thyme"
msgstr[0] "百里香"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "wild herbs"
msgid_plural "wild herbs"
msgstr[0] "野生药草"

#. ~ Description of "Melitzanosalata"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A Greek eggplant dip.  The eggplants are baked until almost falling apart and seasoned with a big help of garlic, then mixed with some oil and acid."
msgstr "一道希腊茄子沙拉，将茄子烤到几乎散开，然后用大量大蒜调味，最后混合少许油和柠檬汁。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled lotus root"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A boiled lotus rhizome, with a soft taste."
msgstr "煮熟的莲藕，口感柔和。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled potato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A boiled potato or other tuber, the keystone of comfort food."
msgstr "一个煮熟的土豆（或者其它块茎作物），舒适食品的基石。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted chili pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A chili pepper that has been roasted on high heat, with the skin removed.  This has taken out most of the spice, and it's much better than eating it raw."
msgstr "一份经过高温烤制并去皮的辣椒。已经去掉了大部分的辣味，而且比生吃要好得多。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked cattail stalk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A cooked stalk from a cattail plant.  Its fibrous outer leaves have been stripped away, and now it is quite delicious."
msgstr "一根煮熟的香蒲的草秆，坚韧的外皮和叶子都已经被剥除，非常美味。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked plant stalk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A cooked stalk from a plant.  Its fibrous outer leaves have been stripped away, and now it is quite delicious."
msgstr "一份做熟的植物茎杆。它的纤维状外层叶子已被剥去，现在它非常美味。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked bell pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A cored and cooked bell pepper.  It is far more enjoyable now that the seeds are removed."
msgstr "一份去核并煮熟的灯笼椒。去掉籽之后吃起来更美味。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable samosa"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A crispy, savory pastry filled with spicy potatoes and vegetables, popular in Indian cuisine."
msgstr "一种香脆可口的糕点，里面充满了辛辣的土豆和蔬菜，在印度美食中很受欢迎。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated chili pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A dehydrated chili pepper.  Still not great, but you can easily ground or mill it into powder."
msgstr "一颗脱水的辣椒。作为食物而言仍不算好，但你可以将其轻松磨成粉末。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable pie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious baked pie with a tasty vegetable filling."
msgstr "一份填满美味蔬菜的烤馅饼。"

#. ~ Description of "baked potato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious baked potato or other tuber.  Got any sour cream?"
msgstr ""
"一个香气喷鼻的烤马铃薯（或者其它块茎作物）。\n"
"\"能淋上点酸奶油就好了。\""

#. ~ Description of "sauerkraut w/ sauteed onions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious sautee of lovely diced onions and sauerkraut.  The smell alone is enough to make your mouth water."
msgstr "美味的酸菜炒洋葱，单是气味就能让人口水直流。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable aspic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A dish in which vegetables are set into a gelatin made from a plant stock."
msgstr "一份用菜汤制成的一种冻状食物。"

#. ~ Description of "dried salad"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A dried salad packed in a box with mayonnaise and ketchup.  Add water to enjoy."
msgstr "包装在小盒子里的干燥沙拉和蛋黄酱、番茄汁，加入净水就能开始享用了。"

#. ~ Description of "insta-salad"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A dried salad with water added, not very tasty but still a decent substitution for real salad."
msgstr "泡好的方便沙拉，距离真正的沙拉还是有差距的，但是至少能吃。"

#. ~ Description of "glazed carrot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A grilled glazed carrot topped with aromatic herbs."
msgstr "经过油煎而表面发亮的胡萝卜，点缀有一些芳香的草药。简直是神来之笔。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated corn kernels"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A handful of dried corn kernels."
msgstr "一把脱水玉米粒。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked long-grain white rice."
msgstr "一份热腾腾香喷喷的米饭。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked wild rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked wild rice."
msgstr "一份热腾腾香喷喷的野生米饭。"

#. ~ Description of "nopalito"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A less prickly version of cactus pads."
msgstr "少刺的食用仙人掌，吃起来更\"顺滑\"。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted cattail rhizome"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A roasted root from a cattail plant.  Its fibrous outer core is charred black, so you can remove it and chew on the dry inside."
msgstr "一根烤熟的香蒲根茎，坚韧的外皮已经烧焦。你可以去掉烧焦的外皮后咀嚼内部的可食用部分。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable salad"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A salad made with all kind of vegetables."
msgstr "一盘什锦蔬菜沙拉，营养丰富。"

#. ~ Description of "beans and rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A serving of beans and rice that has been cooked together.  Delicious and healthy!"
msgstr "将豆子和大米放在一起煮，美味又健康。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked buckwheat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A serving of cooked buckwheat porridge.  Healthy and nutritious but bland."
msgstr "一份煮熟的荞麦粥。健康且营养丰富，但味道寡淡。"

#. ~ Description of "pickled vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A serving of crisply brined and canned vegetable matter.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "脆爽的腌蔬菜，美味又营养。"

#. ~ Description of "fried pickled vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A serving of fried pickled vegetables, tangy with a crunchy golden-brown coating."
msgstr "一份油炸泡菜，味道浓郁，外皮金黄酥脆。"

#. ~ Description of "sushi rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A serving of sticky vinegared rice, commonly used in sushi."
msgstr "制造寿司时使用的粘醋饭。"

#. ~ Description of "mashed pumpkin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A simple dish made by cooking pumpkin pulp and then mashing."
msgstr "将南瓜肉煮熟、捣碎，一份简单的菜肴——南瓜泥就完成了。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted carrot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A simple, tasty roasted carrot."
msgstr "简单而美味的烤胡萝卜。"

#. ~ Description of "pickle"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A small pickled cucumber.  Rather sour, but tastes good and lasts for a long time."
msgstr "一个腌黄瓜，酸酸甜甜，美味可口而且保质期很长。"

#. ~ Description of "tofu stirfry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A tofu stirfry with rice and a sweet, bold flavor."
msgstr "一道加了米饭的豆腐炒菜，口味浓郁偏甜。"

#. ~ Description of "onigiri"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A triangular block of tasty sushi rice with a healthy green vegetable folded around it."
msgstr "一块三角形的美味饭团，用一些绿色蔬菜包裹着。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable pizza"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A vegetarian pizza, with delicious tomato sauce and a fluffy crust.  Its smell brings back great memories."
msgstr ""
"一份蔬菜披萨，上面涂有美味的番茄酱和蓬松的面包片。\n"
"\"在很久以前我还可以悠闲的躺在摇摇椅上吃这块披萨。\""

#. ~ Description of "corn on the cob"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "An ear of corn cooked in foil."
msgstr "用锡纸包着烤熟的玉米棒。"

#. ~ Description of "kombu"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "An essential component of Japanese cuisine, this dried sheet of seaweed has hardened to the point of inedibility.  Boiled in water, it should make an excellent broth."
msgstr "作为日本料理的重要组成部分，这种干燥的海藻片已经硬化到无法食用的程度。  在水中煮沸，它应该成为优质的肉汤。"

#. ~ Description of "baked dahlia root"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Baking this dahlia root has broken down the starch, making it softer and sweeter."
msgstr "烤过的大丽花根已经分解了其中的部分淀粉，这使它变得更加柔软和香甜。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled fiddleheads"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Boiled fiddleheads.  Not bad, but would be better sauteed in butter."
msgstr "一份煮熟的蕨菜叶。吃起来还不差，但要是用点黄油煎一下就更棒了。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled ground nuts"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Boiled ground nuts.  They look and taste a little like potatoes, but with a slight nutty taste."
msgstr "煮熟的美国豆芋。它们的外观和味道有点像土豆，但带有轻微的坚果味。"

#. ~ Description of "mashed potato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Boiled potatoes mashed together with salt & oil."
msgstr "煮熟的土豆加盐和油捣碎。"

#. ~ Description of "canned corn"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Canned corn in water.  Eat up!"
msgstr "罐装玉米。吃掉它！"

#. ~ Description of "salsa"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Chopped tomatoes, spices, and any number of other vegetables, used as a condiment in Mexican food.  Not so good on its own, but great in a dish."
msgstr "切碎的番茄、香料、以及一些其它的蔬菜，用作墨西哥食物的调味品。单独吃不太好，但配着菜很棒。"

#. ~ Description of "succotash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Coming from a word meaning \"broken corn kernels\" in the language of the Narragansett, it is a popular dish during hard times and Thanksgiving in New England.  Incorporating maize and beans (or a similar legume), it is cheap and made from common ingredients."
msgstr "它来自纳拉甘塞特语中的\"碎玉米粒\"一词，在新英格兰的困难时期和感恩节期间是一道受欢迎的菜。它融合了玉米和黄豆（或类似的豆类），价格低廉，由普通原料制成。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked burdock greens"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked burdock leaves.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "一份煮熟的牛蒡叶片，美味且营养丰富，有助于健康。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked dandelion greens"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked leaves from wild dandelions.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "一份煮熟的蒲公英叶片，美味且营养丰富，有助于健康。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked wild vegetables"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked wild edible plants.  An interesting mix of flavors."
msgstr "一份摘挑后再煮熟的野菜，可以直接食用或用作其他料理之中。"

#. ~ Description of "pan roasted corn"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Corn roasted in a frying pan with herbs and spices."
msgstr "在煎锅里用香草和香料烤熟的玉米棒。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated garlic clove"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Dehydrated garlic.  You definitely don't want to eat these like this, but they can be milled or grounded into garlic powder."
msgstr "一份脱水的大蒜。你肯定不想直接这样干吃，但可以磨碎或磨成蒜粉。"

#. ~ Description of "dried rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Dehydrated long-grain rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually inedible when dry."
msgstr "脱水的长粒米。煮熟以后美味又营养，但是干燥状态几乎不能食用。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Dehydrated vegetable flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will remain edible for an incredibly long time."
msgstr "一些片状脱水蔬菜，如果储存妥善，这种干燥的食物可以保存非常长的时间。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable hosomaki"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Delicious chopped vegetables wrapped in tasty sushi rice and rolled up in a healthy green vegetable."
msgstr "将蔬菜切成小条然后用紫菜包起来的寿司卷。"

#. ~ Description of "fried rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Delicious fried rice with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "配有蔬菜的炒饭，美味又管饱。"

#. ~ Description of "tofu fried rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Delicious tofu fried rice with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "配有蔬菜的豆腐炒饭，美味又管饱。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted garlic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Exposed cloves of garlic that have been coated in oil and then roasted.  Much better than eating them raw."
msgstr "把大蒜剥瓣，涂上一层油，然后烤熟。比生吃美味多了。"

#. ~ Description of "dried starch"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Fibrous clumps of carbohydrate-rich paste extracted from a root vegetable.  Now that it's dry, it could be milled into flour."
msgstr "从根茎类蔬菜中提取的富含碳水化合物的糊状纤维团块。现已干燥，可研磨成面粉。"

#. ~ Description of "sauteed fiddleheads"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Fiddleheads sauteed in fat.  Tender and delicious."
msgstr "用油煎过的蕨菜。软嫩而美味。"

#. ~ Description of "prepared ground nuts"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Ground nuts that have been peeled and then boiled, to destroy the harmful protease inhibitors.  Safe to eat, but need further cooking to become palatable.  Can be used much like potatoes."
msgstr "去皮并煮熟的美国豆芋，其中有害的蛋白酶抑制剂已被破坏。可以安全食用，但需要进一步烹饪才能变得可口。烹饪方法和土豆差不多。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Melitzanosalata"
msgid_plural "Melitzanosalata"
msgstr[0] "希腊茄子沙拉"

#. ~ Description of "sauteed Jerusalem artichoke"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Most of this artichoke's inulin has been converted into fructose after cooking, and it now tastes pleasantly sweet."
msgstr "这种洋姜所含的大部分菊糖在烹饪后都转化为果糖，现在尝起来很甜。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted salsify"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Now that it's been properly cooked, this salsify tastes vaguely like oysters.  Makes a great side dish."
msgstr "这份已经烤熟的蒜叶婆罗门参，味道有点像牡蛎，是一道很好的配菜。"

#. ~ Description of "pesto"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Olive oil, basil, garlic, and pine nuts.  Simple and delicious."
msgstr "橄榄油，紫苏，大蒜，松子。简单而美味。"

#. ~ Description of "sauteed onions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Onions cooked up in oil and spices, often used as a topping or side in dishes."
msgstr "用油和香料煎过的洋葱，常用作其它菜的浇头或者配菜。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked bamboo shoots"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Peeled and cooked bamboo shoots.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "去皮煮熟的竹笋。美味又营养。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated fungus chunk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Pieces of strange-looking fungus that have been dried to prevent them from rotting away.  They are probably still not safe to eat."
msgstr "脱水保存以避免烂个精光的受感染的肉，但依然无法安全食用。"

#. ~ Description of "hominy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Popcorn kernels which have been cooked in an alkaline solution and then rinsed, making them better suited for eating or cooking."
msgstr "一些用碱性溶液煮熟并漂洗干净的爆米花碎粒，使其更适合食用或烹饪菜肴。"

#. ~ Description of "fried bamboo shoots"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Raw bamboo shoots that have been peeled, battered and deep-fried.  Very tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "把生竹笋去皮、裹上面粉后炸熟。美味且营养丰富。"

#. ~ Description of "dry wild rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Raw, milled wild rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually inedible when dry."
msgstr "生的、碾过的野生米。煮熟以后美味又营养，但是干燥状态几乎不能食用。"

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated chili pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Reconstituted chili pepper.  It isn't less spicy after dehydrating and rehydrating but it can be used to flavor your dishes again."
msgstr "一些脱水后再水发的辣椒，脱水再泡水后，它的辣味并没有减少，依然能为你的菜肴调味。"

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated corn kernels"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Reconstituted corn kernels, much more enjoyable to eat now that they have been rehydrated."
msgstr "一些脱水后再水发的玉米粒，泡过水再吃更美味了。"

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated garlic clove"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Reconstituted garlic cloves, much more edible than its dehydrated state, although the flavor and texture has changed in the process.  Can be used for recipes, albeit its shelf life is shortened by a great margin."
msgstr "一些脱水后再水发的蒜瓣，在加工过程中味道和口感发生了变化，但还是比脱水状态下可口多了。尽管保质期大大缩短，但仍可用于食谱。"

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Reconstituted vegetable flakes, which are much more enjoyable to eat now that they have been rehydrated."
msgstr "一些脱水后再水发的蔬菜片，泡过水再吃更美味了。"

#. ~ Description of "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Slow-cooked beans and rice with vegetables and seasonings.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "将慢火烹制的豆子与米饭一起烹调，配上蔬菜和调料。美味又管饱。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetarian baked beans"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Slow-cooked beans with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "慢火烹制的豆子，配有一些蔬菜，美味又管饱。"

#. ~ Description of "spaghetti al pesto"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Spaghetti with a generous helping of pesto on top.  Yum!"
msgstr "上面覆盖着厚厚一层香蒜酱的意大利面。非常好吃！"

#. ~ Description of "starch"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Sticky, gooey carbohydrate paste extracted from a root vegetable.  It will spoils rather quickly if not prepared for storage."
msgstr "从根茎类蔬菜中提取的粘稠碳水化合物糊状物。若未进行储存处理，会很快变质。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled Jerusalem artichoke"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Still crunchy but much more palatable than raw, with a slight nutty taste."
msgstr "煮熟的洋姜仍然很脆，但比生的更可口，还有一点坚果味。"

#. ~ Description of "succotash deluxe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Succotash, but made more modern and tasty by adding some flavorful ingredients."
msgstr "还是煮玉米菜豆，但是加了许多风味调料，使其更好看且美味了。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted cooking banana"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "The much less sweet and more starchy relative of the banana, that has been cooked to make it better suited for eating."
msgstr "香蕉的近亲，没那么甜，但淀粉含量更高，经过烹调后更适合食用。"

#. ~ Description of "sauerkraut"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "This crunchy, sour topping made from lettuce or cabbage is perfect for your hot dogs and hamburgers, or, if you're desperate, straight to your stomach."
msgstr "这种脆脆、酸酸的泡菜由莴苣或是卷心菜制成，配上热狗和汉堡就最完美了。不过紧要关头也可以直接吃下肚。"

#. ~ Description of "canned vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "This mushy pile of vegetable matter was boiled and canned in an earlier life.  Better eat it before it oozes through your fingers."
msgstr "一团被煮的稀烂的蔬菜，在刚煮熟的时候就用罐头封装密封。最好在它从你指缝渗光前吃掉。"

#. ~ Description of "cornmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "This yellow cornmeal is useful for baking."
msgstr "这黄色的玉米面可以用来做成面包。"

#. ~ Description of "salted vegetable chunk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Vegetable chunks pickled in a salt bath.  Goes well with burgers, if you can find one."
msgstr "一份盐浴蔬菜，配合汉堡味道更佳。"

#. ~ Description of "fried burdocks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Wild burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very tasty and nutritious."
msgstr ""
"一份将野生牛蒡裹上面粉后炸熟的面拖牛蒡，美味且营养丰富。\n"
"\"吃起来竟然一股鸡肉味！\""

#. ~ Description of "fried dandelions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Wild dandelion flowers that have been pan fried.  Very tasty and nutritious."
msgstr ""
"一份用平底锅煎熟的油煎蒲公英，美味且营养丰富。\n"
"\"吃起来竟然一股鸡肉味！\""

#. ~ Description of "fried dandelions and burdocks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Wild dandelions and burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very tasty and nutritious."
msgstr ""
"一份将野生蒲公英和牛蒡裹上面粉后炸熟的面拖蒲公英配牛蒡，美味且营养丰富。\n"
"\"吃起来竟然一股鸡肉味！\""

