#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A Thermos brand vacuum flask.  Built for temperature retention, helps keep things hot or cold.  Contains 1 L of liquid."
msgstr "一个膳魔师牌保温瓶。能够长时间保持瓶内温度，适用于各种冷热物品。能储存 1 升的液体。"

