#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A bag of vacuum-packed food."
msgstr "一包真空包装的食物。"

#. ~ Description of "large paper bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A big bag made of sturdy paper, great for everything from collecting yard waste to bulk storage of construction materials."
msgstr "由坚固的纸制成的大袋子，非常适合从收集庭院垃圾到大量存储建筑材料等各种用途。"

#. ~ Description of "cement bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A big bag made of woven plastic.  Simple instructions printed on the side explain how to make mortar for all your masonry needs."
msgstr "一个由编织塑料制成的大袋子。  侧面印有简单的说明，解释了如何制作满足您所有砖石需求的砂浆。"

