#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A bright orange plastic bucket about the size of your torso."
msgstr "一个亮橙色的塑料桶，与你的躯干大小相当。"

#. ~ Description of "large clay pot"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A bulky and heavy clay pot with a waterproofed hide lid, meant to store water, but can carry other liquids in a pinch."
msgstr "一只大而笨重的用防水兽皮密封的陶罐，主要用途是装水，不过当然也可以用来在必要时装些其他的液体。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic jerrycan"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A bulky plastic jerrycan, meant to carry fuel, but can carry other liquids in a pinch."
msgstr "一个塑料汽油桶，你也可以用来装别的液体。"

#. ~ Description of "egg carton"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A cardboard container with 12 individual cavities for storing eggs."
msgstr "一种用于放置鸡蛋的硬纸板容器，12枚装。"

#. ~ Description of "styrofoam cup"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A cheap, disposable cup with a plastic lid and straw."
msgstr "一个一次性的廉价杯子，附有塑料盖子和吸管。"

#. ~ Description of "clay bowl"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A clay bowl with a waterproofed hide lid.  Can be used as a container or as a tool.  Holds 250 mL of liquid."
msgstr "用防水兽皮密封的陶碗，可以作为容器或工具。能储存250毫升的液体。"

#. ~ Description of "clay jug"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A clay container with a lid, used to hold and pour liquids."
msgstr "带把的陶制容器，使用来装或者泼出液体。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden bowl"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A crude-looking wooden bowl which can hold some liquid."
msgstr "一个看起来很粗糙的木碗，可以装些液体。"

#. ~ Description of "balloon"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A deflated balloon.  This could be used as a makeshift water container."
msgstr "一个儿童气球。可以作为简易的液体容器使用。"

#. ~ Description of "IFAK pouch"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A fabric pouch designed to contain a personalized trauma kit.  These supplies are used to address immediate life-threatening conditions."
msgstr "一个设计用来装单兵创伤工具包的布袋。这些用品用于处理直接威胁生命的紧急情况。"

#. ~ Description of "individual patrol officer kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A first aid kit designed for patrolling police officers, contents selected for dealing with hemorrhaging injuries such as gunshot wounds.  Comes in a sealed pouch."
msgstr "专为巡警人员设计的急救箱，内含用于处理枪伤等出血性损伤的用具。装在密封袋中。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy punching bag sack"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A five-foot-long cylindrical leather sack, a foot in diameter, with attachment points at the top.  With some bags of sand, some chains, and a bunch of blankets, you could hang it from the ceiling as a heavy punching bag."
msgstr "一个近1.5米长的圆柱形皮袋，直径30厘米，顶部有连接点。用一些沙袋、链条和棉毯，你可以把它挂在天花板上作为一个沉重的训练沙袋。"

#. ~ Description of "clay canister"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A fragile clay vessel with a waterproofed hide lid.  It can be used to make crude impact grenades or to store liquid."
msgstr "一种易碎的粘土容器，带有防水皮盖。  它可以用来制造粗糙的冲击手榴弹或储存液体。"

#. ~ Description of "bucket"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A galvanized bucket for peanuts, chilled wine, iced beer, lobster, crab legs, French fries, animal feed, farm use, tailgating, crafts, planting flowers, holding gift baskets, containing a fruit basket and herbs, loose item storage, or as an ice bucket."
msgstr "一只镀锌的水桶，可用来装花生、冰镇葡萄酒、冰镇啤酒、龙虾、蟹腿、法式薯条、动物饲料，农用，追尾，制造物品，种植花草，装礼品篮，装水果篮和草本植物，松散的存储物品或是用作冰桶。"

#. ~ Description of "condom"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A gentleman's balloon.  A single-use life preventer.  A thumbless latex mitten.  This could be used as a makeshift water container, but otherwise it's anyone's guess what it's for."
msgstr "绅士的气球，一次性生命预防器，乳胶无指手套。可临时用作装液体的容器，但是别人会怀疑里面装着某种体液。"

#. ~ Description of "paper carton"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A half-gallon carton constructed of a paper, aluminum, and plastic laminate.  It has a threaded cap to keep liquid from leaking out."
msgstr "一个由纸，铝和塑料层压制成的纸板盒，容积为半加仑。附带一个螺纹盖子用以防止液体泄漏。"

#. ~ Description of "milk carton"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A half-gallon carton constructed of thick, waterproof paper.  It has a threaded cap to keep the contents from leaking out."
msgstr "一个容积为半加仑的纸盒，由厚厚的防水纸制成。附带一个螺纹盖子用以防止内容物泄漏。"

#. ~ Description of "0.5 L glass jar"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A half-liter glass jar with a metal screw top lid, used for canning.  Preserves its contents from rot until opened (assuming it was sterile before sealing)."
msgstr "带金属拧盖的半升装玻璃罐，一般用来做罐头。在被打开前能够一直保护其中内容物不腐烂（密封前需灭菌）。"

#. ~ Description of "bottle gourd"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A hard, watertight container made from a dried bottle gourd.  Can be used similar to a canteen or just for storing liquids."
msgstr "一个用干葫芦做成的硬质水密容器。可以像水壶一样使用，或者仅仅用于储存液体。"

#. ~ Description of "garbage bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A hefty plastic bag made to carry lots of trash."
msgstr "一个用于装载大量垃圾的大号塑料袋。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A hefty wooden box.  Great for storing items."
msgstr "一个沉重的木盒。非常适合存放物品。"

#. ~ Description of "30 gallon plastic barrel"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A huge plastic barrel with a watertight lid."
msgstr "一个带有水密盖的巨大塑料桶。"

#. ~ Description of "steel drum (100 L)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A huge steel barrel with a watertight lid."
msgstr "一个带有水密盖的巨大钢制油桶。"

#. ~ Description of "large dry bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A huge watertight bag made of strong plastic.  Commonly used in activities with high risk of wetting the equipment, such as kayaking."
msgstr "一个使用强化塑料制作的巨大防水袋，通常用于那些容易打湿装备的运动，比如独木舟划行。"

#. ~ Description of "body bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A human-sized rectangular bag made of strong plastic, with a zipper in the middle.  Intended to hold a dead body."
msgstr "一个内部成人男性大小的条形袋，由坚固的塑料制成，中间有拉链。用来装尸体。"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum tank (100 L)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large aluminum tank, traditionally used to store fuel."
msgstr "一个大型铝制油罐，一般用于储存燃料。"

#. ~ Description of "woven plastic sack"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large and sturdy bag made out of plastic canvas.  These are frequently used as sandbags, or for storing gravel."
msgstr "一种由塑料帆布制成的大型耐用袋子。常被用作沙袋或用于存放砾石。"

#. ~ Description of "canvas sack"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large and sturdy canvas sack.  Smells faintly of soil and hard work."
msgstr ""
"一个大而结实的帆布袋。有股若有若无的泥巴与劳作的味道。\n"
"\"扛着这个感受漫漫回家路。\""

#. ~ Description of "metal tank (60 L)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large metal tank for holding liquids.  Useful for crafting."
msgstr "用来装液体的大型金属罐，可用于制造其他东西。"

#. ~ Description of "2.5 L canteen"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large plastic water canteen, with a 2.5 liter capacity and carrying strap."
msgstr "一个带有背带的大塑料水壶，能够储存 2.5 升液体。"

#. ~ Description of "large biogas tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large tank of biogas, commonly used for heating."
msgstr "一个大型丙烷罐，通常用于大型供暖设备。"

#. ~ Description of "large propane tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large tank of propane, commonly used for heating."
msgstr "一个大型丙烷罐，通常用于大型供暖设备。"

#. ~ Description of "large tin can"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large tin can, like what beans come in.  Holds a substantial amount of food."
msgstr "一个大型锡制罐子，就是装豆子的那种。能够容纳大量食物。"

#. ~ Description of "gallon can"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large tin with a handle and a cap, meant for holding camp fuel or some other oil.  Looks like it could store just over a gallon."
msgstr "一个带提把和盖子的大锡罐，一般用来装露营的燃料或是其他种类的油。看起来它刚好可以装下超过一加仑的东西。"

#. ~ Description of "large waterskin"
