#. ~ Description of "large rifle conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid "This is a large cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and emblazoned with the stylized image of a large, assembled rifle.  Containing appropriate retool components for a given weapon platform, including high-caliber upper receiver assemblies, quick-swap marksman barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr "这是个大的纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的炫酷长枪图片。包含专为模块化武器设计的改装配件，包括大口径的上机匣组件、快拆射手枪管以及各种配件（如弹匣等）。这些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

#. ~ Description of "SBR conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid "This is a modestly proportioned cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled, short-barreled rifle.  Containing appropriate retool components for a given weapon platform, including compact upper receiver assemblies, short quick-swap barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr "这是个比例适中的纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的短管步枪的炫酷图片。包含为特定模块化武器设计的改装配件，包括紧凑型上机匣组件、快拆短枪枪管以及各种配件（如弹匣等）。这些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

#. ~ Description of "micro-carbine conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid "This is a relatively small cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled, extremely compact carbine.  Containing appropriate retool components for a given weapon platform, including adorably small upper receiver assemblies, pistol-length swappable barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr "这是个相对较小的纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的紧凑型卡宾枪的炫酷图片。包含为特定模块化武器设计的改装配件，包括袖珍上机匣组件、可更换的手枪型枪管以及各种配件（如弹匣等）。这些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

#. ~ Description of "standard rifle conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid "This is a sturdy cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled rifle.  Containing appropriate retool components for an average weapon platform, including upper receiver assemblies, swappable barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr "这是个硬纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的炫酷步枪图片。装有一般模块化武器都可用的改装配件，包括上机匣组件、可更换枪管以及各种配件（如弹匣等）。这些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

#. ~ Description of "marksmen's conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid "This is an expansive cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled high-caliber rifle.  Containing appropriate retool components for a larger than typical given weapon platform, including big-bore upper receiver assemblies, quick-swap sniper barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr "这是个宽大的纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的大口径步枪的炫酷图片。包含专为大型模块化武器设计的改装配件，包括大口径的上机匣组件、快拆狙击枪管以及各种配件（如弹匣等）。这些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

