msgid "A big trashcan in which you can store, you guessed it, trash.  Made out of plastic, so it's watertight but fragile and won't survive if you try to carry something really heavy in it."
msgstr "一个大垃圾桶，你猜你可以在里面储存，对，垃圾。它由塑料制成，所以是防水的，但塑料垃圾桶很脆弱，如果你试图携带非常重的东西，它很有可能会罢工（物理）。"

