#. ~ Description of "desiccated corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "A badly mangled human body.  A giant puncture wound is visible on its upper chest, and something has drained most of the moisture from the carcass, leaving it desiccated and making it impossible to determine the body's age."
msgstr "一具严重破损的尸体。在他的上胸部可以看到一个巨大的穿刺伤口，有什么东西把尸体上的大部分水分都吸干了，使尸体变得十分干燥，无法确定尸体的年龄。"

