#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A half-decapitated dead body.  It is unclear what could have caused such a wound."
msgstr "一具头没了一半的尸体。造成这种损伤的原因不得而知。"

#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "A lifeless human body."
msgstr "一具没有生命体征的人类尸体。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "An androgynous-looking corpse gored by bullet wounds from chest to thighs, leaving the face eerily pristine."
msgstr "一具无法分辨性别的尸体，从胸膛到大腿都被子弹打得血肉模糊，但却留下了一副诡异的干净面孔。"

#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "An awful, almost unidentifiable mass of charred flesh."
msgstr "一堆令人作呕的无法辨认的烧焦尸块。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "One of this deceased persons shoulders is disfigured by a deep bite wound with a distinct shape, obviously caused by a human."
msgstr "死者的肩膀有一处形状独特的深咬伤，显然是人为造成的。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The bloody corpse of a young man.  He has been stabbed repeatedly in the jugular and throat with a small blade."
msgstr "一具年轻人的血淋淋的尸体。他被一把小刀反复刺伤颈静脉和喉咙。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The corpse of a middle-aged woman, her legs and arms covered in blood.  She appears to have been shot in the thigh."
msgstr "一具中年妇女的尸体，她的腿和手臂都沾满了鲜血。她似乎大腿中枪。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The corpse of a seemingly older man.  He appears to have been shot in the forehead at very close range, leaving you a good view of his brain matter."
msgstr "一具年长男性的尸体，似乎是在很近的地方被击中了前额，你可以清晰地看见他的脑子。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The corpse of a small old lady, her face caked in blood and missing an eye."
msgstr "一具身材矮小的老太太的尸体，她的脸上满是血块，少了一只眼睛。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The corpse of a tall middle-aged woman.  She appears to have many stab wounds up her legs and thighs."
msgstr "一具高大中年妇女的尸体。她的小腿和大腿上似乎有许多刺伤。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The corpse of a tall woman unblemished but for the bloody hole atop her head, her thick black hair intermixed now with brain, viscera and shotgun pellets."
msgstr "一名身材高大的女性尸体，除了头部上的血洞之外没有其他伤痕，她浓密的黑发现在和脑子、内脏和霰弹混合在了一起。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The corpse of a young blonde woman shot several times in the back with a low-caliber weapon."
msgstr "一具年轻金发女子的尸体，它被一把小口径枪械从背后多次射击。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The corpse of a young man who appears to have been shot to death.  His right arm is only barely still attached to his shoulder."
msgstr "一名年轻男子的尸体，似乎是被枪杀的。他的右臂都快从肩膀上断开了。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The corpse of an infant.  A single small-caliber bullet has been put through its skull."
msgstr "婴儿的尸体。一颗小口径子弹穿过了它的头骨。"

#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The dead body of a child, riddled by bullets to the extent that you can no longer tell their gender."
msgstr "一具儿童的尸体，已经被子弹打成了筛子，你甚至辨认不出这具尸体的性别。"

#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The dead body of a person.  Their forehead bears a large bullet entrance wound.  An even larger exit wound is present on the back of their head."
msgstr "一具尸体，额头上有一个巨大的子弹入射伤口，后脑勺则有另一个更大的伤口。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The dead body of a person.  There is a bloody bite wound on their forearm.  Dry filth surrounds it but the body seems otherwise unharmed."
msgstr "一具人类尸体。前臂上有一处血迹斑斑的咬伤。周围有一圈已经干燥了的污物，但身体其他部位似乎没有受到伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The dead body of a person.  There is a bloody bite wound on their forearm.  Dry filth surrounds it."
msgstr "一具人类尸体。前臂上有一处血迹斑斑的咬伤。周围有一圈已经干燥了的污物。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The dead body of a person.  They look to have been skewered with a large, sharp implement."
msgstr "一个人的尸体。它看起来是被一个大而锋利的东西刺穿的。"

#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The dead body of a small child.  Their corpse bears a calm facial expression, as if they died instantly."
msgstr "一具儿童的尸体，其表情十分平静，就像是一瞬间死掉的。"

#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "The upper half of a dead body, as if it was torn apart with enormous force.  Some organs are hanging out."
msgstr "一具尸体的上半截，像是被蛮力撕开的一样。一些器官从里面漏了出来。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "This lifeless body is covered in myriads of uneven scratches.  Some of them look pretty swollen."
msgstr "这具没有生命体征的尸体上布满了无数凹凸不平的痕迹。有些看起来肿得很厉害。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "This unlucky fellow has a deep, straight cut wound on their hand.  The blackened veins suggest it got infected."
msgstr "这个倒霉蛋的手上有一道又深又直的伤口。发黑的静脉表明它已经被感染了。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "corpse" when FLAG matches FIELD_DRESS
#. ~ Conditional name for "corpse" when FLAG matches FIELD_DRESS_FAILED
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "carcass"
msgid_plural "carcasses"
msgstr[0] "胴体"

#. ~ Conditional name for "corpse" when FLAG matches QUARTERED
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "carcass quarter"
msgid_plural "carcass quarters"
msgstr[0] "四分体"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "corpse"
msgid_plural "corpses"
msgstr[0] "尸体"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid "desiccated corpse"
msgid_plural "desiccated corpses"
msgstr[0] "脱水尸体"

#. ~ Conditional name for "corpse" when FLAG matches SKINNED
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#, c-format
msgid "skinned %s"
msgid_plural "skinned %s"
msgstr[0] "%s（已剥皮）"

#. ~ Description of "golden monolith"
#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
msgid "A large golden monolith.  Carefully carved asymmetric edges betray its artificial origin."
msgstr "一块黄金巨石。精琢的非对称边缘暴露了它是非自然形成的。"

#. ~ Description of "inert delta"
#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
msgid "A small piece of inscrutable alloy shaped like an arrow's broadhead.  It doesn't look like much of a robot once dead."
msgstr "一小块不可思议的合金，形状类似于箭矢的宽箭头。这东西停机后就不像个机械装置了。"

#. ~ Description of "trifacet remains"
#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
msgid "A split-open facet reveals an interior full of closely-fit geometric primitives among chipped strips of milk-white quartz.  The composition of parts lends you no clues as to how this machine ever functioned."
msgstr "一个裂开的琢面揭露出它内部充满了各种紧密结合的几何基元外形的零件，以及无数破裂的奶白色石英结晶长条。这些组合的零件并不能给你带来任何这台机器如何运作的线索。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
msgid "golden monolith"
msgid_plural "golden monoliths"
msgstr[0] "黄金巨石"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
msgid "inert delta"
msgid_plural "inert deltas"
msgstr[0] "惰性三角洲"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
msgid "trifacet remains"
msgid_plural "trifacet remains"
msgstr[0] "三琢面残骸"

#. ~ Description of "broken balloon sniper drone"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "A broken balloon drone.  The balloon has been shredded, but most of the chassis is still intact.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的气球无人机。气球已被撕碎，但大部分底盘仍然完好无损。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive broken cyborg"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "A deactivated broken cyborg, the last shreds of its humanity still rotting away.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and reactivating its mechanical body.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the cyborg will then follow you and attack enemies.  You monster."
msgstr "一台未激活的破损改造人，它最后依然残留着几分人性。使用该物品以将它放置在地面上并重新激活其机械体。若成功编程放置，改造人将跟随你攻击敌人（你这个魔鬼）。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive prototype cyborg"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "A deactivated prototype cyborg, glimpses of humanity can still be seen in its empty eyes.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and reactivating its mechanical body.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the cyborg will then follow you and attack enemies.  You monster."
msgstr "一台未激活的原型改造人，在他空洞的眼中仍能看到残存的人性。使用该物品以将它放置在地面上并重新激活其机械体。若成功编程放置，改造人将跟随你攻击敌人（你这个魔鬼）。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive trifacet"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "A featureless quartz pyramid that, although obviously artificial, shows no real indication of ever having been an advanced robot.  Perhaps you could try reactivating it?"
msgstr "一个平平无奇的石英金字塔，虽然明显应该是人造产物，但并没有真正的迹象表明它曾经是一只高级的机器人。也许你可以试着重新激活它？"

#. ~ Description of "inactive C-4 hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive C-4 hack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through the air.  This one contains a C-4 demolition charge and attacks by flying at its target and detonating.  Use this item to reprogram and activate the C-4 hack.  Electronics and computer skill determines if the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr "一台未激活的 C4 无人机，一种拳头大小的飞行机器人。这台无人机的内部搭载了一发 C4 炸药，通过飞向敌人并引爆 C4 炸药来攻击敌人。使用它以将其激活。电子学和计算机学等级决定了你将其重新编程的成功几率。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive EMP hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive EMP hack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through the air.  This one contains an EMP grenade and attacks by flying at its target and detonating.  Use this item to reprogram and release the EMP hack.  Electronics and computer skill determines if the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr "一台未激活的 EMP 无人机，一种拳头大小的飞行机器人。这台无人机的内部搭载了一枚 EMP 榴弹，通过飞向敌人并引爆 EMP 榴弹来攻击敌人。使用它以将其激活。电子学和计算机学等级决定了你将其重新编程的成功几率。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive exterminatron"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive Hub 01 exterminatron.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and reloaded successfully, the robot will track you while providing fire-support."
msgstr "一台未激活的 Hub 01 根除者无人机。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，根除者无人机将在提供火力支持的同时跟随你。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive dispatch"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive Northrop Dispatch, guard model, serving as a mobile assembler and deployer of kamikaze manhacks for defense.  Activate it to place it onto the ground; due to a one-way switch triggered during deactivation, however, it will be nonaggressive, and serves only as a distraction."
msgstr "一台未激活的诺斯罗普派遣者，警卫型号。它通过装配和部署飞锯无人机进行防御。使用它可将其放置在地上，但是由于在关闭时触发了单向开关，它将不具有攻击性，并且只能起到分散敌人注意力的作用。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive military dispatch"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive Northrop Dispatch, military model, serving as a mobile assembler and deployer of lethal manhacks for combat situations.  Activate it to place it onto the ground; due to a one-way switch triggered during deactivation, however, it will be nonaggressive, and serves only as a distraction."
msgstr "一台未激活的诺斯罗普派遣者，军用型号。它通过装配和部署飞锯无人机进行攻击。使用它可将其放置在地上，但是由于在关闭时触发了单向开关，它将不具有攻击性，并且只能起到分散敌人注意力的作用。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive TALON UGV"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive TALON UGV equipped with an M16A4.  Using this item involves loading the unit with the factory-loaded 5.56x45mm rounds in your inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition, set aside whatever 5.56x45mm you do NOT want to give the robot), turning it on, and placing it on the ground.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the security bot will then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack all enemies with its rifle."
msgstr "一台未激活的\"鹰爪\"型无人车，配有一把 M16A4 步枪。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动，并装填你物品栏内的原装 5.56x45mm 弹药（如果你只想装填部分弹药，请先把不需装填的弹药移出物品栏）。若成功编程放置，无人车会将你识别为友方，自主行动或跟随你，并采用内置步枪攻击附近的所有敌人。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive M202A1 TALON UGV"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive TALON UGV equipped with an M202A1.  Using this item involves loading the unit with the M235 rockets in your inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition, set aside whatever M235 rockets you do NOT want to give the robot), turning it on, and placing it on the ground.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the security bot will then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack all enemies with its M202A1."
msgstr "一台未激活的\"鹰爪\"型无人车，配有一把 M202A1 火箭筒。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动，并装填你物品栏内的 M235 火箭弹（如果你只想装填部分弹药，请先把不需装填的弹药移出物品栏）。若成功编程放置，无人车会将你识别为友方，自主行动或跟随你，并采用内置 M202A1 火箭筒攻击附近的所有敌人。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive loudspeaker"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive automated loudspeaker.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the loudspeaker will continuously shout pre-recorded messages."
msgstr "一台未激活的自动扩音器。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，扩音器将会不停发出提前录制的声音。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive camspy"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive camspy.  Using this item involves turning it on and launching it.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the camspy will then keep watch for intruders."
msgstr "一架未激活的侦察无人机。使用该物品以将它启动并释放。若成功编程放置，侦察无人机会持续寻找入侵者。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive cleaner bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive cleaner bot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the cleaner bot will respond to future commands."
msgstr "一台未激活的清洁机器人。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，清洁机器人将会遵守你发出的指令。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive demining bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive demining robot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and turning it on."
msgstr "一台未激活的排雷机器人。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive flashbang hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive flashbang hack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through the air.  This one contains a flashbang and attacks by flying at its target and detonating.  Use this item to reprogram and activate the flashbang hack.  Electronics and computer skill determines if the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr "一台未激活的闪光弹无人机，一种拳头大小的飞行机器人。这台无人机的内部搭载了一枚闪光弹，通过飞向敌人并引爆闪光弹来攻击敌人。使用它以将其激活。电子学和计算机学等级决定了你将其重新编程的成功几率。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive grenade hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive grenade hack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through the air.  This one contains a grenade and attacks by flying at its target and detonating.  Use this item to reprogram and activate the grenade hack.  Electronics and computer skill determines if the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr "一台未激活的榴弹无人机，一种拳头大小的飞行机器人。这台无人机的内部搭载了一枚榴弹，通过飞向敌人并引爆榴弹来攻击敌人。使用它以将其激活。电子学和计算机学等级决定了你将其重新编程的成功几率。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive grocery bot"
#. ~ Description of "inactive busted grocery bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive grocery bot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and reactivating its mechanical body.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the grocery bot will then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you."
msgstr "一台未激活的食杂店机器人。使用该物品以将它放置在地面上并重新激活其机械体。若成功编程放置，食杂店机器人会将你识别为友方，并自主行动或跟随你。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive manhack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive manhack, a fist-sized robot that flies through the air.  This one is covered with whirring blades and attacks by throwing itself against its target.  Use this item to reprogram and activate the manhack.  Electronics and computer skill determines if the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr "一台未激活的飞锯无人机，一种拳头大小的飞行机器人。这台无人机的表面布满了嗡嗡作响的刀刃，通过撞击目标来攻击敌人。使用它以将其激活。电子学和计算机学等级决定了你将其重新编程的成功几率。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive nurse bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive nurse bot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and reactivating its mechanical body.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the nurse bot will then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and assist you in surgeries."
msgstr "一台未激活的护士机器人。使用该物品以将它放置在地面上并重新激活其机械体。若成功编程放置，护士机器人会将你识别为友方，自主行动或跟随你，并协助你进行手术。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive riot control turret"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive riot control turret.  Using this item involves loading the unit with the 40x46mm M1006 sponge rounds in your inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition, set aside whatever beanbag rounds you do NOT want to give the turret), turning it on, and placing it on the ground, where it will attach itself.  If programmed successfully, the turret will then identify you as a friendly, and attack all enemies with its riot control gun."
msgstr "一座未激活的防暴炮塔。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动，并装填你物品栏内的 40x46mm M1006 海绵弹药（如果你只想装填部分弹药，请先把不需装填的弹药移出物品栏）。若成功编程放置，炮塔会将你识别为友方，并采用内置防暴枪攻击附近的所有敌人。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive security drone"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive security drone.  They are fist-sized robots that fly through the air.  They have a scanner, lens and speaker.  Use this item to reprogram and activate the security drone.  Electronics and computer skill determines if the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr "一台未激活的安防无人机，一种拳头大小的飞行机器人。这台无人机的内部搭载了一台读卡器，摄像机及扬声器。使用它以将其激活。电子学和计算机学等级决定了你将其重新编程的成功几率。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive skitterbot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive skitterbot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the robot will race towards enemies and shock them."
msgstr "一台未激活的掠行无人机。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，掠行无人机将会冲向敌人并电击它们。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive taser hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive taser hack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through the air.  This one has a taser and attacks by flying at its target and delivering an electric shock.  Use this item to reprogram and release the taser hack.  Electronics and computer skills determine if the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr "一台未激活的电击枪无人机，一种拳头大小的飞行机器人。这台无人机的内部搭载了一把电击枪，会飞向敌人并电击目标。使用它以将其激活。电子学和计算机学等级决定了你将其重新编程的成功几率。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive tear gas hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive tear gas hack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through the air.  This one contains a tear gas canister and attacks by flying at its target and releasing the gas.  Use this item to reprogram and activate the tear gas hack.  Electronics and computer skill determines if the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr "一台未激活的催泪弹无人机，一种拳头大小的飞行机器人。这台无人机的内部搭载了一枚催泪弹，会飞向敌人并释放出气体。使用它以将其激活。电子学和计算机学等级决定了你将其重新编程的成功几率。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive turret.  Using this item involves loading the unit with the factory-loaded .50 BMG rounds in your inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition, set aside whatever .50 BMG rounds you do NOT want to give the turret), turning it on, and placing it on the ground, where it will attach itself.  If programmed successfully, the turret will then identify you as a friendly, and attack all enemies with its M2HB."
msgstr "一座未激活的 .50 口径机枪炮塔。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动，并装填你物品栏内的原装 .50 BMG 弹药（如果你只想装填部分弹药，请先把不需装填的弹药移出物品栏）。若成功编程放置，炮塔会将你识别为友方，并采用内置 M2HB 机枪攻击附近的所有敌人。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive autonomous M249 CROWS II"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "An inactive turret.  Using this item involves loading the unit with the factory-loaded 5.56x45mm rounds in your inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition, set aside whatever 5.56x45mm rounds you do NOT want to give the turret), turning it on, and placing it on the ground, where it will attach itself.  If programmed successfully, the turret will then identify you as a friendly, and attack all enemies with its M249."
msgstr "一座未激活的 5.56x45mm 口径机枪炮塔。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动，并装填你物品栏内的原装 5.56x45mm 弹药（如果你只想装填部分弹药，请先把不需装填的弹药移出物品栏）。若成功编程放置，炮塔会将你识别为友方，并采用内置 M249 机枪攻击附近的所有敌人。"

