#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive C-4 hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The C-4 hack flies from your hand and surveys the area!"
msgstr "这台 C4 无人机从你手上飞起，在附近区域自动寻找目标中！"

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive EMP hack"
