#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive broken cyborg"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The broken cyborg lets out a howl of agony and attacks you!"
msgstr "破损的改造人发出痛苦的嚎叫并攻击你！"

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive broken cyborg"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The broken cyborg rises to the sound of screeching metal and peers around for hostiles."
msgstr "破损的改造人在金属的摩擦声中站起，四处寻找敌人。"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive camspy"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The camspy hums and appears to reconnect to whoever was piloting it before."
msgstr "侦察无人机嗡嗡作响，似乎重新连接到了之前控制它的人。"

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive camspy"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The camspy hums and takes to the sky."
msgstr "侦察无人机嗡嗡作响，飞向天空。"

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive cleaner bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The cleaner bot emits a friendly beep and starts scrubbing."
msgstr "清洁机器人发出友好的哔哔声，开始擦洗。"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive cleaner bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The cleaner bot plays an error sound, but starts cleaning anyway."
msgstr "清洁机器人发出运行错误的提示音，开始到处乱擦。"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive demining bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The demining bot spins out of control and lunges at you.  Make way!"
msgstr "排雷机器人旋转着钻头——失控了，它向你冲来，快让开！"

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive demining bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The demining bot whirrs and tunnels into the ground."
