#. ~ Description of "inactive TALON UGV Liberty Edition"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "This bot has had tubes welded above the original guns that allow it to shoot fireworks in order to blind and stun attackers.  With fireworks being harder to come by then the ammo for the original weapons, the best option would be to convert it back to it's original guns.  It should be easy enough to give it back the use of the original M16A4."
msgstr "该机器人在原来的枪上方焊接了管子，可以发射烟花来致盲和击晕攻击者。  由于烟花比原始武器的弹药更难获得，最好的选择是将其改装回原来的枪支。  应该很容易恢复原来的 M16A4 的用途。"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive C-4 hack"
