#. ~ Description of "Integrated AR System"
#: data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "A MicroLED display affixed directly to the corneas, this device serves as a digital assistant, multimedia player, and more - all on an interface that only the user can see."
msgstr "该设备采用直接贴在角膜上的 MicroLED 显示屏，可用作数字助理、多媒体播放器等 - 所有这些都在只有用户可以看到的界面上。"

#. ~ Description of "smoldering embers"
#: data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "A handful of smoldering embers emitting smoke.  They are fading away before your eyes."
msgstr "一份熏烤后留下的余烬，仍有余烟。它渐渐消失在你的眼前，随风而去。"

#. ~ Description of "semi ground grains"
#: data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "A paste of half-finished milled grains, not yet flour."
msgstr "一种由碾碎的谷物制成的糊状物，还不是面粉。"

#. ~ Description of "autonomous surgical scalpels"
#: data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "A system of surgical-grade scalpels.  They allow you to make precise cuts on corpses."
