#. ~ Description of "camphine"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A blend of turpentine and ethanol, historically used as the successor to whale oil for lamps before kerosene."
msgstr "一种松节油和乙醇的混合物，历史上在煤油出现之前作为鲸油的替代品使用。"

#. ~ Description of "crude lamp oil"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A crude, natural oil made for use in pre-modern oil lamps."
msgstr "一种粗制的，用于前现代油灯的天然油脂。"

#. ~ Description of "gelled gasoline"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A flammable gel composed of gasoline and dissolved shavings of polystyrene, roughly similar in properties to napalm B.  It's meant to be used as flamethrower fuel."
msgstr "由汽油和溶解的聚苯乙烯屑制成的可燃胶体，性质类似凝固汽油。可以用作火焰喷射器的燃料。"

#. ~ Description of "denatured alcohol"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A high-strength ethanol solution mixed with denatonium benzoate to make it impossibly bitter to drink, so as to avoid pre-apocalyptic regulations on ethanol.  Intended for use in alcohol-burning stoves and as a solvent."
msgstr "一种高纯度酒精溶液，混入了俗称苦精的苯甲地那铵，使其苦得无法饮用，以此来规避大灾变前的相关酒类法规。可用于酒精炉燃料或化学溶剂。"

#. ~ Description of "gasoline"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A highly flammable liquid fuel.  When under pressure, it has the potential for violent explosion."
msgstr "一种高度易燃的液体燃料。当受压时，有可能发生剧烈爆炸。"

#. ~ Description of "JP8 fuel"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A kerosene-based fuel used mainly by US military vehicles as a replacement for diesel and jet fuel, to simplify logistics."
msgstr "一种基于煤油制成的特种燃料，主要被美国军用载具当作柴油和航空燃油的替代品，以简化后勤需求。"

#. ~ Description of "flamethrower fuel"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A mixture of gasoline and diesel oil in equal parts.  Its combustion properties make it unfit for applications where you would use any of them separately, but it can be used to feed a flamethrower."
msgstr "由等量的汽油和柴油混合而成。特殊的燃烧性质使其无法再像汽油或柴油一样使用，但是可以用作火焰喷射器的燃料。"

#. ~ Description of "diesel"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A petroleum-based fuel made from a byproduct of the gasoline making process."
msgstr "一种从加工汽油的副产品中提炼出来的石化燃料。"

#. ~ Description of "avgas fuel"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A specialized type of petroleum-based fuel used to power aircraft."
msgstr "一种特殊的石油燃料，用于为飞机提供动力。"

#. ~ Description of "crude oil"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A thick black slurry that can be refined to produce usable products including gasoline or diesel"
msgstr "一种浓稠的黑色浆料，可以精炼生产可用的产品，包括汽油或柴油"

#. ~ Description of "kerosene"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A thin and clean-burning oil made for use in oil lamps."
msgstr "一份轻型无烟灯油，在油灯中使用。"

#. ~ Description of "motor oil"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "An oil made for use in car engines."
msgstr "一款供汽车引擎使用的机油。"

#. ~ Description of "biogas"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "Biogas gathered from anaerobic digester system, can be used in biogas cooker."
msgstr "从厌氧消化系统收集的沼气，可用于沼气灶。"

#. ~ Description of "ethanol"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "Extremely pure alcohol suitable for use as a component in chemical reactions.  You could also water it down and drink it, or use it as fuel in an alcohol-burning stove."
msgstr ""
"一些高纯度酒精，可用于进行化学反应。稀释后可以饮用，或者用来做酒精炉的燃料。\n"
"\"把这玩意当作伏特加卖给外行都会有人信！\""

#. ~ Description of "napalm"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "Gasoline mixed with some other components to make it stick to surfaces and increase burning temperature, meant to be used as flamethrower fuel."
msgstr "一种混合了一些特殊成分的汽油，使得其可以粘附在物体表面并增加燃烧时的温度。可以用作火焰喷射器的燃料。"

#. ~ Description of "methanol"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "High-purity methanol suitable for use in chemical reactions.  Could also be used as fuel in an alcohol-burning stove.  Very toxic."
msgstr "一种高纯度甲醇溶液，可用于某些化学反应。也可供酒精炉燃烧。有剧毒。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "JP8 fuel"
msgid_plural "JP8 fuel"
