#. ~ Description of "propane"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "Propane gas, useful for everything from torches to barbeque grills to metalworking."
msgstr "气态丙烷，可用于从焊炬到烧烤架到金属加工的一切用途。"

#. ~ Description of "biodiesel"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "Vegetable oil or animal fat-based diesel fuel consisting of long-chain alkyl (methyl, ethyl, or propyl) esters.  It can safely be used in diesel engines."
msgstr "由植物油或动物脂肪为原料制成的柴油，主要成分是长链烷基（甲基、乙基或丙基）酯。"

