#. ~ Description of "standing mirror"
#: data/json/items/furniture/decorative.json
msgid "A full-length mirror mounted in a sleek aluminum frame.  Metal stand is currently folded."
msgstr "一面全尺寸的穿衣镜，架设在纤薄的铝制框架上。现在金属支架被收起来以节省空间。"

#. ~ Description of "bar stool"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid "A bar stool with a leather seat on a steel support.  Not practical for sleeping at all but it does feel nicer than sitting on the ground."
msgstr "一个酒吧凳子，钢支架上有一个皮革座椅。用来睡觉一点都不实用，但确实比坐在地上感觉更好。"

#. ~ Description of "log stool"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid "A short section from a tree trunk with one of the flat ends smoothed down.  Makes for a decent place to sit, but not quite a real chair."
msgstr "一小段从树干上取下来的原木，其中一端被磨平。它是块坐下来的好地方，但还算不上一把真正的椅子。"

#. ~ Description of "plywood chair"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid "A simple chair made of plywood on a steel frame.  Quite uncomfortable but works for sleeping if it's the only option available."
msgstr "一把简单的椅子，由胶合板固定在钢制框架上制成。相当不舒服，但确实可以用来睡觉，如果这是唯一选择的话。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden stool"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid "A simple stool, with four legs and a seat.  While it's a touch more maneuverable to sit on, the lack of back support means it's significantly less comfortable than a normal chair."
msgstr "一把简单的凳子，有四条腿和一个座位。虽然坐起来更灵活，但缺乏背部支撑意味着它明显不如普通椅子舒适。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden chair"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid "A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to rest your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat a meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again."
msgstr "一把简单的木制椅子，有四条腿，一个椅座和一个靠背。能让你的脚好好休息一会，如果再加上一张合适的桌子，你可以好好吃一顿饭，假装一切正常了。"

#. ~ Description of "black wooden chair"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid "A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to rest your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat a meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again.  This particular chair was painted black."
msgstr "一把简单的木制椅子，有四条腿，一个椅座和一个靠背。能让你的脚好好休息一会，如果再加上一张合适的桌子，你可以好好吃一顿饭，假装一切正常了。这把椅子被特别漆成黑色。"

#. ~ Description of "white wooden chair"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid "A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to rest your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat a meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again.  This particular chair was painted white."
msgstr "一把简单的木制椅子，有四条腿，一个椅座和一个靠背。能让你的脚好好休息一会，如果再加上一张合适的桌子，你可以好好吃一顿饭，假装一切正常了。这把椅子被特别漆成白色。"

#. ~ Description of "steel mesh"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A 6-inch square piece of finely-woven steel wire, useful for dryer lint traps and reusable coffee filter baskets.  You could put this on a window to keep mosquitoes and other bugs out if it was larger, but chain link fencing will do these days."
msgstr "一张6英寸(约15厘米)见方的细钢丝网，可以用作烘干机滤网或者用来滤咖啡。如果它再大点，你就可以把它做成纱窗用来遮挡蚊虫了，但是如今的蚊虫只需要勾花围栏就能挡住了。"

#. ~ Description of "secured USB drive"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A USB thumb drive.  Useful for holding software.  This one seems like it could get run over by a truck and be fine."
msgstr "一个U盘，用于存储电脑软件与数据。这个型号很坚固，能被卡车碾过而毫发无伤。"

#. ~ Description of "onyx"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A beautiful black onyx."
msgstr "一颗漂亮的黑玛瑙。"

#. ~ Description of "pile of dried seaweed"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big heap of dried seaweed.  It's tough, inedible, and possibly poisonous, but it could be burned or used for crafts."
msgstr "一大堆干海藻。  它很坚韧，不可食用，而且可能有毒，但可以燃烧或用于工艺品。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Boston-Chan body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a blue-haired Boston-Chan, the mascot of Boston AnimeCon, on both sides.  It's highly unlikely the convention would officially endorse such a lewd depiction of her."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，两侧印有波士顿动漫展的吉祥物——蓝发的波士顿酱。官方应该不会认可描绘得这么下流的周边。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Boston-Chan body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a blue-haired Boston-Chan, the mascot of Boston AnimeCon, on both sides.  This seems to be official merch, and the art on both sides is quite tame."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，两侧印有波士顿动漫展的吉祥物——蓝发的波士顿酱。这似乎是官方的商品，两边的图案都十分健全。"

#. ~ Description of variant "yandere body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a cute maid on the front and the same maid - covered in blood and holding a knife - on the back."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，正面印有一个可爱的女仆，背面印着同一位女仆——但浑身是血，拿着刀。"

#. ~ Description of variant "femboy body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a feminine man on the front and his scantily-clad version on the back.  It's captioned with 'FEMBOY SUPREMACY' on both sides."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，正面印有可爱男孩子的图案，背面印有他衣着暴露的版本。两侧都带有\"伪娘最棒了\"的标题。"

#. ~ Description of variant "gun body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a fully-modded tacticool M4 SOPMOD II on both sides.  The rifle firing a grenade somehow looks suggestive."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，两侧印有经过彻底改装的战术M4 SOPMOD II步枪。不知何故，那个下挂的榴弹发射器，看起来有很强的性暗示。"

#. ~ Description of variant "tomboy body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a masculine woman on the front and her scantily-clad version on the back.  It's captioned with 'TOMBOY SUPREMACY' on both sides."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，正面印有假小子女孩的图案，背面印有她衣着暴露的版本。两侧都带有\"假小子最棒了\"的标题。"

#. ~ Description of variant "VTuber body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a popular anime VTuber on the front and their scantily-clad version on the back."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，正面印有流行的虚拟主播动漫形象，背面则是衣着暴露的版本。"

#. ~ Description of variant "vocaloid body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a popular blue-twintailed virtual musician on the front and her scantily-clad version on the back."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，正面印有某个流行的蓝色双马尾虚拟歌手图案，背面印有她衣着暴露的版本。"

#. ~ Description of variant "tsundere body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a pouting anime character on the front and their scantily-clad version on the back.  They don't actually like you or anything, they swear!"
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，正面印有一个撅嘴的动漫人物，背面印有衣着暴露的版本。人物发誓着说\"才不喜欢你呢！\""

#. ~ Description of variant "ship body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an aircraft carrier drawn on both sides.  The one on the back is stripped of its armor plating, how naughty."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，两边都画着航空母舰的图案。背面上的版本，舰上的装甲板都被剥光了，好色哦。"

#. ~ Description of variant "goth body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an anime character dressed in all black on the front and their scantily-clad version on the back.  They're surrounded by red candles and laying atop a demonic pentagram."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，正面印有一个衣着全身漆黑的动漫角色，背面是衣着暴露的版本。人物被红色蜡烛包围，并躺在一个恶魔五芒星上。"

#. ~ Description of "body pillow"
#. ~ Description of variant "anime body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an anime character on the front and their scantily-clad version on the back."
msgstr "一个柔软的等身大抱枕，正面印有动漫人物的图案，背面则是角色的……少了些布料的版本。"

#. ~ Description of variant "fox body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an anthropomorphic fox on the front and a scantily-clad version on the back."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，正面印有拟人化的狐狸图案，背面印有衣着暴露的版本。"

#. ~ Description of variant "survivor body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with an anime-style print of Bear Grillings, Ultimate Survivor on both sides.  On one side he's holding a pneumatic air rifle, and on the other he is clad in nothing but duct tape.  The pillow is stylized to look like Kevlar."
msgstr "一个和身体尺寸相当的大抱枕，两侧印有动漫画风的终极生存者——贝尔·格里尔斯。一面上画着他拿着一支气动步枪，另一面上他只穿着胶带。枕头的纹理似乎特地做出了凯夫拉的质感。"

#. ~ Description of variant "makeshift body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A big, body-sized pillow.  Someone drew a vaguely humanoid figure on it.  Its heartwarming smile fills you with joy."
msgstr "一个巨大的全身长的枕头。有人在上面画了一个模模糊糊的人形图案。它温暖的微笑让你充满了喜悦。"

#. ~ Description of "dried seaweed"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A bit of dried seaweed.  It's tough, inedible, and possibly poisonous, but it could be burned or used for crafts."
msgstr "干海藻少许。  它很坚韧，不可食用，而且可能有毒，但可以燃烧或用于工艺品。"

#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough with koji"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A block of dried dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, covered with koji mold.  Usable for making soy sauce."
msgstr "一块煮熟并捣碎的大豆和小麦粉制成的干面团，上面覆盖着曲霉菌。可用于制作酱油。"

#. ~ Description of "book binder"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A book binder.  With a pen and some paper you could copy some recipes from books into it."
msgstr "一个活页夹。有了笔和纸你可以从书上抄写下一些配方装入其中。"

#. ~ Description of "pine bough"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A branch from a pine tree, oozing sticky sap and bristling with prickly needles."
msgstr "一根从松树上折下的树枝，断口出渗出粘糊糊的松脂，树枝上还带着一些绿色的松针。"

#. ~ Description of "candlestick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A brass candlestick with a gold finish."
msgstr "一个有着闪亮金饰面的黄铜烛台。"

#. ~ Description of "broken C-4 hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken C-4 hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的C4炸弹无人机。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken EMP hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken EMP hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的EMP无人机。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken M202A1 TALON"
#. ~ Description of "broken launcher TALON UGV"
#. ~ Description of "broken rifle TALON UGV"
#: data/json/items/generic.json data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/broken_bots.json
msgid "A broken TALON UGV, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一架损坏的\"鹰爪\"型无人车，它的外壳破损，有液体从中流出。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken camspy"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken camspy.  It probably won't spy on anything ever again.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的侦察无人机。它可能再也无法监视任何东西了。可以拆解以获取零件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken flashbang hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken flashbang hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的闪光弹无人机。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken grenade hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken grenade hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的榴弹无人机。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken grocery bot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken grocery bot.  Its smiling face stares vacantly into empty space.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的食杂店机器人。它微笑的脸茫然地凝视着空气。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken loudspeaker"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken loudspeaker.  It's so unusually quiet now….  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的扩音器，现在安静地待在那里。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken manhack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken manhack.  Much less threatening now that it lies limp on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的飞锯无人机。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken recon mech"
#. ~ Description of "broken mech lifter"
#. ~ Description of "broken combat mech"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken mech exoskeleton suit, it looks beyond repair."
msgstr "一套损坏的外骨骼装甲，看起来已经没法修了。"

#. ~ Description of "broken military dispatch"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken military dispatch.  Though the scratched manhacks visible in its belly are disarmed, their destructive potential still inspires a spark of fear in you, even now.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的军用派遣者。透过腹部裂痕，可以看到内部的飞锯无人机，它们闪烁着令人恐惧的火花，仍然隐藏着恐怖的破坏力。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken miner bot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken miner bot.  Much less threatening now that it's no longer capable of drilling anything.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的排爆机器人。没有威胁，因为它再也钻不动了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken nurse bot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken nurse bot.  Its smooth face stares vacantly into empty space.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的护士机器人。它光滑的脸茫然地凝视着空气。可以拆解回收部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken prototype robot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken prototype robot--well, more broken than before.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台破损的原型机器人，至少是比之前更破。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken riot control turret"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken riot control turret.  Much less threatening now that it's laid limp on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一个损坏的防暴炮塔。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken riot dispatch"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken riot dispatch, with its mesh midsection filled with fried manhacks and its motor limp and still.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的防暴派遣者，它的腹部密集的舱位停满了烧焦的飞锯无人机，它的引擎已经完全失去了动力。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken skitterbot"
#. ~ Description of "broken exterminatron"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken robot.  Much less threatening now that it lies limp on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
