#. ~ Description of "broken secubot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken secubot, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一个损坏的安保无人机，它的外壳破损，有液体从中流出。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken green maintenance security drone"
#. ~ Description of "broken yellow maintenance security drone"
#. ~ Description of "broken blue maintenance security drone"
#. ~ Description of "broken green research security drone"
#. ~ Description of "broken black security drone"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken security drone, with its propellers still and camera inert.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一个损坏的安防无人机。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken taser hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken taser hack, with its propellers still and taser inert.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一个损坏的电击枪无人机。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken tear gas hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken tear gas hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的催泪弹无人机。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "broken turret"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken turret.  Much less threatening now that it's laid limp on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一个损坏的炮塔。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "spare tire carrier"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A bumper-mounted rig for attaching and storing a spare tire on the back of a vehicle.  Combine it with a wheel to get a mountable piece."
msgstr "可以存放备胎的托架，用于将备胎固定在车辆后面。将它与车轮组合可得到待安装的载具部件。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift tree spile"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A carved piece of wood which is inserted in a tree crust in order to slowly harvest its sap.  Can be used on a maple tree in between late winter and early spring to harvest maple sap."
msgstr "一截木头插管，手工雕刻制成，把它深深地插进树皮里就可以从中缓慢的获得树汁。可以在晚冬早春时节从枫树里收集枫树树汁。"

#. ~ Description of "processor board"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A central processor unit, useful in advanced electronics crafting."
msgstr "一个中央处理器，简称CPU。用于制造高级电子设备。"

#. ~ Description of "ceramic armor plate"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A ceramic armor plate, specifically engineered for use as armor.  Not suitable for human use."
msgstr "一块陶瓷装甲板，专门设计用于护甲。不适合直接穿戴。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic flower pot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A cheap plastic pot used for planting."
msgstr "一个便宜的塑料花盆，可以用来种植。"

#. ~ Description of "amplifier circuit"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A circuit designed to amplify the strength of a signal.  Useful in lots of electronics recipes."
msgstr "一个用于放大信号的电路。用于制造许多电子设备。"

#. ~ Description of "transponder circuit"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A circuit designed to repeat a signal.  Useful for crafting communications equipment."
msgstr "一段用于重复某段信号的电路。用于制造通讯设备。"

#. ~ Description of "ballast organs"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A cluster of hydrostatic organs, each about the size of a baseball, retrieved from inside a kraken mutant.  Some of them seem to be lighter than air, and some seem to weigh as much as air."
msgstr "一团静压流体器官，每个都有棒球那么大，是从一只海怪变种怪物体内割下来的。有些似乎比空气还轻，而有些似乎和空气一样重。"

#. ~ Description of "cluster of gas sacs"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A cluster of membranous bubbles, each about the size of a grape, retrieved from inside a mutant insect.  They float like tiny helium balloons - perhaps they are full of a lighter-than-air gas."
msgstr "一团薄膜状气泡，每一个都有葡萄大小，是从某种变异的巨型昆虫体内屠宰而来的。它们像微小的氦气球一样在空中漂浮，可能内部充满了比空气还轻的气体。"

#. ~ Description of "adobe brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, baked dry enough to harden into a brick."
msgstr "一块压实的土壤和天然纤维，烘焙得足够干燥，可以硬化成砖块。"

#. ~ Description of "soft adobe brick"
#. ~ Description of "soft adobe brick (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, still too wet to build with.  Load it onto a pallet and leave it to dry."
msgstr "一块压实的土壤和天然纤维，仍然太湿，无法用它建造。把它装到托盘上，让它晾干。"

#. ~ Description of "delayed fuze"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A complex mechanical fuze.  It seems it can be used to detonate stable explosives after a short time by triggering it."
msgstr "一个结构复杂的机械引信。它似乎可以在触发后经过一小段特定时间后引爆稳定炸药。"

#. ~ Description of "impact fuze"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A complex mechanical fuze.  It seems it can be used to detonate stable explosives upon a solid impact."
msgstr "一个结构复杂的机械引信。它似乎可以在受到强烈撞击后引爆稳定炸药。"

#. ~ Description of "condensor coil"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A compressor and fan that work together to cool down refrigerant."
msgstr "一套用来冷凝制冷剂的压缩机和风扇。"

#. ~ Description of "withered plant"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A dead plant.  Good for starting fires or making crude tailoring crafts."
msgstr "一株枯萎的植物。适合生火或制成裁缝制品。"

#. ~ Description of "large damaged tent"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A family-sized tent, very bulky but with plenty of space.  This tent is broken and cannot be deployed."
msgstr "一顶供家庭使用的帐篷，很大，空间充裕。可惜它的龙骨已经断裂，不能再次撑开使用。"

#. ~ Description of "fishbowl"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A filled fishbowl, the tag says 'to Ed' and the fish's name, 'Hoss'.  The fish appears to have tiny antlers."
msgstr "一个充满水的鱼缸，标签上写着\"送给艾德\"和里面的鱼的名字\"霍斯\"，看起来鱼已经变异出微小的鹿角。"

#. ~ Description of "brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fire-hardened building block used in masonry construction."
msgstr "一块经过火烤硬化后的建筑材料，用在各种砖石结构中。"

#. ~ Description of "petrified eye"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fist-sized eyeball with a cross-shaped pupil.  It seems to be made of stone, but doesn't look like it was carved."
msgstr ""
"这颗拳头大小的眼球有个十字形的瞳孔，虽然看起来好像是石头做的，但完全看不出雕刻的痕迹。\n"
"\"似乎散发着奇异的感觉。\""

#. ~ Description of "large wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A flat case used to carry items such as currency, identification documents, laminated cards, and other small items."
msgstr "一个扁平的袋子，用于携带货币、身份证件、塑料卡片，以及其他小型物品。"

#. ~ Description of "travel wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A flat case with a neck strap, used to carry items such as currency, identification documents, laminated cards, and other small items."
msgstr "一个能够挂在脖子上的扁平袋子，用于携带货币、身份证件、塑料卡片，以及其他小型物品。"

#. ~ Description of "mower blade"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A flat steel blade with openings for fasteners and one tapered edge on either end.  It's meant to function as part of a machine and in its present state would make an awkward weapon."
msgstr "一种扁平钢制刀片，两端各有紧固件孔，且各有一侧呈锥形边缘。其设计用途为机器部件，以其当前形态作为武器使用会相当笨拙。"

#. ~ Description of "lanyard"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A flat, clear plastic sleeve for identification documents, laminated cards, and other small items.  It has a neck strap attached."
msgstr "一个扁平的透明塑料套，能够用来装身份证、多层卡片和其他小物件。它有一条颈带。"

#. ~ Description of "down-filled pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fluffy pillow to rest your head on when sleeping."
msgstr "一只软软的充填着羽绒的枕头。"

#. ~ Description of "cottonwood tree boll"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fluffy white seed.  While it looks like the common cotton, it is too weak and short to be turned into clothing."
msgstr "蓬松的白色种子。虽然它看起来像普通的棉花球，但纤维太弱太短，不能做成衣服。"

#. ~ Description of "lump of clay"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fresh piece of clay.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "一块新鲜的黏土，用来制造许多东西。"

#. ~ Description of "abstract plastic card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A generic plastic card item template with numbers based off a credit card."
msgstr "一种通用的塑料卡，其上的数字基于一张信用卡。"

#. ~ Description of "gold chalice"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A gold chalice."
msgstr "一个黄金圣杯。"

#. ~ Description of "armored training dummy"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  This one is covered in scrap armor and looks on guard.  You need to embed it into the ground for training."
msgstr "一个手工制作的人偶，用于近战训练。这个穿着一套废料制成的护甲并看起来像是在防守。你需要把它放置在地上才能进行训练。"

#. ~ Description of "training dummy"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  This one is made from wood and has some duct tape to mark the striking points.  You need to embed it into the ground for training."
msgstr "一个手工制作的人偶，用于近战训练。这个是木头做的，它上面用强力胶带标记出了一些可以击打的目标。你需要把它放置在地上才能进行训练。"

#. ~ Description of "chamomile flowers"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A handful of white chamomile flowers, used as an herbal remedy since ancient times."
msgstr "一把白洋甘菊，自古以来用作草药。"

#. ~ Description of "spurge flowers"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A handful of yellow-green flowers.  Can be brewed into a tea that prevents asthma attacks."
msgstr "一种黄绿色的花。花朵可以制成预防哮喘发作的茶。"

#. ~ Description of "heating element"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A heating element, like the ones used in hotplates or kettles.  Consists of nichrome wire surrounded by electrical insulator and placed inside a steel casing."
msgstr "加热元件，通常用在电炉或电水壶等中。由镍铬合金电热丝组成，由绝缘体包裹，置于钢壳内。"

#. ~ Description of "DARPA hard case"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A heavy and very durable protective case made of steel and thick plastic, locked with a six-dial combination.  A sticker with the logo of DARPA is attached to the front, but looking at the surface, you can see that another marking - formerly stenciled into the material - was recently and hastily destroyed."
msgstr "一个十分坚固耐用的保险箱，由钢和厚塑料制成，被一个密码盘锁紧。正面贴着一张带有DARPA标志的贴纸，但观察它的表面，你可以勉强分辨出另一个标志——曾被蜡印在箱体上——最近刚被匆匆销毁。"

#. ~ Description of "salt lick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A heavy cube-shaped block of salt for livestock.  Don't lick it, it's gross."
msgstr "一大块沉重的立方体食盐块，供牲畜食用。别舔它，太恶心了。"

#. ~ Description of "manhole cover"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A heavy iron disc that typically covers a ladder into the sewers.  Lifting it from the manhole is impossible without a crowbar."
msgstr "一块铁制的大圆盘，通常用来盖在下水道的入口处。如果没有撬棍是几乎不可能将它移出井口。"

#. ~ Description of "high-quality lens"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A high-quality glass lens, useful for focusing or diffusing light.  Might be useful for starting a fire."
msgstr "一个高品质的玻璃镜头，可以用来聚光或散光。或许还可以用来生火。"

#. ~ Description of "tree spile"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A hollow metal cylinder which is inserted in a tree crust in order to slowly harvest its sap.  Can be used on a maple tree between late winter and early spring to harvest maple sap."
msgstr "一根食指大小的中空金属管，把它深深地插进树皮里就可以从中缓慢的获得树汁。可以在晚冬早春时节从枫树里收集枫树树汁。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of cloth patches"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A hundred cloth patches, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr "100片棉布条，系紧打包以便存放。可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of felt"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A hundred felt patches, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr "100片毛毡片，系紧打包以便存放。可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "television"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A large LCD television, full of delicious electronics."
msgstr "一台大屏幕液晶电视，接收不到信号无法观看电视节目，可以使用工具拆解以获得其中零件。"

#. ~ Description of "large LCD screen"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A large backlit screen, used for displaying images.  Useful in some electronics recipes."
msgstr "一个大型背光式屏幕，用于显示图像。用于制造某些电子设备。"

#. ~ Description of "household water heater"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A large metal tank with a water faucet attached to it, primarily used to store and heat water."
msgstr "一个大金属罐，上面有个水龙头，主要用来储存和加热水。"

#. ~ Description of "family–sized household water heater"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A large metal tank with a water faucet attached to it, primarily used to store and heat water.  Large enough for a whole family."
msgstr "一个大金属罐，上面有个水龙头，主要用来储存和加热水。它足够大，可以满足一家人的用水需求。"

#. ~ Description of "scythe blade"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A large, curved blade.  Could be used to assemble a scythe, or make an improvised polearm."
msgstr "一块又大又弯的刀片。可以组装成镰刀，或者制作成一把简易的长柄武器。"

#. ~ Description of "spring"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A large, heavy-duty spring.  Expands with significant force when compressed."
msgstr "一根巨大的弹簧。可以承受不少力，且弹性十足。"

#. ~ Description of "barbed wire"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A length of stiff wire, covered in sharp barbs."
msgstr "一条有着锋利的倒钩的长线。"

#. ~ Description of "wire"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A length of thin, relatively stiff steel wire.  Like the sort you find in chain link fences."
msgstr "一段相对较硬的细钢丝，就像常见的铁丝网上的钢丝一样。"

#. ~ Description of "piano wire"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A length of thin, relatively stretchy coiled steel wire.  Used to produce musical notes in instruments."
msgstr "一段相对较硬的细钢丝，就像常见的铁丝网上的钢丝一样。"

#. ~ Description of "small railroad track"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A length of track, made from some planks and rails."
msgstr "一段窄轨铁路轨道，由一些木板和铁轨制成。"

#. ~ Description of "lotus flower"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A lovely flower that grows on the surface of bodies of fresh water.  Traditionally connected with many Eastern cultures."
msgstr ""
"一种生长在淡水表面的可爱的花。传统上与许多东方文化相联系。\n"
"\"接天莲叶无穷碧\""

#. ~ Description of "chunk of biosilicified chitin"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A lump of exoskeleton that has undergone biosilicification.  It is acid-resistant but rather brittle."
msgstr "一块经过生物硅化反应的昆虫外壳。防酸但很脆弱。"

#. ~ Description of "opal"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A lustrous opal."
msgstr "一颗光滑圆润的蛋白石。"

#. ~ Description of "pearl"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A lustrous pearl."
msgstr "一颗光滑圆润的珍珠。"

#. ~ Description of "autoclave pouch"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A medical device that bears the approval of the FDA (Food and Drug Administration).  If used properly, this pouch can keep things sterile indefinitely."
msgstr "一个通过了美国国家食品药品监督管理局认证的医疗用品。如果使用恰当，这种袋子可以使其他物品保持永久无菌状态。"

#. ~ Description of "drone memory bank"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A memory bank containing the information collected by the meteorologist drone."
msgstr "包含气象学无人机收集信息的记忆库。"

#. ~ Description of "withered bouquet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A mixed collection of flowers.  Unfortunately, they have all withered with time."
msgstr "一整束混合品种的花，可惜它们都随着时间枯萎了。"

#. ~ Description of "signal receiver"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A module designed to receive many forms of signals.  Useful for crafting communications equipment."
msgstr "一个用来接收多种形式信号的模块。用于制造通讯设备。"

#. ~ Description of "lawnmower"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A motorized pushmower that seems to be broken.  You could take it apart if you had a wrench."
msgstr "一台已损坏的电动手推式割草机，可以使用扳手进行拆解以获得其中的零件。"

#. ~ Description of "clay flower pot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A nice-looking clay pot used for planting."
msgstr "一个漂亮的陶花盆，可以用来种植。"

#. ~ Description of "tinted glass lenses"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A pair of small, darkened glass lenses, like the ones used in sunglasses."
msgstr "一对被染黑的小型玻璃镜片，就和用于制造太阳镜的玻璃镜片一样。"

#. ~ Description of "loyalty card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A paper card with spaces marked for stamps or punches to be added upon repeat visits to a business."
msgstr "带有空格的纸卡，用于在重复访问企业时添加印章或打孔。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of chitin"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A piece of a giant arthropod's exoskeleton.  It is light and very durable."
msgstr "巨型节肢动物的外骨骼的一部分。  它很轻而且非常耐用。"

#. ~ Description of "strand of endochitin"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A piece of chitin which was growing on the inside of a giant arthropod's body."
msgstr "生长在巨型节肢动物体内的甲壳碎片。"

#. ~ Description of "pile of straw"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A pile of dry grass.  Can be used to craft a straw bed if there is nothing else to sleep on."
msgstr "一堆干草。实在没什么地方可以躺了，就用它来做张稻草床吧。"

#. ~ Description of "pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A pillow to rest your head on when sleeping."
msgstr "一个由棉花填充的睡眠工具，在睡觉时可以放松头部。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A pillowcase with straw and other dead plants as filling.  It's better than nothing…"
msgstr "一只用稻草和其他枯萎植物作填充物的枕头。总比什么都没有好……"

#. ~ Description of "pilot light"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A pilot light from a gas-burning device, this particular one is a simple piezoelectric igniter."
msgstr "从燃气装置上拆下来的辅助燃烧辅助点火器，这个是压电性的。"

#. ~ Description of "power converter"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A power supply unit.  Useful in lots of electronics recipes."
msgstr "一个供电模块。用于制造许多电子设备。"

#. ~ Description of "crude heating element"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A primitive heating element made from thin coiled steel wire.  It will degrade much quicker with use than normal heating elements, but it'll do for some applications."
msgstr "一款造型简陋的加热元件，由细钢丝盘绕制成。与普通的加热元件相比，它的热效比大大降低，但在某些场合中会起作用。"

#. ~ Description of "circuit board"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A printed card that supports and electrically connects electronic components on a non-conductive substrate."
msgstr "一块印刷好的电路板，能将安装在不导电的衬底上的各个电子部件通过金属连线连接起来。"

#. ~ Description of "cannabis plant"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A psychoactive plant indigenous to Central Asia and the Indian subcontinent traditionally cultivated for its fiber, oil, for medicinal purposes, and for use as a recreational drug.  It requires further processing to be useful."
msgstr "一种致幻植物，源自中亚及印度次大陆。传统用途包括获取其纤维、油料、医用、及用作消遣毒品。需要进一步加工来使用。"

#. ~ Description of "electronic scrap"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A random collection of resistors, capacitors, and diodes which have been stripped from printed circuits."
msgstr "一堆从印刷电路板上拆下来的各种电阻、电容和二极管。"

#. ~ Description of "light bulb"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A rather outdated light bulb used in all sorts of lighting equipment."
msgstr "一个较为过时的电灯泡，用于各种发光设备中。"

#. ~ Description of "fire brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A reinforced brick designed to withstand intense heat."
msgstr "一块经过强化能够承受高温的砖块。"

#. ~ Description of "spiral stone"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A rock the size of your fist.  It is covered with intricate spirals; it is impossible to tell whether they are carved, naturally formed, or some kind of fossil."
msgstr "拳头般大小的岩石。有着复杂的螺旋图形，你也不知道它是雕刻的，还是自然形成的，亦或是某种化石。"

#. ~ Description of "rebar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A rod of rebar.  It's too thin, too floppy, and too heavy to be much use as a weapon."
msgstr "一根钢筋。  它太薄、太软、太重，不太适合用作武器。"

#. ~ Description of "sassafras root"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A root taken from a sassafras tree.  Used in the production of certain sweet beverages."
msgstr "从黄樟树上取下的根。 用于生产某些甜味饮料。"

#. ~ Description of "LIXA research archive backup"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A secured USB thumb drive, containing a copy of the LIXA facility's research archives."
msgstr "一个安全的 USB 拇指驱动器，包含 LIXA 设施研究档案的副本。"

#. ~ Description of "evaporator coil"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A set of long, snakelike tubes for evaporating refrigerant."
msgstr "一套用来蒸发制冷剂的细长蛇形管。"

#. ~ Description of "willowbark"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sheet of bark taken from a willow tree.  Used in the production of aspirin."
msgstr "一片从柳树上取得的树皮，可用于制造阿司匹林。"

#. ~ Description of "paper"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sheet of paper.  It might be useful for starting a fire."
msgstr "一张纸。  它可能对生火有用。"

#. ~ Description of "tanbark"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sheet of tannin-rich bark from a tree, useful for tanning leather"
msgstr "一大块富含单宁的树皮，用于鞣制皮革。"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sheet of tough, water-resistant bark taken from a birch tree."
msgstr "一片既坚硬又防水的树皮，从桦树上取得。"

#. ~ Description of "bimetal thermostat"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A simple thermostat controlled by thermal expansion of a bimetal strip."
msgstr "由双金属片的热膨胀控制的简单恒温器。"

#. ~ Description of "antenna"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A simple thin copper shaft.  Useful in lots of electronics recipes."
msgstr "一个简单的细铜轴。用于制造许多电子设备。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic die"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A six-sided plastic die."
msgstr "一个六面的塑料骰子。"

#. ~ Description of "small LCD screen"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small backlit screen, used for displaying images.  Useful in some electronics recipes."
msgstr "一个小型背光式屏幕，用于显示图像。用于制造某些电子设备。"

#. ~ Description of "desk fan"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small fan, used to propel air around a room."
msgstr "一台小型风扇，可以用来使房间的空气流动。"

#. ~ Description of "hand mirror"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small hand mirror."
msgstr "一块手持小镜子，也可以作为反光镜安装在载具上。"

#. ~ Description of "small lock and key"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small lock, with its key still inserted."
msgstr "一把小锁，上面插着钥匙。"

#. ~ Description of "clock"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small mechanical clock, it's stopped at 10:10."
msgstr ""
"\"10:10\"\n"
"一个小机械钟，已经停止运作。"

#. ~ Description of "annotated paper scrap"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small scrap of paper with two long character sequences scribbled on it."
msgstr "一段2厘米长的碎纸，上面有潦草的字迹。"

#. ~ Description of "refrigerant tank"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small tank containing some sort of refrigerant often used in devices such as freezers.  Hermetically sealed to prevent evaporation - cannot be opened without prior connection to a compatible valve."
msgstr "一种装有某种制冷剂的小型金属罐，常用于制冷设备中，为防止蒸发已被完全密封。需要连接到特制的阀门上才能打开。"

#. ~ Description of "damaged tent"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small tent, just big enough to fit one person comfortably.  This tent is broken and cannot be deployed."
msgstr "一顶小帐篷，足够一个人舒舒服服地钻进去睡大觉。但这个帐篷已经坏了，无法撑开。"

#. ~ Description of "wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small, flat case used to carry items such as currency, identification documents, and laminated cards."
msgstr "一个小而扁平的袋子，用于携带货币、身份证件和塑料卡片等物品。"

#. ~ Description of "small high-quality lens"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small, high-quality glass lens, useful for focusing or diffusing light.  Might be useful for crafting."
msgstr "一个小型高品质的玻璃镜头，可以用来聚光或散光。可用于制成其他物品。"

#. ~ Description of "twig"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small, slender branch.  Makes passable firewood but is not useful for much else."
msgstr "5厘米长的小树枝。很细，除了当柴火，没什么别的用处。"

#. ~ Description of "prototype I/O recorder"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small, transparent card that was attached to the prototype robot's CPU.  It might contain the data the intercom spoke of."
msgstr "这张小小的透明卡连接到了原型机器人的CPU上。它可能包含对讲机提到的数据。"

#. ~ Description of "box archery target"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A soft target for archery, consisting of tightly-packed cloth stuffed into a cardboard box, with a bullseye marked on the front.  Must be set up to use."
msgstr "一个射箭用的软靶，由紧密塞满布条的硬纸盒制成，正面画着一个靶心。需要放置后使用。"

#. ~ Description of "alexandrite"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling alexandrite."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的紫翠玉。"

#. ~ Description of "amethyst"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling amethyst."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的紫水晶。"

#. ~ Description of "aquamarine"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling aquamarine."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的海蓝宝石。"

#. ~ Description of "topaz"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling blue topaz."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的蓝黄玉。"

#. ~ Description of "citrine"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling citrine."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的黄水晶。"

#. ~ Description of "diamond"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling diamond."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的钻石。"

#. ~ Description of "emerald"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling emerald."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的祖母绿。"

#. ~ Description of "garnet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling garnet."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的石榴石。"

#. ~ Description of "malachite"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling malachite."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的孔雀石。"

#. ~ Description of "peridot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling peridot."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的橄榄石。"

#. ~ Description of "ruby"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling ruby."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的红宝石。"

#. ~ Description of "sapphire"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling sapphire."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的蓝宝石。"

#. ~ Description of "tourmaline"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling tourmaline."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的电气石。"

#. ~ Description of "dead flare"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A spent magnesium flare.  It is essentially trash."
msgstr "一个已经燃烧完毕的照明弹。本质上是垃圾，且不可回收。"

#. ~ Description of "pinecone"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A spiny pod from a pine tree."
msgstr "一颗松树所结出多刺松果。"

#. ~ Description of "accounting records"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A stack of various forms and papers with credits and debits listed all over them, detailing transactions and purchases.  Reading over them, all of the balances are mismatched, and a significant amount of money is missing."
msgstr "一堆各种表格和文件，上面列出了贷项和借项，详细说明了交易和购买情况。仔细阅读之后，你发现它们完全无法匹配，大量资金直接消失了。"

#. ~ Description of "accounting records"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A stack of various forms and papers with credits and debits listed all over them, detailing transactions and purchases.  Reading over them, everything is in good order, whoever did these is skilled at their job."
msgstr "一堆各种表格和文件，上面列出了贷项和借项，详细说明了交易和购买情况。仔细阅读之后，里面的一切都十分精确而正常，仿佛出自一位熟练的会计之手。"

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template (UHMWPE)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set required for the fabrication of advanced armor materials.  This seems to just be routines for working with the materials, not actual armor schematics."
msgstr "一套最先进的光学存储系统，存有制造高级护甲材料所需的指令集。看来只是处理材料的通用程序，而非实际的护甲制造设计图。"

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template (silicon photonics)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set required for the fabrication of complex silicon photonic circuitry.  The data within was once clearly worth millions, but now, you are not sure if it's anything more than a fancy, high-tech paperweight."
msgstr "一套最先进的光学存储系统，包含了制造复杂硅光子电路所必须的指令。里面的数据显然曾经价值千万，但是事到如今，你不知道它除了拿来当个花哨的高科技镇纸之外还能用来做什么。"

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set to replicate itself."
msgstr "一种最先进的光学存储系统，包含全套用于复制自身的操作手册。"

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A state-of-the-art optical storage system.  This small slate of transparent glass holds, inscribed as a miniature pattern, the instructions required to create an item through a nanofabricator."
msgstr "一套最先进的光学存储系统。这一小块透明玻璃板上，刻着一个微缩图案，集成了纳米制造机制造物品时所需要的指令。"

#. ~ Description of "steel plate"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A steel armor plate, specifically engineered for use in a bullet-resistant vest."
msgstr "一块钢制装甲板，专为防弹背心而设计。"

#. ~ Description of "RAM"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A stick of memory.  Useful in advanced electronics crafting."
msgstr "一根内存条。用于制造高级电子设备。"

#. ~ Description of "alder bark"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A strip of bark pulled from an alder tree.  Used in the production of topical hemostatics."
msgstr "一片从桤木上取得的树皮，可用于制造局部止血药。"

#. ~ Description of "stylish wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A stylish flat case used to carry items such as currency, identification documents, laminated cards, and other small items."
msgstr "一个款式时髦的扁平袋子，用于携带货币、身份证件、塑料卡片，以及其他小型物品。"

#. ~ Description of "radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A system designed to convert a radio station into an autonomous repeater."
msgstr "一个被设计用来将普通的无线电站转换为自动中继器的装置。"

#. ~ Description of "adobe mortar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A thick, pasty mud, low in sand content to reduce crumbling once dry.  Used to glue larger, heavier pieces of mud and clay together."
msgstr "一团厚厚的泥巴糊，含沙量低，一旦干了就能减少碎裂。用来粘合更大更重的泥块和黏土。"

#. ~ Description of "rubber cement"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A tin of adhesive typically used to glue rubber together.  It forms a less rigid bond than typical superglue, making it ideal for projects requiring flexibility.  Typically smelly and toxic."
msgstr "一罐通常用来粘橡胶的胶水。它能够形成比常见的万能胶更软的胶体，这使它非常适合用于需要弹性的场合。多带有刺激气味且有毒。"

#. ~ Description of "fertilizer"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A token representing fertilization of a plant."
msgstr "一个标记，植物已经使用过肥料。"

#. ~ Description of "pipe cleaner"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A tool designed to clean the interior surface of pipes, bottles, and similar objects.  This one is thin enough to be used for cleaning firearm barrels from dirt and fouling."
msgstr "一个用于清洁管道、瓶子和类似物体内部表面的工具。这个足够细，可以用来清洗枪管内的灰尘和污垢。"

#. ~ Description of "burnt out torch"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A torch that has consumed all its fuel; it can be recrafted into another torch."
msgstr "燃尽了的火炬，加上燃料或就能当新的用了。"

#. ~ Description of "cigar butt"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A true gentleman always finishes his cigars."
msgstr "真汉子从来都是抽到烟屁股的好哇！"

#. ~ Description of "shrapnel"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A twisted shard of jagged metal."
msgstr "一块扭曲而凹凸不平的金属碎片。"

#. ~ Description of "micro electric motor"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A very small electric motor like those used in RC cars or electric hair trimmers."
msgstr "一种非常小的电动马达，就是用在电动遥控车中的那种。可用于制造各种电子设备。"

#. ~ Description of "duct tape wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A wallet made entirely out of duct tape."
msgstr "一个完全由强力胶带制成的钱包。"

#. ~ Description of "leather wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A wallet made of leather."
msgstr "一个由皮革制成的钱包。"

#. ~ Description of "INCIDENT REPORT: IMMERSION-27A"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A white piece of paper on official-looking stationary.  It seems to be an internal report of some kind."
msgstr "一张白纸，左上角印有 XEDRA 的标志，看起来像是一份内部报告。"

#. ~ Description of "cash card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A yellow plastic card used to electronically store money.  It holds up to 2 million dollars."
msgstr "一张黄色的塑料卡，用于存储电子货币。它最多可容纳200万美元。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "ANOMALOUS ARTIFACT REPORT"
msgid_plural "ANOMALOUS ARTIFACT REPORT"
msgstr[0] "异常神器报告"

#. ~ Description of "circular sawblade"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An 8\" circular sawblade.  You could make a saw with it, or throw it.  Wielding it without sturdy gloves is a bad idea."
msgstr "8吋圆锯刃片。可以拿它做把圆锯，扔出去也可以。边缘锋利，请先戴手套再扔它。"

#. ~ Description of "t-substrate sample"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An acrylic cube cast around a small black crystal.  It's tepid to the touch."
msgstr "一小块密封在亚克力玻璃内的黑色晶体，有着微热的触感。"

#. ~ Description of "amplifier head"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An amplifier head.  Typically paired with a speaker cabinet for amplifying musical instruments.  Basically only good for spare parts now."
msgstr "头戴式扩音器，通常与扬声器柜配对，用于放大乐器的声音。现在基本上只能拆掉获得零件。"

#. ~ Description of "household dishwasher"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An appliance used to clean dishes, not of much use without power and water.  Can be placed as an appliance."
msgstr "一台用来洗碗的家电，没水没电就没多大用。可以作为家电放置。"

#. ~ Description of "household washing machine"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An appliance used to wash laundry, not of much use without power and water.  Can be placed as an appliance."
msgstr "一台用来洗衣的家电，没水没电就没多大用。可以作为家电放置。"

#. ~ Description of "hard steel plate"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An armor plate made of very thick steel, specifically engineered for use in a bullet-resistant vest."
msgstr "一块加厚钢制装甲板，专为防弹背心而设计。"

#. ~ Description of "clockwork"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An assortment of miniscule gears and other clockwork gubbins."
msgstr "一堆各式各样的小型齿轮和发条装置。"

#. ~ Description of "cash register"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An electronic device for registering and calculating sales transactions.  It doesn't seem to be working."
msgstr "一台用来记录和计算销售交易的电子设备。它似乎没法工作了。"

#. ~ Description of "empty canister"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An empty canister, which may have once held tear gas or other substances."
msgstr "一个空罐子，里面可能装过催泪弹什么的，有股气味散发出来。"

#. ~ Description of "dog tag"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An identification tag for a pet, engraved with their name and their owner's address and phone number.  It says \"<dog_name>\"."
msgstr "一块宠物识别标签，上面刻有宠物的姓名、主人的地址和电话号码。上面写着：“<dog_name>”。"

#. ~ Description of "straw doll"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An old straw doll, made to look like a woman in a dress."
msgstr "一个老旧的稻草娃娃。看上去是个穿裙子的女性。"

#. ~ Description of "biollante bud"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An unopened biollante flower, brilliant purple in color.  It may still have its sap-producing organ intact."
msgstr "这是一株还未开花的异形花的花苞，呈现出绚丽的紫色，其中可能还原封不动地保存了一些植物的汁液。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Boston-Chan body pillow"
msgid_plural "Boston-Chan body pillows"
msgstr[0] "波士顿酱等身抱枕"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "DARPA hard case"
msgid_plural "DARPA hard cases"
msgstr[0] "DARPA 保险箱"

#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough"
#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "Dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, wrapped in wet paper.  If left to dry for some time, it'll grow koji mold, as necessary for making soy sauce."
msgstr "煮熟并捣碎的大豆混合小麦粉制成的面团，用湿纸包裹。风干一段时间后会长出曲霉菌，这是制作酱油所必需的。"

#. ~ Description of "FEMA data"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Evacuation plans, disaster risk projections, personnel lists, and last-minute communications from just before the end, all scrubbed from FEMA servers and stored in an external HDD."
msgstr "从 FEMA 服务器下载的各种大灾变发生前不久的疏散方案、灾害预测、人员名单和通信记录，存储在一个移动机械硬盘上。"

