msgstr "熄灭"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "FEMA data"
msgid_plural "FEMA data"
msgstr[0] "FEMA数据"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of leather"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Fifty leather patches, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr "50片皮革片，系紧打包以便存放。可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of synthetic fabric"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Fifty synthetic fabric patches, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr "50片化纤布片，系紧打包以便存放。可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of long sticks"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Five long sticks securely tied together for easier transport.  Disassemble to untie them."
msgstr "五根被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的长木棍，可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of javelins"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Five wooden javelins securely tied together for easier transport.  Disassemble to untie them."
msgstr "五根被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的木标枪，可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "bone glue"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Glue made from boiling animal bones.  The adhesive isn't strong enough for heavy-duty usages, but it can be used as a varnish or holding together small items."
msgstr "用动物骨头熬制而成的胶。这种粘合剂粘着性并不太强，但是粘粘一些小手工还是可以的。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "HAADF MICROGRAPH: T-SUBSTRATE"
msgid_plural "HAADF MICROGRAPH: T-SUBSTRATE"
msgstr[0] "高角环形暗场成像：T-基质"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "INCIDENT REPORT: IMMERSION-27A"
msgid_plural "INCIDENT REPORT: IMMERSION-27As"
msgstr[0] "事故报告：沉浸-27A"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "LIXA research archive backup"
msgid_plural "LIXA research archive backup"
msgstr[0] "LIXA研究档案备份"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "MATERIAL: T-SUBSTRATE"
msgid_plural "MATERIAL: T-SUBSTRATE"
msgstr[0] "材料：T-基质"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "MELCHIOR report"
msgid_plural "MELCHIOR reports"
msgstr[0] "梅尔基奥尔报告"

#. ~ Description of "burnt out bionic"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Once a valuable bionic implant, it has not held up well under repeated use.  It has been destroyed by excessive electric current and is now useless."
msgstr "这曾经是块珍贵的生化插件，高强度的使用下它的状态不是很好。而超负荷的电流更是彻底摧毁了它，现在已经不能用了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "RAM"
msgid_plural "RAMs"
msgstr[0] "内存"

#. ~ Description of "rough terrain"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Seeing this is a bug."
msgstr "看到此消息说明遇到了 bug。"

#. ~ Description of "file"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Several documents containing all kinds of information, customer data, and charts, kept together in a manila folder.  Pretty useless now."
msgstr "几份文件资料，包括客户信息、市场分析图表及很多其他东西，收捡于文件袋内。\"别研究了，你已经是街上最受欢迎的仔了\""

#. ~ Description of "cigarette"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Smoke swirls from the lit end of this cigarette, filling the air with the thrilling smell of burning chemicals."
msgstr "烟从这支香烟点燃的末端盘旋而上，让空气中充满了令人陶醉的化学物燃烧的味道。"

#. ~ Description of "unfinished koji rice"
#. ~ Description of "unfinished koji rice (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "Some cooked rice mixed with yeast and koji mold fragments, set aside to let koji mold grow on it so that it can make a passable sake base."
msgstr "将一些煮熟的米饭与酵母和曲霉菌混合，静置使得曲霉菌在上面生长，这样就可以做成一个合格的清酒酒曲。"

#. ~ Description of "growing wild koji mold"
#. ~ Description of "growing wild koji mold (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  If left alone for a while, it will most likely grow koji mold."
msgstr "将一些煮熟的米饭撒上炉灰，并裹在玉米壳之中。静置一段时间，它很可能会长出曲霉菌。"

#. ~ Description of "grown wild koji mold"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  It has grown patches of koji mold inside; disassemble this item to extract it."
msgstr "将一些煮熟的米饭撒上炉灰，并裹在玉米壳之中。它外表长出了一片片的曲霉菌；拆解这个物品将其取出。"

#. ~ Description of "lime mortar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Some lime mortar, made from quicklime and aggregate and ready for building."
msgstr "一些石灰砂浆，由生石灰和骨料制成，可用于建筑。"

#. ~ Description of "dry concrete mix"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Some mixed cement, sand and aggregates, precombined and ready to be used in a construction project."
msgstr "一些混合起来的水泥，沙子和骨料，可以用于建筑。"

#. ~ Description of "mortar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Some mortar, ready to be used in building projects."
msgstr "一堆灰泥，已经准备好，随时可以用到工程建设项目中。"

#. ~ Description of "handful of leaves"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Some ordinary, mostly dry leaves.  They have very few uses and are thus (almost) only good for burning."
msgstr "一些普通的树叶，大部分都干了。用途很少，因此（几乎）只适合当燃料。"

#. ~ Description of "koji rice"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Some rice covered in koji mold, mixed in with yeast.  Useful for making sake, but not really tasty on its own.  Smells vaguely of chestnuts."
msgstr "将一些煮熟的米饭与酵母和曲霉菌混合制成的酒曲。可以用来酿制清酒，但本身并不美味。隐约有栗子的味道。"

#. ~ Description of "laboratory shipping records"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Some type of advanced data storage device, filled with logistical data on subterranean train routes and schedules."
msgstr "某种先进的数据存储设备，里面全是各种地下火车线路和时刻表的后勤数据。"

#. ~ Description of "superglue"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Strong cyanoacrylate glue."
msgstr "强力氰基丙烯酸酯胶。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of planks"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Ten construction planks securely tied together for easier transport.  Disassemble to untie them."
msgstr "十片被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的木板，可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of copper tubing"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Ten copper pipes securely tied together for easier transport.  Disassemble to untie them."
msgstr "十根被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的铜管，可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of pipes"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Ten pipes securely tied together for easier transport.  Disassemble to untie them."
msgstr "十根被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的钢管，可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of rebar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Ten rods of rebar securely tied together for easier transport.  Disassemble to untie them."
msgstr "十根被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的钢筋，可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of sticks"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Ten sticks securely tied together for easier transport.  Disassemble to untie them."
msgstr "十根被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的粗木棍，可拆解。"

#. ~ Description of "broken grocery bot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "The body of a busted grocery bot.  Its tarnished face is still smiling.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台残缺损坏的食杂店机器人，面容黯淡却仍然带着微笑。可以拆解得到部件。"

#. ~ Description of "joint"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "The smell of skunk permeates the air as a thin trail of smoke floats off of this joint."
msgstr "随着一缕缕青烟从这支大麻烟上飘出，空气中弥漫着大麻的臭味。"

#. ~ Description of "cigar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "The smoke billowing from this cigar has a sweet, musty odor."
msgstr "烟从这支雪茄翻滚而出，香甜和霉变的味道混合其中。"

#. ~ Description of "joint roach"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"The smoked-down butt of a joint, a reminder of some good times.  Pretty much trash now.  Bummer, man.\n"
"A few of these could probably be used to roll another joint."
msgstr "被抽剩下的大麻烟蒂，美好时光的最后留念，现在基本就是垃圾，若干份应该足以卷成新的大麻烟。"

#. ~ Description of "drum skin"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "The tanned hide of an animal repurposed to become the head on a percussion drum."
msgstr "晒黑的动物皮被重新用作打击鼓的鼓皮。"

#. ~ Description of "sunflower"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "The top of a sunflower, with yellow petals and some seeds that have yet to be eaten by animals."
msgstr "向日葵的花蕾，有黄色的花瓣和一些尚未被动物吃掉的种子。"

#. ~ Description of "fluid-preserved brain"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This 3 L jar contains a human brain preserved in a formaldehyde solution."
msgstr "一个容量为3L的玻璃罐子，里面有一个保存在福尔马林中的人脑。"

#. ~ Description of "gold gas discount card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This card gives you a good discount on the purchase of gasoline."
msgstr "购买汽油的时候可以便宜一些的优惠卡。"

#. ~ Description of "silver gas discount card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This card gives you a little discount on the purchase of gasoline."
msgstr "购买汽油的时候可以便宜一点的优惠卡。"

#. ~ Description of "platinum gas discount card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This card gives you a splendid discount on the purchase of gasoline."
msgstr "购买汽油的时候可以便宜不少的优惠卡。"

#. ~ Description of "military parachute"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This is a big, bulky military-level parachute, designed to slow the fall of up to a thousand kilograms of cargo dropped from an aircraft.  You have no clue how to put all the straps back in their place."
msgstr "这是个大型的军用降落伞，可使1吨重的货物从飞行器上缓降。你不知道该如何收好上面的绑带放到它们原先的位置。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden pallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This is a heavy and bulky 40x48 inch palette."
msgstr "这是个笨重的木制货运托盘，边长40x48英尺(约1×1.2米)。"

#. ~ Description of "in-progress craft"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This is an in-progress craft."
msgstr "这是一个正在制造中的物品。"

#. ~ Description of "in-progress disassembly"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This is an in-progress disassembly."
msgstr "这是一个正在拆解中的物品。"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of cloth sheets"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Twenty-five cloth sheets, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr "25张棉布面料，系紧打包以便存放。可拆解。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "VTuber body pillow"
msgid_plural "VTuber body pillows"
msgstr[0] "虚拟主播等身抱枕"

#. ~ Description of "raw tobacco"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Various parts of a tobacco plant, full of nicotine.  They need to be dried to become smokable."
msgstr "烟草的各个部分，富含尼古丁。需要先弄干后才能抽。"

#. ~ Description of "cigarette butt"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"What was once a wonderfully addictive tube of dried tobacco leaf is now just a smelly piece of trash.  What a tragedy!\n"
"The leftover tobacco in a few of these could probably be used to roll another cigarette.  If you're willing to go that far…"
msgstr "曾经令人着迷的烟叶卷现在只剩下了一小片有味道的垃圾。如果你烟瘾实在无法解决，可以尝试用多个这东西里边剩下的烟草，应该可以卷成一个新的香烟。"

