#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A ordinary-looking bottle cap with a stamped logo of the Tacoma ranch on the inside.  You can take it back to the bartender with your glass for a small refund."
msgstr "一个外观普通的瓶盖，上面印着塔科马公社的标志。你可以把它和你的酒杯一起拿回去给酒保，换回些退款。"

#. ~ Description of "chit"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A slip of paper signed by the issuer."
msgstr "一张某人签的欠条。"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 Gold Coin"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A small but surprisingly heavy gold coin.  One side is etched with circuitry and the other side reads 'Hub 01 exchange currency'."
msgstr "一枚虽然很小但是很重的金币。一面刻有电路，另一面写着\"Hub 01 兑换币\"。"

#. ~ Description of "icon"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A small picture, about the size of an ID card, symbolizing a religious figure.  On the back, there is text that faintly reads 'New England Church Community'."
msgstr "一张和钥匙卡差不多大小的小卡片，上面的图案象征着某个宗教人物。背面隐约写着\"新英格兰教会社区\"。"

#. ~ Description of "dime"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A ten-cent coin, featuring a portrait of Franklin D Roosevelt.  You could flip it."
msgstr "一枚十美分硬币，印有富兰克林·罗斯福的肖像。你可以把它抛起来。"

#. ~ Description of "ten-dollar bill"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A ten-dollar bill, featuring a portrait of Alexander Hamilton."
msgstr "一张十美元的钞票，印有亚历山大·汉密尔顿的肖像。"

#. ~ Description of "merch currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A thousand Free Merchant Certified Notes, divided evenly between ten improvised currency straps, and bundled together with rubber bands.  This can be exchanged for food, water, and other services through the Free Merchants at the Refugee Center."
msgstr "一千张自由商会的商会币，平均分为十份用自制扎钞带绑好的整刀，用橡皮筋捆在一起。可以用它在位于难民中心的自由商会处等价交换食物、水、或其他服务。"

#. ~ Description of "fifty-dollar currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A thousand fifty-dollar bills, divided evenly between ten brown currency straps, and bundled together with rubber bands."
msgstr "一千张五十美元的钞票，平均分为十份用棕色扎钞带绑好的整刀，用橡皮筋捆在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "five-dollar currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A thousand five-dollar bills, divided evenly between ten red currency straps, and bundled together with rubber bands."
msgstr "一千张五美元的钞票，平均分为十份用红色扎钞带绑好的整刀，用橡皮筋捆在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "hundred-dollar currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A thousand hundred-dollar bills, divided evenly between ten mustard currency straps, and bundled together with rubber bands."
msgstr "一千张一百美元的钞票，平均分为十份用褐黄色扎钞带绑好的整刀，用橡皮筋捆在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "one-dollar currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A thousand one-dollar bills, divided evenly between ten blue currency straps, and bundled together with rubber bands."
msgstr "一千张一美元的钞票，平均分为十份用蓝色扎钞带绑好的整刀，用橡皮筋捆在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "ten-dollar currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A thousand ten-dollar bills, divided evenly between ten yellow currency straps, and bundled together with rubber bands."
msgstr "一千张十美元的钞票，平均分为十份用黄色扎钞带绑好的整刀，用橡皮筋捆在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "twenty-dollar currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A thousand twenty-dollar bills, divided evenly between ten violet currency straps, and bundled together with rubber bands."
msgstr "一千张二十美元的钞票，平均分为十份用紫色扎钞带绑好的整刀，用橡皮筋捆在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "two-dollar currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A thousand two-dollar bills, divided evenly between ten green currency straps, and bundled together with rubber bands."
msgstr "一千张两美元的钞票，平均分为十份用绿色扎钞带绑好的整刀，用橡皮筋捆在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "twenty-dollar bill"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A twenty-dollar bill, featuring a portrait of Andrew Jackson."
msgstr "一张二十美元的钞票，印有安德鲁·杰克逊的肖像。"

#. ~ Description of "quarter"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A twenty-five-cent coin, featuring a portrait of George Washington.  You could flip it."
msgstr "一枚25美分硬币，印有乔治·华盛顿的肖像。你可以把它抛起来。"

#. ~ Description of "two-dollar bill"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A two-dollar bill, featuring a portrait of Thomas Jefferson."
msgstr "一张两美元的钞票，印有托马斯·杰斐逊的肖像。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "American Buffalo coin"
msgid_plural "American Buffalo coins"
msgstr[0] "水牛金币"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "FlatCoin"
msgid_plural "FlatCoins"
msgstr[0] "扁毫子"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "Hub 01 Gold Coin"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 Gold Coins"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 金币"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "Silver Eagle coin"
msgid_plural "Silver Eagle coins"
msgstr[0] "鹰扬银币"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "Tacoma drink token"
msgid_plural "Tacoma drink tokens"
msgstr[0] "塔科马瓶盖"

#. ~ Description of "merch"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "The Free Merchant Certified Note, also known by names such as a 'c-note' or 'merch', is a currency based on old American bills.  Fifty dollar bills and larger are printed with a promissory note signed by the treasurer of the Free Merchants, along with a complex design.  The note explains that this can be exchanged for food, water, and other services through the Free Merchants in the Refugee Center."
msgstr "自由商会认证货币，又被称为\"C币\"或是\"商币\"，是一种以旧美金为基础的货币。一张50美元或更大面额的旧美金本票，经过自由商会财务主管亲笔签字后，又加盖了经过精心设计的复杂图章。纸币上解释了可以用它在位于难民中心的自由商会处等价交换食物、水、或其他服务。"

#. ~ Description of "American Buffalo coin"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "The official 24-karat bullion coin of the United States, it has a nominal face value of fifty dollars and is guaranteed to contain one troy ounce of 99.99% pure gold."
msgstr "一枚美国官方发行的24K纯金硬币，面值为50美元，保证含有一盎司99.99%的纯金。"

#. ~ Description of "Silver Eagle coin"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "The official silver bullion coin of the United States, it has a nominal face value of one dollar and is guaranteed to contain one troy ounce of 99.9% pure silver."
msgstr "一枚美国官方发行的纯银硬币，面值为一美元，保证含有一盎司99.9%的纯银。"

