#. ~ Description of "cast-iron dutch oven"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A cast-iron dutch oven, suitable for boiling, broiling, roasting, baking, stewing, frying and any other method of cooking."
msgstr "一个铸铁荷兰锅，可用于煮沸、烧烤、烘焙、烘烤、炖煮、油炸和任何其他烹饪方法。"

#. ~ Description of "cast-iron frying pan"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A cast-iron pan.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is used for cooking."
msgstr "一只铸铁煎锅。一种不错的近战武器，且能用于烹饪。"

#. ~ Description of "ceramic plate"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A ceramic dinner plate, unremarkable in every way."
msgstr "陶瓷餐盘，各方面都不起眼。"

#. ~ Description of "casserole pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A ceramic pot made for both cooking and serving, particularly one-pot dinners."
msgstr "一只陶瓷砂锅，能烹饪或者上菜用，特别是当晚餐是一锅烩菜的时候。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift copper pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A cooking pot crudely hammered out of copper.  Good enough to cook food and boil water, but not as useful as proper cookware."
msgstr "粗暴地砸凹铜料造出来的锅子。烹食煮水倒是够用了，但是跟正常的锅子比肯定是不成的。"

#. ~ Description of "pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A cooking pot, useful for boiling water and making all kinds of food."
msgstr "一个烹饪锅，用于烧水和制作各种食物。"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A cooking pot, useful for boiling water and making all kinds of food.  Made from aluminum."
msgstr "一个烹饪锅，用于烧水和制作各种食物。这个是由铝制成的。"

#. ~ Description of "copper pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A cooking pot, useful for boiling water and making all kinds of food.  Made from copper, with a lining of tin to prevent metal from leaching into acidic foods."
msgstr "一个烹饪锅，用于烧水和制作各种食物。由铜制成，内层镀锡，以防止酸性食物腐蚀。"

#. ~ Description of "copper frying pan"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A copper frying pan, coated in a thin layer of tin.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is used for cooking."
msgstr "一只铜制煎锅，外部镀了薄薄一层锡。一种不错的近战武器，且能用于烹饪。"

#. ~ Description of "butter knife"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A dull knife, absolutely worthless in combat.  Excellent for spreading soft things on bread."
msgstr "一把钝刀，在战斗中绝对毫无价值。非常适合在面包上涂抹柔软的东西。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic tumbler"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A durable plastic drinking vessel.  This one is made of clear acrylic and looks almost like glass."
msgstr "耐用的塑料饮用容器。这个是透明压克力制成，看起来几乎像玻璃。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic plate"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A durable plastic plate, the sort you might use as patio dishware."
msgstr "耐用的塑料盘，你可以用这类东西作庭院餐具。"

#. ~ Description of "fork"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A fork, if you stab something with it, you eat it right away.  Wait… nevermind."
msgstr "一把叉子，叉了东西之后就可以送进嘴里。等等……现在这么说好像不太对。"

#. ~ Description of "glass bowl"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A glass bowl for soup or dessert."
msgstr "用于汤或甜点的玻璃碗。"

#. ~ Description of "glass plate"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A glass dinner plate, for people who don't have clumsy children."
msgstr "玻璃餐盘，适合没有笨拙孩子的人。"

#. ~ Description of "coffee pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A glass pot for making a cup of joe."
msgstr "一个用来泡咖啡的玻璃壶。"

#. ~ Description of "improvised oven"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A large pot converted into an improvised oven, suitable for basic baking on a hot surface."
msgstr "一口大锅，被改造成一个简易烤箱，适合在高温表面上进行基本的烘焙。"

#. ~ Description of "stock pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A large pot with 20 gauge walls and a thick aluminum bottom, used for making soup stocks.  You could fit a whole turkey in there, with a bit of shoving."
msgstr "一口用来熬汤的大锅，20号锅壁，厚铝锅底。稍微挤挤的话，你可以塞进去一整只火鸡。"

#. ~ Description of "cutting board"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A large, flat piece of wood for chopping vegetables on without ruining your knife or your countertop."
msgstr "一大块扁平的木板，用来切菜，不会磨坏刀子或台面。"

#. ~ Description of "ceramic cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A light ceramic teacup.  Quite classy."
msgstr "轻陶瓷茶杯。相当优雅。"

#. ~ Description of "clay pot oven"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A makeshift oven made of a big clay pot with a lid, containing firebricks to hold heat and a smaller pot to bake in."
msgstr "一个自制的荷兰锅，由一个带盖子的大陶锅制成，里面有耐火砖来保温，还有一个小锅能用来烘烤。"

#. ~ Description of "ceramic bowl"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A perfectly ordinary ceramic soup bowl."
msgstr "非常普通的陶瓷汤碗。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic tupperware"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A piece of plastic tupperware with a matching watertight lid.  Holds 750 mL of liquid."
msgstr "一个带有匹配水密盖子的塑料水杯，可以储存750毫升液体。"

#. ~ Description of "kiddie bowl"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic bowl designed for use by children."
msgstr "设计供儿童使用的塑料碗。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic knife"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic butter knife.  It's actually a bit sharper than its metal counterpart, but that doesn't make it any more effective as a weapon."
msgstr "塑料黄油刀。它的刀刃其实比金属版更锐利，但这并不能让它作为武器使用。"

#. ~ Description of "sippy cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic cup with a spill-proof lid, designed for use by children."
msgstr "带防漏盖的塑料杯，专供儿童使用。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic fork"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic disposable fork.  Great for picnic lunches in the post-apocalyptic wasteland."
msgstr "塑料一次性叉子。非常适合后世界末日废土的野外午餐。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic disposable spoon.  Easier to bend than the metal variety."
msgstr "塑料一次性勺子。比金属勺子更容易被折弯。"

#. ~ Description of "kiddie spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic spoon designed for use by children."
msgstr "专为儿童使用的塑料勺子。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic straw"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic straw, for drinking things and littering."
msgstr ""
"塑料吸管，用于喝饮料以及变成干垃圾。\n"
"\"也许还是可回收垃圾？\""

#. ~ Description of "spatula"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A rubber scraper for making sure you get every last scrap of cookie dough."
msgstr "一把橡胶刮刀，保证你能刮下来每一点面团。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A sheet of metal crudely hammered into a cooking pot.  Good enough to cook food and boil water, but not as useful as proper cookware."
msgstr "粗暴地砸凹金属板造出来的锅子。烹食煮水倒是够用了，但是跟正常的锅子比肯定是不成的。"

#. ~ Description of "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A simple lever for popping open bottles."
msgstr "一个简单的杠杆，用来撬开瓶子。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable peeler"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A simple tool for peeling the outer skin off fruits and veggies without stabbing yourself."
msgstr "一把简单的工具，可以削掉蔬果外皮而不刺伤自己。"

#. ~ Description of "pewter bowl"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A small pewter serving bowl without a lid.  Holds 250 mL of liquid."
msgstr "无盖的小锡碗。容纳250毫升液体。"

#. ~ Description of "coffee mug"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A small, <color> ceramic coffee cup."
msgstr "一只<color>的小号陶瓷咖啡杯。"

#. ~ Description of "cheese grater"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A stainless steel cheese grater with a plastic grip.  It is used to shred cheese."
msgstr "带有塑料手柄的不锈钢奶酪刨丝器，它能用来把奶酪切碎。"

#. ~ Description of "mesh colander"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A stainless steel mesh colander, for washing rice and vegetables, or straining liquid off from noodles or other foods."
msgstr "一个不锈钢滤网，可以用来淘米，洗菜，或者滤掉面条之类东西里的水。"

#. ~ Description of "splatter guard"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A stainless steel mesh screen for preventing flying oil from getting all over your nice counters (or you) when frying."
msgstr "一个用来在炒菜时防止溅油的不锈钢网，你再也不用担心你的崭新柜台（或者你自己）被油溅到了！"

#. ~ Description of "meal tray"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A stainless steel tray used for serving food in cafeterias, mess halls, or similar places."
msgstr "不锈钢托盘，用于在自助餐厅，食堂或类似场所中提供食物。"

#. ~ Description of "steel frying pan"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A steel frying pan.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is used for cooking."
msgstr "一只钢制煎锅。一种不错的近战武器，且能用于烹饪。"

#. ~ Description of "wine glass"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A stemmed drinking glass that makes you feel very fancy when you drink from it."
msgstr "高脚玻璃酒杯，让你喝酒时自觉品味非凡。"

#. ~ Description of "rolling pin"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A stout piece of hardwood, turned and sanded smooth, with rounded handles at the ends.  This timeless kitchen tool also doubles as an effective club."
msgstr "一块经过打磨抛光的结实硬木，两侧的末端带有圆形把手。这款永不过时的厨房工具同时也是一根非常有效的棍棒。"

#. ~ Description of "kettle"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A stovetop kettle for boiling water."
msgstr "用于烧开水的炉灶水壶。"

#. ~ Description of "drinking glass"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A tall drinking glass."
msgstr "一个高高的玻璃水杯。"

#. ~ Description of "tin plate"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A tin dinner plate, lightweight and clanky."
msgstr "锡制餐盘，轻巧而紧凑。"

#. ~ Description of "whisk"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A tool designed for finely mixing ingredients or introducing air into the blend.  Also known as a 'wire whip', but it's a less effective weapon than that name makes it sound."
msgstr "一种用于精细混合成分或将空气引入混合物中的工具。也被称为\"钢丝鞭\"，但如果当武器用起来可不像这个名字那么有效。"

#. ~ Description of "potato masher"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A tool for mashing potatoes and soft root vegetables; it cannot do the twist."
msgstr "一把用来捣碎马铃薯和块根类蔬菜的工具；但它不能用来搅拌。"

#. ~ Description of "can opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A tool for opening cans that lack pull-tabs.  Now that you think about it, you haven't seen any of those around lately."
msgstr "一种用于打开无拉环罐头的工具。不过现在想想，你已经多少年没见过这种罐头了。"

#. ~ Description of "garlic press"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A tool for squashing a clove or two of garlic into a fine paste."
msgstr "一把用来将一两瓣大蒜压成细小糊状物的工具。"

#. ~ Description of "pizza cutter"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A utensil used for cutting pizza.  Practically useless in combat."
msgstr "切披萨饼的用具，在战斗中几乎没什么用。"

#. ~ Description of "icecream scoop"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A utensil used for scooping icecream into bowls.  It has a spring powered lever to assist."
msgstr "一种用于将冰淇淋捞入碗中的器具，它有一个弹簧驱动的杠杆来助力。"

#. ~ Description of "carving fork"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A utensil used to hold meat still while you slice it.  It's like a tiny pitchfork, or a very large dinner fork."
msgstr "切肉时用来固定肉的器具。像一个微型干草叉，或者一个非常大的餐叉。"

#. ~ Description of "canning pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A very large 20 liter pot, primarily meant for canning food in glass jars via the water bath method, though it can cook normal foods just as well.  Canning foods with it will require a lot of water.  If you're only canning a couple of jars at a time, you'd fill it up with rocks or something to displace the water above the lids."
msgstr "一个容量20升的非常大的锅，主要是用于水浴法让玻璃瓶罐装食物，当然它同样可以当作厨具烹饪普通食物。罐装食品需要大量的水。如果你只是一次装几个罐子的话，你需要先放些石头或什么东西抬升水位没过罐子的盖子。"

#. ~ Description of "clay canning pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A very large 25 liter earthenware pot, primarily meant for canning food via the water bath method, though it can cook normal foods just as well.  Canning foods with it will require a lot of water.  If you're only canning a couple of jars at a time, you'd fill it up with rocks or something to displace the water above the lids."
msgstr "一个容量25升的非常大的陶锅，主要是用于水浴法来罐装食物，当然它同样可以当作厨具烹饪普通食物。罐装食品需要大量的水。如果你只是一次装几个罐子的话，你需要先放些石头或什么东西抬升水位没过罐子的盖子。"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum frying pan"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "An aluminum frying pan.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is used for cooking."
msgstr "一只铝制煎锅。一种不错的近战武器，且能用于烹饪。"

#. ~ Description of "tin cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "An enameled tin cup.  Great for camping or for prison use; makes a wonderful sound when clanged along bars."
msgstr "搪瓷锡杯。非常适合露营或监狱使用；敲着杯沿叮当作响，发出美妙的声音。"

#. ~ Description of "foon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "Clearly the superior instrument.  Sporks are just imitators."
msgstr ""
"一个西方国家之中常见的餐具，叉子一端可手握，另一端有二至四条分支，用来插入或盛住食物。\n"
"\"贵人用餐叉，穷蛋用叉勺。\""

#. ~ Description of "spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "Do not try to bend the spoon.  That is impossible."
msgstr ""
"一个喝汤盛饭所用的用餐工具。\n"
"\"试图用念力折弯它是不可能的。\""

