#. ~ Description of variant "$10 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A $10 gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local hardware store."
msgstr "一张价值10美金的礼品卡，可在本地五金店付款时抵扣。"

#. ~ Description of variant "$100 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A $100 electronic gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local megastore."
msgstr "一张价值100美金的电子礼品卡，可在本地购物广场付款时抵扣。"

#. ~ Description of variant "$20 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A $20 gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local clothing store."
msgstr "一张价值20美金的礼品卡，可在本地服装店付款时抵扣。"

#. ~ Description of variant "$5 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A $5 gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local bookstore."
msgstr "一张价值5美金的礼品卡，可在本地书店付款时抵扣。"

#. ~ Description of variant "baby shower card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A baby blue greeting card with a drawing of a teddy bear holding an umbrella.  Words printed on it read: \"It's getting closer by the hour, so let's have a baby shower!\""
msgstr "一张淡蓝色的贺卡，上面画着一只泰迪熊拿着一把伞。上面印着一行文字：\"时间越来越近了，我们来洗个婴儿澡吧！\""

#. ~ Description of variant "sympathy card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A black greeting card with a picture of a dimly lit candle.  Words printed on it read: \"Please accept our deepest and most heartfelt condolences at this challenging time.\""
msgstr "一张黑色的贺卡，上面画着一支昏暗的蜡烛。上面写着：\"在这个充满挑战的时刻，请接受我们最深切、最衷心的哀悼。\""

#. ~ Description of "envelope"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A flat paper container with a sealable flap, used to enclose a letter or other paper goods."
msgstr "一个带有封口的扁平纸制容器，用于封装信件或其他纸制品。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pink slip" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A folded pink sheet of paper declaring the homeowner fired!  Oh no."
msgstr "一张折叠的粉红色纸片，宣布房主被踢出门了！哦，不！"

#. ~ Description of variant "restaurant gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A gift card for a local restaurant, covering the cost for an entire meal."
msgstr "一张本地餐厅的礼品卡，可以支付一顿饭的费用。"

#. ~ Description of variant "greeting card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A greeting card for expressing best wishes.  Its corners are decorated with paintings of flowers and leaves."
msgstr "一张用来表达美好祝愿的贺卡。它的四周装饰着花和叶子的图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "birthday card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A greeting card given to a person to celebrate their birthday.  This one has a floral design."
msgstr "送给某人庆祝生日的贺卡。这张上印着花卉图案。"

#. ~ Description of variant "retirement card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A greeting card wishing the recipient a long and happy retirement.  This one displays a drawing of a rocking chair surrounded with white roses."
msgstr "一张贺卡，祝收信人退休愉快。这张上印了一张被白玫瑰环绕的摇椅。"

#. ~ Description of variant "friendship card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A greeting card with a stylized picture of a donut and a coffee cup.  Above the picture, it says 'I am thankful for our friendship' and below are the words 'we are better together'."
msgstr "带有风格化的甜甜圈和咖啡杯图片的贺卡。图片上方写着\"感谢我们的友谊\"，下方写着\"我们在一起更好\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "letter from the bank" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A letter from the bank stating the homeowners account is overdrawn and they owe quite a bit of money."
msgstr "银行的一封信，说明房主账户透支，他们欠了不少钱。"

#. ~ Description of variant "late rent notice" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A letter to recipient notifying them of their overdue rent, they have 30 days to pay or they are going to court!"
msgstr "给收件人的一封信，通知他们拖欠的租金，他们有 30 天的时间支付，否则他们将上法庭！"

#. ~ Description of variant "automated speeding ticket" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A notice from the local police, there is a tiny picture of a car and a demand of 350 dollars for speeding in a school zone."
msgstr "一张当地警方的通知，显示有一张汽车的照片，并因在学区超速行驶而被罚款350美元。"

#. ~ Description of variant "credit card offer" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A notification from a credit card company, the recipient has been preapproved!  Attached in a thick wad of glue is a fake credit card, this could be theirs if they wanted it."
msgstr "信用卡公司的通知，收件人已获得预先批准！粘在厚厚一团胶水里的是一张假信用卡，如果他们想要的话，这可能是他们的。"

#. ~ Description of "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A piece of card stock meant to convey an expression of sentiment."
msgstr "一张意在传递情感的卡片。"

#. ~ Description of "postcard"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A piece of thick, rectangular paper intended for writing and mailing without an envelope."
msgstr "一张厚厚的长方形纸片，用于书写和邮寄，无需信封。"

#. ~ Description of variant "thank you card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A plain white greeting card featuring an expression of gratitude to the recipient."
msgstr "一张素白的贺卡，上面写着对收信人的感激之情。"

#. ~ Description of "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A small card that can be exchanged for goods or services from a particular business, usually given as a gift."
msgstr "一张小卡片，可以从特定企业兑换商品或服务，通常作为礼物赠送。"

#. ~ Description of variant "farewell card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A white greeting card with a stylized drawing of an empty road.  Words printed on it read: \"You're going places (literally).  Wishing you the best!\""
msgstr "这是一张白色贺卡，上面画着一条空旷的道路。上面印着这样的文字：\"你将离我而去（字面上）。祝你一路顺风！\""

#. ~ Description of variant "sad letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A written message from a soldier to their parents.  Their deployment has been extended and they won't be home for the holidays.  This sad letter makes you feel homesick."
msgstr "一名士兵给他们父母的书面信息。他们的军事部署已被延长，他们不会回家过节。这封悲伤的信让你感到思乡。"

#. ~ Description of variant "love letter" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A written message from a soldier to their partner, carefully folded into its envelope.  Their deployment ends soon and they can't wait to see their lover.  Reading the rest of it would be rude."
msgstr "一个士兵给他的伴侣的书面信息，小心翼翼地折在信封里。他们的军事部署即将结束，他们迫不及待地想见到他们的爱人。阅读它的其余部分是不礼貌的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "angry letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A written message from a soldier to their partner, stuffed angrily into its envelope.  They know, they know she knows, and don't even pretend you don't know.  This letter is full of expletives you don't dare read aloud."
msgstr "一个士兵给他们的伙伴的书面信息，愤怒地塞进信封。他们知道，他们知道她知道，不要假装你不知道。这封信里充满了你不敢大声读出的脏话。"

#. ~ Description of variant "letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A written message from a student to their parents scrawled on notebook paper.  They're having a great time at college and can't wait to introduce you to their new lover.  Coincidently they have run out of money for gas again and it sure would be great if you could send some."
msgstr "一个学生给他们父母的书信，写在笔记本纸上。他们在大学过得很开心，迫不及待地想把你介绍给他们的新恋人。巧合的是，他们又没钱买汽油了，如果你能打一些钱，肯定会很好。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sad letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A written message from a student to their parents scrawled on notebook paper.  They're having a really bad time at college and want to come home, nothing seems to be going well, their grades and heart are in the dumps."
msgstr "一个学生写在笔记本纸上给他们父母的书面信息。他们在大学里过得非常糟糕，想回家，似乎没有什么事情是顺利的，他们的成绩和心都很糟糕。"

#. ~ Description of variant "love letter" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A written message from a woman to her lover, it's sealed with a heart-shaped sticker and smells of perfume.  You start to read it but it quickly becomes embarrassing."
msgstr "一个女人写给她的情人的书信，它用心形贴纸密封，有香水味。你开始读它，但它很快就变得很尴尬。"

#. ~ Description of "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A written message from one person to another, usually put in an envelope.  Reading it would be rude."
msgstr "一个人写给另一个人的书面信息，通常放在信封里。偷读他人信件是很没教养的行为。"

#. ~ Description of variant "letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A written message home in a foreign tongue, carefully folded into its envelope."
msgstr "一封用你不懂的外语写的家书，小心翼翼地折在信封里。"

#. ~ Description of variant "barbershop gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "This gift card could be exchanged for a free cut at a local barbershop."
msgstr "这张礼品卡可以在本地一家理发店兑换一次免费理发。"

#. ~ Description of variant "5% discount card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
#, c-format
msgid "This gift card gives you a 5% discount for purchases at your local shopping mall.  Can only be redeemed once."
msgstr "这张礼品卡可以在本地购物中心购物时减免百分之五。只能使用一次。"

#. ~ Description of variant "get well card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "This greeting card displays a cartoon turtle in a cozy blanket sipping hot tea.  Above the turtle, it says 'Wishing you a SPEEDY recovery!'"
msgstr "这张贺卡展示了一只卡通海龟在舒适的毯子里啜饮着热茶。海龟上方写着\"祝你早日康复！\""

#. ~ Description of variant "congratulations card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "This greeting card displays a picture of a graduate tossing their graduation cap.  Above the cap is the word 'CONGRATULATIONS'."
msgstr "这张贺卡上印着一张毕业生投掷毕业帽的照片。在帽子上方是\"毕业了\"一词。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "angry letter home"
msgid_plural "angry letters home"
msgstr[0] "愤怒的书信"

