#. ~ Description of "long string"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 3-foot (or about 90 cm) long piece of cotton string."
msgstr "一根三英尺(约90厘米)长的棉线。"

#. ~ Description of "long leather lace"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 3-foot (or about 90 cm) long piece of leather lace, made from smaller pieces that are tied together.  Useful for some purposes, but not as flexible as proper string."
msgstr "一根三英尺(约90厘米)长的皮革条。可用于某些制造配方，但柔韧性不如正规生产的棉线。"

#. ~ Description of "long cordage piece"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 3-foot (or about 90 cm) long piece of natural cordage.  Useful for some purposes, but not as strong or flexible as proper string."
msgstr "一根三英尺(约90厘米)长的天然纤维。可用于某些制造配方，但强度和柔韧性不如正规生产的棉线。"

#. ~ Description of "long rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 30-foot (or about 9 m) long rope.  Useful for keeping yourself safe from falls.  Wear it over a shoulder and tie items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr "一段三十英尺(约9米)长的绳索。有效保护你从高处落下时的安全。你可以把它挂在肩上用来拴住东西携带。"

#. ~ Description of "long cordage rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 30-foot (or about 9 m) long rough rope, woven from natural cordage.  Not strong enough to hold up to falls, but still useful for some things, such as suspending large corpses for butchering.  Wear it over a shoulder and tie items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr "一根三十英尺(约9米)长的绳索，采用天然纤维编织而成。可用于某些制造配方，但强度和柔韧性不如正规生产的绳索。强度不足以让你用于攀岩下降。足以吊起大型尸体一边屠宰。你可以把它挂在肩上用来拴住东西携带。"

#. ~ Description of "short rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 6-foot (or about 180 cm) long piece of rope.  Wear it over a shoulder and tie items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr "一段六英尺(约1.8米)长的绳索。你可以把它挂在肩上用来拴住东西携带。"

#. ~ Description of "short cordage rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 6-foot (or about 180 cm) long piece of rough rope, woven from natural cordage.  Useful for some purposes, but not as strong or flexible as proper rope.  Wear it over a shoulder and tie items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr "一根六英尺(约1.8米)长的绳索，采用天然纤维编织而成。可用于某些制造配方，但强度和柔韧性不如正规生产的绳索。你可以把它挂在肩上用来拴住东西携带。"

#. ~ Description of "short string"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 6-inch (or about 15 cm) long piece of cotton string."
msgstr "一根六英寸(约15厘米)长的棉线。"

#. ~ Description of "short leather lace"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 6-inch (or about 15 cm) long piece of leather lace.  Useful for some purposes, but not as flexible as proper string."
msgstr "一根六英寸(约15厘米)长的皮革条。可用于某些制造配方，但柔韧性不如正规生产的棉线。"

#. ~ Description of "short cordage piece"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 6-inch (or about 15 cm) long piece of natural cordage.  Useful for some purposes, but not as strong or flexible as proper string."
msgstr "一根六英寸(约15厘米)长的天然纤维。可用于某些制造配方，但强度和柔韧性不如正规生产的棉线。"

#. ~ Description of "seat belt"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A length of synthetic fiber weaved into a flat band, usually used to securely fasten passenger inside vehicles."
msgstr "一段编织成扁平带状的合成纤维，通常用于将乘客固定在车内。"

#. ~ Description of "fibrous stalk"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A rather green stick.  Very fibrous."
msgstr "一根相当绿的植物茎秆，富含纤维。"

#. ~ Description of "long vine"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A sturdy 30-foot (or about 9 m) long vine.  Could easily be used as a rope.  Strong enough to suspend a large corpse for butchering.  Wear it over a shoulder and tie items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr "一段三十英尺(约9米)长的藤蔓。完全可以替代绳子，但是无法分解。足以吊起大型尸体以便屠宰。你可以把它挂在肩上用来拴住东西携带。"

#. ~ Description of "short vine"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A sturdy 6-foot (or about 180 cm) long vine.  Wear it over a shoulder and tie items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr "一段六英尺(约1.8米)长的坚固藤蔓。你可以把它挂在肩上用来拴住东西携带。"

#. ~ Description of "steel chain"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "About 180 cm of heavy steel chain. It's too short for climbing and hoisting and too heavy to use as a sling, but it might make a serviceable weapon."
msgstr "约180厘米的重钢链。它太短，不适合攀爬和提升，也太重，不适合用作吊索，但它可能会成为一种有用的武器。"

#. ~ Description of "rubber band"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "An elastic loop of rubber commonly used to hold multiple objects together."
msgstr "一根有弹性的橡胶圈，能将许多物体捆在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "long steel chain"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "Thirty feet (or about nine meters) of heavy steel chain.  It's tremendously inconvenient to lug around, but could be used like a long rope, or cut into more manageable lengths with the right tools."
msgstr "三十英尺（或约九米）的重型钢链。  它携带起来非常不方便，但可以像长绳子一样使用，或者用合适的工具切成更易于管理的长度。"

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "short rope"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "seat belt"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "Tie what to the rope?"
msgstr "选择用绳索捆绑的物品。"

