#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "10mm/.40 revolver"
msgid_plural "10mm/.40 revolvers"
msgstr[0] "10mm/.40 左轮手枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "10mm/.40 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "10mm/.40 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A classic six-shooter revolver chambered for 10mm and .40 rounds."
msgstr "一把 10mm/.40 口径的六发左轮手枪。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 20 pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Glock 20 pistol" of item "Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A full-sized version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  The third model of Glock designed, all other full-sized, large framed Glocks are adaptations of this one."
msgstr "一把广受欢迎的格洛克系列手枪的全尺寸的版本，采用威力更大的 10mm Auto 弹。它是格洛克系列手枪的第三版，其他全尺寸大型格洛克手枪都是基于此版本开发而成。"

#. ~ Description of variant "hunter Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 40 pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Glock 40 pistol" of item "hunter Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A full-sized, long-slide version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  The extra barrel length makes for slightly more accurate and powerful shots, and the extra slide length means the sights are a little easier to use."
msgstr "一把广受欢迎的格洛克系列手枪的全尺寸长套筒版本，采用威力更大的 10mm Auto 弹。额外加长的枪管使射击精度更高，威力更大，而额外加长的套筒使其瞄具用起来更简单。"

#. ~ Description of gun "hunter Glock pistol"
#. ~ Description of "hunter Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A full-sized, long-slide version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  The extra barrel length makes for slightly more accurate and powerful shots, and the extra slide length means the sights are a little easier to use.  It also features Glock's Modular Optic System, making aftermarket optics much easier to mount."
msgstr "一把广受欢迎的格洛克系列手枪的全尺寸长套筒版本，采用威力更大的 10mm Auto 弹。额外加长的枪管使射击精度更高，威力更大，而额外加长的套筒使其瞄具用起来更简单。它还自带格洛克公司出品的模块化光学瞄具系统（MOS），能更容易安装非原厂瞄具。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Colt Delta Elite pistol" of gun "Colt Delta Elite
#. pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Colt Delta Elite pistol" of item "Colt Delta
#. Elite pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A modernized, match-grade variant of the venerable M1911 chambered in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  Early variants were known to crack frames; modern 1911s, like this one, are slotted to prevent such crack formation."
msgstr "一把基于著名的 M1911 手枪设计，经现代化改造后的竞赛级衍生型手枪，采用威力强大的 10mm Auto 弹。早期的 M1911 型号枪身容易破损；现代改造后的 M1911 手枪，像这把，增加了加固槽，以防止枪身裂开。"

#. ~ Description of variant "compact Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 29 pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Glock 29 pistol" of item "compact Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A modestly sized version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  It is easy to carry because of its small size, but also recoils fiercely."
msgstr "一把广受欢迎的格洛克系列手枪的大小适中的版本，采用威力更大的 10mm Auto 弹。便携性能很好，因为体积较小，但是也因此后坐力更大。"

#. ~ Description of variant "double-stack 10mm 1911 pistol" of gun "STI
#. Tactical 2011 DS pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "STI Tactical 2011 DS pistol" of item "double-
#. stack 10mm 1911 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A next-gen model of the venerable 1911, ready to win World War Z.  Modernized and manufactured by Staccato, sporting a double-stack magwell, sleek solid-steel frame, and ergonomic grip; favored by certain dog-loving assassins.  This model is chambered in 10mm Auto."
msgstr "值得尊敬的 1911 的下一代模型，准备赢得第二次世界大战。由 Staccato 进行现代化和制造，配备双层弹匣井、时尚的实心钢框架和符合人体工程学的握把；受到某些爱狗的刺客的青睐。  该型号采用 10 毫米自动弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "EAA Witness pistol"
#. ~ Description of "EAA Witness pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm and accepting EAA Witness magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动手枪，可使用 EAA \"证人\"手枪弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm and accepting Glock magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动手枪，可使用格洛克弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "XD-M pistol"
#. ~ Description of "XD-M pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm and accepting XD-M magazines"
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动手枪，可使用 XD-M 弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Colt Delta Elite pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Colt Delta Elite pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm.  It accepts Colt Delta Elite magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动手枪，可使用柯尔特 \"三角精英\"手枪弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "SIG pistol"
#. ~ Description of "SIG pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mmm and accepting SIG magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动手枪，可使用 SIG 弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "BA10 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "BA10 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic rifle chambered in 10mm and accepting BA10 magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动步枪，可使用 BA10 弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "compact Glock pistol"
#. ~ Description of "compact Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A small pistol accepting Glock magazines and chambered in 10mm.  Because of its size, it is easy to carry, but it has rather fierce recoil."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的小型手枪，可使用格洛克弹匣。因为它的体积小，它很便于携带，但后坐力很强。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of "Glock submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A submachine gun chambered in 10mm, accepting Glock magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的冲锋枪，可使用格洛克弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "double-stack 10mm 1911 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "double-stack 10mm 1911 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "An updated version of the M1911 pistol, chambered in 10mm Auto, that uses double-stack magazines for greater capacity."
msgstr "M1911 手枪的更新版本，采用 10 毫米自动弹匣，使用双排弹匣以实现更大的容量。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "BA10 rifle"
msgid_plural "BA10 rifles"
msgstr[0] "BA10 步枪"

