#. ~ Name of a gun
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Colt Delta Elite pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Colt Delta Elite pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "Colt Delta Elite pistol"
msgid_plural "Colt Delta Elite pistols"
msgstr[0] "柯尔特 \"三角精英\"手枪"

#. ~ Description of variant "XD-M pistol" of gun "Springfield Armory XD-M
#. Competition pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Springfield Armory XD-M Competition pistol" of
#. item "XD-M pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "Designed by HS Produkt in Croatia, the HS2000 has become a commercial success for Springfield Armory, who imports and markets it as the eXtreme Duty.  The XD has since been offered in a variety of chamberings and sizes, including this full-sized match grade variant in 10mm Auto."
msgstr "HS2000 手枪由克罗地亚的 HS Produkt 公司设计，已经成为春田武器公司的一款成功进口产品，按eXtreme Duty商标进口并在北美销售。XD 系列手枪已经覆盖了各种口径和尺寸，包括这把使用 10mm Auto 弹的全尺寸竞赛型号。"

