#. ~ Description of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of "small game lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A .22 Long Rifle lever-action rifle, which holds 15 rounds of ammo.  While quite useful against small game, its effectiveness isn't as great against the undead."
msgstr ".22 Long Rifle 杠杆式步枪，可容纳 15 发子弹。  虽然对付小型游戏非常有用，但对付不死生物却没有那么有效。"

#. ~ Description of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of "small game lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A .22 Long Rifle lever-action rifle, which holds 16 rounds of ammo.  While quite useful against small game, its effectiveness isn't as great against the undead."
msgstr ".22 Long Rifle 杠杆式步枪，可容纳 16 发弹药。  虽然对付小型游戏非常有用，但对付不死生物却没有那么有效。"

#. ~ Description of variant "full-auto varmint rifle" of gun "full-auto Ruger
#. 10/22 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "full-auto Ruger 10/22 rifle" of item "full-auto
#. varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A Ruger 10/22 modified post-Cataclysm to selective fire.  While the .22 round isn't very powerful, full auto makes it a lot more effective, and still easily controllable in full auto."
msgstr "鲁格 10/22 改装为大灾变后选择性射击。  虽然 0.22 子弹威力不是很大，但全自动使其更加有效，并且在全自动模式下仍然易于控制。"

#. ~ Description of variant "full-auto varmint pistol" of gun "full-auto Ruger
#. 22 Charger pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "full-auto Ruger 22 Charger pistol" of item "full-
#. auto varmint pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A Ruger 22 Charger modified post-Cataclysm to selective fire.  While the .22 round isn't very powerful, full auto makes it a lot more effective, and still easily controllable in full auto even with the lack of a stock."
msgstr "Ruger 22 Charger 在大灾变后进行了选择性射击改造。  虽然 0.22 子弹威力不是很大，但全自动射击使其更加有效，并且即使在缺乏枪托的情况下仍然可以轻松控制全自动射击。"

#. ~ Description of variant "large .22 six-shooter" of gun "Heritage Rough
#. Rider 9" revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Heritage Rough Rider 9" revolver" of item "large
#. .22 six-shooter"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A cheap, single action revolver chambered in .22 LR.  While it makes for a handy plinking gun, the single action mechanism, size of the firearm, combined with the lack of a swing out cylinder makes for a less than ideal zombie fighting handgun, even with the slightly increased performance from the longer barrel."
msgstr "一种廉价的单动左轮手枪，子弹为 0.22 LR。  虽然它是一把方便的叮当作响的枪，但单动机构、枪支的尺寸，再加上缺乏摆动式气缸，使得它成为一款不太理想的僵尸格斗手枪，即使较长的枪管稍微提高了性能。"

#. ~ Description of variant ".22 six-shooter" of gun "Heritage Rough Rider
#. 6.5" revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Heritage Rough Rider 6.5" revolver" of item ".22
#. six-shooter"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A cheap, single action revolver chambered in .22 LR.  While it makes for a handy plinking gun, the single action mechanism, size of the firearm, combined with the lack of a swing out cylinder makes for a less than ideal zombie fighting handgun."
msgstr "一种廉价的单动左轮手枪，子弹为 0.22 LR。  虽然它是一把方便的叮当作响的枪，但单动机构、枪械的尺寸，再加上缺乏摆动式气缸，使得它成为一款不太理想的僵尸格斗手枪。"

#. ~ Description of variant "varmint rifle" of gun "Ruger 10/22 carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger 10/22 carbine" of item "varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A combination of negligible recoil, high customization, and inexpensive ammunition made the Ruger 10/22 a popular choice among enthusiasts and small game hunters.  Even though it fires the weak .22 round, it's perfectly capable of killing."
msgstr "低后坐力，高定制化，廉价的弹药的结合使鲁格 10/22 步枪成为枪械爱好者和猎人的普遍选择。尽管它使用较弱的.22弹药，但完全能把你打残。"

#. ~ Description of variant ".22 caliber revolver" of gun "Ruger LCR .22
#. revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger LCR .22 revolver" of item ".22 caliber
#. revolver"
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger LCR revolver"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger LCR revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "A compact, double-action-only revolver designed for easy concealment, with a stainless steel cylinder and aluminum frame."
msgstr "一支紧凑的、仅双动发射的左轮手枪，其设计目标是用不锈钢转轮弹仓和铝制骨架，制成一支方便隐藏的小左轮。"

#. ~ Description of gun ".22 caliber revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".22 caliber revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A comparatively dainty revolver, chambered for 8 tiny rounds of .22 LR."
msgstr "一支比较精致的左轮手枪，可装8发 .22 口径的小子弹。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Walther training pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Walther training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A dainty training pistol offered by the Walther Arms company, making use of the .22 LR cartridge, for training on a pistol very similar to more powerful pistols."
msgstr "瓦尔特武器公司所生产的一种训练手枪，使用.22 LR弹药，用于训练以适应威力更大的手枪。"

#. ~ Description of gun ".22 caliber submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of ".22 caliber submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A dramatically uncommon automatic weapon, making use of high-capacity pan magazines and firing the low power .22 caliber cartridge: an unusual ammunition choice for a submachine gun.  With negligible recoil on account of its modest cartridge and a suppressively high rate of fire, a burst of .22 LR rounds from this little machine gun can be best likened with a swarm of hornets… an incredibly angry swarm of hornets."
msgstr "一把非常不寻常的自动武器，使用大容量的盘型弹匣供弹，发射低威力的.22子弹，这不是冲锋枪子弹的常用口径。由于弹药口径较小，枪口上跳几乎可以忽略，再加上极高的射速，这挺小机枪射出的.22 LR子弹就像一群破巢而出的黄蜂…当然，一群极端愤怒的黄蜂。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Mossberg Brownie pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Mossberg Brownie pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A four barreled pocket pistol that fires the minuscule .22 LR cartridge.  Produced in the early 20th century for trappers, its combat effectiveness is questionable to say the least."
msgstr "一种四管口袋手枪，发射微小的 .22 LR 弹药。生产于20世纪早期，面向捕猎者，其战斗效能至少可以说是值得怀疑的。"

#. ~ Description of gun "full-auto varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "full-auto varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A handy and lightweight rifle, modified to fire semi and full auto."
msgstr "一种方便且轻便的步枪，经过改装可以半自动和全自动射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun "pipe rifle"
#. ~ Description of "pipe rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/json/items/gun/32.json data/json/items/gun/38.json data/json/items/gun/380.json data/json/items/gun/40.json data/json/items/gun/44.json data/json/items/gun/45.json data/json/items/gun/9mm.json data/json/items/gun/9x18.json
msgid "A home-made rifle.  It is simply a pipe attached to a stock, with a hammer to strike the single round it holds."
msgstr "一把自制的步枪。简单地把一根钢管安装在木把上，还有一个只能单次击发的击锤。"

#. ~ Description of gun "high capacity handgun"
#. ~ Description of "high capacity handgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A large capacity handgun, chambered in .22 and feeding from quad stack magazines.  Used both recreationally and in competition."
msgstr "一把大容量手枪，采用 0.22 口径，采用四排弹匣供弹。  既可用于娱乐，也可用于比赛。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A light and handy .22 LR handgun from Ruger, this handgun is one of the most popular .22 handguns ever created."
msgstr "鲁格公司的一款轻便的 0.22 LR 手枪，这款手枪是有史以来最受欢迎的 0.22 手枪之一。"

#. ~ Description of gun "varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A lightweight and modular pistol caliber hunting carbine, firing the low power .22 LR cartridge.  Before the Cataclysm, a mix of high customizability, cheap ammunition, and low recoil made this a very popular varmint rifle amongst civilian shooters."
msgstr "一把轻便模块化的手枪弹狩猎卡宾枪，发射.22LR弹药。在大灾变前，因高度可定制性、廉价的弹药和低后坐力而使其成为平民射手间十分流行的猎人步枪。"

#. ~ Description of gun "full-auto varmint pistol"
#. ~ Description of "full-auto varmint pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A lightweight varmint pistol, modified to fire both semi, and full auto."
msgstr "一把轻型恶鼠手枪，经过改装可以半自动和全自动射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun "pump action varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "pump action varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A lightweight, wood framed pump action rifle, holding 15 rounds of .22 with an 18 inch barrel.  While pump actions tend to be largely shotguns, they can be made in calibers such as .22 LR."
msgstr "一款轻型木质框架泵动步枪，可容纳 15 发 0.22 子弹，枪管为 18 英寸。  虽然泵动枪机主要是霰弹枪，但它们可以制成 0.22 LR 等口径。"

#. ~ Description of gun "firefly training pistol"
#. ~ Description of "firefly training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A medium sized, .22 caliber semi-automatic pistol, for training with a pistol similar to more powerful pistols.  Built from aluminum and polymer components, the weapon is lightweight and concealable, but its chambering is not very powerful."
msgstr "中型 0.22 口径半自动手枪，用于使用类似于威力更大的手枪的手枪进行训练。  该武器由铝和聚合物部件制成，重量轻且可隐藏，但其膛室威力不是很大。"

#. ~ Description of variant "small game lever-action rifle" of gun "Henry
#. Golden Boy rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Henry Golden Boy rifle" of item "small game
#. lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A modern .22 LR lever-action rifle, the Henry Golden Boy features an 20\" octagonal barrel with 16 rounds of ammo in its tube magazine, which is loaded from the front of the rifle.  It fairly resembles the original Henry Model 1860 with its brass colored receiver, though with wooden furniture at the front, and without a doubt using modern manufacturing."
msgstr "亨利金童 (Henry Golden Boy) 是一款现代化的 0.22 LR 杠杆式步枪，配备 20 英寸八角形枪管，弹匣内装有 16 发弹药，从步枪前部装弹。它与原版亨利 1860 型步枪非常相似，配有黄铜色机匣，但前部配有木制家具，并且毫无疑问采用了现代制造。"

#. ~ Description of variant "small game lever-action rifle" of gun "Rossi Rio
#. Bravo rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi Rio Bravo rifle" of item "small game lever-
#. action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A modern .22 LR lever-action rifle, the Rio Bravo features an 18\" barrel with 15 rounds of ammo in its tube magazine, which is loaded from the front of the rifle.  The mechanical origins date back decades, being based off of Rossi's R92 series of rifles which themselves were based off of the Winchester 1892."
msgstr "Rio Bravo 是一款现代化的 0.22 LR 杠杆式步枪，配备 18 英寸枪管，弹匣内装有 15 发弹药，从步枪前部装弹。其机械起源可以追溯到几十年前，基于 Rossi 的 R92 系列步枪，而这些步枪本身又是基于 Winchester 1892。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pump action varmint rifle" of gun "Rossi Gallery
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi Gallery rifle" of item "pump action varmint
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A modern take on the Winchester 1890, the Rossi Gallery is a .22 LR rifle, notably using a pump action.  Much like a pump action shotgun, the magazine tube is below it's 18 inch barrel and can hold 15 rounds.  While pump actions are quite often associated with shotguns, the mechanism can be applied to rifles as well, though in practice it's limited to .22 LR."
msgstr "Rossi Gallery 是 Winchester 1890 的现代版本，是一款 0.22 LR 步枪，特别采用泵动式。  与泵动式霰弹枪非常相似，弹匣管位于 18 英寸枪管下方，可容纳 15 发子弹。  虽然泵动装置通常与霰弹枪相关，但该机构也可以应用于步枪，尽管实际上它仅限于 0.22 LR。"

#. ~ Description of gun "S&W target pistol"
#. ~ Description of "S&W target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A modest offering from the Smith and Wesson (S&W) gun company, this is a medium sized pistol that fires the .22 LR cartridge.  Featuring an integrated rail for optics mounting, it was a popular .22 handgun amongst shooters of the low-power cartridge."
msgstr "这是史密斯威森 (S&W) 枪支公司推出的一款中等尺寸手枪，发射 0.22 LR 子弹。  它具有用于安装光学器件的集成导轨，是低威力子弹射击者中流行的 0.22 手枪。"

