msgid "Made from only the cheapest of budget metals, firing one of the weakest cartridges, and having a hearty laugh at the concept of user safety, this .22 caliber pocket pistol is of questionable utility at best.  Affordably priced before the Cataclysm, the pistol's price point was arguably its only positive element, an element which pertains zero bearing on your current situation."
msgstr "这款 0.22 口径袖珍手枪仅由最便宜的廉价金属制成，发射最弱的子弹之一，并且对用户安全的概念进行了热烈的嘲笑，这支 0.22 口径袖珍手枪的实用性充其量也值得怀疑。  在大灾变之前，手枪的价格可以承受，它的价格点可以说是它唯一的积极因素，这个因素对你目前的情况影响为零。"

