#. ~ Description of "OA-93 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "An AR-15 derivative pistol manufactured by Olympic Arms in the nineties.  The main difference compared to the AR-15 is that the recoil spring has been moved to the top of the gun, circumventing the necessity for a solid buttstock."
msgstr "一把90年代由奥林匹克武器公司制造的 AR-15 步枪的手枪衍生型号。与 AR-15 步枪相比，主要的区别在于，反冲弹簧被移到了枪管的顶部，避免了使用固体枪托的必要。"

#. ~ Description of gun "G36 assault rifle"
#. ~ Description of "G36 assault rifle"
