#. ~ Description of "Desert Tech MDRX carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "Produced by the Desert Tech gun company, this is a highly modular, semi-automatic rifle of remarkably modest dimensions.  The weapon is notable for the simplicity of converting it to fire a wide number of different cartridges, with retool kits for .223 Remington, .308 Winchester, and .300 AAC Blackout being available."
msgstr "由沙漠科技制造，这只高度模块化的半自动步枪有着很合适的尺寸。它的特色是便于改装使用各种口径的子弹，只要你有合适的改装工具，可以改成.223雷明顿，.308温彻斯特，或者是.300 AAC BLACKOUT。"

