#. ~ Description of variant "Remington 700 rifle" of item "bolt-action hunting
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/270win.json
msgid "A classic bolt-action rifle chambered for .270 Winchester, very popular among hunters.  This is a CDL SF model with a forged, fluted, 416 stainless steel barrel threaded into the receiver and a recessed bolt face.  It has checkered walnut furniture and a recoil pad to reduce perceived recoil."
msgstr "一把经典的栓动步枪，使用.270温彻斯特弹，在猎人中十分流行。这把CDL SF 型号属于经典奢华版，线膛枪管使用 416 不锈钢锻造，枪管-枪机连续膛线，以及嵌入式枪栓。它的核桃木枪托上装饰着格子图案，还有一个用于减少后坐力的托垫。"

#. ~ Description of gun "bolt-action hunting rifle"
#. ~ Description of "bolt-action hunting rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/270win.json
msgid "Featuring a handsome set of wooden furnishings, a classic design, and a no nonsense .270 caliber chambering, this is a powerful hunting rifle.  With a tried and proven pedigree dating back over 60 years, millions of such rugged arms have been made, exported, and used throughout the United States and the world at large.  Where hunting is concerned, this is a highly capable and well proven weapon in all respects."
msgstr "这款步枪配有典雅的木制枪身，设计经典，采用实用可靠的 .270 口径，是一支强劲的猎枪。其血统可追溯至60多年前，久经考验，数百万支这种坚固的步枪在美国及世界各地被制造、出口和使用。在狩猎方面，这是一款各方面性能都非常出色且久经考验的武器。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "bolt-action hunting rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "bolt-action hunting rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/270win.json
msgid "Remington 700 rifle"
msgid_plural "Remington 700 rifles"
msgstr[0] "雷明顿 700 步枪（.30-06 弹）"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/270win.json
msgid "bolt-action hunting rifle"
msgid_plural "bolt-action hunting rifles"
msgstr[0] "栓动猎枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "M2010 ESR rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M2010 ESR rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
msgid "A bolt-action, box-magazine-fed sniper rifle chambered in the powerful .300 Winchester Magnum round.  The M2010 had completely replaced the M24 rifle series by 2017."
msgstr "一把栓动狙击步枪，弹匣供弹，使用威力强大的.300温彻斯特马格南弹药。M2010 狙击步枪在2017年完全取代了M24系列狙击步枪。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
msgid "M2010 ESR rifle"
msgid_plural "M2010 ESR rifle"
msgstr[0] "M2010 增强型狙击步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger Precision Rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger Precision Rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
msgid "Originally introduced to the Ruger gun corporation's family of high-end marksman rifles in 2015, the Ruger Precision Rifle is a modern and highly modular long-range bolt-action weapon.  By incorporating a unique in-line recoil path that manages recoil from the rear of the receiver to the buttstock, as opposed to traditional bedding, the rifle offers maximal accuracy potential, while the arm's additional bells and whistles, an incorporated marksman's trigger, muzzle brake, and this particular rifle's powerhouse chambering of .300 Win Mag, help to make the most from any long-range engagement."
msgstr "鲁格精密步枪最初于 2015 年引入鲁格枪支公司的高端射手步枪系列，是一款现代化、高度模块化的远程栓动武器。  与传统的枪托不同，通过采用独特的内嵌反冲路径来管理从机匣后部到枪托的后坐力，该步枪提供了最大的精确度潜力，同时该枪臂的附加功能、内置射手扳机、枪口制退器以及这款特殊步枪的 0.300 Win Mag 的强力膛室，有助于在任何远程交战中发挥最大作用。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
msgid "Ruger Precision Rifle"
msgid_plural "Ruger Precision Rifles"
msgstr[0] "Ruger 精准步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "Weatherby Mark V rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Weatherby Mark V rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
msgid "The Weatherby Mark V is one of the world's finest bolt-action rifles.  Designed in 1955 by Roy Weatherby and Fred Jennie, it has a strong action designed to safely fire high-pressure cartridges.  These rifles were presented to celebrities as part of a marketing campaign."
msgstr "韦瑟比 Mark V 步枪是世界上最好的旋转拴动式步枪之一，在1955年由罗伊·韦瑟比和佛莱德·珍妮两人设计。其牢靠的机械设计使其可以安全地发射高压弹药。这杆步枪被视为市场销售的成功品。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Winchester Model 70 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Winchester Model 70 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
msgid "The Winchester Model 70 is a bolt-action sporting rifle.  It has an iconic place in American sporting culture and has been held in high regard by shooters since it was introduced in 1936."
msgstr "温彻斯特 Model 70步枪是一种竞赛栓动步枪，在美国射击竞赛文化中有着标志性的地位，自从1936年发布之后就广受射手们的喜爱。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
msgid "Weatherby Mark V rifle"
msgid_plural "Weatherby Mark V rifle"
msgstr[0] "韦瑟比 Mark V 步枪"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
msgid "Winchester Model 70 rifle"
msgid_plural "Winchester Model 70 rifle"
msgstr[0] "温彻斯特 M70 游猎步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "Browning BLR rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Browning BLR rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
msgid "A highly accurate lever-action hunting rifle chambered for the powerful .30-06 round.  Notable for using a detachable magazine instead of a traditional tube."
msgstr "高度精准的杠杆式狩猎步枪，使用威力强大的.30-06子弹。因其使用可拆卸的弹匣而不是传统的管式而闻名。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger M77 Hawkeye rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger M77 Hawkeye rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
msgid "A popular bolt-action hunting rifle first introduced in 2006, the Ruger M77 was originally intended to be a modernized Mauser 98-style long gun.  To this end, the weapon features a Mauser-type fixed blade extractor and an angled large screw that tightly beds the action into the stock."
msgstr "作为一种最初产于2006年的狩猎用栓动式步枪，鲁格M77 最初是作为毛瑟98式 步枪的现代化版本而设计。因此，它有着毛瑟同款的退弹装置，以及大号的斜角螺丝将枪膛与枪托紧紧固定。这支步枪有着额外的改装，有更流畅的扳机及一个精心打磨的后托。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M1903 Springfield rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M1903 Springfield rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
msgid "A powerful military rifle chambered in .30-06, developed to replace the US Army's older Krag rifle.  It served as the main American rifle in World War I, was used alongside the M1 Garand in World War II, and was used as a sniper rifle as late as the Vietnam War."
msgstr "一把威力强大的 .30-06 口径军用步枪，被研发以取代当时在美军服役的卡拉格-约根森步枪。从作为第一次世界大战时美军的主要制式装备步枪，它一直都在服役，在第二次世界大战时同本来要取代它的M1加兰德步枪平起平坐，也作为狙击步枪在越南战场使用到最后撤装。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M1 Garand rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M1 Garand rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
msgid "A semi-automatic .30-06 battle rifle, developed to replace the M1903 Springfield.  It didn't completely supplant the older bolt-action until after World War II."
msgstr "一把 .30-06 口径半自动战斗步枪，研制以取代M1903 斯普林菲尔德（春田）步枪。尽管它是把不错的半自动步枪，但是直到二战打完，它都未能完全取代上一代的栓动式的M1903春田步枪。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Remington 700 .30-06 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Remington 700 .30-06 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
msgid "A very popular and durable hunting or sniping rifle.  Popular among SWAT and US Marine snipers.  Highly damaging, but perhaps not as accurate as the competing Browning BLR."
msgstr "一把非常普及的打猎/狙击两用步枪。SWAT特警队和美国海军陆战队狙击手都喜欢用它。高杀伤力，但精准度比起勃朗宁BLR步枪来或许不那么高。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
msgid "Browning Automatic Rifle"
msgid_plural "Browning Automatic Rifles"
msgstr[0] "勃朗宁自动步枪"

