msgid "A gas-operated rifle, with a short 5.5 inch barrel, built-in thin folding stock, and full rail mount on the upper receiver.  This particular one is a select-fire military version."
msgstr "一种气动式步枪，带有5.5英寸(约14厘米)的短枪管，内置可折叠枪托，以及安装在上机匣的全长导轨。这个型号是可选择射击模式的军用版本。"

