#. ~ Description of gun "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLK carbine"
#. ~ Description of "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLK carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/300BLK.json
msgid "The IWI Tavor X95 (also called Micro-Tavor or MTAR) is an Israeli bullpup assault rifle designed and produced by Israel Weapon Industries.  This is the civilian version chambered for .300 AAC Blackout."
msgstr "IWI 塔沃尔 X95 突击步枪（又名微型塔沃尔或 MTAR）是一种以色列产的无托突击步枪，由以色列军事工业制造。这个民用型号发射的是 .300 BLK 弹药。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Remington ACR .300BLK carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Remington ACR .300BLK carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/300BLK.json
msgid "This carbine was developed for military use in the early 21st century.  It is damaging and accurate, though its rate of fire is a bit slower than competing carbines.  This version is chambered for the .300 AAC Blackout round."
msgstr "这款步枪在 21 世纪初为军用设计开发的。它具有高伤害及高精度，但其射速和其他步枪相比偏慢一点。这个型号发射的是 .300 BLK 弹药。"

#. ~ Description of variant "updated Enfield rifle" of gun "Lee-Enfield No. 4
#. Mk I rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Lee-Enfield No. 4 Mk I rifle" of item "updated
#. Enfield rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
msgid "A Second World War progression of the British Commonwealth's Lee-Enfield battle rifle, the No. 4 began its decades-long service life in 1939.  Externally similar to its forefather, the rifle possesses a reinforced receiver, an adjusted nose cap, and a heavier barrel.  Still chambered for the same .303-caliber cartridge, the No. 4 represents one of the most populous firearm imports in U.S. history."
msgstr "作为英联邦李-恩菲尔德战斗步枪的第二次世界大战升级版，第4号步枪于 1939 年开始其长达几十年的服役生涯。在外观上与其前身相似，该步枪拥有加强型机匣、经过调整的枪托盖和更重的枪管。使用相同的 .303 口径子弹，第4号步枪代表了美国历史上进口数量最多的枪支之一。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Enfield battle rifle" of gun "SMLE No. 1 Mk III
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "SMLE No. 1 Mk III rifle" of item "Enfield battle
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
msgid "An English darling and icon of the First World War, the Short Magazine Lee-Enfield Mk III was the standard issue battle rifle of the British commonwealth from 1907.  Chambered for .303 ammunition, the rifle makes use of ten-round detachable magazines.  With its full-length wooden handguard, brass buttplate, and smooth action, the Lee-Enfield cuts a recognizable profile in either the trenches of the Great War or the zombie-strewn wastelands."
msgstr "李-恩菲尔德短式弹夹步枪Mk III是英国第一次世界大战时期的英国宝贝和标志，自1907年起成为英国联邦的标准装备战斗步枪。该步枪使用.303弹药，具有十发可拆卸弹夹，配有全长的木质护手，黄铜枪托板和平滑的操作，可在一战的战壕或丧尸横行的荒野中轻易与众不同。"

#. ~ Description of gun "updated Enfield rifle"
#. ~ Description of "updated Enfield rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
msgid "An evolution of Britain's First World War battle rifle, this bolt-action firearm uses the same .303-caliber cartridge as its forerunner.  Much beloved across the globe by collectors, rifles like this served as England's infantry rifle well into the 1950s, with a specialized sniper variant remaining in service until the early nineties."
msgstr "这款栓动枪械是英国第一次世界大战战斗步枪的演变，使用与其前身相同的 0.303 口径弹药筒。  这种步枪在 20 世纪 50 年代一直是英国的步兵步枪，深受全球收藏家的喜爱，其中一种专门的狙击步枪一直服役到 90 年代初。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Enfield battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Enfield battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
msgid "An iconic weapon of both the First and Second World Wars, this bolt-action rifle has seen deployment in the hands of Commonwealth troops across Europe and beyond.  Firing the .303-caliber cartridge and making use of 10-round Enfield magazines, the firearm's reputation precedes it."
msgstr "一战与二战的标志性武器，这种栓动式步枪已在欧洲及其他地区的英联邦军队手中部署。 发射 .303 口径弹药并使用恩菲尔德10发弹匣，枪的名气大过了枪支本身。"

