msgid "A very accurate rifle chambered for the powerful .308 round.  Its very low ammo capacity is offset by its accuracy and near-complete lack of recoil."
msgstr "这是一支采用.308子弹的步枪，十分精准，后坐力很低，就是弹匣容量少了一些。"

