#. ~ Description of gun "M1 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "M1 carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/30carbine.json
msgid "A light rifle developed during the Second World War to provide a less cumbersome weapon for soldiers that didn't need the firepower of the M1 Garand.  Firing the .30 Carbine cartridge, it provides more firepower than a pistol and is easier to carry than most other rifles."
msgstr "一把在第二次世界大战期间研制的轻型步枪，为不需要 M1 加兰德步枪火力的士兵提供一种不那么笨重的武器。使用 .30 卡宾枪弹药，比手枪威力更大，又比其他步枪更容易携带。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M2 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "M2 carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/30carbine.json
msgid "An improved version of the M1 carbine offering full-auto capability, the M2 carbine was rare and coveted among collectors even before the world ended.  Takes M1 carbine magazines."
msgstr "M2 卡宾枪是 M1 卡宾枪的改进型号，增加了全自动模式，甚至在世界末日之前，M2 卡宾枪在收藏家中也十分罕见，令人垂涎。使用 M1 卡宾枪弹匣。"

