#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
msgid "Kel-Tec P-32 pistol"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec P-32 pistols"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec P-3AT 手枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "Kel-Tec P-32 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Kel-Tec P-32 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
msgid "One of Kel-Tec's oldest designs, the P-32 is a popular option for deep concealment and backup usage.  Despite its extreme light weight and small size, its .32 ACP chambering makes for good handling and recoil control."
msgstr "作为Kel-Tec数控工业公司最古老的设计之一，P-32手枪常常在秘密渗透和火力支援时使用。虽然它的重量非常轻，体积也很小，但是它的 .32ACP 口径使它的后坐力很小，易于控制。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Walther PPK pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Walther PPK pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
msgid "One of the most famous handguns of the 20th century.  Your name is not Bond, but you might find this little gun still useful."
msgstr "20世纪最著名的手枪之一。虽然你不是詹姆斯邦德，但你仍会发现这把枪还是有用的。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
msgid "SIG P230 pistol"
msgid_plural "SIG P230 pistols"
msgstr[0] "西格&绍尔 P220 10mm 手枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "SIG P230 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "SIG P230 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
msgid "The SIG Sauer P230 is a small, semi-automatic handgun chambered in .32 ACP.  Due to its small dimensions, it was often carried as a backup weapon."
msgstr "西格&绍尔P230手枪是一种使用.32ACP弹药的小型半自动手枪。它体型小巧，通常作为一个备用武器。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
msgid "Walther PPK pistol"
msgid_plural "Walther PPK pistol"
msgstr[0] "瓦尔特P22手枪"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid ".338 bolt-action sniper rifle"
msgid_plural ".338 bolt-action sniper rifles"
msgstr[0] ".338 栓动狙击步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "single-shot target rifle"
#. ~ Description of "single-shot target rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid "A bolt-action precision rifle with the potential for impressive accuracy, this particular weapon makes use of the powerful .338 Lapua cartridge and is decked in a handsome set of wooden furniture, providing the rifle with a classical mystique.  Unfortunately, the weapon's single-round magazine and a lack of factory iron sights, which makes target acquisition an exercise in futility unless a gunsight is installed, make the rifle limited in its post-Cataclysm utility."
msgstr "这是一款精度极高的栓动式精确步枪，它使用强力的 .338 拉普阿弹，配有漂亮的木制装饰，为步枪提供了古典的神秘感。 不幸的是，由于该武器的单发弹匣且没有机瞄，除非安装瞄准具，否则连瞄准目标都做不到，这使得它在大灾变后的实用性受到限制。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Barrett precision rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Barrett precision rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid "A box magazine-fed bolt-action precision rifle developed by the Barrett Arms Company, firing the .338 Lapua cartridge.  A civilian copy of more versatile military weapons, this rifle is a remarkably well-crafted piece of anti-personnel engineering despite lacking the sheer modularity of its Marshal sister, and is still capable of engaging targets at extreme distances."
msgstr "由 Barrett Arms Company 研制的盒式弹匣供弹栓动精密步枪，发射 .338 拉普阿弹。 作为军队武器的民用仿制品，它仍是杰出的人员杀伤武器。尽管它不像姊妹枪那样完全模块化，但在极远距离打击目标的能力一点不弱。"

#. ~ Description of gun ".338 bolt-action sniper rifle"
#. ~ Description of ".338 bolt-action sniper rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid "A high-precision bolt-action sniper rifle, in service with special operations members of the US Navy prior to the cataclysm.  Firing the powerful .338 Lapua cartridge, the weapon feeds from detachable five round Accuracy International magazines."
msgstr "一把高精度栓动式狙击步枪，大灾变前服役于美国海军的特种作战人员。 该武器发射威力强大的 .338 拉普阿弹，由可拆卸的五发精密国际弹匣供弹。"

#. ~ Description of variant "single-shot target rifle" of gun "Savage 112
#. Magnum Target rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Savage 112 Magnum Target rifle" of item "single-
#. shot target rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid "A highly-accurate precision rifle chambered for the powerful .338 Lapua cartridge, the Savage 112 Magnum Target is a classically designed bolt-action rifle in both its fit and finish, with a heavy barrel, a hardwood stock, and an attached muzzle brake.  Unfortunately for the weapon and its users, a traditional veneer, no matter how admittedly swanky, isn't conducive to tactical effectiveness, as demonstrated by the 112 Magnum Target's mighty magazine size of one entire cartridge and lack of any factory-attached sights."
msgstr "萨维奇 112 马格南“目标”步枪是一款设计经典的高精度栓动式精密步枪，使用强力的 .338 拉普阿弹，配有重枪管、硬木枪托和加装式枪口制退器，无论是装配还是表面处理都做得很好。 不幸的是，对于武器及其使用者来说，再好看的饰面，也不提供战术价值。它'大容量'的一发弹匣以及出厂没有附装任何瞄准具很好的证明了这一点。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Accuracy International AXMC rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Accuracy International AXMC rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid "A weapon platform that prides itself on modularity and customizability, this highly accurate precision rifle may be configured with various caliber conversion kits that can allow it to fire either the .338 Lapua, .300 Win Mag, or .308 Winchester cartridges.  The rifle's size prevents it from being a particularly mobile piece of equipment, but the weapon's folding buttstock aids in portability."
msgstr "以模块化和定制性而自豪的步枪平台，这种高精度的精密步枪可以搭配各种口径转换套件，以发射 .338 拉普阿、.300 温彻斯特马格南或 .308 温彻斯特子弹。 枪身的尺寸使其无法成为特别便携的装备，但武器的折叠式枪托有助于携带。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid "Accuracy International AXMC rifle"
msgid_plural "Accuracy International AXMC rifles"
msgstr[0] "精密国际 AXMC 狙击步枪"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Barrett precision rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Barrett precision rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
