#. ~ Description of variant "Barrett precision rifle" of gun "Barrett MRAD SMR
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Barrett MRAD SMR rifle" of item "Barrett
#. precision rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid "Chambered for the .338 Lapua cartridge, the Barrett MRAD SMR is a civilian variant of the MK22 MRAD sniper rifle, which was in service with elements of the US army and is often regarded as one of the finest bolt-action sniper rifles ever developed.  The primary differences that set this weapon apart from its Marshal sibling are the removal of the MRAD's caliber conversion capabilities and the installation of a fixed buttstock.  These changes have resulted in a lighter and slimmer rifle that, most importantly for the discerning pre-Cataclysmic precision shooter, didn't require a second mortgage to purchase."
msgstr "Barrett MRAD SMR 采用 0.338 Lapua 弹药筒，是 MK22 MRAD 狙击步枪的民用变体，曾在美国陆军服役，通常被认为是有史以来最优秀的栓动狙击步枪之一。  该武器与其同类武器 Marshal 的主要区别在于取消了 MRAD 的口径转换功能并安装了固定枪托。  这些变化使得步枪变得更轻、更细，最重要的是，对于挑剔的大灾难前精确射手来说，不需要二次抵押即可购买。"

#. ~ Description of variant ".338 bolt-action sniper rifle" of gun "McMillan
#. Tac-338 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "McMillan Tac-338 rifle" of item ".338 bolt-action
#. sniper rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid "Chambering the .338 Lapua cartridge, the Tac-338 is a high-precision, bolt-action sniper rifle that, before the Cataclysm, complemented the arsenal of the US Navy Special Warfare unit.  Providing Navy SEAL marksmen with the capability to land effective shots on targets at a typical range of 1600 meters, a valuable capability for the long-distance engagements prevalent during the US army's war on terror, the rifle comes kitted with an adjustable cheek pad, butt hook, and muzzle break."
msgstr "Tac-338 装有 .338 Lapua 子弹，是一款高精度栓动狙击步枪，在大灾变之前，它补充了美国海军特种作战部队的武器库。  该步枪配备了可调节的颊垫、枪托钩和枪口折断器，为海豹突击队射手提供了对典型射程 1600 米的目标进行有效射击的能力，这对于美国陆军反恐战争期间普遍存在的远距离交战来说是一项宝贵的能力。"

