msgid "A crudely made double barrel pistol firing .38 Special ammo.  Unfortunately, the name is less about the double barrels and more about the number of shots you'll get before it breaks down on you."
msgstr ""
"一把自制的双管 .38 特制弹手枪。不幸的是，这枪名字里的\"双发\"指的不是它有几根枪管，而是它坏掉之前能发射多少发子弹。\n"
"\"哈哈搞到一把双管霰……手、手枪？\""

#. ~ Description of gun "Manurhin MR 73 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "Manurhin MR 73 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "A finely made .357 Magnum revolver with a 4 inch barrel.  It has adjustable sights, big plastic grips and a very smooth trigger."
msgstr "制作精良的.357马格南左轮手枪，带有4英寸(约10厘米)枪管。它具有可调节的瞄准具、大塑料握把和非常平滑的扳机。"

#. ~ Description of gun "7-shot .357 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "7-shot .357 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "A revolver chambered in .357, with a 4 inch barrel and adjustable sights."
msgstr "0.357 口径左轮手枪，配有 4 英寸枪管和可调节瞄准器。"

#. ~ Description of gun ".357 revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".357 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "A revolver chambered in .357, with a 6 inch barrel and 6 shots."
msgstr "左轮手枪的口径为 0.357，枪管为 6 英寸，可发射 6 发子弹。"

#. ~ Description of gun "S&W 619 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "S&W 619 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "A seven-round .357 revolver sold by Smith & Wesson.  Can also fire .38 Special.  It features a fixed rear sight and a reinforced frame."
msgstr "由史密斯威森公司发布的这款装弹量为7发的.357口径左轮手枪，最大的特点是修正过的后准星和加固后的构架，并且可以使用.38 特制弹。"

#. ~ Description of gun ".357 revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".357 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "A six inch revolver chambered in .357 Magnum/.38 Special.  Favorite of sheriffs and post-Cataclysm survivor group leaders."
msgstr "一把六英寸左轮手枪，装填 0.357 Magnum/.38 Special。  深受治安官和大灾变后幸存者团体领导人的喜爱。"

#. ~ Description of gun "S&W Model 10 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "S&W Model 10 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "A six-shot revolver, produced since 1899 and known as the most popular handgun of the 20th century.  It has a swing-out cylinder for ease of reloading."
msgstr "一把六发左轮手枪，最早于1899年生产，被誉为20世纪最流行的手枪。弹仓能够侧向旋出，便于重新装填。"

#. ~ Description of variant ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver" of gun "Rossi
#. RP63 revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi RP63 revolver" of item ".357-caliber snub-
#. nosed revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "A small frame, stainless-steel Brazilian wheel gun with rubberized grips, a serrated front sight, and a satin finish, boasting a 6-round cylinder of .357-magnum persuasion.  Affordable, before the world collapsed, and confidently asserted by Rossi themselves to be the ideal carry gun for its rounded butt and 3-inch barrel, you aren't wholly sure that such assertions accounted for zombies."
msgstr "这是一款小型不锈钢巴西轮枪，配有橡胶握把、锯齿状准星和缎面饰面，拥有 0.357 马格南威力的 6 发弹筒。  价格实惠，在世界崩溃之前，罗西自己自信地声称其圆形枪托和 3 英寸枪管是理想的随身枪，但你不能完全确定这种说法是否适用于僵尸。"

#. ~ Description of gun "COP .357 Derringer pistol"
#. ~ Description of "COP .357 Derringer pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "A small, chubby derringer pistol bearing a slight resemblance to the Mossberg Brownie.  It uses a rotating firing pin to fire the individual hammers of the four barrels arranged in a square formation."
msgstr "一把小型的肥嘟嘟的德林加手枪，外观有点像莫斯伯格\"布朗尼\"手枪。它使用一根旋转的发火针来触发排列成方形阵列的四根枪管内的独立击锤。"

#. ~ Description of variant ".357 revolver" of gun "Chiappa Rhino revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Chiappa Rhino revolver" of item ".357 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "An innovative, futuristic looking revolver designed by Emilio Ghisoni after developing the Mateba, its most distinctive feature is its barrel, aligned with the bottom chamber of its hexagonal cylinder to alleviate muzzle flip.  This positions the bore lower relative to the sights, effectively making the gun easier to shoot but harder to aim."
msgstr "这是一款创新的、具有未来感的左轮手枪，由埃米利奥·吉索尼 (Emilio Ghisoni) 在开发 Mateba 后设计，其最显着的特点是其枪管，与六角形圆柱体的底部膛室对齐，以减轻枪口翻转。  这使得枪管相对于瞄准具更低，有效地使枪更容易射击，但更难瞄准。"

