#. ~ Description of gun ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "Short, stout, and compact, this stainless steel revolver is a handy dispenser of .357-magnum, or lower-power .38-caliber, cartridges.  Six rounds fit within the weapon, though its small stature and short barrel ensure that each pull of the trigger is all but a pyrotechnic spectacle: flashy, loud, and jumpy."
msgstr "这款不锈钢左轮手枪短小、粗壮、紧凑，是一款方便的 0.357 马格南弹药筒或低威力 0.38 口径弹药筒的分配器。  该武器可容纳六发子弹，但其较小的身材和较短的枪管确保每次扣动扳机都如同烟火般的奇观：华丽、响亮和跳跃。"

#. ~ Description of variant "reproduction .357 lever-action rifle" of gun
#. "Uberti 1873 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Uberti 1873 rifle" of item "reproduction .357
#. lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "The 1873 is a rifle platform developed all the way in, unsurprisingly, 1873.  This one is a fairly faithful Uberti reproduction, although the original 1873s pre-dated .357 Magnum, and even .38 Special.  This one has a case-hardened finish, wood furniture, and octagonal barrel."
msgstr "不出所料，1873 是一款在 1873 年开发的步枪平台。这把枪是 Uberti 的忠实复制品，尽管最初的 1873 步枪早于 0.357 Magnum，甚至 0.38 Special。  这一款具有表面硬化处理、木质家具和八角形桶。"

#. ~ Description of variant ".357 lever-action rifle" of gun "Rossi R92 16"
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi R92 16" rifle" of item ".357 lever-action
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, featuring a wide array of different calibers and barrel lengths.  These aim to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the lever-action formula.  This particular one features wooden furniture, a 16\" barrel, and 8 rounds of .357 Magnum or .38 Special."
msgstr "R92 是 Rossi 广泛成功的杠杆式步枪系列，具有多种不同的口径和枪管长度。  这些旨在减少对旧式步枪的复制，而是采用现代的杠杆式步枪。  这把特别的手枪配有木制家具、16 英寸枪管和 8 发 0.357 Magnum 或 0.38 Special。"

#. ~ Description of variant ".357 lever-action rifle" of gun "Rossi R92 20"
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi R92 20" rifle" of item ".357 lever-action
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid "The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, featuring a wide array of different calibers and barrel lengths.  These aim to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the lever-action formula.  This particular one features wooden furniture, a 20\" barrel, and 10 rounds of .357 Magnum or .38 Special."
msgstr "R92 是 Rossi 广泛成功的杠杆式步枪系列，具有多种不同的口径和枪管长度。  这些旨在减少对旧式步枪的复制，而是采用现代的杠杆式步枪。  这把特别的手枪配有木制家具、20 英寸枪管和 10 发 0.357 Magnum 或 0.38 Special。"

#. ~ Description of gun ".357 lever-action rifle"
