#. ~ Description of "AF2011A1 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/38super.json
msgid "A double-barrel semi-automatic pistol of Italian origin, firing two bullets per shot, a derivative of the M1911 pistol."
msgstr "一把源自意大利的双管半自动手枪，每次发射两发子弹，是 M1911 手枪的衍生型号。"

