msgid "Lighter than Beretta's iconic 92 series of guns, the Px4 Storm was built by utilizing light-weight polymer construction with steel inserts.  Its shape was also optimized for concealed carry.  This one is chambered in .40 S&W."
msgstr "比伯莱塔出品的标志性的92系列手枪要轻，Px4 \"风暴\"手枪充分利用了轻便的带钢制插件的聚合材料主体结构。它的形状也被设计得便于隐蔽携带。这一把使用 .40 S&W 弹。"

