#. ~ Description of "SIG Pro pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
msgid "Originally marketed as a lightweight and compact alternative to older SIG handguns, the Pro .40 is popular among European police forces."
msgstr "上市之初，这款.40口径手枪作为旧版西格手枪的替代品，在设计上更加轻巧紧凑，使它受到欧洲各国警方的青睐。"

