#. ~ Description of gun "H&K M320 grenade launcher"
#. ~ Description of "H&K M320 grenade launcher"
#: data/json/items/gun/40x46mm.json
msgid "Heckler & Koch's M320 grenade launcher offers the functionality of larger launchers in a very small package at the cost of decreased accuracy.  This one is combined with a buttstock for standalone operation."
msgstr "H&K公司出品的M320型榴弹发射器以降低精度为代价，将更强大的榴弹发射器的功能塞进了更小的体积之中。这个型号有一个内置枪托可以单兵操作。"

