#: data/json/items/gun/450bushmaster.json
msgid "A compact, magazine-fed, bolt-action hunting rifle designed and manufactured with cost-effectiveness at the peak of concerns, the Ruger American Ranch Rifle series caters to shooters on a budget.  Factory chambered for the powerful, though short-range, .450 Bushmaster cartridge, the weapon was able to stand toe-to-toe with all native North American game despite its minimalist design."
msgstr "一把紧凑的弹匣供弹的栓动式狩猎步枪，鲁格美式牧场系列步枪切中要害地考虑了购买者的预算问题，设计与生产都考虑到了成本问题。原厂使用射程较近但威力强劲的 .450大毒蛇 弹药，所以即使有着极简设计也能在北美本土猎枪市场有它的一席之地。"

