msgid "The Taurus Raging Judge Magnum is a 6-shot revolver chambered in .454 Casull.  It can fire .410 shotshells and .45 Colt cartridges as well."
msgstr "陶鲁斯 \"暴怒裁决\"马格南手枪发射 .454 卡苏尔弹，弹容量6发。该型号同时也能够发射 .410 口径霰弹或 .45 柯尔特弹。"

