msgid "A modern reproduction of a Colt pump-action rifle.  Originally chambered in .44-40, modern versions most commonly use .45 Colt, complementing the Single Action Army as a Cowboy Action Shooting firearm."
msgstr "柯尔特泵动式步枪的现代重制版本。原本采用 .44-40 口径，现代重制品常常采用 .45 柯尔特口径，在牛仔射击运动中可作为单动式手枪的替代品。"

