#. ~ Description of "Taurus Judge revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
msgid "Marketed for home defense, the Taurus Judge is a 5 shot cylinder revolver, capable of firing .410 shotshells or .45 Colt cartridges out of its 3 inch barrel.  While it doesn't compete ballistically with a proper rifle, it's still a handy weapon against the living and the dead."
msgstr "Taurus Judge 是一款用于家庭防御的 5 发弹筒左轮手枪，能够从 3 英寸枪管发射 0.410 霰弹或 0.45 柯尔特子弹。  虽然它在弹道上无法与普通步枪相媲美，但它仍然是对抗生者和死者的便捷武器。"

#. ~ Item name
