#. ~ Description of gun "AI AS50 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "AI AS50 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/50.json
msgid "Developed by the British firearms producer Accuracy International, the AI AS50 is a semi-automatic .50 caliber anti-materiel rifle produced for the British armed forces and the United States Navy SEALs.  With a free-floated barrel, titanium frame, and an accessory rail integrated into the weapon's machined-steel receiver with two others mounted on each side of the barrel shroud, the rifle features commendable ergonomics and a notable level of modularity.  Providing operators with the capability to engage targets at a maximum estimated range of around 1500 meters, the firearm feeds from detachable 10-round box magazines."
msgstr "精密国际 AS50 步枪由英国枪械制造商精密国际公司研制，是一款半自动的.50口径反器材步枪，生产供应英国武装部队和美国海军海豹突击队。该型号步枪采用自由浮动枪管、钛制枪身和集成在机加工钢制机匣顶部的瞄具导轨，此外还有两根附加导轨分布于枪管护木两侧，整枪具有值得称赞的人体工学设计和极高的模块化水平。赋予使用者在最大约1500米的射程打击目标的能力，这把武器使用可拆卸的10发盒式弹匣供弹。"

