#. ~ Description of "M224 mortar"
#: data/json/items/gun/60mm.json
msgid "The Lightweight Company Mortar System is a portable mortar that can be carried and used by a single person, provided they have access to 60mm mortar shells.  There are a set of firing tables attached to it, but it will likely take some expertise with launchers to understand them."
msgstr "轻型连队迫击炮系统是一种便携式迫击炮，只要能够使用 60 毫米迫击炮弹，就可以由单人携带和使用。  它附有一组发射台，但可能需要一些发射器方面的专业知识才能理解它们。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M202A1 FLASH rocket launcher"
#. ~ Description of "M202A1 FLASH rocket launcher"
#: data/json/items/gun/66mm.json
msgid "An American rocket launcher designed in the 1970s to replace WWII-era flamethrowers still in use in Vietnam.  It has four barrels sharing the 66mm caliber of the M72 LAW."
msgstr "19 世纪 70 年代设计的美制火箭发射器，用于取代越战中仍有使用的二战老式火焰喷射器。这种火箭筒有四个发射管，使用与 M72 LAW 单兵火箭筒相同的 66mm 火箭弹。"

