#. ~ Description of gun "vz. 58 combat rifle"
#. ~ Description of "vz. 58 combat rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762.json
msgid "A Cold War-era Czechoslovak assault rifle, likely constructed stateside from a pre-1986 imported parts kit or brought back from a third world war zone.  Externally similar to the AK family of rifles, this weapon nevertheless only shares the former's 7.62x39mm chambering.  Featuring no interchangeable parts with its Russian doppelganger, this firearm makes use of a completely different internal operating system, is far more svelte than its other Warsaw Pact counterparts, and feeds from proprietary box magazines."
msgstr "冷战时期的捷克斯洛伐克突击步枪，可能由1986年前的进口零件在美国组装制造，或是从第三次世界大战战区带回国内。虽然这种武器外观与AK步枪系列相似，但它只和前者共用7.62x39mm 口径。这款枪械没有与其仿制的俄罗斯版互通的零件，它使用了完全不同的内部操作系统，比其他华约同类产品要小巧得多，并且使用特制的弹匣供弹。"

#. ~ Description of variant "vz. 58 tactical rifle" of gun "vz. 58 Tactical
#. Sporter rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "vz. 58 Tactical Sporter rifle" of item "vz. 58
#. tactical rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762.json
msgid "A modern semi-automatic clone of the Czechoslovak-produced vz. 58 assault rifle, chambered in the Soviet 7.62x39mm cartridge.  Built off of surplus vz. 58 parts, the rifle makes use of additional American made components such as the receiver, barrel, and buttstock to comply with US importation laws.  Featuring an extended 16 inch barrel, an M4 style stock adapter and tube, and an integrated side rail for optics mounting, this Cold War rifle makes for a relatively handy post-apocalyptic companion."
msgstr "一把原产于捷克斯洛伐克的 Vz. 58 突击步枪的现代半自动克隆版，使用苏制 7.62x39mm 口径。利用遗留多余的 Vz. 58 零件组装，并使用其他美制组件，如机匣、枪管和枪托，以符合美国进口法律。配备加长的16英寸(约41厘米)枪管、M4样式的枪托适配器和枪管，以及用于安装光学瞄具的集成侧导轨，这款源自冷战的步枪是后灾变时代一位十分有用的的伙伴。"

