#. ~ Description of variant "CZ 805 Bren rifle" of item "Bren 7.62mm carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/762.json
msgid "Strongly resembling the FN SCAR, with features and ergonomics inspired by the AR-18, this semi-automatic rifle is a civilian clone of the Czech Republic's formerly standard infantry carbine and was produced by the same company.  Discontinued in 2018, the rifle features an included muzzle break and adjustable folding buttstock, with this particular version being chambered in 7.62x39mm."
msgstr "这款半自动步枪与 FN SCAR 非常相似，其功能和人体工程学设计灵感来自 AR-18，是捷克共和国以前标准步兵卡宾枪的民用克隆产品，由同一家公司生产。  该步枪于 2018 年停产，配有枪口折断器和可调节折叠枪托，该特殊版本的膛室尺寸为 7.62x39mm。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Beretta ARX-160 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Beretta ARX-160 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762.json
msgid "The Beretta ARX-160 was a Phase II contender in the United States Army Individual Carbine competition to replace the M4 carbine.  It failed to replace it, but it is widely used by military all around the world.  This version is chambered for 7.62x39mm."
msgstr "伯莱塔 ARX-160卡宾枪是美军为了替换M4卡宾枪所举行的卡宾枪竞赛中第二阶段的竞争者之一。虽然没有被用来替换M4卡宾枪，但也被广泛使用。这一版本使用7.62x39mm弹药。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Mk47 Mutant rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Mk47 Mutant rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762.json
msgid "The CMMG Mk47 Mutant is an American rifle, natively chambered for 7.62x39mm ammo.  Features a characteristic free-floating handguard, with a similar action mechanism to the AR-15, repurposed for the bigger, more potent ammo."
msgstr "CMMG公司出品的 Mk47 \"突变\"步枪是一把美国步枪，本体采用 7.62x39mm 口径弹药。采用标志性的自由浮动式护手，具有与 AR-15 步枪类似的击发机制，但改用口径更大、威力更强的弹药。"

#. ~ Description of variant "vz. 58 combat rifle" of gun "Samopal VZ 58 V
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Samopal VZ 58 V rifle" of item "vz. 58 combat
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762.json
msgid "This lightweight and relatively svelte Cold War assault rifle was originally developed for use by the Czechoslovak army, in place of the various licensed Kalashnikov rifles which were then prevalent around eastern Europe.  Bearing more than a passing resemblance to the AK-47, this weapon nevertheless features a completely different array of internals and possesses no interchangeable parts with its Russian counterpart.  Making use of proprietary magazines and a 15.4 inch barrel, the vz. 58 was regarded by some to be the Kalashnikov's lesser-known superior.  Likely reconstructed from a pre-1986 imported parts kit, or brought back from a third world war zone, this particular weapon features a removable side-folding buttstock and a 'V' suffixed designation, which both mark it as an original airborne or crew issued model."
msgstr "这种轻便且相对轻巧的冷战突击步枪最初是为捷克斯洛伐克军队开发的，以取代当时在东欧流行的各种经许可的卡拉什尼科夫步枪。尽管这种武器与AK-47步枪有很多相似之处，但其内部结构却完全不同，与俄罗斯的AK-47步枪没有可以互通的零件。使用特制弹匣和15.4英寸(约39厘米)长枪管，Vz. 58 步枪被一些人认为是卡拉什尼科夫冲锋枪鲜为人知的更高级替代品。这把步枪很可能是使用1986年以前的进口零件组装制造而来，或者是从第三次世界大战地区带回国内的，其特点是可拆卸的侧面折叠枪托并以\"V\"作为代号，都标识了它是原装的空降兵或载具成员型号。"

#. ~ Description of variant "vz. 58 combat rifle" of gun "Samopal vz. 58 P
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Samopal vz. 58 P rifle" of item "vz. 58 combat
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762.json
msgid "This lightweight and relatively svelte Cold War assault rifle was originally developed for use by the Czechoslovak army, in place of the various licensed Kalashnikov rifles which were then prevalent around eastern Europe.  Bearing more than a passing resemblance to the AK-47, this weapon nevertheless features a completely different array of internals and possesses no interchangeable parts with its Russian counterpart.  Making use of proprietary magazines and a 15.4 inch barrel, the vz. 58 was regarded by some to be the Kalashnikov's lesser-known superior.  Likely reconstructed from a pre-1986 imported parts kit, or brought back from a third world war zone, this particular weapon features a removable wood impregnated plastic buttstock and a 'P' suffixed designation, which both mark it as an original infantry model."
msgstr "这种轻便且相对轻巧的冷战突击步枪最初是为捷克斯洛伐克军队开发的，以取代当时在东欧流行的各种经许可的卡拉什尼科夫步枪。尽管这种武器与AK-47步枪有很多相似之处，但其内部结构却完全不同，与俄罗斯的AK-47步枪没有可以互通的零件。使用特制弹匣和15.4英寸(约39厘米)长枪管，Vz. 58 步枪被一些人认为是卡拉什尼科夫冲锋枪鲜为人知的更高级替代品。这把步枪很可能是使用1986年以前的进口零件组装制造而来，或者是从第三次世界大战地区带回国内的，其特点是可拆卸的浸渍材塑料枪托并以\"P\"作为代号，都标识了它是原装步兵型号。"

