#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762R.json
msgid "The Mosin-Nagant 1891/30 is a bolt-action, internal magazine-fed military rifle, developed by the Russian Empire and later used and perfected by the Soviet Union."
msgstr "莫辛纳甘 1891/30型步枪是一把栓动式内部弹匣供弹的军用步枪，由沙俄帝国发明，并被之后的苏联广泛使用并完善。中国又称其为\"水连珠\"。在二战时，一把工艺精良且高精度的莫辛纳甘步枪，甚至会被装上高倍率瞄准镜，当作狙击步枪配备给俄军特训狙击手们使用，是经久不衰的一把名枪。"

#. ~ Description of gun "PSL rifle"
#. ~ Description of "PSL rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762R.json
msgid "The Romanian PSL is a designated marksman's rifle developed by Romania after political tensions with Soviet Russia forced them to develop their own alternative to the SVD."
msgstr "罗马尼亚 PSL 狙击步枪是在罗马尼亚与苏联关系紧张后，独立研发的一款狙击步枪，用以替代SVD狙击步枪。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mosin battle rifle" of gun "Mosin-Nagant
#. 1891/30-EBR rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Mosin-Nagant 1891/30-EBR rifle" of item "Mosin
#. battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762R.json
msgid "This Mosin-Nagant has exchanged the classic wooden stock for a modern synthetic model, carefully balanced to the same weight and handling, to allow support for modern accessories."
msgstr "这把莫辛纳甘步枪把传统木制枪托替换为现代合成枪托，并且精心调节至相同的重量及控制度，以供安装现代改装配件。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mosin carbine" of gun "Mosin-Nagant M44-EBR
#. carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "Mosin-Nagant M44-EBR carbine" of item "Mosin
#. carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/762R.json
msgid "This carbine packs the classic Mosin-Nagant Model 44 action in a modern-day stock capable of accepting modifications."
msgstr "这把卡宾枪将传统的莫辛纳甘44式步枪和现代可调整枪托结合在一起。"

#. ~ Description of variant "PPSh-41 submachine gun" of gun "PPSh-41
#. submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of variant "PPSh-41 submachine gun" of item "PPSh-41
#. submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/762x25.json
msgid "A bulky and simple Second World War submachine gun of Russian manufacture, composed from a basic wooden buttstock, steel barrel shroud, and the hopes and prayers of Soviet soldiers under threat of German invasion.  Designed for mass production with limited materials, the weapon is notable for its high-capacity drum magazines, capability of rapidly depleting said magazines, and vicious 7.62x25mm chambering."
msgstr "俄罗斯在二战期间制造的一款笨重但简单冲锋枪，由基本的木制枪托、钢制枪管护木，以及受到德国入侵威胁的苏联士兵的希望和祈祷组成。 该武器设计之初就确定了造价低廉、大规模列装的路线，以其弹鼓容量管饱、泼水能力强大以及致命的 7.62x25mm子弹而闻名。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Tokarev handgun"
#. ~ Description of "Tokarev handgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/762x25.json
msgid "A symbol of Soviet pride and favored sidearm of Red Army officers, this is a compact pistol firing the punchy 7.62x25mm cartridge.  featuring an uncomfortable grip angle reminiscent of brandishing an unusually irate capital L at one's opponents, it is nevertheless a commendably accurate and durable handgun."
msgstr "这是苏联自豪感的象征，也是红军军官喜爱的随身武器，这是一款紧凑型手枪，发射强力的 7.62x25 毫米子弹。  它的握把角度令人不舒服，让人想起对对手挥舞着异常愤怒的大写字母“L”，但它仍然是一把值得称赞的精确且耐用的手枪。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#. ~ Variant name of gun "PPSh-41 submachine gun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "PPSh-41 submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/762x25.json
msgid "PPSh-41 submachine gun"
msgid_plural "PPSh-41 submachine guns"
msgstr[0] "PPSh-41 冲锋枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "PPSh-41 submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of "PPSh-41 submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/762x25.json
msgid "The Soviet-made PPSh-41 is a mass-produced selective-fire submachine gun.  It has a relatively high rate of fire."
msgstr "苏联造的ppsh-41冲锋枪是一种大规模量产的射击模式可调的冲锋枪，射速相对较高。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tokarev handgun" of gun "Tokarev TT-33 pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Tokarev TT-33 pistol" of item "Tokarev handgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/762x25.json
msgid "The Tokarev TT-33 is an antique Russian semiautomatic pistol, famous for its durability, accuracy, and uncomfortable grip angle.  It was chambered for the 7.62x25mm due to the popularity of the C96 pistol among Russian revolutionaries."
msgstr "托卡列夫ТТ-33型半自动手枪，俄国古董手枪之一，闻名于其耐用与精度，还有无视人体工程学的令人不适的握把角度。它使用的 7.62x25mm 托卡列夫手枪弹，是从俄国在革命时期的\"熟人\"德国流行的毛瑟C96手枪的 7.63mm 子弹经过\"社会主义改造\"改良得来的，颇具含义，就是不能够换用。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Tokarev handgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Tokarev handgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/762x25.json
msgid "Tokarev TT-33 pistol"
msgid_plural "Tokarev TT-33 pistols"
msgstr[0] "托卡列夫 TT-33 手枪"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/762x25.json
msgid "Tokarev handgun"
msgid_plural "Tokarev handguns"
msgstr[0] "托卡列夫手枪"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_arisaka.json
msgid "7.7mm battle rifle"
msgid_plural "7.7mm battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "7.7mm 战斗步枪"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_arisaka.json
msgid "7.7mm sniper rifle"
msgid_plural "7.7mm sniper rifles"
msgstr[0] "7.7毫米狙击步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "7.7mm sniper rifle"
#. ~ Description of "7.7mm sniper rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_arisaka.json
msgid "A precision weapon issued to Japanese forces part way through the Second World War and proving to be little more than an off-the-rack 7.7mm battle rifle fitted with a telescopic sight, the rifle, despite being only marginally different from its closer-range cohorts, was a formidable implement upon the battle fields of the Pacific theatre."
msgstr "这是第二次世界大战期间向日本军队配发的一种精确武器，事实证明它只不过是一支配有望远瞄准镜的现成 7.7 毫米战斗步枪，尽管与近距离同类步枪略有不同，但它在太平洋战区的战场上却是一种强大的武器。"

#. ~ Description of gun "7.7mm battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "7.7mm battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_arisaka.json
msgid "A stout and rugged battle rifle that traces its origins to the hands of imperial Japanese forces and saw extensive use in the Pacific theatre of the Second World War, this bolt-action firearm shoots the 7.7x58mm Arisaka cartridge.  Powerful, dependable, and elegantly built, Japan's 20th-century infantry rifle may yet find service guarding the lives of her former enemies."
msgstr "这款坚固耐用的战斗步枪起源于日本帝国军队，并在第二次世界大战的太平洋战区得到广泛使用，这款栓动式枪械发射 7.7x58 毫米有坂子弹。  日本 20 世纪的步兵步枪威力强大、性能可靠、结构优雅，或许还能用来保护她昔日敌人的生命。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "7.7mm battle rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "7.7mm battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_arisaka.json
msgid "Arisaka Type 99 rifle"
msgid_plural "Arisaka Type 99 rifles"
msgstr[0] "有坂99式步枪"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "7.7mm sniper rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "7.7mm sniper rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_arisaka.json
msgid "Arisaka Type 99 sniper rifle"
msgid_plural "Arisaka Type 99 sniper rifles"
msgstr[0] "有坂99式狙击步枪"

#. ~ Description of variant "7.7mm battle rifle" of gun "Arisaka Type 99
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Arisaka Type 99 rifle" of item "7.7mm battle
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_arisaka.json
msgid "Standing as a clear example of what happens when a country losing a war realizes that it's running out of resources and its rifles are ripe for corner-cutting, this Type 99 Arisaka, the standard service arm of imperial Japan from 1939, is a crewed end-of-war example.  Coated in machining marks, lacking an upper handguard, and with the early production anti-aircraft sights long since done away with, where early production Arisaka rifles are a feat in elegant engineering, this one is a last-ditch bang stick hammered together in a mostly bombed-out factory.  Aesthetics not withstanding, this weapon is still an effective and powerful shoulder arm, just… not the prettiest."
msgstr "这架 99 有坂步枪是日本帝国自 1939 年以来的标准军种，它是一个典型的例子，说明当一个输掉战争的国家意识到自己的资源即将耗尽，并且其步枪已经到了可以走捷径的时候，会发生什么情况，这架 99 有坂步枪是日本帝国自 1939 年以来的标准军种，是一个有人驾驶的战后例子。  涂有加工痕迹，缺少上护手，早期生产的防空瞄准器早已废弃，早期生产的有坂步枪在优雅的工程中是一项壮举，这把枪是在一家几乎被炸毁的工厂里锤炼而成的最后一搏的爆炸棒。  尽管不考虑美观，这把武器仍然是一个有效而强大的肩臂，只是……不是最漂亮的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "7.7mm battle rifle" of gun "Arisaka Type 99
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Arisaka Type 99 rifle" of item "7.7mm battle
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_arisaka.json
msgid "The standard service arm of the imperial Japanese army during the Second World War, chambered for the powerful 7.7x58mm cartridge and built to replace the weaker Type 38, the Type 99 is a sturdy and formidable bolt-action rifle with a Mauser-inspired action renowned for its strength.  Though the rifle was historically sneered at in the US due to extensive anti-Japanese propaganda and the lower quality of later-production guns, the weapon is, by most metrics, a finely produced and effective shoulder arm.  This particular Arisaka is an early-war example with anti-aircraft sights and an intact 6-petal chrysanthemum seal."
msgstr "99 式是第二次世界大战期间日本帝国军队的标准装备，配备威力强大的 7.7x58 毫米弹药筒，旨在取代较弱的 38 式步枪，它是一款坚固而强大的栓动步枪，其受毛瑟启发的枪机以其强度而闻名。  尽管由于广泛的抗日宣传和后来生产的枪支质量较低，该步枪在美国历来受到嘲笑，但从大多数指标来看，该武器是一款制作精良且有效的肩臂。  这艘特殊的有坂号是早期战争时期的型号，配有防空瞄准器和完整的六瓣菊花印章。"

#. ~ Description of variant "7.7mm sniper rifle" of gun "Arisaka Type 99
#. sniper rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Arisaka Type 99 sniper rifle" of item "7.7mm
#. sniper rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_arisaka.json
msgid "The standard sniper's weapon of Imperial Japan, this rifle is essentially an early production Type 99 Arisaka fitted with an offset optical sight and a bent bolt handle to facilitate stripper clip loading and easy manipulation despite the scope's presence.  While its 7.7x58mm chambering resulted in a muzzle flash and report that were significantly greater than those of the Type 97, which it sought to replace, the rifle's man-stopping potential is nothing to be trifled with."
msgstr "这款步枪是日本帝国的标准狙击手武器，本质上是早期生产的 99 有坂步枪，配备了偏置光学瞄准镜和弯曲的枪机手柄，以便于装弹夹，并且尽管有瞄准镜，也可以轻松操作。  虽然它的 7.7x58mm 枪膛导致枪口闪光和爆炸声明显大于它试图取代的 97 式，但该步枪的制人潜力却不容小觑。"

#. ~ Description of gun "AT4 launcher"
#. ~ Description of "AT4 launcher"
#: data/json/items/gun/84x246mm.json
msgid "A milspec recoilless rifle - an 84mm unguided, portable, single-shot recoilless smoothbore weapon used primarily by the US military."
msgstr "一把军用无后坐力炮，84毫米口径、无制导、便携式单发无后坐力炮，主要由美国军方使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/84x246mm.json
msgid "AT4 launcher"
msgid_plural "AT4 launchers"
msgstr[0] "发射器"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/84x246mm.json
msgid "M3 rocket launcher"
msgid_plural "M3 rocket launchers"
msgstr[0] "自制火箭发射器"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/84x246mm.json
msgid "M3E1 rocket launcher"
msgid_plural "M3E1 rocket launchers"
msgstr[0] "自制火箭发射器"

#. ~ Description of gun "M3 rocket launcher"
#. ~ Description of "M3 rocket launcher"
#: data/json/items/gun/84x246mm.json
msgid "Manufactured in Sweden, the Carl Gustaf M3 is a breech-loading 84 millimeter man-portable, reusable, multi-role recoilless rifle commonly used by the US military.  Under normal circumstances, users should refrain from shooting more than 6 rounds per day to avoid undue risk of brain injury…"
msgstr "卡尔·古斯塔夫M3是一种84毫米后装式单兵便携式、可重复使用、多用途无后坐力炮，通常被美军使用。在正常情况下，使用者应避免每天射击超过6发，以防止过度的脑损伤风险……"

#. ~ Description of gun "M3E1 rocket launcher"
#. ~ Description of "M3E1 rocket launcher"
#: data/json/items/gun/84x246mm.json
msgid "The Carl Gustaf M3E1 is a breech-loading 84 millimeter man-portable, reusable, multi-role recoilless rifle.  This is a shorter, lighter, and more advanced development of the M3.  Under normal circumstances, users should refrain from shooting more than 6 rounds per day to prevent undue risk of brain injury…"
msgstr "卡尔·古斯塔夫M3E1是一种84毫米后装式单兵便携式、可重复使用、多用途无后坐力炮。这是M3的更短，更轻，更先进的版本。在正常情况下，使用者应避免每天射击超过6发，以防止过度的脑损伤风险……"

#. ~ Description of gun "RM103A pistol"
#. ~ Description of "RM103A pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/8x40mm.json
msgid "Designed for style rather than practicality, the Rivtech RM103A is an impressive-looking pistol with less-than-impressive results.  Too short to properly utilize Rivtech's proprietary 8mm caseless ammunition, this status symbol is still a capable sidearm.  Accepts stick magazines."
msgstr "Rivtech RM103 A是一款外观令人印象深刻的手枪，其设计目的是追求时尚而非实用性，但效果并不令人印象深刻。由于太短，无法正确使用Rivtech专有的8毫米无壳弹药，这仍然是个一个有能力的随身武器身份的象征。接受条形弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "RM11B rifle"
#. ~ Description of "RM11B rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/8x40mm.json
msgid "Intended to function as a long-range sharpshooter support weapon for the military, the Rivtech RM11B scout rifle was designed for durability and accuracy under less than ideal circumstances.  Its bullpup layout, digital scope, and two round burst mode allow it to deliver precise long-range takedowns, utilizing the proprietary Rivtech 8mm caseless round.  Accepts stick magazines."
msgstr "作为为军队设计的长距离精确射击辅助武器，RM11B侦察步枪被设计在恶劣条件下保证射击精度和武器耐久。无托枪型，集成了消音器及数字瞄准镜，其双发短点射模式可以在远距离精确击杀敌人，该武器发射Rivtech公司最新专利——8mm无壳弹。能使用Rivtech公司条形弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "RM51 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "RM51 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/8x40mm.json
msgid "Originally produced for military use, the Rivtech RM51 assault rifle was designed for durability and ease of use under less than ideal circumstances, with its considerable bulk minimized by a compact and ergonomic layout.  Accepts box magazines."
msgstr "原为军用，Rivtech RM51突击步枪设计时考虑了耐用性及非理想环境下的易用性，它的体积因为其紧凑及符合人体工学的设计而大大减小。可使用盒式弹匣。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/8x40mm.json
msgid "RM103A pistol"
msgid_plural "RM103A pistols"
msgstr[0] "M11 手枪"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/8x40mm.json
msgid "RM11B rifle"
msgid_plural "RM11B rifles"
msgstr[0] "M1A 步枪"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/8x40mm.json
msgid "RM2000 SMG"
msgid_plural "RM2000 SMGs"
msgstr[0] "M3 冲锋枪"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/8x40mm.json
msgid "RM51 rifle"
msgid_plural "RM51 rifles"
msgstr[0] "M1A 步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "RM2000 SMG"
#. ~ Description of "RM2000 SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/8x40mm.json
msgid "Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM2000 submachine gun was designed for durability and ease of carrying under less than ideal circumstances.  Accepts stick magazines."
msgstr "Rivtech RM2000冲锋枪采用了一种不常见但足够强力的口径，这把武器的设计目标就是能够在恶劣环境下提供持久火力并易于携带。能使用Rivtech公司条形弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Colt Model 635 SMG"
#. ~ Description of "Colt Model 635 SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A 9x19mm submachine gun based on the M16 rifle design, it is a closed bolt, blowback operated firearm.  There is a large plastic brass deflector mounted by the ejection port, and no forward assist.  It looks very similar to an M4 carbine, except for the magazine well that accepts Uzi-style magazines."
msgstr "一把采用9x19mm 口径的冲锋枪，基于 M16A2 步枪为原型开发，采用封闭式机匣和反冲式枪机。抛壳口处有块大型塑料制弹壳挡板，没有辅助推机柄。它看起来与 M4 卡宾枪非常相似，但是使用的是乌兹冲锋枪族的弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Luty SMG"
#. ~ Description of "Luty SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A Luty pattern makeshift smoothbore SMG crudely constructed out of various steel parts using advanced powered hand tools; likely one of the most complex guns that is feasible to make outside of a machine shop, but still very unreliable.  This one is chambered for 9x19mm cartridges and accepts STEN-compatible magazines."
msgstr "Luty式自制无膛线冲锋枪，使用具有更先进动力的手动工具，由各种钢制零件拼凑而成。也许是能够在工厂车间外制造出的最复杂的枪支之一，但仍然很不可靠。这一款专为9x19mm弹设计，同时能够兼容斯登冲锋枪弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock 19 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Glock 19 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A common 9x19mm pistol of modest proportions, produced by the popular Glock gun company and mainly built from plastic polymers.  Making use of aptly-named Glock magazines and being a decades-long popular concealed carry option for civilians due to its small size, it is a tried, tested, and reliable design."
msgstr "一种普通的9x19毫米手枪，尺寸不大，由流行的格洛克枪械公司生产，主要由塑料聚合物制造。由于其体积小，它是几十年来平民隐蔽携带的流行选择，这种设计久经考验而且十分可靠。"

#. ~ Description of gun "H&K operational briefcase SMG"
#. ~ Description of "H&K operational briefcase SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A hard-sided briefcase with a trigger in the handle and a concealed hole in the side.  To fire the internally mounted MP5K-PDW, one braces the briefcase at the waist, ensures the hole is pointed at the enemy, and squeezes the trigger.  Precision and handling are severely hampered by the shape of the briefcase, but if you need to 'hand over the goods' or look low profile while bodyguarding, this is your gun.  When the briefcase is open, the MP5 may be reloaded or dismounted."
msgstr "一个硬壳公文包，把手上有一个扳机，侧面开有一个隐秘的枪孔，内部藏有一把 MP5K-PDW 冲锋枪。正确的射击方法如下：将手提箱抵在腰部，确认枪口对准了目标，并按下扳机。因为藏在公文包里，射击的命中率和操控性都很差，但是如果你需要去\"交货\"或者不想引人注目的话，这就是你的最佳选择。如果你要装弹或取出冲锋枪的话，则需要打开手提箱。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Semi Automatic MP 40 SMG"
#. ~ Description of "Semi Automatic MP 40 SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A modern semi-automatic replica of the MP 40 submachine gun, which lacks a butt stock to make it legally be considered a pistol.  It actually bears only a visual resemblance to the original, differing substantially from originally manufactured MP 40 submachine guns in its internal operations."
msgstr "一把MP40冲锋枪的现代半自动复制品，因为它没有枪托，因此在法律上被视为手枪。它仅具有与原始产品的外观，内部构造与原本的 MP40 完全不同。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Federal Ordnance M714 Broomhandle pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Federal Ordnance M714 Broomhandle pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A modern take on the original Mauser design, this variant is chambered for 9x19mm cartridges and, unlike its elder brother, the pre-1900 Mauser Broomhandle, this firearm feeds from detachable box magazines.  Whilst it features surplus Mauser parts in its construction, the frame of the pistol is of relatively modern manufacture."
msgstr "一把根据原始毛瑟再设计的现代手枪，这款型号的枪管可使用9x19mm弹药，与它更早的兄弟1900款毛瑟驳壳枪不同，这款手枪使用可拆卸的盒式弹匣供弹。虽然它的结构中采用了遗留下来的多余毛瑟部件，但手枪的主体框架仍然是相对现代的制造。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Beretta 90-two pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Beretta 90-two pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A more modern version of Beretta's popular 92 series of handguns, the 90-two performs largely the same.  The main difference is a sleeker, almost futuristic-looking design owed in large part to the polymer underbarrel rail cover.  This one is chambered in 9x19mm."
msgstr "贝雷塔畅销92系列手枪的现代化版本，90-two在性能上基本无异。主要区别在于其更流畅、近乎未来感的设计，这在很大程度上归功于聚合物下挂导轨护盖。该枪发射9x19毫米弹药。"

#. ~ Description of gun "SIG M18 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "SIG M18 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A more petite version of the United States army's general issue sidearm, this is a modestly-sized pistol firing 9x19mm rounds.  Making use of the same magazines as its larger brother, the weapon features a shorter barrel and frame which helps to reduce its overall profile and make it more concealable as a result."
msgstr "这是美军的常见军用手枪的紧凑型号，一种可发射9x19mm弹药的中等大小的手枪。相对于它体型更大的兄弟，紧凑型使用了更短的枪管和套筒，有助于缩短整体长度，更加隐蔽和便携。"

#. ~ Description of gun "SIG Pro pistol"
#. ~ Description of "SIG Pro pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A polymer-frame, semi-automatic, DA/SA operated pistol, featuring a Picatinny rail and a Nitron stainless steel slide."
msgstr "一把塑料聚合物框架的半自动手枪，可双动/单动操作，具有卡皮汀尼式轨道和工程塑料底把。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Beretta M9A1 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Beretta M9A1 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A rugged, iconic, and long-serving 9mm handgun, the M9 is a sleek pistol that has enjoyed fame in military, law enforcement, and civilian circles ever since its inception.  Adopted as the primary service sidearm across all United States armed branches from the early eighties until the late two thousand and tens, the weapon has seen a great deal of popular media coverage in both videogames and television alike."
msgstr "作为一把造型优美的、可靠的、标志性的且使用寿命长的9mm手枪，M9自问世以来就在军用、警用和民用领域备受好评。从80年代初到20世纪末，M9作为随身武器服役于全美各军事机构，并且因在游戏和电视上大量出现而广为人知。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock 18C pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Glock 18C pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A selective-fire variation on the Glock 17, originally designed for Austria's EKO Cobra unit.  It has compensator cuts along its barrel to make recoil more manageable."
msgstr "Glock 17手枪可选射击模式的衍生型号，最初设计供奥地利的 EKO 眼镜蛇部队使用。它有一个沿着枪管走向的枪口补偿器，使其后坐力能在掌控范围内。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Luger P08 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Luger P08 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic 9x19mm military issued pistol with an unusual toggle-lock action.  Well-known for its use by the Germans during both World Wars, it's a notably accurate handgun even by modern standards, and this example of a P08 was more than likely either brought back state-side as a war trophy by a veteran, or imported."
msgstr "一把军用制式 9x19mm 半自动手枪，具有罕见的肘节式闭锁机。因两次世界大战期间在德军服役而闻名。射击精度即使按照现代标准也非常准，而手头这款P08手枪，很可能是退伍军人作为战利品带回美国来的，或是进口而来的。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Mauser C96 Broomhandle pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Mauser C96 Broomhandle pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic German pistol developed prior to 1900, the firearm features a burned and painted number '9' on its broom handle-shaped grip to signify its chambering, 9x19mm parabellum, and makes use of appropriate stripper clips or single round loading.  Quite possibly the most aesthetically steampunk weapon that one could ever possibly get their hands on, this example likely found its way into the US via early import or as a holdover from the Great War."
msgstr "这是一款 1900 年之前开发的德国半自动手枪，该枪械的扫帚柄形状的握把上有一个烧焦并涂漆的数字“9”，表示其膛室，9x19 毫米 parabellum，并使用适当的弹夹或单发子弹。  这个例子很可能是人们能得到的最美观的蒸汽朋克武器，它很可能通过早期进口或作为第一次世界大战的遗留物进入美国。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Vollmer MP 40 SMG"
#. ~ Description of "Vollmer MP 40 SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "An antique German-issued submachine gun from the Second World War, likely having entered the United States as a personal holdover by a veteran.  Chambered in 9x19mm and utilizing proprietary box magazines, the firearm has an integrated under folding wire stock."
msgstr "一把二战时期德国配发的老式冲锋枪，很可能是一名退伍军人遗物进入美国的。这块冲锋枪采用9x19mm口径弹药，并使用特制的专用盒式弹匣，有一个内置下折铁丝枪托。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Bergmann MP 18 SMG"
#. ~ Description of "Bergmann MP 18 SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "An early German submachine gun introduced near the end of the First World War, the MP 18 chambers 9x19mm cartridges and makes use of Luger magazines.  Sporting a fixed wooden stock, the weapon more than likely entered the US as a personal holdover from the Great War."
msgstr "一把早期的德国冲锋枪，在第一次世界大战末期投入实战。MP 18 冲锋枪使用 9x19mm 口径弹药和鲁格弹匣。这把枪采用木制全枪托，很可能是作为一次大战遗留下来的个人遗物带进美国的。"

