#. ~ Description of "Glock 17 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "Designed for all shooters, this offering from the Glock gun company is a full-sized 9x19mm pistol marketed towards law-enforcement and military users.  Because of the long magazine well, it can't fit magazines shorter than the standard 17-round ones."
msgstr "为所有级别的射手设计，格洛克公司的这款9x19mm手枪面向执法人员和军事用户。由于弹仓很长，无法装比标准17发弹匣短的弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Beretta Cx4 Storm carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Beretta Cx4 Storm carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid "Designed to be a companion rifle with provided M9 handguns, this compact and light weight pistol-caliber carbine makes use of the same 9x19mm magazines.  Originally intended for use by law enforcement units, this style of small caliber, semi-automatic carbine failed to achieve the same level of popularity as regular and more potent rifles.  However, despite being inadequate for their original purpose, before the Cataclysm these modestly sized weapons still found a home in sport shooting and self-defense civilian roles."
msgstr "紧凑而轻巧的手枪口径卡宾枪，可以与普通的9x19mm手枪使用相同的弹匣，最初供执法单位使用。这种风格的小口径半自动卡宾枪，未能像更强大的普通步枪一样普及。尽管不足以满足其最初目的，但在大灾变之前，这些大小适中的武器仍然在运动射击和自卫的平民角色中找到了家。"

