#. ~ Description of gun "M9-7 flamethrower"
#. ~ Description of "M9-7 flamethrower"
#: data/json/items/gun/flammable.json
msgid "A large flamethrower with substantial gas reserves.  The steel frame, with canvas accoutrements and aluminum cylinders, are all colored olive drab, like so many other pieces of equipment from the Vietnam War era."
msgstr "具有大量气体储备的大型火焰喷射器。  与越南战争时期的许多其他设备一样，钢制框架配有帆布装备和铝制圆筒，颜色均为橄榄褐色。"

#. ~ Description of gun "DARPA flamethrower"
#. ~ Description of "DARPA flamethrower"
#: data/json/items/gun/flammable.json
msgid "A modernized flamethrower, using alloy components and composite pressure tanks.  Despite having been replaced by the M202 FLASH, due to the questionable effectiveness of the flamethrower in modern combat, it appears that someone, somewhere, needed a flamethrower for the modern age, as the date code on many of the components is within the past five years.  While this resembles the Vietnam War era M9-7, the wand ignition system has been improved with a piezoelectric one, in addition to the material improvements of the system overall."
msgstr "现代化的火焰喷射器，采用合金部件和复合材料压力罐。  尽管已被 M202 FLASH 取代，但由于火焰喷射器在现代战斗中的有效性值得怀疑，似乎有人在某个地方需要现代的火焰喷射器，因为许多组件上的日期代码都在过去五年内。  虽然这类似于越南战争时期的 M9-7，但除了整个系统的材料改进之外，还使用压电点火系统改进了魔杖点火系统。"

