#. ~ Description of gun "M1014 shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "M1014 shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Benelli's first gas-operated shotgun, featuring dual pistons for enhanced reliability with various loads and a collapsible buttstock that reduces length by almost 8 inches.  Adopted in 1999 as the M1014 Joint Service Combat Shotgun, the Benelli M4 is one of the finest combat shotguns available."
msgstr "伯奈利公司出品的首把采用气体驱动的霰弹枪，采用双活塞提高使用各种弹药时的可靠性，此外还有一个可折叠的枪托，将整体长度减少了约8英寸(20厘米)。于1999年被军方采购并编号为M1014三军战斗霰弹枪，伯奈利M4霰弹枪是现有最好的战斗霰弹枪之一。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Browning Auto 5 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Browning Auto 5 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "勃朗宁 Auto 5 霰弹枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "Saiga-12 shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "Saiga-12 shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Built in the same style as the venerable AK series of rifles, this Russian exported firearm feeds from detachable magazines rather than making use of a standard tubular design like most commercial shotguns.  With 10 and 30-round magazines available, reloading is rendered a much quicker procedure than can ever be accomplished with conventional bottom-feeding firearms."
msgstr "这款俄式霰弹枪与经久不衰的AK系列步枪风格相同，使用可拆卸弹匣供弹，而不是像大多数民用霰弹枪一样使用标准管状弹匣设计。由于有10发和30发弹匣可供使用，重新装弹的过程比传统的底部供弹枪械要快得多。"

#. ~ Item name
