#. ~ Description of gun "Tavor TS12 shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "Tavor TS12 shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Looking more like some form of sci-fi prop gun than an actual firearm, this weapon uses a system of three different magazines to field 15 12-gauge shotgun shells within a comparatively compact design.  As the weapon's trigger assembly is situated forwards of the chamber and magazines in what is termed as a 'bullpup' design, the firearm's notably more compact than its peers despite having a higher capacity when compared against more classically designed shotguns."
msgstr "这种武器看起来更像某个科幻电影里的道具枪，而不是真正的枪支，它使用一个由三个管状弹匣组成的系统，在一个相对紧凑的设计中装填15发霰弹。每根管子都必须单独装填，但这提供了为不同情况装填不同弹药的选项。此外，由于该武器的扳机位于膛室前方，和弹匣供弹设计一同被称为\"无托式\"设计，虽然与更经典设计的霰弹枪相比其容量相对较高，但它的结构明显比同类武器更紧凑。"

