#. ~ Description of "paintball gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/toy.json
msgid "A fairly harmless gun that shoots small paintballs."
msgstr "一把无害的射击竞赛玩具枪，可以发射小彩弹。"

#. ~ Description of "novelty pneumatic launcher"
#: data/json/items/gun/toy.json
msgid "A toy that uses compressed air to launch small objects for the amusement of children.  It is very tiring to reload, and completely ineffective as a weapon.  Pump sold separately."
msgstr "利用压缩空气发射小物体的玩具，供儿童娱乐。重新装填非常累人，而且作为武器完全没用。气泵单独出售。"

