#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/toy.json
msgid "paintball gun"
msgid_plural "paintball guns"
msgstr[0] "彩弹枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "XM34 EMP projector"
#. ~ Description of "XM34 EMP projector"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "A powerful electrolaser developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\".  Especially effective against electronic targets."
msgstr "强力电子激光枪，由研究机构\"Aerial Labs\"制造。对电子目标特别有效。"

#. ~ Description of gun "A7 laser rifle"
#. ~ Description of "A7 laser rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "A state-of-the-art laser rifle developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\".  Initial performance rivaled Rivtech's finest, with rumors flying about corporate skulduggery.  Though the Cataclysm put that on the ash heap of history, this weapon can still do the same to your foes."
msgstr "最先进的激光步枪，由研究机构\"Aerial Labs\"制造。初始性能甚至可以和Rivtech的最佳产品一较上下，虽然集团诈骗的传言满天飞，当大灾变降临，这些都被扔进了历史的垃圾堆里。这把武器也能把你的敌人扔进历史的垃圾堆里。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "A7 laser rifle"
msgid_plural "A7 laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "A7 激光步枪"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "CMES laser cannon"
msgid_plural "CMES laser cannons"
msgstr[0] "CMES 激光炮"

#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
#. ~ Description of "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "Formerly belonging to an RMES mech-suit, this powerful long-range laser rifle was never designed for human hands.  You might be able to make it work if you deployed it or mounted it to a vehicle, though, and its long range and potency could be pretty handy if you can keep it powered."
msgstr "这架威力强大的远程激光步枪曾经属于某套RMES外骨骼机甲，从不是为供人手持使用而设计的。你需要将其部署或安装到载具上，才能使它工作，只要你能为其提供动力，它的射程和威力可能会很有用。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "RMES marksman system"
msgid_plural "RMES marksman systems"
msgstr[0] "RMES 狙击系统"

#. ~ Description of gun "V29 laser pistol"
#. ~ Description of "V29 laser pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "The V29 laser pistol was one of the first handheld laser weapons.  It is larger than most traditional handguns, but has no recoil whatsoever."
msgstr "V29激光手枪是全球首款手持激光武器之一。它的外型比普通手枪要大一些，但射击时感受不到一点后坐力。"

#. ~ Description of gun "CMES laser cannon"
#. ~ Description of "CMES laser cannon"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "The integral weapon system for the CMES exoskeleton mech-suit, a rotating-barrel actively-cooled rapid-fire laser system."
msgstr "CMES外骨骼机甲的内置武器，一套转管式主动冷却速射激光系统。"

#. ~ Description of gun "RMES marksman system"
#. ~ Description of "RMES marksman system"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "The integral weapon system for the RMES exoskeleton mech-suit, a quiet and accurate marksman laser rifle."
msgstr "集成到侦察机甲中的武器系统，一把无声且精确的狙击激光步枪。"

#. ~ Description of gun "hm12 dazzle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "hm12 dazzle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "This bulky anti-drone gun molded from black polymer was once beloved on all sides of the Eastern European theater.  It disrupts navigation and communcation systems by firing a brief but powerful burst of microwave energy.  A direct hit may cause robots, drones, and even cyborgs to malfunction for a short time."
msgstr "这种由黑色聚合物制成的笨重反无人机枪曾经受到东欧战区各方的喜爱。  它通过发射短暂但强大的微波能量爆发来扰乱导航和通信系统。  直接命中可能会导致机器人、无人机甚至机器人在短时间内出现故障。"

#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
#. ~ Description of "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "This gatling-laser has been stripped from its CMES mech-suit and is far too heavy to use on its own.  You will need to deploy it or mount it to a vehicle, but it could be devastating if you have deep battery reserves."
msgstr "这架加特林激光炮已经从CMES外骨骼机甲上拆下来了，它太重了，无法直接使用。你需要将其部署或安装到载具上，但只要你供电充足，它就能够轻而易举地为目标带来死亡。"

