#. ~ Description of gun mod "belt clip"
#. ~ Description of "belt clip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "A belt clip that attaches to the grip or slide of a pistol to facilitate 'Mexican carry', the practice of carrying without a holster.  It does not offer any protection for the trigger, so users are strongly advised to carry with the chamber empty or select a firearm with a very heavy trigger pull."
msgstr "一个皮带夹，附在手枪的握把或滑套上，以方便\"墨西哥式携带\"——即不带皮套地携带。它不为扳机提供任何保险，因此强烈建议用户在枪膛空着的情况下携带，或选择扳机拉力很大的火器。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow stabilizer"
#. ~ Description of "bow stabilizer"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "A counterweight placed forward of the bow's grip allows for greater accuracy.  Aside from increased weight and size, there are no drawbacks."
msgstr "安置在弓柄上用于提高精准度的平衡物。除了增加重量和体积外，没有缺点。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow dampening kit"
#. ~ Description of "bow dampening kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "A set of simple pads and rubber with adhesive backing, designed to stick on the limbs and string of a bow to absorb vibrations.  This substantially reduces noise during firing and can help with accuracy."
msgstr "一套橡胶制成的简单护垫和护条，背后有粘合剂，用于贴在弓身中段和末端来吸收弓身的振动。它可以降低弓箭发射时的噪声，并且提高射击精度。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "primitive bow dampening kit"
#. ~ Description of "primitive bow dampening kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "A set of simple pads and strips of fur with adhesive backing, designed to stick on the limbs and string of a bow to absorb vibrations.  This substantially reduces noise during firing and can help with accuracy."
msgstr "一套毛皮制成的简单护垫和护条，背后有粘合剂，用于贴在弓身中段和末端来吸收弓身的振动。它可以降低弓箭发射时的噪声，并且提高射击精度。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow stabilizer system"
#. ~ Description of "bow stabilizer system"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "A set of stabilizing rods with dampeners and an adjustable mount.  This system will significantly reduce shaking at full draw."
msgstr "一套带有减震器和可调支架的稳定杆。这套系统能够显著减少拉弓时的震动。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of "arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "wooden arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of "wooden arrow rest"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "A small extension above the grip which an arrow rests upon while being aimed.  Improves accuracy with no drawbacks."
msgstr "一个装在握柄上的小小扩件，在你瞄准时将弓箭固定在握柄处。无损提高精准度。"

