#. ~ Description of gun mod "ported barrel"
#. ~ Description of "ported barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "A ported barrel redirects exhaust gases to compensate for muzzle climb, improving recoil but increasing noise and reducing accuracy slightly."
msgstr "装有气门的枪管，通过改变排放气体的方向来降低枪口上扬的幅度，降低了后座力，但增大了噪音，并且轻微地降低了精度。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "shortened barrel"
#. ~ Description of "shortened barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "A shortened barrel results in markedly reduced accuracy and a minor increase in noise, but also greatly improves the ease with which the weapon can be carried and wielded."
msgstr "锯短枪管会导致射击精度明显降低，并略微增加噪声，但也能使武器便于携带和手持。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "UPS test"
#. ~ Description of "UPS test"
