#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .223 extended-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .223 extended-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions and requiring STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly makes the most from the weapon's bullpup design with a 20-inch barrel configuration, coaxing increased terminal performance from fired rounds."
msgstr "这是装有专用气体补偿器的一根快拆枪管，配有相应的枪栓组件，安装在DT MDRX步枪的枪机内。该枪管适用.223口径的弹药并且需要STANAG弹匣供弹，这种改装充分利用了无托式布局与20英寸(约51厘米)枪管，提高了最终的弹药发射性能。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .223 MICRON assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .223 MICRON assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions and requiring STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly renders the MDRX into a compact CQB carbine, with an 11.5-inch barrel recessed into the weapon's bullpup layout."
msgstr "这是装有专用气体补偿器的一根快拆枪管，配有相应的枪栓组件，安装在DT MDRX步枪的枪机内。该枪管适用.223口径的弹药并且需要STANAG弹匣供弹，这种改装将11.5英寸(约29厘米)枪管隐藏在无托式布局中，把MDRX变成了一把紧凑的CQB卡宾枪。"

