#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, and bolt carrier group that is installable upon an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with this kit furnishing a weapon with a specialized 7.5-inch barrel chambered for .300 AAC Blackout ammunition.  Fortunately, standard STANAG magazines are still compatible."
msgstr "这是一个完整的上机匣组件，包含枪管、护木和枪栓托架组，可安装在 AR-15 式步枪的下枪身上。  可更换的上部使兼容的枪械能够重新装配以适应不同的弹药筒和枪管长度，该套件为武器配备了专门的 7.5 英寸枪管，可容纳 0.300 AAC Blackout 弹药。  幸运的是，标准 STANAG 弹匣仍然兼容。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "CQB .223 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of "CQB .223 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, and bolt carrier group that is installable upon an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with this kit providing a weapon with a 10.3-inch barrel chambered for .223 Remington ammunition, commonly installed on special-purpose carbines, including those used by US SOCOM forces."
msgstr "这是一个完整的上机匣组件，包含枪管、护木和枪栓托架组，可安装在 AR-15 式步枪的下枪身上。  可更换的上部使兼容的枪支能够重新装配以适应不同的弹药筒和枪管长度，该套件提供了一种带有 10.3 英寸枪管的武器，可容纳 0.223 雷明顿弹药，通常安装在特殊用途卡宾枪上，包括美国特种作战司令部部队使用的卡宾枪。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "carbine .223 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of "carbine .223 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, and bolt carrier group that is installable upon an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with this kit providing a weapon with a 14.5-inch barrel chambered for .223 Remington ammunition, commonly installed on standard-issue M4 carbines."
msgstr "这是一个完整的上机匣组件，包含枪管、护木和枪栓托架组，可安装在 AR-15 式步枪的下枪身上。  可更换的上部使兼容的枪支能够重新装配以适应不同的弹药筒和枪管长度，该套件提供了一种带有 14.5 英寸枪管的武器，可容纳 0.223 雷明顿弹药，通常安装在标准发行的 M4 卡宾枪上。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "rifle .223 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of "rifle .223 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, and bolt carrier group that is installable upon an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with this kit providing a weapon with a 20-inch barrel chambered for .223 Remington ammunition, commonly installed on full-length M16 rifles."
msgstr "这是一个完整的上机匣组件，包含枪管、护木和枪栓托架组，可安装在 AR-15 式步枪的下枪身上。  可更换的上部使兼容的枪械能够重新装配以适应不同的弹药筒和枪管长度，该套件提供了带有 20 英寸枪管的武器，可容纳 0.223 雷明顿弹药，通常安装在全长 M16 步枪上。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol .223 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of "pistol .223 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, and bolt carrier group that is installable upon an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with this kit providing a weapon with a 7.5-inch barrel chambered for .223 Remington ammunition.  These are most often found on stockless AR pistol lowers, to comply with legal restrictions on short barrels on rifles.  No such laws exist now, or at least people that can enforce them."
msgstr "这是一个完整的上机匣组件，包含枪管、护木和枪栓托架组，可安装在 AR-15 式步枪的下枪身上。  可更换的上部使兼容的枪支能够重新装配以适应不同的弹药筒和枪管长度，该套件提供了带有 7.5 英寸枪管的武器，可容纳 0.223 雷明顿弹药。  这些最常见于无枪托 AR 手枪下机，以符合步枪短枪管的法律限制。  现在不存在这样的法律，或者至少没有能够执行这些法律的人。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod ".22 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of ".22 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, and bolt carrier group that, given the right knowledge, is installable upon an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with this kit furnishing a weapon with a 16-inch barrel chambered for .22 rounds."
msgstr "这是一个完整组装的上机匣，包括枪管、护木和枪栓总成，如果了解对应的知识，可以安装在AR-15系列步枪的下枪身上。兼容该上机匣的枪支能够改装，使用不同口径的子弹和不同长度的枪管。现在这个上机匣有16英寸(约41厘米)长的特制枪管，使用.300 BLK弹药。幸运的是，标准的STANAG弹匣将仍然兼容。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "CQB .450 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of "CQB .450 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, and bolt carrier group that, given the right knowledge, is installable upon an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with this kit furnishing a weapon with a high-caliber 10.5-inch barrel chambered for .450 Bushmaster cartridges.  Special-purpose low-capacity magazines are required to feed the large rounds, but the upper turns any AR-15 into a short-range powerhouse."
msgstr "这是一个完整组装的上机匣，包括枪管、护木和枪栓总成，如果了解对应的知识，可以安装在AR-15系列步枪的下枪身上。兼容该上机匣的枪支能够改装，使用不同口径的子弹和不同长度的枪管。现在这个上机匣有10.5英寸(约27厘米)长的大口径枪管，使用.450 大毒蛇弹药。这种大子弹只能压入特制的低容量弹匣，但任何安装此上机匣的AR-15将会变成一头近程火力猛兽。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "SBR .450 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of "SBR .450 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, and bolt carrier group that, given the right knowledge, is installable upon an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with this kit furnishing a weapon with a high-caliber 7.5-inch barrel chambered for .450 Bushmaster cartridges.  Special-purpose low-capacity magazines are required to feed the large rounds, but the upper turns any AR-15 into a short-range powerhouse."
msgstr "这是一个完整组装的上机匣，包括枪管、护木和枪栓总成，如果了解对应的知识，可以安装在AR-15系列步枪的下枪身上。兼容该上机匣的枪支能够改装，使用不同口径的子弹和不同长度的枪管。现在这个上机匣有7.5英寸(约19厘米)长的大口径枪管，使用.450 大毒蛇弹药。这种大子弹只能压入特制的低容量弹匣，但任何安装此上机匣的AR-15将会变成一头近程火力猛兽。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "CZ .223 barrel-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "CZ .223 barrel-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a quick-detach .223-caliber barrel assembly and bolt-head, installable within the frame of a CZ 600 rifle, and secured with three fasteners.  With this assembly installed, a rifle is capable of feeding ammunition from standard STANAG-style magazines."
msgstr "这是一根.223口径带枪栓的枪管改装件，用三个紧固件安装在CZ 600步枪的机匣内。换装此组件后，枪械可适用标准STANAG型弹匣供弹。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "CZ 7.62x39mm barrel-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "CZ 7.62x39mm barrel-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a quick-detach 7.62mm barrel assembly and bolt head, installable within the frame of a CZ 600 rifle, and secured with three fasteners.  With this assembly installed, a rifle is rendered compatible with 7.62x39mm CZ Bren 2 magazines."
msgstr "这是一根7.62mm口径带枪栓的枪管改装件，用三个紧固件安装在CZ 600步枪的机匣内。换装此组件后，枪械兼容适用7.62x39mm的CZ Bren 2弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "AXMC .300 barrel-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "AXMC .300 barrel-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a specialized 24-inch .300-caliber barrel and bolt face that is installable within the main chassis of an Accuracy International AXMC rifle, converting it to fire the .300 Winchester Magnum cartridge."
msgstr "一根专用的 24 英寸 .300 口径枪管，可用螺栓固定安装在机密国际生产的 AXMC 狙击步枪的枪机内，使其能够发射.300 温切斯特 马格南弹药。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "AXMC .308 barrel-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "AXMC .308 barrel-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a specialized 24-inch .308-caliber barrel and bolt face that is installable within the main chassis of an Accuracy International AXMC rifle, converting it to fire the .308 Winchester cartridge."
msgstr "一根专用的 24 英寸 .308 口径枪管，可用螺栓固定安装在机密国际生产的 AXMC 狙击步枪的枪机内，使其能够发射.308 温切斯特弹药。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "AXMC .338 barrel-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "AXMC .338 barrel-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "This is a specialized 27-inch .338-caliber barrel and bolt face that is installable within the main chassis of an Accuracy International AXMC rifle, converting it to fire the .338 Lapua cartridge."
msgstr "一根专用的27英寸(约69厘米) .338 口径枪管，可用螺栓固定安装在机密国际生产的 AXMC 狙击步枪的枪机内，使其能够发射 .338 拉普阿弹。"

