msgstr "一个使用了高能量密度材质制成的电容器，能够增加激光武器的射程和伤害，但同时也极大的增加了射击时的能量消耗。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "effective emitter"
#. ~ Description of "effective emitter"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
msgid "A set of electronics to optimize emitter workcycle and increase overall energy efficiency.  Decreases power consumption."
msgstr "一套用于优化发射器工作循环的电子设备，能增加整体能量效率并降低能量消耗。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "electrolaser conversion"
#. ~ Description of "electrolaser conversion"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
msgid "A set of high-tech electronics and optics.  Converts a laser pistol into a less-lethal electrolaser capable of stunning targets, at the cost of a decreased damage output and increased power consumption."
msgstr "一套高科技电路及光学器件。这个改装模组可将激光手枪改装成发射能够击晕目标的非致命电子束激光，但相应的会减少伤害输出，并增加射击时的能量消耗。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "beam scatterer"
#. ~ Description of "beam scatterer"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
msgid "A set of optics made to fit on laser weapons, which will diffract the laser beam into several lower powered beams.  This increases point-blank damage, but greatly reduces range."
msgstr "一套适用于激光武器的光学器件，可将激光束分解成许多低能激光。增加近身伤害，但大大减少射程。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "focusing lens"
