#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "A complex set of parts designed to minimize recoil using a reciprocating counterweight."
msgstr "一套复杂的枪械模组，使用往复式配重来最大限度地降低后坐力。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "match trigger"
#. ~ Description of "match trigger"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "A precision weighted trigger assembly that slightly improves a firearm's accuracy."
msgstr "这种精密的配重扳机组件可以略为提升枪械命中率。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "TEC-9 full auto sear"
#. ~ Description of "TEC-9 full auto sear"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "A relatively simple modification of some of a TEC-9's internal fire-control components, converting it to a fully-automatic-only machine pistol.  Calling this hilariously illegal would be an understatement, but anyone who'd care is probably long gone by now."
msgstr "这个模组对TEC-9的一些内部扳机结构进行了相对简单的改造，将其改造成为全自动冲锋枪。把这种改装称为\"违法行为\"甚至都算轻描淡写，但会关心这种事情的人应该都已经与世长辞了。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Glock auto sear plate"
#. ~ Description of "Glock auto sear plate"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "A relatively simple switch or button mechanism that replaces the back plate of a Glock slide, allowing it to function as a select-fire machine pistol.  A highly illegal modification, but the feds are zombie food anyway.  This will fit any standard Glock pistol in 9mm, .40, .45, 10mm, or .357 caliber."
msgstr "一个结构还算简单的扳机或按钮模组，取代了格洛克手枪滑槽的背板，将其改造成一把可选射击模式的自动手枪。这算是极度违法的改装，但反正联邦调查局都已经成为丧尸们的大餐了。该模组适用于任何9mm、.40口径、.45口径、10mm或.357口径标准的格洛克手枪。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "M240 select fire trigger"
#. ~ Description of "M240 select fire trigger"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "A trigger modification that allows the M240 to switch between semi and full automatic modes."
msgstr "一个选择开火模式的小扳机，可以让M240在半自动与全自动开火模式间切换。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "M249 select fire trigger"
#. ~ Description of "M249 select fire trigger"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "A trigger modification that allows the M249 to switch between semi and full automatic modes."
msgstr "一个选择开火模式的小扳机，可以让M249在半自动与全自动开火模式间切换。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "drop-in auto sear"
#. ~ Description of "drop-in auto sear"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "A vaguely 'U'-shaped piece of metal with a vaguely 'T'-shaped flapper on a pin.  Once tucked into an AR-15's lower receiver, the rifle will become selective fire-capable.  The handcrafted-sear surface isn't as good as actual full-auto parts, so precision and reliability suffer slightly."
msgstr "一个U形金属片和一个T形活动挡板通过转轴组装在一起。把它塞进AR-15步枪的下机匣里，能够改变射击模式。由于自制挡板的表面不如实际的全自动阻铁好，所以精度和可靠性略有下降。"

