#. ~ Description of gun mod "rail laser sight"
#. ~ Description of "rail laser sight"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/rail.json
msgid "A small visible-light laser that mounts on a firearm's accessory rail to enhance ease and speed of target acquisition.  Aside from increased weight, there are no drawbacks."
msgstr "小型可见激光发射器，可安装在枪械上，增加命中率与瞄准速度。完全没有缺点——除了增加一点点重量。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "offset sight rail"
#. ~ Description of "offset sight rail"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/rail.json
msgid "An additional rail set at 45° for attaching a secondary optic."
msgstr "一组以垂直枪械平面45度角安装到枪械侧面上的导轨，让你能够安装一个额外瞄具。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified offset sight rail"
#. ~ Description of "modified offset sight rail"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/rail.json
msgid "An additional rail set at 45° for attaching a secondary optic.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon, if you so want."
msgstr "一组以垂直枪械平面45度角安装到枪械侧面上的瞄具导轨。这个导轨经过了改装，能够装在几乎所有武器上。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "offset iron sights"
#. ~ Description of "offset iron sights"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/rail.json
msgid "An alternative set of iron sights mounted at 45° for use when a scope or other modification prevents use of the primary sights."
msgstr "一组以垂直枪械平面45度角安装到枪械侧面上的机械瞄具，方便在枪械安装了瞄准镜等必须遮挡标准机械瞄具的改装件之后还可以正常利用机械瞄具来瞄准射击的一个枪械用改装件。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified offset iron sights"
#. ~ Description of "modified offset iron sights"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/rail.json
msgid "An alternative set of iron sights mounted at 45° for use when a scope or other modification prevents use of the primary sights.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon, if you so want."
msgstr "一组以垂直枪械平面45度角安装到枪械侧面上的机械瞄具，方便在枪械安装了瞄准镜等必须遮挡标准机械瞄具的改装件之后还可以正常利用机械瞄具来瞄准射击的一个枪械用改装件。这个瞄具经过了改装，能够装在几乎所有武器上。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "offset grip"
#. ~ Description of "offset grip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/rail.json
msgid "An angled grip set at 45° that attaches to a side rail, allowing for a grip while leaving the underbarrel rail free, or on guns that have integral bipods."
msgstr "成 45° 角的握把固定在侧轨上，可在保持枪管下轨自由的情况下进行握持，或者安装在具有一体式两脚架的枪支上。"

