#. ~ Description of gun mod "adjustable sling (front)"
#. ~ Description of "adjustable sling (front)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sling.json
msgid "A shoulder strap allows the rifle to be worn over your shoulders like a piece of clothing.  Currently adjusted so the weapon hangs off your front."
msgstr "一条肩带，让你可以把步枪背到身上，就像是一件衣服。目前正把武器挂在你的胸前。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "adjustable sling"
#. ~ Description of "adjustable sling"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sling.json
msgid "An adjustable strap that allows the rifle to be worn over your shoulders like a piece of clothing.  However, it offers no protection."
msgstr "可调节肩带使步枪可以像件衣服一样穿在肩膀上。 然而，它不提供任何保护。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "adjustable sling (front)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sling.json
