#. ~ Description of gun mod "collapsing wire stock"
#. ~ Description of "collapsing wire stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A collapsing wire stock which folds closely against the body of the weapon, reducing length and volume."
msgstr "一个可折叠的铁丝枪托，可以紧密地折叠在枪身上，减少枪身长度和体积。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "collapsing wire stock (collapsed)"
#. ~ Description of "collapsing wire stock (collapsed)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A collapsing wire stock which folds closely against the body of the weapon, reducing length and volume.  Currently collapsed, making shooting difficult"
msgstr "一个可折叠的铁丝枪托，可以紧密地折叠在枪身上，减少枪身长度和体积。目前枪托已经折叠起来，很难射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "tail hook stock"
#. ~ Description of "tail hook stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A foldable add-on stock for handguns and submachine guns with a pivoting hook that latches onto the forearm, allowing for greater stability."
msgstr "一个可折叠枪托，可以安装在手枪或连发手枪上，带有可旋转的尾钩，能够钩住前臂，使你持枪时更稳定。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "folding stock"
#. ~ Description of "folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A folding stock which reduces length when folded.  Currently unfolded and ready to shoot."
msgstr "一个可以折叠并缩短枪身长度的折叠枪托。目前已经被展开并准备好射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "folding stock (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "folding stock (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A folding stock which reduces length.  Currently folded, making shooting this gun difficult."
msgstr "一个被折叠起来缩短枪身长度的折叠枪托。目前枪托已经折叠起来，很难射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "under-folding stock (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "under-folding stock (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A light wire-framed stock with a push button release catch on the side  which allows it to fold and be stored away under the weapon's receiver.  It is currently folded underneath the weapon's chassis, making it more difficult to control."
msgstr "一个轻便的铁丝枪托，侧面有个按钮释放锁扣，可以折叠并存放在枪身的机匣下。它目前被折叠在枪械机匣下，使得在射击时更难控制武器后坐力。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "under folding stock"
#. ~ Description of "under folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A light wire-framed stock with a push button release catch on the side  which allows it to fold and be stored away under the weapon's receiver.  The wire construction means that it's less comfortable to shoulder than a regular fixed attachment.  The stock is currently locked in the open position."
msgstr "一种轻型线框枪托，侧面有一个按钮释放扣，可以折叠并存放在武器接收器下方。  钢丝结构意味着它比常规的固定附件肩负起来不太舒服。  该股票目前被锁定在未平仓位置。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "modular folding stock (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "modular folding stock (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A multi position, high-end folding stock which reduces length when folded.  Currently folded, making shooting this gun hard."
msgstr "一个多工位高端折叠枪托，可以折叠并缩短枪身长度。目前枪托已经折叠起来，很难射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "adjustable folding stock"
#. ~ Description of "adjustable folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A multi position, high-end folding stock which reduces length when folded.  Currently unfolded and ready to shoot."
msgstr "一个多工位高端折叠枪托，可以折叠并缩短枪身长度。目前已经被展开并准备好射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "sawn-off stock"
#. ~ Description of "sawn-off stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A quick saw cut removed the original stock from this weapon.  It is now much harder to handle, but much smaller."
msgstr "简单的锯切把这把武器的原始枪托锯断了。这使它后坐力更难控制，但体积变小了很多。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "recoil stock"
#. ~ Description of "recoil stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A replacement stock designed to absorb perceived recoil."
msgstr "一个可替换的带缓冲枪托，可以吸收枪械射击时的巨大后坐力。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MASS compatible stock"
#. ~ Description of "MASS compatible stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A specially designed adjustable stock with an integrated grip to convert the M26-MASS to a standalone configuration."
msgstr "专门设计的可调枪托，带有握把，可将M26-MASS转换为能独立使用的配置。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "cheek pad"
#. ~ Description of "cheek pad"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A stock accessory for sniper rifles and DMRs, this considerably improves eye relief efficiency, prevents slipping, and reduces recoil to the neck and cheek."
msgstr "一套供狙击步枪和精确射手步枪使用的枪托配件。极大提升眼部舒适度，防止枪托滑动，并降低颈部和脸颊所受到的后坐力。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol stock"
#. ~ Description of "pistol stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "An add-on stock for handguns, this considerably improves control of recoil."
msgstr "一个手枪附加枪托，可以大大提高后坐力控制。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "adjustable stock"
#. ~ Description of "adjustable stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "An adjustable replacement stock improving both recoil and accuracy."
msgstr "一个可调式的替换用枪托，改善枪械后坐力和精度。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "butt hook"
#. ~ Description of "butt hook"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "An attachment to the butt of the gun that is held under the armpit, improving stability."
msgstr "一个安装在枪托后方的枪械模组，可以支撑在腋下，提升射击时的稳定性。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "hollow polymer stock"
#. ~ Description of "hollow polymer stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "An extremely lightweight stock.  There's a hollow cavity at the bottom where a spare magazine can be stored."
msgstr "极其轻量的枪托。  底部有一个空腔，可以存放备用弹匣。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "MASS compatible stock"
msgid_plural "MASS compatible stocks"
msgstr[0] "MASS 兼容枪托"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "integral folding mechanism (folded))"
#. ~ Description of "integral folding mechanism (folded))"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "The integral series of hinges and pivots which allow the SUB-2000 to fold in half and be stored for transport.  Shooting this firearm would be particularly tricky given that the barrel assembly is folded and locked backwards for storage, rendering the weapon inoperable."
msgstr "一系列内置的铰链和枢轴，让SUB-2000冲锋枪能够对折起来储存以供运输。鉴于枪管组件被折叠并向后锁定以便储存，导致武器无法操作，因此目前没法射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "integral folding mechanism"
#. ~ Description of "integral folding mechanism"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "The integral series of hinges and pivots which allow the SUB-2000 to fold in half and be stored for transport.  The firearm is currently locked in the unfolded position and is ready for use."
msgstr "一系列内置的铰链和枢轴，让SUB-2000冲锋枪能够对折起来储存以供运输。枪械目前锁定在展开位置，可以使用。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "folding stock"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "adjustable folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "You fold the stock for transport."
msgstr "您可以折叠库存以便运输。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "collapsing wire stock (collapsed)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "You pull the stock out for combat."
msgstr "你把库存拉出来进行战斗。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "under folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "You push in the release catch on the side and fold away the stock."
msgstr "您推入侧面的释放卡扣并将库存折叠起来。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "collapsing wire stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "You push the stock in for storage."
msgstr "您将库存推入存储。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "integral folding mechanism (folded))"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "You release the barrel and pivot it forwards, locking it in the open firing position."
msgstr "您释放枪管并将其向前旋转，将其锁定在打开的射击位置。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "integral folding mechanism"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "You tug down on the trigger guard whilst swinging the barrel assembly up and over onto the receiver, locking it into place by the buttplate."
msgstr "您向下拉动扳机护圈，同时将枪管组件向上摆动到机匣上，通过枪托板将其锁定到位。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "folding stock (folded)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "modular folding stock (folded)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "under-folding stock (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "You unfold the stock for combat."
msgstr "你打开枪托进行战斗。"

