#. ~ Description of gun "LeMat revolver shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "LeMat revolver shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "LeMat revolver shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The LeMat revolver is unique in that its cylinder axis pin is also a fully functional 20 gauge percussion-primed smoothbore barrel.  It's irremovable."
msgstr "勒马特左轮手枪的独特之处在于它的转轮中央还有另一根发射20号雷管击发霰弹的滑膛枪管。这根枪管是不可拆卸的。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M203A1"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "M203A1"
#. ~ Description of "M203A1"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The M203 was originally designed for use with M16 variants but today can be attached to almost any rifle.  It allows a single 40mm grenade to be loaded and fired."
msgstr "M203最初为M16设计的，但如今它发展成能够适配几乎所有步枪的榴弹发射器组件。该榴弹发射器组件每次装填一发40mm榴弹。"

#. ~ Description of gun "modified M203"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified M203"
#. ~ Description of "modified M203"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The M203 was originally designed for use with M16 variants but today can be attached to almost any rifle.  It allows a single 40mm grenade to be loaded and fired.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."
msgstr "M203最初为M16设计的，但如今它发展成能够适配几乎所有步枪的榴弹发射器组件。该榴弹发射器组件每次装填一发40mm榴弹。这个榴弹发射器经过了改装，可以装在除了手枪和泵动式枪械之外的几乎任何武器上。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M320 GLM"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "M320 GLM"
#. ~ Description of "M320 GLM"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The M320 Grenade Launcher Module offers the functionality of larger launchers in a very small package at the cost of decreased accuracy.  It can be either attached to a rifle or combined with a buttstock for standalone use."
msgstr "M320榴弹发射器模组采用非常小的封装就达到了大体积发射器才能实现的功能，但是射击精度相比有所下降。它可以被安装在多种步枪的枪管下，也可以安个枪托独立使用。"

#. ~ Description of gun "modified M320 GLM"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified M320 GLM"
#. ~ Description of "modified M320 GLM"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The M320 Grenade Launcher Module offers the functionality of larger launchers in a very small package at the cost of decreased accuracy.  It can be either attached to a rifle or combined with a buttstock for standalone use.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."
msgstr "M320榴弹发射器模组采用非常小的封装就达到了大体积发射器才能实现的功能，但是射击精度相比有所下降。它可以被安装在多种步枪的枪管下，也可以安个枪托独立使用。这个榴弹发射器经过了改装，可以装在除了手枪和泵动式枪械之外的几乎任何武器上。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M26-MASS shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "M26-MASS shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "M26-MASS shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The Modular Accessory Shotgun System is an underbarrel bolt-action shotgun that was inspired by the \"Masterkey\" and fixed most of its predecessor's problems.  It can be mounted under the barrel of a rifle, or used as a standalone weapon by attaching a pistol grip or collapsible buttstock module.  It feeds from three- or five-shot detachable magazines."
msgstr "模块化配件霰弹枪系统，原本是一把受\"万能钥匙\"启发研制出的管下栓动式霰弹枪，解决了它的大部分问题。它可以安装在不同步枪的枪管下方，或通过安装上手枪枪托或可折叠枪托模块使它变为独立武器使用。它使用三发或五发弹容量的可拆卸弹匣供弹。"

#. ~ Description of gun "modified M26-MASS"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified M26-MASS"
#. ~ Description of "modified M26-MASS"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The Modular Accessory Shotgun System is an underbarrel bolt-action shotgun that was inspired by the \"Masterkey\" and fixed most of its predecessor's problems.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns."
msgstr "模块化配件霰弹枪系统，原本是一把受\"万能钥匙\"启发研制出的管下栓动式霰弹枪，并且解决了前任型号的大部分问题。这款型号经过改装和定制，几乎可以安装在除手枪和泵动式枪械以外的任何枪械上。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "integral polymer bipod"
#. ~ Description of "integral polymer bipod"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The Steyr Scout's integral bipod is effectively part of the rifle's housing, causing its added weight to practically be zero.  However, the polymer construction and awkward design prevent it from being as useful as a normal bipod."
msgstr "斯太尔侦查步枪的整体式双脚架实际上是步枪外壳的一部分，其增加的重量几乎为零。然而，聚合物结构和笨拙的设计使它无法像普通的双脚架那样有效。"

#. ~ Description of gun "KSG-25 second magazine"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "KSG-25 second magazine"
#. ~ Description of "KSG-25 second magazine"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The integrated second tube magazine of the Kel-Tec KSG-25, which holds 12 shots.  It's irremovable."
msgstr "Kel-TecKSG-25霰弹枪集成的第二弹管，能容纳12发霰弹。无法拆除。"

#. ~ Description of gun "TS12 second magazine"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "TS12 second magazine"
#. ~ Description of "TS12 second magazine"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The integrated second tube magazine of the Tavor TS12, which holds 5 shots.  It's irremovable."
msgstr "塔沃尔TS12霰弹枪集成的第二弹管，能容纳5发霰弹。无法拆除。"

#. ~ Description of gun "TS12 third magazine"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "TS12 third magazine"
#. ~ Description of "TS12 third magazine"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The integrated third tube magazine of the Tavor TS12, which holds 5 shots.  It's irremovable."
msgstr "塔沃尔TS12霰弹枪集成的第三弹管，能容纳5发霰弹。无法拆除。"

#. ~ Description of gun "combination gun shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "combination gun shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "combination gun shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The integrated underbarrel shotgun of a combination gun which holds two shots.  It's irremovable."
msgstr "步霰两用枪集成的下挂式霰弹枪，能容纳2发霰弹。无法拆除。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "weapon light"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The weapon light's batteries are dead."
msgstr "武器灯的电池没电了。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "integrated bayonet (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "integrated bayonet (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The weapon's integrated bayonet has been folded for storage."
msgstr "这把武器的集成刺刀已被折叠起来。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "integrated bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "integrated bayonet"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "The weapon's integrated bayonet."
msgstr "该武器的集成刺刀。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "integral polymer bipod, deployed"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "With an ugly snap, you crack the bipod legs back into the rifle."
msgstr "随着一声丑陋的响声，你将两脚架腿重新装回步枪中。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "bipod hand guard (deployed)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "You collapse and fold the bipod legs."
msgstr "您折叠并折叠两脚架腿。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "bipod hand guard"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "You extend the bipod legs."
msgstr "您延长两脚架腿。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wire monopod, collapsed"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "You flip out the monopod and lock it into position."
msgstr "您翻转独脚架并将其锁定到位。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "integral polymer bipod"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "You flip the bipod out from the rifle housing and lock it into position."
msgstr "您将两脚架从步枪外壳中翻转出来并将其锁定到位。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "integrated bayonet"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "You fold in the bayonet.  It can no longer be used."
msgstr "你折叠刺刀。  它不能再使用了。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "integrated bayonet (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "You fold out the bayonet.  It can be used."
msgstr "你把刺刀折起来。  可以使用。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "weapon light (on)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "You turn the weapon light off."
msgstr "你把武器灯关掉。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "weapon light"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "You turn the weapon light on."
msgstr "你打开武器灯。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wire monopod, deployed"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid "You unlock the monopod and stow it in its folded position."
msgstr "您解锁独脚架并将其存放在折叠位置。"

