#. ~ Description of "co-op badge"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "A manually-encoded badge giving you access to the artisans' workshop.  It even has your name written on the back."
msgstr "一张手动编码的钥匙卡，让你能够进入匠人工坊。它的背面甚至写着你的名字。"

#. ~ Description of "visitor's pass"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "A visitor's pass to some sort of facility.  The reverse side describes the protocol for using it; this could grant access at a card reader, if you can find one.  It also lists the addresses of nearby facilities; activate it to add their locations to your map."
msgstr "某种设施的访客通行证。背面描述了使用它的协议；如果你能找到读卡器，这可以授予访问权限。它还列出了附近设施的地址；使用它以将设施位置添加到地图中。"

#. ~ Description of "LIXA ID badge"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An ID badge for the LIXA facility, with a photo of an awkwardly smiling scientist on the front.  Instructions on the back explain that this will grant you access to the LIXA experiment floor."
msgstr "LIXA 设施的 ID 徽章，正面有一张尴尬地微笑着的科学家的照片。  背面的说明解释说，这将允许您进入 LIXA 实验层。"

#. ~ Description of "defaced LIXA ID badge"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An ID badge for the LIXA facility, with a photo of an awkwardly smiling scientist on the front.  It is heavily scratched, and there is a line on the back in black marker."
msgstr "LIXA 设施的 ID 徽章，正面有一张尴尬地微笑着的科学家的照片。  它有严重的划痕，背面有一条黑色记号笔的线。"

#. ~ Description of "LIXA ID badge: Dr. Jason Mitchell"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An ID badge for the LIXA facility.  The photo is of a confidently smiling young man."
msgstr "LIXA 设施的 ID 徽章。  照片上是一位自信微笑的年轻人。"

#. ~ Description of "LIXA ID badge: Dr. Richard Raimes"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An ID badge for the LIXA facility.  The photo is of a gently smiling older man, with kind eyes."
msgstr "LIXA 设施的 ID 徽章。  照片上是一位老人，笑容温和，眼神慈祥。"

#. ~ Description of "LIXA ID badge: Dr. Najma Saed"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An ID badge for the LIXA facility.  The photo is of a pleasantly smiling woman in a hijab."
msgstr "LIXA 设施的 ID 徽章。  照片上是一位戴着头巾、笑容可掬的女人。"

#. ~ Description of "LIXA ID badge: Dr. Kai-Mei Luo"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An ID badge for the LIXA facility.  The photo is of an awkwardly smiling woman, who blinked during the picture."
msgstr "LIXA 设施的 ID 徽章。  照片上是一位尴尬地微笑的女人，在拍照过程中她眨了眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of "industrial ID card"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An ID card that once belonged to a high-level technician.  The reverse side describes the protocol for using it; this could grant access at one control panel, if you can find one."
msgstr "这张钥匙卡曾经属于某位高级工程师。它的背面描述了使用规定，如果你能找到一个控制面板，它可以让你获得一次访问授权。"

#. ~ Description of "military ID card"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An ID card that once belonged to a military officer.  The reverse side describes the protocol for using it; this could grant access at one control panel, if you can find one."
msgstr "这张钥匙卡曾经属于某位军官。它的背面描述了使用规定，如果你能找到一个控制面板，它可以让你获得一次访问授权。"

#. ~ Description of "science ID card"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An ID card that once belonged to a scientist.  The reverse side describes the protocol for using it; this could grant access at one control panel, if you can find one."
msgstr "这张钥匙卡曾经属于某位科学家。它的背面描述了使用规定，如果你能找到一个控制面板，它可以让你获得一次访问授权。"

#. ~ Description of "transport freight employee badge"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An employee badge for a freight hauler.  The reverse side describes the protocol for using it; this could grant access at transport freight card readers.  It also lists the addresses of nearby facilities; activate it to add their locations to your map."
msgstr "一张货运工的钥匙卡。它的背面描述了使用规定，可以让你获得货运区读卡器的访问授权。它还列出了附近设施的地址，激活它可以添加它们的位置到你的地图。"

#. ~ Description of "Maintenance: blue zone badge"
#: data/json/items/id_cards.json
msgid "An employee badge for a maintenance worker.  The reverse side describes the protocol for using it; this could grant access at blue zone card readers."
msgstr "一张维护工的钥匙卡。它的背面描述了使用规定，可以让你获得蓝区读卡器的访问授权。"

#. ~ Description of "Maintenance: green zone badge"
