#: data/json/items/magazine/50beowulf.json
msgid "A detachable 10-round box magazine, nearly identical in size and shape to standard 30-round STANAG magazines, and able to be inserted into the same compatible rifles.  The magazine has been engineered to feed a single-stack column of .50 Beowulf ammunition into the chamber of an appropriately converted AR-style firearm."
msgstr "一个可以拆卸的10发盒式弹匣，与标准的30发STANAG弹匣外型类似，可以为同样兼容的枪械供弹。这个弹匣被改装来填装.50 贝奥武夫弹药，并且兼容已经过对应改装的AR武器平台。"

#. ~ Description of magazine "retooled STANAG 20-round magazine"
#. ~ Description of "retooled STANAG 20-round magazine"
#: data/json/items/magazine/50beowulf.json
msgid "This 20-round box magazine is compatible with STANAG rifles and has been modified to hold a single-stack, seven round column of .50-caliber Beowulf ammo.  The front lip of the magazine has been beveled to allow for reliable feeding of the Beowulf rounds into a properly converted weapon's chamber, and, happily, this modification hasn't interfered with the magazine's ability to hold standard ammunition."
msgstr "一个20发弹匣，适用于STANAG步枪。经过改装后也可容纳7发.50 贝奥武夫弹药。弹匣的前唇已经倾斜，以便能够将贝奥武夫弹药可靠地送入经过适当改装的武器弹膛，好消息是，这并没有影响弹匣容纳标准弹药的能力。"

#. ~ Description of magazine "retooled STANAG 20-round magazine with ranger
#. plate"
#. ~ Description of "retooled STANAG 20-round magazine with ranger plate"
#: data/json/items/magazine/50beowulf.json
msgid "This 20-round box magazine is compatible with STANAG rifles and has been modified to hold a single-stack, seven round column of .50-caliber Beowulf ammo.  The front lip of the magazine has been beveled to allow for reliable feeding of the Beowulf rounds into a properly converted weapon's chamber, and, happily, this modification hasn't interfered with the magazine's ability to hold standard ammunition.  The bottom has been modified with a ranger plate attachment to allow it to clip to carabiners."
msgstr "一个20发弹匣，适用于STANAG步枪。经过改装后也可容纳7发.50 贝奥武夫弹药。弹匣的前唇已经倾斜，以便能够将贝奥武夫弹药可靠地送入经过适当改装的武器弹膛，好消息是，这并没有影响弹匣容纳标准弹药的能力。弹匣改装有快拔底板，使其能够夹在钩环上。"

