msgid "Collapse"
msgstr "折叠"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "expandable baton (collapsed)"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "Expand"
msgstr "展开"

#. ~ Description of "goedendag"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "Halfway between a short spear and a long club, the goedendag consists of a heavy metal spike mounted to the end of an even heavier shaft.  It is unsophisticated, but was once a favorite among medieval infantry who needed a cheap, simple means to smash through enemy armor."
msgstr "介于短矛与长棍之间的一种武器，由一根沉重的金属尖刺安装在更沉重的木杆末端构成。它结构简单，但曾是中世纪步兵的最爱，他们需要一种廉价而直接的方式来击穿敌人盔甲。"

#. ~ Description of "cudgel"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "Mankind's oldest weapon: a length of wood tapered slightly to maximize weight at the business end -- in other words, a club.  This one is quite short, prioritizing speed over power."
msgstr "人类最古老的武器：一根稍微变细的木头，以最大程度地增加工作端的重量——换句话说，就是一根棍棒。  这个很短，优先考虑速度而不是力量。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "Mjölnir"
msgid_plural "Mjölnirs"
msgstr[0] "Mjölnir，雷神之锤"

#. ~ Description of "pipe staff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "Two steel pipes fitted end-to-end in a clumsy facsimile of a quarterstaff."
msgstr "三根钢管端对端连接在一起，变成了一根笨重的金属长棍。"

