#. ~ Description of variant "AK bayonet"of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "AK bayonet" of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A 6H4 bayonet for Kalashnikov pattern rifles, usually imported military surplus from eastern bloc countries.  The blade is made of stainless steel and the handle of a lightweight and durable plastic.  It features a middling metal saw on the spine of the blade, and can function as a wire cutter as well.  Though it is quite sturdy, it can't hold an edge very well."
msgstr "用于卡拉什尼科夫步枪的6H4刺刀，从东方集团国家进口的多余军事物资。刀身由不锈钢制成，手柄由轻便耐用的塑料制成。它的特点是在刀脊上有一段中等长度的锯齿，也可以作为剪线钳使用。虽然很结实，但不好抓握。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "National Guard bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "National Guard bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A Cold War era Army bayonet that has only partially been replaced by newer models.  It has an apocalypse-proof full-tang, double-edged high steel blade terminating in a spear point.  The no-frills design makes for both a good fighting knife and bayonet, a fact that was appreciated when reserve stocks of these were issued out to National Guardsmen."
msgstr "一把冷战时期的军队刺刀，这种刺刀目前只有一部分被新式刺刀替换。该刺刀采用末日生存刀一样的全龙骨结构，高碳钢的双刃刀身之上是矛形的刀尖。这种简洁的设计让它能出色地兼任格斗刀和刺刀，这一事实在库存刺刀发放给国民警卫队时得到了证明。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A cast bronze knife with a full tang, with a handle wrapped in cord and leather, work-hardened and sharpened to a fine edge."
msgstr "一把铸造成型的青铜小刀，刀柄用绳索和皮革包裹，刃口经过精心加工硬化，十分锋利。"

#. ~ Description of "bone shiv"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A femur or other bone, about 20 cm long, which has been broken at one end and sharpened into a cutting tool.  Its jagged edge is wicked but fragile."
msgstr "一根大约20厘米长的股骨或是其他类似的骨头，一端被折断并被磨尖成切割工具。其锯齿状的边缘看上去很危险，但其实很脆弱。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A hidden handle compartment.  Unscrew the compass to access."
msgstr "一个隐藏的把手隔间，拧开指南针就可以打开。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A knife consisting of a long, somewhat sharpened spike and a tightly-wrapped rag as a handle.  Not as good as a real knife, but it'll do in a pinch."
msgstr "一把小刀，由一根略微锋利的钉刺组成，一边紧紧包裹有破布作为握柄。虽然没有真正的刀子好，但在紧要关头也能用。"

#. ~ Description of "copper knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A knife made of crudely-worked copper with a simple handle.  Primitive, but a step above stone-age."
msgstr "一把粗糙的自制铜刀，带着一个简单的把手。很原始，但比石器时代更上了一步。"

#. ~ Description of "switchblade"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A long, thin knife with a spring-loaded blade that rests inside the handle while not in use."
msgstr "又长又细的弹簧小刀，不用时可以把刀刃收在刀柄里面，使用时自动弹出。"

#. ~ Description of "carving knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A long-bladed kitchen knife with a thin, slightly curved blade for deftly slicing meat either in flat sheets or around the bone.  It makes a decent melee weapon, and is excellent for butchery."
msgstr "一把长刃菜刀，有一个轻薄、稍微弯曲的刀刃，能够灵巧地将肉切成薄片或剔除骨头。一把不错的近战武器，屠宰时也十分好用。"

#. ~ Description of "chef knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A long-bladed kitchen knife.  The blade is wider than the handle, giving room for the wielder's knuckles, and it has a characteristic curve for a fast rocking action for chopping vegetables.  It makes an acceptable melee weapon, but the wide blade is unwieldy for butchering."
msgstr "一把长刃菜刀。刀刃比把手宽，为持刀者的指关节提供了空间，刀刃的特殊曲线使它在切菜时可以快速来回摇动。作为近战武器还行，但宽大的刀身在屠宰时不太方便。"

#. ~ Description of "baselard"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A medieval dagger forged from rough iron.  It is not the sharpest tool in the shed, but it is certainly one of the largest."
msgstr "一把用粗铁锻造的中世纪匕首。它也许不是工具棚里最锋利的工具，但肯定是最大个之一。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable cleaver"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A menacing-looking knife with a broad, square shaped blade, curved for fast vegetable chopping.  Its heft and sharpness make it a decent weapon as well, although not as good as a meat cleaver."
msgstr "一把看起来很凶险的刀，刀身宽大，呈方形，刀刃弯曲，能够快速切开蔬菜。它的分量和锋利度也使它成为一种不错的武器，虽然不如剁肉刀。"

#. ~ Description of "meat cleaver"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A menacing-looking knife with a broad, square-shaped blade.  Its heft and sharpness would make it a very effective melee weapon and an excellent butchering tool."
msgstr "一把看起来很凶险的刀，刀身宽大，呈方形。它的重量和锋利度也使它成为一种非常有效的近战武器，也是一种优秀的屠宰工具。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "USMC bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "USMC bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A modern bayonet in use with the US Marine Corps, adopted in an effort to improve USMC hand-to-hand fighting capabilities.  The bayonet is optimized to function as a fighting knife, sporting an ergonomic handle that will minimize hand fatigue during combat.  The blade tip is sharper in profile than other bayonets to assist in penetrating body armor, and also features a small serrated section to provide for some utility."
msgstr "美国海军陆战队使用的一种现代刺刀，旨在提高美国海军陆战队的肉搏战能力。刺刀被优化为战斗刀，具有符合人体工程学的手柄，可以在战斗中最大限度地减少手部疲劳。刀尖在轮廓上比其他刺刀更锋利，以提供破甲效果，并且还具有一个小锯齿部分，以提供其他效用。"

#. ~ Description of "stone chopper"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A rock with sharpened edges, produced by knapping.  Works as a crude cutting and butchering tool, if nothing else is available."
msgstr "一块边缘磨尖的大石头，可以用作简易的切割屠宰工具，总比徒手好。"

#. ~ Description of "steak knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A sharp knife designed for cutting meat.  It makes a poor melee weapon, but is decent at butchering corpses."
msgstr "一把较为尖锐、带有小锯齿的西餐餐具，设计用来在餐桌上切牛排。虽然是把很差劲的近战武器，但用来屠宰尸体还行。"

#. ~ Description of "butcher knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A sharp, heavy knife.  It makes a good melee weapon, and is an ideal item for butchering corpses."
msgstr "一把锋利而厚重的刀子。是把不错的近战武器，也是用于屠宰尸体的理想工具。"

#. ~ Description of "honey scraper"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A sharp, knife-like tool used for harvesting honey from beehives.  Makes a passable melee weapon."
msgstr "一把锋利的刀状工具。用来从蜂巢收集蜂蜜。勉强能够拿来当近战武器。"

#. ~ Description of "stone knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A sharpened stone set into a hollowed handle.  Not nearly as usable as a proper knife, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr "一块磨利的石头，插进一个带洞的手柄里。怎么看也不太像匕首，用起来也不那么方便，但总比赤手空拳要好。"

#. ~ Description of "dive knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A short, sturdy knife with a serrated edge for cutting lines and straps, and a blunt tip for prying.  Used primarily by divers, this knife has been fitted with cork to slow its descent if dropped underwater, so it takes up more space than usual."
msgstr "一个短而结实的匕首，锯齿状的刀刃能够切割绳子和皮带，边缘一个钝头可当做小型撬棍使用。这种刀主要由潜水员使用，它有个软木塞，如果落入水中，可以减缓下降速度，因此它比普通的刀更占空间。"

#. ~ Description of "paring knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A short-bladed knife with a sharp blade, made for fine controlled cuts to vegetables without using a cutting board."
msgstr "一把刀口锋利的短刃刀，可以在不使用砧板的情况下对蔬菜进行精细切割。"

#. ~ Description of "folding knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A small folding knife with a locking blade and a pocket clip.  Not as good a weapon as a solid fixed-blade knife, but better than a penknife."
msgstr "一把小型折叠刀，有着一个可以伸缩的锁口刀片，背面有个口袋夹。和刀身固定的刀具相比，它不适合当作武器使用，但总比一个削笔刀好些。"

#. ~ Description of "boxcutter knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A small knife designed for opening boxes.  It could cause some damage, but it really should be used against inanimate objects.  It is too small to effectively butcher corpses with."
msgstr "一把小巧且锋利的刀具，专门用来打开纸箱。它能造成一些伤害，但只能打中不会动的物体。它太小了，不能用来有效地屠宰尸体。"

#. ~ Description of "pocket knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A small pocket knife.  It isn't great for combat, but it's better than nothing.  It's sharp enough to butcher with."
msgstr "一把折叠刀，作为武器那是相当糟糕，但总比没有好。不过足够用来切肉了。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "AK bayonet"
msgid_plural "AK bayonets"
msgstr[0] "AK刺刀"

#. ~ Description of "balisong"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "Also called a butterfy knife, this is a flashy knife with hinged handles that completely conceal the blade while folded."
msgstr "也称为蝴蝶刀，这是一把带有铰链手柄的华丽刀，折叠时完全隐藏刀片。"

#. ~ Description of "Swiss Army knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "An iconic pocket knife imported from Europe.  Its red plastic handle conceals many small tools."
msgstr "名字响亮，这个从欧洲进口的折叠刀的红塑料柄里面藏着不少小工具。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic shank"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "An oblong plastic object with the far end ground down into a stabbing point."
msgstr "一片长方形的塑料，一端被磨尖成匕首形状。"

#. ~ Description of "sai"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "An okinawan weapon consisting of a slender spike with two hooked tines just above the hilt."
msgstr "一种冲绳武器，由一根细长尖刺组成，在握柄上方带有两个钩状分叉。"

#. ~ Description of "F-S fighting knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "Arguably the most famous combat knife in military history, this blackened double-edged knife is made of drop-forged steel and knurled brass.  The balance of the knife is such that it can be tossed from one hand to the other instinctively, and the spear point allows for easy insertion into an unsuspecting foe's heart.  While this knife is great in a fight, it's not very good as a tool.  The ricasso declares this to be a 'Fairbairn-Sykes knife', with a National Stocking Number of '1095-99-963-2037'."
msgstr "可以说是军事历史上最著名的战斗刀，这把黑色的双刃刀是由滴锻钢和滚花黄铜制成的。刀的平衡使它可以本能地从一只手抛向另一只手，刀尖可以很容易地插入毫无防备的敌人的心脏。虽然这把刀在打斗中很好用，但作为工具却不怎么好用。里卡索宣称这是一把“费尔贝恩-赛克斯刀”，柄上有编号：“1095-99-963-2037”。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "Army bayonet"
msgid_plural "Army bayonets"
msgstr[0] "军用刺刀"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "Bayonet"
msgid_plural "Bayonets"
msgstr[0] "刺刀"

#. ~ Description of "hunting knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "Commonly used by hunters, this single-edged sheath knife is designed for cutting and skinning game rather than combat."
msgstr "猎人常用的刀具，这种单刃带鞘的小刀专用于切削、剥皮等用途，而不是战斗。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "F-S fighting knife"
msgid_plural "F-S fighting knives"
msgstr[0] "F-S战斗匕首"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "KA-BAR knife"
msgid_plural "KA-BAR knives"
msgstr[0] "卡巴猎刀"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "National Guard bayonet"
msgid_plural "National Guard bayonets"
msgstr[0] "国民警卫队刺刀"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "Swiss Army knife"
msgid_plural "Swiss Army knives"
msgstr[0] "瑞士军刀"

#. ~ Description of "KA-BAR knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "The KA-BAR was developed by the United States Marine Corps in 1942 by modifying hunting knife designs to be more soldier-proof.  The handle is made of stacked leather washers, and the blade is made of easy to sharpen high steel, making for a popular fighting, hunting and utility knife.  The blade is marked 'USMC'."
msgstr "KA-BAR 是美国海军陆战队于 1942 年通过修改猎刀设计而开发的，更适合士兵使用。手柄由堆叠的皮革垫圈制成，刀片由易于打磨的高碳钢制成，是一把流行的格斗、狩猎和实用刀。刀片上标有“USMC”。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "Army bayonet"of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "Army bayonet" of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "The current issue Army bayonet, before the Cataclysm anyways.  It is thick, heavy, and surprisingly sharp.  This bayonet also functions as a wire cutter, and a mediocre saw for cutting through aircraft fuselage.  That the handle and tang can be completely disassembled from the blade is surely a fact of great comfort to the soldier, survivalist, and you."
msgstr "大灾难前最新版的陆军刺刀。刀身厚重且锋利。这种刺刀还可以作为剪线钳和锯子使用。刀柄和刀根可以从刀刃上拆卸下来，这对士兵、生存主义者和你来说无疑是一个好消息。"

#. ~ Description of "bread knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "This knife has quite a long blade with a scalloped edge for cutting bread.  It's not that sharp, but its length and heft mean it could do a bit of damage and cause some nasty tearing."
msgstr "这把刀有着很长的刀刃，刀刃呈扇形，用来切面包。它并不锋利，但它的长度和重量意味着它能够给敌人造成少许伤害，并导致撕裂伤。"

#. ~ Description of "survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "This large knife looks scary at first, but its hollow handle, the compass built into its pommel, and the saw teeth along the spine reveal that it's more of a novelty for wannabe survivalists."
msgstr "一把常见于特种部队、野外求生爱好者所用的大号生存刀。刀身径直，刀背上有着一排锯齿，有着砍、锯、刺等多种用途，握柄底端镶嵌着一个迷你指南针。  这把是用回火碳钢定制的。是时候像兰博一样对这个末日做出回应了。"

#. ~ Description of "trench knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking."
msgstr "一把钢制护手的匕首，用于保护指关节，也可以用来敲击或者格挡。专为第一次世界大战中残酷的肉搏战设计的武器，让士兵们在狭窄的战壕里互相厮杀，独特的刃形可以令其轻易撬开或凿穿钢盔，对付丧尸也是同样如此。"

#. ~ Description of "kukri"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "This versatile implement is a modern take on a traditional weapon that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved edge, it can be used as both a tool and a weapon."
msgstr "这种多功能的传统武器起源于尼泊尔。具有重厚的刀身和向内弯曲的刀刃，可以用来作为一种工具和武器。"

#. ~ Description of "kris"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "This wavy-bladed dagger is from Southeast Asia.  The design of the blade causes it to make broad, painful wounds."
msgstr "东南亚原产的波纹状刀刃的匕首。刀刃的形状让它善于制造又大又疼的伤口。"

