#. ~ Description of "qiang"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A Chinese spear in use since antiquity. The tip is larger than most european spears, and there's typically a decorative tassel hung just below it."
msgstr "中国自古以来使用的矛。尖端比大多数欧洲矛更大，并且通常在其下方悬挂有装饰性流苏。"

#. ~ Description of "ji"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A bronze polearm that originated in the Shang dynasty of China, if not earlier.  It combines a long spear head with a perpendicular axe plade shaped like a crescent moon."
msgstr "一把起源自中国商朝或是更早时期的青铜长柄武器。它的顶部由矛尖和垂直于矛尖的，被称作戈的刀刃组成。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden javelin"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A fire-hardened wooden spear honed to a sharper point."
msgstr "一个前端磨尖并用火烤硬化的木制长矛。"

#. ~ Description of "naginata"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A lightweight Japanese polearm reminiscent of a sharply curved katana with an exceptionally long handle.  Originally a battlefield tool, they eventually came to be used for home defense, and were widely used for this purpose by women of the samurai class."
msgstr "一种轻质的日本长柄武器，让人想起带有超长手柄的急剧弯曲的武士刀。  它们最初是一种战场工具，最终被用于家庭防御，并被武士阶层的女性广泛用于此目的。"

#. ~ Description of "simple stone spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A long stick with a sharp stone spearhead."
msgstr "一根长木棍，一端配有尖锐的石制矛头。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze bush hook"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A long, slightly curved and hooked bronze blade on the end of a sturdy shaft.  It could be used to thoroughly ruin something's day, or to cut branches and small trees."
msgstr "一个结实地安装在柄端上的稍微弯曲的钩状青铜长斧头。可以用来彻底搞砸某人的一天，或者用来砍点灌木或者小树什么的。"

#. ~ Description of "bush hook"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A long, slightly curved and hooked steel blade on the end of a sturdy shaft, usually used for clearing brush.  Some people call it a kaiser blade."
msgstr "一个长长的，稍微弯曲和钩状斧头，结实地安装在柄端上。可以用来彻底弄糟某人的一天，或者用来砍树枝。"

#. ~ Description of "copper pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with a copper spearhead."
msgstr "一把中世纪武器，由一根非常长的木杆与铜制矛尖结合而成。"

#. ~ Description of "pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with a steel spearhead."
msgstr "一把中世纪武器，由一根非常长的木杆与钢制矛尖结合而成。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft with a fire-hardened point."
msgstr "一把中世纪武器，由一根非常长的木杆，雕刻出矛尖并经过火焰硬化而成。"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened pipe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A pipe with one end cut off at an angle."
msgstr "一端被切断磨出尖角的钢管。"

#. ~ Description of "war scythe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A pole weapon with a curving single-edged blade.  Its blade bears some superficial resemblance to that of an agricultural scythe from which it likely evolved."
msgstr "有弯曲的单侧刀刃的杆状武器。它的刀刃表面有点像农用镰刀，很可能是从农用镰刀演变而来的。"

#. ~ Description of "poleaxe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A polearm with an axe head, a small hammer on the back, and a short dagger-like spike on top.  It's surprisingly lightweight for its size, and specialized for cracking open heavy armor."
msgstr "一把带有斧头的长柄武器，另一面有一个小锤子，顶部有一个类似匕首的的短尖。它没有大多数长柄武器那么重，头也更小，挥舞速度更快。"

#. ~ Description of "steel short spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A shorter spear designed for use in close quarters.  Weapons like these were once used by fighting forces around the world, from the Vikings to the Zulu."
msgstr "专为近距离使用而设计的较短矛。  从维京人到祖鲁人，世界各地的战斗部队都曾使用过此类武器。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze short spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A shorter spear with a bronze head.  What it lacks in reach it more than makes up for in maneuverability."
msgstr "带有青铜头的较短矛。  它在触及范围上的不足足以弥补其机动性。"

#. ~ Description of "pointy stick"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A simple wooden pole with one end sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一根简单的木质长杆，一头被削尖。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A spear with a bronze head."
msgstr "一支带有青铜锻造矛头的长矛。"

#. ~ Description of "steel javelin"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A steel-tipped wooden throwing spear."
msgstr "钢头木制投掷矛。"

#. ~ Description of "crude wooden spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout pole with one end sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一根结实的长杆，一头被削尖。"

#. ~ Description of "fire-hardened wooden spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a fire-hardened point."
msgstr "一根结实的木杆，尖端被火烤过而硬化。"

#. ~ Description of "steel spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a hand-forged steel spearhead."
msgstr "一根结实的木棍，配有手工钢质矛头。"

#. ~ Description of "stone spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a sharp stone spearhead."
msgstr "一根结实的木棍，一端配有尖锐的石制矛头。"

#. ~ Description of "copper spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a spearhead worked from copper."
msgstr "一根结实的木制长杆，附有锋利的铜制矛头。"

#. ~ Description of "knife spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with the blade of a knife bolted into place at the end.  The shape of a knife blade isn't ideal for a spear, but it's still very sharp and effective."
msgstr "一根结实的矛杆，末端栓接着一把刀刃。刀刃的形状对于长矛来说并不理想，但依然十分锋利好用。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift glaive"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A sturdy pole with a broad cutting blade securely bolted to one end.  It's intimidating despite being clearly homemade."
msgstr "一根坚固的杆子，一端牢固地固定有宽阔的切割刀片。  尽管显然是自制的，但它还是令人生畏。"

#. ~ Description of "glaive"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A sturdy polearm with a sizable single-edged blade on the end."
msgstr "一把结实的长柄武器，末端为一个相当长的单刃刀，形如偃月刀与朴刀，起源于威尔士。"

#. ~ Description of "halberd"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A versatile polearm with an axe blade, a spike, and a hooking beak attached to a long, sturdy haft."
msgstr "一把多功能的长柄武器，长粗木棍上固定有一个斧头，一个矛头，以及其他装饰。"

#. ~ Description of "fire poker"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "Also known as a fire iron, this short rod has a pointed tip with a hook on one side.  It was designed for stoking firewood, but it looks like it could really do some damage in a fight."
msgstr "这种短棒也称为火熨斗，具有尖头，一侧有钩子。  它是为柴火而设计的，但看起来它确实可以在战斗中造成一些伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "pitchfork"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "An agricultural tool with a long wooden shaft and four spikes.  It's normally used to lift hay, but the tines could do some damage in a fight."
msgstr "一种带有长木柄和四根尖齿的农具。通常用于叉运干草，但其尖齿在战斗中也足以造成伤害。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift war scythe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "This farming tool has been modified into an improvised weapon by rotating its blade 90 degrees, transforming it into a deadly giant blade on the end of a stick.  It's quite fragile, however."
msgstr "这种农用镰刀的刀刃旋转了90度，被改造成一种简易的武器，巨大而致命，就是不太耐用。"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened spear shaft"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "You've gone through the effort of making a proper spear shaft, but instead of attaching something sharp to the end you just whittled a point into the wood.  The peak of pointy stick technology."
msgstr "你花了很大力气制作一个合适的矛杆，但你没有在末端装上任何尖锐的东西，而只是在木头上刻出了一个尖。不管怎样，这东西都代表了尖木棍技术的顶峰。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "bronze bush hook"
msgid_plural "bronze bush hooks"
msgstr[0] "青铜锄头"

