#. ~ Description of "cestus"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid "A leather hand and arm wrap incorporating metal plates over the knuckles to improve punching power and defense."
msgstr "一个皮革缠绕而成的护手和护臂，在指关节上嵌入了金属板，以提高拳击威力和防护。"

#. ~ Description of "scrap knuckles"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid "A mass of scrap metal crudely beat into shape, with folded rags underneath to protect the wearer's knuckles."
msgstr "一块被粗鲁敲打成型的废金属，有几层布内衬来保护穿戴者的关节，一件不错的快速武器，不过你可能需要在很近的距离来用它。"

#. ~ Description of "studded gloves"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid "A pair of gloves with studded metal knuckles and a thin back plating."
msgstr "一对镶有金属指关节和装甲背板的手套。"

#. ~ Description of "nail knuckles"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid "A pair of knuckles consisting of two small squares of wood with several nails sticking through them.  Useful in nasty street fights."
msgstr "一副木制护手拳套，上面还敲进了几个钉子。常见于街头斗殴之中，富有实用性。"

#. ~ Description of "steel knuckles"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid "A pair of knuckles forged from steel, designed to be worn over the fingers to cause punches to do more damage."
msgstr "一个用钢锻造的指虎，可以套在手中，造成额外的伤害。这是一件精良、快速的武器，不过你可能需要在很近的距离来用它。"

#. ~ Description of "skewer knuckles"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid "A pair of metal braces, each with a single sturdy spike attached.  When strapped to your hands, the spikes protrude 5 centimeters past your clenched fists."
msgstr "一对金属支架，每个支架上都有一根坚固的钢刺。当绑在你的手上时，钢刺在你紧握的拳头上突出5厘米。"

#. ~ Description of "impact knuckles"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid "A pair of thick steel plates to wear over the knuckles."
msgstr "一条卡其色的长裤，比牛仔裤稍微保暖些。"

#. ~ Description of "bagh nakh"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid "Also called tiger claws, these Indian weapons consist of two sets of finger rings that secure curved steel claws to the wearer's palms, allowing for vicious unarmed attacks while worn."
msgstr "这些印度武器也被称为虎爪，由两组指环组成，将弯曲的钢爪固定在佩戴者的手掌上，允许在佩戴时进行恶意的徒手攻击。"

#. ~ Description of "brass knuckles"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid "Two sets of metal rings connected to lugs which are worn over the fingers to add a good deal of power to the user's punches."
msgstr "两组金属环连接到凸耳，这些凸耳戴在手指上，为用户的出拳增加很大的力量。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
