#. ~ Description of "character sheet"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A Dungeons & Dragons character sheet."
msgstr "《龙与地下城》角色表。"

#. ~ Description of "post-it note"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A bright yellow post-it note."
msgstr "一张亮黄色的便利贴。"

#. ~ Description of "production notes"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A collection of documents attesting to the purity of this batch, the performance of instrumentation during its production, and a list of materials used during its production and analysis.  It includes a Certificate of Analysis, each line listing a test method, result, and reviewer's signature, all in service of… something.  On one distinctive page a series of checkmarks slowly appear and fade around <color_yellow>\"500 units of mutagen per 500 units of primer\"</color> ratio."
msgstr "一套文件记录，描述了某个批次的产品的纯度、生产时的仪器性能和生产检测中用到的材料的列表。里面包括了一张检测证书，每一行都列出了一种测试方式、相应的测试结果以及审阅人的签名，全部都是为了……某种目标。其中一张与众不同的文件上打着一系列时隐时现的勾，勾的附近写着<color_yellow>\"500 单位诱变剂结合 500 单位诱变引物\"</color>。"

#. ~ Description of "score card"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A colorfully-printed score card."
msgstr "一张彩色印刷的记分卡。"

#. ~ Description of "valentine card"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A creased holiday card.  It appears to be a Valentine's Day card from before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "一张皱折的节日贺卡。这似乎是大灾变前的情人节贺卡。"

#. ~ Description of "lab report (psychology)"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A folder full of what appear to be transcripts of confidential psychotherapy sessions.  Most of it is rather trivial, but certain passages catch your eye…"
msgstr "一个满是秘密心理治疗记录的文件夹。大部分内容都很琐碎，但某些段落吸引了你的眼球……"

#. ~ Description of "missing cat poster"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A handmade poster notifying passersby about someone's missing cat, and requesting that anyone with information contact the listed phone number."
msgstr "一张手工海报，内容大意是某人遗失了他的猫，希望任何有线索的路人联系主人的号码。"

#. ~ Description of "missing dog poster"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A handmade poster notifying passersby about someone's missing dog, and requesting that anyone with information contact the listed phone number."
msgstr "一张手工制作的海报，通知路人某人失踪的狗，并要求任何有信息的人联系列出的电话号码。"

#. ~ Description of "lab report (security)"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A manila folder bearing an atom-and-rifle insignia.  Most of it is concerned with shipping logs and personnel rotations, but there is a single page that feels out of place."
msgstr "一个印着原子和步枪标记的马尼拉文件夹。大部分内容都与运输记录和人员轮换有关，但其中一张似乎有些异常。"

#. ~ Description of "lab report (biology)"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A manila folder containing top-secret test data.  Most of it is unintelligible without knowing the jargon, and the contents have obviously suffered from the chaos in this place, but there are some intact pages you can make sense of."
msgstr "一个包含某些绝密测试数据的纸制文件夹。大部分内容在你不知道术语时是完全无法理解的，而且内容显然被这里的混乱所影响，但是有一些完整的页面可供你学习。"

#. ~ Description of "child's note"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A piece of paper.  Something's written on it, scrawled in simple, messy handwriting."
msgstr ""
"一张废纸，上面写了些字，但是太潦草了。\n"
"\"你的字写得像狗刨的\""

#. ~ Description of variant "Cybercop 3D movie poster" of item "movie poster"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A poster for \"Cybercop 3D\", a sci-fi movie about a policeman tasked to take down a group of dangerous hackers inside a simulated reality."
msgstr "\"Cybercop 3D\"的海报，这是一部科幻电影，讲述了一名警察的任务是在模拟现实中击败一群危险的黑客。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hunted III movie poster" of item "movie poster"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A poster for \"Hunted III\", the third entry of the \"Hunted\" slasher franchise.  Its tagline reads: \"You can't outrun it forever\"."
msgstr "《猎杀III》的海报，《猎杀者》系列的第三部作品。 它的标语是：\"你不能永远超越它\"。"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Black Freighter movie poster" of item "movie
#. poster"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A poster promoting the animated movie \"The Black Freighter\", an adaptation of the novel of the same name.  The print is in the same style as the source material."
msgstr "一张宣传动画电影《黑船》的海报，改编自同名小说。这张传单的美术画风和其衍生漫画相同。"

#. ~ Description of "child's drawing"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A scrap of paper with a faded drawing on it."
msgstr "一张纸，上面画着已经略显褪色的涂鸦。"

#. ~ Description of "flyer"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A scrap of paper."
msgstr "一张废纸。"

#. ~ Description of "survivor's note"
#. ~ Description of "note"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A scrap of paper.  Something's written on it, scrawled in bad handwriting."
msgstr "一张废纸，上面写了些字，但是太潦草了。"

#. ~ Description of "biology protocol"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A sheet of paper adorned with an atom-and-flask symbol, detailing some questionable biological research."
msgstr "一张印着原子和烧瓶符号标记的纸，详细描述了一些可疑的生物学研究。"

#. ~ Description of "psychotherapy protocol"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A sheet of paper bearing an atom-and-cross symbol, pertaining to the mental wellbeing of science staff."
msgstr ""
"一张印着原子和十字符号标记的纸，内容似乎与科研人员的精神健康有关。\n"
"\"查询科研人员精神状态\""

#. ~ Description of "metatopography protocol"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A sheet of paper bearing an atom-and-flask symbol, filled with incoherent ramblings about alien geometries and how to get to them."
msgstr "一张印着原子和烧瓶符号标记的纸，上面写满了各种奇怪的几何结构以及如何到达它们的杂乱无章的文字。"

#. ~ Description of "security protocol"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A sheet of paper bearing an atom-and-rifle symbol, detailing some very particular security protocols."
msgstr "一张印着原子和步枪符号标记的纸，详细说明了一些非常特殊的安保流程。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It is possibly one of the last issues printed before New England was overwhelmed.  Most of the information is terribly trivial or out of date, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr "一份报纸中的某页。可能来自新英格兰被丧尸占领前印刷的最后几期。大多是些琐碎或者过时的信息，但某件事还是能短暂吸引你的目光。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It seems to date from a few years ago--amazing it has lasted this long.  Most of the information is terribly trivial or out of date, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr "一张报纸大张。 它似乎可以追溯到几年前 - 令人惊讶的是它持续了这么长时间。 大多数信息都非常琐碎或过时，但有一件事会短暂地吸引你的眼球。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It seems to date from several years ago, and you have NO idea how it lasted this long.  Most of the information is terribly trivial or out of date, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr "一份报纸中的某页，来自好几年前，你很奇怪它是如何保存至今的。大多是些琐碎或者过时的信息，但某件事还是能短暂吸引你的目光。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid "A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It was printed in the months leading up to the Cataclysm.  Most of the information is terribly trivial or out of date, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr "一张报纸大张。 它是在大灾变前的几个月里印刷的。 大多数信息都非常琐碎或过时，但有一件事会短暂地吸引你的眼球。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
