#. ~ Description of gun "composite bow"
#. ~ Description of "composite bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "A heavily recurved short bow made of wood, bone, and horn laminated together.  Its shape and construction give it a formidable draw weight despite its size."
msgstr "一种由木头、骨头和牛角层压而成的重弯短弓。  尽管其尺寸很大，但其形状和结构使其具有强大的拉力。"

#. ~ Description of gun "wooden war bow"
#. ~ Description of "wooden war bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "A long bow as tall as a man, this is a convincing reproduction of the weapons that ruled the battlefield prior to the invention of gunpowder.  The incredible draw weight is too much for the average person, but in the right hands it could be devastating."
msgstr "一把与人一样高的长弓，这是火药发明之前统治战场的武器的令人信服的复制品。  令人难以置信的拉力对普通人来说太大了，但在正确的人手中，它可能是毁灭性的。"

#. ~ Description of gun "compound hunting bow (low)"
#. ~ Description of "compound hunting bow (low)"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "A modern bow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-velocity shots that can be used effectively by average archers.  Currently set to a low weight, making it much easier to draw."
msgstr "一把威力大的弓，带有偏心滑轮组和额外的弓弦，能够射出高速弓箭，力量普通的人就能够有效的使用它。当前滑轮组设置在低力度水平，很容易拉开。"

#. ~ Description of gun "compound hunting bow"
#. ~ Description of "compound hunting bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "A modern bow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-velocity shots that can be used effectively by fairly strong archers.  Currently set to a medium weight."
msgstr "一把威力大的弓，带有偏心滑轮组和额外的弓弦，能够射出高速弓箭，需要较为强壮的人才能够有效的使用它。当前滑轮组设置在中力度水平。"

#. ~ Description of gun "compound hunting bow (high)"
#. ~ Description of "compound hunting bow (high)"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "A modern bow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-velocity shots that can be used effectively by very strong archers.  Currently set to a high weight, and ready to cause some real damage - if you can draw it."
msgstr "一把威力大的弓，带有偏心滑轮组和额外的弓弦，能够射出高速弓箭，需要十分强壮的人才能够有效的使用它。当前滑轮组设置在高力度水平，如果你能拉开它，能对敌人造成不错的伤害。"

#. ~ Description of gun "fiberglass recurve bow (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "fiberglass recurve bow (folded)"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "A modern fiberglass bow that has been taken down for storage.  Activate it to assemble it for use."
msgstr "一把现代玻璃纤维反曲弓，被拆卸便于储存。在较为强壮的射手手中十分好用。使用它来组装成型。"

#. ~ Description of gun "survival bow"
#. ~ Description of "survival bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "A weak bow crudely crafted from a single uncured wood stave.  It could be useful for hunting small game, or maybe even fish."
msgstr "一把用整块未经处理的木板粗糙制作而成的简易弓。威力很弱，准头也很差，但制作起来很容易。"

#. ~ Description of gun "wooden target bow"
#. ~ Description of "wooden target bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "A wooden longbow nearly the height of a man.  Though it resembles a medieval weapon of war, the modest draw weight means this weapon is more suited for shooting targets or animals than penetrating chain mail."
msgstr "接近人高的木制长弓。  虽然它类似于中世纪的战争武器，但适度的拉力意味着这种武器比穿透链甲更适合射击目标或动物。"

#. ~ Description of gun "compound war bow"
#. ~ Description of "compound war bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "An extremely large, powerful compound bow, made with enormous limbs and a thick string to take an immense amount of energy.  A pulley system makes it a bit easier to draw, though it would still be quite a feat of strength for any human."
msgstr "一把体型巨大且威力强大的合成长弓，弓身巨大且弓弦粗壮，能够吸收巨大的能量。需要超乎想象的力量才能拉开弓。"

