msgstr "拆开它"

#. ~ Description of gun "wooden short bow"
#. ~ Description of "wooden short bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "Emphasizing portability and agility over power, this all-wood bow is suitable for small game and harassing enemies."
msgstr "这把全木制成的短弓侧重于提高便携性和灵活性而非威力，适合捕猎小型动物或骚扰敌人。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "compound hunting bow (high)"
