#. ~ Description of gun "fiberglass recurve bow"
#. ~ Description of "fiberglass recurve bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "The fiberglass limbs of this modern-day short bow curve back on themselves, giving it a decent amount of power despite its size.  It can be activated to fold down for easy storage when not in use."
msgstr "这种现代短弓的玻璃纤维弓片向后弯曲，尽管其尺寸很大，但仍能提供相当大的功率。  不使用时可以将其折叠起来以便于存放。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "compound hunting bow"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "compound hunting bow (low)"
