msgstr "投掷"

#. ~ Description of "ballista bolt"
#: data/json/items/ranged/ballista.json
msgid "A big steel tipped projectile, twice the size of a normal bolt and much heavier than one.  It gets thicker towards the base, and is fletched there with the protrusions of the shaft itself."
msgstr "一种巨大的钢头射弹，尺寸是普通螺栓的两倍，而且比螺栓重得多。  它向底部变厚，并在轴本身的突出部分上有羽毛。"

#. ~ Description of gun "carroballista"
#. ~ Description of "carroballista"
#: data/json/items/ranged/ballista.json
msgid "A smaller, mounted version of the Greco-Roman ballista, for those situations where the crossbow just isn't enough.  Unlike crossbows, it is powered by a torsion spring that is wound by a hand crank and uses two prods instead of one bow.  Its size and design make it unfeasible to be used by hand, requiring it to be set down or mounted to a vehicle."
msgstr "希腊罗马弩炮的小型安装版本，适用于十字弓不够用的情况。  与弩不同的是，它由扭力弹簧提供动力，扭力弹簧由手动曲柄缠绕，并使用两根刺棒而不是一张弓。  它的尺寸和设计使其无法用手使用，需要将其放置或安装到车辆上。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ranged/ballista.json
msgid "ballista bolt"
msgid_plural "ballista bolts"
msgstr[0] "弩炮炮矢"

