msgid "2x"
msgstr "2x"

#. ~ Description of gun "light crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "light crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "A crossbow made entirely of wood, save for the bowstring.  It simple design makes it easy to operate, but it's lacking in power."
msgstr "除弓弦外全部由木头制成的弩。  它的设计简单，易于操作，但缺乏动力。"

#. ~ Description of gun "latchet crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "latchet crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "A lever lies in a recess carved into this crossbow's wooden stock, allowing it to be mechanically reloaded simply by lifting it out to catch the string and pressing it back into place.  This allows for rapid reloading despite the relatively heavy steel limbs."
msgstr "十字弓木托上刻有一个凹槽，其中有一个杠杆，只需将其抬起以抓住弦并将其压回原位即可机械地重新装弹。  尽管钢制肢体相对较重，但仍可以快速重新装弹。这把弩的木质弩托内嵌有一根杠杆。只需将其抬起勾住弩弦，再压回原位，即可完成机械式装填。尽管采用了相对沉重的钢制弩片，这一设计仍能实现快速装填。"

#. ~ Description of gun "repeating crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "repeating crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "A lightweight wooden crossbow which can mount a magazine atop it, allowing for automatic fire via the operation of a lever which in a single motion spans the bow, nocks the bolt, and releases the string."
msgstr "一种轻便的木制弩，顶部可安装弹匣。通过操作杠杆，只需一个动作即可完成拉弦、上箭和放箭，从而实现连发射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun "heavy crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "heavy crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "A medieval heavy crossbow designed to penetrate armor.  Its steel limbs can store a tremendous amount of energy, but it takes a lot of time and effort to load."
msgstr "一种中世纪的重弩，旨在穿透盔甲。  它的钢制肢体可以储存巨大的能量，但加载时需要花费大量的时间和精力。"

#. ~ Description of gun "compound crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "compound crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "A modern hunting crossbow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-power shots.  An integrated cocking rope assists the user with string pulling."
msgstr "一把大威力十字弩，带有偏心滑轮组和额外的弓弦，能够射出高速弓箭。一体化的扣弦绳可以协助使用者拉弦。"

#. ~ Description of gun "repeating compound crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "repeating compound crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "A modern hunting crossbow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-powered shots.  It is mounted with a ten-bolt magazine and a pump-action lever for rapid reloads."
msgstr "一把大威力十字弩，带有偏心滑轮组和额外的弓弦，能够射出高速弓箭。一体化的扣弦绳可以协助使用者拉弦。"

#. ~ Description of gun "pistol crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "pistol crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "A modern reverse-draw crossbow engineered to be compact and quiet without sacrificing firepower.  Despite its diminutive size, this weapon ought to be sufficient for taking deer, or perhaps even larger targets."
msgstr "一款现代反拉十字弓，设计紧凑、安静，且不牺牲火力。  尽管尺寸很小，这种武器应该足以对付鹿，甚至更大的目标。"

#. ~ Description of gun "double-string crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "double-string crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "A slender medieval crossbow with four steel limbs and two bowstrings.  With the aid of a foot stirrup, it may be loaded with two bolts and fired twice in succession."
msgstr "一把纤细的中世纪弩，配有四片钢制弓臂和两根弓弦。在脚蹬的辅助下，它可以同时装填两支弩箭，并实现连续两次射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun "hand crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "hand crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "A small crossbow designed for use with one hand.  Due to its small size and simple construction, it is quite weak."
msgstr "专为单手使用而设计的小型十字弓。  由于其体积小、结构简单，因此其强度相当弱。"

#. ~ Description of gun "bullet crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "bullet crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "Also called a stonebow, this light crossbow fires pebbles or other small projectiles rather than bolts with surprising accuracy, if not a lot of power."
msgstr "也被称为石弹弩。这种轻型弩发射鹅卵石或其他小型弹丸，而非弩箭。虽然威力不算大，但精准度惊人。"

