msgstr "一个利用橡皮筋的力道发射特制长矛的水下捕鱼设备，在水下效果很好，但在陆地上几乎无用。"

#. ~ Description of gun "double roller speargun"
#. ~ Description of "double roller speargun"
#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid "Underwater fishing device, this speargun has set of two rubber bands.  It doesn't make you able to load two spears, but it can put a bit more power into shot.  While highly effective when used underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr "水下捕鱼装置，该鱼枪有两根橡皮筋。  它并不能让你装填两支矛，但它可以增加射击的力量。  虽然在水下使用时非常有效，但在陆地上几乎毫无用处。"

