#. ~ Description of "bronze war dart"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A bronze-tipped fletched throwing spear with a throwing loop for extra range."
msgstr "一种带有投掷环的青铜尖刺飞镖，射程更大。"

#. ~ Description of "lawn dart"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A large plastic dart made for outdoor games."
msgstr "一个在户外游戏中所使用的大型塑料飞镖。"

#. ~ Description of "weighted dart"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A lead weighted dart for throwing at enemies, like the Romans used."
msgstr "一种铅制飞镖，用于朝敌人投掷，就像罗马人用的那样。"

#. ~ Description of "throwing axe"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A lightweight hatchet made for throwing.  Its ineffective cutting edge and light weight make it unsuitable for use as a tool."
msgstr ""
"一把重量很轻的投掷用轻斧。它没有斧刃，而且重量太轻，这让它没法当作工具使用。\n"
"\"中土世界的矮人专用。\""

#. ~ Description of "net"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A mesh of weights and cordage designed to entangle opponents in combat.  It probably won't work on anything too small or too big."
msgstr "一种由配重块与绳索构成的网状物，设计用于在战斗中缠绕对手。可能对体型过大或过小的目标效果不佳。"

#. ~ Description of "disc"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A plastic disc made for playing disc golf.  It is smaller and denser than a normal frisbee."
msgstr "打飞盘高尔夫用的的塑料圆盘。它比普通的飞盘更小、密度更高。"

#. ~ Description of "frisbee"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A plastic frisbee made for outdoor games."
msgstr "一种用于户外游戏的塑料飞盘。"

#. ~ Description of "bolas"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A rope with stone weights at either end.  If thrown, these might trip a person or animal, provided it isn't too small or too big."
msgstr "一种两端系有石质配重的绳索。若将其抛出，或许能绊倒体型适中的人或动物。"

#. ~ Description of "throwing stick"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A stick carved into a shape suitable for throwing at a target.  It's not a boomerang, so don't expect it to return to your hand."
msgstr ""
"一根削尖的木棍，适合投掷，它不是回旋镖，投掷后需要自己拾取才能反复使用。\n"
"\"如果掌握原力就可以自动回到手中。\""

#. ~ Description of "throwing knife"
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A thin, flat knife made for throwing.  Its ineffective cutting edge and odd shape make it unsuitable for use as a tool."
msgstr ""
"一个细薄而扁平的投掷用小刀。它没有刀刃，而且形状也很怪异，这让它无法作为工具使用。\n"
"\"The world！\""

