#. ~ Description of "antique silver locket"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A heart-shaped silver locket with an black-and-white image of a smiling woman in it.  Her eyes seem to follow you whenever you look at it."
msgstr "一个心形的银色小盒子，里面有一个微笑的女人的黑白图像。每当你看着它时，她的眼睛似乎都会跟着你目光移动。"

#. ~ Description of "varsity jacket"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A jacket traditionally worn by school athletes.  The logo of the school has an oddly detailed fractal pattern that draws your eye in whenever you look at it."
msgstr "看起来是学校运动员穿的夹克。校徽上有一个奇怪而精细的分形图案，每当你看到它时，它都会吸引你的眼球。"

#. ~ Description of "ambiguous apron"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A long apron with a plain pattern on it.  Your eyes can't seem to decide what color it is."
msgstr "一条有着普通图案的长围裙。你的眼睛似乎无法确定它是什么颜色的。"

#. ~ Description of "antique scissors"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A pair of ornately decorated steel scissors.  The handle is decorated with vicious-looking birds."
msgstr "一把装饰华丽的钢剪刀。把手上装饰着凶恶的小鸟。"

#. ~ Description of "strange sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A pair of thin, round sunglasses.  The tinted glass seems to reflect the same shade of baleful orange light no matter what light it reflects."
msgstr "一副又薄又圆的太阳镜。无论什么颜色的光照射在它的有色玻璃上，似乎都能反射出同样的橙色光线。"

#. ~ Description of "Hawaiian shirt"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A slightly worn button-down shirt with a tropical pattern, straight out of the 80's.  You swear that every time you look away and look back, the pattern changes subtly."
msgstr "一件80年代的带有热带图案的破旧纽扣衬衫。你发誓，每次你把目光移开再回头看时，上面的图案都会发生微妙的变化。"

#. ~ Description of "engraved cube"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A small cube of smooth rock.  A uniform grid of nine squares is engraved in each of its faces."
msgstr "一小块鬼斧神工般的的方形怪石，出奇的平整而又光滑，你甚至怀疑它不是地内产物。它的每一面都浮现着一个由9个正方形组成的规则网格。"

#. ~ Description of "glitching stopwatch"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A small digital stopwatch, looking slightly old by today's standards.  Its digital display prints ever-changing gibberish."
msgstr "一个小型数字秒表，样式按今天的标准来看有点老旧。它显示的数字不断毫无意义地跳动。"

#. ~ Description of "golden comb"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A small, delicate golden comb.  It was once carefully engraved, but time has smoothed its designs to illegibility."
msgstr "一把小巧精致的金色梳子，曾被精心雕琢过，但时间已经使它表面的图案变得难以辨认。"

#. ~ Description of "shifting keyring"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A smooth ring of steel, heavy under the weight of numerous keys.  The designs of the keys change over time, but none will fit any keyhole you have ever found."
msgstr "一个光滑的钢环，在它上面数不清许多钥匙的重压下变得很重。钥匙的式样会随着时间推移而不断改变，但是没有一根能插进你所找到的任何钥匙孔中。"

#. ~ Description of "Utah teapot"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A squat teapot with a minimalist design.  Its surface shines under the glow of unseen light sources."
msgstr "一个设计简约的矮胖茶壶。它的表面在某种肉眼不可见光源的照射下会若隐若现的发出诡异之光。"

#. ~ Description of "defaced badge"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A strange golden badge in the shape of a shield with scratched out lettering.  The faceless figures decorating the badge seem taller and thinner than ordinary humans."
msgstr "一个刻着字的怪异金色盾形徽章。徽章上的无脸人看起来比普通人更高更瘦。"

#. ~ Description of "Bakelite phone"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "A vintage, bright-red Bakelite phone of famous Swedish design.  It would look almost normal, if not for the fact that its rotary dial has been replaced with a doorknob."
msgstr "一部采用胶木和著名瑞典设计的鲜红色老式旋转号盘电话机。若不是因为它的拨号盘被一个门把手所取代，它看起来几乎完全正常。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "Bakelite phone"
msgid_plural "Bakelite phones"
msgstr[0] "胶木旋盘电话机"

