#. ~ Description of "inscribed disc"
#: data/json/items/relics/monolith_items.json
msgid "A thin, palm-sized disc of incredibly dense stone, engraved with meaningless swirls.  Its surface seems to repel grime and debris, and it refuses to tarnish or scratch."
msgstr "一个手掌大小的薄薄圆盘，由密度极高的黑石制成，上面刻着含义不明的漩涡。它的表面似乎能阻挡污垢和碎屑，而且不会变色或划伤。"

#. ~ Description of "warped brick"
#: data/json/items/relics/monolith_items.json
msgid "This brick of too-dense stone is warped in a way that just barely makes it worthless as a building material.  Its smooth surface is unmarred by texture, dirt, or color."
msgstr "一块扭曲的砖块，由密度极高的黑石制成，表面弯曲的程度恰好让它成为一种毫无价值的建筑材料。它光滑的表面没有任何纹理、污垢或颜色的痕迹。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/relics/monolith_items.json
msgid "inscribed disc"
msgid_plural "inscribed discs"
msgstr[0] "蚀刻圆盘"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/relics/monolith_items.json
msgid "warped brick"
msgid_plural "warped bricks"
msgstr[0] "扭曲砖块"

#. ~ Description of "alien fern branch"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A branching trunk of leaves from a massive fern, about two feet long and a couple of feet across in diameter when including the leaves.  Maybe one day you'll think of something to make with a giant fern."
msgstr "某种巨型蕨类植物叶子的分枝，根据叶片大小判断，巨型蕨类长约两英尺，直径也得有数英尺。也许有一天你能想到用这种巨型蕨类植物做点什么。"

#. ~ Description of "sensor assembly"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A carved sphere embedded with small black glass screens.  It's probably a sensor of some kind."
msgstr "一个雕刻有花纹的球体上嵌有黑色的小玻璃屏幕。 这可能是某种类型的传感器。"

#. ~ Description of "CBM interface wire kit"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A collection of hand-soldered wires leading to plugs and what looks like a micro controller.  The plugs look like they could be attached to you, assuming you have a Standard Neurobionic Interface."
msgstr "一套手工打磨过的电线连接着插头，看起来像是一个外星人的奇特微控制器。如果你植入了SNI（标准神经仿生接口），这些插头看起来像是可以连接到你身上。"

#. ~ Description of "external climate control kit"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A collection of mismatched pipes, wires, and a central device that looks like a micro controller.  It almost looks like it could be used for some form of central cooling."
msgstr "一组不太匹配的管道、电线和一个看起来像外星人的奇特微控制器的主控设备。看起来它似乎是某种中央冷却装置。"

#. ~ Description of "alien metal scrap"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A collection of tiny metal strips, spheres, and other geometric primitives taken from a disassembled alien machine."
msgstr "从外星机器中拆解出的细小金属条、球体和其他几何基元零件。"

#. ~ Description of "alien resin pod"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A large pod the size of a beer keg, filled with gooey alien resin.  Squeezing it firmly causes resin to squirt from the broken stalk at the end, hardening within a few seconds of being exposed to the air."
msgstr "这是一个大型荚囊，有一个木桶大小，里面装满了粘稠的异界树脂。紧紧地挤压它会导致树脂从断裂的茎端喷出，只要暴露在空气中几秒钟就会迅速硬化。"

#. ~ Description of "robotic innards"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A robotic assembly of unknown function.  Entirely made from tight-fitting metal plates, it somewhat resembles the interior of a mechanical clock."
msgstr "未知功能的机器人组件，完全由一堆紧密贴合的金属板制成，有点类似于机械钟的内部。"

#. ~ Description of "alien resin chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A shattered fragment of alien resin.  It looks a bit like a large piece of sea glass, frosted and gritty with the edges rounded off.  It is somewhat warm to the touch."
msgstr "一块异界树脂碎块。它看起来有点像一大块海玻璃，表面磨砂，边缘圆润。摸起来有点温暖舒适。"

#. ~ Description of "alien metal plating"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A slightly curved plate of white metal.  It readily collects low amounts of static charge."
msgstr "略微弯曲的白色金属板，非常容易带上少量的静电荷。"

#. ~ Description of "monolithic machine"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "A very heavy sphere, presumably made almost entirely of gold.  The complex pattern etched across its surface implies that it might serve some exotic function."
msgstr "一个非常重的球体，可能几乎完全由黄金制成。表面上蚀刻的复杂图案，意味着它可能具有一些奇异的功能。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "CBM interface wire kit"
msgid_plural "CBM interface wire kits"
msgstr[0] "CBM接口连线模块"

#. ~ Description of "woven metallics"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "Thin metallic strips with an ochre sheen, interlaid together into a flexible mesh.  You can't tell whether it's a circuit, a heat dissipation component, or a mechanical actuator."
msgstr "带有赭色光泽的细金属丝，交织在一起形成灵活的网状结构。你无法判断它是电路，散热组件还是处理器。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "alien fern branch"
msgid_plural "alien fern branches"
msgstr[0] "异星蕨枝"

