#. ~ Description of "stripped oven cabinet"
#: data/json/items/resources/appliance_parts.json
msgid "A large, hefty steel box that was once the main body of an electric oven.  Most of the parts have been stripped.  It could be further disassembled into base materials."
msgstr "一个曾经是电烤箱主体的巨型钢箱。大部分零部件已被拆解。它可以进一步拆解成基础材料。"

#. ~ Description of "broiler pan"
#: data/json/items/resources/appliance_parts.json
msgid "A simple sheet metal drawer that goes in the bottom of an electric oven."
msgstr "放在电烤箱底部的简单金属抽屉。"

#. ~ Description of "oven control panel"
