#. ~ Description of "potassium"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "A chunk of potassium, a highly reactive soft gray metal, immersed in anhydrous mineral oil to prevent it from oxidizing in the air during storage."
msgstr "一小块金属钾，一种高活性的软灰色金属，浸泡在无水矿物油中，以防止它们在储存期间在空气中氧化。"

#. ~ Description of "sodium"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "A chunk of sodium, a highly reactive soft gray metal, immersed in anhydrous mineral oil to prevent it from oxidizing in the air during storage."
msgstr "一小块金属钠，一种高活性的软灰色金属，浸泡在无水矿物油中，以防止它们在储存期间在空气中氧化。"

#. ~ Description of "mercury fulminate"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "A handful of gray powder that is highly sensitive to friction, heat, and shock.  Often used as a primary explosive, and historically in percussion caps and primers for self-contained firearm ammunition."
msgstr "一小撮对摩擦、加热和冲击高度敏感的灰色粉末。通常用作起爆药，历史上用于定装弹药的火帽和底火。"

#. ~ Description of "cloth dye powder"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "A handful of powdered colorful cloth dye, which can be used to dye many fabrics if combined with water and some mordant."
msgstr "一些粉状的彩色染布染料，如果与水和媒染剂结合在一起，可用于多种织物的染色。"

#. ~ Description of "potassium alum"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "A handful of small, water-soluble white crystals with a watery metallic odor, historically used for many different purposes.  Also known as potash alum and potassium aluminum sulfate; often called simply alum, as it's the most important member of the generic class of compounds called alums."
msgstr "颗粒状的水溶性白色晶体，散发出淡淡的金属气味，在历史上有许多不同的用途。也被称为钾明矾或硫酸铝钾；通常也简称为明矾，因为它是明矾类化合物中最重要的一员。"

#. ~ Description of "lead azide"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "A handful of white powder that is used in detonators to detonate secondary explosives.  It replaced mercury fulminate in modern ammunition primers."
msgstr "一把白色粉末，用作引爆药来引爆次级炸药。它取代了现代弹药底火中的雷汞。"

#. ~ Description of "sodium carbonate"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "A handful of white, odorless, hygroscopic powder, also known as soda ash or washing soda.  Despite the name, it isn't used for cleaning, though it is one ingredient of detergent."
msgstr "一把白色、无味、有吸湿性的粉末，也称为纯碱或洗涤苏打。  尽管有这个名字，但它并不用于清洁，尽管它是洗涤剂的一种成分。"

#. ~ Description of "calcium chloride"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "A handful of white, odorless, strongly hygroscopic powder with an extremely salty taste.  Often used as a de-icing agent or as dessicant."
msgstr "一种白色无气味的强吸湿性粉末，尝起来味道非常咸。常用作除冰剂或干燥剂。"

#. ~ Description of "baking soda"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "Also known as sodium bicarbonate, this is a white, odorless powder with a slightly salty alkaline taste.  It's often used in baking as a leavening agent, but can be put toward a wide variety of other purposes."
msgstr "也称为碳酸氢钠，是一种白色、无臭的粉末，具有微咸的碱性味道。  它通常在烘焙中用作膨松剂，但也可用于多种其他用途。"

#. ~ Description of "mercury"
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "Elemental mercury, unique in that it is a liquid under normal temperatures and pressures.  Known for its use in thermometers."
msgstr "元素汞，独特之处在于它在正常温度和压力下是一种液体。 因其在温度计中的使用而闻名。"

