msgstr "各式各样的小块金属碎片，经过整理，可用于制造各种物品。"

#. ~ Description of "copper tubing"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A copper tube; too thin to be much use as a melee weapon, but will do if nothing else is available.  Useful in a few crafting recipes."
msgstr "一根铜管，管壁太薄，不适合作为近战武器，但在没有其他武器是也能勉强使用。可用来制造其他物品。"

#. ~ Description of "bismuth"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A dense but brittle metal often used as an alternative to lead."
msgstr "一种高密度但脆性较高的金属，常用作铅的替代品。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy wire rack"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A durable steel rack, the sort you might find in an oven or on a barbecue."
msgstr "一个耐用的钢架，你可以在烤箱或烤肉架上找到。"

#. ~ Description of "tin powder"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A handful of fine gray tin powder, usable for making solder and lining containers to prevent corrosion."
msgstr "灰色的细锡粉，可以用来制造焊锡，或者镀在容器上防止腐蚀。"

#. ~ Description of "magnesium powder"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A handful of powdered magnesium, a highly flammable alkaline earth metal.  Useful for constructing flares and similar items."
msgstr "一把粉状的镁，一种高度易燃的碱土金属。用于制造信号弹和类似物品。"

#. ~ Description of "half-meter length of railroad track"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A heavy half-meter length of railroad track with a smooth top, liberated from a now-defunct rail line.  Could be used as a makeshift anvil, especially with some modifications, or as spare steel."
msgstr "从现已废弃的铁路线中解放出来的半米长、顶部光滑的重型铁轨。  可以用作临时砧，特别是经过一些修改，或者作为备用钢。"

#. ~ Description of "length of railroad track"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A heavy one-meter length of railroad track with a smooth top, liberated from a now-defunct rail line.  Far too heavy to be useful for much as-is, but perhaps could be shaped into something with some metalworking skill, or cut down into an anvil if sawed in half first."
msgstr "从现已废弃的铁路线中解放出来的一米长、顶部光滑的重型铁轨。  太重了，无法按原样使用，但也许可以通过一些金属加工技术塑造成某种东西，或者如果先锯成两半，则可以切成铁砧。"

#. ~ Description of "iron chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A heavy piece of iron.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "一块沉重的铸造贴，在一些制作中会很有用。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of budget steel"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
