msgid "A small metal hinge with two metal plates with screw holes.  Useful for making doors or chests."
msgstr "由两个带螺孔的金属板组成的小金属铰链。用来制造门或箱子的活页。"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum scrap"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of aluminum, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "一小块铝材，可以用来制造或修理物品。"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of aluminum; light but durable, this could be cast into various shapes for construction or ground down to a powder, for more high-profile applications."
msgstr "一小块铝；轻便但耐用，可铸造成各种建筑形状，或研磨成粉末，用于更高级的应用。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze fragment"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of copper alloyed with another metal such as aluminum or tin."
msgstr "一种由铜与其他金属（如铝或锡）合金化的一小块铜。"

#. ~ Description of "copper fragment"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of copper, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "一小块的铜，可以用来制造或修理物品。"

#. ~ Description of "iron scrap"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of iron, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "一小块的锡废料，可以用来制造或修理物品。"

#. ~ Description of "iron fragment"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of iron."
msgstr "一小堆雪。"

#. ~ Description of "steel fragment"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of steel about the size of a golf ball."
msgstr "一个高尔夫球大小的钢碎块"

#. ~ Description of "small metal sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small sheet of metal."
msgstr "一小片金属。"

#. ~ Description of "solder"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small spool of solder, useful for electronics crafting."
msgstr "一小卷焊料，对电子工艺很有用。"

#. ~ Description of "lead"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A soft, dull metal used since ancient times.  Due to its malleability, it has a wide variety of uses including the manufacture of ammunition."
msgstr "一种质地柔软的钝性金属，自古以来就被人们所知。由于其延展性可用于弹药制造等多种用途。"

#. ~ Description of "silver"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A soft, shiny metal.  Before the Cataclysm it was worth quite a bit, but its value is now greatly diminished."
msgstr ""
"一种较软的具有明显光泽的金属，你可以用它制造一些东西，或有其它用途。\n"
"\"据说用银做的子弹可以对僵尸造成更大的伤害，但可惜敌人是丧尸。\""

#. ~ Description of "gold"
#. ~ Description of "platinum"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A soft, shiny metal.  Before the apocalypse this would've been worth a small fortune, but now its value is greatly diminished."
msgstr "一块质地柔软光泽闪亮的金属。灾变之前这会值不少钱，但现在它的价值大打折扣。"

#. ~ Description of "pipe"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A steel pipe.  A decent weapon in its own right, it could also be used in a number of crafts."
msgstr "一根钢管。  它本身就是一种不错的武器，也可以用于许多工艺品。"

#. ~ Description of "copper rod"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A thin copper rod, ready to be made into copper wire."
msgstr "一根细铜棒，可以做成铜线。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of brass"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "Some decent-sized chunks of scrap brass."
msgstr "一些大小合适的废黄铜块。"

#. ~ Description of "tin scrap"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "Some small pieces of tin, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "一小块的锡废料，可以用来制造或修理物品。"

