msgid "A huge fossilized bone.  Not good to eat."
msgstr "一块大骨化石。不能吃。"

#. ~ Description of "large rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "A large, heavy rock, big enough to be used as a primitive anvil or shaped into larger stone items."
msgstr "一块有铁砧大小的沉重石头，大到可以当作简易铁砧使用，或被制造成大型石制物品。"

#. ~ Description of "bone replica"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
