#. ~ Description of "tonewood"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A block of tonally appropriate wood that has been air dried for a year in preparation for being turned into a musical instrument."
msgstr "一块音色合适的木材，已风干一年，准备制成乐器。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden door"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A door complete with hinges and handle, ready to be installed in a frame."
msgstr "一个内嵌小透镜的金属圆筒，安装在门上，你可以用它来观察门外的景象。"

#. ~ Description of "plank"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A flat, thick plank of wood.  It's very awkward as a melee weapon, but perhaps it could be carved into something better."
msgstr "一块又平又厚的木板。  作为近战武器，它非常尴尬，但也许它可以被雕刻成更好的东西。"

#. ~ Description of "giant wooden screw"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A giant screw carved out of solid wood, a simple component used to convert rotational energy into a downward movement of greater force."
msgstr "一根由实木雕刻而成的巨大螺杆，一个简单的部件，用来将旋转的动力转化为更大力量的向下移动。"

#. ~ Description of "log"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A large section of tree trunk."
msgstr "一大段树干。"

#. ~ Description of "soaking spear shaft"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A long stick carved and sanded into a smooth staff with a slight taper, for use in making spears. It's currently being soaked with oil and quite slippery.  Once it's finished it will be ready for use in other projects."
msgstr "一种长棍，雕刻并打磨成光滑的杆，具有轻微的锥度，用于制作矛。现在它已经被油浸透了，非常滑。  一旦完成，就可以在其他项目中使用。"

#. ~ Description of "long plank"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A long, thick plank of wood commonly known as a two by four, one of the most common pieces of lumber.  In wood frame construction, these are the studs that support drywall and give a building its structure."
msgstr "一种又长又厚的木板，通常称为二乘四木板，是最常见的木材之一。  在木框架结构中，这些是支撑干墙并赋予建筑物结构的螺柱。"

#. ~ Description of "stick"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A respectable length of wood.  It could serve as a weapon as-is, but it might be better to carve it into something."
msgstr "一段相当长的木头。  它可以直接用作武器，但最好将其雕刻成某种东西。"

#. ~ Description of "short plank"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A short, thick plank of wood, about 1/4th of a two by four."
msgstr "一块短而厚的木板，大约是二乘四的 1/4。"

#. ~ Description of "small wood block"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A small 2x2x5 inches block of wood, primarily used for carving out small wooden objects."
msgstr "一块2x2x5立方英寸(约5×5×13立方厘米)的木头，主要用于雕刻小型木制物品。"

#. ~ Description of "splintered wood"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A splintered piece of wood. It could be used as a skewer for cooking."
msgstr "一根被劈成细条的木片，可用来串肉或者作为燃火用品。"

#. ~ Description of "large wooden sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A standard 4 by 8 sheet of flat wood.  Heavy and bulky, it is extremely useful for all manner of construction, but you might have to cut it to size before doing smaller projects."
msgstr "一块标准的4x8大小的大木板，通常是胶合板、欧松板或纤维板类似材质。又沉又笨重，它能够被用于建造各种建筑，不过也许你需要在建造小型建筑前将它切割成合适的尺寸。"

#. ~ Description of "long pole"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A stout pole, half again the height of a man.  It has been carefully oiled to preserve its strength and flexibility."
msgstr "一根粗壮的杆子，有半个人高。  它经过仔细上油，以保持其强度和灵活性。"

#. ~ Description of "soaking long pole"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A stout pole, half again the height of a man.  It is soaking in oil to give it strength and flexibility, and it will be some time before it's ready for further use."
msgstr "一根粗壮的杆子，有半个人高。  将其浸泡在油中以赋予其强度和柔韧性，并且需要一段时间才能准备好进一步使用。"

#. ~ Description of "spear shaft"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A very long stick, sanded and treated with oil for integrity and carved into a smooth staff with a slight taper, for use in making spears."
msgstr "一根长木棍，经过打磨和油脂处理，并雕刻成两端带钝锥头的的光滑木杖，用于制作真正的长矛。它也可以作为简易的武术长棍使用，但太细了，用来打人不是很有效。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden panel"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A wide, thin wooden board, already cut to shape.  It's good for all kinds of construction, but for really big projects you'd need a proper sheet of uncut wood or the like."
msgstr "一种宽而薄的胶合板、纤维板或欧松板，已经切割成型并打孔好凹槽。非常适合建造各种建筑。但是对于真正的大型项目来说，你可能需要更合适的未切割的板材。"

#. ~ Description of "short wooden post"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A wooden post with a 4 by 4 square base.  Posts with a length similar to this are commonly used as chair legs."
msgstr "一根横截面是正方形，长24英寸(约61厘米)的木杆。长度与此相似的杆子通常用于椅子腿。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden post"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A wooden post with a 4 by 4 square base.  Posts with a length similar to this are commonly used in mailboxes or as table legs."
msgstr "一根横截面是正方形，长4英尺(约1.2米)的木杆。长度与此相似的杆子通常用于邮箱或作为桌腿。"

#. ~ Description of "long wooden post"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A wooden post with a 4 by 4 square base.  Posts with a length similar to this are commonly used in the construction of walls and floors."
msgstr "一根横截面是正方形，长8英尺(约2.4米)的木杆。长度与此相似的杆子通常用于地板或墙体建设。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy wooden beam"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "An enormous beam of solid wood, very heavy and hard to lug around, but also very sturdy for construction.  You could saw or chop it into smaller pieces, like planks or panels."
msgstr "巨大的实木梁，很重，很难被拖动，但对于建筑来说也很坚固。你可以把它锯成小块，比如木板或木墙板。"

#. ~ Description of "long stick"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "An unworked length of wood, half again the height of a man.  It's quite unwieldy in its current state.."
msgstr "一段未经加工的木头，有半人高。  在目前的状态下它非常笨拙.."

#. ~ Description of "tuning peg"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "Tuning pegs go on stringed instruments to both provide an anchor for the strings and to control the tightness of the wire which in turn controls the tune of the notes produced."
msgstr "调音钉安装在弦乐器上，既作为琴弦的固定点，又可以调节钢丝的松紧程度，从而控制所发出音符的音调。"

