#. ~ Description of "foldable plastic bottle"
#: data/json/items/tool/container.json
msgid "A non-rigid plastic bottle for easy storage, holds 500 mL of liquid."
msgstr "一个水密的可折叠塑料瓶，能储存500毫升的液体。"

#. ~ Description of "steel bottle"
#: data/json/items/tool/container.json
msgid "A stainless steel water bottle, holds 750 mL of liquid."
msgstr "一个不锈钢水瓶，能储存750毫升的液体。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/container.json
msgid "foldable plastic bottle"
msgid_plural "foldable plastic bottles"
msgstr[0] "可折叠塑料瓶"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/container.json
msgid "steel bottle"
msgid_plural "steel bottles"
msgstr[0] "不锈钢瓶"

#. ~ Description of "oil-powered manual oil press"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A barrel with a large screw press for creating vegetable oil.  A kerosene cooker heats the raw material to increase extraction efficiency."
msgstr "一台带着大桶的手摇式压榨机，用于制作植物油。有台煤油炉加热原料以提高萃取效率。"

#. ~ Description of "water purifier"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A battery-powered device designed to purify drinking water.  Using this item on a container full of water will purify the contents.  It could be useful for water taken from uncertain sources like a river, as it may be non-potable."
msgstr "一个由电池供电的净水装置。使用该物品可将任何装水的容器中的水净化使其能够安全饮用。特别是对那些从河流、水池、集雨器甚至是马桶里的弄来的不怎么干净的水来说，再好不过了。"

#. ~ Description of "heat pack"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A chemical heat pack, used to treat sports injuries and heat food.  It is usable only once."
msgstr "一次性加热贴，可以被用来处理伤口或者加热食物。"

#. ~ Description of "used heat pack"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A chemical heat pack, used to treat sports injuries and heat food.  This one has been used up and is chemically inert, rendering it useless."
msgstr "一次性加热贴，可以被用来处理伤口或者加热食物，但这个加热贴已经被用过了，现在没用了。"

#. ~ Description of "clay teapot"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A clay teapot.  Now all you need is tea and water."
msgstr "一个陶茶壶，再来点茶叶和水。"

#. ~ Description of "clay pot"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A crude clay pot with a lid, used for cooking."
msgstr "一个粗糙的带把陶锅，可以用来做饭。"

#. ~ Description of "can sealer"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A hand-crank-powered cast steel machine designed to automatically seal tin cans."
msgstr "手摇驱动的铸铁机器，用于自动封装罐头。"

#. ~ Description of "manual oil press"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A hand-cranked press for creating vegetable oil.  A hotplate heats the raw material to increase extraction efficiency."
msgstr "一台手摇式压榨机，用于制作植物油。有台电炉加热原料以提高萃取效率。"

#. ~ Description of "coffeemaker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A heating element with a pot and a frame for holding coffee or other powders.  You can use it to make coffee, or other drinks if you so choose."
msgstr "一套带有壶和粉末滤网的加热器具。你可以拿它来煮咖啡，或者你想要的其它饮料。"

#. ~ Description of "induction hotplate"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A high end hotplate that utilizes magnetic induction coils to heat ferrous cookware directly.  It is far more efficient than a standard hotplate."
msgstr "一种利用磁感应线圈直接加热铁质炊具的高端加热板。它比标准的火锅效率高得多。"

#. ~ Description of "microwave"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A home microwave, has probably seen its share of baked beans."
msgstr "一个家用微波炉，也许有人用它烤过豆子。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift vacuum sealer"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A homemade heat sealer unit with an air pump.  It's used for vacuum packing food to preserve it."
msgstr "自制的便携式真空热封口机，用于包装真空食品以延长食物保质期。"

#. ~ Description of "survivor mess kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A homemade mess kit containing everything you might need for creating post-apocalyptic cuisine.  Powered by a kerosene burner, it is composed of simple yet durable tools and materials."
msgstr "一个自制的野炊套装，里面装满了各类用来烹饪后大灾变菜肴的必需工具。以煤油炉供热，全套套装都是由简单而耐用的工具和材料组成。"

#. ~ Description of "butchering kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A kit containing all the specialized knives you need to debone, skin, and prepare cuts of meat from an animal."
msgstr "一套各式各样的专业刀具，能满足你一切去骨，剥皮等屠宰加工需求。"

#. ~ Description of "food processor"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A kitchen appliance capable of slicing, chopping, shredding, grinding, pureeing, and mixing."
msgstr "一种厨房用具，可用于切片、剁块、绞碎、研磨、打泥和搅拌。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift pressure cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A large pot with 20 gauge walls and a thick aluminum bottom, modified to serve as a bulky but passable pressure cooker."
msgstr "一个经过改装的锅壁和锅底有20Ga.（译注：约为0.81mm）厚的大铝锅，可以作为一个笨重但可堪一用的高压锅。"

#. ~ Description of "still"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A large still, useful for creating distillations of alcohol and other, more curious substances.  Features a slot for a thermometer."
msgstr "一个大型蒸馏器，用来制取酒精和其他更为奇妙物质的蒸馏物。有一个温度计槽。"

#. ~ Description of "hexamine stove"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A lightweight, folding stove designed to use small hexamine tablets for cooking.  Also known as an Esbit stove."
msgstr "一种轻便的折叠炉，使用乌洛托品进行加热。也被称为易斯比特炉。"

#. ~ Description of "coal/charcoal cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A little metal tank for holding coal or charcoal, with a pilot light attached and a pipe to vent toxic coal fumes.  You could use it for cooking food."
msgstr "一个小型金属罐，可填充煤炭或是木炭，配有点火装置和排出有害煤炭烟气的管道。你可以用它来烹饪食物。"

#. ~ Description of "pasta extruder"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A pasta extruder powered by a hand crank.  Useful in making pasta.  It comes with various heads to make various kinds of pasta."
msgstr "一个手摇挤面机。拥有一整套面嘴，能够挤出各种面条。"

#. ~ Description of "charcoal smoker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A portable charcoal smoker.  Good for weekend barbecuing and preserving meat with smoke.  Cannot be used with coal; the toxic fumes would ruin the meat."
msgstr "一台便携式木炭烤架。周末BBQ和制烟熏肉的好帮手。不能使用煤炭，因为有毒烟气会破坏肉的质量。"

#. ~ Description of "vacuum sealer"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A portable heat sealer unit with an air pump.  It's used for vacuum packing food to preserve it."
msgstr "自制的便携式真空热封口机，用于包装真空食品以延长食物保质期。"

#. ~ Description of "wicker sieve"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A primitive sieve constructed from woven strips of plant material.  Early sieves like this were used to sift grain, though the openings on this one are too small for that."
msgstr "一个用植物编织成的粗糙筛子。这种筛子在人类历史早期被用于筛选谷物，但是这个筛子的网孔太小，没法用来筛谷物。"

#. ~ Description of "pressure cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A sealable pot, designed to cook food at higher pressures and temperatures.  Useful for all kinds of cooking, and it can also be used for pressure-sensitive chemical reactions."
msgstr "一种可密封的锅，用于在更高的压力和温度下烹饪食物。适用于各种烹饪，也可用于压敏化学反应。"

#. ~ Description of "sealed yeast culture"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "A sealed jar holding sanitized yeast wort.  You may harvest the yeast inside when it's done culturing."
msgstr "装满了洗干净的酵母增殖原料的密封罐。当发酵完毕你就可以收获酵母了。"

#. ~ Description of "mess kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A self-contained camping mess kit, containing everything you might need for wilderness cooking."
msgstr "一个独立的露营餐包，里面有你在野外烹饪时可能需要的一切。"

#. ~ Description of "mortar and pestle"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple combination of a small grindstone and a bowl-shaped stone.  Used for grinding grain, but time-consuming compared to more complex methods."
msgstr "一个小磨石和一个碗石的简单组合。用于研磨谷物，但比复杂的方法耗时。"

#. ~ Description of "stone quern"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple hand-powered stone quern with a wooden handle, for grinding grain."
msgstr "一个造型简单，带有木把手的手推石磨，用来磨面粉。"

#. ~ Description of "acetylene cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple heater powered by acetylene welding gas.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr "用乙炔焊气供能的简单加热器。设计上用来烹饪食物。"

#. ~ Description of "biogas cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple heater powered by biogas.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr "一只被设计成用汽油来加热食物的简单炉子。"

#. ~ Description of "gasoline cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple heater powered by gasoline.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr "一只被设计成用汽油来加热食物的简单炉子。"

#. ~ Description of "kerosene cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple heater powered by kerosene.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr "一只被设计成用煤油来加热食物的简单炉子。"

#. ~ Description of "propane cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple heater powered by propane.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr "一只被设计成用丙烷来加热食物的简单炉子。"

#. ~ Description of "hotplate"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A small heating element on a stand, powered by your electric grid.  It is indispensable for cooking and chemistry.  Try not to burn yourself."
msgstr "一个小小的带插头的加热装置，无论是烹饪还是做化学药剂都必不可少。用的时候可得小心，可别把自己给煮了。"

#. ~ Description of "teapot"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A small metal teapot.  Teatime wouldn't be complete without one."
msgstr "小金属茶壶，没有它的存在你的下午茶时间就是不完整的。"

#. ~ Description of "toaster"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A small two-slice toaster, can be used to toast toast and few other things."
msgstr "一个小巧的两片型烤面包机，如今几乎已经没用，但你可以使用工具拆解出其中的零件。"

#. ~ Description of "waffle iron"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A waffle iron, generally used for making waffles."
msgstr "一个华夫饼烤盘，一般用于制作华夫饼。"

#. ~ Description of "food dehydrator"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "An electric food dehydrator, invaluable in preserving food.  Can be connected to the electric grid using cord."
msgstr "电子食品脱水机，保存食品的无价之宝。 可以用电线连接到电网。"

#. ~ Description of "electric carver (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "An electric meat carver powered by a cable.  It has two serrated blades that vibrate together to slice just about anything from turkey to ham."
msgstr "一把使用电池供电的切肉刀。一副共同振动的锯齿状刀刃从火鸡到火腿都能轻松切开……甚至丧尸！"

#. ~ Description of "slow-sand water filter"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "An improvised water filter made from a plastic bucket filled with a layer of sand and a layer of gravel.  It can be used to remove particulates and some pathogens from water, but it is not 100% effective."
msgstr "一种简易滤水器，由装满一层沙子和一层砾石的塑料桶制成。  它可以用来去除水中的颗粒物和一些病原体，但并不是100%有效。"

#. ~ Description of "soda can stove kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "An ultra-light alcohol-burning stove with a simmer ring, crafted by hand from a couple of aluminum soda cans.  It comes with a 500 mL plastic bottle to hold concentrated alcohol fuel."
msgstr "一个超轻型酒精燃烧炉，有着用铝罐手工加工而成的火力密封环。它配备了一个500毫升的塑料瓶，以容纳提炼过的酒精燃料。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift sieve"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "Some fine steel mesh attached to a length of thicker steel wire, forming a rigid frame.  Useful for sieving."
msgstr "一张简易筛网，由较粗钢丝制成的硬质边框附着细钢网。适用于筛选或过滤。"

#. ~ value of variable 'sound_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_running__carver" in use action of item "electric carver
#. (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "The electric carver buzzes."
msgstr "电动雕刻刀嗡嗡作响。"

#. ~ value of variable 'success_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_activate__carver" in use action of item "electric carver
#. (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "The electric carver's serrated blades start buzzing!"
msgstr "电动切肉刀的齿刃开始滋滋振动！"

#. ~ Description of "electric carver (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This carver is on and the blades are buzzing.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "这把切肉刀已经启动，刀锋正嗡嗡作响。激活它来关闭。"

#. ~ Description of "atomic coffeemaker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This is a Curie-G coffeemaker, by CuppaTech.  It famously uses a radioactive generator to heat water for coffee, reducing the amount of total electricity it consumes.  Consumer safety concerns led to it being banned in the EU as well as many other countries, but don't let that stop you from brewing your morning Joe with the power of the atom™!"
msgstr "这是茶杯科技制造的\"居里-G\"型咖啡机。它以使用放射性发电机加热咖啡从而减少了总用电量而闻名。由于可能会对消费者产生安全问题，它在欧盟和许多其他国家被禁止，但不要让这件事阻止你用原子™的力量制造你的早晨咖啡!"

#. ~ Description of "screw press"
#. ~ Description of "nearby warp obelisk"
#. ~ Description of "nearby infinity tree"
#. ~ Description of "nearby infinity stone"
#. ~ Description of "nearby infinity ore"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "This is a crafting_pseudo_item if you have it something is wrong."
msgstr "这是一个虚拟物品，正常不应该出现在你的游戏里。"

#. ~ Description of "sieve"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This is no mere strainer for noodles; it's a laboratory-grade sieve used to separate particles of certain sizes.  You could use this to do a really good job sifting flour, remove dust and soil from grain, or perhaps conduct gradation tests for any civil engineers you might know.  This one has been constructed from steel mesh."
msgstr "这可不是用来捞面的滤网，而是一个用来过滤特定尺寸颗粒的实验室级筛子。用这个东西你可以很好地筛面粉，从谷物中筛除尘土，或者用于土木工程的粒度分级试验。这个筛子是由钢丝网做成的。"

#. ~ Description of "fermenting eggs jar"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "This jar contains a batch of eggs in a pickling solution.  You can seal up the jar once the process is completed."
msgstr "这个玻璃罐里储存了一批发酵中的醋泡蛋。可在发酵完成后封装以长期储存。"

#. ~ Description of "fermenting pickle jar"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "This jar contains a batch of pickles set to ferment.  You can seal up the jar once the process is completed."
msgstr "这个玻璃罐里储存了一批发酵中的腌黄瓜。可在发酵完成后封装以长期储存。"

#. ~ Description of "fermenting sauerkraut jar"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "This jar contains a batch of sauerkraut set to ferment.  You can seal up the jar once the process is completed."
msgstr "这个玻璃罐里储存了一批发酵中的德式酸菜。可在发酵完成后封装以长期储存。"

#. ~ Description of "milk cream jar"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This jar contains raw milk separated into cream.  It is sealed until you are ready to use it."
msgstr "这个大罐储存了分离成奶油的生乳。封装后可长期储存直到你再次将其打开使用。"

#. ~ Description of "rising cream jar"
#. ~ Description of "rising cream jar (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "This jar contains raw milk separating into cream.  You can seal up the jar once the process is completed."
msgstr "这个大罐储存了准备分离奶油的生乳。你可在分离完成后封装以长期储存。"

#. ~ Description of "charcoal water purifier"
#. ~ Description of "large charcoal water purifier"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "Using this item on a container full of water will purify the water using layered charcoal.  Once the charcoal has purified enough water, it will become unusable and can be disassembled and recycled.  Water taken from uncertain sources like a river may be dirty."
msgstr "这个物品专门用来吸取纯净水源，使用三层滤网，和活性木炭过滤，一旦木炭吸取了足够的杂质，将变得无法使用，只能拆解回收。从河流之类的不明水源取得的水有可能被污染。"

