#. ~ Description of "locksmith kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "A locksmith's set of sturdy steel lockpicks and torsion wrenches.  It is essential for silently and quickly opening locks, provided you have some lockpicking and mechanical skills."
msgstr "锁匠用的开锁工具，想安静而迅速地开门就把它带上吧，前提是你的撬锁和机械技能已经点上了。"

#. ~ Description of "crowbar"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "A long prying tool with a slender wedge at either end.  Use it to open locked doors without destroying them, or to lift manhole covers."
msgstr "一个小型撬棍，一端有一个带爪的弯曲用于拔出铁钉，可以轻易进出别人的家里而不破坏门或者用来开启下水沟井盖，还可以潇洒的敲开丧尸的脑袋。"

#. ~ Description of "rudimentary lockpick"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "A pair of thin pieces of metal, one bent in an 'L' shape to push tumblers and the other acting as a torsion wrench.  These tools are almost totally inadequate for picking locks, but when you've got nothing else, it might work."
msgstr "一对金属丝，一个弯曲成\"L\"形，用来撬动锁栓，另一个更加结实的则用来施加扭力。这对马马虎虎的工具几乎完全不适合撬锁，但当你没有其他工具时，凑合用吧。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift crowbar"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "A pipe with both ends bent and hammered flat to resemble a crowbar.  It's a poor weapon and a terrible prying tool, but sometimes you have to make do."
msgstr "两端弯曲并锤平以类似于撬棍的管子。  这是一种很差劲的武器，也是一种可怕的窥探工具，但有时你不得不凑合着用。"

#. ~ Description of "ice axe"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "A short ice axe with a spiked head and a small hammer on the other end, a multi-purpose hiking and climbing tool used by mountaineers.  It is sturdy enough to lift manhole covers."
msgstr "一种短冰斧，头部带有尖刺，另一端装有小锤子，是登山者使用的多用途徒步登山工具。  它足够坚固，可以提起井盖。"

#. ~ Description of "improvised lockpick"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "An improvised pick and torsion wrench made from scrap metal.  You'll need MacGyver-like skills to open locks with these as they are brittle, but they lower the chances of alarms being set off."
msgstr "简易的撬锁工具，用一块金属碎片做成，用它来撬锁对一般人来说有些强人所难，不过，它确实能降低触发警报的几率。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "bio lockpick"
msgid_plural "bio lockpicks"
msgstr[0] "生化开锁器"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "crowbar"
msgid_plural "crowbars"
msgstr[0] "撬棍"

#. ~ Item name
