#. ~ Description of "makeshift shotshell 'press'"
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "A collection of items improvised for field reloading of shotshells.  A plank with a hole cut in the center, a medium-sized nail, and a whittled dowel are used to seat wads, decap primers, and (carefully!) reprime hulls.  Powder and shot are measured with a cut-down shotshell hull.  The opposite side of the plank has been shaped to allow for roll-crimping of the plastic hulls.  There's no provision for resizing, so reloaded hulls will fire best in the firearm they were fired from."
msgstr "一套可以用来随时重新装填霰弹的简易装置。它由一根中间开孔的木板、一根中号钉子和一根木销组成，分别用于放置填料、打开并（小心地）装上底火。火药和弹丸通过一颗切短的霰弹壳来称量。木板的另一侧被制成能够碾压卷曲塑料弹壳的形状。这套装置不能改弹药口径，因此复装的霰弹在之前发射的枪里发射效果最好。"

#. ~ Description of "hand press"
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "A small hand press for hand loading firearm ammunition.  It comes with everything you need to start hand loading your own munitions."
msgstr "小型的手工压弹机，足够你进行各种复装弹药制备。"

#. ~ Description of "kinetic bullet puller"
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "A tool used for properly disassembling firearm ammunition."
msgstr "一个用来拆解子弹的装置。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "hand press"
msgid_plural "hand presses"
msgstr[0] "手动压弹机"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "kinetic bullet puller"
msgid_plural "kinetic bullet pullers"
msgstr[0] "反冲拆弹锤"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "makeshift shotshell 'press'"
msgid_plural "makeshift shotshell 'presses'"
msgstr[0] "简易霰弹\"压弹机\""

#. ~ Description of "integrated welder"
#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
msgid "Integrated bionic miniature welding tool implanted in your fingers."
msgstr "内置小型生化焊接工具被植入到了你的手指中。"

#. ~ Description of "integrated multimeter"
#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
