#. ~ Description of "plastic rake"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A cheap plastic rake.  Will break quite quickly if used for anything other than raking leaves."
msgstr "一把廉价的塑料耙子。如果把它用于除了耙树叶以外的任何用途，都会很快损坏它。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic snow shovel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A cheap plastic shovel used for picking up snow and moving it somewhere else.  It was useful before the cataclysm, but now it's useless."
msgstr "一种便宜的塑料铲，用来将雪铲除并把它移到其他地方。它在大灾难之前很有用，但现在已经没用了。"

#. ~ Description of "hedge trimmer (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  A long line of sharp-edged teeth extends from the engine; turning the trimmer on will make them rapidly vibrate.  The poor man's chainsaw as far as the zombies are concerned."
msgstr "一把汽油动力的灌木修剪机。马达连着一条长链，上面是锋利的锯齿，如果启动修剪机的话它们会快速振动。如果被丧尸缠上了，就把它当成电锯来用吧……"

#. ~ Description of "wooden shovel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A crude shovel with a shovelhead made from wood, historically used as an alternative to metal shovels when metal was too expensive.  It works passably well, but really can't compare to a metal shovel."
msgstr "一把粗糙的铲子，铲头由木头制成，在历史上金属太贵时用作金属铲子的替代品。它功能类似铲子，但比真正的铲子差太多。"

#. ~ Description of "shovel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A digging tool.  Use it to dig pits adjacent to your location."
msgstr "一个挖坑工具，你可以用它在你周围挖坑。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze hoe"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A farming implement made from bronze.  The added heft and durability should let you till soil for farming more easily as well."
msgstr "一把用青铜制成的农具，但增加的重量和耐用性应该让你更容易耕作土壤。"

#. ~ Description of "hoe"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A farming implement.  You can use it to turn tillable land into a slow-to-cross pile of dirt, or dig a shallow pit."
msgstr "一件农具。可用于把可耕种土地锄成难以穿行的土堆，或者挖一个浅坑。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze sickle"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A handheld grass-cutting tool with a cast bronze blade, fastened to a wood handle wrapped with leather."
msgstr "一把手持割草工具，带有铸造而成的青铜刀片，固定在用皮革包裹的木把手上。"

#. ~ Description of "digging stick"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A large stick with the end carved into a broad blade for digging.  It could be used to dig shallow pits, but not deep ones."
msgstr "一根长长的木棍，底端削成了类似锄头的宽刃形状。可以用来挖掘浅坑，但是挖不了多深。"

#. ~ Description of "stone sickle"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A primitive tool for cutting grass.  The sharp, crescent-shaped stone at the end of the handle is barely good enough for the job."
msgstr "一个用来割草的简易工具。手柄末端是一块磨尖的新月形石头，只能勉强完成这项工作。"

#. ~ Description of "trowel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A small, sharp gardening shovel, perfect for digging up grubs and worms."
msgstr "一把小巧的，锋利的园艺铲，非常适合挖掘蛴螬和蠕虫。"

#. ~ Description of "metal rake"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A sturdy metal rake, a must-have during autumn."
msgstr "一把结实的金属耙子，秋季收获必备农具。"

#. ~ Description of "snow shovel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A sturdy metal shovel used for picking up snow and moving it somewhere else.  It was useful before the cataclysm, but now it's useless."
msgstr "一种结实的金属铲，用来将雪铲除并把它移到其他地方。它在大灾难之前很有用，但现在已经没用了。"

#. ~ Description of "sickle"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "An old-fashioned farming tool for cutting tall grass."
msgstr "一把用于割杂草的老式农具的无趣、廉价的复制品。"

#. ~ Description of "scythe"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "An old-fashioned farming tool used to cut tall grass.  Despite being a giant blade on the end of a stick, it is incredibly awkward to use for anything but its intended purpose."
msgstr "老式农业工具，专门用来割杂草。尽管它的棍子末端装上了一片巨大的刀片，但除了本来的用途之外，它非常难以用于任何其他用途。"

#. ~ value of variable 'sound_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_running__trimmer" in use action of item "hedge trimmer
#. (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "The hedge trimmer rumbles."
msgstr "绿篱修剪机隆隆作响。"

#. ~ Description of "hedge trimmer (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "This hedge trimmer is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "这台绿篱修剪机已开启，正发出很大噪音。使用它可以将其关闭。"

#. ~ value of variable 'success_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_activate__trimmer" in use action of item "hedge trimmer
#. (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "With a roar, the hedge trimmer leaps to life!"
msgstr "随着一声轰鸣，绿篱机猛烈的旋动起来！"

