#. ~ Description of "electric lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A battery-powered lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time."
msgstr "一盏电提灯，灯光虽然不是很亮，但是可以持续亮很久。"

#. ~ Description of "active flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A bright burning flare that is producing light.  It will last for about a minute before burning out."
msgstr "产生光的明亮燃烧耀斑。  它会持续大约一分钟，然后就会熄灭。"

#. ~ Description of "active flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A burning magnesium flare that is producing light.  It will last for about a half hour before burning out."
msgstr "这个镁制照明弹正在不停地燃烧，大约半小时后熄灭。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty flashlight (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A heavy-duty aluminum LED flashlight, often used by security guards.  It even works underwater, and it's not bad for smacking hooligans."
msgstr "一种重型铝制LED手电筒，保安经常使用它。它甚至可以在水下工作，而且拿来打流氓也不错。"

#. ~ Description of "kerosene lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A kerosene-fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "以煤油为燃料的灯。  它提供的光线不多，但持续时间很长。  它已打开。  用它来将其关闭。"

#. ~ Description of "kerosene lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A kerosene-fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "以煤油为燃料的灯。  它提供的光线不多，但持续时间很长。  用它来打开它。"

#. ~ Description of "torch"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A large stick wrapped in rags that are soaked with flammable material.  It is burning, producing plenty of light."
msgstr "浸透了可燃材料的布胡乱地缠在棍子上，正在燃烧，光芒四射。"

#. ~ Description of "torch"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A large stick wrapped in rags that are soaked with flammable material.  When lit, it produces a fair amount of light.  You'll need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr "浸透了可燃材料的布胡乱地缠在棍子上，点燃了似乎就能照亮四周。找个打火机或者划根火柴点着它。"

#. ~ Description of "reading light"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A little clip-on LED light, meant for reading books in the dark."
msgstr "一个带夹子的小型LED灯，能让你在黑暗中阅读书籍。"

#. ~ Description of "reading light (active)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A little clip-on LED light, meant for reading books in the dark.  This one is turned on."
msgstr "一个带夹子的小型LED灯，能让你在黑暗中阅读书籍。现在开着。"

#. ~ Description of "diving flashlight (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A little waterproof light.  It can easily be clipped to a belt or a helmet, or to some diving masks."
msgstr "一个小型的防水手电筒，配有铝制握柄，由电池供电。可以固定在一些潜水面罩和头套上使用。"

#. ~ Description of "LED strip (inactive)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A one meter strip of LED lights, usually used for decoration or accent lighting."
msgstr "一条一米长的LED灯带，通常用于装饰或氛围照明。"

#. ~ Description of "flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A slow-burning magnesium flare.  Use it to strike the striker and light it.  It will produce a bright light for about a half hour."
msgstr "一个缓慢燃烧的镁制照明弹。激活后，它会持续发出约半个小时的强光。"

#. ~ Description of "glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A small blue-light glowstick.  Use it to bend the plastic and break the glass cylinder inside to start the reaction.  It will produce a small amount of light."
msgstr "小小的蓝色荧光棒，弯曲一下就能产生光，当然，不怎么亮就是了。"

#. ~ Description of "gasoline lantern (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A small gasoline-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "小型汽油燃料灯笼。它的光线较弱，但它的持续时间较长。它正亮着呢，不用时请关掉它。"

#. ~ Description of "gasoline lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A small gasoline-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "小型汽油燃料灯笼。它的光线较弱，但它的持续时间较长。用的时候请打开它。"

#. ~ Description of "propane lantern (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A small propane-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "小型丙烷燃料灯笼。它的光线较弱，但它的持续时间较长。它正亮着呢，不用时请关掉它。"

#. ~ Description of "propane lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A small propane-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "小型丙烷燃料灯笼。它的光线较弱，但它的持续时间较长。用的时候请打开它。"

#. ~ Description of "smart lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A smart lamp that can be activated remotely."
msgstr "这是一个遥控灯，它可以遥控激活。"

#. ~ Description of "smart lamp (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A smart lamp which can be deactivated remotely.  Currently it is turned on."
msgstr "一种可以远程遥控的智能灯。目前它已打开。"

#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil lamp.  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to be extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  Use it to light it."
msgstr "一个带有灯芯的特殊小陶罐，是一种古老的油灯形式。与更新的设计不同，它不防风，因此如果暴露在风中，火焰可能会熄灭；最好在室内使用。它提供的光不多，但能持续很长时间。使用它以点燃。"

#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil lamp.  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to be extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not provide much light, but lasts a long time.  It is lit, consuming oil and providing light.  Use it to extinguish the flame."
msgstr "一个带有灯芯的特殊小陶罐，是一种古老的油灯形式。与更新的设计不同，它不防风，因此如果暴露在风中，火焰可能会熄灭；最好在室内使用。它已经被点燃，消耗灯油并提供光亮。使用它以熄灭火焰。"

#. ~ Description of "dead glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A spent glowstick.  It is essentially trash."
msgstr "用过的荧光棒，没什么用了，有兴趣可以留着。"

#. ~ Description of "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A thick wax candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn for quite a long time.  This candle is lit."
msgstr "一只点亮的粗蜡烛，除了提供足够时间的可怜照明亮度之外，也可能有些奇奇怪怪的用途。"

#. ~ Description of "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A thick wax candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn for quite a long time.  You'll need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr "一只熄灭的粗蜡烛，除了提供足够时间的可怜照明亮度之外，也可能有些奇奇怪怪的用途。"

#. ~ Description of "flashlight (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A typical household flashlight with a plastic handle, powered by batteries."
msgstr "一种典型的家用手电筒，塑料手柄，电池供电。"

#. ~ Description of "active glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "An active glowstick, currently producing light.  It will last for a few hours before burning out."
msgstr "被激活内在化学反应而正在发出微光的荧光棒，只能亮几个小时。"

#. ~ Description of "acetylene lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "An antique brass lamp designed to run from a pressurized cylinder of acetylene.  It is an efficient, if somewhat dangerous, light source."
msgstr "一件仿古的黄铜油灯，设计成使用压缩乙炔气罐。是个有效而又有些危险的光源。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "atomic headlamp"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "atomic lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Close cover"
