#. ~ Description of "atomic lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this device will provide just enough light to read by for at least a decade.  Use it to close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr "由核衰变和低能耗LED灯的神奇力量驱动，这台装置能提供至少持续十年的阅读光线。使用它可以合上盖子以遮住光线。"

#. ~ Description of "atomic lamp (covered)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at least a decade.  It is also available with a cute cartoon bear cover to turn it into a nightlight for a very wealthy child with a fear of the dark.  The cover is closed.  Use it to open the cover and show the light."
msgstr "这种昂贵的小灯由核衰变和低能量 LED 的魔力提供动力，提供的光线足以阅读至少十年。  它还配有可爱的卡通熊盖，可以将其变成夜灯，供害怕黑暗的非常富有的孩子使用。  盖子已关闭。  用它打开盖子并显示灯光。"

