#. ~ Description of "RX12 jet injector"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A Rivtech RX12 jet injector, a small pistol-shaped device used to inject advanced fast-healing chemicals through the skin without using a needle.  A label on the side warns against using more than two doses per hour."
msgstr "Rivtech RX12射流注射器是一种小型的疗伤用无针头注射器，通过皮肤直接将高效的快速治疗药剂注入身体。手枪外形，旁边的标签上印有每小时使用不得超过两次的警告文字。"

#. ~ Description of "wrapped radiation badge"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A badge that detects radiation dosage, sealed in a radiation-blocking bag.  Use it to remove it from the bag."
msgstr "一块用来检测辐射量的徽章，密闭在防辐射的包装袋中。使用它以将其从包装中取出。"

#. ~ Description of "huge saline infusion kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A huge, sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy, with rubber tube and cannula - all you need to perform an infusion.  Holds two liters of completely sterile saline, therefore it is safe to put it inside your veins, if you know how."
msgstr "一个用于静脉输液的超大型密封塑料袋，带有橡胶管和静脉导管，有了它你就可以进行输液。里面装着 2 升的无菌生理盐水，可以安全地注射到静脉中，如果你懂得怎么操作的话。"

#. ~ Description of "blood draw kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A kit for drawing blood, including a test tube for holding the sample.  Use this tool to draw blood, either from yourself or from a corpse you are standing on."
msgstr "一套能用来采集血液的工具，附带一根用来保存血样的试管。使用它来抽血，可以是从你自己身上抽血，或者是你当前所站位置的尸体身上抽血。"

#. ~ Description of "anesthesia kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A kit for inducing anesthesia for surgery, containing specialized canisters with a variety of powerful hypnotic, analgesic, and stimulative drugs.  It's intended for use in specialized medical equipment, and can't be administered manually."
msgstr "一整套用于手术麻醉的工具，内含装有各种强力催眠剂、止痛剂及兴奋剂的瓶子。该工具箱设计主要用于专业医疗设备使用，暂时无法直接使用。"

#. ~ Description of "large saline infusion kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A large, sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy, with rubber tube and cannula - all you need to perform an infusion.  Holds a liter of completely sterile saline, therefore it is safe to put it inside your veins, if you know how."
msgstr "一个用于静脉输液的大型密封塑料袋，带有橡胶管和静脉导管，有了它你就可以进行输液。里面装着 1 升的无菌生理盐水，可以安全地注射到静脉中，如果你懂得怎么操作的话。"

#. ~ Description of "syringe"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A medical syringe.  Used for administering intravenous drugs."
msgstr "一支医用针筒，可以用来注射海洛因或其他毒品。"

#. ~ Description of "medical scissors"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A pair of medical scissors, typically used by nurses or paramedics to cut bandages or fabric."
msgstr "一把医用剪刀，通常由护士或护理人员用来剪绷带或织物。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift gauze patch"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A palm-sized square of absorbent material with adhesive tape along the edges, designed for easy application.  It's neither professional nor sterile, but maybe this isn't the time to be choosy."
msgstr "手掌大小的正方形吸收材料，边缘带有胶带，设计方便使用。  这既不专业也不乏味，但也许现在不是挑剔的时候。"

#. ~ Description of "adhesive gauze patch"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A palm-sized square of sterile fabric with adhesive tape along the edges, designed for easy application."
msgstr "一块手掌大小的无菌纱布方块，四周带有粘胶，方便直接贴在伤口上。"

#. ~ Description of "thermometer"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A plastic thermometer that can read the air temperature."
msgstr "一个塑料的温度计，可以让你知道当前气温。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift bandage"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A reasonably clean strip of cloth ready for use as a simple bandage."
msgstr "一块相当干净的棉布卷起来做成的简易绷带。有总比没有好。"

#. ~ Description of "saline infusion kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy, with rubber tube and cannula - all you need to perform an infusion.  Holds 500 mL of completely sterile saline, therefore it is safe to put it inside your veins, if you know how."
msgstr "一个用于静脉输液的密封塑料袋，带有橡胶管和静脉导管，有了它你就可以进行输液。里面装着 500 毫升的无菌生理盐水，可以安全地注射到静脉中，如果你懂得怎么操作的话。"

#. ~ Description of "small oxygen delivery kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A small tank of compressed medical oxygen with a folding regulator and mask.  Commonly used in emergency situations, it provides immediate relief for asthma attacks or smoke inhalation, and can provide a brief burst of energy."
msgstr "一小罐医用压缩氧，附带调节器和面罩。能够迅速缓解哮喘症状和烟雾吸入损伤，也能让你在短时间内精神满满。"

#. ~ Description of "small saline infusion kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A small, sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy, with rubber tube and cannula - all you need to perform an infusion.  Holds 250 mL of completely sterile saline, therefore it is safe to put it inside your veins, if you know how."
msgstr "一个用于静脉输液的小型密封塑料袋，带有橡胶管和静脉导管，有了它你就可以进行输液。里面装着 250 毫升的无菌生理盐水，可以安全地注射到静脉中，如果你懂得怎么操作的话。"

#. ~ Description of "bandage"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A sterile roll of cloth.  Used for stopping blood loss and protecting wounds from aggravation to help them heal faster."
msgstr "一条无菌布绷带。用于阻止失血和保护伤口免受恶化，以助于更快地愈合。"

#. ~ Description of "sanitized makeshift bandage"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A strip of cloth that has been thoroughly decontaminated to improve its effectiveness as a bandage."
msgstr "经过彻底净化以提高其绷带效果的布条。"

#. ~ Description of "oxygen delivery kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A tank of compressed medical oxygen with a regulator and mask.  Commonly used in emergency situations, it provides immediate relief for asthma attacks or smoke inhalation, and can provide a brief burst of energy."
msgstr "一罐医用压缩氧，附带调节器和面罩。能够迅速缓解哮喘症状和烟雾吸入损伤，也能让你在短时间内精神满满。"

#. ~ Description of "band-aid"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A tiny square of gauze stuck to a strip of sticky tape, usually used for quickly covering superficial wounds."
msgstr "粘在一条胶带上的小方块纱布，通常用于快速覆盖浅表伤口。"

#. ~ Description of "scalpel"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A very sharp knife designed for surgical cutting.  Its small, sharp blade allows for precision strikes in the hands of the skilled."
msgstr ""
"一把小型的，非常锋利的刀具，被广泛应用于各项外科手术中。如果你很擅长近战武器的话，它也会是一件大杀器。\n"
"\"在寂静岭医院工作的护士们用此解剖过无数活人。\""

#. ~ Description of "alcohol wipe"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A wet wipe saturated with alcohol and stored in a sterile package."
msgstr "一种用酒精浸透并储存在无菌包装中的湿巾。常用于个人卫生或小伤口消毒。"

#. ~ Description of "inhaler"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "An albuterol inhaler.  Used in the treatment of bronchospasm, it is a lifeline for people with asthma.  A mild stimulant, it may cause anxiety or tremors."
msgstr "沙丁胺醇吸入剂。用于治疗支气管痉挛，是哮喘患者救命恩人。一种温和的兴奋剂，它可能导致焦虑或震颤。"

#. ~ Description of "cotton balls"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "Fluffy balls of clean, white cotton.  They can serve as makeshift bandages in an emergency."
msgstr "毛茸茸的白棉球。紧急情况下可以勉强作为简易绷带使用。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "small saline infusion kit"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "saline infusion kit"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "large saline infusion kit"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "huge saline infusion kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "Infuse saline"
msgstr "输注生理盐水"

#. ~ Description of "first aid spray"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "Polymer dissolved in a disinfectant solution for minor cuts and scrapes, packaged in a tiny bottle with an atomizer spray for convenient application.  When applied, it quickly bonds to the skin and dries to stop bleeding and form a protective barrier against microbes."
msgstr "将聚合物溶解在消毒剂溶液中以防止轻微割伤和擦伤，包装在一个带有雾化器喷雾的小瓶子中，方便使用。  使用后，它会迅速粘合到皮肤上并干燥以止血并形成针对微生物的保护屏障。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
