msgstr[0] "温度计"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "wrapped radiation badge"
msgid_plural "wrapped radiation badges"
msgstr[0] "辐射侦测徽章（已包装）"

#. ~ Description of "swage and die set"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A big steel block with various holes and grooves in it, accompanied by some oddly-shaped metal pegs.  These items are essential for shaping metal during the forging process."
msgstr "一块大钢块，上面有各种孔和凹槽，还附有一些形状怪异的金属钉。  这些物品对于锻造过程中金属成型至关重要。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze anvil"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A block of oddly-shaped bronze complete with a pritchel hole and hardy hole.  Once installed, it can be used in most metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr "一块形状奇特的青铜，上面有一个冲凿孔和一个插模孔。安装后可在大多数金属加工制作中使用。"

#. ~ Description of "finished charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A charcoal kiln that has finished burning.  Disassemble it to get the charcoal."
msgstr "一只完成燃烧的炭窑。拆解它以回收木炭。"

#. ~ Description of "crude bronze nail"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A crude bronze nail.  Probably not useful for many things due to its size and shape."
msgstr "粗制的青铜钉。  由于其尺寸和形状，可能对很多事情没有用处。"

#. ~ Description of "gas forge"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A gas-fueled metalworking forge.  With the right tools, you could use this for metalworking."
msgstr "一种便携式燃气金工锻造工具。搭配合适当的工具，你可以用它来加工金属物品。"

#. ~ Description of "hotcut"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A hardened chisel-like object for metalsmithing.  It's used to cut lengths of metal in some metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr "这是一种用于金属锻造的坚硬凿子。在某些金属加工制造配方中，用来将金属切割成长条。"

#. ~ Description of "drift"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A hardened spike-like object for metalsmithing.  It's used to make holes in metal in some metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr "这是一种用于金属锻造的坚硬锥形冲头。在某些金属加工制造配方中，用来在金属上打孔。"

#. ~ Description of "steel scraper"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A hardened steel tool similar to a drawknife, but for metal."
msgstr "一把由硬钢制成的工具，类似于刮刀，但用于金属。"

#. ~ Description of "anvil"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A heavy block of oddly-shaped steel complete with a pritchel hole and hardy hole.  Once installed, it can be used in most metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr "一块沉重的、形状奇特的钢，上面有一个冲凿孔和一个插模孔。安装后可在大多数金属加工制作中使用。"

#. ~ Description of "filled charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A kiln filled with wood which will become charcoal after a slow period of burning."
msgstr "一只填满木材的炭窑，木材经过缓慢燃烧后将会变成木炭。"

#. ~ Description of "lit charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A kiln full of wood that has been lit; better drop it!"
msgstr "装满木材的制炭窑炉，已经点燃了，你最好把它放下。"

#. ~ Description of "large sandcasting mold"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A large mold for casting molten metals into different shapes."
msgstr "用于将熔融金属铸造成不同形状的大型模具。"

#. ~ Description of "polishing stone"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A large natural stone with a flat surface to grind against."
msgstr "一块天然的大石头，表面平坦可以用来研磨抛光。"

#. ~ Description of "bolt cutters"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A large pair of bolt cutters.  You could use them to cut padlocks or heavy gauge wire."
msgstr "一个用于剪断电线的老虎钳，你还可以用它来剪断铁丝网和锁链。"

#. ~ Description of "long sandcasting mold"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A large, long, mold for casting molten metals into different shapes."
msgstr "一种大而长的模具，用于将熔融金属铸造成不同的形状。"

#. ~ Description of "sandcasting mold"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A medium mold for casting molten metals into different shapes."
msgstr "用于将熔融金属铸造成不同形状的中型模具。"

#. ~ Description of "flatjaw tongs"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A pair of flatjaw tongs.  They are commonly used for metalworking, fabrication, or forging recipes."
msgstr "一把平口钳，通常用于金属加工、制造或锻造配方。"

#. ~ Description of "kitchen tongs"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A pair of long, metal tongs.  They are commonly used for cooking."
msgstr "一把长长的金属夹钳。是常用的烹饪工具。"

#. ~ Description of "sandleather"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A patch of leather paired with a handful of sand.  Works as a substitute for sandpaper."
msgstr "一块沾满了沙子的皮革。用作砂纸的替代品。"

#. ~ Description of "draw plate"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A piece of metal with holes of varying size drilled into it.  Used as part of wire drawing."
msgstr "钻有大小不等的孔的金属片。用作拉丝的工具。"

#. ~ Description of "charcoal forge"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A portable, charcoal-fired metalworking forge.  With the right tools, you could use this for metalworking."
msgstr "一种便携式烧炭金工锻造工具。搭配合适当的工具，你可以用它来加工金属物品。"

#. ~ Description of "clay crucible"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A primitive metalworking crucible made of clay.  Looks like a stout drink tumbler.  You could use it for metalworking."
msgstr "一个小的金属坩埚。看起来像是一杯烈酒。用于某些金属加工制造的模具。"

#. ~ Description of "small anvil"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A proper, albeit small, anvil.  Pretty handy."
msgstr "一个合适的铁砧，尽管很小。  非常方便。"

#. ~ Description of "pedal powered grindstone"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A round, pedal-powered grindstone, useful for grinding metal."
msgstr "一块圆形的脚踏式砂轮，用于磨削金属。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail sheet"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A sheet of riveted chainmail.  With some skill, several of these sheets could be connected to make effective armor."
msgstr "一片铆接而成的锁环网。稍有技巧的人能够将几片锁环网拼接成可用的护甲。"

#. ~ Description of "sandpaper"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A sheet of rough paper.  It is commonly used in metalworking and carpentry."
msgstr "一张粗糙的纸。常用于金属加工和木工。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze chisel"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A short, stout metalworking chisel made of bronze.  It's used in some metalworking fabrication recipes.  Bronze chisels spark less than their steel counterparts, but are less durable."
msgstr "一种由青铜制成的短而坚固的金属加工凿子。  它用于一些金属加工制造配方。  青铜凿子比钢凿子火花少，但耐用性较差。"

#. ~ Description of "metalworking chisel"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A short, stout metalworking chisel.  It's used in some metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr "一个短而粗的金工凿。在某些金属加工制造时使用。"

#. ~ Description of "jeweler's blowtorch"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A small butane blow torch with a pipe to blow into. Used by jewelers to weld soft metals like gold and copper together."
msgstr "一个带有吹管的小型丁烷喷灯。珠宝商用来将金和铜等软金属焊接在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "crucible"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A small metalworking crucible.  Looks like a stout drink tumbler.  It's used in some metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr "一个小的金属坩埚。看起来像是一杯烈酒。用于某些金属加工制造的模具。"

#. ~ Description of "small sandcasting mold"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A small mold for casting molten metals into different shapes."
msgstr "用于将熔融金属铸造成不同形状的小模具。"

#. ~ Description of "charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A stout metal box used for producing charcoal via pyrolysis: the incomplete burning of organic materials in the absence of oxygen."
msgstr "一个结实的金属箱，利用它可以采用热解法烧炭：让有机材料在缺氧环境下不完全燃烧以获得炭。"

#. ~ Description of "blow lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A very early version of a blow torch. Made with a clay bowl that holds a wick and metal tube, it is used by blowing through it to create a precise flame hot enough to weld soft metals like copper and gold. Mainly used for jewelry."
msgstr "喷灯的早期版本。它由装有灯芯和金属管的粘土碗制成，通过吹过它来产生精确的火焰，温度足以焊接铜和金等软金属。主要用于首饰。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy anvil"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "An absolutely enormous block of oddly-shaped steel with all the bells and whistles a blacksmith could ask for on an anvil.  Necessary for heavy-duty metalworking or dropping on roadrunners."
msgstr "一块庞大的、形状奇特的钢，具有铁匠所需的全部功能与附件。在重型金属加工和Herobrine为谋害Steve所建的陷阱中必不可少。"

#. ~ Description of "electric forge"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "An electric metalworking forge, powered by your electric grid.  With the right tools, you could use this for metalworking."
msgstr "一个可用于加工金属的电锻炉，带有一个插头。搭配合适当的工具，你可以用它来加工金属物品。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "filled charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "Light wood"
msgstr "点燃木头"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "lit charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "The kiln is still burning."
msgstr "这个窑仍然在燃烧。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "lit charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "The kiln's embers have died out; you can now disassemble it to get the charcoal."
msgstr "炭窑余烬已经熄灭了。拆解它以回收木炭。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "filled charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "You light the wood."
msgstr "你点燃了木头。"

#. ~ "need_fire_msg" action message of item "filled charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "You need something to light it with!"
msgstr "你需要点火工具！"

