#. ~ Description of "permanent marker"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A King Size™ industrial-strength permanent marker, about halfway between a typical marker and a can of spray paint in size.  Activate it to write something down.  However, writing \"Elbereth\" probably won't help you."
msgstr "King Size牌的工业级记号笔，大小介于一般的记号笔和喷涂罐之间。可以用它来写东西。但是写下\"Elbereth\"可能不会有什么用。（注：Elbereth是NetHack中驱赶怪物的咒语）"

#. ~ Description of "fur rollmat"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A bedroll made of pelts which can be rolled up for transport.  It insulates you from the floor, making it easier to sleep.  Use it to unroll and place on the ground."
msgstr "一床毛皮制成的铺盖，可以卷起来随身携带。垫在地上，让你更容易入睡。"

#. ~ Description of "leather bellow"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A bellow is a device constructed to furnish a strong blast of air"
msgstr "风箱是一种用于提供强力空气的装置"

#. ~ Description of "car horn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A car horn meant to be attached to a car's electrical system."
msgstr "需要连接到汽车电气系统的汽车喇叭。"

#. ~ Description of "whistle multitool"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A cheap gadget combining a whistle, thermometer, magnifying glass, and compass."
msgstr "一个廉价的小玩意儿，结合了口哨，温度计，放大镜，和指南针。"

#. ~ Description of "clay urn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A clay container for storing cremated ashes."
msgstr "用于存放骨灰的黏土容器。"

#. ~ Description of "porcelain urn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A container for holding the remains of a loved one.  Its prior owners must have taken good care of it, as you can see your face reflected clearly upon its surface."
msgstr "用来存放亲人骨灰的容器。它的前主人一定把它照顾得很好，因为你可以看到你的脸清楚地反射在它的表面上。"

#. ~ Description of "cow bell"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A cow bell.  You feel like you need more of it."
msgstr "一个牛铃。你觉得你需要更多。（注：Need more cowbell meme）"

#. ~ Description of "garden hose"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A flexible garden hose.  If you cut it into smaller pieces, it could be used for crafting or siphoning fuel from a vehicle."
msgstr "一根柔软的花园用橡胶软管。可以用来做东西，也可以用来从载具中抽油。"

#. ~ Description of "hand pump"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A hand-powered pump suitable for pumping air into inflatable objects."
msgstr "一个打气筒，可以给任何物体充入空气，比如娃娃。"

#. ~ Description of "handheld glass cutter"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A handheld tool used for controlled breaking of glass.  A necessity for any glass cutting projects."
msgstr "一把可手持的工具，用于让玻璃可控地裂开。任何玻璃切割项目的必需品。"

#. ~ Description of "stun gun"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A high-powered stun gun.  Use this item to attempt to electrocute an adjacent enemy, temporarily paralyzing them."
msgstr "一把高能电击枪。激活以尝试电击身边的敌人，暂时使其瘫痪。"

#. ~ Description of "retractable telescope"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A homemade collapsible telescope, perfect for a pirate.  Too large and inaccurate to use as a weapon scope, but carrying it in your inventory will double the distance that is mapped around you during your travels."
msgstr "一个自制的可折叠式望远镜，非常适合海盗。太大而且精度不高，无法用作武器瞄准镜，但把它带在身上可以让你看到的地图视野距离翻倍。"

#. ~ Description of "etched human skull"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A human skull covered with strange etchings."
msgstr "一个布满奇怪蚀刻图案的人类头骨。"

#. ~ Description of "superglue bottle"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A little plastic bottle with a narrow tip, designed to store and dispense superglue.  It's gunked up with the stuff and wouldn't be good for much else."
msgstr "一个带有窄尖端的小塑料瓶，设计用于储存和分配强力胶。  它被这些东西粘住了，对其他方面没有什么好处。"

#. ~ Description of "can of butane"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A non-refillable can of butane with an adapter for refilling lighters.  It could be useful as a fuel, but also as a solvent or chemical reagent."
msgstr "一种不可再填充的丁烷罐，带有用于可填充打火机的适配器。它可以用作燃料，也可以用作溶剂或化学试剂。"

#. ~ Description of "tear gas sprayer"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A pocket sized plastic canister filled with a pressurized tear gas spray, a step above oleoresin capsicum pepper spray in terms of potency.  Most commonly used by law enforcement and bear-wary hikers, but it became more common in recent months due to anxiety over the riots.  Probably won't do much against a zombie, but should give anything still breathing a rather nasty surprise and give you time to get away.  It contains enough spray for about twenty seconds of continuous application."
msgstr "一个口袋大小的塑料罐，里面装满了加压的催泪瓦斯喷雾，在效力方面比辣椒喷雾高出一截。最常用于执法部门和担心被熊袭击的徒步旅行者，但由于对骚乱的焦虑，近几个月来它变得更加常见。可能对丧尸没有多大作用，但应该会给任何仍在呼吸的东西一个相当恶心的惊喜，并给你时间逃跑。它含有足够的喷雾，可以持续使用约20秒。"

#. ~ Description of "large space heater"
#. ~ Description of "large space heater (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A portable electric heater that steadily emits warm air.  Raises temperature about 10 degrees Celsius, and fills a larger volume of air than the smaller version."
msgstr "一种便携式电加热器，能稳定地放出温暖的空气。将温度升高约10℃，并比小型版本排气量更大。"

#. ~ Description of "small space heater"
#. ~ Description of "small space heater (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A portable electric heater that steadily emits warm air.  Raises temperature about 10 degrees Celsius."
msgstr "一种便携式电加热器，能稳定地放出温暖的空气。将温度升高约10℃。"

#. ~ Description of "travel toilet"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A portable plastic toilet, designed to use plastic bags for waste instead of plumbing."
msgstr "一种便携式塑料厕所，旨在使用塑料袋代替管道来处理废物。"

#. ~ Description of "folded travel toilet"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A portable plastic toilet.  It has been collapsed for easy transport."
msgstr "用于野外旅行的金属餐桌，目前已被折叠起来方便携带。"

#. ~ Description of "sarcophagus access code"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A printout displaying a string of numbers, the passcode to access the elevator in the hazardous waste sarcophagus."
msgstr "一串密码，用来启动通往危险废品储存间的电梯。"

#. ~ Description of "notched plank"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A quarter of a wooden plank with notches cut into it, used with a fire drill to create embers."
msgstr "刻有火种凹槽的木板，用来配合钻木取火器生火。"

#. ~ Description of "safe deposit box"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A secure combination-lock box.  Sadly, you don't know the combination.  Breaking into it would destroy anything of value."
msgstr "一个组合式锁箱，不幸的是，你不知道密码。强行打开的话会破坏里头值钱的东西。"

#. ~ Description of "survival marker"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A sharpened piece of charcoal used as an improvised pencil.  Almost guaranteed to get your hands all covered in charcoal.  Activate it to write something down."
msgstr "只是一块被磨尖的木炭，你为了磨它，弄得整个手都是木炭黑。使用它来写字。"

#. ~ Description of "rollmat"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A sheet of foam which can be rolled tightly for storage.  It insulates you from the floor, making it easier to sleep.  Use it to unroll and place on the ground."
msgstr "卷紧便携的泡沫垫。可以垫在地板上，让你更容易进入梦乡。使用它，即可将它展开、铺在地上。"

#. ~ Description of "bicycle horn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A simple bulb horn found on many bicycles.  Activate it to honk.  Honk honk."
msgstr "一个简单的小铃铛，许多自行车上都可以看到。激活它以发声。"

#. ~ Description of "grip hook"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A simple steel hook with a circular steel handle."
msgstr "一种带有环形钢柄的简易钢钩。"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum stepladder (folded)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A single-story aluminum A-frame ladder, collapsed for transport or storage.  Activate it to set it up."
msgstr "单层铝制 A 形梯，可折叠以便运输或储存。  激活它进行设置。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden stepladder (folded)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A single-story wooden A-frame ladder, collapsed for transport or storage.  Activate it to set it up."
msgstr "一种单层木制 A 形梯，可折叠以便运输或储存。  激活它进行设置。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic gasket"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A single-use plastic gasket."
msgstr "一次性使用的塑料垫片。"

#. ~ Description of "compressed air horn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A small can of compressed air attached to a plastic horn.  Pressing the button on top causes it to emit a loud honking sound."
msgstr "这罐压缩空气被安上了一个塑料的号角，只要轻轻按下罐子上的按钮，就会发出巨大的喇叭声。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic pail"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A small plastic bucket, the kind of thing a child might have built sandcastles with."
msgstr "一个小塑料桶，就像孩子用来建造沙堡的那种东西。"

#. ~ Description of "vortex stone"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A stone with spirals all over it and holes around its perimeter.  Though it is fairly large, it weighs next to nothing.  Air seems to gather around it."
msgstr "一块遍布漩涡刻痕的石头，四周遍布着孔洞。虽然看上去不小，但几乎没有重量，似乎有气流聚集在这块石头的周围。"

#. ~ Description of "entrenching tool"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A stout, collapsible spade.  It's commonly used by military forces and favored by hikers for digging."
msgstr "一把常用于军队的折叠铲，简易的折叠设计，非常节省空间，是野外露营、探险、旅游等活动的必备工具，备受徒步旅行者的追捧。"

#. ~ Description of "telescoping umbrella (extended)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A telescoping umbrella currently in its extended form, useful for keeping dry when wielded.  May be collapsed down for easy storage."
msgstr "一种伸缩雨伞，已经展开，手持时避免淋雨。 可以折叠起来，便于存放。"

#. ~ Description of "telescoping umbrella (collapsed)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A telescoping umbrella which has been collapsed down for easy storage.  May be used to keep dry when extended and wielded."
msgstr "伸缩雨伞，已折叠，便于存放。 展开并手持可避免淋雨。"

#. ~ Description of "truck horn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A very loud horn, usually found on large trucks like semis."
msgstr "一个非常响亮的喇叭，通常用在拖车这样的大卡车上。"

#. ~ Description of "alarm clock"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A wind-up alarm clock.  Though the noise it makes is unpleasant to wake up to, it's always good to get an early start to your day.  Can also be disassembled into some useful parts."
msgstr "一个发条闹钟。被吵醒实在是不舒服，但起早总没什么坏处。也可以拆成有用的零件。"

#. ~ Description of "notched stick"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A wooden stick with notches cut into it, used with a fire drill to create embers."
msgstr "刻有火种凹槽的木棍，用来配合钻木取火器生火。"

#. ~ Description of "bug spray"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "An aerosol canister of pesticides that promises to kill ants, roaches, and spiders in seconds."
msgstr "一罐气雾杀虫剂，宣称能在数秒内杀死蚂蚁、蟑螂和蜘蛛。"

#. ~ Description of "rubber sealant spray"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "An aerosol spray can that contains (if there's any left) quick-drying liquid butyl rubber, which can be sprayed onto fabric and other materials to make them waterproof, or onto surfaces like spraypaint."
msgstr "气溶胶喷雾罐，内含（如果还有剩余的话）快干液体丁基橡胶，可喷洒在织物和其他材料上以使其防水，或喷洒在喷漆等表面上。"

#. ~ Description of "spraypaint"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "An aerosol spray can used to store paint under pressure.  Activate it to make graffiti on the floor."
msgstr "一个装满油漆的喷雾器。激活它可以在地板上涂鸦。"

#. ~ Description of "crystal urn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "An exquisite, translucent container for cremated ashes, decorated with floral patterns."
msgstr "精致的半透明骨灰容器，刻有花卉图案装饰。"

#. ~ Description of "pocket watch"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "An old-fashioned pocket watch.  Tells the time and looks good doing it.  Can also be disassembled into some useful parts."
msgstr "一个经典款怀表，可以让你在查看时间时显得很有派头。可以被拆解成零件。"

#. ~ Description of "umbrella"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "An umbrella with a pointy end, useful for keeping dry when wielded."
msgstr "一把顶部尖尖的长伞，手持它时可以让你不被雨淋湿。"

