msgstr "一个简易的民谣吉他，自带一条背带。即使在不弹奏的时候，你也可以穿着它到处走。"

#. ~ Description of "ukulele"
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "A small factory-made ukulele.  Makes you wish you were on a tropical island, or somewhere over the rainbow."
msgstr "一家小工厂生产尤克里里。让你希望自己在一个热带岛屿上，或者彩虹之上的某个地方。"

#. ~ Description of "banjo"
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
