msgstr "一把批量生产的斑鸠琴，看起来保存的挺不错的。"

#. ~ Description of "electric guitar"
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "A standard factory-made electric guitar.  It's probably better at smashing heads than melting faces, these days.  Has a strap."
msgstr "标准的工厂制造的电吉他。这段日子，砸人头可能比融化脸要好。有一条背带。"

#. ~ Description of "drum, percussion"
