#. ~ Description of "livestock scale"
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "A giant electronic scale with a rubber mat meant for weighing a single horse, cow, or other large animal.  You could also weigh yourself with it."
msgstr "一台巨大的电子秤，带有能承载马、牛等大型动物的橡胶板。你也能用它称量自己的重量。"

#. ~ Description of "glass terrarium"
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "A glass container meant to hold plants and/or insects.  They come in a variety of sizes."
msgstr "一个用来盛放植物和/或昆虫的玻璃容器。有各种尺寸。"

#. ~ Description of "pet carrier"
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "A plastic container meant to hold pets for transport.  Use it on a suitable animal to capture, use it on an empty tile to release."
msgstr "一个塑料笼子，可以用来运输小型宠物。激活它后选择需要捕获的动物，或者选择空地放出笼中动物。"

#. ~ Description of "horse tack"
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "A saddle, bridle, and associated tack that can be placed on a tamed animal that is capable of being ridden."
msgstr "一个鞍座，一副缰绳，以及配套的各类马钉，能够装在已驯服的动物身上，让它供你骑乘。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze shears"
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "A set of forged single-piece bronze shears for cutting fabrics.  Made of two painstakingly sharpened blades connected by a carefully tempered twisted bridge."
msgstr "这是一对锻造加工而成的青铜剪刀，用来剪切布料。由两片经过精心磨砺的刀片组成，并由一个经过精心回火的曲柄连接。"

#. ~ Description of "forged shears"
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "A set of heavy-duty shears designed to obtain wool from sheep.  Made of two steel blades connected by spring leaf."
msgstr "用于剪羊毛的重型剪刀，由两片钢片以弹簧片连接而成。"

#. ~ Description of "shears"
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
