msgstr "由一些棍子和绳子与防水油布所搭建的一个简易集雨器。"

#. ~ Description of "metal funnel"
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid "A large metal funnel used to collect rainwater.  Less portable than plastic funnels, but collects more water.  Use it outside and place a container beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr "一个用来收集雨水的大型金属漏斗。相较于塑料版更难移动，但能收集更多水。在户外激活该物品把它放在地上，然后在它下面放一个容器就可以收集雨水了。"

#. ~ Description of "funnel"
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid "A plastic funnel used to collect rainwater.  Use it outside and place a container beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr "一个用来收集雨水的塑料漏斗。在户外激活该物品把它放在地上，然后在它下面放一个容器就可以收集雨水了。"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark funnel"
