#. ~ Description of "black pen"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A disposable ballpoint pen, offers a smooth writing experience on paper.  Has the same logo as those disposable lighters.  This one is black."
msgstr "一支一次性圆珠笔，提供流畅的书写体验。有着和那些一次性打火机相同的商标。这支笔是黑色的。"

#. ~ Description of "blue pen"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A disposable ballpoint pen, offers a smooth writing experience on paper.  Has the same logo as those disposable lighters.  This one is blue."
msgstr "一支一次性圆珠笔，提供流畅的书写体验。有着和那些一次性打火机相同的商标。这支笔是蓝色的。"

#. ~ Description of "green pen"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A disposable ballpoint pen, offers a smooth writing experience on paper.  Has the same logo as those disposable lighters.  This one is green."
msgstr "一支一次性圆珠笔，提供流畅的书写体验。有着和那些一次性打火机相同的商标。这支笔是绿色的。"

#. ~ Description of "red pen"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A disposable ballpoint pen, offers a smooth writing experience on paper.  Has the same logo as those disposable lighters.  This one is red."
msgstr "一支一次性圆珠笔，提供流畅的书写体验。有着和那些一次性打火机相同的商标。这支笔是红色的。"

#. ~ Description of "pen"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A fine metal pen, of much better quality than a disposable model."
msgstr "一支很好的圆珠笔，质量比普通的一次性圆珠笔要好得多。"

#. ~ Description of "leather journal"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A leather-back journal for preserving notes and maps, has a strap to keep loose pages contained."
msgstr "一本用来保存各类笔记和地图的皮革日记本，有一条带子固定松散的书页。"

#. ~ Description of "office scissors"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A long pair of heavy-duty scissors.  You can use them to cut things such as fabric or plastic apart."
msgstr "一把耐用的工艺长剪刀。你可以用它把织物或塑料之类的东西剪开。"

#. ~ Description of "hole puncher"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A metal tool that can punch a single hole in a piece of paper.  I mean, you could do more if you wanted, but you'd have to do them one at a time.  Or, if you really wanted more holes with one punch, I suppose you could fold the paper….  This is a one-cylinder hole puncher."
msgstr "这个金属工具可以帮你在纸上打一个孔。多打几个也行，只要你肯一个一个来。或者，如果你真的非常想用它一次打好几个孔，也许可以把先纸折起来……总之它是一个单筒打孔器。"

#. ~ Description of "safety scissors"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A pair of short scissors designed with kids in mind.  You can use them to cut things such as fabric or plastic apart, although they are probably subpar compared to other alternatives."
msgstr "一把为孩子设计的短剪刀。你可以用它们来切割织物或塑料等东西，尽管与其他替代品相比，它们可能不太好。"

#. ~ Description of "wavy scissors"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A pair of wavy artistic scissors.  You can theoretically use them to cut things but you should probably not get your hopes too high."
msgstr "一把波浪形的艺术剪刀。理论上你可以用它们来切割东西，但你可能不应该抱有太高的希望。"

#. ~ Description of "pencil"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A sharpened HB Number 2 graphite pencil, equipped with an eraser."
msgstr "一支削尖的HB#2石墨铅笔，尾部配有橡皮擦。"

#. ~ Description of "letter opener"
#: data/json/items/tool/stationery.json
msgid "A sterling silver letter opener resembling a small dagger, with a sharp point and no cutting edge.  It's used to open mail envelopes neatly and quickly."
msgstr "一把像小匕首的纯银开信刀，有锋利的刀尖，但没有开刃。它能干净利落地拆开信封。"

