#. ~ Description of "primitive rock drill"
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
msgid "A thick, blunted wooden stick.  Can be used to drill rough holes in rock, if water and sand are available, but the process is lengthy."
msgstr "一根粗钝的木棍。如果有水和沙子，可以用来在石器上钻出粗糙的孔，但耗时很长。"

#. ~ Description of "bone punch"
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
msgid "A thick, short bone with a small, pointy tip, usually used in flintknapping for indirect percussion and pressure flaking."
msgstr "一根带有尖端的粗短骨头，通常用于加工燧石时桯钻打孔。"

#. ~ Description of "bone billet"
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
msgid "A thick, short bone, usually used in flintknapping for soft-hammer percussion."
msgstr "一根粗短的骨头，通常用于当作软锤敲击燧石。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden billet"
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
msgid "A thick, short wooden stick, usually used in flintknapping for soft-hammer percussion."
msgstr "一根粗短的木棍，通常用于当作软锤敲击燧石。"

#. ~ Description of "nail punch"
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
msgid "Two pieces of wood with a steel nail secured between them with some cordage.  Usually used in flintknapping for indirect percussion and pressure flaking."
msgstr "一根铁钉被牢牢绑住夹在两根木板之间，通常用于加工燧石时桯钻打孔。"

