#. ~ Description of "cloth patch"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A 6-inch square patch of fabric, suitable for repairing and tailoring clothing."
msgstr "一块约6英寸(约15厘米)见方的棉布片，可以用来修补或缝制衣物。"

#. ~ Description of "sponge"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A cleaning aid made of soft, porous material.  It will make cleaning hard objects much easier."
msgstr "一种由柔软多孔材料制成的清洁用品。可使清洁硬质物品更加轻松。"

#. ~ Description of "shaving kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A compact, lightweight shaving kit made for travelers.  You can use it to shave if it's supplied with soap.  It requires 1 unit of soap per use."
msgstr "一个为旅行者准备的紧凑、轻便的刮胡刀工具包。如果你有肥皂，你可以用它刮胡子。每次使用需要1单位的肥皂"

#. ~ Description of "dish towel"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A dish towel, useful for cleaning hard surfaces."
msgstr "一条擦碗布，用于清洁坚硬的表面。"

#. ~ Description of "razor blade"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A double-edged razor blade."
msgstr "一片双刃剃须刀片。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift haircut kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A kit containing various improvised tools for cutting hair."
msgstr "一个理发套装，包括各种自制的理发工具。"

#. ~ Description of "hair dye kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A kit featuring all the tools needed to dye hair, including an applicator brush, combs, and plastic gloves."
msgstr "该套件包含染发所需的所有工具，包括涂抹刷、梳子和塑料手套。"

#. ~ Description of "collapsible mop"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A long, unwieldy mop with a collapsible handle for convenient transportation.  You may use it to clean up any 'mess' you have made."
msgstr "笨重的拖把，手柄可折叠，便于携带。清理泄露的液体很不错。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift shaving kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A makeshift shaving kit.  You can use it to shave if it's supplied with soap.  It requires 1 unit of soap per use."
msgstr "一把简易剃须刀。如果你有肥皂，你可以用它刮胡子。每次使用需要1单位的肥皂。"

#. ~ Description of "scrub brush"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A plastic scrub brush.  It will make cleaning hard objects much easier."
msgstr "一把塑料刷子。它能让清洁硬质物品变得更容易。"

#. ~ Description of "electric hair trimmer"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A pocket-sized electric trimmer made for cutting hair.  You can use it to cut your hair if it's supplied with batteries.  It requires 1 unit of charge per use."
msgstr "一个小巧的电动理发剪。如果你有电池，你可以用它剪头发。每次使用需要10单位的电量。"

#. ~ Description of "bathroom scale"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A small bathroom scale, meant to weigh a person while naked."
msgstr "一个小型的浴室秤，用来称一个人裸体时的体重。"

#. ~ Description of "washboard"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A wooden washboard.  It will make washing clothing and other soft items much easier."
msgstr "一块木质搓衣板。它能让清洗衣物及其他软质物品变得更容易。"

#. ~ Description of "mop"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "An unwieldy mop.  Good for cleaning up spills.  Use to mop up any 'mess' you may have made."
msgstr "笨重的拖把，清理泄漏的液体很不错。"

