#. ~ Description of "bionic power conversion mod"
#: data/json/items/toolmod.json
msgid "A kit that replaces conventional battery connections with the circuitry and cables required to draw power from a Standard Neurobionics Interface (SNI).  Any device modified with this is powered by your own bionic power storage instead of conventional batteries."
msgstr "该套件用从标准神经仿生接口 (SNI) 获取电源所需的电路和电缆取代了传统的电池连接。  任何经过此修改的设备都由您自己的仿生电源存储而不是传统电池供电。"

