msgid "A ant plushie with a sturdy, hard yet soft shell mimic, and big, inquisitive eyes."
msgstr "一只蚂蚁毛绒玩具，具有坚固、坚硬但柔软的外壳模仿，以及好奇的大眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Canadian lynx plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A beautiful, cute and cuddly hypoallergenic Canadian lynx plushie with a ruff of fur around the neck, big whiskers, and a playful attitude."
msgstr "一个经抗过敏处理的加拿大猞猁毛绒玩具，漂亮可爱，让人想一把将其抱住。颈部有一圈花纹皮毛，有着粗长的胡须，正做出玩耍的动作。"

#. ~ Description of variant "komodo dragon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A big komodo dragon plushie with textured yet soft light brown scales, big, friendly eyes, and an adorable snout.  Extremely huggable."
msgstr "一只大科莫多龙毛绒玩具，有纹理但柔软的浅棕色鳞片，友善的大眼睛和可爱的鼻子。  非常让人想抱抱。"

#. ~ Description of variant "walrus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A big, soft and cuddly walrus plushie with fluffy brown fur, cute, soft tusks, and big, wise soulful eyes."
msgstr "一只又大又软又可爱的海象毛绒玩具，有着蓬松的棕色皮毛、可爱、柔软的獠牙和大而睿智、深情的眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mosasaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A blue-grayish, large, chubby mosasaurus plushie with a friendly smile, big eyes and soft flippers."
msgstr "一个蓝灰色、胖乎乎的巨大沧龙玩偶，带着友好的微笑，大大的眼睛和柔软的鳍状肢。"

#. ~ Description of variant "elasmosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A blueish, large, long-necked elasmosaurus plushie with a cute and friendly expression.  It is very soft and huggable."
msgstr "一只蓝色、长颈、长毛的薄片龙玩偶，表情可爱友好。它非常柔软，可以抱在怀里。"

#. ~ Description of variant "plesiosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A blueish, soft and friendly plesiosaurus plushie with big floppy flippers, a long neck and a cute, gentle expression."
msgstr "一只蓝色、柔软友好的蛇颈龙玩偶，有着大而松软的鳍状肢、长长的脖子和可爱温柔的表情"

#. ~ Description of variant "bullfrog plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A bullfrog plushie with soft, green, and bumpy skin, big, playful eyes, and typical frog legs.  This plushie produces realistic croaking sounds when squeezed and a special texture that makes it fun to squeeze and manipulate."
msgstr "牛蛙毛绒玩具，有着柔软、绿色、凹凸不平的皮肤、顽皮的大眼睛和典型的青蛙腿。  这款毛绒玩具在挤压时会发出逼真的呱呱声，并且特殊的纹理使挤压和操作变得有趣。"

#. ~ Description of variant "cayman plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cayman (some kind of dwarf crocodile) plushie with soft, light green skin, big, playful eyes, and a cute smile.  This plushie has superior cuddly and fluffy features, making it the perfect companion for bedtime snuggles."
msgstr "开曼群岛（某种矮鳄鱼）毛绒玩具，有着柔软的浅绿色皮肤、顽皮的大眼睛和可爱的微笑。  这款毛绒玩具具有卓越的可爱和蓬松功能，使其成为睡前依偎的完美伴侣。"

#. ~ Description of variant "centipede plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A centipede plushie with soft, colorful segments and big, playful eyes.  This plushie has a special climbing mechanism that lets it crawl over and cling to objects."
msgstr "蜈蚣毛绒玩具，拥有柔软多彩的节段和顽皮的大眼睛。  这款毛绒玩具有一个特殊的攀爬机制，可以让它爬过并攀附在物体上。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic scythe"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cheap plastic toy made to look like the Grim Reaper's scythe.  Let the harvest begin."
msgstr "一种看起来像死神镰刀的廉价塑料玩具。  让收获开始吧。"

#. ~ Description of variant "gavial plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddling gavial plushie with a soft body and long snout, with a playful expression.  It has a chomping action when the tail is pulled, letting people, specially children, playfully recreate the gavial's hunting tactics.  Don't worry, it is a complex system of cotton ligaments."
msgstr "可爱的鳄鱼毛绒玩具，身体柔软，鼻子长，表情俏皮。  当尾巴被拉动时，它会做出咀嚼动作，让人们，特别是儿童，可以嬉戏地重现长吻鳄的狩猎策略。  别担心，这是一个复杂的棉韧带系统。"

#. ~ Description of variant "gorilla plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly and adorable gorilla plushie with soft, black fur, big eyes, and a friendly expression."
msgstr "一只可爱的大猩猩毛绒玩具，有着柔软的黑色皮毛、大大的眼睛和友善的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "scarab beetle plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly and adorable scarab plushie with soft, brown fur and big, friendly eyes.  This plushie features a special iridescent finish that makes it faintly sparkle and shimmer like a real scarab beetle."
msgstr "可爱的圣甲虫毛绒玩具，有着柔软的棕色皮毛和友善的大眼睛。  这款毛绒玩具具有特殊的虹彩表面，使其像真正的圣甲虫一样闪闪发光。"

#. ~ Description of variant "turkey plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly and big wild turkey plushie with brown cotton faux feathers, a prominent, soft beak, and expressive, soulful eyes.  It has a special feature of making gobbling sounds when squeezed, almost perfectly mimicking the turkey's unique calls."
msgstr "一只可爱的火鸡毛绒玩具。它长长的深褐色的棉制羽毛乱蓬蓬的，喙部柔软但有形。那双富有表现力且深情的眼睛更是突出。这只玩偶的特别之处在于，当你捏它时，会发出特别的咯咯声（不要联想到那种常见市售的黄色尖叫鸡），几乎完美地模仿了火鸡独特的叫声。"

#. ~ Description of variant "bald eagle plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly and majestic bald eagle plushie with soft, brown and white cotton faux feathers, a hooked, soft beak, and a patriotic expression.  It has a pair of special eyes that glow as brightly as the stars and stripes of Old Glory, the perfect partner to fend off your enemies in the Cataclysm."
msgstr "一个可爱而雄伟的秃鹰毛绒玩具，有着柔软的棕色和白色的人造棉羽毛，一个弯曲的软喙，和一种爱国的表情。它有一双特别的眼睛，能像美国国旗的星星和条纹一样闪亮，是在大灾变中抵御敌人的完美伙伴。"

#. ~ Description of variant "chameleon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly and soft chameleon plushie that can change colors, complete with big, round eyes and a cute expression.  This plushie's soft body has a simple color-changing mechanism on its fabric, that changes from green to brown if you pet it properly, enabling people, especially children, to explore and learn about the biology of this fascinating reptile."
msgstr "可爱又柔软的变色龙毛绒玩具，可以改变颜色，有着又大又圆的眼睛和可爱的表情。  这款毛绒玩具的柔软身体在其织物上有一个简单的变色机制，如果你正确地抚摸它，它会从绿色变成棕色，使人们，特别是儿童，能够探索和了解这种迷人爬行动物的生物学。"

#. ~ Description of variant "snowy owl plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly and wise-looking snowy owl plushie with fluffy white cotton faux feathers, orange eyes, and a cute expression.  .It features a special light-up effect, mimicking the way the snowy owl's eyes glow brightly in the dark."
msgstr "一只惹人喜爱的雪鸮，看起来很有智慧。它有着雪白的棉花人造羽毛和一对浅棕色的眼睛。与众不同的是，它的眼睛会在黑暗处发出淡淡的光，虽然不能提供照明，但是能照亮你的心。"

#. ~ Description of variant "blue whale plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly blue whale plushie with soft blue-gray fur and a playful expression."
msgstr "一个可爱的蓝鲸毛绒玩具，有着柔软蓝灰色的绒毛和俏皮的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "dromedary plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly camel plushie with a single humps, tan fur, and big soulful eyes."
msgstr "一个可爱的骆驼毛绒玩具，有一个驼峰，浅棕色的绒毛，和一双充满深情的大眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "camel plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly camel plushie with two soft humps, tan fur, and big soulful eyes."
msgstr "一个可爱的双峰骆驼毛绒玩具，有两个柔软的驼峰，浅棕色的绒毛，和一双充满深情的大眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "common loon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly common loon plushie with soft, black-and-white cotton faux feathers and a pleasing expression.  Its head can bob and turn to mimic the loon's distinctive courtship calls."
msgstr "一只可爱的白嘴潜鸟毛绒玩具，拥有柔软的黑白色棉花人造羽毛和可爱的表情。它的头可以上下摆动和转动，也可以模仿白嘴潜鸟独特的求偶叫声。"

#. ~ Description of variant "duck plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly duck plushie with soft, yellow cotton faux feathers, cute orange feet, and a lovable quack.  This plushie has special water-repellent properties to make it float in water, just like a real duck!"
msgstr "可爱的鸭子毛绒玩具，有柔软的黄色棉质人造羽毛、可爱的橙色脚和可爱的嘎嘎声。  这款毛绒玩具具有特殊的防水特性，使其可以漂浮在水中，就像真正的鸭子一样！"

#. ~ Description of variant "harbor seal plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly harbor seal plushie with soft, grayish fur and big, soulful eyes.  It features a realistic texture that mimics the soft and textural quality of real seals' fur."
msgstr "一个可爱的斑海豹毛绒玩偶，有着柔软的灰色毛皮和灵性的大眼睛。质感很逼真，试图模仿真实海豹毛皮的柔软。"

#. ~ Description of variant "iguana plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly iguana plushie with soft green scales, big eyes, and a friendly, curious expression.  It possess a special ribbed texture to mimic the skin of a real iguana."
msgstr "一只可爱的鬣蜥毛绒玩具，有着柔软的绿色鳞片、大大的眼睛和友善而好奇的表情。  它具有特殊的罗纹纹理，模仿真正鬣蜥的皮肤。"

#. ~ Description of variant "peregrine falcon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly peregrine falcon plushie with soft, brown and white cotton faux feathers, a soft hooked beak, and an alert expression.  With a speedy and sleek plushie design, this toy plushie is sure to take imaginative people on make-believe high-flying chase scenes!"
msgstr "一只可爱的游隼毛绒玩具，采用柔软的棕色和白色棉质人造毛绒，拥有柔软的钩状鸟嘴和机警的神色。这款毛绒玩具的设计既迅捷又时尚，定能带领富有想象力的人们展开想象高空中的追逐场景！"

#. ~ Description of variant "moose plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly plushie of the mighty moose, with soft brown fur, floppy ears, and big antlers.  It has a special huggability feature that makes it delightfully squishy, perfect for comforting cuddles."
msgstr "一只毛茸茸的可爱驼鹿，有着柔软的棕色皮毛、耷拉的耳朵和巨大的鹿角。它有一个特殊的可拥抱功能，非常适合安慰拥抱。"

#. ~ Description of variant "lobster plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cuddly red lobster plushie with a soft red shell and big playful eyes."
msgstr "一个可爱的红色龙虾毛绒玩具，有着柔软的红色外壳和俏皮的大眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "alligator plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute alligator plushie with soft green skin, big round eyes, and a playful expression.  This plushie features glowing eyes that change color in the dark, adding an eerie and mysterious touch to its playful design."
msgstr "可爱的鳄鱼毛绒玩具，有着柔软的绿色皮肤、圆圆的大眼睛和俏皮的表情。  这款毛绒玩具的眼睛会发光，在黑暗中会改变颜色，为其俏皮的设计增添了怪异和神秘的感觉。"

#. ~ Description of variant "alpaca plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute alpaca plushie featuring soft, curly fur in shades of white and brown."
msgstr "一个可爱的羊驼毛绒玩具，有着柔软卷曲的白色和棕色绒毛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "gecko plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute and colorful gecko plushie with soft, vibrant skin and big, playful eyes.  This plushie has a special cotton-based internal mechanism that makes its tail wiggle and move playfully when squeezed enough, just like a real lizard's tail."
msgstr "可爱多彩的壁虎毛绒玩具，拥有柔软、充满活力的皮肤和顽皮的大眼睛。  这款毛绒玩具有一个特殊的棉质内部机制，当受到足够的挤压时，它的尾巴会摆动并俏皮地移动，就像真正的蜥蜴的尾巴一样。"

#. ~ Description of variant "chimpanzee plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute and cuddly chimpanzee plushie with soft, brown fur, big, curious eyes, and a playful expression."
msgstr "可爱又可爱的黑猩猩毛绒玩具，有着柔软的棕色皮毛、好奇的大眼睛和俏皮的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "toad plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute and cuddly toad plushie with soft, bumpy green skin, big eyes, and a gentle expression.  This plushie features a special scent that captures the earthy and musky aroma of a damp forest floor, not that everyone will like it."
msgstr "可爱又可爱的蟾蜍毛绒玩具，有着柔软、凹凸不平的绿色皮肤、大大的眼睛和温柔的表情。  这款毛绒玩具具有特殊的气味，可以捕捉潮湿森林地面的泥土和麝香香气，但并不是每个人都会喜欢它。"

#. ~ Description of variant "kitty plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute and lovable domestic kitty plushie with soft, plush fur, big, round eyes, and a gentle expression.  You can't tell if it is a short-haired one or a long-haired one."
msgstr "一只可爱的家猫玩偶。它的毛发很软，看起来也很温顺。你难以分辨这是短毛猫还是长猫猫。"

#. ~ Description of variant "ladybug plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute and lovable ladybug plushie with soft, red and black polkadotted wings and big, friendly eyes.  This plushie features a special retractable spotted soft wing mechanic sewed directly into the body that gives it the authentic appearance of a ladybug about to fly."
msgstr "可爱可爱的瓢虫毛绒玩具，拥有柔软的红黑圆点翅膀和友好的大眼睛。  这款毛绒玩具采用特殊的可伸缩斑点软翼机械结构，直接缝在身体上，使其具有即将飞翔的瓢虫的真实外观。"

#. ~ Description of variant "screech owl plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute and wise-looking eastern screech owl plushie with big, round eyes and soft, tan cotton faux feathers.  It has a soft and silky texture, making it an excellent sensory object for people, specially children, to play and explore while they navigate the world around them."
msgstr "一只机灵可爱的东美角鸮，有着明亮的大眼睛和柔软的深色棉花人造羽毛。选材和工艺使它毛绒和外表和柔顺的触感深受儿童的喜爱，让孩子们举着它周游世界，沉浸在飞天梦里。"

#. ~ Description of variant "striped skunk plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute striped skunk plushie with soft, black-and-white fur and a playful expression.  Ironically, it has a weak, pleasant pine scent."
msgstr "一只可爱的条纹臭鼬毛绒玩具，有着柔软的黑白毛皮和顽皮的表情。具有讽刺意味的是，它散发出微弱而宜人的松木香味。"

#. ~ Description of variant "chipmunk plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute, adorable eastern chipmunk plushie with soft, reddish-brown fur and big eyes.  It features a harmless, special crinkly texture that mimics the sound of chipmunks rustling in the leaves."
msgstr "一只可爱的东方花栗鼠，有柔软的红棕色皮毛和大眼睛。它有一种无害的、特殊的褶皱纹理，模仿花栗鼠在树叶中沙沙作响的声音。"

#. ~ Description of variant "ankylosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute, squat ankylosaurus plushie with a spiky tail and soft plating."
msgstr "一只可爱的矮胖的甲龙玩偶，有着尖尖的尾巴，质感柔软。"

#. ~ Description of variant "zombie teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A dark green teddy bear with stylized stitches all over and X's for eyes.  The perfect size for a small child to hug the unlife out of.  Looks like the zombie apocalypse hit the toy store shelves first."
msgstr "一只墨绿色的泰迪熊，上面绣满了程式化的针脚，带有X的眼睛。尺寸非常适合小孩子抱着这个无生命的东西。看来丧尸启示录先在玩具店上架了。"

#. ~ Description of variant "iguanodon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A earth-brown, huggable and soft iguanodon plushie with a friendly smile and soft, round features."
msgstr "一只土褐色的禽龙玩偶，带着友善的微笑和柔软的圆形特征。"

#. ~ Description of "fidget spinner"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fidget spinner.  An artifact from when the times were simpler."
msgstr "一个指尖陀螺。纯真年代时的神器。"

#. ~ Description of variant "allosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fierce-looking allosaurus plushie with a soft, huggable body and clean white teeth."
msgstr "一个看起来凶猛的异特龙毛绒玩具，柔软可爱的身体和干净洁白的牙齿。"

#. ~ Description of variant "carnotaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fierce-looking, but extremely soft carnotaurus plushie with a brightly-colored snout and a pair of round, soft horns."
msgstr "一只看起来很凶，但极其柔软的食肉牛龙玩偶，它有一个色彩鲜艳的鼻子和一对圆圆的软角。"

#. ~ Description of variant "unicorn figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A figurine of a blue unicorn.  It is in a sitting position, shyly covering both eyes with its front hooves."
msgstr "一只蓝色独角兽的手办。它坐在地上，害羞地用两只前蹄遮起眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mermaid figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A figurine of a redheaded mermaid sitting on a rock.  Like in the film this toy is based on, she gazes longingly out to a world she wants to be a part of - or she would be, but the face isn't drawn very well and doesn't express much emotion at all."
msgstr "一个坐在岩石上的红发美人鱼的手办。就像这个玩具所依据的电影一样，她渴望地凝视着一个她想加入的世界——或者说她本来该这样，但是脸画崩了，根本没有表达什么情感。"

#. ~ Description of variant "swamp monster figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A figurine of a scaly green swamp monster emerging from some fetid lagoon."
msgstr "一个有鳞片的绿色沼泽怪物的手办，正从一个腥臭的泻湖中浮起。"

#. ~ Description of variant "swordsman figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A figurine of some unnamed swordsman, covered with scars and equipped with sturdy leather armor.  Seems to be ready to fight."
msgstr "一个无名剑客的手办，满身伤痕，穿着结实的皮甲，似乎已经准备好战斗。"

#. ~ Description of variant "opabinia plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fluffy and colorful opabinia plushie with a cute, unconventional design, with a lengthy hollow proboscis ending in a single, long and soft 'claw' extending out of its head that's topped with five eyes on stalks.  Its segmented body is colored a mix of light pink and white while its tail bears purple stripes."
msgstr "一只毛茸茸、色彩缤纷的欧巴宾海蝎毛绒玩具，款式可爱、非同寻常，从它的头上伸出一根长长的空心长鼻，末端是一个长而柔软的“爪子”，五只杆状眼睛分别长在爪子末端。它分段的身体混杂着浅粉色和白色，而尾巴则带有紫色条纹。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sanctacaris plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fluffy and colorful sanctacaris plushie, the great great grandfather of all arthropods.  It has a soft, chubby body, multiple soft legs, and eyes on stalks.  Its plush is light blue colored, with accents of shimmering purple on its legs and details on the body.  It has big, round eyes with a cute and friendly expression."
msgstr "一只毛茸茸、色彩缤纷的多须虫毛绒玩具，它是所有节肢动物的曾曾祖父。它长着柔软圆胖的身体，以及许多柔软的腿和杆状眼睛。它的绒毛是淡蓝色的，腿上和身体上有闪闪发光的紫色斑点。它长着一双又大又圆的眼睛，带着可爱和善的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mutt puppy plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fluffy and cuddly plushie of a mutt puppy with soft, fuzzy fur, big, round eyes, and a playful expression."
msgstr "蓬松可爱的杂种小狗毛绒玩具，有着柔软毛茸茸的皮毛、又大又圆的眼睛以及顽皮的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "rooster plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fun and colorful rooster plushie with soft, vibrantly colored cotton faux feathers, a long rooster tail, and a bold expression."
msgstr "有趣且色彩缤纷的公鸡毛绒玩具，采用柔软、色彩鲜艳的棉质人造羽毛、长长的公鸡尾巴和大胆的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "termite plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fun and colorful termite plushie with big, curious eyes and furry antenna."
msgstr "有趣且色彩缤纷的白蚁毛绒玩具，有着好奇的大眼睛和毛茸茸的天线。"

#. ~ Description of variant "baboon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fun and playful baboon plushie with soft, brown fur and big, colorful feet and cute expression.  Like almost all baboons, this one has a red butt and can grip and hold small objects with its soft, plush hands."
msgstr "一款有趣俏皮的狒狒毛绒玩具，拥有柔软的棕色皮毛、色彩缤纷的大脚和可爱的表情。  像几乎所有狒狒一样，这只狒狒有一个红色的屁股，可以用柔软毛绒的手抓住和握住小物体。"

#. ~ Description of variant "velociraptor plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A furry velociraptor plushie with oversized eyes and little claws.  It has a very friendly demeanor."
msgstr "毛茸茸的伶盗龙玩具，眼睛超大，爪子很小。看起来十分友好。"

#. ~ Description of variant "aphid plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A giant aphid plushie with soft, textured green skin and big, curious eyes.  This plushie features a special attachment mechanism that lets it cling and crawl on flat surfaces, just like a real aphid."
msgstr "一只巨大的蚜虫毛绒玩具，有着柔软、有纹理的绿色皮肤和好奇的大眼睛。  这款毛绒玩具具有特殊的附着机制，可以让它像真正的蚜虫一样粘附在平坦的表面上并爬行。"

#. ~ Description of variant "goose plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A goose plushie with soft, white cotton faux feathers, a cute and soft orange beak, and big, playful eyes.  This plushie produces realistic honking sounds when hugged!"
msgstr "一只鹅毛绒玩具，配有柔软的白色棉质人造羽毛、可爱柔软的橙色喙和顽皮的大眼睛。  这款毛绒玩具在拥抱时会发出逼真的鸣叫声！"

#. ~ Description of variant "baryonix plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A grayish, soft and cute baryonix plushie with a big head and small arms, it is holding a fish, probably saving it for later."
msgstr "一个柔软的可爱灰色重爪龙毛绒玩具，有着大脑袋短胳膊，正抓着一条鱼，可能是留到之后吃。"

#. ~ Description of variant "dilophosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A greenish, playful, smiling dilophosaurus plushie with a cute frilled collar and a long, curly and soft tail."
msgstr "一个绿色、顽皮、微笑的双脊龙玩偶，有一个可爱的褶边领子和一条长而卷曲柔软的尾巴。"

#. ~ Description of variant "spider monkey plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A huggable and cute spider monkey plushie with soft, brown fur and long, playful arms with big, curious eyes."
msgstr "一只可爱的蜘蛛猴毛绒玩具，有着柔软的棕色皮毛和长而顽皮的手臂，还有好奇的大眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "humpback whale plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A huggable humpback whale plushie with soft gray and white fur and big friendly eyes."
msgstr "一个可爱的座头鲸毛绒玩具，有着柔软的灰白色绒毛和友善的大眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "jacare plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A jacare (or yacare, kind of a South American crocodile) plushie with soft sandy brown scales, a soft plush belly, and an adorable expression.  This plushies has a special scented feature that makes it smell just like a warm and tropical Brazilian jungle."
msgstr "一种 jacare（或 yacare，一种南美鳄鱼）毛绒玩具，拥有柔软的沙棕色鳞片、柔软的毛绒腹部和可爱的表情。  这款毛绒玩具具有特殊的香味，使其闻起来就像温暖的热带巴西丛林。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mech figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large figurine of a humanoid robot, armed with a rifle, with a smaller figure sitting inside the head."
msgstr "一个机器人手办，手持步枪，头部还坐着一个小人。"

#. ~ Description of variant "knight figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large figurine of a knight in shining armor standing watch, with its sword planted at the ground at its feet."
msgstr "一个大型的骑士手办，身穿闪亮的盔甲，正在站岗，一把大剑插在它身前的地面中。"

#. ~ Description of variant "video game figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large figurine of a videogame character, holding a massive gatling gun in his giant arms."
msgstr "一个大型的电子游戏角色手办，它巨大的手臂抱着一挺同样巨大的加特林机枪。"

#. ~ Description of "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large manufactured figurine.  This is the default variant, if you see it something went wrong."
msgstr "一个大型的手办。这是基础样式，如果你看到它说明出错了。"

#. ~ Description of variant "ferret plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plush ferret with cute beady eyes."
msgstr "一只长着可爱小眼睛的大型毛绒雪貂。"

#. ~ Description of variant "fox plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plush fox.  It isn't realistic enough to trick a zombie into going after it, but it's very cute and makes a comforting bedtime companion."
msgstr ""
"大只毛绒狐狸。它没那么像真的，丧尸不会追着它跑，但它确实很可爱，是个很好的床头伙伴。\n"
"\"kon kon kitsune~\""

#. ~ Description of variant "rabbit plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plush rabbit."
msgstr "一只大型毛绒兔子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "remora plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plush remora, a fish commonly seen alongside sharks.  Wait, wasn't there a shark plushie somewhere here…"
msgstr "一只大型毛绒䲟鱼，一种在鲨鱼旁常见的鱼。等等，别处会不会有个毛绒鲨鱼……"

#. ~ Description of variant "T-rex plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plush t-rex."
msgstr "一只大型毛绒霸王龙。"

#. ~ Description of variant "ichthyostega plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plushie of your ancestor, the ichthyostega!  It has a long, sturdy, soft body, four soft, fat legs, and a soft fish-like tail.  Its body is extremely soft and fluffy, and has bumpy green skin with lighter green stripes as details.  It presents a cute expression with big, wise eyes."
msgstr "你的祖先，鱼石螈的大型毛绒玩具！它有着长而坚固的柔软身体，四只柔软的肥腿和一条柔软的鱼尾。它的身体非常柔软和蓬松，绿色的皮肤凹凸不平，细节处还有浅绿色的条纹。一双大而明亮的眼睛构成了一副可爱的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "tiktaalik plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plushie of your ancestor, the tiktaalik!  It has a soft, huggable fish-like body, stubby legs, and paddle-like soft fins.  Its color is a mix of blue-gray soft scales pattern on the back and a plush beige belly.  It has large eyes and a friendly expression."
msgstr "你的祖先，提塔利克鳄鱼的大型毛绒玩具！它的身体像鱼一样柔软，适合拥抱，有着短小的腿和像桨一样的软鳍。它的背部为蓝灰色柔软鳞片图案，腹部为毛绒米色。它有着大大的眼睛和友好的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pteranodon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large pteranodon plushie with big wings and adorable eyes."
msgstr "一只长着大翅膀和可爱眼睛的大型无齿翼龙毛绒玩具。"

#. ~ Description of variant "stegosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large stegosaurus plushie with a spiky back and soft, huggable body.  Don't worry, it is completely docile!"
msgstr "一只背部长着尖刺的大号的剑龙玩偶，身体柔软，可以随便拥抱。别担心，它很温顺的！"

#. ~ Description of variant "tylosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large, chubby and huggable tylosaurus plushie with a big head and soft fins."
msgstr "一个又大又胖又可爱的海王龙玩偶，它有一个大大的头和柔软的鳍。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sarcosuchus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large, chubby sarcosuchus plushie with a friendly, toothy grin and adorable snout.  It resembles a crocodile."
msgstr "一只大号、胖乎乎的帝王鳄毛绒玩具，它带着友好、露齿的笑容和可爱的鼻子。它很像一只鳄鱼。"

#. ~ Description of variant "triceratops plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large, round, cuddly dinosaur plushie with soft horns and a sturdy build."
msgstr "一只又大又圆的可爱的恐龙毛绒玩偶，有着柔软的角和结实的身体。"

#. ~ Description of variant "irritator plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large, soft and colorful reddish orange irritator plushie with a long snout and playful expression."
msgstr "一个大而柔软，色彩鲜艳的橙红色激龙毛绒玩具，长着长鼻子，脸上流露出顽皮的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "archaeopteryx plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large, soft, fuzzy and colorful archaeopteryx plushie with bird-like features.  His feathers apparently are individually designed and placed."
msgstr "一个又大又软的彩色始祖鸟毛绒玩具，带有明显鸟类特征。有着刻意设计的根根分明的羽毛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "diplodocus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A long and floppy diplodocus plushie with a gentle expression and wrinkled skin."
msgstr "一个皮肤褶皱，表情温和的梁龙玩偶。"

#. ~ Description of variant "orangutan plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A lovable and huggable orangutan plushie with soft, orange-brown fur and big, friendly eyes in a big, wise-looking face.  This plushie makes playful and cuddly jungle sounds when squeezed and hugged."
msgstr "一只可爱又令人想抱抱的猩猩毛绒玩具，有着柔软的橙棕色皮毛，大而友善的眼睛，聪明的大脸。  当挤压和拥抱时，这款毛绒玩具会发出俏皮可爱的丛林声音。"

#. ~ Description of "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A manufactured plush toy.  This is the default variant, if you see it something went wrong."
msgstr "一只人造毛绒玩具。这是基础样式，如果你看到它说明出错了。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sloth teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A mass-produced plush black teddy bear with a mark in its face that looks like a pair of white glasses or a white bandit mask.  It is wearing a little white t-shirt and a pajama hat, but no pants."
msgstr "一只量产的黑色毛发的熊玩偶，脸上有着类似眼罩的白色花纹。它穿着一件小小的白色T恤和一顶睡帽，但没有裤子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "black teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A mass-produced plush black teddy bear.  It is wearing a little white t-shirt, but no pants."
msgstr "一只量产的黑色毛发的熊玩偶。它穿着一件小小的白色T恤，但没有裤子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sun teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A mass-produced plush brown teddy bear with a yellowish snout.  It is wearing a little white t-shirt with a small sun printed on it, but no pants."
msgstr "一只量产的棕色毛发和淡黄色鼻子的熊玩偶。它穿着一件小小的印着太阳的白色T恤，但没有裤子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "grizzly teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A mass-produced plush brown teddy bear.  It is wearing a little red t-shirt but no pants."
msgstr "一只量产的棕色毛发的熊玩偶。它穿着一件小小的红色T恤，但没有裤子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "panda teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A mass-produced plush panda teddy bear.  It is wearing a little gray t-shirt, but no pants."
msgstr "一只量产的熊猫玩偶。它穿着一件小小的灰色T恤，但没有裤子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A mass-produced plush teddy bear.  It is wearing a little red t-shirt but no pants."
msgstr "一只量产的毛绒泰迪熊。它穿着一件小小的红色T恤，但没有裤子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "polar teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A mass-produced plush white teddy bear.  It is wearing a little white puffer jacket, holding a glass of soda, but is wearing no pants."
msgstr "一只量产的白色毛发的熊玩偶。它穿着一件小小的白色羽绒服，手里拿着一杯汽水，但没有裤子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "zombie figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A nasty looking figurine of a mutant zombie, with a large tongue sprouting from its face.  You thankfully haven't encountered something like that yet."
msgstr "一个看起来很恶心的变种丧尸手办，一条大舌头从脸上长出。谢天谢地，你还没有遇到这种玩意。"

#. ~ Description of "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A normal-sized manufactured figurine.  This is the default variant, if you see it something went wrong."
msgstr "一个正常大小的人造雕像。这是基础样式，如果你看到它说明出错了。"

#. ~ Description of "buttons and thread"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A pair of mismatched buttons and some dull yellow thread, to put on a brave face with."
msgstr "一对不相配的纽扣和一些暗黄色的线，用来缝出勇敢的面孔。"

#. ~ Description of variant "fashionable doll" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A plastic figurine of a young woman.  She's meant to be dressed up and accessorized with a wide variety of clothing, sold separately."
msgstr "一位年轻女性的塑料模型，可以用各种服装首饰打扮，不过服饰需要单独购买。"

#. ~ Description of variant "avocado figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A plastic figurine of an anthropomorphic avocado, holding a salt shaker and a spoon.  Makes a great gift for the guacamole lover in your life, or as a decoration for your kitchen."
msgstr "一个拟人化的牛油果塑料手办，手持盐罐和勺子。这是给鳄梨酱爱好者的好礼物，也可以作为你厨房的装饰。"

#. ~ Description of variant "nightmare figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A plastic figurine with a nightmarish, scarred face.  He wears a hat and has three long blades extending from a glove on the back of his hand."
msgstr "一个有长着梦魇般满是伤痕脸庞的塑料手办。它带着一顶帽子，手背上有三片从手套延伸出来的长刀。"

#. ~ Description of variant "river otter plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A playful and fuzzy northern river otter plushie with brown fur and a curious expression.  It has a special, state-of-the-art semi-waterproof finish that makes it the perfect bathtub companion for those who love to play with their toys while they get clean."
msgstr "一个毛茸茸的北河水獭毛绒玩偶，动作生动活泼，有着棕色的毛皮和好奇的表情。表面有先进半防水涂层，是习惯在洗澡时玩玩具的人们的完美浴缸伴侣。"

#. ~ Description of variant "suchomimus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A playful and very soft suchomimus plushie with a funny, toothy grin and floppy, soft arms."
msgstr ""
" \n"
"一只调皮而又非常柔软的似鳄龙玩偶，它有着滑稽的露齿笑容和柔软的垂臂。"

#. ~ Description of variant "coyote plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A playful eastern coyote plushie with soft, gray and brown fur and a big, curled tail.  It is extremely huggable, but is not realistic enough to trick anyone, yet, it is very cute."
msgstr "一只正在嬉戏的东部郊狼毛绒玩具，有着柔软的灰色和棕色毛皮以及一个大大的卷曲尾巴。它非常令人想抱抱，但还不够逼真，无法欺骗任何人，但非常可爱。"

#. ~ Description of variant "crow plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A plushie with black fluffy cotton faux feathers, big curious eyes, and an inquisitive expression."
msgstr "毛绒玩具，有着黑色蓬松的棉质人造羽毛、好奇的大眼睛和好奇的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "racoon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A plushie with soft, black-gray-and-white fur and a curious expression with its iconic bandit mask.  It has a special feature that makes its tails emerge from its hiding spot in the toy, reminiscent of one of the raccoon's greatest attributes."
msgstr "一个拥有柔软的黑色、灰色和白色毛皮的浣熊毛绒玩具，带有标志性的小偷面具和好奇的表情。它有一个特殊的设计，让它的尾巴从玩具的遮掩处露出，让人想起浣熊最大的特征之一。"

#. ~ Description of variant "cave bat plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A precious cave bat plushie with soft, black fur, big ears, and somewhat small, curious eyes.  It produces a special squeaker sound effect when squeezed."
msgstr "一种珍贵的洞穴蝙蝠毛绒玩具，有着柔软的黑色皮毛、大耳朵和有点好奇的小眼睛。  挤压时会产生特殊的吱吱声效果。"

#. ~ Description of variant "llama plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A precious llama plushie with soft, fluffy fur in grayish white.  It has expressive eyes and a tuft of fur on its head."
msgstr "一个珍贵的羊驼毛绒玩具，有着柔软蓬松的灰白色绒毛。它有一双传神的眼睛，头顶还有一撮绒毛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "chicken plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A precious soft and cuddly chicken plushie with soft, warm brown cotton faux feathers and a gentle expression."
msgstr "一款珍贵的柔软可爱的小鸡毛绒玩具，具有柔软、温暖的棕色棉质人造羽毛和温柔的表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "deinonychus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A reddish, cuddly deinonychus plushie with white, clean teeth and soft claws.  Apparently, it is smiling."
msgstr "一个略带红色，可爱的恐爪龙毛绒玩具，牙齿洁白干净，爪子柔软。显然，它在微笑。"

#. ~ Description of variant "T-rex figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A relatively large plastic figurine of a T-rex."
msgstr "一个相对较大的霸王龙塑料手办。"

#. ~ Description of variant "brontosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A silly, oversized and soft brontosaurus plushie with a long tail, a long neck and a small head with a friendly smile."
msgstr "一个愚蠢的、超大号的、柔软的雷龙玩偶，它长着一条长尾巴、一条长脖子和一个带着友好微笑的小脑袋。"

#. ~ Description of "yoyo"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A simple yoyo on a string.  Now you can be bored with style."
msgstr "一个朴素的带绳悠悠球。现在你可能厌倦了款式。"

#. ~ Description of variant "kronosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A sleek-looking, soft kronosaurus plushie with white dinosaur smile smooth texturized skin and large, cute eyes."
msgstr "一个外观光滑、柔软的克柔龙玩偶，带有白色恐龙微笑平滑纹理皮肤和可爱的大眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "crocodile plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A soft and cuddly crocodile plushie with soft green scales, a big smile, and a long snout.  When squeezed or touched, this plushie produces authentic hissing and growling sounds, just like a real crocodile."
msgstr "这只绿色毛绒鳄鱼的表面较为光滑，显然做过处理。它长长的口吻两侧，缝有整齐的棉制牙齿。它的嘴巴无法完全闭合，再加上圆滚滚的眼睛，看起来一点也不凶猛，反而有点呆萌。如果你捏它，它会发出逼真的咆哮声混杂着尖细的嘶嘶声，就像只真的鳄鱼。"

#. ~ Description of variant "compsognathus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A soft compsognathus plushie, with a cute and bright appearance like that of a baby dinosaur."
msgstr "一个柔软的美颌龙毛绒玩具，有着像小恐龙一样可爱明亮的外表。"

#. ~ Description of variant "bobcat plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A soft, cute bobcat plushie with a cute, tufted pair of ears, a fluffy tail and soft brown fur.  It has embroidered both soft whiskers and claws that add a touch of realism to its cute and playful design."
msgstr "一只柔软可爱的山猫毛绒玩具，有一对可爱的簇绒耳朵，一条蓬松的尾巴和柔软的棕色皮毛。它有刺绣的柔软胡须和爪子，为其可爱俏皮的设计增添了一丝真实感。"

#. ~ Description of variant "flying squirrel plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A soft, playful and fuzzy flying squirrel plushie with brown fur and oversized pair of armwings.  This plushie features almost undetectable special suction cups on its paws that makes it possible to 'climb' and stick to smooth surfaces, mimicking the cuddly creature's real-life abilities."
msgstr "一个软软的、可爱的、毛茸茸的飞鼠毛绒玩具，有着棕色的毛发和超大的臂翼。这种毛绒玩具的爪子上有一个几乎无法察觉到的特殊吸盘，可以“攀爬”并粘在光滑的表面上，模仿这种可爱的生物在现实生活中的能力。"

#. ~ Description of variant "parasaurolophus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A soft, yellowish parasaurolophus plushie with a big crest in the head and cute puppy-dog eyes."
msgstr "一只柔软的淡黄色副栉龙玩偶，头上有一个大冠，还有一双可爱的眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of "shark plushie"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A somewhat large, mass produced shark plushie.  Meant to provide comfort to people of all ages."
msgstr "一只量产的巨大鲨鱼毛绒玩具，能让人感到舒适，老少皆宜。"

#. ~ Description of variant "black bear plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A somewhat realistic, but still childish black bear plushie with soft, black fur, round ears, and a sweet expression.  It has a warm and fuzzy texture that makes it the perfect companion for snuggles during evenings."
msgstr "一只有点逼真，但略显年幼的黑熊毛绒玩具，有着柔软的黑色皮毛、圆圆的耳朵和甜美的表情。它有着温暖而柔软的质地，是晚上依偎的完美伴侣。"

#. ~ Description of variant "tarantula plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A somewhat scary, but cuddly tarantula plushie with soft, fuzzy brown fur and big, curious eyes."
msgstr "一只有点吓人但又可爱的狼蛛毛绒玩具，有着柔软、毛茸茸的棕色皮毛和好奇的大眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "spinosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A spiky spinosaurus plushie with big claws and a friendly demeanor, he is holding a fish, probably saving it for later."
msgstr "一个长着尖刺的剑龙玩偶，有着大爪子，表情温和，手里还拿着一条鱼，也许准备留着以后吃。"

#. ~ Description of variant "plateosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A squat, chubby, cute and very huggable plateosaurus plushie with a prominent belly and a soft stubby tail."
msgstr "一个矮胖、可爱、非常讨人喜欢的板龙玩偶，有一个突出的腹部和一条柔软的粗短尾巴。"

#. ~ Description of variant "cow plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A stuffed dairy cow with soft, velvety fur spotted in Holstein black and white."
msgstr "一只填充的荷斯坦奶牛毛绒玩具，有着柔软如天鹅绒般的黑白斑纹皮毛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "superhero figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A superhero action figure.  Its limbs can be adjusted for different poses, and it is designed to do battle against a wide variety of crooks and supervillains, sold separately."
msgstr "一个超级英雄玩具人偶。它的四肢可以调整为不同姿势，用来与各种各样的骗子和超级恶棍做斗争（反派需单独购买）。"

#. ~ Description of variant "brachiosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A sweet-faced brachiosaurus plushie with a long neck and oversized head.  It looks very wise!"
msgstr "一个有着长脖子和大头的可爱腕龙玩偶，看起来非常的智慧。"

#. ~ Description of variant "penguin plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A velvety-soft plush penguin.  It makes a funny noise when you hug it."
msgstr "一只天鹅绒般柔软的毛绒企鹅。当你拥抱它时，它会发出一种滑稽的声音。"

#. ~ Description of variant "deer plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A very huggable white-tailed deer plushie with soft, brown fur and a cute expression with adorable antlers."
msgstr "一只非常可爱的白尾鹿毛绒玩具，拥有柔软的棕色皮毛，可爱的表情和讨人喜爱的鹿角。"

#. ~ Description of variant "robot figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A very intricate looking model of a robotic skeleton with red eyes and a futuristic weapon in its hand."
msgstr "一个精巧的骨架机器人模型，有着红色的眼睛，手里拿着一把未来风格的武器。"

#. ~ Description of variant "crab plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "An amazing crab plushie with soft, textured blue and red bumpy shell and big, curious eyes."
msgstr "一款令人惊叹的螃蟹毛绒玩具，拥有柔软、有质感的蓝色和红色凹凸不平的外壳和好奇的大眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "lizardman figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "An expensive figurine of a buff man in streetwear with a lizard head, holding a pair of knives in his hands."
msgstr "一个昂贵的蒙眼男手办，穿着街头服饰，留着蜥蜴头，手持一对锋利的匕首。"

#. ~ Description of variant "anime figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "An expensive figurine of a cartoon woman in flashy clothing."
msgstr "一个穿着华丽服装的卡通女性的昂贵手办。"

#. ~ Description of variant "alien figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "An expensive looking figurine of a gnarly, jet-black alien covered in menacing looking spines."
msgstr "一个看起来很昂贵的外星人手办，它身上粗糙不平，乌黑发亮，还长满了看起来很危险的尖刺。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Canadian lynx plushie"
msgid_plural "Canadian lynx plushies"
msgstr[0] "猞猁玩偶"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "imperfect doll"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Hug the imperfect doll."
msgstr "拥抱残破玩偶。"

#. ~ Description of "imperfect doll"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Its legs are mismatched, its arms misshapen, its eyes more crooked than its smile.  Everywhere, it sparkles with the golden thread that has put it back together.  It's beautiful."
msgstr "它长着极不协调的腿和畸形的手臂，带着一股扭曲的眼神和微笑。闪闪发光的金线让它不至于破碎。它很漂亮。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Japanese macaque plushie"
msgid_plural "Japanese macaque plushies"
msgstr[0] "日本猕猴玩偶"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "fidget spinner"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Spin"
msgstr "旋转"

#. ~ Variant name of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "T-rex figurine"
msgid_plural "T-rex figurines"
msgstr[0] "霸王龙手办"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "T-rex plushie"
msgid_plural "T-rex plushies"
msgstr[0] "霸王龙玩偶"

#. ~ Description of "threadbare cotton arms"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "The spun cloth fingers are fraying away.  There's nothing that they could hold on to."
msgstr "磨破了的布质手指，什么都抓不住。"

#. ~ Description of "floppy cotton legs"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "They're different colors and different lengths.  It would be hard to run away with these."
msgstr "它们颜色各异，长短不一，带着这些东西会让你难以逃跑。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Japanese macaque plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This Japanese macaque plushie features a soft, brown grayish fur, with a reddish-brown face and hands."
msgstr "这款日本猕猴毛绒玩具具有柔软的棕灰色皮毛，脸和手呈红棕色。"

#. ~ Description of variant "wild boar plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This big wild boar plushie features a soft tuft of coarse, dark fur along its spine, with a soft and plushy body.  It also has a pair of soft tusks protruding from its snout and has a fierce expression."
msgstr "这款大野猪毛绒玩具的脊椎上有一簇柔软的粗糙深色毛皮，身体柔软而毛绒。  它的口鼻部还伸出一对柔软的獠牙，表情凶狠。"

#. ~ Description of variant "golden lion tamarin plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This bright, extremely cute golden lion tamarin plushie features long, soft, and golden-colored fur and a extremely playful demeanor.  On the label it says that it is an ambassador of its species, and that the amounts collected in the sales of the plushies were donated to help the conservation of the species.  Surely now, without many humans, maybe these animals don't have to worry so much about their habitat being destroyed."
msgstr "这款明亮、极其可爱的金狮面狨毛绒玩具具有长而柔软的金色皮毛和极其俏皮的举止。  标签上写着它是该物种的大使，销售毛绒玩具所收集的资金将捐献给该物种的保护。  当然，现在没有很多人类，也许这些动物不必太担心它们的栖息地被破坏。"

#. ~ Description of variant "howler monkey plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This cute and cuddling howler monkey plushie has soft, brown fur, and produces a sound that mimics the howler monkey's signature hooting noise when hugged properly."
msgstr "这款可爱且令人抱抱的吼猴毛绒玩具拥有柔软的棕色皮毛，正确拥抱时会发出模仿吼猴标志性叫声的声音。"

#. ~ Description of variant "black lion tamarin plushie plushie" of item
#. "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This extremely cute black lion tamarin plushie features a soft black fur, bright orange hands and feet along with expressive, friendly eyes.  On the label it says that it is an ambassador of its species, and that the amounts collected in the sales of the plushies were donated to help the conservation of the species.  Surely now, without many humans, maybe these animals don't have to worry so much about their habitat being destroyed."
msgstr "这款极其可爱的黑狮狨猴毛绒玩具具有柔软的黑色皮毛、亮橙色的手和脚以及富有表现力、友善的眼睛。  标签上写着它是该物种的大使，销售毛绒玩具所收集的资金将捐献给该物种的保护。  当然，现在没有很多人类，也许这些动物不必太担心它们的栖息地被破坏。"

#. ~ Description of variant "fruit bat plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This fruit bat plushie is tan in color, with soft, fuzzy fur.  It has delicate pointed ears and a sweet, friendly expression with big, brown eyes.  This plushie has special hanging capabilities that let it cling to objects using its feet, simulating the playful behavior of a real fruit bat.  It also come with a removable plush red fruit, probably a berry of some kind, that it can 'eat'."
msgstr "这只果蝠毛绒玩具是棕褐色的，皮毛柔软、毛茸茸的。它长着精巧的尖耳朵和棕色的眼睛，表情很温和。它特有的抓握功能使它能够用爪子攀在任何物体上，来模拟一只顽皮的蝙蝠。它的软爪子中还塞着一颗毛绒浆果，看起来它们是配套的。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sheep plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This loving and fluffy sheep plushie features soft woolly fur in white, with cute floppy ears and expressive eyes."
msgstr "这只可爱又蓬松的绵羊毛绒玩具，有着柔软的白色羊毛，可爱的垂耳和传神的眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "black sheep plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This loving and fluffy sheep plushie features soft, woolly fur in black, with cute floppy ears and somewhat careless, bored eyes."
msgstr "这款可爱蓬松的绵羊毛绒玩具具有柔软的黑色羊毛皮毛、可爱的下垂耳朵和略显漫不经心、无聊的眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pink sheep plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This loving and fluffy sheep plushie features soft, woolly fur in pink, with cute floppy ears and square-pixeled eyes, for some reason."
msgstr "这款可爱蓬松的绵羊毛绒玩具具有柔软的粉红色羊毛皮毛，出于某种原因，有可爱的下垂耳朵和方形像素的眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pig plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This loving, precious pig plushie has a soft pink fur, with endearing floppy ears and bright eyes.  It also has a plush snout with brown fur on its legs and paws.  Its nose is somewhat long and black, and its eyes are large and expressive."
msgstr "这款可爱而珍贵的小猪毛绒玩具拥有柔软的粉红色皮毛、可爱的下垂耳朵和明亮的眼睛。  它还有一个毛绒的鼻子，腿和爪子上有棕色的毛皮。  它的鼻子又长又黑，眼睛又大又富有表情。"

#. ~ Description of variant "white unicorn plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This majestic unicorn plushie features a soft white body and horn, with tufts of white hair on its neck and tail.  Its black eyes are adorably large and round."
msgstr "这款雄伟的独角兽毛绒玩具拥有柔软的白色身体和角，脖子和尾巴上有一簇白色的毛发。  它的黑色眼睛又大又圆，非常可爱。"

#. ~ Description of variant "white unicorn plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This majestic unicorn plushie features a soft white body and horn, with tufts of white hair on its neck and tail.  Its black eyes are adorably large and round.  For some odd reason, this one is wielding a plush knife with its forehooves."
msgstr "这款雄伟的独角兽毛绒玩具拥有柔软的白色身体和角，脖子和尾巴上有一簇白色的毛发。  它的黑色眼睛又大又圆，非常可爱。  出于某种奇怪的原因，它用前蹄挥舞着一把毛绒刀。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mandrill monkey plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This mandrill monkey plushie is striking due to the bright colorful features present in its face (mandrills are known for that, after all).  This plushie has a movable jaw that reveals soft plush teeth when opened, giving it a realistic appearance."
msgstr "这款山魈猴毛绒玩具因其面部明亮的彩色特征而引人注目（毕竟，山魈以此而闻名）。  这款毛绒玩具有一个可移动的下巴，打开时会露出柔软的毛绒牙齿，使其具有逼真的外观。"

#. ~ Description of variant "marmoset plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "This precious and cute marmoset plushie features a fluffy and dense brown fur, and a long fluffy tail like the real animal."
msgstr "这款珍贵可爱的狨猴毛绒玩具具有蓬松浓密的棕色皮毛，以及像真正的动物一样长而蓬松的尾巴。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_spinner_spinning" in use action of
#. item "fidget spinner"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "You spin your fidget spinner."
msgstr "你转起指尖陀螺。"

#. ~ Description of variant "reaper figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Your heart leaps to your throat as you see the face of Death itself staring back at you, scythe raised for the harvest!  You relax significantly once you realize it's only a few inches tall and made of plastic."
msgstr "当你看到死神的面孔盯着你，举起镰刀准备收割时，你的心一下子跳到了嗓子眼！然后你意识到它只有十几厘米高，而且是塑料做的……"

