#. ~ Description of "carbon fiber boat hull"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/boat.json
msgid "A rigid carbon fiber sheet that keeps the boat afloat.  Add boat hulls to a vehicle until it floats, then attach oars or a motor to get the boat to move."
msgstr "一张让船只保持浮力的坚固碳素纤维板。可多层加装到载具上直到浮起。然后可以加上桨或者引擎来为船只提供动力。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic boat hull"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/boat.json
msgid "A rigid plastic sheet that keeps the boat afloat.  Add boat hulls to a vehicle until it floats, then attach oars or a motor to get the boat to move."
