#. ~ Description of "medium steam engine"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/engine.json
msgid "A medium-sized steam engine.  An integrated boiler burns coal to heat water into steam, driving a reciprocating shaft.  A condenser recaptures the water, making this a closed-cycle system."
