#: data/json/items/vehicle/farming.json
msgid "An advanced electronic device used to cut down, collect, and store crops."
msgstr "高级电子设备，用于割倒、收集并存储农作物。"

#. ~ Description of "reaper"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/farming.json
msgid "An assembly of a blade, wheels, and a small lever for engaging/disengaging, used to cut down crops prior to picking them up."
