#: data/json/items/vehicle/farming.json
msgid "An assembly of motors and sheet metal that allows a vehicle to clean the road surface by removing debris and contaminants."
msgstr "由引擎和大块金属组装而成，能够允许车辆清除道路上的废墟及各类污染物。"

