#. ~ Description of "advanced solar panel array"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
msgid "A collection of four smaller solar panels, ready to convert solar radiation into electric power.  These panels are high-performance, made with monocrystalline silicon cells."
msgstr "四个较小的太阳能电池板的集合，准备将太阳辐射转化为电能。  这些面板具有高性能，由单晶硅电池制成。"

#. ~ Description of "solar panel array"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
msgid "A collection of four solar panels, ready to get to work converting solar radiation into electric power.  Install them to use them in a static power grid."
msgstr "一组由四块太阳能电池板组成的装置，随时都能开始将太阳辐射转换成电能。安装它们以便将其接入家电电网。"

#. ~ Description of "advanced reinforced solar panel"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "advanced reinforced solar panel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "A high-performance solar panel with sturdy brackets and wire guards across its face, trading efficiency for durability."
msgstr "高性能太阳能电池板，其表面配有坚固的支架和金属丝防护罩，以效率换取耐用性。"

#. ~ Description of "folding solar panel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
msgid "A portable solar panel which can be easily deployed to charge batteries on the go, though it's less efficient than a stationary panel would be."
msgstr "一种便携式太阳能电池板，可以轻松部署以在旅途中为电池充电，但其效率低于固定电池板。"

#. ~ Description of "advanced folding solar panel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
msgid "A portable solar panel which can be easily deployed to charge batteries on the go, though it's less efficient than a stationary panel would be.  This is a higher-end monocrystalline model."
msgstr "一种便携式太阳能电池板，可以轻松部署以在旅途中为电池充电，但其效率低于固定电池板。  这是一种更高端的单晶硅型号。"

#. ~ Description of "solar cell"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
msgid "A small electronic device that can convert solar radiation into electric power.  This one is a common, inexpensive type made of polycrystalline silicon."
msgstr "可以将太阳辐射能量转换成电能的小型电子设备。这是一种常见的、廉价的多晶硅电池。"

#. ~ Description of "advanced solar cell"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
msgid "A small electronic device that can convert solar radiation into electric power.  This one is a high-performance type made of monocrystalline silicon."
msgstr "可以将太阳辐射能量转换成电能的小型电子设备。这款高性能太阳能板是由单晶硅电池制成的。"

#. ~ Description of "reinforced solar panel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
msgid "A solar panel that has been reinforced to protect the delicate solar cells from zombies or errant baseballs.  This causes this panel to produce slightly less power than normal."
msgstr "一块太阳能电池板，覆盖着一层强化玻璃，以免脆弱的太阳能电池被丧尸或者打歪的棒球破坏。玻璃保护层导致电池功率略有降低。"

#. ~ Description of "advanced solar panel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
msgid "An electronic device that can convert solar radiation into electric power.  This one is a high-performance type made with monocrystalline silicon cells."
msgstr "可以将太阳辐射能量转换成电能的电子设备。这款高性能太阳能板是由单晶硅电池制成的。"

#. ~ Description of "solar panel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
msgid "An electronic device that can convert solar radiation into electric power.  Useful for a vehicle or a static power grid."
msgstr "可以将太阳辐射能量转换成电能的电子设备。用于制造载具，或者接入家电电网之中。"

