msgid "A crude wooden table."
msgstr "一张粗糙的木桌。"

#. ~ Description of "workbench (folded)"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/tables.json
msgid "A sturdy workbench made of metal and wood.  It is perfect for crafting large and heavy things, when unfolded."
msgstr "一个用金属制成的坚固的工作台。当它展开时非常适合用来制造巨大而沉重的物品。"

#. ~ Description of "fancy table"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/tables.json
msgid "A very fancy table for those with fancy lives.  If times were better, it might be useful for something other than firewood."
msgstr "一张从豪华房车上拆下的豪华桌子。如果情况不像现在一样糟的话，它可能除了被当成柴火烧掉还有点其他用途。"

