#. ~ Description of "heavy wheel hub assembly"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A heavy metal assembly that allows bolting a wheel onto a car.  Fit for a large car wheel."
msgstr "一种可以用螺栓把轮子固定在汽车上的重型金属部件。适合大型车轮。"

#. ~ Description of "roller drum"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "roller drum"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A large cylinder fashioned out of plates of hardened steel, normally found on road rollers.  Its massive weight is meant to, slowly, roll over asphalt and other surfaces, levelling them out."
msgstr "一个由硬化钢板制成的大型圆柱体，通常用于压路机上。其巨大的重量旨在缓慢碾压沥青及其他路面，从而将其压平。"

#. ~ Description of "bicycle rim"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A large, spoked rim for a bicycle tire."
msgstr "一个大大的自行车轮胎的辐条轮辋。"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel rim"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A medium-size steel rim for a car tire."
msgstr "一个汽车轮胎的中等尺寸的钢制轮辋。"

#. ~ Description of "medium wheel hub assembly"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A metal assembly that allows bolting a wheel onto a car.  Fit for a car wheel."
msgstr "一种可以用螺栓把轮子固定在汽车上的金属组件。适合汽车轮子。"

#. ~ Description of "off-road motorbike wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A motorbike wheel, studded for improved off-road performance."
msgstr "一个表面布满了钉状花纹，提供了更好抓地和越野性能的宽摩托车轮胎。"

#. ~ Description of "deflated 20" off-road motorbike wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A motorbike wheel, studded for improved off-road performance.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr "一个表面布满了钉状花纹，提供了更好抓地和越野性能的20英寸(约50厘米)的宽摩托车轮胎。它被放掉了气，需要充气后才能在载具上使用。"

#. ~ Description of "motorbike wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A motorbike wheel."
msgstr "一只摩托车轮胎。"

#. ~ Description of "deflated 16" motorbike wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A motorbike wheel.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr "一个16英寸(约41厘米)的摩托车轮胎。它被放掉了气，需要充气后才能在载具上使用。"

#. ~ Description of "skateboard trucks"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A pair metal skateboard trucks, for attaching wheels to."
msgstr "一对金属制成的支架，用于安装滑板轮。"

#. ~ Description of "pair of small rail wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A pair of small rail wheels.  It fits small railroad rails found in places like amusement parks.  Mostly for hobby purposes rather than transportation."
msgstr "一对窄轨火车车轮。它适合用在游乐园等地的观光窄轨铁路上。主要是为了观光游乐，而不是运输货物。"

#. ~ Description of "wheelchair wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A pair of wheels for a wheelchair."
msgstr "一副轮椅的轮毂。"

#. ~ Description of "light wheel mount"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "light wheel mount"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A piece of metal with holes suitable for a bike or motorbike wheel."
msgstr "一种带有孔的金属片，适合自行车或摩托车车轮使用。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden wheel mount"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A piece of wood with holes suitable for a bike wheel."
msgstr "一种带有孔的木片，适合自行车车轮使用。"

#. ~ Description of "small wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A pretty small wheel.  Probably from one of those Segway things.  It is not very menacing."
msgstr "一个非常小的轮子。可能是来自于那种体感车。不是很靠谱啊。"

#. ~ Description of "set of skateboard wheels"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "skateboard wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A set of four small wheels, for a skateboard."
msgstr "成套的四个小型滑轮，适用于滑板。"

#. ~ Description of "set of tricycle wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A set of hard plastic wheels with one larger than the other two.  Proudly made in the USA by Double Dango Productions."
msgstr "一套硬塑料轮子，其中一个比另外两个大。由美国双丹戈公司出品。"

#. ~ Description of "set of medium casters"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "medium casters"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A set of medium wheels mounted on pivots, like you'd find on a shopping cart."
msgstr "一套脚轮，就像超市购物车用的那种。"

#. ~ Description of "set of small casters"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small casters"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A set of small wheels mounted on pivots, like you'd find on a rolling office chair."
msgstr "一套安装在旋转轴上的小型车轮，和办公室里的旋转椅或是购物车的轮子那样。"

#. ~ Description of "concrete mixer wheel mounts"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "concrete mixer wheel mounts"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A set of two small wheel mounts from a concrete mixer."
msgstr "成套的四个小型滑轮，适用于滑板。"

#. ~ Description of "concrete mixer wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A set of two small wheels from a concrete mixer."
msgstr "成套的四个小型滑轮，适用于滑板。"

#. ~ Description of "set of large casters"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A set of wheels mounted on pivots, like you'd find a dumpster or a generator."
msgstr "一套安装在旋转轴上的小型车轮，和办公室里的旋转椅或是购物车的轮子那样。"

#. ~ Description of "metal wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A simple metal wheel."
msgstr "一个简单的金属轮。"

#. ~ Description of "16" racing tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A slick 16\" racing car tire for fitting to a medium steel rim."
msgstr "一个光滑的16英寸(约41厘米)竞赛轮胎，用于安装在中型轮辋上。"

#. ~ Description of "wheelbarrow wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A small wheel from a common garden wheelbarrow."
msgstr "一只园艺手推车的小型轮胎。"

#. ~ Description of "17" car tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A standard 17\" car tire for fitting to a medium steel rim."
msgstr "一个标准的17英寸(约43厘米)汽车轮胎，用于安装在中型轮辋上。"

#. ~ Description of "steel motorbike rim"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A steel rim for a motorbike tire."
msgstr "一个摩托车轮胎的钢制轮辋。"

#. ~ Description of "rail wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A strong rail wheel.  A flange helps keep it on a rail, but makes it perform terribly when not on a rail."
msgstr "一个坚固的金属火车轮。凸出的轮缘有助于保持在轨道上行进，但如果不沿着轨道行进，那它的性能会十分糟糕。"

#. ~ Description of "skate wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A very small plastic wheel with a punk attitude.  This wheel was made for skating."
msgstr "一个很小的塑料轮子，看上去很有朋克精神。这个轮子是用来造滑冰鞋的。"

#. ~ Description of "armored wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide military-grade wheel."
msgstr "一只军用宽轮胎。"

#. ~ Description of "wide steel rim"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide steel rim for a larger tire."
msgstr "一个大轮胎的宽钢圈。"

#. ~ Description of "24" wide tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide tire for fitting to a wide steel rim."
msgstr "一个24英寸(约61厘米)汽车宽轮胎，用于安装在宽轮辋上。"

#. ~ Description of "24" off-road wide tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide tire for fitting to a wide steel rim.  It's studded to provide better grip off-road at the cost of some performance on pavement."
msgstr "一个24英寸(约61厘米)汽车宽轮胎，用于安装在宽轮辋上。表面布满了钉状花纹，能在越野时提供更高的抓地力，但牺牲了在公路上行驶时的一些性能。"

#. ~ Description of "wide wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide wheel.  \\o/ This wide."
msgstr "一只宽车轮。\\o/ 有这么宽。"

#. ~ Description of "deflated 24" wide wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide wheel.  \\o/ This wide.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr "一个24英寸(约61厘米)宽车轮。它被放掉了气，需要充气后才能在载具上使用。"

#. ~ Description of "off-road wide wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide wheel.  \\o/ This wide.  It's studded to provide better grip off-road at the cost of some performance on pavement."
msgstr "一只宽车轮。\\o/ 有这么宽。表面布满了钉状花纹，能在越野时提供更高的抓地力，但牺牲了在公路上行驶时的一些性能。"

#. ~ Description of "deflated 24" off-road wide wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide wheel.  \\o/ This wide.  It's studded to provide better grip off-road at the cost of some performance on pavement.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr "一个宽车轮。表面布满了钉状花纹，能在越野时提供更高的抓地力，但牺牲了在公路上行驶时的一些性能。它被放掉了气，需要充气后才能在载具上使用。"

#. ~ Description of "deflated 16" racing wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide, smooth wheel intended for racing.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr "一个用于竞赛的表面光滑的16英寸(约41厘米)宽车轮。它被放掉了气，需要充气后才能在载具上使用。"

#. ~ Description of "racing wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide, smooth wheel intended for racing.  The slick surface provides better speed on pavement but penalizes off-road speed."
msgstr "一种用于竞赛的表面光滑的宽车轮。光滑的表面能提高公路行驶时的速度，但越野性能很差。"

#. ~ Description of "27" off-road bicycle tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide, studded bicycle tire intended to be fitted to a bicycle rim for off-road biking."
msgstr "一个表面布满了钉状花纹的宽27英寸(约69厘米)自行车轮胎，用于安装在自行车轮辋上，适合自行车越野时使用。"

#. ~ Description of "off-road bicycle wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide, studded bicycle wheel intended for off-road biking."
msgstr "一个表面布满了钉状花纹的宽自行车轮，适合自行车越野时使用。"

#. ~ Description of "deflated 27" off-road bicycle wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide, studded, bicycle wheel intended for off-road biking.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr "一个表面布满了钉状花纹的宽自行车轮，适合自行车越野时使用。它被放掉了气，需要充气后才能在载具上使用。"

#. ~ Description of "small wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
