#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Unsorted"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "A space for items which are to be sorted into other storage zones.  You can use the \"sort out items\" zone action to automatically move items from here to any valid destinations, including ones contained within this zone."
msgstr "该区域内的物品会被整理到其他储物区。你可以使用“整理物品”区域操作，自动将这里的物品移动到任何有效的目标位置，包括本区域内的其他容器。"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Unload Everything"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Any containers in this zone you don't otherwise sort will have their contents dumped out and placed on the same tile.  This includes corpses, magazines, and magazine wells."
msgstr "此区域中的容器可以通过\"整理物资\"或\"清空附近容器\"指令来将容器中的所有固体倒出，并放在同一格内。\"容器\"也包括尸体、弹匣和枪械。"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Strip Corpses"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Corpses in this zone you don't otherwise sort will have everything taken off them and dropped on the same tile."
msgstr "此区域中的所有尸体，如果使用\"清空附近容器\"指令，或者同时处于\"物资：待整理\"区域，并且进行\"整理物资\"活动时不会被分类，那么尸体身上的所有物品将会被倒出并放在同一格内。"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Bionics"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for Compact Bionic Modules, a.k.a. CBMs."
msgstr "所有生化插件CBM的分类放置区域。"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Ammo"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for ammo."
msgstr "所有弹药的分类放置区域。"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Default"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
