#. ~ Message of martial technique "Biojutsu Cleave"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> quickly cleaves through %s and those nearby!"
msgstr "<npcname>迅速地劈穿了%s和附近的敌人!"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Bionic Combatives"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "A modern combat style for the post-modern human.  Nicknamed \"Biojutsu\", Bionic Combatives combines integrated weaponry, armor, and augments into a consolidated fighting discipline."
msgstr "一种后现代的先进格斗术，简称\"生化术\"。生化格斗术将武器、护甲和其它生化插件结合，产生了这种统一的武术流派。"

#. ~ Description of buff "Bionic Combatives" in martial art "Reactive Defense"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Adjust stance to optimally deflect incoming attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+1 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 4 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff "Bionic Combatives" in martial art "Optimization"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Apply combat data from a defeated opponent.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, +15% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff "Bionic Combatives" in martial art "CQC Program
#. Alpha"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
