#. ~ Description of monster "prototype cyborg"
#: data/json/monsters/cyborgs.json
msgid "A human fused with a mess of metal parts and wires.  While their eyes are empty, the flashes of pain that occasionally cross their face remind you that, deep down, there is a person still trapped in this grotesque body.  Someone with enough surgical skills might be able to restore some of their humanity, but they'd first need to subdue them somehow."
msgstr "与零件、电缆融在一起的\"人\"，虽然眼神空洞，但转瞬即逝的痛苦表情仍提醒着你，在它的内心深处，有一个和你一样的人被困在这具怪诞的身体里。也许掌握了足够的外科手术技能的人，可以恢复它们的部分人性，但愿还有人在乎……"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cyborg"
#: data/json/monsters/cyborgs.json
msgid "This walking corpse is riddled with the broken promises of next-gen biotech.  Its flesh has gone black around the edges of its bionic armor plating, and its unpowered implants now serve only as dead weight."
msgstr "这具行尸走肉身上，满是次世代生物科技破灭承诺的残骸。其仿生装甲板边缘的肉体已发黑坏死，而无能源驱动的植入物如今仅沦为累赘的死重。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/cyborgs.json
msgid "prototype cyborg"
msgid_plural "prototype cyborgs"
msgstr[0] "原型改造人"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/cyborgs.json
msgid "zombie cyborg"
msgid_plural "zombie cyborgs"
msgstr[0] "丧尸改造人"

