#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_cop_fungal_infected"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "A maddened and crazed police officer infected by the fungus.  Their body armor is overgrown with fungal matter.  Though obviously in pain they don't seem any less keen to batter you to death with their baton."
msgstr "一个被真菌感染而暴怒发狂的警察军官，身上的护甲已经被长出的真菌物质所覆盖。虽然被真菌感染显得无比痛苦，可想用手中警棍殴打你的意图没有半点衰减。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral prepper"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "A quick glance at this person would suggest that they have prepared well enough for the apocalypse.  Unfortunately, they've been swept up in the tide of madness that killed the world.  One of their hands clasps the handle of a makeshift weapon, while the other grips a handgun."
msgstr "一眼望去就能发现它早已为世界末日做好了充足的准备。不幸的是，它布满血丝的眼睛，以及不死族对它的特殊对待表明它已堕入疯人一族。它的一只手紧握着一把自制武器的握把，而另一只手紧握着一把手枪。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mad scientist"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "A researcher who has stared too long into the abyss, and now shambles about muttering nonsense under their breath.  For some reason, the zombies don't seem to mind that this person is obviously still alive.  They're clutching a tiny but razor-sharp blade in one shaky hand."
msgstr "一个凝视了太久深渊的研究人员，现在不断低声咕哝着胡话。出于某种原因，丧尸们似乎并不介意这个显然还活着的人。它一只摇摇晃晃的手上抓着一把小而锋利的刀。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral biker"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "A rough-looking human, clad in black leather and wielding a pump-action shotgun.  It seems body-armor wasn't one of their priorities however."
msgstr "一个外表粗鲁的疯子，身穿黑色皮衣，手持一把泵动式霰弹枪。然而，防弹衣似乎并非它们的首选装备。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral cop"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Another of the crazed humans among the dead.  This police officer angrily mutters to themself, wandering about with a baton in hand in search of someone to brutalize."
msgstr "又一个在丧尸中疯掉的人。这个警察军官嘴上一直骂骂咧咧的，手拿警棍寻找着要暴力镇压的对象。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_labsecurity_flashlight"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "At first glance, this disheveled figure could almost pass for a survivor, but the bloodshot eyes give them away as one of the humans who have gone feral and joined the undead without dying.  Their uniform suggests that this was at some point a security guard, and they still carry a stun gun and a heavy-duty flashlight that looks like it could easily double as a club."
msgstr "乍一看，这个衣冠不整的人几乎可以算是个幸存者，但充满血丝的瞳孔却表露出它其实已经成为疯人们中的一员，虽未死却已经加入不死一族。制服表明它曾是一名警卫，其携带一把电击枪和一支看起来可以轻松当作棍棒使用的重型手电筒。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral pyromaniac"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Before the bombs fell, runaway fires were the biggest killers.  Now you behold one of their architects: a gibbering madman, reeking of fuel and painted all over with soot and ash that fail to conceal the glint of a knife."
msgstr "在核弹落下之前，失控的火灾是最大的杀手。而现在，你面对的是这些灾难的缔造者之一：一个口中喃喃自语的疯子，身上散发着刺鼻的燃油味，周身涂满了烟灰与尘垢——但这依然掩盖不住他手中闪烁的刀光。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral crewman"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Clad in a grimy and tattered naval uniform, this former sailor clutches a massive wrench as some form of makeshift weapon.  At a distance, you could mistake them as being another survivor.  However, upon closer inspection you make note of how their veins are visibly bulging, their wide open eyes have a primal, animalistic quality to their gaze, and their breaths come in ragged, wheezing pants.  Whatever the Cataclysm has done to the military crewman that this twitching shell of their former self once was, you're certain that they're not fully human anymore."
msgstr "这位前水手穿着肮脏破烂的海军制服，手里拿着一把巨大的扳手作为某种临时武器。  从远处看，你可能会误认为他们是另一个幸存者。  然而，仔细观察后，你会注意到他们的静脉明显鼓起，他们睁大的眼睛有一种原始的、兽性的品质，他们的呼吸来自破烂、喘息的裤子。  无论大灾变对军事船员造成了什么影响，他们以前的这个抽搐的躯壳曾经是什么样子，你可以肯定他们不再是完全的人类了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Clad in ancient armor and with a battle axe in hand, this maniac walks around in search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over their axe."
msgstr "穿着古老的盔甲，手持战斧，这个疯子四处走动寻找下一个猎物。你可以在战斧上看到干涸的血迹。"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Clad in ancient armor and with a mace in hand, this maniac walks around in search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over their mace."
msgstr "穿着古老的盔甲，手持狼牙棒，这个疯子四处走动寻找下一个猎物。你可以在狼牙棒上看到干涸的血迹。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_mop"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Clutching a stout mop in their quivering hands, this crewman was presumably assigned to basic deck sweeping in their final moments, before the Cataclysm struck and stripped them of their humanity.  Dressed in basic naval fatigues, you'd be forgiven for believing them to be another survivor.  However, their bloodshot eyes, blackened veins, and spastic twitching tell a far different story."
msgstr "这名船员颤抖着手中握着一把粗壮的拖把，大概在大灾变袭来并剥夺了他们的人性之前，在他们的最后时刻被指派进行基本的甲板清扫工作。  穿着基本的海军迷彩服，你相信他们是另一位幸存者也是情有可原的。  然而，他们充血的眼睛、发黑的静脉和痉挛性的抽搐却讲述了一个截然不同的故事。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_pipe_fungal_corpse"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores covering this person's body, and their facial expression is pure agony."
msgstr "无数纤细的菌柄从覆盖它全身的伤口中成排地萌发而出，而它的面部表情只剩下纯粹的痛苦。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_axe_fungal_corpse"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores on this person's arms, and their facial expression is pure agony."
msgstr "无数纤细的菌柄从覆盖它手臂的伤口中成排地萌发而出，而它的面部表情只剩下纯粹的痛苦。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar_fungal_corpse"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores on this person's arms, and their facial expression is pure agony.  Their mouth opens and closes softly in a silent moan."
msgstr "无数纤细的菌柄从覆盖它手臂的伤口中成排地萌发而出，而它的面部表情只剩下纯粹的痛苦。它的嘴伴随着无声的呻吟不断轻轻地开合着。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral survivor"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "If it weren't for the stooped posture and wild eyes, this person's gear and bladed weapon might mark them as another survivor of the Cataclysm.  Now they move among the dead like they're one of them, shaking like a rabid dog."
msgstr "如果不是弯腰的姿势和狂野的眼神，这个人的装备和利刃武器可能会让他们成为大灾变的又一个幸存者。  现在他们在死者中间移动，就像他们是死者中的一员一样，像疯狗一样颤抖。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a broom in hand, searching for a victim to sweep off this mortal coil."
msgstr "这个疯子曾经是某个富裕家庭的高级仆人，手里拿着扫帚四处走动，寻找一个受害者，为其扫除人世牵挂。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a candlestick in hand, ready to snuff out your life."
msgstr "这个疯子曾经是某个富裕家庭的高级仆人，手里拿着一个烛台四处走动，准备掐灭你的生命之火。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a knife in hand, searching for some victims to butcher."
msgstr "这个疯子曾经是某个富裕家庭的高级仆人，手里拿着刀四处走动，寻找着一位受害者，成为待宰羔羊。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_axe"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Spattered from head to toe in large swaths of dried viscera, the deep blue of this person's tattered naval uniform has been stained the color of rust.  Having seemingly had enough presence of mind to consider arming themself, this former crewman carries a crash axe in their shaking hands.  The veins on the back of their neck are visibly bulging, their eyes bloodshot, and a mass of crisscrossing blackened veins stand out against the pale skin of their face as they regard the area around them for perceived threats."
msgstr "从头到脚沾满了大片干涸的内脏，此人破烂的海军制服深蓝色已经被染成了铁锈色。  这位前船员似乎有足够的头脑考虑武装自己，他颤抖的手中拿着一把砍伐斧。  他们脖子后面的静脉明显凸出，眼睛布满血丝，当他们将周围的区域视为感知到的威胁时，大量纵横交错的黑色静脉在他们脸上苍白的皮肤上显得格外突出。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_lug_wrench"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Still dressed in a grease spattered uniform, this crewman appears to have once been a naval engineer.  With tangled hair, oil stained working attire, and a lug wrench clenched in their fist, you assume that they were either assigned to shipside maintenance or responsible for servicing onboard aircraft.  Now all that's left of the crewman that this person once was is a madly twitching, psychopathic monster."
msgstr "这名船员仍然穿着沾满油脂的制服，似乎曾经是一名海军工程师。  头发缠结，穿着沾满油污的工作服，拳头紧握扳手，你会认为他们要么被分配到船边维修，要么负责机上维修。  现在，这个人曾经是一名船员，只剩下一个疯狂抽搐、精神变态的怪物。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_knife"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The Cataclysm began as an outbreak of what then seemed like violent insanity, but there must be something more to it, as these lost souls freely walk among the undead without being attacked.  This one has got their hands on a kitchen knife, and they look eager to put it to use."
msgstr "大灾变开始时像是一次暴力疯狂的爆发，但其中一定有其他原因，因为这些迷失的灵魂可以在不死生物中自由行走而不被攻击。这个家伙拿了一把厨刀，看起来很渴望使用它。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral biker"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral biker fires their shotgun!"
msgstr "疯人车手击发了它的霰弹枪！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "well dressed feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral human shoots their crossbow!"
msgstr "盛装疯人射出了弩箭！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral human"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "mon_feral_human_knife"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral mechanic"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral human throws a rock!"
msgstr "野性疯人扔了一块石头！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral militia"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral militiaman fires their rifle!"
msgstr "疯狂民兵击发了它的步枪！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral officer"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral officer fires their M18!"
msgstr "疯人海军军官击发了它的 M18 手枪！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral prepper"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral prepper haphazardly fires their firearm!"
msgstr "有备疯人偶然击发了手中的枪械！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral pyromaniac"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral pyromaniac throws a Molotov cocktail!"
msgstr "野性纵火狂投掷了燃烧瓶！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral security guard"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral security guard fires their Beretta M9A1!"
msgstr "疯人警卫击发了它的伯莱塔 M9A1 手枪！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral warden"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral warden fires their rifle!"
msgstr "疯狂民兵击发了它的步枪！"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral warden"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The warden of this prison is somehow still alive, but that doesn't mean they haven't turned.  They still regard these surroundings with cold authority, even wielding a rifle to back it up, but their staring bloodshot eyes and eerie silence mark them as one of the billions whose minds shattered under the unbearable weight of the Cataclysm."
msgstr "这所监狱的典狱长不知何故还活着，但这并不意味着他们没有回转。  他们仍然以冷酷的权威看待周围的环境，甚至挥舞着步枪来支持它，但他们凝视的血丝眼睛和令人毛骨悚然的沉默标志着他们是数十亿在大灾变的难以承受的重压下精神崩溃的人之一。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Their pupils are dilated and what can be seen of the iris and sclera are bloodshot.  This crowbar-wielding maniac still breathes, but the zombies treat them like one of their own."
msgstr "它的瞳孔扩大，眼中残存的虹膜和眼白已经充血变得鲜红。这个握着撬棍的疯子还能呼吸，但丧尸们已经把它当成自己中的一员。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral human"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Their pupils are dilated and what can be seen of the iris and sclera are bloodshot.  This pipe-wielding maniac still breathes, but the zombies treat them like one of their own."
msgstr "它的瞳孔扩大，眼中残存的虹膜和眼白已经充血变得鲜红。这个握着钢管的疯子还能呼吸，但丧尸们已经把它当成自己中的一员。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral axe murderer"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "They stumble along, clutching an axe.  Their face is twisted into a sadistic grin, and they walk among the dead as though already one of them."
msgstr "它拖着血染的大斧步履蹒颠。脸上扭曲着嗜虐的笑颜，游走死者之间，仿佛已成了其中的一员。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral mechanic"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "This maniac was probably a mechanic before the Cataclysm.  Now, they're reduced to a mad thing, still wearing the remains of a work uniform and clutching a hammer that is now nothing more than a weapon."
msgstr "这个疯子很可能是大灾变之前的一名机械师。  现在，他们变成了疯子，仍然穿着工作服的残骸，手里拿着一把锤子，而锤子现在只不过是一件武器。"

#. ~ Description of monster "cunning feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "This person is lost to the madness that killed the world, but their movements seem steadier than others of their kind.  They're carrying a crude spear, and have assembled some basic armor from whatever they could find.  Despite these signs of greater intelligence, this creature is still only a few steps away from being a zombie themself."
msgstr "这个人已陷入毁灭世界的疯狂之中，但其动作似乎比同类地稳健。他们拿着一支简陋的矛，并用随手能找到的材料拼凑了一些基础护甲。尽管这些迹象表明其拥有更高的智能，但这个生物距离变成僵尸也仅剩一步之遥了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral officer"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "This person, clad in the tattered uniform of a naval officer, twitches erratically as their bloodshot eyes dart about and their breaths come in ragged pants.  The Cataclysm has clearly done something horrible to this military professional, inaudible mutterings emanating from their lips as they creep about like a skittish animal.  In their quivering hands they clutch a service pistol, the officer's fingers nervously fidgeting with the weapon.  They may not be an undead corpse, but you doubt that they're any more rational than the zombies which now infest the world."
msgstr "这个人穿着海军军官的破烂制服，不规则地抽搐，充血的眼睛四处转动，呼吸声透过破烂的裤子。  大灾变显然对这位军事专业人士造成了可怕的影响，他们像受惊的动物一样蠕动，从嘴唇中发出听不见的嘀咕声。  他们颤抖的手中握着一把军用手枪，警官的手指紧张地摆弄着武器。  他们可能不是不死尸体，但你怀疑他们比现在肆虐世界的僵尸更理性。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral security guard"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "This security guard still breathes, but has been lost to some terrible madness.  They move among the undead, handgun at the ready and saucer pupils scanning for threats in a mockery of their former duty."
msgstr "这个警卫仍在呼吸，但已经深陷于某种可怕的疯狂之中。它与它的不死族人一同行动，手中的手枪已经上膛，鲜红的瞳孔扫视着四周的威胁，仿佛是对它从前职责的无情嘲弄。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral marine"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "This twitching, bloodied person is still clad in a ragged naval uniform, the insignia of the marines visible on their coat and a corresponding tattoo on their forearm.  Clutching a rifle in their quivering hands, you see them repeatedly pull the weapon's trigger, constantly muttering incoherently and yanking back on the gun's charging handle every time the rifle fails to fire.  Seemingly having lost the capability to comprehend that their weapon is empty, you'd feel relatively safe were it not for the gleaming bayonet still attached to the end of their firearm."
msgstr "这个浑身抽搐、血迹斑斑的人仍然穿着一件破烂的海军制服，外套上清晰可见海军陆战队的徽章，前臂上有相应的纹身。  他们颤抖的手中紧握着步枪，你会看到他们不断地扣动武器的扳机，不断地语无伦次地嘟囔着，每次步枪无法开火时，他们都会猛地拉回枪的充电手柄。  似乎已经失去了理解他们的武器是空的的能力，如果不是因为他们的枪支末端仍然附有闪闪发光的刺刀，你会感到相对安全。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral militia"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Wearing a tactical getup with a Kevlar vest, this person seems to have been a militia member, now lost to madness.  They scan for threats with bloodshot eyes and a semi-automatic rifle, and a flashlight strapped to their helmet illuminates their surroundings."
msgstr "这个身穿凯夫拉背心及迷彩服的疯子似乎是当地民兵，但已经发疯了。它的双手紧握着一把半自动步枪，眼睛布满血丝，四处寻找着威胁；绑在它头盔上的手电筒照亮了它的存在和周围的环境。"

#. ~ Description of monster "well dressed feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Wearing fancy clothes and with a crossbow in hand, this maniac was once a socialite.  Their hands caress the crossbow as if touching a loved one."
msgstr "穿着花哨的衣服，手里拿着弩，这个疯子曾经是个社交名流。它的手似乎抚摸着弩，好像抚摸着心爱的人。"

#. ~ Description of monster "well dressed feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "Wearing fancy clothes and with a rapier in hand, this maniac was once a socialite.  They smile with madness and seem like they want to invite you to dinner."
msgstr "穿着花哨的衣服，手里拿着剑，这个疯子曾经是个社交名流。它疯狂地笑着，似乎想邀请你吃饭。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral soldier"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "What was once a service member has been lost to the madness that devoured the world.  Tense, dirty hands grip a combat knife as their bloodshot eyes scan for threats."
msgstr "这位身穿防弹背心及军装的人似乎曾经是一名训练有素的军人，现在早已发疯。它紧绷、肮脏的双手握着一把战术匕首，布满血丝的眼睛不断扫视着四周的威胁。"

