#. ~ Description of monster "blight horse"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "A carpet of shaggy mold covers this decaying horse, scattering a puff of spores with each staggering step.  It travels towards anything moving, even though in the center of each eye lies multiple fungal blooms."
msgstr "这匹腐烂的马身上覆盖着一层毛茸茸的霉菌地毯，每迈出一步，就会散落一团孢子。  它会朝着任何移动的物体移动，尽管每只眼睛的中心都有多个真菌花朵。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "A rotund and bloated human body with pasty, fungus-ridden flesh.  Its mouth drips with a frothing gray sludge."
msgstr "这具腐败的丧尸身上充满了浮肿的烂肉和发芽的真菌。更恐怖的是这货的嘴里流淌着污泥。"

#. ~ Description of monster "pollinator zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "Every breath of this crooked, fungus-ridden zombie emits a fine dust of spores, and it constantly looks like it's emerging from a cloud of mist."
msgstr "这只扭曲的布满真菌的丧尸的每一次呼吸都喷射出一片孢子尘，使它看起来就像是从迷雾中诞生一般。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal runner"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "Fungal sprouts seem to support the host's broken legs like crude splints.  Even with its eyes shrouded with tiny spores, it darts towards anything that seems to move in a small radius."
msgstr "真菌芽似乎像粗糙的夹板一样支撑着宿主的断腿。 即使它的眼睛笼罩着微小的孢子，它也会冲向任何似乎在小半径范围内移动的东西。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal juggernaut"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "Fungi bloom from the crevices in the ossified plates of this ponderous bone titan, and it seems even its eyes are lost to it.  A dust of spores lands on the ground with every sluggish stomp of its heavy legs."
msgstr "真菌从这只笨重的骷髅巨兽的骨板缝隙中长出，它的眼睛似乎已经被真菌破坏。它移动缓慢，而每一次踏步都使一片孢子尘飘落在地。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal skeletal zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal skeletal brute"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "Fungi bloom from the crevices in the twisted bone growths that cover this creature.  Spores linger in the air around it."
msgstr "真菌从覆盖在这只怪物的扭曲的骨板缝隙中长出。它周围的空气中飘荡着孢子尘。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal raptor"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "Infested by a thick crust of fungal growth, this small, winged predator darts through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet.  It looks like nothing you've seen on Earth, and yet strangely like it is made of human parts."
msgstr "被一层生长着厚厚真菌的外壳所感染，这种长着翅膀小型猛兽在空中飞来飞去，它的三对翅膀上十分蓬松，看起来就像被拉长的人手。在翅膀会合的地方长出了一根锯齿状的尖刺。它看上去根本一点都不像地球上的任何生物，然而奇怪的是，它又是由各种人类的肢体构成的。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal child"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "It is hard to recognize a human child in this creature.  Disgusting-looking mold covers most of its skin.  Many cracks perforate its body, with small fungal stalks poking through."
msgstr "一只真菌生物，很难认出这曾经是一个人类儿童。霉菌几乎覆盖住了它全部的皮肤，身体遍布裂痕穿孔，无数细小的菌丝在其中穿插蠕动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "Once alive, then undead, now something else entirely.  Fungal tendrils sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, holding together a shambling mass of mold-covered flesh."
msgstr "一具曾是人类的尸体，现在完全变成了怪物。真菌从它的口、眼、耳和其他孔洞处喷薄而出并互相连接起来，被霉菌覆盖的躯体还在蹒跚而行。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "bloated fungal zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "truffle pig"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts, releasing a cloud of spores."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "spore host"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "The air around this stumbling corpse seems to constantly warp and shift; Colors and shapes visibly distort in its presence.  It's no spacial anomaly, just a trick of the light passing through the ultra-fine haze of spores surrounding it."
msgstr "这具跌跌撞撞的尸体周围的空气似乎在不断地扭曲和变化。颜色和形状在它的存在下明显扭曲。  这并不是什么空间异常，只是光线穿过周围超细孢子雾的一个把戏。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mold dog"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "The deformed, animated, and again reanimated corpse of a what looked like the concept of a canine.  It has lost almost all of its dog-like features, except for its constant aggressive growling, and tendency to bite.  It shakes its fur like a wet dog, sending tiny spore clouds everywhere."
msgstr "一具变形的、充满活力的、又复活的尸体，看起来像是一只犬科动物的概念。  它几乎失去了所有像狗一样的特征，除了不断的攻击性咆哮和咬人倾向。  它像一只湿漉漉的狗一样抖动皮毛，将微小的孢子云散布到各处。"

#. ~ Description of monster "decaying fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "The rotten skin that flakes from the host's body seems to be covered in tiny blue dots; occasional popping and crackling sounds are heard, like cracking wood.  This corpse can't be discerned as human by the naked eye."
msgstr "从宿主身上剥落的腐烂皮肤上似乎布满了蓝色的小点； 偶尔会听到爆裂声和噼啪声，就像木头破裂的声音。 这具尸体用肉眼根本无法辨别是人类。"

#. ~ Description of monster "scarred fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "The tough callouses and scar tissue of this unfortunate corpse are the only remaining signs of something once made of flesh; any spot seemingly soft enough has been thoroughly punctured by thick fungal tendrils that have started to creep over this disfigured husk."
msgstr "这具不幸的尸体上坚韧的老茧和疤痕组织是曾经由血肉构成的东西唯一残留的迹象。任何看似足够柔软的地方都被厚厚的真菌卷须彻底刺穿，这些真菌卷须已经开始在这个毁容的外壳上爬行。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungideer"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "This bumpy, discolored reindeer resembles a malformed Rudolph, its nose having a faintly glowing red fungal sprout.  It'd look almost comical if it wasn't mutilating bodies with its innate strength."
msgstr "这只凹凸不平、变色的驯鹿就像畸形的鲁道夫，它的鼻子上长着微弱的红色真菌芽。  如果不是用天生的力量残害身体，那简直就是滑稽可笑。"

#. ~ Description of monster "moldering deer"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "This deer's thick fur is spotted with blue orbs that seem to pop and ooze every few minutes, and its rotten skin seems unable to fall off, held together by thick fungal bedding underneath."
msgstr "这只鹿厚厚的皮毛上布满了蓝色的球体，似乎每隔几分钟就会爆裂和渗出，它腐烂的皮肤似乎无法脱落，由下面厚厚的真菌垫层固定在一起。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal moose"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "This formerly-majestic beast has lost any semblance of what a moose is, aside from its outgrown antlers, now covered in writhing fungal tendrils, seemingly trying to break into the cracking bone.  The animated corpse seems to be in a state of constant disrepair, held together by strange, sticky blue orbs."
msgstr "这种曾经雄伟的野兽已经失去了驼鹿的任何外表，除了它那长大的鹿角，现在覆盖着翻腾的真菌卷须，似乎试图闯入开裂的骨头。  这具动画尸体似乎一直处于年久失修的状态，由奇怪的粘性蓝色球体固定在一起。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal zombie crawler"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "This fungal monster struggles to move as bulbous mushrooms grow from its exposed back.  Its leg seems to be wrapped in sturdy tendrils, and its arms visibly swell and pop gruesomely with each drag along the ground."
msgstr "当球状蘑菇从它裸露的背部生长时，这种真菌怪物挣扎着移动。  它的腿似乎被坚固的卷须包裹着，它的手臂明显地肿胀，并且随着地面的每一次拖曳而可怕地弹出。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal tiger"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "This rotting tiger has lost its stumble, as large fungal bulbs seem to have extended its pawpads thoroughly.  Its head crackles when trying to turn, seemingly stuck facing forward."
msgstr "这只腐烂的老虎已经失去了绊脚石，因为巨大的真菌球茎似乎已经彻底延长了它的爪垫。  当它试图转动时，它的头会发出噼啪声，似乎正面朝前。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wretch"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "This severely deformed child lies on its back, its ribs exposed to the sky.  With its limbs contorted in ways only possible through a lack of bones, the child's ribcage stretches far beyond the boundaries of human biology, appearing akin to a bony hive coated in quivering fungal matter.  Spores occasionally waft from its hollowed interior, and, periodically, you can catch sight of weak movement within the abomination's guts."
msgstr "这个严重畸形的孩子仰面躺着，肋骨暴露在天上。  由于四肢因缺乏骨骼而扭曲，孩子的胸腔远远超出了人类生物学的界限，看起来类似于一个覆盖着颤抖真菌物质的骨蜂巢。  孢子偶尔会从它中空的内部飘出，并且时不时地，你可以看到这可憎之物的内脏里微弱的运动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal bulk"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "This terrifying fungal construct seems to have lost all facial features, its face covered in thick fungal sprouts.  Its arms end in jagged points as fungal tendrils burst forth."
msgstr "这个可怕的真菌丧尸似乎失去了所有的面部特征，它的脸上覆盖着厚厚的真菌芽。 它的手臂末端呈锯齿状，真菌须从中爆发出来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal feeder"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "Thousands upon thousands of fungal bulbs, sprouts and tendrils jut out from every angle of this walking carcass.  Large patches of yellow pulsating mold seem to be growing in the zombie's fat folds."
msgstr "成千上万的真菌球茎、芽苗和卷须从这具行走的尸体的各个角度伸出。 大片的黄色脉动霉菌似乎正在丧尸的脂肪褶皱中生长。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "fungal wretch"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "Through a plume of fungal spores, a small beast struggles to take flight from the wretch's abdomen!"
msgstr "透过一缕真菌孢子，一只小野兽奋力从这个可怜虫的腹部飞走！"

#. ~ Description of monster "truffle pig"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "What was once a pig is now covered in black mold.  Its eyes have been eaten away, but its nose still twitches and sniffs the air, and the tumorous fungal growth riddling its body make for formidable armor.  Its belly is worryingly distended."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bloated fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "With its swollen gray skin overgrown by thick layer of mold, this balloon-like fungal zombie looks like it could violently burst into a cloud of noxious spores at any moment."
msgstr "这只真菌丧尸肿胀的灰白皮肤上长满了厚厚的真菌，如同气球一般隆起，随时都有可能爆炸变成一团孢子云。"

