msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstable fire ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s's abdomen suddenly contracts."
msgstr "%s的腹部突然收缩。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A baby mutant cockroach about the size of a rat."
msgstr "一只体积约有老鼠一样大的变异蟑螂的幼虫。"

#. ~ Description of monster "helpless dog"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A barely living dog, panting in a pool of slime and blood.  As you draw near it lets out a faint whimper, and you see the smallest hint of a twitch in its tail."
msgstr "一只勉强还活着的狗，在一滩黏液和血泊中不停喘息。当你走近它时，它发出微弱的呜咽声，你看到它尾巴上有轻微的抽搐。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized black widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A black mutant spider the size of a housecat with a long legs and oversized fangs.  There is a red hourglass shape on the underside of its bulbous abdomen."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的变异黑色蜘蛛，长着细长的腿、大大的眼睛和超大的獠牙。在它的胸前有着一个红色沙漏状的图案。"

#. ~ Description of monster "bloodbank mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A bloated abdomen the size of a dumpster floats like a balloon, aided but surely not carried by a pair of furiously beating wings.  The flying freakshow is still recognizable as a mosquito thanks to its spindly legs and spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr "垃圾箱大小的肿胀腹部像气球一样漂浮着，有一对猛烈拍打的翅膀帮忙，但肯定不是它的支撑。  由于其细长的腿和矛尖的长鼻，这种会飞的怪物仍然可以被认出是蚊子。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A brightly-colored mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but beware its venom."
msgstr "一只颜色鲜艳的变异蜈蚣，有狗一般大小，快速地在灌木丛中穿行。它也许不会把你当作猎物，但是要小心它的毒液。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A caterpillar undergoing a metamorphosis.  Considering the size of the cocoon, you have a feeling the emerging adult will be massive as well."
msgstr "正在蜕变的毛毛虫。考虑到茧的大小，你已经能感觉到新生的成虫会有多巨大了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A cellar spider - also known as \"daddy long-legs\" - grown to distressing size.  Its body is about the size of your head, with the long, spindly legs raising it up to your knee.  It tries getting away from you with an unnervingly fluid run."
msgstr "一只地窖蛛——也被称为\"长腿爸爸\"——长到了令人痛心的大小。它的身体和你的头差不多大，细长的腿可以举到你的膝盖上。它试图以一种令人不安的流畅步伐远离你。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A colorful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge ovipositor extruding from her abdomen.  She darts around in search of a suitable home for her many, many children."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的彩色的寄生蜂，腹部长着一个巨大的产卵器。它飞来飞去，为她许许多多的孩子寻找一处合适的家。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized queen ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A colossal red ant with a bulging, bloated thorax.  She moves slowly and deliberately, tending to nearby eggs and continually laying more."
msgstr "一只胸腔肿胀的巨大的红色蚂蚁。它移动缓慢而从容，在照顾四周的卵的同时继续产下更多的蚁卵。"

#. ~ Description of monster "deathtrap spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A cow-sized mutant spider with strong, thick legs and a bulbous thorax, dark brown in color.  Anything it pulls into its underground lair is unlikely to see the light of day again."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的变异蜘蛛，腿十分粗壮，胸部球状，呈深棕色。任何被它拖进地下巢穴的东西都不可能再见到阳光。"

#. ~ Description of monster "huge black widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A cow-sized mutated black widow spider with a distinctive red hourglass shape on its abdomen and fangs no doubt loaded with lethal venom."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的变异黑寡妇蜘蛛，在它的胸前有着一个红色沙漏状的图案。它仍然拥有臭名昭著的毒液，但它甚至不需要用上，就能把你像虫子一样碾碎。"

#. ~ Description of monster "enormous web spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A cow-sized mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light gray in color.  It moves ponderously, depending on its webs to prevent prey from fleeing."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的的变异草蛛，长着细长的腿，呈浅灰色。它动动十分笨重，依靠自己的网防止猎物逃跑。"

#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier acid ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A cow-sized woolly brown ant, corrosive liquid seeping from her abdomen.  Given the relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't doubt that this one could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的毛茸茸褐色巨蚁，。腐蚀性液体从它的巨大下颚渗出。考虑到蚂蚁的相对力量与其身体大小的关系，你毫不怀疑这只蚂蚁能轻易推着汽车到处跑，或者撕裂坚固的墙壁。"

#. ~ Description of monster "enormous wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A cow-sized, hairy mutant wolf spider.  Its mouthparts have noticeably changed, and it moves much more slowly now with the additional weight it needs to carry."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的多毛变异狼蛛。它的口器已经发生了明显的变异，由于如今需要带动额外体重，它的移动速度要慢得多。"

#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A cow-sized, hairy red ant.  Bulging pincers extend from her jaws.  Given the relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't doubt that this one could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的毛茸茸的红色巨蚁。它的下巴长出了一对凸出的钳子。考虑到蚂蚁的相对力量与其身体大小的关系，你毫不怀疑这只蚂蚁能轻易推着汽车到处跑，或者撕裂坚固的墙壁。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized trapdoor spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A dark brown mutant spider the size of a dog with a bulbous thorax, big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的变异深棕色蜘蛛，长着球型的胸腔、大大的眼睛和超大的獠牙。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik midwife"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A dermatik grown even larger, her wings and ovipositor chewed off by her sisters.  She now stands watch in the nest, tending to the unfortunate hosts dragged home and ensuring they don't perish before their purpose is fulfilled."
msgstr "一只翅膀和产卵器被她的姐妹们啃掉了的寄生蜂。它现在在巢穴里当看守，照顾那些被拖回家的不幸宿主，确保他们不会在目标实现之前死去。"

#. ~ Description of monster "large worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A disturbingly large mutated earthworm.  It possesses a fanged mouth and a slender body as tall as a man.  It has no eyes, but seems keenly interested in sound."
msgstr "一只令人不安的大型变异地下生物，可能是从蚯蚓之类变异而来的。长有吸血鬼般的尖牙利齿和与你膝盖同高的修长体形，边上肯定还有更多同类藏在地底下。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized acidic ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A dog-sized mutant brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small orifice at the tip.  Glistening liquid drips out periodically."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异棕色蚂蚁，它肿胀的腹部末端长着一个小孔，有闪闪发光的液体不时从中滴出。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant jumping spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A dog-sized mutant spider with big forelegs and two pairs of inquisitive-looking eyes.  It can leap quite quickly, even into the treetops."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异蜘蛛，长着大大的前腿和两对好奇的眼睛。它可以快速跳跃，甚至可以跳到树梢上。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant black widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A dog-sized mutated black widow spider.  There is a red hourglass shape on the underside of its bulbous abdomen.  A highly venomous nightmare come to life."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异黑寡妇蜘蛛。在它的胸前有着一个红色沙漏状的图案。这种蜘蛛毒素更加猛烈，犹如噩梦来袭。"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A dog-sized white grub, featureless apart from a vestigal mouthpart.  It hangs upside-down in its cell, and regurgitates sweet-smelling fluid in return for the scraps of viscera fed to it by the workers below."
msgstr "一只小狗大小的白色幼虫，除了退化的口器外没有其他特征。它倒挂在自己的巢室里，并反刍出一种带有甜味的液体，以换取下面工蜂给它喂食内脏碎片。"

#. ~ Description of monster "larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A fake monster.  If you're seeing this something went wrong."
msgstr "一个虚拟怪物。你不该在游戏中见到它。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A fat white grub as big as a squirrel, with a pair of large, spadelike mandibles."
msgstr "一个体积差不多与小猫一样大的肥硕蠕虫，有着非常锋利的下颚，正在贪婪的寻找能让它迅速成长的养分。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr "一只凶猛的、明亮的绿色蜻蜓，尽管长到了幼童大小，但仍然闪电般地飞快。它的头只不过剩下一双篮球大小的彩虹复眼，它的经过进化专门用来抓住猎物的腿上长满了弯曲的锋利尖刺。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant maggot"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A fly larva the size of a rat."
msgstr "老鼠大小的苍蝇幼虫。"

#. ~ Description of monster "centipede matriarch"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A giant centipede grown even larger, hind segments curled up to protect a huge clump of eggs and its children of different ages.  Sometimes one of its young gets shaken off by its clutchmates and disappears into the underbrush."
msgstr "一只更加庞大的巨型蜈蚣，尾部卷起并保护着一大堆卵和不同年龄的小蜈蚣。一两只小蜈蚣不时从母虫身上掉落下来，然后消失在灌木丛之中。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A giant mutant mosquito with a spindly body, it flutters erratically to keep its blood-swollen abdomen aloft.  Its face is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant web spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A giant, light gray mutant grass spider, it waits for prey to become ensnared in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."
msgstr "一只巨大的浅灰色织网蜘蛛，在丛林树木间编织这死亡的蛛网，等待猎物的上门。"

#. ~ Description of monster "twitching spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A giant, mutated spider lying on its back, legs twitching without pause.  A translucent slime, mixed with its ichor seeps from its joints, and its chitin is marked by numerous exit wounds."
msgstr "一只巨大的变异蜘蛛仰卧着，腿不停地抽搐。一种半透明的黏液，与它自身的体液混合后，从它的关节渗出，它的几丁质外壳上有许多破裂钻出的伤口。"

#. ~ Description of monster "skittering plague"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A giant, sickly-looking cockroach that appears to be using the undead as its primary food source.  If it's anything like the bugs from before the Cataclysm, it's probably not a picky eater."
msgstr "一只看起来得了病的巨型蟑螂，似乎正在利用丧尸作为其主要的食物来源。长期食用受感染的肉似乎并未对它造成伤害，但这只蟑螂的某些生化特性显然以及发生了变化。它似乎对你不感兴趣。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant trapdoor spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A gigantic dark brown spider with a bulbous thorax.  It digs a deep underground burrow that serves as a pit to trap unwary prey."
msgstr "一只巨大的深棕色蜘蛛，长着球型的胸腔，会挖掘出一个大坑，等待粗心大意的猎物掉入陷阱。"

#. ~ Description of monster "cave worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A gigantic mutated worm.  It has a round, gaping mouth lined with dagger-like teeth, and its flesh is slick with bubbling blue slime."
msgstr "一只变异的巨大蠕虫，隐匿在地下深处。它的圆形大口之中长着一圈刀刃般的利齿，血肉中泛着冒泡的蓝色黏液。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A gigantic wasp worker, scouring the landscape for an easy meal to feed the next generation.  Her abdomen glowers with ominous yellow stripes and ends in a half-hidden stinger the size of a kitchen knife."
msgstr "一只巨型黄蜂工蜂，在周围土地上搜寻着狩猎目标来喂养下一代。它的腹部上的黄色条纹发出不祥的光，末端长着一根菜刀大小的半隐藏的毒刺。"

#. ~ Description of monster "grasshopper nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A grasshopper nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "一只有兔子大小的蚱蜢若虫。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant aphid"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A green aphid about the size of a rabbit.  It is constantly searching for plants to suck from."
msgstr "一只体型和兔子一般大小的蚜虫。它不断地寻找可以吸取的植物。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized praying mantis"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A green mutant insect with sharp grappling spikes on its front legs.  It's a little smaller than an adult person."
msgstr "一只绿色的变异昆虫，前腿上长着尖锐的钩刺。它的体型比成年人稍小一点。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A huge brown spider in constant movement, with a small body the size of a child held up at chest level by a set of spindly legs that branch into three-pronged graspers at the end.  Unlike the smaller variant it obviously decided hunting you is worth a try, and follows you with mandibles chittering in anticipation."
msgstr "一只不停移动的巨大棕色蜘蛛，有一个孩子大的身体被一组细长的腿在胸前支撑住，这些腿在末端分支成三叉的抓手。与较小的变种不同，它显然觉得狩猎你值得一试，下颌骨一边发出叽叽喳喳的声音，一边期待地尾随着你。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cicada"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A huge cicada the size of a person.  These insects are mostly harmless but may bite if attacked and produce a loud buzzing sound."
msgstr "一只体型和人一般大小的巨型蝉。这些昆虫大多无害，但如果受到攻击，可能会咬人并发出响亮的嗡嗡声。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant grasshopper"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A huge green grasshopper about the size of a big dog, with long and strong back legs.  It hops, it hops and never stops."
msgstr "一只体型和大狗一般大小的巨型绿色蚱蜢，后腿又长又壮。它跳啊，跳啊，跳个不停。"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of metallic gray, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living animal.  Its mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialized to hunt prey at least as well-armored as itself.  You really don't want to try if you'd fare better."
msgstr "一只巨大的变异蜈蚣，身体覆盖着互相连接的银灰色甲壳。这使你想起了脱轨的火车而不是其它活物。它的颚末端是锯齿状的，似乎专门用于捕猎和它一样带有厚重甲壳的生物。你可不想和它比试比试。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A huge wasp the size of a large cat with bright yellow markings on her jet-black carapace and a threatening stinger.  She flies around erratically, searching for smaller prey."
msgstr "一只体型有成年猫那么大的巨型黄蜂，黑色的甲壳上长着亮黄色的斑纹，还有一根凶猛的毒刺。它飘忽不定地飞行，寻找着比它更小的猎物。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized acidic soldier ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A human-sized ant covered in bristly brown chitin.  A corrosive liquid seeps from the end of her bloated abdomen."
msgstr "一只毛茸茸的棕色巨蚁，长着高出工蚁的巨大头冠，以及巨大的下颚，某种腐蚀性液体从它膨胀的腹部的尾端渗出。"

#. ~ Description of monster "cellar spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile cellar spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "一只幼年的地窖蜘蛛，大概有一个啤酒瓶那么大。"

#. ~ Description of monster "centipede larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile centipede.  Despite its young age it is still quite large and you reckon these mandibles could pack quite a bite."
msgstr "一条幼年蜈蚣。虽然他不是完全体，但体型已经很大了，它的下颚提醒着你它巨大的咬合力。"

#. ~ Description of monster "web spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile giant grass spider, about the size of a beer bottle.  Too young to be venomous, or to walk proficiently for that matter"
msgstr "一个未成熟的巨型网蛛，体型和啤酒瓶一般大小。过于年幼以至于还未产生毒素，你可以走过去快速解决它。"

#. ~ Description of monster "jumping spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile jumping spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "一只幼年的跳蛛，大概有一个啤酒瓶那么大。"

#. ~ Description of monster "trapdoor spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile trapdoor spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "一只螲蟷幼蛛，大概有一个啤酒瓶那么大。"

#. ~ Description of monster "wolf spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile wolf spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "一只幼年的狼蛛，大概有一个啤酒瓶那么大。"

#. ~ Description of monster "lady bug larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A large armored larva looking not unlike a centipede.  Even though it's just a juvenile the armor on its back already looks functional."
msgstr "一只身上有甲壳的大瓢虫，不像是蜈蚣。即便还是幼虫，但它背上的甲壳看起来已经有实际作用了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized grasshopper"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A large grasshopper a few times bigger than a regular one."
msgstr "一只体型比普通蚱蜢大几倍的大蚱蜢。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A large mosquito larva.  A bit more unsettling now that it isn't microscopic."
msgstr "一只巨大的蚊子幼虫。往日常见的小虫子长到这么大让你有些不安。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized web spinning spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A light gray mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的变异浅灰色蜘蛛，长着细长的腿、大大的眼睛和超大的獠牙。"

#. ~ Description of monster "locust nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A locust the size of a rabbit.  You'd hate to think what a swarm of these could do."
msgstr "一只如兔子一般大的蝗虫。你不敢去想像一群这样的怪物会干些什么出来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "lunar moth"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A majestic moth painted in pale colors.  This giant of the night only comes out after the moon is out, leaving glittering dust."
msgstr "一只浑身惨白的体型雄伟的巨型飞蛾。这个夜晚中的巨人只有在月亮出来后才出来，所过之处留下微尘。"

#. ~ Description of monster "praying mantis nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mantis nymph about the size of a dog.  Even though its far smaller than the adults, you have a feeling it wouldn't take kindly to you coming too close."
msgstr "一只有狗大小的螳螂若虫。即使它比成年人小得多，你也觉得不应该靠它太近。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A monstrous brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small orifice at the tip.  Glistening liquid seems to drip out periodically."
msgstr "一只红色巨蚁，它肿胀的腹部末端长着一个小孔，似乎有闪闪发光的液体周期性地从中滴出。"

#. ~ Description of monster "graboid"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A monstrous worm with a mouth full of bladed tongues.  It keeps most of its enormous body hidden underground."
msgstr "一只体型如半挂卡车一般巨大的野兽，三瓣嘴，露出骇人的数百利齿与充满尖刺的舌头，他的大部分身体隐藏在地下。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant bee the size of a small dog."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异蜜蜂。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant cockroach the size of a dog.  This size advantage is apparently all it needs to start regarding humans as food!"
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异蟑螂。显然，这点体型优势足以使其将人类列入菜单！"

#. ~ Description of monster "pregnant giant cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant cockroach the size of a small dog.  Its abdomen is heavily swollen with eggs."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的变异蟑螂，它的腹部被无数虫卵撑得非常肿胀。"

#. ~ Description of monster "frigate fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant housefly nearly the size of a man, creating a loud buzzing sound as it inexplicably stays airborne."
msgstr "一只体型接近人类的突变家蝇，在空中莫名其妙地停留时发出巨大的嗡嗡声。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant housefly the size of a cat.  Its buzzing is high-pitched and somehow sad."
msgstr "一只猫大小的突变家蝇。  它的嗡嗡声很高亢，而且有些悲伤。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant mosquito the size of a housecat, buzzing and fluttering erratically."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的变异蚊子，在空中嗡嗡的飞着，飘忽不定。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized fire ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant red and black ant the size of a dog, covered in chitinous plates.  It smells faintly of gasoline, and in place of a stinger, a tiny flame adorns its abdomen like a pilot light."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异红蚂蚁，浑身覆盖着几丁质甲壳，长着一双扭动的触角和可怖的下颚。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant red ant the size of a dog, covered in chitinous plates.  She possesses a pair of wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异红蚂蚁，浑身覆盖着几丁质甲壳，长着一双扭动的触角和可怖的下颚。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized jumping spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant spider the size of a small dog with long forelegs, big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的变异蜘蛛，长着超长的前腿、大大的眼睛和超大的獠牙。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutated butterfly larger than a human.  Despite its size it is very lightweight and feeds mainly on the nectar produced by triffid flowers."
msgstr "一只体型比人稍大的变异蝴蝶。尽管它的体积很大，但重量很轻，主要以三尖树花蜜为食。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized firefly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutated firefly grown to the size of a large housecat, brightly glowing abdomen bobbing up and down as it tries to impress its unseen mate.  It looks strangely uninterested in you and everything else."
msgstr "一只家猫大小的变异萤火虫，腹部来回跳动、发出荧光，试图给它找不见的求偶对象留点深刻印象。它出奇地对你和其他东西一点都不感兴趣。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutated moth larger than a human.  It silently flies with its huge wings after dusk looking for nocturnal flowers to feed upon."
msgstr "一只体型比人稍大的变异飞蛾。在黄昏后，它用巨大的翅膀静静地飞翔，寻找夜间活动的花朵为食。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutated wasp queen grown to the size of a person, laying a single white egg in each empty cell she comes across while scurrying around on the paper walls of her home.  She struggles to fit into some of them, but the newer cells seem to be getting larger…"
msgstr "一只长到了成人的大小的变异黄蜂蜂后，它在其巢穴的纸墙上到处乱爬，并在每一个空巢室中都产下一枚白色的卵。它的体型很难被塞进其中某些巢室之中，但新建的巢室看起来都似乎变得越来越大……"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp guard"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutated wasp worker, buzzing around the nest.  While her foraging sisters are relatively content to leave you be, this one won't hesitate to attack anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr "一只变异的巨型黄蜂工蜂，在它的巢穴周围嗡嗡作响。虽然它的觅食蜂姐妹相对而言不爱搭理你，但这只会毫不犹豫地攻击任何它认为对巢穴构成威胁的东西。别在此逗留了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "motionless deer"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A paralyzed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and flee."
msgstr "一只瘫痪且瘦弱的鹿。当它注意到你的存在时，它抽搐了一下，当它发现自己无法站立或逃跑时，恐惧的眼睛在浑浊的眼眶中不停打转。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly naiad"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A predatory, aquatic dragonfly larva, normally barely a centimeter long and feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  Underneath its sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw has changed into something resembling a barbed spear."
msgstr "一只蜻蜓的掠食性水生幼虫，通常只有一厘米长，以小鱼为食，但现在已经长到鲶鱼般大小。在它锋利的下颌下，你可以看到它卷起的下颚变成了类似于带刺长矛的东西。"

#. ~ Description of monster "ant larva"
#. ~ Description of monster "fire ant larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A pulsating sausage of glistening white flesh, the size of a large cat.  On one end is a set of squirming mouth parts."
msgstr "浑身看起来像是白色果肉的蠕动香肠，体型像猫一样，一端是蠕动的锋利口器。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant fire ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A red and black ant the size of a deer.  It reeks of petroleum, and little tongues of fire occasionally gout from its abdomen."
msgstr "一只鹿大小的红黑蚂蚁。  它散发着石油的臭味，腹部偶尔会冒出小火舌。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A shaggy brown mutant spider with eight long legs.  Though it stands only knee-high to a grown man it moves quickly, and its big black eyes seem ever-alert."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "plague nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A sickly-looking mutant cockroach about the size of a rat, raised from birth on a diet of zombie flesh."
msgstr "一只体型和老鼠一般大小的变异蟑螂幼虫，看起来得了病，从出生起就以丧尸血肉为食。它还保留了足够的本能懂得避免接近你。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant water scorpion"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A slender relative of the water bug, grown close to human size.  It uses its long tail as a snorkel while ambushing prey."
msgstr "龙虱的近亲，体形修长，体型长到和人一般大小。在伏击猎物时，它用它的长尾作为通气管。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A slimy earthworm the size of an anaconda, with misshapen fangs jutting from its otherwise featureless face."
msgstr "一条黏糊糊的蚯蚓，大小如水蟒，毫无特征的脸上长着畸形的獠牙。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "centipede matriarch"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A small centipede is shaken off in the struggle!"
msgstr "一只小蜈蚣在母虫的挣扎中掉了下来！"

#. ~ Description of monster "half worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded giant worm."
msgstr "一个巨虫被切断的部份，体液从断肢部分渗出，还在不断扭动着。"

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic ant larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A squirming yellow grub that seems to be oozing liquid from both ends of its body.  It appears its chitin hasn't developed enough to resist acid."
msgstr "一只蠕动的黄色蠕虫，身体两端似乎微微渗着液体。看来它的几丁质外皮尚未发展出足够的酸抗性。"

#. ~ Description of monster "warehouse spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A tangle of branching chitinous legs operating seemingly independently, somehow still managing to carry a cow-sized central body.  A number of malformed, twitching legs hang from the cephalothorax, but the head -and especially the mandibles- still seem to be in working order."
msgstr "一堆缠结的几丁质腿似乎各有自己的想法，不知怎的仍然设法承载着有一头牛大的躯干。许多畸形、抽搐的腿从头胸部垂下来，但头部——尤其是下颚——似乎仍处于正常工作状态。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A tremendous housefly the size of a dog, predictably accompanied by a loud, incessant buzzing sound."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异苍蝇。它在空中飞来飞去，不停地嗡嗡作响。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A two-meter-long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly orient itself with its antennae."
msgstr "一只两米长的蜈蚣，身上长着一双挂着毒液的颚和多得吓人的用于抓取的肢体，用几十只腿迅捷地移动。它长着一双小型复眼，但是似乎主要通过触须来感知四周。"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp pupa"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A wasp larva undergoing metamorphosis into a full-grown giant wasp.  It looks like a strangely immobile adult coated in a thin white membrane, its legs and wings packed tightly into its cell."
msgstr "一只黄蜂幼虫，正在蜕变成为一只成年巨型黄蜂。它看起来像一个被一层薄薄的白色薄膜包裹着的奇怪凝结不动的成年体，它的腿和翅膀紧紧地包在巢室里。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp guard"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A wasp worker grown to the size of a person, buzzing around her home.  While her foraging sisters are relatively content to live and let live, this one won't hesitate to attack anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr "一只体型长到成人大小的巨型黄蜂工蜂，在它的巢穴周围嗡嗡作响。虽然它的觅食蜂姐妹相对而言不爱搭理你，但这只会毫不犹豫地攻击任何它认为对巢穴构成威胁的东西。别在此逗留了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "water strider nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A water strider nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "一只有兔子大小的水黾若虫。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mole cricket nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A whitish mole cricket nymph the size of a dog."
msgstr "一只带白色斑点的蟋蟀若虫，有小狗那么大。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A wolf spider mutated to the size of an actual wolf, it moves quickly and aggressively to catch and consume prey."
msgstr "变异的狼蛛，为普通狼蛛的三十倍大小，移动迅速且富有攻击性，被盯上的猎物很难逃脱。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant woodlouse"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A woodlouse grown to the size of a dog.  These humble crustaceans are harmless and enjoy damp places."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的潮虫。这些不起眼的甲壳类动物无害，喜欢潮湿的地方。"

#. ~ Description of monster "earthworm larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A wriggling earthworm the size of a housecat."
msgstr "一只有兔子大小的蚱蜢若虫。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant locust"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a dog with big eyes and long, powerful legs and wings that never seem to stop twitching.  It seems intent on finding food above all else - any food."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的黄褐色变异蝗虫，长着一双大眼和有力的长腿。它可能不会吃掉你，但是会严重损害周围的植被。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized locust"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a small dog, with big eyes and long, powerful legs."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的黄褐色变异蝗虫，长着一双大眼和有力的长腿。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A yellowjacket queen grown to the size of a horse, towering over her daughters.  Even with her abdomen swollen with eggs and wings long unused she still poses a threat to interlopers, should her children have failed at subduing them."
msgstr "一只体型像马一样大的身披黄夹克的蜂后，在它的女儿之中如同鹤立鸡群一般。即使它们的腹部长满了卵，翅膀也早已无用，但当它的子民未能制服入侵者时，它自身仍能对入侵者构成威胁。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An aggressive mutant cockroach the size of a small dog."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的变异蟑螂，攻击性很强，长着巨大的口器与坚硬的外壳，浑身散发着恶心的味道，在地上疯狂的爬行寻找食物。"

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic queen ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An enormous brown ant with an elongated, pulsating abdomen.  Her orifice seems developed only for egg-laying rather than spraying acid like the rest of the colony, but she doesn't seem affected by the acrid liquid either."
msgstr "一只棕色巨蚁，长着不断搏动拉伸的腹部，它的孔口似乎只用于产卵，而不是像其他同类一样喷射酸液，并且腐蚀液体对其似乎没有影响。"

#. ~ Description of monster "emperor butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An enormous butterfly with regal looking wings.  This giant of the sky flies cheerfully under the sun, leaving dust as it passes."
msgstr "一只长着帝王般翅膀的巨型蝴蝶。这个天空中的巨人在阳光下欢快地飞翔，在经过时留下了无数微尘。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant praying mantis"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An enormous green insect grown to about the size of a bear.  It moves in a weird, dance-like pattern and looks ready to chop your head off at any moment."
msgstr "一只体型和熊一般大小的巨型绿色昆虫。它以一种奇怪的、舞蹈般的模式移动，仿佛随时都可能把你的头砍掉。"

#. ~ Description of monster "missile spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An enormous hairy mutated spider the size of a cow, with strong forelegs and a raised, bloated thorax.  Its vast increase in size has caused it to lose much of its mobility, and when near it you can smell rotten eggs for some reason…"
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的巨型多毛变异蜘蛛，前腿强壮，胸部凸起。它体积的巨大增加使它失去了大部分活动能力，但当你靠近它时，不知为何会闻到臭鸡蛋的味道……"

#. ~ Description of monster "alpha bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An enormous mutant bee with black and white markings and a long stinger spelling doom."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的变异蜜蜂，长着黑白相间的条纹和一根标志着厄运的长毒刺。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An enormous red ant covered in chitinous plates.  She possesses a pair of wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr "一只红色巨蚁，浑身覆盖着几丁质甲壳，长着一双扭动的触角和可怖的下颚。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant mole cricket"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An enormous underground bug.  Beware its ear-splitting screech and strong shovel-like front legs."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的地下昆虫。当心它所发出刺耳的尖叫声和结实的铲子形前腿。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized soldier ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An overgrown red ant the size of a deer.  Bulging pincers extend from her jaws."
msgstr "一只毛茸茸的红色巨蚁，几乎有其他巨蚁两倍大小。从它的下颚伸出一对凸出的钳子。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An oversized butterfly with vibrant colored markings.  Unlike the other big insects of the Cataclysm this is a very peaceful nectivore."
msgstr "一只长着鲜艳斑纹的超大蝴蝶。与大灾变中的其他变异大昆虫不同，这是一种非常安静的食蜜昆虫。"

#. ~ Description of monster "firefly larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An oversized larva of a firefly.  Shockingly large when compared to the adults of its kind."
msgstr "一个超过平常大小的萤火虫幼体，比起一般的成年萤火虫都大得惊人。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized moth"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An oversized moth with its typical wood-like motifs.  It is as peaceful as the mutated butterflies found during the day."
msgstr "一只具有典型的木质图案的超大飞蛾。它就像白天发现的变异蝴蝶一样平静。"

#. ~ Description of monster "unstable fire ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "Something has gone more wrong than usual with this poor creature.  Its soft is swollen to the size of a bean bag chair and occasionally leaks globs of flaming liquid.  It struggles to drag its bulk around, compound eyes and waving antennae communicating none of the pain it surely feels."
msgstr "这个可怜的生物出了比平常更严重的问题。  它的软体肿胀到豆袋椅大小，偶尔会泄漏出一团团燃烧的液体。  它挣扎着拖着庞大的身躯四处走动，复眼和挥动的触角没有传达出它确实感受到的痛苦。"

