#. ~ Description of monster "black widow spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The horrid spawn of a giant black widow spider.  Though, given the size that it currently is, it appears relatively harmless."
msgstr "巨型黑寡妇蜘蛛的后代，看起来就让人觉得很不爽。不过考虑到它目前的体型，应该还没什么危险。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant caterpillar"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The larval stage of a butterfly or a moth.  This one appears to be about your size so you can only imagine the size of the insect that it will grow into."
msgstr "蝴蝶或蛾子的幼虫阶段。这只看起来已经和你的大小差不多了，所以你只能想象它蜕变为成虫后会有多大。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "warehouse spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The maimed legs start twitching erratically!"
msgstr "残废的腿开始不规律地抽搐！"

#. ~ Description of monster "cicada nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The mutated larval form of a cicada.  It doesn't produce noise like the adults but its digging claws seem suited for scratching."
msgstr "蝉的变异幼虫。它不像成蝉那样发出噪音，但它的用来挖掘的爪子似乎很能抓挠。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant lady bug"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The normal-sized version of this red and black beetle is generally considered cute, and is adored by children and associated with good luck.  This monster, on the other hand is clearly a ferocious predator capable of killing swarms of ants, aphids, and unprepared humans."
msgstr "这种红黑相间的甲虫的正常体型下通常被认为很可爱，深受孩子们的喜欢，被认为会带来好运。另一方面，这种怪物显然变成了某种凶猛的捕食者，能够杀死成群的蚂蚁、蚜虫和毫无准备的人类。"

#. ~ Description of monster "water scorpion nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The nymph of a water scorpion, looks like a smaller version of its parents."
msgstr "一只水蝎的若虫，看起来像它父母的缩小版本。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant water tiger"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The predatory, aquatic larva of a diving beetle grown to large proportions.  It is quite slow but still a good ambusher."
msgstr "一只体形庞大的捕食性水生幼虫。它相当慢，但仍然是一个很好的伏击者。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "mommy long-legs"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The spiderlings fall to the ground!"
msgstr "一群小蜘蛛掉到了地上！"

#. ~ Description of monster "detached spider leg"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The strangely branching leg of a mutated cellar spider that… fell?  crawled?  off of the main body when hurt.  It now flails about blindly, irregular clawed appendages grasping at anything that comes close."
msgstr "一条分支出来的变异地窖蛛腿，因为受伤从躯干上脱离了下来……但还在爬行？它现在盲目地挥舞着，末端不规则的爪状结构试图抓住任何靠近的东西。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "motionless deer"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The sudden motion of their host cause some dermatik larvae to flee!"
msgstr "由于宿主突然的移动，导致一些寄生蜂幼虫逃了出来！"

#. ~ Description of monster "great mantis"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This ferocious cow-sized mantis stalks the fields of New England.  It's probably capable of killing a moose with its powerful arms."
msgstr "这只体型和奶牛一般大小的凶猛螳螂在新英格兰的田野里游荡。它也许能用它有力的长臂杀死一头驼鹿。"

#. ~ Description of monster "plague vector"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This giant cockroach has been feeding on the undead for some time and has started to mutate chaotically.  Extra limbs and growths sprout from its thorax, and it is notably aggressive even to creatures much larger than itself."
msgstr "这只巨型蟑螂以丧尸为食已经有一段时间了，并开始无序的变异。额外的肢体和器官从它的胸腔中生长出来，它甚至对比自己体型大得多的生物也表现出明显的攻击性。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fire ant queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This horse-sized red ant drags its distended abdomen behind it slowly, burdened by its own eggs."
msgstr "这只马大小的红蚂蚁缓慢地拖着膨胀的腹部，背负着自己的卵。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized aphid"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This huge aphid is as big as a hamster.  It's not as thirsty as bigger ones, but a herd of these could eat your crops easily."
msgstr "一只体型和仓鼠一般大小的蚜虫。虽然它不像大的那么饥渴，但一群这样的家伙可以很轻松地吃光你的庄稼。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant antlion"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This huge grub has powerful mandibles and a hungry look.  It hides in the dirt and awaits its prey."
msgstr "这只巨大的幼虫长着强壮的下颚，看起来很饥饿。它躲在泥土里等待着猎物送上门。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized lady bug"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This is a mutated lady bug the size of a big dog.  While not as dangerous as her giant sisters, she's still troublesome to deal with."
msgstr "一只体型和大狗一般的变异瓢虫。虽然不像她的巨型姐妹那样危险，但她仍然很难对付。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant lacewing"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This mutant bug superficially resembles a dragonfly the size of a human child, but its smaller eyes and the rearward tilt of its wings give it away as the adult form of an antlion."
msgstr "这种突变虫子表面上类似于人类儿童大小的蜻蜓，但它较小的眼睛和向后倾斜的翅膀表明它是蚁狮的成年形态。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mommy long-legs"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This surprisingly shy giant cellar spider holds a head-sized ball of crawling spiderlings of different ages in its mandibles, carefully balancing on her long legs not to drop the precious cargo.  She seems uninterested in you."
msgstr "这只意外害羞的巨型地窖蛛用下颚叼着一个脑袋大的球，年龄不一的小蜘蛛在里面爬来爬去。她小心地用长腿保持平衡以避免弄丢了这珍贵的货物——对你似乎不感兴趣。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized water strider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This water bug is several times larger than a regular one.  Its movements are fast and fluid."
msgstr "这只水生昆虫大小比普通的要大上好几倍。它的动作既快又流畅。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant water strider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "This water glider is about as big as a domestic cat.  Its legs are more fin-like and a swollen body is mostly submerged underwater."
msgstr "一只体型和家猫一般大小的水黾。它的腿更像鳍，肿胀的身体大部分被淹没在水下。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant diving beetle"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "Water beetles can be found in all freshwater environments, with diving beetles being their predatory variant.  These however seem to have grown far larger with the Cataclysm."
msgstr "龙虱可以各种淡水环境中找到，水龟虫是它们的捕食者变种。然而，随着大灾变的发生，这些昆虫体型似乎变得更大了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fused dragonflies"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "What appears to be a single, enormous insect with a swollen abdomen is actually the unholy union of two dragonflies in the act of mating, bodies still locked into the telltale heart shape.  The remains of their wings and abdomens form an egg sac they sluggishly pull between them, periodically dropping a handful of glistening eggs."
msgstr "看起来是一个巨大的昆虫，腹部十分肿胀，但实际上是由两只正在交配的蜻蜓所组成的可怕融合体，从它们仍然如同锁紧的心脏一般的身体就能够看出来。它们的翅膀和腹部的残骸形成了一个卵囊，缓慢地拖在身后，时而产下许多闪闪发光的卵。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "With a stinger the size of a kitchen knife, this dog-sized insect's black and yellow markings warn you to leave it undisturbed."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异蜜蜂，长着和厨刀一样锋利的尾刺，身上黄黑色条纹警告着你需要离它远一点。"

#. ~ Description of monster "woodlouse manca"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "Woodlice reproduce by carrying their eggs in a pouch and releasing them as juveniles.  Their mancae look like small adults except for their pale color."
