#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid "A putrid amalgamation of body parts from man and beast have fused together in this aberration of healthy and rotting flesh.  The eyes of all the heads dart about rapidly and the mouths form a chorus of groaning screams."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "protean giant"
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid "A seeping conglomeration of spasming muscle and organs have fused together into this towering caricature of the human form.  Various organs fall off of its hulking body only to be reabsorbed moments later.  Despite the stench of death rolling off of it, its flesh looks vital, and in places almost healthy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "fleshy shambler"
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid "An amalgamation of throbbing organs from various creatures have fused together into this lurching, vaguely-humanoid shape.  Its myriad roughly-formed mouths susurrate in a chorus of sibilant groans and whispers."
msgstr "各种生物跳动的器官融合在一起，形成了这个蹒跚而行、略为人型的怪物。无数临时拼凑形成的嘴颤抖着不断发出咝咝作响的呻吟和低语。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid "fleshy shambler"
msgid_plural "fleshy shamblers"
msgstr[0] "血肉蹒跚者"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid "jabberwock"
msgid_plural "jabberwocks"
msgstr[0] "伽卜沃克"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid "protean giant"
msgid_plural "protean giants"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "octopus spawn"
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "A young Cecaelia.  If one is out here, a very protective parent is likely nearby."
msgstr "一只幼年塞卡莉亚人。如果你发现了一只幼年塞卡莉亚人，说明它那保护欲极强的父母也一定就在附近。"

#. ~ Description of monster "kraken"
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "The kind of octopus that can take down small boats by itself."
msgstr "这只章鱼的体型足以使其击沉一艘小船。"

#. ~ Description of monster "scylla"
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "The water froths as a great bulk of tentacles breach the surface.  A great bulk swiftly rises until the beak rises above the water and a shriek erupts from the beast."
msgstr "水面不停得冒出泡泡，随后大量触手突出水面。一个巨大的身体迅速浮现上升，直到尖喙露出水面，随后这只怪兽发出刺耳的尖啸。"

#. ~ Description of monster "stalker octopus"
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "This octopus seems larger than you remember from visits to the aquarium and doesn't seem as slowed by land as would be expected.  Its body seems to mimic its surroundings."
msgstr "这只章鱼看起来比你参观水族馆时记得的要大，而且也并未如你所想的那样在陆地上减慢速度。它的身体似乎在模仿周围的环境。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "kraken"
msgid_plural "kraken"
msgstr[0] "海怪"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "octopus spawn"
msgid_plural "octopus spawns"
msgstr[0] "章鱼子嗣"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "scylla"
msgid_plural "scylla"
msgstr[0] "斯库拉"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "stalker octopus"
msgid_plural "stalker octopuses"
msgstr[0] "章鱼潜行者"

