#. ~ Description of monster "BM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "LGR security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "BS security drone"
#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
msgid "A small quadcopter drone, it has a camera and speaker visible.  It patrols the surrounding area in a regular manner, continuously scanning individuals it encounters even if there is hardly anything left of them."
msgstr "一架小型四旋翼无人机，上面安装了摄像头和扬声器。它定期巡逻附近区域，不断扫描它遇到的每个人，即便这里已经没有多少活人了。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Green Maintenance Badge Trait"
