#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  Or maybe it just tolerates your presence better.  It's hard to tell with felines."
msgstr "%s似乎很喜欢你！或者它只是更容忍你的存在。对于猫科动物来说，这很难说。"

#. ~ Pet message of monster "cat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
