#. ~ Description of monster "giant slug"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A disturbingly large mutated slug as large as a human.  Venom drips from its spearlike tongue, and it is covered with sticky mucus."
msgstr "一只大到让人恶心的蛞蝓，体型和成人一般大小。它的口器中有毒液滴出，它的身体上布满粘液。"

#. ~ Description of monster "colossal slug"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A mutated slug as wide as a golf cart.  A spearlike tongue protrudes from its mouth as it oozes around slowly, leaving a trail of glistening slime."
msgstr "变异的蛞蝓，有一辆高尔夫球车那么宽，毒液不断地从他的血盆大口滴下。它缓慢的往前滑行，所过之处留下一地闪闪发光的黏液。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized snail"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A shelled gastropod either of native or introduced stock.  Worryingly, this one is the size of a cat."
msgstr "一只有壳的腹足类动物，原产本地或是引进自国外。这只看起来比普通的大得多。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized slug"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A slimy gastropod without a shell.  Normally smaller than a human finger, this one is bigger than a squirrel."
msgstr "一只黏滑的无壳腹足类。通常比人的手指还小，这只却比松鼠还大。"

#. ~ Description of monster "sludge crawler"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A sluglike creature the size of a refrigerator.  Its black body glistens as it oozes its way along the ground.  Eyestalks occasionally push their way out of the tar-like mass and look around."
msgstr "一只巨型蛞蝓，八英尺(约2.4米)长，冰箱那么宽。黑色的身体不停地闪烁并一路\"流动\"。它沿着地面缓慢爬行，杆状眼偶尔从油乎乎的一坨肉里伸出观察路况。"

#. ~ Description of monster "slug larva"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A small slug larva."
msgstr "一只小小的蛞蝓幼虫。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant snail"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A snail grown to human size, oozing with slime."
msgstr "一只体型和人一般大小的蜗牛。它的嘴和腹部不断滴下酸液。"

#. ~ Description of monster "freshwater snail"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A tiny and shelled aquatic gastropod of either native or introduced stock.  Dangerous to eat raw but properly cooked and cleaned it may serve as a fine dish."
msgstr "一只有壳的小型水生腹足动物，原产本地或是引进自国外。生吃十分危险，但经过适当烹调和清洗，可以作为一道佳肴。"

#. ~ Description of monster "snail larva"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A tiny little snail.  Its body bulges and squirms unnaturally."
msgstr "一只小小的蜗牛。身体不正常地鼓胀、扭动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "colossal snail"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "An enormous gastropod with a massive shell on its back.  It slowly crawls over the ground while leaving a trail of mucus in its path.  A bladed radula hands from its mouth like a biological chainsaw, backed up by a probing tongue like a harpoon on the end of a tentacle."
msgstr "一只背上长着巨大外壳的超巨大的腹足动物。它在地面上缓慢爬行，同时在所到之处留下酸液。"

#. ~ Monster name
