#. ~ Description of monster "experimental mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "A deformed mutant in a torn jumpsuit, looking at you with insane hatred.  Their skin is a chaotic mix of scales, fur and chitin, and their fingers end in long talons."
msgstr "一个穿着破旧连身衣的畸形变种人，带着疯狂的仇恨盯着你。它的皮肤是鳞片、毛皮和甲壳的混乱混合体，手指末端变成了长长的爪子。"

#. ~ Description of monster "ungulate mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "A gigantic mutated test subject, still wearing the tattered remains of an orange jumpsuit.  They walk on four warped legs ending in hooves, and their head is dominated by a glistening, tangled crown of antlers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "arthropod mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "A horribly mutated experimental subject.  Their original body - still wearing an orange jumpsuit - flops around lifelessly, carried by twelve segmented legs covered in hairy chitin erupting from their back.  At the base of the front pair of legs, an almost-human scalp gives way to a dozen irregularly-sized eyes and a set of mandibles, and from their hind end a stinger not unlike a scorpion's emerges."
msgstr "一个可怕的变异实验对象。它原来的身体——仍然穿着橙色的连身衣——毫无生气地拖着十二条分节的腿，从背部长出的腿上覆盖着毛茸茸的甲壳。在前腿的底部，一个几乎像人类的头皮被十几只大小不规则的眼睛和一组下颚所取代，在它的身后长出了一根类似蝎子的毒刺。"

#. ~ Description of monster "camouflaged mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "A mutated test subject, running on all fours at alarming speed.  Their short fur changes color to match the background in an instant, making you struggle to keep the thing in focus.  Their thin limbs end in long talons, and their mouth is held perpetually open by a set of knife-sized fangs."
msgstr "一个变异实验对象，以惊人的速度用四肢奔跑。它的短毛会在瞬间改变颜色以匹配背景，使你很难盯住它的移动路径。它纤细的四肢末端变成长长的爪子，它的嘴被一对刀刃大小永远张开的尖牙所取代。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mutant child"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "A thin child with a shaved head, wearing a too-large white lab coat over a baggy orange jumpsuit.  They turn their head towards you with uncanny speed, and you're taken aback by the inhuman curiosity burning in their eyes.  Their angelic smile does very little to reassure you of their intentions."
msgstr "一个剃了光头的瘦小孩子，穿着一件太大的白色实验服，外面套着一件宽松的橙色连身衣。它以不可思议的速度把头转向你，你被它眼中燃烧着非人好奇心吓了一跳。天使般的微笑并不能让你确信它的意图。"

#. ~ Description of monster "bestial mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "A towering mutated test subject, covered in thick fur and the torn bottom part of a jumpsuit.  Their legs end in large padded feet not unlike a dog's, but they still manage to stand upright, freeing up their clawed hands to tear you apart."
msgstr "一个高大的变异测试对象，全身覆盖着厚厚的毛皮和被撕裂的连身衣碎片。它的脚变异成了一只很大的软垫爪子，和狗的腿没什么两样，但它仍然能够直立站立，伸出长着爪子的手把你撕成碎片。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shelled mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "An enormous mutant hidden beneath a gray segmented shell, crawling on a carpet of innumerable tentacles covered with suckers.  They hold three thicker, branching limbs high on their front end, each dotted with dozens of unblinking eyeballs."
msgstr "一个巨大的变种人，藏在一个分段的灰壳下，用无数覆盖着吸盘的触角在地毯上爬行。它的前端高举着三条较粗的分支肢体，每一条肢体上都点缀着几十个不眨眼的眼球。"

#. ~ Description of monster "transcendent mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "An experimental subject wearing a surprisingly clean orange jumpsuit.  They look unchanged at a distance, but as you approach their head spins towards you with unnatural speed.  Their face is disconcertingly beautiful, but their eyes shine with an intelligence far beyond human - and a deep disgust directed at you."
msgstr "一个实验对象，穿着一件干净得出奇的橙色连身衣。它在远处看起来没有变异化的迹象，但当你走近时，它的头以一种不自然的速度向你旋转。它的脸令人不安地美丽，但它的眼中闪耀着远远超出人类的智慧——以及对你的深深厌恶。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "mutant child"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "The child's eyes widen, and they try to say something before falling to the ground."
msgstr "孩子的眼睛睁得大大的，它试图在倒下之前说些什么。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "transcendent mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "The mutant gestures at you and barks a few orders, sending its pack of mutants into a frenzy."
msgstr "变种人向你做手势，吼出了几句指令，让它周围的一群变种人陷入疯狂。"

#. ~ Description of monster "chud"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "This was once a person, but they've undergone some hideous transformation.  Their pallid skin is clammy and wet, and their face is dominated by unnaturally large, reflective eyes that no longer hold the spark of intelligence."
msgstr "它曾是一个人，却经历了某种可怖的异变。惨白的皮肤湿冷黏腻，脸上最醒目的是一双异常硕大、反光的眼睛，早已没了智慧的痕迹。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "arthropod mutant"
msgid_plural "arthropod mutants"
msgstr[0] "节肢变种人"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "bestial mutant"
msgid_plural "bestial mutants"
msgstr[0] "野兽变种人"

