#. ~ Description of monster "Loper puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something about its legs seems off."
msgstr "一只可爱但不同寻常的小狗。它高兴地摇着尾巴，但腿上似乎有些不对劲。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Mauler puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something about its mouth seems off."
msgstr "一只可爱但不寻常的小狗。它高兴地摇着尾巴，但它的嘴似乎有些不对劲。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Thrasher puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something about its paws seems off."
msgstr "一只可爱但与众不同的小狗。它欢快地摇着尾巴，但它的爪子有些不对劲。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Cerbearus"
msgid_plural "Cerbearuses"
msgstr[0] "多头熊"

#. ~ Description of monster "destrier"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "From a distance, this freak of nature could almost be taken for a draft horse but for its tufted ears and the set of its eyes, mounted at the front of its face beneath the cunning brow of a predator.  Its hooves are splayed out to form three-toed claws that grip rock and soil alike as it prowls the fields, and from time to time an overlong forked tongue slips out of its fanged maw to taste the air."
msgstr "若从远处看，这只怪异的生物乍看之下颇像一匹挽马，但它那长着簇毛的耳朵，以及生在面部前方、位于捕食者那种狡黠眉骨之下的双眼，却暴露了它的真面目。它在原野上游荡时，蹄部向外张开，形成三趾状的利爪，能牢牢抓紧岩石与泥土；那长满獠牙的巨口中，不时探出一条细长分叉的舌头，探寻着空气中的气味。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dextrous raccoon"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Its paws have grown to be longer, and it seems capable of briefly standing on its hindlimbs.  You wonder if this sleazy beast is able to open doors yet."
msgstr "它的爪子变长了，而且它似乎能够短暂地用后肢站立起来。你不禁好奇这只肮脏的野兽是否已经能够开门了。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Loper"
msgid_plural "Lopers"
msgstr[0] "冲锋犬"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Loper puppy"
msgid_plural "Loper puppies"
msgstr[0] "幼年冲锋犬"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Mauler"
msgid_plural "Maulers"
msgstr[0] "撕裂犬"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Mauler puppy"
msgid_plural "Mauler puppies"
msgstr[0] "幼年撕裂犬"

#. ~ Description of monster "Cerbearus"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Sometime between the Cataclysm and now, this black bear has gained two extra heads.  This doesn't seem to have improved its disposition."
msgstr "从大灾变之后，这只黑熊又多了两个脑袋。但这似乎没有改变它暴躁的性格。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "destrier"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s devours the meat.  It growls low at you, but no longer seems quite as unfriendly."
msgstr "那只 %s 吞食着肉块。它向你发出低沉的咆哮，但看起来似乎不再那么不友善了。"

#. ~ Pet message of monster "Loper puppy"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "Mauler puppy"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "Thrasher puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s happily wags its tail while you pat their head."
msgstr "当你拍拍%s的头时，它们会高兴地摇尾巴。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Thrasher"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "This dog has undergone visible mutation.  Its paws are larger than normal and have developed long digging nails.  Its fur is extremely short, barely covering its leathery skin."
msgstr "这只狗已经发生了明显的突变。  它的爪子比正常爪子大，并且长有长长的挖趾甲。  它的皮毛极短，几乎无法覆盖其皮革般的皮肤。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Loper"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "This dog has undergone visible mutation.  While its body is larger than normal, its legs are noticeably elongated, muscular and covered in long cord-like fur.  It easily stands as tall as a man and watches its surroundings with reflective eyes."
msgstr "这只狗发生了明显的变异。虽然它的身体比正常情况下大，但它的腿明显细长，肌肉发达，覆盖着长长的绳索状毛皮。它很容易站得和你一样高，用反光的眼睛仔细观察你的一举一动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mongrel"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "This dog of unidentifiable breed looks like it has seen better days.  Its wiry hair is patchy, revealing scales underneath, but it still happily wags its tails anyways."
msgstr "这只无法辨认品种的狗看起来已经独自生存了好些日子，它的毛看起来乱七八糟的，但它仍然高兴地摇着尾巴。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feaver"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "This mutant beaver's body is covered with brightly-colored feathers in a particularly eyecatching pattern.  It must have been very lucky not to have been caught by a predator before now."
msgstr "这种变异河狸身体上覆盖着色彩鲜艳的羽毛，图案特别醒目。之前他一定足够幸运没有被捕食者抓住。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dambreaker"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "This mutated beaver is almost double its normal size, and its back is covered with tough-looking bristles."
msgstr "这只变异河狸的体型几乎是原来的两倍，它的背部长满了坚硬的鬃毛。"

#. ~ Description of monster "spideer fawn"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "This obviously mutated adolescent deer moves unsteadily on its eight legs, nervously scanning the area with all five eyes."
msgstr "这只明显变异的幼鹿用八只脚不太稳定地移动，五只眼睛紧张地扫视着周边区域。"

#. ~ Description of monster "spideer"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "This once-ordinary deer has grown a disturbingly agile array of extra limbs, plus three extra eyes.  Its antlers wriggle subtly in the wind."
msgstr "一只曾经普通的变异鹿，如今多长出了些令人不安的肢体和三只灵活转动的眼睛，鹿角在风中敏锐的蠕动着。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Mauler"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "This stocky dog has undergone visible mutation.  Its jaw has widened and features more teeth than any canine should ever have."
msgstr "这只粗壮的狗发生了明显的变异。它的下巴变宽了，牙齿比任何狗都多。虽然它龇牙咧嘴的笑容令人不安，但它的尾巴却像往常一样充满活力地摇摆着。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "This wolf has grown to terrifying proportions, rivalling a small car.  Its teeth give steak knives a run for their money, and it definitely doesn't look friendly."
msgstr "这只长得特别吓人的狼，大小堪比小汽车。它的牙齿让牛排刀都只能卷铺盖走路，而且看来明显不太友善。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Thrasher"
msgid_plural "Thrashers"
msgstr[0] "猛禽犬"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Thrasher puppy"
msgid_plural "Thrasher puppies"
msgstr[0] "幼年猛禽犬"

#. ~ Description of monster "slavering coyote"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Unnatural bulges line the neck of this obviously-mutated coyote; green-tinted foam flecks from its lips, and there's a crazed look in its eyes."
msgstr "一只明显变异的郊狼，颈部有不自然的鼓包，它的嘴边有飞溅出来的绿色泡沫，眼神中只有疯狂。"

#. ~ Description of monster "grinning coyote"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Were it not for the misshapen snout and visible teeth, this would look like an ordinary Northeastern coyote.  Closer inspection of its mouth reveals row after row of serrated, shark-like teeth."
msgstr "如果不看它变形的鼻子和牙齿，这就是一只郊狼。但仔细看它的嘴巴，可以发现成排像鲨鱼一样的锯齿状牙齿。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "dambreaker"
msgid_plural "dambreakers"
msgstr[0] "溃坝河狸"

