#. ~ Monster attack "star_vampire_blood_drinking_ferals" message
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto you, but you dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s 试图追上你，但你躲开了！"

#. ~ Monster attack "star_vampire_blood_drinking" message
#. ~ Monster attack "star_vampire_blood_drinking_ferals" message
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s 试图固定在你的 %2$s 上，但无法穿透你的盔甲。"

#. ~ Description of monster "person"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A common human.  It looks exactly like a human looks.  You can see them.  They can see you.  You know they know you can see them.  They know you know you can see them.  They move towards you."
msgstr "一个普通的人类。 它看起来和人类的样子一模一样。 你可以看到他们。 他们可以看到你。 你知道他们知道你能看到他们。 他们知道你知道你能看到他们。 它在向你移动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dementia"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A crazed individual, the bloody scars on the side of its shaved head suggest some sort of partial lobotomy."
msgstr "一个头上带有血淋淋的伤疤的怪人，显然是接受过某种脑叶切除手术，疯狂转动的瞳孔搜索着附近一切它想杀死的生物，充满着攻击性。"

#. ~ Description of monster "blood sacrifice"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A defiled human body, once living.  Tortured to death long ago, it remains chained to the altar, the putrescent flays of its peeled skin quivering like so much flotsam upon a murky pond."
msgstr "一个人形生物，被折磨至死很久了，但仍然被锁在祭坛上，从表皮剥落的腐肉抖动得就像浮在灰暗池塘上的垃圾，目光死死盯着你，充满着难以估量的怨恨。"

#. ~ Description of monster "tentacle dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A dog's body with a mass of ropey, black tentacles reaching out from its head."
msgstr "这只狗的身上有大量的粘液，蛇形的黑色触角从头部生长出来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A domesticated mongrel of the canine persuasion.  In the absence of human society, it has turned feral."
msgstr "一只曾经被驯服的杂种犬，人类社会的瓦解让它恢复了野性，眼神极其凶恶。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mercenary officer"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A figure in a high-tech suit, their outline contorted as though you were viewing them through a prism.  Their movements are strained but determined, pushing through apparent pain with feverish resolve, dead-set on reaching their target."
msgstr "一个身着高科技服装的身影，他们的轮廓扭曲，就像你透过棱镜看到的一样。 他们的动作紧张而坚定，带着狂热的决心忍着明显的疼痛，一心只想到达目标。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mercenary ghost"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A figure in combat gear, distorted and shattered like broken glass.  They thrash around as they move, an expression of shock and anguish frozen on their face."
msgstr "一个个身着战斗服的身影，像破碎的玻璃一样扭曲、破碎。 他们一边移动一边扭动着身体，震惊和痛苦的表情凝固在脸上。"

#. ~ Description of monster "nuckalavee"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A four-legged monster that almost resembles a skinless rider and horse fused into one grotesque apparition.  Its arms hang nearly to the ground, and a noxious fog streams from both of its mouths."
msgstr "一种几乎类似于无皮骑士和马的四足怪物，融合成一个怪诞的幽灵。  它的手臂几乎垂在地面上，有毒的雾气从它的双嘴中流出。"

#. ~ Description of monster "wraith"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A gigantic shadow, chaotically changing in shape and volume.  Two piercing orbs of light dominate what can only be described as its head."
msgstr "一个巨大的暗影怪物，形状和体积毫无规律的不停变化，两颗光球占据着一块只能被描述成它头部的部分。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hound of Tindalos"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A grotesque dog-like beast, its frame is angular and emaciated and its head is like that of an abyssal fish.  When it moves, its twisted limbs duplicate, merge, disappear, and reform in dissonance, as if a hundred copies of itself were somehow forced to inhabit the same space.  Extraneous to our reality, it moves between the corners of the world, hunting those that would dare step beyond time and space."
msgstr "一只怪诞的如猎犬般的怪物，它的身躯瘦骨嶙峋，头部就如一条来自地狱深渊的鱼。当它移动的时候，扭曲的肢体以一种诡异的方式复制、融合、消失和重组，就仿佛有上百个自身的复制品被以某种未知的方式强行栖居在同一个空间里。它游离在我们的现实世界之外，在无数世界的角落之间移动，猎杀那些胆敢穿越时空的人。"

#. ~ Description of monster "flying polyp"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A half-polypous, utterly alien creature.  It is a large writhing tumor of eyes, mouths and tentacles; It's only partly material and has the ability to fly, despite the absence of wings.   "
msgstr "一只源自克苏鲁神话的盲目者亚种，完完全全的异界生物。它的身体仅有一半是由物质构成，虽然没有翅膀却能够在空中飞行。它在移动时发出奇怪的呼啸声，压倒了其他所有的声音。"

#. ~ Description of monster "yugg"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A huge, slimy worm-like creature.  Its pale, flattened head drips an oily mucus as it breaches the ground, searching for prey.  Its pinkish mouth opens and closes, revealing long fangs glistening with ropey strands of saliva, which leave smoldering stains wherever they drip."
msgstr "一只巨大而粘滑的蠕虫状生物。它苍白而扁平的头部在它钻出地面寻找猎物时会不断滴下油性粘液。它的粉红色的大嘴一张一合，露出沾满丝丝恶心唾液的长牙。无论唾液滴在哪里都会留下燃烧的痕迹。"

#. ~ Description of monster "twisted body"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A human body, but with its limbs, neck, and hair impossibly twisted.  It clambers around swiftly, making awful screeching sounds."
msgstr "一具人类的尸体，但是他的四肢、颈部、和头发均不可思议的扭曲。它飞快地在四处攀爬，并发出可怕的尖叫声。"

#. ~ Description of monster "writhing root"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A small chunk of curious looking roots, constantly trying to grow and expand but failing miserably.  It has grown weak, as if incompatible with the very soil it is in."
msgstr "一小块看起来很奇怪的根，不断地尝试生长和扩张，但惨遭失败。  它变得越来越虚弱，仿佛与它所处的土壤格格不入。"

#. ~ Description of monster "nether fish symbiote"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A small fish symbiote that resembles a deformed, eyeless piranha.  It swims blindly in the yellow ichor, wriggling incessantly with malicious intent."
msgstr "一只小型的共生鱼，样子像没有眼睛的食人鱼。它在黄色的脓水里盲目地游动，一刻不停地扭动着身躯，酝酿着恶毒的意图。"

#. ~ Description of monster "missing researcher"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A spindly abomination taller than a house and whipping its disgusting body around in apparent agony.  It's awful to look at, but worst of all is the realization that this is a human being, twisted and stretched like a piece of chewing gum, and somehow still alive."
msgstr "一个比房子还高的、细长而畸形的怪物，正挥舞着它那令人作呕的身体，显得极其痛苦。它看起来极其恐怖，但最糟糕的是意识到这竟然是一个人类——像一块口香糖一样被扭曲和拉伸，而且不知为何竟然还活着。"

#. ~ Description of monster "spearfisher"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A strange quadrupedal creature with long, lanky limbs and a gaping maw.  A long sharp spike protrudes from it's back, which occasionally launches from its' joint to stab prey before slinking back in."
msgstr "一只奇怪的四足动物，有一张大嘴与修长的四肢。 一根修长的利刺从它的背上钻出，偶尔发射出去刺击猎物。"

#. ~ Description of monster "glowstalk"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A tall, thin stalk of rubbery flesh, creeping around on a sluglike foot at its base.  The blob you might call the \"head\" is riddled with brightly glowing, yellow-green pustules, while a line down the middle seems to function as its mouth.  It looks unhealthy, like it's withering away."
msgstr "一根又高又细的橡胶肉茎，在其底部有一只像鼻涕虫一样的脚在爬行。  你可能称之为“头”的一团东西布满了明亮发光的黄绿色脓疱，而中间的一条线似乎起到了它的嘴的作用。  它看起来不健康，就像它正在枯萎一样。"

#. ~ Description of monster "impossible shape"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A twisted shape floating in midair; its angles don't seem to quite add up - it hurts to look at.  Is it inanimate?  Alive?  Something else?  You can't make heads or tails of it at all, but you can see through it - not as if it were transparent, but as if it isn't quite fully here."
msgstr "一个扭曲的形状漂浮在半空中；它的角度似乎完全不合逻辑——光是看着就让你头痛。它是死的吗？是活的吗？还是别的什么？你对此毫无头绪。你可以看穿它，不是因为它是透明的，而是因为它仿佛不完全位于这个空间之中。"

#. ~ Description of monster "vortex"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A twisting spot in the air, with some kind of morphing mass at its center."
msgstr "半空中出现一个扭曲的点，它的中心似乎有某种正不断变形的东西。"

#. ~ Description of monster "strange leech"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A very wet, snake-like creature which you estimate to be five feet long, covered in slime and slithering about.  Occasionally, it will attach itself to the flesh around it and begin to suck."
msgstr "一条体表潮湿、外形像蛇的生物，估计有五英尺(约1.5米)长，浑身都是粘液，四处滑动。偶尔，它会附在周围的肉上，开始吸吮。"

#. ~ Description of monster "carrion grub"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A wriggling brown grub of unnatural origin, slithering along the ground and unnaturally pulsating.  As it moves along, it chews through any available flesh with surprising speed."
msgstr "一种不像是自然界的的蠕动的棕色蛴螬，沿着地面滑行，不自然地脉动着。 一路上它以惊人的速度咀嚼着任何可用的肉体。"

#. ~ Description of monster "chunk of alien flesh"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A writhing mass of strange flesh and something that oddly resembles tentacles.  It is getting more pale by the minute."
msgstr "一团扭动的奇怪血肉和一些奇怪地像触手的东西。  时间一分一秒地变得更加苍白。"

#. ~ Description of monster "thing"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "An amorphous black creature, detaching and sprouting tentacles without any apparent pause."
msgstr "一只外形不定的黑色怪物，从它的躯体上毫不间断地有触手长出并脱离出来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "sloth"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "An animate blotch of conflicting shapes, when you look at or think of this, a desire to stop moving rises."
msgstr "一堆相互冲突的动态不明形体，当你看到它或想到它时，忽然有一种想要停下一切的冲动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "guilt"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "An animate blotch of conflicting shapes, when you look at or think of this, memories of your wrongdoings rise to the surface."
msgstr "一堆相互冲突的动态不明形体，当你看到它或想到它时，过去犯下的错误浮出水面。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shifting mass"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "An animate blotch of conflicting symmetries, erratically hovering through the air.  It's not even real enough to hold a stable shape, and its entire form is constantly in flux.  You can see through it - not as if it were transparent, but as if it isn't quite fully here."
msgstr "一团活生生的充满矛盾而又对称的班点，不规则地在空中盘旋。它甚至无法保持稳定状态，整体形状都在不断变化。你可以看穿它——不是因为它是透明的，而是因为它仿佛不完全位于这个空间之中。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shadow snake"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "An animate shadow in the form of a long and sinuous snake.  Translucent and dark, it glides silently across the floor, wriggling and flexing as it moves."
msgstr "一只活着的暗影，外形如同一条细长弯曲的蛇。它悄无声息地在地板上蜿蜒滑行，透明而黝黑的身体随之蠕动和弯曲。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shadow"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "An animate shadow.  Looking like nothing more than an errant patch of normal shadow, it draws your attention by the way it moves subtly and whispers softly in the back of your mind.  Strange intrusive thoughts accompany the quiet murmur, trying to forcefully supplant your own."
msgstr "一团移动的暗影，看起来不过是一块罕见的影子，但它细微的移动吸引了你的注意力，并开始在你的脑海中轻声低语。 怪异的侵入性想法伴随着低声的耳语，试图强行取代你的神志。"

#. ~ Description of monster "flaming eye"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air through some unknown agency.  Wreathed in unnatural flickering blue flame, it possesses a blazing yellow iris with a slitted pupil like that of a cat, and trails a set of flailing black tendrils as it slowly drifts about.  You involuntarily get a heavy, sinking feeling deep in your gut as you watch its gaze comb over the world around it."
msgstr "一只体型有如成人大小而脱离了肉体的巨大眼球，通过某种未知的方式在空中四处漂浮。浑身上下笼罩在一种超自然的蓝色火焰之中，它长着炽热发光的黄色虹膜和如同猫一般的瞳孔，而在它缓缓漂浮的身躯之后长出了许多四处挥舞的黑色触须。当它的目光扫过周遭时，你的内心深处不由得产生了一种厚重、坠落的感觉。"

#. ~ Description of monster "human snail"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "An enormous fleshy snail, with an oddly human face.  Eyestalks protrude from where the eyes should be."
msgstr "一只令人惊悚的人面蜗牛，眼睛却是一对触角。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "dog"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "If you're seeing this message it's a bug."
msgstr "如果你看到这个，说明游戏出bug了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "structural spur"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Misshapen spikes of concrete and rebar crumble upwards from the floor, held aloft by strands of visual distortion.  Sound around it is drowned and distorted into an incessant drone."
msgstr "无数残缺的混凝土和钢筋尖刺从地板向上刺出，被一串串的扭曲视觉的细丝固定在高处。它周围的声音被其淹没，扭曲成永不停歇的蜂鸣声。"

#. ~ Description of monster "star vampire"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Originally invisible, you can now see the myriad writhing tentacles tipped with gnashing maws that make up this creature.  The small central body is dominated by an enormous fanged mouth from which emerges a near-constant high-pitched tittering."
msgstr "最初是看不见的，但现在你可以看到构成这种生物的无数蠕动的触手，触手末端有咬牙切齿的胃。  中央的小身体被一张巨大的尖牙嘴所控制，从嘴里发出近乎持续的高音调的笑声。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "structural spur"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Scraps of metal fly off the spur and into the nearby swarms!"
msgstr "许多金属碎片从空间尖岔中飞出，汇合成一个裂片集群！"

#. ~ Death message of monster "memory"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s begins to cry as it disappears."
msgstr "%s不断哭号并消失。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "dog"
#. ~ Death message of monster "tentacle dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s emerges!"
msgstr "%s 出现了！"

#. ~ Death message of monster "veiled butterfly"
#. ~ Death message of monster "writhing root"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s fades away into nothingness."
msgstr "%s逐渐消失，化为虚无。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "shifting mass"
#. ~ Death message of monster "impossible shape"
#. ~ Death message of monster "guilt"
#. ~ Death message of monster "sloth"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s fades away."
msgstr "%s 消失了。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "shrapnel swarm"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s grows inert."
msgstr "%s 逐渐停止了移动。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "person"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s just disappeared."
msgstr "这个%s就这么突然消失了。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "veiled butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's wings move in odd ways and a strange glow envelops you!"
msgstr "%s 的翅膀以奇怪的方式移动，奇怪的光芒笼罩着你！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mercenary officer"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The creature screams \"SOMEONE HELP ME, ANYONE!\"."
msgstr "这个生物拼命叫喊着\"帮帮我，谁来帮帮我！\""

#. ~ Death message of monster "structural spur"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The distortion fades as the %s crumbles."
msgstr "时空扭曲随着%s破碎而逐渐消失。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "guilt"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The guilt makes no physical movement and yet you feel the force of its assault.  Everything feels heavier."
msgstr "罪恶没有任何移动，但你却能感受到它向你攻来的力量。一切都感觉更重了。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shifting mass"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The shifting mass passes through you as if you were an illusion, and a slight wave of fatigue washes over you."
msgstr "幻形怪穿透了你的身体，仿佛它是一个幻觉，一股轻微的疲倦感席卷了你。"

#. ~ Description of monster "memory"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The silhouette of a human body, reaching towards you like it needs help.  It has no eyes, but you can still feel it staring through you."
msgstr "人型剪影向你伸出手，好像它需要帮助一般。它没有眼睛，但你觉得它紧盯着你的眼神穿透了你。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "sloth"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The sloth does nothing, and you feel time itself aiding your desire to do nothing."
msgstr "怠惰什么都没有做，你感觉时间本身也让你什么都不要做。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "mercenary ghost"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The soldier fades away to nothing."
msgstr "这个佣兵鬼魂永远的消逝了，什么也没剩下。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "yugg"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The yugg launches a viscous barb!"
msgstr "%s 射出了一道酸液！"

#. ~ Description of monster "veiled butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "There is barely anything there, but you do notice hints of a faint, translucent veiled creature that you can only describe as butterfly-like.  While strangely alluring, it seems unsuited to the atmosphere and is slowly falling apart."
msgstr "那里几乎什么也没有，但你确实注意到了一种微弱的、半透明的、蒙着面纱的生物的痕迹，你只能将其描述为蝴蝶状的生物。  虽然有着奇异的诱惑力，但它似乎与这里的气氛格格不入，正在慢慢崩溃。"

#. ~ Description of monster "unseen hunter"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "There was nothing here a moment ago, but now you see the faintest outline of an otherworldly creature approaching you with jittery leaps.  Trying to focus on it reveals a pointed beak dripping translucent fluid and rows upon rows of bladed legs grasping the floor, before your eyes begin to burn and your head starts to spin."
msgstr "上一刻这里还什么都没有，但现在你隐约看见一只异界生物的模糊轮廓正不断闪烁地跳跃着向你接近。当你试图把注意力集中在它身上时，能看见它的尖嘴中滴下半透明的液体，一排又一排如利刃一般的爪子抓着地板，随后你的眼睛开始发酸，头昏脑涨。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hunting horror"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "This is some sort of great viperine creature, possessed of a curiously distorted head and massive clawed appendages.  It partially supports itself with the aid of black, rubbery wings of monstrous dimensions.  The wings beat slowly like an eagle while the body coils through the air like how an eel swims in water."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的如毒蛇一般的怪物，长着一个怪异而扭曲的头部和许许多多爪子一样的附肢。它的身体依靠着尺寸巨大的黑色且有弹性的翅膀支撑而部分竖起。翅膀像鹰一样缓慢地拍打，而身体像鳗鱼在水中游动一样在空中盘旋。"

#. ~ Description of monster "gozu"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "This is some sort of unnatural cross between a bull and a man.  Quite different from the minotaur of legend, it possesses a shaggy white bull's head on an otherwise unremarkable human body.  It grunts and snuffles, drooling ropey strands of white slobber down its chest.  You occasionally catch a glint in its eyes and freeze up involuntarily, like a deer in headlights."
msgstr "这是公牛和人之间某种不自然的杂交。  与传说中的牛头怪完全不同，它在一个不起眼的人体上拥有一个毛茸茸的白色牛头。  它咕哝着，吸鼻子，胸前流着绳状的白色口水。  你偶尔会看到它眼中的光芒，然后不由自主地僵住，就像头灯下的鹿一样。"

#. ~ Description of monster "strange bug"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "This small, three legged bug-like creature curiously wriggles its 5 antennae.  Its body somewhat reminds you of a stink bug.  It looks like a fish out of water and is getting weaker by the minute."
msgstr "这种小型三足虫状生物好奇地蠕动着它的 5 根触角。  它的身体有点让人想起臭虫。  它就像一条离开水的鱼，每况愈下。"

#. ~ Description of monster "blank body"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "This thing has the general shape of a human, but that's where the resemblance stops.  Featureless and pale, its face is entirely missing, leaving only a huge hole that leads down what might be a throat.  Adding to its unearthly appearance is the way it moves, stiff and doll-like as though it was only feigning knowing how to walk."
msgstr "这是某种形式的非自然的变异生物；它的外表是对人类外形的平淡嘲弄。 它没有特征，脸色苍白，除了一张完美的圆嘴外，没有眼睛和明显的特征，因此它令人厌恶的面孔更令人不安。 它移动的方式更让人觉得不伦不类，僵硬得像个洋娃娃，仿佛它只是在假装知道如何走路。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shrapnel swarm"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Uncountable jagged spikes, cleaving reality as they fly through its invisible seams."
msgstr "无数锯齿状的尖刺划破了现实，仿佛穿行于你所看不见的裂隙一般。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hanging roper"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "What looks to be a loose mass of worm-like appendages reveals a solid body beneath, a great maw of rows of serrated fangs taking up most of the body.  It is either very lethargic or stalking prey, sitting in place without much obvious motion."
msgstr "它看起来由一堆蠕虫般的增生肉瘤组成，盖着下方的坚实身体，一张布满锯齿的血口占据了身体的大部分。它要么就萎靡不振，要么就在等待伏击猎物，伫立在原地没有什么明显的移动。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "person"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "You feel something was destroyed inside you."
msgstr "你觉得你内在的某些东西被摧毁了。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "impossible shape"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
msgid "You get a very clear view of the impossible shape."
msgstr "你能清清楚楚地看清无法之形。"

#. ~ Description of monster "tainted shadow"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Your shadow is host to something alien."
msgstr "你的影子仿佛是某些怪东西的宿主。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "tainted shadow"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Your shadow seemingly becomes normal again."
msgstr "你的影子似乎又恢复正常了。"

