#. ~ Description of monster "triclopean dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid "A rather average looking dog until you notice the third eye, right on its forehead, covered by a thick eyelid.  Whenever its open, small particles of dust from the ground rise and swirl around it."
msgstr "一只看起来相当普通的狗，直到你注意到它的第三只眼睛，就在它的额头上，被厚厚的眼皮覆盖。每当它睁开时，地面上的小颗粒灰尘就会上升，在它周围旋转。"

#. ~ Description of monster "iridescent cat"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid "As it moves, this cat's colors shift unnaturally in the light.  You can't make out the breed, but its fur pattern seems to change with every step."
msgstr "这只猫在阳光移动时下呈现不同的颜色。你看不出它的品种，但它的毛皮似乎每步都在变化。"

#. ~ Description of monster "liquid cat"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid "It is universally known that cats are liquid, but this cat's body is actually quivering while it walks around.  It also enjoys resting while twisting its body in ways that would break a normal cat's bones."
msgstr "众所周知，猫是液体。但这只猫的身体在四处走动时，实际上是在颤动。它享受休息时光的时候，还会把身体扭曲成能把正常猫骨头折断的程度。"

#. ~ Description of monster "void cat"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid "Seeing how unnaturally dark this black cat's fur is, you are certain this is no ordinary cat.  Its fur seems to absorb light from the surroundings."
msgstr "看到这只黑猫的毛黑得不自然，你确定这不是普通的猫。它的毛似乎吸收了周围的光线。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "liquid cat"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body splashes one last time."
msgstr "%s的身体最后一次溅射开来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "translucent dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid "This dog doesn't cast a shadow, and if you squint hard enough you can see right through it.  Its condition doesn't appear to do any harm to it, though it seems to cause trouble when it tries to groom itself."
msgstr "这只狗没有影子，如果你用力眯起眼睛，就能\"看穿\"它。这种状况似乎没对它造成任何危害，不过当它梳理狗毛时可能会有些麻烦。"

#. ~ Description of monster "unknowable dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid "You are completely unable to recall anything about what this dog looks like.  You know it's a dog, you know it's there, you know you can see it, but any further information about it isn't retained in your mind."
msgstr "你完全无法回忆起这只狗的样貌。你知道那里有一条狗，你能看到它，但关于它的任何进一步信息都没有保留在你的脑海中。"

