#. ~ Description of monster "mutant frog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "A hopping amphibian that has grown big enough to eat a small dog.  It looks unwell, as if this growth spurt was less than comfortable."
msgstr "一种跳跃的两栖动物，已经长到足以吃掉一只小狗。  看起来不太舒服，好像这个突增的过程不太舒服。"

#. ~ Description of monster "juvenile mutant rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "A large mutated timber rattlesnake in its hatchling stage.  It will eventually grow a rattle and learn how to hunt."
msgstr "一只在刚孵化的大型变异木纹响尾蛇。它最终会长出尾环，学会如何捕猎。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "A large mutated timber rattlesnake, about six times as large as the norm.  While it still isn't big enough to regard humans as potential prey, it is much more aggressive and dangerous compared to a normal rattler."
msgstr "一条变异的巨型林响蛇，约有普通响尾蛇的六倍体积，虽然体型仍没有大到可以将人类当作猎物，但相比普通的响尾蛇更具有侵略性且更危险。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant frog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "A mutated frog taller than a man.  Its huge mouth and dumpy body aren't quite as funny at this size."
msgstr "比人还高的变异青蛙。  它的大嘴和矮胖的身体在这个尺寸下并不那么有趣。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mutant rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "A mutated timber rattlesnake, about three times as large as the norm.  While it isn't big enough to regard humans as potential prey, it is more aggressive and dangerous compared to a normal rattler."
msgstr "一条变异的林响蛇，约有普通响尾蛇的三倍体积，虽然体型并没有大到可以将人类当作猎物，但相比普通的响尾蛇更具有侵略性且更危险。"

#. ~ Description of monster "deathrattle serpent"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "A primal fear strikes when the club-like tail of this massively warped snake shifts, an assortment of bones rattling softly.  Multiple sets of hollow fangs have erupted in its maw, which itself is flanked by skinless ropes of powerful muscle.  Its scales constantly shed off and regrow with unnatural speed."
msgstr "当这条巨大而扭曲的蛇的棒状尾巴移动时，一种原始的恐惧朝你袭来，各种各样的骨头轻轻地嘎嘎作响。它的大嘴已经长出了好几对中空的毒牙，而大嘴两侧则是没有皮肤的强健肌肉纤维。它的鳞片以不自然的速度不断脱落和再生。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant tadpole"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "A tadpole the size of a bass.  At this size, it's easy to spot the little growths that will eventually become its limbs."
msgstr "一条鲈鱼大小的蝌蚪。  在这个尺寸下，很容易发现最终会成为四肢的小生长物。"

#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "A teeny tiny baby frog, smaller than a penny.  It's basically just a head with a tail."
msgstr "一只比一便士还小的小青蛙。  它基本上只是一个头和一个尾巴。"

#. ~ Description of monster "juvenile rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "A timber rattlesnake in its hatchling stage.  It will eventually grow a rattle and learn how to hunt."
msgstr "一只在刚孵化的木纹响尾蛇。它最终会长出尾环，学会如何捕猎。"

#. ~ Description of monster "sewer snake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "An aggressive mutant variety of the worm snake, turned pale yellow from lack of sunlight.  It swarms beneath the ground, and is named for its habit of infesting sewer lines."
msgstr "这是一种具有攻击性的变异盲蛇，缺少阳光照射使其身体变成淡黄色。这种生物在地下生活，并以其群聚在下水道的习性而命名。"

#. ~ Description of monster "megafrog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "Big enough to swallow a person whole, this enormous frog is especially lumpy, burdened by tumors and extra toes as its unnatural growth runs out of control."
msgstr "这种巨大的青蛙大到足以吞下一个人，但由于其不自然的生长失控，它的身体特别笨重，长满了肿瘤和多余的脚趾。"

#. ~ Description of monster "bullfrog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "The American bullfrog, a slimy green amphibian the size of a rat.  It feeds on insects, mice, lizards and any other living thing it can stuff down its gullet."
msgstr "美国牛蛙，在自然栖息地生活，他捕食昆虫、老鼠、蜥蜴等，食道可以过滤掉残渣。"

#. ~ Description of monster "rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "The timber rattlesnake, the most venomous viper native to New England.  Climatic changes have extended its range far into the north."
msgstr "一条林响蛇（响尾蛇的一种），新英格兰地区的毒性最强的一种，气候变化将其活动范围拓展到北方边远地区。"

