#. ~ Description of monster "Hub 01 camspy"
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "A white and brown quadcopter drone mounting what looks to be a camera dome and a large antenna array.  It calmly hovers a comfortable distance above the ground, surveiling its surroundings with cold indifference."
msgstr "一架白棕色的四旋翼无人机，安装了一个看起来像是摄像头的圆顶和一个大型天线阵列。它平静地在离地面较高的地方盘旋着，冷漠地监视着周围的环境。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Hub 01 exterminatron"
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "An an armed and up-armored skitterbot, clad in white plastic plating and mounting a stripped down 7.62 battle rifle over its original cam-arm."
msgstr "一台全副武装的掠行无人机，覆盖白色的塑料装甲板，在原来的辅助臂上安装了一支简化版本的 7.62mm 口径战斗步枪。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "Hub 01 camspy"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 camspies"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 侦察无人机"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "Hub 01 exterminatron"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 exterminatrons"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 根除者无人机"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Hub 01 exterminatron"
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "The exterminatron legs lock into place as it swings its turret to bear."
msgstr "根除者无人机的腿部固定在原地，同时转动炮塔对准目标。"

#. ~ Description of monster "prototype laser turret"
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "This appears to be a very experimental automated tower.  Lacking armor plating and seemingly half-built, it's little more than an oversized laser emitter and a camera, both welded to a swiveling platform."
msgstr "它似乎是一台实验性的自动化炮塔。尚未安装装甲板，看起来像是半成品一般，像是在一台加大号的激光发射器上安装了一个摄像头，两者都被焊接在一个能够旋转的炮塔底座上。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "prototype laser turret"
msgid_plural "prototype laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "原型激光炮塔"

#. ~ Description of monster "tunnel runner"
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "Prior to the Cataclysm someone might have referred to this dog-sized rat as a 'mass of claws and teeth,' but that could describe nearly everything you meet these days.  In any case, this particular mass of claws and teeth is eyeing its surroundings hungrily."
msgstr "在大灾变之前，有人可能会把这只从地底爬出来的巨大老鼠称为\"一团尖牙利爪\"，但这几乎可以描述你现在遇到的一切。不管怎样，这团尖牙和利爪正贪婪地注视着周围的环境。"

#. ~ Description of monster "big rat"
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "This cat-sized rat snuffles along the ground looking for things to eat.  It hisses at anything that comes near it, baring sizable teeth."
msgstr "这只体型和猫一般大小的老鼠在地上嗅来嗅去寻找食物。它会对任何靠近的东西发出嘶嘶声，露出尖利的大牙齿。"

#. ~ Description of monster "pack rat"
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "This mutated rodent stands on two legs, as tall as a man.  It has a habit of shoving shiny objects into its cheek pouches, and eyes its surroundings with too-human eyes that sparkle with greed, but not intellect."
msgstr "这只变异啮齿动物用两条腿站立，有一个人那么高。  它习惯于将闪亮的物体塞进颊囊，并用过于人类的眼睛观察周围的环境，眼睛里闪烁着贪婪的光芒，但没有智慧。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "big rat"
msgid_plural "big rats"
msgstr[0] "变异大鼠"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "pack rat"
msgid_plural "pack rats"
msgstr[0] "林鼠"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "tunnel runner"
msgid_plural "tunnel runners"
msgstr[0] "隧道追猎鼠"

#. ~ Description of monster "slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of living oil."
msgstr "一个黑色粘液球，渗出的粘液滴在地上像一团有生命的石油。"

#. ~ Description of monster "amoebic mold"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A formless slime mold the size of a cow.  Crusty bits of cytoplasm fall away as it oozes across the ground."
msgstr "一团无定形的黏液，有母牛般大小。随着它在地上爬行，不断有小块细胞质从身上掉落。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shoggoth"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A gargantuan protoplasmic blob, constantly reshaping, forming new pseudopods seemingly at will.  All over its body are eyes that form and disappear.  The rapid and chaotic way it reconstitutes itself gives the impression of it boiling over with some kind of primordial fury."
msgstr "那是一个体型无比巨大的，身上不断分裂出四处挥舞的触手，外形不定的巨型变形怪。遍布它全身的无数只眼睛，不断地在体表形成又消失。它快速而混乱地重组自己，给人一种它沸腾着某种原始的愤怒的印象。"

#. ~ Description of monster "brain slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A gigantic black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of living oil.  Other slimes seem to swarm around it."
msgstr "一个巨型的黑色粘液球，渗出的粘液滴在地上像一团有生命的石油。无数的小变形怪围绕着它。"

#. ~ Description of monster "big slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A large black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of living oil."
msgstr "一个大型的黑色粘液球，渗出的粘液滴在地上像一团有生命的石油。"

#. ~ Description of monster "small slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A small black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of living oil."
msgstr "一个小型的黑色粘液球，渗出的粘液滴在地上像一团有生命的石油。"

#. ~ Description of monster "slime microbian"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A small wriggling slime, a first line of defense for the colony."
msgstr "一团蠕动的小型变形怪，是种群中的第一道防线。"

#. ~ Description of monster "slime ocularium"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A spire of hardened slime, coated in rotating eyespots and glistening ocular nerves."
msgstr "一只变硬的尖顶变形怪，覆盖着不停旋转的眼柄和闪闪发光的眼神经。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "sewer slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts, releasing its vile contents!"
msgstr "%s 爆炸，释放出其邪恶的内容！"

#. ~ Death message of monster "slime microbian"
#. ~ Death message of monster "slime ocularium"
#. ~ Death message of monster "bilious soldier zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "caustic soldier zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body dissolves into acid."
msgstr "%s 的尸体被酸液融化了。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "small slime"
#. ~ Death message of monster "tadpole constrictor"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body melts away."
msgstr "%s 的尸体融化了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "sewer slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "This moving, black glob emits a foul stench.  It has incorporated the both the liquid and solid contents of the sewer water."
msgstr "这个移动的黑色球体散发着恶臭。  它结合了下水道水中的液体和固体成分。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "amoebic mold"
msgid_plural "amoebic molds"
msgstr[0] "阿米巴原虫"

