#. ~ Description of monster "zombie wolf"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "A zombified wolf.  Putrescence oozes from its mouth to coat vicious-looking yellow fangs."
msgstr "一条丧尸化的野狼。它的嘴里流淌着黑色物质，长长的白色獠牙外翻着。"

#. ~ Description of monster "rotting zombie dog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "An acrid smell accompanies this limping canine corpse.  Its whole body is covered in chains of pulsing cysts and slime-dribbling ulcers."
msgstr "这具复生的犬类尸体散发着刺鼻的气味。它全身都布满了一串串不断搏动的囊肿，从中滴下粘稠的溃疡脓汁。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cow"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "Dairy cows have no natural weapons, but a zombie as big, heavy, and murderous as this is still extremely dangerous."
msgstr "曾经是一头平静的母牛，这只皮革包裹的恐怖怪物蹒跚着，颤抖着。虽然奶牛没有天生的武器，但像这样又大又重的凶残丧尸奶牛仍然极其危险。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie horse"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "From the deteriorated state of this undead horse's ghastly features--protruding ribs, off-white skull, and decayed, tattered muscles--it doesn't seem like it should put up much of a fight, but something deep inside gives it power.  Reeking pus drips from its wounds."
msgstr "这匹丧尸马有着可怕的外表，从它突出的肋骨、发白的头骨、腐朽破烂的肌肉来看，它似乎无法进行太多的战斗，但它变异后的力量让它变得更加强大。黑色发臭的体液从伤口上缓缓滴下。"

#. ~ Description of monster "abyssal terror"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "Once a former apex predator of the seas, now an undead nightmare, this zombified Great White shark terrorizes the waters with its relentless hunger and aggression."
msgstr "这只丧尸化的大白鲨曾经是海洋的顶级捕食者，而现在成为了不死的梦魇，以其无尽的饥饿和攻击性为海洋带来恐惧。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zeindeer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "Once a majestic caribou, this undead creature barely resembles Santa's helpful reindeer and seems to only be interested in human flesh."
msgstr "曾经是一只高贵强壮的驯鹿，被丧尸化后已经与圣诞老人的驯鹿大相径庭，只渴望着人类的血肉。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie shark"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "Once a normally-aggressive, normally-hungry bull shark, this undead terror is now even more aggressive and more hungry, possibly thanks to its lack of a functioning brain."
msgstr "曾经它是一条极富攻击性的饥肠辘辘的牛鲨，它现在丧尸化后看起来更恐怖了，可能是因为它缺乏一个正常运作的大脑的原因吧。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie pig"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "The body of a stout, scruffy pig, reanimated now and somehow even angrier than it was in life."
msgstr "那是一具粗壮、毛色杂乱的猪的躯体，如今已死而复生，且不知为何，竟比生前还要暴怒。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "The deformed, animated corpse of a canine; a sinewy beast which can easily outpace its two-legged friends."
msgstr "一具变形的犬类尸体，现在已经复活。这只怪兽肌肉发达，能够轻易追赶上它的两条腿的\"朋友\"。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie goat"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "The moving corpse of what once was a goat is now left stumbling around, its vacant eyes looking for anything alive to kill."
msgstr "这具曾经是山羊的尸体现在正蹒跚而行，嗜杀的欲望让它那双漆黑空洞的眼睛不断地寻找着任何活物。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie deer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "The ragged remains of this woodland ungulate stagger madly about in search of anything that breathes."
msgstr "这只林地有蹄类动物的残骸破烂不堪，疯狂地摇摇晃晃地寻找任何能呼吸的东西。"

#. ~ Description of monster "undead attack dog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "The reanimated corpse of a dog used in law enforcement.  Its deformed body is encased in a protective Kevlar harness."
msgstr "一只已经变成丧尸的德国牧羊警犬。它早已变形的身躯上仍然套着残存的凯夫拉犬具。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "zombie llama"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "The vicious vicuña spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr "酸尸羊驼吐出了一团酸液！"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombear"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "This black bear's eyes have gone filmy-white, and its flesh is torn and scarred.  It moves with an unnaturally graceless gait."
msgstr "这只黑熊的眼睛渗出深色油状液体，撕裂的肉体瘢痕累累。它的步伐拖曳蹒跚。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombull"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "This enormous, terrifyingly fast creature with blood-bloated eyes and dreadful horns was once a domestic bull.  While live bulls can be temperamental, unbridled rage is now this one's only emotion."
msgstr "曾经是一头家养的公牛，这只巨大且速度惊人的怪物长着黑色油光的眼睛和可怕的尖角。即便是活生生的公牛也会喜怒无常，而如今难以掩盖的愤怒是它唯一的情绪。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie moose"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "This formerly-majestic moose has succumbed to the infection that is killing the world.  Shiny green blowflies swarm the vast, suppurated patches of purulent flesh where its skin has sloughed away, and its remaining fur is matted with necrotic discharge."
msgstr "这只曾经高贵强壮的驼鹿已经向正在毁灭世界的感染屈服。脱落的皮肤将化脓溃烂的血肉暴漏在外，滋生大量的绿头苍蝇。残余的毛皮则被腐败物染成了黑色。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie llama"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "This llama oozes a dark oil from a multitude of lesions and cuts.  Its wool has sloughed off with parts of its skin, revealing pulsating muscles and flesh.  Its mouth drips with a sickly green substance which it seems to be chewing on."
msgstr "这只羊驼从许多伤口中渗出黑色液体，毛皮已经和部分皮肤一起脱落，露出跳动的肉块。它的嘴里滴着一种恶心的绿色物质，似乎在咀嚼。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie sheep"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "This sheep's once pure white wool is now barely hanging by its rotten flesh, held together by dried mud and blood.  Its legs now buckle as the rotten muscles have a hard time sustaining the rest of the body."
msgstr "这只绵羊身上沾着干泥和污血的腐肉已经挂不住它那曾经纯白色的羊毛，由于腐烂的肌肉很难支撑身体的其余部分，它现在只能屈膝着腿。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie tiger"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "This tiger stumbles and sways, its jaws slack, its eyes wide open and shining yellow-white."
msgstr "这只看似正常的老虎走起路来摇摇晃晃的，下巴松弛，眼睛睁得大大的，漆黑的眼睛正闪闪发亮。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombeaver"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "This wall-eyed beast has a large wound on its side, its gore-stained ribs clearly visible.  Foamy corpse-bile dribbles from around its fearsome orange incisors, which look all the more intimidating now that the flesh of its face has begun to peel away."
msgstr "这只长着白星眼的怪兽身体侧面有个巨大伤口，血迹斑斑的肋骨清晰可见。它最突出的特征是一对可怕的门牙和嘴中不断滴下的厚厚的黑色粘液。它看起来不再想要啃树了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "frail zombie deer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "What might have once been a noble creature has been reduced to a sorry sack of skin and bones, oozing gore as it trots along clumsily in search of something to kill."
msgstr "曾经可能是高贵的生物已经沦为一袋皮包骨头的可怜动物，在笨拙地小跑寻找可杀死的东西时渗出血迹。"

