#. ~ Description of monster "zombie brute"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
msgid "A former doctor of some sort, though its uniform has been torn apart.  You assume the oversized muscles that cover it to be the culprit."
msgstr "或许它曾经是某种医生，但它的制服已经被身上硕大的肌肉撕碎了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_skeleton_medical"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
msgid "A malformed armor of misshapen bone has grown over this zombie, having pushed what remains of the skin out of the way.  The clothes of a medical worker are still draped over it."
msgstr "这只丧尸身上长出了一副畸形的骨头盔甲，已经把剩下的皮肤推开了。上面仍然披着一套医务工作者的衣服。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_zombie_medical_regenerating"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
msgid "The zombified remains of a practitioner of medicine, you aren't certain what field - your focus is instead drawn to the way that its pink flesh snakes all over it, weaving its way over wounds and injuries."
msgstr "一个分不清是哪个领域的医学工作者遗体，显然已经丧尸化了。你注意到，粉红的血肉正盘布在它的伤口和残躯上，四处蔓延。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_zombie_medical_acidic"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
msgid "This is the body of a doctor or nurse of some kind.  It's hard to tell now that most of its clothing has corroded away from whatever vile acid its secreting."
msgstr "一具医生或护士的尸体，具体是哪种，看不出来。它的大部分衣服已经被分泌出的恶心酸液腐蚀掉了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie medic"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
msgid "This shambling corpse is dressed like a medical professional.  It was either a doctor, or only played one on TV."
msgstr "这具蹒跚而行的尸体穿着得像个医学专家。要么它曾经真的是医生，要么就是它在电视上演过一个。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie brute"
msgid_plural "zombie brutes"
msgstr[0] "狂暴丧尸兽"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
msgid "zombie medic"
msgid_plural "zombie medics"
msgstr[0] "医生丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "shady pupating zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of what once may have been a human being, but its edges bulge rhythmically in places that are not anatomically possible for humans."
msgstr "怪诞的阴影笼罩着这个生物。你可以看出曾经为人的隐约轮廓，但轮廓边缘处规律的鼓胀，却不是人体结构能办到的。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hive hulk"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "The bloated torso of this gigantic corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr "这具巨大的肌肉肿胀的人类尸体被一种黑色粘稠的纤维包裹着。在其下方有什么东西正在有规律的不停搏动，看上去十分怪异。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "hive hulk"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "The hive hulk opens its mouth, and a gore-smeared winged beast flies out of it!"
msgstr "蜂巢浩克的嘴巴张开，一只血迹斑斑的带翼怪兽从中爬了出来！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "pupating brute"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "The pupating brute bursts, and gore-smeared winged beasts climb out of the corpse!"
msgstr "化蛹丧尸兽的身体爆开，许多血迹斑斑的带翼怪兽从尸体中爬了出来！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "pupating zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "The pupating zombie bursts, and gore-smeared winged beasts climb out of the corpse!"
msgstr "化蛹丧尸的身体爆开，一只血迹斑斑的带翼怪兽从尸体中爬了出来！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shady pupating zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "The pupating zombie bursts, and shadowy winged beasts climb out of the corpse!"
msgstr "化蛹丧尸的身体爆开，一只暗色的带翼怪兽从尸体中爬了出来！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "pupating zombie crawler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "The pupating zombie crawler bursts, and gore-smeared winged beasts climb out of the corpse!"
msgstr "化蛹爬行丧尸的身体爆开，一只血迹斑斑的带翼怪兽从尸体中爬了出来！"

#. ~ Description of monster "pupating zombie crawler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "This half of a human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr "这半具人类尸体自脖子以下的一切都被一种黑色粘稠的纤维包裹着。在其下方有什么东西正在有规律的不停搏动，看上去十分怪异。"

