#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid "zaptor"
msgid_plural "zaptors"
msgstr[0] "雷鸷"

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie dog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "A deformed, sickly-looking animated corpse of a canine.  A dangerous-looking yellow saliva drips from its mouth."
msgstr "残缺扭曲、不堪入目的犬类活尸。怵目惊心的黄涎从其嘴中滴落。"

#. ~ Description of monster "wretched puker"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "A degenerate corpse, shambling as it walks.  Various pieces of trash and waste materials have melded into the black goo leaking from its skin."
msgstr "一具蹒跚移动的腐化尸体。各种各样的垃圾和废料已经融化成从皮肤上不断渗出的黑色黏液。"

#. ~ Description of monster "spitter zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "A hunched human body with its eyes pushed up into its forehead and drooping cheeks, most of its face is occupied by a puckered mouth.  Its stomach is swollen and nearly translucent, with a sickly yellow tint."
msgstr "一个弯腰驼背的丧尸，他的面部下垂，大部分的皮肤都有皱褶，几乎半透明，身上慢慢滴下病态的黄色液体。"

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "A sickly-looking zombie.  Its skin looks especially thin, with a sticky, yellow fluid flowing through the clearly visible veins."
msgstr "一只看上去很恶心的丧尸。它的皮肤看上去非常薄，你都能看到它的血管下流动着粘稠的黄色液体。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "acidic zombie"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "acidic zombie dog"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "festering acid hound"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s barfs acid!"
msgstr "%s 被震晕了！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "wretched puker"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s pukes acid!"
msgstr "%s喷出了一些胆汁！"

#. ~ Description of monster "festering acid hound"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "The reeking remains of what was once a dog.  Its torso is swollen up like a barrel, supported by unnaturally elongated legs.  Its fur has mostly been burned off by a corrosive liquid that leaks from is jaws and puckered sores all over its body."
msgstr "曾经是一只狗的恶臭残骸。  它的躯干像桶一样肿胀，由不自然地伸长的腿支撑。  它的皮毛大部分被从下巴漏出的腐蚀性液体烧掉，全身布满褶皱的疮口。"

#. ~ Description of monster "corrosive zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "This zombie has swollen to immense proportions, but still manages to hold itself together with semi-congealed acid all over its bloated, leathery body.  It moves clumsily, but spits from a large reserve of acid with uncanny accuracy."
msgstr "一只全身大部分都浮肿的丧尸，但是在他臃肿的身体里由于一些半凝固的胶体酸液，仍然能够保持着大概的轮廓。它移动十分笨拙，但将体内储备的大量强酸吐出，精确得出奇。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "酸液丧尸"

