msgstr[0] "可怖呕吐者"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "charged amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#, c-format
msgid "A bolt of electricity arcs from %s!"
msgstr "%s射出了一道电弧！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "charged amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#, c-format
msgid "A cloud of electricity explodes from the %s"
msgstr "一团电弧云从%s的身体上爆发开来！"

#. ~ Description of monster "leaping amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "A four-legged white creature about the size of a human, running with a decidedly feline gait, the three remaining limbs holding an almost-translucent skin membrane outstretched on its side and rear.  Much of its head is taken up by a beak like a raven's, which opens to reveal a set of jagged black teeth."
msgstr "一只四条腿的白色生物，大小和人差不多，以一种明显的猫科动物步态奔跑，剩下的三条肢体在侧面和后面撑起一层几乎透明的皮膜。它的头部大部分被一个像乌鸦一样的喙占据，张开后露出一组锯齿状的黑牙。"

#. ~ Description of monster "caustic amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "A gangly creature running on six legs, its form made irregular by the green pustules at the limbs' base, each feeding into a large vein leading to two blackened claws.  What must have been a seventh leg fused with the creature's head forming a jagged proboscis emerging from below its eyes, dripping a caustic liquid."
msgstr "一只用六条腿奔跑的奇怪生物，它的形状因四肢根部的绿色脓包变得不规则，每个脓包都通往一条大血管，通向两个发黑的爪子。第七条腿和它的头融合在一起，形成一个锯齿状的颚，从眼睛下面冒出来，滴下一种腐蚀性的液体。"

#. ~ Description of monster "brutish amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "A large, thickly armored creature built not unlike a bear, if a bear had a long, clubbed tail and two short limbs ending in black talons framing a vertical mouth on an otherwise smooth, featureless head.  On second thought, not that much like a bear at all."
msgstr "一只带有厚重装甲的巨大生物，长得和熊差别不是很大——如果熊有大木棒一样的尾巴，上面还长着两条短肢，末端是黑色的爪子，另一端有张垂直的嘴，光滑到看不出来是头的话。转念一想，这根本就不像熊。"

#. ~ Description of monster "large meat cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "A mass of pink flesh the size of a fridge squirming constantly, black veins anchoring it to the ground.  Occasionally a malformed limb pushes against the skin from the inside, before a churn of the cocoon pushes it back.  Not ready yet, it seems."
msgstr "一团冰箱大小的粉红色血肉不断蠕动着，黑色的血管将它固定在地面上。偶尔有一个畸形的肢体向外推动皮肤，然后被茧的搅动推回去。似乎还没有准备好。"

#. ~ Description of monster "gigantic meat cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "A rigid, off-white lump of flesh the size of a small car constricted by bands of rope-sized pulsing black veins that tie it to the floor below.  The whole thing is shuddering constantly, and gives off an otherworldly stench."
msgstr "一个僵硬的米白色肉块，有一辆小汽车那么大，被绳索大小的黑色血管束缚着，把它固定在下面的地板上。整个肉茧在不断地颤抖，并散发出一种另类的臭味。"

#. ~ Description of monster "small meat cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "A sack of pink flesh sitting in the middle of a net of black roots.  At irregular intervals it shudders as something (or multiple somethings?) inside changes position.  You're not sure you want to know what's inside."
msgstr "一个粉红色的肉袋子固定在黑色根状物间，随着里面的东西（或多个东西）改变位置，它不定期地颤抖着。你不确定你是否想知道里面有什么。"

#. ~ Description of monster "charged amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "A short, crablike creature waddling around on six multi-jointed legs, its body dominated by a large glowing organ bulging from between the white armor plates.  A single raised appendage connects to the mass, its tip surrounded by brilliant white sparks."
msgstr "一只螃蟹形状的矮小生物，用六条多关节的腿蹒跚而行，它的身体被一个巨大的发光器官占据，从白色的甲壳板之间鼓起。一个凸起的附着物与这团东西相连，其顶端被灿烂的白色火花包围。"

#. ~ Description of monster "tiny meat cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "A small, wet sack of pink skin, with something dog-sized moving around underneath the surface.  Black roots anchor it to the ground."
msgstr "一个由粉红色皮肤组成的潮湿小袋子，表面下有狗大小的东西在蠕动。黑色的树根状结构将它固定在地面上。"

#. ~ Description of monster "vigilant amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "An inflated white body carried by five dainty legs, waving its remaining two limbs constantly.  Each one is tipped by a head-sized compound eye, independently scanning the horizon for prey."
msgstr "一个肿胀的白色身体，由五条细小的腿支撑，不断挥舞着剩下的两条腿。每条腿的顶端都有一只和头一样大的复眼，各自不断扫描着地平线，寻找猎物。"

#. ~ Description of monster "swarming amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid "An small, flat creature dashing around erratically on seven short legs.  Its form is dominated by an oversized set of black mandibles on an almost comically small head, featureless apart from a single, black eye.  The rest of the body is covered with sickly white skin crisscrossed by black veins."
msgstr "一只小而扁平的生物，用七条短腿无规律地四处奔跑。它的外形由一组超大的黑色下颌骨主导，头部小得有点滑稽，除了一只黑色的眼睛外没有其他特征。身体的其余部分覆盖着病态的白色皮肤，上面有纵横交错的黑色血管。"

