#. ~ Description of monster "fiend"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "A charred zombie covered with bony plates, spikes, and protrusions.  Moves stiffly, but swiftly."
msgstr "一具烧焦的丧尸，但长着骨质甲壳，尖刺和凸起。移动僵硬，但是速度很快。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_zombie_fiend_rust"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "A charred zombie covered with bony plates, spikes, and protrusions.  Moves stiffly, but swiftly.  This one appears to have metal fragments sticking out of its body."
msgstr "一具烧焦的丧尸，但长着骨质甲壳，尖刺和凸起。移动僵硬，但是速度很快。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie kinderling"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "A diminutive humanoid figure, its body ravaged by fire into a blackened, charred shell.  Its leathery flesh has mended in patches, and the tattered clothing is still clinging to its emaciated frame making it clear it once was - and still is - the body of a child."
msgstr "一个身材矮小的人形，它的身体被火烧成焦黑的外壳。  它皮革般的肉体已经修补好，破烂的衣服仍然粘在它瘦弱的身躯上，这表明它曾经是——而且仍然是——一个孩子的身体。"

#. ~ Description of monster "scorched zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its flesh has mended into a leathery shell."
msgstr "一具严重烧伤的丧尸，烧焦的血肉散发着恶臭。它的血肉已经碳化为一层皮甲似的壳。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_zombie_scorched_rust"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its flesh has mended into a leathery shell.  This one appears to have metal fragments sticking out of its body."
msgstr "一具严重烧伤的丧尸，烧焦的血肉散发着恶臭。它的血肉已经碳化为一层皮甲似的壳。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "fiend"
msgid_plural "fiends"
msgstr[0] "恶魔丧尸"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "scorched zombie"
msgid_plural "scorched zombies"
msgstr[0] "烧焦丧尸"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "zombie kinderling"
msgid_plural "zombie kinderlings"
msgstr[0] "柴薪丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie child"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "It was only a child, and little is different about it now aside from the hungry look in its eyes.  You'd be hard-pressed to not feel like you were killing an actual child by putting it down."
msgstr "它只是一个孩子，现在除了眼中的饥饿，外表没有什么不同了。你在杀死它时很难摆脱自己是在杀死一个真正的孩子的感觉。"

#. ~ Description of monster "wretched hatchery"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "Lethargically resting on its back, this hideous mass of sagging flesh and writhing organs, which used to be a child, twitches feebly as its midsection churns.  Almost bursting from its skin, the child's ribcage has arched outward, forming a hive-like construct covered by severely stretched epidermis.  Through the wretched organism's taut abdominal flesh, you witness small forms swarming within its ribcage—its guts roiling as new beings are sculpted from pilfered flesh and bone.  The creature's limbs rest haphazardly on the ground, contorted in ways that suggest the absence of bones or any interior construct."
msgstr "昏昏欲睡地躺在它的背上，这团可怕的下垂的肉体和扭动的器官曾经是一个孩子，随着它的腹部翻腾而无力地抽搐。  孩子的胸腔几乎从皮肤中爆出来，向外拱起，形成一个蜂巢状的结构，上面覆盖着严重拉伸的表皮。  透过这个可怜的有机体绷紧的腹部肌肉，你可以看到在它的胸腔内聚集着小形体——当新的生物从偷来的肉和骨头中被雕刻出来时，它的内脏在翻滚。  该生物的四肢随意地放在地上，扭曲的方式表明没有骨头或任何内部结构。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "wretched hatchery"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "Ripping and tearing, a small beast burrows free of the wretch's abdomen!"
msgstr "一只小野兽撕扯着，从这个可怜虫的腹部钻了出来！"

#. ~ Description of monster "sproglodyte"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "This crouching child-mutant's face is dominated by a pair of huge milky eyes, and its fingertips end in sharp claws."
msgstr "这个蜷缩着的变异小孩的脸上长着一对巨大的黑眼睛，它的指尖末端有着锋利的爪子。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shriekling"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "This heavily mutated child zombie twitches and flails its limbs in painful-looking spasms as it runs about."
msgstr "这个严重变异的儿童丧尸移动时四肢四处抽搐，看着如同痉挛疼痛一般。"

#. ~ Description of monster "anklebiter"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "This horrifying little mutated wretch looks to have once been a child, but its massive gaping jaws are now far more suggestive of a predatory beast."
msgstr "这个可怕的小型变异怪胎看上去曾经是一个小孩，但其巨大的大颚让它看上去更像一只食肉的野兽。"

#. ~ Description of monster "snotgobbler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "This swollen, gooey-looking mutant child looks bad, even for a zombie.  Maybe that's why it seems to want a hug so badly."
msgstr "这孩子是一个肿肿的，粘稠的变异怪物。即使是按丧尸的标准，看起来也很糟糕。也许这就是为什么它似乎如此迫切地想要一个拥抱。"

#. ~ Description of monster "howling waif"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "Undeath has not been kind to the children of the apocalypse.  This one is little more than a reanimated membrane of skin stretched across tiny brittle bones."
msgstr "亡灵并没有善待末日的孩子们。这只小怪物就仅有复活的膜状皮肤包裹着微小脆弱的骨头。"

#. ~ Description of monster "creepy crawler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "What was once a child has bent and twisted into a bloated carcass with blackened skin and massive bloodshot eyes"
msgstr "曾经是个小孩，但现在已经成了变异怪兽，有着发黑的表皮及巨大的眼睛。这可憎的邪恶生物就是对其人类起源的嘲弄。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "anklebiter"
msgid_plural "anklebiters"
msgstr[0] "小不点啃蚀者"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "creepy crawler"
msgid_plural "creepy crawlers"
msgstr[0] "恐怖爬行者"

