#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
msgid "Fake zombie used for spawning dormant zombies.  If you see this, open an issue on github."
msgstr "假僵尸用于生成休眠僵尸。  如果您看到此内容，请在 github 上提出问题。"

#. ~ Description of spell "dormant corpse waking up"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
msgid "You should not see this.  Causes all dormant corpses in the tile to revive."
msgstr "你不应该看到这个。  使方块中所有休眠的尸体复活。"

#. ~ Description of spell "cause loud moaning"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
msgid "You should not see this.  Causes loud noise."
msgstr "你不应该看到这个。  造成很大的噪音。"

#. ~ Description of spell "kill pseudo zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
msgid "You should not see this.  Kills pseudo zombie to turn it into a corpse for revival."
msgstr "你不应该看到这个。  杀死伪僵尸使其变成尸体复活。"

#. ~ Description of spell "dormant corpse setup"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
msgid "You should not see this.  Sets up trap for dormant zombies."
msgstr "你不应该看到这个。  为休眠的僵尸设置陷阱。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "cause loud moaning"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
msgid "a zombie moaning!"
msgstr "僵尸在呻吟！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
msgid "cause loud moaning"
msgstr "引起大声呻吟"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
