msgid_plural "zombie crawlers"
msgstr[0] "爬行丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "shocker brute"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "A huge beast covered in visible scarring from the lightning bolts that arc out of its body.  Being near it, you can hear a slight humming, like that of an electrical transformer."
msgstr "一个覆盖着疤痕的巨型丧尸，那些疤痕来自其体内闪电激发出来的电弧。当靠近它的时候，你可以听到轻微而又低沉的嗡嗡声，像是工作中的交流电变压器一样。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shocker zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy."
msgstr "一具身体呈现淡蓝色的丧尸，由于生化插件的异常放电，其周围不断有噼啪的电流环绕。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zapper zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "A very pale dead body with the worst case of static hair you have ever seen.  Sparks of electricity frequently jump off it, lighting it up in the dark.  You might not want to touch it with your bare hands, or anything conductive."
msgstr "一具非常苍白的尸体，长着你所见过的最糟糕的带电头发。电火花偶尔从它身上射出来，在黑暗中点亮它。你也许不该徒手或是用任何导电的物体触摸它。"

#. ~ Description of monster "incandescent husk"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "This zombie is visible only as a glowing white silhouette that you have to squint to see, cloaked in a crackling field of lightning that pulses like a beating heart.  It walks slowly and deliberately, the thunderstorm surrounding it eagerly jumping to anything conductive within its grasp."
msgstr "这只丧尸如今仅剩下一个发光的白色轮廓，你必须眯着眼睛才能透过那如同心跳一般一闪一闪的电场看见它的身影。它慢悠悠地走着，身体四周缠绕的闪电急切地扑向所能触及的任何导电物体。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "incandescent husk"
msgid_plural "incandescent husks"
msgstr[0] "炽耀躯壳"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "shocker brute"
msgid_plural "shocker brutes"
msgstr[0] "放电丧尸兽"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "shocker zombie"
msgid_plural "shocker zombies"
msgstr[0] "放电丧尸"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "zapper zombie"
msgid_plural "zapper zombies"
msgstr[0] "静电丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "swollen tearjerker"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "A bloated corpse, its ballooning skin blistered and rashy and its face caked in mucus.  The off-color orange gas that occasionally leaks from it makes your eyes water and smells faintly of pepper."
msgstr "一具臃肿的尸体，它膨胀的皮肤起了很多水泡，泛着红晕，脸上结着粘液。偶尔从它身上漏出的异常橙色气体让你\"潸然泪下\"，还带有淡淡的胡椒味。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "bombardier boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "A bombardier boomer explodes!"
msgstr "投弹爆汁丧尸爆炸了！"

#. ~ Description of monster "boomer glutton"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "A large, grotesque ball of flesh and fat.  Seemingly vestigial limbs flop around haphazardly as it rolls across the ground.  You occasionally catch a glimpse of bulging eyes and a distended gaping maw oozing some sort of black sludge."
msgstr "一个巨大而怪诞的血肉和脂肪组成的肉球。当它在地面上滚动时，看似残存的四肢随之肆意摇摆。你偶尔会瞥见一双鼓鼓的眼睛和一只张开的大嘴、从中不断渗出某种黑色淤泥。"

#. ~ Description of monster "gasoline zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "A massively bloated zombie that has either been chugging gasoline or making biofuel in its distended gut; fumes and flames escape from its mouth and liquid petroleum leaks from its waddling form."
msgstr "一只巨大、肿胀的丧尸，似乎吃了许多汽油；烟雾和火焰从它的口中喷出，燃油不停地从它的蹒跚而行的身体中泄漏出来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief and layered in rolls of fat.  It emits a horrible odor, and a putrid sludge dribbles from its mouth."
msgstr "臃肿的难以相信的躯体，脂肪堆积在一起，它发出一种可怕的气味，粉红色的腐烂粘液从它口中滴下来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "sleepwalker zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "A zombie swollen with a bluish, oddly sweet smelling gas.  It stumbles around even more than regular zombies, as if heavily intoxicated."
msgstr "这只丧尸的肚子被某种蓝色的、奇怪的甜味气体撑得鼓鼓胀胀的。它走起路来比普通丧尸更加跌跌撞撞，仿佛喝醉了一般。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s spews bile!"
msgstr "%s喷出了一些胆汁！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "big boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s spews glowing bile!"
msgstr "%s喷出灼热的胆汁！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "boomer glutton"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "The glutton vomits sludge!"
msgstr "贪食爆汁丧尸吐出了一团淤泥！"

#. ~ Description of monster "big boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "This zombie has bloated well beyond human size, as though inflated by the putrid goo overflowing from its gullet."
msgstr "这只僵尸的体型已经远远超过了人类的大小，就好像被从食道里溢出的腐烂粘液所膨胀一样。"

#. ~ Description of monster "bombardier boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "This zombie's exposed ribcage is encircled by swollen lungs and other organs.  You would prefer to be far away when they burst."
msgstr "这只丧尸肿胀的肺脏和其他器官似乎快要从胸腔里爆出来了。当它们爆炸时，你最好躲得远远的。"

#. ~ Description of monster "bloated zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "With its gray skin swollen to near-rupture with putrid gas, this cyst-covered zombie looks like it could violently burst under the slightest of disturbances."
msgstr "一具灰白的皮肤下充满了臌胀的腐败气体的尸体，隆起的皮肤遍布着黑色的血管，随时都可能爆出大量毒气。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "big boomer"
msgid_plural "big boomers"
msgstr[0] "巨型爆汁丧尸"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "bloated zombie"
msgid_plural "bloated zombies"
msgstr[0] "胀气丧尸"

