msgid_plural "swollen tearjerkers"
msgstr[0] "催泪丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "rust urchin"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "A spiked horror of a zombie covered in long, rusty spikes.  A walking tetanus infection waiting to happen."
msgstr "一只浑身长满锈刺的恐怖丧尸。一个等待发生的会行走的破伤风感染。"

#. ~ Description of monster "rust zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "A zombie impaled with a multitude of metal fragments, each covered with a thick layer of rust that seems to propagate to other parts of its body.  You can't remember the last time you got a tetanus shot, so it would be best not to let this thing touch you."
msgstr "这只丧尸浑身上下穿刺着无数覆盖着厚厚铁锈的金属碎片，碎片上的铁锈似乎已经扩散到了尸体的其他部位。你不记得上次注射破伤风疫苗是什么时候了，所以最好不要让它碰你。"

#. ~ Description of monster "magnetic zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "A zombie like any other, but there's a strange feeling in the air around it.  Bits of black dust and small metal objects stick to it like magnets on a fridge."
msgstr "和其他僵尸一样，但周围的空气中有一种奇怪的感觉。  黑色灰尘和小金属物体像冰箱上的磁铁一样粘在上面。"

#. ~ Description of monster "magnetokinetic zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "A zombie surrounded by a whorl of black dust - iron filings, held in a magnetic storm that surrounds it like a hurricane.  It drags bits of metal along with it as it goes, and periodically, the area around it shimmers and warps as if seen through a distorted lens."
msgstr "一只僵尸被一团黑色的尘埃——铁屑——包围，周围像飓风一样被磁力风暴包围。  它在移动时会拖着一些金属碎片，并且周期性地，它周围的区域会闪烁和扭曲，就像通过扭曲的镜头看到的一样。"

#. ~ Description of monster "rust shell zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "Jagged fragments of rust-bitten metal have fused into this zombie's flesh and displaced parts of its spine."
msgstr "锈蚀的锯齿状金属破片融合进丧尸的血肉中并取代了部分脊椎。"

#. ~ Description of monster "rust plated zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "Ruptures in this zombie's skin expose fragments of metal arranged like armor underneath.  Black sludge can be seen in places where the rust has receded."
msgstr "丧尸皮肤破裂处露出的金属破片，如同交织于皮下的甲胄。在锈迹消退之处可以看到黑色的污泥。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Slag Hulk"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "Several workers died beneath a cascade of molten slag, their bodies shriveling and contorting together under the unimaginable heat.  The metal cracked and cooled, but they did not stay dead.  Still largely encased in their mineral prison, revivified muscle and bone now drag the lumpen mass along on four ungainly limbs that must have once been human beings."
msgstr "几名工人死在熔渣的倾泻下，他们的身体在难以想象的高温下枯萎并扭曲在一起。  金属破裂并冷却，但他们并没有死。  大部分仍被困在矿物监狱中，复活的肌肉和骨骼现在拖着这块肿块拖着四个笨拙的四肢前进，而这些四肢一定曾经是人类。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "Slag Hulk"
msgid_plural "Slag Hulks"
msgstr[0] "熔渣"

#. ~ Description of monster "rust fist brute"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "This brute of a zombie is covered in rusted metal detritus.  Chunks of metal smashed through its arms have deformed them into hammers."
msgstr "这只丧尸兽身上覆盖着生锈的金属破片。大块的金属砸穿了它的手臂，并融合成了锤子一样的形状。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "magnetic zombie"
msgid_plural "magnetic zombies"
msgstr[0] "磁力丧尸"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "magnetokinetic zombie"
msgid_plural "magnetokinetic zombies"
msgstr[0] "磁动力丧尸"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "rust fist brute"
msgid_plural "rust fist brutes"
msgstr[0] "锈拳丧尸兽"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "rust plated zombie"
msgid_plural "rust plated zombies"
msgstr[0] "锈甲丧尸"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "rust shell zombie"
msgid_plural "rust shell zombies"
msgstr[0] "锈壳丧尸"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "rust urchin"
msgid_plural "rust urchins"
msgstr[0] "锈刺丧尸"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "rust zombie"
msgid_plural "rust zombies"
msgstr[0] "锈铁丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "gangrenous impaler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "A corpse hideously twisted into an insect-like form.  A hollow tendril reaches out from its open thorax."
msgstr "这个尸体以骇人的方式扭曲，变成了昆虫一般的形状。从它的胸腔之中伸出了一只中空的触手。"

#. ~ Description of monster "flesh wall"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "A great lump of mutated flesh.  It resembles the innards of some gigantic creature, and is covered in a grid of diminutive veins."
msgstr "一大团体积巨大的变异肉体。它看起来像是某种巨型生物的内脏，表面覆盖着纤细血管构成的网络。"

#. ~ Description of monster "spasming lump"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "A great pile of merged bodies and mutated flesh.  It spasms in an arrhythmic and desperate manner."
msgstr "一大团融合在一起的尸体和变异血肉。它不断痉挛，如同心率失常的心脏病人般绝望地搏动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "trapped tendril"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "A great tendril of mutated flesh and sharpened bone.  Emerging from a crevice in the ruined floor, hundreds of human limbs seek freedom and writhe incessantly from underneath its grotesque carapace.  As enormous as it may be, you feel certain that this is just part of a much bigger creature, for when it moves, you can feel this whole ruin tremble, as though an unseen giant is struggling against the weight of its concrete tomb."
msgstr "一只血肉和尖骨组成的巨型触手。它从破损的地面的一个缝隙中伸出，缝隙之下无数的人类残肢在怪异的甲壳下不停蠕动，希望重获自由。虽然这只触手已经无比巨大，你仍然确信这只是一只更大生物的一部分，因为当触手移动时，你能感觉到整个废墟的震动，如同一只未知的巨人正在与它的混凝土坟墓抗争。"

#. ~ Description of monster "scissorlimbs"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "A nightmarish spider of gore standing tall among the ruins, keeping silent watch of the blighted landscape.  Its spindly limbs of bone slip between the rubble with otherworldly speed."
msgstr "一团如同梦魇般的蜘蛛形状的血肉高高地矗立在废墟中，无声地守护着眼前残破的景色。它细长的骨头四肢以难以置信的速度在瓦砾中滑动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "gangrenous crawler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "A nightmarish, spidery abomination born from human gore.  It deftly crawls between the walls and ceiling with limbs grown from its own disjointed ribs."
msgstr "一只噩梦般的蛛形怪物，由人类血肉变成。它敏捷地在墙壁和天花板上爬行，断离的肋骨构成了它的肢体。"

#. ~ Description of monster "melded task force"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "A tangle of security personnel fused with their gear and with each other, warped limbs and flesh-covered equipment moving in strange unison.  Every so often you glimpse a pitch-black figure at its center, limbs mirroring the movements of the larger mass."
msgstr "一堆保安尸体与他们的装备相互融合，扭曲的四肢和覆盖着肉体的装备异曲同工地移动着。每隔一段时间，你就会看见一只漆黑的身影从它的体内钻出，四肢的移动方式和它更大的主体一样。"

#. ~ Description of monster "gangrenous flesh"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "Covered in grievous wounds, this wretch's gray skin has bloated to near-rupture with putrid gas.  Between lumps of unrecognizable gore, a human head lamely follows your movements with empty, black eyes."
msgstr "这个可怜虫的灰色皮肤上布满了严重的伤口，在腐败气体的压力下几乎就要爆炸。在不可辨认的血肉之中，一个人类头颅用空洞的黑色眼珠注视着你的行动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hanging innards"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "Great snakes of flesh hang from the ceiling above, madly thrashing and reaching about."
msgstr "一大块巨大的蛇形血肉从天花板悬吊下来，疯狂地四处拍打着，不断搜寻着猎物。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "melded task force"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "The creature grows sluggish before freezing in place for a moment.  Suddenly its flesh turns black and recedes to coat the central figure, which reaches out towards you before collapsing into a pinprick of shimmering air.  Torn uniforms and other gear tumble to the ground."
msgstr "这只怪物动作逐渐迟缓，直到停在原地静止片刻。突然，它的血肉变黑并渐渐褪去，从中浮现出其体内的躯体，它向你伸出手来，然后突然塌陷成一团闪闪发光的空气。被撕碎的制服和其他装备掉落在地上。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "gangrenous impaler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "The impaler launches a barb!"
msgstr "坏疽穿刺者射出了一根毒刺！"

