#. ~ Description of monster "prisoner zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
msgid "Apparently this zombie was doing time when the Cataclysm struck.  It wears black and white striped prisoner clothes, and tattoos can be seen on its decaying skin."
msgstr "显然，当大灾变来临时这只丧尸正在狱中服刑。它穿着黑白条纹的囚衣，腐烂的皮肤上刻有纹身。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fat prisoner"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
msgid "This fat zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr "这只肥胖丧尸穿着黑白条纹的囚服。"

#. ~ Description of monster "prisoner brute"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
msgid "This muscular zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr "这只肌肉发达的丧尸穿着黑白条纹的囚服。"

#. ~ Description of monster "tough prisoner"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
msgid "This tough-looking zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr "这只外貌凶猛的丧尸穿着黑白条纹的囚服。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
