msgid_plural "skeletal shockers"
msgstr[0] "放电骷髅"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
msgid "skeletal zombie"
msgid_plural "skeletal zombies"
msgstr[0] "骷髅丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie marine"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Dressed head to toe in naval combat equipment and with Marine insignia embroidered on its gear, this lurching corpse still retains its physical fitness in death."
msgstr "从头到脚穿着海军作战装备，装备上绣着海军陆战队徽章，这具摇摇晃晃的尸体在死亡中仍保持着健壮的躯体。从头盔下面，它墨黑的眼睛扫视着周围的区域。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie officer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Dressed in the shredded blue dress uniform of a naval officer, this undead corpse was evidently a higher ranking crewman in life.  Having more than likely not been clad in body armor, the result now staggers before you: horrific wounds exposed to the air and large portions of flesh and muscle ripped from its glistening skeleton."
msgstr "这具不死丧尸身穿海军军官的破碎蓝色制服，显然是一名级别更高的海员。很可能由于没有及时穿上防弹衣，结果现在你面前蹒跚而行：可怕的伤口暴露在空气中，大部分血肉从闪闪发光的骨架上被撕碎垂落下来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hunter-killer zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Fragments of visible uniform hint that this monstrosity was once a soldier.  Anything human is invisible, hidden inside a sheath of living shadow.  It moves with preternatural fluidity and grace."
msgstr "身上残留的制服碎片表明这个怪物曾经是一名士兵。它失去了人类的所有特征，隐藏在仿佛有生命的阴影中。它的移动方式不可思议的优雅和灵动。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Kevlar brute"
msgid_plural "Kevlar brutes"
msgstr[0] "凯夫拉丧尸兽"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Kevlar hulk"
msgid_plural "Kevlar hulks"
msgstr[0] "凯夫拉浩克"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Kevlar zombie"
msgid_plural "Kevlar zombies"
msgstr[0] "凯夫拉丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "bestial stalker"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Lumbering about on all fours, this mutated beast's dagger-like claws clack against the ground as it predatorially moves: thick strands of exposed muscle tissue running across its rotting body.  The addition of its new bulk has caused the skin along its arms and back to split, and the brute's teeth have extended into spikes of bone.  The Marine insignias on the remains of the creature's pulverized gear are the only testaments to the soldier that this hulking abomination used to be."
msgstr "这种变异的野兽四足笨重，在掠夺性移动时，匕首般的爪子在地面上发出咔嗒声：厚厚的裸露肌肉组织遍布其腐烂的身体。  新体积的增加导致手臂和背部的皮肤裂开，而这头野兽的牙齿也延伸成了骨刺。  该生物被粉碎的装备残骸上的海军陆战队徽章是这个巨大的怪物曾经是一名士兵的唯一证明。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_bestial_stalker"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Lumbering about on all fours, this mutated beast's dagger-like claws clack against the ground as it predatorially moves: thick strands of exposed muscle tissue running across its rotting body.  The addition of its new bulk has caused the skin along its arms and back to split, and the brute's teeth have extended into spikes of bone.  The military insignias on the remains of the creature's pulverized gear are the only testaments to the soldier that this hulking abomination used to be."
msgstr "这种变异的野兽四足笨重，在掠夺性移动时，匕首般的爪子在地面上发出咔嗒声：厚厚的裸露肌肉组织遍布其腐烂的身体。  新体积的增加导致手臂和背部的皮肤裂开，而这头野兽的牙齿也延伸成了骨刺。  该生物被粉碎的装备残骸上的军事徽章是这个巨大的怪物曾经是士兵的唯一证明。"

#. ~ Description of monster "elite zombie bio-operator"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Once a highly-trained soldier, this zombie is still equipped with heavy military gear and dangerous physical abilities.  It moves with mechanical precision despite its undead state."
msgstr "这只丧尸曾经是一名训练有素的士兵，现在仍然穿着厚重的军用装备，具备可怕的身体素质。它的故障设备偶尔会释放出一连串火花。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie military pilot"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Once a pilot, it is wearing a flight suit and a sturdy-looking flight helmet.  The head twitches and adjusts constantly, following any and every source of movement."
msgstr "曾经是一名飞行员，穿着飞行服，戴着看起来坚固的飞行头盔。  头部随着任何运动源不断抽搐和调整。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie soldier"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Once a soldier, it is dressed head to toe in combat gear and carries itself rather steadily for a zombie."
msgstr "一个曾经是一名军人的丧尸，从头到脚包裹着战斗服，隐藏在基因里的本能与尚存的肌肉记忆使其比普通丧尸更加可怕。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie mariner"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Still dressed in the ragged remains of deep blue naval fatigues, it's clear that this walking corpse was once a sailor of some description."
msgstr "这具行尸仍然穿着破烂的深蓝色海军迷彩服，显然这具行尸曾经是一名某种意义上的水手。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "bilious soldier zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s launches a corrosive dart!"
msgstr "%s 射出了一道酸液！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "caustic soldier zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s launches a hail of corrosive darts!"
msgstr "%s 射出了许多酸雨！"

#. ~ Description of monster "black-ops zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "This soldier zombie's skin radiates a sort of shadowy smoke that obscures its outline, making its camouflage even harder to see against the background.  In the darkness it would be nigh invisible."
msgstr "这只士兵丧尸的皮肤散发出一种模糊的烟雾，模糊了它的轮廓，使得它的伪装在背景下更加难以察觉。在黑暗中，几乎看不见它。"

#. ~ Description of monster "bilious soldier zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "This staggering soldier wears a burnt gasmask, now fused to its face.  Through the melted, bile-encrusted ruination of the mask protrudes some sort of hardened, fleshy proboscis, with steaming corrosive fluid leaking from the end."
msgstr "这个蹒跚而行的士兵丧尸戴着一个烧坏的防毒面具，现在和它的脸融化在一起了。透过融化且被胆汁腐蚀结痂的面具，能看见似乎是某种已经硬化的肉质长喙，某种正在冒烟的腐蚀性液体从中泄漏出来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "uniformed zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "This undead soldier is adorned in standard military fatigues.  It carries itself rather steadily for a zombie."
msgstr "这个不死士兵浑身穿着制式军装。以丧尸的标准来说，它的行动相当稳健。"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie bio-operator"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "This walking corpse is dressed in high-end tactical gear .  It jerks mechanically as it moves, as though something was merely puppeting the corpse."
msgstr "这具行尸身穿高档战术装备。它移动时动作机械而生硬，仿佛有什么东西在操纵着这具尸体。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "This zombie dons a uniform with heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  Peculiarly, the uniform seems to have fused to its skin in certain places, its flesh gripping the edges of its gear as though the body were trying to absorb it."
msgstr "这只丧尸穿着一件缝有厚重防弹材料的制服，制服似乎在某些地方与它的皮肤融合了在一起，腐肉包住了那件制服的边缘，就像它的身体正在试图吸收它一样。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar hulk"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "This zombie was once wearing some kind of now long-shredded uniform with heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  It has grown into a hulking, leatherbacked beast, its mutated skin taking on a strange texture similar to the Kevlar bits embedded in it.  Its arms have twisted into enormous clubs of misshapen bone that it drags on the ground behind it."
msgstr "这只丧尸曾经穿着一种有重型防弹材料夹层的制服，但现在它已经长成了一只巨大的厚皮怪物，它变异的皮肤呈现出一种奇怪的纹理，类似于嵌入其中的凯夫拉甲块。它的手臂扭曲成了巨大的畸形骨头棒，在它身后拖行。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar brute"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "This zombie was once wearing some kind of uniform with heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  At this point it's impossible to tell what kind of uniform it was: the monster's skin has grown over the fabric, splitting and tearing it to shreds, turning the remaining Kevlar and other bits of armor material into part of its hide.  Its hands have similarly fused into large, leathery cudgels."
msgstr "这只丧尸曾经穿着一种缝有重型防弹材料的制服。但现在已经看不出是什么制服了：怪物的外皮已经覆盖在原有织物上，将制服撕裂成碎片，把剩下的凯夫拉装甲和其他防弹材料变成了它的一部分。同样的，它的双手也融合成了巨大的厚皮棍棒。"

#. ~ Description of monster "caustic soldier zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "This zombie wears what appears to have once been a soldier's uniform and armor, now a series of cracked and melted plates that have fused to its skin and thickened hide.  Its face and arms blister with strange, mutated tubes that pulse and drip with acid."
msgstr "这只丧尸穿着一件看起来曾经是士兵制服和盔甲的东西，现在已经变成了几块破裂融化的金属板，融到了它外表的厚皮之中。它的脸和胳膊被变异血管涨破，酸液不断随着血管的跳动滴落在地上。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
