msgid "Started representing."
msgstr "成为新人类的代表。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Bovoid" for female
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Stopped worrying and learned to love the cowbell."
msgstr "不再担忧，开始习惯挂着牛铃。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Bovoid" for male
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
