#. ~ Description of mutation "Fruiting"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A few odd-looking fruits ripen on stems growing out of your head.  They'll probably die off come winter, but you could activate this mutation to pick them before then, if you wanted."
msgstr "一些看起来奇怪的果实在从你头顶长出的茎上成熟了。  它们可能会在冬天死去，但如果你愿意的话，你可以激活这种突变来在此之前采摘它们。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Down"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A fluffy undercoat of downy feathers keeps you extra warm."
msgstr "蓬松的绒毛底毛让您格外温暖。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect Wings"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "A large pair of translucent wings grow from your back.  They are too small to lift you, but if you're not weighed down, they can help a bit if you fall.  You can flutter them quickly to improve your move speed, but this is noisy and tires you out."
msgstr "你的背上长出一对半透明的大翅膀。它们太小了，抬不起你，但如果你在没有负重时摔倒了，它们可以帮你一点忙。你可以快速摆动它们来提高你的移动速度，但这很吵，还会让你疲惫。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tentacles"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A long pair of tentacles like those of a squid grow from your shoulders in place of human arms.  The underside of the paddle-shaped tips are lined with suckers that aid in grasping tools and prey alike."
msgstr "你的双肩上长出了一对长长的触手（类似乌贼的触手），取代了原本的人类手臂。这些触手末端呈桨状，其内侧布满吸盘，既有助于抓握工具，也能用来捕捉猎物。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Electroreceptors"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A network of jelly-filled electroreceptors, like that of a shark, have grown throughout your face and nose.  They are very sensitive to magnetic fields, allowing you to see robots and creatures charged with electricity through walls, but being shocked will seriously mess you up."
msgstr "你的脸部和鼻子内长出了一个像鲨鱼一样的充满胶质的电感受器网络。它们对磁场非常敏感，可以让你透过墙壁看到带电的机器人和生物，但是一旦被电击你会更惨。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antlers (Fresh)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A pair of short, nubby antlers, still covered in velvet, are growing from your skull."
msgstr "一对短而多节的鹿角，仍然覆盖着天鹅绒，从你的头骨中长出来。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Batrachian"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A perfect ambush predator, if only there were less competition."
msgstr "一个完美的伏击捕食者，要是少一点竞争就好了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reflex Photophore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A photophore has grown from your head.  You can't consciously control it, and it might start to shine in response to your emotions or your physiological state."
msgstr "你的头上长出了一个发光器。你不能自主控制它，它可能会随着你的情绪或生理状态而自行发光。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak Photophore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A photophore has grown from your head; you can make it glow softly.  This will make you very visible in the dark, ideal for attracting a partner during mating season."
msgstr "从你的额头上长出一个发光器官，你可以使它发出微光。这将使你在黑暗中非常明显，很适合在交配季节吸引伴侣。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mandibles"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A set of insect-like mandibles have grown around your mouth.  They allow you to eat faster and provide a slicing unarmed attack.  Slightly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的嘴上长出了类似昆虫一样的下颚，你吃东西更快，并且让你在徒手攻击时能够用它狠狠地咬敌人一口。稍微减少湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mouth Tentacles"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A set of tentacles surrounds your mouth.  They allow you to eat twice as fast.  Slightly decreases wet penalties."
msgstr "你嘴上长了很多触须。吃东西快了一倍。稍微减少湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleek Scales"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A set of very flexible and slick scales has grown to cover your toughened skin.  These act as decent natural armor, improve your ability to swim, and make you difficult to grab.  Mostly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，柔韧光滑的鳞片长满了你硬化的皮肤，成为了你天然的护甲。这些鳞片有一定保护效果，也增强了你的游泳能力，同时让你滑溜溜难以被抓住。减少湿身心情惩罚。"

