#. ~ Description of mutation "Arthropod Limbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "An extra pair of decidedly buggy arms have grown from your torso.  They flail more or less uncontrollably, making you feel rather larval."
msgstr "你\"终于\"从身体中部长出了一对臂膀。他们来回摆动基本不受控制，让你感觉自己就是个幼虫。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect Arms"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "An extra pair of decidedly buggy arms have grown from your torso.  Though they're too thin to block or punch, you can fold them inside human-shaped gear if need be."
msgstr "有这么多臂膀真是好。尽管它们太纤细没办法格挡或者击拳，但需要时你能够把它们藏进你披的这身人皮里边。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Violent Monster"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Anger clouds your mind; you can't think straight, but you feel strong."
msgstr "莫名的愤怒充满了你的头脑，你脑子里一团糟，但你感觉自己很强大。"

