msgid "Arms?  No, you've got a pair of long tentacles with broad paddle-shaped structures at the tips, granting the ability to strike while prone at a reduced penalty.  Their grasping surface is lined with suckers and dozens of swiveling hooks that function like vicious claws."
msgstr "手臂？不，你长着一对长触手，末端带有宽阔的桨状结构，使你即便在俯卧状态下也能发动攻击，且受到的惩罚较轻。触手的抓握面上布满了吸盘和数十个可灵活转动的钩刺，这些钩刺犹如凶猛的利爪一般。"

