#. ~ Description of mutation "Raptor Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Formed from a network of interlocking bones, a long tail has mutated from the base of your spine, with ossified tendons assisting in keeping the limb stiff and rigid.  A plume of lengthy feathers sprouts from the reptilian flesh along your new tail, drawing the eye.  While it is useless in combat and prevents you from wearing non-fabric pants, you find it's pretty handy for maintaining your balance."
msgstr "长尾巴由互锁的骨骼网络组成，从脊柱底部变异而来，骨化的肌腱有助于保持肢体僵硬。  一缕长长的羽毛沿着你的新尾巴从爬行动物的肉体中长出来，吸引了人们的注意。  虽然它在战斗中毫无用处并且会阻止你穿非织物裤子，但你发现它对于保持平衡非常方便。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spider Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Four spidery limbs sprout from your body.  They're not yet strong or coordinated enough to support your weight, and mostly just get in the way of your arms and legs."
msgstr "四个蜘蛛般的肢体从你的身体里长出来。  它们的强度和协调性还不足以支撑您的体重，并且大多会妨碍您的手臂和腿。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eight Legged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Four strong, spidery limbs sprout from your body.  By crouching or running with your hands free, you can use these in concert with your other arms and legs to move more quickly and quietly, and to easily climb walls and other obstacles."
msgstr "四根强壮且像蜘蛛一样的肢体从你的身体中生长出来。当你处于潜行状态或在双手空闲时奔跑，你可以将这些肢体与原有的手脚协同使用，从而更快速、更安静地移动，并能轻松攀爬墙壁及其他障碍物。"

