#. ~ Description of mutation "Feathers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Iridescent feathers have grown to cover your entire body, providing a marginal protection against attacks and minor protection from cold.  They also provide a natural waterproofing."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，绚丽的羽毛长满了你的身体。羽毛可以抵挡少量伤害并提供很好的保暖。同时，它们也拥有防水能力。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Irreparable"
msgstr "无法治愈"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tough"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "It takes a lot to bring you down.  You get a 10% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "你的肌肉密度更大，对于外界打击有着更强的抵御能力，你的生命值上限增加20%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "It would be good to be a queen, having workers constantly servicing your every need… but how would you keep them in line?"
msgstr "要是你能够成为王虫，让其它虫子每时每刻服侍着你，不是很好吗……但是怎样才能让虫群顺从呢？"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Beast"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "It's about time you grew out.  Now that you've matured, it is time to make something of yourself."
msgstr "漫长的时间终于让你成熟，是时候让你拥有自己的东西了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Roots"
#. ~ The idea is that you, for lack of a better term, plant yourself.
#. Crafting and digging don't count because they presume a certain amount of
#. movement during the task.  The handheld game does count.
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "It's about time you started developing a root system.  When reading, fishing, waiting, or otherwise being stationary for a while on diggable terrain, you'll extract nutrients and water from the soil."
msgstr "是时候发展你的根系了。在阅读，钓鱼，等待，或者站在可挖掘地形上时，你将从土壤中提取营养素。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Addictive Personality"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "It's easier for you to become addicted to substances, and harder to rid yourself of these addictions."
msgstr "你很容易对其他东西上瘾，烟酒不论，同时，也许是上瘾和戒瘾过于频繁，你想再次戒瘾是很难办到的。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Jaundice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "It's subtle, but your skin has definitely taken on a sickly yellow-green hue."
msgstr "虽然很轻微，但你的皮肤毫无疑问正呈现病态的黄绿色。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Disease Resistant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "It's very unlikely that you will catch ambient diseases like the cold or flu."
msgstr "你的机体免疫力更强，对感冒等环境疾病有一定的特殊抵抗能力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dead Verdant Leaves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "It's winter, so all your leaves are gone.  This keeps you warm by reducing heat loss, but you don't know that because you shouldn't be able to see this."
msgstr "现在是冬天，所有的叶子都落光了。  这通过减少热量损失让你保持温暖，但你不知道这一点，因为你不应该看到这一点。"

