#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Bloom"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Local organisms seem to regard overt spore dispersal as a danger, and attack the Mycus.  Accordingly, our local blossoms remain quiescent, until local guidance determines that it is safe to germinate.  Rapid development taxes local nutrient reserves but ensures swift and effective growth."
msgstr "有机生物土著们似乎将公开散播孢子视作危险行为，并攻击马卡斯。为此吾等将使本地孢子花保持沉寂，直至本地生物的引导者决定何时为安全发芽的时机。孢子增殖会极大地消耗本地养分储备，但能保证快速而有效地繁殖。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Sporogenesis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Local organisms seem to regard overt spore dispersal as a danger, and attack the Mycus.  Accordingly, our local spore sacs remain quiescent, until local guidance determines that it is safe to germinate.  Rapid development taxes local nutrient reserves but ensures swift and effective growth."
msgstr "有机生物土著们似乎将公开散播孢子视作危险行为，并攻击马卡斯。为此吾等将使本地孢子囊保持沉寂，直至本地生物的引导者决定何时为安全发芽的时机。孢子增殖会极大地消耗本地养分储备，但能保证快速而有效地繁殖。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycogenesis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Local physiology has been fully incorporated with that of Mycus silicate fibers.  In addition to benefits conferred by previous developments, we may join with Mycus fibers beneath us - sleeping on top of fungal areas places us into a dormant state, which spreads spores around us as we sleep and revitalizes our body much more quickly than regular sleep."
msgstr "本地生物结构已完全与马卡斯硅酸盐纤维融合。先前变异的益处仍然存在，现在吾等可与脚下的马卡斯纤维融合，在马卡斯之地上入眠可使吾等变为休眠状态，在吾等睡眠时朝四周散布孢子，并比普通睡眠更快恢复元气。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Provenance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Local spore sacs and blossoms have merged into a single, symbiotic form.  Acting as one, they germinate together to cement rapid growth across a large area according to local guidance.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr "本地的孢子囊和孢子花已融合为单一而共生的形态。合二为一，它们将在本地生物引导者的控制下共同生长，将这广阔的土地融合在马卡斯下。马卡斯必将壮大。"

