#. ~ Description of mutation "Assault Barbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Some of the quills on your body have become quite loose.  With a twitch of your muscles, you can fire off these quills as projectiles."
msgstr "你胳膊上的一些羽毛已经松了。你可以甩动手臂，把这些羽毛当作投射物发射出去。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Urticating Hairs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Some of your hairs have loosened.  Anything that tries attacking you is likely to get fine, bristly chitin in an irritating spot."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，产生了许多毛发。大部分毛发都是松脱地粘在身上的。攻击你的生物很可能会沾上大量恼人的绒毛。这些毛发并未携带你身上的毒液，但会分散攻击者的注意力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Animal Kinship"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Something about your presence is calming to animals, and they will treat you with innate trust.  This only applies to natural animals such as woodland creatures."
msgstr "你能让动物平静下来，他们会以与生俱来的信任对待你。此特性只对野生动物起效。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Junkfood Intolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Something in those heavily processed foods doesn't agree with you.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr "你非常讨厌那些高热量低营养的快餐，虽然你还是可以吃快餐，但是你会受到心情惩罚并吸收更少的营养。"

