msgstr "你习惯于长年生活在地下，对你来说并不痛苦。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Normal Human" to "HYDE"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The anger overtakes you!"
msgstr "怒火占据了你全身！"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Violent Monster" to "JEKYLL"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The anger subsides."
msgstr "怒火平息了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Padded Feet"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The bottoms of your feet are strongly padded.  You receive no movement penalty for not wearing shoes, and your steps are significantly quieter, as added tissue dampens the noise."
msgstr "你的脚底有厚实的肉垫。你不会因为不穿鞋而受到运动惩罚。此外，你的脚步声明显更加安静了，因为额外的肉垫可以减弱噪音。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tough Feet"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The bottoms of your feet are tough, and you are accustomed to going barefoot.  You receive no movement penalty for not wearing shoes."
msgstr "你的脚掌厚度与脚底反射区较为坚韧，即便脚掌没有保护，也不会受到移动力惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Theropod"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The chance to undo not one but TWO extinction events.  You're confident you'll do fine."
msgstr "接连化解两次灭绝危机的挑战，你相信你会做得很好。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mutagenic Downward Spiral"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The events of the Cataclysm have done something horrible to you.  You mutate frequently, all mutations you receive (from any source) are negative."
msgstr "一次大灾变中发生的事故已经严重损坏了你的DNA，使其难以恢复。你会经常发生变异，而且你获得的所有变异（无论来源）都是负面的，同时你的基因不稳定性在快速增长。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Digitigrade Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The heels of your feet have shifted up off the ground in a rather animalistic fashion, reducing your carry weight limit and preventing you from wearing shoes.  These hind feet are a bad match for human arms, but could pair well with matching forepaws."
msgstr "你的脚后跟以一种相当动物化的方式向上移动，降低了你的负重，还让你没法穿鞋子。这种脚后跟和人类的手臂无法很好地配合，但可以和前爪相得益彰。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Turning Leaves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The leaves growing from your head and arms have taken on fall colors.  While pretty, they can't photosynthesize as well as the green ones.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr "从你的头上和手臂上长出的叶子已经呈现出秋天的颜色。  虽然很漂亮，但它们不能像绿色的那样进行光合作用。  减少潮湿影响。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fey Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The shadows don't seem as dark now."
msgstr "现在阴影看起来不再那么暗了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime Hands"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The skin on your hands is now a mucous membrane that produces a thick, acrid slime.  Attacks using your hand will cause minor acid damage.  Slightly increases wet benefits."
msgstr "你双手表皮发生了变异，能够分泌出一层厚厚的、刺鼻气味的黏液膜，当你徒手攻击敌人时将会造成轻微的酸液腐蚀伤害。稍微增加湿身心情加成。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rosebuds"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The top of your head is blooming with rosebuds.  They're eye catching, and have a mild fragrance that makes you pleasant to be around."
msgstr "你的头顶绽放着玫瑰花蕾。  它们引人注目，并且散发着温和的香味，让您在周围感到愉快。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bookworm"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "There's nothing quite like the smell of a good book!  Books are more fun (or less boring) for you!"
msgstr "没有什么能比得上看一本好书的感觉！书籍对你来说更有趣（或不会枯燥）！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Terrifying"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "There's something about you that creatures find frightening, and they are more likely to try to flee."
msgstr "你身上有些让动物们感到恐惧的东西，它们更有可能试图从你身边逃开。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thermal Vision"
msgstr "热能防护"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug No Torso"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "They said college costs an arm and a leg, they sure weren't kidding!"
msgstr "他们说上大学要抵上你的手和脚，他们肯定不是在开玩笑！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Big Head"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Torso Replacement"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "They said college what make me smart, this is a lot to lug around!"
msgstr "他们说上大学让我有一个聪明的大头，这实在是太拖累了。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thick Scales"
msgstr "厚重鳞甲"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thick Tail"
msgstr "蜥蜴尾"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Furry"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thick black fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing minor protection against attacks, and considerable protection from cold."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，整个身体长出了厚厚的黑色毛皮，既可以少许抵挡攻击，又相当保暖。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thick-Skinned"
msgstr "坚韧皮肤"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thin-Skinned"
msgstr "脆弱皮肤"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pessimist"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Things just keep getting you down.  You tend to be unhappy, and it takes some doing to cheer you up."
msgstr "你天性易怒，你时常抱怨这个世界，看什么都感到不快，你很难感到开心。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Carries Brandy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "This Bartender now carries brandy!"
msgstr "这个酒保带着白兰地！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Carries Rum"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "This Bartender now carries rum!"
msgstr "这个酒保带着朗姆酒！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Carries Whiskey"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "This Bartender now carries whiskey!"
msgstr "这个酒保带着威士忌！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Assign Random No-move Mission"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "This is an AI tag to give a static NPC a random mission that doesn't involve them following you.  If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr "这是给静态NPC分配随机不跟随你的任务的AI标记，如果你看到这个，说明游戏出bug了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Assign Random Mission"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "This is an AI tag to give a static NPC a random mission.  If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr "这是给静态NPC分配随机任务的AI标记，如果你看到这个，说明游戏出bug了。"

