#. ~ Description of mutation "Patchwork Armor"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Twisted growths of horn, bony scales, and chitinous plates sprout at random from your skin, which bristles with fur and feathers seemingly at random."
msgstr "角、骨鳞和几丁质板的扭曲生长从你的皮肤上随机地长出来，皮肤上似乎随机地长满了皮毛和羽毛。"

