#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We are the Mycus."
msgstr "吾等为马卡斯。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Flesh"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have begun adapting local physiology to Mycus physical structure, greatly reducing wet effects."
msgstr "吾等已将本地生物肌体改造为马卡斯结构。大大降低了湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Blossoms"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have developed local blossoms.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr "吾等已在本地生物上培育出了孢子花。马卡斯必将壮大。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Spores"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have developed local spore sacs.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr "吾等已在本地生物上培育出了孢子囊。马卡斯必将壮大。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Fireproofing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have spliced the dense, amphibole fibers from Mycus core towers with the resilient, adaptive flesh of local physiology.  This reduces our speed by a moderate amount, but provides powerful armor across our body, nullifies wet effects, and provides complete protection from fire."
msgstr "吾等已将源自马卡斯核心塔中的致密角闪石纤维嫁接至本地生物柔韧而广泛适应的肌体之上。大大降低吾等速度，但为吾等各处躯体提供强大保护，无视湿身心情惩罚，并提供对火焰的完全防护。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Feeder"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have streamlined our nutritional requirements.  We rely on the Mycus for sustenance, as it relies on us.  We may locate sources of sustenance in close proximity to Mycus core towers, and in forested areas that the Mycus has grown into."
msgstr "吾等已精简了营养需求。吾等依赖马卡斯维生，正如其依赖吾等。在马卡斯核心塔及马卡斯繁盛之地四周，吾等将可寻获营养之源。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Identity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have synchronized our local physiology with that of the Mycus.  Any spores we may encounter will not attempt to germinate inside the local system, and we may traverse Mycus biospheres easily, as native bioforms shift shape to accommodate us."
msgstr "吾等已将本地生物结构与马卡斯同步。所遇到的孢子将不会在本地生物体内生长，并且吾等可在马卡斯中畅行无阻，本地生物将改变形态以容纳吾等。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Photophore"
msgstr "弱发光器"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Photophore (on)"
msgstr "弱发光器（开）"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Scent"
msgstr "体味微弱"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Stomach"
msgstr "痨肠寡肚"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakening"
msgstr "虚弱"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Diver"
msgstr "吊网者"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Spinner"
msgstr "吐网者"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Walker"
msgstr "蛛网行者"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Weaver"
msgstr "织网者"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Webbed Feet"
msgstr "脚蹼"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Webbed Hands"
msgstr "蹼状手指"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dungeon Master"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weeks spent picking through manuals and researching topics you aren't versed in has taught you to find what you need to know more quickly.  You read slightly faster, and suffer no reading time penalty for books too complex for you to easily understand."
msgstr "你经常会花费了数周的时间钻研各类游戏手册，了解各类陌生领域的设定，这让你更快找到你所需要学习的信息。你阅读速度略有提升，同时免受书籍难度超出智力时的阅读时间惩罚。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weight: XS"
msgstr "XS 体型"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weight: XXXL"
msgstr "XXXL 体型"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Aranean"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Well, maybe you'll just have to make your own worldwide web."
msgstr "你已经变异为蜘蛛人，你也许可以自己搞个万维网。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Plant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Well, you still have those other walking flowers--and the mushrooms, too--to deal with.  But you'll manage."
msgstr "好吧，你还要处理一些会走路的花草或者蘑菇，但你会搞定的。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "What was that old advertisement?  'Paint the planet'?  That might be a good long-term goal, but for now…"
msgstr "以前有个宣传是怎么说的，\"绿色地球\"？听起来是个不错的远大目标，不过现在嘛……"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sapiovore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "What's left of humanity is merely prey.  If they can't outrun you, there's no sense feeling bad about eating them."
msgstr "人类剩下的只是猎物。  如果它们跑不过你，吃掉它们也没什么不好的感觉。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Irreparable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whatever caused the end of the world affected you in a horrible way.  Your wounds will never heal on their own and your broken limbs will never mend."
msgstr "无论是什么导致了世界末日，都以某种可怕的方式影响着你。你的伤口永远无法自行愈合，你折断的肢体也永远无法自愈。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Combat Adaptation"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "When you are in great danger you may flip a chemical switch in your brain and for a cost in hunger, fatigue, and thirst your nervous system will process things around you slightly faster.  Giving you better reaction times that you can pay for later if you survive."
msgstr "当你处于极大的危险中时，你可能会在大脑中触发一个化学开关，以饥饿、疲劳和口渴为代价，你的神经系统会稍微加快处理你周围的事情。提升你的反应时间，如果你能活下来，你可以之后再付代价。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Night Blindness"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whether congenital or acquired, you suffer from nyctalopia, and see poorly in the dark."
msgstr "无论是先天性还是后天性，您都患有夜盲症，并且在黑暗中视力不佳。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Addiction Resistant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whether due to a lifetime of exposure or through simple willpower, it's harder for you to become addicted to substances, and easier to rid yourself of these addictions."
msgstr "你的机体对于物质与精神的相互作用更加具有自我控制力，你不易上瘾，戒瘾也更加轻松。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bad Knees"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whether due to injury or age, your knees aren't particularly strong or flexible.  Moving over rough terrain will slow you down more than normal."
msgstr "你的膝盖状态由于旧伤一直欠佳。在比较崎岖的地形上行走会让你耗时更长。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Languorous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whether due to lack of exercise and poor diet, or due to a natural disinclination to physical endurance, you tire due to physical exertion much more readily than others."
msgstr "或许是由于缺乏运动和常吃垃圾食品，或许是由于先天体能劣势，你的体力消耗比其他人更快。你的心肺功能和耐力上限比常人低。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Obligate Digestion"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "While it is by no means pleasant, your body has adapted to handle the toxic contaminants in mutant meat a little better.  You can eat a bit more of the stuff before suffering ill effects."
msgstr "虽然这绝不是令人愉快的，但你的身体已经适应了更好地处理突变肉中的有毒污染物。  在遭受不良影响之前，您可以多吃一点这种东西。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whiskers"
msgstr "猫须"

#. ~ Variant name of mutation "Bird Wings"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "White Bird Wings"
msgstr "鸟翼"

#. ~ Variant name of mutation "Feathers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "White Feathers"
msgstr "“白色死神”"

#. ~ Description of variant "White Feathers" of mutation"Feathers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "White feathers have grown to cover your entire body, providing a marginal protection against attacks and minor protection from cold.  They also provide a natural waterproofing."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，绚丽的羽毛长满了你的身体。羽毛可以抵挡少量伤害并提供很好的保暖。同时，它们也拥有防水能力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crustacean"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Who needs skin when you can have a hard carapace?"
msgstr "当你有着坚硬的甲壳，谁还会需要皮肤？"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wide Mouth"
msgstr "大嘴"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Will Not Bash"
msgstr "不砸东西"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wing Stubs"
msgstr "翅根"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wiry Whiskers"
msgstr "鼠须"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rope Webs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "With spinnerets like THESE, who needs rope?!  Activate to produce rope."
msgstr "有了次世代纺织器，谁还需要绳子？激活该变异以制造绳索。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Speed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "With this, you'll be fixing those bugs faster than ever!"
msgstr "有了这个，你将比以往更快地修复bug !"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Near-Sighted"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Without glasses, your seeing radius is severely reduced!  However, you are guaranteed to start with a pair of glasses."
msgstr "当不戴近视眼镜时，你看不清远处的东西了。幸运的是，你可以一开始就拥有一副近视镜。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Far-Sighted"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Without reading glasses, you are unable to read anything, and take penalties on melee accuracy and electronics/tailoring crafting.  However, you are guaranteed to start with a pair of reading glasses."
msgstr "你的晶状体硬化，弹性减弱，睫状肌收缩能力降低而致调节减退，近点远移，故发生近距离视物困难，近处的东西什么都看不清，所以根本无法看书、制造物品了。幸运的是，你可以一开始就拥有一副老花镜。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wool Allergy"
msgstr "羊毛过敏"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Terrible Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wounds are incredibly dangerous to you, as they barely heal at all.  Your HP whilst asleep, as well as your broken limbs, heal at 10% of the regular rate."
msgstr "伤口对你来说是非常危险的，因为它们几乎无法愈合。伤口在睡眠时恢复速度以及折断的四肢的愈合速度是正常人的10%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Snackaholic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You *adore* the taste of junk food, and find it preferable to everything else!  Additionally, you suffer no negative health effects from eating it."
msgstr "你*爱极*了垃圾食品的味道，比起其他食物对你的身体更好！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bile Stink"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You absolutely reek.  The bile you were splashed with seems to be reacting with your body chemistry to produce a smell that's somehow even worse.  If anything that hunts by scent is around, it's sure to notice you."
msgstr "你绝对臭。  你被溅到的胆汁似乎与你的身体化学物质发生反应，产生了某种更糟糕的气味。  如果周围有任何靠气味捕猎的东西，它一定会注意到你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "US Marshal"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a duly sworn Federal marshal, with nationwide jurisdiction and the authority of the United States of America."
msgstr "你是一名誓言守卫法律的联邦执法官，拥有在美国全国的执法权。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dextrous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a little nimbler.  +1 Dexterity."
msgstr "你比以前灵活了少许。敏捷+1。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Smart"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a little smarter.  +1 Intelligence."
msgstr "你比以前聪明了少许。智力+1。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pretty"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a sight to behold.  People who care about such things will react more kindly to you."
msgstr "你的外貌十分出众，习惯以貌取人的人或许对你会更有好感。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sociable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a social creature.  Spending time with friends will improve your mood, but if you're alone too long, you'll start to feel unhappy."
msgstr "你是社交性的生物。与朋友共度时光会改善你的心情，但如果长时间独处，你会开始感到不快。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Beautiful"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a vision of beauty.  Some people will react very well to your looks, and most people will trust you immediately."
msgstr "你有一个看起来美丽的外表，一些人会被你外表所吸引，大多数人会信任你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Outdoorsman"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are accustomed to being exposed to the elements.  This decreases morale penalties for being wet."
msgstr "你相比普通人，更习惯于被雨淋。减少湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wool Allergy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are badly allergic to wool, and cannot wear any clothing made of the substance."
msgstr "你对羊毛过敏，不能穿任何羊毛制品。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Back"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You are capable of carrying far more than someone with similar strength could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 15%."
msgstr "你背部肌肉力量比普通人更大，你的身体最大承载重量上升35%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Blooded"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You are cold-blooded and rely on heat to keep moving.  Your lose 1% of your speed for every 2 (1.1) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C), resulting in less calorie usage."
msgstr "你是冷血动物，依靠热量来移动.你在气温为18℃以下（65F）时气温每下降1.1℃（2F）速度降低1%。但缓慢的新陈代谢能够减少卡路里消耗。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insanely Smart"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are far smarter.  +7 Intelligence."
msgstr "你比以前更聪明了。智力+2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hub 01 Ancillary"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are known to be a capable and resourceful mercenary at the employ of Hub 01."
msgstr "众所周知，你是Hub 01雇佣的一名有足够能力且足智多谋的雇佣兵。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Stomach"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are less likely to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc.  If you throw up despite this, you won't suffer any residual nausea."
msgstr "你的胃与肠道对于酒精与食物中毒等处理能力更强，即便你呕吐了，也不会因此导致后续恶心。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak Stomach"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are more likely to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc."
msgstr "你患有慢性胃病，在食物中毒或饮酒后有更大的几率呕吐。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insanely Dextrous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are much nimbler than before.  +7 Dexterity."
msgstr "你掌握了灵活行动的身法。敏捷+7。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Smart"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are much smarter.  +4 Intelligence."
msgstr "你比以前更聪明了。智力+2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Dextrous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are nimbler.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr "你比以前更灵活了。敏捷+2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Cold Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are now even less bothered by the cold and it is harder for you to freeze or to even get chilly.  When you do though, it'll hit just as hard as it did before."
msgstr "你现在更加不受寒冷的困扰了，你更难被冻僵，甚至更难变冷。不过当你冻僵的时候，它一样会让你受到沉重的打击。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Heat Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are now even less bothered by the heat and it is harder for you to overheat or even sweat.  When you do though, it'll hit just as hard as it did before."
msgstr "你现在更加不受炎热的困扰了，你更难过热，甚至更难发热。不过当你过热的时候，它一样会让你受到沉重的打击。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Temperature Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are now not at all bothered by the heat and it is harder for you to overheat or freeze at all.  When you do though, it'll hit just as hard as it did before."
msgstr "你现在更加不受温度的困扰了，你更难过热，也更难冻僵。不过当你过热或冻僵的时候，它一样会让你受到沉重的打击。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Prevent Death"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are prevented from death."
msgstr "你将免疫死亡。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Dextrous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are quick and nimble.  +4 Dexterity."
msgstr "你比以前更灵活了。敏捷+2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Learner"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are slow to grasp new ideas, and thus learn things more slowly than others.  Note that this only applies to real-world experience, not to skill gain from other sources like books."
msgstr "你认为掌握新思维实在是个难事，你在生活实践中获得的经验较常人少，但并不影响其他来源的经验获取速度，比如阅读。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Smart"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are smarter.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr "你比以前更聪明了。智力+2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Disorganized"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You are terrible at organizing and storing your possessions.  You retrieve things from containers 10% slower."
msgstr "你的物品总是放得一团糟。你从包里取东西的速度慢10%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nyctophobia"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are terribly afraid of the dark.  You refuse to enter very dark areas.  If you somehow still happen to stay in dark areas, you suffer from various detrimental mental and physical effects."
msgstr "你非常害怕黑暗。你拒绝进入非常黑暗的区域。如果你强行或仍然以某种方式碰巧停留在黑暗区域，那么你将遭受各种有害的心理和身体影响，可以服用速效镇静剂来缓解。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fey"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are the tree under which humankind will shelter during these dark times."
msgstr "你是一颗大树。你是人类在黑暗岁月的避难所。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Martial Artist"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are trained in a hand-to-hand fighting style."
msgstr "你做了一个被禁闭在恐怖医院里的怪梦。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Little"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are very short.  Either you haven't fully grown up yet, or you've got some form of dwarfism.  You can't carry as much, your feet can't reach the pedals to drive a car, and you're not as durable as the average adult."
msgstr "你很矮。  要么你还没有完全长大，要么你患有某种形式的侏儒症。  你不能携带那么多东西，你的脚够不着踏板来开车，你也不像一般成年人那么耐用。"

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Digitigrade Legs"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Paws"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Rabbit Feet"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You assume a less bestial posture."
msgstr "你采取了一种不那么野蛮的姿势。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Insect Wings" to
#. "WINGS_INSECT_active"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "You begin buzzing your wings."
msgstr "你的翅膀开始嗡嗡作响。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Transpiration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You body has begun moving nutrients via the evaporation of water.  This increases your thirst when it's hot, but reduces it when it's cold."
msgstr "你的身体已经开始通过水分的蒸腾作用来运输营养物质。热的时候会让你更容易口渴，但在冷的时候会让你不容易口渴。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Camouflage Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can change your skin patterns to match your environment, somewhat increasing your stealthiness."
msgstr "你可以改变你的皮肤以适应你周围的环境，在一定程度上增加你的隐蔽性。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slimewave"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can communicate with your extant mass without physical contact, absorbing knowledge from nearby friendly slime."
msgstr "你可以在没有身体接触的情况下与你现存的同类交流，从附近友好的变形怪中获取知识。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Substance Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can handle intoxicants well.  Their effects clear up more quickly for you."
msgstr "你可以很好的抵抗麻醉药品。它们的效果在你身上持续时间更短。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Comfortably Fluid"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can hear your heartbeat in your ears, feel the blood sloshing around in your veins.  The uneven hitches in your breath, the aches in your joints, the rumbling of your stomach.  It's nasty and messy and ugly.  And you are extremely grateful for that."
msgstr "你可以在耳朵里听到你的心跳，感觉到血液在你的静脉里流动。你的呼吸不均匀，关节疼痛，胃部隆隆作响。它又脏又乱又丑。你对此非常感激。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pounce"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can leap a good distance forward at a moment's notice."
msgstr "你可以立即向前跳跃很远的距离。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crushing Leap"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can leap a significant distance and slam your body down hard on anything, friend or foe, in your landing zone."
msgstr "你可以跳跃很远的距离，然后用身体猛烈地撞击着陆区的任何物体，无论是朋友还是敌人。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Photophore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can make your photophore glow brightly."
msgstr "你额头上的发光器官现在能发出强光。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fleet-Footed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can move more quickly than most, resulting in a 15% speed bonus on sure footing."
msgstr "你的腿部肌肉与协调能力更加出色，可以比别人走、跑得更快，俗称\"健步如飞\"。你步行的速度增加15%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Distributed Senses"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can now extend and reabsorb sensory organs at will, and can therefore ignore most shocks that would overwhelm lesser beings."
msgstr "你的感知器官能够随意伸展收回，这让你能够忽略那些会对大部分低等生物造成巨大感知伤害的打击。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extreme Persistence Hunter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can pursue prey for days if you have to.  Your stamina recovers quickly and you can go a bit longer without sleep."
msgstr "如果有必要，你可以连续几天追捕猎物。  你的体力恢复得很快，不睡觉可以坚持更长的时间。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Persistence Hunter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can pursue prey for quite a long time thanks to your increased stamina recovery and reduced need for sleep."
msgstr "由于体力恢复的增加和睡眠需求的减少，你可以追捕猎物相当长的时间。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Cardio"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can run, but you'll never run out of breath."
msgstr "你可以跑，但你永远不会喘不过气来。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fey Nightsight"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can see almost perfectly in the dark."
msgstr "你可以在黑暗中视物。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Night Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can see incredibly well in the dark!"
msgstr "您在黑暗中的视力非常好！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Full Night Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can see perfectly well even in near-total darkness."
msgstr "即使在近乎完全黑暗的情况下，您也能看得很清楚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insanely Perceptive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can sense things you never imagined.  +7 Perception."
msgstr "你能感觉到你从未想象过的东西。感知+7。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bioluminescent Flare"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can spit a wad of bioluminescent goo several meters away.  There it will light up its surroundings until it dissipates."
msgstr "你可以在几米外吐出一团生物发光的粘液。在那里，它会照亮周围的环境，直到消失。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hemovore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can still eat other food, but you crave the taste of blood over everything else.  Without a steady supply or some kind of iron supplement, you're prone to developing anemia."
msgstr "你仍然可以吃其他食物，但你对血的味道胜过其他一切。  如果没有稳定的铁供应或某种铁补充剂，您很容易患上贫血。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Durable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can survive injuries that would incapacitate humans: you get a 20% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "你能从严酷的环境中存活下来，生命值上限额外加成20%。可以和强壮等特性叠加。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Introvert"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can tolerate others, but you prefer to be alone.  Spending time by yourself will boost your mood slightly."
msgstr "你能够容忍他人，但更喜欢独处。独自度过时光会略微提升你的心情。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cannibal"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can't afford to pass up any opportunity to eat, even if it means gorging yourself on human flesh to survive.  Besides, it's not as if you're really one of them anymore…right?"
msgstr "你不能错过任何吃饭的机会，即使这意味着要大吃人肉才能生存。  而且，你已经不再是他们中的一员了……对吧？"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antsy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can't bear to stay still for long.  Your morale will suffer unless you constantly explore new territory."
msgstr "你不能在同一个地方待太久。去探索未知的地方，不然你就会感到难受。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Superiority Complex"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can't stand to prostrate yourself before your lessers and hate it when they don't immediately do what you say.  Persuasion is much more difficult, but you're better at lying and intimidating."
msgstr "你不能忍受在一些次要之人面前卑躬屈膝，讨厌他们不立刻按你说的去做。说服他人会变得更加困难，但你会更擅长说谎和威胁。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chaos"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can't tell what you are anymore.  Everything and yet nothing, like you weren't meant to exist.  But you do, and you're a force, no matter what happens."
msgstr "你再也不能描述你是什么了。你不是任何生物，好像你根本不存在。但你是确实存在的，你是一种力量，不管发生了什么。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Large"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You carry your rugged body with the dignity you deserve.  Strength +2."
msgstr "虽然你的身材高大，但是你也拥有与之相匹配的力量和敏捷。力量+2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Predator"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You consider yourself something other than human and no longer empathize with them.  Combat skills are easy to learn and maintain, but your critical thinking, so characteristic to these creatures, suffers."
msgstr "你认为自己不再归属于人类，也不再同情他们。战斗技能很容易提升及保持，但你的批判性思维能力，那类生物的突出特点，变差了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extreme Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You consume three times as much food as the average human to maintain your truly superhuman endurance."
msgstr "你的全身系统发生了变异，你消耗的食物相当于普通人食量的三倍多，但以此来维持你超人一般的耐力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Heavy Sleeper"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You could probably sleep through a firefight."
msgstr "大火和消防水枪都叫不醒你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tireless"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You defend the realm all night and all day."
msgstr "你的大脑发生了变异，脑细胞活性较于常人相比基本处于旺盛状态，疲劳下降速度为正常的一半。"

#. ~ Message when spawning item "vine_30" with mutation "Vine Sprouter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You detach a vine from your body."
msgstr "你从身上扯下一条藤蔓。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bulging Reservoir"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You develop a reservoir of fluids that bulges out of your abdomen.  Your body has adapted to containing extra liquids in event of shortfalls."
msgstr "你的腹部形成了一个隆起的体液储库。你的身体进化得能够容纳额外液体供水分短缺时使用。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "No Extras"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You don't have any tails, whiskers, horns, or miscellaneous extra bits."
msgstr "你没有任何尾巴、胡须、角或其他多余的部分。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pacifist"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You don't like thinking about violence.  Your combat skills advance much slower than usual, and you feel more guilt about killing."
msgstr "你对暴力行为极为的抵触与反感，连想都不愿意想，你的战斗技能增长更为缓慢，你对杀戮造成的内疚也更为强烈。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extrovert"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You don't mind being alone, but you get a slight mood boost from being around friends."
msgstr "你并不介意独处，但与朋友在一起会让你的心情略有提升。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Little Sleep"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You don't sleep often.  But when you do, you need very little of it."
msgstr "你的大脑发生了变异，细胞活性极其活跃，你无需经常睡觉，仅需小憩便能恢复活力。"

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Digitigrade Legs"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Paws"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Rabbit Feet"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You drop down on all fours."
msgstr "你开始用四肢爬行。"

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Eight Legged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You drop to the ground to use all your limbs to skitter along."
msgstr "你摔倒在地上，挣扎着保持清醒。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Thirsty"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You dry out seriously quickly, requiring three times as much liquid to stay hydrated."
msgstr "如果没有三人份的水的话，你就要变成人干了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gourmand"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You eat faster, and can eat and drink more in a single sitting.  You also enjoy food more; delicious food is better for your morale, and you don't mind unsavory meals as much.  Activate to skip prompt for overeating."
msgstr "你比别人吃得更快，也比别人更能吃！你能从美食中获得更多的好心情，你也不介意残羹剩菜。激活该变异可跳过暴饮暴食的确认对话框。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Retractable Claws" to
#. "CLAWS_RETRACT_active"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You extend your claws."
msgstr "你伸出了爪子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime Spray"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You exude slime from your pores.  You can spread that slime on an opponent in melee range."
msgstr "你的毛孔会渗出黏液。你可以在近战时将黏液喷射到对手身上。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You fare better than most in colder climates and are less bothered by lower temperatures.  Note that while it will take more cold and exposure for you to suffer the effects of frostbite, you aren't any better at dealing with the symptoms."
msgstr "你比大多数人更能适应寒冷的气候，受到低温的影响更少。请注意，虽然你因此略微不容易被冻伤，但冻伤对你的影响并不会比正常人轻。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You fare better than most in warmer climates and are less bothered by hotter temperatures.  Note that while it will take more heat and exposure for you to suffer the effects of sunstroke, you aren't any better at dealing with the symptoms."
msgstr "在温暖的气候条件下，你比大多数人表现得更好，更少受到高温的困扰。 需要注意的是，虽然中暑需要更多的热量和曝晒，但这并不会让你更容易应对中暑的后果。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakening"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel as though you are slowly weakening and your body heals slower."
msgstr "你好像觉得你的身体正在慢慢变得虚弱，而且自愈得更慢了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gastropod"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel bad for all the creatures that don't carry their home on their backs."
msgstr "你为所有不背着家的生物感到难过。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nausea"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel nauseated almost constantly, and are more liable to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc.  You can, if desired, think yourself into vomiting, too."
msgstr "你经常感到恶心，更容易从变质食物和酒精中获得这种状态。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sunlight Dependent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You feel very sluggish when not in direct sunlight.  You suffer a 5% drop in speed when in shade, and a 10% drop in speed when in the dark."
msgstr "当你不在阳光下时，你的行动会变得非常迟钝。你在阴暗处速度下降5%，在黑暗中下降10%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rooter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You find it difficult not to sink roots when able.  You extract nutrients and water whenever on diggable terrain, but move more slowly."
msgstr "你发现一有机会自己就想要扎根进土里。你可以从任何可挖掘地形上或者水中汲取营养，但你的行动更加缓慢了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mesopic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You find it difficult to see very far in bright light.  On its own, this doesn't make you any better at seeing in the dark."
msgstr "您会发现在强光下很难看清很远的地方。  就其本身而言，这并不能让您在黑暗中看得更清楚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Sleepy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You find yourself needing to sleep quite often.  You'll spend about half of your time in or around a bed."
msgstr "你发现自己更加渴望睡眠，整天都迷迷糊糊，睡眠占去了你的一半生命。"

#. ~ Message when firing ranged attack with mutation "Assault Barbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You fire off some of your quills."
msgstr "你射出了一些棘刺。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Howler"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You frequently let out a piercing howl."
msgstr "你经常发出刺耳的惨嚎声。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weight: XXXL"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You gained an awful lot of weight before the Cataclysm.  Whatever the reason, now that mobility is key to survival, your oversized figure presents an additional danger.  You need to lose weight or die trying."
msgstr "你在大灾变之前增加了不少体重。无论原因如何，你肥胖的体型开始拖你的后腿，而移动能力又对你的生存至关重要。你需要在挂掉之前开始减肥。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Directionally Challenged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You get lost easily.  Even in good conditions, you will uncover much less of your overmap while exploring."
msgstr "你很容易迷路。  即使在良好的条件下，您在探索时发现的地图也会少得多。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Marloss Gateway"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You get the feeling that you're on the cusp of becoming something greater than yourself."
msgstr "你觉得你将马上成为某种比你自己更伟大的存在。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Psychopath"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a diminished capacity for empathy and feel little remorse for your actions.  This does not necessarily make you predisposed to harming or exploiting others, but your superficial charm and lack of guilt make lying all too easy."
msgstr "你的同理心能力下降，对自己的行为几乎没有悔恨之心。  这并不一定会让你倾向于伤害或剥削他人，但你肤浅的魅力和缺乏内疚感让你很容易撒谎。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tail Fin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a finned tail that allows you to swim more effectively."
msgstr " 你拥有一条鳍尾，能让你更高效地游泳。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slit Nostrils"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a flattened nose and thin slits for nostrils, giving you a lizard-like appearance.  This makes breathing slightly difficult and increases mouth encumbrance by 10."
msgstr "你有一个扁平的鼻子和窄窄的鼻孔，就像蜥蜴一样。使你产生轻微的呼吸困难，嘴部累赘+10。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Growling Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a growling, rough voice.  Persuading or lying to people will be more difficult, but threatening them will be easier."
msgstr "你有着一个粗鲁的声音，说服他人将更加困难，但威胁他们变得十分容易。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Whiskers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a handsome set of whiskers around your mouth.  These make you more aware of vibrations in the air, and improve your ability to dodge very slightly."
msgstr "你的嘴部周围长出了漂亮的胡须。它可以在空气中震动从而提高你的感知，略微提升你的闪避能力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insomniac"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a hard time falling asleep, even under the best circumstances!"
msgstr "你患有严重的失眠症，你的大脑睡眠功能非常紊乱，即使最好的情况下依然难以入睡。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ponderous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a hard time getting anywhere in a hurry.  This affects only your movement, not your actions."
msgstr "你很难匆忙到达任何地方。  这仅影响您的移动，而不影响您的行动。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pain Resistant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a high tolerance for pain."
msgstr "你的神经与精神更加坚韧，对疼痛有着很高的忍耐性。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antlers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a huge rack of antlers, like those of a stag.  They allow you to make a powerful headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr "你头上有个像麋鹿一样的鹿角。你可以用你的头撞击对方造成轻微的钝击伤害，但也让你没法戴上不是织物做的帽子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Mouth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a human mouth with human teeth."
msgstr "你有一张长着人牙的人嘴。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Club Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a long tail that ends in a heavy, bony club.  It does not improve your balance at all, but allows for a powerful bashing attack.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "你有一条骨感十足的长长的尾巴，它并不能使你保持平衡，但提供钝击伤害。让你没法穿上不是织物的裤子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stinging Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a long tail that ends in a vicious stinger.  It helps with balance and can deliver a powerful stabbing attack.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "你拥有一条长尾巴，末端带有凶猛的毒刺。它能帮助你保持平衡，并能发动强力的刺击攻击。由于此特征，你无法穿着非织物材质的裤子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fluffy Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a long, furry tail.  It helps you dodge, but it also tends to betray how you're feeling in social situations.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "你有一条长而毛茸茸的尾巴。它能帮你闪避攻击，但在社交场合中，它往往会出卖你的真实情绪。你无法穿着非织物材质的裤子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Long Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a long, graceful tail, like that of a big cat.  It improves your balance, making your ability to dodge higher, but prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "你有一条像猫一样的尾巴，它可以提高你的平衡能力，使你的闪避能力提高，但也让你没法穿上不是织物的裤子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rodent Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a long, hairless tail.  It's a pretty effective balancing aid, but does look, uh, ratty.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "你长出了一条长而无毛的尾巴。它提供了优秀的平衡辅助，你没法穿上不是织物的裤子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptilian Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a long, powerful set of jaws, like a monitor or a crocodilian.  This makes it hard to find a mask that fits, but if you also have a set of fangs, you can really do some damage while grappling."
msgstr "你有一副长而有力的下巴，就像巨蜥或鳄鱼一样。  这使得找到合适的面具变得很困难，但如果你还有一组尖牙，那么你在格斗时确实可以造成一些伤害。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Croaking Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a low, croaking voice, like an aged grandparent.  Persuading or lying to people will be easier, but threatening them will be more difficult."
msgstr "你的声音变成低沉的呱呱叫声，像一个年老的祖父母。说服他人会更容易，但威胁他们会更难。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vomitous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a major digestive disorder.  Though it causes you to vomit frequently, you have found that you can trigger your vomit reflex on demand, too."
msgstr "你有严重的消化系统紊乱，虽然它会导致你频繁呕吐，但你也可以根据需求触发呕吐反射。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antennae"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a pair of antennae.  They allow you to detect the presence of monsters up to a few tiles away, even if you can't see or hear them, but prevent wearing headwear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr "你有一对触角，可以发现周围你看不见的怪物，但也让你没法戴上不是织物做的帽子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Head Bumps"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a pair of bumps on your skull, like something's growing beneath the skin."
msgstr "你额头上有一对突起。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Curled Horns"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a pair of large curled horns, like those of a ram.  They allow you to make a strong bashing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing most headwear."
msgstr "你有一对像公羊一样的羊角。你可以用你的头撞击对方造成钝击伤害，但也让你没法戴上不是织物的帽子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Long Horns"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a pair of long, pointed horns, like those of an antelope.  They allow you to make a strong piercing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr "你头上有一对像羚羊般的犄角。你可以用你的头撞击对方造成刺击伤害，但也让你没法戴上不是织物做的帽子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Horns"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a pair of small horns on your head.  They'll make your headbutts do more damage if uncovered, but prevent the use of most rigid headwear."
msgstr "你头上有一对角，它们能让你施展较弱的头刺击，但也阻止了大多数硬质头部装备的佩戴。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wing Stubs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a pair of stubby little wings projecting from your shoulderblades.  They can be wiggled at will, but are useless."
msgstr "你肩胛骨外有一对又粗又短的小翅膀，你可以拍打它们，但它们没什么用。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gluten Intolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a rare allergy that prevents you from eating wheat.  It's possible for you to eat wheat-based products, but you will suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr "你有罕见的过敏症使你难以消化麦面制品。虽然你还是可以吃，但是你会受到心情惩罚并吸收更少的营养。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nictitating Membrane"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a set of clear lenses which lower over your eyes while underwater, allowing you to see as though you were wearing goggles.  Slightly decreases wet penalties."
msgstr "你的眼睛长出了透明的薄膜，在水下时能够覆盖眼球，让你像戴了潜水镜一样看得很清楚，同时也稍微减少湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wiry Whiskers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a set of prominent rodent-like whiskers around your mouth.  These make you more aware of vibrations in the air, and improve your ability to dodge slightly."
msgstr "你的嘴部周围出现了像啮齿动物般的显眼胡须。它可以在空气中震动从而提高你的感知，并轻微提升你的闪避力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stubby Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a short, stubby tail at the base of your spine, like a hamster.  It serves no purpose, but it's easy enough to hide under your clothes."
msgstr "你的脊椎底部长着一条短而粗的尾巴，就像仓鼠那样。它没什么实际用途，不过藏在衣服下面倒也容易。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cattle Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a short, thin with a tuft on the end.  It's too small to aid your balance or interfere with equipment, but it's pretty handy for reflexively swatting away flies."
msgstr "你有一条短而细的尾巴，末端带有一簇毛。它既不足以辅助平衡，也不会妨碍装备的使用，但在本能地拍打驱赶苍蝇时却相当好用。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sweet Tooth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a soft spot for sweets, snacks, and empty calories.  Junk food is more enjoyable, but everything else is a bit less so."
msgstr "你对甜食、零食​​和那些“空热量”食品情有独钟。相比之下，垃圾食品吃起来更让人享受，而其他食物就没那么有吸引力了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crushing Beak"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a strong, sharp beak, perfect for cracking open nuts or shellfish.  You'll sometimes use it to bite in combat, especially while grappling."
msgstr "你的喙强壮且锐利，足以击碎坚果或甲壳类生物。在战斗中，尤其是进行擒拿时，你偶尔会用它发动猛咬。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Snarling Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a threatening snarl in your voice.  Persuading or lying to people will be near impossible, but threatening them will be much easier."
msgstr "你的嗓门很大且经常发出咆哮音，从而几乎不可能说服他人，但威胁他们要容易得多。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stimulant Psychosis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a unique history with stimulants (like coffee or amphetamines).  You can tolerate a lot more of them without overdosing, but if you indulge too much, you start seeing things…"
msgstr "你有着一段关于兴奋剂（如咖啡因或安非他命）的独特经历。你比普通人能够承受更高剂量的兴奋剂而不过量，但如果你摄入过多兴奋剂，你会开始看见奇怪的事情发生……"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bombardier Beetle Blast"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have an ability to spray boiling water on your enemies at melee distance.  This will drastically increase your thirst.  Without an extra reservoir you would quickly dehydrate yourself."
msgstr "你能在近距离向你的敌人喷射灼热液体。这将大大增加你的口渴速度。如果没有额外的储备，你会很快脱水。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pyromaniac"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have an unhealthy obsession with fire, and you get anxious if you don't light them every now and then or stand near them often.  However, you gain a mood bonus from doing so."
msgstr "你对火焰有种病态的渴望，每当你不点燃火焰或靠近火焰，你就感到自己无比焦虑。反之，你的心情会得到很大提升。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wide Mouth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have an unsettlingly wide mouth, like a frog.  This looks hideous, but allows you to swallow your food whole.  If you don't have any other bite attacks, you'll still sometimes bite while grappling."
msgstr "你有一张令人不安的大嘴，就像青蛙一样。  这看起来很可怕，但可以让你把食物整个吞下去。  如果你没有任何其他咬伤攻击，你有时仍然会在格斗时咬伤。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Blue" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have blue avian eyes."
msgstr "蓝色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Brown" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have brown avian eyes."
msgstr "棕色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Retractable Claws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have claws on the ends of your fingers, and can extend or retract them as desired.  Gloves will still get in the way, though."
msgstr "你的指甲变得尖锐锋利，并且伸缩自如。如果不戴手套，你的徒手攻击将造成少量斩击伤害。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Claws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have claws on the ends of your fingers.  If you aren't wearing gloves, you'll be able to make barehanded attacks with these."
msgstr "你的指甲变得又长又硬，如果不戴手套，徒手攻击对方会造成少量斩击伤害。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rigid Eyestalks"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have compound eyes on rigid stalks that can fold back against your head to protect them from danger.  This gives you better all-around vision and allows you to see underwater, but interferes with eyewear.  Perception +1"
msgstr "你有一对坚硬的眼柄，可以向后折叠靠在你的头上，保护它们免受危险。这可以给你更好的全方位视野，让你在水下看看得更清楚，但会让你无法戴上眼镜。感知+1。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Folding Fangs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have developed deadly extensible fangs.  This makes eating slower, but they're great for striking your prey, especially when it's helpless.  Slightly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你已经长出了致命的可伸展尖牙。  这会使进食速度变慢，但它们非常适合攻击猎物，尤其是当猎物无助时。  稍微减少潮湿效果。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vines"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have developed several vines sprouting from your shoulder area.  They're bulky, and get in the way."
msgstr "你的肩膀上长出了许多藤蔓。又笨重又麻烦。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fast Reflexes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have fast reflexes, allowing you to dodge attacks more easily."
msgstr "你反应很快，让你更容易闪避敌人的攻击。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crab Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have four prong-tipped legs, splayed out and articulated like a crab's.  They're a little quieter than human feet."
msgstr "你张开四条关节像螃蟹一样的尖头腿。它们比人腿要安静一点。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vine Sprouter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have full control of your vines, and can grow new ones and detach old ones more or less at will."
msgstr "你已经完全掌握了你的藤蔓。并且可以随时生长出新的藤蔓或者扯下旧的藤蔓。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycorrhizal Communion"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have gained the ability to commune with trees and comprehend their ancient wisdom.  Activate next to a tree to gradually gain overmap vision through connected forests."
msgstr "你获得了与树木交流的能力，能够理解它们的古老智慧。在树木附近激活，可借助相连的森林获得大地图视野。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stomach Cleanse"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have gained the ability to invert your stomach outside your body to quickly eliminate toxins, and are more likely to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc.  If you throw up because of this, you won't suffer any residual nausea."
msgstr "你获得了将胃容物呕吐到体外的能力，以快速排除毒素，并且更有可能因食物中毒、酒精等而呕吐。如果你因此呕吐，你不会产生残留的恶心效果。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Goosebumps"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have goosebumps that never seem to go away.  Are they getting bigger?"
msgstr "你身上的鸡皮疙瘩似乎用于不会消退。它们会变得更大吗？"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shell"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have grown a thick shell over your torso, providing excellent armor, but you cannot wear anything on your torso.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的躯干外长出了一层厚厚的外壳，为你提供了优秀的防护。但不能穿衣服了。稍微减少湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Freakishly Huge"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have grown even more massive, to the point where you cannot usefully fit into human-sized clothing or vehicles.  Much of it is powerful muscle mass (Strength +4), but it's a real pain to haul around."
msgstr "你的巨型身材很难找到匹配的衣服，连钻进汽车都困难。尽管你的力量惊人（力量+4）但是与之相随的迟缓笨重令你相当头痛。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inconveniently Large"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have grown noticeably taller and broader.  Much of it is useful muscle mass (Strength +2), but you find it throws off your balance and you get in your own way (+10 torso and arm encumbrance)."
msgstr "你明显地长高长壮了。你变得更强壮（力量+2），但是你发现你的平衡感被破坏了，甚至会自己绊到自己（+10躯干和手臂累赘）。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Toe Talons"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have grown wickedly sharp talons on your feet.  Fortunately, they don't get in the way of your movement.  Unfortunately, they do prevent wearing footgear."
msgstr "你的大脚趾上长出了巨大、弯曲且看上去十分锋利的爪子。幸运的是，它们不会影响你的移动。不幸的是，这爪子让你无法穿戴鞋袜。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Arms"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human arms."
msgstr "你有人类的手臂。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Blood"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human blood."
msgstr "你体内流着人类的血。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human ears and hearing."
msgstr "你有人的耳朵和听力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human eyes."
msgstr "你有人类的眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Hands"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human hands."
msgstr "你有人类的手掌。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human legs."
msgstr "你有人类的腿。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human skin and no distinct smell."
msgstr "你有人类的皮肤，没有特别的气味。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Animal Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have large ears with broad pinnae, like a dog or a cow.  They enhance your hearing, allowing you to hear at greater distances."
msgstr "你有着一对耳廓很宽的大耳朵，就像狗或者牛一样。它们能增强你的听觉，让你听得更远。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dead Lush Leaves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have no leaves because it's wintertime.  This keeps you warm by reducing heat loss, but you don't know that because you shouldn't be able to see this."
msgstr "你没有叶子，因为现在是冬天。  这通过减少热量损失让你保持温暖，但你不知道这一点，因为你不应该看到这一点。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Orange" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have orange avian eyes."
msgstr "绿色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Melee Weapon Training"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have practiced fighting with weapons.  You start with your choice of Barbaran Montante, Bōjutsu, Eskrima, Fencing, Fior Di Battaglia, Kalaripayattu, Medieval Swordsmanship, Niten Ichi-Ryu, Pencak Silat, or Sōjutsu."
msgstr "你曾进行过武器格斗训练。开始前你可以从以下流派中选择一种：巴巴兰蒙坦特、棒术、埃斯克里马、击剑、菲奥尔·迪·巴塔利亚、卡拉里帕亚图、中世纪剑术、二天一流、班卡西拉或枪术。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Meat Intolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have problems with eating meat.  It's possible for you to eat it, but you will suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from it."
msgstr "你坚持素食主义。虽然你还是可以吃肉，但是你会受到心情惩罚并且吸收更少的营养。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fiber Intolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have problems with eating vegetables.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr "你讨厌蔬菜。虽然你还是可以吃菜，但是你会受到心情惩罚并且吸收更少的营养。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Red" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have red avian eyes."
msgstr "绿色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have thick reptilian tail.  It helps you balance a bit but also makes a serviceable whip.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "你拥有一条粗壮的蜥蜴尾巴。它能帮你维持一定的平衡，同时也可以作为一把好用的鞭子。由于它的存在，你无法穿着非织物材质的裤子。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Yellow" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have yellow avian eyes."
msgstr "棕色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Healing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You heal as fast as most humans do in this new world."
msgstr "在这个新世界里，你的治愈速度和大多数人一样快。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hissing Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You hiss when speaking.  Persuading people will be more difficult, but lying to or threatening them will be easier."
msgstr "正常说话的时候会伴随嘶嘶声，虽然说服他人会更为困难，但是威胁他们却轻而易举。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tunnel Fighter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You know how to fight in cramped tunnels at risk of collapse.  You gain bonuses when fighting underground."
msgstr "你知道如何在狭窄的隧道里冒着坍塌的危险战斗。你在地下战斗时获得加成。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Booming Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You know how to project your voice.  You are able to shout much louder than the average person."
msgstr "你知道如何发声才能广为人知。你能比一般人喊得更大声。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vain"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You know you're beautiful, and the world deserves to know it too.  You prefer to show off your stunningly good looks to the world and will be unhappy if you cover up your face."
msgstr "你知道自己很美，全世界都应该知道。你更喜欢向世界炫耀你惊人的美貌，你会因为面部被遮掩而感到不快。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Vine Limbs" attacks
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Vine Sprouter" attacks
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You lash %s with one of your vines!"
msgstr "你用藤蔓鞭挞%s！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chiropteran"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You long for a colony, the cover of darkness, and a meal on the wing."
msgstr "你渴望一个殖民地、黑暗的掩护和在机翼上的一顿美餐。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weight: XS"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You lost an awful lot of weight before the Cataclysm.  Whatever the reason, now that food is not always close at hand, your skeletal figure presents an additional danger.  You need to gain weight or die trying."
msgstr "你在大灾变之前失去了不少体重。无论原因如何，你现在骨瘦如柴，在食物难以获得的如今这开始拖你的后腿。你需要在饿死之前增加你的体重。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Light Step"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You make less noise while walking.  You're also less likely to set off traps."
msgstr "你走路时的声音很轻，而且触发陷阱的概率更低。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Clumsy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You make more noise while walking.  You're also more likely to set off traps."
msgstr "你的身体协调能力很差，你的行走噪声更大，也更容易触发陷阱。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Footed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You move a little slower than most.  This affects only your movement, not your actions."
msgstr "你比大多数人移动得慢一点。  这仅影响您的移动，而不影响您的行动。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sluggish"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You move quite slowly.  This affects only your movement, not your actions."
msgstr "你移动得很慢。  这仅影响您的移动，而不影响您的行动。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Fast Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You need about twice as much food as the average human to maintain your expanded cardiovascular and respiratory systems.  On the plus side, it doesn't take you much time to recover from any strenuous activity."
msgstr "你消耗的食物相当于普通人食量的两倍多，这才能够支撑被变异扩充的心肺系统。同时，你的耐力能在经过激烈运动后更加快速的恢复。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Less Sleep"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You need less sleep than the average person."
msgstr "相比普通人，你不需要充足的睡眠就依旧能够保持活力，你对睡眠时间的要求比普通人要少。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleepy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You need sleep more often, but still spend most of your time awake."
msgstr "相对于常人，你需要更多的睡眠，不过大多数时候还能保持清醒。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Illiterate"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/mods/innawood/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You never learned to read!  Books and computers are off-limits to you."
msgstr "你幼年时错过了对文字的最佳开发期，所以你不识字，你无法阅读书籍或使用电脑。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inattentive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You never paid attention to your surroundings and specifically to people around you.  You can't judge the intent of critters you see."
msgstr "你从来没有注意过你周围的环境，尤其是你周围的人。你不能判断你看到的动物的意图。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mutagenic Instability"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You occasionally mutate.  There's no telling what will change, or when."
msgstr "你偶尔会发生突变。无法预料会改变什么，也无法预料何时发生。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shouter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You occasionally shout uncontrollably."
msgstr "你偶尔会无法控制的大喊大叫。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mucus Secretion"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You once had a significant other call you slimy, now you exemplify that.  It covers everything you come into contact with but now you can move through slime you didn't create with ease."
msgstr "你曾经有个重要的另一半说你滑头，现在你就是个活生生的例子。黏液覆盖了所有你接触到的东西，但现在你可以不受阻碍的穿过任何粘液。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Schizophrenic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You periodically suffer from delusions, ranging from minor effects to full visual hallucinations.  Some of these effects may be controlled through the use of antipsychotics."
msgstr "你会周期性地出现妄想，从轻微影响到完全的视觉幻觉不等。其中一些症状可以通过使用抗精神病药物进行控制。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Photophore (on)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You photophore is glowing brightly."
msgstr "你额头上的发光器官正在发出强光。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cenobite"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You positively adore pain, in all its varied forms."
msgstr "你沉迷于疼痛带来的快感，无论何种形式。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Glorious"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You possess an unearthly beauty.  Most people cannot help themselves due to your charms, and will do whatever they can to please you."
msgstr "你有着超凡脱俗般的灿丽容貌，正如天使下凡一般，无论是谁都完全在你身上挑不出任何缺点；人们情不自禁被你所折服，将尽一切可能来的取悦你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Night Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You possess natural night vision, and can see further in the dark than most."
msgstr "你拥有天生的夜视能力，在黑暗中比大多数人看得更远。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Saprophage"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You prefer to sustain your nutritional needs using your roots and direct nutrient extraction/synthesis.  Your human parts still need the raw caloric bulk of 'food' to keep them going, though, and you handle it a lot easier if it's had time to… age a little."
msgstr "你更喜欢用你的根和或其他直接的营养萃取合成过程来维持你的营养需求。不过，你的人体成分仍然需要大量的\"食物\"来维持它们的健康，而且吸收食物养分时，你更希望它们能……\"熟成\"一段时间。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Narcoleptic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You randomly fall asleep without any reason."
msgstr "你无缘无故就会倒下睡着。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hates Water"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You really hate getting your fur all wet.  This increases morale penalties for being wet, and you will get them even when wearing appropriate clothing."
msgstr "你真的很讨厌把你的毛皮弄湿。增加湿身时的心情惩罚，就算穿着合适的衣服也会遭受影响。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lagomorph"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You really want to eat some carrots.  Welcome to the Lagomorpha family."
msgstr "你十分想吃胡萝卜。欢迎加入兔兔大家族。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quick Pain Recovery"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You recover from pain faster than normal."
msgstr "你从疼痛中恢复的速度要比一般人要快很多。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Quick Pain Recovery"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You recover from pain much faster than normal."
msgstr "你从疼痛中恢复的速度远远超过一般人。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pain Recovery"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You recover from pain slightly faster than normal."
msgstr "你从疼痛中恢复的速度要比一般人快一些。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fast Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You require more food than most people, but recover stamina slightly faster."
msgstr "你消耗的食物比大部分人都多，同样，你耐力的恢复速度略微加快。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rapid Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You require more food than most, but you recover stamina and heal from wounds more quickly."
msgstr "你消耗的食物比大部分人都多，同样，你耐力的恢复速度略微加快。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Extended Claws" to
#. "CLAWS_RETRACT"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You retract your claws."
msgstr "你缩回了爪子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Changing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You shouldn't see this.  This makes you mutate."
msgstr "你不应该看到这个。这会让你变异。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tainted Shadow"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You shouldn't see this.  This makes you spawn tainted shadows."
msgstr "你不应该看到这个。这会让你召唤出污秽暗影。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bad Back"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You simply cannot carry as much as people with a similar strength could.  Your maximum weight carried is reduced by 15%."
msgstr "你的背伤让你无法和其他同等力量的人那样携带那么重的东西。你的最大负重减少了35%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Rest"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sleep a normal amount for a human."
msgstr "对于人类来说，你的睡眠量是正常的。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Acidic Secretion" attacks
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You smear slime on %s!"
msgstr "你朝 %s 喷射黏液！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Smelly"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You smell awful.  Monsters that track scent will find you very easily, and humans will react poorly."
msgstr "你的臭味十里外都能闻得到，怪物很容易追到你，人类都离你远远的。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptile"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sometimes look back on your days before your tail came in.  But you're better now."
msgstr "你偶尔还会回想起长尾巴前的日子，但你觉得现在快活多了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Screamer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sometimes scream uncontrollably."
msgstr "你有时会失声尖叫。"

#. ~ Message when spawning item "rope_30" with mutation "Rope Webs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You spin a rope from your silk."
msgstr "你用自己的丝编了一条绳索。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Bombardier Beetle Blast" attacks
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You spray %s with a boiling chemical mixture!"
msgstr "你朝着 %s 喷出一股灼热的化学液体！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Light"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You start to emit a light, so you can debug in the darkest nights."
msgstr "你开始发光，即使在最黑暗的夜晚也能进行调试。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chemical Imbalance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You suffer from a minor chemical imbalance, whether mental or physical.  Minor changes to your internal chemistry will manifest themselves on occasion, such as hunger, fatigue, pain, etc."
msgstr "你存在轻微的化学物质失衡，无论是在生理还是心理层面。这种体内化学环境的细微变化会不时显现出来，表现为饥饿、疲劳、疼痛等症状。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Jittery"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You tend to get a bad case of the shakes when you're hungry or under the effects of stimulants.  Nicotine can help, and benzodiazepines will stop the effect entirely."
msgstr "当你感到饥饿或受到兴奋剂影响时，往往会出现严重的颤抖。尼古丁能起到缓解作用，而苯二氮卓类药物则能彻底消除这种症状。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Seasonal Allergies"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You tend to get hay fever, especially in springtime.  Antihistamines are your friend."
msgstr "你容易得花粉热，尤其是春天。抗组胺药是你的朋友。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Seasonal Affective Disorder"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You tend to have bouts of depression during the fall and especially winter.  Taking antidepressants can help."
msgstr "到秋季末至冬季，你会出现抑郁症状。服用抗抑郁药会有所帮助。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Savant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You tend to specialize in one skill and be poor at all others.  You advance at half speed in all skills except your best one.  If multiple skills are equal, the topmost one on the skill list will be selected."
msgstr "你在技能实践上严重偏科，除了你当前最高等级的技能的之外都爱搭不理，这将会导致其他的技能升级速度减半。此外，如果你同时拥有快速学习特性时，改为你的所有的技能经验获取速度减慢。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime Intelligence"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You understand almost everything about which you think, with minimal effort."
msgstr "你的智力发展已经完美。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Charger"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You walk slowly, but can run with surprising speed.  Additionally, you can activate this mutation to perform a charging attack."
msgstr "你平时步履缓慢，但奔跑速度却快得惊人。此外，你还可以激活这项变异，发动冲锋攻击。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Asthmatic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You will occasionally need to use an inhaler, or else suffer severe physical limitations.  However, you are guaranteed to start with an inhaler."
msgstr "你患有哮喘，需要时不时地使用哮喘吸入剂，否则将会受到多种生理方面的制约。幸运的是，你可以一开始就拥有一个哮喘吸入剂。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Loner"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You'd really rather be by yourself.  Being alone will improve your mood, but spending too much time around other people can grate on your nerves."
msgstr "你更愿意独处。独处会改善你的情绪，但长时间与他人相处可能会让你感到烦躁。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Normal Human"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're a normal human; there's nothing wrong with you.  No need to worry."
msgstr "你现在是个正常人，没什么问题。不用担心。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fast Reader"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're a quick reader, and can get through books a lot faster than most."
msgstr "你的大脑对于文字与图片的处理更加有效率，俗称\"一目十行\"，你阅读书籍的速度比一般人要快。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Beautiful"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're a real head-turner.  Some people will react well to your appearance, and most people have an easier time trusting you."
msgstr "你的相貌十分英俊，大家很容易接近你并且信任你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Reader"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're a slow reader, and it takes you longer to get through books than most."
msgstr "你大脑对于文字处理能力很差，你阅读速度很慢，你阅读书籍消耗比别人更长的时间。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Guileless"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're a terrible liar and you have a difficult time haggling or intimidating people.  Some find you more trustworthy, though others might look down on your ineffectuality."
msgstr "你是一个可怕的骗子，你很难讨价还价或恐吓别人。  有些人认为你更值得信赖，但另一些人可能会看不起你的无能。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Picky Eater"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're a very picky eater.  You refuse to eat any food that tastes bad unless you're starving."
msgstr "你是个很挑食的人。除非你感到极度饥饿，否则你拒绝吃任何难吃的食物。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Easy Sleeper"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're able to fall asleep easily, even in less than ideal circumstances."
msgstr "你很容易入睡，即便在金属残骸上也照睡不误。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Grazer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're accustomed to eating plants directly, and can get nutrition from grass as well as underbrush and shrubs.  Eat either one by activating this, standing over your target, and pressing E."
msgstr "你习惯直接吃植物，可以从草地以及灌木丛中得到营养。激活后站在目标上按\"E\"键，吃掉它。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Verminous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're accustomed to filth, and don't mind being covered in or surrounded by it.  This does not confer any resistance to illness or infection."
msgstr "你已经习惯了身处肮脏之中，无论身上还是周围满是污垢都不会感到不适。不过，这并不意味着你能抵抗疾病或感染。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scout"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're an excellent navigator and your ability to recognize distant landmarks is unmatched.  Your sight radius on the overmap extends beyond the normal range."
msgstr "你是个出色的领航员，你认出远处地标的能力无与伦比。你的大地图视野相比普通人有所扩大。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Amphibious"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're as comfortable in water as on land, and your body has adapted around that fact.  Your base swimming speed is greatly increased, and weight will hinder you much less while swimming."
msgstr "你感到自己在水里和在陆地上一样舒服，你的身体已经据此进化了。你的基础游泳速度大大提高，游泳时负重对你的阻碍会更少。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tank"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You're built like a brick shithouse.  You get a 40% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "你的肌体强度极为强大，对于一切攻击都有着出色的抵御能力，你的生命值上限增加40%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crustacean Carapace (Molted)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're covered in a great chitin carapace which reduces your Dexterity by 1, however it has recently molted and will offer poor protection until it has time to harden.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你被巨大的几丁质甲壳给整个包住了，减少你 1点 敏捷。但甲壳才蜕出不久，在完全硬化之前防御力会很差。极大减低湿身惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deft"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're especially nimble, making you better at a variety of tasks.  You're less likely to be thrown off-balance when missing an attack, to fall down when skating, or to lose your footing on slippery terrain."
msgstr "你特别敏捷，使你能够更好地完成各种任务。  您不太可能在错过攻击时失去平衡、滑冰时摔倒或在湿滑的地形上失去立足点。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Squeamish"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're finicky, maybe even germophobic.  You can't willingly wear filthy items, and certain foods may be especially upsetting to you."
msgstr "你很挑剔，甚至可能有细菌恐惧症。  你不能心甘情愿地穿肮脏的衣服，而且某些食物可能会让你特别不舒服。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect Wings (Buzzing)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're fluttering your wings as fast as you can.  This doesn't generate enough lift to move you, but it does increase your movement speed.  If you're not burdened, you can fall short distances without harm."
msgstr "你在尽可能快地扇动翅膀。这不足以产生的升力让你飞行，但它确实提高了你的移动速度。如果你没有负重，你可以在短距离内免疫跌落伤害。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Liar"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're great at bending the truth, and when it comes to haggling, you know how to get a good deal.  It's usually an asset, but some people can see right through it, and it makes sincere attempts at persuasion more difficult."
msgstr "你非常擅长曲解事实，而在讨价还价时，你知道如何在交易占上风。这通常是一种优势，但有些人可以看穿你的手段，这会使真诚的说服变得更困难。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Badly Deformed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're hideously deformed.  Some people will have a strong negative reaction to your appearance."
msgstr "你的面部结构严重变形，有些人可能会对你的外表产生强烈的反感。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deaf"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're not able to hear anything, and as such you're not able to talk to anyone."
msgstr "你什么都听不到，所以你不能和他人说话。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ugly"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're not much to look at.  People who care about such things may react less favorably toward you."
msgstr "你的五官令有着正常审美的人会感到不悦，一些在意你长相的人可能不会信任你，甚至忽视你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fey Hearing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're not sure the shape of your ears is helping you any; regardless, you have become very sensitive to sounds."
msgstr "你不确定是不是耳朵形状的原因，你对声音变得非常敏感。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime Dexterity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're perfectly coordinated."
msgstr "你的肢体协调性已经完美。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heavy Sleeper"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're quite the heavy sleeper.  Noises are unlikely to wake you up."
msgstr "你很容易进入深度睡眠，而且深度更甚于常人，当你沉睡时，基本对外界没有任何感应，任何声响都无法唤醒你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deformed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're slightly deformed.  Some people will react badly to your appearance."
msgstr "你长得像个畸形怪胎，某些人看你可能不顺眼。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unassuming"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're still tiny, but your anatomy has adjusted to make more efficient use of your size.  You feel a little tougher, and you can eat and carry more than before."
msgstr "您仍然很小，但您的身体结构已经进行了调整，可以更有效地利用您的尺寸。  你感觉身体更坚韧了一些，吃的东西和携带的东西都比以前多了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Avian"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're sure you'll fly someday.  In the meantime, there are still nests to build."
msgstr "你确信你有一天会飞起来的，但在此之前还是先把窝做好再说。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Canine"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're the perfect candidate to lead a pack."
msgstr "你是狼群最合适的领头人选。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're the perfect candidate to tidy this mess."
msgstr "你就是救世主。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tiny"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're the size of a toddler!  You can't carry much, most clothes won't fit, and your hit points are heavily reduced, but your stature confers a number of advantages: you're harder to hit, quieter, less injured by falls, and too light to set off certain traps."
msgstr "你的身材只有一个小孩那么大！  你不能携带太多东西，大多数衣服都不合身，你的生命值会大大降低，但你的身材赋予了许多优势：你更难被击中，更安静，摔倒时受伤更少，而且太轻而无法触发某些陷阱。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nomad"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're too adventurous for your own good.  The more time you spend somewhere, the unhappier it makes you to be there."
msgstr "你过于爱好冒险。在同一地点待得越久，你就越是坐立难安。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Solidly Built"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You're tough as nails.  You get a 30% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "你不仅肌肉密度更强大，你的内脏与骨骼也更加坚韧，你的生命值上限增加30%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vegan"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're very strictly vegan, eating animal products is out of the question, even if it means death.  You also can't bear to wear clothing made of animal products, such as leather or fur."
msgstr "你是一个严格意义的素食主义者，吃下动物制品是不可能的，死都不吃。你也坚决抵制穿上动物材质的衣服，如皮革或是毛皮。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spiritual"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've always felt that there is more to the world than we can see.  Whether driven by religious beliefs or philosophical interest, you find great inspiration in studying holy texts and experiencing mystical things."
msgstr "你一直觉得世界远比我们能看到的丰富。不知是出于宗教信仰还是哲学观念，总之你能从研习神学或体验神秘事物中得到极大的鼓舞。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rigid Table Manners"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've been taught proper table manners from your early childhood on; now, you can't even think about eating without being seated at a table and taking your time.  Eating without a table and chair frustrates you, but eating like a civilized person gives you a bigger morale bonus."
msgstr "你从小就被教导需要时刻遵守正规餐桌礼仪。即便是现在，你依然无法想象自己不在桌椅吃饭，或是不细嚼慢咽慢慢吃饭的样子。不在桌椅上吃饭会让你沮丧，像文明人一样吃饭会带给你好心情。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rashy Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed a persistent skin rash.  Sometimes it's fine, other times it itches like hell."
msgstr "你患上了持续性的皮疹。有些还好，有些地方简直痒得难以忍受。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pain Junkie"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed a serious appetite for pain, and take pride in your scars."
msgstr "你对疼痛上瘾了，而且你对自己满身的伤疤非常自豪。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cephalopod Mind"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed an uncanny patience for problem-solving, making it easier to stay focused on learning."
msgstr "您已经培养出了解决问题的不可思议的耐心，从而更容易专注于学习。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leaping Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed quite a powerful leap."
msgstr "你从来没有感到如此轻盈，强大。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Snail Trail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed some ability to control your slime emissions.  As a result of this you can leave trails of slime anywhere you walk."
msgstr "你进化出了部分控制你的黏液排放的能力。因此，无论你走到哪里，你都可以留下黏液的痕迹。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hairy Chitin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed some sort of bristly hair growing out of parts of your chitin.  It provides a bit of warmth."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，产生了甲壳。几丁质甲壳上进化出了一些毛发。比光溜溜的要暖和点儿。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vine Limbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed the ability to control your vines; they make good lashes.  You can even rappel down sheer drops using them, but disconnecting HURTS."
msgstr "你已经可以控制你身上的藤蔓了。这些藤蔓可以猛抽你的敌人。你甚至可以用这些藤蔓从陡坡上爬下去，不过藤蔓断开时可真疼。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hibernation"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed the ability to stockpile calories and then sleep for extended periods of time."
msgstr "你拥有了储存大量卡路里后进入冬眠状态的能力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Web Weaver"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed the necessary anatomy and techniques to control your web-generation.  Activate this to start or stop weaving webs."
msgstr "你已经变异出了生成蛛网的必要结构并掌握了相关控制技巧。激活该变异来开始或停止编织蛛网。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rabbit Nose"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've got a short snout with a twitchy rabbit nose.  If you have matching incisors, this will allow you to use them more effectively."
msgstr "你有一个短鼻子和一个抽搐的兔子鼻子。  如果您有匹配的门牙，这将使您能够更有效地使用它们。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chitin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've grown a chitin exoskeleton, much like that of an insect.  In addition to acting as armor, you are somewhat resistant to the harmful effects of radiation.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你长出了一层类似昆虫的几丁质外骨骼。这层外骨骼不仅能充当护甲，还能让你对辐射的有害影响产生一定的抵抗力。此外，它还能在一定程度上减轻潮湿环境带来的负面影响。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gills"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've grown a set of gills in your neck, allowing you to breathe underwater.  Slightly increases wet benefits."
msgstr "你的呼吸系统发生了变异，拥有了一对腮，允许你在水下呼吸。稍微增加湿身对你的心情加成。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cephalopod Gills"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've grown a set of gills, running from your neck up behind your ears.  They allow you to breathe underwater and slightly increase wet benefits."
msgstr "你的呼吸系统发生了变异，长了一对腮，从脖子一直开口到耳朵后边。允许你在水下呼吸。略微增加湿身对你的心情奖励。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleek Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've grown sleek fur, providing minor protection against attacks, and some protection from cold."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，整个身体长出了光滑的毛皮，既可以少许抵挡攻击，又可以保暖。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Culler"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've had a revelation: by killing the weaker creatures, who would only die anyway, you preserve resources for those better able to survive.  You are less bothered by the deaths of others: their own weakness invited these fates upon them."
msgstr "你从杀戮之中领悟到，通过杀掉终将死去的弱者，你为那些能够活下去的强者保留了更多资源。你不会太被其他人的死亡所困扰，因为他们自身的懦弱导致了他们的结局。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Echolocation"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've learned how to hunt without sight.  Activate this mutation to make a quiet chirp that can reveal obstacles and enemies by its echo."
msgstr "你已经学会了如何在没有视力的情况下狩猎。  激活此突变可发出安静的鸣叫声，通过其回声可以发现障碍物和敌人。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scruffy Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've lost your fluffy undercoat for the summer.  This feels a lot better in the heat, but it's less protective and looks a little bedraggled."
msgstr "夏天你已经失去了蓬松的底毛。  这在炎热的天气里感觉好多了，但它的保护性较差，而且看起来有点脏。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Small"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've noticeably shrunk in size.  You're able to move with increased litheness, but your smaller stature prevents you from driving a car or carrying as much."
msgstr "你的体型明显缩小了。你移动时更加敏捷，但你的小个子让你无法携带很多东西。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fruiting (picked)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've picked all your fruit and no longer have any, as such this mutation is not supposed to be visible."
msgstr "你已经采摘了所有的水果，但不再有任何水果，因此这种突变不应该是可见的。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fat Deposits"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've put on some additional weight around your body.  It slows you down a little, but helps your swimming and warmth."
msgstr "你身上有不少脂肪，或许这会使你变得迟钝一点，不过这对游泳和保暖都有帮助。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chitin (Molted)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've recently molted, and your chitin exoskeleton is still soft and vulnerable."
msgstr "你刚刚才蜕皮，你的几丁质外骨骼还柔软而脆弱。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Flowering"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've started blooming where your scalp used to be.  Your blossoms have a pleasant aroma, are visually striking, and are quite sensitive."
msgstr "你的头皮上开出了花朵，香气怡人，看上去也很令人瞩目，而且还特别敏感。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chloromorphosis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've truly become a walking plant, though you mostly feel like sleeping in the sunshine.  When you do, your roots and bark will take in more nutrients than ever."
msgstr "你已经真正成为一棵行走的植物，尽管你最想在阳光下睡觉。  当你这样做时，你的根和树皮会比以往吸收更多的营养。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lactose Intolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You, like 75 percent of the world, cannot tolerate milk or milk based products.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr "你像世界上75%的人一样，你有乳糖不耐症，难以消化奶制品。虽然你还是可以吃，但是你会受到心情惩罚并且吸收更少的营养。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Numb"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your ability to feel or express emotion has been greatly hampered."
msgstr "你的感官及表达情感的能力受到了极大的妨碍。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unbreakable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your anatomy is specialized to endure physical punishment.  You have a 30% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "你不仅肌肉密度更强大，你的内脏与骨骼也更加坚韧，你的生命值上限增加30%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antlers (Shed)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your antlers have shed for the season.  If you can see this, you're using debug, or you've encountered a bug."
msgstr "你的鹿角已经在这个季节脱落了。  如果您可以看到这一点，则说明您正在使用调试，或者遇到了错误。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "White Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "Brown Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "Blue Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "Black Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "Bald Eagle Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your arms have mostly transformed into a huge pair of feathered wings.  Though you retain a few fingers, your fine manipulation is greatly hampered.  On the other hand, you can glide from ledges and will take less damage if you fall, provided you're healthy and unburdened."
msgstr "你的手臂大部分已经变成了一对巨大的羽毛翅膀。  虽然你还保留了几根手指，但你的精细操作却受到了极大的阻碍。  另一方面，如果你身体健康且没有负担，你可以从壁架上滑翔，并且在跌倒时受到的伤害也会较小。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feathered Arms"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your arms have sprouted feathers, and you find you can no longer fully extend your elbows.  This gets in the way a bit, but the feathers offer minor protection from damage and the elements."
msgstr "你的手臂上长出了羽毛，你发现自己的肘部再也无法完全伸直了。这有些不便，但这些羽毛能提供些许保护，让你免受伤害和恶劣天气的侵袭。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Appeal"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your attractiveness would be considered unremarkable by the average human."
msgstr "你的外貌在普通人眼中被认为平平无奇。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Shifting Bark (Distributed)" to
#. "BARK2_b"
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Shifting Bark (Consolidated)"
#. to "BARK2_c"
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Shifting Bark (Latticed)" to
#. "BARK2_a"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your bark ripples across your body, repositioning at a cellular level."
msgstr "你的树皮在扩散出一道道波纹，在细胞水平上重新调换位置。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Incisors"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your big teeth have grown in.  Folks had best show some more respect."
msgstr "你的嘴部牙齿发生了变异，长出了很突出的门齿，看起来也许会令人不悦。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Infection Immune"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your bloodstream has developed antibiotic properties.  Your wounds will never become infected."
msgstr "你的血液里充斥着抗体。你的伤口再也不会被感染了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mutagenic Chaos"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body alters itself rapidly, and without your intervention or conscious control."
msgstr "你的身体快速的发生各种变异，而且根本不管你愿不愿意。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Frail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your body breaks very easily.  Its maximum HP is 50% lower than usual.  Your weakness is apparent and makes you less intimidating."
msgstr "你的身体非常容易受损。HP上限减少50%，并且这种明显的脆弱感降低了你的威慑力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Flimsy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your body can't take much abuse.  Its maximum HP is 25% lower than usual.  Your weakness is apparent and makes you less intimidating."
msgstr "你的身体经不起太多打击。HP上限减少20%，并且这种明显的脆弱感降低了你的威慑力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Albino"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body cannot produce melanin, leaving you extremely pale.  You sunburn extremely easily, and typically use an umbrella and sunglasses when going out in the sun."
msgstr "由于基因缺陷，你缺乏皮肤色素沉着。你非常容易被阳光晒伤，外出时最好带上伞和太阳镜。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Thirst"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body dries out easily; you need to drink more water."
msgstr "你的身体容易脱水。你需要喝更多的水。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Web Walker"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body excretes very fine amounts of a chemical which prevents you from sticking to webs.  Walking through webs does not affect you at all."
msgstr "你的皮肤分泌出非常精细的化学物质以阻止粘在网上。你可以尽情地穿梭于网中了"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hyperalgesia"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your body experiences pain out of proportion to the physical causes.  Pain dealt to you is increased by 50%."
msgstr "你所感受到的疼痛要比实际情况高出很多。你受到的疼痛增加50%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Metabolic Rehydration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body gets everything it needs from the food that you eat!  You no longer need hydration from fluids."
msgstr "你的身体能够从食物中得到所有需要的所有营养！你不再需要通过液体补水了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hirsute"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body hair is growing in thicker than it used to.  It's almost like you're going through a second puberty."
msgstr "你的体毛比以往长得更厚，你又到青春期了还是啥的吗？"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ectothermic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your body has become permanently cold-blooded.  Your speed lowers or raises 1% for every 2 (1.1) degrees below or above 65 F (18.3 C).  You eat much less than you otherwise would."
msgstr "你已经完全变异为冷血动物。在温度低于/高于18.3℃（65F）时，每 1.1℃（2F）的变化会使你的速度降低/提高 1%。你的食量也因此减少了不少。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Severe Radioactivity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit heavy levels of radiation, making your surroundings unlivable."
msgstr "你的身体拥有了放射性！你不断向周围辐射大量的射线，你周围的世界寸草不生。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Minor Radioactivity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit low levels of radiation, which slowly contaminates the world around you."
msgstr "你的身体拥有了放射性！你不断向周围辐射少量的射线，缓慢地污染着你周围的世界。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radioactivity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit moderate levels of radiation, which contaminates the world around you."
msgstr "你的身体拥有了放射性！你不断向周围辐射中量的射线，污染着你周围的世界。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Acid Blood"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body has developed a wonderful defense mechanism.  Instead of normal blood, you bleed a strong molecular acid which will damage any creature foolish enough to harm you."
msgstr "你的身体产生了一种神奇的防御机制。你流出的血含有强酸，会伤害任何蠢到弄破你皮肤的家伙。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Resilient"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your body has grown accustomed to physical trauma.  You get a 20% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "你不仅肌肉密度更强大，你的内脏与骨骼也更加坚韧，你的生命值上限增加30%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slimy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is coated with a fine slime which makes uncovered skin harder to grab and helps protect you from acid.  Greatly increases wet benefits."
msgstr "你的身上覆盖着一层细腻的黏液，使你裸露的皮肤难以抓握，并且使你能免受酸液腐蚀的长期效果影响，但不能防止短期腐蚀。大大增加湿身心情加成。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crustacean Carapace"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is covered with a durable carapace.  In addition to powerful physical protection, you are somewhat resistant to the harmful effects of radiation.  It reduces dexterity by 2 and greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的身体覆盖着坚固的甲壳。除了提供强大的物理防护外，你还对辐射的有害影响具有一定的抵抗力。它会使敏捷降低 2 点，并大幅减轻潮湿带来的影响。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quills"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is covered with large quills.  Whenever an unarmed opponent strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will receive significant damage."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，长出了又大又长的硬刺。当对手徒手攻击直接命中暴露在外的肢体时，将会受到较高的伤害。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spines"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is covered with sharp spines.  Whenever an unarmed opponent strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will receive moderate damage."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，长出了许多细骨刺。当对手徒手攻击直接命中暴露在外的肢体时，将会受到不小的伤害。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fragile"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your body is extremely fragile.  Its maximum HP is 75% lower than usual.  Your weakness is apparent and makes you less intimidating."
msgstr "你的身体极其脆弱。HP上限减少75%，并且这种明显的脆弱感降低了你的威慑力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mutagenic Adaptability"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is ideally suited to mutation.  Taking different kinds of mutagen won't result in more negative mutations than normal."
msgstr "你的身体非常适合突变。使用不同类型的诱变剂不会比正常情况产生更多的负面变异效果。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Omnicellular"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is more or less one consistent whole: a single, giant, omni-cell that alters itself as needed."
msgstr "你的身体基本上就是一个整体：一个单一巨大可以随意变换形状的大细胞。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Night Raider"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is one with the night.  You make less noise when the moon is up in the sky, even when you cannot see it."
msgstr "你的身体与黑夜合一。当月亮升上天空时，即使你看不见它，你也会发出更少的噪音。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Disease Immune"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is simply immune to diseases.  You will never catch an ambient disease."
msgstr "你的身体产生了疾病免疫。你将永远不会生病。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Disintegration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is slowly wasting away!"
msgstr "你的身体正在缓慢地萎缩！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Parasite Immune"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is unusually inhospitable to parasitic lifeforms.  You will never become infested with internal parasites."
msgstr "你的身体对寄生虫类生命形式极度不友好。你永远不会被内部寄生虫感染。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deterioration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is very slowly wasting away."
msgstr "你的身体正在非常缓慢地萎缩！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Venomous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body produces a venom which may aid you in combat, provided you have a way to deliver it."
msgstr "你的身体会产生一种毒液，如果你有办法释放它，它可能会在战斗中帮助你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Web Spinner"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body produces and anchors webbing.  Too bad you can't seem to control the process.  There is a chance that you will leave webs in your wake."
msgstr "你的身体能够自动生成并射出蛛网，不过不受控制。没准儿一觉醒来，你就被粘在床上了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Alcohol Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body produces enzymes that process alcohol more quickly.  Sobering up faster makes it less addictive, and you won't suffer as many negative health effects."
msgstr "您的身体会产生能够更快地处理酒精的酶。  更快地醒酒可以减少成瘾性，并且您不会遭受太多的负面健康影响。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mammal Pheromones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body produces low-level pheromones which put mammals at ease.  They will be less likely to attack or flee from you."
msgstr "你的身体会生产少量使哺乳动物安心的信息素，使得动物不太可能会攻击或逃离你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Amphibian Pheromones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body produces low-level pheromones, identifying you as a friend to many species of amphibian.  Amphibians will attack you much less."
msgstr "你的身体会生产少量使两栖动物安心的信息素，使得两栖动物不太可能攻击你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect Pheromones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body produces low-level pheromones, identifying you as a friend to many species of insects.  Insects will attack you much less."
msgstr "你的身体会生产少量使昆虫安心的信息素，使得昆虫不太可能攻击你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extreme Hyperalgesia"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body reacts cripplingly to any source of pain.  Pain dealt to you is doubled."
msgstr "你的身体会对任何疼痛来源产生极度反应。对你造成双倍疼痛。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Alpha Purity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body rejects the corruption of subhuman mutations.  You can no longer gain mutations from any category other than Alpha, though purifier should still work."
msgstr "你的身体拒绝非人类突变的腐蚀。  你不能再从 Alpha 以外的任何类别获得突变，尽管净化器应该仍然有效。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hyper-Metabolism: burning"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body steams as it burns calories to visibly regenerate at an astonishing rate."
msgstr "当你燃烧卡路里时，你的身体会以惊人的速度明显地恢复活力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Carnivore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body's ability to digest fruits, vegetables, grains and nuts is severely hampered.  You've largely lost your taste for everything but meat, but your nutritional needs have largely adjusted to suit your new lifestyle."
msgstr "您的身体消化水果、蔬菜、谷物和坚果的能力受到严重阻碍。  除了肉之外，您基本上已经失去了对所有食物的口味，但您的营养需求已在很大程度上进行了调整，以适应您的新生活方式。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Herbivore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body's ability to digest meat is severely hampered.  Eating meat has a good chance of making you vomit it back up; even if you manage to keep it down, its nutritional value is greatly reduced."
msgstr "你的身体丧失了对肉类的消化以及吸收能力，你将不能从鸡鸭等肉类中获得营养，你只能吃素了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Able Sleeper"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body's demanding energy needs mean you can fall asleep just about anywhere."
msgstr "你的身体所需要的极高能量消耗让你能够在任何地方迅速睡着。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Viscous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body's slime output has become sticky and gel-like, making uncovered skin harder to grab and offering some protection from acid.  Greatly increases wet benefits."
msgstr "你身上的黏液变得粘稠且呈凝胶状，使你裸露的皮肤难以抓握，并且使你能部分免受酸液的腐蚀。大大增加湿身心情加成。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dense Bones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your bones are particularly dense and durable.  Your tougher frame grants 5% more HP and 15% more carry capacity plus bashing attacks injure you less, but your higher weight makes attacking and moving 5% slower.  Also, dodging and swimming are harder."
msgstr "你的骨骼特别致密耐用。更硬的身体为你增加了5%的生命值和15%的负重能力，钝击对你的伤害也变得更小了，但你较高的体重会使攻击和移动速度变慢5%。此外，你更难进行闪避和游泳。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hollow Bones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your bones are very light, hollow and partially supported by a network of air sacs connected to your lungs.  You are faster and recover stamina more efficiently as a result, but are vulnerable to blunt force trauma and cannot carry as much."
msgstr "您的骨骼非常轻、中空，并且部分由与肺部相连的气囊网络支撑。  因此，你的速度更快，恢复耐力也更有效，但很容易受到钝器损伤，并且无法携带那么多东西。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Light Bones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your bones are very light.  This enables you to move and attack more quickly, but limits your weight capacity and makes you vulnerable to bashing damage."
msgstr "你的骨骼发生了变异，骨质非常松脆，你的行动速度增加了10%，但你所携带的物品最大重量下降20%，而且你受到的钝击伤害略微提升。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hunter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your brain has a lot more in common with a predatory animal than a human, making it easier to control misplaced reactions to the death of your prey.  Additionally, combat skills, which you use to hunt, are easier to learn and maintain."
msgstr "你的大脑较人类而言更像是只猛兽，让你更容易控制自己在面对猎物死亡时所造成的负面情绪。此外，你能够更容易提升及保持你所用来进行狩猎的战斗技能。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cephalopod Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your brain has caught up with your eyes.  You can see much better in the dark, but sunlight seems much brighter now.  Activate to toggle NV-visible areas on or off."
msgstr "你的视觉系统发生了变异，你的大脑神经跟上了你眼睛的速度，在黑暗中你看得更清楚了。不过阳光对你来说却更加刺眼。激活来切换显示夜视可见范围。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Distributed Neurology"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your brain has evolved beyond human imagination.  You'll show them the REAL meaning of 'gray goo'!"
msgstr "你的大脑已经进化到人类无法想象的地步。现在让他们见识一下什么才是\"变形怪\"真正的力量。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bat Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your broad, pointed ears are like radar dishes.  You can hear even the slightest sounds at great distance, and are less likely to be deafened by loud noises."
msgstr "你又宽又尖的耳朵就像雷达天线。  您甚至可以在很远的距离听到最轻微的声音，并且不太可能被大声的噪音震耳欲聋。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bull Roids"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your bulk has rendered you a veritable living wall.  Be careful around water though; while you're as sturdy as a rock, you'll sink like one too."
msgstr "你的体积使你成为一堵名副其实的活墙。不过要小心水源；当你像岩石一样坚固时，你也会像岩石一样沉没。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Capabilities"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your capabilities are pretty normal."
msgstr "你的能力很普通。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Huge"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your cardiovascular system has caught up with your muscular physique, so who needs pathetic human cars?  Strength +4."
msgstr "你的生理系统已经足够驱动你巨大的身形，惊人的力量在你身上得到了完美的平衡。你堪称人形汽车。力量+4。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Furred Chitin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your chitin hair has thickened and spread across your body.  It provides a bit of warmth and helps you sense nearby vibrations."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，产生了甲壳。甲壳上的几丁质毛发变得浓密并且遍布全身。这为你提供了一点热量，并且有助于你感知附近的振动。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bloodfeeder"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your craving for blood borders on obsession.  You need the stuff too much to care about whether it came from a human, and your body can filter out most of the toxins in mutant blood."
msgstr "你对血液的渴望近乎痴迷。  你太需要这些东西了，以至于不在乎它是否来自人类，而你的身体可以过滤掉突变体血液中的大部分毒素。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Burrowing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your dextrous paws and long teeth allow you to dig through dirt and rubble with ease."
msgstr "你灵活的爪子和长牙可以让你轻松地挖开泥土和瓦砾。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eater Of The Dead"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your digestion has evolved further.  In addition to mutated meat, you can also stomach the tainted and long-dead flesh of zombies… if you can stand the taste, of course."
msgstr "你的消化能力进一步发展。除了变异肉，你还可以吃被污染的、早已死去的丧尸肉……当然，如果你能忍受这种味道的话。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your digestive system and cardio health are standard for a human."
msgstr "你的消化系统和心肺功能是普通人类的标准。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ruminant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your digestive system is capable of digesting cellulose and other rough plant material.  You can eat underbrush and shrubs by activating this, standing over your target, and pressing E."
msgstr "你能消化纤维素等植物原料了。激活后站在灌木丛上按\"E\"键，吃掉它。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Saprovore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your digestive system is specialized to allow you to consume decaying material.  You can eat rotten food, albeit for less nutrition than usual."
msgstr "你的消化系统已经变异得能够消化已经腐坏的食物，但是仅能从中获得较正常食物少的营养。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rodent Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your ears are huge, round, and gray!  They're rather fascinating, and help you hear from a much greater distance."
msgstr "你的耳朵发生了变异，变得又大又圆还有点灰！它们看上去很迷人，而且能够帮助你听见远处的动静。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your ears have extended into long, pointed, velvety ones, like those of a feline.  You find it easier to tune in on sounds from afar."
msgstr "你的耳朵发生了变异，变得又长又尖又软，和猫耳朵差不多。你发现自己能比较容易的收到远处发出的声音，听力得到了增强。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rabbit Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your ears have grown into tall and flexible rabbit ears.  They're are slender and enhance your hearing beyond the normal range."
msgstr "你的耳朵已经长成了长长的、灵活的兔耳朵。它们又细又长，使你的听力超越凡人。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ursine Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your ears have grown longer and rounder, much like those of a bear.  You can hear things a little farther away."
msgstr "你的耳朵发生了变异，变得又圆又大，和熊耳朵差不多。你的听力稍微提升了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Stamina"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your energy to squash bugs is endless!"
msgstr "你消灭虫子的能量是无穷无尽的！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Summer Coat"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your entire body is covered in dense fur, but it's thinned out a bit for the summer, which may provide some relief from the heat at the cost of physical protection."
msgstr "你的整个身体都覆盖着浓密的皮毛，但到了夏天，皮毛会变得稀疏一些，这可能会在一定程度上缓解炎热，但代价是身体的保护。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Epicuticle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your epidermis has turned into a thin, flexible layer of chitin.  It provides decent physical protection.  Slightly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，变成了一层轻薄而有弹性的甲壳。可以很好的抵挡攻击。稍微减少湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Epicuticle (Molted)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your epidermis has turned into a thin, flexible layer of chitin.  Newly molted, it feels a little tender, but it's still tough and leathery."
msgstr "你的外表皮变成了一层薄的、可动的几丁质甲壳层。刚刚蜕皮，现在还是软的，但已经像皮革般坚韧了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sores"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your extremities are covered in painful sores.  The pain is worse when they are covered in clothing."
msgstr "你的四肢覆盖满了疼痛的溃疡。当你穿着衣服时更是会痛不欲生。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Muscle Consolidation"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your extremities have gained strength but lost fine motor skills.  -1 Dexterity +2 Strength."
msgstr "你的四肢力量增强了，但失去了精细运动技能。敏捷-1，力量+2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Compound Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes are compound, like those of an insect.  This increases your Perception by 2 whenever you aren't wearing eyewear."
msgstr "你的眼睛变成了像昆虫一样的复眼。只要你不戴任何眼部装备，感知 +2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Intermediate Eyestalks"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes barely protrude from your head on stalks, preventing the use of any rigid eyewear.  On the plus side, you can have additional awareness, but sometimes your vision goes wonky as your brain tries to process the new angles.  Perception +1"
msgstr "你的眼睛变成触柄稍稍从你的头上凸出，这让你无法使用任何硬质眼镜。从好的方面来说，你可以获得额外的环境感知力，但有时当你的大脑试图处理新的视角时，你的视野会变得不稳定。感知+1"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bulging Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes bulge out several inches from your skull.  This does not affect your vision in any way."
msgstr "你的眼睛从头颅突出来几英寸，但这并不影响你的视觉。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Infrared Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes have mutated to pick up radiation in the infrared spectrum."
msgstr "你的眼睛发生了变异，可以看见红外线光线。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptilian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes have mutated, with a brilliant iris and slitted pupil similar to that of a lizard.  This could help you lie or intimidate people, but on its own it's not helping you see in the dark."
msgstr "你的眼睛发生了变异，有着类似蜥蜴一样闪亮的虹膜和竖瞳，看上去很吓人，不过好像并不影响你的视力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes have mutated; now you have slit pupils, and they glitter in the light, much like a cat's.  This could help you lie or intimidate people, but on its own it's not helping you see in the dark."
msgstr "你的眼睛发生了变异，瞳孔像猫一样眯成一条缝，在夜里闪着光。看起来不错，但并没有夜视功能。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fey Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes have turned… green.  It's tough to tell the exact shade, as it seems to shift.  The hypnotic effect almost passes for natural, and makes it easier to lie or persuade others."
msgstr "你的眼睛发生了变异，眼睛颜色变成了莹绿色。瞳孔似乎在不断地转动，你很难描述出它的形状，这效果棒极了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lidless Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes lack lids and are instead protected by a translucent scale that shuts out irritants.  This will make it much easier to see underwater, and to spot danger approaching even while you rest."
msgstr "你的眼睛没有眼睑，而是由一层半透明的鳞片保护，可以阻挡刺激物。  这将使您更容易在水下看到东西，甚至在休息时也能发现正在逼近的危险。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eyestalks"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes protrude from your head on flexible tentacles, preventing the use of any eyewear.  On the plus side, you can see in two directions at once, and they automatically retract to reduce damage.  Perception +2"
msgstr "你的眼睛从你的头上伸出，变成灵活的触柄，这让你无法使用任何眼镜。但另一方面，你可以同时看向两个方向，它们会自动缩回以减少伤害。感知+2"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Snout"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your face and jaw have begun… changing.  Masks and such fit OK, but you're noticeably mutated."
msgstr "你的脸和下巴发生了……变化。你仍然可以戴上面具一类的东西，但是你的变异已经十分明显。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rodent Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your face and jaw have extended, giving you an alert and attentive appearance.  If you have a pair of matching incisors, you can bite harder and faster than any human ever could."
msgstr "你的脸颊凸出来了，让你看起来充满着警觉与细心。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dromeosaur Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your face has drastically mutated, with the bones of your jaws having extended forth into a long, tapered snout.  While modern-day gas masks mostly don't account for paleobiology, if you manage to evolve a set of fangs, you will bite with the ferocity of long-dead beasts."
msgstr "你的脸发生了巨大的变异，下巴的骨头向前延伸，变成了一个长长的、锥形的鼻子。  虽然现代防毒面具大多无法解释古生物学，但如果你设法进化出一套尖牙，你就会像死去已久的野兽一样凶猛地咬人。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bovine Snout"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your face resembles that of a bull, with a significant snout.  It looks fearsome but makes it difficult to find gear that covers your face."
msgstr "你的脸像公牛，有一个很大的鼻子。  它看起来很可怕，但很难找到遮盖你脸的装备。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Saber Teeth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your fangs have grown extremely large and incredibly sharp.  They get in the way of wearing masks and eating, but they can punch through even heavily armored enemies."
msgstr "你的牙又长又尖，以至于你不能带口罩，吃东西也很不方便……不过你的尖牙在咬人会留下可怕的伤口。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Webbed Feet"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your feet are heavily webbed, allowing you to swim faster if you aren't wearing footwear."
msgstr "你的脚上长有厚厚的蹼，如果你不穿鞋，可以游得更快。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hooves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your feet have fused into hooves.  This allows you to perform a powerful kicking attack, provides natural armor, and removes the need to wear shoes; however, you cannot wear normal shoes."
msgstr "您的脚已经融合成马蹄形状。这使您能够进行强大的踢击攻击，提供天然的护甲，并且不需要穿鞋子；然而，您无法穿普通的鞋子。这还可以减少在潮湿环境下的不利影响。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hooked Toes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your feet have grown into strong, curved claws.  They won't fit into normal shoes and are not much help in combat, but they allow you to climb most vertical surfaces with ease.  You can even cling to walls you glide into!"
msgstr "你的脚已经长成强壮、弯曲的爪子。  它们不适合普通的鞋子，对战斗没有太大帮助，但它们可以让你轻松攀爬大多数垂直表面。  您甚至可以紧贴滑入的墙壁！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Long Fingernails"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your fingernails are long and sharp.  If you're barehanded and not wearing gloves, you'll be able to fight with them."
msgstr "你的指甲变得很长。如果不戴手套，徒手攻击对方时将造成少量斩击伤害。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bovine Bulk"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your flesh has become dense with fat and muscle.  This makes you harder to take down, but also a poor swimmer."
msgstr "你的肉变得充满脂肪和肌肉。这会让你更难被击倒，但同时也是一个糟糕的游泳者。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radiophile"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your flesh has developed a unique reaction to radiation that lets you sense when ambient radiation is abnormally high.  Turn off to ignore messages."
msgstr "你的血肉能与辐射产生特殊的反应，让你能感觉到超出底噪的辐射量。关闭以忽略监测信息。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Amorphous Body"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your flesh is a pleasing gel-like consistency.  Your bodily functions seem to be moving around, and your leg-equivalents flow comfortably - if a little slower than your old meat-legs."
msgstr "你的血肉就好像一整块舒爽的凝胶。你的身体结构似乎正在到处跑偏，而你的\"腿\"流动的相当舒适，不过比起你原先的肉腿稍微慢了些。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Toxic Flesh"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your flesh is highly poisonous, and creatures that bite you will receive a nasty surprise."
msgstr "你的肉含有剧毒，任何咬你的生物会得到一个麻烦的惊喜。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Regeneration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your flesh regenerates and your limbs mend incredibly quickly."
msgstr "你的肉体再生与断肢愈合速度快得不可思议。"

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Bow-legged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your folded wings make it easy to crawl."
msgstr "你湿透的手使攀爬更困难。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Subterranean Build"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your frame has adapted for life in confined spaces.  You seem a little shorter and bulkier, trading mobility for muscle mass.  (+2 Strength, -2 Dexterity)"
msgstr "为了适应在狭小地方的生活，你变得矮小精干，牺牲灵活性来获得力量。力量 +2，敏捷 -2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shaggy Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your fur has grown out and thickened, providing great protection from attacks as well as considerable insulation."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，体表的毛皮长得又浓又密，既可以很好的抵挡攻击，又相当保暖。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lynx Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your fur has grown out significantly around your cheeks and neck, providing excellent protection from attacks."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，脸上和脖子上都长出了猞猁一样的长毛，可以极好地抵挡攻击。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rabbit Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your fur keeps you covered in winter, maintaining heat and allowing you to better tolerate cold temperatures."
msgstr "在冬天，你的毛皮能更好地保持体温，让你更加耐寒。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Freshwater Osmosis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your gills and skin are highly permeable to moisture, and you can hydrate your body through osmosis.  While submerged in fresh water, any thirst you might have will be slaked."
msgstr "你的鳃和皮肤能够渗透并吸收水汽，你可以通过渗透补充你的身体的水分。当你被淡水淹没时，你所有的任何口渴度将得到满足。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Potent Venom"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your glands swell with deadly venom.  Hopefully your fangs are big enough to deliver it."
msgstr "你的腺体因致命的毒液而肿胀。  希望你的獠牙足够大，能够把它送出来。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Intestinal Fortitude"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your guts have developed the ability to handle the toxic elements of mutated flesh.  Mostly."
msgstr "你的五脏六腑已经进化出处理变异肉中有毒成分的能力。大部分吧。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Webbed Hands"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hands are heavily webbed, which significantly improves your ability to swim, but makes manipulation more difficult and prevents wearing many kinds of gloves."
msgstr "你的手上有很多蹼，这显着提高了你游泳的能力，但也让操作变得更加困难，并且妨碍了佩戴多种手套。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Little Paws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hands have elongated and look a bit more like paws.  It makes fine manipulation a little more difficult, but you can still probably manage.  Plus, they allow you to move on all fours when crouching and unarmed."
msgstr "你的手变得更加修长，看上去更像爪子。精细操作变得困难了一点，但还勉强接受。此外在空手蹲伏时，可以适用四肢爬动行进。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Paws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hands have fused into quasi-paws.  Fine manipulation is a challenge: permanent hand encumbrance of 10, difficulty with delicate craftwork, and your gloves don't fit.  But they handle water better and bear weight well, allowing you to move on all fours when crouching and unarmed."
msgstr "你的双手变成了爪子。精细操作对你来说是个挑战：手掌累赘永久+10，精细制造时间延长，手套也不再合身。但也更适应于游泳，可以更好地负重，也能让你在没穿装备时用四肢匍匐行进。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Autumn Foliage"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your head and upper limbs are covered in beautiful autumn leaves.  If they're uncovered you'll still be able to photosynthesize, but not as well as in the warmer months.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的头和上肢都被美丽的秋叶覆盖。  如果它们未被覆盖，您仍然可以进行光合作用，但不如在温暖的月份进行。  减少潮湿影响。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Glass Jaw"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your head can't take much abuse.  Its maximum HP is 20% lower than usual.  Your apparent fragility makes you less intimidating."
msgstr "你的头骨由于生理缺陷导致很脆弱，经不起太大打击。头部HP上限减少20%，并且这种明显的脆弱感降低了你的威慑力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blooming Roses"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your head is crowned with radiant flowers that spread their petals wide.  The dizzying fragrance attracts people and pollinators alike."
msgstr "你的头上戴着光芒四射的花朵，花瓣张开。  令人眼花缭乱的香味吸引着人们和传粉者。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Slow Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your health recovery is severely impaired.  Your HP whilst asleep, as well as your broken limbs, heal at 33% of the regular rate."
msgstr "你的机体自愈能力严重受损。伤口在睡眠时恢复速度以及折断的四肢的愈合速度是正常人的33%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lupine Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hearing has evolved further and is now on par with that of wolves.  You can hear things significantly farther away."
msgstr "你的耳朵已经进一步变异，现在和狼耳朵差不多了。你能够听到远得多的地方所发出的声音。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Good Hearing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hearing is better than average, and you can hear distant sounds more easily."
msgstr "你的听觉神经更为发达，对于微小的、更远处的声音你可以更容易的听清楚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Poor Hearing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hearing is poor, and you may not hear quiet or far-off noises."
msgstr "你的听力很弱，可能听不清楚附近小的或远些的声音。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hyperactive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your heartbeat is so rapid, it sometimes feels like it's vibrating in your chest.  Your fitness and stamina are greatly improved."
msgstr "你的心跳如此之快，有时感觉就像是在你的胸腔里振动。  你的体质和耐力都得到了很大的提高。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scuttle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hook-shaped feet curl inward to grip the ground, allowing you to easily walk along the bottom when you're underwater.  They're also a bit quicker at climbing over obstacles, even on dry land."
msgstr "你的钩形脚向内弯曲以抓住地面，让你可以轻松地沿着水底行走。即使在陆地上，它们也能帮你更快地越过障碍。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Frog Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your huge, bulging eyes are great at tracking movement even underwater, and you have a transparent third eyelid that allows you to sleep with your eyes open."
msgstr "你巨大而凸出的眼睛即使在水下也能很好地追踪运动，而且你有透明的第三眼睑，可以让你睁着眼睛睡觉。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Hyper-Metabolism: burning" to
#. "EATHEALTH"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hyper-metabolism slows down."
msgstr "你的超级代谢渐渐减弱了。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Hyper-Metabolism" to
#. "EATHEALTH_active"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hyper-metabolism starts burning up calories."
msgstr "你的超级代谢开始极速消耗卡路里。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Immunity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your immune system is more or less normal for a human."
msgstr "你的免疫系统能力处于正常人类范围。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Infection Resistant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your immune system is particularly good at resisting infections.  You have an increased chance for dirty wounds and infections to recover on their own, and suffer reduced penalties from them."
msgstr "你的免疫系统特别能抵抗感染。你有更高的机率治愈严重的伤口与感染，而且伤势的影响也较轻微。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ursine Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your jaw and nose have extended into a bearish muzzle, which interferes with most face-covering gear.  If you have a set of fangs, this will greatly improve their effectiveness against downed enemies."
msgstr "你的下巴和鼻子已经延伸成熊状的口吻，这会干扰大多数面部遮盖装备。  如果你有一套尖牙，这将大大提高它们对抗倒地敌人的效率。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lupine Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your jaw and nose have extended into a wolfish muzzle, making it difficult to find masks that fit.  If you have a set of fangs, you'll be able to trip most enemies in combat by biting them."
msgstr "你的下巴和鼻子已经延伸成狼一样的口鼻，很难找到合适的口罩。  如果你有一组尖牙，你就能在战斗中咬住大多数敌人，让他们绊倒。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Knees"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your knees are strong and capable of angles that you couldn't imagine previously.  Moving over rough terrain will slow you down less than normal."
msgstr "你的膝盖很强壮，能够弯曲到你以前无法想象的角度。在崎岖不平的地形上移动时不像普通人那样困难。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Verdant Leaves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your leaves are vibrant, large, and green, and have become a major source of nutrients for your body.  Whenever your arms and head are uncovered you will gain a large amount of nutrients by standing in the sunlight.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的叶子生机勃勃，又大又绿，它已经成为你身体营养的主要来源。当你的手臂和头部被暴露在阳光下时，光合作用会产生大量的营养。减少湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lush Leaves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your leaves have grown in size and prominence, with additional leaves sprouting along your arms.  While your arms and head are uncovered, you will photosynthesize nutrients while in sunlight.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的叶子已经长大了，而且非常突出，更多的叶子在你的手臂上发芽。当你的手臂和头部被暴露在阳光下时，光合作用会产生营养。减少湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Avian Leap"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your legs and feet have become bird-like; digitigrade with scaly skin and grasping claws arranged three ahead and one behind.  They're perfect gripping onto precarious perches, or for making a long-ranged leap attack."
msgstr "你的腿和脚已经变得像鸟一样；趾行者，皮肤有鳞，爪子三前一后排列。  它们非常适合抓住不稳定的栖息地，或者进行远程跳跃攻击。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Roadrunner"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your legs are extremely limber and fast-moving.  You can walk and run 30% faster on flat surfaces."
msgstr "你的腿非常柔软有弹性。在平地上，你移动能快30%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your legs have gained muscle mass to propel you across any terrain."
msgstr "你的双腿肌肉发达，可以让你穿越任何地形。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leg Tentacles"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your legs have transformed into six tentacles.  This decreases your speed on land by 20%, makes your movement silent, increases your swimming speed and reduces wet penalties, but you can't use footwear any more."
msgstr "你的腿变成了六条触须。这会降低你20%左右的陆地移动速度，但让你走路悄无声息。然而，也增加你的游泳速度，减少湿身心情惩罚，同时你也无法再穿上鞋子了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rubbery Limbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your limbs are significantly more flexible than any pathetic human arm or leg.  +3 Dexterity, -2 Strength."
msgstr "你的四肢明显比可悲的人类肢体要柔韧。敏捷 +3，力量 -2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stretchy Limbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your limbs seem to have a little more 'give' to them.  +1 Dexterity."
msgstr "你的四肢好像能够再主动\"伸远\"一点点。敏捷 +1。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tentacle Bracing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your lower arms have developed strong suckers, perfect for walking along lake beds and ocean floors.  They make land movement marginally more tiring, but do a good job of keeping you set in place."
msgstr "你的前臂长出了强健的吸盘，非常适合在湖底和海底行走。虽然这会让陆地移动稍微费力一些，但能让你稳稳地固定在原地。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bow-legged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your lower limbs have shortened and splayed, slowing your bipedal movement.  As long as you're not wielding anything and you've got both wings, you're able to crawl quickly and quietly when you run or crouch."
msgstr "您的下肢已缩短并张开，从而减慢了您的双足运动。  只要你不挥舞任何东西并且你有双翼，当你跑步或蹲下时，你就可以快速而安静地爬行。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Light Eater"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your metabolism is a little slower, and you require less food than most."
msgstr "你的新陈代谢较为缓慢，你所需食物比普通人更少一些。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Mind"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your mind and brain chemistry are not mutated."
msgstr "你的思维和脑化学没有发生任何变异。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Apex Predator"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your mind and brain have adapted to your new place in the world: as one on top of the food chain.  You can effortlessly master and maintain combat skills, but your critical thinking has atrophied further."
msgstr "你是顶级掠食者，你的意识和大脑已经适应了你在世界上的新地位：食物链的巅峰。你可以毫不费力地提升及保持战斗技能，但你的批判性思维能力已进一步萎缩。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mood Swings"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your morale will shift up and down at random, often dramatically.  Lithium tablets can reduce the severity of this disorder."
msgstr "你的情绪会随机波动，且往往起伏剧烈。锂盐片剂可以减轻这种病症的严重程度。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Proboscis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your mouth is now a long, flexible tube.  You can no longer consume solid food and must find liquid nourishment instead."
msgstr "你的嘴现在变成了一根细长而灵活的管子。你无法再进食固体食物，必须寻找流质营养来维持生存。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quick"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your movement and reaction speed are heightened.  You move and act 10% faster."
msgstr "你的移动和反应速度都会加快。  您的移动和行动速度加快 10%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Acidic Secretion"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your mucus has developed an acidic component that seems to soften your prey up."
msgstr "你分泌出的粘液中含有一种酸性成分，似乎能软化你的猎物。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Dependent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your muscle response is dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose 1% of your speed for every 5 (2.8) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  This sluggishness helps you conserve energy, however."
msgstr "你的肌肉反应速度受环境温度影响。在18.3℃（65F）以下，温度每降低2.8℃（5F），你的速度将下降1%。但行动迟缓能够帮助你减少略微食物消耗。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Heat Dependent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your muscle response is highly dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose 1% of your speed for every 3 (1.7) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C), but your slow metabolism requires much less energy."
msgstr "你的肌肉反应速度严重受环境温度影响。在18.3℃（65F）以下，温度每降低1.7℃（3F），你的速度将下降1%。但你缓慢的新陈代谢能够帮助你减少能量消耗。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are a little stronger.  +1 Strength."
msgstr "你比以前强壮了少许。力量+1。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Strong"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are much stronger.  +4 Strength."
msgstr "你的肌肉变得强壮多了。力量+4。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insanely Strong"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are noticeably bulging.  +7 Strength."
msgstr "你的肌肉明显鼓起。力量+7。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime Strength"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are perfectly developed."
msgstr "你的肌肉已经生长完美。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Strong"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are stronger.  +2 Strength."
msgstr "你的肌肉更强壮了。力量+2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Flexibility"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles, joints, and the movement center of your brain have changed internally somewhat, allowing you to traverse obstacles with ease."
msgstr "你的肌肉、关节和大脑运动中枢发生了一些内部变化，让你可以轻松穿越障碍。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Acidproof"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your mutated flesh is immune to the damaging effects of acid."
msgstr "你变异后的血肉对酸液的腐蚀伤害免疫了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leaf Nose"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your nose is upturned, ridged and flared out into a leaf shape that humans will likely find unsightly.  On the plus side, thermoreceptors in your nostrils allow you to smell heat as long as you can breathe."
msgstr "你的鼻子向上、隆起并向外张开，形成人类可能会觉得难看的叶子形状。  从好的方面来说，只要你还能呼吸，鼻孔中的温度感受器就可以让你闻到热气的味道。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your optic nerves and brain caught up with your eyes.  Now you can see pretty well at night."
msgstr "你的视觉系统发生了变异，视觉神经和大脑终于适应了你的新眼睛。现在你能像猫一样看穿黑夜了。激活来切换显示夜视可见范围。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thermal Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your optic nerves and brain have mutated to catch up with your eyes, allowing you to see in the infrared spectrum."
msgstr "你的视觉系统发生了变异，视觉神经与大脑已经随着你眼睛的变异而变异，现在你能使用红外线视觉了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hyper-Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your particular metabolism allows you to burn calories at a prodigious rate to regenerate tissues in a matter of hours; this is, however, a very wasteful process.  Activate to start healing."
msgstr "你特殊的新陈代谢让你以惊人的速度燃烧卡路里，在几分钟内使组织再生，然而这是一个非常耗能的过程。激活以开始治疗。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Broad Paws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your paws are much larger now.  They help you swim, and you can crawl around easily if you crouch with your hands free, but they're a real impediment to crafting and fine manipulation."
msgstr "你的爪子现在大了很多。  它们可以帮助你游泳，如果你蹲下来解放双手，你可以轻松地爬行，但它们确实是制作和精细操作的障碍。"

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Broad Paws"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Little Paws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your paws make it easier to crawl on all fours."
msgstr "你的灵能让你更容易瞄准。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak Photophore (on)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your photophore is glowing softly."
msgstr "你额头上的发光器官正在发出柔弱的微光。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Weak Photophore" to
#. "BIOLUM1_active"
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Photophore" to "BIOLUM2_active"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your photophore starts glowing."
msgstr "你额头上的发光器官开始发出微光。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Weak Photophore (on)" to
#. "BIOLUM1"
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Photophore (on)" to "BIOLUM2"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your photophore stops glowing."
msgstr "你额头上的发光器官停止发光。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Indefatigable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your powerful heart delivers oxygen to your cells with greater than human efficiency, improving your fitness and stamina."
msgstr "您强大的心脏以高于人类的效率向您的细胞输送氧气，从而改善您的健康和耐力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Raptor Leap"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your powerful legs allow you to perform a long distance leap attack with your talons out in front, a great way to strike at prey or get away from something larger."
msgstr "你强大的双腿让你可以用爪子在前面进行长距离跳跃攻击，这是攻击猎物或逃离更大物体的好方法。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nacreous Shell"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your protective shell has developed increased strength and hardness and a mother of pearl sheen."
msgstr "你的保护外壳变得具有更高的强度和硬度，散发出珍珠母般的光泽。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Roomy Shell"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your protective shell has grown large enough to accommodate--if need be--your whole body.  Activate to pull your head and limbs into your shell, trading mobility and vision for warmth and shelter."
msgstr "你可以随时、把自己整个缩进你宽敞的甲壳里，充分享受它的温暖和保护。激活它将头和四肢缩入壳里，以移动力和视野为代价，换取保暖和防护。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pseudolimbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your pseudopod-like limbs can fit into anything!  You also suffer reduced penalties to attacking while prone.  +4 Dexterity, -4 Strength."
msgstr "你的伪足般的四肢可以适应任何东西！  你在俯卧时攻击也会受到减少的惩罚。  +4 敏捷，-4 力量。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cephalopod Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your pupils have widened into horizontal squiggles.  Seeing underwater is no problem, and your ability to see in the dark is significantly improved."
msgstr "你的瞳孔已经扩大成水平曲线。  水下看东西没问题，而且你在黑暗中的看东西能力显着提高。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptilian Healing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your rate of healing speeds up dramatically so long as your body is kept at or above room temperature, allowing even broken limbs to recover in record time."
msgstr "只要您的身体保持在室温或高于室温，您的愈合速度就会显着加快，甚至可以让骨折的肢体在创纪录的时间内恢复。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Giant Pincer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your right hand has become a crab claw.  It encumbers you greatly, but you can use it while grappling to deal massive damage."
msgstr "一只巨大的钳子代替了你的右手。它让你非常烦恼，但你可以在近战中使用它来造成巨量伤害。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bloodletter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your saliva contains powerful anticoagulants.  If you have a bite attack, it will prolong the bleeding of most animals, including humans and the undead.  It may be less effective against insects and stranger creatures."
msgstr "你的唾液含有强大的抗凝血剂。一旦被你咬伤，会延长多数生物的流血时间，无论是人类还是丧尸。但这对昆虫和异界生物可能就不起作用了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Scent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your scent is particularly strong.  It's not offensive to humans, but animals that track your scent will do so more easily."
msgstr "你的汗腺等处散发的气味比常人要重。人们也许还不怎么在意，但嗅觉灵敏的其他生物会因此轻易的追踪到你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak Scent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your scent is quite weak.  Animals that track your scent will do so with more difficulty."
msgstr "你身上汗腺等处散发的气味很小，依靠气味追踪的怪物不太容易注意到你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sensory Disintegration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your sense organs are all over the place: eyes extending and retracting, 'ears' of various shapes migrating about, and taste & smell are uncontrollable.  The world is a horrible mixup.  Ugh!"
msgstr "你的感知器官非常淘气：眼睛非凸即凹，各种形状的耳朵长的到处都是，假如它们还算是耳朵的话，更别提嗅觉和味觉了，根本不听使唤。这世界变成了一团恐怖的浆糊。呃啊~！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Perceptive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are a little keener.  +1 Perception."
msgstr "你的感官敏锐了少许。感知+1。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Perceptive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are keener.  +2 Perception."
msgstr "你的感官更敏锐了。感知+2。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime Perception"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are keenly honed."
msgstr "你的感官敏锐度已经完美。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Perceptive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are much keener.  +4 Perception."
msgstr "你的感官比以前敏锐得多了。感知+4。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Drill Beak"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your sharp, pointed beak can peck holes in solid wood.  You'll sometimes use this against your enemies, especially while grappling."
msgstr "你那尖锐且锋利的喙可以在坚硬的木头上啄出孔洞。有时你也会将此用于攻击敌人，尤其是在格斗缠斗时。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick Scales"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin has grown thick and leathery and a set of heavy green scales has grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural armor.  Further, bony scutes cover your extremities, offering additional protection there.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤已经变得坚韧而厚实，一套厚重的绿色鳞片覆盖了你的大部分身体，充当天然的盔甲。此外肢体末端还覆盖有骨甲板，提供更多的防御。尽管难以被穿透，但它也限制了你的灵活性。极大减少湿身惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Smooth Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin has lost some of its color and taken on a smooth, papery texture.  This slightly reduces wet effects, but also makes you a little more vulnerable to cuts and scrapes."
msgstr "你的皮肤失去了它本应有的颜色，呈现平滑的白纸质感。这稍微减少了湿身的影响，但这也使你面对割伤或砍伤时更加的脆弱。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Patchwork Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin has mutated into an amalgamation of thickened fur, scales, and more."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，由厚厚的毛皮和鳞片等融合而成。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sparse Scales"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin has toughened and grown thin, flexible scales in some places, acting as natural armor."
msgstr "你的皮肤已经变硬，在一些地方长出薄而有弹性的鳞片，作为天然的盔甲。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scales"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin has toughened further and your scales have grown to cover most of your body.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤进一步变硬，你的鳞片生长覆盖了你的大部分体表。在一定程度上减少湿身效果。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Protective Bark"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is coated in a light bark, like that of a tree.  This provides powerful armor and makes you nearly waterproof."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，整个身体覆盖着一层薄薄的树皮，就像一棵树一样。这为你提供了强大的防护，也让你几乎完全防水。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spots"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is covered in a pattern of red spots."
msgstr "你的皮肤长了很多红色的疹子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Colorful Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is covered in shifting patterns of dots, lines, and swirls.  This is outside of your control and does not help your stealth.  In fact, it makes you more noticeable."
msgstr "你的皮肤上布满了变化的斑点、线条和漩涡。你无法操控它，而且对你的隐身没有帮助。事实上，它会让你更引人注目。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thorns"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is covered in small, woody thorns.  Whenever an unarmed opponent strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will receive minor damage.  Your punches may also deal extra damage."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，覆盖着许多细小的木质尖刺。当对手徒手攻击直接命中暴露在外的肢体时，将会受到些微的伤害。你的徒手攻击也能造成额外伤害。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thin-Skinned"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is fragile and slightly vulnerable to cutting and stabbing attacks."
msgstr "您的皮肤很脆弱，容易受到割伤和刺伤。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Phelloderm"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is light green and has a slightly woody quality to it.  This provides armor and helps you retain moisture, resulting in less thirst.  Greatly decreases wet penalties."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织发生了变异，在变成绿色的同时质地也更像木头。这为你提供了防护加成，并帮助你保持水分，从而使你不容易口渴。大大减少湿身心情惩罚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pale Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is rather pale."
msgstr "你的皮肤很苍白。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick-Skinned"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is tough.  Cutting and bashing damage is slightly reduced for you.  There's a small chance you don't cut yourself on sharp terrain."
msgstr "你的皮肤组织比普通人更加坚韧。略微减少对你受到的钝击和斩击伤害，同时降低在通过尖锐地形时割伤自己的几率。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Peeling Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin keeps peeling in big flakes, like you're recovering from a bad sunburn.  Oddly, it doesn't hurt at all."
msgstr "你的皮肤出现了大块脱皮的症状，就好像经历过严重的晒伤一样。但很奇怪，这一点也不疼。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Sensitivity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin simply cannot handle ultraviolet radiation, such as sunlight.  It will seriously burn you."
msgstr "你的皮肤无法承受阳光中的紫外线辐射，暴露在阳光下会严重灼伤你的皮肤。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gorger"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your stomach can expand quite a bit.  This comes in handy as you tend to swallow food whole."
msgstr "你的胃能大幅扩张，这很管用，因为你往往会把食物整个吞下去。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rabbit Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your stubby tail has become fuzzy and more round, but doesn't seem to serve any purpose."
msgstr "你短粗的尾巴变得毛茸茸、圆滚滚，但似乎没有什么实际用途。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radiogenic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your system has adapted to radiation.  While irradiated, you will actually heal slowly, converting the radiation into hit points."
msgstr "你的身体似乎稍微适应了辐射。当你受到辐射时，你将缓慢恢复生命值，将辐射值慢慢转换成生命值。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Poison Resistant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your system is rather tolerant of poisons and toxins, and most will affect you less."
msgstr "你的身体组织对于中和体内有毒物质能力更强，大部分毒素对你效果甚微。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampire Fangs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your teeth are so sharp, you can use them to shave the fur from your victims before you feed.  What's more, anticoagulants in your saliva will keep their blood flowing long after it should have clotted."
msgstr "你的牙齿非常锋利，你可以在喂食之前用它们剃掉受害者的皮毛。  更重要的是，唾液中的抗凝剂可以让血液在应该凝结后很长时间内保持流动。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shark Teeth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your teeth have grown incredibly sharp, and have calcified even further.  In addition to letting you eat much faster, you can use them as a lethal natural weapon, especially in deep water."
msgstr "你的牙齿变得非常锋利，并且进一步钙化。除了让你更快进食，你还可以将它们作为一种致命的天然武器使用，只要你的身体允许。它们也生长得非常快，会时不时随机地脱落。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fangs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your teeth have grown into long, sharp fangs.  If your mouth is uncovered, you'll sometimes bite your enemies."
msgstr "你的牙齿长得又长又尖。当嘴部无遮挡时，你有时会用牙咬人。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human ACCLIMATIZATION"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your temperature tolerance is more or less normal for a human."
msgstr "你的耐热与耐寒能力处于正常人类范围。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Toe Roots"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your toes have grown wriggly, and you can't imagine why you wear that stuff on your feet.  Take it off.  It's in the way."
msgstr "你的脚趾奇葩的蜿蜒着，而你根本想不通你为何会在脚上穿东西。脱下来，它挡到你了。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Barbed Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your tongue can extend halfway to the ground.  It's lined with jagged little teeth, and its spearlike tip can stab with shocking force."
msgstr "你的舌头可以延伸到地面的一半。  它布满了锯齿状的小牙齿，矛状的尖端可以发出令人震惊的力量。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Harpoon Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your tongue can extend much farther and faster, propelled by incredible hydrostatic pressue.  Activate this mutation to harpoon enemies and drag them into melee range."
msgstr "在令人难以置信的静水压力的推动下，您的舌头可以伸展得更远、更快。  激活此突变可以用鱼叉攻击敌人并将其拖入近战范围。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Whipping Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your tongue can extend quite some distance and its tip is incredibly sticky.  It's not the best for talking, but you may use it to snare creatures and pull them towards you."
msgstr "你的舌头可以伸出相当长的距离，而且它的尖端非常粘。  它不太适合说话，但你可以用它来诱捕生物并将它们拉向你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lolling Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your tongue has lengthened and often extends far beyond your mouth.  This makes you a little worse at talking to people."
msgstr "你的舌头拉长了，而且经常伸到嘴以外。这没有效果。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Forked Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your tongue is forked, like that of a reptile.  It softens your inflection, making lying a little easier."
msgstr "你的舌头像蛇一样分叉，除了吓人以外没什么用。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Burrowing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your tough paws allow you to dig through dirt and rubble with ease."
msgstr "你坚硬的爪子可以让你轻松地挖开泥土和瓦砾。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pointed Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your upper earlobes have grown noticeably higher.  Fortunately, they don't get in the way of your headgear, much.  Unfortunately, they also don't seem to help your hearing any."
msgstr "你的耳朵发生了变异，和精灵一般，幸运的是，长长的耳垂并不影响你穿戴头饰。不幸的是，这仅仅是外观上的改变，并不能增强你的听力。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Grotesque"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your visage is disgusting and liable to induce vomiting.  People will not want to interact with you unless they have a very good reason to."
msgstr "你恶心的畸形外表让人看到就有想吐的冲动，除非有非常重要的缘由，人们压根就不愿搭理你。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your vision has become particularly acute: you suspect you could pick out zombies much farther away.  Perception +4."
msgstr "你的视觉非常敏锐，很远距离就能看见丧尸。感知+4"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your voice doesn't sound especially abnormal."
msgstr "你的嗓音并没有什么反常的。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Screeching Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your voice sounds like a bird trying to imitate a human.  It makes it harder to lie, threaten, or convince anyone of anything."
msgstr "你的声音听起来像是一只鸟在模仿人类。说服他人将会更加困难，但恐吓他们会更简单。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shifting Bark (Consolidated)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your warped bark can be shifted in function, and is currently consolidated on your torso.  Activate to shift your bark into a lattice, increasing bulk but providing better protection for the entire body."
msgstr "你所变异出的树皮可以进行功能转化，目前固结在躯干上。激活此变异，将树皮变成网格状，增加累赘，同时为整个身体提供更好的保护。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shifting Bark (Latticed)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your warped bark can be shifted in function, and is currently expanded into a sturdy lattice.  Activate to collapse the lattice, returning to an evenly distributed form."
msgstr "你所变异出的树皮可以进行功能转化，已经扩展开成坚固的网格。激活此变异，将网格回缩，变成更加平均分布的形状。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shifting Bark (Distributed)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your warped bark can be shifted in function, and is currently spread evenly.  Activate to better protect your torso, at the cost of other areas."
msgstr "你所变异出的树皮可以进行功能转化，目前分布均匀。激活此变异，可以以牺牲其他部位为代价，更好地保护躯干。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Web Diver"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your webbing is strong enough to support your weight.  Activate to rappel down any drop you encounter, at the cost of nutrition."
msgstr "你的蛛网很结实，足以支撑你的体重。激活时，通过消耗营养值，让你快速索降至悬崖之下。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Insect Wings (Buzzing)" to
#. "WINGS_INSECT"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your wings go still."
msgstr "你的翅膀静止不动。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fast Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your wounds and broken limbs heal quicker than usual."
msgstr "你的伤口与断肢比常人愈合得更快。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Fast Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your wounds and broken limbs heal very quickly."
msgstr "你的伤口与断肢恢复得非常快。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your wounds heal a little slower than most.  Your HP whilst asleep, as well as your broken limbs, heal at 75% of the regular rate."
msgstr "你的伤口愈合得比大多数人都慢。伤口在睡眠时恢复速度以及折断的四肢的愈合速度是正常人的75%。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Freedom fighter"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> believes in fighting… mostly for others, even at risk to their own wellbeing."
msgstr "<npc_name>执着于为他人而战斗，甚至冒着损害自身利益的风险。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scrooge"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> collects trash like a RPG protagonist collects potions."
msgstr "<npc_name>像RPG游戏里收集药剂一样收集垃圾。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Coward"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> flinches at the thought of fighting, whether it be other people or the undead."
msgstr "<npc_name>一想到战斗就会退缩，无论是与其他人还是不死生物。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Craven"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> is afraid of the dark, spiders, and unexplained sounds.  So are you, but only because you've lived through the apocalypse.  <npc_name> has always been like this."
msgstr "<npc_name> 害怕黑暗、蜘蛛和无法解释的声音。  你也是，但只是因为你经历过世界末日。  <npc_name>一直都是这样。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hero"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> is an ideal ally to those they call friend, always willing to help others."
msgstr "<npc_name>对于那些被他们称为朋友的人来说是一个理想的盟友，总是愿意帮助别人。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Survivor at any cost"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> is certainly a survivor.  You can only wonder how many they've abandoned to save themself."
msgstr "<npc_name> 无疑是幸存者。  你只能想知道他们为了拯救自己而抛弃了多少人。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Volatile"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> is just looking for an excuse."
msgstr "<npc_name>只是在找借口。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Kind"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> just wants to help."
msgstr "<npc_name> 只是想帮忙。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Brave"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> knows the name of fear, but only as a long-defeated foe.  Little can shake them."
msgstr "<npc_name>知道恐惧的名字，但只是作为一个久败的敌人。  没有什么可以动摇他们。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Miser"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> loves their trinkets, and hates giving them away."
msgstr "<npc_name>异常爱惜自己的小玩意，并拒绝把它们交出去。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hardass"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> loves to fight a good fight, but only for themself."
msgstr "<npc_name>喜欢打一场漂亮的仗，但只是为了他们自己。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Self-centered"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> steers every interaction into discussing how it will help them."
msgstr "<npc_name>引导每次互动讨论它将如何帮助他们。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Timid"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> tries to avoid conflict, even when they have good reason not to."
msgstr "<npc_name> 尽量避免冲突，即使他们有很好的理由不这样做"

