msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Actually, I ran into another survivor once - survivalist, total nutcase.  He was headed for a military bunker to try and loot it, guessing that didn't go well.  Anyway, he mentioned a pack of survivors who camped out at a farm around here, some of them actually knew about farming.  There's a chance they're still out there, could be worth looking for."
msgstr "其实我曾经遇到过另一个幸存者——生存主义者，十足的疯子。他去了一个碉堡，试图洗劫它，但我估计结果不会太好。不管怎样，他提到过一群在附近农场定居的幸存者，他们中有不少人知道怎么种地。很可能他们仍然住在那里，值得去看看。"

