msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I found a cell phone a while ago and it started ringing.  I picked it up and just listened.  It was this cook, and they just kept talking on and on about some restaurant and all the good food there and asking to be rescued.  Maybe they were just dialing random numbers?  I don't know.  But they might still be out there, and I wouldn't mind a good meal."
msgstr "我之前发现过一部手机，正当我看到它，它就开始响了。我拿起它，只是听着。对面是个厨师，他只是不停地谈论某家餐馆和那里所有的美食，并且求救。也许他只是随机打的电话？我不知道。但他可能还在那个地方，我不介意吃顿好的。"

