msgid "I was just sittin' in lockup.  They took me in the night before, for a bullshit parole violation.  Assholes.  I was stuck in my cell when the cops all started yelling about an emergency, geared up, and left me in there havin' a <swear> staring contest with a security cam that probably wasn't even on.  I was stuck in there for two god-damn days, with no food and only a little water.  Then this big-ass zombie busted in.  I didn't know what the fuck to think, but if my cam wasn't working, the one in the hall sure was.  Tripped a motion sensor or some shit, alarm started going, and the big dumb fuck turned around to get at it while its arms were still stuck in the cell bars.  Ripped the whole door out."
msgstr "explain"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
msgid "It was just <swear> chaos on the streets, man.  But I'm used to chaos.  You don't live as long as I've lived and not know how to keep away from a fight you can't win.  Biggest worry wasn't the zombies and the monsters, honestly.  But I swear, some cops got a nightstick so far up their ass…  I didn't have time to ditch my orange when stuff kept swipin' at me, and I swear, cops got a look at me, they decided I was the big problem.  Goddamn walking corpse next to me, who do they pick to shoot at?  Pricks."
msgstr "这只是<发誓>街上一片混乱，伙计。  但我已经习惯了混乱。  你活得不像我那么久，而且不知道如何避免一场你无法获胜的战斗。  老实说，最担心的不是僵尸和怪物。  但我发誓，有些警察的屁股上插着警棍……当东西不断向我袭来时，我没有时间扔掉我的橙子，我发誓，警察看了我一眼，他们认为我是个大问题。  我旁边的该死的行尸走肉，他们选择向谁开枪？  刺痛。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
msgid "Lucky you.  How did you get away?"
msgstr "你真幸运。你是怎么逃出来的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
msgid "What were you in for in the first place?"
msgstr "你一开始是因为什么进去的？"

