#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I spent a lot of time rummaging for rhubarb and bits of vegetables in the forest before I found the courage to start picking off some of those dead monsters.  I guess I was getting desperate."
msgstr "我花了很多时间在森林里采集大黄和一些能食用的野菜，直到我鼓起勇气开始翻找那些死去怪物的尸体。我想我那时候是够孤注一掷的。"

