msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "My evac shelter got swarmed by some of those bees, the ones the size of dogs.  I took out a few with a plank, but pretty quick I realized it was either head for the hills or get stuck like a pig.  The rest is history."
msgstr "我的避难所里被那些蜜蜂袭击了，它们体型就像狗一样大。我用一块木板干掉了几只，但很快我就意识到要不赶紧逃到山里，要不就得给它们叮成猪头。接下来的事你都知道了。"

