msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "We're all thinking the same thing, aren't we?  Not much this could be but some kind of secret military bullshit.  At first, I thought it was our own government, but after all that went down, it's just too much.  It must've been the Chinese.  I wonder if those sons of bitches are sitting back home, right as rain, watching us struggling down here and waiting for things to die down."
msgstr "我们都是这么想的，不是吗？这可能不是什么秘密军用狗屁玩意。起初，我以为这是我们自己政府干的，但在一切分崩离析之后，这也太演了。一定是中国佬干的。我不知道那些狗娘养的是不是坐在家里，完全健康，看着我们在这里挣扎，等待情况好转。"

