msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Listen, I know it's incredibly cheesy.  That's D&D for you.  Anyway, something about the tone really got to me.  I knew it was important.  I wasted a little time waffling, then decided to use my outstanding vacation time and skip town for a while.  I packed for the end of the world.  Turns out, I packed the right stuff."
msgstr "听着，我知道这太俗气了。但是D&D就是这样的。不管怎么说，信中的语调确实打动了我。我知道这件事情很重要。我犹豫不决浪费了一些时间，然后决定利用我剩下的假期，暂时离开城镇。我打包好迎接世界末日。结果发现，我做的一切准备都是对的。"

