#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
msgid "What happened when you went out?"
msgstr "你出去的时候发生了什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
