msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I knew the city pretty well.  I went for an abandoned building I knew about, headed through a broken window, and holed up in there for a few days.  I had a fair bit of stolen food and I just kept to myself.  When things started to quiet down, I headed out, and here I am."
msgstr "我对这个城市很熟悉。我跑到我所知道的一幢废弃建筑里，从一扇破窗里钻了进去，呆了几天。我在那里存了一些偷来的食物，我就自己一个人呆着。当事情开始平静下来，我就离开了，然后我就在这里了。"

