msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Kinda, I guess.  I heard people blaming the riots on some kind of mind control drug, and frankly I'm not sure that's far off base.  That's kinda what it felt like, although the whole time I really felt like myself.  It wasn't until I snapped out of it that I realized how weird it was.  That doesn't explain anything else though: the zombies, the monsters, all this stuff is way off base.  Anything I've tried to guess just sounds like bad science fiction, like demonic curses or alien weapons kinda stuff."
msgstr "我想某种程度上是吧。我听到有人把暴乱归咎于某种精神控制药物，说实话，我觉得这理论并不离谱。这就是我的感觉，虽然全程中我感觉还能控制自己。直到我猛地惊醒过来，我才意识到整件事情有多奇怪。不过，这并不能解释其他的一切：丧尸，怪物，以及那些离谱的东西。我所能想到的任何解释听起来都像是糟糕的科幻小说，像是恶魔的诅咒或者外星人的武器之类的东西。"

