#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
msgid "Those rioters had a reputation for being absolutely psycho."
msgstr "那些暴徒确实像是疯子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
msgid "What made you come back?"
msgstr "是什么让你回头的？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Yeah, you're telling me.  The rioters… they weren't even like humans, let alone protesters.  Nothing like any protest I'd ever been in before.  That didn't stop me.  I joined them, and I was as bad as a bunch of them.  Smashed windows, beat up bystanders, burnt cars.  I remember ripping riot gear off a cop and… nevermind.  I don't want to remember that."
msgstr "是啊，你说得对。那些暴乱者...他们根本不像人，更别说是抗议者了。完全不像我以前参加过的任何抗议活动。但这并没有阻止我。我加入了他们，变得和他们一样糟糕。砸碎窗户，殴打旁观者，烧毁汽车。我记得我曾经把一个警察的防暴装备全部撕下来……算了，我不想回忆起那些事情。"

