#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Before <the_cataclysm>, I was just a regular meteorologist.  I worked for the local weather station doing data analysis and stuff.  In general, ordinary boredom.  In my free time I was studying electronics and radio engineering, a bit for work but mostly just as a hobby.  When the riots got serious, my neighborhood was looking pretty sketchy.  I gathered all my things that I managed to carry with me and settled in a radio station that seemed abandoned.  I lived there for a while, doing all sorts of nonsense, until I met you.  I guess you know the rest."
msgstr "在<the_cataclysm>以前，我只是个普通的气象学家。我在当地气象站做数据分析之类的工作。总的说，普通得无聊。在我的空闲时间，我学了电子学和无线电工程，有些小作品，但主要只是作为一种爱好。暴乱变得越来越严重，而我的邻居看起来很诡异。我把随身携带的东西都收集起来，安顿在一个似乎被遗弃的无线电塔里。我在那里住了一段时间，把时间浪费在各种蠢事上，直到遇见你。我想剩下的你都知道了。"

