msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm not stupid.  I know they're gone.  Who knows where… maybe in an evac shelter, maybe in a FEMA camp.  Most of everyone is dead."
msgstr "我没那么傻。我知道他们走了。谁知道在哪……也许在紧急避难所里，也许在联邦应急管理局营地里。但大多数人都死了。"

