msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I know it's nuts.  It sounds like fake amnesia from a Bugs Bunny cartoon.  See?  How can I know that, but not remember how I know it?  Like, I remember Bugs Bunny but I don't remember any time I sat down and watched a Bugs Bunny show."
msgstr "我知道这很疯狂。听起来像是兔巴哥动画里的假健忘症。看吧，怎么我认识兔巴哥，却不记得我是什么时候认识它的？就像，我记得兔巴哥，但我不记得我什么时候坐下来看过任何一场兔巴哥的动画。"

