#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
msgid "You're asking me what I think caused all this?  It was all over the news.  Some kind of Chinese bio-weapon.  It's no different from the pandemic a few years back, but this time they got the formula right.  Maybe too right.  Doesn't matter anyway, I hear it got out on them and wiped them out too.  Serves em right."
msgstr "你在问我是什么导致了这一切？新闻上到处都是。某种中国生物武器。这与几年前的新冠病毒大流行没有什么不同，但看来这次他们的配方用对了。也许太对了。反正没关系，我听说这病毒对他们也有效，把他们全都干掉了。他们活该。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_5.json
msgid "Fair enough.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "有道理。<end_talking>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_5.json
msgid "I can respect that.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "我可以尊重这一点。<done_conversation_section>"

