msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Let's not talk about it, ok?  It just hurts to think about.  I've lost so many people… and I'm sure you have too.  Let's focus on the here and now."
msgstr "我们别谈它了，好吗？想想就头疼。我已经失去了那么多人……我相信你也有。让我们精力集中在此时，此刻。"

