msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "She took sick a few hours after we left the lake.  Puking, complaining about her joints hurting.  I took us to a little shop I knew about on the riverside, hoping they might have something to help or at least know what was going on."
msgstr "我们离开湖边几个小时后，她就生病了。呕吐，抱怨她浑身关节疼。我带她去了河边一家我认识的小商店，希望他们能帮点忙，或者至少知道发生了什么事。"

