#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that LMOE shelter"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Any luck finding the LMOE shelter?"
msgstr "找到那个LMOE避难所了吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Are you sure?  It kind of feels like it might be yours by the way you're acting…"
msgstr "你确定吗？从你的行迳看，感觉上那好像就是你的……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "But we're good to go, right?  I mean… the door is the only trick you had?  No clever traps hidden in the walls or anything?"
msgstr "但我们已经准备好了吧？我的意思是，这道门就是你唯一的小秘密？没有墙里的秘密陷阱之类的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "But you DID leave your computer unprotected.  AND full of evidence.  It's exactly what a government agent would need to track you down…  Someone like me…"
msgstr "但是你确实遗下了你那台已经解锁，而且装满了证据的电脑。而那正是追踪你的政府特工——像我这样的——所需要的……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "C'mon, you would do the same!  It's life or death out here!"
msgstr "得了吧，你也会这么做的！现在是生死攸关的时候！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Check out that LMOE shelter"
msgstr "探访那个LMOE避难所"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Could you tell me that story again?"
msgstr "你能再说一遍那个故事吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that LMOE shelter"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Damn, can't believe we finally made it.  I was smart enough not to store anything that might rot, so as long as nobody else already broke in, I bet there's at least two weeks of good food just sitting there.  Pristine workshop down there, too.  It cost me a pretty penny to get built.  I could tell you all about it sometime if you ever wanted.  Anyway, thanks for helping me get back here.  It sure ain't safe to travel on your own anymore."
msgstr "天啊，不敢相信我们真的做到了。我聪明地只选择储存不会腐烂的事物，所以只要这里没有在我们进入之前被其他人侵入，我打赌会有两周的完好的食物等待着我们。下面还有一台崭新的工作台，花了我不少的钱来修建。如果哪天你想听，我可以把它相关的事情全告诉你。不管怎么说，感谢你帮助我回到这里。你孤身一人在旅途上确实很不安全。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Did you get there?"
msgstr "你到那里了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Dozens, they told me.  Probably more by the end of it.  But they obviously didn't say where or who for.  It was kind of a hot business and I think they were some of the best doing it."
msgstr "几十个，他们说的。最终数字应该更多。但他们明显没说造在哪里、顾客又是谁。避难所当时是热门生意，我觉得他们是那一行里最优秀的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Finders, keepers."
msgstr "我找到的就是我的了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "For all I know, you COULD have something to do with this.  Who really knows what happened?"
msgstr "以我所知，你*可能*和这事有关。谁知道发生了什么呢？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Hey, uh…  I noticed you left a computer down in your shelter.  I didn't intend to pry, but you said I could go through everything.  So, I read a little of what you wrote.  You wanna talk about it?"
msgstr "嘿，呃……我注意到你在你的庇护所里留下了一台电脑。我并不打算窃听，但你说我可以翻阅所有的东西。所以，我读了一点你写的东西。你想谈谈吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "High-tech armor?  And there's a whole group of them down in a bunker?  Probably best to keep people like that on our good side.  What they're saying seems to check out.  Reality does seem pretty fucked.  Kinda makes me wonder how involved THEY were if they know all that, though."
msgstr "高科技装甲？而且他们还有一整群在地堡里？也许把那些人往好的方面想，他们说的似乎是应验了，毕竟现实看起来确实操蛋。然而，令我怀疑的是，若他们明知这一切，那\"他们\"究竟掺合了多少。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Hmm, good point."
msgstr "emmm，有道理。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Honestly, it doesn't matter who opened up what portal to wherever.  Extraterrestrial monster?  Engineered bio-weapon?  Three children standing on each others' shoulders in an alien Halloween costume?  I'll blast 'em either way."
msgstr "老实说，谁打开了到哪里的什么传送门都没有关系。外星怪物？工程生物武器？三个穿着外星万圣节服装的孩子站在彼此的肩膀上？无论是什么，我都会炸飞他们。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Honestly, it's probably aliens.  I can't really think of another reasonable explanation for all of this."
msgstr "老实说，那可能是外星人。对于这一切，我实在想不出另一个合理的解释。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "How many of these places did the company build?"
msgstr "那个公司建造了多少个这样的避难所？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "I can't accept that.  Everything was just fine for a while, but the bad started some years ago, with bad people doing bad things.  I think we all knew it was gonna end one way or another.  But there's got to be some sort of deeper explanation for… this!  Someone is responsible!"
msgstr "我无法接受。一开始还好，但几年前罪恶肇始，接着便是恶人做尽恶事。我想我们都知道这会以某种方式结束。但这事……必须有一些更深入的解释！某些人得负责！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "I could go check out that shelter for you if you like.  Bring back any supplies you left behind?"
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，我可以帮你去看看那个避难处。要顺便帮你把留在那里的补给品带回来吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "I don't think there's any explanation.  Sometimes bad things just happen."
msgstr "我不认为有任何解释。有时坏事就这么发生了。"

