#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "I know this might seem weird but… your shelter wasn't on the way out of town, was it?  A hole in the ground, surrounded by trees?  Full of supplies with a sign out front that says 'I'm gonna shoot you'?"
msgstr "我知道这似乎很奇怪，但是……你的庇护所并不在出城的路上，对吗？一个地洞，周围都是树？装满了物资，门前挂着一个牌子，上面写着\"我要枪毙你\"？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "I marked the spot for you.  When you get there, pry off the metal above the door and you'll see the special latch I made to keep thieves out.  I trust you to make the right decisions."
msgstr "我给你标记了地点。当你到达那里时，撬开门上的金属，你会看到我为防止小偷进入而制作的特殊门闩。我相信你会做出正确的选择。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "I might not have 'real' authority anymore, and we might not have a real 'society', but it's still not nice to make fat jokes…"
msgstr "我可能不再有\"真正\"的权力，也许我们也没有了真正的\"社会\"，但乱开玩笑终归不好……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
