#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "I refuse to believe things are just random.  Especially this!  The dead don't start rising all over the world for no reason!"
msgstr "我拒绝相信事情只是随机的。尤其是这件事！死人不会无缘无故地在世界各地一起复活！"

