msgid "I'm sorry.  I guess I just didn't know how to tell you I needed what was in it."
msgstr "抱歉。我想我只是不知该怎么告诉你我需要里面的东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  I'm sure we can find lots of stuff to replace whatever I took."
msgstr "我很抱歉。我相信我们可以找到很多东西来替代我拿走的东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "I'm tired of talking.  Let's get moving and put that truth together for ourselves…"
msgstr "我已经厌倦了聊天。走吧，我们把真相拼到一起，为了我们自己……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more that I see, the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want this, but if you're a brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr "我试着努力不去想它，但你可能是对的。我看到的越多，我能解释的就越少。我不知道为什么人类会想要这个，但如果你是一个吸食大脑的外星人，这就是你要去的地方。"

