msgid "Interesting…"
msgstr "有意思……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "It IS a good place to stay safe.  Just don't go prying, okay?"
msgstr "这里*确实*是个安全的地方。只是不要到处摸来摸去，好吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "It's an invasion.  Or, at least, I think that's what they were trying to do at first.  Sudden bouts of violence, sending agitators to riots, doing false flags with covert and overt agents alike…  When they couldn't get what they wanted, they went full 'scorched earth'.  They decided to destroy everything instead."
msgstr "这是一场入侵。或者说，我认为他们至少一开始试着这样做。想想看，突发的暴力事件，被煽动的骚乱，由公开的或者不公开的特工之类的人打着假旗号……当他们得不到自己想要的，他们就宁愿一切化为\"焦土\"。他们决定摧毁一切。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
