msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Just don't lie about it.  I understand your life was probably in danger.  I can see past that.  Trust me, I've been in sticky situations before.  Tell the truth next time."
msgstr "别撒谎。我知道你可能命悬一线。我看得到过去。相信我，麻烦事儿我经历过太多了。下次可得实话实说。"

