#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Let's get moving.  I feel like it's useless worrying who they are when they're some of the only friends we've got…"
msgstr "那走吧。我觉得担心他们是谁没有用，因为他们是我们唯一的朋友……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Let's just keep moving.  We don't have time for this nonsense…"
msgstr "继续前进吧。咱们没有时间胡说八道……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Let's keep moving.  This is a topic for another day, when we've actually found some answers…"
msgstr "我们继续前进吧。这是另一天的话题，当我们真正找到一些答案时……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Let's not dwell on it.  I'm ready to get a move on…"
msgstr "咱们别再沉湎于此了。我准备继续前行……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Maybe the explanation is more scientific.  Zombies and flesh-eating monsters only come from supervillains and gods in fiction."
msgstr "也许这种解释更科学。丧尸和食人怪物只会来自小说中的大反派和神灵。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Check out that LMOE shelter"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Maybe there's something left in that LMOE shelter you heard about."
msgstr "也许你之前听说过的那间LMOE避难所里还能剩些东西。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Maybe.  I guess multiple things could be possible.  You really don't think that there's someone or something behind this?  Someone who flew a little too close to the sun?  Poked the beast?"
msgstr "也许吧。我猜各种情况都是有可能的。你真的不认为这背后有某些人或事物吗？某些\"飞得太靠近太阳\"的人？触犯了禁忌？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "My… what do you mean?  How would YOU know what the sign says?"
msgstr "我的……你是什么意思？你怎么会知道牌子上写的是什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "No, I barely got two miles.  I crashed into some kind of hell-spawn bio-weapon, a crazy screeching <monster> made of arms and legs and heads from all sorts of creatures, humans too.  I think I killed it, but I know for sure I killed the truck.  Grabbed my duffel bag and ran, after putting a couple bullets into it for good measure.  I hope I never see something like that again."
msgstr "不，我只跑出了两英里。我撞上了一种来自地狱的中国佬的生物武器，一头疯狂尖叫的<monster>，它是由各种生物包括人类的手臂、腿和头部组成的怪物。我想我也许杀了它，但可以肯定的是皮卡被我撞坏了。我拿起行李袋就跑了，当然离开前给那家伙额外补了几颗子弹。我希望我再也不要见到那样的东西了。"

