#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "No, you're right!  I'm sorry for intruding!"
msgstr "不，你是对的！我很抱歉！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Nope, that's it.  Got the idea for the door from a book on medieval castles, in case you were wondering.  But instead of a counterweight holding a drawbridge up, I just ram a hex key in a hole."
msgstr "只有这个。一本关于中世纪城堡的书告诉我的。不过没有用来拉起吊桥的配重，只有插进孔里的六角匙。"

