#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Possibly, but we can never know for sure.  Sometimes bad things gather into uncontrollable avalanches."
msgstr "可能吧，但我们永远无法确定。有时坏事的聚集会陷入失控的崩溃。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Prepare to meet your end, <npc_name>.  *Attack <npc_name>.*"
msgstr "准备好迎接你的末日吧，<npc_name>。*攻击<npc_name>*"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Right…"
msgstr "好吧……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Scared?  Yeah, that's fair.  I wouldn't say it's a friendly world out here.  Still, it's best to be friends.  Anyone that prepared for the apocalypse is probably armed to the teeth anyway."
msgstr "害怕？是的，这很正常。我没法说这是一个友好的世界。不过，最好还是和他们交个朋友。无论如何，任何为世界末日做准备的人或许都是全副武装的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
