msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "That's what I'm saying!  Everything that's going on wouldn't be possible without massive fuck-ups by people in power.  China has fusion reactors?  Well, I've never seen it!  America sinks trillions and trillions of dollars into secret military budgets with no explanation.  If you gave me a trillion dollars and the brain of a bureaucrat, I bet I could completely fuck up reality, too."
msgstr "这就是我要说的！若非当权者出了大纰漏，绝不可能有正在发生的这一切。中国有聚变反应堆吗？好，我从未见过！美国在没有任何解释的情况下将数万亿美元投入秘密军事预算。如果你给我一万亿美元和一颗官僚的脑子，我赌我也能彻底把现实搞砸。"

