msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "The shelter?  Bought the land pretty cheap.  I hired a contractor to build the thing but did the door myself.  Metal pin in the door frame.  Can't open unless you remove it.  There's a little pulley inside you have to pull up to reset.  They made dozens of these in the area, and I couldn't sleep knowing just any <name_b> at that company could waltz in as soon as shit hit the fan.  They'd know exactly where to go and what to do!  Nah… how do you think I've made it this long?  Always keep a trick up your sleeve."
msgstr "庇护所？我买了一块很便宜的土地，雇了一个承包商来建造这个东西，但自己做了门。门框上有金属销。除非你把它移开，否则无法打开。里面有一个小滑轮，你必须拉起来才能复位。他们在该地区制造了几十个这种建筑，我知道那家公司的任何<name_b>都可以在出事后马上大摇大摆地进来，我就睡不着觉。他们完全知道该去哪里，该做什么！嘛……你认为我是怎么做到这么久的？袖子里总要留一招。"

