#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "The wall thing is pretty nifty, I have to admit."
msgstr "这个隐藏墙真巧妙，我必须承认。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "The whole front door had been blown off and everything had been looted.  Nothing left.  It seemed like something major had happened, that's all."
msgstr "整个前门都被炸掉了，所有东西被洗劫一空，什么都没留下。看起来像是发生了什么大事，就是这样。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "There was a bunch of notes about Chinese bio-weapons and this guy who worked at an airport…  If you want to talk about it, we can."
msgstr "有一堆关于中国生化武器和这个在机场工作家伙的笔记……如果你愿意，我们可以谈谈。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "There was a dead guy inside.  It didn't take much to make that connection."
msgstr "里面有一个死人，不费吹灰之力就能联想到发生了什么。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "They were talking a LOT in that time, that's for sure."
msgstr "那段时间他们谈论了\"很多\"，这是十分肯定的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "This is the world now.  If I didn't take it, someone else would have."
msgstr "这就是现在的世界。如果我不拿，别人也会拿。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Those bad people are probably all dead now.  If bad things continue to happen, it's just the nature of the universe.  Entropy and chaos are the natural order of things."
msgstr "那些恶人估计现在都死了。若恶事继续发生，那就是宇宙本性。熵与混沌乃万物天然之道。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "We should keep moving…  No sense dwelling on fate.  If those people are right, then this is all we've got: survival."
msgstr "我们应该继续前进……纠结于命运毫无意义。如果那些人是对的，那么我们所要追求的一切就是：生存。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Well, I certainly wouldn't tell you.  The way you talk… the questions you ask… they're extremely suspicious.  Why did you ask about the shelter anyway?  What do you want from me?"
msgstr "我是不会告诉你的。你说话的方式……你问的问题……都非常可疑。话说回来，为什么你要问避难所的事情？你想要我的什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Well, I got inside one and found a computer with a bunch of… conspiracy theory documents?  I'm not sure how to put it.  It seemed like whoever wrote it wasn't doing well."
msgstr "好吧，我进去了，发现一台电脑里有一堆……阴谋论文件？我不知道该怎么说。看起来不管是谁写的，都不是很好。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Well, let's get going.  I'm trying to stick it to 'The Man' while we've still got a chance."
msgstr "好了，咱们开始吧。我现在得试着揭竿而起，在我们还有机会的时候。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  How…  Why…  I was still trying to get back there, surviving and struggling just like you!  How would you feel if I came and stole all YOUR stuff right when you needed it most?!"
msgstr "好吧，这也是说\"去你妈的\"一种方式！为什么……为什么……我那时还在试图回到那边，像你一样生存和挣扎！如果我在你最需要的时候偷你所有的东西，你会有什么感觉？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
