#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Well…  I did.  And that's just how it goes.  It wasn't even that difficult."
msgstr "嗯……是我干的。就是这样，甚至比我想象的还要简单。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Well… I'm actually a government agent sent to assassinate you.  I just had to find out the location of your secret stash before I took you out!"
msgstr "嗯……我实际上是被派去暗杀你的政府特工。在我带你出去之前，我只需要找出你秘密藏匿处的位置！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "What about your shelter?"
msgstr "你的避难所呢？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "What do you mean?  Who is 'they'?"
msgstr "你是什么意思？\"他们\"是谁？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "What do you think happened?  You must have some interesting theories on why everything went to shit."
msgstr "你认为发生了什么？你一定有一些有趣的理论来解释为什么一切都变糟了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "你怎么了？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "What, like some secret Batcave?  Pull back the curtain and it turns out I'm the communist <name_b> who brewed up a demon bio-weapon in their basement?  I just gave you food, all the tools in my workshop, and the safest hole in the ground in the county.  If I've got any secrets left, they're mine to keep."
msgstr "什么，秘密蝙蝠洞那种东西吗？揭开帘幕，发现我是在地下室里制造恶魔生物武器的康米特务<name_b>？我刚给了你食物、工坊里的全部工具，还有全县最安全的地方，如果我还有什么秘密的话，我也不会告诉你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
