#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Why else would I ask about your shelter?  I don't need your gear.  I don't need your help.  Look around you!  I'm tracking down the last free thinkers who have been putting the puzzle pieces together.  It's YOU I'm after!"
msgstr "我为什么要问你庇护所的事情？我不需要你的装备，我不需要你的帮助。看看你周围！我在寻找最后一批能够把这一切谜题的拼图完成的自由思考者。我要的是你！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Why not?  Now that it's all finally come to a head, maybe some of your theories are right."
msgstr "为什么不？现在一切终于到了紧要关头，也许你的某些理论是正确的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm just messing with you, don't worry.  What, can't take a joke?"
msgstr "是的，我只是在逗你，别担心。什么，不能开玩笑吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Yeah, but they put the secret room in their advertising.  Not really a secret then, is it?"
msgstr "嗯，但他们把秘密房间写在广告里了。这样一来就不再是秘密了，不是吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Yeah, it does seem a little grim…  Let's keep moving for now."
msgstr "是，这看来确实有点严峻……咱们现在继续前进吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Yeah, listen, just keep your questions to yourself.  I don't trust you and you shouldn't trust me, either."
msgstr "是啊，听着：不要把你的问题问出来。我不信任你，你也不应该信任我。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Yeah…?  I didn't realize it bothered you so much."
msgstr "啊……？我没有意识到这如此困扰你。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "You approach the LMOE and do as you were told, prying back a thin piece of metal atop the doorframe, revealing an opening.  You reach inside and grab a handle attached to a wire, pull hard on it, and hear a heavy metal *clunk*.  The door is open."
msgstr "你走近LMOE，按照别人告诉你的方法去做，撬开门框顶部的一块薄薄的金属，门上露出了一个开口。你把手伸到里面，抓住一个绑在电线上的把手，用力拉出来，然后你听到了沉闷的金属碰撞声，门开了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<acknowledged>"
#. ~ Generic acknowledgment of a command.  Comes up a lot and could use more
#. variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "You got it."
msgstr "没问题。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "You know, the elites.  The ones who have always had control will continue having control, no matter what it costs.  If it means destroying everything to be king of the ashes, they'll do it.  I used to think it was China, for sure, but I'm not so sure anymore.  I figured they would probably be here by now, putting on their crown.  Maybe they're still waiting to make their move…"
msgstr "你知道的，那些精英。那些已经掌权的人们想要继续掌控权力，不管花费什么代价。如果继续做人上人意味着先把一切毁灭殆尽而成为灰土上的王，他们也会去做的。我曾经认为是中国做了这些，但我现在不太确定了。我想他们也许现在就要在这片焦土上戴上他们的王冠，亦或者他们还没决定采取行动……"

