#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "You said you could tell me more about the shelter if I wanted.  How did these things get built?"
msgstr "你说过，如果我愿意，你可以告诉我更多关于庇护所的情况。这些东西是如何建成的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "You sure do."
msgstr "你当然知道。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "You think that's funny?!  Some of us watched the warning signs for years.  All the news, all the violence and the secret plots…  Now the dead are walking, reality itself is tearing apart, and you're making jokes like that?!"
msgstr "你觉得这很好笑？！我们中的一些人多年来一直关注这些警告信号。所有的新闻，所有的暴力和秘密的阴谋……现在死者正在行走，现实本身正在撕裂，你还开这样的玩笑？！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "You wouldn't keep ALL your tricks and secrets from me, though, would you?  After everything we've been through?"
msgstr "你不会一点秘密都不告诉我吧？在我们经历了这么多之后？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
