#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "Thanks!  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "谢谢！<done_conversation_section>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "Thanks!  <end_talking>"
msgstr "谢谢！<end_talking>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "Thanks!  What was it you were saying before?"
msgstr "谢谢！你刚刚说了什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "Whatever's in that map benefits both of us."
msgstr "地图上的东西对我们都有好处。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "Why did you leave your bunker?"
msgstr "你为什么离开你的地堡？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "Yeah, I do.  I'd be willing to part with them for, say, $1000.  Straight from your ATM account, no cash cards."
msgstr "是的，我有。我愿意需要，嗯，1000美元来说出这个故事。直接从ATM帐户走，现金卡可不行。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "[$1000] You have a deal."
msgstr "[1000$]成交了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
msgid "Assault charges.  I really don't want to get into it, let's just say that you don't want to talk during a movie around me okay?"
msgstr "故意伤害指控。我真的不想谈这件事，这么说吧，当我在看电影的时候你不会想要在我身边说话的，好吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
msgid "Did that actually work?"
msgstr "计划真的成功了么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
msgid "How did you get out of lockup?"
msgstr "那你是怎么从监狱逃出来的？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
msgid "I got a little bit into black market organ trading.  It sounds worse than it was… but it was pretty bad."
msgstr "我被稍稍卷入了黑市器官交易。听起来可能比实际更糟……但实际也很糟。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I heard gunshots, even from down in lockup.  Didn't hear much screaming or anything.  That was my first clue something was up.  Food stopped showing up, next.  Then, the lights went out.  I was down there for maybe hours, maybe days, when finally a flashlight in the bars blinded me.  It was a guard.  He let me out, filled me in on what was going on.  I wanted to think he was crazy, but something in his eyes… I believed him."
msgstr "我听到了枪声，即便是在禁闭室里都能听到的枪声。并没听到多少尖叫声什么的。我第一反应是肯定出了什么事。接着，食物不再送过来了。然后灯灭了。我在那里面呆了几个小时，甚至几天，最后一道铁栏外的手电筒几乎晃瞎了我。是个警卫。他把我放了出来，告诉我发生了什么事。我当时以为他疯了，但他那种眼神……我相信了他。"

