msgid "It worked better than I'd imagined, honestly.  We thought the bots would shoot the lockers but I guess they mistook us for family.  There were six of us and four of them, and four of us made it out."
msgstr "比我想象的要好得多。我们以为机器人会朝储物柜开火，但我想它们把我们错误的当成同伴了。我们有六个人，对面有四个机器人，最后我们有四个人活着出来了。"

