msgid "Tax evasion.  I was an accountant, and I helped my boss move a hell of a lot of money in some very clever ways.  Not clever enough, it turns out…"
msgstr "逃税。我是一名会计师，我用一些非常聪明的方式帮我的老板转移了一大笔钱。但聪明得还不够，结果就这样了……"

