#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rescue_pilot_1.json
msgid "I can see where this is going."
msgstr "我不知道你要说什么了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rescue_pilot_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I don't really know what I believe.  It's too sad to think about.  I just wanted to help people, and I wonder, how many of the crazies out there were just like me before it got to them?  A lot of them - the zombies, too - they must have been good people, once.  It's too bad.  Too bad…"
msgstr "我真的不知道我相信什么。  想起来也太悲伤了。  我只是想帮助人们，我想知道，在这件事发生之前，有多少像我一样的疯子？  他们中的很多人——还有僵尸——他们一定曾经是好人。  太糟糕了。  太糟糕了…"

