msgid "I was a SAR pilot - that's Search And Rescue.  I used to help out with lost hikers, mostly.  Pick 'em up and fly 'em back to the hospital, or if someone got hurt out in the boonies, you know."
msgstr "我是一名搜寻与援救飞行员。  我过去常常帮助迷路的徒步旅行者。  把他们抱起来然后飞回医院，或者如果有人在郊区受伤，你知道的。"

