msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Well when the riots got worse, or I guess before that, we were all run pretty ragged.  Lots of car crashes, uh, violence, which is weird thinking about it now.  The hospitals were filling up, but not 'cause of a pandemic, not like COVID anyway.  Everybody was just running wild, beating on each other, shootouts.  The hospital looked like Fallujah or something, everyone all banged up, bleeding out in the waiting rooms.  Then there wasn't any more room, and they didn't have time to start burying dead people before they started getting back up…  So the army rolled in with like, jeeps and a tank and everything.  Took over the whole operation.  A lot more people died."
msgstr "好吧，当骚乱变得更严重时，或者我猜在那之前，我们都衣衫褴褛。  很多车祸，呃，暴力，现在想起来很奇怪。  医院人满为患，但不是因为大流行，也不像新冠病毒那样。  每个人都疯狂奔跑，互相殴打，枪战。  医院看起来就像费卢杰之类的，候诊室里的每个人都受伤了，流血了。  然后就没有更多的空间了，他们在开始恢复之前没有时间开始埋葬死者……所以军队开着吉普车、坦克和一切东西开进来。  接管了整个行动。  更多人死亡。"

