#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rescue_pilot_1.json
msgid "What about when things went bad?"
msgstr "那要是丧尸以外的东西呢？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rescue_pilot_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Yeah, for sure.  They mostly weren't any better.  It was just like…I thought I knew what hate was, you know?  But it was demonic, how people started acting, and I don't say that lightly.  I just wish we'd realized sooner that it wasn't them, it was…I don't know, something that got into everybody, brought all the zombies back to life.  Demonic, like I said."
msgstr "是的，当然。  他们大多情况并没有好转。  就像……我以为我知道仇恨是什么，你知道吗？  但这是恶魔般的，人们开始行动的方式，我不会轻易这么说。  我只是希望我们早点意识到那不是他们，而是……我不知道，某种东西进入了每个人的体内，让所有的僵尸复活了。  恶魔，就像我说的。"

