#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_2.json
msgid "I mean, if you find anything related to all this that falls under the theoretical physics banner, I could probably help you decipher it and maybe explain it a bit.  To do more, like construct functioning models and such, I'd need a safe lab of my own, with quite a lot of fancy gear, and a reliable power grid.  I think that's a long way down the road."
