msgid "Yeah, in hindsight it maybe wasn't the best choice of dates, huh?  I admit I had cold feet though.  Anyway we were getting hitched at the church.  Lucky for me I was late to the ceremony… I guess some of the fresher corpses in the graveyard had gotten up and started harassing the party."
