#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "A soft breeze rolls across this pool of sand, rippling it in gentle waves."
msgstr "一股轻柔的微风吹过这滩沙子，把它轻轻地吹出波浪。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "Among the solid wall of glass book spines, there is a single empty space."
msgstr "一个空位出现在由一堆玻璃书本组成的实心墙壁上。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "Leave."
msgstr "转身离开。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "Place the glass sailboat in the pool."
msgstr "将玻璃帆船放入池水中。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "Place the glass storybook among the others."
msgstr "将玻璃故事书放在其他故事书中。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "Plant the withered apple in the soil."
msgstr "把干瘪的苹果种在土里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "Reassemble the doll."
msgstr "重新组装玩偶。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "Repairing the doll is easier than you thought.  The mismatched parts fit together easily, and soon it is whole again."
msgstr "修复这个娃娃比你想象的要容易。那些不匹配的部分很容易就能组装在一起，不久之后，它又变得完整了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "Sitting among the glass cushions of the couch is the only thing among all the glass which is soft; the limbless, faceless torso of a worn plush doll.  It is warm to the touch, but it doesn't feel right to pick it up while it's so damaged."
msgstr "一个只剩下躯干的破旧毛绒娃娃端坐在沙发的玻璃垫子上，在玻璃的包围中，它是其中唯一柔软的东西。它摸起来很暖和，但它已经破损得这么严重了，你似乎没有什么理由需要拿走它。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "The boat would sink immediately in water.  On the denser sand, it finds a balance, and the breeze stirs it to life."
msgstr "如果这是水，那这艘船会立即沉下去。然而在密度更大的沙子上，它找到了平衡，一阵微风轻轻吹动着它。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "The book slots in among the rest, and you can no longer see the difference.  Maybe there isn't any."
msgstr "这本书夹在其他书中间，你再也看不出它们有什么不同了。也许它们本就没有什么不同。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "The soil yields easily, as if welcoming your contribution.  The rotten shell of the apple crumbles away, and the seeds sparkle as the dirt covers them."
msgstr "土壤好像很喜欢你的举动，变得很“肥沃”。苹果腐烂的果肉破碎了，种子在泥土的覆盖下闪闪发光。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "You find something new in your inventory."
msgstr "你在你的物品栏里发现了新的东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/vitrified_farm.json
msgid "You pick up the soft little thing, and feel a strong urge to hug it."
msgstr "你捡起了这个柔软的小家伙，突然感到一股想要拥抱它的强烈欲望。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/xedra_merc.json
msgid ""
"An almost human voice erupts in your mind:\n"
"\"FREE ME!\""
msgstr ""
"一种类似人类的声音闯入了你的脑海中：\n"
"\"放了我！\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/xedra_merc.json
msgid "As you approach you feel compelled to touch the creature encased in glass.  The corpse inside is screaming, it needs your help."
msgstr "当你走近时，你觉得有必要去触摸那个被玻璃包裹的生物。里面的那具身体在尖叫，它需要你的帮助。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/xedra_merc.json
msgid "Back away."
msgstr "后退。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/xedra_merc.json
msgid "Say: \"Is someone there?\""
msgstr "说：“有人在这里吗？”"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/xedra_merc.json
msgid "Touch it."
msgstr "触摸它。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/xedra_merc.json
msgid ""
"With a terrible shriek the mercenary falls off the spike and begins to move.  It stares right at you before vanishing.  In the distance you can hear a radio squelch:\n"
"\"Target acquired.  Falling back, regroup and prepare to attack the intruder.\""
msgstr ""
"随着一声可怕的尖叫，一个雇佣兵从尖刺上掉了下来，然后开始移动。它在消失之前一直盯着你，你听到了远处无线电发出的噪声：\n"
"“目标已捕获。撤退，重新集结，准备攻击入侵者。”"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/xedra_merc.json
msgid "You can hear the rushing of boots all around you, and the chattering of radios.  It must still be close and you are their target."
msgstr "你可以看到周围匆匆忙忙移动着的靴子，以及听到周围发出嗡嗡声的无线电。它一定还在你附近，而你是他们的目标。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"BUT, if the spacetime through which the laser has distorted with effects parallel to the beam, the waveforms will be OUT OF PHASE, and the signal amplitude will be lower than normal!\"  There is a diagram of two waves which do not synch up, and a third wave underneath it that is smaller than either of them."
msgstr "“但是，如果激光穿过的时空发生扭曲并影响平行于光束的效果，则波形将异相，并且信号幅度将低于正常值！”  有一个图表，其中两个波不同步，其下方的第三个波比它们中的任何一个都小。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"But what are we measuring???\""
msgstr "“但是我们在测量什么？？？”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"ERROR: file path corrupted.  Please contact your sysadmin.\"  The computer then freezes, and reboots."
msgstr "“错误：文件路径已损坏。请联系您的系统管理员。”  然后计算机冻结并重新启动。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"How does LIXA work?\""
msgstr "你怎样战斗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"LIGO and spatial compression.\""
msgstr "工业压缩机"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"LIXA funding.\""
msgstr "“LIXA 资金。”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"LIXA is based off a proposition for a device called LIGO (Laser Interferometer Gravitational wave Observatory).  It was originally designed to confirm the existence of Gravitational Waves, a spreading distortion in spacetime caused by ultramassive events.  The design has been repurposed for the exciting field of exospatial research, where we already know we can find spatial distortions!\""
msgstr "“LIXA 是基于一种名为 LIGO（激光干涉仪引力波天文台）的装置的提议。它最初的设计目的是为了确认引力波的存在，引力波是由超大质量事件引起的时空扩散扭曲。该设计已被重新用于激动人心的外空研究领域，我们已经知道我们可以在其中发现空间扭曲！”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"LIXA works using the principle of LOCAL EXODIMENSIONAL FLUX, the phenomenon in which ambient spacetime around exospatial breaches moves through the \"portal\".  LIXA is equipped with several LOCAL DIMENSIONAL COMPRESSORS.  These devices turn 'portals' on and off hundreds of times a second, which results in the FLUX repeatedly drawing tiny segments of our local n-space into exospace.  This creates a compression effect, 'storing' an enormous amount of 4d-space in those segments in the neighboring exospace.\""
msgstr "“LIXA 的工作原理是局部外维度通量 (LOCAL EXODIMENSIONAL FLUX) 原理，即外层空间缺口周围的环境时空通过“门户”移动的现象。LIXA 配备了多个局部维度压缩器。这些设备每秒打开和关闭“门户”数百次，导致 FLUX 反复将本地 n 空间的微小片段吸入外层空间。这会产生压缩效果，“存储”大量的邻近外太空中那些部分的 4d 空间。”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"LIXA, or 'Liza' as we like to call her, is the forefront of exospatial research.  It has been confirmed that matter from our local n-space (the 4d coordinates in which we exist) can transit through exodimensions.  But it cannot do it safely!  To understand the behavior of exospace, we must first learn about how it works.\""
msgstr "“LIXA，或者我们喜欢称呼她的‘丽莎’，是外层空间研究的前沿。已经证实，来自我们当地 n 空间（我们存在的 4 维坐标）的物质可以通过外层空间传输。但它不能安全地进行！要了解外层空间的行为，我们必须首先了解它是如何工作的。”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"Laser interferometry is the technique LIXA uses to measure changes in local exospace.  The principle is simple!  A laser is directed down a long, vacuum-sealed chamber for an exact multiple of its wavelength.  It strikes a mirror and returns down another chamber.  If the spacetime through which the laser moved has not changed, the waveforms will be IN PHASE, and the signal will be at full amplitude!\"  Here there is a diagram of two waves, with peaks at the same places, and a third wave beneath them."
msgstr "“激光干涉测量法是 LIXA 用于测量局部外太空变化的技术。原理很简单！激光被引导到一个长的真空密封室，其波长的精确倍数。它撞击镜子并返回到另一个室。如果激光移动的时空没有改变，波形将是同相的，并且信号将处于全振幅！”  这里有两个波浪的图表，峰值位于相同位置，第三个波浪位于它们的下方。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"The compressed n-space 'stored' in local exospace is in segments too small for any exospace flux, but is still IN exospace.  Through repeated frequency alterations, we can 'rotate' the n-space through the infinite n-planes of exospace, and detect the way in which they shift relative to each other.  This is the first step towards countermeasures, and may one day lead to actual safe transit!!!\""
msgstr "“‘存储’在本地外太空中的压缩 n 空间对于任何外太空通量而言都太小，但仍然处于外空间之中。通过重复的频率改变，我们可以通过外太空的无限 n 平面‘旋转’ n 空间，并检测它们相对于彼此移动的方式。这是采取对策的第一步，也许有一天会导致真正的安全传输！！！”"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"What is LIXA?\""
msgstr "干什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "\"What is laser interferometry?\""
msgstr "“什么是激光干涉测量？”"

