#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "The next slide is titled \"But what if?\""
msgstr "下一张幻灯片的标题是“但是如果呢？”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "The screen bears the letters LIXA in big bold font.  Underneath it, in smaller letters, are the words \"Laser Interferometer eXospatial resonance Array\".  The slides are neatly tabulated under grouped headers down the side."
msgstr "屏幕上有大粗体的 LIXA 字母。  在它的下面，用较小的字母写着“激光干涉仪外空间共振阵列”。  幻灯片整齐地排列在侧面分组标题下。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "This computer is somehow still powered; an alarming buzz emanates from its wall plug.  The desktop is cluttered with dozens of unsorted powerpoint files.  After some investigation, you find one labeled \"LAYMAN BRIEFING\"."
msgstr "这台计算机不知何故仍然通电；墙壁插头发出令人震惊的嗡嗡声。  桌面上堆满了数十个未分类的幻灯片文件。  经过一番调查后，您发现一个标有“外行简报”的内容。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "This is a personal computer, the frame around the screen decorated with whale stickers.  It has undergone a severe fault, and its file structure is completely scrambled."
msgstr "这是一台个人电脑，屏幕周围的框架上装饰着鲸鱼贴纸。  它发生了严重的故障，其文件结构完全混乱。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "This is a series of several slides.  All of them contain financial data so full of references to other projects and definitions that it is basically incomprehensible.  It all adds up to a very large amount of money."
msgstr "这是一系列幻灯片。  所有这些都包含财务数据，其中充满了对其他项目和定义的引用，以至于基本上难以理解。  这一切加起来是一笔非常大的钱。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "Title slide."
msgstr "步枪背带"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
msgid "WARNING:  multiple system faults detected!  SHUT DOWN IMMEDIATELY."
msgstr "警告：检测到多个系统故障！  立即关闭。"

