msgid "Hey, you're alive!  Me too.  Been a long while since I've had a conversation.  Uh, with someone else.  Um."
msgstr "嘿，你还活着！我也一样。自从我上次交谈已经过了有一段时间了。呃，和别人一起。呃。"

