msgid "I heard it's bad in the cities, back when the radio was still working.  Some of those things came through here.  I want to stay out in the country if I can stay safe."
msgstr "我听说城里的情况很糟糕，那时候广播还能用。有一些那种东西经过这里了。如果能保持安全，我想待在乡下。"

