msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm a lot better now, I've been hunkering down here.  Something came by in the night screaming and crying, sounded just like that woman.  Maybe a ghost, I don't know.  It's good to have company again.  You're not a ghost, right?  On second thought, don't tell me if you are, I probably don't want to know."
msgstr "我现在好多了，我一直躲在这里。但是夜里总会有人在附近尖叫和哭泣，听起来就像那个女人。也许是鬼魂，我不知道。能再次见到活人可真好。你不是鬼魂，对吗？仔细想想，即使是也别告诉我了，我还是不要知道的好。"

