msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I… um… hid.  I was in the kitchen, preparing another masterpiece when I heard glass shattering followed by screaming.  I ran over to the serving window to see what happened, assuming a guest had fallen and broke something.  What I witnessed was the most awful thing I've ever seen.  I'm not even sure I could go over it again."
msgstr "我……呃……藏起来了。那时候我还在后厨准备大餐，突然听见玻璃破碎和尖叫声，我跑到服务窗口去看看发生了什么事，一开始还以为是有客人摔倒碰坏了什么东西，可我看见的是我一生之中所见过的最可怕的事情。我甚至不太敢回忆它。"

