msgid "Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds: explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  I've been hiding here since."
msgstr "是的。又过了好一阵子一切才平静下来。我听见各种各样的声音：爆炸、飞机、直升机、尖叫、剧烈的枪声。我确信我有次甚至听到了坦克驶过的声音！我一直躲在这里。"

