#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Do you have it?"
msgstr "弄到那东西了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the hydrochloric acid?"
msgstr "弄到盐酸了吗？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Establish A Trade Route"
msgstr "建立贸易路线"

#. ~ Description of mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Establish trade relations between the chemist and a refugee center, and bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr "建立化学家和难民中心之间的贸易关系，并带回一份协议书。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
msgstr "收集一个基础实验室分析工具包"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Find Some Gasoline"
msgstr "收集 100 升汽油"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgstr "收集 15 升盐酸"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Go negotiate a trade agreement."
msgstr "去谈一份贸易协议。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "How does this help me?"
msgstr "这对我有什么好处？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I bet the best place to find that much gas is still a gas station.  Bringing it all here is another problem.  You might want one of those big steel drums we used to use to haul off hazardous waste before <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr "我敢打赌，找到这么多汽油的最佳地点仍然是加油站。但如何把它全部带到这里是另一个问题，你或许想要一个我们在<the_cataclysm>以前用来运走危险废物的大钢桶。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I need 100 liters of gas."
msgstr "我需要 100 升汽油。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I need 15 liters of hydrochloric acid."
msgstr "我需要 15 升盐酸。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I need a basic laboratory analysis kit."
msgstr "我需要一个基础实验室分析工具包。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I was out scavenging recently, and I found one of those old evac shelters.  Turns out the computer was still on and it had an address for a refugee center.  I think my skills might be useful to them, for helping maintain medical supplies and whatnot, so I want you to head over there and see if they're interested.  I'd do it myself, but I need to look after this place."
msgstr "我最近在外面捡拾东西，发现了一个旧的疏散避难所。原来电脑还开着，显示有一个难民中心的地址。我想我的技能可能对他们有用，帮助维持医疗用品供应之类的，所以我希望你去那里看看他们是否感兴趣。我本来打算自己去的，但我需要照顾这个地方。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "I'll be here when you get back.  Good luck!"
msgstr "我会在这里等你回来的。祝你好运！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I'm in a bit of a spot.  I keep a generator around here to power all my scientific equipment.  It has a bit of gas in it, but I've burned through that and I can't use most of my tools without power.  This may seem like a lot, but if you could get me 100 liters of gas, I'll pay you back any way I can."
msgstr "我碰到了点麻烦。我在这里放了一台发电机，为我所有的科学设备供电。它里面本来有一点汽油，但我已经都烧掉了，我的大部分工具都不能在没有电源的情况下使用。这可能看起来很多，但如果你能给我 100 升汽油，我会尽我所能回报你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I've checked the stock here at this house, and it turns out there's a few pieces of equipment I need.  Firstly, I need a reliable way to take measurements and verify results.  If you could get me a basic laboratory analysis kit just to get started, I'd be grateful.  That's the first step towards making everything I brought with me useful."
msgstr "我检查了这所房子的库存，结果发现我依然缺少一些设备。首先，我需要一种可靠的方法来进行测量和验证结果。如果你能给我一个基础实验室分析工具包，我将不胜感激。这是让我随身携带的一切能派上用场的第一步。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "It should be pretty simple making the deal, but I'd recommend taking a car over there myself."
msgstr "交易应该很简单，但我建议开辆车过去。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 liters of gasoline for the chemist."
msgstr "为化学家准备 100 升汽油。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 15 liters of hydrochloric acid for the chemist."
msgstr "为化学家准备 15 升盐酸。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a basic laboratory analysis kit for the chemist."
msgstr "为化学家寻找一个基础实验室分析工具包。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "One of those old labs might have one."
msgstr "那些旧世界的实验室之中可能有一个。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Please?  This is really important to me."
msgstr "拜托了，这对我来说真的很重要。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "嗯，谢了！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Thank you!  I can't wait to get started!"
msgstr "谢谢！我等不及要开始了！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks for trying…  I guess."
msgstr "感谢你的努力……我想是吧。"

