#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll have to find it myself."
msgstr "真不幸。我想我得自己去找。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll have to find other customers."
msgstr "真不幸，我想我得另找买家了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "The last thing I really need to get going is hydrochloric acid.  It's one of those chemicals that's just perfect for so many things.  An acidifying reagent, and one of the best.  With a large supply of hydrochloric acid, you and I are only a few steps removed from a stable source of antiseptic, fungicide, and even some light explosives!  As the only apparent health authority left, I do have to warn you not to get it on your skin, though.  Find this for me and I'll sell you whatever I can make."
msgstr "我真正需要做的最后一件事是盐酸。它是一种用途广泛的化学物质。一种酸化试剂，也是最好的试剂之一。有了大量的盐酸，你我距离稳定的防腐剂、抗真菌剂甚至一些轻炸药的来源只有几步之遥！不过，作为如今唯一明显的健康权威，我必须警告你不要把它弄到你的皮肤上。帮我找到这个，我会卖给你任何我能做出来的东西。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Well, someone's got to do it."
msgstr "嗯，总得有人去做这件事。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "What did they say about it?"
msgstr "他们怎么说？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  I'm sure this will be quite helpful."
msgstr "太棒了！我相信这东西会非常有用。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
