msgid "I'm not even supposed to be here today, I just lost a bet and had to take this shift."
msgstr "我今天根本不应该来这里，我只是输了赌注，不得不接受这个轮班。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
