msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I'm not even supposed to be here today, I just lost a bet and had to take this shift."
msgstr "我今天根本不应该来这里，我只是输了赌注，不得不接受这个轮班。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "I'm not in charge here, you're looking for someone else…"
msgstr "我在这只是个干活的，要谈事情的话找别人去吧……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
msgid "Just on lookout, move along."
msgstr "我只是站岗的，有什么问题去找管理员。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
msgid "Stay alert, there's trouble in these woods."
msgstr "保持警惕，树林里有麻烦。"

#. ~ Job description of "Guard" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/campus/generic_class_definitions.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/generic_class_definitions.json
msgid "I'm on a guard shift."
msgstr "我在轮班。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "*waves and smiles.  \"Welcome fellow reader.\""
msgstr "你好同学。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "About other things…"
msgstr "关于其他的事……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Actually, I need to head out."
msgstr "其实，我该走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Actually, I wanted to ask…"
msgstr "其实我...只是想和你说说话。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Always glad to help another reader."
msgstr "永远乐于帮助读者们"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Are there any other settlements around?"
msgstr "附近还有其他定居点吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Before you ask, we can't lend out books anymore.  We've had too many stolen and destroyed.  If you want to read something, either do it here or I will need to sell it to you for something useful, like a book.  Oh, my name is Elvira Fish, I run Circulations here.  I hope you learn something."
msgstr "恕我直言，我们不能再往外借书了。况且，你不知道我们曾有多少的书被毁被盗。希望你能明白。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Can you answer some questions for me?"
msgstr "我有些问题。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Have you heard anything about the rest of the world?"
msgstr "有外界的消息吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Hello, who are you?  This is a library, is it?"
msgstr "你是谁？这里就是图书馆吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "I am expecting some new materials <interval>, hopefully some good escapism."
msgstr "我想去见新的事物。<interval>，尤其希望是能够满足我那逃避主义情结的...我的意思是能让我暂时忘记大灾变。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "I just love books."
msgstr "我爱看书！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "I just want to browse.  See you."
msgstr "没什么，我只是在四处看看。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "I wanted to talk."
msgstr "我想谈谈。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "I would be happy to assist."
msgstr "这是我的荣幸，请说。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr "我会记着的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join your group?"
msgstr "我可以加入你的团队吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "It can be hard to predict the way things are now, but I am expecting new materials around <interval>."
msgstr "事情的走向总是难以预料，不过我期待<interval>周围的新事物。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Just saying hello."
msgstr "只是来打个招呼。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Let me look at what you have."
msgstr "让我看看你有什么。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Let me see what you have."
msgstr "让我看看你有什么。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Never stop learning."
msgstr "学无止境。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Of course, how can I help?"
msgstr "好。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Of course, please ask."
msgstr "当热可以了，我等你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Oh sorry, I'm not interested right now."
msgstr "对不起，我现在不能被打扰。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Some, here and there.  My responsibilities keep me here but I have spoken with traveling merchants.  They thought we wanted guns and were confused that we wished to trade books for books.  I must assume that most of the other survivors are more violent and less scholarly."
msgstr "有的，你周围就是。我的职责让我呆在这里，但我和路过的商人谈过了。他们最初以为我们想购入枪支，但对我们只想以书易书的态度非常不解。我们承认，我们认为大多数人都很野蛮甚至不学无术。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Thanks, I will make sure to check back."
msgstr "谢谢，我会确保能再回来看的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "That's all for now.  Take care."
msgstr "就这样把。保重。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
msgid "That's fine for now."
msgstr "就这样吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "What questions do you have?"
msgstr "问吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "What's your story?"
msgstr "说说你的故事？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "When will you have new material?"
msgstr "什么时候有新材料啊"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Who's in charge here?"
msgstr "这里谁是头？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Yes we are.  We still have some of our original collection, but far too much of it was stolen or destroyed, and of course it was far from complete even before.  Some of us go out to try and rebuild the collection from towns nearby, but mostly we rely on people passing through like you.  We especially want anything rare and hard to find."
msgstr ""
"是这样的。我们仍然有不少原先的收藏，但绝大多数已经消失。无论如何，即使是在那以前，想到完全收藏也有很大的距离。\n"
"我们中的一些人去附近城镇收集资源来重建收藏，但主要是依靠像你这样路过的人。我们尤其想要珍贵的和罕见的东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "You can't lend out books?  What kind of library is that?"
msgstr "为什么？这里不是图书馆吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "You want even more books?"
msgstr "你还想要更多的书？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "*deep breath, tired smile.  \"How else can I help you?\""
msgstr "...还有什么问题吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "*frowning, grimacing.  \"I don't know.  It's.  I can't talk about this right now.\""
msgstr "*皱眉，面色凝重*  “我不知道...它...我现在不能说这个。”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "*frowning.  \"It's not.  I'm not saying nothing happened.  We lost a lot.  I lost a lot.  We just need to go forward.  We need to put things back together and help people.  That's why this place is here.  What else would we do?  We can't give up too."
msgstr "*皱眉。  “不是的。我并不是说什么都没发生。我们失去了很多。我失去了很多。我们只需要前进。我们需要把事情重新组合起来并帮助人们。这就是这个地方在这里的原因。我们还能做什么？我们也不能放弃。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "*frowning.  \"Listen, we are doing our best here.  Most of our original staff is gone and people keep stealing and breaking things for no reason.  We're just trying to protect some information for the future.\""
msgstr "(皱眉)“听着，我们已经尽力了。原来的人大多已经不在了，这些人毫无征兆地偷窃和破坏。我们只是想为未来留下一些信息。”"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Another time, then."
msgstr "那下次再聊吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "But why bother then?"
msgstr "为什么会这么麻烦？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "How did you end up here?"
msgstr "你是怎么到这里来的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "I hope it works out for you."
msgstr "我希望它对你有用。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
msgid "I should probably go."
msgstr "也许我该走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "I'm useful!  I have skills!"
msgstr "我会的很多，我很有价值！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Maybe I could change your mind…?~"
msgstr "也许我可以改变你的想法……？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Of course, I'm sorry."
msgstr "无意冒犯。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Oh, we did have a President, Mx. Rose.  As things were starting to get bad they locked themself into the administrative building with all of the senior staff.  It's a good thing too because that building is full of the dead now, just like the rest except the library here.  For now everyone is still trying to operate under the old library structure, so I guess I'm in charge now as the most senior library staff left, though we have some survivors here from the other buildings from other divisions.  Callista Rupp from Academics is here, she taught physics.  I think she was at MIT for a while.  And Jack Springer from Facilities is here too, he's probably the only really practical person here, very handy!  It was his idea to board up the other buildings."
msgstr "哦，我们确实有一位总统，墨西哥人。玫瑰。  随着事情开始变得糟糕，他们和所有高级职员一起把自己锁在行政大楼里。  这也是一件好事，因为那栋建筑现在充满了死者，就像除了这里的图书馆之外的其他建筑一样。  目前，每个人仍在尝试在旧的图书馆结构下运作，所以我想我现在负责，因为最高级的图书馆工作人员离开了，尽管我们有一些来自其他部门的其他建筑物的幸存者。  来自学术界的卡莉斯塔·鲁普（Callista Rupp）在这里，她教物理。  我想她在麻省理工学院呆过一段时间。  来自 Facilities 的 Jack Springer 也在这里，他可能是这里唯一一个真正务实的人，非常方便！  用木板封住其他建筑物是他的主意。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Oh, well I took a job here about a year before <the_cataclysm>, and I was living alone when things got bad and I thought I might be safer here with work friends.  My friends Beatrice and Ross and I got some supplies ready and then more people started to join us.  And then it got bad.  But I think that has settled down some now."
msgstr "我在一年前的<the_cataclysm>就有了一份工作。当事情变坏时，我一个人住，后来和这些工作伙伴一起就安全得多。我跟碧翠斯和罗斯着手收集物资，更多人也因此加入。再往后，更多的灾难蜂拥而至，不过我们最终还是挺了过来，现在已经安定了不少。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Oh.  Um.  I don't.  I don't think that makes sense right now.  I have enough help here, and we.  Maybe when things are more settled but not now.  But you might ask others if they need help."
msgstr "呃，不，我们暂时不能信任你。等事情解决了再说吧，总之不是现在。但是，如果你认为自己可以在那以后就能立刻加入我们，现在就可以帮忙。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Oh.  Um.  I guess I like stories.  And quiet."
msgstr "啊，嗯。我想我喜欢故事，还有冥想。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Okay, I'm sorry."
msgstr "哦，抱歉。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Trying to keep the library here in good order.  She's seen some hard times recently and needs a lot of love.  Past that, well…I guess it would be good to get the rest of the campus cleaned up.  That's what Jack wants to do but we don't have any guns and we don't want to.  I know Callista wants to get classes going again as soon as possible though I imagine we have some problems with the academic interests of the students still with us and the teachers we have left."
msgstr "努力保持这里图书馆的良好秩序。  她最近经历了一些困难时期，需要很多爱。  除此之外，嗯……我想把校园的其余部分清理干净会很好。  这就是杰克想做的，但我们没有枪，我们也不想这么做。  我知道卡莉斯塔希望尽快重新开课，但我想我们仍然和我们一起的学生以及我们离开的老师的学术兴趣存在一些问题。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Um.  Right, I guess you made it this far.  But.  Really I don't have something right now.  But really if you could find some books to trade us that would be great.  We really should be rebuilding the collection.  Really.  Um."
msgstr "嗯。  是的，我猜你已经做到了这一步。  但。  确实我现在什么都没有。  但实际上，如果你能找到一些书来与我们交易那就太好了。  我们确实应该重建收藏。  真的。  嗯。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Um.  Well.  You shouldn't.  I shouldn't.  Um.  I don't.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "嗯。  出色地。  你不应该。  我不应该。  嗯。  我不知道。  我们来谈谈别的事情吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Yes, so I hear.  One trader I talked to said they have a whole market somewhere with all kinds of useful things.  Not a lot of books though, it sounds like."
msgstr "是的，我听说了。  我采访过的一位交易员说，他们在某个地方拥有一个完整的市场，里面有各种有用的东西。  虽然听起来书不多。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "You're really just going to keep going like nothing happened?"
msgstr "你真的要若无其事地继续下去吗?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "&The officer scans the area, looking for trouble.  They have a dangerous glint in their eyes."
msgstr "警官扫描该区域，寻找麻烦。  他们的眼中闪烁着危险的光芒。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "&They are still breathing but unable to move and speak.  You are unsure if they are even fully conscious and yet shudder at the thought of being trapped inside your body."
msgstr "他们仍在呼吸，但无法移动和说话。  你不确定它们是否完全有意识，但一想到被困在你的身体里就感到不寒而栗。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "&They let out a bellowing warcry and wave their stick."
msgstr "&他一边发出震耳欲聋的战吼一边挥舞着手中的棍子。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "&They shriek and stumble backwards, as if you just became a threat."
msgstr "&他们尖叫着向后踉跄，就好像对他们来说，你刚刚成为了一个威胁。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "&You see this crazed fellows eyes darting around anxiously, always anticipating impending doom.  Every now and then you can even hear them whimper in fear.  Although they do not seem aggressive, they definitely are out of their mind."
msgstr "&你看到这些疯狂的家伙的眼睛焦急地转来转去，预料着即将到来的厄运。你有时甚至能听到他们恐惧的呜咽。尽管他们看起来并不具有攻击性，但他们肯定是疯了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Are you crazy?  Get out of here!"
msgstr "你疯了？快跑！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Don't worry, I'm with the police<punc>"
msgstr "别担心，我和警察在一起<punc>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Fuck that, I'm not going out like a coward!"
msgstr "滚吧，我才不会像个懦夫似的逃跑！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Have you seen my child?"
msgstr "你见到我孩子了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "I am not leaving without my little one!"
msgstr "我必须找到那小家伙..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "I'M INVINCIBLE!"
msgstr "我所向披靡！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "I'm gonna kill all these <swear> things!"
msgstr "我要杀掉所有这些<发誓>东西！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Like hell I will!"
msgstr "我决不后退！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "No!  I just know it, they are still alive!"
msgstr "不，不！我要找到他们！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Stand aside citizen, I'll handle this!"
msgstr "公民，靠边站，我来处理这件事！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Where is my kid?"
msgstr "我孩子哪去了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "You need to get to safety!"
msgstr "你需要去安全的地方！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Your child is likely dead by now and you should get to safety!"
msgstr "现在立刻离开这里，否则那些“暴徒”会把你也杀掉！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Awkwardly distance yourself.]"
msgstr "[尴尬地远离]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Back away.]"
msgstr "[后退。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Leave them to their futile fight.]"
msgstr "【让他继续他那徒劳的战斗。】"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Leave them to their ultimate fate.]"
msgstr "（他们是大灾变的受害者）"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Let them keep on searching.]"
msgstr "【放弃劝说】"

