#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Gov assigns names based off numerological conversions of house numbers.  Robert Williamson: 205 W Orchard Avenue.  Robert (78) + Williamson (127) = 205.  Despite the beautiful weather, he keeps the curtains closed and no one has even visited yet.  And he's been here for more than two weeks!  I only ever see him when he's coming or going from work.  I assume it's work, even if the hours are strange sometimes.  Black car, out of state plates, looks brand new.  Fed behavior, if you ask me… Is he actually going somewhere or just trying to convince me he's legitimate?  Is he on the job when he leaves or on the job when he's here?  Further investigation required."
msgstr "政府根据门牌号的数字转换来分配名字。罗伯特•威廉姆森：205 W 果园大道。罗伯特(78) + 威廉姆森(127) = 205。尽管天气很好，他一直拉着窗帘，甚至还没人来访。而他已经在这里住了两个多星期了！我只有在他上下班的时候才能看到他。我想这是工作，但上下班时间有时很奇怪。黑色的车，外州的车牌，看起来是全新的。如果你问我，我只能说看起来像美联储的员工，他是真的要去哪里？还是只是想让我相信他是合法的？他是离开时在工作，还是在这里工作？需要进一步调查。"

