msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I do have a twin.  Malsumis is probably around here somewhere, very tricky.  You know I turned Malsumis to stone once?  I'm supposed to be the nice one, but you know how much it hurts turning yourself back from stone?  It takes days."
msgstr "我是有个双胞胎。马尔苏米斯可能就在附近，非常棘手。你知道我曾经把马尔苏米斯变成石头吗？我本该是个好人，但你知道把自己从石头变回来有多痛苦吗？这需要几天的时间。"

