#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I don't have time for this.  I have serious survival business to do.  I am a serious survival business person."
msgstr "我没时间玩这个游戏了。我还有重要的生存任务要做。我是一个正经的生存生意人。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I don't know about names, let's talk about something more interesting."
msgstr "我不是很了解这名字背后的故事，让我们谈些更有趣的话题吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I don't know what Malsumis would say, Malsumis is very tricky.  I always tell the truth, it's very boring."
msgstr "我不知道马尔苏米斯会说什么，马尔苏米斯很狡猾。我总是说实话，这很无聊。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I don't think so.  I'm pretty good at hunting though."
msgstr "我不这么认为。不过我很擅长打猎。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I feel the same way best friend."
msgstr "我也有同感，我的挚友。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I guess that's something."
msgstr "我想这也算吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I need to move on."
msgstr "我该走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I'm not made out of trees, I'm made out of awesome.  Follow me and you will grow fat and rich."
msgstr "我可不是树做的，我可是最棒的人。跟着我，你会吃香喝辣，变得又胖又富有。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I'm trying to become more powerful than whatever else is out there."
msgstr "我正在努力变得比其他任何东西都更强大。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I'm trying to make a survivor settlement.  You should join!"
msgstr "我正在努力建设一处幸存者营地。你应该加入！"

