msgid "If I were Malsumis you would be in terrible danger my friend.  But Glooscap would stop me."
msgstr "如果我是马尔苏米斯，你会处于非常危险的境地，我的朋友。但格鲁斯卡普会阻止我的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
