#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "让我们谈点其他的事情吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Maybe some day.  If you can survive for long enough I may decide to come and stay with you."
msgstr "也许有一天。  如果你能活得足够长，我可能会决定来和你住在一起。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Maybe.  Is it worse to be unhappy with a goal or to be unhappy without a goal?  You're all right, I feel like we get each other."
msgstr "也许吧。对现有目标不满意，还是没有目标而不满意，哪样更糟糕？你会没事，我觉得我们彼此很了解。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No idea what you mean."
msgstr "不懂你的意思。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No problem, a lot of people are going through some hard times right now.  Honestly, you're doing better than most.  You should follow me, I have a pretty good handle on reality."
msgstr "没关系，现在很多人都在经历着一些困难。老实说，你比大多数人都做得好。你应该跟着我，我对什么是真实很有把握。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No, I just made it up."
msgstr "不，那只是我编出来的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No, my name has been a name here for a very long time too."
msgstr "不，我的名字在这附近也应该出名了一段时间了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Not enough given what's happening."
msgstr "考虑到正在发生的一切，显然还不够。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Of course, that all makes as much sense as anything I guess.  So you have crazy supernatural powers then?  Can you stop whatever is happening and make it like before?"
msgstr "当然，这一切都和我所想的一样合乎情理。那么你有疯狂的超自然力量吗？你能阻止正在发生的一切，让这世界回到像以前一样吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "So.  You're dressed like a hunter.  Are you a hunter?"
msgstr "所以你穿得像个猎人。你是猎人吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Sure sure.  So are you on drugs?"
msgstr "当然，当然。你吸嗨了吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "This is awkward.  I need to leave."
msgstr "这可真尴尬。我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "We are not good and I'm done talking to you."
msgstr "就这样吧，我跟你没什么好谈的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Whatever, I don't have time for creepy stuff."
msgstr "随你怎么说，我可没时间和这些怪事情打交道。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Whatever, I don't have time for whatever this is.  Try not to get your face eaten I guess."
msgstr "或许吧，我没时间管这不知道是啥的事。只能说尽量不要让你的脸被吃掉。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Whoah whoah, calm down.  Yikes.  Yeah fine, we're good.  Just stop making that face, it's too much for me.  Gives me feelings."
msgstr "喔，喔，冷静点。真恶心。好吧，我们到此为止。别再做出那样的表情了，我受不了。让我有些感觉。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Whoah whoah, calm down.  Yikes.  Yeah fine, we're good.  Just stop trying to spook me, I don't like it."
msgstr "喔，喔，冷静点。真恶心。好吧，我们到此为止。别再吓唬我了，我不喜欢。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Yes, I just got here.  What's happening?"
msgstr "是的，我刚到这一带。发生了什么事？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Yes, I'm a very smart survivor of the apocalypse.  Anyway, I need to move along.  Later Glooscap."
msgstr "是的，我是一个非常聪明的大灾变幸存者。不管怎样，我得走了。稍后见了，格鲁斯卡普。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Yes, thank you for sharing with me.  So what are you doing here?  What are you trying to accomplish?"
msgstr "是的，谢谢你和我分享。你在这里干什么？你想完成什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Yes, that worked great."
msgstr "是的，看起来效果很好。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You know the real people's stories?  Yes, a lot like that."
msgstr "你知道关于真人的故事吗？是的，就像那一样。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You know you're not really Glooscap right?  You're joking right?"
msgstr "你知道自己并不真的是格鲁斯卡普，对吧？你在开玩笑吧？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You seem cool and I'd like to talk more but I don't have anything fun.  I'll try and find something and come back so we can share."
msgstr "你看起来是个酷小子，但我手头没啥好货。我会找些烟酒回来和大家分享。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You seem cool but I don't have anything fun.  I'll try and find something and come back so we can share."
msgstr "你看起来是个酷小子，但我手头没啥好货。我会找些烟酒回来和大家分享。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You shouldn't follow me, but I guess I can't stop you."
msgstr "你也许不应该跟着我，但我想我也没法阻止你这么做。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[GLORIOUS] Worship my beauty."
msgstr "[倾国倾城]你也会崇拜我的美。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 11]  Like the Wabanaki myth?"
msgstr "[INT 11] 喜欢 Wabanaki 神话吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] Do you have a twin named Malsumis?"
msgstr "[智力 14]那你也有一个叫马尔苏米斯的双胞胎吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] I think you're Malsumis.  Where is Glooscap?"
msgstr "[智力 14]我想你是马尔苏米斯。格鲁斯卡普在哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] I'll look out then, thanks.  Of course if you were Malsumis you probably wouldn't admit it because no one likes Malsumis.  Who would your twin say you are?"
msgstr "[智力 14]那我会当心的，谢谢。当然，如果你是马尔苏米斯，你可能不会承认，因为没有人喜欢马尔苏米斯。你的双胞胎兄弟会说你是谁？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] I'm trying to understand what happened and see if I can make something better happen."
msgstr "[智力 14]我正在努力了解发生了什么，看看是否能让这一切变得更好。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] Yes, that all makes sense to me.  Forget I asked."
msgstr "[智力 14]是的，这回答对我来说很有意义。忘记我刚刚的问题吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[Offer Beer] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some drinks with me, want to have some?"
msgstr "[提供啤酒] 我非常喜欢你的笑容，是的。  我带了一些饮料，想喝点吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[Offer Beer] I don't know about friends, but I have some drinks with me, want to have some?"
msgstr "【提供啤酒】我不知道朋友怎么样，但我有一些饮料，想喝点吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[Offer Cigarettes] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some cigarettes, want one with me?"
msgstr "[提供香烟] 我非常喜欢你的笑容，是的。  我有一些香烟，想要一支吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[Offer Cigarettes] I don't know about friends, but I have some cigarettes, want one with me?"
msgstr "[提供香烟] 不知道朋友怎么样，但我有一些香烟，要带一根吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[Offer India Pale Ale] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some drinks with me, want to have some?"
msgstr "[提供印度淡啤酒] 我非常喜欢你的笑容，是的。  我带了一些饮料，想喝点吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[Offer India Pale Ale] I don't know about friends, but I have some drinks with me, want to have some?"
msgstr "【提供印度淡色艾尔】不知道朋友们怎么样，我带了一些饮料，想喝点吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[Offer Joint] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have something to smoke, want to have some with me?"
msgstr "[报价联合] 我非常喜欢你的笑容，是的。  我有烟，想和我一起抽吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[Offer Joint] I don't know about friends, but I have something to smoke, want to have some with me?"
msgstr "【优惠联】不知道朋友怎么样，但是我有烟，想和我一起抽吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[PRETTY] I think we're going to be great friends, don't you agree?"
msgstr "[长相俊美]我想我们会成为好朋友的，对吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[PRETTY] That smile is very nice.  It makes me smile too."
msgstr "[长相俊美]那笑容不错。这让我也想笑。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[SKILLED LIAR] Then you're definitely not Malsumis and everything is cool.  So Malsumis wants to kill everybody right?  I guess they're feeling pretty great right now huh?"
msgstr "[说谎达人]那你肯定不是马尔苏米斯，万事大吉。所以马尔苏米斯想杀了所有人，对吧？我想他们现在感觉很好吧？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[TERRIFYING] Destroy me!"
msgstr "[恐惧气息]是想要干架吗？死吧！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[TERRIFYING] Fear me!  I am disgusting!"
msgstr "[恐惧气息]恐惧我！恐惧我的样子！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Ayuh, I was thinkin' it's just another monstah skulkin' about.  Who are you?"
msgstr "啊哈，俺还以为又是一只鬼鬼祟祟的家伙呢。恁是谁啊？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Can't say I can think of summin' specific right now.  Gotta say though, maybe it oughta be a good idea for us ta travel togetha' - safety in numbers an' all that."
msgstr "这会俺也想不到啥要帮手的。不过照俺说，咱俩可真该一起走——俗话咋说的来着，烂麻搓成绳，也能拉千斤，只要人手多，石磨挪过河。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Can't say I really agree.  I'll be going now."
msgstr "我不太同意。我该走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Don't have much of a choice, do I?  On my own, a monstah will get lucky sooner or later, and even if I kill it, bleedin' out in some alley is not summin' I fancy.  Plus, we just had a nice, civil chat where no one tried ta kill the otha', so I reckon we're off to ah' good start, all things considered."
msgstr "俺有的选不？就俺一人，迟早那天那只怪物走了运干掉俺，即使俺杀死了它，在个小巷子里流血到死也不是俺寻思的。而且，俺们不是好好唠了唠吗，也没人想干掉对方，那俺寻思这事还有戏，起码开了个好头。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Fair enough.  Want to travel with me, then?"
msgstr "有点道理。那想和我走吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Great!  Let's go."
msgstr "太棒了！我们走吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "How about we travel together?"
msgstr "我们一起走怎么样？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "I hate it."
msgstr "我讨厌这样。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "I like it."
msgstr "我喜欢这样。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
