msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I was just sort of wanderin' around, hoping ta maybe find some bettah gear.  Decided ta rest up, 'eard someone walkin', and, well, here we are."
msgstr "俺之前只是四处溜达溜达，寻思着能搞来些得劲装备。将将要歇一会，就听到些响动，然后就碰到恁了。"

