#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "I'll think about it."
msgstr "我会考虑的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Is it a good idea to trust a stranger like me this easily?"
msgstr "这么容易就相信像我这样的陌生人是个好主意吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Is there something I can do for you?"
msgstr "我能帮你什么忙吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Just a survivor, looking around.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "只不过是个到处游荡的幸存者。你在这里干嘛？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Let's hope it will."
msgstr "希望能吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Okay then."
msgstr "好吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "On a second thought, let me think about it a bit more"
msgstr "回头想一想，还是让我再考虑考虑吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Sounds like a good idea - want to join me, then?"
msgstr "听起来是个好主意——想和我一起走吗？"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor trying to stay safe
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor completely unwilling to talk
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor that gave up on life
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor willing to trade items
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Survivor cowboy"
msgstr "牛仔幸存者"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Wha', nevah been ta Boston 'ave ya?  Hope you're not 'avin a hahd time keepin' up with me, but if ya get used ta it, wicked good fun, let me tell ya."
msgstr "咋的了，恁从没去过波士顿吧？但愿恁能听俺唠唠不会太累得慌，等恁听习惯了，老得劲儿了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "What did you before all this?"
msgstr "你在这之前是做什么的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "What's with the accent?"
msgstr "你的口音是怎么回事？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Wicked.  Been around the old road long enough ta know how ta handle myself in a pinch.  Knew my way around a gun ever since my da taught me when I was a kid, so ya don't have ta worry about me doing my part."
msgstr "太中了。俺在这江湖道上走了很久，知道怎么照顾好自个。自打小时候俺爸教会俺起，俺就会耍枪弄棍，所以甭担心俺，俺会做俺该做的事。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Alright, I'm leaving."
msgstr "好吧，我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Alright, alright, I'm going."
msgstr "好吧，好吧，我要走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Did you just fucking threaten me?!  This is your last chance to piss off or I swear I will end you!"
msgstr "你他妈的敢威胁老子？！最后给你一次滚开的机会，否则我发誓我会杀了你！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Does private property even exist anymore?"
msgstr "现在还有所谓的私人领地吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Don't threaten me or you will regret it."
msgstr "别威胁我，否则你会后悔的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "For the last goddamn time, leave or I will defend myself!  I will kill you!"
msgstr "我最后再说他妈的一次，快滚，否则我会自卫！我会杀了你的！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Hey!  Stop right there!  This here is private property!  Not one step closer, you got it?!"
msgstr "嘿！站住！这里是私人领地！不许你再近一步，明白了吗？！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I just want to talk."
msgstr "我只是想谈谈。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I really just want to talk - I mean no harm."
msgstr "我真的只是想谈谈——我没有恶意。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I said stay away!  Don't get any closer or I swear I will kill you."
msgstr "我说了离我远点！别靠近我，否则我发誓我会杀了你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I'd like to see you try."
msgstr "那就来试试看吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "It does on my property!  Now blow off!"
msgstr "在我的领地上还算数！现在快滚！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Okay, I'll leave."
msgstr "好吧，我马上走。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Whoa, calm down, no reason to get heated."
msgstr "哇，冷静点，没必要发火。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Yeah that's right!  And don't bother me again, you hear?!"
msgstr "是的，这就对了！别再烦我了，听到了吗？！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "You better calm down right now."
msgstr "你最好现在冷静下来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Alright.  Goodbye."
msgstr "好吧。再见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Alright.  Take care."
msgstr "好吧。保重。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "For how long?  You've seen what's out there.  If we survive today, we'll die the day after.  Or the day after that.  And if we live beyond that, we'll just see everyone we care about die.  All of them.  Might as well get it over with."
msgstr "又能活多久呢？你已经看到外面有什么了。即便今天我们活了下来，第二天就会死。或者再下一天。即便能活得更久，我们也只会看到我们关心的每一个人慢慢死去。所有的人。不如让它了结掉我。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Good.  Take care."
msgstr "好吧。你多保重。"

#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_SWIRLING_VORTEX"
