msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "我说了让我静静。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  But you still can't give up.  You have a lot to live for!"
msgstr "请节哀。但你不能就这么放弃了啊。你还有很多活下去的理由！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I'm sure your loved one would want you to live on for them."
msgstr "我相信你的爱人会希望你为他们活下去。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "It will.  Let's get going."
msgstr "会的。咱们走吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I… I mean… huh.  I guess."
msgstr "我……我是说……嗯。也许吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Just leave me alone."
msgstr "让我一个人静静。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr "住在附近的一个镇上。很普通的生活。朝九晚五的工作。当这一切发生时，我们跑开找些安全的地方。但是已经没有安全的地方了，不是吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
