msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr "住在附近的一个镇上。很普通的生活。朝九晚五的工作。当这一切发生时，我们跑开找些安全的地方。但是已经没有安全的地方了，不是吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "No one gets out alive.  Always been that way.  So we keep going."
msgstr "没人能活着逃离。一直都是这样。所以我们继续前进。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Oh.  Hey there."
msgstr "哦，你好啊。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "On a second thought, wait here a while."
msgstr "回头想一想，你还是在这里等着吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Right.  Okay."
msgstr "好吧。说的是。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So shouldn't you be more concerned?  Trying to survive?"
msgstr "所以你不应该更担心吗？为了活下去？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So you're just going to give up?"
msgstr "所以你就这么放弃了吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "That's a start."
msgstr "这是个好开头。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Thought I heard someone.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "我听到这里有人。你在这里干什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Wait, 'we'?"
msgstr "等等，\"我们\"？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "We all lost someone.  No reason to sit down and die."
msgstr "我们都失去了亲人。但这不是坐下来等死的理由。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Would you like to come with me?"
msgstr "想要和我一起走吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I do."
msgstr "是的。我知道。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I think I will."
msgstr "是的。我想我会的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You can't let yourself be consumed by grief.  It will get better."
msgstr "你不能让自己沉浸在悲伤之中。一切会好起来的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You do realize there is an apocalypse going on, right?"
msgstr "你知道世界末日正在发生，对吧？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Ah, not much really.  Passing through, trying to make a living by trading with folk.  If you're interested, I got a lot of good things on sale, stranger."
msgstr "啊，没什么。只是四处跑跑，试着跟各种各样的人做点生意。如果你感兴趣，陌生人，我有很多东西可以卖。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Any news on that Remington?"
msgstr "找到雷明顿了吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Fair enough.  Goodbye."
msgstr "好吧。再见。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Fantastic!  I'll try and get it to the buyer, if he's still alive.  If not, well, still a good gun to sell.  Now, how would you like to be compensated?"
msgstr "太棒了！如果买家还活着，我会马上拿给他。如果他挂了，好吧，这还是把能卖出价钱的好枪。那么现在，你希望拿到怎样的报酬？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Great!  Let me know when you get it, and I'll try to get in touch with him."
msgstr "太棒了！你找到后马上告诉我，我会再试着和他联系。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Hah, real cute.  Seem the End times didn't take your sense of humor, eh, stranger?"
msgstr "哈，真可爱。看来末日并未夺走你的幽默感呵，陌生人？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Hey!  Who goes there?"
msgstr "嘿！谁在那儿？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "How did you even get this option to display the hell."
msgstr "你他妈到底是怎么样骗过我的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I am a ghost.  I died here 37 years ago, yet I cannot depart this mortal realm."
msgstr "我是一个鬼魂。37年前我死在这里，但至今都无法脱离这衰朽俗世。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I have my moments.  So what are you doing here?"
msgstr "我也有过自己的好日子。话说你在这里干什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I'm you, from the future.  I've come to warn you."
msgstr "我就是你，来自未来的你。我是来警告你的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "If you think so."
msgstr "随你怎么想。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr "我能帮你什么忙吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Just another survivor.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "我只是另一个幸存者。你在这里做什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Not a bad way to live."
msgstr "日子过得还不坏。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
msgstr "收集 雷明顿 870 \"急速\"霰弹枪"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Speaking of which, I'd like to see your wares."
msgstr "这么说的话，我想看看你的货。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Suit yourself.  Ain't a rush."
msgstr "随便你。不着急。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Then where is it?"
msgstr "那么它到底在哪里？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Well, a gun store is a solid bet, but the model is common enough.  Maybe you can find one in a police station, or a store with hunting gear."
msgstr "好吧，我打赌枪械商店里应该能有很大几率找到，但这种型号非常常见。也许你可以在警察局或者是卖狩猎用品的商店里找到一把。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Well, now that you mention it…"
msgstr "好吧，既然你提到了……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Worked as a salesman - high end farming equipment.  Now I know, it may not sound that fancy, but you'd be shocked at how pricy those machines can get.  I was lucky enough to be on a fairly remote farm when everything went to shit.  In a way, being a salesman saved me and the experience from the job might allow me to make a living in the apocalypse, bartering for gear and trinkets, so I got that going for me, I suppose."
msgstr "我以前是个推销员——卖高端农用设备的。我知道，听起来不算厉害，但你肯定会被这些机器的高昂价格吓一大跳。我算是够幸运的了，在一切变糟时正好在一间偏僻的农场里。某种意义上，推销员的工作挽救了我，过往的经验让我得以在末世里谋生，倒卖装备和些小玩意，所以我算是为自己跑腿。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "You do?  Let me take a look."
msgstr "你有货？让我看看。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "You see, some time ago, I ran into this guy who offered me a substantial payment in exchange for a Remington 870 Express.  I asked if he'd like another weapon, since nowadays, any gun will do, but for some reason, he's dead set on that particular model.  If you could obtain one for me, well, I'd be quite grateful."
msgstr "要知道，就在前一阵子，我遇到了一个家伙，他给了我一大笔钱，就为了买一把雷明顿 870 \"急速\"霰弹枪。我问他要不要换一把武器，毕竟现在，只要是把枪就行，但不知道怎么回事，他对这个特殊型号情有独钟。如果你能帮我搞一把过来，那就再好不过了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "You seem like a decent sort, but I'm not really looking for company right now.  Think I'm better off on my own."
msgstr "你看起来是个热心肠，但我现在真的不打算找合伙人。我认为还是自己独资比较好。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor living in a barn or a forest or something, all
#. by themselves.  At some point this NPC should get special dialogue.
#. ~ A member of the Gray Moose Militia, trying to safe in their isolated
#. location
#. ~ A survivor who sometimes visits the refugee center.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ A wandering survivor, a pretty tough and capable dude.  Represents an NPC
#. version of a person much like the player.
#. ~ A random scavenger visiting the refugee center to check it out, just like
#. you.
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/rural.json data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "幸存者"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "&There's a person reclined on the sofa here.  They're very tall, with their legs reaching to the other armrest, and they're wearing a set of dubious-looking military gear.  They raise a hand in greeting.  \"Placeholder text.\""
msgstr ""
"&这里有个人斜靠在沙发上。他很高，腿伸到另一个沙发扶手上，穿着Hub 01的模块化盔甲。一套蓝褐色的环境防护服在桌子附近的地板上被揉成一团，靠在远处的沙发扶手上的是一支步枪，样式看起来你以前从未见过。\n"
"\n"
"当你走进门时，他抬头看着你，挥了挥手。\"占位符文本。\""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*frowns at you.  \"I've been with you this whole time, dude.  C'mon."
msgstr "*对你皱眉。\"我可一直跟着你呢，老兄。加把劲。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*goes quiet.  They chew their lip, looking off towards a point in space."
msgstr "*安静下来。他咬着嘴唇，朝着空中的某个点望去。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*smiles at you, genuine and warm.  \"It feels nice to tell it.  You're welcome.\""
msgstr "*对你微笑，真诚而温暖。\"说出来感觉很好。不客气。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*stares at a point at the wall, thinking.  Their wedding ring glints on their left hand."
msgstr "*盯着墙上的一个点思考。他的结婚戒指在左手上闪闪发光。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*waits expectantly."
msgstr "*期待地等着。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "A while later, I made it here.  The gate was open, so I just walked right in.  I tried the intercom, but nobody answered, which I'm sure you had happen to you, too.  Then I realize: this building is super reinforced, unlocked, and seems abandoned now.  Why don't I just stay here?  So I set up my stuff in this here lobby and I spend the night there.  Then I try the intercom again."
msgstr "又过了一阵子，我来到了这里。大门是开着的，所以我径直走了进去。我试过对讲机，但没人接，我相信你也遇到过这种情况。然后我意识到：这座建筑经过了超级加固，没有上锁，现在似乎被遗弃了。我为什么不留在这里？所以我把我的东西放在这里的大厅里，在那里过夜。然后我再试试对讲机。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About the gold you wanted…"
msgstr "关于你想要的黄金……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About those jobs…"
msgstr "关于那些任务……"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Active Noise Control"
msgstr "激活降噪程序"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I don't think I have time for that, sorry."
msgstr "啊，我可没空，对不起。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I have some places to be right now.  Good to meet you."
msgstr "其实，现在我有个能去的地方。很高兴遇见你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Alright, let's be off.  You don't mind taking point, right?"
msgstr "好吧，我们出发吧。你不介意我去侦察一下，对吧？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And *now* the rest is history."
msgstr "那*之后*的事就是历史了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And the rest is history."
msgstr "之后的事就是历史了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Anything on your mind?"
msgstr "你在想什么呢？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "But like, I was a park ranger.  I wasn't exactly making six figures, and you know how bad rent was.  I couldn't buy a ton of canned food, but what I *could* do is can things myself.  Not in tin cans, but in jars; the old way.  So every paycheck, I'd use a little bit to buy one or two big glass jars, and on the weekends I'd spend a few hours filling them up with food and sealing them.  I started brushing up at the range too.  Proud gun owner, baby."
msgstr "但是，我那时候只不过是个护林员。我挣的不是六位数，你知道房租有多高。我甚至买不起一堆罐头食品，但我*能做*的就是自己动手做罐头。不是锡罐头，而是玻璃罐；老办法。所以每次发工资时，我都会用一点钱买一两个大玻璃罐，周末我会花几个小时把食物装满罐子，然后密封起来。我也开始在靶场训练。骄傲拥枪人，宝贝。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "But what?"
msgstr "但是什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Computer network?"
msgstr "计算机网络？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cool."
msgstr "酷。"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the the surface of Hub 01 as an external mercenary.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cranberry Foster"
msgstr "克兰伯里·福斯特"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did they answer that time?"
msgstr "他们当时回应了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did you want something?"
msgstr "有什么想要的吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Dude, I wish.  It sounds like there's different people on the mic at different times, but all of them give me the same spiel: nobody's allowed in right now.  I guess I shouldn't raise a fuss about it, honestly.  All being considered, this compound is pretty safe, and the couch ain't so bad."
msgstr "哥们，我也想啊。听起来对讲机那边有不同的人在不同的时间值班，但他们都给了我相同的套话：现在任何人都不允许进入。老实说，我想我也不该对此大惊小怪。综合考虑，这栋建筑非常安全，而且沙发也没那么糟糕。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Exchanging my money for goods and services.  Just as the founding fathers intended."
msgstr "用我的钱换商品和服务。正如制宪元勋们所希望的那样。"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub Mercenary" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Fighting for the all-mighty dollar."
msgstr "为万能的美元而战。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Good to have some company."
msgstr "有个伴也不错。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Got some gold for me?"
msgstr "有金子给我吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Have something to say?"
msgstr "有什么想说的吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
