#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Snippet in category "magic_8ball_good"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "是。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You got it.  I'll let you know if I find any gold."
msgstr "成交了。如果我找到金子，我会告诉你的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You got it.\"  Cranberry grins.  \"I ask them if their drone got home in one piece, and it did.  They said that my work wasn't bad at all and did a little impromptu interview asking where I learned my skills and how I got to the building.  I got the canned intro of 'we underestimated your usefulness', and like you say, the rest is history.  Now we're here."
msgstr "你明白了。\"克兰伯里咧嘴笑了。\"我问他们，他们的无人机是否完好地回到了家，确实如此。他们说我的手艺一点也不差，并临时做了个面试，询问我从哪里学到的技能，以及我是如何到达大楼的。我收到了'我们低估了你的能力'的老套回复，正如你所说，之后的事都是历史了。直到现在。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You sound frustrated about it."
msgstr "你听起来很愤慨。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You think we fixed the problem?"
msgstr "你觉得我们解决问题了吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "[200 gold] Here's a batch for you."
msgstr "[200 单位黄金]有一批给你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Leave.]"
msgstr "[离开]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "[Listen.]"
msgstr "[倾听。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "[Spend a while in silence.]"
msgstr "[一同沉默了一会儿。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Wait.]"
msgstr "[等待。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "…Alright.  Well.  For starters, I lived alone in an apartment, and I didn't have any family or relatives I really cared about, so things were a lot easier for me than they could have been."
msgstr "……好吧。首先，我以前独自一人住在一套公寓里，我没有真正值得让我关心的家人或亲戚，所以这一切对我来说要容易接受得多。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "…Did you just say \"placeholder text\" out loud?"
msgstr "…你刚才是不是大声说了\"占位符文本\"？"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ A cold ex-mercenary from a third world country you have never heard of
#. before.  Third in charge after Melchior and Director Cohen.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Ulysses_Rourke.json
msgid "Head of Security"
msgstr "安全主管"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Needs his own unique background.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Ulysses_Rourke.json
msgid "Head of security"
msgstr "安全主管"

#. ~ Job description of "Head of security" NPC class
#. ~ Needs his own unique background.
