msgid "I'm part of the Hub security team."
msgstr "我是Hub安保小组的一员。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ A cold ex-mercenary from a third world country you have never heard of
#. before.  Third in charge after Melchior and Director Cohen.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Ulysses_Rourke.json
msgid "U. Rourke"
msgstr "尤利西斯·洛克"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A generic guard for Hub 01.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
msgid "Hub Security"
msgstr "Hub 保安"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Just on watch, move along."
msgstr "我就是个站岗的。走开。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
msgid "Keep it civil, merc."
msgstr "文明举止，佣兵。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Ma'am"
msgstr "女士"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Sir."
msgstr "先生"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Around <interval>, if the caravan doesn't run into trouble."
msgstr "在<间隔>左右，如果商队没有遇到麻烦的话。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Caravaneer"
msgstr "商队老板"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A free merchant caravanner that temporarily supplies the hq with
#. foodstuff.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Free Merchant"
msgstr "自由商人"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Here to trade, I hope?"
msgstr "我想，你是来交易的吧？"

#. ~ Job description of "Caravaneer" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "I'm the owner of a trade caravan."
msgstr "我是商队的老板。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Keep safe, then."
msgstr "那么，请注意安全。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Let's trade."
msgstr "让我们交易吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Safe travels, scavenger."
msgstr "一路平安，拾荒者。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Thanks for the info, bye."
msgstr "谢谢你的信息，再见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "We have been supplying this lab here with food from a few hunting and farming communities nearby.  The roads are tough and dangerous, but it makes good money, and beats scavenging the cities for scraps."
msgstr "我们从周围的猎人和农夫聚落手里收集食物，然后提供给这所实验室补给。道路艰难险阻，但获利颇丰，比起去城里搜寻那些残羹剩饭要强得多。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Welcome…"
msgstr "欢迎……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "When is the next shipment?"
msgstr "下次发货是什么时候？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
