msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "&A grim expression and deep sunken eyes imply some malady that can't be simply drowned with alcohol alone.  They interrupt you just as you were about to introduce yourself.  \"This anchor I'm wearing, I don't think I'll be needing it any more.  I-I'm just looking for someone to rid me of it"
msgstr "严峻的表情和深陷的眼睛暗示着某种仅靠酒精无法淹没的疾病。  当你正要自我介绍时，他们打断了你。  “我戴着这个锚，我想我不再需要它了。我-我只是在找人摆脱它"

