#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Alright, see you around then."
msgstr "好的，我们回头见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "It takes only a moment to retrieve a suitable coin from your pockets, and yet your interlocutor found enough time to disappear, having left a sharp emptiness both in memory and the chair before you.  The anchor has been neatly folded on the table."
msgstr "从你的口袋里取出那枚合适的硬币只需要一小会儿，然而同你对话的人却有足够的时间消失。在你的记忆和你面前的椅子上都留下了尖锐的空虚感。空间锚已被整齐地叠放在桌子上。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
