msgid "It takes only a moment to retrieve a suitable coin from your pockets, and yet your interlocutor found enough time to disappear, having left a sharp emptiness both in memory and the chair before you.  The anchor has been neatly folded on the table."
msgstr "从你的口袋里取出那枚合适的硬币只需要一小会儿，然而同你对话的人却有足够的时间消失。在你的记忆和你面前的椅子上都留下了尖锐的空虚感。空间锚已被整齐地叠放在桌子上。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Just leave, this isn't right at all."
msgstr "走吧，这不对头。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Offer to buy the anchor for 1 HGC."
msgstr "提出以 1 HGC 购买锚。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Sorry, I don't think I can help you."
msgstr "抱歉，我想我帮不了你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Take the anchor and leave the coin.  Do we have a deal?"
msgstr "拿起锚并留下硬币。  我们有协议吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Take the anchor."
msgstr "收下空间锚。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "The mercenary stares in silence, a flickering of the overhead lighting thankfully cuts the moment short."
msgstr "雇佣兵沉默地凝视着，谢天谢地，头顶上闪烁的灯光缩短了这一刻。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
