msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "The mercenary stares in silence, a flickering of the overhead lighting thankfully cuts the moment short."
msgstr "雇佣兵沉默地凝视着，谢天谢地，头顶上闪烁的灯光缩短了这一刻。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Well, what's that thing for anyways?"
msgstr "嗯，那东西到底有什么用呢？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "&A pair of veteran mercenaries share stories between bouts of heavy drinking.  You could probably join them if you wanted to."
msgstr "一对经验丰富的雇佣兵在酗酒期间分享了故事。  如果你愿意的话，你也许可以加入他们。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&As you sit, the older mercenary continues their narration of <merc_story>.\n"
"\n"
"When their tale reaches conclusion, you stop to consider what sort of story you could tell."
msgstr ""
"&当你坐下后，最为年长的雇佣兵继续讲述<merc_story>。\n"
"\n"
"他的故事达到尾声后，你开始思考你可以讲个什么样的故事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "&The clearly drunk mercenaries hail you as minor celebrity and invite you to a pair of rounds when your tale is finished."
msgstr "&明显醉酒的雇佣兵将你视为小名人，并在你的故事结束后邀请你来玩两轮。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "&The expressions on both the mercs' faces are a mix of confusion and visceral disgust as you relate your tale.  Finally, the younger mercenary blurts out, \"None of us wanted to touch that contract since the intercom was being so shifty about it.\"  \"You're my kind of free-range lunatic!\"  The older mercenary interjects.  \"I'll drink to that!\"."
msgstr "当你讲述你的故事时，两个雇佣兵脸上的表情都混合着困惑和发自内心的厌恶。  最后，年轻的雇佣兵脱口而出：“我们谁都不想碰那份合同，因为对讲机对它太狡猾了。”  “你是我喜欢的那种自由放养的疯子！”  年长的雇佣兵插话道。  “我要干杯！”。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "&The veteran's expressions turn to a mixture of awe and fear as your tale nears conclusion, the younger mercenary is finally after a long  \"We heard someone had gone and completed that death trap contract, but I still couldn't believe it.\"  \"You're a damn madman!\"  The older mercenary interjects in agreement.  \"I'll drink to that!\"."
msgstr "&当你的故事接近尾声时，老雇佣兵的脸上浮现出敬畏中带着恐惧的表情，年轻的雇佣兵终于在漫长的沉默后开口“听到你说自己完成了那个死亡陷阱般的委托，我还是不敢相信。”“你真他娘是个疯子!”老雇佣兵插嘴表示同意。“我要为此干一杯!”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "&The veterans eagerly accept your challenge, and none of you can really stomach the prospect of more drinks after the first pair of tales."
msgstr "老兵们热切地接受你的挑战，在第一对故事结束后，你们谁也无法真正忍受喝更多饮料的前景。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&The veterans seem happy to have you, and you listen as the older mercenary narrates <merc_story>.\n"
"\n"
"You all share some drinks while going over the details and as the conversation winds down."
msgstr ""
"&老兵们似乎很欢迎你的加入，其中最为年长的雇佣兵开始讲述<merc_story>。\n"
"\n"
"你们一起喝了一些酒，并且交流了事情的细节，直到聊天结束。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "&While the veterans indulge your storytelling, they clearly seem not too pleased nor impressed by your tale."
msgstr "虽然退伍军人沉迷于你的故事，但他们显然似乎对你的故事不太高兴或印象深刻。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "&You make some small talk and share a pair of drinks after finishing your story."
msgstr "故事讲完后，你们闲聊并喝了一杯。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_BEM_BEM_CHATTING_VETERANS_DRUNK_MESSAGE"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "<ANCILLA_BAR_HANGOVER>"
msgstr "<ANCILLA_BAR_HANGOVER>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Bar… barshender!  We… we?"
msgstr "酒吧……调酒师！  我们……我们？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Recall that time when you rescued a farmer's son from a citadel full of alien horrors."
msgstr "回想一下，当你从充满外星恐怖的城堡中救出一个农民的儿子时。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Recall that time when you used a tactical nuclear weapon."
msgstr "回想一下你使用战术核武器的那次。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Recall the long story of how you agreed to help the remnants of the Federal Government."
msgstr "回想一下您如何同意帮助联邦政府残余势力的长篇故事。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Recall the time you were tricked into fighting against distorted versions of yourself while lost in a place beyond time."
msgstr "回想一下，当你迷失在超越时间的地方时，你被欺骗去对抗扭曲的自己。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Speak about the alien construct you found while lost in an endless sea of black glass."
msgstr "谈谈你在无尽的黑色玻璃海洋中迷失时发现的外星建筑。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Tell them about the horrors uncovered by the mining expeditions of New England."
msgstr "告诉他们新英格兰采矿探险所发现的恐怖。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Tell them about the horrors wandering in these very same subway tunnels."
msgstr "告诉他们在这些地铁隧道中徘徊的恐怖事件。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Tell them about your hunting of a pyramidal robot using a prototype energy rifle."
msgstr "告诉他们您使用原型能量步枪狩猎金字塔机器人的故事。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Tell them the story of how you dived into and were forced to fight for your life within a disgusting, toxic hellscape made from the un-living innards of some crushed zombie monstrosity.  All so the intercom could have some damned HDD back."
msgstr "告诉他们你如何潜入一个令人厌恶、有毒的地狱景象，并被迫为自己的生命而战的故事，这个地狱景象是由一些被压碎的僵尸怪物的无生命的内脏构成的。  所有这些都是为了对讲机可以有一些该死的硬盘驱动器。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Tell them the story of how you were trapped in an infinitely looping corridor, fighting the warped remnants of the researchers there and somehow the damned corridor itself.  And at the end of the day, you're not even sure the headache was worth it."
msgstr "告诉他们你是如何被困在一个无限循环的走廊里，与那里的研究人员的扭曲残骸以及不知何故与该死的走廊本身战斗的故事。  一天结束时，您甚至不确定这些头痛是否值得。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Try to gross each other out with tales of mutant butchery."
msgstr "试着用变种人屠杀的故事来让对方感到恶心。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Well, I should be going now."
msgstr "嗯，我现在该走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Well, ugh…  I should be going now…"
msgstr "嗯，呃……我该走了……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Yeah I guess it really did happen just like that."
msgstr "是的，我想事情确实就是这样发生的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Yeah looking back I really don't know why I did it."
msgstr "是的，回想起来，我真的不知道我为什么这么做。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Yeah, that was certainly an…  interesting experience."
msgstr "默认的怪物难度及物品生成几率。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "You share increasingly embellished stories about your exploits as you dare each other into downing series of eye-watering drinks."
msgstr "你们互相挑战，喝下一系列令人垂涎的饮料，并分享越来越多的关于自己功绩的故事。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "[Join and hear them out for a while.]"
msgstr "[加入并听听他们的声音。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
