msgid "Sure, let see what you offer."
msgstr "当然，让我们看看你提供什么。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_gunrunner.json
msgid ""
"&You find the gun runner intently assessing the swirling smoke of a stale cigarette.  <mypronoun> barely acknowledges your approach.  \"Let's cut it short, I have come upon an excess supply of exotic weaponry and let's say that it would be expedient for it to disappear and you seem like just the kind of person I'm looking for.\" .\n"
"\n"
"<mypronoun> hands you an inventory list, loosely annotated in a piece of graph paper.\n"
"\n"
"\"No harm in looking right?"
msgstr ""
"你会发现军火走私者聚精会神地评估一支过期香烟的漩涡烟雾。  <mypronoun> 几乎不承认你的做法。  “总而言之，我发现了一种过剩的异国武器，如果它消失的话，那是一个权宜之计，而你看起来正是我要找的那种人。” 。\n"
"\n"
"<mypronoun> 为您提供一份库存清单，在一张方格纸上松散地注释。\n"
"\n"
"“看起来正确没有坏处吗？"

