#. ~ Description of mission "Fleshmonger"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "Deposit a human sample in a pit within the dead drop location.  Pick up your reward at the Terminal once that's done."
