#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "Most I can give is two gold coins.  I've arranged a drop in the nearby woods, put the goods there and you can get your cash with the barkeep here."
msgstr "我最多只能给两枚金币。  我已经在附近的树林里安排了停运，把货物放在那里，你可以向这里的酒保拿现金。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
