#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "\"God\"-Slayer"
msgstr "\"上帝\"-杀手"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "&<mypronoun> seems completely lost to the present, but you can't help but notice <mypossesivepronoun> gear is caked with mud and broken twigs.  It doesn't look like you'll be getting much conversation from this one."
msgstr "&<mypronoun> 似乎完全迷失在当下，但你会情不自禁地注意到 <mypossesivepronoun> 装备上沾满了泥土和折断的树枝。  看起来你不会从这个人那里得到太多的谈话。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "&<mypronoun> silently points at your maps with a trembling hand."
msgstr "&<mypronoun>颤抖着手默默地指着你的地图，"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "&Continued prodding manages to extract a baffling response from your interlocutor \"I- I've seen it, the god of our new world, a god of flesh and bone.\" <mypronoun> says with a maddened glare, as though this were some sort of shocking revelation."
msgstr "持续的刺激成功地从你的对话者那里得到了令人困惑的回答“我——我已经看到了，我们新世界的神，一个有肉有骨的神。” <mypronoun> 带着疯狂的目光说道，仿佛这是某种令人震惊的启示。"

