#. ~ Description of mission ""God"-Slayer"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "A traumatized mercenary has claimed to have seen what you assume to be a powerful monster.  Maybe you should investigate this for the benefit of everyone."
msgstr "一个受伤的雇佣兵声称看到了强大的怪物。也许你应该为了群众利益而调查一下。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Attempt a friendly approach."
msgstr "尝试友好的方式。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Leave the traveler to their trauma."
msgstr "放任旅行者继续面对他们的创伤。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Press on in search of a reaction."
msgstr "继续按寻找反应。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Show your map to the mercenary, and have them mark where they saw this \"god\"."
msgstr "把你的地图给雇佣兵看，让他们标出看到这个 \"神\"的位置。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Try to find someone more interested in conversation."
msgstr "尝试找到对谈话更感兴趣的人。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Yeah I'm sure I have seen that one too.  Try to stay safe."
msgstr "是啊，我敢肯定我也见过那个。 注意安全"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "&You spot the mercenary at the tail end of a deal.  \"Want in on the business?  Still have a pair of ID cards looking for buyers.  Two army and two science cards left, they sell together for 4 coins or not at all."
msgstr "&你看到一个马上要做完交易的佣兵。\"你也想做生意吗？我这里还有不少钥匙卡在找买家。剩下两张军用的和两张科学家的，打包一起卖4个金币，不零卖。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
