#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "Huh where do you get those from"
msgstr "嗯，你从哪儿弄来的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "Not a bargain bin kid, the price's the price."
msgstr "这可不适合讨价还价，孩子，一口价。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "Offer to buy them for 2 coins."
msgstr "试图按2个金币的价格讲价。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "Oh, it looks like I don't actually have two coins right now…"
msgstr "哦，看来我现在并没有两枚硬币……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "See you around then."
msgstr "那我们回头见了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "Sure whatever, two coins and its all yours."
msgstr "好吧随你便，只要2个金币，它就归你了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "Well that'd be telling.  Suffice to say that a few friends found them, and none of us are into the lab-dive business."
msgstr "好吧，说来话长。我只想说，有几个朋友碰巧找到了它们，我们中可没人在做下实验室的活。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "[2 HGC] Its a deal then."
msgstr "[2 金币]那么成交。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "[4 HGC] Its a deal."
msgstr "[4 金币]成交。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "&The mercenary seems uncharacteristically upbeat, or perhaps just drunk.  \"Found this neat gizmo in a bank run a few days ago.\"  <mypronoun> blurts while procuring a small cube of etched glass from <mypossesivepronoun> pocket.  \"Now, I have no use for such a thing, but perhaps you do.  What do you say?  It's yours for 3 coins.\""
msgstr "这名雇佣兵看起来一反常态地乐观，或者可能只是喝醉了。  “几天前在银行挤兑中发现了这个巧妙的小玩意。”  <mypronoun>一边从<mypossesivepronoun>口袋里取出一小块蚀刻玻璃，一边脱口而出。  “现在，我用不到这样的东西，但也许你有用。你说呢？只要3个硬币，它就是你的了。”"

