#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "A 'nanofabricator template', it seems, no idea what it's good for, but it sure looks valuable.  Are you buying it or not?"
msgstr "一个“纳米制造商模板”，似乎不知道它有什么用处，但它看起来确实很有价值。  你买还是不买？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "I don't even know what that is."
msgstr "我什至不知道那是什么。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "Offer to buy it for 2 coins."
msgstr "试图按2个金币的价格讲价。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "Sure whatever, two coins and it's all yours."
msgstr "当然，无论如何，两枚硬币，它就是你的了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "Well I'm sure someone who values it will come around, thanks for hearing the pitch anyways."
msgstr "好吧，我相信会有人识货的，总之谢谢你听我说了这番话。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "[2 HGC] It's a deal then."
