#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/NPC_BEMS.json
msgid "the ID forger"
msgstr "钥匙卡伪造商"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/NPC_BEMS.json
msgid "the cheerful mercenary"
msgstr "乐观的佣兵"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/NPC_BEMS.json
msgid "the disconsolate mercenary"
msgstr "沮丧的佣兵"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/NPC_BEMS.json
msgid "the drinking veteran"
msgstr "酗酒老兵"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ These are all random people you met in a bar once, the fact that they
#. don't have names is meant to emphasize the transient nature of the
#. conversations you have with them
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/NPC_BEMS.json
msgid "the enterprising gunrunner"
msgstr "有胆识的军火走私贩"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/NPC_BEMS.json
msgid "the pill pusher"
msgstr "药品销售"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/NPC_BEMS.json
msgid "the shady mercenary"
msgstr "可疑的佣兵"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/NPC_BEMS.json
msgid "the traumatized traveler"
msgstr "受创旅行者"

#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#. ~ An experienced survivor doing low importance work for Hub 01, or working
#. under another ancillary. Has no access to Hub 01s custom gear.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NC_ANCILLA_GRUNT.json
msgid "Fighting in the name of Hub 01 and money, mostly money."
msgstr "为了 Hub 01 和金钱而战，金钱占大头。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Ahh but if you want suggestions and are one for craft beers, I certainly suggest having some old world brew before it all goes flat or sour."
msgstr "啊，但如果你想得到建议，并且是个喜欢精酿啤酒的话，我当然建议在旧世界的啤酒变得平淡或是变酸之前来喝掉些。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Also good for a chat if you don't want anything."
msgstr "即便你什么都不想要，也可以找我聊天。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Also have some old world sodas if alcohol isn't your kind of thing."
msgstr "如果你不喜欢喝酒，也可以喝一些旧世界的汽水。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "And you can also try chatting with some of the other patrons if networking is your thing."
msgstr "如果你是那种社交人士，你也可以试着和其他顾客聊天。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Any good rumors?"
msgstr "有什么有意思的传言吗？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Can also sell some dry foods if you want to stock for a trip somewhere."
msgstr "如果你想为长途旅行储备干粮，我这里也可以卖一些给你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "I'll ask around, thank you."
msgstr "我会四处问问的，谢谢。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "I'll be going…"
msgstr "我该走了……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"If what you want are jobs and opportunities, you'll probably be better off asking to my other patrons.  Have regulars from well across the state, I'm sure some can offer what you want.\"\n"
"\n"
" \"Really, I just tend the bar and don't ask many questions.  Things tend work out better that way."
msgstr ""
"如果你想找个工作和机会，你最好问问我这里的其他酒客们。有来自全国各地的常客，我相信总能找到可以满足你要求的人。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"真的，我只是照管酒吧，不问太多问题。这样事情往往会好些。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Just bought some of this new \"Free Whiskey\" from the caravaneer up above.  It's vile if you ask me, but it packs a good punch.  A real drink of the apocalypse I suppose."
msgstr "刚刚从上面的商队那里买了一些新的“免费威士忌”。  如果你问我的话，这很卑鄙，但它具有很强的冲击力。  我想这是真正的世界末日饮料。"

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Just some water."
msgstr "来点水就行。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Just the best spirits the whole of New England has to offer.  Well the best we've managed to loot so far at least.\n"
"\n"
" <ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
msgstr ""
"这是整个新英格兰最好的烈酒。  嗯，至少是迄今为止我们能掠夺到的最好的东西。\n"
"\n"
" <ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Let me see what you keep behind the counter."
msgstr "让我看看你有什么好货。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Not much fruit juice to make fancy drinks, but I can scrounge up some still."
msgstr "果汁剩的不多了，没法整些花式饮品，但我仍然设法找到了一些。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Oh yes of course, think this should be all, well that's all there is anyhow."
msgstr "哦，是的，当然，我想这应该就是全部了，无论如何，这就是全部了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "On second thought, don't bother."
msgstr "[取消]回头想一想，算了吧。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Speaking off, Cranberry here brought me a whole cask of Cabernet a few days ago.  So if red wines are your thing I can offer that by the gallon."
msgstr "话说回来，几天前克兰伯里给我带来了一整桶赤霞珠。如果你喜欢红葡萄酒，我可以按加仑提供。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "The water I boiled from a pool by the rails, so I don't suggest you get some."
msgstr "这里的水其实是我靠着游泳池边的栏杆煮出来的，所以我不太建议你买。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "There should be a package for me here."
msgstr "这里应该有个给我的包裹。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Welcome to the Terminal, scavenger, longest standing underground bar in the state.  Feel free to ask if you need something."
msgstr "欢迎来到终点站，拾荒者，本州历史最悠久的地下酒吧。如果你需要什么，尽管问。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "What do you have on tap?"
msgstr "有什么喝的没有？"

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$2] Just some water."
msgstr "[2$]来点水就行。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] Get me a cup of red wine"
msgstr "[3$]来杯红酒吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a beer"
msgstr "[3$]来杯啤酒。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a shot of rum"
msgstr "[3$]来杯朗姆酒。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a shot of whiskey"
msgstr "[3$]来杯威士忌。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "A few of us joined up to make this a safe house, and it's just my turn watching the gates."
msgstr "我们几个人联合起来，把这里变成了安全屋，现在轮到我看守大门了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Getting paid for standing around.  And you are getting in the way."
msgstr "领钱在这里站岗。而你却在碍事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "I'm just on watch, move along."
msgstr "我就是个站岗的。走开。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "If you are looking for the Terminal, it's in the first basement, right down the stairs and to the left."
msgstr "如果您正在寻找航站楼，它位于地下一楼，下楼梯后左侧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join your team?"
msgstr "我可以加入你的团队吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Just go down to the Terminal if you want in."
msgstr "如果你想进去的话，下楼去终点站。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Just making sure people don't ask stupid questions."
msgstr "只是确保人们不会问愚蠢的问题。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"Me?  Just standing around, looking scary.  Think I'm doing a good job?\n"
"\n"
"Don't answer that."
msgstr ""
"我？  只是站在一旁，看起来很可怕。  你认为我做得很好吗？\n"
"\n"
"不要回答这个问题。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Well you certainly look like you could.  Try ringing the box in the bunker across the street, or see if someone in the Terminal has a need for help."
msgstr "你看起来当然可以。试着按一下街对面碉堡里的对讲机，或者看看终点站里是否有人需要帮助。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Generic Mercenary Guard for the ancilla hq.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "mercenary"
msgstr "雇佣兵"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "Andrea Dzvonko"
msgstr "安德里亚·德赞科"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Hold on, hold on.  I'm not here to hurt anyone, and there aren't enough of us left to just start fighting."
msgstr "等等，等等。我不想伤害任何人，而我们这些活下来的人已经不够再开启一场战斗的了。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Andrea Dzvonko is a software engineer with a limited understanding of how
#. melchior actually functions.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "Hub 01 Software Engineer"
msgstr "Hub 01 软件工程师"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 Software Engineer" NPC class
#. ~ Andrea Dzvonko is a software engineer with a limited understanding of how
#. melchior actually functions.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "I work for Hub 01 as a software engineer."
msgstr "我是一名 Hub 01 的软件工程师。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too."
msgstr "很高兴见到你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Who the fuck are you?  How did you get down here?  Security!"
msgstr "你他妈的是谁？你怎么进来的？警卫！"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "software engineer"
msgstr "软件工程师"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
msgid "Darla Novak"
msgstr "达拉·诺瓦克"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Keeps melchior from boiling to death and you from
#. choking on stale bunker air.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
msgid "Hub 01 HVAC maintenance"
msgstr "Hub 01 暖通维护工"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 HVAC maintenance" NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Keeps melchior from boiling to death and you from
#. choking on stale bunker air.
#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 Server Maintenance" NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Resident dungeon master.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "I'm part of Hub 01's maintenance crew."
msgstr "我是 Hub 01 维护组的一员。"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
msgid "building maintenance"
msgstr "建筑维护工"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Trucker and now general handyman.  Used to work as a cargo driver for a
#. company supplying Hub 01, is only inside the lab by chance.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "Hub 01 Assistant"
msgstr "Hub 01 助手"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 Assistant" NPC class
#. ~ Trucker and now general handyman.  Used to work as a cargo driver for a
#. company supplying Hub 01, is only inside the lab by chance.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "I do miscellaneous jobs within Hub 01."
msgstr "我在 Hub 01 做些打杂的事。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "Jonathan Farrier"
msgstr "乔纳森·法里尔"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "assistant"
msgstr "助手"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Resident dungeon master.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Hub 01 Server Maintenance"
msgstr "Hub 01 系统维护工"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Sunil Narayana"
msgstr "苏尼尔·纳拉亚纳"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "server maintenance"
msgstr "系统维护工"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "&An intercom is embedded into the wall here, just next to the card reader.  It's a metal box about as big as a dinner plate, with a speaker shaped like a downwards curve and a large camera prominently featured in the center.  You see a single metal button with a dark LED next to it.  The intercom is silent."
msgstr "&这面墙上嵌入了一个对讲机，就在读卡器旁边。它是一个金属盒子，大概有一个餐盘那么大，伸出一个向下弯曲的扬声器，中间是一个大大的摄像头。你能看到在一个金属按钮旁边有个熄灭的LED灯。对讲机沉默不语。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "&The intercom crackles with static as it turns on.  The LED next to the button lights up a bright red, and the camera lens whirrs as it focuses on you.  There is no immediate response."
msgstr "&对讲机发出静电干扰的噼啪声，随后启动了。按钮旁边的LED灯亮起闪亮的红色，相机镜头发出呼呼声，聚焦在你身上。但目前没有任何直接的回应。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "&The intercom erupts into static.  Then, it resolves into a voice.  It clears its throat, then speaks slowly and carefully.  \"Understood.  There is a tray embedded beneath the intercom.  Please place the drive into it.\"  On cue, a small portion of the wall beneath the intercom slides out along rails, revealing a large tray several inches deep.  \"You are welcome to leave afterwards.\""
msgstr "&对讲机突然停止工作。然后，它变成了一个声音。它清了清嗓子，然后慢慢地、小心地说话。\"知道了。对讲机下面有个托盘。请把硬盘放进去。\"在提示下，对讲机下方的一小部分墙壁沿着轨道滑出，露出一个几英寸深的大托盘。\"之后请离开这里。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "&The intercom hisses.  A voice of indeterminate sex speaks flatly.  \"I don't know who you are or how you got to this location, but we have nothing to gain from one another.  If you have a reason to be here, then please state your business.  Otherwise, please leave the area.\""
msgstr "&对讲机发出嘶嘶声。一个性别不明的声音缺乏热情的说到：\"我不知道你是谁，也不知道你是怎么来到这里的，但我们彼此之间没有任何关联。如果你有理由来这里，请说明你的来意。否则，请离开这里。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The intercom is silent."
msgstr "&对讲机沉默不语。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "&The tray slides shut.  \"Thank you.\"  The intercom turns off without another word."
msgstr "&托盘滑动关上了。\"谢谢你。\"对讲机一句话也没说就关机了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "About that hard drive…"
msgstr "关于硬盘……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "And the trading we agreed on?"
msgstr "那我们之前谈好的交易呢？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Ask Gavin."
msgstr "去问加文。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Certainly.  I've just finished speaking with a certain individual, who has authorized you limited access to a selection of our internal stores.  We will provide you with pay for contracts in the form of tokens to be used as an exchange currency, which you can then trade for goods.  We are also amenable to bartering in exchange for supplies that are currently difficult for us to obtain from outside the facility, and are especially interested in any…especially unusual items you may find."
msgstr "当然没问题。我刚刚和领导谈过话，他授权你部分获取我们的一些内部商店的资源。我们将以代币作为合同报酬支付给你，你可以将代币用作交换货币进行商品交易。我们还可以进行物物交换，以换取目前我们难以从设施外获得的特殊物资。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Don't do anything stupid."
msgstr "别做傻事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Don't loiter."
msgstr "别闲逛了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Get with it."
msgstr "去干活吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Hold on, who are you?  And what do you want with the data?"
msgstr "等等，你们是谁？你们想要这些数据做什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I don't have the drive with me right now; I'll give it to you when I have it."
msgstr "我现在没带着硬盘；等我拿到了就给你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I have a delivery from the Free Merchants.  You requested a hard drive from them."
msgstr "我这里有份自由商会的快递。你们让他们送了块硬盘来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I have to go."
msgstr "我得走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I promise you, there is nothing you can do for us.  Now leave, before I'm forced to-\"  They stop suddenly.  You hear a short, muffled conversation from the other end.  There's a brief pause.  \"Alright.  We might be able to gain some mutual benefit.  It's a dangerous task, but if you complete it then we would be willing to open up limited trading access."
msgstr "我敢保证，你帮不了我们。赶紧离开，不然我就——\"他突然停了下来。你听到另一端传来一段简短、低沉的对话。有一段短暂的停顿。\"好吧，我们也许能找到共赢的方式。这里有项危险的任务，但是如果你能完成的话，我们可以与你进行有限的交易。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I'll keep that in mind.  Let's get down to business."
msgstr "我会记住的。我们开始谈正事吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I'm just looking for valuables.  Maybe we can trade?"
msgstr "我只不过路过找些值钱货色的，也许我可以和你们做笔交易？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr "洗耳恭听。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "If/you speak to/understand… you/me. Yes?"
msgstr "如果……你想讲……理解……你……我。是吧？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "It's the apocalypse out here!  Please just let me in!"
msgstr "已经是世界末日了！请让我进去吧！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Let's discuss contracts."
msgstr "我们来谈谈合约的事吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Look, there must be something we can work out."
msgstr "听着，我们一定有办法谈妥价格的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr "快点儿。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Mercenary."
msgstr "你好，佣兵。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Oh!  Good.  We had written that off as a non-starter.  Just drop it into the tray and we'll bring it in."
msgstr "哦！好吧。我们认为无可奉告。快把它放进托盘里，我们就把它拿进来。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Please don't bother us senselessly."
msgstr "请不要无谓地打扰我们。"

#. ~ Job description of "intercom" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Reading this line is a bug"
msgstr "如果你看到这个，那么你遇到一个bug。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Right.  Your handling of this situation was exemplary, and it's clear to us that we greatly underestimated our potential for mutual benefit.  If you are interested, we are willing to offer you more work going forward, and all of it will have proper compensation from now on."
msgstr "是的。你对现场情况的处理令人印象深刻，显然我们之前大大低估了互惠互利的潜力。如果你感兴趣的话，我们愿意为你提供更多的任务，从现在起所有任务都将提供恰当的补偿。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Risk my neck for the privilege of trading with you?  Maybe another time."
msgstr "为了和你交易的特权而冒我的险？下次再说吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Say again?"
msgstr "再说一遍？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Say it."
msgstr "说吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "So, do you need something?"
msgstr "所以，你需要什么吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Sorry, forgot to grab the drive.  I'll return with it."
msgstr "抱歉，忘带硬盘了。我会带着它回来。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Speak slowly and clearly.  Please."
msgstr "慢慢地说清楚。请。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Thank you.  Was there anything else you needed?"
msgstr "非常感谢。你还需要什么吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "The merchant at the refugee center sent me.  You were looking for a hard drive from them?"
msgstr "难民中心的商人派我来的。你们在找他们的硬盘？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "The traders at the refugee center asked me to deliver this drive of FEMA data…"
msgstr "难民中心的商人让我把这份联邦应急管理局的数据交给你们……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "The traders mentioned you were looking for help."
msgstr "商会还说你们正在找帮手。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Ugh, I hate intercom duty… oh, um.  Hello."
msgstr "我讨厌值对讲机的班……哦，嗯。你好。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Um, can anyone hear me?"
msgstr "呃，有人能听得见我说话吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr "等等，什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "We look forward to working with you."
msgstr "我们期待着与你再次合作。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "然后？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "What am I getting out of this?"
msgstr "我能从中得到什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "What's up with the interference in this thing?"
msgstr "怎么总来打扰我们？"

#. ~ Reason for a shopkeeper blacklist entry
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Will not buy back their own gear"
msgstr "不会买回自己的装备"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Yes, mercenary?"
msgstr "怎么了，佣兵？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You do realize that the front door is just open?"
msgstr "你知道前门就已经是这么开着的吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You may rarely come across certain items which have been affected by the…ongoing phenomena.  They may seem like mundane household objects, but exhibit properties which seem to defy casual explanation.  I'm afraid that we cannot be clearer on this matter - suffice to say that you will likely know it when you see it.  We are willing to barter for these items at a high value."
msgstr "您可能很少遇到某些受到……持续现象影响的物品。  它们可能看起来像普通的家居用品，但所表现出的特性似乎无法随意解释。  恐怕我们对这个问题说得再清楚不过了——只要你看到它就可能知道了。  我们愿意以高价交换这些物品。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You mentioned wanting unusual items?"
msgstr "你没有在穿戴那件物品。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You mentioned you had a map of the area?"
msgstr "你提过你们有张本地区的地图？"

#. ~ Refusal reason for a shop item group
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You're not yet qualified to buy this"
msgstr "你还没有获得购买资格"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Bang on the metal door.]"
msgstr "[敲打金属门]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Hand over the FEMA data.]"
msgstr "[交出联邦应急管理局的数据。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Identify yourself before the intercom.]"
msgstr "[在对讲机前表明身份]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Press the button.]"
msgstr "[按下按钮]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Tap the camera lens.]  Look, I know someone's listening.  What is this place?"
msgstr "[轻敲镜头。]听着，我知道有人在听。这里是什么地方？"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "the intercom"
msgstr "对讲机"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "…Hello?"
msgstr "……哈喽？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "\"Other dangers\" is a little vague.  Do you have anything more substantial?"
msgstr "\"其他危险\"也太含糊了。能说得更清楚点吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&Over the course of several minutes, you calmly detail the events at the facility: the unexpected zombie presence underground, the anomalous nature of the experiment floor, and the encounter with the warped and hostile research staff trapped in the corridor.  Throughout, the voice interjects with questions, the sounds of typing filling the pauses.\n"
"\n"
"\"We appreciate your thorough report,\" the voice finally responds.  \"Your handling of the circumstances was commendable considering the anomalous and unpredictable nature of the facility.  If you seek further contract work, rest assured, we'll take into account the potential for anomalous circumstances in future assignments and relay them accordingly.\""
msgstr ""
"在几分钟的时间里，你平静地详细描述了设施中发生的事件：地下意想不到的僵尸存在，实验层的异常性质，以及与被困在走廊里的扭曲和敌对的研究人员的遭遇。  在整个过程中，声音不断地插入问题，打字的声音填补了停顿。\n"
"\n"
"“我们感谢您的详尽报告，”那个声音终于回应道。  “考虑到该设施的异常和不可预测的性质，你对这种情况的处理是值得赞扬的。如果你寻求进一步的合同工作，请放心，我们将考虑在未来任务中出现异常情况的可能性，并相应地转发它们。”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&Over the course of several minutes, you explain what happened at the ruins: the zombie presence and gigantic tendrils on the surface, and the biological infestation completely taking over the basement, as well as the hostile threats encountered therein.  The voice periodically interjects with questions or statements; the whole time, you hear the sounds of typing on a keyboard.\n"
"\n"
"\"We would like to extend our thanks for your detailed report.  It is clear to us that the threat level present at the manufacturer was far higher than we had originally anticipated, and your performance in the situation was exemplary.  Should you desire further contract work, we will bear these facts in mind, and ensure that the threat prognoses of your future assignments are adequately assessed.\""
msgstr ""
"&在几分钟的时间里，你解释了在废墟里发生的事情：丧尸的存在和地上巨大的触须，完全占据地下室的生化感染，以及其中遇到的敌对威胁。对讲机对面的声音时不时地插入问题或描述；整个过程中，你都能听到键盘打字的声音。\n"
"\n"
"\"我们要感谢您的详细报告。结果很清楚，制造厂目前的威胁水平远高于我们最初的预期，你在这种情况下的表现堪称典范。如果你希望获得更多合约工作，我们将牢记此次经历，并确保对你未来任务的威胁预测进行充分评估。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The intercom is silent for a few seconds while the tray slides back in.  \"Yes it is.  It's unfortunate that only the data was salvageable, but you have our thanks for returning it nonetheless.\""
msgstr "&对讲机沉默了几秒钟，托盘滑了回去。\"就是这个。不幸的是，只挽救回了数据，但我们还是感谢你归还它。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom tray quickly slides shut.\n"
"\n"
"\"We expected nothing less.  We hope you found the hm12's performance to be satisfactory.\""
msgstr ""
"对讲机托盘快速滑合。\n"
"\n"
"“我们的期望丝毫不减。我们希望您对 hm12 的性能感到满意。”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom tray quickly slides shut.  After a pause, the voice on the other end sighs.\n"
"\n"
"\"…we requested that the subject remain intact.  This outcome is… unfortunate.  We will process the specimen, but it is unlikely that it will yield usable information as to its purpose.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You may keep the dazzle rifle.  You are dismissed.\""
msgstr ""
"&对讲机托盘迅速滑动关闭停顿片刻后，另一端的声音叹了口气。\n"
"\n"
"\"……我们要求目标完好无损。这个结果……很不幸。我们将对样本进行处理，但不太可能获得有关其用途的可用信息。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"你可以留着那把原型枪。解散吧。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The intercom waits patiently."
msgstr "&对讲机耐心地等待。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom's tray slides shut.\n"
"\n"
"\"This is the case; thank you.  Transferring the stipulated amount now.\"  The tray slides back open with your payment.  \"As an additional form of payment, you have been given clearance to receive a map of the area around this site, to assist in your work.  The standing price is 1 HGC; please inform us if you'd like to follow up on that offer going forward."
msgstr ""
"&对讲机下的托盘滑动关上了。\n"
"\n"
"\"就是这个箱子，谢谢。现在就把规定的金额转账。\"托盘又滑开了，放着你的报酬。\"作为一种额外的任务奖励，你已获得许可，可以购买这个地点周围区域的地图，以协助你在本地的行动。标准价格为 1 个 Hub 01 金币；如果你想进一步了解详情，请告诉我们。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The voice hesitates.  \"About that.  Give me a moment.\"  After a pause, you hear muffled back-and-forth conversation.  You can't make out what's being said, but you can make out at least two other distinct voices."
msgstr "&声音犹豫了一下。\"关于那件事。给我一点时间。\"停顿片刻后，你会听到低沉的来回对话。你听不清对方在说什么，但你至少可以分辨出另外两个不同的声音。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The voice on the other side of the intercom is silent with disbelief."
msgstr "&对讲机另一边鸦雀无声，似乎难以置信。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "About that.\"  You hear papers shuffling.  \"Our drones are unable to approach the structure too closely, as a large amount of interference prevents surveillance, but long-distance measurements reveal a high concentration of toxic compounds in the air, as well as densely-clustered heat signatures.  We expect a high concentration of undead, and other dangers are likely."
msgstr "关于这个嘛。\"你听到翻文件的声音。\"我们的无人机无法太靠近大楼，因为大量干扰妨碍了监视，但远距离测量显示空气中有高浓度的有毒化合物，并且有强烈的热信号。我们预计不死生物会高度集中，而且可能会有其他危险。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "All I can tell you is that they were conducting cutting-edge research related to-\" The intercom abruptly cuts off for several seconds before coming back on, the voice sounding apologetic, \"Sorry, but as it turns out I'm not at liberty to divulge that information."
msgstr "我只能告诉你，他们正在进行尖端研究，涉及到——”对讲机突然断了几秒钟，然后又重新接通，声音听起来充满歉意，“抱歉，但事实证明，我不能随意透露这些信息。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I'll see if I can't get that data for you."
msgstr "我看看我能为你做些什么。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I've done my part.  What now?"
msgstr "好了，我已经尽了我的责任。现在呢？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Alright, alright."
msgstr "好吧，好吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "And after ALL THAT, I find your manufacturing lab on the other end of this thing straight out of a fever dream nightmare, and after ALL THAT, I find your photonics, and then I have to get ALL THE WAY out of the ENTIRE ZOMBIE-INFESTED TOWN so I could bring you your stupid fucking template.  Are you happy now?"
msgstr "而在这一切之后，我发现你们要找的制造实验室就在另一端，中间有个从某场狂热的噩梦中跑出来的怪物挡着。而在这一切之后，我找到了那个该死的光电子设备，然后我必须一路穿过整个丧尸横行的城镇，才能给你们带来那个该死的模板。你们现在满意了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "As we discussed during acceptance of the contract, we were aware of hazardous ground conditions, but we were unable to deduce further information other than what was available through long-range sensing.  If you would like to provide a description of the hazards present, we are willing to document them."
msgstr "正如我们在签订合约时所说过的，我们知道现场状况很危险，但除了通过远程遥感所获得的信息外，我们无法推断出其他信息。如果你能提供所遇到的具体危险的描述，我们很乐意记下来。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "At the moment, their origin is unclear.  The temperature profile of the building is highly unusual, despite the damage, and is much denser than wandering hordes observed through remote scouting.  A large amount of heat consistent with an extremely high density of organisms appears to be emanating from the basement itself.  We are, unfortunately, in the dark about the cause of this density.  We would advise you remain observant and note down any abnormalities."
msgstr "目前来说，这些东西的源头尚不明晰。尽管遭到了破坏，但这栋建筑的温度分布非常不寻常，而且比通过远程侦察观察到的尸群密度要大得多。与极高密度的生物体相一致的大量热量似乎是从地下室本身散发出来的。不幸的是，我们对这种高密度信号产生的原因一无所知。我们建议你保持警惕并记录任何异常情况。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Back to the contract itself…"
msgstr "回到合约本身……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Correct.  The source of the chemicals is unknown, as is the exact composition; only trace amounts are present in the air itself.  We can, however, extrapolate that something within the ruins is creating highly poisonous emissions.  We do not know how strong these emissions will become, or what form they will take."
msgstr "对的，化合物的来源不明，确切成分也不清楚；空气中只存在微量痕迹。然而，我们可以推断，废墟中的某些东西正在不断排放出剧毒气体。我们不知道这些排放源头会有多强，或者是以什么形式出现的。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Data Retrieval"
msgstr "寻光之旅"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Description, huh?  Where to begin?  Let's start with the giant mob of zombies that was infesting the building.  Oh, and there were also horrors full of toxic gas that exploded when I got near them or killed one, so I was constantly choking on fumes the whole time."
msgstr "描述，嗯？从哪里开始？让我们从充斥着大楼的庞大尸群开始。哦，还有充满有毒气体的恐怖怪物，当我靠近或杀死它们时，它们会爆炸，所以我一直被毒烟呛着。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Did you have any other concerns?"
msgstr "你还有其他顾虑吗？"

#. ~ Description of mission "Iron Safari"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Disable and retrieve the unusual robot by <color_yellow>successfully stunning it with the provided hm12 dazzle rifle or a scrambler grenade,</color> then <color_yellow>quickly running up and deactivating the robot before it recovers from the stun</color>.  You can keep shooting it while it's stunned to prolong the time until it is active again.  You can intercept the robot indicated by Hub 01, or find an inactive robot somewhere else.  <color_yellow>You'll need some experience in electronics or mechanics to disable it</color>."
msgstr "<color_yellow>使用提供的 hm12 眩晕步枪或干扰手榴弹成功击晕它，然后<color_yellow>在机器人从眩晕中恢复之前快速启动并停用机器人，以禁用并检索不寻常的机器人</color>。  你可以在它被击晕的时候继续射击它，以延长它再次激活的时间。  您可以拦截Hub 01指示的机器人，或者在其他地方找到不活动的机器人。  <color_yellow>您需要一些电子或机械方面的经验才能禁用它</color>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Do you have any idea what I just went through?"
msgstr "你知道我刚刚经历了什么吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Do you have any more work for me right now?"
msgstr "你们现在还有什么活要做的吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Dr. Prado knew the risks, and she chose to follow through with the test anyway.  Her death is cause for sadness, and it will affect us, but you didn't even know her.  At least now, something of her work will remain."
msgstr "普拉多博士知道风险所在，但她还是选择坚持到底。她的死是令人悲伤，也会影响我们，但你甚至不认识她。至少现在，她的一部分工作还将保留下来。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"During the Cataclysm, we lost contact with one of our sister sites, LIXA.  Aerial surveillance indicates that the facility's inhabitants are deceased, and beyond the now-zombified security detail, the site should be sparsely populated.  We want you to enter the facility and make a copy of what they were researching on the provided thumb drive.  Additionally, we will be providing you with a keycard that should at the very least get you in the front door.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We're offering a standard 5 HGC for successful retrieval of the data.  If that isn't enough of an incentive, we do have a manifest from before we lost contact with the facility showing a handful of specialized powered suits in inventory.  You are free to take any that are left."
msgstr ""
"在大灾变期间，我们与姊妹站点之一 LIXA 失去了联系。  空中监视表明该设施的居民已经死亡，除了现在僵尸化的安全细节之外，该地点应该人烟稀少。  我们希望您进入该设施并在提供的拇指驱动器上复制他们正在研究的内容。  此外，我们将为您提供一张钥匙卡，至少可以让您进入前门。”\n"
"\n"
"“我们提供标准 5 HGC 来成功检索数据。  如果这还不够激励的话，我们确实有一份在我们与该设施失去联系之前的清单，其中显示了库存中的一些专用动力套装。  您可以随意拿走剩下的任何东西。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Excellent.  Thank you very much.\"  The intercom recites a series of coordinates.  \"Exercise a great deal of caution.  We do not know what the conditions on the ground are like.  Use your best judgment.  As before, we are willing to offer you protective gear, if you would like it."
msgstr "太棒了。非常感谢。\"对讲机念出了一系列坐标。\"要格外当心。我们不知道那里的实际情况如何。发挥你的判断力。而且之前说过了，如果你想要，我们愿意为你提供一套防护装备。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Extremely dangerous?  What kind of danger should I expect?"
msgstr "极其危险？  我应该预料到什么样的危险？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Fantastic.\"  The intercom's tray slides shut, and then opens shortly afterwards with your payment.  \"You have our thanks and our payment."
msgstr "好极了。\"对讲机的托盘滑动关闭，随后又带着你的报酬打开了。\"谢谢你，这是你的报酬。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Return to sender"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Find the corpse of a Hub 01's AI researcher and retrieve the hard case they brought with them during the evacuation."
msgstr "找到 Hub 01 的人工智能研究员的尸体，并取回他们在疏散过程中携带的保险箱。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Give me a moment to look at your file… here we are.  Valid assignments are turning up empty at the moment.  I'm afraid we have no open contracts for you."
msgstr "给我点时间看下你的档案……找到了。待分配任务的查询结果是空的。恐怕我们眼下没有适合你的合约。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I can handle it.  Where is the test site?"
msgstr "我能应付。  测试地点在哪里？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"I don't believe I'm cleared to-\"  You hear brief chatter.  \"Apologies; I was mistaken.  The manufacturer was, technically speaking, kept secret from the public.  As a result, it operated using an office tower as a front, and was located underground.  An elevator in the back of the building led to the basement, but it was likely destroyed in the damage - as a result, you will need to find a way down yourself.  While there were stairs as well, it's highly likely that they have been destroyed.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We advise bringing a way to safely enter and exit the lower level; a grappling hook would work well for this purpose.  Given the damage, the elevator shaft itself probably remains intact, and would be your likeliest point of entry to the underground portion of the building."
msgstr ""
"我不觉得我的授权能够——\"你听到简短的讨论。\"抱歉；我错了。制造厂的存在，严格来说，曾对公众保密。因此，它使用一座办公楼作为掩护，主体位于地下。大楼后面的一部电梯通往地下室，但它很可能在破坏中被毁了——因此，你需要自己找到下楼的方式。虽然也有楼梯，但它们很可能也早已摧毁。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"我们建议先找到一条安全进出地下楼层的方式；一个抓钩可以很好地达成这个目的。考虑到损坏情况，电梯井本身可能仍然完好无损，可能是你进入大楼地下的最可能的途径。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I found it.  I found your template.  [Hand over the silicon photonics template.]"
msgstr "我找到它了。我找到你要的模板了。[交出硅光子电路模板。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I found the robot, but…  [Hand over the trifacet remains.]"
msgstr "我找到了无人车，但是……[交出三琢面残骸。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I think I'll pass."
msgstr "我想我会通过的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I would like that gear, yes.  Tell me about it."
msgstr "我想要装备，是的。具体说一说把。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I'll be back soon."
msgstr "我很快就会回来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where is the test site?"
msgstr "这活我接了。测试地点在哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'll pass on getting killed today, thanks."
msgstr "我今天可不想被人杀了，谢谢。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'll take it.  Where's the convoy?"
msgstr "这个活我接了。车队在哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm back from LIXA.  [Hand over the data.]"
msgstr "我从车队那回来了。[交出保险箱。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm back from the convoy.  [Hand over the hard case.]"
msgstr "我从车队那回来了。[交出保险箱。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm interested in that map."
msgstr "我对那张地图感兴趣。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "If I lose the ID card or the memory stick, what should I do?"
msgstr "如果我把记录器弄丢了或者弄坏了，要怎么办？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"If you'll give me a moment…\"  You hear the sounds of typing.  \"Its designation is hm12, you may have seen it in the news.  It is a weapon which is mostly harmless to living targets, but is specifically designed to incapacitate robots without harming their internals.  Once a subject is stunned, it can be manually deactivated; That is, you must approach it and turn it off before it reactivates.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"A shot will only stun the robot if you manage to hit its main sensory array, which will require good aim.  In short, try to use the weapon to stun it, then run up to it and examine it to find the, er, off switch."
msgstr ""
"给我一点时间……\"你听到打字的声音。\"它的品名是HM12。它的工作原理类似于激光，但专门设计用于使机器人失能，同时不损伤内部设备。一旦目标瘫痪，就可以手动将其关闭。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"射击只有在你成功击中主要感官阵列时，才能瘫痪无人车，这取决于你的瞄准。在一次瘫痪射击后，你可以近距离检查无人车来尝试关闭它。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Return Field Data"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Investigate a nearby field and return with Dr. Prado and the robot prototype she was testing.  Failing that, retrieve the I/O recorder stored within the robot.  If the robot remains operational, avoid direct confrontation and use EMP grenades to disable it."
msgstr "调查附近的荒野，找到并带回普拉多博士和她正在测试的原型机器人。若未成功，带回机器人体内的 I/O 记录器。如果找到机器人时它仍处于工作状态，应避免直接战斗，并使用EMP手雷使机器人失能。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Iron Safari"
msgstr "狩猎钢铁"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Is \"unfortunate\" how you usually describe someone being eviscerated by a robot?"
msgstr "你们通常用\"不幸\"来形容那些被机器人摘除内脏的人吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "It was ambushed on the road.\"  The intercom recites a series of coordinates.  \"Report back with the hard case.  If the researcher brought it with him, it will be intact; have no doubt about that."
msgstr "他们在路上遭到伏击。\"对讲机念出了一系列坐标。\"带着保险箱回来报告。如果研究员随身携带它，它会完好无损的；这是毫无疑问的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "It's an acronym that stands for Laser Interferometer eXodimensional resonance Assay."
msgstr "它是激光干涉仪超维共振分析的缩写。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "It's built with experimental combat programming and some heavy-duty armor.  Despite the armor, it's pretty nimble, so unless you've got a vehicle don't expect to outrun it.  We decided to hold off on adding long-range weapons until we finished the initial field testing, so if you can keep your distance, you should be safe."
msgstr "它是用实验性战斗编程和一些重型装甲建造的。  尽管有装甲，它还是相当灵活，所以除非你有车辆，否则不要指望能超越它。  我们决定推迟添加远程武器，直到完成最初的现场测试，所以如果你能保持距离，你应该是安全的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "It's fine.  At least now we know for the future."
msgstr "没事。至少现在我们知道了未来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Let's do this, then.  Transfer the location."
msgstr "那我们就开干吧。把地址告诉我。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Let's never do that again."
msgstr "我们再也不要那样做了。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Light retrieval"
msgstr "寻光之旅"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Lovely.  Just a moment; we will transfer the hm12 and handling procedures, which includes information of its last recorded location.\"\n"
"\n"
"The intercom tray thumps several times as objects are placed into it.  After about a minute, it slides open, revealing a slender weapon that looks a bit like a radar gun, a heavy battery, a sheaf of papers in a binder, and a UPS.  \"The hm12 draws power from a connected UPS.  Please remember to bring the specimen back *intact* - battered salvage is of no use to us.  To safely perform the task of deactivation, please review the provided documentation, and pay special attention to the procedures detailed in subsections IV and VII."
msgstr ""
"太棒了。请稍等，我们将提供原型枪和操作手册，其中包括其上次记录位置的信息。\"\n"
"\n"
"托盘发出了几声砰砰响，似乎有物品正被放入托盘。大约一分钟后，它滑开了，露出一把细长的武器，看起来有点像把雷达枪，一个重型电池，一捆装在活页夹里的文件，还有一个UPS电源。\"HM12步枪通过连接的UPS供电。请记住将样本*完好无损*地带回来——破损的残骸对我们没有任何用处。为安全执行此任务，请查阅我们提供的文件，并特别注意第四和第七小节中详述的程序。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Not yet.  I'll get back to it."
msgstr "还没有。我会继续做的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Officially speaking, they were a senior DARPA researcher.  Their corpse should stick out; it's likely the only one not wearing camouflage.  That's all you need to know."
msgstr "官方说法，他曾是DARPA的高级研究员。他们的尸体应该很显眼；可能是唯一一个没有穿迷彩的人。你只需要知道这些。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Oh, but that's not all!  They were coming from a pair of giant fucking tentacles coming out of the ground like a monster movie that were constantly roaring and shaking the whole building, and toxic exploding spiders kept crawling off and shooting poison darts at me until I got away or stopped the tentacles themselves, which wasn't easy because the entire building had come down around them."
msgstr "哦，但还不止这些！它们来自一对巨大的该死触手，像怪物电影里那样从地底下伸出来，不停地咆哮着，摇晃着整栋建筑，有毒的爆炸蜘蛛不断地爬行着，向我发射毒箭，直到我逃开或是被触手挡住，这可并不容易，因为整栋建筑都在它们周围倒塌了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "One of our scientists recently left the building to perform a field test of a prototype robot, but failed to return.  We have not been able to contact them.  Your job would be to investigate the testing site, and return with her and the prototype.  Failing that, return with the data recorder that was attached to our prototype."
msgstr "我们的一位科学家最近离开大楼，对一个原型机器人进行了实地测试，但未能返回。我们无法联系到他。你的任务是调查测试现场，并把她和原型机一起带回来。如果做不到的话，起码把连接在原型机器人上的数据记录器带回来。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"One of our scout drones spotted a partially-malfunctioning robot of unconventional make while tracking an anomalous radiation spike close by.  We project that much knowledge could be gained from a close examination of this subject, and you would be tasked to retrieve it for us intact.  We will equip you with a prototype rifle and instructions on how to use it and deactivate the robot, if you accept.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"The success of this contract requires that the subject be brought back in an inactive state, and *not* destroyed.  A ruined robot is of no scientific value.  We emphasize that you use the hm12 to complete this task, though it will likely be a diffcult shot to make.  A scrambler grenade might also suffice, but an EMP blast would likely destroy the target outright.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Completion of this contract awards 2 HGC, and you will be able to keep the hm12 rifle and the equipment used to operate it."
msgstr ""
"我们的一架侦察机在探测附近异常的放射性峰值时发现了一台部分故障的样式特殊的无人车。我们预计，对这个对象进行仔细研究，可以获得很多知识，你将承担为我们执行此数据回收操作的任务。如果你接受，我们将为为你配备一支原型枪以及完成任务目标所需要的知识。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"任务成功要求将对象恢复到关闭状态，*并非*摧毁它。损坏的无人车没有任何科学价值。我们强调，一定要用原型枪来完成这项任务；EMP爆炸可能会彻底摧毁它。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"我们为此任务支付 2 个 Hub 01 金币，以及所提供的装备作为补偿。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our facility once sourced advanced photonic circuitry from a nearby robotics manufacturer.  Their building suffered major damage during the portal storms, and collapsed almost entirely.  However, preliminary scouting reveals that the basement prototyping lab likely remains intact.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We ask you to investigate the ruins, and if possible, retrieve a template for the fabrication of said photonic circuitry.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Completion of this contract awards 8 HGC, the standard heightened-hazard rate.  We are also willing to provide you with a set of protective gear at a considerable discount upon acceptance of the contract."
msgstr ""
"我们机构曾经从附近的机器人制造厂订购先进光子电路。他们的建筑在空间风暴中遭到了严重破坏，几乎完全倒塌。但是初步侦察显示地下的原型实验室可能还保存完好。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"我们想请你调查一下那间机器人制造厂的废墟，最好能把光子电路的制造模板带回来。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"我们为此任务支付 8 个 Hub 01 金币的标准危险津贴。我们还将在你接受合约后以相当大的折扣向你提供一套防护装备。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Pardon me.\"  The voice briefly turns away from the microphone and asks something.  \"Very well.  I am cleared to tell you that it appeared near the beginning of the portal storms, and during this time, it was logged and documented.  No attempt was ever made to retrieve it before the government collapsed.  That is all I am able to share with you at this time."
msgstr "请稍等。\"声音短暂地从麦克风旁远离，似乎在问些什么。\"很好。我可以告诉你，它在空间风暴开始时出现在附近，在这段时间被识别记录了下来。在政府垮台之前，没人试过把它带过来。这就是我现在能告诉你的所有内容。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Please slow down-"
msgstr "请慢一点——"

#. ~ Description of mission "Data Retrieval"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Reach the LIXA facility, and search the area for anything of interest.  The intercom warned you about a number of undead aboveground, and the high probability of more underground."
msgstr "到达 LIXA 设施，并在该区域搜索任何感兴趣的东西。  对讲机警告你地面上有大量不死生物，而且地下很可能还有更多不死生物。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Light retrieval"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Reach the collapsed tower basement, and search the ruins for a photonic circuitry template.  The intercom warned you about heavy enemy presence, and of the existence of a hazardous environment."
msgstr "前往倒塌大楼的地下室废墟并搜寻光子电路模板。对讲机警告过你那里有大量的敌人，并且环境恶劣。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Return Field Data"
msgstr "取回现场数据"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Return to sender"
msgstr "返还发件者"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Tell me about these heat signatures."
msgstr "和我具体说说热信号。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Tell me about this rifle."
msgstr "和我说说那把原型枪。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "That makes-"
msgstr "这可真是——"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "That seems trivial.  Is there a catch?"
msgstr "这似乎很简单。有什么难点吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "The convoy was composed of vehicles and personnel from the US Army, and it was heavily armed.  Our surveillance of the area has shown that the majority of the slain military personnel have revivified.  Resistance will be heavy, but if possible, you may be able to locate and retrieve the hard case, then exfiltrate without direct combat as long as you can outpace the undead there.  Otherwise, bring a rifle and plenty of ammo."
msgstr "车队由美军车辆和人员组成，全副武装。  我们对该地区的监视表明，大多数阵亡军事人员已经复活。  抵抗将会很激烈，但如果可能的话，你也许能够找到并取回硬箱，然后只要你能超过那里的不死生物，就可以在不直接战斗的情况下潜出。  否则，请带上步枪和充足的弹药。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "The handling procedures you gave me seemed to predate the Cataclysm.  How long had that robot been here?"
msgstr "你们给我的操作手册似乎是在大灾变之前写的。那台无人车在这里有多久了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "The more I hear about this, the worse it sounds."
msgstr "我听得越多，听起来就越糟。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "The weapon worked!  [Hand over the inactive trifacet.]"
msgstr "那把武器生效了！[交出关闭的三琢面。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Then it took me half an hour to find the way down, because there were holes in the floor everywhere, and when I finally did, I was in the insides of a goddamn flesh pit with flooding up to my ankles, and to complement the innards hanging from the ceiling that I couldn't see through the gas that would throw me ten feet and make me start drowning, there were dozens of people fused together in lumps everywhere, and did I mention the poison gas?  Because they were full of it too, and so everything reeked and it felt like being in a giant fucking intestine full of people."
msgstr "然后我花了半个小时才找到下去的路，因为地板上到处都是洞，当我终于下去时，我在一个该死的肉坑里，血水涨到了脚踝，而且作为补充，从我没法透过毒气看见的天花板还垂下各类内脏，能把我扔到十英尺(约3米)外淹死，到处都是几十具尸体聚成的尸堆，我刚刚有没有提到毒气？因为也到处都是，所有东西都散发着恶臭，感觉就像是在一个他妈的充满人的巨大肠道里。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "There is.  If the robot is operational, it's very likely to be hostile and extremely dangerous.  I don't recommend fighting it directly.  Dr. Prado left the building with a handful of EMP grenades.  If you can locate those grenades, use them to disable the prototype instead."
msgstr "有。  如果机器人可以运行，它很可能具有敌意并且极其危险。  不建议直接打。  普拉多博士带着一把电磁脉冲手榴弹离开了大楼。  如果您可以找到这些手榴弹，请使用它们来禁用原型。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "To be specific, there have been anomalous readings that we are unable to explain.  Seismic disturbances have been recorded emanating from the ruins, with a magnitude ranging from two to four, and periodic vocalizations have been documented to exceed 150 decibels.  We are uncertain why or how these phenomena are created."
msgstr "具体来说，有些异常记录我们无法解释。我们记录到废墟中发出了地震干扰，震级从2级到4级不等，周期性发出超过150分贝的声音。我们不确定这些现象产生的原因或方式。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Toxic compounds?"
msgstr "有毒化合物？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Transferring the items now.\"  The intercom tray slides open, revealing an ID card for the facility and what looks like a USB thumb drive.  \"Again: please take care not to lose either of these since we can't exactly make more of them."
msgstr "现在转移物品。”对讲机托盘滑开，露出该机构的 ID 卡和一个看起来像 USB 拇指驱动器的东西。“再次强调：请小心不要丢失其中任何一个，因为我们无法制造更多。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<acknowledged>"
#. ~ Generic acknowledgment of a command.  Comes up a lot and could use more
#. variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Understood."
msgstr "了解。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Very close by.\"  The voice lists off some relative coordinates.  \"Good luck."
msgstr "就在附近。\"声音列出了些相对坐标。\"祝你好运。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "We are as of yet uncertain of its origin and purpose.  Its body most closely resembles a pyramid on what we believe are three sets of legs for mobility.  It is lightly armed, and has attacked our cam-spy drones using high-voltage electric discharge.  We theorize that this is most likely for deterrence, and not to cause direct harm.  Nonetheless, we need to emphasize that its full capabilities are unknown, and we do not know how it will react when confronted with a living threat."
msgstr "到目前为止，我们还不确定它的来源和目的。它的身体看起来最接近一个金字塔，我们认为它底下应该有可以移动的三条腿。它装备了小口径武器，并使用高压放电攻击我们的监控无人机。我们推测这很可能只是为了威慑，而非造成直接伤害。尽管如此，我们需要强调的是，它所拥有的能力是未知的，我们不知道它在面对活体威胁时会做出怎样的反应。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Well, the ID card wouldn't strictly speaking be necessary if you were to find some way of breaching the facility's security doors.\" The voice pauses for a moment, \"But that said we only have the one ID card, so unless you're confident you can get in without it, please don't lose it.  As for the memory stick I would highly recommend you not lose that as portable drives with the required hardware security modules to interface with secure terminals are in short supply these days.  However there may very well be some on-site for you to scavenge if you're lucky."
msgstr "好吧，严格来说，如果你想找到某种方法突破设施的安全门，身份证并不是必需的。”声音停顿了一会儿，“但这就是说，我们只有一张身份证，所以除非你有信心没有它就能进去，否则请不要丢失它。  至于记忆棒，我强烈建议您不要丢失它，因为如今带有与安全终端连接所需的硬件安全模块的便携式驱动器供不应求。  不过，如果幸运的话，现场很可能有一些东西可供您捡拾。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What can you tell me about what they were doing there?"
msgstr "能和我说说关于恐龙的事吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What do you mean by-"
msgstr "你刚刚说——"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What does LIXA even mean?"
msgstr "有什么喝的没有？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What else do you have available?"
msgstr "你们还有别的活吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What is this robot, and what does it look like?"
msgstr "那个无人车是什么，长什么样？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What should I expect to go up against?"
msgstr "我会面对些什么敌人？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What would you like to discuss?"
msgstr "你想谈些什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"When the portal storms started, the government issued an evacuation order for critical personnel and sent convoys to retrieve them, with our head of AI research among the recalled.  We recently discovered that he died when the convoy transferring him was ambushed in the initial chaos, but his corpse and belongings might remain intact enough to benefit from his research.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We want you to travel to the convoy and locate the body, if possible.  His evacuation protocol included retrieving and storing as much of the data from his facility as possible, to be stored in a code-locked hard case.  If this hard case is present, retrieve it, and bring it back here.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We offer the standard hazard pay of 4 HGC for this contract."
msgstr ""
"当空间风暴开始时，政府向关键人员发出了疏散命令，并派出了车队来营救他们，我们的人工智能研究负责人也名列其中。我们最近发现，他意外身亡了，运送他的车队在最初的混乱中遭遇了伏击，但他的尸体和随身物品还可能是完好无损的，足以从他的研究中受益。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"如果可能的话，我们希望你前往车队所在处并找到尸体。他的疏散命令中包括从他所在设施中收集下载尽可能多的数据，并将其存储在一个带密码锁的保险箱中。如果这个保险箱还在的话，找到它，并把它带回这里。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"我们为此任务支付 4 个 Hub 01 金币的标准危险津贴。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Where is this manufacturer?"
msgstr "这个制造厂在哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Who was this person, and what do they look like?"
msgstr "这个人是谁，他长什么样？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Will this weapon work on other robots, as well?"
msgstr "这把枪对其他机器人也能用吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Yeah, yeah.  You're welcome."
msgstr "是的，是的。不客气。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Yes, almost certainly.  UGVs, autonomous CROWS units, manhacks, and other drones should all be vulnerable to the weapon, although we advise great caution; as you might have found, it can be difficult to precisely hit the target."
msgstr "我们相信也可以；在交给你之前，它在现有的和理论模型上进行了密集的内部测试。无人车、无人CROWS炮塔、飞锯无人机和其他机器人都应该能够被这把枪瘫痪，尽管我们建议小心使用；武器的射程很短，不是为了瞄准远处的敌人而设计的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You certainly gave me a run for my money, I'll say that much."
msgstr "我只想说，你们这次可是让我为了些钱而竭尽全力了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You mention hazard pay.  What dangers are there?"
msgstr "你提到危险津贴。有什么危险？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You're back.  Do you have anything to report?"
msgstr "你回来了。有什么要报告的吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You've got a deal.  I'll track down your robot."
msgstr "就这么定了。我会找到你要的无人车。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Your hesitation is understandable.  Unfortunately, we have already taken all possible measures to obtain data and information remotely, but we are unable to develop our understanding further without a physical presence."
msgstr "你的顾虑是可以理解的。不幸的是，我们已经尽所有可能来远程获取数据和信息，但如果没有实地探访，我们无法进一步增进了解。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Your scientist was dead, but I disabled the prototype.  Is this what you were looking for?  [Hand over the prototype I/O recorder.]"
msgstr "你们的科学家死了，但我成功瘫痪了机器人。这就是你要找的吗？[交出原型I/O记录器。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Data Retrieval]"
msgstr "[合约：寻光之旅]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Iron Safari]"
msgstr "[合约：狩猎钢铁]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Light retrieval]"
msgstr "[合约：寻光之旅]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Return to sender]"
msgstr "[合约：返还发件者]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Detail the conditions at the collapsed tower and its basement.  This will advance time by ten minutes.]"
msgstr "[详细说明倒塌大楼及其地下室的情况。一直讲了快十分钟。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Detail the conditions at the research facility.  This will advance time by ten minutes.]"
msgstr "[详细说明倒塌大楼及其地下室的情况。一直讲了快十分钟。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Let them know how bad that mission REALLY was.]"
msgstr "[让他们知道那个任务有多么糟糕。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[PER 8] The original markings on that case had been scratched out.  Who did it really belong to?"
msgstr "[PER 8] 该箱子上的原始标记已被刮掉。  它真正属于谁？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Stop talking.]"
msgstr "[停下来。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "…Just forget it.  Let's never speak of this again."
msgstr "……算了吧。我们再也别提这个了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "…Uh.  We are- thank you for finding the photonics.  We will, ah, make sure that the threat conditions of your future contracts are adequately assessed.  Um.  Thank you."
msgstr "……嗯。我们——非常感谢你找到光子电路。我们会确保今后合约中的威胁条件得到充分评估。嗯。非常感谢。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "Given the context of your assignment, we are willing to sell you a set of our protective gear - a gas mask and an environmental suit - at a considerable discount.  We will part with it for two exchange coins.\"  The intercom waits expectantly.  \"Actually, hold on, we might not have one in your size…"
msgstr "考虑到你的任务特点，我们可以按特别优惠价打折卖给你一套我们的防护装备——防毒面具和全套防护服。只要两枚我们的金币。\"对讲机停了一会。\"说回来，等等，我们可能没有你这个尺寸的……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "I have to give it a thought."
msgstr "我得再想想。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "I'll have to give it some thought."
msgstr "我得再想想。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "To assist your operations, we are willing to sell you a map of the local area, as surveyed by our cam-spy drones.  Its standing price is 1 HGC."
msgstr "为了协助你在本地的行动，我们愿意向你出售一份由我们的监控无人机所勘测的本地地图。它的标准价格是 1 个 Hub 01 金币。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid ""
"What the gas mask does should be obvious; we'll provide you with a cartridge, of course.  The environment suit is full-body, and protects you from water, harmful radiation, and environmental hazards.  It's also rated to protect from electric shocks of up to twelve thousand volts.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Bear in mind that the suit isn't armor.  It will keep you safe from the environment, but it's just Nomex and it won't protect you from anything stronger than a punch.  The modular defense system is designed to fit over it, so I'd urge you to bring them both if fighting is unavoidable."
msgstr ""
"防毒面具的作用应该是显而易见的；当然，我们会提供一个滤芯。防护服是全身防护服，防水、防有害辐射和环境防护。而且通过评测还可以防止高达1.2万伏的电击。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"请记住，这套防护服不是盔甲。它可以防护环境危害，但它只是芳纶做的，没法保护你免受任何比拳头更强的伤害。模块化防御系统的设计可以穿在它上面，所以如果战斗不可避免，我建议你把它们都穿上。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "What will it do for me?"
msgstr "它对我有什么用？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "[1 HGC] Deal!"
msgstr "[1 金币]成交！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "[2 HGC] Deal!"
msgstr "[2 金币]成交！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "As I said, that's the thing I need.  You don't need to know what's that exactly.  Just grab all things you find in the safe, and call it a day."
msgstr "我已经说了我要你干啥。你不需要知道具体是什么，把保险箱里面的东西打包带给我就完事了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "At last!  Give me a second to check if it isn't damaged.  Here, take this for your troubles."
msgstr "谢天谢地！让我看看它们有没有损坏。给，拿着这个来解决你的问题。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Can we just talk it over?"
msgstr "我们不能好好说话吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Did you get the card already?"
msgstr "你拿到材料了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Do I have a <swear> exclamation sign over my <swear> head, like I'm a <swear> quest-giver from some <swear> video game?"
msgstr "我<swear>头上是不是有个<swear>感叹号，好像我是<swear>电子游戏里面的<swear>NPC一样？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Fine, I'll get it sooner or later."
msgstr "好吧，反正我早晚都会拿到那东西的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Gee, what's the matter with you?  Okay, okay, I'm leaving."
msgstr "噫，你没问题吧？好吧，好吧，我这就离开。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Get the military ID card from the chief's office"
msgstr "拿回局长办公室的材料"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Great!  Don't try to use the card now, just bring it straight to me."
msgstr "伟大的！  现在不要尝试使用该卡，直接将其交给我即可。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hello there.  Haven't seen you around before.  You must be from the other wing.  Managed to survive, huh?"
msgstr "你好，我没见过你。你一定是从另一个区来的。总算活下来了，是吧？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Here's the job…"
msgstr "任务是这样的……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, <fuck_you>!"
msgstr "嘿，<fuck_you>！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, <fuck_you>!  You'll regret that!"
msgstr "嘿，<fuck_you>！你会后悔的！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, no need to be hostile.  Here you go, I don't need it anyway."
msgstr "嗨，没必要这么激动，给你了，反正我也不需要。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, where did you get it?  Nevermind, just give it to me.  Just <swear> now."
msgstr "哈，你从哪儿拿到这个的？算了，直接给我吧，<swear>就现在。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it doesn't matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING ENTRY DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules are: don't fuck with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a reason with someone from us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"哎，你他妈的是谁啊？我没见过你。嗨，去他妈的，我也没兴趣知道。\n"
"告诉你这儿的规矩。最重要的第一条：进门后一定关好他妈的门！没问题的话，剩下的规矩是：不要惹我们，不要偷我们东西，不要没事找架打。懂了吗，瘪三？滚吧！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
