#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "<the_cataclysm> didn't spare us humans.  Our former selves would look at us in disgust at the things we do for survival.  At least, that's what I was told.  I heard reports of arachnids deep in the woods.  I can't exactly pinpoint where their webs are, but I'm sure you'll figure it out once you're stuck in them.  I'd like me a spider egg!"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>没有放过我们人类。我们以前的自己会厌恶我们为生存所做的一切。至少，这是他们告诉我的。我听到森林深处有巨型蜘蛛的报告。我无法确切地指出它们的网在哪里，但我相信一旦你陷入其中，你会知道的。我想要一颗巨型蛛卵！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "A book store should have enough, I'll mark one for you."
msgstr "书店里应该有不少，我这就给你标记一间。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "A bookstore or office supply should have tons of it."
msgstr "书店或办公用品店里应该有很多。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "A house or grocery store should have some."
msgstr "民房或杂货店应该有一些。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "A jewelry store should have a pair.  If not, I'd check a wedding venue."
msgstr "珠宝店应该有成对的。如果没有，我会去婚礼会场附近找找。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "A laboratory or pharmaceutical factory should have one."
msgstr "实验室或制药厂应该有一些。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "A public works or a craft shop should have some lying around.  If not, try a steel mill."
msgstr "市政工程部或工艺店里应该有不少。如果没有，可以去钢厂试试。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "A radio tower should have some lying around in storage."
msgstr "无线电塔的仓库里应该存了一些。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "A textile museum should have one lying around."
msgstr "纺织博物馆应该有一台。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I'll find someone else."
msgstr "好吧，我去找别人。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Alright, where's it all at?"
msgstr "好吧，都在哪里？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Alright.  I'll do it myself."
msgstr "好吧，那我自己来做。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "An office building should have tons."
msgstr "随便一间办公楼应该都有成吨的铅笔。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "An old doctor's office should have some.  Some of them have those fancy autodocs upstairs."
msgstr "老式诊所里应该会有一些。有些诊所的楼上甚至配备了那种高级的自动医疗设备。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "An old factory might have one, or a hobby shop."
msgstr "旧工厂里可能会有一些，或者是业余爱好的商店。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "An outdoor emporium should have some.  Of course, you could always dig them up from a lakeshore or driveway."
msgstr "户外建材商场里应该有一些。当然，你总是可以在湖边或路边挖到它们。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Any luck with that horror?"
msgstr "干掉那些怪物了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Any luck, survivor?"
msgstr "运气如何，幸存者？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Are the heretics purged?"
msgstr "那些异教徒被清算了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Are you standing with them?"
msgstr "你和他们是一边的吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "As a matter of fact, yes you can.  You see, we're running low on toilet paper.  It's not something we can't live without, but it's luxury we can afford.  I can pay you handsomely if you find us ten rolls of toilet paper."
msgstr "事实上，是的，你可以。  你看，我们的卫生纸快用完了。  它不是我们离不开的东西，但它是我们买得起的奢侈品。  如果你能为我们找到十卷卫生纸，我可以付给你丰厚的报酬。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "As expected of such a person…"
msgstr "一点都不出乎意料……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Attack at night to surprise them.  Barring that, go in full force, guns blazing.  I wouldn't try to call a horde in, I don't want to ruin such a holy place."
msgstr "等到夜晚再进攻，给他们一个惊喜。除此之外，全速前进，炮火全开。我可不会试图引来尸潮，我不想破坏这样一处圣地。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Bible Belt"
msgstr "圣经带"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Blasphemy, heresy, the righteous judgement of God!  I have found the scum of Hell pillaging a church for valuables!  Even in <the_cataclysm>, I shall not stand for this.  I want you to go there and wipe those <swear> <name_b>s from the Earth."
msgstr "亵渎，异端，上帝的正义审判！我发现地狱的渣滓在教堂里掠夺贵重文物！即使是<the_cataclysm>，我也绝不会支持这么干。我要你去那里，把那些<swear><name_b>从地球上抹除。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Blessings be unto you."
msgstr "祝福你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Blessings be unto you.  I'll start on the garden right away."
msgstr "祝福你。我马上就开始造花圃。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Bring one last trophy to Russell Connelly.  Harvest a sting from a bee."
msgstr "为拉塞尔·康纳利带来最后一件战利品。从巨型蜜蜂身上获得毒刺。"

