#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I do appreciate it."
msgstr "非常感谢。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I don't have any butcher knives in here.  It's difficult to cut anything hard without it.  It's good to have one, even though I won't use it that often.  Could you get me one?"
msgstr "我这连把屠宰刀都没，没了它只要是稍微硬点的东西都很难切。要是有一把就好了，虽然我平时也不会经常用。你能帮我找来一把吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I guess I have to cut them with my steak knife."
msgstr "我想我只能用我自己的牛排刀来切了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I guess I'll just skip that note."
msgstr "我想我只能不弹那个音了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I have a job for you…"
msgstr "我这里有份活给你……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I have a plan…"
msgstr "我有一个主意……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I have the location for an alien crash site.  I want you to investigate and bring me anything you'd find interesting."
msgstr "我这里有个异界撞击点的位置。我想让你调查一下，把你找到的所有奇怪的东西带给我。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I know most cathedrals keep small relics, that's a good place to look."
msgstr "我知道许多大教堂里都保存着小巧圣物，这应该是个不错的目标。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I know this doesn't sound important, but I am running low on salt.  We don't just need it as a seasoning, it's also vital for food preservation.  Could you find about 20 pounds of salt for me?"
msgstr "我知道这也许听起来不那么重要，但是我手头已经快没盐了。这里不光要盐当调味料，而且它还是长期贮藏食品的关键原料。你能帮我找来大概20磅重的盐吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a mechanical pump to finish construction."
msgstr "我需要一台机械泵来完成建造。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
