msgstr "我需要你的帮助……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I really appreciate your help.  Don't worry, you won't leave empty-handed."
msgstr "我真是太感谢你了。别担心，你不会空手而归的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
