msgstr "我知道这任务看起来十分艰巨，但你能够赚到很多钱。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I want to take a look at some of the missing posters for any links.  If you could get me twenty-five of them, I could start my analysis.  Make sure to get posters for adults, I don't think any children could provide links."
msgstr "我想分析一下那些寻人启事的海报，寻找任何线索。如果你能给我找来25张，我就可以开始分析了。记着一定要关于成人的海报，我可不认为那些儿童的寻人启事能够提供什么线索。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I want to try making my own cloth, it's getting harder to find the quantities I need.  I'll buy an electric spinning wheel if you can find one, it'd vastly expedite the process."
msgstr "我想试着自己做布料，我现在越来越难找够需要的量了。如果你能找到的话，我想要付钱买一台电动纺车，这可以大大加快制作过程。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I want you to have these few things of mine, I won't be needing them anymore.  I think I'll take a walk in the woods, get some fresh air for these old bones…"
msgstr "我想让你收下我这几样东西，我不再需要它们了。我想我会在树林里散散步，为这些老骨头呼吸些新鲜空气……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I wish you the best of luck, may God guide your path."
msgstr "祝你好运，愿你信仰的那个上帝指引你前进的道路。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I wish you the best, pal.  I appreciate it."
msgstr "我祝你一切顺利，伙计。我感激不尽。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I wonder what the link could be.  Too much information?  Government conspiracy?  Aliens?  I'll have to find out."
msgstr "我想知道他们会有什么联系。信息太多了？政府阴谋？外星人？我得弄清楚。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd check an electronics store for one."
msgstr "我会去电器店里找一台。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd check one of the local schools for a USB stick with it."
msgstr "我会去本地的学校找那种能够随身携带的U盘。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to have better food storage."
msgstr "我想要更好的食物储存。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to have some cans to store food in."
msgstr "我想要一些罐头来储存食物。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to read some mystery novels."
msgstr "我想读点悬疑小说。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to read some trapping guides."
msgstr "我想阅读一些诱捕指南。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd look anywhere there's food waste or scrap piles.  We can wash out the cans when we get them."
msgstr "我会寻找任何有食物垃圾或废料堆的地方。  拿到罐头后我们可以把它们洗掉。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd loot libraries and bookstores."
msgstr "要是换我会去图书馆或者书店里找找。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd mean so much to the both of us, and there's a lot of money involved."
msgstr "我想这对我们俩都很重要，而且涉及的钱不是一笔小数目。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd poke around any industrial sites for some."
msgstr "我会试着去任何工厂里找一找。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd try a gardening store or a home supply store would have some."
msgstr "要我说园艺店或家居用品店应该会有。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd wear a hazmat suit while I'm in there.  Those spores are absolutely nasty for your health, if my observations of <zombies> nearby are any indication."
msgstr "我在里面的时候会穿上防护服。要说我对附近的<zombies>观察有任何结论的话，就是这些孢子对你的健康绝对有害。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll find someone else, then."
msgstr "那我只能找其他人了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to be careful with this thing, thanks for getting it for me.  Let's see what this can do…"
msgstr "我必须小心处理它，谢谢你帮我把它弄过来。让我们看看它有什么效果……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to look for them myself…"
msgstr "看来只能我自己去找了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to make my own, I guess…"
msgstr "我想我得自己去找了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm looking to construct some fortifications around the church, should any of Satan's devils decide to run amok.  We have most of the material needed for such an undertaking, but processing our raw lumber is taking far too long.  I've heard a planer could do such in a fraction of the time; I'll pay for two of them."
msgstr "我想在教堂周围建造一些防御工事，以防撒旦的恶魔们到处横冲直撞。我们拥有这样一项任务所需的大部分材料，但加工我们的原木耗时太长了。我听说一台刨床可以在很短的时间内完成；我可以出钱买两台。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm not gonna go and fix this <swear> mess."
msgstr "我不会去收拾这<swear>烂摊子的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm running out of antipsychotics, and Arturo is starting to see things again.  I'd pay for seventy-five antipsychotic pills, and be eternally grateful."
msgstr "我的抗精神病药快用完了，阿图罗又开始看到怪东西了。我愿意为 75 颗抗精神病药付一大笔钱，并永远感激在心。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm starting to run low on cloth for my sewing.  I think three hundred cloth patches should hold me for a while; I'll pay you for them if you get me some."
msgstr "我缝纫用的棉布开始缺了。我想三百片棉布片应该能够我用上一会儿了；如果你给我一些，我会付钱给你的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm wanting to experiment with some of the more…  otherworldly fauna that have appeared recently.  I saw these pink berries inside a fungal infestation the other day before I burned it with a Molotov.  If you could get me one, I can pay you with a discount on my medicine."
msgstr "我想试验一下最近出现的一些更……非同寻常的物种。前几天，我在用燃烧弹烧光一处真菌感染之前，我在那里看到了这种粉红色的浆果。如果你能给我带一个来，以后我的药可以给你打折。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm wanting to try growing some new plants.  I've never tried growing cactus; if you could find some seeds for me, I'd pay you."
msgstr "我想尝试种植一些新植物。我从未尝试过种植仙人掌；如果你能为我找到一些种子，我会付钱给你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I've assembled quite a collection of evidence in my research, and I want an easier way to organize it.  If you could get me one of those e-ink tablets, I could scan all my documents into an easily-preserved digital format.  There's some money for you, too."
msgstr "我在研究中收集了相当多的证据，我需要一种更简单的方法来整理它们。如果你能给我找来一台电纸书，我就可以把所有文件扫描成易于保存的数字格式。当然，还会付些钱给你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I've been drawing up some plans to expand our food storage around here.  Now that we won't starve to death anytime soon, our old crates just aren't cutting it, so we're going to build a small warehouse to store everything, and I've gathered a crew to build it.  We've got most of the materials covered, but we don't have enough sheet metal to make the shelves.  If you could get us about 5,000 pounds of the stuff, I'll pay you handsomely with what we have.  How does that sound?"
msgstr "我一直在制定一些计划来扩大我们这里的食物储存。  现在我们不会很快饿死，我们的旧板条箱实在不行了，所以我们要建一个小仓库来存放所有东西，我已经召集了一个工作人员来建造它。  我们已经准备好了大部分材料，但我们没有足够的金属板来制作架子。  如果你能给我们大约 5,000 磅的东西，我会用我们现有的东西付给你丰厚的报酬。  听起来怎么样？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I've been looking to spruce up this place with some iconography, and a small relic would do just that.  It'd help tremendously with morale around here, so I need you to find one for me."
msgstr "我一直想用一些圣像画来装饰这个地方，一件小巧的圣物就能做到这一点。这将极大地提高这里的士气，所以我需要你为我找一个来。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I've been writing for a bit, and I've used up my pencils.  If you could get me thirty more, I'll give you some money."
msgstr "我已经写了一段时间了，但我的铅笔用完了。如果你能再给我带三十只来，我会给你一些钱。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I've decided to broaden my horizons with my research, now I need more general documents for examination, get the big picture.  If you could get me two hundred files, on anything, I'll pay you for them."
msgstr "我决定为我的研究拓宽一下视野，现在我需要更多的普通文件来分析，了解全局。如果你能给我带来两百份文件，我会付钱给你的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I've decided to start making more concentrated remedies for more serious cases, but I don't have a way of refining any herbs to that degree.  I'd pay for a chemistry set."
msgstr "我已经决定制作一些浓缩药剂来治疗更严重的病例，但我没有办法能够将草药提炼到那种程度的手段。我可以付钱买一套化学用品包。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I've got an idea to solve my problem.  I'll pay you if you can find seven oxycodone pills for me; the ones they used to prescribe after a surgery."
msgstr "我有个解决我问题的办法。如果你能为我找来七片羟考酮，我会付钱给你；他们过去在手术后给我开过这个药。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I've had a craving for fish recently.  Could you find three cans of tuna for me?  I'll pay you for them."
msgstr "我最近很想吃鱼。你能给我找三罐金枪鱼吗？我会付钱给你的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I've started working on a small project of mine which requires a great deal of computational input.  A piece of MatheMAX software would be a great help."
msgstr "我已经开始做我的一个小项目，这需要大量的数据计算。一套MatheMAX软件将成为很大的助力。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "If I were you, I'd bring a gun and a butcher knife.  I don't think bug spray work anymore."
msgstr "如果我是你，我会带上一把枪和一把屠宰刀。我认为杀虫剂应该已经不起作用了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "If you can find a steel mill, I'd look there."
msgstr "如果你能找到一家钢铁厂，我就去那里看看。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr "如果你看到这个，说明游戏出bug了。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Investigate the Center"
msgstr "调查难民中心"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It feels like I'm doing this for revenge.  I have one last mission for you.  Ever seen those ginormous bee hives?  Well, I can tell you where the closest one is.  Just kill off one stray bee, harvest its stinger and bring it to me."
msgstr "感觉我这样做是为了复仇。我还有最后一个任务给你。见过那些巨大的蜂巢吗？好吧，我可以告诉你最近的一个在哪里。只需杀死一只走散的蜜蜂，收获它的毒刺，然后把它带回来给我。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It'd really help me in getting your stuff to you faster."
msgstr "这能让我更快地把你订的东西交到你手上。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It'd really help us…"
msgstr "这真的帮我们大忙了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It's less like a well, and more like a covered pit currently.  I'll need you to find a mechanical pump, one that will make this <swear> thing work."
msgstr "它不像是一口井，更像是一个有盖的坑。我需要你找来一台机械泵，一个能让这<swear>家伙运作起来的泵。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It's not a big deal, it isn't that urgent."
msgstr "没什么大不了的，这件事没那么急。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It's okay, I can do without them.  Just let me know if you reconsider."
msgstr "没关系，没那些我也能行。如果你改变心意了，告诉我就行。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Its a simple job."
msgstr "这活很简单。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just bring it to me when you have it."
msgstr "你找到后给我就行了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just bring them to me when you have it."
msgstr "当你有的时候把它们带给我就可以了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "如果你改变主意就和我说一声。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Kill some bandits for Helena Misinter."
msgstr "为海伦娜·米森特干掉一些强盗。"

#. ~ Description of mission "End The Nightmare"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Kill whatever's keeping Zachary up at night."
msgstr "杀死那些让扎卡里晚上睡不着的东西。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to find that pump?"
msgstr "找到那个机械泵了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to succeed, survivor?"
msgstr "成功了吗，幸存者？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Mathematical Measures"
msgstr "数学手段"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you, <name_g>."
msgstr "愿上帝保佑你，<name_g>。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you."
msgstr "愿上帝保佑你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God protect you."
msgstr "愿上帝保佑你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May the Lord bless you."
msgstr "愿上帝保佑你。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Missing Persons"
msgstr "失踪人士"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Much obliged, survivor.  Thanks to you, we don't need to worry about where our water's gonna come from.  Here, take this as a token of our gratitude."
msgstr "非常感激，幸存者。多亏了你，我们不必再担心水从哪里来了。给你，这是我们的谢礼。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Music shops should have some."
msgstr "民房或杂货店应该有一些。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Natural Chemistry"
msgstr "天然化学"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Nevermind then.  I hope you'll change your mind."
msgstr "没关系的，等你改变主意了再来找我。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Nice catch!  Friend, you've proven yourself to be an extraordinary survivor.  Maybe there's still hope for humanity.  I'll take that egg, thank you very much.  Here's your reward and some bullets for your effort."
msgstr "漂亮的收获！朋友，你已经证明自己是个非凡的幸存者。也许人类还有希望。请给我那颗卵，非常感谢。这是你的报酬和一些子弹作为奖励。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "No electricity for us then."
msgstr "看来我们用不上电了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Now that we have some canning pots from Helena, we can start storing foodstuffs more easily around here.  Recycling our old tin cans is great and all, but if we get a big influx of new foods, then we can't properly store it all.  As such, if you could find about 100 more empty tin cans for me, I'd really appreciate it."
msgstr "现在我们有了一些来自海伦娜的罐头罐，我们可以在这里更轻松地储存食物。  回收旧锡罐固然很棒，但如果大量新食品涌入，我们就无法妥善储存它们。  因此，如果您能为我找到大约 100 个空罐头，我将非常感激。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Now that we've got a steady supply of water, I've been thinking about raising some livestock.  I'm starting with some chickens I found on a farm the other day, but I don't have a coop for them.  If you can get me 150 nails, I can start building one."
msgstr "现在我们有了稳定的水源，我一直在考虑养些家禽。我们可以从前几天在农场找到的几只鸡开始，但我们缺少一间鸡舍。如果你能给我找来150根钉子，我可以开始造一个。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Now that's some enthusiasm, pal.  Ever since our water supply shut off, we've been using the nearby river for most of our water needs.  Who knows how many bloated corpses have decayed in that.  I want to construct a well, but I'm missing some building materials - eight pipes to be exact."
msgstr "这份热情可不赖，伙计。自从我们的供水中断后，我们就一直使用附近的河流来满足我们的大部分用水需求。谁知道有多少臃肿的尸体在里面腐烂过了。我想造一口井，但我缺少一些建筑材料——准确地说缺八根钢管。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Now we can get in touch with a lot more people, see what's out there.  Thank you, <name_g>."
msgstr "现在我们可以接触更多的人，了解外面的情况。非常感谢。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a guitar string"
msgstr "找到吉他弦"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Office buildings, police stations, any high-profile place should have what we want."
msgstr "办公楼，警察局，任何文件集散地都应该有我们想要的东西。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Oh thank you!  Darryl will be so happy to hear about this!  Take there for your payment, it must've been hard for you."
msgstr "哦，谢谢！达里尔听到这个消息会很高兴的！这是给你的报酬，你一定费了不少力。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Oh thank you!  Now I can finally get a nights sleep.  Here, I've got some icons saved up, I want you to have them."
msgstr "哦，谢天谢地！现在我终于可以好好睡一晚了。给你，我存了一些圣像，我想它们都归你了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Okay, great.  We're gonna create a charger and a generator all in one.  Here's the battle plan.  Zack could create the framework, you'll get me a solar array or four solar panels.  The rest I can craft or repurpose from the bus.  Helena's promised us a reward if this thing lives up to her standards."
msgstr "好的，太棒了。我们将造台多合一充电发电机。这是作战计划。扎克可以搭建框架，你可以给我找来一块太阳能板，剩下的部分我可以自己造或者从公交车上拆下来。海伦娜答应过我们，如果这东西符合她的标准，她会给我们奖励。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Olwen and I have been dating for a while now, and I was planning on asking her to marry me.  I never got the chance to buy our rings before <the_cataclysm>, but I think I'll surprise her with some in a few days.  If you could get me two of them, I'll pay a fair price: $250 in icons."
msgstr "奥尔文和我已经交往了一段时间，我正打算向她求婚。我在<the_cataclysm>以前从未有过买戒指的机会，但我想几天后我会给她一些惊喜。如果你能给我找来两枚戒指，我会给你一个公道价：价值250美元的圣像。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "One of my guitar strings busted from where I smacked a zombie.  If you could get me a piano wire, I can fix my guitar."
msgstr "我的一根吉他弦在我砸碎丧尸脑袋时断了。如果你能给我找来一根铁丝，我可以用它来代替。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Out Of This World Cures"
msgstr "此药只应天上有"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Pebble Pusher"
msgstr "推石子的人"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Pickled Meals"
msgstr "腌制的一餐"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Picky Meals"
msgstr "挑剔的一餐"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Planning Planers"
msgstr "规划刨床"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Please bring it back as soon as possible."
msgstr "请尽快把它带回来。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Please?  The dating scene isn't that big around here."
msgstr "求求你了，这里的约会场面没那么大。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Plumbing Maintenance"
msgstr "管道维护"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Preservation of Sustenance"
msgstr "维持生计"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Prickled Meals"
msgstr "刺痛的一餐"

#. ~ Description of mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Purge the cultists in exchange for <reward_count:icon> icons."
msgstr "清除邪教徒以换取 <reward_count:icon> 个圣像。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Purge the heretics."
msgstr "消灭那些异教徒。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Purging Heresy"
msgstr "清除异端"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Radio-active"
msgstr "无线电激活"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Relic Recovery"
msgstr "回收圣物"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Remnants of Civilization"
msgstr "文明遗迹"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Renewable Energy"
msgstr "可再生能源"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Retrieve Thorazine"
msgstr "取回冬眠灵"

#. ~ Description of mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Retrieve a religious relic for Greenwood in exchange for <reward_count:icon> icons."
msgstr "为格林伍德取回一件宗教遗物，以换取 <reward_count:icon> 个圣像。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
msgstr "获取生育保健品"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Righteous judgement shall come!"
msgstr "正义的审判即将到来！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "See who's over there."
msgstr "看看谁在那里。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Since <the_cataclysm> happened, I've had a surprising amount of free time.  I want to start writing, but there's very little paper around here.  For the time being, eight hundred sheets should do; I'll pay if you can get it for me."
msgstr "从<the_cataclysm>以后，我有了惊人的空闲时间。我想开始写作，但这里的纸张很缺。目前，给我八百张纸就够了；如果你能帮我拿到，我会付钱的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Since we've got all the stuff to store away food, I figure that it's time we get some more.  I've been talking it over with Russell, and I think setting out animal traps is a good way to go.  The problem is, nobody here knows how to do it.  I've heard that The Modern Trapper is a good place to start, so if you could get me a copy, I'd really appreciate it."
msgstr "既然我们已经有了所有用来储存食物的东西，我想我们是时候多买一些了。  我一直在和拉塞尔讨论这个问题，我认为设置动物陷阱是一个好方法。  问题是，这里没有人知道该怎么做。  我听说《现代捕手》是一个很好的起点，所以如果你能给我一本，我将非常感激。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found it?"
msgstr "那么，你找到了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found the books?"
msgstr "那么，你找到书了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found the cans?"
msgstr "那么，你找到罐子了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Someone's house might have one."
msgstr "随便某个房子就可能有一根。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Sometimes it gets a little bit boring up here, and I like to read something to take my mind off of things.  Problem is, I've run out of books.  I've been wanting to read some mystery novels as of late, so could you get me three of them?"
msgstr "有时这里会有点无聊，我喜欢读一些东西来分散我的注意力。  问题是，我的书已经用完了。  我最近想看一些悬疑小说，你能给我买三本吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Sorry, I had to find someone else since you didn't come through."
msgstr "抱歉，因为你没来，所以我得找别人了。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Spinning Wheels"
msgstr "转动的纺车"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Store Up Your Grain"
msgstr "储存你的谷物"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Take care of yourself out there."
msgstr "在外面照顾好自己。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I can't cut anything with this dull knife."
msgstr "你愿意接受这个任务，真是太谢谢了。我用这把钝刀切不了东西。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr "多谢帮忙，这是报酬。我还有一件事要请你帮忙。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you so much!  I'll get back to work on my manuscript, I should have it ready in a month or so."
msgstr "非常感谢！我会完成我的初稿的，我想再过一个月左右应该就能完成了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you so much!  This should last for a while."
msgstr "非常感谢！这应该够用一段时间了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <granny_name_g>.  I'm glad the youngsters still help the elderly."
msgstr "谢谢你，<granny_name_g>。我很高兴年轻人仍然帮助老年人。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  Take these for your trouble."
msgstr "谢谢你，<name_g>。这些给你当作报酬。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  The truth is ever closer!"
msgstr "谢谢你，<name_g>。真相越来越接近了！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  This should do me for a while."
msgstr "谢谢你，<name_g>。这应该够用一段时间了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, here's your payment."
msgstr "谢谢，这是你的报酬。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, me and Russell will start studying it soon."
msgstr "谢谢你，我和拉塞尔很快就会开始研究它。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, now we won't have to worry about running out of food in the winter."
msgstr "谢谢你们，现在我们再也不用担心冬天没有食物了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Arturo will be happy to get these."
msgstr "非常感谢。阿图罗会很高兴得到这些药的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  I don't like killing people, but this time we had too.  Here, take this; its some of our internal money that we've started using.  You know those religious pamphlets shaped like bills people would leave?  These are some of those, couldn't stand 'em myself."
msgstr "非常感谢。我不喜欢杀人，但这次我们别无选择。拿着这个；这是我们开始使用的一些内部货币。你知道那些形状像钞票的宗教宣传册吗？这些就是其中的一部分，我自己有时候都受不了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  I should have some eggs in a week, once I finish the coop.  Come back and buy some!"
msgstr "非常感谢。我这个星期内应该就能吃上鸡蛋了，等我把鸡舍造完。记得回来买点吧！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Maybe you people aren't so bad after all."
msgstr "非常感谢。也许你们毕竟没那么坏。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  This will keep me busy for a while.  Please take this as a token of my gratitude."
msgstr "谢谢你。这些书够我读上一阵子的了。请收下这个，这是我的谢礼。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  You're welcome to some of our first batch, if you're interested."
msgstr "非常感谢。如果你感兴趣的话，欢迎试吃我们的首批产品。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks <name_g>, I'm counting on you."
msgstr "谢谢你，<name_g>，我可都指望你了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks for accepting this task.  It'll take a load off my shoulders.  I finally won't have to worry about this problem anymore."
msgstr "多谢你接了这个活。真是让我轻松了不少。我终于不用再担心这个问题了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_g>."
msgstr "多谢啊，<name_g>！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks, make sure you're ready for whatever beast is waiting for you."
msgstr "谢谢，请确保你已经准备好对付那个不知道是什么东西的怪物。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks, you'll be the first to see my writing."
msgstr "谢谢，你会是我作品的第一个读者。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'll give you a performance when you get back with it."
msgstr "谢谢。你回来后我会给你表演一场的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "That fungus is going to kill us all if it isn't stopped."
msgstr "如果不加以阻止，那种真菌会杀死我们所有人。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "That's all right.  Not everyone is cut out for this."
msgstr "没关系，不是每个人都对此感兴趣。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "That's too bad…"
msgstr "那可真糟糕……"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "The Honeymooners"
msgstr "蜜月伴侣"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "The best place to look is probably on rooftops.  You'll need a wrench, and maybe a stepladder to get up and down safely."
msgstr "最好的观看地点可能是屋顶。  您需要一把扳手，也许还需要一个活梯才能安全地上下。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "The great work is now complete.  Are you good with words, by the way?  I was thinking, maybe you should be the one to negotiate with Helena.  But whatever you do, don't accept their icons.  Our work is worth a lot more than their valueless currency."
msgstr "伟大的作品完成了。顺便问一下，你擅长言辞吗？我在想，也许你应该是和海伦娜谈判的人。但无论你做什么，都不要收他们的圣像。我们的工作比他们毫无价值的货币更有价值。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "The storage room of a pharmacy should have them."
msgstr "药房的储藏室应该有不少。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "There should be plenty on poster-boards around town.  A police station should have a lot."
msgstr "镇上的告示栏里应该贴了很多海报。警察局里应该也有很多。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "There's a lot of places to look.  They are common in house kitchens, restaurants or grocery stores."
msgstr "在很多地方都能找到，像是在普通住宅的厨房里，餐馆里，又或者是杂货店里。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "There's a weird fungus that started to invade ever since <the_cataclysm>, and several individuals in strange robes are cultivating it.  I've seen what it can do, so I need you to execute them and destroy all traces of these strange mushrooms."
msgstr "自从<the_cataclysm>以后，有种奇怪的真菌开始入侵，几个穿着奇怪长袍的人正在培育它。我已经看到了它的作用，所以我需要你干掉它们，销毁这种奇怪蘑菇的所有痕迹。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "They should be near the counter, or on a shelf."
msgstr "它们应该放在柜台附近，或者在架子上。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This could give us a prosperous future, <name_g>."
msgstr "这可以给我们一个繁荣的未来，<name_g>。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This is wonderful!  I'll really be able to put the pedal to the metal!"
msgstr "这太棒了！我真的能尽全力做了！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This means so much to me."
msgstr "这对我来说意义重大。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This passion of mine may just be getting to me…"
msgstr "我的这份激情可能只有我来承担了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This should be very useful to us.  Now we can truly begin our march of righteousness."
msgstr "这对我们应该很有用。现在我们可以真正开始我们的正义之路了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This should occupy my work for a while.  Thanks <name_g>, we'll discover the truth one of these days."
msgstr "这应该会占用我的工作一段时间。谢谢，<name_g>，总有一天我们会发现真相的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This task is bit more serious.  I don't have enough jars to preserve perishables for the future, and we can't just store everything in salt.  We could do our own canning if we had some more glass jars.  I could get by with 5 for now."
msgstr "这个任务比较重要。我这没有足够玻璃罐来做保存易腐食物的罐头了，总不能把什么东西都埋到盐里。如果这里再有多一些玻璃罐的话，我们就能自己做罐头了。我这现在有5个就勉强够用了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This'll be quite useful in the future.  Thank you, <name_g>."
msgstr "这对今后的研究会很有用。非常感谢，<name_g>。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "To be honest, I'm not alright.  Have you met Darryl?  He's my husband, and we had a go at getting a baby recently.  The thing is, its not happening.  Now that we're in a safe spot, on our feet again, I want to try.  I'm trying to find some fertility supplements.  I ordered some before <the_cataclysm>, but I never got to pick them up.  If you'd go over and get them for me, I'd pay you."
msgstr "老实说，我不太好。你见过达里尔吗？他是我丈夫，最近我们想要个孩子。问题是，一直没戏。现在我们在一个安全的地方，重新站了起来，我想再试试。我在找一些生育保健品。我在<the_cataclysm>以前订了一些，但我从来没有拿到过。如果你过去帮我拿，我会付钱给你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Too trivial for you?"
msgstr "对你来说太微不足道了？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Trophy Hunt I"
msgstr "战利品狩猎I"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Trophy Hunt II"
msgstr "战利品狩猎II"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Trophy Hunt III"
msgstr "战利品狩猎III"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Try disassembling another well."
