#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "We were in the process of refurbishing the retreat when <the_cataclysm> interrupted us.  Some of the plumbing around here was troublesome, and we need to fix that.  200 pipes should be all we need to finish it."
msgstr "我们整修这个隐居地的工程被<the_cataclysm>打断了。这里的部分管道一直有点问题，而我们需要修复它。200根钢管应该足够我们完成这项工作。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "We'll have to try again, I suppose."
msgstr "我想我们得再试一次。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "We've got to see how many people are out there."
msgstr "我们得看看外面还有多少人活着。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well Construction"
msgstr "建造水井"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well, do you have them?"
msgstr "嗯，东西都齐了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well, partner, this might just be the end of the road.  I hope you enjoyed it as much as I have.  In the meantime… here's your reward, a handful of icons, that's all I have left.  Spend them all, I think you've deserved it."
msgstr "好吧，伙计，这条路应该已经走到头了。我希望你和我一样喜欢它。同时……这是你的奖励，一些圣像，我只剩这些了。花光它们，这是你应得的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well, that's great.  Good luck."
msgstr "那太好了。祝你好运。"

