msgstr "这样做有什么用？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "What have you found out?"
msgstr "你发现了些什么？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "When we skipped town during <the_cataclysm>, most of us left our possessions behind.  We only have a few Bibles here for all of us, and they're starting to fall apart.  If you could get ten more of the King James version, I'd pay well for them."
msgstr "当我们在<the_cataclysm>期间逃离城镇时，我们中的大多数人都把自己的财产留下了。我们这里只有几本《圣经》，而它们都快被翻散架了。如果你能再找来20本，就是那种钦定版的，我可以付一笔大价钱。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Where is it?"
msgstr "它在哪里？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "While we are blessed with a bountiful stock, we need a way to preserve our newer food, mainly those potatoes Darryl's growing.  Fortunately, he brought a book on canning things.  We need five canning pots to get the setup going in full fashion."
msgstr "虽然我们的库存逐渐丰富起来，但我们需要一种方法来保存我们的新食物，主要是达里尔种的土豆。幸运的是，他带来了一本关于罐装食物的书。我们需要五个水浴锅，来全速启动罐装进程。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Why have you failed us?!"
msgstr "你为什么让我们失望？！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "With my brains and your brawn we'll make an excellent team.  A regular solar panel will do just fine."
msgstr "有了我的头脑和你的体力，我们会成为一支优秀的队伍。一块普通的太阳能板就可以了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Worst case scenario you'll be covered in slime.  There's nothing to fear, I hope."
msgstr "最坏的情况是你身上会沾满粘液。我希望没什么好担心的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Would you please reconsider?  Arturo's had some bad hallucinations before, he'll go crazy without them."
msgstr "请你再考虑一下好吗？阿图罗以前有过一些糟糕的幻觉，如果没有药，他会发疯的。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Writers' Will"
msgstr "作家心愿"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Writers' Will II"
msgstr "作家心愿II"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "You could take apart some furniture in town, or make them yourself."
msgstr "你可以去城里拆些家具，或者自己做。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "You could try cutting up some unneeded sweaters from a clothing store, or you could make some yourself."
msgstr "你可以试着从服装店剪碎些不需要的衣物，也可以自己做一些。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "You give up now?  This country fell apart because no one could find a good man to rely on… might as well give up, I guess."
msgstr "你就这么放弃了？这个国家因为大家找不到一个可以依靠的好人而土崩瓦解……还不如放弃，我想也是。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "You liar!"
msgstr "你这个骗子！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "You remember what toilet paper is, right?"
msgstr "你还记得卫生纸长什么样，对吧？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "&Arturo stares blankly for a moment.  \"The man in the mirror comes to me at night, and whispers things in my ear.  Eyes on the walls, watching, watching…  The woman who crawls.\"  I'm sorry about that."
msgstr "阿图罗瞪大了空荡荡的眼睛好一会：\"镜子里的男人晚上来到我身边，在我耳边低语。墙上的眼睛，看着，看着……爬行的女人。\"啊抱歉。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Are you alright?"
msgstr "你还好吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Chill out man, I'm leaving."
msgstr "冷静点，伙计，我要走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Could you tell me about the community?"
msgstr "能和我说说你们这个社区的情况吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Hey Arturo, how are ya?"
msgstr "嘿，阿图罗，最近怎么样？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Hi, <name_g>.  Could I pat you on the shoulder?  I wanna be sure you're here."
msgstr "嗨，<name_g>。我能拍拍你的肩膀吗，我想要确认一下你在这里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "How are things around here?"
msgstr "这附近的情况怎么样？"

