#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "I've had a bad run of things.  I grew up real poor, in a bad part of town, always got my nose where it shouldn't have been.  When I was about eighteen, I started doing coke heavily.  Every two days, I'd get spaced out on the stuff; started robbing gas stations and dumb <swear> things like that for a fix.  I went to jail, and I met the New England Church Community there.  I joined up to find penance for my sins.  Another thing, stay off of that <swear> stuff; I messed up my brain real bad doin' that."
msgstr "我经历了一系列糟糕的事情。我从小就很穷，走遍了城里的每一个糟糕的地方，总喜欢插手各种闲事。当我大约十八岁时，我开始大量吸食可卡因。每两天，我就会因为这些东西而无法思考；开始做出抢劫加油站之类的<swear>蠢事来解决问题。我进了监狱，在那里我遇到了新英格兰教会社区。我加入了为我的罪孽忏悔的行列。而且远离了那些<swear>东西；搞砸了我的大脑真的很糟糕。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "It's alright, just take your time."
msgstr "没事的，你继续忙。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Nah.  Not everything's perfect around here, but it's the only thing I've got left."
msgstr "不。虽然这里并非一切都是完美的，但这是我唯一剩下的东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Nice talking to you, but I gotta go."
msgstr "和你聊天很愉快，但我也该走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Sorry, I gotta go."
msgstr "抱歉，我该走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "They're not so hot.  The whole compound is always low on food, there's <swear> <zombies> out on the roads, and Helena's starting to panic a bit.  She thinks I'm a holy visionary, with my episodes…  Sometimes I want to believe her.  I usually take the Thorazine Jane has, but I've been getting it less and less."
msgstr "不太乐观。整个社区的食物总是很匮乏，路上到处都是<swear><zombies>，海伦娜开始有点恐慌了。她认为我是一个神圣的幻想家，因为我之前经历的事情……有时我想相信她。我经常服用简给我的的冬眠灵，但最近越来越少这么做了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Want to come with me?"
msgstr "与我同行吧，如何？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Well, its an old church group that decided to become doomsday preppers.  I don't know much else, except that they used to do a lot of charity work.  I met them that way."
msgstr "好吧，这是一个决定成为世界末日准备者的古老教会团体。别的我就不知道了，只知道他们曾经做过很多慈善工作。我就是这样认识他们的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "What do you see in your visions?"
msgstr "你看到了什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "What's hangin'?"
msgstr "还有别的事吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
