#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Could you make something for me?"
msgstr "你能帮我编一些东西吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Do you knit at all?  I noticed you have sewing needles."
msgstr "你会编织吗？我看到你有缝纫针。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Fuck you then, I'm leaving."
msgstr "那我去你妈的，我走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "He was a man of many secrets.  It would've been too personal to share, I'm afraid.  On the other hand, there was a prophecy he was quite vocal about.  In a way, he predicted <the_cataclysm> long before the first warning signs appeared.  Thanks to him, we had the foresight to prepare.  Oh what a great man he was…"
msgstr "他是一个神秘的男人。对于分享他的事情，恐怕过于隐私了。另一方面，他有一个一直念叨着的预言。在某种程度上，他早在第一个警告信号出现之前就预测到了<the_cataclysm>。多亏了他，我们才有了准备的先见之明。噢，他是多么伟大的人……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "He was an exceptional man.  Ever since he was a child it was clear that there was something special about him.  My husband had a way with people, and with God too.  But, after all he was as human as you and I.  He was corrupted by addiction.  One day, God appeared to him in a vision that turned his life around, he had other plans for him.  From then on he didn't take his life for granted.  He used his talent and newfound inspiration to better the people around him."
msgstr "他是一个非凡的人。从他还是个孩子的时候起，就很明显有一些特别之处。我丈夫对人有一套，对神也有一套。但是，毕竟他和你我一样是人。他被毒瘾腐蚀了。有一天，上帝出现在他的幻觉中，改变了他的生活，他有了另一套计划。从此，他不再把自己的生命视为理所当然。他利用自己的才华和新发现的灵感来帮助周围的人。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Hello, Theresa.  How are you doing?"
msgstr "嗨，特蕾莎。你还好吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "How long does it take you to make these?"
msgstr "你做这些需要多长时间？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "How've things been since <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>以来这里过得怎么样？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I can knit a scarf ready by tomorrow, a blanket in two days, and a quilt in a week."
msgstr "我明天可以织好一条围巾，两天一条毯子，一个星期一条被子。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I hope you like it <granny_name_g>.  If you want anything else, just come back."
msgstr "我希望你喜欢它，<granny_name_g>。如果你还想要什么，就回来吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I suppose I could, in exchange for a few icons.  A scarf is five, a blanket ten, a quilt thirty."
msgstr "我想我可以，以一些圣像作为交换。围巾五块，毯子十块，被子三十块。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I'll have a blanket."
msgstr "我要一条毯子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I'll have a quilt."
msgstr "我要一床被子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I'll have a scarf."
msgstr "我要一条围巾。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "I'm afraid I can't talk right now."
msgstr "恐怕我现在没空交谈。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I'm doing as well as can be expected.  How's everything, <granny_name_g>?"
msgstr "我的表现与预期的一样好。  一切都好吗，<granny_name_g>？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I'm here about the blanket."
msgstr "我来取毯子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I'm here about the quilt."
msgstr "我来取被子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I'm here about the scarf."
msgstr "我来取围巾。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I've changed my mind, I have to leave."
msgstr "我改变主意了，我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I've changed my mind.  How're you feeling?"
msgstr "我改变主意了。你觉得如何？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "I've grown tired, <granny_name_g>.  I haven't left here since we came, and things outside are getting worse each day.  All my old aches and pains have come back too; I can't see too good, and my muscles are always sore.  I don't like where my niece is going either; she's ever more fanatical, and taking my dear husband's prophecy to the extreme.  I'm content with my life, though.  I've lived long and prospered by the grace of the Lord."
msgstr "我已经累了，<granny_name_g>。从我们来到这儿后我就没离开过，而外面的情况一天比一天糟。我所有的陈年病痛都回来了；眼神儿也不好，肌肉老酸痛。我也不喜欢我侄女去的地方；她越来越狂热，把我亲爱丈夫的预言发挥到了极致。不过我对自己的生活挺满意。靠着主的恩典，我活得长久而富足。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "Is there anything I can do to help?"
msgstr "有什么我可以帮忙的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Is there anything I can help you with?"
msgstr "我能帮你什么忙吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "It is nice to meet you as well.  I reckon you got some questions about our group."
msgstr "我很高兴见到你。我想你对我们这个群体有一些疑问。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Just fine.  Nice of you to ask.  How's it going, <granny_name_g>?"
msgstr "就好了。  很高兴你能问。  怎么样，<granny_name_g>？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Theresa.  I'm <u_name>."
msgstr "很高兴见到你，特蕾莎。我是<u_name>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Oh you don't have the time for that, do you now?  It's a long, long tale, thank goodness.  I'm grateful, for I was blessed with a full life."
msgstr "噢，你现在没有时间，是吗？这是一个很长很长的故事，谢天谢地。我总是很感激，因为我被祝福拥有充实的生活。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "So, he founded the community?"
msgstr "所以，他成立了这个社区？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Tell me about his visions."
msgstr "他看到了什么幻觉？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Tell me about your husband."
msgstr "和我说说你的丈夫。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Thank you, Theresa.  I'll put it to good use."
msgstr "谢谢你，特蕾莎，我会妥善使用的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "That's right.  He wanted something to return for the guidance he received when he was at the lowest point of his life.  He created a charity group which, over the years, became what's now known as the New England Church Community.  He lead them for many decades, until his death a few years before his prophecy was fulfilled.  Now, our niece Helena leads the community."
msgstr "对的。他想要回报他在人生最低谷时得到的指导。他创建了一个慈善团体，多年来，这个团体成为了现在众所周知的新英格兰教会社区。他领导大家几十年，直到他的预言应验，在几年前去世。现在，我们的侄女海伦娜在领导社区。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "That's very sweet of you <granny_name_g>, but there's nothing I could possibly want from this mortal world.  My life is now complete, I believe."
msgstr "你真是太贴心了，<granny_name_g>，但我对于这个平凡世界没有什么想要的。我相信我的生活现在已经完成了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "We're doing better than most, to put it mildly.  There's a reason for that, as for everything.  Say, have I told you about my husband?  I'm sorry if I already have, my memory's not what it used to be."
msgstr "委婉地说，我们比大多数人过得更好。这一切都是有原因的。话说，我跟你说过我丈夫的事吗？对不起，如果我已经说了，我的记忆力已经不如从前了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Welcome, <granny_name_g>.  I don't think I recognize you, I'm Theresa."
msgstr "欢迎，<granny_name_g>。我好像没见过你，我是特蕾莎。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Well, it's been nice talking to you, but I need to head out."
msgstr "嗯，和你谈话很愉快，但我该出发了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "What's it like living here?"
msgstr "在这里住着怎么样啊？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "What's the insults for?"
msgstr "辱骂是为了什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "Yes, I knit and sew in my spare time.  Its' helped keep my hands in good shape over the years."
msgstr "是的，我在业余时间编织和缝纫。多年来，我靠它来保持双手状态良好。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
msgid "You clearly have the mark of a sinner.  I've seen your kind out and about after the Flood, killing and maiming like wild animals.  None of you are any good, not even to God, and you're of no good to me either.  Run on back to your sinful ways, now.  God has judged you already."
msgstr "你显然有罪人的印记。我在大洪水之后见过你们这种人，像野兽一样杀人、致残。你们没有一个好人，对我、对上帝也毫无用处。回到你的罪恶生活中去吧。上帝已经审判过你了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Alright, let's change the subject."
msgstr "好，我们换个话题吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Aren't you a bit too old not to realize how dangerous the world is for a kid like me?  I know how to handle one without hurting myself!  My dad taught me everything, he's a real pro."
msgstr "你是不是太老了一点，没有意识到这个世界对我这样的孩子有多危险？我知道如何干掉一个而不伤害自己！我爸爸教会了我一切，他可是一个真正的职业玩家。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Aren't you a bit young to be carrying a knife?"
msgstr "你这年纪带把刀子是不是早了点儿？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Do you wanna shoot the breeze?"
msgstr "你要不要聊聊？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Hi.  I can't stay and chat right now."
msgstr "嗨。我现在不能留下来闲聊。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "How'd you and Sonia come to meet again?"
msgstr "你和索尼娅是怎么重逢的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "How'd you and Sonia come to meet?"
msgstr "你和索尼娅是怎么相遇的？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "I don't know.  They were going to a contract deal before the riots broke out, at one of military bases I think.  I don't know what happened to them from there."
msgstr "我不知道。他们打算在骚乱爆发前签一项合同协议，我想是在一个军事基地里。我不知道他们在那里发生了什么。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "I don't wanna talk about it right now."
msgstr "我现在不想谈这件事了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "I was home alone during the ongoing riots.  My parents chose the worst possible time to reconnect, which sucks, but I'm also kinda happy for them.  Anyway, they were part of the NECC people, so they knew about this place and their plans and all.  Thing is, it was, like, really far away.  I kinda didn't want to go alone but I also didn't want the rioters to eat me, so I asked Sonia - my neighbor - to evacuate with me, I guess.  So that was fun; escaping my hometown, walking down the country road, waiting for a horror to ambush us.  Spoiler alert: we were attacked.  So this zombie shambles in front of us and Sonia whacks it real hard with her guitar!  Its brain splatters all over the pavement, I threw up 'cause it was so disgusting.  We got here soon after that.  My parents weren't here, obviously.  Oh man, they must worry about me so much…"
msgstr "在持续的暴动中，我一个人在家。我的父母选择了最坏的时间转移，糟透了，但我也为他们感到高兴。不管怎样，他们是NECC的一员，所以他们知道这个地方，也有他们的计划。那些事情感觉就像过去很久了。我有点不想一个人离开，但我也不希望暴徒吃掉我，所以我请我的邻居索尼娅和我一起撤离，我猜这样会好些。旅途很有趣：逃离家乡，走在乡间小路上，等待恐怖的埋伏忽然跳出来。剧透警告：我们被攻击了。所以有只丧尸在我们面前蹒跚而行，索尼娅用她的吉他狠狠地敲打着它！它的脑浆溅了一地，我吐了，因为实在是太恶心了。在那之后我们很快就到了这里。显然，我的父母不在这里。哦，兄弟，他们一定很担心我……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "I'll let you know if anything turns up."
msgstr "如果有任何事情发生，我会通知你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "I'll let you know if anything turns up.  See you around."
msgstr "如果有任何事情发生，我会通知你。回头见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "I'm not a baby you know, I don't need a babysitter.  Sonia looks out for me though.  She's not so weird, I guess.  She promised to give me guitar lessons and she even signed me an autograph.  I know she's only nice to me because I saved her, but that's okay; we're equal now."
msgstr "你知道我不是婴儿，我不需要保姆。不过，索尼娅会照顾我。我想她没那么奇怪。她答应给我上吉他课，还给我签了名。我知道她对我好只是因为我救了她，但没关系；我们现在扯平了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  Maybe we should talk about something else."
msgstr "我为你的损失感到难过。也许我们该谈谈别的事情。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Just saying hello.  Keep safe."
msgstr "只是过来打个招呼。注意安全。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Chloe.  What's up?"
msgstr "很高兴认识你，克洛伊。  这是怎么回事？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Oh… hi.  I don't know you.  My name's Chloe."
msgstr "哦……嗨。我不认识你。我叫克洛伊。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "On second though, let's talk about something else."
msgstr "转念一想，咱还是说点别的吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Really, what's your story?"
msgstr "真的，说说你的故事？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Shoot."
msgstr "中啊。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Thanks for the info."
msgstr "多谢你的消息。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Thanks for the info.  Let's chat about something else."
msgstr "谢谢你提供的信息。我们谈点别的吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "That makes sense."
msgstr "那就讲得通了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "They're not dead."
msgstr "他们没有死。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Things suck right now, but you know that anyway.  I don't even know why you bother asking these stupid questions."
msgstr "现在情况很糟糕，但你应该已经很清楚了。我甚至不知道你为什么要问这些愚蠢的问题。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Well, I grew up in the city.  My parents were always out of town on some business meeting or another, so I had plenty of time to myself.  They're great people; mom's a wonderful cook, she makes an amazing fish casserole.  Dad's a hot shot for military contracts, he handled business deals for DARPA and whatnot.  He's an ex-marine, and taught me how to defend myself with a knife."
msgstr "嗯，我是在城里长大的。我的父母总是出城参加一些商务会议之类的，所以我有很多时间独处。他们都很好；妈妈是个很棒的厨师，她做的鱼砂锅很棒。爸爸是各种军事合同的热门人选，处理过DARPA的商业交易等等。他也是一名退伍军人，教我如何用刀自卫。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Where do you think your parents are now?"
msgstr "你觉得你的父母现在在哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgid "Yeah, that's enough for me."
msgstr "是，对我而言已经足够了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a kid.  Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet paper and everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive and they're looking for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for you?"
msgstr "你真是个怪人。我很抱歉你没有朋友，但我真的是个孩子。地球上的每个人都变成了丧尸，我们的厕纸和所有东西都快用完了，我的父母也不见了。我知道他们还活着，他们在找我。我想念他们。这对你来说够私人了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a kid.  Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet paper and everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive and they're looking for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for you?"
msgstr "你真是个怪人。我很抱歉你没有朋友，但我真的是个孩子。地球上的每个人都变成了丧尸，我们的厕纸和所有东西都快用完了，我的父母也不见了。我知道他们还活着，他们在找我。我想念他们。这对你来说够私人了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
