msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a kid.  Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet paper and everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive and they're looking for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for you?"
msgstr "你真是个怪人。我很抱歉你没有朋友，但我真的是个孩子。地球上的每个人都变成了丧尸，我们的厕纸和所有东西都快用完了，我的父母也不见了。我知道他们还活着，他们在找我。我想念他们。这对你来说够私人了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "&Corrie blankly stares at the wall for a moment.  \"Me and my friends were in the cities when it hit, I was the only one to make it out.  Some gigantic horror… devoured… everything in its way.  There was a memorial service and all, organized by the church-goers.  By far the nicest thing they've done for me.\""
msgstr "科里呆呆地盯着墙看了一会儿：\"当它来袭时，我和我的朋友们都在城市里，我是唯一一个逃出来的人。一些巨大的怪物……吞噬了……路上的一切。后来有一个追悼会，完全由去教堂的人组织。这是他们为我做过最好的事情。\""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Are the non-joinees treating you fairly?"
msgstr "老教友们对你还公平吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Basic repairs and upkeep, mostly.  The generator in the basement is on its last legs, so I've been thinking about building a solar array for this place.  Helena's against it, but I want to change her mind.  All I need are a few spare parts."
msgstr "主要是基本维修和保养。地下室的发电机快坏掉了，所以我一直在考虑为这个地方建造一个太阳能阵列。海伦娜反对，但我想改变她的想法。我只需要一些零件。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Glad to help.  See you around, Corrie."
msgstr "很高兴能帮上忙。下次见，科里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Glad to help.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "很高兴能帮上忙。你之前说什么来着？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Hey Corrie, you free?"
msgstr "嘿，科里，你有空吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Hey Corrie.  I gotta go."
msgstr "嘿，科里。不过我得走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Hey there, <name_g>.  Welcome to the losers club."
msgstr "嘿，<name_g>。欢迎来到失败者俱乐部。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Hey, we're on the same boat, aren't we?"
msgstr "嘿，我们在同一条船上，不是吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "How about some food as payment?"
msgstr "也许你可以给我点食物，作为报酬。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "How are things, living here?"
msgstr "住在这里怎么样？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "How have things changed after that deal with Helena?"
msgstr "在和海伦娜做了那笔交易之后，这里有什么变化没？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "I can help you get the items you need."
msgstr "我能帮你搞到需要的东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "I'd better get going."
msgstr "我得走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "I'm just here, really.  I'm the local mechanic around here, I just fiddle with the machinery.  Just about all of it is a <swear> <name_b>, older than dirt and nearly unfixable.  They're running a wood-fire generator for power, the <swear> thing is the noisiest clunker I've ever heard."
msgstr "我还活着，真的仅此而已。我是这附近的当地机械师，只会摆弄机器。几乎所有东西都是个<swear><name_b>，比泥土还古老，几乎没法修。他们用柴火发电机发电，这是我听过<swear>最吵的机器。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "I'm just passing through."
msgstr "我只是路过而已。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Just so you know, a lot of the folks here might not take to kindly to your appearance.  I'm cool with it, though."
msgstr "你知道，这里的很多人可能不太喜欢你的外表。  不过我对此很满意。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<end_talking>"
#. ~ Avatar response indicated that the conversation is over via TALK_DONE.
#. Could be used in a lot more dialogs.  Could also use a lot more variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Let's hit the road."
msgstr "我们上路吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Like second-class citizens, that's how they treat us."
msgstr "就像二等公民，他们就是这样对待我们的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Nearly everyone here went to a church that was a bit… out there, shall we say.  They hate what they call \"mutants\", how some creatures and people have physically changed inexplicably after everything went to shit.  I'm glad they didn't kill you on the spot, not many people are left out there."
msgstr "这里几乎每个人都去了一座有点……我们可以说的教堂。  他们讨厌所谓的“变种人”，讨厌一些生物和人在一切都陷入困境后身体发生莫名其妙的变化。  我很高兴他们没有当场杀了你，没有多少人被留在那里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Nice to meet you."
msgstr "很高兴认识你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "No rest for the weary…"
msgstr "快累死了也不让人歇歇……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Not much.  I told you not to go for the icons."
msgstr "不是很多。不过我劝你不要整天围着圣像转。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Oh, I completely forget.  Here you are."
msgstr "噢，我完全忘记了。给你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Sorry Corrie, I can't stay to chat."
msgstr "抱歉，科里。我没空留下来聊天。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Sorry for bringing it up.  Well, bye."
msgstr "很抱歉提起它。嗯，拜拜。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Sorry for bringing it up.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "很抱歉提起它。你之前说什么来着？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Sorry to hear that.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "真是遗憾。你刚刚还说了什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Sure, I'll come.  I hate staying here, and you've gone out of your way to help me.  I appreciate that, <name_g>."
msgstr "当然，我会跟你走的。我讨厌呆在这里，而你却来特意帮助我。我很感激，<name_g>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Sure.  I can clear a few minutes of my oh-so hectic schedule."
msgstr "当然。我可以清理一下我忙碌的日程，安排上几分钟。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Thank you for your politeness and generosity.  I'll be seeing you."
msgstr "感谢您的礼貌和慷慨。  我会见到你的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Well if that's the case, I don't suppose you could help out struggling survivors, do you?"
msgstr "好吧，如果是这样的话，我不认为你是来帮助挣扎中的幸存者的，是吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Well, thank's for telling me.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "嗯，谢谢你告诉我。  我们来谈谈别的事情吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "What needs to be done?"
msgstr "[营地]营地还需要些什么吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Why would that be?"
msgstr "为什么会这样呢？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Wow.  This place is <swear> crazy, I'm outta here."
msgstr "哇。  这个地方<发誓>太疯狂了，我要离开这里。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Yeah, yeah they have.  I've noticed a change in attitude towards us, the new guys.  Positive ones.  Things might be looking up, a little bit."
msgstr "确实有。我注意到他们对我们这些新人的态度发生了积极的变化。事情可能正在好转，一点点。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "About that well…"
msgstr "关于那口井……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Actually, I had better go."
msgstr "转念想想，我该走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "All right, this is what I've got:  I can spare three packs of cucumber, barley or blackberry seeds for one icon; carrot, buckwheat or cranberry seeds for two icons; oat, sugar beet or potato seeds for three icons."
msgstr "好了，情况是这样的：我可以拿出三包黄瓜、大麦或黑莓种子来换取一个图标；胡萝卜、荞麦或蔓越莓种子换取两个图标；燕麦、甜菜或土豆种子换取三个图标。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Can I buy anything?"
msgstr "我能买些什么吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Can you spare anything?  You know how bad the food situation is."
msgstr "你能匀出点什么吗？你知道现在的食品短缺情况有多严重。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Do you have any family?"
msgstr "你有家人吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Fuck you <name_b>, I'm outta here."
msgstr "去你的<name_b>，我要离开这里了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Hey Darryl.  Care to trade?"
msgstr "嗨，达里尔。想交易吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Hey Darryl.  Got a minute?"
msgstr "嗨，达里尔。有空吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "How are the chickens?"
msgstr "鸡怎么了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "How are things here?"
msgstr "这里怎么样？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Huh, never would have thought you were interested in the fine art of farming.  Sure, I've got seeds I can say goodbye to… if you have the appropriate money of course."
msgstr "唔，想不到你对农艺感兴趣。当然，我有些种子正好想说再见了……当然，如果你有足够的钱的话。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I guess I can spare a few minutes.  What is it?"
msgstr "我想我还是能抽出些时间聊聊的，啥事？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy barley seeds."
msgstr "我要买大麦种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy blackberry seeds."
msgstr "我要买黑莓种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy buckwheat seeds."
msgstr "我要买荞麦种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy carrot seeds."
msgstr "我要买胡萝卜种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy cranberry seeds."
msgstr "我要买蔓越莓种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy cucumber seeds."
msgstr "我要买黄瓜种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy oat seeds."
msgstr "我要买燕麦种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy potato seeds."
msgstr "我要买土豆种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy some."
msgstr "我会买点。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll buy sugar beet seeds."
msgstr "我要买甜菜种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll check on her.  I hope everything works out for you."
msgstr "我去看看她。希望对你有帮助。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'll leave you to it."
msgstr "我就不打扰你了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss."
msgstr "听到你的损失我很难过。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I've got a wife, Gemma.  She's a grand lady, should be around here somewhere.  She used to teach biology, and we both love gardenin'; that's how we met, ya see.  She ain't been herself lately, I'm startin' to worry."
msgstr "我有个妻子，叫杰玛。她是个很棒的女人，应该就在这附近。她以前教生物，我们俩都爱园艺——你看，我们就是这么认识的。她最近状态不太对劲，我开始有点担心了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "I've heard of unnatural monsters such as yourself causing chaos after the fall of civilization, and how men have transformed into horrors and gone mad with sin.  This is the judgement of God upon you heathens for your wicked ways, and I want nothing to do with it."
msgstr "我听说过像你这样的非自然怪物在文明崩溃后制造混乱，以及人类如何变成恐怖并因罪恶而疯狂。  这是上帝对你们这些异教徒的邪恶行为的审判，我不想与此有任何关系。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Is there anything I can do to help you out?"
msgstr "我能帮你什么忙吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "It really isn't hard to earn your keep here.  Talk to folks, someone'll have something for you to do."
msgstr "在这里想挣口饭吃真不难。跟大伙儿聊聊，总有人会给你安排点活儿干的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "It's finished, and I've got eggs!  I'd be willing to sell ya some, a dozen for seven icons."
msgstr "它已经完成了，而且我有鸡蛋！我愿意卖给你一些，一打七圣像。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Let's trade, then."
msgstr "那我们就交易吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Nice farm you have here."
msgstr "你这农场不错啊。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too, Darryl.  Neat farm you have here."
msgstr "我也很高兴认识你，达里尔。你这儿的农场井井有条。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Oh, they passed a long time ago.  Wish they could've seen Gemma and I marry…"
msgstr "噢，他们很久以前就去世了。希望他们能看到我和杰玛结婚……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Thank you.  See you around, Darryl."
msgstr "谢谢你。再见，达里尔。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "That's a bit rich for my blood.  I had better go."
msgstr "对我来说太亏了。我该走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "That's a bit rich for my blood.  I'd better go."
msgstr "对我来说太亏了。我该走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "This uncertainty is eating me inside, to be frank with you.  I'm a simple man: I tend my farm, I scare off vermin, but even I can see somethin' ain't right here.  I've talked to my wife, I had a word with Damien, they told me to have more faith in God.  It's the last sliver of hope I have left, and I was told that's enough."
msgstr "坦白说，这种迷茫正在侵蚀我的内心。我是一个单纯的人：我照料我的农场，驱赶害虫，但即便是我也能看出这里有些不对头。我和我妻子讨论过，也和达米安谈过，他们告诉我要对上帝有更多的信心。这是我仅剩的最后一丝希望，有人告诉我这就够了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Took us two weeks and four hard-working hands to clear this humble little land.  It's a far cry from my old garden, it really is.  I heard theories, from Tom of course, that really messed with my head.  The earth don't yield like she used to, and maybe it's for the same reason the dead don't stay buried any more.  I s'pose it's no use worrying about it, we just have to work twice as hard."
msgstr "我们花了整整两周时间，靠着一双手辛勤劳作，才把这块不起眼的小地给清理出来。这地方跟我以前那个花园简直没法比，真的。汤姆——当然又是他——跟我说了一些让人心里发毛的说法：说是这片土地不再像从前那样肥沃丰产了，而这背后的原因，或许跟死人如今不再安分地待在坟墓里是同一个道理。不过，我想操心这些也没用，咱们唯有加倍努力干活才行。"

