msgid "Well I'll be damned, a fellow survivor!  I'm Darryl, nice to meet you."
msgstr "喔，好家伙，一个幸存者老乡！我是达里尔，很高兴认识你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "Well, I'd rather not get into my life before all this.  I have a farm to maintain, after all.  Would be nice, sharing our tales while sipping cold brew beer.  Not at a time like this.  Now if you'll excuse me, I'll be back to work."
msgstr "好吧，大前提是我希望别谈论我的生活。毕竟我有一个农场要维护。边喝冷酿啤酒边分享我们的故事也许挺好，但这会儿可不是时候。现在，如果你不介意的话，我要回去工作了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "What's the poor attitude about?"
msgstr "态度这么差是怎么回事？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Yeah, I surely do.  Here, it ain't much, but oats are easy enough, and good food too."
msgstr "是啊，我确实很喜欢。来，虽然算不上什么大餐，但燕麦做起来简单，而且也是好东西。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
