msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "哦，好吧，又是一个幸存者。欢迎来到我们这个小团体，我叫凯瑟琳。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "哦，好吧，又是一个幸存者。欢迎来到我们这个小团体，我叫凯瑟琳。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Our prayers were heard.  We knew the day was coming, so we prepared.  Our community stockpiled months' worth of canned goods, well enough until the chaos ends.  With the food we have left, we could live peacefully, but we foolishly didn't take extra people into consideration.  With so much at risk, I don't think we can afford more people.  Though I'm not the one who makes the decisions here, and it's probably for the better."
msgstr "我们的祈祷受了回应。我们知道末日即将到来，所以我们做好了准备。我们社区囤积了几个月的罐头食品，直到混乱结束。有了剩下的食物，我们本可以平静地生活，但我们愚蠢地没有考虑到额外增加的人口。现在处境已经很危险，我觉得我们负担不起更多的人。虽然我不是在这里能做主的人，但这种决定可能会更好。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "She occasionally plays her guitar in the hall, and she's quite good at it.  Unsurprisingly, she doesn't know any hymns.  Wouldn't let her near my son."
msgstr "她偶尔会在大厅里弹吉他，而且弹得很好。毫不意外，她不会唱赞美诗。不会让她靠近我儿子的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Tell me about the community."
msgstr "和我说说这个社区吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Tell me about your family."
msgstr "和我说说你的家庭情况。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "The Founder?"
msgstr "创始人？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "There's not an illness God can't cure.  Yet, by fate, we were given a doctor.  She's now taking care of Arturo, that poor thing.  Oh well, who am I to question God's ways?"
msgstr "没有上帝无法治愈的疾病。然而，命运却给我们送来了一个医生。她现在在照顾阿图罗，那个可怜的家伙。哦，我又怎敢质疑上帝的意志？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "We have many things to pray for, I'm afraid."
msgstr "恐怕我们有很多事要祈祷。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "What did you do before <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "你在<the_cataclysm>之前是做什么的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "You don't seem to like the joinees very much.  Why is that?"
msgstr "你似乎不太喜欢新入会者。为什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "You're right, I don't.  They should've come when they had the chance.  Now that our Ark has sailed, they want to jump aboard.  Such is the way of sinners, I suppose."
msgstr "你说得对，我不太喜欢。他们本就应该一有机会就加入。而现在我们的方舟已经启航，他们却想跳上船。我想这就是罪人的行为。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Alright then."
msgstr "那么好吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Alright, I'll take a look."
msgstr "好的，我去看看。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Alright, thanks for informing me. Bye!"
msgstr "好的，谢谢你通知我。再见！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "好吧，你说服了我。我会教耶利米的，指点他一下。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "好吧，你说服了我。我会教耶利米的，指点他一下。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "好吧，你说服了我。我会教耶利米的，指点他一下。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Alright.  See you around, Kostas."
msgstr "好的。回见，科斯塔斯。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Are there any jobs I could do?"
msgstr "有什么我可以帮忙的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Can I try your pine needle tea?"
msgstr "我可以尝尝你的松针茶吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Care to share your knowledge about herbalism?"
msgstr "能教教我你的草药知识吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Fuck you, I'm blowing this joint."
msgstr "操你妈的，我要吹这个关节了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Hey Kostas, find something interesting lately?"
msgstr "嘿科斯塔斯，最近发现一些有趣的事情吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Hey, Kostas.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "嗨，科斯塔斯。我不能留下来聊天。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Hi, Kostas.  Care to trade?"
msgstr "嗨，科斯塔斯。想交易吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I can tell you this: pine needles make the best tea.  Perhaps I'll make you one someday."
msgstr "我可以告诉你：松针是最好的茶。也许有一天我会给你泡一壶。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I have the pine needles you asked me for."
msgstr "我找到了你要的松针。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I heard Jeremiah wanted to learn a few things from you."
msgstr "我听说耶利米想向你学些东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I know him pretty well, I'm sure he'll learn as he goes along."
msgstr "我很了解他，我相信他会随着时间的推移学会的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I'm afraid I haven't gone out there for a while, maybe come back in <interval>.  These are all I have, care to take a look?"
msgstr "恐怕我已经有一段时间没有出去了，也许<interval>回来。  这些都是我的，想看一下吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I'm talking about you and your filthy, unnatural appearance.  I don't like your kind, and neither does anyone else.  Go repent before the Lord for your many sins, if he'll even listen to you."
msgstr "我说的是你和你肮脏、不自然的外表。  我不喜欢你们这种人，其他人也不喜欢。  如果他愿意听你的话，请在主面前为你的许多罪悔改。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "If you don't take him under your wings, I'll rip them off for you.  Capiche?"
msgstr "如果你不把他收进你羽翼下，我会把它们都撕碎的。听明白了没？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "It's been quiet and peaceful.  Nature is recovering, and so are we.  There's something bittersweet about <the_cataclysm>, isn't there?  Our species was on the path of destruction, but Mother Nature spared us.  A sign of mercy for a creature that did not deserve it."
msgstr "这里安宁而平静。大自然正在复苏，我们也是。<the_cataclysm>有点苦乐参半，不是吗？我们这个物种正走在毁灭的道路上，但大自然宽恕了我们。这是对一个不配拥有它宽恕的生物的怜悯。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Jeremiah's a bright kid.  I'll just tell him to not wander as a stipulation."
msgstr "耶利米是个聪明的孩子。我会把这个当作约定，让他不得四处闲逛。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "My story?  I'm afraid it's not as gripping as the other tales around here.  My father was an herbalist, my grandfather was an herbalist and - as ancestral pressure would have it - I also became an herbalist.  I studied from the best teachers and, through the years, a generation's knowledge passed on to me.  I've spent a good portion of my life warning others of the fakery that is plastic medicine and helping them rediscover the forgotten beauty that lies in our surroundings.  I joined the New England Church Community to express my gratitude towards the benevolence of nature.  This is where it brought me."
msgstr "我的故事？恐怕它不像这里的其他故事那样扣人心弦。我父亲是一名草药师，我爷爷是一名草药师，而我也成为了一名草药师。我师从最好的老师，经年累月，传授给我一代人的知识。我花了大部分时间来警告其他人当心那些塑料做的假药，并帮助他们重新发现周围被遗忘的美好事物。我加入了新英格兰教会社区，以感谢大自然的仁慈。而这它把我带到了这里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too, Kostas."
msgstr "很高兴见到你，科斯塔斯。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "No, I'm still certain about this.  Jeremiah just isn't a good fit."
msgstr "不，我还是很确定。耶利米就是不太适合。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Sorry these are all I have.  However I'll be back from my next run in <interval>.  Care to take a look in the meanwhile?"
msgstr "抱歉，我只有这些了。  不过，我会在 <interval> 的下一次跑步中回来。  介意同时看一下吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Sure.  Bring me a dozen pine boughs and I'll boil you some."
msgstr "当然可以。给我一打松枝，我给你煮一些。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Thank you.  See you around, Kostas."
msgstr "谢谢你。回见，科斯塔斯。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "This recipe is a gemstone of my family heritage.  Lucky for us that the most common evergreen tree in the U.S. is non-toxic.  Start by rinsing the needles, and separating any woody parts from them.  Then, cut the pine needles in half.  Add one bough's worth of chopped needles to a cup or mug and fill it with boiling water.  Let the needles steep for ten minutes, until they turn brownish and sink down to the bottom.  As a final step, you can strain the needles, but then you'd be wasting precious calories.  A drink like this is perfect for mid-winter colds."
msgstr "这份配方是我家学传承的一颗宝石。幸运的是，北美最常见的常青树都是无毒的。首先漂洗松针，并剔除残留的木质部分。然后，把松针切成两半。在杯子或马克杯中加入一整根松枝的碎松针，并将其灌满沸水。让松针浸泡十分钟，直到它们变成褐色并沉入底部。最后一步，你可以滤掉松针，但这样你就浪费了宝贵的卡路里。像这样的热饮非常适合治疗冬季感冒。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "What can I do for you, <name_g>?"
msgstr "我能帮你什么忙吗，<name_g>？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "What do you do around here?"
msgstr "你在这里干什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr "你到底在说什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Yeah, yeah…  I don't think he'd be a good fit for an herbalist.  He has a bad habit of wandering off someplace, could get him killed one of these days."
msgstr "是的，是的……我认为他不适合做草药师。他有个坏习惯，总是爱四处闲逛，这在目前的情况下总有一天会害死他自己。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "You learn how to craft pine tea."
msgstr "您将学习如何制作松针茶。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local herbalist."
msgstr "你一定是新来的，很高兴认识你。他们叫我科斯塔斯，我是本地的草药师。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local herbalist."
msgstr "你一定是新来的，很高兴认识你。他们叫我科斯塔斯，我是本地的草药师。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local herbalist."
msgstr "你一定是新来的，很高兴认识你。他们叫我科斯塔斯，我是本地的草药师。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "You must be new to herbalism, no?  In short, I scavenge the land for herbs to supply our humble community with medicine.  And that's just one part of my job.  Say, are you interested in buying campsite gear?  I came across an abandoned camp while foraging.  One can only wonder what happened to its poor inhabitants…"
msgstr "你对草药一定很陌生吧？简而言之，我在这片土地上寻找草药，为我们这个小社区提供药品。这只是我工作的一部分。比如说，你有兴趣购买露营装备吗？我在外出采集时发现了一个废弃营地。只能猜测它里面的可怜住户发生过些什么……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Alright, I'll get to it."
msgstr "好吧，我会开始做的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Alright, alright, chill the <swear> out, I'm leaving!"
msgstr "好吧，好吧，冷静一下<发誓>，我要走了！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Could you sew something for me?"
msgstr "你能帮我缝一些东西吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Could you tell me about Theresa?"
msgstr "能和我说说关于特蕾莎的事情吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Could you tell me about yourself?"
msgstr "能和我说说你的情况吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Here it is, I hope you enjoy it.  If you want something else, just come to me."
msgstr "给你，我希望你喜欢。如果你还想要别的，来找我就行。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Hey Maria.  I can't stay to talk right now."
msgstr "嗨，玛丽亚。我不能留下来聊天。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Hey Maria.  What's up?"
msgstr "嗨，玛丽亚。怎么了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "How's my order going?"
msgstr "我的订单怎么样了？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I always wanted to be a fashion designer when I was young.  I used to have a set of dolls, and I'd make dresses for them out of spare cloth I could find.  I took up sewing in high school, and I was trying to get a job with Fashion Nova before <the_cataclysm> screwed that up."
msgstr "我小时候一直想成为一名时装设计师。我以前有一套洋娃娃，我会用我能找到的多余布料为它们做衣服。我在高中时就开始学习缝纫，在<the_cataclysm>搞砸一切之前，我还想在Fashion Nova里找份工作。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I arrived a bit later than everyone else, I was at my studio when <the_cataclysm> came.  Had to dodge a big horde of <zombies> on my way out of town, totaled my car, and hiked the rest of the way."
msgstr "我比其他人晚到了些，<the_cataclysm>到来的时候我正在我的工作室里。在我出城的路上，我不得不躲开一大群<zombies>，撞坏了我的车，剩下的路都是徒步过来的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I don't think I've met you before, have I?  I'm Maria Serrano, it's nice to see an new face."
msgstr "我想我以前没见过你，是吗？我是玛丽亚·塞拉诺，很高兴看到一张新面孔。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a backpack."
msgstr "我订了一个背包。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a dress."
msgstr "我订了一件连衣裙。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a gambeson."
msgstr "我订了一件软铠。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a jacket."
msgstr "我订了一件夹克。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a longcoat."
msgstr "我订了一件风衣。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a pair of pants."
msgstr "我订了一条长裤。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a t-shirt."
msgstr "我订了一件T恤衫。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I sure can!  For now, I can make t-shirts, pants, dresses, longcoats, backpacks, jackets, and a gambeson; if that's your thing."
msgstr "我当然会！现在，我可以缝T恤、长裤、连衣裙、防尘风衣、风衣、背包、夹克和软铠；如果你喜欢的话。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a backpack."
msgstr "我要一个背包。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a dress."
msgstr "我要一件连衣裙。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a gambeson."
msgstr "我要一件软铠。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a jacket."
msgstr "我要一件夹克。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a longcoat."
msgstr "我要一件长款外套。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a pair of pants."
msgstr "我要一条长裤。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a t-shirt."
msgstr "我要一件T恤衫。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I've been busy lately, what did you ask for again?"
msgstr "我最近很忙，你之前订什么来着？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Is everyone treating you fairly?"
msgstr "大家对你还公平吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "It's a pleasure to meet you, Maria."
msgstr "很高兴认识你，玛丽亚。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Let's get to it."
msgstr "开始动手做吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Nevermind, I have to leave."
msgstr "算了，我该走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Nevermind.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "算了，我们谈点其他事情吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "She's a kind old lady, does a lot of knitting.  She could probably make you something if you asked nicely."
msgstr "她是一位善良的老太太，会编织很多东西。如果你好好问问，她可能会给你做点什么。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "T-shirts, pants, jackets, and dresses are four icons.  Longcoats and backpacks are six icons.  A gambeson is fifteen."
msgstr "T恤、长裤、夹克和连衣裙是四个圣像。防尘风衣、风衣和背包是六个圣像。软铠要十五个。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "T-shirts, pants, jackets, and dresses take me two days.  Longcoats and backpacks take four days, while a gambeson takes six days."
msgstr "T恤、长裤、夹克和连衣裙得花两天。防尘风衣、风衣和背包得花四天。软铠得六天。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Things are alright, could be better.  I've been mending clothes and sheets ever since I arrived, fixing this and that.  Theresa's been a big help in those regards, we've traded quilt patterns and designs quite a bit."
msgstr "一切都很好，也许能更好。自从我来了以后，我就一直在补衣服和床单，补补这个，补补那个。特蕾莎在这方面帮了我大忙，我们互相交流了各种缝纫图样和款式。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "What can you sew?"
msgstr "你都会缝些什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "What'll ya have?"
msgstr "你想要什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "What's the price?"
msgstr "价钱是多少？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Yeah, they are.  I just wish my work was more appreciated."
msgstr "是的，大家都很好。我只是希望我的工作能得到更多人的赞赏。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Any old port in a storm, I guess."
msgstr "我想暴风雨中，任何港口都是避难所。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Could you teach me anything?"
msgstr "你能教我点东西吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Could you tell me about your past?"
msgstr "你能告诉我你的过去吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Hey, Olwen.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "嗨，奥尔文。我不能留下来聊天。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Hi, Olwen.  What's up?"
msgstr "嗨，奥尔文。怎么了？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I definitely haven't met you yet.  Nice to meet you, I'm Olwen."
msgstr "我肯定还没见过你。很高兴认识你，我是奥尔文。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I heard you were handy with computers."
msgstr "我听说你很会用电脑。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I suppose a lot of us are these days, with all the nasty things wandering around.  I hope you like it here, might not be the most comfortable, but it'll do for me."
msgstr "我想现在我们很多人都是这样，到处都是四处游荡的怪物。我希望你喜欢这里，也许不够舒适，但对我够用了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I'd rather not say, I gotta go."
msgstr "我不想说话，我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I'm just a curious traveler."
msgstr "我只是一个好奇的旅行者。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I'm just a traveler."
msgstr "我只是一个旅行者。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I'm seeking asylum here."
msgstr "我来这里寻求庇护。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "In that case, I'd better get going."
msgstr "既然如此，我最好还是走吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "My dad's having a hard time letting go of the past.  Got any more interview questions?"
msgstr "我爸爸对过去发生的事情还是难以忘怀。还有什么面试问题吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Not many travelers come through here these days.  There's not much left to wander too, besides a horde of <zombies>."
msgstr "这些天没有多少游客经过这里。  除了一群<僵尸>之外，也没什么可逛的了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Not many travelers come through here these days.  There's not much left to wander too, besides a horde of <zombies>.  The people here won't be too friendly with you either, so that sucks."
msgstr "这些天没有多少游客经过这里。  除了一群<僵尸>之外，也没什么可逛的了。  这里的人对你也不会太友好，所以这很糟糕。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Not much too it, really.  I came here on that bus with everyone else when <the_cataclysm> happened to stroll by.  I've been servicing everyone's electronics since then."
msgstr "真的没什么可以说的。我和其他人一起坐公交车来到这里，<the_cataclysm>碰巧发生。从那时起，我就一直在为大伙提供电子设备服务。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Sure does."
msgstr "当然了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "They're alright, I suppose.  Helena's an asshole as usual, we're low on supplies, and all scared to go twenty feet outside the gate."
msgstr "我想还算可以吧。海伦娜像往常一样是个混蛋，我们的补给不足，所有人都害怕走出大门外二十英尺(约6米)。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Well, this is a really xenophobic bunch, and regard some of your, changes, as a curse brought on by God.  I'm cool with you though, not like some of these other <name_b>.  There are a few who wouldn't mind you, though."
msgstr "嗯，这真是一群仇外的人，他们把你们的一些改变视为上帝带来的诅咒。  不过我对你很客气，不像其他一些<name_b>。  不过，还是有一些人不介意你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "怎么了？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Why not?  Oversharing is kind of my thing anyway.  Got any more interview questions?"
msgstr "为什么不呢？反正过度分享算是我的弱点。还有什么面试问题吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Yeah, I got a master's in computer science from the University of Rhode Island.  Everyone around here comes to me when they want to keep their computers running.  Corrie works more with the hardware portion of these things; I'd recommend visiting her."
msgstr "是的，我在罗得岛大学获得了计算机科学硕士学位。这里任何想要保持电脑正常运行的人都会来找我。科里更多负责硬件相关的部分；我建议你去找找她。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "You look somewhat interesting.  So, what's your story?"
msgstr "你看起来是个有意思的人。那么，你的故事是什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "&Russel's expression becomes somber, and he briefly stares at the wall.  \"She was my dog, had her for seventeen years.  We used to go duck-hunting, she'd swim out and get anything I shot.  She helped me track many a deer through the woods…   When <the_cataclysm> hit, she saved me from some <zombies> when we were skippin' town, but she died…  Then she came back, wasn't herself…  I had to put her down.\""
msgstr "&拉塞尔的表情变得阴沉，他盯着墙看了一会：\"她是我的狗，养了她十七年。我们过去常去猎鸭子，她会游出去，把我射杀的猎物叼回来。她帮我在树林里追踪过无数头鹿……当<the_cataclysm>到来时，我们在小镇上滑雪，她从一群<zombies>手中救下了我，但她也死了……然后她又复活了，不再是她自己……我不得不亲手杀了她。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "And I hate to break it to you, but my point still stands."
msgstr "我不得不打破你的幻想，但我的观点仍然成立。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Chill out man, I'll leave you alone."
msgstr "冷静点，伙计，我不会打扰你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Could you tell me more about Betsey?"
msgstr "能和我说说更多关于贝西的事吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Do you really need these trophies?"
msgstr "你真的需要这些狩猎战利品吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Find somebody else, dude."
msgstr "去找别人吧，兄弟。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Go and hunt them yourself.  You have a gun after all."
msgstr "你可以自己去狩猎它们。毕竟你有枪。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Hey, Russell.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "嗨，拉塞尔。我不能留下来聊天。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Hi, Russell.  Got a minute?"
msgstr "嗨，拉塞尔。有空吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Huh, so it was you over there.  It's always great to see a new face.  Name's Russell, Russell Connelly."
msgstr "唔，原来是你在那边。看到一张新面孔总是很棒的。我叫拉塞尔，拉塞尔·康纳利。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I can help.  Anyway, how are things?"
msgstr "我可以帮忙。话说回来，这里情况如何？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I can't give a discount, but here's some meat instead.  Made by yours truly."
msgstr "我没法打折，但这里还有一些肉。由你亲爱的朋友制造。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I hate to break it to you, but I came here because I don't want to see the world."
msgstr "我不得不打破你的幻想，但我来这里是因为我不再想看到这个世界。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I hunt with most of my time these days.  Whatever game I spot, I bag and donate.  Thing is, it's getting harder and harder.  Have you also noticed how corruption is slowly overtaking the natural wildlife in this God-given planet?  They think the flesh is just rotten.  No, it's mutated, become something else."
msgstr "这些天我大部分时间都在打猎。无论我发现什么猎物，我都会干掉它，献给教会。然而情况却越来越难了。你是否也注意到，在这个上帝赐予的星球上，腐败正在慢慢征服野生动物？他们认为肉只是腐烂了。不，它变异了，变成了别的东西。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I may be more skilled or better equipped but you, my friend, have something I don't: experience.  A good hunter never leaves his hunting ground.  I sure ain't gonna leave it!  Now you <name_g>, you know what it's REALLY like out there!"
msgstr "我可能更熟练或装备更好，但我的朋友，你有我没有的东西：经验。一个好猎人从不离开他的猎场。我肯定不会离开的！而现在你，<name_g>，你知道外面变成什么样子了！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I won't let you leave just yet.  You're the new one here, I have so much to ask.  Let me put it another way: what have you seen out there?  I'm talking about the monsters that lurk deep in the woods.  Have you witnessed them with your very own eyes?"
msgstr "我现在还不会让你离开。你是新来的，我有很多事要问。让我换个说法：你在外面看到了什么？我说的是潜伏在森林深处的怪物。你亲眼目睹过吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I wouldn't be here if I saw one.  Why do you ask?"
msgstr "要是我看到过，我就不会在这里了。你为什么这么问？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm humbled by your words.  See ya later."
msgstr "您谬赞了。好吧，回头见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm humbled by your words.  Well, bye."
msgstr "您谬赞了。好吧，再见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm just a curious traveler.  What's up with you?"
msgstr "只是一个好奇的旅行者。你们情况如何？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm seeking asylum here.  What's up with you?"
msgstr "我来这里寻求庇护。你们情况如何？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  I'd better get going."
msgstr "请节哀。我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  Let's change the subject."
msgstr "我为你的损失感到难过。我们换个话题吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I've been better.  Having a hellish time keeping up with strange wildlife that suddenly want us dead… hey, let's forget the world while we're talking.  How's life treatin' ya?"
msgstr "我已经好多了。之前度过一段地狱般的时间，与那些突然想要杀死我们的奇怪野生动物近距离接触……嘿，我们在交谈时先忘了这个世界吧。你的生活怎么样？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I've got other things to deal with.  Do you really need these trophies?"
msgstr "我还有其他事情要处理。你真的需要这些狩猎战利品吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I've seen too many things out there.  Why do you ask?"
msgstr "我在外面见过太多东西了。你为什么这么问？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I've seen too much out there.  Why do you ask?"
msgstr "我在外面见过太多东西了。你为什么这么问？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "It's not often that we see new folks around the remnants of the New England Community Church.  So, got any tales to share from the outside world?"
msgstr "这个新英格兰社区教会的残存周围很少有新面孔。那么，有什么外面的故事可以和我们分享吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Let's make a deal."
msgstr "让我们做个交易吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Let's talk about getting you those trophies."
msgstr "我们谈谈那些狩猎战利品的事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Look, I'm just a regular God-fearing fella like you.  You gotta have something to keep your mind off stuff.  You'd get mad otherwise.  My passion happens to be collecting trophies."
msgstr "听着，我只是一个和你一样的虔诚信徒。你得找些东西让自己稍稍远离这些琐事。否则你会疯掉的。而我的爱好恰好是收集战利品。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Oh it's nothing new to me.  Livin' off the land, far from everyone - it's just what I'm adjusted to.  I've kept in touch with the church folks, and that was enough.  I had a loyal companion back home, Betsey, my rottweiler.  Things have been very different since she passed away, though."
msgstr "噢，这对我来说并不是什么新鲜事。生活在远离人群的地方，这正是我早就适应了的。我一直与教会的人保持联系，这就够了。我曾经在家里有一个忠实的同伴，贝西，我的罗威纳犬。不过，自从她去世后，情况就大不相同了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Russell, hey?  Nice to meet you."
msgstr "拉塞尔，是吗？很高兴见到你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Since I helped you out with your trophies, can I get a discount?"
msgstr "既然我帮你带来了这些战利品，能给我打个折吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Thank you.  I'll see you around, Russell."
msgstr "谢谢你。回见，拉塞尔。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Thank you.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "谢谢你。你刚才说什么来着？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "We're all desperately holding on to our stockpiles, but I can find something for you.  I have some spare hides and pelts, if you're interested in buying."
msgstr "我们都在拼命维持仅剩的库存，但我可以为你找到一些东西。如果你有兴趣的话，我有一些多余的兽皮和毛皮。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Well, let's just say I'm interested in rare game.  I've heard stories, rumors and some tall tales about otherworldly beings out there in the wasteland.  That's where you come in.  I want to see the evidence, something physical I can collect as a trophy collection.  You seem to have experience, I was hoping you could help me."
msgstr "好吧，不如说我对稀有的猎物感兴趣吧。我听过一些关于荒原上异界怪物的传说、谣言和一些荒诞的故事。而这也是你来的地方。我想看看证据，一些我可以收集作为战利品的实物。你似乎很有经验，我希望你能帮我。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "What do you do now?"
msgstr "你现在做什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Who cares what's up with me?  You're the new one here.  Let me put it another way: what have you seen out there?  I'm talking about the monsters that lurk deep in the woods.  Have you witnessed them with your very own eyes?"
msgstr "谁在乎我们怎么样了？你是新来的。让我换个说法：你在外面看到了什么？我说的是潜伏在森林深处的怪物。你亲眼目睹过吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Why didn't you hunt these trophies yourself?"
msgstr "你为什么不亲自去狩猎这些战利品？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Why don't you hunt these trophies yourself?"
msgstr "你为什么不亲自去狩猎这些战利品？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Your life, your escape mechanism…"
msgstr "你的生活，你的逃避机制……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Alright, let's hear it."
msgstr "好吧，我们来听听吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Fairly?  There's no such thing as fairness in the world.  The NECC wouldn't give a damn if I starved to death on this very bench.  At least I have friends here, ones that appreciate what I do.  I make music and that's all I have left, it means everything to me."
msgstr "公平？这世界上从来就没有公平这回事。如果我在这张板凳上饿死，新英格兰教会也根本不在乎。至少我在这里有个朋友，能欣赏我干的活。我做音乐，这就是我仅剩的活计，它对我来说意味着一切。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Good to see people like you in the world.  I'm Sonia, Sonia Greene.  I entertain the people."
msgstr "很高兴在世界上看到像你这样的人。我叫索尼娅，索尼娅·格林。我让大伙开心些。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Hey Sonia.  I can't stay to talk right now."
msgstr "嗨，索尼娅。我现在不能留下来聊天。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Hey Sonia.  What's up?"
msgstr "嗨，索尼娅。最近咋样？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "I was in an underground band - Taurists was our name - before all this.  Performing gigs at local venues and jamming with my friends; that's all my life was about.  Now, I'm a badass soloist with a war-torn guitar, a singer of the old-world preserving the wonders of music and the Taurist legacy for generations to come.  That's also a synonym for not having all that much going on in my life."
msgstr "在这一切发生之前，我是一个地下乐队的成员——金牛座是我们乐队的名字。在周边的场子演出，和朋友们一起表演；而那是我生命的全部。现在，我是一个带着饱受摧残吉他的恶棍独奏家，一个旧世界的歌手，为后世保存下音乐的奇迹和金牛座的遗产。这也是我生活中没有那么多事情发生的同义词。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Nothin' much, just sitting around and biding my time, getting any work I can.  I might play something to cheer everyone up, if my guitar wasn't busted."
msgstr "没什么，只是坐着等待时机，尽我所能地完成工作。  如果我的吉他没有坏的话，我可能会弹一些东西来让大家高兴起来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Now that your guitar is fixed, could you play something for me?"
msgstr "现在你的吉他修好了，你能为我弹奏一下吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Now that's a wild story.  I owe my life to this kid Chloe, really.  I'll let her tell the tale."
msgstr "那可真是一个疯狂的故事。我的生命真的要归功于克洛伊，这个孩子，真的。我会让她讲完这个故事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Oh, just fine.  A bit malnourished and all, but I can't really complain if that's the worst of it, right?  My guitar makes our twisted little world a bit more tolerable, though.  Takes my mind off stuff and muffles the screams of the boogeyman, you know?"
msgstr "哦，还行吧。有点营养不良，但如果只有这件事能称得上糟糕，我真的没什么好抱怨的，对吧？不过，我的吉他让这个扭曲的小世界变得更容易忍受。让把我的注意力从其他事情上移开，压制住怪兽们的尖叫，你知道吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Sonia?  Nice to meet you, I'm <u_name>.  How are things here?"
msgstr "索尼娅？很高兴见到你，我是<u_name>。这里情况如何？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Sure, I can play you a tune or two that I know.  It will cost you a little something, just one icon.  The artist doesn't want to starve, if you know what I mean."
msgstr "当然，我可以给你弹一两首我知道的曲子。  它会花费你一点钱，只是一个图标。  艺术家不想挨饿，如果你明白我的意思的话。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "That's a nice guitar you have."
msgstr "你这把吉他很不错。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "You're <swear> right.  I like its scars, makes it look like it has a history, you know?  We've been through a lot.  Those pesky <zombies> forced me to harm my sweet, sweet guitar, but I retaliated and bashed their heads in!  I lost a part of me that day, but the guitar's alright.  Just a bit rusted from all that blood and gore, that's all."
msgstr "你<swear>是对的。我喜欢它的伤疤，这让它看起来像是有段历史，你知道吗？我们一起经历过很多。那些讨厌的<zombies>迫使我弄伤了我亲爱的吉他，但我报仇了，狠狠地砸碎了它们的头！那天我失去了自己的一部分，是的，但吉他没事。那些血迹让它有些锈了，只是这样。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "啊，又一个幸存者！我希望你能平安归来。我是汤姆，很高兴认识你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "啊，又一个幸存者！我希望你能平安归来。我是汤姆，很高兴认识你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "啊，又一个幸存者！我希望你能平安归来。我是汤姆，很高兴认识你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "All of us are here; me, Felicity, and Olwen.  We're so <swear> lucky, I feel like crying tears of joy every time I see them."
msgstr "我们都在这里；我、费利西蒂和奥尔文。我们太<swear>幸运了，每次看到他们，我都想高兴地流泪。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Any progress?"
msgstr "有什么进展吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Could you tell me about Felicity?"
msgstr "能和我说说关于费利西蒂的事情吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Could you tell me about Olwen?"
msgstr "能和我说说关于奥尔文的事情吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Delivering <topic_item>."
msgstr "提供<topic_item>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Good luck with that.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "祝你好运。回头见，汤姆。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Hey, Tom.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "嗨，汤姆。我不能留下来聊天。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Hey, that's nice of you to ask.  The people here are barely holding on.  Malnutrition, sleepless nights, odd sounds from the woods, everyone turns a little mad in these circumstances.  It's not their fault, I know, but they did get what they wanted."
msgstr "嘿，你能问我真是太好了。这里的人几乎快撑不下去了。营养不良，失眠长夜，树林发出奇怪的声音，在这种情况下，每个人都会变得有点疯狂。我知道这不是他们的错，但他们确实得到了他们想要的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Hi Tom, got a minute?"
msgstr "嗨，汤姆。有空吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I haven't got a story.  I'm an independent thinker.  Living out here, away from the Man."
msgstr "我没有故事。我是一个独立思考的思想家。住在这里，远离人类。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I mean, can I help with the research?"
msgstr "我的意思是，我可以帮助研究吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I want to find out the truth and preserve the past for the following generation, so that they'll know some of what <swear> happened."
msgstr "我想找出真相，为下一代人保留过去，这样他们就会知道<swear>发生了什么。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I was nobody but an ordinary office drone.  Lived the average suburban life, prepping for the inevitable.  Had the bright idea of purchasing a Last Man On Earth shelter, but I decided to settle for less when I found out it cost five times my annual salary.  That's how I ended up in a religious campground with my family and a survival kit."
msgstr "我只是一个普通的办公室工蜂。过着普通的郊区生活，为不可避免之事做准备。我曾经有过购买\"地球上最后一个人\"庇护所的好主意，但当我发现它的花费是我年薪的五倍时，我决定花费更少的钱。这就是我和我的家人以及全套生存装备一起来到这个宗教露营地的原因。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I'm currently in the middle of solving a pointless mystery for my own entertainment.  Of course I have time!"
msgstr "我目前正在自娱自乐尝试解决一个毫无意义的谜团。我当然有时间！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I'm just a curious traveler.  What about you, how are you doing?"
msgstr "只是一个好奇的旅行者。你呢，过得怎么样？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I'm seeking asylum here.  What about you, how are you doing?"
msgstr "我来这里寻求庇护。你呢，过得怎么样？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Let's talk about your goals."
msgstr "我们来谈谈你的目标。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "New England Church Community is what they're called.  My wife was the first in the family to come in contact with 'em.  She joined because of their charity work and as for myself, well… you know why I was there.  Let me tell you, being surrounded by like-minded folks was like a breath of fresh air.  Even if the only belief we shared was paranoia, but you get what I'm saying.  I tried everything to prep my family for the inevitable, I really did, but in the end it wasn't me who saved us all."
msgstr "新英格兰教会社区，他们就是这么称呼自己的。我妻子是家里第一个和他们接触的人。她加入是因为他们的慈善工作，至于我，嗯……你知道我为什么在这里。让我告诉你，被志同道合的人包围就像呼吸新鲜空气。即使我们唯一的共同信念是偏执，但你明白我的意思。我想尽一切办法让我的家人为不可避免之事做好准备，我真的做到了，但最终救下了我们全家人的并不是我。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Tom."
msgstr "很高兴见到你，汤姆。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "No no no no no!  Thinking is one of the only thing I have left and you can't take that away from me.  But, If you *really* want to make yourself useful, relevant newspapers would help me piece out the puzzle."
msgstr "不不不不！思考是我仅存的东西之一，你不能把它从我身上抢走。但是，如果你*真心*想让自己变得有用，相关的报纸会帮我解开这个谜题。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "No rest for the weary.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "疲惫者不能休息。回头见，汤姆。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Of course!  Just put all your literary findings on that chair over there.  Remember, you're not only doing a favor for me, but for all of humanity as well.  World heritage is what we're talking about!  I managed to get my hands on a book called 'Zombie Survival Guide' while, uh… dumpster diving.  Imagine how much this book alone reveals about our pre-Cataclysm culture!  Oh boy, how wrong we were about everything."
msgstr "当然了！把你所有的文学发现放在那边的椅子上。记住，你不仅是在帮我的忙，也是在帮全人类的忙。我们谈论的是世界遗产！我设法弄到了一本叫做《丧尸生存指南》的书，在我呃……打扫垃圾桶的时候。想象一下，单是这本书就能揭示了我们大灾变前的文化！天啊，我们把一切事情都想错了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Olwen's a bright girl; she's fiddled with electronics and computers since she was in high school.  She got a master's in it from the University of Rhode Island.  Felicity's been a good mother for her, always been there for us.  Olwen might be able to teach you a few things, she should be around here somewhere."
msgstr "奥尔文是个聪明的女孩；她从高中起就喜欢摆弄电子设备和电脑。她获得了罗得岛大学的硕士学位。费利西蒂一直是她的好母亲，一直在我们身边。奥尔文也许能教你一些东西，她应该在这里的某个地方。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Perhaps it's not worth finding out."
msgstr "也许这不值得一探究竟。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Perhaps.  You don't wanna think about the stuff I'm thinking about, it would spiral a newbie independent thinker into madness.  I don't blame you for saying that."
msgstr "也许吧。你可别去想我所在想的事情，这会让一个刚刚学会独立思考的新人陷入疯狂。你会这么说我一点都不奇怪。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Please continue."
msgstr "请继续说。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "She's my wife, we've been married for a while now.  We used to live in Rhode Island, worked at a publishing firm, Stillwater.  She's always wanted to be a writer, that's why we moved away.  We've been a bit distant as of late, I don't think she's taking the \"whole end-of-the-world\" thing too well."
msgstr "她是我的妻子，我们结婚有一段时间了。我们过去住在罗得岛，在一家出版公司 Stillwater 工作。她一直想成为一名作家，这就是我们搬走的原因。我们最近有点疏远了，我不认为她对\"世界末日\"有足够的理解。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "So far?  Not so great.  Now that the Internet is down, I don't know.  Such abundant hidden information - all gone!"
msgstr "目前为止，不太妙。现在互联网已经瘫痪了，我也不知道怎么办。如此丰富的隐藏信息——全都没了！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Sorry Tom, I can't stay to chat."
msgstr "抱歉，汤姆。我没空留下来聊天。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Sounds like an ambitious project.  Is there anything I can do to help you out?"
msgstr "听起来像是一个雄心勃勃的大工程。我能帮你什么忙吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Tell me about yourself."
msgstr "跟我说说你的情况吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "The sky has broken!  They received a rather passive-aggressive sign from God!  The wait is finally over.  Well, not for me.  So much is left unanswered, and I know for a fact the answer's out there."
msgstr "天塌了！他们从上帝那里得到了某种消极反抗的信号！等待终于结束了。好吧，对我来说不是。还有很多问题没有答案，我知道答案就在那里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Try not to get stuck in the past.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "尽量不要陷入过去。回头见，汤姆。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Try not to glorify the past.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "尽量不要美化过去。回头见，汤姆。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Was it difficult to find us?  We haven't seen a single soul out there for so long, I'm starting to lose my hope.  So, tell me about yourself."
msgstr "找到我们非常困难吗？我们已经很久没有见到一个活人了，我都快失去希望了。所以，和我说说你自己吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night for a while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see what that thing is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr "你没听到吗？夜里总有东西在森林里发出尖叫，有时让我睡不着。我太害怕了，不敢出去看看那是什么东西。如果你杀了它，我会永远记住你的恩情。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
