#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Don't worry, I'm not going to hurt you."
msgstr "别担心，我不打算伤害你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Food is just the thing a starving man needs.  Thanks for the help, <name_g>."
msgstr "食物正是饥饿的人所需要的。谢谢你的帮助，<name_g>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ha ha ha!  Think before you speak, chum.  Eight icons for an honest day's work, I say the system's broken!"
msgstr "哈哈哈！说话前先想一想，老兄。八个圣像能换一整天诚实的工作，想想可不可能吧！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
