#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Hey, good to see you're still around."
msgstr "嗨，很高兴看到你还在。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "I ain't leaving, <name_g>.  Not until that eldritch screeching nightmare is dead 'n buried."
msgstr "我不会离开，<name_g>。  直到那个可怕的尖叫噩梦被埋葬。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "I got here first, therefore this place belongs to me.  Them's the rules in the <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr "我先到的，所以这个地方属于我。这就是<the_cataclysm>的规则。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "I got my rights to be here, chum.  Squatter's rights!"
msgstr "我有权在这里，朋友。擅自占有权！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
