#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "我看看能做些什么。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "I'll see you around then."
msgstr "那我们回头见了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that <name_g>, but I don't feel like facing it either."
msgstr "听到这个消息我很抱歉，<name_g>，但我也不想面对它。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "It ain't so bad.  I got shelter, heat, and people to defend me if any <zombie> shuffles its way in here.  If I want to eat then I'll be doin' construction work all day."
msgstr "没那么糟。我有庇护所，有暖气，如果有那个<zombie>敢来这里的话，也有人保护我。如果我想混口饭吃，我可以从早到晚当建筑工。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "No chance!  Its not you, its the world out there I'm worried about.  All those <swear> monsters really give me the creeps, and as far as I know this church is the last bastion of humanity in the <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr "门都没有！我担心的不是你，而是外面的世界。所有这些<swear>怪物真的让我毛骨悚然，据我所知，这座教堂是<the_cataclysm>世界上人类的最后堡垒。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Now that's an archaic belief.  I'll see you around."
msgstr "这可真是一个过时的信仰。回头见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, but they took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a <swear> nuisance."
msgstr "这不是重点，哥们。你不明白吗？这是我的地盘，但他们把它夺走了。现在他们认为我们只是个<swear>讨厌鬼。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
