msgstr "这不是重点，哥们。你不明白吗？这是我的地盘，但他们把它夺走了。现在他们认为我们只是个<swear>讨厌鬼。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "That's understandable."
msgstr "可以理解。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "They are nice people, lettin' us stay here 'n all.  I got friends here, and while we may not be members we belong here.  We'll fight together if they ever try to kick us out."
msgstr "他们都是好人，让我们呆在这里。我在这里有朋友，虽然我们还不是教会成员，但我们属于这里。如果他们想把我们踢出去，我们会团结起来和他们打一架。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "What nightmare?"
msgstr "什么梦魇？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Who I was is gone, dead… died when I put down the monsters wearing the face of my friends.  Ever since then, I've felt nothing but disgust for myself.  Let's not <swear> reminisce."
msgstr "曾经的那个我已经没了，死了……当我干掉戴着我朋友脸的怪物时就已经死了。从那以后，我只对自己感到厌恶。别<swear>回忆了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Why don't you blow this joint and come with me?"
msgstr "你为什么不抽了这根大烟和我一起飞？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
msgid "Alright, let's chat."
msgstr "好吧，咱们来聊天。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Could I have some food?"
msgstr "能给我点东西吃吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Could be better, could be worse, but I'm not complaining.  I have everything I need here; my family, a nice job, and roof over my head.  I only wish God was as forgiving to others as to me."
msgstr "可能更好，可能更糟，但我一点都不抱怨。我在这里有我所需要的一切；我的家庭，一份好工作而且头上有片瓦。我希望上帝能像对我一样宽恕别人。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Could you tell me about Jeremiah?"
msgstr "你能告诉我有关耶利米的事吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Could you tell me about Katherine?"
msgstr "你能告诉我关于凯瑟琳的事吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Could you tell me more about Jeremiah?"
msgstr "你能告诉我更多关于耶利米的事吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Could you tell me more about Katherine?"
msgstr "你能告诉我更多关于凯瑟琳的事吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Good to hear that."
msgstr "很高兴听到你这么说。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, name's Simon."
msgstr "你好，陌生人，我想我们以前从未见过面。  很高兴认识你，我叫西蒙。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, name's Simon."
msgstr "你好，陌生人，我想我们以前从未见过面。  很高兴认识你，我叫西蒙。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, name's Simon."
msgstr "你好，陌生人，我想我们以前从未见过面。  很高兴认识你，我叫西蒙。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "How are you holding up?"
msgstr "你过得好吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "I gotta go, see you later."
msgstr "我得走了，待会儿见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "I guess I'll starve."
msgstr "我想我只能饿死了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "I heard the joinees could get some food here."
msgstr "我听说入会者可以在这里吃点东西。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "I used to volunteer as a cook in a homeless shelter.  I met the church through that job; their missionaries would come by every so often and hand out essentials to people living there, then give a sermon in one of the back rooms.  Katherine and I wound up going to one of their sermons, and we've stayed connected since.  Working in that shelter taught me to cook on a shoestring budget; that's really useful these days, ya know."
msgstr "我曾经在一个流浪者收容所里做厨师。我通过那份工作认识了教会；他们的传教士会经常来，向住在那里的人分发必需品，然后在一个后屋里布道。凯瑟琳和我最终加入了他们的布道会，从那以后我们一直保持联系。在收容所的工作教我学会了如何用微薄的预算做饭；你知道，现在这技能真的很有用。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<done_conversation_section>"
#. ~ Avatar response to an NPC that can be used for TALK_NONE responses.
#. Could be used in a lot more dialogs.  Could also use a lot more variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'd like to ask you about something else."
msgstr "我想问你点别的事。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<acknowledged>"
#. ~ Generic acknowledgment of a command.  Comes up a lot and could use more
#. variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'll do that."
msgstr "我会去做的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "I've changed my mind, forget about it."
msgstr "我改变主意了，忘掉它吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Is there any way I could join the community?"
msgstr "我有什么办法加入这个社区吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "It was worth a shot, I guess."
msgstr "我想值得一试。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "It's been a while since anyone gave out meals.  We're low on supplies around here, I can't spare any.  I'm sorry."
msgstr "有一段时间没有派餐了。我们这里的补给不足，我可分不出一份给你。我很抱歉。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Jeremiah is my son, he's a sweet boy and all grown up now.  We taught him everything he knows, and we all had high hopes for how he could make it in the world, before <the_cataclysm> took it away.  He doesn't like his mother, Katherine, very much, and I've tried to help the two, but they can't seem to properly get along."
msgstr "耶利米是我的儿子，他是一个可爱的男孩，现在已经长大了。  我们教给他所知道的一切，在<大灾变>夺走它之前，我们都对他如何在这个世界上取得成功寄予厚望。  他非常不喜欢他的母亲凯瑟琳，我试图帮助他们两个，但他们似乎无法正常相处。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Just passing through, don't mind me."
msgstr "只是个路过的，别在意。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Katherine is a bit overprotective of him, and ever since <the_cataclysm>, she's become extremely worried for his safety.  He wants more independence, seein' as how he's grown now, but she won't leave him be.  She tells me that someone needs to keep an eye on him, so she took it upon herself to do so.  I think she has the best intentions at heart, I know she loves him dearly, but the boy needs to figure out some things on his own."
msgstr "凯瑟琳对他有点过度保护，自从<大灾变>之后，她就变得非常担心他的安全。  从他现在的成长来看，他想要更多的独立，但她不会离开他。  她告诉我需要有人监视他，所以她自己就这样做了。  我认为她内心是善意的，我知道她深爱他，但男孩需要自己解决一些事情。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Katherine's probably in the bunks right now, and Jeremiah's next door.  Feel free to say hello sometime."
msgstr "凯瑟琳现在可能在宿舍里，耶利米大概在隔壁。有空打个招呼吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Look, I have a family too.  I know how hard it is for you, but I've already told you, rules are rules."
msgstr "听着，我也有家人。我知道这对你来说很艰难，但我已经告诉过你了，规矩就是规矩。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "No, I wouldn't.  Like I said, we don't have any to spare."
msgstr "不行，我没有。就像我刚刚说的，我们这里分不出多余的给你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Okay, man.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "好吧，伙计。  我会上路的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Okay, shoot."
msgstr "好吧，说吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "On second thought, I gotta go.  See ya, <name_g>."
msgstr "转念一想，我得走了。再见，<name_g>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Please?  I need it for my family."
msgstr "求求了，我的家人需要食物。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "She's my wife, worked for the Church before <the_cataclysm>.  She used to organize charities for the needy, now we're the ones in need of charity.  She has a bit of a high horse these days, but a nice lady once you get to know her.  We've been married for 28 years, and I couldn't ask for a better wife."
msgstr "她是我的妻子，在<大灾变>之前为教会工作。  她曾经为有需要的人组织慈善事业，现在我们才是需要慈善事业的人。  如今她有点傲慢，但一旦你了解了她，就会发现她是一个很好的女士。  我们结婚28年了，我找不到比她更好的妻子了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Sure, what's up?"
msgstr "当然，怎么了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_g>.  See you around."
msgstr "谢谢，<name_g>。我们回头见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "That's good to hear, but I gotta go."
msgstr "很高兴听到这个消息，但我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "That's good to hear.  I'd like to ask you about something else."
msgstr "很高兴听到这个消息。  我想问你一些别的事情。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "They can, but we're limited on the portions for now.  Hope you enjoy it, and come back tomorrow for another."
msgstr "他们可以，但目前我们的份量有限。希望你喜欢，明天可以再来领一份。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "This is the New England Community Church, I should say it's one of their old retreats.  I'm Simon, the head chef around here."
msgstr "这是新英格兰教会社区，我应该说曾经是他们的旧避难所之一。我是西蒙，这里的主厨。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Where's your family now?"
msgstr "你的家人都在哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Who are you?  Where am I right now?"
msgstr "你是谁？我现在在哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Who's Jeremiah?"
msgstr "耶利米是谁？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Who's Katherine?"
msgstr "凯瑟琳是谁？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Why would they have an issue with each other?"
msgstr "为什么他们之间会产生矛盾呢？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "Would you accept any money for it?"
msgstr "你愿意接受任何钱吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
msgid "You'd have to talk to Gemma or Julian about that.  I'm sure there's a way, though."
msgstr "你得去找杰玛或朱利安谈谈这件事。不过我肯定一切总会有解决办法。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Alright then, fuck you <name_b>."
msgstr "好吧，操你妈的<name_b>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Alright, alright.  Here's some food and water, <name_b>.  Get out of my <swear> sight."
msgstr "好吧，好吧。这是一些食物和水，<name_b>。快<swear>离开我的视线。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Alright.  I gotta go."
msgstr "好吧，我该走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Alright.  See ya."
msgstr "好吧。再见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Care to talk for a bit?"
msgstr "愿意聊一会儿吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Could I borrow something from the stock?"
msgstr "我能从这里借点东西吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Could some money persuade you?"
msgstr "一些钱能说服你吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Could you just chat for a bit?"
msgstr "你能聊一会儿吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
msgid "Could you tell me a bit about yourself?"
msgstr "能和我说说关于你自己的情况吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Could you tell me about your hobbies again?"
msgstr "你能再告诉我你的爱好吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Do you have any hobbies?"
msgstr "你有什么爱好吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Geez, I'm leaving."
msgstr "天哪，我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Has anyone stolen from here?"
msgstr "有人偷过这里的东西吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "He was a nice fellow, taught me everything I know about firearms, wildlife, and sailing.  We lived next to this big ol' lake, so we had plenty of opportunities to catch bass and catfish.  He'd skin and filet them, and we'd have it for dinner.  My mother always cooked them, and she was great at it."
msgstr "他是一个好人，教了我关于枪械、野生动物和航海的一切。  我们住在这个大湖旁边，所以我们有很多机会捕捉鲈鱼和鲶鱼。  他会把它们剥皮、切片，然后我们就把它当晚餐。  我妈妈总是煮它们，而且她做得很棒。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Hello.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr "你好。什么风把你吹来了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "How much food do you have?"
msgstr "你们这里有多少食物？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I can give these people one less mouth to feed, if you'd prefer that."
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，我可以让这些人少吃一口。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I can understand that.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "我能理解。让我们谈谈其他事情。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I don't have anything right now.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "我现在什么都没有，我们谈点别的吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I don't know anymore, to tell you the truth.  I was planning on settling down and having kids, but now that everyone's dead and the judgement of God has come to pass, I'll seek His truth and try to keep on living.  One day, when this is all over, I'll fly away to Heaven's pearly gates and be with the angels.  As for the Earth, I'd rather not think about the things that have come to pass."
msgstr "说实话，我已经不知道了。  我原本打算安定下来并生孩子，但现在每个人都死了，神的审判已经来临，我将寻求他的真理并努力继续生活。  有一天，当这一切都结束时，我会飞向天堂的珍珠之门，与天使们在一起。  至于地球，我宁愿不去想已经发生的事情。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I guess they will.  I pray to God that I won't have to shoot someone, I never want to be forced into deciding between life or death."
msgstr "我想他们会的。  我向上帝祈祷我不必开枪射杀某人，我永远不想被迫在生与死之间做出决定。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I guess those shooting skills come in handy these days."
msgstr "我想这些拍摄技巧现在会派上用场。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I have to go, see you later."
msgstr "我得走了，待会儿见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I hope it isn't too boring.  See ya."
msgstr "我希望这不会太无聊。再见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I really like to draw things, I primarily did landscapes in my spare time.  I like paper-and-pencil sketches, but I have worked with watercolors and oil canvases.  Never could get my head around the digital stuff, though, too complex for me and I never had a good free hand with a stylus.  I also shot a bit, went hunting a few times.  I mainly went to the gun range though, shotguns were always my forte.  Besides that, I watched some TV and regular ol' stuff.  I also like to read quite a bit, too."
msgstr "我很喜欢画画，业余时间主要画风景。  我喜欢纸笔素描，但我也用过水彩画和油画。  然而，我永远无法理解数字化的东西，对我来说太复杂了，而且我从来没有很好地自由使用手写笔。  我也打过几枪，打过几次猎。  不过我主要去的是射击场，霰弹枪一直是我的强项。  除此之外，我还看了一些电视和一些常规的东西。  我也很喜欢读书。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I used to work for the U.S Postal Service, I was a mail carrier.  Delivered all the letters, packages, and mail orders to the residents of <city>, door-to-door.  It was pretty hard at times, but it kept me fit and on the road."
msgstr "我曾经在美国邮政局工作，是一名邮递员。  将所有信件、包裹和邮购挨家挨户递送给<城市>的居民。  有时这很困难，但它让我保持健康并继续前进。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I used to, me and my mother were pretty close.  I didn't know my father very well for the first four years of my life, he was always out on deployment with the Navy someplace.  Me and him got to know each other after he retired from the service, we'd always go fishing on Sunday afternoons for years.  My mother though, she was the sweetest lady you'd ever meet, always took care of me and Dad.  Now they're gone, been that way for the last three years."
msgstr "以前，我和妈妈关系很好。  在我生命的头四年里，我不太了解我的父亲，他总是在海军的某个地方部署。  我和他是在他退役后认识的，多年来我们总是在周日下午去钓鱼。  但我的母亲，她是你见过的最可爱的女士，总是照顾我和爸爸。  现在他们走了，过去三年都是这样。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I won't.  Pleasure doin' business."
msgstr "我不会的。交易愉快。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I'm alright at it, I guess.  I'm no Van Gough or Botticelli, but I get along with it and do my best.  I've started using the desk up here to work on these days, I just need to keep my firearm close and one eye on the door."
msgstr "我想我没问题。  我不是梵高或波提切利，但我能接受并尽力而为。  这些天我开始使用这里的办公桌工作，我只需要把枪拿近，一只眼睛盯着门。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I'm just a regular guy, been with the Church for a while now.  I kept a good, solid job before <the_cataclysm>, lived in a nice apartment on Chestnut Street."
msgstr "我只是一个普通人，加入教会已经有一段时间了。  在<大灾变>之前我一直保持着一份不错、稳定的工作，住在栗树街的一套漂亮公寓里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Is that why you joined the Church?"
msgstr "这就是你加入教会的原因吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Is there anything I can do to help you?"
msgstr "有什么我可以帮助您的吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Just stopping by for a moment.  See ya."
msgstr "只是在这里停留片刻。再见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Keep that in mind."
msgstr "我会记着的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Name's Eddie.  I'm making sure this stockpile is alright."
msgstr "名字叫艾迪。  我确保这个库存没问题。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Nobody's tried to yet.  It can get a little boring sometimes, standing around and doing nothing."
msgstr "还没有人尝试过。有时候，站着无所事事，会有点无聊。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Nope, it couldn't.  Don't try and <swear> bribe me again, you <swear> <name_b>."
msgstr "不，这不行。别再<swear>贿赂我了，你<swear><name_b>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Nope, you can't do that.  I'd like to help you, but we've already got enough mouths to feed."
msgstr "不，你不能那样做。  我很想帮助你，但我们已经有足够的人口了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Okay, here's some food and water.  Don't tell anyone I gave you that."
msgstr "好的，这是一些食物和水。别告诉任何人我给你的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "She sure was, helped me through some very hard times in my life.  I used to be bullied in middle school, whenever I'd get beat up, she'd always help clean me up and tell me I'd be alright.  She had this recipe for peach casserole too, best one in the world.  It was hard for me when she passed, but I found some solace right here in this Church.  We'd always been religious, but this one just clicked for me, ya know?"
msgstr "她确实是，帮助我度过了人生中一些非常困难的时期。  我中学时曾被欺负，每当我被打时，她总是帮我收拾东西，并告诉我不会有事。  她也有这个桃子砂锅菜谱，世界上最好的一个。  她去世时我很难过，但我在这座教堂里找到了一些安慰。  我们一直都很虔诚，但这对我来说很合时宜，你知道吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Sure, I'd be willing to purchase some.  I'll have to work up the money with Helena, but I'm sure we've got it.  I'd prefer canned, and preserved goods.  How much are you talkin'?"
msgstr "当然，我愿意购买一些。  我得和海伦娜一起凑钱，但我确信我们已经拿到了。  我更喜欢罐头和腌制食品。  你说多少话？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Sure, what's happening?"
msgstr "当然，发生了什么事？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "That's private info, <name_g>."
msgstr "这是私人信息，<name_g>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "What are you planning on doing in the future?"
msgstr "你未来打算做什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "What did you do for a job before <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "在<the_cataclysm>之前你做什么工作？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "What was your father like?"
msgstr "你的父亲是什么样的人？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Who are you again?"
msgstr "你又是谁？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Would you be willing to buy any food?"
msgstr "你愿意买任何食物吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Yeah, her death was hard on me.  I wound up goin' here one day, and I felt something come over me, like I belonged here.  I haven't left since, and I've been able to move on with them."
msgstr "是的，她的死对我来说很难受。  有一天，我最终来到了这里，我感觉有一种东西笼罩着我，就像我属于这里一样。  从那以后我就没有离开过，而且我能够和他们一起继续前进。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "You must be a very good artist then.  Do you still have time to draw?"
msgstr "那你一定是一位非常优秀的艺术家。  你还有时间画画吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "You're mother must've been very nice."
msgstr "你妈妈一定很好。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "You're mother sounds very nice, what was she like?"
msgstr "你妈妈听起来人很好，她是个什么样的人?"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/necc/npcs.json
msgid "Arturo Maldonado"
msgstr "阿图罗·马尔多纳多"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Random NPC, can direct you to the free merchants and sell you things.
#. ~ Random NPC, non persistent, can direct you to the free merchants and sell
#. you things.
#: data/json/npcs/necc/npcs.json data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Caravan Merchant"
msgstr "商队商人"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/necc/npcs.json
msgid "Chloe Taylor King"
msgstr "克洛伊·泰勒·金"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/necc/npcs.json
msgid "Corrie Kaja Dosia"
msgstr "科里·卡贾·多西亚"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/necc/npcs.json
msgid "Darryl Johnstone"
msgstr "达里尔·约翰逊"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/necc/npcs.json
