msgstr "我是基地军需官。如果你有任何要交易的值钱货，就来找我。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_quartermaster.json
msgid "If you're looking to trade you've come to the right place."
msgstr "如果你想交易，你算是找对地方了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_quartermaster.json
msgid "Welcome to camp Arabella, What will it be?"
msgstr "欢迎来到阿拉贝拉基地，想干什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_quartermaster.json
msgid "Well, I'd better be going.  Bye."
msgstr "好吧，我最好先走了。再见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "<greet>"
msgstr "<greet>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Could I buy one of your pets?"
msgstr "我能买只你的宠物吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Finally, someone who isn't part of those <zombies>."
msgstr "总算有不是那群<zombies>的人出现了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Hey, nice to meet you."
msgstr "嘿，很高兴认识你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "I hate to see them go, but I think you'd be able to take better care of one than I can right now.  I can sell you a cat or dog of your choosing, for $25 and $50, respectively."
msgstr "我不想看到它们离开，但我想现在你比我能更好地照顾它们。 你选只猫或狗，我可以卖你25 美元或者50 美元。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I worked here before <the_cataclysm> dumped everything in the <swear> bin.  I took care of all the animals here, and when the <zombies> started roaming the streets, I gathered every pet or stray I could.  I still take care of them, just gotta worry about the <zombies> now on top of disease, cleanliness, etc."
msgstr "在<the_cataclysm>把一切都变成<swear>垃圾箱里的一团糟前我曾在这里工作。我在这里负责照顾动物，<zombies>开始在街上晃荡后，我设法收容了所有宠物和流浪动物。我现在依然在照料它们，只是现在除了疾病、清洁之类的问题，还得担心<zombies>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
