#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "I'll have a cat."
msgstr "我要养一只猫。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "I'll have a dog."
msgstr "我要养条狗。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "I've changed my mind, let's talk about something else."
msgstr "我改变主意了，我们谈点别的吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr "有意思。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "That's quite noble of you, but how do you take care of so many animals?"
msgstr "你可真是个高尚的人，但你是如何照顾这么多动物的呢？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "To be honest with you, it's been pretty difficult.  I sneak out at night or whenever there's an opening to grab whatever I need and come back before something notices me.  I've been held up for quite a while whenever a horde decides to pass by.  Good thing we had some spare bookcases lying around, or I'd be a goner by now."
msgstr "和你实话实说，这很困难。我会在晚上或者任何有机会的间隙溜出去拿我需要的任何东西，然后在有什么玩意发现我前赶回来。每当有尸潮经过，我都会被困住好一阵子。幸好我们还有些多余的书柜，不然我现在已经死透了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Wanna buy something, maybe sell off what you don't need?"
msgstr "想买点什么，或者卖点什么你不需要的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Yeah, today's your lucky day.  Hand over your stuff, or you'll be one yourself."
msgstr "Yeah，今天是你的幸运日。把你的东西全都交出来，要么你也成为其中一员。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Can I stay here for a while?"
msgstr "我能在这里呆一会儿吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Hand over your stuff!  Don't make any sudden moves, or you die!"
msgstr "交出你的所有东西！不要做小动作，小心刀子不长眼！"

