#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that.  Maybe we should change the subject."
msgstr "很遗憾听到这种事情。也许我们该换个话题"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Well, they weren't really around to lock it up.  Whoever got here first blew their head off with a 12-gauge, but they were up and movin', tried to kill me too.  They're out in the dumpster now."
msgstr "好吧，他们离这不够近所以没有即时赶到锁门。先到这里的人拿12号口径把他们的头都轰成了稀烂，但他们竟然爬了起来了，还想把我也杀了。现在所有人都在垃圾箱里了。"

