msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "It's hard to say exactly what I'm doing out here, but I guess one thing just leads to another and… well, you're just being nice when you ask, aren't you?  It doesn't matter now anyway.  I'm here and I'm still alive."
msgstr "很难说清楚我在这里做什么，但我猜想一件事会导致另一件事，而且……好吧，你问的时候只是出于善意，不是吗？反正现在也无所谓了。我在这里，我还活着。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
