msgstr "很难说清楚我在这里做什么，但我猜想一件事会导致另一件事，而且……好吧，你问的时候只是出于善意，不是吗？反正现在也无所谓了。我在这里，我还活着。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid "Nothing to it.  Before <the_cataclysm>, it didn't take much to find yourself here.  And I guess it just made sense to stay.  We seem to be doing better than most, anyway."
msgstr "没什么。<the_cataclysm>以前，我在这里发现自己其实不需要那么多东西。我想留在这里是有意义的。无论如何，我们现在似乎比大多数人过得更好。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Pleasure to see you again."
msgstr "很高兴又见到你了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "拜拜。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid "Surviving, as I always have.  Is that what you mean?"
msgstr "挣扎求生，就像我一直以来一样。你是这个意思吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Can I purchase some of your wares?"
msgstr "我能购买你们的一些商品吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Can I stay here?"
msgstr "我能待在这儿吗？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<hands_up>"
#. ~ Mostly hostile NPCs say these things in preparation for mugging an
#. unarmed avatar.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hands up!"
msgstr "举起手来！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "How's that smoker coming along?"
msgstr "那个烟鬼怎么样了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I have nothing."
msgstr "我什么都没有。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I have nothing.  I'd best get going."
msgstr "我什么都没有。我最好还是走吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I think I'll buy 10 slices.  [$20]"
msgstr "[20$]我想我要买10片。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out on the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on what we can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you might find yourself a good deal."
msgstr "在遇到<the_cataclysm>之前，我曾经无家可归。我在路上遇到了一些朋友并在这里露营，现在我们只是靠能找到的物品勉强度日。不过，我们很乐意和你交易。说不定你会跟我交易的很愉快，对吧？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out on the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on what we can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you might find yourself a good deal."
msgstr "在遇到<the_cataclysm>之前，我曾经无家可归。我在路上遇到了一些朋友并在这里露营，现在我们只是靠能找到的物品勉强度日。不过，我们很乐意和你交易。说不定你会跟我交易的很愉快，对吧？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out on the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on what we can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you might find yourself a good deal."
msgstr "在遇到<the_cataclysm>之前，我曾经无家可归。我在路上遇到了一些朋友并在这里露营，现在我们只是靠能找到的物品勉强度日。不过，我们很乐意和你交易。说不定你会跟我交易的很愉快，对吧？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I'll take 50 slices of the stuff.  [$100]"
msgstr "[100$]我要50片。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "It's wonderful!  We've been preserving a lot more of what we manage to scavenge so we won't have to worry about our food going bad for a while.  We'd be willing to sell some of the excess, if you want."
msgstr "太棒了！我们一直在设法贮藏拾荒日子里收集到的东西，所以暂时不必担心我们的食物会变质。如果你愿意，我们可以出售一些多余的部分。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Making ends meet, even in the worst circumstances.  We've been camping out here now, trading with whoever passes by.  If something catches your eye, let me know."
msgstr "即使在最糟糕的情况下，也要维持生计。我们现在一直在这里安营扎寨，与任何经过的人交易。如果有什么东西吸引了你的注意，请告诉我。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Sure!  It turned out well enough for us, and it's one of the few fresh meats we can find.  I'll pay fairly for it."
msgstr "当然！结果对我们来说已经足够好了，这是我们能找到的为数不多的新鲜肉类之一。我会给你同等的回报的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "They should be around here somewhere.  We usually go out in teams to scavenge, and they haven't told me about anything yet.  They might have something for you to do."
msgstr "他们应该在附近的某个地方，我们一般是组队出去搜刮，他们没告诉我任何事情，所以我什么也不知道。但是他们也许有事情找你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "We got tired of being out on the road and decided to stay here for a bit.  We've found a lot of useful stuff out and about, so if you see anything you need I'll make you a deal."
msgstr "我已经厌倦了流浪的生活，决定在这里住一段时间。我在外面发现了许多有用的东西，如果有你需要的东西，我们可以做一笔交易。礼尚往来，对吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Well, I don't see anything wrong with it.  We should have a spare bed in that tent you could sleep on.  Just don't cause any trouble."
msgstr "嗯，我觉得可以。那间帐篷里还有你可以睡的床位。只要别造成什么麻烦就行。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Where might your friends be?"
msgstr "你的朋友们可能在哪里？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Who are you?  Would you like to trade?"
msgstr "你是谁？想不想来场交易？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "You think 20 slices would be alright?  [$40]"
msgstr "[40$]你觉得20片可以吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Nice to meet you.  I mean no harm."
msgstr "很高兴见到你，我没有恶意。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Oh, they're right over there, and one of us is in that tent over there.  They handle any stuff we manage to scavenge, so feel free to trade for what you want."
msgstr "噢，他们就在那边，我们有一个同伴在那边的帐篷里。他负责处理我们收集到的玩意，所以随意交易你想要的东西吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Thanks for the offer, but I don't have anything to spare right now.  One of my buddies over in that tent handles stuff like this, though.  You might find something."
msgstr "谢谢你的提议，但我现在没有多余的东西。不过，那个帐篷里，我的一个朋友会处理这种事情。你可能会想去那里看看。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Want to trade?"
msgstr "来交易吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Well, they were the brightest of us when all hell broke loose.  They managed to get us some food and weapons early on.  I guess that just kinda made them the leader."
msgstr "好吧，当一切都崩溃时，他们是我们中最聪明的人。他们很早就设法给我们弄来了一些食物和武器。我觉得这种事情只是让他们变成了领导者而已。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "What's with that guy in the tent?"
msgstr "帐篷里的那个家伙怎么样了？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Who are you, and what are you doing here?"
msgstr "你是谁？你在这里做什么？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A hardware store or lumbermill should have one."
msgstr "五金店或木材厂应该有一个，或者在农舍这类地方。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A hardware store should have one lying around."
msgstr "五金店里应该会摆着不少。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A shotgun of some sort might work well."
msgstr "一把霰弹枪可能会很好用。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Ah, well.  It's no big deal."
msgstr "啊，好吧，这也没啥了不起的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I can understand that."
msgstr "好吧，我能理解。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I can understand that.  I guess I'll have to get it myself."
msgstr "好吧，我能理解。看来我只能想办法自己获取了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Any nearby forest should have all you need.  Otherwise, you might try breaking down some furniture in town."
msgstr "附近的森林应该会有你需要的材料，或者，你可以尝试去拆一些家具。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Are those slimes dead yet?"
msgstr "那些变形怪死透了吗？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Arthropod Hunting"
msgstr "狩猎蚁群"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Did they give you the slip?  It's worse than I thought, then."
msgstr "你踩到它们滑倒了？好吧，比我想象得还要糟糕。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my lumber?"
msgstr "你弄到木材了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my ropes?"
msgstr "弄到绳子了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my saw?"
msgstr "弄到木锯了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal smoker?"
msgstr "弄到便携式木炭烤架了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the meat?"
msgstr "弄到肉了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the shovel?"
msgstr "弄到铲子了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I can tell you're lying.  I don't see shit."
msgstr "你在撒谎，我一眼就能看出来。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I need some help."
msgstr "我需要一些帮助。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I'll be here when you get back."
msgstr "我会在这里等到你回来。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I'll do it myself, then."
msgstr "那我还是自己做吧。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "If you can't find any rope around, one of our books should have something on rope-making.  Most plants can be woven into a halfway decent rope."
msgstr "如果你傻到连一根绳子都找不到的话，我们有一本专门给( ﾟ∀。)看的书，上面有一页详细写了如何获得一根绳子。大概是说大部分植物都可以编成纤维绳。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Kill some ants and bring back ten slices of their meat in exchange for credit with some of the traders."
msgstr "杀死一些蚂蚁并带回十片他们的肉，以换取一些商人的信任。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Kill some slimes in exchange for credit with some of the traders and bring back six of their slime scraps."
msgstr "杀死几只变形怪以换取一些商人的信用，并带回它们的六块变形怪糊。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Maybe try a farm?  I bet those rural folks were pretty invested in preserving their food."
msgstr "也许可以试试农场？那些农民对如何保存他们的食物颇有研究。看到那谷仓了吗？这就是证明。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "My buddies and I have decided to stay here for a while.  This is about the only safe place out here, and it's kinda become our home.  Anyway, we're going to build a wall.  Our old logs have provided a bunch of the wood, but we still need quite a few planks.  About 100 of them.  If you could get it for us, I'd be grateful."
msgstr "我和我的兄弟们决定在这里住一段时间。这里应该是附近唯一安全的地方了，它也快成为我们的家了。不管咋么说，我们要建一堵墙。尽管我们的旧原木提供了一堆木材，我们仍然需要不少木板——大概100块。如果你能带给我们100块木板，我将不胜感激。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Nice.  I'll get these cooked up.  Who knows, we might want some more in the future."
msgstr "妙啊。我会把这些做熟。或许有一天我们还会想要呢。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Nice.  I'll just take those off your hands.  Might be good for greasing the bike chains and door hinges around here even though it is a bit… abnormal."
msgstr "好的，这些东西我就收下了。或许可以用来润滑这里的自行车链条和门铰链，即使它有点……不正常。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "No problem.  I'm sure one of us will get to it anyway."
msgstr "没问题，我总会想办法解决的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Now that we've got the wall done, we decided to move out of these old tents.  We still have some leftover nails but we need more wood.  So, if you could get us 150 planks, we'd be grateful."
msgstr "现在我们已经砌好了墙壁，所以就不住这些破帐篷了。我们剩下了一些钉子，但是木板就不够了。如果你能给我们提供150块木板那就太好了。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 planks."
msgstr "收集 100 块木板。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 150 planks."
msgstr "收集 150 块木板。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 6 ropes."
msgstr "收集 6 根绳子。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a charcoal smoker."
msgstr "收集一台便携式木炭烤架。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a shovel."
msgstr "收集一把铲子。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a wood saw."
msgstr "收集一把木锯。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Our entrance is wide open so we're building a gate over it.  Problem is we don't have any ropes.  If you could find some for us, we'll pay you."
msgstr "看到那个破门了吗，是个丧尸都能进去敲掉我们的脑壳，所以我们需要在上面建一个门。但问题是我们没有绳索。如果你能给我们找到一些，那我就会送你些交易盈余作为补偿。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Our sanitation here has become… problematic.  We've mostly just been going outside the walls to piss.  Not only is it kinda unhealthy, but the last time I wandered out I almost got eaten!  So, if you'd get us a shovel, we could make a latrine for ourselves.  We'll pay you fairly, as usual."
msgstr "我们这里的卫生设施……一言难尽。我们大部分时候都是在墙外边嘘嘘。这不仅有点不健康，我上次出去差点就被吃掉了！如果，你能送我们一把铲子，我们就可以自己做一个厕所了。我们会像平时一样给你报酬的。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments"
msgstr "整修家园"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. II"
msgstr "整修家园 II"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. III"
msgstr "整修家园 III"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
msgstr "整修家园 IV"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. V"
msgstr "整修家园 V"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
msgstr "整修家园 VI"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Sticky Situation"
msgstr "粘手困境"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Sure, they can be cut, but I'd say it's better to splatter them with something large and heavy."
msgstr "当然，你可以把它们切开，但我觉得最好用大而重的东西砸散它们。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Pick what you want from our stash."
msgstr "谢谢，你可以从我们的珍藏品中挑你喜欢的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll be sure to compensate your efforts."
msgstr "谢谢，作为回报，我们会给你一些补偿的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll get started right away."
msgstr "谢谢，现在我们可以开始了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll start right away."
msgstr "谢谢，我们这就出发。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We're eternally grateful to you."
msgstr "谢谢。我们会永远感激你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "The last time we went out scouting we found some gargantuan ants crawling around.  We thought we might see how they taste, if they could be cooked and whatnot.  I want you to go kill one and bring back some of its meat."
msgstr "上次我们出去侦察时，发现一些巨大的蚂蚁在四处爬行。我们想尝尝它的味道，看看它们的肉能不能煮熟之类的。我想要你去杀了一只并带回一些肉。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Turns out that ant meat you got us wasn't actually too bad.  A little tough, sure, but perfectly edible.  The problem now is we need a way of preserving it.  One of those portable charcoal smokers would be really great.  Heck, you might even wanna buy some."
msgstr "我们试吃了一下你给我们的蚂蚁肉，也不算太难吃，就是有点硬。现在我们需要保存它的方法，防止烂掉。有一个便携式木炭烤架就很好，对吧？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "We appreciate all of your help but we can't rely on everyone else to do things for us.  I'd be willing to buy a wood saw of some kind from you so we can cut our own wood as needed."
msgstr "十分感谢你为我们付出的这一切，但我们不能总让别人帮助。我愿意从你那里购买木锯，以便我们可以自己锯木材。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "We've had some trouble with slimes not far from us.  It's been hard going through there with all them around, so I want you to go take care of it."
msgstr "附近的变形怪给我们造成了一些麻烦。对付他们一大群实在是太困难了，所以我希望你去处理这件事。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "You don't look nearly as sticky as you're supposed to.  Get back to it."
msgstr "你看起来并不像想象的那么黏糊糊的，回去做你该做的事吧。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "You sure?  I don't see my meat anywhere."
msgstr "你确定？我都没看到肉的影子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Don't worry, we're getting there soon."
msgstr "别担心，我们很快就到了。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
msgstr "给气象学家找个无线电控制器"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
msgstr "为气象学家收集电池"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
msgstr "为气象学家寻找高清镜头"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
msgstr "为气象学家收集废料"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
msgstr "找到气象学家坠毁的无人机"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Good.  I just need a little stuff: 50 scrap, 6 lithium batteries, 5 small high-quality lenses and a radio remote control.  Bring the scrap for now, but don't forget about the rest."
msgstr "很好。我只需要一些东西：50份废料、6块锂电池、5个小型优质透镜，还有一个无线遥控器。先把废料带过来，但别忘了剩下的那些。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, I'm continue to work on it…"
msgstr "太好了，我可以继续干活了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, I'm continuing to work on it…"
msgstr "太好了，我可以继续干活了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, I'm starting to work on it…"
msgstr "太好了，我可以开始干活了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, very little work left.  I need a few days to finish all this, and to try it in work.  I hope everything will work fine!  While I'm working on the drone, you can read this book.  Maybe you can learn something new from it."
msgstr "太好了，只剩下一丁点工作了。我需要花几天来完成它，然后试飞一下。希望一切顺利！当我在忙着做无人机的时候，你可以读读这本书。也许你可以从中学到一些新东西。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Help?  Help with what?  Oh, yes, yes.  If you know a place with many survivors, can you take me there?  I doubt I can survive alone…"
msgstr "帮忙？帮什么忙？哦，是的，是的。如果你知道一个有很多幸存者的地方，你能带我去吗？我怀疑我一个人没法活下去……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Help?  Help with what?  Oh, yes, yes.  If you know a place with many survivors, can you take me there?  I doubt I can survive alone…"
msgstr "帮忙？帮什么忙？哦，是的，是的。如果你知道一个有很多幸存者的地方，你能带我去吗？我怀疑我一个人没法活下去……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Help?  Help with what?  Oh, yes, yes.  If you know a place with many survivors, can you take me there?  I doubt I can survive alone…"
msgstr "帮忙？帮什么忙？哦，是的，是的。如果你知道一个有很多幸存者的地方，你能带我去吗？我怀疑我一个人没法活下去……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Hmm, I see that the drone is not with you.  Maybe at least the memory module remains?  Okay, show it to me… hmm, situation is worse than I expected, much, much worse… I'm not feeling good.  I don't feel safe in this place anymore.  I have to run, run somewhere.  But where to run if these <monster>s are everywhere…"
msgstr "嗯，我看到那架无人机并不在你身边。也许至少内存模块还在？好吧，给我看看……嗯，情况比我预想的更糟，更糟……我有不详的预感。我想我再待下去已经不安全了。我得跑，跑到其他地方。但是如果到处都是<monster>的话该怎么办……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "How's it going?"
msgstr "怎么样了？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I advise you to search in a store, such as electronics or toy store."
msgstr "我建议你去商店里找，例如电器店或玩具店。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I don't know quite what happened.  Maybe something noticed my drone and tried to bring it down.  Be careful."
msgstr "我不太清楚发生了什么事。也许有什么东西注意到了我的无人机，想把它弄下来。小心点。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I don't think this is a difficult task.  Surely there is a lot of it underfoot."
msgstr "我可不认为这任务有多困难。当然，脚下就有很多。"

