#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I need more time.  Come back later."
msgstr "我需要更多的时间。晚点再来。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I'm glad that you are alive and that you haven't forgot about me.  The drone turned out to be great, it managed to take off and even was able to fly several hundred meters!  Unfortunately, after that, I lost control of it… I don't know what happened to it, though.  Maybe you can check?  I'm a little afraid to go out there…"
msgstr "谢天谢地，你还活着，而且没忘记我。这架无人机本来很棒，它成功起飞，甚至能飞几百米高！不幸的是，在那之后，我没法控制它了……我不知道发生了什么。也许你可以查一下？我有点害怕出门……"

