msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm just a regular meteorologist.  In recent years I have worked at a weather station, monitored the weather, state of air, read and wrote reports, drew up schedules… in general, complete boredom.  In my free time I was studying electronics and radio engineering, making various devices, some for work, some just for fun.  When the first riots began, I gathered all my things that I managed to take with me and settled here.  Since then I've been sitting here, wasting my time doing all sorts of nonsense."
msgstr "我只是个普通的气象学家。最近几年我在一个气象站工作，监测天气，空气质量，读写报告，制定时间表……总的说，非常无聊。空闲时间我学习电子学和无线电工程，制造各种各样的设备，有些是为了工作，有些只是为了好玩。当第一次暴乱开始时，我把随身携带的东西都收集起来，在这里安顿下来。从那以后，我一直呆坐在这里，把时间浪费在各种蠢事上。"

