#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I'm waiting for you."
msgstr "我等着你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I've been sitting here for a long time, and all that time I was wondering how bad everything is outside.  I want to build a drone that I can use to fly over New England, check the air condition, take a few pictures from above to get a glimpse of how is it.  There were a lot of things in our back room that could be useful, but still I'm missing a lot of things.  You look like an experienced survivalist.  Can you help me?"
msgstr "我在这里干等太久了，一直在想了解外面的情况有多糟糕。我想造一架无人机，我可以用来飞越新英格兰，检测空气质量，从空中拍几张照片，看看情况如何。在我们后面的房间里有很多有用的东西，但我还是缺了很多东西。你看起来像个老练的幸存者。你能帮助我吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I've lost the drone, we should find out what happened…"
msgstr "我的无人机失联了，我们需要弄清楚到底发生了什么……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Maybe I can help you with your problem?"
msgstr "也许我能帮忙解决你的问题？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Maybe another time…"
msgstr "下次再说吧……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Me too."
msgstr "我也是。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Meteorologist"
msgstr "气象学家"

#. ~ Job description of "Meteorologist" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Meteorologist."
msgstr "一名气象学家。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<acknowledged>"
#. ~ Generic acknowledgment of a command.  Comes up a lot and could use more
#. variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "No problem."
msgstr "没问题。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Thank you.  I will never forget your kindness, <name_g>.  Take this book as token of my gratitude."
msgstr "非常感谢。我永远不会忘记你的好意，<name_g>。把这本书当作我的谢礼吧。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring 6 lithium batteries."
msgstr "气象学家要求携带6块锂电池。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring him 5 small high-quality lenses."
msgstr "气象学家要你给他带来5个小型高清镜头。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring him 50 pieces of scrap."
msgstr "气象学家要你给他带来50块金属废料。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring him a radio controller."
msgstr "气象学家要你给他带来1个无线电控制器。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring him his crashed drone."
msgstr "气象学家要你给他找回坠毁的无人机。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Try looking for some battery-powered trinkets and take them apart."
msgstr "试着找一些电池供电的小玩意，把它们拆开。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Try looking for telescopes or microscopes to dismantle."
msgstr "试着寻找望远镜或显微镜进行拆解。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "We need an RC to assemble a drone…"
msgstr "我需要个无线电控制器来组装无人机……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "We need batteries to assemble a drone…"
msgstr "我需要些电池来组装无人机……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "We need scrap metal to assemble a drone…"
msgstr "我需要些金属废料来组装无人机……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "We need small high quality lenses for our drone…"
msgstr "我需要些小型高清镜头来组装无人机……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Well, what's next on the list… yeah, batteries.  6 lithium batteries would be enough."
msgstr "嗯，清单上的下一项是……对，电池。6节锂电池就够了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Well, what's next on the list… yeah, lenses.  5 small high-quality lenses would be enough."
msgstr "好吧，清单上的下一项是……对了，镜头。5个小型高清镜头就足够了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Well, what's next on the list… yeah, radio control.  Any kind will do, but the simplest one is better, so I can easily reconfigure it for my drone."
msgstr "好吧，清单上的下一项是……对了，无线电控制器。任何型号都可以，但越简单的越好，这样我可以很容易地把它重新配置成适合无人机使用。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Why do you say that?"
msgstr "你为什么这么说？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Yes, you can relax now."
msgstr "是的，现在你可以放心了。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "meteorologist"
msgstr "气象学家"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Aren't you a little short to be a stormtrooper?"
msgstr "你这个冲锋队员是不是有点矮了？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Can you get me out of this hell hole?"
msgstr "你能救我离开这个地狱吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Can you please save me?  I have to get out of here."
msgstr "我能求你救救我吗？我想离开这里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Come with me, if you want to live."
msgstr "想活命的话就跟我走。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Hallelujah, rescue!"
msgstr "感谢上帝，有人来救我了！"

