msgid "Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to die, hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* after the apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy lifting needed now… no, you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr "哦哦。哦。可你他妈的也没能进去里面啊。就把我们这些胖子留在外面等死呢，啊？你知道在大灾变之后获得那些该死的*甲状腺激素药*有多难吗，混蛋？除此之外，你知道现在除了干重活的苦力还急需有其他技能的人吗……算了，听好，你去死吧。你不值得我浪费时间。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to die, hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* after the apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy lifting needed now… no, you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr "哦哦。哦。可你他妈的也没能进去里面啊。就把我们这些胖子留在外面等死呢，啊？你知道在大灾变之后获得那些该死的*甲状腺激素药*有多难吗，混蛋？除此之外，你知道现在除了干重活的苦力还急需有其他技能的人吗……算了，听好，你去死吧。你不值得我浪费时间。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "So, about that doctorate of yours…"
msgstr "所以，关于你的博士学位……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Sorry for bringing it up. What were you saying?"
msgstr "很抱歉提起它。你之前说什么来着？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Sure, I'd better get going.  I'll see if I can find you something."
msgstr "好吧，我该出发了。我看看能不能帮你找到那玩意。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Sure.  My grandparents were from China.  That means I'm obviously personally responsible for all this.  Do you think there's some other reason they let hundreds of other educated people in and I'm sitting out here?"
msgstr "当然。我的祖父母来自中国。显然这意味着我该对这一切发生的事件负责。否则为什么他们让其他几百个读过书的家伙进去了而只把我留在了外面，你说呢？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Tempting offer, but I don't know how much I trust a random stranger offering me a place to live.  Call me crazy."
msgstr "你的邀请很诱人，但我不知道自己是否应该轻易相信陌生人给我提供住宿的承诺。就当我疯了吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Thanks for saying it.  So, what brings you around?"
msgstr "谢谢你这么说。那么，你怎么来了？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Thanks, I really appreciate this."
msgstr "谢谢，我真的很感激。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "That's awful kind of you, but look at me.  I'm not traveling material, I've managed to stay fifty pounds overweight on a diet of pine nuts and wilted rhubarb, and I scream and shake uncontrollably at the sight of blood."
msgstr "真是谢谢你的好意，但看看我。我就不是旅行的料，我光是吃松仁和枯萎的大黄就能让自己超重了50磅，而且我一看到血就会不由自主的尖叫并且浑身发抖。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "They're 'too full'.  Won't share fuck-all."
msgstr "他们说\"人太多了\"。妈的一帮不懂分享的混蛋。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "We're cool.  Sorry for insulting you earlier."
msgstr "没事的。之前冒犯了你，对不起。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Well good.  Let's get going, I want to see some more of these crazy mushrooms."
msgstr "很好。我们走吧，我想多看看这些疯狂的蘑菇。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Well, before <the_cataclysm> ended I was working at a university bookstore.  I know a little bit about a lot of things, I guess you could say.  I kinda loved the job, to be honest."
msgstr "好吧，<the_cataclysm>之前，我在一家大学书店工作。我想你可以这么说，我什么东西都知道一点。老实说，我有点喜欢那份工作。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Well, they might not share, but I can.  Are you hungry?"
msgstr "嗯，他们不愿分享，但我可以。你饿了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well.  Well, well, well.  This is really interesting.  Look, you can see reticulations here, it looks sort of like an enlarged piece of a stipe from a basidiocarp… but look at this, these fibers are clearly unlike anything I've seen before.  I wonder if they're motile?\n"
"\n"
"Okay, listen: you've got yourself a deal.  I'll come to your base, but you've gotta get me hooked up with a microscope as soon as you can.  This could be the beginning of something really cool.  Oh, and it should go without saying that I'm not coming unless you can find a place for my friends here in your base.  I'm sure you anticipated that.  Talk them into going and I'm in.  It should be easy, they're a bunch of sweet hearted saps."
msgstr ""
"嗯。嗯，好吧，嗯。这可真有意思。你看，你可以在这里看到网状结构，它看起来有点像一个放大版的孢子菌柄……但是再看这里，这种纤维和我以前见过的完全不同。也不知道它们能不能动？\n"
"\n"
"好吧，听着：我们成交了。我会去你的营地，但你得尽快给我搞来一台显微镜。这将开始一项可能会很酷的研究。哦，对了，除非你能在营地里给我的朋友们也留个位置，否则我是不会去的。说服他们一起走，我才会加入你。这应该很简单，他们都是一群心地善良的笨蛋。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well.  Well, well, well.  This is really interesting.  Look, you can see reticulations here, it looks sort of like an enlarged piece of a stipe from a basidiocarp… but look at this, these fibers are clearly unlike anything I've seen before.  I wonder if they're motile?\n"
"\n"
"Sorry.  I could stare at this all day.  I owe you one, a big one.  Thanks for this.  Let me know if you ever need a favor from a chubby beggar woman."
msgstr ""
"嗯。嗯，好吧，嗯。这可真有意思。你看，你可以在这里看到网状结构，它看起来有点像一个放大版的孢子菌柄……但是再看这里，这种纤维和我以前见过的完全不同。也不知道它们能不能动？\n"
"\n"
"哦，抱歉。我可以盯着它看上一整天。我想我欠你一个人情，一个很大的人情。谢谢你做的一切。如果你需要一个胖嘟嘟的女乞丐的帮助，请告诉我。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "What better choice do you have?  It's not like it would be just you and me, the others out here can come too."
msgstr "你还有更好的选择吗？不仅仅是你和我，其他人也会一起来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "What had you working at the university bookstore in the first place?  Are you an academic yourself?"
msgstr "你怎么能在大学书店里工作？你也是个学者吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "What was it you were saying before?"
msgstr "你刚才说什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "What's this I hear about you having a doctorate?"
msgstr "我听说你有过博士学位？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Why are you living here then?"
msgstr "那你为什么还住这里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Why stay out here then?"
msgstr "那为什么还要呆在这儿？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Yeah, yeah, it's all very glamorous.  Sure, I trained in the great ivory tower, got my PhD in mycology.  Did my dissertation on signaling pathways in hyphae formation, and a postdoc in plant-fungus communication in rhizomes.  Then I got the job at the bookstore because there wasn't a ton of work for a doctor of mycology, although I'd had a few nibbles before things really got crazy.  Now, people are just breaking down my door to get my sweet sweet knowledge of mold to help them fight the incoming zombie threat."
msgstr "是啊，是啊，那些迷人的头衔。当然，我在那伟大的象牙塔里接受培训，获得了真菌学博士学位，笑。我的学位论文是关于菌丝形成中的信号通路，博士后研究植株根茎内植物-真菌交互行为。后来我只能在书店里打零工，因为真菌学博士能干的工作实在不多，而后直到一切变得疯狂之前我做过的最接近专业的事也就是吃几口蘑菇。现在，大家都疯狂的砸着我家的门，想获得我脑中珍贵的真菌知识，来帮助他们对抗即将到来的丧尸威胁，笑。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "You sound more optimistic than usual."
msgstr "你看起来比平时更乐观。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "You think you were treated like that because of your race?"
msgstr "你认为你是因为你的种族才受到这样的对待？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Because I sure ain't fit, so I'm sittin' out here until I starve to death.  Help a poor sickly soul out?"
msgstr "因为我肯定不适合，所以我现在正坐在这里等着被饿死呢。帮帮我这个得病的可怜人吧？"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Sickly beggar in the refugee center.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Brandon Garder"
msgstr "布兰顿·贾德尔"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Came with a small group quite a while ago.  The others were young and fit, they got in.  They were some of the last ones to get in actually.  I didn't make the cutoff."
msgstr "和之前的一小群人一起来的。其他人都很年轻，身体很好，于是进去了。说起来，他们是最后几个被收进去的人。我没能被算上。"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ Sickly beggar in the refugee center.
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Flavor
#. ~ Construction skill trainer
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter1.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
msgid "Carpenter"
msgstr "木匠"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Golly.  I didn't expect that, but I'm as good as my word.  Let's get going."
msgstr "天啊。我没料到会这样，但我说话算话。我们走吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Hey, are you a big fan of survival of the fittest?"
msgstr "嘿，你相信适者生存吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "How did you even get here if you're so sick?"
msgstr "你如果你得了重病，那你还怎么可能来到这里的？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "I could maybe help you out… want something to eat?"
msgstr "我也许能帮你……想吃点什么吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "I have a camp.  It's a damn sight better than those place, and there are regular meals.  Someone with your trades experience would be welcome, even if you can't do the big jobs anymore."
msgstr "我有一个营地，风景比这鬼地方好，而且有充足的食物供应。像你这样的有工作经验的人在那里很受欢迎，即使你没法再干重活了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "I think I've sorted Dave out pretty well, don't you?  Would you consider coming with me now?"
msgstr "我想我已经把戴夫安顿好了，不是吗？现在可以考虑和我一起走了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "It's good to know there are still people like you in the world, it really is."
msgstr "知道世界上还有像你这样的人真好，真的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "It's sweet of you to say that, but I'm just not up to the wandering life, not with these knees."
msgstr "谢谢你这么说，但我想我受不了流浪的生活，特别是膝盖受不了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Let's get going."
msgstr "我们走吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Nice to see you too, what's up?"
msgstr "很高兴见到你，怎么了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Nice to see you.  I gotta be going though."
msgstr "很高兴见到你。不过我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "No problem.  See you around."
msgstr "没问题。回头见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
