msgid "Well now, that's quite a kind offer, and I appreciate you looking past my full-body pubic hair.  Sorry though.  I've come to feel sort of responsible for this little gaggle of squatters.  As long as I'm the only one providing for them, I don't think I can leave."
msgstr "哦，好吧，是个好心的提议，我很感激你能不在乎我这身该死的毛。不过很抱歉。我开始觉得自己得负责照顾门口这群小家伙了。只要我还是唯一一个能养活他们的人，我就没法离开他们。"

