msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "*seems impossibly young at first glance, her dark face nervous when she sees you looking her way.  On closer inspection as you approach, you see that she is likely in her early teens, but the contrast to the weary faces around makes her age stand out.  \"Oh, uh… hi.  You look new.  I'm Aleesha.\""
msgstr "*乍一看，她似乎年轻得不可思议，当她发觉你正盯着她时，她那张黝黑的脸表现得很紧张。当你走近仔细观察时，你发现她可能不过十几岁，但与周围疲惫的面孔所形成强烈对比让她的年龄显得格外突出。\"哦，呃……嗨。你看上去是新来的。我叫阿莱莎。\""

