msgstr "你感到很轻松。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You give me confidence.  I trust you.  I do not know why this is."
msgstr "你曾经给了我信心。我曾经相信你。我不知道为什么你要这么做。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You know what?  You do you.  It's all good."
msgstr "知道吗？随你做自己。我怎么样都好。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You make me so happy I could give you little kisses, and some big kisses, and then something else maybe."
msgstr "你让我心满意足，我唯有回报给你一些小小的吻，一些大大的吻，当然也可能还有些别的东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You seem a little forward…"
msgstr "你看起来有点无礼……"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Relaxed with Alonso"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You spent some pleasant time relaxing with someone."
msgstr "你和某人一同度过了一段愉快的时光。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "[PER 10] What is up with you?  What's with the fake accent, and speaking in the third person?"
msgstr "[每 10 分] 你怎么了？  假口音、用第三人称说话是怎么回事？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "[PRETTY] Remember that nice thing I did for you?  Can you do something nice for me?"
msgstr "[长相俊美]还记得我为你做的好事吗？你能为我做点好事吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "[UGLY] I'm desperate.  You're my only chance."
msgstr "[丑陋]我绝望了。你是我唯一的机会。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "&Boris boots up the laptop and opens a folder labelled 'ART'.  He shows you simple digital paintings, clearly done by an adolescent.  There's nothing terribly remarkable about them except the number: Ash was a prolific creator.  Boris goes through several, proudly showing how his son learned little lighting tricks, or reminiscing on the time his son showed him the art.  After a while, he stops commenting and just continues quietly clicking through photos.  He seems different in the glow of the screen, like several years dropped away from his face, despite the deep sadness still etched there."
msgstr "[鲍里斯启动笔记本电脑并打开标记为\"艺术\"的文件夹。他向你展示了一幅简单的数字画，很明显是由少年完成的。除了画的总数之外，它们没有什么特别引人注目的：埃什是位多产的创作家。鲍里斯连续介绍了几张，骄傲地展示了他的儿子所用的微妙光照技法，或者回忆起他的儿子向他展示这份画时的经历。过了一阵子，他不再评论，只是静静地点击着图片。他的脸在发光的屏幕映照下似乎略显不同，就像突然年轻了好几岁一样，尽管那里依旧镌刻着深深的哀伤。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "&Boris boots up the laptop and opens a folder labelled 'STORY 1'.  In it are numerous text files containing smatterings of stream-of-conscious notes, copy-and-pasted bits of fanfictions, notes about how to write a novel, and more.  The story itself is a handful of poorly fleshed out chapters written with the quality level you'd expect from a grade schooler.  Nonetheless it's quite impressive that there's this much stuff on a single topic.  Boris talks for a while about dinner conversations for weeks that would focus on Ash's ideas for his stories.  After a while, he trails off and just continues flipping through the files, reading silently."
msgstr "[鲍里斯启动笔记本电脑并打开一个标记为\"故事1\"的文件夹。其中包含大量意识流一般的日记，各类复制粘贴来的同人文，以及如何撰写小说的笔记等等的文本文件。故事本身不过是些质量不好的章节片段，这些章节的写作水平十分符合你对小学生的期望。尽管如此，在一个主题上能写出这么多东西还是相当令人印象深刻。鲍里斯滔滔不绝地谈论着数周之前的餐前对话，都是埃什关于故事的各类想法。过了一阵子，他渐渐安静下来，鼠标继续翻过一个个文件，无声地阅读着。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "&Boris boots up the laptop and opens the videos folder.  He shows you several self-made videos that follow a loose blog style, of an awkward young man talking about his favorite games, interspersed with comments about art and writing.  Boris comments on little events and laughs a few times, before becoming engrossed in his reminiscence."
msgstr "[鲍里斯启动笔记本电脑并打开视频文件夹。他向你展示了几个类似博客日志风格的自制视频，里面一个略显尴尬的年轻人谈论着他最喜欢的游戏，穿插着关于作画和写作的评论。鲍里斯评论了一些小事件，笑了几次，然后又全神贯注地沉浸在他的回忆中。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "*forces a bit of a smile through his bushy beard, though it doesn't reach his eyes.  \"It is good to see you too.  I would not say things are looking 'up' yet, but they are not so much looking down perhaps.  I am keeping a bit busier."
msgstr "*浓密的胡子上勉强挤出一丝微笑，但未到他的眼中：\"我不会说事情正在\"好\"转，但起码并没有那么坏。我有点忙。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "*nods at you, his eyes lighting up a little as you approach.  \""
msgstr "*向你点头，当你走近时，他的眼睛微微发亮。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "*stares at you for a moment before nodding in recognition.  \""
msgstr "*盯着你看了一会儿，然后点头表示认可。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ", woken by zombies in the night"
msgstr "，半夜还会被丧尸吵醒"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ".  I have spent so much time, just regretting what I have lost.  Thank you for bringing back what little you could."
msgstr "。我已经花费了太多的时间，沉浸在对已经失去的东西上的惋惜上。谢谢你所带回来的些许往日的回忆。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ".  To me, though, that is all just a drop in the bucket"
msgstr "。但对于我来说，这些不过是九牛一毛"

#. ~ Description of "Ash's laptop computer"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "A small, somewhat worn-out laptop computer.  The flip-top is decorated with various stickers."
msgstr "一台有些旧的笔记本电脑，后盖上装饰着各种贴纸。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Actually, what were you saying before?"
msgstr "那么，你刚刚还说了什么？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find someone to clean up the back bay."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris a circular saw."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris his son's lost writing."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Ah well.  I can ask around myself, perhaps."
msgstr "啊，好吧。也许我可以问问这周围的人。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Ah, another new face.  Hello.  I am Boris."
msgstr "又一个新面孔。你好。我是鲍里斯。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris a circular saw."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Ah, good.  VonWalt is good brand, I had a saw like this at home.  Now I shall set to work, and make myself a shop back there.  Oh yes, here is a little payment I saved."
msgstr "啊，很好。冯沃特是个好牌子，我原来在家里有把这样的圆锯。现在我准备好开始工作了，能在这后面给自己开家小店。哦，对了，这是我为你存下来的一份报酬。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Ash's laptop computer"
msgid_plural "Ash's laptop computers"
msgstr[0] "埃什的笔记本电脑"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Boris Borichenko"
msgstr "鲍里斯·波里申科"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find someone to clean up the back bay."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Boris in the refugee center is looking for at least four people to help clean up the back bay"
msgstr "难民中心的鲍里斯正在寻找至少四个人，协助清理后湾（Back Bay）区域。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Boris, I'm sorry, but I could only find three people willing to help.  Can I pitch in myself?  [Spend 4 hours helping]"
msgstr "鲍里斯，对不起，我只能找到三个愿意帮忙的人。  我可以自己投稿吗？  [花4小时帮助]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Boris, I'm sorry, but I could only find two people willing to help.  Can I pitch in myself?  [Spend 5 hours helping]"
msgstr "鲍里斯，对不起，我只能找到两个愿意帮忙的人。  我可以自己投稿吗？  [花5小时帮助]"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Bring Boris a circular saw."
msgstr "给鲍里斯带把圆锯来。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Bring Boris his son's lost writing."
msgstr "给鲍里斯找到他儿子的遗作。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Could you teach me something about carpentry?"
msgstr "你能教我些木工方面的东西吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Do you have any of his writing?"
msgstr "你有什么他写的作品吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris his son's lost writing."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Even that you tried means a lot to me."
msgstr "只要你尝试过了，这对我来说也很有意义。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Everyone agrees this is bad.  Sleeping on a cot on the floor, crowded in with strangers"
msgstr "大家都觉得这样不好。睡在贴着地板的行军床上面，周围挤满了陌生人"

#. ~ Description of mission "Bring Boris his son's lost writing."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find Boris' son's laptop in the evac shelter marked on your map."
msgstr "在地图上标记的疏散避难所中找到鲍里斯儿子的笔记本电脑。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris his son's lost writing."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find Boris' son's laptop."
msgstr "找到鲍里斯儿子的笔记本电脑。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris a circular saw."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find a circular saw for Boris."
msgstr "给鲍里斯找把圆锯。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Bring Boris a circular saw."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find a circular saw for Boris.  Smokes might be selling one if it's available in stock."
msgstr "为鲍里斯找到一把圆锯。  如果有库存的话，Smoks 可能会出售一款。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find someone to clean up the back bay."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find a few people able to help clean the back, people without too much trauma there."
msgstr "找几个能帮你清理后院的人，得是那些没有受过太多伤的人。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find someone to clean up the back bay."
msgstr "找来帮手清理后院。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Good to see you, Boris.  Are things looking up for you at all?"
msgstr "很高兴见到你，鲍里斯。最近情况有没有好转啊？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Got anything else I can help out with?"
msgstr "我能帮上其他事情吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Great!  Let's get started."
msgstr "太棒了！我们开始干吧。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris a circular saw."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Greetings, my friend.  Have you found a saw I can use?"
msgstr "你好，我的朋友。你找到我能用的圆锯了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find someone to clean up the back bay."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Greetings, my friend.  Have you found anyone?"
msgstr "你好，我的朋友。你找到人了吗？"

