#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Sorry.  I didn't notice which dialogue option I was selecting.  I'll just back away slowly now."
msgstr "对不起。我没有注意到我选择了哪个对话选项。我现在慢慢退回来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Sure, my friend.  I'd love to hear you brag about your boy."
msgstr "当然，我的朋友。我喜欢听到你夸耀自己的儿子。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Thank you for trying, my friend.  With you and me that will be five, I will do my best to be strong and assist in the cleanup."
msgstr "谢谢你的尝试，我的朋友。  和你我五个人在一起，我会尽我最大的努力坚强起来，协助清理工作。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
