#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "What do you need to get things cleaned up?  Can I help?"
msgstr "你需要清理什么东西？我能帮吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "What have you lost, if it's okay for me to ask?"
msgstr "容我冒昧问一句，你失去了什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "What is 'up'?  Less than I would like, it seems.  I am better when I am busy, and I am not at all busy."
msgstr "还要怎么样？比我想象的要差很多。忙起来我会感觉好点，可是现在我一点也不忙。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Yeah, fine.  Just wallow in it.  I'm out."
msgstr "是的，好吧。沉迷其中。我该走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Yes, my friend.  You have done so much for me, I would be glad to teach you what I can.  I must ask a small amount in trade, for materials.  I hope you understand."
msgstr "是的，我的朋友。你为我做了这么多，我很乐意尽我所能教会你。但是作为交换条件，我需要一点材料。我希望你能理解。"

