msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Oh my, am I dealing with a professional dancer here?  Sweet moves, friend."
msgstr "天哪，我在这里面对的是专业舞者吗？  甜蜜的举动，朋友。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
