msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "*tips his cowboy hat and sets his feet far apart as he faces you.  \"Howdy, pardner.\""
msgstr "*歪了歪他的牛仔帽，双脚分开，转过来正对着你。\"你好，伙计。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
