msgid "*is a well-kept middle aged woman with dark hair tied back in a long braid.  She looks surprised as you approach.  \"Ah!  You are new.  I'm sorry, I'm Mangalpreet.\""
msgstr "*是一个留着长长辫子的中年女人。你走近时，她看起来很惊讶。\"啊！你是新来的。对不起，我是曼加普雷特。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
