msgid "Oh, I didn't mean that in a bad way.  Been out in the wilderness so long, I find myself noticing things by scent before sight."
msgstr "哦，我不是那个意思，用那个作为开场话题真是个坏主意。在旷野中待了这么久，我发现我更多地依赖嗅觉发现事物了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Oh, so you hunt?"
msgstr "喔，那你自己打猎吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "O…kay…?"
msgstr "好……吧……？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Spot your prey before something nastier spots you."
msgstr "在你被更可怕的怪物发现你之前，先发现你的猎物。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Sure, just bagged a fresh batch of meat.  You may want to grill it up before it gets too, uh… 'tender'."
msgstr "当然好，我刚刚捕到一大批鲜肉。记得在它变得太，嗯……太\"嫩\"之前赶紧烤熟它。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "The Jabberwock is real, don't listen to what anybody else says.  If you see it, run."
msgstr "伽卜沃克是真真实实存在的怪物，别听其他人怎么对你说的。如果你真的不幸看到它了，跑就是了！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Watch your back out there."
msgstr "出门在外，当心你的背后。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Yep.  Whatever game I spot, I bag and sell the meat and other parts here.  Got the occasional fish and basket full of wild fruit, but nothing comes close to a freshly-cooked moose steak for supper!"
msgstr "对啊。不管我抓到什么猎物，我都把肉品和其他部位带来这里卖。偶尔也能弄到写鲜鱼或是几篮野果，但没有什么能比上新鲜的碳烤驼鹿肉排当晚餐！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "You… smelled me?"
msgstr "你……闻到了我？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Zombified animals aren't good for eating, and the fur's no good either."
msgstr "动物丧尸化之后，它们的肉就不适合拿来吃了，但是有时候也许你会发现它们的毛皮还能用。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "&He crosses his arms.  \"Fine.  Go talk to the guards, that crash was all the talk among them for a while.  Look, I wouldn't risk my reputation and my job for a handful of cash, feel free to tell everyone in the center that I'm a liar sending people to their death for a quick buck if you find out that it's bullshit.\""
msgstr "&他交叉双臂。  “好吧。去和警卫谈谈，那场车祸是他们之间一段时间的话题。听着，我不会为了一点钱而拿我的名誉和工作冒险，请随意告诉中心里的每个人，我是个骗子，如果你们发现这是胡说八道，我会为了快点钱而把人们送死。”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "A helicopter crashed in the region not long ago, at first I thought it was just a rumor, folks talking about some crash nearby, but then I got a visit from a couple of soldiers looking for a lost helicopter, one of them got quite drunk one night and shared some interesting details, turns out it was coming back from way out west with quite the cargo, and I know where you can find it.  That's all you're getting for free though, I'd like to see some return on investment on that bottle you understand."
msgstr "不久前，一架直升机在该地区坠毁，一开始我以为这只是谣言，人们在谈论附近发生的坠机事件，但后来我接到几个正在寻找一架失踪直升机的士兵的拜访，其中一个晚上喝得很醉，并分享了一些有趣的细节，原来它是从遥远的西方回来，带着相当多的货物，我知道你在哪里可以找到它。  不过，这就是您免费获得的全部，我希望看到您了解的那瓶酒的投资回报。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill Bandits"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "A pair of bandits have been preying on locals, based out of a nearby cabin.  Ensure they meet a bitter end along with any associates, but watch out for traps around their hideout."
msgstr "附近的一个小屋被两个强盗当作窝点来袭击群众。你需要彻底消灭他们和任何可能的同伙，但是要小心他们窝点附近的陷阱。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Alright, give me your map I'll show you the location."
msgstr "好的，把你的地图给我，我告诉你位置。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Anything else I should know?"
msgstr "还有什么我应该知道的吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Anything more to it?"
msgstr "还有什么？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "As I recommended, libraries would be a good start.  Or any place that sells books and manuals, really."
msgstr "正如我所建议的，图书馆将是一个好的开始。  或者任何出售书籍和手册的地方，真的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "As I said, I have no repeaters or manuals at my disposal.  But you might want to try you chances in Libraries or maybe other survivors.  Godspeed, Marshal."
msgstr "正如我所说，我没有可用的复读机或手册。  但你可能想在图书馆或其他幸存者中尝试一下机会。  祝你好运，元帅。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Assassinate Raider Leader"
msgstr "暗杀强盗头目"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Come back when you get a chance Marshal.  We really need get in touch with rest of the region."
msgstr "元帅，有机会就回来吧。  我们确实需要与该地区的其他地区取得联系。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Deal with Informant"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Assassinate Raider Leader"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Come back when you get a chance, we could use a few good men."
msgstr "一有机会就回来找我吧，我们欢迎能人。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Bandits"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Contractor, I welcome you aboard."
msgstr "临时工，欢迎加入。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Deal with Informant"
msgstr "解决敌方眼线"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Does the Old Guard need anything?"
msgstr "[任务]我能替旧世守护者做点什么吗？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Find the sunken helicopter"
msgstr "寻找沉没的直升机"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "For now, the perimeter of the Refugee Center is free of threats.  That means we can afford to divert our attention to others in need of help.  However, our communication with the wasteland is lacking at best and nonexistent at worst.  We need to broaden our reach to intercept and send radio broadcasts.  Unfortunately Radio Towers are out of the question to widen our broadcasts, as the emergency grid for them is out of action.  However, Radio Stations in towns or urban areas should still have some juice left.  I want you to install something called a \"radio repeater mod\" in these stations that can broaden their reach and allow them to pick weaker signals.  Sadly, I have neither these devices nor a manual for them at my disposal.  You'll need to find instructions and assemble them yourself.  Are you up for this task?"
msgstr "目前，难民中心周边没有威胁。  这意味着我们可以将注意力转移到需要帮助的其他人身上。  然而，我们与荒原的交流往好里说是缺乏，往坏了说是根本不存在。  我们需要扩大拦截和发送无线电广播的范围。  不幸的是，无线电塔无法扩大我们的广播范围，因为它们的应急电网已经失效。  然而，城镇或城市地区的广播电台应该还剩下一些能量。  我希望你在这些电台中安装一种称为“无线电中继器模块”的东西，可以扩大它们的覆盖范围并允许它们选择较弱的信号。  遗憾的是，我既没有这些设备，也没有它们的手册。  您需要找到说明并自行组装。  你准备好完成这个任务了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Good work, Marshal.  Here's some supplies for your next venture.  Come back to me if you are willing to install more."
msgstr "干得好，元帅。  这里有一些适合您下一次冒险的用品。  如果您愿意安装更多，请回来找我。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Secure Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Great work, wasn't sure what I was sending you after."
msgstr "做得好！那时候我还不知道你会遇到些什么。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Assassinate Raider Leader"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Has the leadership been dealt with?"
msgstr "干掉他们的头目了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Have you set up a repeater yet, Marshal?"
msgstr "元帅，你设置好中继了吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Hmmm…"
msgstr "呣……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Huh, that's weird, the boys at comms say that they didn't really see an improvement.  Well, if you want to try again, come to me.  Maybe this time it'll work."
msgstr "嗯，这很奇怪，通讯部的男孩们说他们并没有真正看到任何改进。  好吧，如果你想再试一次，就来找我吧。  也许这一次会成功。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Huh; that's weird, the boys at comms say that they didn't really see an improvement.  Well, if you want to try again, come to me.  Maybe this time it'll work."
msgstr "呵呵；这很奇怪，通讯部的男孩们说他们并没有真正看到任何改进。  好吧，如果你想再试一次，就来找我吧。  也许这一次会成功。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I don't know much about how it formed but it is the armada of military and commercial ships that's floating off the coast.  They have everything from supertankers and carriers to fishing trawlers… even a few NATO ships.  Most civilians are offered a cabin on one of the liners to retire to if they serve as a federal employee for a few years."
msgstr "我不太了解它怎样组建起来的，只知道它是巡弋在外海的军事或者商业船只组成的舰队。他们从拖网渔船到超级油轮都有……甚至有一些北约组织的船。大部分撤离的平民愿意作为联邦雇员工作几年，而报酬则是舰队的一个客舱小隔间。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Bandits"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I don't like sending untested men into the field but if you have stayed alive so far you might have some skills.  There are at least a pair of bandits squatting in a local cabin, anyone who preys upon civilians meets a quick end… execute both of them for their crimes.  Complete this and the Old Guard will consider you an asset in the region."
msgstr "我不喜欢派遣新人上战场送死，但是，既然你能活到现在，说明你确实有点本事。在这附近某个小屋里有至少两个强盗盘踞于此，任何捕杀平民的罪犯都应当被快点了结掉……你的任务就是处决掉他们。完成这个任务之后，旧世守护者就会认为你是个对他们有用的人。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I don't need anything major for now, Marshal.  Well, except…"
msgstr "我现在不需要任何重要的东西，元帅。  好吧，除了……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I ensure that the citizens here have what they need to survive and protect themselves from raiders.  Keeping some form of law is going to be the most important element in rebuilding the world.  We do what we can to keep the 'Free Merchants' here prospering and in return they have provided us with spare men and supplies when they can."
msgstr "我确保这里的平民们能够得到所需的生存物资，并且保护他们免受强盗伤害。在我们重建世界的时候，保持某种形式的法律将会是至关重要的一点。我们竭尽所能来保持这里的\"自由商会\"能够繁荣发展。做为回报，他们需要为我们尽可能的提供多余的人力与物资。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I had other questions."
msgstr "我还有其他问题。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I wanted to ask you something about that offer."
msgstr "我想问你一些关于这个提议的事情。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Assassinate Raider Leader"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I'd recommend having two deputies… it would be a death trap if a single man got surrounded."
msgstr "我建议你带上一两个副官……如果独自一人被包围的话，就像是掉进了死亡陷阱一样。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I'm not buying anything without some proof."
msgstr "没有证据我不会买任何东西。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I'm sorry, but I can't leave my post here, and I just don't have the human resources even for a project like that."
msgstr "很抱歉，我不能离开我的岗位，而且我们也没有足够的人手来做这样的项目。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I'm the region's federal liaison.  Most people here call us the 'Old Guard' and I rather like the sound of it.  Despite how things currently appear, the federal government was not entirely destroyed.  After the outbreak I was chosen to coordinate civilian and militia efforts in support of military operations."
msgstr "我是该地区的联邦政府联络官，在这里大多数人称呼我们为\"旧世守护者\"，我还是挺喜欢这个绰号的。尽管目前情况不容乐观，但是联邦政府并未因此而完全垮掉。疫情爆发后，我被选来协调平民和民兵的工作，以便支持军事行动。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Assassinate Raider Leader"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I've located a Hell's Raiders encampment in the region that appears to be coordinating operations against the Free Merchants.  We know almost nothing about the command structure in the 'gang' so I need to send someone in to decapitate the leadership.  The raid will be held under orders of the U.S. Marshals Service and by agreeing to the mission you will become a marshal, swearing to assist the federal government in regaining order."
msgstr "我已经定位了一个\"地狱掠夺者\"在这一区域的营地，这个营地似乎是用来组织对自由商会攻击行动的。我们对这个\"帮派\"的组织架构一无所知，所以我需要有人去进行斩首行动。行动将在美国司法部法警署的命令下进行，同意参加任务后，你将会被任命为执法官，并誓言帮助联邦政府重建秩序。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Deal with Informant"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "If they draw first blood their friends are less likely to blame you…"
msgstr "如果他们先动手，那么他们的朋友可能就不会责怪你……"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Install radio repeater mod"
msgstr "安装无线电中继器模块"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Is there a catch?"
msgstr "能说重点吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join the 'Old Guard'?"
msgstr "我可以加入\"旧世守护者\"吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "It's your lucky day: I just made contact with a couple volunteers like yourself, and that's exactly the sort of project I can put them to."
msgstr "今天是你的幸运日：我刚好联系到了几个像你一样的志愿者，而这正是我可以让他们参加的项目。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Kill Bandits"
msgstr "杀死强盗"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_graboid" placed on map update on start of
#. mission "Secure Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Little Guy"
msgstr "小家伙"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Assassinate Raider Leader"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Marshal, you continue to impress us.  We may have some hope of long term survival yet thanks to you."
msgstr "执法官，你又一次令我们留下了深刻的印象。多亏了你，我们可能还有一些长期生存的希望。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Never mind…"
msgstr "算了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Assassinate Raider Leader"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Now repeat after me… I do solemnly swear that I will support and defend the Constitution of the United States against all enemies, foreign and domestic… that I will bear true faith and allegiance to the same… that I take this obligation freely, without any mental reservation or purpose of evasion… and that I will well and faithfully discharge the duties of the office on which I am about to enter.  To establish justice, insure domestic tranquility, provide for the common defense, promote the general welfare and secure the blessings of liberty.  So help me God.  Congratulations Marshal, don't forget your badge and gun.  As a marshal all men or women assisting you are considered deputy marshals so keep them in line."
msgstr "现在跟着我重复一遍……我郑重宣誓，我将支持和捍卫美利坚合众国宪法，反对国内外一切敌人……我将信念坚定，忠诚不渝……我自愿承担这一义务，毫无保留，决不逃避……我将尽职尽责完成我即将担负的本职工作。树立正义，保障国内安宁，提供共同防务，促进公共福利，并使我们自己和后代得享自由的幸福。有上主作证。祝贺你，执法官，不要忘记带上你的徽章和配枪。作为一名联邦执法官，所有协助你的男女老少都是你的副官，管好他们。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Oh well, you can try again anytime."
msgstr "哦，好吧，你可以随时再试一次。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Secure Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "One of the Free Merchants silently disappeared while escorting a trade caravan.  Whoever or whatever is responsible must be quick and quiet - investigate the trade route and eliminate the threat."
msgstr "自由商会的一名成员在护卫一只商队时突然失踪了。任何造成此事的人，或者东西，一定非常敏捷且悄无声息。调查商队路线并解决掉这一威胁。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Representative"
msgstr "联络官"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Secure Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Search the bushes for any trace?  I'm not an expert tracker but you should be able to find something."
msgstr "找找灌木丛里留下的痕迹？我不是追踪专家，但你应该能够找到什么线索。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Secure Trade Route"
msgstr "保护贸易路线"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "So what are you actually doing here?"
msgstr "那么你在这儿究竟在干什么？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Stay safe, Marshal."
msgstr "保持安全，元帅。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Tell me about it."
msgstr "[接受]好吧，说来听听。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Tell me about the footholds."
msgstr "和我说说那些个据点。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Thank you for the good work, Marshal.  It's not much but please accept these supplies to compensate.  Come back to me if you are willing to install more."
msgstr "谢谢你的出色工作，元帅。  虽然不多，但请收下这些补给品作为补偿。  如果您愿意安装更多，请回来找我。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Deal with Informant"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Thank you, I'll do the explaining if anyone else asks about it."
msgstr "谢谢你，如果别人问起来我会解释的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Deal with Informant"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Thank you, please keep this discreet."
msgstr "谢谢你，请注意保密。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Secure Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Thanks, keeping the people safe is what we try and do."
msgstr "谢谢，保证人民的安全是一件我们一直尽力尝试的事。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Thanks, that's great news!"
msgstr "谢谢，这可真是个好消息！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "That's a damn shame…  You can come back anytime if you want to try again."
msgstr "真是太可惜了……如果你想再试一次，你可以随时回来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "The 2nd Fleet?"
msgstr "第二舰队？"

#. ~ Description of mission "Deal with Informant"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "The Hell's Raiders bandit group may have an informant working inside the Refugee Center.  Investigate and bring them to justice without arousing any suspicions."
msgstr "难民中心内部可能有地狱掠夺者的眼线。调查此事并解决掉这个眼线，不要引起怀疑。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Assassinate Raider Leader"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "The Old Guard have located a Hell's Raiders encampment that is coordinating attacks on the Free Merchants.  Pay them a visit and execute the area leadership."
msgstr "旧世守护者最近发现了地狱掠夺者的一个营地。他们发现地狱掠夺者通过这个营地指挥对自由商会的攻击。找到他们并解决掉营地的头目。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Bandits"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "The Old Guard thanks you for eliminating the criminals.  You won't be forgotten."
msgstr "旧世守护者十分感谢你干掉了那些罪犯，你的贡献不会被遗忘的。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "The Old Guard wishes to expand their range of communications to get in touch with other survivors in the Wasteland.  Find a Radio Station and install a repeater mod via its terminal."
msgstr "老卫士希望扩大他们的通讯范围，以便与废土上的其他幸存者取得联系。  找到一个广播电台并通过其终端安装中继器模块。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Bandits"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "The States will remain a wasteland unless good men choose to save it."
msgstr "美国将永远是一片废墟，除非优秀的人站出来拯救它。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Secure Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "There is another monster troubling the merchants but this time it isn't human… at least I don't think.  Guy just disappeared while walking behind a packed caravan.  They didn't hear any shots but I suppose some raider may have been real sneaky.  Check out the area and report anything you find."
msgstr "又有困扰商会的麻烦了，但这一次不是人类……至少我觉得不是。有个跟在商队末尾的人就那么消失了。没有人听到任何枪响，或许有些强盗非常擅长匿其行踪。侦查这片区域，然后回来跟我说说你发现的线索。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "There isn't much pushed out by public relations that I'd actually believe.  From what I gather, communication between the regional force commands is almost non-existent.  What I do know is that the 'Old Guard' is currently based out of the 2nd Fleet and patrols the Atlantic coast trying to provide support to the remaining footholds."
msgstr "现在公开渠道已经很难得到什么可信的消息了。据我所知，各区域势力之间的联系几乎已经全被阻断了。我唯一知道的是，\"旧世守护者\"目前依靠第二舰队，在大西洋沿岸巡逻，以支援他们仍在运作的据点。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "They may just be propaganda but apparently one or two cities were successful in 'walling themselves off.'  Around here I was told that there were a few places like this one but I couldn't tell you where."
msgstr "他们有可能只是在宣传，但显然的有一两个城市已经成功建成\"隔离区\"。这附近有人告诉我还有几个跟这里一样的地方，但是我不知道在哪。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Bandits"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "They might suspect you are coming, keep an eye out for traps."
msgstr "搞不好他们能猜到你会来，多留点心，可能有陷阱。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Deal with Informant"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "This task is going to require a little more persuasive skill.  I believe the Hell's Raiders have an informant here to monitor who comes and goes.  I need you to find out who it is and deal with them without letting anyone else know of my suspicions.  We normally allow the Free Merchants to govern themselves so I would hate to offend them."
msgstr "这个任务需要你口才好一些。我确信\"地狱掠夺者\"在这里有个眼线来监视过往的人。我需要你找出这个眼线是谁，并且在不被任何人发现的前提下干掉他。我们通常和自由商会井水不犯河水，所以我并不想让他们觉得我在管闲事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Wait.  Before you go, I got an offer for you if you're interested."
msgstr "等待。  在你走之前，如果你有兴趣的话，我给你提供了一份报价。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "We need more help…"
msgstr "我们需要更多帮助……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "We need more repeaters to expand our range and ability of our communications.  You know the drill Marshal, find or assemble a radio repeater mod and set it up in a Radio Station.  Radio Towers are still off the table."
msgstr "我们需要更多的中继器来扩大我们的通信范围和能力。  您知道演习元帅，找到或组装无线电中继器模块并将其设置在广播电台中。  无线电塔仍然不在讨论范围之内。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Well, let's just say that the location of the helicopter doesn't make the retrieval of the cargo…trivial.  Apparently the higher-ups agreed that it was too hard and too far to be worth the bother.  Cargo's valuable, but there's not exactly a surplus of manpower."
msgstr "好吧，我们只能说，直升机的位置并不会让货物的取回变得……微不足道。  显然，高层一致认为，这太难、太远了，不值得费心。  货物很有价值，但人力并不完全过剩。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Well, thanks anyway…"
msgstr "好吧，还是要谢谢你……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Well… I was like any other civilian till they conscripted me so I'll tell it to you straight.  They're the best hope we got right now.  They are stretched impossibly thin but are willing to do what is needed to maintain order.  They don't care much about looters since they understand most everyone is dead, but if you have something they need… you WILL give it to them.  Since most survivors here have nothing they want, they are welcomed as champions."
msgstr "好吧……在守护者征召我之前，我和其他人一样不过是个平民百姓，因此我就对你直说了。他们是我们目前的最大希望。虽然他们现在力量薄弱，但他们会尽全力维持控制区内的秩序。他们不在乎拾荒者，因为他们明白大部分的人都死了，但是如果你有他们需要的东西……你*理应*给他们。这儿的大部分幸存者不会有他们想要的东西，因此他们受到英雄一般的欢迎。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Well… I was like any other civilian till they conscripted me so I'll tell it to you straight.  They're the best hope we got right now.  They are stretched impossibly thin but are willing to do what is needed to maintain order.  They don't care much about looters since they understand most everyone is dead, but if you have something they need… you WILL give it to them.  Since most survivors here have nothing they want, they are welcomed as champions."
msgstr "好吧……在守护者征召我之前，我和其他人一样不过是个平民百姓，因此我就对你直说了。他们是我们目前的最大希望。虽然他们现在力量薄弱，但他们会尽全力维持控制区内的秩序。他们不在乎拾荒者，因为他们明白大部分的人都死了，但是如果你有他们需要的东西……你*理应*给他们。这儿的大部分幸存者不会有他们想要的东西，因此他们受到英雄一般的欢迎。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Well… I was like any other civilian till they conscripted me so I'll tell it to you straight.  They're the best hope we got right now.  They are stretched impossibly thin but are willing to do what is needed to maintain order.  They don't care much about looters since they understand most everyone is dead, but if you have something they need… you WILL give it to them.  Since most survivors here have nothing they want, they are welcomed as champions."
msgstr "好吧……在守护者征召我之前，我和其他人一样不过是个平民百姓，因此我就对你直说了。他们是我们目前的最大希望。虽然他们现在力量薄弱，但他们会尽全力维持控制区内的秩序。他们不在乎拾荒者，因为他们明白大部分的人都死了，但是如果你有他们需要的东西……你*理应*给他们。这儿的大部分幸存者不会有他们想要的东西，因此他们受到英雄一般的欢迎。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Why sell the info instead of retrieving the cargo yourself, and how can you be sure it wasn't looted already?"
msgstr "为什么要出售信息而不是自己取回货物？您如何确定货物没有被抢劫？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Yes actually.  The scout told me that he saw something weird down at the lake, shapes swimming close to the surface from time to time.  He wasn't keen on diving in to get a better look."
msgstr "是的，实际上。  侦察兵告诉我，他在湖边看到了一些奇怪的东西，不时有一些形状靠近水面游动。  他并不热衷于深入观察。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "You can find the Radio Stations in towns or urban centers.  I still have no repeater mod available Marshal.  However you can craft one yourself, if you find the manual.  Try libraries or bookstores if you still don't have one."
msgstr "您可以在城镇或城市中心找到广播电台。  我仍然没有可用的中继器模组元帅。  不过，如果你找到手册，你可以自己制作一个。  如果您还没有图书馆或书店，请尝试一下。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "You can't actually join unless you go through a recruiter.  We can usually use help though, ask me from time to time if there is any work available.  Completing missions as a contractor is a great way to make a name for yourself among the most powerful men left in the world."
msgstr "在直到一名招募官来之前，你没法地真正加入我们。不过我们一直都欢迎大家来帮一把手，记得时常来问我有没有可以干的活。作为临时工，多完成任务可以让你在这群世上仅存的最有实力的人们中扬名立万。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Deal with Informant"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "You deal with the rat?"
msgstr "你干掉那个内鬼了吗？"

#. ~ Failure explanation for NPC dialogue response
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "You don't have enough."
msgstr "你还不够。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find the sunken helicopter"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "You got the location of a sunken helicopter, all that's left to do is find a way to get there."
msgstr "你已经找到了一架沉没直升机的位置，剩下要做的就是找到到达那里的方法。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "[50 merch] Fine."
msgstr "[50 件商品] 很好。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "A pilot?"
msgstr "飞行员"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "About that helicopter…"
msgstr "关于合约的事……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Alright, let's get moving."
msgstr "好的，出发吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Are you part of Yusuke's group?"
msgstr "你是在害怕我最终会把你变成什么样子吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Do you need anything?"
msgstr "你需要什么吗？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Get to the Chopper"
msgstr "选择用绳索捆绑的物品。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Great, I'm with you."
msgstr "如你所愿，我和你一起走！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Great.  I guess I'll hang back until we're ready, just let me know when you want me to come with."
msgstr "伟大的。  我想我会等一下，直到我们准备好为止，只要你想让我一起去就告诉我。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Hello there.  Glad to see an unfamiliar face around here."
msgstr "嘿，陌生人。很高兴在这里看到一张新面孔。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Hey, that's fine.  Thanks for taking me up here."
msgstr "嘿，没关系。  谢谢你带我来这里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "How did you wind up here?"
msgstr "你是怎么到这里来的？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I don't blame you.  The offer stands though, in case you decide to stop being so sensible."
msgstr "我不怪你。  不过，如果你决定不再那么明智，这个提议仍然有效。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I have to get going."
msgstr "你最好快点讲，我要走了。"

#. ~ Job description of "Rescue Pilot" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I just want to fly."
msgstr "我只是想谈谈。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I should have figured…"
msgstr "我感觉还能扛一会。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I wound up getting chased out of town myself, had to leave my ride behind and just run.  Yusuke, the mut--uh, the furry guy who hangs out with the folks in the lobby, he found me, brought me back here."
msgstr "结果我自己被赶出了城，不得不丢下车跑掉。  幽介，那个杂种——呃，那个和大厅里的人一起出去玩的毛茸茸的家伙，他找到了我，把我带回了这里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I'll have to think about it."
msgstr "我会考虑的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I'll try to get us there, just tell me where to go."
msgstr "我会尽力带我们去那里，请告诉我去哪里。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I'm coming with you, but it might be easier to clear a path up there on your own first.  Just give the word and I'll hang back."
msgstr "我和你一起去，但你自己先清理出一条路可能会更容易。  只要你说一声，我就会犹豫不决。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "It's like I said: take me to it, and I'll fly you anywhere you want to go from now on.  It's not like I got anywhere else to be."
msgstr "就像我说的：带我去吧，从现在起我会带你去任何你想去的地方。  我好像没有其他地方可去。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Just let me know what you need."
msgstr "如果你改变主意就和我说一声。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Let's talk about that helicopter."
msgstr "我们来谈谈营地的事情。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Nah.  I owe Yusuke for getting me someplace safe, but I'm not trying to set up camp here and most of these people don't want outsiders sticking around anyway.  I just need to get my helicopter back."
msgstr "不。  我欠佑介把我带到安全的地方，但我并不想在这里扎营，而且这些人中的大多数人也不希望外人留下来。  我只需要取回我的直升机。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Nevermind that for now."
msgstr "算了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Not really.  What happened with the army?"
msgstr "巴里怎么了？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Oh, you don't remember?  I wouldn't worry too much, seems a lot of people lost a week or two around the time the bombs fell.  Long story short, the army--well, not just them, it was the guard and the police, whoever really.  Order kind of fell apart and some of the guys cracked, started shooting at each other or the evacuees.  That was right around the time the dead started walking…a lot of people really couldn't handle that.  Anyway most the refugee camps…the FEMA camps, the evac shelters…most of 'em turned into death traps pretty quick.  I'm surprised these folk here are getting on as well as they are."
msgstr "哦，你不记得了？  我不会太担心，似乎很多人在炸弹落下时损失了一两周。  长话短说，军队——嗯，不仅仅是他们，还有警卫和警察，无论是谁。  秩序有点崩溃，一些人崩溃了，开始互相射击或向撤离人员射击。  就在死者开始行走的时候……很多人真的无法应对。  无论如何，大多数难民营……联邦应急管理局营地，疏散避难所……其中大多数很快就变成了死亡陷阱。  我很惊讶这里的人们过得这么好。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Rescue Pilot"
msgstr "直升机驾驶员"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Right."
msgstr "好的。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
msgstr "与救援飞行员交谈"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "That chopper's still up there."
msgstr "这里有个碾磨机。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "The rescue pilot at the refugee center says there's probably still a working helicopter on the roof of a hospital.  If you bring them there, they'll be happy to fly you anywhere you want to go."
msgstr "难民中心的救援飞行员表示，医院屋顶上可能还有一架正在工作的直升机。  如果你带他们去那里，他们会很乐意带你去任何你想去的地方。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Uh, advice?  I say we get the hell out of here as fast as we possibly can."
msgstr "呃，建议？  我说我们要尽快离开这里。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Unless the army got to it, and let's just say I don't think there's much chance of that, it'll be parked up on the roof of the hospital I was working with.  Hopefully I don't have to explain to you how dangerous that place probably is by now."
msgstr "除非军队找到它，我认为这种可能性不大，否则它就会停在我工作的医院的屋顶上。  希望我现在不必向你解释那个地方可能有多危险。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Wait here for now."
msgstr "就这样吧。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "We made it!  Just let me check out the bird real quick."
msgstr "我们成功了！  让我快速检查一下这只鸟。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Well at first they had me flying people out the mountains to a hospital, but then things started to get too bad in the city and, well, you know what happened with the army and all of that."
msgstr "好吧，一开始他们让我把人们从山上送到医院，但后来城里的情况开始变得太糟糕，好吧，你知道军队发生了什么以及所有这些。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Well here's the thing: I'm a pilot, and I want to get airborne again.  I dunno if there's anyone left to find or help or whatever out there, but I don't like being grounded like this.  If you can help get me back to my bird, I'll fly you anywhere you want to go.  Problem is, it's up on a roof and I can't reach it by myself.  I'm not really equipped for that kind of thing."
msgstr "事情是这样的：我是一名飞行员，我想再次飞上天空。  我不知道是否还有人可以寻找或帮助或其他什么，但我不喜欢像这样被禁足。  如果你能帮我回到我的鸟儿身边，我会带你去任何你想去的地方。  问题是，它在屋顶上，我自己够不着。  我真的没有能力做那种事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Well up until recently I was a search and rescue pilot.  Now I guess I'm more of a pedestrian."
msgstr "直到最近我还是一名搜救飞行员。  现在我想我更像是一个行人。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "What about your helicopter?"
msgstr "你的避难所呢？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Where did you leave your ride?"
msgstr "你为什么离开你的藏身处？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Yeah, I was flying medevac, for all the good it did.  There wound up being nowhere to take anyone."
msgstr "是的，我乘坐的是医疗后送飞机，尽管它确实有很多好处。  结果无处可带任何人。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "谁啊？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "You held up your end, so I guess I'm with you now.  Like I said, I can fly this or any other helicopter, I'll take you anywhere you want to go."
msgstr "你坚持了你的结局，所以我想我现在和你在一起。  就像我说的，我可以驾驶这架或任何其他直升机，我会带你去任何你想去的地方。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "You've made it to the helipad, you probably ought to talk to the pilot."
msgstr "您已到达直升机停机坪，您可能应该与飞行员交谈。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Any tips for surviving?"
msgstr "有什么生存诀窍吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I see.  Let's try this again from the start."
msgstr "我懂了。让我们从重头再来一次。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I suppose I should hire a party then?"
msgstr "所以说，我该去雇一帮人是吧？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I'm currently waiting for a customer to return… I'll make you a deal though, 750 merch will cover my expenses if I get a small cut of the loot."
msgstr "我正在等另一个客户……不过如果你出的起钱我也会跟你做笔交易。如果你不介意的话，750商会币一口价，外加战利品分成。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I'm just a hired hand.  Someone pays me and I do what needs to be done."
msgstr "拿人钱财替人消灾！这样说你能明白不？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "If you have to fight your way out of an ambush, the only thing that is going to save you is having a party that can return fire.  People who work alone are easy pickings for monsters and bandits."
msgstr "如果你想从埋伏中杀出一条血路的话，唯一能救得了你的只有一群能与你并肩作战一起还击敌人的小队。孤胆英雄只会成为强盗和怪物们唾手可得的晚餐。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the refugee center as a partner for hire.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Merc"
msgstr "佣兵"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Merch is what they call dollar bills around here.  Free Merchant Credit Notes or something.  If you want to buy stuff around here and you don't want to barter away your guns, you need merch."
msgstr "商会币就是这附近通用的货币，就和原来的美元一样。全名好像是\"自由商会认证货币\"之类的。如果你想在这附近买东西，而且不想用你的枪以物易物的话，你就需要商会币。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Okay, how much merch do I need?"
msgstr "好的，我需要多少商会币？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Well, thanks for the info.  Bye!"
msgstr "好吧，谢谢你的信息。再见！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "What the heck is a merch?"
msgstr "商会币是什么玩意？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "What would it cost to hire you?"
msgstr "要花多少钱才能雇你啊？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "[750 merch] You have a deal."
msgstr "[750 商会币]成交了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Actually, I have to go.  Maybe later."
msgstr "其实，我得走了。回头再聊。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Ah, yeah, I've heard of that too.  It's a weird world out there, hey?"
msgstr "啊，是的，我也听说过。外面的世界很奇怪，不是么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Hey there.  Do you work here, or what?"
msgstr "嘿，你好啊。你在这里工作吗，还是什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr "我在一个避难所里找到了一张到这个地方的地图，我想我会看看里面是不是满是<zombies>，还是有些别的什么。但从没想到会发现这里还有这么多幸存者活着。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr "我在一个避难所里找到了一张到这个地方的地图，我想我会看看里面是不是满是<zombies>，还是有些别的什么。但从没想到会发现这里还有这么多幸存者活着。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr "我在一个避难所里找到了一张到这个地方的地图，我想我会看看里面是不是满是<zombies>，还是有些别的什么。但从没想到会发现这里还有这么多幸存者活着。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "It doesn't really work that way.  They're back in safety, and I've got to go check in with them with some supplies.  You know how it is, not everyone is suited to risk travel these days."
msgstr "这可行不通。他们安全在家里呆着，而我得带着物资去和他们会合。你也知道，现在不是每个人都适合冒险旅行。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Look, I don't know a better way to put this.  I don't know you, I can't bring some random back with me.  For all I know you're a cannibal psycho or something.  We all saw too much of that during <the_cataclysm>.  Me and mine, we're not looking to expand our tribe just now, OK?"
msgstr "听着，我不知道更好的说法。我不认识你，我不能就这么带着一些陌生人回去。万一你是个食人魔心理变态之类的。在<the_cataclysm>时，我们都见得太多了。我和我的家人，我们现在不想加人了，好吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Me?  No, I'm just passing through, how about you?"
msgstr "我吗？不，我只是路过而已，你呢？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Not much, just passing through.  Have a good day."
msgstr "没什么，只是路过而已。祝您今天过得愉快。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Oh well, I'd better get going."
msgstr "哦，好吧，我得走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Sorry, I have people of my own to look out for.  I can't leave them in the lurch."
msgstr "对不起，我有我自己的人要照顾。我不能丢下他们不管。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Sure, here, I'll draw you up a little map."
msgstr "当然，我给你画一张小地图。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Thanks!  I'd better get going."
msgstr "谢谢了！我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Thanks!  What's your story?"
msgstr "谢谢了！你的故事是什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "They could come along too."
msgstr "他们也可以一起来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Well, I'd better get going."
msgstr "好吧，我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Why don't I come back to your hideout?"
msgstr "那为什么不带我去你的藏身处？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Work here?  No, of course not.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "在这里工作？不，当然不是。我得走了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "You looking for a travelling companion?  I could use someone to watch my back."
msgstr "你在找旅伴吗？我想找个人掩护我。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "You seen anything interesting out there?"
msgstr "你在外面看到过什么有意思的东西吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Anything else you need?"
msgstr "你还需要别的东西吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Can I have another look?"
msgstr "我可以再看看吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Do you need something?"
msgstr "你需要什么吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Find anything good?"
msgstr "找到什么好东西了吗？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<hands_up>"
#. ~ Mostly hostile NPCs say these things in preparation for mugging an
#. unarmed avatar.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hands up, <name_b>!"
msgstr "举起手来，<name_b>！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Haven't seen another face in quite a while.  Not a living one, at least.  State your business.  Maybe you got some use for some of this scrap metal?"
msgstr "好久没看到人了，至少不是活着的人。听你说，这些废旧金属似乎对你有用？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Let's take a look at your stock."
msgstr "让我看看你的库存。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Like I said, I came out here when the dead got pissed off.  This place had some barbed wire, metalworking tools, and plenty of stuff to make weapons out of.  Even the walls are my own making."
msgstr "就像我说的，当死者生气的时候我就出来了。  这个地方有一些铁丝网、金属加工工具和大量用来制造武器的东西。  连墙壁都是我自己做的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Nah, see ya."
msgstr "啊，拜拜。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Nope, although I have a really good claim by the river.  Gonna go fetch them soon, be right back in <interval>."
msgstr "不，虽然我在河边有一个非常好的主张。  我很快就会去取它们，在<间隔>内就回来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Pleasure to see you again, <name_g>."
msgstr "别来无恙，<name_g>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Sure thing.  I've got a few things on hand.  What'll ya have?"
msgstr "当然可以。我手头有几样东西。你有些啥？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Sure, I'm fine with it.  There's a spare bed in the shed next door for anyone who needs it.  Just don't hog it.  Someone else might come along."
msgstr "当然可以。隔壁棚子里有一张备用床，提供给有需要的任何人。只是别占着它，后面还有其他人。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Think I could stay here?"
msgstr "你觉得我可以留在这儿吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Well, I held a modest job here as a scrap yard worker.  Business was fair most days, but when <the_cataclysm> hit, I decided to head out here.  With all the craziness going on in the cities and whatnot, I decided to just stay here for while.  I figure someone might find a use for the leftover metal lying around, so I started selling it to anyone who passed by."
msgstr "嗯，我在这里做着一份不起眼的工作，是一名废品场工人。  大部分日子里生意都很顺利，但当<大灾变>来袭时，我决定前往这里。  考虑到城市里发生的所有疯狂的事情，我决定在这里待一段时间。  我认为有人可能会发现周围剩下的金属的用途，所以我开始把它卖给任何路过的人。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Well, good luck."
msgstr "好吧，祝你好运。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Why stay here of all places?"
msgstr "为什么要留在这里？"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "scrapper"
msgstr "废品商"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "An electronics store might have some."
msgstr "电器店可能会有一些。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal?"
msgstr "弄到木炭了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the magnetrons?"
msgstr "弄到磁控管了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the solder?"
msgstr "弄到焊料丝了吗？"

#. ~ Description of mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Establish trade relations between the scrapper and a refugee center, and bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr "建立废品商和难民中心之间的贸易关系，并带回一份协议书。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Find 25 Magnetrons"
msgstr "收集 25 个磁控管"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "How does this help us?"
msgstr "这对我们有什么好处？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "I need help…"
msgstr "帮帮我们……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "I was out scavenging recently, and I found one of those old evac shelters.  Turns out the computer was still on and had an address for a refugee center.  I figure they might want some spare metal, so I need you to go over there and strike a deal with them."
msgstr "我最近在外面捡拾东西，发现了一个旧的疏散避难所。原来电脑还开着，显示有一个难民中心的地址。我想他们可能会需要一些备用的金属材料，所以我需要你去那里与他们达成协议。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Its fairly simple to make some.  I don't know where you could find any, though."
msgstr "制作一些木炭是很简单的，但是你在别处很难找到它。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Magnetrons can be found in microwaves.  An apartment block should have tons of them."
msgstr "磁控管可以在微波炉里找到，一个公寓楼应该会有大量的磁控管。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 Solder"
msgstr "收集 100 份焊料"

#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 solder in exchange for credit with the scrap merchant."
msgstr "收集 100 份焊料，以换取废品商的信任。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 25 magnetrons in exchange for credit with the scrap merchant."
msgstr "收集 25 个磁控管以换取废品商的信任。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
msgstr "获得 300 木炭"

#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 300 lumps of charcoal in exchange for credit with the scrap merchant."
msgstr "用废品商人的信用换取 300 块木炭。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Since business is increasing around here, I've decided to start selling more specialized metal.  Problem is, I can't separate the metal out.  Fortunately, I found some old schematics on a machine for this sort of thing.  If you could get me 25 magnetrons, I can melt down the sorted stuff into bars.  I can quickly pay you in raw materials."
msgstr "由于这里的生意越来越好，我决定开始销售更专业的金属。问题是，我无法分离各类金属。还好，我找到了关于这种机器的旧原理图。如果你能带给我25个磁控管，我可以给你一些金属原材料。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Someone's got to do it."
msgstr "总得有人去做。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "That machine I put together is working wonderfully, but the generator is nearly out of juice.  If you could get me 300 lumps of charcoal, I'll pay you however I can."
msgstr "我组装的那台机器工作得很好，但发电机几乎没电了。  如果你能给我300块木炭，我会尽我所能付钱给你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "That machine I put together needs some repairs on it, but I'm out of solder.  If you could get me about 100 spools, I'll pay you for it."
msgstr "我组装的那台机器需要一些修理，但是我的焊料用完了，如果你能给我大概一百份焊料，我会回报你的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll do it myself."
msgstr "真不幸。我想我得自己做了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess we'll have to find someone else to trade with."
msgstr "真不幸，我想我们得另外找客户了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Where are they?  I don't believe you."
msgstr "东西在哪呢？我不相信你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  I'll start the smelting as soon as possible."
msgstr "太棒了！我这就开始冶炼。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  This should do for a while."
msgstr "太好了！这应该够用一段时间了。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
