msgstr "我想用两个瓶盖换"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "I'm looking for information."
msgstr "我想打听点儿消息。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 2 Stills"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "I'm sure you could find the design for the stills in home brewing books."
msgstr "我相信你可以在酿造类书籍里找到蒸馏器的制造方法。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "If it isn't obvious, I oversee the bar here.  The scavengers bring in old world alcohol that we sell for special occasions.  For most that come through here though, the drinks we brew ourselves are the only thing they can afford."
msgstr "如果你还看不出的话，我负责照看这个酒吧。拾荒者们会带回些旧世界的酒，但很少能卖的出去。基本上来这儿的人都只喝得起我们自己酿的酒。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Just a glass of water, please."
msgstr "来杯清水就够了，谢谢。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Make 2 Stills"
msgstr "制造 2 个蒸馏器"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Oh, that?  There were too many people stealing our glasses, so I started stamping a logo on some bottle caps as a token and raised the drink prices a bit to encourage their return.  I'll give you a merch back when you bring me the token with your glass."
msgstr "哦，那个？有太多人偷走了我们的玻璃酒杯，所以我开始在一些瓶盖上打上标志作为代币，并稍微提高了酒品价格鼓励他们还回来。当你把酒杯和瓶盖一起还给我时，我会还给你一个商会币。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
