msgid "I was among one of the first groups of immigrants sent here to fortify the outpost.  I might have exaggerated my construction skills to get the hell out of the refugee center.  Unless you are a trader, there isn't much work there and food was really becoming scarce when I left."
msgstr "我是被派来加固哨站的第一批移民之一。为了离开那该死的难民中心，我可能稍稍夸大了一点我的建造技能。除非你有什么能交易的东西，不然这里可没有什么活能给你干的，我离开那里的时候食物已经很少了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "I've got to go…"
msgstr "我该走了……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "350 merch should be enough to cover the purchase and the labor to plow it."
msgstr "350商会币应该足以支付购买和耕种的费用。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "<npc_name> jots your name down on a ledger and yells out to nearby laborers to begin plowing your new field."
msgstr "<npc_name>把你的名字填入账本中，然后喊来附近的工人，开始开垦你的新田地。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "After counting your money, <npc_name> directs a nearby laborer to begin constructing a fence around your plot…"
msgstr "数完你给的钱后，<npc_name>指派一个附近的工人，开始绕着你的田修筑围栏……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Can you build a fence around my field?"
msgstr "你能在我的地周围造一圈围栏吗？"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Flavor
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Crop Overseer"
msgstr "农业主管"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I don't have that much right now.  Maybe later."
msgstr "我现在手头没那么多钱。下次再说吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I figured you might be looking for some help…"
msgstr "我想你似乎正在寻求帮助……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I hope you are here to do business."
msgstr "我希望你来这儿是做生意的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'd like to discuss my field…"
msgstr "我想谈谈我的地……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'd like to harvest some plants…"
msgstr "我想收割作物……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'd like to plant some seeds…"
msgstr "我想种些种子……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm a bit short right now.  Maybe later."
msgstr "我现在手头有些紧。下次再说吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm interested in investing in agriculture…"
msgstr "我想要投资点农田……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm interested.  How much is it going to cost?"
msgstr "我很感兴趣。要花多少钱？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm looking to expand my field…"
msgstr "我想扩大我的土地……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "My job is to manage our outpost's agricultural production.  I'm constantly searching for trade partners and investors to increase our capacity.  If you are interested, I typically have tasks that I need assistance with."
msgstr "我的工作是管理前哨站的农业生产。我一直在寻找贸易伙伴和投资者，以提高我们的产能。如果你想要的话，我这里也有些你能帮上忙的任务。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Sure, we could build a sturdy picket fence around it that will keep most wildlife from nibbling at your crops.  Your crop yields will increase slightly as well."
msgstr "当然，我们可以在它周围建一道坚固的栅栏，防止大多数野生动物啃食你的庄稼。你的作物产量也会略有增加。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Tell me more about this field."
msgstr "跟我说说关于土地的事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "There's a field on the other side of the house that isn't being used for anything right now.  We're willing to let you purchase it for your own agricultural enterprises if you're interested."
msgstr "房子的另一头有块地，现在什么用都没有。如果你感兴趣的话，我们可以愿意让你买下它来开展你自己的农业事业。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "We can plow some more land around your field to give you room for more plants.  Any existing plants or items in the way will be destroyed.  It'll only cost 100 merch to expand.  Still interested?"
msgstr "我们可以在你的地旁边再开垦出一块地，给你种植更多植物的空间。但现有的作物或物品将被摧毁。一切都只要花100商会币。还有兴趣吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "We'll have to divert a decent amount of lumber from our other projects for the fence, but we can get it done for 200 merch."
msgstr "我们将不得不从其他项目中调集数目不小的木材来建设你的围栏，但我们只要花200商会币就能完成。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "We'll have to divert a decent amount of lumber from our other projects for the fence, but we can get it done for 300 merch."
msgstr "我们将不得不从其他项目中调集数目不小的木材来建设你的围栏，但我们只要花300商会币就能完成。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "We'll help plow the land and put up a sign to let everybody know it's yours.  Once it's plowed, you can hire some workers to plant or harvest the crops for a small fee of course.  Oh, and if you're growing anything we have a demand for, we'll gladly take it off your hands after the harvest."
msgstr "我们可以帮你种地，并竖个牌子，让每个人知道这是你的地。一旦开垦完毕，你可以雇佣一些工人来种植或收割庄稼，当然只需支付少量费用。哦，如果我们对你种植的作物有需求，我们会愿意在收割完成后付钱收走。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "We'll plant the field with your choice of crop if you are willing to finance it.  When the crop is ready to harvest, you can have us liquidate it or harvest it for you.  Planting will cost 1 merch per plot."
msgstr "我们可以按照你选择的作物种这块地，只要你愿意提供资金。当作物准备收割时，你可以让我们收走或替你收割。种植每格地的成本为1商会币。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "What do you need done?"
msgstr "你需要我干什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "You can either have us liquidate the crop and give you the cash or pay us to harvest it for you.  Harvesting will cost 1 merch per plot."
msgstr "你要么让我们收获作物并且付给你钱，要么付钱让我们替你收获作物。收割作物每格地的成本为1商会币。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[1 merch / plot] I'd like to harvest the field."
msgstr "[1 商会币/格]我想收割作物。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[1 merch / plot] I'd like to plant some seeds."
msgstr "[1 商会币/格]我想种些种子。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[100 merch] Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr "[100 商会币]可以，开干吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[200 merch] Alright, build me a fence."
msgstr "[200 商会币]好吧，给我建一道围栏。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[200 merch] Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr "[200 商会币]可以，开干吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[300 merch] Alright, build me a fence."
msgstr "[300 商会币]好吧，给我建一道围栏。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[350 merch] Seems like a fair price.  I'll take it."
msgstr "[350 商会币]听起来很公道。我要了。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "A Crutch to Lean on"
msgstr "依靠的拐杖"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgstr "给医生找来麻醉剂"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Any progress on getting some anesthetic or parts?"
msgstr "麻醉剂和机器的事有进展吗？"

#. ~ Description of mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Bring the doctor 3000 units of anesthetic.  Ask around the commune for assistance in building an anesthetic machine."
msgstr "给医生带去 3000 单位的麻醉剂。在公社里寻求协助，建造一台麻醉机。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Bring the doctor 5 pairs of medical gloves."
msgstr "给医生带去5双医用手套。"

#. ~ Description of mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Bring the doctor some crutches."
msgstr "给医生带些拐杖。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Collect Office Supplies"
msgstr "收集办公用品"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Could you help me with some bionics?"
msgstr "你能帮我安装些生化插件吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Do you have the crutches?"
msgstr "弄到拐杖了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Do you have the medical gloves?"
msgstr "弄到医用手套了吗？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
msgstr "收集 5 双医用手套"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect Office Supplies"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Have you found the supplies yet?"
msgstr "你找到办公用品了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have a few sitting around."
msgstr "医院和诊所里应该有一些丢在那里的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have some.  Labs could have some as well."
msgstr "医院或诊所里可能会有一些。实验室里也可能有一些。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I can't right now, I have other matters to attend to."
msgstr "我现在不行，我还有其他事情要处理。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I could only find one real crutch, but if you match it with this wooden one, that's just as good, right?."
msgstr "我只能找到一根真正的拐杖，但如果你把它和这个木拐杖搭配起来，那也不错吧？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "I could use your medical assistance."
msgstr "我需要你帮忙治疗一下。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I couldn't find any crutches, but I've got these handmade ones.  Will they work?"
msgstr "我这里没拐杖了，但我做了这个。也许这够用了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I need help removing an implant…"
msgstr "我需要你帮我移除生化插件……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "I need medical attention."
msgstr "我需要医疗救治。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I want to make sure we are setup to handle any major surgeries that come our way, but pain management is going to be an issue.  For longer surgeries, we're going to need some anesthetic.  Can you bring me 3000 units to start?  We're also going to need an anesthetic machine to deliver it.  Maybe some people around the commune can help with that?"
msgstr "我想确保我们已经做好了前期准备，现在可以处理重大手术了，但疼痛处理将成为问题。对于时间更长的手术，我们需要使用麻醉剂。你能先给我带个 3000 单位来吗？我们还需要一台麻醉机来输送它。也许公社里的一些人能帮忙造一台？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I was wondering if you could install a cybernetic implant…"
msgstr "我需要你帮我安装生化插件……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I'll see what I can find."
msgstr "我看看能不能找到。"

