#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "I'm counting on you."
msgstr "我就指望你了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I'm running out of office supplies.  I know… of all the things to need at a time like this!  I just need to be able to keep track of and organize medical records so that I can focus on helping people.  Ten binders and a ream of paper should tide me over until some shipments come in."
msgstr "我的办公用品快用完了。我知道……在这样的时刻居然需要这种东西！我只需要有些东西来记录和整理病历，这样我才能专心治疗大家。十个活页夹和一大摞纸应该能帮我渡过眼前的难关，直到下批货送来。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I don't have time to help you at the moment."
msgstr "抱歉，我现在没时间照应你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Is there anything else I can help with?"
msgstr "我还能帮你些什么吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Maybe I could help you with something?"
msgstr "也许我能帮你点忙？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "One of the laborers injured their foot pretty badly and I don't want them walking on it for a few days at least.  Do you think you could find a pair of crutches?"
msgstr "我们这里有个工人的脚伤得很严重，我不可想让他光着脚走路几天。你能帮我找一副拐杖来吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
