#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Ever since you got the bartender set up, our liquor business has been running so much better!  As thanks for your efforts, I wanted to reward you with a portion of recent profits."
msgstr "自从你设置了调酒师后，我们的酒类生意就运转得好多了！  为了感谢您的努力，我想用最近的利润的一部分来奖励您。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
