#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Let's see what you've managed to find."
msgstr "让我看看你都搞到些什么。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Lightweight gear that can easily be repaired is in high demand.  Could you make us some suits of leather armor?  The life expectancy of my scavengers would drastically increase if you did."
msgstr "易于维修的轻型齿轮的需求量很大。  你能为我们制作一些皮甲吗？  如果你这样做的话，我的拾荒者的预期寿命将会大大增加。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
msgstr "制造 12 个燃烧瓶"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
msgstr "制造 3 件皮革护甲"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 5 Headlamps"
msgstr "制造 5 顶头灯"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
msgstr "碳化木矛"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Night is the ideal time for my team to go on raids, but they are going to need better light sources to speed up their missions.  Could you craft a set of five headlamps for them?  Keeping both hands free greatly helps during combat."
msgstr "夜晚是我们的小队出去搜刮的好时机，但是他们想要一些更好的光源来帮助加快他们的工作。你可以制造5顶头灯给他们吗？解放了他们的双手，他们就可以在战斗中得到更大的优势了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr "不，谢了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Nope, current run hasn't returned yet.  Come back in <interval>.  You might find something you like."
msgstr "不，当前运行尚未返回。  在<间隔>内回来。  你可能会找到你喜欢的东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "现在还不行。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Mission source, shopkeep
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Scavenger Boss"
msgstr "拾荒队长"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Tell me more about the scavenging runs."
msgstr "跟我说说关于拾荒小队的事。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "They're pretty easy to make.  You can knock down young trees for long sticks, then you just need a knife and a fire to dry the tip."
msgstr "它们很容易制作。  你可以把小树砍倒成长棍，然后你只需要一把刀和一把火来烘干尖端。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "We don't have any of the parts needed right now, but we could send out a scavenging party to a hospital if you have anyone willing to go."
msgstr "我们现在没有所需要的零件，但只有有人愿意去的话，我们可以派一队人去医院搜刮一下。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Welcome to the junk shop."
msgstr "欢迎来到旧货商店。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "What kind of tasks do you have for me?"
msgstr "你有什么样的任务给我？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "When outnumbered or forced to pull back, my scavengers have been taught to throw Molotov cocktails to keep monsters from chasing them.  We go through one or two on every mission, so we can always use a few more.  Would you be willing to make us a dozen?  I'm willing to pay you what I can for your assistance."
msgstr "在寡不敌众或是被迫撤退时，我的拾荒队员们被教导要扔些燃烧瓶以避免被怪物追击。我们每次出任务都得扔一两个，所以燃烧瓶总是供不应求。你可以给我们造一打吗？我们会尽量回报你的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "You should be able to make them with the most basic of skills."
msgstr "它只要些最基本的技能就能被制造出来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "An angle grinder and a hacksaw?  I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "角磨机和钢锯？我看看我能不能弄来。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "Don't mind me."
msgstr "忙你的吧。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Tools for Scrap"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "Have you found the tools yet?"
msgstr "你找到那些工具了吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Hmm, let me think.  There might be a few things I could scrounge up to help, but it's going to take some time to sort through the scrap to find exactly what you need.  How about this… some of my tools are getting a bit worn and are in need of replacement.  If you could bring me a new angle grinder and a hacksaw, I should be able to find all the parts you need by the time you get back."
msgstr "嗯，让我想想。也许我能找到一些能帮你的东西，但要一些时间来整理这堆废品，才能找到你真正需要的东西。不如这样……我这里有些工具已经有点磨损了，需要更换。如果你能给我带来一台全新的角磨机和钢锯，我应该能在你回来时找到你需要的所有零件。"

