#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Sure, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "当然，我会看看我能做什么。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Sure.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "当然。  你之前说什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Well, I'd better go look into that."
msgstr "嗯，我最好去调查一下。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Well, I'd better go."
msgstr "好吧，我最好走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Well…\" he tugs jokingly at his collar as though letting off steam.  \"I know a bit.  I used to make pickles and jams as a hobby.  With my mom.  When I was a teenager.  But I know the principles!  And Dana knows more than you'd think about grain and flour because she's a huge nerd for her craft.  We do have some knowledge gaps between design and implementation though."
msgstr "嗯……”他开玩笑地拉着衣领，仿佛在发泄。“我知道一点。  我曾经把做泡菜和果酱作为一种爱好。  和我妈妈一起。  当我十几岁的时候。  但我知道原则！  达纳对谷物和面粉的了解比你想象的还要多，因为她是一个手艺的超级书呆子。  不过，我们在设计和实现之间确实存在一些知识差距。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "What kind of gaps?"
msgstr "什么样的差距？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Yeah, she would say that.\"  He makes intense eye contact.  \"Not just a bakery, my friend.  A real, post apocalyptic, honest-to-god culinary experience!  We're planning to grow food and crops here.  Central's plan is to import our crops directly, and pay us for our work.  I don't think they've even thought much about transport, outside just shipping them back home.  If we do local site processing we can prevent storage losses, and make higher value material to sell out!  And Central still benefits from having a dedicated bread basket!"
msgstr "是的，她会这么说。”他进行了强烈的目光接触。“不仅仅是一家面包店，我的朋友。  真正的后世界末日、诚实的烹饪体验！  我们计划在这里种植粮食和农作物。  中央的计划是直接进口我们的农作物，并支付我们的工作报酬。  我认为他们甚至没有考虑过交通，只是在外面把他们运回家。  如果我们进行本地现场处理，我们可以防止存储损失，并生产更高价值的材料来出售！  中央仍然受益于拥有专用的面包篮！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "[Ecology 4, Fabrication 4] I know how to build a good root cellar.  Here, let me show you."
msgstr "[生态学 4，制造 4] 我知道怎么建造一个优质的地窖。来，我演示给你看。"

