#. ~ Description of profession "Farmer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "A patch of soil, some water, and sunlight were all you ever needed; why should things be any different now?  With a handful of seeds and your trusty hoe, it's time to rebuild the Earth, one plant at a time."
msgstr "一小块肥沃的土壤，一些水和阳光就是你所需要的全部，即便是现在，情况又会有什么不同呢？带上一小撮种子和你那把值得信赖的锄头，现在是时候重建地球了，从种下一棵植物开始。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Farmer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "A patch of soil, some water, and sunlight were all you ever needed; why should things be any different now?  With a handful of seeds and your trusty hoe, it's time to rebuild the Earth, one plant at a time."
msgstr "一小块肥沃的土壤，一些水和阳光就是你所需要的全部，即便是现在，情况又会有什么不同呢？带上一小撮种子和你那把值得信赖的锄头，现在是时候重建地球了，从种下一棵植物开始。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Sniper" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "A top-secret military program sought to convert you into the perfect sniper.  Your bionics, equipment, and extensive field training enable you to drop targets from implausible distances, even after weeks of total isolation in enemy territory."
msgstr "一项绝密的军事计划把你变成完美的狙击手。你的生化插件，装备，数不清的战地训练足够让你在敌后渗透几个星期并且把目标在难以置信的距离放倒。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Sniper" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "A top-secret military program sought to convert you into the perfect sniper.  Your bionics, equipment, and extensive field training enable you to drop targets from implausible distances, even after weeks of total isolation in enemy territory."
msgstr "一项绝密的军事计划把你变成完美的狙击手。你的生化插件，装备，数不清的战地训练足够让你在敌后渗透几个星期并且把目标在难以置信的距离放倒。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "After being discharged from the armed forces, you were sent to a veterans' hospital for treatment.  Just when you thought you'd overcome your traumas and readjusted to civilian life, the world has come to an end and your worst nightmare has become a reality: life in an endless battlefield."
msgstr "从军队退伍后，你被送往一家退伍军人医院接受治疗。就在你认为自己已经克服了创伤并重新适应了平民生活时，世界来到了尽头，最糟糕的噩梦成为了现实：生活在无尽的战场上。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "After being discharged from the armed forces, you were sent to a veterans' hospital for treatment.  Just when you thought you'd overcome your traumas and readjusted to civilian life, the world has come to an end and your worst nightmare has become a reality: life in an endless battlefield."
