#. ~ Description of profession "Police Interceptor" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "An on-duty officer, you received the call and were ready to respond to the robbery.  It all went to shit, your backup got eaten, and you were lucky to escape with your life and patrol car."
msgstr "作为值班警官，你接到了呼救电话，准备响应抢劫案件。一切都糟透了，你的后援被吃掉了，你很幸运带着你的性命和巡逻警车逃走了。"

