#. ~ Description of profession "Hobo" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "At some point in your life, you slipped through the cracks and became homeless.  You don't have much to your name, but you've learned a thing or two about what it takes to survive."
msgstr "在你人生的某个时刻，你陷入了困境，变得无家可归。你名下没有多少财产，但你已学会了一些生存的技巧。"

