#. ~ Description of profession "Explosive Ordnance Disposal Technician" for
#. female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Ever since you were a child you were fascinated with explosives and all things that go boom.  As soon as you turned 18 you joined the army to become an EOD technician.  While out on a call about a potential explosive in the neighboring county, your team was overrun by hordes of the undead.  You are alone, with nothing but your precious training, gear and love of explosives."
msgstr "当你还是孩子时，便已沉迷于炸药和所有爆炸物。你一满十八岁就加入了军队，成为一名排爆技术员。当你为一份邻郡可能存在爆炸物的通报出勤时，您的团队被成群的不死生物淹没了。你孤身一人，身无长物，仅剩下优异的训练、装备和对炸药的热爱"

