#. ~ Description of profession "Heist Driver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "For as long as you can remember, you have lived a double life: a normal driver by the day and a heist driver in the night.  Now there are no cops and no law, but even after the Cataclysm, you drive."
msgstr "在你记忆中已经你已经在这样的双重生活中度过了很久：白天是普通司机，晚上是抢劫司机。 现在已经没有警察和法律了，但即使在大灾变后，你还是当司机。"

