#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacker" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "For the past few years you've been traveling the world, sightseeing and living off your parents' trust fund.  You came home to find the world in ruins, and the only thing between you and death is the open road and your backpack."
msgstr "在过去的几年里，你环游世界观光旅游，靠父母的信托基金生活。你回家后发现世界已成废墟，而你和死亡之间的距离只有眼前的大路和你身后的背包。"

