#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "In the rush to safety, you were separated from your master by cruel fate.  Now you are on your own, with nothing to your name but a suit of really kinky black leather.  Unfortunately, there are no safewords in the apocalypse."
msgstr "在一早的玩命大逃亡中，你和你的主人失散了。你没有名字，只有一身SM皮装。让你迷茫的是，你又可以完全掌控你自己了，你不得不一遍遍提醒自己：大灾变之后可没有安全词了！"

