#. ~ Description of profession "Police Officer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Just a small-town deputy, you got the call and were ready to come to the rescue.  Soon it was you who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape with your life.  Who's going to respect your authority when the government this badge represents might not even exist anymore?"
msgstr "你只是一名小镇的副警长，你接到了求救电话，准备前往现场。但很快你发现自己才是需要救援的那个人，你很幸运地逃了出来。当这个徽章所代表的政府已经不复存在时，谁还会尊重你的权威呢？"

