#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Small businesses often hired you for electrical work.  You were halfway through your latest job when the whole power grid went dead."
msgstr "小企业主们经常雇佣你做电气工作。你刚刚做完一单，结果整个电网都瘫痪了。"

