msgstr "你年轻的时候梦想着成为一名军人。战争就是地狱，地狱就是战争，但你从没想过会这么糟糕。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Surgeon" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Whether you worked in aesthetics, oncology, or orthopedics, you're going to have to get used to the fact that pretty much everyone with your skillset is now first and foremost a trauma surgeon."
msgstr "无论你是从事美容、肿瘤学还是骨科工作，你都得习惯这样一个事实：几乎所有拥有你这种技能的人，现在首先都是创伤外科医生。"

