#. ~ Description of profession "Rat Princess" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You probably needed psychiatric help instead of a prison sentence.  At least your loyal subjects have agreed to hold the line as you make your daring escape."
msgstr "你可能需要精神治疗而不是监禁。至少你忠诚的臣民已经同意在你大胆逃跑的时候保持中立。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rat Prince" for male
