#. ~ Description of profession "Blacksmith" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You ran into trouble coming out of class at your community college's metalsmithing program, but despite the havoc you've managed to keep ahold of some of the equipment you were carrying."
msgstr "你在参加完社区学院的金属加工培训回家时遇到了麻烦，但尽管发生了大破坏，你还是设法保管好了一些随身携带的设备。"

