#. ~ Description of profession "Guru" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned.  Normally you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure what to do about the ravenous undead."
msgstr "你用了很多年来游历世界，以增长见识变得聪慧。通常，你可以给出任何的问题的答案，但是即便是你也不知道该如何面对这些饥饿的不死生物。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Guru" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
