#. ~ Description of proficiency "Doctorate of Mycology"
#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
msgid "Extensive and detailed knowledge of the esoteric biology of fungi, to an extremely nerdy degree."
msgstr "广泛而详尽的有关真菌生物的深奥知识，早已经进入了极度枯燥乏味的领域。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
