msgstr "废土烹饪"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Cheesemaking Expert"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "Taking the basics of curdled milk and making it delicious."
msgstr "把简单的凝乳做成美食。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Food Preservation"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "The basic knowledge of ways to keep food safe for long periods of time in a post-refrigeration world."
msgstr "在无冰箱的世界里如何长时间保持食品安全的基本知识。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Cheesemaking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "The basics of curdling and coagulating milk and similar things without the wrong kinds of bacteria and mold winning out."
msgstr "制造酸奶和凝乳以及类似的东西，并避免有害细菌和霉菌滋生的基础知识。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Culinary Fermentation"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "The basics of fermenting for human consumption, including sanitary technique, avoiding harmful molds, and identifying common problems."
msgstr "将食材发酵成可供人食用的基础知识，包括卫生消毒技巧、避免有害霉菌和识别常见问题。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Brewing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "The fine art of brewing grains into beers."
msgstr "把谷物酿造成啤酒的技艺。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Winemaking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "The knowledge of how to turn sugary fruits, and occasionally vegetables, into fermented beverages."
msgstr "如何把含糖的水果，偶尔还有蔬菜变成发酵饮料的知识。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Lactofermentation"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "The microbiology of most non-alcoholic fermented edibles, from sauerkraut to sourdough."
msgstr "从酸菜到酸面团等大多数不含酒精的发酵食品的微生物学。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Canning Food"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "Using pressure canning or tinning to safely store food in sealed containers."
msgstr "使用压力罐或锡罐将食物安全地储存在密封容器中。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Curing and Drying Food"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "Using salt, smoke, and similar agents to cure or dehydrate food."
msgstr "用盐、烟熏和类似的添加剂将食物脱水。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "Winemaking"
msgstr "果酒酿造"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Patisserie Expert"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "You could have been a professional baker before the Cataclysm.  Your profiteroles are the envy of the wastelands."
msgstr "你本可以在灾难发生前成为一名专业面包师。你的甜饼是废土上令人羡慕的东西。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Breading & Battering"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "You know enough about deep frying breads and batters to do it easily without thinking about it."
msgstr "你对煎炸面包和面糊有足够的了解，不用想就可以轻松地做。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Baking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "You know the basics of baking - proportions, leavening, and things - and are less likely to make a dramatic mistake when working from memory."
msgstr "你知道烘焙的基本知识——比例、发酵和其他东西——而且在只凭记忆时，不太可能犯严重错误。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Scavenger Cooking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "You know the secrets of cooking tasty food using strange substitutions and weird things you found in a cabinet in an abandoned house."
msgstr "你知道用奇怪物质和在某个废弃民房的橱柜中发现的奇怪食材烹饪美味佳肴的秘密。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fried Desserts"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "You know the vaunted secrets of creating delicious deep fried sweets."
msgstr "你知道制作美味的油炸甜点的秘密。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Knife Skills"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "You're quite skilled at culinary knife work, making you noticeably faster at preparing meals that involve a lot of chopping."
msgstr "你很擅长各类厨刀的操作，这让你在制作需要大量切菜的菜肴时明显地快了很多。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Breadmaking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "You've baked enough bread to consider yourself an expert.  May your yeast be ever frothy."
msgstr "你烤了足够多的面包，可以把自己当作专家了。愿你的酵母永远起泡。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Food Preparation"
#: data/json/proficiencies/comestibles.json
msgid "You've done enough cooking to know the basics about how to quickly and efficiently sort your ingredients."
msgstr "你已经有足够的烹饪经验，知道如何快速有效地处理食材的基本知识。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/computers.json
msgid "Robotic Programming"
msgstr "机器人编程"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Robotic Programming"
#: data/json/proficiencies/computers.json
msgid "You're familiar with software used to compel complex machines to move on their own."
msgstr "你很熟悉那些用于驱动复杂机器自主运行的软件。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Electromagnetics"
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "A practical working knowledge of electromagnetic fields and their creation and application."
msgstr "电磁学知识和产生及应用电磁场的实战经验。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Electroshock Weapons"
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "An understanding of how to use high voltage, low-current devices to cause debilitating muscle spasms.  Includes some theoretical knowledge of how to protect yourself from these."
msgstr "了解如何通过高电压低电流设备造成肌肉痉挛使目标失去行动能力，以及如何保护自己免受这些伤害的知识。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Electronics Soldering"
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "An understanding of the skills and tools needed to create durable, effective soldered electrical connections."
msgstr "用于在电子元器件之间通过焊锡建立有效且牢固的连接的技术。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Semiconductors"
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "Basic working knowledge of using semiconductors such as diodes and transistors in electrical circuits, for switching or amplifying electrical signals."
msgstr "在电路中使用半导体（如二极管和晶体管）来切换或放大电信号的基础知识。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "Electrical Circuits"
msgstr "电子线路"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "Electromagnetics"
msgstr "电磁学"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "Electronics Soldering"
msgstr "电子焊接"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "Electroshock Weapons"
msgstr "电击武器"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Integrated Circuits"
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "Familiarity with the role of IC chips in circuit design, and ability to identify many common pre-Cataclysm ICs and understand how to use them in functional circuits."
msgstr "熟悉IC芯片在电路设计中的作用，能够识别许多常见的大灾变前生产的芯片，并理解如何在电路中使用它们。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "Integrated Circuits"
msgstr "集成电路"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Electrical Circuits"
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "Practical experience building electrical circuits, and a grasp of the principles of electrical continuity, current, voltage, and resistance."
msgstr "构建电路的实际经验，并掌握电气联通、电流、电压和电阻的原理。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/electronics.json
msgid "Semiconductors"
msgstr "半导体"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Gunsmithing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "A basic understanding of how guns are put together and what tools and materials are needed for the job."
msgstr "关于枪械制造及相关材料和工具的基础知识。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "Antique Gunsmithing"
msgstr "老式枪械制造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
