msgid "Improvised Gunmaking"
msgstr "自制枪械制造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "Principles of Gunsmithing"
msgstr "枪械制造基础"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "Revolver Gunsmithing"
msgstr "左轮枪械制造"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Spring-powered Guns and Crossbows"
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "Similar to bowyery, the art of making guns that are powered by elastic mechanisms."
msgstr "制造通过弹性装置驱动的枪械的技术，与制弓类似。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "Spring-powered Guns and Crossbows"
msgstr "弹簧枪械和弩具"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Firearm Cleaning"
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "You know how to quickly disassemble guns, clean them, and reassemble them in the field."
msgstr "你知道如何在野外快速拆卸，清洁，并重新组装枪支。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Antique Gunsmithing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "You're specifically skilled at building and repairing antique guns."
msgstr "你对如何制造和修理老式枪械有着专门的知识。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Improvised Gunmaking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "You've become an expert at putting together guns and launchers from makeshift parts."
msgstr "你已成为通过自制元件制造枪械和发射器的专家。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Revolver Gunsmithing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "You've got the know-how to make a classic Western revolver, and its many variants."
msgstr "你了解如何制造各种经典的西部左轮手枪和类似枪械。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Surgery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "Beneath the skin, the body is merely an enormously complex machine.  A trained eye can guide a steady blade through the inner workings of that machine with minimal harm to the patient."
msgstr "在皮肤之下，人体不过是一台极其复杂的机器。受过专业训练的目光，能引导稳健的手术刀穿行于这台机器的内部构造之中，并将对患者的伤害降至最低。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "Burn Care"
msgstr "烧伤护理"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "Field Medic"
msgstr "战地医生"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "Human Autopsies"
msgstr "人体解剖"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "Principles of Biology"
msgstr "生物基础"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "Surgery"
msgstr "手术"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Biology"
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "You are beginning to gain a general idea of how various living beings function."
msgstr "你开始掌握各种各样的生物如何运作的基础概念。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Human Autopsies"
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "You have been trained such that you are desensitized to the sight of a human's innards, and can dissect human corpses without penalty."
msgstr "你已经被训练得对人类的内脏不再敏感，可以不受惩罚地解剖人类尸体。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Burn Care"
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "You have some basic understanding of how burns work and (potentially) how they could be treated."
msgstr "你已经掌握了烧伤的基本原理和（可能的）治疗方法。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Field Medic"
#: data/json/proficiencies/health_care.json
msgid "You're accustomed to dressing wounds under pressure, and can apply bandages or disinfectant much more quickly."
msgstr "您习惯于在压力下包扎伤口，并且可以更快地使用绷带或消毒剂。"

