#. ~ Description of proficiency "High Pressure Systems"
#: data/json/proficiencies/mechanics.json
msgid "You know how to safely and efficiently build, repair, maintain and use various appliances that make use of high pressure."
msgstr "你知道如何安全高效地建造、维修、维护和使用各种高压设备。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Chemical Engineering"
#: data/json/proficiencies/mechanics.json
msgid "You know how to safely and efficiently build, repair, maintain and use various complex machinery that makes use of chemical processes."
msgstr "你知道如何安全高效地建造、维修、维护和使用各种化工工业的复杂机械。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Airframe and Powerplant Mechanic"
#: data/json/proficiencies/mechanics.json
msgid "You've been trained and certified to repair aircraft.  You're not really sure how that could help you survive now."
msgstr "你受过航空器的修理培训并获维修技师认证，通常被称为机身和动力装置（A＆P）机械师。但你不确定这是否能帮你活过这个末日。"

