#. ~ Description of proficiency "Skilled Knitting"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "Knitting, one of the oldest ways of making loops in fiber until it is fabric."
msgstr "针织，是在纤维上形成线圈直到形成织物的最古老的方法之一。"

