#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "Making elastic bands is easy enough, but making a whole garment from stretchy cloth takes a bit of finesse.  You're good at it."
msgstr "做橡皮筋很容易，但是用弹力面料制造整件衣服需要一些特殊技巧。你对此很在行。"

