#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "Making flexible items out of hard materials is tricky.  You've done enough of it to understand how to make smoothly articulated joints out of rigid or semi-rigid materials."
msgstr "将坚硬的材料制作成灵活的物品是非常棘手的。你已经制造了足够多的盔甲，知道如何使用刚性或半刚性材料来制造能够灵活转动的铰接关节。"

