msgid "Working with fur and faux fur is a skill all its own."
msgstr "如何处理毛皮和人造毛皮自身就是一项技能。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Skilled Leatherworking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "Working with leather requires a specific set of skills and tools… a set you are familiar with."
msgstr "制造皮革需要特定的技能和工具……你早已谙熟此道。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Garment Closures"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "You are familiar with the adjustments and tricks needed to make properly functional buttons, zippers, and other closures on garments."
msgstr "你熟悉制造合适的纽扣、拉链与其他服装收口相关的技艺。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Speed Knitting"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "You have knitted and knitted and knitted some more, and have the consistent string tension to show for it.  When you get going, the clicking of your needles is like a metronome."
msgstr "你已经不停地针织、针织、再针织，这使得你能够持续稳定地快速将线团变成织物。当你针织时，针头的敲击有如节拍器一般。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fabric Waterproofing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "You know how to make garments and fabric containers sealed against water."
msgstr "你知道如何制造各种防水服装和织物容器。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fabric Quilting"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "You know how to sew stacks of sheets together efficiently to create sturdier armor.  It's also a nice way to sew something pretty!"
msgstr "你知道如何有效地将成堆的面料缝合在一起，以制作更坚固的盔甲。这也是一种缝制漂亮东西的好方法！。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Advanced Polymer Sewing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "You know the tricks for working with Kevlar, Nomex, and other advanced polymer cloth."
msgstr "使用凯夫拉，芳纶和其他先进聚合物织物的技艺。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Leatherworking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "You've got a basic familiarity with how to work with leather, furs, hides, and similar materials."
msgstr "你对如何使用皮革、毛皮、生皮和类似材料有基本的了解。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Cobbling"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
msgid "You've learned how to construct footwear by hand."
msgstr "能像童话里的小精灵一样徒手制造鞋类装备的技艺。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Millinery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/tailoring.json
