#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Expert Debug Weakpoint"
msgstr "调试用专家弱点"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Expert Debug Weakpoint"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Expert improvement on the chance of hitting the Weakpoint Monster's weak points."
msgstr "极大提高命中弱点怪物弱点的几率。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Triffid detailed anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Extensive study of triffids has provided you with a good understanding of their strengths and weaknesses when it comes to combat.  A scientific study of them might yield further biological insights, but you don't have the time to spend years cooped up in a lab."
msgstr "对三足动物的广泛研究使您能够很好地了解它们在战斗中的优势和劣势。  对它们进行科学研究可能会产生进一步的生物学见解，但你没有时间在实验室里呆上几年。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hymenopteran Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Familiarity with the comparative anatomy of mutant Hymenopterans - ants, bees, and wasps of all kinds.  You find it easier to exploit their weak points, and possibly disable their natural weaponry."
msgstr "你对各种膜翅昆虫有所了解，蚂蚁、蜜蜂、黄蜂之类。你能够找到它们的弱点，并瘫痪它们天生的武器。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Fungaloid basic anatomy"
msgstr "真菌体构造基础"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Fungaloid detailed anatomy"
msgstr "真菌体构造专精"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Giant Humanoids"
msgstr "巨型人型生物"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Hymenopteran Anatomy"
msgstr "膜翅昆虫构造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Invertebrate Biology"
msgstr "无脊椎生物学"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Mi-go basic anatomy"
msgstr "米·戈构造基础"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Mi-go detailed anatomy"
msgstr "米·戈构造专精"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Natural Armors"
msgstr "天然护甲"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Netherium Abominations"
msgstr "异界生物构造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Ossified Exoskeletons"
msgstr "骨化生物构造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Small Humanoids"
msgstr "小型人型生物"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Triffid basic anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Study of triffids has given you insights into their anatomy that allows you to aim for some weak spots."
msgstr "对三叉戟的研究使您能够深入了解它们的解剖结构，从而使您能够瞄准一些弱点。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Synthetic Armors"
msgstr "人造护甲"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Undead Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "The so-called walking dead are in fact alive.  They do not breathe and most do not eat, but their hearts still pump putrid blood to their rotting muscles, and if they bleed, they can be killed."
msgstr "所谓的“行尸”其实是活着的。它们不呼吸，大多数也不进食，但它们的心脏仍在向腐烂的肌肉输送污浊的血液；如果流血，它们便会被杀死。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Anatomy of Amalgamations"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "These twisted chimeras are each unique, yet follow a reliable set of underlying biological principles which can still be exploited."
msgstr "这些扭曲的嵌合体虽各不相同，却遵循着一套可靠的底层生物学原理，而这些原理依然可资利用。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Triffid basic anatomy"
msgstr "三尖树构造基础"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Triffid detailed anatomy"
msgstr "三尖树构造专精"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Undead Anatomy"
msgstr "不死生物解剖学"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Synthetic Armors"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Understanding of man-made armors and ways to exploit them.  You're able to find openings in certain kinds of body armor."
msgstr "对各类人造护甲的了解，以及如何利用它们的缺点。你可以找到某些护甲的弱点。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Beetle Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You are familiar with the anatomy of mutated beetles - bypassing their thick armor should be easier."
msgstr "你对那些变异甲虫有所了解。你能够绕开它们厚重的甲壳。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Centipede Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You are familiar with the anatomy of mutated centipedes, letting you target their less-deadly parts with ease."
msgstr "你对那些变异蜈蚣有所了解。你能够瞄准它们不太危险的部位。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Arachnid Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You are familiar with the anatomy of mutated spiders of all shapes and sizes."
msgstr "你对各种形状大小的蜘蛛有所了解。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fungaloid detailed anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You have advanced your understanding of the fungaloid body sufficiently to have a pretty good idea of where you can harm it and where it's better protected.  You don't really understand it's biological functions, although it seems it would be possible for someone with much more time than you have to glean some insight into it, but you've gotten an understanding of how to hurt it, and that's what's important here."
msgstr "您对类真菌体的了解已经足够深入，可以很好地了解在哪里可以伤害它以及在哪里可以更好地保护它。  你并不真正了解它的生物学功能，尽管对于一个比你有更多时间的人来说似乎有可能收集一些关于它的见解，但你已经了解了如何伤害它，这就是这里重要的。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Netherium Abominations"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You have extensive experience with netherium abominations which provides you with a vague sense of where more vulnerable spots might be."
msgstr "你对幽冥憎恶有着丰富的经验，这让你对哪里可能是更脆弱的地方有一个模糊的感觉。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Giant Humanoids"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You have some practice in fighting large, hulking humanoids.  You're better at reaching certain weak points."
msgstr "你有着对抗巨型人型生物的经验。你更容易利用某些弱点。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Small Humanoids"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You have some practice in fighting small humanoids like children.  You don't necessarily feel good about it."
msgstr "你有着对抗诸如儿童之类的小型人型生物的经验。虽然你觉得未必能用得上。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fungaloid basic anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You have studied fungaloids sufficiently to get an idea of which parts are the more sensitive ones.  While seeming to be a weird mixture of fungus and animal, it at least has a structure with commonalities between different types of fungaloids."
msgstr "你已经对真菌进行了充分的研究，了解其弱点所在。虽然看起来是真菌和动物的奇怪混合物，但它至少和地球上一些不同类型的真菌之间有着共同的结构。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Mi-go basic anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You have studied mi-go sufficiently to get a sense for where some sensitive points might be.  However, its biology remains too different from life originating on Earth to be understood to any extent."
msgstr "你已经对米戈进行了充分的研究，了解了其弱点所在。然而，它的生理结构与地球上的生命有巨大差别，使你完全无法理解其构造。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Ossified Exoskeletons"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You're familiar with creatures presenting unsettling bones on their outer structure."
msgstr "你对那些在外部结构上长着可怕骨头的生物十分熟悉。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Cyborg Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You're somewhat familiar with cybernetic creatures.  You're able to find openings and gaps that aren't as hardened."
msgstr "你对那些生化改造过的生物有所了解。你能够找到某些坚固装甲上的弱点。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Natural Armors"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "You're somewhat familiar with naturally armored creatures.  You're able to find openings in certain kinds of hardened shells and thick hides."
msgstr "你对那些长着天然护甲的生物有所了解。你能够找到某些坚固甲壳和硬化兽皮中的弱点。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Mi-go detailed anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Your understanding of the mi-go body is advanced enough to have a decent idea of where it is more sensitive to harm.  This does not mean you have any significant understanding of how it works internally; if anything, your dissections have just left you more confused."
msgstr "你对 mi-go 身体的了解已经足够深入，能够清楚地知道哪里对伤害更敏感。  这并不意味着您对其内部工作原理有任何深入的了解；如果说有什么不同的话，那就是你的解剖让你更加困惑了。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Archer's Form (Expert)"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "After significant practice, you have become experienced in the movements used in drawing and firing a bow, and have strengthened those muscles considerably."
msgstr "经过大量的练习，你已经成为拉弓射箭的专家，并且大大锻炼了相关肌肉群。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Archer's Form"
msgstr "弓术基础"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Archer's Form (Expert)"
msgstr "弓术专家"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Archer's Form (Master)"
msgstr "弓术大师"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Basic Tanning"
msgstr "鞣制基础"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Fiber Twisting"
msgstr "编线"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Ropemaking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Making twisted fibers into durable and useful rope."
msgstr "把编织线制成更加耐用且有用的绳索的技艺。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Ropemaking"
msgstr "制绳"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Skilled Tanning"
msgstr "熟练鞣制"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Skilled Tanning"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "You have a lot of practice and experience with processing hides to leather, as well as related techniques like making boiled leather."
msgstr "你有很多将生皮加工成皮革的实践经验，并掌握了各种鞣制皮革的技巧，比如煮制皮革。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Archer's Form (Master)"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "You have drawn and fired a bow so many times, you probably have a bit of a twist in your spine from it.  You've developed at least a professional-level understanding of the pose and motion of effective archery."
msgstr "你已经拉了无数次弓，射了无数次箭，已经形成了脊椎反射。你对有效射箭的姿势和动作至少有了专业水平的理解。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Archer's Form"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "You have grasped some basic understanding on archery, and find handling bows easier."
msgstr "你已经掌握了射箭的一些基本知识，这让操作弓箭变得更容易。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Basic Tanning"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "You're familiar with the theory behind turning raw hides into leather."
msgstr "你熟悉把生皮鞣制成皮革的理论。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fiber Twisting"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "You've got a basic grasp of the theory of how to twist and arrange fibers into a more durable cord."
msgstr "把纤维缠绕编织成更耐用的线材的技艺。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/woodworking.json
msgid "Basic Carpentry"
msgstr "木工基础"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/woodworking.json
msgid "Hobbyist Luthier"
msgstr "发烧友"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hobbyist Luthier"
#: data/json/proficiencies/woodworking.json
msgid "Simple projects involving creating musical instruments out of wood."
msgstr "涉及用木头制作乐器的简单项目。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Basic Carpentry"
#: data/json/proficiencies/woodworking.json
msgid "Simple projects involving holding planks and panels of wood together with nails or similar fasteners."
msgstr "你会用钉子或类似的扣件把木板和木板固定在一起的简单技术。"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_beds_0"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_beds.json
msgid "We should build a pair of beds in the northern shack for our survivors."
msgstr "我们应该在营地北侧为幸存者造一对床铺。"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_beds_1"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_beds.json
msgid "We should build a pair of beds in the southern shack for our survivors."
msgstr "我们应该在营地南侧为幸存者造一对床铺。"

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_beds_0"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_beds.json
msgid "pair of beds in the northern shack"
msgstr "北侧营地床铺"

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_beds_1"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_beds.json
msgid "pair of beds in the southern shack"
msgstr "南侧营地床铺"

