#. ~ Description of scenario "Abandoned" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Accident or illness left you under intensive care.  When your hospital was overrun, you were considered a lost cause and left behind.  You awaken to the sound of movement around the hospital."
msgstr "天生的药罐子和病秧子，你在各家医院的病房中度过了大部分的生命。在医院集体疏散时，你因为他们认为你注定活不了多久而被遗弃。但你被医院周围的动静惊醒。"

