#. ~ Description of scenario "Golden Years" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "After a lifetime of hard work, you managed to settle down in a posh retirement community.  You saw the riots on the news but assumed they would have no reason to attack some harmless old folks.  That assumption was proven wrong by a group of lunatics breaking in, leaving you no choice but to deal with them personally.  Welcome to your golden years."
msgstr "经过一生的辛勤工作，你终于在一个豪华的退休社区安定下来。你在新闻上看到了骚乱，但认为他们没有理由去袭击一些无害的老人。这一假设被一群闯入的疯子证明是错误的，你别无选择，只能亲自对付他们。欢迎来到你的黄金岁月。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Golden Years" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "After a lifetime of hard work, you managed to settle down in a posh retirement community.  You saw the riots on the news but assumed they would have no reason to attack some harmless old folks.  That assumption was proven wrong by a group of lunatics breaking in, leaving you no choice but to deal with them personally.  Welcome to your golden years."
msgstr "经过一生的辛勤工作，你终于在一个豪华的退休社区安定下来。你在新闻上看到了骚乱，但认为他们没有理由去袭击一些无害的老人。这一假设被一群闯入的疯子证明是错误的，你别无选择，只能亲自对付他们。欢迎来到你的黄金岁月。"

