msgid "As the world was falling apart around you, something shook you out of your stupor: Someone, somewhere, placed an order for a meal delivery."
msgstr "当世界在你周围分崩离析时，某件事将你从恍惚中惊醒：某人在某处下了一单外卖订单。"

