#. ~ Description of scenario "Unliving History" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "New England is dotted with old forts from the Revolutionary War, and many of them are still standing.  When things started getting really bad, it seemed like a natural place to hole up for a while, and it turns out that many, many other people had the same idea.  The peace didn't last long.  Now everyone else is undead, and you're trapped inside the walls with them.  The single entrance being a tight choke point is looking a lot less useful now…"
msgstr "新英格兰地区遍布革命战争时期的旧堡垒，其中许多堡垒仍然存在。当事情开始变得非常糟糕时，这似乎是一个自然平静的地方，可以供人躲避一段时间。事实证明，许多，许多的其他人有同样的想法。和平并没有持续很久。现在其他人都成了亡灵，而你和他们一起被困在墙里。唯一的入口是一个狭小的阻塞点，现在看起来也不那么有用了……"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Unliving History" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "New England is dotted with old forts from the Revolutionary War, and many of them are still standing.  When things started getting really bad, it seemed like a natural place to hole up for a while, and it turns out that many, many other people had the same idea.  The peace didn't last long.  Now everyone else is undead, and you're trapped inside the walls with them.  The single entrance being a tight choke point is looking a lot less useful now…"
msgstr "新英格兰地区遍布革命战争时期的旧堡垒，其中许多堡垒仍然存在。当事情开始变得非常糟糕时，这似乎是一个自然平静的地方，可以供人躲避一段时间。事实证明，许多，许多的其他人有同样的想法。和平并没有持续很久。现在其他人都成了亡灵，而你和他们一起被困在墙里。唯一的入口是一个狭小的阻塞点，现在看起来也不那么有用了……"

