#. ~ Description of scenario "Lone Survivor" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "You are the only one that made it.  Everyone else died nearby.  You have to get out of here!"
msgstr "你是唯一一个成功的人。 其他人都死在附近。 你必须离开这里！"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Lone Survivor" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
