msgid "You are the only one that made it.  Everyone else died nearby.  You have to get out of here!"
msgstr "你是唯一一个成功的人。 其他人都死在附近。 你必须离开这里！"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Car Crash" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled cities.  While en route to your destination, you were involved in a crash that totaled your vehicle.  Injured and alone, you'll need to think fast if you want to survive."
msgstr "你认为郊外道路比充满丧尸的城市更有前景。在前往目的地的途中，你卷入了一场车祸，导致你的车完全报废。受伤又孤独，你得动动脑才能活下来。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Car Crash" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled cities.  While en route to your destination, you were involved in a crash that totaled your vehicle.  Injured and alone, you'll need to think fast if you want to survive."
msgstr "你认为郊外道路比充满丧尸的城市更有前景。在前往目的地的途中，你卷入了一场车祸，导致你的车完全报废。受伤又孤独，你得动动脑才能活下来。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Close Encounter" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "You don't know what it was but you managed to lose it for the time being.  Now you are injured, surrounded and the building is on fire.  You hope you have some time before it returns to finish the job."
msgstr "你不知那究竟是什么，但已暂时将其甩脱。如今你身负重伤、陷入重围，四周的建筑物正烈火熊熊。但愿在你彻底解决此事前，它不会立刻卷土重来。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Close Encounter" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "You don't know what it was but you managed to lose it for the time being.  Now you are injured, surrounded and the building is on fire.  You hope you have some time before it returns to finish the job."
msgstr "你不知那究竟是什么，但已暂时将其甩脱。如今你身负重伤、陷入重围，四周的建筑物正烈火熊熊。但愿在你彻底解决此事前，它不会立刻卷土重来。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Fungal Infection" for female
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Fungal Infection" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "You feel spores crawling beneath your skin.  It's only a matter of time."
msgstr "你感觉到孢子在你皮肤下爬行。死亡不过是个时间问题。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Fungal Infection" for male
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Fungal Infection" for male
