#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_2>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"-for understanding.  I was too jumbled up to find the right words, so I want to make it clear now:  I don't want to end our arrangement, I just need a break.  I actually think I could use physical intimacy now more than ever, so if you're alright with just cuddling-\""
msgstr "“——为了理解。我太混乱了，找不到合适的词语，所以我现在想澄清一下：我不想结束我们的安排，我只是需要休息一下。我实际上认为我现在比以往任何时候都更能利用身体上的亲密关系，所以如果你只是拥抱就可以了——”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_1>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"-how are you recovering?  They tried to get on us about testing times, I told them they can eat my entire ass.  If they don't want delays they will keep those jackboot bastards from breaking someone's fucking jaw.  I also put in an order for-\""
msgstr "“——你恢复得怎么样了？他们试图向我们询问测试时间，我告诉他们他们可以吃掉我的整个屁股。如果他们不想拖延，他们会阻止那些长筒靴混蛋打断别人的下巴。我还下了订单——”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_1>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"-look, I know we're all wigging out.  But you have got to remember to eat something.  Set an alarm if you have to, just-\""
msgstr "“——听着，我知道我们都精疲力尽了。但你必须记住吃点东西。如果有必要的话，设置闹钟，只是——”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_1>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"-they said that the temporal distortion will never reach more than 10 seconds.  It's been Saturday for three days.\""
msgstr "“——他们说时间扭曲永远不会超过10秒。周六已经三天了。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_sad_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"AT LEAST PROMETHEUS HAD A NICE VIEW AND A FUCKING EAGLE FOR COMPANY\""
msgstr "“至少普罗米修斯有美丽的风景，还有一只该死的老鹰陪伴”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_sad_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"And when we saw the vastness of our works, we wept.  For there was no more death to become.\""
msgstr "“当我们看到我们的作品之浩瀚时，我们哭了。因为不再有死亡了。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"At this point?  The only reason I haven't killed myself is because they'd make you guys work even harder to make up for me.  So yeah.  Not doing great.\""
msgstr "“现在？我没有自杀的唯一原因是因为他们会让你们更加努力地工作来弥补我。所以是的。做得不太好。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"BEWARE THE PHANTOM OF THE ASSAY\""
msgstr "“当心化验的幽灵”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Because it's a stupid fucking acronym, is why.  Someone sat down and thought 'how do we make people take our DOUBLE SECRET agency seriously?  I know!  X's are super cool, right?  It's embarrassing.\""
msgstr "“因为这是一个愚蠢的缩写词，这就是为什么。有人坐下来想‘我们如何让人们认真对待我们的双重秘密机构？我知道！X 超级酷，对吧？这很尴尬。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_1>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Dear mom.  How are you doing?  I hope this message finds you alive, because by the time it gets to you I will be fuckin' dead.\""
msgstr "“亲爱的妈妈。你好吗？我希望这条信息能发现你还活着，因为当它到达你那里时我他妈的已经死了。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Finished refitting the experiment chamber card readers.  It's just us in there now.  I don't think the soldiers want to risk undoing it, if it means possibly compromising the device.\""
msgstr "“完成了实验室读卡器的改装。现在只有我们在里面。我认为士兵们不想冒险拆除它，如果这意味着可能会损害设备。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_1>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Had the dream again.  An ocean, as far as the eye can see.  Gently rolling waves.  All of it, photons.\""
msgstr "“又做了那个梦。一片海洋，一望无际。海浪轻轻翻滚。这一切，都是光子。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"How do you stop a coordinate transformer from squeaking?  Make sure you have an Euler handy!'"
msgstr "“如何阻止坐标变换器发出吱吱声？确保手边有一个欧拉！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_2>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I can answer that for you, actually.  He's what those of us who took two semesters of psych 12 years ago call a 'fucking asshole'.\""
msgstr "“事实上，我可以回答你这个问题。他就是我们这些12年前学了两个学期心理学的人所说的‘该死的混蛋’。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_2>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I can't remember loving this project.  I know that I did; I was so excited.  We were going to change the world.  But I cannot remember the feeling of anything other than hate.\""
msgstr "“我不记得自己喜欢这个项目。我知道我喜欢这个项目；我太兴奋了。我们要改变世界。但我不记得除了仇恨之外的任何感觉。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I hate to be the devil's advocate, but; they're trapped as well.  It's easy to resent them for at least having the sun, but isn't having freedom that much closer and still beyond reach maddening as well?\""
msgstr "“我讨厌成为魔鬼的拥护者，但是；他们也被困住了。人们很容易因为他们至少拥有阳光而怨恨他们，但拥有如此近在咫尺却又遥不可及的自由不是也令人抓狂吗？”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I just don't get what's in this for Kim.  He says he won't be in any more trouble if they bust him for smuggling stuff for us on top of his own, but we have nothing to offer him in exchange.  I'd like to believe he's just a good guy, but I don't have that luxury anymore.\""
msgstr "“我只是不明白这对金来说意味着什么。他说，如果他们抓获他，除了他自己之外，还为我们走私东西，他不会再遇到任何麻烦，但我们没有什么可以提供给他作为交换。我愿意相信他只是一个好人，但我不再有那种奢侈了。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_raving_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I just wanted to help\""
msgstr "我只是想谈谈。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I never believed I would miss fast food at all, let alone this much.  I would do terrible things for a single bite of cheap, dubious hamburger.\""
msgstr "“我从来不相信我会想念快餐，更不用说这么想念了。为了一口便宜的、可疑的汉堡，我会做出可怕的事情。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_2>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I wiped the last of the documentation drives last night.  I think we all know that if they replace us, it won't be because we've been let go and allowed to resume our lives.  Now they no longer have that option.\""
msgstr "“我昨晚擦除了最后一个文档驱动器。我想我们都知道，如果他们取代我们，那不会是因为我们被解雇并允许恢复我们的生活。现在他们不再有这个选择。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I wonder what they've told my children.  I hope it's that I am dead.  The alternative, that they think I abandoned them?  I would rather BE dead.\""
msgstr "“我想知道他们对我的孩子们说了什么。我希望我死了。或者，他们认为我抛弃了他们？我宁愿死了。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_raving_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I'm NOT fucking sorry.\""
msgstr "\"我饿了。\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"I've got a cask of the finest paradimensional research in my cellar.  Would you like a taste, Fortunato?\""
msgstr "“我的地窖里有一桶最优秀的平行维度研究成果。你想尝尝吗，福尔图纳托？”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"If anyone finds this message; send more fucking tomatoes.\""
msgstr "“如果有人发现这条信息，就送更多该死的西红柿。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"If there was a nuclear war, would anyone remember we're down here?  Has there been one already, and they just haven't told us?\""
msgstr "“如果发生核战争，有人会记得我们在这里吗？已经发生过一场核战争，只是他们没有告诉我们吗？”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_raving_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"It's EtERNITy in there\""
msgstr "\"有人在吗？\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_2>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"It's getting bad up there.  The soldiers seem tense, a little shocked.  I don't think they're allowed any news either, so it must be something they can see happening.\""
msgstr "“那里的情况越来越糟糕。士兵们看起来很紧张，有点震惊。我认为他们也不允许有任何消息，所以这一定是他们能看到正在发生的事情。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Kim spent his last takeout order on us, enough to give us leftovers for days.  He got it from Ping's.  He remembers I said their siu mai are made the real way.  I don't understand.\""
msgstr "“金把最后一份外卖给了我们，足够我们吃几天的剩菜了。他是从平家买的。他记得我说他们的烧麦是正宗的。我不明白。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Listen, I am very pleased for you two, in the abstract.  I just would like you to remember that your room shares a ventilation duct with mine.  A note on my door would be nice if you have plans for an evening.\""
msgstr "“听着，抽象地说，我为你们两个感到非常高兴。我只是希望你们记住，你们的房间与我的房间共用一个通风管道。如果你们晚上有计划，在我的门上贴一张便条会很好。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_1>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Listen, I know it's upsetting, and I agree.  You're right that there's no way a cat could cause any real problems down here.  But, and I apologize for the cold comfort; this way, you can be sure Yujin will see the sun again.  Cats need sun to be happy.\""
msgstr "“听着，我知道这令人心烦意乱，我同意。你是对的，猫不可能在这里造成任何真正的问题。但是，我为寒冷的安慰而道歉；这样，你就可以确定Yujin会再次看到阳光。猫需要阳光才能快乐。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"No, you can't get high off air freshener, you dumbass.  I just miss the smell of living things.  Cheap fake pine in close enough.\""
msgstr "“不，你不能因为空气清新剂而兴奋，你这个笨蛋。我只是想念生物的气味。廉价的假松木就在附近。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Something is wrong.  I don't think the compression factor numbers are a bug or error.  I think we've lost control of this thing entirely.\""
msgstr "“出了点问题。我不认为压缩因子数字是错误或错误。我认为我们已经完全失去了对这件事的控制。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_raving_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"THEY BURIED US ALIVE\""
msgstr "“他们把我们活埋了”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"The last I heard, dad was very sick.  That was 8 months ago.  What am I SUPPOSED to think?\""
msgstr "“我最后一次听到爸爸病得很重。那是八个月前的事了。我应该怎么想？”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"The outside has been closed for repairs.  Thank you for your patience.\""
msgstr "“外部已关闭进行维修，感谢您的耐心等待。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_2>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"They must have done something to Keaton.  The soldiers seem very upset with us.  As though it's our fault he couldn't keep his temper?\""
msgstr "“他们肯定对基顿做了什么。士兵们似乎对我们很不满。他无法控制自己的脾气，好像是我们的错？”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_1>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"They've been telling us the lockdown is temporary for three weeks.  Now they're saying we need escorts to even go to the surface level and get some damn sun.  How much more-\""
msgstr "“他们一直告诉我们，封锁只是暂时的，为期三周。现在他们又说，我们甚至需要护送才能到地表晒晒太阳。更何况——”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_raving_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"To whoever finds this; tell my children I loved them.  You owe me that.  you owe me that YOU OWE ME THAT\""
msgstr "“无论谁找到这个，请告诉我的孩子们，我爱他们。这是你欠我的。你欠我的，你欠我的”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_sad_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"WHAT was WRONG with just doing EINSTEIN?\""
msgstr "“仅仅研究爱因斯坦有什么问题吗？”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Whatever is happening up there, it's not our fault.  We cannot be responsible for the ways other people use our research.  Any scientist who has ever lived has only been able to hope their work is used well.  The work must be done, regardless.\""
msgstr "“无论那里发生什么，这都不是我们的错。我们不能对其他人使用我们的研究成果的方式负责。任何曾经生活过的科学家都只能希望他们的工作能够得到很好的利用。无论如何，工作都必须完成。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_raving_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Whoever leaves last, please get the lights before you go.\""
msgstr "“谁最后离开，请在走之前把灯拿好。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "\"Yeah, now I'm sure.  Someone has been stealing my underwear.  Next briefing, we tell them we either get onsite laundry installed, or we forget to turn the device off and they can deal with the power bill.\""
msgstr "“是的，现在我确定了。有人偷了我的内衣。在下一次简报中，我们告诉他们我们要么在现场安装洗衣设施，要么我们忘记关闭设备，他们可以处理电费。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "After analysis, the signal extracted from the beat frequency run S2848 has been judged to be a statistical anomaly of the sort expected in exodimensional transit compressions.  Requests for testing halt have been denied.  I know it was spooky, but it didn't mean anything.  Stay focused."
msgstr "经过分析，从拍频运行 S2848 中提取的信号被判断为外维度传输压缩中预期的统计异常。  停止测试的请求已被拒绝。  我知道这很恐怖，但这没有任何意义。  保持专注。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "After last week's decompression event, all onsite personnel must find a spot on the weekly schedule for offsite transit and further testing.  This schedule will be rotated in five-hour blocks.  You may consider your requests for a timeline update to accommodate these interruptions already filed.  I'm working on it, people."
msgstr "在上周的减压活动之后，所有现场人员必须在每周计划中找到一个地点进行场外转运和进一步测试。  该时间表将按五个小时轮换一次。  您可以考虑更新时间表的请求，以适应已提交的这些中断。  我正在努力，各位。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_notes"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Coordinate distension not to exceed 7 steps under ANY CIRCUMSTANCES."
msgstr "在任何情况下协调扩张不超过 7 步。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_notes"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Corporal Dickass is on the warpath about something.  For god's sake, keep your mouth SHUT during the debrief this week."
msgstr "迪卡斯下士因为某件事而大发雷霆。  看在上帝的份上，本周的汇报期间请闭嘴。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_mil_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Deliveries of food and goods from civilian sources is being suspended as of Thursday, March 17th.  Offsite control has agreed to arrange one more handoff before suspension.  Personnel are advised to make it count."
msgstr "自 3 月 17 日星期四起，暂停从民用来源运送食品和货物。  场外控制已同意在暂停前再安排一次交接。  建议工作人员进行计数。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_mil_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Effective immediately, all offsite transit has been suspended indefinitely."
msgstr "即日起，所有场外运输均已无限期暂停。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_notes"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "I've got a keycard for the stairwell.  Meet me tonight, usual location.  REMEMBER TO BURN THIS NOTE."
msgstr "我有一张楼梯间的钥匙卡。  今晚在惯常地点见我。  记住烧掉这张纸条。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_mil_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "In the interest of squad cohesion, all investigation into the perpetrators of Tuesday's incident has been suspended.  The new duty roster reflects an understanding that it will not, under any circumstances, be repeated.  The eggheads are not replaceable.  You are."
msgstr "为了保持团队凝聚力，对周二事件肇事者的所有调查均已暂停。  新的值班表反映了一种谅解，即在任何情况下都不会重复。  蛋头是不可更换的。  你是。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_notes"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Mirror three's developed a nm fault again.  However we're machining them, we need them to do better."
msgstr "第三镜再次出现纳米故障。  无论我们如何加工它们，我们都需要它们做得更好。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_notes"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "New stuff's coming in.  It's inside the battery housings of the new soldering irons.  REMEMBER TO BURN THIS NOTE."
msgstr "新东西即将到来。它位于新型烙铁的电池盒内。  记住烧掉这张纸条。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_mil_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Offsite leisure has been suspended for the duration of this change of command.  Leisure hours will not accrue during this time."
msgstr "在指挥权变更期间，场外休闲活动已暂停。  在此期间不会累积休闲时间。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_notes"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "POKER NIGHT THURSDAY"
msgstr "周四扑克之夜"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Personnel are reminded that unmonitored outside contact will result in disciplinary measures.  I understand that you are upset, but as has been stressed before, this is a temporary measure until the situation stabilizes."
msgstr "提醒工作人员，不受监控的外部接触将导致纪律处分。  我理解你的不安，但正如之前所强调的，这是临时措施，直到局势稳定下来。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_mil_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Protection of onsite research personnel is still considered a primary objective.  Termination of research personnel via action or negligence will be grounds for immediate discharge."
msgstr "保护现场研究人员仍然被视为首要目标。  研究人员因行为或疏忽而被解雇将成为立即解雇的理由。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "The equipment malfunction has been resolved.  The return waveform was delayed by 39h 26m 12s.  Adjusting from beat frequency, this is a displacement of 4.24e10 km."
msgstr "设备故障已解决。  返回波形延迟了39h 26m 12s。  根据拍频调整，位移为 4.24e10 km。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "The phase difference between the cesium clocks on the device floor and at surface level has lowered to 6 seconds, suggesting a cyclic temporal displacement.  As the displacement remains under the caution threshold of 10 seconds, operation and maintenance will continue as normal."
msgstr "设备地板上的铯钟和表面水平的铯钟之间的相位差已降至 6 秒，表明存在周期性时间位移。  由于排水量仍低于10秒的警告阈值，操作和维护将继续正常进行。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_files"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "The source of the testing wavelength shift has been identified.  A fault had developed in the vacuum casing of the laser chambers, allowing a small amount of ambient atmosphere in.  These were subsequently expanded on crossing the resonator threshold.  (I don't know what a stretched air molecule looks like either.)  Further tests awaiting approval."
msgstr "测试波长偏移的来源已被确定。  激光室的真空外壳出现故障，导致少量环境大气进入。这些故障随后在跨越谐振器阈值时扩大。  （我也不知道拉伸的空气分子是什么样子。）进一步的测试正在等待批准。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "There is a large line sketch, in marker, of a tall wardrobe's closed doors here."
msgstr "这里有一个用记号笔画的大线条草图，画的是一个高衣柜关着的门。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_notes"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "There is an intricate pen drawing of a whale on this post-it note."
msgstr "这把勺子的手柄上有一个可爱的卡通熊。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_notes"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a cartoony pen drawing of a pigtailed woman in a dirndl, smiling a gaptoothed grin while playing an accordion.  Underneath are the words 'LIXA PLAYS THE CLASSICS!!!'"
msgstr "这是一幅卡通钢笔画，画的是一位穿着紧身连衣裙、扎着辫子的女人，一边拉着手风琴，一边咧着大牙笑着。  下面写着“LIXA 演奏经典！！！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a detailed drawing of a humpback whale.  An obvious addition from a different artist has added what looks like sunglasses.  The visible arm is comically short, and the nose bridge extends over the top of the whale.  Possibly a third hand has added the words \"From hell's heart I chill with thee!\""
msgstr "这是座头鲸的详细绘图。  来自不同艺术家的明显添加添加了看起来像太阳镜的东西。  可见的手臂短得滑稽，鼻梁延伸到鲸鱼的顶部。  可能是第三只手添加了这样的话：“发自地狱的心，我与你同在！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a drawing of a horned, ogre-like creature sitting in an arm chair, wearing a small pair of reading glasses and holding what is presumably a normal sized book delicately between each finger and thumb.  Underneath are the words \"But how does he turn the pages?\", followed, in a different hand, by \"Carefully.\""
msgstr "这幅画描绘了一个长角、食人魔般的生物，坐在扶手椅上，戴着一副小老花镜，每根手指和拇指都小心地拿着一本大概是正常大小的书。  下面是“但是他如何翻页？”，后面是另一只手写的“小心翼翼”。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a drawing, combined together from several people's contributions.  The result is a deeply unflattering caricature of a soldier skipping down a road, alongside the words KEATON ON HIS WAY TO BUY MORE PAINT CHIPS."
msgstr "这是一张由几个人的贡献组合在一起的图画。  结果是一幅非常不讨人喜欢的漫画，描绘了一名士兵在路上跳跃，旁边写着“基顿正在去购买更多油漆碎片”的字样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a random page from what appears to be an original work of erotic fiction.  The things described here seem anatomically unlikely, at best."
msgstr "这是随机的一页，似乎是色情小说的原创作品。  这里描述的事情充其量在解剖学上似乎不太可能。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a saved file that opens in a digital painting program.  All it contains are the words THEY BURIED US ALIVE in shaky handwriting."
msgstr "这是一个保存的文件，可在数字绘画程序中打开。  里面只有用颤抖的笔迹写着“他们把我们活埋了”。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a saved file that opens in a digital painting program.  It is a crude cartoon of a woman in a suit with a manic expression, and a word balloon saying \"WIBBLEY WOBBLEY, SPACEY-WACEY, STUFF\"."
msgstr "这是一个保存的文件，可在数字绘画程序中打开。  这是一幅粗制滥造的漫画，画的是一个穿着西装、表情狂躁的女人，还有一个文字气球，上面写着“WIBBLEY WOBBLEY，SPACEY-WACEY，STUFF”。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_2>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a saved file that opens in a digital painting program.  The linework, and some shading, has been done on a painting of a long-furred cat."
msgstr "这是一个保存的文件，可在数字绘画程序中打开。  线条和一些阴影是在一幅长毛猫的画上完成的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_sad_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a sketchy portrait in permanent marker of a man in military body armor.  His face is blotted out by an angry snarl of ink.  Underneath is the word KIM."
msgstr "这是一幅身穿军用防弹衣的男子用永久性记号笔绘制的粗略肖像。  他的脸被墨水愤怒的咆哮遮住了。  下面是“KIM”一词。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a spreadsheet containing the info for a Blobs & Bandits character named Antigone.  They are apparently some sort of psychic specializing in area-of-effect attacks, and have a pet 'shrike worm' named Scylla."
msgstr "这是一个电子表格，其中包含名为 Antigone 的 Blobs & Bandits 角色的信息。  他们显然是某种专门从事区域攻击的通灵者，并且有一只名为 Scylla 的宠物“伯劳虫”。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_2>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a spreadsheet that passes several cells of what look like poker hands through a mathematical function, directing them to a cell with the heading CHEATCHANCE and the number 77."
msgstr "这是一个电子表格，通过数学函数传递几个看起来像扑克牌的单元格，将它们定向到标题为 CEATCHANCE 和数字 77 的单元格。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_4>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a text document.  All it contains are the words SPACE IS A WASTE TIME IS A CRIME several thousand times."
msgstr "这是一个文本文档。  它包含的只是“空间是浪费，时间是犯罪”这句话数千次。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_3>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a text file containing a very large ASCII image of a dog wearing glasses."
msgstr "这是一个文本文件，其中包含一个戴着眼镜的狗的非常大的 ASCII 图像。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_sad_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is a very large and extremely detailed drawing of a long-furred black cat.  It must have taken a very long time.  Underneath are the words 'someone still remembers yu'."
msgstr "这是一幅非常大且极其详细的长毛黑猫图画。  肯定花了很长时间。  下面写着‘还有人记得你’。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is an adorable drawing of a troll-like creature with a snout like an aardvark.  Next to it are the words \"Please don't tell anyone I'm down here!\""
msgstr "这是一幅可爱的图画，画的是一种像巨魔一样的生物，有着像土豚一样的鼻子。  旁边写着“请不要告诉任何人我在这里！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_2>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is an entire folder of video files, apparently the complete first season of an animated series called The Shepherd House.  Every file crashes to desktop ten seconds into the opening credits, so all you can tell is that the theme music seems interesting."
msgstr "这是一个完整的视频文件文件夹，显然是名为“牧羊人之家”的动画系列的完整第一季。  每个文件在片头十秒后都会崩溃到桌面，所以你只能看出主题音乐似乎很有趣。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This is is a very large circle, filled with hundreds and hundreds of delicate spirals in yellow and orange marker."
msgstr "这是一个非常大的圆圈，充满了数百个黄色和橙色标记的精致螺旋。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This wall is covered in games of tic-tac-toe, with Xs and Os in different colors.  Some sketching on the side suggests that it is all one game, played on a 6 dimensional grid.  Underneath that are the words THIS WAS FUCKING STUPID."
msgstr "这面墙上挂满了井字游戏，X 和 Os 的颜色各不相同。  侧面的一些草图表明这只是一个游戏，在 6 维网格上进行。  下面写着“这太他妈愚蠢了”。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "This wall is covered in paired tables of tally marks, under headings such as NEWTON/LEIBNITZ, CAKE/PIE, TRITE/MOIST, and ORIGINAL/REBOOT."
msgstr "这堵墙布满了成对的计数标记表，标题下有“牛顿/莱布尼茨”、“蛋糕/馅饼”、“简单/潮湿”和“原始/重新启动”。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_goodbye"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "We went in.  We're going to try to fix it.  If someone finds this; we were here.  We tried to make it right."
msgstr "我们进去了。我们会尽力修复它。  如果有人发现这个；我们在这里。  我们试图纠正它。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_notes"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Word's in.  We're not DARPA funded anymore.  I don't know what that means.  Come talk to me, please."
msgstr "消息传来。我们不再受 DARPA 资助。  我不知道这意味着什么。  请过来跟我谈谈。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_sad_snips"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "Written in a neat script, side by side in Somali and English, are the words \"But now, after everything, I am too afraid to face you.\""
msgstr "上面用工整的字体写着索马里语和英语，并排写着“但是现在，经历了这一切，我太害怕面对你了。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<LIXA_personal_snip_1>"
#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
msgid "You open an application that turns out to be a top-down strategy game of some sort, set in space.  Shortly after selecting anything in the menu, the game freezes and crashes to desktop."
msgstr "你打开一个应用程序，结果发现它是一款以太空为背景的自上而下的策略游戏。  在菜单中选择任何内容后不久，游戏就会冻结并崩溃到桌面。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_cannabis_mild_awake"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "A toke would level you out."
msgstr "抽上一口就能让你平复下来。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opioid_mild_awake"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "If I can just find some oxies, everything will be fine."
msgstr "如果我能找到一些氧气，一切都会好起来的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_mild_awake"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "If only you had a beer…"
msgstr "你要是有瓶啤酒就好了……"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_cannabis_mild_awake"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "If only you had some weed…"
msgstr "要是你有点大麻就好了……"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opioid_mild_awake"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "If you don't find some opioids soon you might start engaging in reckless behavior, you think to yourself."
msgstr "如果你不尽快找到一些阿片类药物，你可能会开始做出鲁莽的行为，你自己想想。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_cannabis_strong_asleep"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "Imagine all the world leaders passing a blunt around and just talking things out.  This could have all been avoided."
msgstr "试想一下，如果各国领导人能围坐在一起，传着抽一支大麻烟，心平气和地把事情谈开——这一切本是可以避免的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "In your dream you brutally disanimate several zombies and then tear through their clothing looking for any unsmoked cigarettes."
msgstr "在梦中，你无情地终结了几个丧尸的“生命”，随后撕开它们的衣物，搜寻未吸过的香烟。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_mild_asleep"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "In your dream you were standing around a campfire with a bunch of your now dead friends, a cigarette between your lips.  The tobacco smell mixing in with the wood smoke in the chill fall air."
msgstr "在你的梦中，你和一群已经死去的朋友站在篝火旁，嘴里叼着一支香烟。  秋天寒冷的空气中，烟草味与木烟混合在一起。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "Standing on the edge of a building with a cigarette in your hand, a horde of zombies milling below.  You take one last long drag and flick the butt out over the zombies then step off the ledge.  Waking with a start you can almost taste the smoke and tar in your mouth."
msgstr "站在建筑物边缘，手里拿着香烟，下面有一群僵尸在乱窜。  你最后长吸一口气，把屁股弹到僵尸身上，然后走下壁架。  一觉醒来，你几乎可以尝到嘴里的烟味和焦油味。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_mild_asleep"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "Talking to friends for hours while having a couple drinks…good times."
msgstr "和朋友边喝几杯边聊天，一聊就是好几个小时……真是美好的时光。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_strong_asleep"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "That calm that soaks into your bones from the outside in that benzos bring.  You wake and there is none of that calm to find."
msgstr "苯并带来的那种平静从外部渗透到你的骨头里。  当你醒来时，你发现没有那么平静。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opioid_mild_asleep"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "That warm rush fills your body in your dream, oxy's hug enveloping you."
msgstr "那种温暖的冲动在你的梦里充满了全身，氧气的拥抱包围了你。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opioid_strong_awake"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "The best thing about the apocalypse is that you've become your own prescriber."
msgstr "关于世界末日的最好的事情是你已经成为自己的处方者。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opioid_strong_awake"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "The doctor is in and the doctor says it's time for some morphine, stat!"
msgstr "医生来了，医生说是时候吃点吗啡了，统计！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opioid_strong_asleep"
#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
msgid "The same old dream: a bottle of oxycodone, a zipper bag, a hammer, a flat surface and a dollar bill."
