msgid "\"A drawing of a small stick figure cowering in the corner.  The rest of the page is colored black, with strange faces sneering and laughing at them.\""
msgstr "“画着一个蜷缩在角落里的小简笔画。页面的其余部分被涂成黑色，陌生的面孔正在嘲笑他们。”"

