msgid "\"Dad and I have been living in the woods for a week now.  He gives me his pistol when he is out hunting.  It wasn't enough to stop the werewolf that attacked me.  So I had to hide in a small hole for a whole night where it couldn't reach me.  Luckily dad found me and killed it.  He also said he will make me a werewolf jacket for my birthday.  A WEREWOLF JACKET, IHAVETHECOOLESTDADINTHEWORLD.\""
msgstr "“爸爸和我已经在树林里住了一周了。他外出打猎的时候会把手枪给我。这不足以阻止袭击我的狼人。所以我不得不在一个小洞里躲了一整晚，它够不着我。幸运的是，爸爸找到了我，把它杀了。他还说他会给我做一件狼人夹克作为生日礼物。 一件狼人夹克，我有世界上最酷的爸爸。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"Dad said he was going to get groceries two days ago.  he didnt come home yet.  he told me to stay inside the shelter but im getting scared.  i think i remember where the grocery store is.\""
msgstr "爸爸两天前说他要去买杂货。他还没有回家。他让我呆在避难所里，但我被吓到了。我想我记得杂货店在哪里。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"Daddy and Mommy, some really scary storm is happening outside.  I hear some people telling me everything will be okay and everything will be over if I get out, so I'm going with them to help find you, and if not i left a message to you so you know where I'm gone!  I'm just too hungry to keep waiting anymore… I'm sorry.\""
msgstr "“爸爸和妈妈，外面正在发生一场非常可怕的风暴。我听到有人告诉我，如果我出去，一切都会好起来的，一切都会结束，所以我要和他们一起去帮助找到你们，如果没有的话，我给你们留言，这样你们就知道我去了哪里！我只是太饿了，不能再等了……我很抱歉。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
