msgid "\"Daddy told me to hide in the closet, but it's been forever and he hasn't come back yet.  I'm really scared.\""
msgstr "“爸爸让我躲到衣柜里，但已经过去了很久了，他还没有回来，我真的很害怕。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"Daddy, where are you?  I'm scared…\""
msgstr "\"爸爸，你在哪儿？我好害怕……\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"Dear Diary, I was at the park today with Percy.  Danny always told me that she was very sad when her dog died, so I broke Percy's neck because I wanted to see how I'd feel.  I think I was sad for a little, but I kept playing with him but I had to stop after too many pieces fell off and Percy became gross.  I buried him in the park so mom and dad wouldn't find out, but Mr. Luca and Mrs Annaliese saw me.  I'm scared they'll tell on me.  Daddy thinks I don't know where he keeps the keys to his gun safe.\""
msgstr "“亲爱的日记，今天我和珀西在公园里。丹尼总是告诉我，当她的狗死了时，她非常伤心，所以我扭断了珀西的脖子，因为我想看看我的感受。我想我有点伤心，但我继续和他玩，但在太多碎片掉落后我不得不停下来，珀西变得很恶心。我把他埋在公园里，这样妈妈和爸爸就不会发现，但卢卡先生和安娜丽丝太太看到了我。我很害怕他们会告发我的，爸爸认为我不知道他把枪的钥匙藏在哪里。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"Dear diary- My parents are stupid.  I told Dad to not go outside today, but he wouldn't listen.  Said it was all a hoax.  Now he's beaten up pretty bad, Mom's got the bandages out to help him.  Jimmy lost his toy today, a red stuffed bear.  Looks like I'll have to help him with that.\""
msgstr "“亲爱的日记——我的父母太蠢了。我告诉爸爸今天不要出去，但他不听。说这都是骗局。现在他被打得很厉害，妈妈拿出绷带来帮助他。吉米今天丢了他的玩具，一只红色的毛绒熊。看来我得帮他了。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"Dear diary.  Mommy and dad have been making us live in the basement for the last few days.  It's to keep us safe, they say, but it gets really stuffy during the night and I can't sleep, so I sometimes sneak upstairs.  Sometimes I talk to Aunt Maria.  She always stays in the back yard and appears when the sky goes all weird and when scary noises come from outside.  I always ask her to come in, but she tells me she can't and that I should go out instead.  I think it's because dad doesn't want her around, he always told me she died in 2001.  He's a liar, and I think he wants the monsters to eat her.  The door's always locked, but I can reach the garage controls.\""
msgstr "“亲爱的日记。最近几天，妈妈和爸爸让我们住在地下室。他们说，这是为了保证我们的安全，但晚上真的很闷，我睡不着，所以我有时会偷偷溜上楼。有时我会和玛丽亚阿姨说话。她总是呆在后院，当天空变得怪异和外面传来可怕的噪音时，她就会出现。我总是让她进来，但她告诉我她不能进来，我应该出去。我我想这是因为爸爸不想让她在身边，他总是告诉我她在 2001 年去世了。他是个骗子，我想他想让怪物吃掉她。门总是锁着的，但我可以到达车库控制装置。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
