msgid "\"I hate it here.  I want to go home.  Abba and Ima told me things would be okay and we will be here a for a few days and then a bus will come take us and we will be safe but I heard them arguing last night.  Ima cried.  I'm scared.  I wanna go home.\""
msgstr "“我讨厌这里。我想回家。阿爸和伊玛告诉我一切都会好起来的，我们会在这里待几天，然后一辆公共汽车会来接我们，我们就安全了，但我昨晚听到他们吵架。伊玛哭了。我很害怕。我想回家。”"

