"Downloads/government_lies_to_you.mp4\n"
"\n"
"A 20 minute video of some freak with a lot of trinkets on his body, who tries to explain that the mass hysteria cases aren't caused by Chinese mind control agents.  His own version, that it was the work of \"mushroom people I saw a few days ago\" doesn't sound correct either."
msgstr ""
"下载/GOGATE_LIES_TO_YOU.mp4\n"
"\n"
"这是一段20分钟的视频，视频中某个怪胎身上戴着很多小玩意儿，他试图解释说，大规模歇斯底里病例不是由中国精神控制机构引起的。他自己的说法，这是“几天前我看到的蘑菇人”的作品，听起来也不正确。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Downloads/government_overreach.mp4\n"
"\n"
"Overlooking a stage formed from a shipping crate placed upon a harbor wharf, the view depicts a man dressed in combat fatigues standing atop the container, two militiamen flanking him, and a line of bound and gagged civilians kneeling in a line at the structure's edge: a potbellied man, an athletic-looking woman, an adolescent girl, and a boy.  Crowds of people are gathered at the container's foot, gazing up as the uniformed man speaks.\n"
"\n"
"\"My fellow Rhodians,\" he booms.  \"On behalf of the Narragansett government, I stand before you to announce that, this morning, these individuals,\" he pronounces, gesturing towards the bound captives with a flourish of a drawn pistol, \"were detained as they attempted to cross our borders, doubtlessly intended to be installed as sleeper agents during this time of emergency.  That the United States would seek to invest in our destruction, even as their own countrymen are falling before the undead, is nothing short of disgusting.  Let the fates of these intruders serve as an example to any who would challenge the sovereignty of Rhode Island!\"\n"
"\n"
"Stepping behind the restrained man, the speaker presses his pistol against his head.  \"This man,\" he declares, \"was found to carry a weapon within his vehicle and is doubtlessly a soldier of the United States.\"  The echo of a solitary shot reverberates through the audio as the man's lifeless corpse rolls from the container and plunges into the water below amidst muffled shrieks from his fellow captives.\n"
"\n"
"\"This woman,\" the executioner thunders, stepping behind the prisoner in question, \"was registered as possessing land within our borders.  Land, my friends, upon which a bunker was built!\"  A second shot and a spray of brains herald the woman's end as her body plunges to join her compatriot before the man marches behind the huddled children.\n"
"\n"
"\"These kids aren't responsible for the actions of their government,\" he somberly announces.  \"Yet, they will grow to be enemies of Rhode Island and must be dealt with; the law bends for no one.\"\n"
"\n"
"Two more gunshots and two smaller splashes bring the video to an end."
msgstr ""
"下载/government_overreach.mp4\n"
"\n"
"这张照片俯瞰着一个由放置在港口码头上的运输板条箱组成的舞台，画面描绘了一名身着战斗服的男子站在集装箱顶上，两名民兵站在他的两侧，一排被捆绑和封住嘴巴的平民跪在建筑物边缘：一名大腹便便的男子、一名运动型的女子、一名青春期的女孩和一名男孩。  成群结队的人聚集在集装箱底部，当这名身穿制服的男子说话时，他们抬头凝视着。\n"
"\n"
"“我的罗德岛同胞们，”他大声说道。  “我代表纳拉甘西特政府，在你们面前宣布，今天早上，这些人，”他用拔出的手枪指着被束缚的俘虏，说道，“他们在试图越过我们的边境时被拘留，毫无疑问是为了在这个紧急时期被安插为潜伏特工。美国试图投资于我们的毁灭，即使他们自己的同胞在亡灵面前倒下，这简直是令人厌恶。让命运听天由命吧。这些入侵者为任何挑战罗德岛主权的人树立了榜样！”\n"
"\n"
"说话者走到被束缚的男子身后，用手枪抵住他的头。  “这个人，”他宣称，“被发现在车内携带武器，毫无疑问是一名美国士兵。”  当这名男子毫无生气的尸体从集装箱中滚出，在其他俘虏的低沉尖叫声中跳入下面的水中时，一声枪响的回声在音频中回响。\n"
"\n"
"“这个女人，”刽子手走到犯人身后，大声说道，“登记为在我们境内拥有土地。土地，我的朋友们，上面建有一个掩体！”  第二枪和脑浆喷射预示着这名妇女的死亡，她的身体跳向她的同胞，而男子则跟在挤在一起的孩子们后面。\n"
"\n"
"“这些孩子不对政府的行为负责，”他严肃地宣布。  “然而，他们将成为罗德岛州的敌人，必须予以处理；法律不允许任何人屈服。”\n"
"\n"
"又两声枪响和两声较小的水花使视频结束。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Downloads/how_to_train_your_nightmares_trailer.mp4\n"
"\n"
"The trailer starts with a surreal violin score: a deathly pale woman in a lab coat kneeling on a basement floor.  Head bowed over a collection of engraved silver glyphs, her crimson hair drenched in rivulets of blood, and eyes closed, she chants under her breath as a British accented voice, the same as hers, speaks over the scene.  \"There are things stalking beyond the abysses that drive the sane to madness.\"  Letting blood spatter upon the glyphs from wounds hidden by her hair, the woman's breathing quickens as the objects begin to sizzle, the view zooming upon her heavily scarred face as her eyes slowly open and the music escalates.  \"But when insanity rains,\" fully opening her eyes, the woman's irises are revealed to be burned scarlet, the perspective filled by a view of one of them as the narration concludes, \"the only thing left… is to transcend.\"\n"
"\n"
"After a moment of tense freeze frame, the music grows to a dynamic bass-drum rhythm, the view zooming out and revealing the eyes of a tall, robed figure stalking through the deserted mezzanine level of a shopping plaza.  With their face lost in the shadow of a hood, their limbs bend in disturbingly inhuman ways as they stride, moments before a clawed hand bursts from beneath and whips them from the corridor.  Encircled by a throng of nightmarish, slavering monstrosities, the figure rests still for a moment before their robe bursts apart, revealing them to be an anthropoid composed of intertwining tentacles.  Machine pistols clutched at the ends of their many limbs, they latch to the ceiling and, in a hail of bullets, swing from the floor and towards the view.\n"
"\n"
"The perspective shifts to a scene of the woman, wielding a bayonet-equipped battle rifle, riding astride a motorcycle.  Weaving through a street crowded with writhing eldritch abominations, she stabs from the bike as a viperine creature wings behind her, the pair cutting a bloody swath through the crowd before the view changes.\n"
"\n"
"Dozing in the back of a covered wagon within a barn, the woman rests, the barn's doors wide open.  A spidery creature made from tentacles creeps in through the opening, the camera shifting to its perspective as it crawls towards the wagon.  Laying a leg upon the vehicle's lip, the view glances up, only to reveal the viperine beast crouching atop the cart.  A still second passes before the winged monstrosity dives, the view filled by its gaping maw, before fleshy words bleed across the screen.\n"
"\n"
"\"How to Train Your Nightmares, coming to cinemas April 22nd!\""
msgstr ""
"下载/how_to_train_your_nightmares_trailer.mp4\n"
"\n"
"预告片以一段超现实的小提琴乐谱开始：一个穿着实验室外套、脸色苍白的女人跪在地下室的地板上。  她低着头，看着一系列雕刻的银色符号，深红色的头发浸透了鲜血，她闭着眼睛，低声吟诵着一个带有英国口音的声音，与她的声音一样，在现场说话。  “有些东西在深渊之外潜行，让理智变得疯狂。”  鲜血从她头发隐藏的伤口中溅到雕文上，随着物体开始发出嘶嘶声，女人的呼吸加快，随着她的眼睛慢慢睁开，音乐逐渐升级，视野放大到她伤痕累累的脸上。  “但当疯狂下雨时，”完全睁开眼睛，女人的虹膜显露出被烧焦的猩红色，旁白总结道，“唯一剩下的……就是超越。”\n"
"\n"
"经过片刻紧张的定格后，音乐变成了充满活力的低音鼓节奏，视野缩小，露出一个穿着长袍的高个子的眼睛，他在购物广场废弃的夹层中走来走去。  他们的脸隐藏在兜帽的阴影中，大步走时，他们的四肢以令人不安的非人方式弯曲，紧接着一只带爪子的手从下面突然伸出，把他们从走廊上抽了出来。  被一群噩梦般的、流着口水的怪物包围着，这个人物静止了一会儿，然后他们的长袍炸开了，露出了他们是一个由相互缠绕的触手组成的类人猿。  它们的许多肢体末端都握着冲锋枪，它们紧贴天花板，在枪林弹雨中从地板上向视野摆动。\n"
"\n"
"视角切换到一名女子的场景，她挥舞着一把装有刺刀的战斗步枪，骑着一辆摩托车。  她穿过一条挤满了翻滚的可憎之物的街道，她从自行车上刺出，一只毒蛇生物在她身后扇动翅膀，两人在视野改变之前在人群中划出了一条血迹。\n"
"\n"
"这名妇女在谷仓内一辆有盖马车的后座上打瞌睡，谷仓的门敞开着。  一只由触手制成的蜘蛛生物从开口处爬了进来，当它爬向马车时，镜头转向它的视角。  将一条腿放在车的边缘，视线向上一瞥，只看到蹲在车顶上的毒蛇野兽。  又过了一秒，这只长着翅膀的怪物俯冲而下，它张开的大嘴充满了整个视野，然后血肉模糊的文字在屏幕上流淌。\n"
"\n"
"《如何训练你的噩梦》，4 月 22 日上映！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Downloads/no_man's_land_trailer.mp4\n"
"\n"
"The trailer opens with a distorted rendition of \"It's a Long Way to Tipperary,\" with a muddy trench, piled high with the bodies of dead soldiers, filling the scene and a dense layer of yellowish gas obscuring much from direct sight.  Zooming down into the dugout, the camera focuses on the mangled face of a dead infantryman sprawled in bloody water, his jaw blown off and shrapnel embedded in its place.  Clouds of flies crawl over his visage, dispersing in swarms as the music builds and the dead man's bloodshot eyes open.  Staggering to his feet, the soldier shambles down the trench, other corpses unsteadily rising in his wake.  The view pans out beyond the trench and past the layer of gas, revealing hundreds of staggering silhouettes moving in uneven, shambling lines before the escalating music peeks and the scene smash cuts to an overhead view of 19th-century Paris.\n"
"\n"
"Hordes of zombies pour into the city, flashes of gunfire and artillery strikes lighting up the chaotic scene as a line of soldiers attempt to fend off the undead.  With the line breaking after a few seconds of frantic combat, the camera zooms down on a solitary soldier freshly brought to the ground in the midst of the surging wave of zombies, struggling to fend off gnashing teeth and clawing hands.  Seeming to make eye contact with the camera, the man lifts a hand in slow motion, revealing the pulled pins of several grenades before the view is consumed by an explosion.\n"
"\n"
"With a fully fledged orchestral tidal wave scoring the scene, the trailer cuts to a bird's-eye shot of the soldier frantically climbing a ladder, one of his legs missing, and a child clinging to his back as a swarm of undead climb over one another at the structure's foot.  As the infantryman climbs, the view pulls out further and further, eventually depicting the landscape of France, with most man-made lights absent from view and the entire landmass awash with the flashes of heavy guns and detonations.  As the music reaches a heart-throbbing crescendo, bullet holes spray across the scene, spelling out,\n"
"\n"
"\"No Man's Land, coming to cinemas June 15th!\""
msgstr ""
"下载/no_man's_land_trailer.mp4\n"
"\n"
"预告片以扭曲的“通往蒂珀雷里的路很长”开头，泥泞的战壕里堆满了死去的士兵的尸体，充满了场景，浓密的黄色气体遮蔽了大部分直接视线。  镜头缩小到防空洞内，镜头聚焦在一名倒在血水中的死去步兵的残破脸庞，他的下巴被炸飞，弹片嵌在原处。  成群结队的苍蝇在他的脸上爬行，随着音乐的响起和死者布满血丝的眼睛睁开，苍蝇成群地散开。  士兵摇摇晃晃地站起来，摇摇晃晃地走下战壕，其他尸体在他身后摇摇欲坠地升起。  画面越过战壕，越过气体层，在渐强的音乐声和场景猛烈切换到 19 世纪巴黎的俯视图之前，数百个令人震惊的轮廓以参差不齐、摇摇欲坠的线条移动。\n"
"\n"
"成群的僵尸涌入城市，枪声和炮火的闪光照亮了混乱的场景，一排士兵试图击退僵尸。  经过几秒钟的疯狂战斗后，防线被打破，镜头拉近了一名孤独的士兵，他在汹涌的僵尸浪潮中刚刚被带到地上，奋力抵挡咬牙切齿和抓爪的双手。  这名男子似乎在与摄像机进行目光接触，他以慢动作举起一只手，露出了几颗手榴弹的拉钉，然后画面被爆炸吞噬。\n"
"\n"
"随着一场成熟的管弦乐浪潮席卷整个场景，预告片切入了一个鸟瞰镜头，士兵疯狂地爬上梯子，他的一条腿不见了，一个孩子紧贴着他的背，而一群不死生物在建筑脚下互相攀爬。  随着步兵的攀登，视野越来越远，最终描绘出法国的风景，大多数人造灯光从视野中消失，整个大陆都充满了重炮和爆炸的闪光。  当音乐达到令人心悸的渐强时，弹孔遍布整个场景，说明：\n"
"\n"
"“无人区，6 月 15 日上映！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Downloads/taufledermaus_8x40_shooting.mp4.\n"
"\n"
"A middle aged man in a field shows off some pricey looking caseless cartridges for an even pricier looking handgun, before shooting them at a range of targets.  A slo-mo camera catches the shots ripping through a block of ballistic gel like air."
msgstr ""
"下载/taufledermaus_8x40_Shooting.mp4.\n"
"\n"
"一名中年男子在田野里炫耀着一些看起来昂贵的无壳子弹，然后向一系列目标开枪。一台SLO-MO相机捕捉到了镜头穿过一块像空气一样的弹道凝胶。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Downloads/Приходите в подполье.mp4\n"
"\n"
"Magnitudes darker than the soot-caked countenance of the man who forms this video's subject, the footage captures a vertically shot view of arched concrete walls and steel rail lines leading off into an impenetrable vale of black.  The man, enwrapped within an olive-green military uniform and clutching a rifle, stands framed within this utilitarian warren of grime and rust, the beam of radiance from his weapon light quivering across his face as his hands shiver.  In the background, you can pick up a low murmur of voices along with a fainter series of reverberant clinks and clangs, the latter of which are drowned out as the soldier's lips part in a croaky monologue, thickly seasoned by an eastern European accent.\n"
"\n"
"\"Я 2-й лейтенант российских вооруженных сил Гавриил Фадеев, и я записываю это сообщение для всех, кто еще находится в городе.  Поверхность больше не безопасна; силы армии развалились.  Если вы на это способны, уходите под землю, в линии метро.  Мы с моими людьми установили периметр в туннелях, ведущих к Чистым Прудам.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the video trundles onwards, a level of peculiar distortion grows evident in the footage.  It almost seems like, at points, micro-second-long clips of a second film perspective have been embedded into the tape, struggling to grow visible over the original footage before flashing by in a blur of brown, red, and gray hues—too fast to properly catch.  You're about to fast-forward the tape before, suddenly, as though in a hard-won breakthrough, the view of the soldier dissolves and is replaced by a different perspective of the man, presented within an alternative version of the tunnel.  At least… you think what you're seeing is meant to be the tunnel.  It looks far more like the pulsating interior of some beast's esophagus, and you have to do your best to link that flailing, flesh-stripped thing immersed waist-deep in a bubbling brown slurry in the frame's center with anything remotely human.  It stands, held upright by a bulbous white appendage extending from the ceiling and smothering the oozing remnants of its head.\n"
"\n"
"\"ЭТО ЛОЖЬ, ЭТО ЛОЖЬ,\" the thing that is and isn't a man screams, before a club-like limb extends from the white mass, plows through its chest in a shower of bone and mangled lungs, and the tape jumps back to the soldier.\n"
"\n"
"\"Приходите на линии метро,\" the man croaks.  \"У нас есть тепло.  У нас есть еда.  Мы позаботимся о вас.\"  He smiles at the camera.  Half of his face stays limp."
msgstr ""
"下载/来到地下.mp4\n"
"\n"
"这段视频的亮度比构成该视频主题的男子满是烟灰的面容还要黑暗，这段视频捕捉到了拱形混凝土墙和通向无法穿透的黑色山谷的钢轨的垂直拍摄视图。  这名男子身穿橄榄绿军装，手握步枪，站在这个布满污垢和铁锈的功利之地，他的武器发出的光芒在他的脸上颤抖，双手颤抖。  在背景中，你可以听到低沉的低语声，以及一系列微弱的叮当声和叮当声，当士兵张开嘴唇发出带有浓重东欧口音的沙哑独白时，后者被淹没了。\n"
"\n"
"“我是俄罗斯武装部队第二中尉加夫里尔·法捷耶夫（Gavriil Fadeev），我正在为仍在城里的每个人记录这条信息。地表不再安全；军队已经崩溃。如果你有能力的话，进入地下，进入地铁线路。我和我的人和我已经在通往 Chistye Prudy 的隧道中建立了边界。”\n"
"\n"
"随着视频的继续播放，镜头中出现了一定程度的特殊失真。  在某些时候，第二电影视角的微秒长片段似乎被嵌入到磁带中，在以棕色、红色和灰色的模糊色调闪烁之前，很难在原始镜头上变得可见——速度太快，无法正确捕捉。  你正要快进磁带，突然间，就像是在一次来之不易的突破中，士兵的视野消失了，取而代之的是另一个版本的隧道中呈现的男人的不同视角。  至少……你认为你所看到的就是隧道。  它看起来更像是某种野兽食道的脉动内部，你必须尽最大努力将画面中央那个浸在齐腰深、冒泡的棕色浆液中、挥舞着、皮肉剥落的东西与任何遥远的人类联系起来。  它站着，由一根从天花板延伸出来的球状白色附属物支撑着，遮住了头部渗出的残余物。\n"
"\n"
"“这是一个谎言，这是一个谎言，”那个是人又不是人的东西尖叫着，然后一根棒状的肢体从白色的物体中伸出，在一阵骨头和破碎的肺部中刺穿它的胸部，录像带跳回到士兵身边。\n"
"\n"
"“坐地铁来吧，”男人嘶哑地说。  “我们有温暖。我们有食物。我们会照顾你。”  他对着镜头微笑。  他的半边脸依然软绵绵的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"EAS_apr_25,_15.57.mp3\n"
"\n"
"The file begins with complete silence, but then, a tired voice breaks the stillness:\n"
"\n"
"\"My name is Clayton Gore, I am the head of [unintelligible].\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry, I WAS the head of [unintelligible].\n"
"\n"
"I am speaking to you using the remains of the Emergency Alert System, with everything we have left here.\n"
"\n"
"This is the final message.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The government has fallen.\n"
"\n"
"There is nothing left.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"No help is coming.  Use your weapons, clubs, fists and teeth to survive this hard time.\n"
"\n"
"No one will arrest you.\n"
"\n"
"No one will help you.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You're on your own.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"End of transmission.\""
msgstr ""
"Eas_apr_25，_15.57.mp3\n"
"\n"
"文件以完全的沉默开始，但随后，一个疲惫的声音打破了寂静：\n"
"\n"
"“我的名字是克莱顿·戈尔，我是[Unmible]的负责人。”\n"
"\n"
"对不起，我是[不可理喻]的负责人。\n"
"\n"
"我正在用紧急警报系统的残余物和我们留在这里的一切与你交谈。\n"
"\n"
"这是最后一条消息。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"政府垮台了。\n"
"\n"
"什么都没有了。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"不会有人来帮忙的。使用你的武器、棍棒、拳头和牙齿来度过这段艰难的时光。\n"
"\n"
"没有人会逮捕你。\n"
"\n"
"没有人会帮你。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"你得靠自己了。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"传输结束。“"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Gazing into a canvas of darkness, this tape seems to have originated from a highway speed camera.  Utterly deserted, the thoroughfare stretches from one end of the choppy frame to the other, the audio devoid of any sound save for the death-rattle rasp of the wind.  Presently, footfalls and exhausted breathing join the soundscape as two men stagger upon the scene, one hunched and bearing the blood-soaked profile of the other.\n"
"\n"
"Clad in the remains of riot gear, the starlight glistening over the red wells of bullet holes flowering across his back, the limply carried officer is clearly dead.  His bearer, a slighter man with bloodshot, vacant eyes, stumbles as he walks, his quivering lips moving as he maintains a hoarsely-whispered, one-sided dialogue.  \"Don't worry, Kev,\" he wheezes.  \"Carlhaven's just a couple miles up ahead.  I'm sure we'll find someone there who can help you, and after you're better, we can go to my place on the lake and wait for all this to die down.  I'll get us there, I promise.  You just need to talk to me.  Please.  Tell me something.\"\n"
"\n"
"Catching his foot in a pothole, the man staggers to the concrete, the corpse sprawling atop him as he lies face down.  \"I'm going to get us there.  I promise.  I promise.  I just want you to wake up.  Please, Kev.  I've got to get us there.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the man wretchedly whimpers, various figures begin to shamble up from the same direction he came from.  Futilely trying to rise, the man only succeeds in rolling himself into a sitting position as his crying grows harder.  \"Please Kev… please.  I don't want to die alone,\" he bawls.  \"Please, wake up and don't let me die alone.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the first zombie stumbles to within a few meters of the man, his sobs grow quiet as he makes eye contact with the inhuman monster ushering in his destruction.  Closing his eyes, he pulls the policeman's corpse into a tight hug and lowers his head, planting a tender kiss on the dead man's lips.  The embrace never breaks, even as the zombies descend upon him."
msgstr ""
"凝视黑暗的画布，这段录像带似乎源自高速公路测速摄像机。  这条大道完全荒芜，从波涛汹涌的画面的一端延伸到另一端，除了风的致命的嘎嘎声外，没有任何声音。  目前，脚步声和疲惫的呼吸声加入了音景，两名男子摇摇晃晃地出现在现场，其中一人弓着背，另一人的侧影浸满了鲜血。\n"
"\n"
"身穿残骸的防暴装备，星光在他背上布满弹孔的红色井上闪闪发光，这位软弱无力的军官显然已经死了。  抬他的人是个身材瘦小的男人，眼睛布满血丝，眼神空洞，走路时踉踉跄跄地走着，嘴唇颤抖着，一边低声低语一边一边对话。  “别担心，凯夫，”他喘着气说。  “卡尔黑文就在前方几英里处。我相信我们会在那里找到可以帮助你的人，等你好起来后，我们可以去我在湖边的住所，等待这一切平息下来。我保证，我会带我们去那里。你只需要跟我说话。拜托。告诉我一些事情。”\n"
"\n"
"这名男子的脚陷入了坑洼，摇摇晃晃地走到了水泥地上，他脸朝下躺着，尸体趴在他身上。  “我会带我们去那里的。我保证。我保证。我只是想让你醒来。求你了，凯文。我必须带我们去那里。”\n"
"\n"
"当这个男人可怜兮兮地呜咽着时，各种人影开始从他来的方向摇摇晃晃地走来。  这名男子徒劳地试图站起来，但随着哭声越来越大，他才成功地坐了起来。  “求你了，凯夫……求你了。我不想独自死去，”他哭喊道。  “求你醒醒吧，不要让我一个人死去。”\n"
"\n"
"当第一只僵尸跌跌撞撞地来到距离该男子几米远的地方时，当他与即将毁灭他的非人怪物进行目光接触时，他的抽泣声逐渐安静下来。  他闭上眼睛，将警察的尸体紧紧抱住，低下头，在死者的嘴唇上轻轻一吻。  即使僵尸降临到他身上，这个拥抱也从未中断。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"IMG_202X0401_111567.jpg\n"
"\n"
"A high quality photo of an angry civil mob that suppressed a line of shielded policemen.  There are a few dead people on the edge of the photo, one of which lays with a chopped off head."
msgstr ""
"IMG_202X0401_111567.jpg\n"
"\n"
"一张高质量的照片，展示了一群愤怒的民间暴徒镇压了一排受保护的警察。照片边缘有几个死人，其中一人被砍下了头。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Monochrome security camera footage of an intersection that was recorded on April 15th.\n"
"\n"
"23:39: A person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car hits them at full speed.  The driver drives away from the accident, while the body is left where it is.\n"
"23:50: Another person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car runs the person over at full speed.  The driver drives away from the accident, while the body is left near the first victim.\n"
"00:01: Some person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car hits the person at full speed.  The driver drives away from the accident, with the third body near the original two\n"
"The tape was cut here, to show the very end of the story\n"
"4:15: you see a giant pile of corpses, of at least two dozen bodies, each wearing the same set of clothes.  Despite this, it seems that both drivers and pedestrians do not care about it, simply trying to drive around the pile.  Another person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car hits them at breakneck speed.  The driver seems unable to drive away, as the car is stuck in the pile, so they leave the car, and try to push it out.  Some passing pedestrians try to help them, and with some help the car gets unstuck.  The driver drives away from the intersection, and the tape ends."
msgstr ""
"4月15日拍摄的一个十字路口的单色监控录像。\n"
"\n"
"23时39分：一个人试图过马路，突然一辆车全速撞上了他们。司机开车离开了事故现场，而身体却留在了原地。\n"
"23时50分：另一个人试图过马路，突然一辆车全速碾压了这个人。司机开车离开了事故现场，而身体则留在了第一名受害者附近。\n"
"00：01：有人试图过马路，突然一辆车全速撞上了该人。司机开车离开了事故现场，第三具车身靠近原来的两辆\n"
"录像带被剪在这里，以显示故事的最后部分\n"
"4点15分：你看到一大堆身体，至少有20多具身体，每一具都穿着同样的衣服。尽管如此，似乎司机和行人都不在乎，只是想绕过一堆车。另一个人试图过马路，突然一辆车以极快的速度撞上了他们。司机似乎无法开车离开，因为车被困在了一堆车里，所以他们离开了车，试图把车推出来。一些路过的行人试图帮助他们，在一些帮助下，汽车被卡住了。司机开车离开了十字路口，胶带结束了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "One big footage for some live-action roleplay game, which is mostly unremarkable until some guy with bloodstained clothes arrives running and panting.  \"We need to evacuate.  Hayneth went crazy and someone brought real steel weapons.  It's a bloodbath.  Everyone fights against everyone and it has become one hell of a brawl.  Tim, call the cops right NOW.\" As the camera man utters \"Are… are you serious, dude?\" in disbelief, a bloodied warrior clad in foam armor can be seen in the distance and emits a bloodcurdling war cry.  \"Shit!\", the camera man turns around.  After a couple seconds of very shaky forest floor impressions, the video ends."
msgstr "某个真人角色扮演游戏的一个大镜头，在一些穿着血迹衣服的人气喘吁吁地跑过来之前，这基本上没什么引人注目的。  “我们需要撤离。海恩斯疯了，有人带来了真正的钢铁武器。这是一场血腥屠杀。每个人都在对抗每个人，这已经成为一场地狱般的斗殴。蒂姆，现在就打电话给警察。”当摄影师说“你……你是认真的吗，伙计？”难以置信的是，远处出现了一位身穿泡沫铠甲、浑身是血的战士，发出令人毛骨悚然的战吼。  “糟糕！”摄影师转过身来。  经过几秒钟非常摇晃的森林地面印象后，视频结束。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "One of the more recent photos is a bald man with a beard taking a selfie on a trail, with a tall black figure - that you recognize as one of the monsters you saw mindlessly wandering around - in the midground facing him.  The man's face is a mixture of confusion and an awkward smile."
msgstr "最近的一张照片是一个留着胡子的秃头男子在一条小路上自拍，一个高大的黑色身影——你认出它是你看到的漫不经心地四处游荡的怪物之一——在他对面的中间。  男人的脸上夹杂着困惑和尴尬的笑容。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Peeking down from a pole mount, this segment of security camera footage films the apex of a bridge overpass's boarding ramp.  A number of large police and military vehicles loom at the concrete incline's foot, with a low line of sandbags forming a makeshift checkpoint behind which several armed national guardsmen and police officers stand at attention.  The view, however, is mainly taken up by a veritable metal wall of civilian vehicles crawling in a haphazard line across the bridge, disheveled groups of exhausted men, women, and children flitting alongside the slow procession of evacuating vehicles.  The footage proceeds in this fashion for several minutes, with new groups of refugees being waved through by the soldiers, before a distant sonic boom resounds through the audio.  Gradually coming to a halt, with the heads of civilians and personnel alike inclined skyward and tense expressions adorning unkempt faces, the stream stands in collective puzzlement as the sound of powerful jet engines can be heard in the background, steadily rising in volume.  The collective apathy dissolves into utter, terrified pandemonium as a large shadow rapidly darkens the overpass and an officer suddenly screams, \"CLEAR THE BRIDGE!\"\n"
"\n"
"With a number of fresh whistling sounds dominating the newly overwhelmed soundscape, soldiers grab those they can and race clear of the checkpoint as panicked civilians fling themselves off the overpass, rapidly joined by the occupants of those vehicles on the edges of the stagnated convoy.  In the last few shots, you can see the drivers of cars at the procession's heart struggle to abandon their vehicles before a sleek form streaks from the sky, the start of an ear-splitting explosion rips through the muddled audio, and the view goes white."
msgstr ""
"这段安全摄像机镜头从杆子上往下看，拍摄了一座立交桥登机坡道的顶端。  水泥斜坡脚下停着许多大型警车和军车，一排低矮的沙袋形成临时检查站，后面站着几名武装国民警卫队和警察。  然而，眼前的景象主要是一堵名副其实的金属墙，民用车辆在桥上杂乱地爬行，一群群披头散发、疲惫不堪的男人、女人和孩子沿着缓慢的疏散车辆队伍飞快地走着。  镜头以这种方式持续了几分钟，士兵们挥手示意新的难民群通过，然后远处的音爆在音频中响起。  渐渐地停了下来，平民和工作人员的头都仰向天空，蓬乱的脸上表情紧张，溪流集体困惑，背景中可以听到强大的喷气发动机的声音，音量逐渐增大。  当一个巨大的阴影迅速使立交桥变暗时，集体的冷漠化为彻底的、恐惧的混乱，一名警官突然尖叫道：“清理桥梁！”\n"
"\n"
"随着一些新鲜的口哨声占据了新近不堪重负的音景，士兵们抓住了他们能找到的东西，冲出了检查站，惊慌失措的平民从立交桥上跳了下来，停滞的车队边缘的车辆上的乘客也迅速加入了进来。  在最后几个镜头中，你可以看到游行队伍中心的汽车司机挣扎着放弃他们的车辆，然后一个光滑的形状从天空中划过，一声震耳欲聋的爆炸撕裂了混乱的音频，视野变成了白色。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Peering down from what appears to be a security camera mount, this monochromatic segment of footage is focused on a section of airport taxiway.  A solitary, desert-drab plane rests upon the stretch of concrete, its boarding stairs lowered, and its twin engines whining as it idles, the drone of its motors almost eclipsing the distant screams and gunfire occasionally conveyed through the crackling audio.  Minutes into the tape, a small group of ragged people burst into view: assorted individuals in civilian garb flanked by a scattering of soldiers, all running headlong towards the aircraft.  A small child can be seen at the rear of the group, half carried by a serviceman and lagging behind the main body.  Suddenly, a violent flutter of gossamer wings fills the view as a dog-sized insectoid lunges past the camera, the colorful wasp alighting on the child's back and snapping large mandibles about them.  As a sickening, writhing carpet of wasps swarms into view and the group's front-runners begin to hurry up the aircraft's steps, a terrible game of tug of war ensues between the soldier and the ever-growing number of frenzied parasitoids, culminating in the man reeling back, showered in spurting blood, and clutching the child's chewed-off arm.  As the screaming child is subsumed beneath a twitching carapace of legs and pulsating ovipositors and the soldier is forced up the stairs, he pulls a pistol and fires wildly into the swarm, the ammunition depleting before he's dragged into the aircraft.  The last thing that the camera records is a spherical object being flung from the plane's closing door—the item pinging off the taxiing aircraft's wing and rolling into the frenzied crowd.  The plane powers out of sight, moments before the footage goes white."
msgstr "从看似安全摄像头的地方往下看，这段单色镜头聚焦于机场滑行道的一段。  一架孤独的、沙漠色的飞机停在一片混凝土上，登机梯降低了，双引擎在空转时发出呜呜声，引擎的嗡嗡声几乎盖过了远处偶尔通过噼啪声传来的尖叫声和枪声。  录像几分钟后，一小群衣衫褴褛的人突然出现在视野中：穿着便装的各种各样的人，两侧是分散的士兵，所有人都一头扎向飞机。  可以看到一个小孩子在队伍的最后面，一半由军人抱着，落在大部队后面。  突然，一只狗大小的昆虫冲过镜头，薄纱翅膀猛烈地扑动，色彩缤纷的黄蜂落在孩子的背上，用大下颌咬住他们。  当令人作呕、扭动的黄蜂蜂拥而至，队伍的领跑者开始加快飞机的步伐时，士兵和数量不断增加的疯狂寄生蜂之间展开了一场可怕的拔河游戏，最终，这名男子向后退去，浑身喷血，并紧紧抓住孩子被咬断的手臂。  当尖叫的孩子被裹在抽搐的双腿甲壳和搏动的产卵器下时，士兵被迫走上楼梯，他拔出手枪，向蜂群疯狂射击，弹药在他被拖上飞机之前耗尽。  摄像机记录的最后一件事是一个球形物体从飞机关闭的舱门中扔出——该物体撞上滑行的飞机机翼，滚入疯狂的人群中。  就在镜头变白之前，飞机已经消失在视线之外。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Peering over the crumbling lip of a building's parapet and capturing the sight of a heavily cratered cul-de-sac lit in the pale light of dawn, the video's opening shots tilt hither and dither as the camera's carefully adjusted and a low voice murmurs in the background.\n"
"\n"
"\"Well, it's day 4 of the apocalypse; the internet's still running somehow, and that's my cue to post another video, so welcome back, y'all.  I never thought that I'd be using YouTube as a way to try reaching out to people during a fucking zombie cataclysm, but here we are, so… yeah.  If you're watching, I guess, sound off in the comments that you're still around and, I don't know, like and subscribe to your daily coverage of hell.\"\n"
"\n"
"The video's frame settles on the view of a modestly sized storefront, or, more precisely, half of a storefront.  The establishment's been supplemented by the addition of a semi-truck resting nose first through the shop's merchandise window, and, as you watch, you can make out a faint staring of movement from within the building.\n"
"\n"
"\"It's 9 in the morning.  I figured that y'all may as well join me as I see who around here wants a sample of Grampa's cure-all, and it looks like, folks, we have a taker.\"\n"
"\n"
"The barrel of a large-caliber rifle edges into the frame, escorted by the rattle of a bolt being cycled and the slightly more unsettling tempo of the cameraman softly humming, \"Another one bites the dust.\"  Thankfully for your musical sensibilities, the humming dissolves into a surprised breath as the rifle's sharply retreated from the parapet, the camera's jostled rearwards, and, from the ruins of the store, a ragged woman clambers over the debris and slides down upon the hood of the equally battered semi.  With her eyes bloodshot and misted over with an unblinking glaze, the woman staggers to her feet, an inflamed and seeping, purplish-red mass evident in her leg that speaks to unhealed fractures.  Hoisting the concrete-dusted bundle of a blanket and plushie to her chest as she all but collapses off the vehicle, the footage zooms in on the survivor as she limps about the truck's trailer and fumbles with the rear gate's locking latch, haltingly swinging the barrier down with a rusted shriek.  Disappearing within the container, a faint rattling announces the woman's eventual reemergence as she teeters behind the push-bar of a baby stroller.  A wan smile touches the corner of her slack lips as she parks the carriage by the truck, crumples to her knees, and fusses over the basket, tucking the plush toy within before enveloping the contents within the coverlet.\n"
"\n"
"As the woman drags herself to the steering position and unsteadily sets off down the street, the film focuses on the stroller's interior.  The plastic toy of a baby is swaddled within.  Only its staring eyes and jagged sneer are visible across the shattered wreckage of the doll's face, and it's dressed in a set of baby clothes.  You've never seen a garment so completely crusted with dried blood."
msgstr ""
"从一栋建筑物摇摇欲坠的护栏边缘往外看，捕捉到在黎明苍白的光线下照亮的一条坑坑洼洼的死胡同的景象，视频的开场镜头向这里倾斜，随着镜头的仔细调整和背景中低沉的声音低语而出现。\n"
"\n"
"“好吧，现在是世界末日的第四天；互联网仍然以某种方式运行，这就是我发布另一个视频的提示，所以欢迎回来，你们。我从来没有想过我会使用 YouTube 作为在一场他妈的僵尸灾难期间与人们接触的方式，但我们来了，所以……是的。如果你正在观看，我猜，在评论中表明你仍然存在，并且我不知道，点赞并订阅你每天对地狱的报道。”\n"
"\n"
"视频的画面选择了一个中等大小的店面，或者更准确地说，是一半的店面。  该店还增设了一辆半卡车，首先通过商店的商品橱窗停放车头，当您观看时，您可以从建筑物内辨认出微弱的动静。\n"
"\n"
"“现在是早上 9 点。我想你们也可以跟我一起来，因为我看到这里谁想要一份爷爷的灵丹妙药的样品，看起来，伙计们，我们有一个接受者。”\n"
"\n"
"一把大口径步枪的枪管伸入画面，伴随着枪机旋转时发出的嘎嘎声，以及摄影师轻声哼唱的稍微令人不安的节奏，“另一支死了。”  谢天谢地，你对音乐的敏感度很高，当步枪从栏杆上猛然撤退、摄像机向后推挤时，嗡嗡声化为惊讶的呼吸声，在商店的废墟中，一名衣衫褴褛的女人爬过废墟，滑落到同样破旧的半挂车的引擎盖上。  女人的眼睛布满血丝，一眨不眨地蒙上了一层雾气，摇摇晃晃地站了起来，腿上明显有发炎、渗出的紫红色肿块，说明骨折尚未愈合。  当她几乎从车上摔下来时，她把沾满混凝土灰尘的毯子和毛绒玩具抱到胸前，镜头放大了幸存者，她一瘸一拐地绕着卡车的拖车，摸索着后门的锁闩，摇摇晃晃地把护栏摇下来，发出生锈的尖叫声。  消失在集装箱内后，一阵微弱的嘎嘎声宣告了这名女子最终再次出现，她在婴儿车的推杆后面摇摇欲坠。  当她把马车停在卡车旁时，她松弛的唇角露出一抹苍白的微笑，她跪倒在地，忙着翻动篮子，把毛绒玩具塞进去，然后把里面的东西包进被子里。\n"
"\n"
"当这位女士拖着自己的方向盘，摇摇晃晃地沿着街道出发时，影片聚焦于婴儿车的内部。  婴儿的塑料玩具被包裹在里面。  在娃娃破碎的脸上只能看到它凝视的眼睛和参差不齐的冷笑，而且它穿着一套婴儿衣服。  你从来没有见过一件衣服上沾满了干涸的血迹。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Photo of a square, white room with no furniture apart from a fridge against the farthest wall, and some sort of mucus coating the floor."
msgstr "照片上是一个方形的白色房间，除了靠在最远处的墙上的冰箱外，没有任何家具，地板上覆盖着某种粘液。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Scrolling through the device's video storage, you come across an archived video message received, apparently, through a chat app a few days after the first mass-spread portal storms.  Evidently taped through the low-grade camera of a smartphone, the footage shows the interior view of a small room bathed in darkness, a door visible in the background with several heavy-duty dead bolts drawn, and the grime-caked face of a balding man hovering in the foreground.  Quivering like a particularly well-bearded leaf, the man's gaze continually darts around as he rasps into the microphone, barely above a whisper.\n"
"\n"
"\"Denis, I don't have a clue if you and Lorence are still alive; fuck knows, after the shit that's been going on, I don't know how anyone can still be alive, but, in the name of hell and Jesus Christ, I hope you are, because you need to come get me, man; you really, really need to come get me out of here.  Something's gotten into my house.  I don't know what it wants; it hasn't hurt me yet, but it's not leaving, it's not letting me leave, it just watches me all day and all night, watching and following.  I managed to lock myself in the broom closet.  I don't think it can get in, but you need to come get me.  Please.  Please, for the love of God.  Send somebody.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the man's babbling trails onwards, your eyes are increasingly drawn to the space over the door, where a slight quivering in the wall is steadily growing more pronounced.  Suddenly, yellowed, rat-like incisors burst through the space, furiously and swiftly gnawing a softball-sized hole through the wood.  Noiselessly withdrawing, the fangs' place is taken by a disturbingly slender arm that limply drapes itself through the aperture, the unnaturally long hand at its end feeling along the wall with fingers that tangle like the leaves of a spider plant.  The cameraman only grows wise to the spaghetti-thin limb's intrusion as the fingers lightly cascade over his shoulders, moments before the arm entwines about him with tentacle-like deftness.\n"
"\n"
"The view's sent spiraling to the ground as the limb constricts and whips him rearwards, a sickening series of crunches and pained wails audible as the man's slammed against the heavy door with machine gun rapidity.  The last few shots consist of the man being yanked through a freshly splintered hole in the door as, upside down, a horrifically bloated head slithers down the wall.  Domed like the cranium of an infant, sparsely furred, inset with anglerfish-like eyes, and far too large for the ragged straw of flesh that composes its neck, the being's skull passively observes the blooded, screaming mess of a body that it's trying to feed through the watermelon-sized gap.  It succeeds… eventually."
msgstr ""
"滚动浏览设备的视频存储，您会看到一条存档的视频消息，显然是在第一次大规模传播的门户风暴几天后通过聊天应用程序收到的。  这段视频显然是通过智能手机的低档摄像头录制的，视频显示了一个沐浴在黑暗中的小房间的内部视图，背景中可以看到一扇门，上面拉着几个重型门闩，前景是一个秃顶男人满是污垢的脸。  当他对着麦克风大声说话时，他的目光不断地扫视周围，就像一片胡须特别浓密的叶子一样颤抖，几乎是低声耳语。\n"
"\n"
"“丹尼斯，我不知道你和洛伦斯是否还活着；他妈的知道，在这一切发生之后，我不知道怎么会有人还活着，但是，以地狱和耶稣基督的名义，我希望你还活着，因为你需要来救我，伙计；你真的，真的需要来救我离开这里。有东西进入了我的房子。我不知道它想要什么；它还没有伤害我，但它不会离开，它不让我离开，它只是整天整夜地监视着我，我认为它无法进入，但看在上帝的份上，请派人来吧。”\n"
"\n"
"随着男人的喋喋不休，你的目光越来越被门上方的空间吸引，那里墙壁的轻微颤抖逐渐变得更加明显。  突然，黄色的、老鼠般的门齿从空间中冲了出来，猛烈而迅速地在木头上啃出了一个垒球大小的洞。  獠牙无声无息地缩回，取而代之的是一条细长得令人不安的手臂，它无力地从缝隙中垂下来，末端那只不自然的长手沿着墙壁摸索，手指像吊兰的叶子一样纠缠在一起。  当手指轻轻地滑过他的肩膀时，摄影师才意识到意大利面条般瘦弱的肢体的入侵，随后手臂以触手般的灵巧缠绕在他身上。\n"
"\n"
"当他的肢体收缩并将他向后鞭打时，画面旋转到地面，当他以机枪般的速度撞上沉重的门时，可以听到一系列令人作呕的嘎吱声和痛苦的哀号。  最后几个镜头显示，这名男子被从门上刚刚裂开的洞里拽了出来，而一个肿胀得可怕的头颅则从墙上滑了下来。  这个生物的头盖骨像婴儿的头盖骨一样呈圆顶状，毛茸茸的，嵌着像琵琶鱼一样的眼睛，对于构成它脖子的参差不齐的肉来说太大了，这个生物的头骨被动地观察着它试图通过西瓜大小的缝隙喂食的血淋淋的、尖叫着的尸体。  它最终成功了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Swirling with a head-spinning meld of spurting reds and fleshy pinks, the sky looms over a windswept street, the jittering view seemingly recorded by a private property's security camera.  Bulging and receding, as though it were the face of a storm-ravaged ocean, a road-facing lawn fills the foreground.  A school bus rocks beyond the distorted greenery, the giggles of children clear over the squeals of the vehicle's suspension and the deformed whispers that tickle the edges of audibility.  The bus is coated in a carpet of writhing, flopping, and quivering torsos and limbs, all seemingly from children.  Rolling, through some indeterminate agency, along the vehicle's sides, wiggling across its roof, and at times merging straight through the metal, the bleeding body parts frolic across the bus.  Smiling and laughing, the heads attached to the torsos revolve in ways that would break regular necks, their jaws clamping about the faces of cohorts that they wriggle into, both parties gnawing at each other's skulls before they merge strait through one another.\n"
"\n"
"As the road buckles and an abyssal vortex twists into being beyond the bus, all the flailing legs assemble beneath the chassis and lift the vehicle from the ground, the children's eyes bursting from their sockets and wriggling to the bus's front as the rest of the body parts assume positions upon the seats.  The red-splattered distortion of children on a field trip sprints into the portal, the children's heads still laughing."
msgstr ""
"天空笼罩着令人头晕的红色和肉粉色的混合体，天空在风吹过的街道上若隐若现，颤抖的景象似乎是由私人财产的安全摄像头记录下来的。  前景处是面向道路的草坪，时而隆起，时而后退，仿佛是饱受风暴蹂躏的海洋的表面。  一辆校车在扭曲的绿地之外摇晃着，孩子们的咯咯笑声清晰地盖过了车辆悬架的尖叫声，以及刺痛听觉边缘的变形的低语声。  巴士上铺满了扭动、扑通、颤抖的躯干和四肢，所有这些似乎都是儿童的作品。  通过某种不确定的机构，沿着车辆的侧面滚动，在车顶上扭动，有时甚至直接穿过金属，流血的身体部位在公共汽车上嬉戏。  附在躯干上的头微笑着、大笑着，以一种足以折断普通脖子的方式旋转，它们的下巴夹住了它们蠕动进去的同伴的脸，双方在彼此合并之前互相咬着对方的头骨。\n"
"\n"
"当道路弯曲，深渊漩涡扭曲到公交车外时，所有摆动的腿都聚集在底盘下方，并将车辆从地面升起，孩子们的眼睛从眼窝中喷出，扭动到公交车的前部，而身体的其余部分则在座位上占据位置。  实地考察中的孩子们被红色泼溅的扭曲冲进了大门，孩子们的脑袋还在笑。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"The entire view pitches and rocks unsteadily, with the top bar of a ship's guardrail visible at the frame's base and a frothing ocean stretching for as far as the eye can see.  A muddled mix of desperate liturgies and shouts meld with the background rattle of gunfire; the sounds all but drown beneath the ear-splitting shriek of the video's subject: an enormous, writhing mass of gelatinous tentacles breaching the water and tussling with the bows of a military transport.  Floundering in the midground, the transport's all but subsumed beneath the megalithic limbs, rows of hooked barbs digging into the steel plating, the appendages connected to a gargantuan, scaly form that thrashes beneath the waves.  As the vessel is hoisted from the water and the tiny silhouettes of soldiers are dragged into the various slavering maws lining the tentacles like masses of krill, small specks appear in the sky on the horizon.\n"
"\n"
"A sonic boom resounds and the specks resolve into a flight of low-flying fighter jets.  Bellies laden with ordinance, the aircraft dive towards the struggle, harpoon missiles streaking free of their armament bays before they steeply climb.  Columns of water and yellowish ichor spurt skyward as the weapons find their mark, sending chunks of quivering flesh showering across the scene as the pummeled ship crashes back into the water.  As the behemoth's corpse slips beneath the waves, two jets bank around and sweep low, depositing depth charges over the creature's liquid grave.\n"
"\n"
"As the subsurface bombs detonate in a wave of bloody water, the final shot depicts the wrecked ship as it joins its attacker beneath the waves, a solitary soldier clinging to the uppermost reaches of the vessel as it sinks into the abyss."
msgstr ""
"整个画面不稳定地倾斜和摇晃，画面底部可见一艘船护栏的顶部栏杆，而一片泛着泡沫的海洋一直延伸到眼睛所能看到的地方。  绝望的礼拜仪式和呼喊声与背景的枪声混杂在一起；这些声音几乎淹没在视频主题的震耳欲聋的尖叫声中：一大群扭动的凝胶状触手破水而出，与军用运输船的船头发生扭打。  运输船在中地挣扎，几乎被巨石四肢淹没，一排排钩状倒钩刺入钢板，附属物连接到一个巨大的鳞状结构，在波浪下拍打。  当船只被从水中吊起时，士兵们的微小轮廓被拖进触手排列的各种流着口水的胃里，就像大量的磷虾一样，地平线上的天空中出现了小斑点。\n"
"\n"
"音爆响起，斑点分解成低空飞行的战斗机。  机腹装载着军械，飞机俯冲向战斗，鱼叉导弹在急剧爬升之前从武器舱中飞驰而出。  当武器找到目标时，水柱和黄色脓水向天空喷射，当被击中的船重新坠入水中时，大块颤抖的肉洒满整个场景。  当这个庞然大物的尸体滑入海浪之下时，两架喷气式飞机倾斜并低空扫过，在该生物的液体坟墓上沉积深水炸弹。\n"
"\n"
"当地下炸弹在血水波中引爆时，最后一个镜头描绘了失事的船只在海浪下与攻击者汇合，一名孤独的士兵在船只沉入深渊时紧紧抓住船只的最上游。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"The footage opens with an angled view of a rumpled picnic blanket, surrounded by the trunks and gnarled roots of trees and verdant shrubbery crowding the extremities.  The blanket is nearly obscured by the dozing profile of a young woman and three large dogs, one curled around her head like a pillow and the others sprawled across her body.\n"
"\n"
"\"Here, ladies and gentlemen of America,\" speaks a young man's voice into the microphone, \"we view a feral Annaliese in her natural habitat: buried under several kilos of dog.\"  A light chuckle accompanies the remark as the man shifts the view, the camera panning and bringing more of the environment into sight.  The film's transit pauses as a young boy seated upon a bench comes into frame, his face a slack, glass-eyed mask of indifference, a rivulet of drool dribbling from his hanging mouth.  A small dog is perched atop his knees, nuzzling at the child's motionless form and whimpering.\n"
"\n"
"A solitary, strangled yelp escapes the little dog's muzzle as the boy seizes its snout and throat, deftly breaking its neck.  As a stunned \"holy mother of God!\" can be heard from the cameraman, the view growing lopsided as he evidently fumbles the device, a mix of emotions blossoms across the boy's face.  The child's eyes well with tears, his mouth simultaneously twisting in a smile as he systematically sets to snapping the dead dog's bones.  Amidst the flurry of growls and barks emanating from the couple's recently awoken dogs and a muttered, \"Anna, get the dogs and get to the truck; we better leave,\" audible in the background, the video's final shot depicts the boy staring straight into the camera, a goofy grin plastered across his face.  He waves the dead canine's broken arm in a grotesque farewell."
msgstr ""
"视频一开始，从一个角度看，是一张皱巴巴的野餐毯，周围是树干、粗糙的树根和四肢拥挤的翠绿灌木丛。  毯子几乎被一名年轻女子和三只大狗打瞌睡的轮廓遮住了，其中一只像枕头一样蜷缩在她的头上，其他的则趴在她的身上。\n"
"\n"
"“在这里，美国的女士们、先生们，”一个年轻人的声音对着麦克风说道，“我们看到一只野生安娜丽丝在她的自然栖息地：埋在几公斤重的狗下面。”  伴随着这句话的，是一阵轻笑，那人改变了视角，镜头平移，让更多的环境进入视野。  影片的过渡暂停，一个坐在长凳上的小男孩出现在画面中，他的脸松弛，目光呆滞，脸上挂着冷漠的表情，垂着的嘴里淌着一条流口水。  一只小狗栖息在他的膝盖上，用鼻子蹭着孩子一动不动的身躯，呜咽着。\n"
"\n"
"当男孩抓住小狗的鼻子和喉咙，巧妙地折断小狗的脖子时，小狗的口鼻发出一声孤独、窒息的叫声。  作为一个目瞪口呆的“圣母上帝！”可以从摄影师那里听到，当他显然摸索着设备时，视野变得不平衡，男孩的脸上绽放出复杂的情绪。  孩子的眼里充满了泪水，他的嘴角同时扭曲着微笑，有条不紊地开始折断死狗的骨头。  在这对夫妇刚刚醒来的狗发出的一阵咆哮和吠叫声中，以及背景中传来的嘟哝声：“安娜，把狗带上卡车；我们最好离开。”视频的最后一个镜头描绘了男孩直视镜头，脸上挂着傻乎乎的笑容。  他挥舞着死去的狗断掉的手臂，以一种怪诞的告别方式。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "The photo depicts a serene and well-maintained terrace basked in warm, clear weather.  The central part of the picture is an intriguing sight, where a section of the terrace and a portion of the building behind it appear to have been cleanly removed, as if erased from reality.  To the side, there is a shattered flower pot, spilling out its soil and a plant with long, broad leaves, some of which have also been cut away in a sharp, clean fashion, almost as if sliced with a knife."
msgstr "这张照片描绘了一个宁静而维护良好的露台，沐浴在温暖晴朗的天气中。照片的中心部分是一个有趣的景象，露台的一部分和后面的一部分建筑似乎被干净利落地拆除了，就像从现实中抹去一样。旁边有一个碎了的花盆，洒出了泥土，还有一株叶子又长又宽的植物，有些叶子也被砍得干干净净，几乎就像被刀切了一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"The quality of this footage is both choppy and filled with the background fluctuations of static, with the view being angled upwards through the shattered beams of what used to have been a roof.  The structure looks as though it's been the recipient of a mortar bombardment, with large swaths of the roiling gray sky visible through the gaps and stifling volumes of heavy fog rolling in over the edges.  Unsteadily zooming past the wreckage, the camera focuses on the distant profile of a helicopter raveled in the depths of the filth-tinged clouds, the drone of its rotors audible as the aircraft beats its way through the bank of fog.  In the airspace around the machine, you can vaguely detect bands of ebony black undulating through the clouds—strands of oily darkness waning and fattening about its fuselage like writhing sea serpents.\n"
"\n"
"Just as you fancy that the tendrils were bulging into outlines, shadowy limbs extending from them, and, for a split second, appearing like suspended ranks of unnaturally lanky figures, the whole view devolves into the screech of static.  It takes you a moment to realize that what you originally took to be the shriek of interference was actually just the video's audio.\n"
"\n"
"For the last 45 seconds, it transmits the distant sounds of many hundreds of nearing, drawn-out screams."
msgstr ""
"这段镜头的质量既不稳定，又充满了静态的背景波动，视角通过曾经是屋顶的破碎横梁向上倾斜。  这座建筑看起来就像是迫击炮轰击的对象，透过缝隙可以看到大片灰色的天空，令人窒息的浓雾从边缘滚滚而来。  摄像机摇摇晃晃地飞过残骸，聚焦在远处一架直升机的轮廓，这架直升机在污浊的云层深处乱七八糟，当飞机穿过浓雾时，可以听到旋翼的嗡嗡声。  在机器周围的空域中，你可以隐约发现乌木黑色的带子在云层中起伏——油腻的黑暗带子在机身周围逐渐减弱和变胖，就像扭动的海蛇一样。\n"
"\n"
"正当你想象卷须凸出轮廓，阴暗的肢体从卷须中延伸出来，在一瞬间，看起来就像一队悬浮的不自然的瘦长人物时，整个景象变成了静电的尖叫声。  您过了一会儿才意识到，您最初认为是干扰的尖叫声实际上只是视频的音频。\n"
"\n"
"在最后 45 秒里，它从远处传来数百声近在咫尺的、拖长的尖叫声。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"These are a series of five recent voice recordings, all taken on the same day.\n"
"\n"
"18:31: A throaty, young woman's voice speaks into the microphone, restless footfalls audible in the background.  \"Okay, can we all—that is, me—just admit how fucked up it is that I've resorted to speaking to my phone to keep my nerves from blowing up?  I heard that pretending like someone is listening helps chill you out, but, Jesus, fuck, this ain't working.  Guess it's better to pretend to talk to someone than to stay quiet, though.  Christ.  <city> looked like God had decided to wack out the middle finger: bodies everywhere and massive crowds of folks losing their collective shit.  Thank heaven, I'd been out hiking and was able to turn tail and mosey back where I came from.  I don't know how long I'd been walking before I found this cabin.  The place looked deserted, and the door was unlocked, so I let myself in.  I guess I'll hang out here until something happens.  Definitely better than slogging it outside or trying to go back.\"\n"
"\n"
"19:55: \"You know, whoever owned this shack, you sure had one sick taste in art.  Some of the walls have these largeish, glass-cased portraits that are, honestly, really well painted.  Damn if ain't most of them skinless faces, though.  Oh, and tentacles.  Lots of tentacles.\"  The speaker falls silent as an unearthly squeal echoes in the distance.\n"
"\n"
"23:05: \"Windows.  The portraits were windows.  The faces aren't there anymore.  God, help me.\"\n"
"\n"
"0:21: Amidst what sounds like distant, monstrous whispers and crashing reverberations of unknown origin, the woman's hysterical, shrieking voice sobs.  \"I blacked out a few minutes ago and found myself about to open the front door.  I've tied myself to the stovetop.  They're out there!  They want me to come out!  I don't want to go!  I don't want to!  I don't want…\"\n"
"\n"
"0:44: Interspersed by whining shrieks and heavy pants, the woman's voice struggles to be heard within the distorted recording.  \"Snakes.  I see them!  They're everywhere!  They're inside of me; I know it!  slithering!  Crawling!  Writhing!  I need to get them out.  Dear God, get them out of me!  Get them out!\"  The sound of a drawer being wrenched open can be heard, followed by the characteristic clatter of a metallic implement being drawn.  The sickening sound of sawing meat and cracking bones can be heard, all but lost beneath the woman's agonized screams.  For the last 15 minutes of the recording, only the dripping sound of coils of wet, viscous material dribbling to the ground can be heard."
msgstr ""
"这些是一系列最近的五段录音，全部拍摄于同一天。\n"
"\n"
"18:31：一个沙哑的年轻女子的声音对着麦克风说话，背景中可以听到不安的脚步声。  “好吧，我们所有人——也就是我——能不能承认我靠着手机说话来避免紧张情绪是多么糟糕？我听说假装有人在听可以让你冷静下来，但是，天哪，操，这行不通。不过，我猜假装和某人说话比保持安静更好。天啊。<城市>看起来就像上帝决定竖起中指：到处都是尸体，一大群人失去了他们的生命。谢天谢地，我出去徒步了，我不知道我走了多久才发现这个小屋，而且门没锁，所以我就进去了。我想我会在这里闲逛，直到发生什么事情，这绝对比在外面挣扎或试图回去要好。”\n"
"\n"
"19:55：“你知道，无论是谁拥有这间小屋，你对艺术的品味肯定是有病的。有些墙上有这些巨大的、玻璃外壳的肖像画，说实话，画得非常好。但该死的，如果不是大多数人都没有皮肤的脸。哦，还有触手。很多触手。”  远处传来一声怪异的尖叫声，说话者陷入了沉默。\n"
"\n"
"23:05：“窗户。肖像是窗户。面孔不再存在了。上帝，帮助我。”\n"
"\n"
"0:21：在听起来遥远而可怕的低语声和来历不明的破碎回响中，女人歇斯底里地尖叫着抽泣。  “几分钟前我就昏过去了，发现自己正要打开前门。我把自己绑在炉子上。他们就在那里！他们要我出来！我不想走！我不想！我不想……”\n"
"\n"
"0:44：在扭曲的录音中，女人的声音夹杂着呜咽的尖叫声和厚重的裤子，很难被听到。  “蛇。我看到它们！它们无处不在！它们在我体内；我知道！滑行！爬行！扭动！我需要把它们赶出去。亲爱的上帝，把它们赶出去！把它们赶出去！”  可以听到抽屉被打开的声音，随后是金属工具被拉动时发出的特有的咔哒声。  可以听到锯肉和骨折的令人作呕的声音，但几乎被女人痛苦的尖叫声淹没了。  在录音的最后 15 分钟，只能听到潮湿粘稠材料滴落到地面的滴水声。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This appears to be a civil-protection video, published by the Federal Emergency Management Agency a handful of days before the official evacuation order was declared.  Within the clip, standing within a plain-featured, well-lit room behind a steel table, a close-shaven redhead in a light olive shirt demonstrates the proper donning and doffing procedure for a gasmask, as well as providing general tips and information for proper NBC conduct.  Mask in hand and with an assortment of cylindrical filters arrayed upon the table, she demonstrates dawning, screwing in the proper filter, pressurizing the mask for an airtight seal, and repeatedly encouraging the viewer to \"Remember, gentlemen, shave your chin first before even thinking about trying to put on a mask.  That goes for you as well, ladies.  All that hair—ponytails, pigtails, bangs, whatever—needs to go right out the window.  You can keep the eyebrows, though.\"\n"
"\n"
"At the video's conclusion, the instructor outlines several tactics for protecting one's self from biological contaminants, including several methods for distilling water, sealing the edges of doors and window frames with masking tape, and formulating a makeshift NBC suit from multi-layered water-proof rubber storm coats, waders, gloves, and a liberal amount of duct tape.  Ultimately, the clip rounds off with a solemn warning that \"all the equipment in the world won't protect you from negligence and stupidity, for all the keyboard warriors and self-proclaimed preppers watching.  All this gear is only meant to allow you to evacuate to a safer area, and that's all it'll do.  It won't let you ride out a catastrophe indefinitely, so it's still important that you keep your heads down and proceed to an evacuation gathering point if and when the call goes out.\""
msgstr ""
"这似乎是一段民事保护视频，由联邦紧急事务管理局在宣布正式疏散令前几天发布。  在这段视频中，一名穿着浅橄榄色衬衫、剃得光光的红发站在一张钢桌后面的一间朴素、光线充足的房间里，演示了防毒面具的正确佩戴和脱下程序，并提供了正确的 NBC 行为的一般提示和信息。  她手里拿着口罩，桌子上摆着各种各样的圆柱形过滤器，她演示了如何拧上适当的过滤器，给口罩加压以形成密封，并反复鼓励观众“记住，先生们，在考虑戴口罩之前先把下巴刮干净。女士们，这也适合你。所有的头发——马尾辫、辫子、刘海等等——都需要直接从窗外出去。你可以保留不过，眉毛。”\n"
"\n"
"在视频的结尾，讲师概述了几种保护自己免受生物污染物侵害的策略，包括几种蒸馏水的方法、用胶带密封门窗框的边缘，以及用多层防水橡胶防风雨衣、涉水鞋、手套和大量胶带制作临时的 NBC 防护服。  最后，剪辑以一个庄严的警告结束：“世界上所有的装备都无法保护你免受疏忽和愚蠢的影响，所有键盘战士和自称末日准备者都在看着。所有这些装备只是为了让你疏散到一个更安全的区域，仅此而已。它不会让你无限期地渡过灾难，所以你低头并继续前进仍然很重要。”如果呼叫消失，疏散集合点。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This appears to be a locally saved livestream archive, with the feed filming a decrepit backstreet.  An older, bespectacled man and a middle-aged Latina woman stand huddled in a line against the wall, their legs lashed to each other and their hands bound to the front.  Beaming like a ray of sunshine, a man dressed in tactical gear prances before them, a baseball bat resting conspicuously upon his shoulder as he greets the camera.  \"Hey guys,\" he says, \"this is Andre Diliman, and we're going to be putting our detective hats on and figuring out who's to blame for all the shit going on, and we're going to do that, with the help of these beautiful people right here, so please, introduce yourselves.\"\n"
"\n"
"Exchanging resigned glances, the two captives lower their heads as the woman mutters, \"I'm Dr. Martha Sharma.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"And I'm Dr. Conrad Sharma,\" her compatriot glumly adds.\n"
"\n"
"\"And both you fuckers work at Jameson Biotech,\" the spokesman concludes in a sing-song cadence as he saunters before the couple.  \"We're going to start easy.  The CDC has been saying that something's messing with people's brains: making them act all aggressive.  Now, my question to you is simple: What did y'all cook up in those labs of yours?\"\n"
"\n"
"Lifting her head and making eye contact with her questioner, the woman shakes her head incredulously.  \"You fucking idiot.\"\n"
"\n"
"Nodding understandingly, the man turns away from the couple.  \"I see we might need some harder persuasion, that's not too surprising.  Alexander, Tomas, and Mary, bring in the kid… and the wire!\"\n"
"\n"
"Amidst a flurry of horrified protests from the captives, a gaunt man appears from off-frame, a goofy grin creasing his unshaven face as he lugs a squalling baby in his arms.  A second man and a woman follow him into view… uncoiling a length of barbed wire.  Wrapping the rusted steel about the infant's midsection, heedless of the pained wails emanating as the barbs scrape its skin, the duo stand apart, gripping opposite ends of the makeshift garrote.  \"Ok guys,\" the ringleader gleefully instructs, \"on my mark, we'll give the little shit a light squeezing.  If the good doctors don't want to talk after that… then I want it rendered into mincemeat!  3, 2, 1…\"\n"
"\n"
"Spouts of blood spurt in all directions as bullet-riddled bodies collapse to the ground, the camera toppling rearwards as a bark of automatic gunfire echoes through the audio, accompanied by the approaching, hurried stomps of soldiers' boots."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是本地保存的直播档案，视频中拍摄的是一条破旧的后街。  一名戴着眼镜的年长男子和一名中年拉丁裔女子靠墙挤成一排，他们的腿互相绑在一起，双手被绑在前面。  一名身穿战术装备的男子在他们面前昂首阔步，笑容满面，像一缕阳光，迎接镜头时，他的肩上显眼地搁着一根棒球棒。  “嘿伙计们，”他说，“我是安德烈·迪利曼，我们将戴上侦探帽子，找出谁应该为所有这些狗屎事件负责，我们将在这些美丽的人的帮助下做到这一点，所以请介绍一下你们自己。”\n"
"\n"
"两名俘虏交换了无奈的眼神，低下头，女人低声说道：“我是玛莎·夏尔马博士。”\n"
"\n"
"“我是康拉德·夏尔马博士，”她的同胞闷闷不乐地补充道。\n"
"\n"
"“你们两个混蛋都在詹姆森生物技术公司工作，”发言人在这对夫妇面前闲庭信步，以唱歌的节奏总结道。  “我们要从简单的开始。疾病预防控制中心一直在说有人的大脑受到了干扰：让他们表现出攻击性。现在，我问你的问题很简单：你们在你们的实验室里做了什么？”\n"
"\n"
"女人抬起头，与提问者进行眼神交流，难以置信地摇摇头。  “你他妈的白痴。”\n"
"\n"
"男人理解地点点头，转身离开这对夫妇。  “我发现我们可能需要更强有力的说服，这并不奇怪。亚历山大、托马斯和玛丽，把孩子带进来……还有电线！”\n"
"\n"
"在俘虏们一阵惊恐的抗议声中，一名瘦削的男子从画面外出现，他未刮胡子的脸上挂着傻乎乎的笑容，怀里抱着一个正在哭闹的婴儿。  第二个男人和一个女人跟着他进入视野……展开一段带刺铁丝网。  将生锈的钢铁包裹在婴儿的腹部，不顾倒刺刮伤婴儿皮肤时发出的痛苦哀号，两人分开站着，抓住临时绞刑架的两端。  “好吧，伙计们，”头目兴高采烈地指示道，“按照我的指示，我们会轻轻挤压一下这个小东西。如果好医生在那之后不想说话……那么我希望它变成肉末！3、2、1……”\n"
"\n"
"当布满弹孔的尸体倒在地上时，鲜血向四面八方喷涌而出，摄像机向后倒下，自动枪声在音频中回响，伴随着士兵急促的靴子踩近声。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This appears to be a promo video for Food Place brand food, depicting a nondescript drive-through with an idling open-topped convertible containing a family of four.  As the driver is handed a paper bag of generic fast food, a sudden bolt of lightning arcs from the night sky, striking the bag and reducing it to ashes.  With the family left exchanging wide-eyed glances, the growl of an engine becomes audible over a steadily rising crescendo of music.  The soundtrack eventually resolves into a rock iteration of the American anthem as a purple motorcycle bursts onto the scene, the Food Place logo stamped upon the side, and its caped rider bearing the noble visage… of Food Person!  Swiftly mounting the car's hood, the motorcycle soars in a slow-motion arc across the convertible, its rider depositing a giant bag of Food Place food into the arms of the cheering family.  Large, metallic text stamps boldly across the view as the bike lands and roars into the distance.\n"
"\n"
"\"Food Place: The hero your stomach doesn't deserve… but needs!\"\n"
"\n"
"The text dissolves, replaced by three figures holding appropriately massive hamburgers: Abraham Lincoln, Martin Luther King, and, in between them… Jesus?\n"
"\n"
"\"Food Place: food made by great Americans… for great Americans!\""
msgstr ""
"这似乎是 Food Place 品牌食品的宣传视频，描绘了一辆平淡无奇的汽车餐厅，一辆闲置的敞篷车载着一家四口。  当司机收到一袋普通快餐时，夜空中突然划出一道闪电，击中了纸袋，将其化为灰烬。  当剩下的家人睁大眼睛交换目光时，随着音乐逐渐渐强，发动机的轰鸣声变得清晰可闻。  配乐最终解析为美国国歌的摇滚版本，一辆紫色摩托车突然出现在现场，侧面印有 Food Place 标志，披着斗篷的骑手带着高贵的面容……美食人！  摩托车迅速装上汽车引擎盖，以慢速弧线飞过敞篷车，骑手将一大袋 Food Place 食物放入欢呼的家人怀里。  当自行车落地并呼啸至远方时，巨大的金属文字大胆地印在视野中。\n"
"\n"
"“美食广场：你的胃不值得……但却需要的英雄！”\n"
"\n"
"文字消失了，取而代之的是三个拿着适当大汉堡的人物：亚伯拉罕·林肯、马丁·路德·金，以及在他们中间的……耶稣？\n"
"\n"
"“美食广场：伟大的美国人为伟大的美国人制作的食物！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "This appears to be a screen shot of a social media blog post, with the view dominated by a full-color picture of a futuristic-looking wind turbine standing tall against a backdrop of rolling hills and verdant pastures.  Looming atop a distant mound squats a large nuclear energy facility, with a forbiddingly dark mushroom cloud blossoming in the air above it and the surrounding land a toxic, radioactive-green wasteland.  Regally poised atop one of the turbine's blades stands a diminutive figure, bark-like skin cladding them like armor and flowering buds crowning their scalp.  An estoc carved from wood is securely wielded in their vine-composed arms and thrusts towards the mushroom cloud, with the caption, \"Thrust Away Nuclear Energy, Stab into the Future of Clean Electricity,\" looming over the scene.  The rest of the post details the time and location arrangements for an eco-rights protest in Vermont, scheduled to take place weeks before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "这似乎是社交媒体博客文章的屏幕截图，视图以全彩图片为主，未来派风力涡轮机高高矗立在连绵起伏的山丘和翠绿牧场的背景下。  远处的一座土丘上隐约矗立着一座大型核能设施，其上方的空气中盛开着令人生畏的黑色蘑菇云，周围的土地是有毒的、放射性的绿色荒地。  涡轮机叶片上矗立着一个身材娇小的人物，树皮般的皮肤像铠甲一样包裹着他们，头皮上长着花蕾。  他们用藤蔓组成的手臂牢牢地挥舞着木雕的埃斯托克，并向蘑菇云刺去，标题是“推开核能，刺入清洁电力的未来”，在场景中若隐若现。  帖子的其余部分详细介绍了佛蒙特州生态权利抗议活动的时间和地点安排，该抗议活动定于大灾变前几周举行。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This appears to be a screenshot from a newsreel: a reporter standing in the foreground before the night-enveloped backdrop of a rubble-strewn crossroad, the caption, \"Maine disaster area,\" printed in the upper corner.  Several military transport vehicles idle in the midground, the white beams of their headlights illuminating groups of civilians dressed in a shabby assortment of streetwear and night clothes.  Clutching bundled possessions, children, and pets, it's evident that they're being ushered towards the waiting vehicles, with teams of heavily armed soldiers forming protective flanks and lines of machinegun-equipped sandbags cordoning off roadways at the frame's extremities.\n"
"\n"
"Stooping behind a building's window and peeking through partly opened curtains, observing the humans' flight with beady, unblinking eyes, you can make out an amorphous, white shape.  You're not sure what's stranger: that the creature's somehow evaded notice by the dozens of watchful soldiers, or that, for all the world, it resembles an inhumanly tall, muscular penguin."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是新闻影片的截图：一位记者站在前景中，背景布满瓦砾的十字路口，背景布满了夜色，上方角落印有标题“缅因州灾区”。  几辆军用运输车停在中间，车头灯的白色光束照亮了一群穿着破旧街头服装和睡衣的平民。  他们抓着捆绑的财物、儿童和宠物，显然正在被引向等候的车辆，一队全副武装的士兵形成保护性侧翼，一排排配备机枪的沙袋封锁了车架末端的道路。\n"
"\n"
"弯腰在建筑物的窗户后面，透过半开的窗帘，用圆圆的、一眨不眨的眼睛观察人类的飞行，你可以看到一个无定形的白色形状。  你不确定什么是奇怪的：这个生物以某种方式躲过了数十名警惕的士兵的注意，或者，对于整个世界来说，它就像一只非人的高大、肌肉发达的企鹅。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This appears to be a segment of bodycam footage, with the perspective shaking as the wearer jogs through a dimly lit corridor, a drawn pistol's muzzle leading the way.  Rounding a bend, any forward progress is promptly arrested as a formally dressed woman comes into the shot.  Hefting a large sledgehammer and crushing the skulls of zombie after zombie clambering through a shattered window, an expression of childish glee is plastered across her face.\n"
"\n"
"Glancing towards the camera, her maniacal grin grows wider as she abandons her post and, stumbling on high heels, rushes towards the view.  Heedless of the bullets that plunge into her gore-caked body, the enraptured look upon the woman's face as she swings the mallet and blood spurts across the lens is going to haunt you in your sleep."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是随身摄像机镜头的一部分，当佩戴者慢跑穿过光线昏暗的走廊时，视角在晃动，拔出的手枪枪口在前面引路。  转弯时，当一名穿着正装的女人进入镜头时，任何向前的进展都会立即停止。  当僵尸爬过破碎的窗户后，她举起一把大锤，敲碎僵尸的头骨，脸上洋溢着孩子气的欢乐表情。\n"
"\n"
"她瞥了一眼镜头，脸上的笑容变得更加疯狂，她放弃了自己的岗位，踩着高跟鞋跌跌撞撞地冲向镜头。  不管子弹射入她血淋淋的身体，当她挥动木槌、鲜血喷洒在镜头上时，她脸上的狂喜表情将会在你的睡梦中萦绕心头。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This appears to be somebody's saved to-do list, with a green checkmark rounding off each entry, save for the last.\n"
"\n"
"To-do:\n"
"\n"
"Pack the car with a few weeks worth of provisions: clothes and shoes, toiletries and medications, electronics and games, a portable steamer, and camping equipment (tents, a cooking set, sleeping bags, a propane cooker, and some tanks).  Dig out dad's Vietnam AK47 from the packing boxes in the basement and hunt around for his old reloading equipment (look up how it works).  If the kids ask, just say it's for hunting.\n"
"\n"
"File for extended leave from work and withdraw the kids from school.  If Erith complains about having to leave uni and her girlfriend, say it's only temporary.\n"
"\n"
"Take the car and stop by the supermarket for some pre-packed camping meals before heading to pick up the kids.\n"
"\n"
"Head into Scofield's on the way out of town to pick up some bullets.  Should probably ask Julian for advice and help; he plays videogames with this sort of stuff.  Can I even buy ammo without having a license?  *Just found out that different guns take different bullets and that reloading equipment isn't used to reload guns.  Definitely ask Julian for help.\n"
"\n"
"Take the highway out north and meet up with Sandra at the rest stop 10 miles out before traveling to her place in Rhode Island."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是某人保存的待办事项列表，每个条目都有一个绿色的复选标记，除了最后一个。\n"
"\n"
"待办事项：\n"
"\n"
"在车上装上几周的必需品：衣服和鞋子、洗漱用品和药物、电子产品和游戏、便携式蒸锅和露营设备（帐篷、炊具、睡袋、丙烷炊具和一些坦克）。  从地下室的包装箱中挖出爸爸的越南 AK47，并寻找他的旧装填设备（看看它是如何工作的）。  如果孩子们问起来，就说这是为了打猎。\n"
"\n"
"申请延长休假并让孩子们退学。  如果埃里斯抱怨不得不离开大学和她的女朋友，请说这只是暂时的。\n"
"\n"
"开车去超市买一些预先包装好的露营餐，然后去接孩子们。\n"
"\n"
"在出城的路上前往斯科菲尔德店取一些子弹。  也许应该向朱利安寻求建议和帮助；他用这类东西玩电子游戏。  我什至可以在没有许可证的情况下购买弹药吗？  *刚刚发现不同的枪使用不同的子弹，并且重新装弹设备不用于重新装弹枪。  一定要向朱利安寻求帮助。\n"
"\n"
"沿高速公路向北行驶，在 10 英里外的休息站与桑德拉会合，然后前往她在罗德岛州的住处。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This appears to have been a segment of let's play footage, a face-cam section occupying the film's upper corner and depicting an unshaven man sitting within a windowed bedroom.  Maintaining an enthused monolog, the youth's upbeat commentary plods along for most of the video, undisturbed by intermittent, inhuman screams and distant detonations.  Indeed, even when the sky beyond his window abruptly darkens, the man shows little reaction save for moving to turn on an adjacent lamp, his commentary swiftly resuming despite the device failing to turn on.\n"
"\n"
"Minutes pass, and, following a particularly violent glitch, an amorphous, white shape can be seen suspended in the gloom, some distance beyond the window.  A chain of malfunctions suddenly begins, each glitch rendering the screen dark.  With every glitch, the form grows steadily closer until its visage is suddenly pressed against the glass.  Bearing the shape of a woman, with patches of fish-like scales knitting between jagged rows of protruding teeth that emerge from its skin, the naked aberration grins with a mouth full of slithering tentacles, its eye sockets replaced by gnashing maws, and many dozens of staring eyes sunken into its undulating flesh.  Another malfunction darkens the screen, only for the view to be nearly subsumed by the nightmare's writhing face when vision returns, the creature's rotten, bloated body merging straight through the still-babbling man's trunk.  A final malfunction robs the footage of visuals, and when it returns, only the man can be seen—sitting quietly alone, his bloodied, empty eye sockets staring at the camera, his toothless maw gaping.  The film goes black, and for the final minutes, only the man's soft crying can be heard."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是让我们播放镜头的一个片段，一个面部摄像头部分占据了影片的上角，描绘了一个不刮胡子的男人坐在有窗户的卧室里。  这位年轻人保持着热情的独白，在视频的大部分时间里都在缓慢地进行着乐观的评论，没有受到断断续续的、非人的尖叫声和远处爆炸的干扰。  事实上，即使窗外的天空突然变暗，该男子除了打开旁边的灯外几乎没有任何反应，尽管设备无法打开，但他的评论很快又恢复了。\n"
"\n"
"几分钟过去了，在一次特别严重的故障之后，可以看到一个无定形的白色物体悬浮在黑暗中，距离窗户有一段距离。  一连串的故障突然开始，每个故障都会使屏幕变暗。  每出现一次故障，这个物体就会逐渐靠近，直到它的脸突然压在玻璃上。  这个赤裸的异兽有着女人的形状，皮肤上长出一排锯齿状的突出牙齿，上面编织着一片片鱼状的鳞片，它咧着嘴笑，嘴里长满了滑行的触手，它的眼窝被咬牙切齿的胃所取代，几十只凝视的眼睛陷入了它起伏的肉体中。  另一次故障使屏幕变暗，当视野恢复时，视野几乎被梦魇扭曲的脸所淹没，该生物腐烂、肿胀的身体直接融入了仍在喋喋不休的男人的躯干。  最后一次故障使镜头失去了视觉效果，当它返回时，只能看到那个人——独自安静地坐着，他血迹斑斑、空洞的眼窝盯着镜头，张着没牙的嘴巴。  影片变黑，最后几分钟只能听到男人轻柔的哭泣声。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "This is a video that was taken in a subway train.  Someone is obviously giggling at someone reading a comically large newspaper when the train suddenly halts and an unnaturally big rat scurries off into the darkness, barely visible but its eyes reflect the light from the interior of the train.  You can hear a muffled \"What the fuck\" and the video ends with the train continuing to the next station."
msgstr "这是一段在地铁列车上拍摄的视频。当火车突然停下来时，一只不自然的大老鼠跑进了黑暗中，几乎看不见，但它的眼睛反射着火车内部的光线。显然，有人正对着一份滑稽的大报纸咯咯笑着。你可以听到一声低沉的“他妈的”，视频以列车继续驶向下一站而结束。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This is an archived text sent through a messaging app.\n"
"\n"
"L. C. Carlsen: Yo, I just got this pick sent over from my buddy in the Air Force.  Dude, check this shite out.n\n"
"An attached high-resolution photo shows an aerial view of several residential and commercial city blocks, with most of the buildings leveled and heavy bomb damage throughout.  A yawning chasm splits the ground where a main road had evidently lain; the concrete thoroughfare burst open as though from some tremendous subterranean pressure.  Mottled, gray mold cakes the surroundings, swamping debris, street fixtures, and entire vehicles in layers of fungal matter, giant, mushroom-like stems lifting heavy heads to the roofs of buildings.  A solitary soldier stands atop a half-collapsed roof, quivering mold reaching almost level with the structure's parapet.  The quality of the photo is such that you can almost distinguish the individual tears that dampen the soldier's cheeks and trace the bright outline of the flare that they hold above their head."
msgstr ""
"这是通过消息应用程序发送的存档文本。\n"
"\n"
"L.C. Carlsen：哟，我刚刚从我空军的朋友那里收到了这个选秀权。  老兄，检查一下这个东西。n\n"
"随附的高分辨率照片显示了几个住宅和商业街区的鸟瞰图，大部分建筑物被夷为平地，炸弹造成严重损坏。  一条巨大的裂缝将地面劈开，那里显然是一条主干道。混凝土大道仿佛受到某种巨大的地下压力一样爆裂开来。  斑驳的灰色霉菌覆盖了周围的环境，沼泽碎片、街道设施和整辆车都覆盖着一层层的真菌物质，巨大的蘑菇状茎把沉重的头举到了建筑物的屋顶上。  一名孤独的士兵站在半倒塌的屋顶上，颤抖的霉菌几乎与建筑物的护墙齐平。  照片的质量如此之高，你几乎可以分辨出士兵脸颊上的每一滴眼泪，以及他们头顶上举着的照明弹的明亮轮廓。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This is an archived voice message sent through a chat app.\n"
"\n"
"The recording opens with the low purr of a vehicle's motor, with various rattling clinks and clangs audible as a man's Hispanic accent forces its way through the choppy audio.  \"HEY CHICA, CAN YOU GIVE A MAN ONE HELL OF A WOOHOO?  I just got off the plane from Costa Rica—one full hour ahead of schedule!  Let me tell you something: the airport was emptier than a fucking graveyard, and the staff, sheesh, jumpier than Pablo when he sees the neighbors' dog.  I didn't know that a few riots would put the fear of God in all you gun-toting Americans, but if they're anything like down in San Jose, I suppose I can't blame people.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the man talks, the regular thump of large helicopter rotors grows audible in the background, the aircraft seeming to roar right overhead as the driver concludes.  \"Anyway, I'm in a rental and heading to <city> right now; I should be there in less than an hour.  I'll get back to you later.  There's a pretty big roadblock ahead, and it looks like they're flagging me down.  I'll see you soon, guapa, love…\"  The recording is cut short by a burst of automatic gunfire."
msgstr ""
"这是通过聊天应用程序发送的存档语音消息。\n"
"\n"
"录音以汽车发动机的低沉咕噜声开始，伴随着一个男人的西班牙口音强行穿过断断续续的音频，发出各种叮当声和叮当声。  “嘿，奇卡，你能给一个人一个地狱般的呼呼吗？我刚从哥斯达黎加下飞机——比预定时间提前了整整一个小时！让我告诉你一件事：机场比他妈的墓地还空，工作人员，天哪，当巴勃罗看到邻居的狗时，他比巴勃罗还要紧张。我不知道几场骚乱会让你们所有持枪的美国人对上帝产生恐惧，但如果他们像圣保罗一样，何塞，我想我不能责怪别人。”\n"
"\n"
"当这名男子说话时，背景中可以听到大型直升机旋翼的规律撞击声，当驾驶员总结时，飞机似乎在头顶呼啸而过。  “不管怎样，我正在租一辆出租屋，现在正前往<城市>；我应该不到一个小时就能到达。我稍后再回复你。前面有一个相当大的路障，看起来他们正在标记我。我很快就会见到你，瓜帕，亲爱的……”录音被一阵自动枪声打断。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This is an archived voice message, seemingly received on the eve of the Cataclysm from a number saved as \"Mandy.\"\n"
"\n"
"The sound of ragged, unsuccessfully stifled breaths fills the recording, with hiccupped whimpers emitted at barely above a whisper as, in the background, a man's shouting and a woman's pleading sobs are audible.\n"
"\n"
"\"Jonas,\" sniffs a teen girl's voice.  \"I… I don't know what's happened, but dad's gone crazy.  He's tied Mom to the radiator for the last hour, and… oh God!  Jona, I think he's stripped her, and he's been turning on and off the radiator and sometimes I hear him crooning about how much he loves her, even as he's beating her and she's screaming.  I tried calling 911, but nobody's answering, and he's locked me in the basement, and I\"\n"
"\n"
"The girl's speech dissolves into sob-clogged gasps as the woman's voice escalates into a blood-curdling shriek, the scream growing sodden and gurgling as the liquid spray of gushing viscera grows to dominate it.  Heavy footfalls grow audible as the distant, gore-choked death rattle fades, replaced by the burble of viscous fluids and the girl's uneven breaths.\n"
"\n"
"\"Ooh, little Manatee,\" calls a man's sing-song voice as the muffled click of an opening door and the thump of bare feet on stairs register in the recording.  \"Come on, sweety, it'll be easier if you just work with me.\"\n"
"\n"
"For a few moments, all that can be heard are the girl's desperately muffled breaths and her father's searching footfalls.\n"
"\n"
"The recording is suddenly filled with the girl's terrified shrieks and the swish of a struggling body being violently hauled across the floor, the sounds growing distorted as the phone tumbles to the ground.  Swiftly gagged, the daughter's weeping pleas are muffled, replaced by the retching of lungs clawing for air as the man's monstrously soothing voice filters through the recording.  \"There, there, little manatee,\" he croons, the sound of fingers being comfortingly stroked through hair in contrast with the nauseous gurgling of a throat freshly choking on vomit.  \"Don't fight it.  Go to sleep now.  Soon, you'll be happy with Mom.  There, there.  Go to sleep, darling.  I loved you.  I love you.\"\n"
"\n"
"The last few minutes of the recording are occupied by silence before the father's voice returns.  He's weeping."
msgstr ""
"这是一条已存档的语音消息，似乎是在大灾变前夕从一个保存为“Mandy”的号码收到的。\n"
"\n"
"录音中充满了断断续续、无法抑制的呼吸声，打嗝的呜咽声几乎高于耳语，背景音乐中可以听到男人的喊叫和女人恳求的抽泣。\n"
"\n"
"“乔纳斯，”一个十几岁女孩的声音传来。  “我……我不知道发生了什么事，但爸爸疯了。最后一个小时他把妈妈绑在暖气片上，然后……天啊！乔纳，我想他把她脱光了，他一直打开和关闭暖气片，有时我听到他低吟着说他有多爱她，尽管他正在殴打她，她在尖叫。我试着拨打 911，但没有人接听，他把我锁在了房间里。”地下室，还有我”\n"
"\n"
"女孩的话语逐渐变成了抽泣般的喘息，而女人的声音则升级为令人毛骨悚然的尖叫声，随着内脏喷涌而出的液体喷涌而出，尖叫声变得湿漉漉的，发出汩汩的声响。  随着远处血腥的死亡嘎嘎声渐渐消失，沉重的脚步声逐渐响起，取而代之的是粘稠液体的咕噜声和女孩不规则的呼吸声。\n"
"\n"
"“哦，小海牛，”一个男人唱着歌的声音喊道，录音中记录着开门时发出的低沉的咔哒声和光脚踩在楼梯上的重击声。  “来吧，亲爱的，如果你和我一起工作会更容易。”\n"
"\n"
"有那么一会儿，只能听到女孩绝望地低沉的呼吸声和她父亲搜寻的脚步声。\n"
"\n"
"录音中突然充满了女孩惊恐的尖叫声和挣扎着的身体被猛烈拖过地板的声音，随着手机跌落到地上，声音变得扭曲。  女儿的哭泣声被迅速堵住，声音被压抑，取而代之的是肺部的干呕声，而男人那可怕的舒缓声音穿过录音。  “那里，那里，小海牛，”他低声说道，手指舒适地抚摸头发的声音与刚被呕吐物窒息的喉咙发出令人作呕的咕噜声形成鲜明对比。  “别抗拒了。现在去睡觉吧。很快，你就会和妈妈在一起幸福的。好了，好了。睡吧，亲爱的。我爱你。我爱你。”\n"
"\n"
"录音的最后几分钟充满了沉默，然后父亲的声音又回来了。  他在哭。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This security tape captures the view of a rural gas station and the deserted, tree-fringed roadway beyond.  The space beside one of the gas pumps is soon filled as a large 4x4 motors into the frame, towing a bouncing and rocking animal carriage behind it.  As the truck pulls up and a burly, bearded man clambers out, insistent whinnies and heavy bangs emanate from the trailer's interior.  Brows knit in concern, the driver potters with the pump as the trailer trembles and shakes with the struggles of its displeased captive, the neighs growing ever harsher and verging on a distorted scream by the time the man's finished tending to his vehicle.  After he finishes gassing up, the motorist replaces the nozzle and approaches the trailer, rapping on its side.\n"
"\n"
"\"Blacky,\" he calls out, \"the hell is wrong with you in there?\"\n"
"\n"
"A crushing blow bulges the trailer's shell, causing it to sway violently as rivets burst and the man staggers back.  With successive blows shattering the trailer's side panels, the head of a horse eventually forces its way through a widening crack, shards of jagged metal stripping the flesh from its skull as it struggles.  Scrambling to the door of his 4x4, the driver flings himself into the vehicle as the undead beast crashes free, sniffing the air for a few moments before rearing up and bringing its front hooves down on the truck's windshield.  Cowering out of sight, the man's sobbing pleas and screams are audible as the heavy utility vehicle is pummeled into a crumpled wreck, the heap of mobile sinew that used to be his steed struggling to push its snapping snout through the shattered window.\n"
"\n"
"Tearing the driver's side door free with a screech of ripping metal, the animal tosses its head and lets loose a malformed shriek before it plunges into the peeled-open cabin.  Muscles rippling and thrashing, the horse's metal-flayed bulk obscures much of the scene, though the man's rising screams, the nauseating sounds of bones being torn from their homes, and the sprays of viscera pulsing through the vehicle's open gaps attest well enough to the quadruped's brutal work."
msgstr ""
"这段安全录像捕捉到了一个乡村加油站和远处荒芜、绿树成荫的道路的景色。  其中一个气泵旁边的空间很快就被填满，成为一台大型 4x4 发动机装入框架中，后面拖着一辆弹跳摇晃的动物马车。  当卡车停下来时，一名身材魁梧、留着胡须的男子爬了出来，拖车内部传出持续不断的嘶嘶声和重重的巨响。  司机忧心忡忡地皱着眉头，拖车摇晃着泵，拖车因不高兴的俘虏的挣扎而颤抖，当该男子完成照料车辆时，嘶鸣声变得越来越刺耳，近乎扭曲的尖叫声。  After he finishes gassing up, the motorist replaces the nozzle and approaches the trailer, rapping on its side.\n"
"\n"
"“小黑，”他喊道，“你在里面到底怎么了？”\n"
"\n"
"沉重的一击使拖车的外壳凸出，导致其剧烈摇晃，铆钉爆裂，男子踉踉跄跄地向后退去。  随着连续的打击打碎了拖车的侧板，一匹马的头部最终强行穿过一条不断扩大的裂缝，在它挣扎的过程中，锯齿状的金属碎片剥落了它头骨上的血肉。  司机爬到他的四轮驱动车的车门前，猛地跳进车里，而这头不死的野兽却挣脱了束缚，在空气中嗅了一会儿，然后站起来，用前蹄踩住了卡车的挡风玻璃。  当这辆重型多功能车被撞成一堆皱巴巴的残骸时，这名男子畏缩在视线之外，抽泣着恳求和尖叫声，曾经是他的坐骑的一堆移动肌腱正在努力将其断断续续的鼻子推入破碎的窗户。\n"
"\n"
"伴随着金属撕裂的尖叫声，这只动物将驾驶员侧的车门撕开，然后猛地一仰头，发出畸形的尖叫声，然后冲进了被剥开的驾驶室。  马的肌肉在颤动，金属剥落的躯体遮住了大部分场景，但男人的尖叫声、骨头从家中被撕裂的令人作呕的声音，以及内脏从车辆的缝隙中喷涌而出，都充分证明了四足动物的残酷行为。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This seems to be a digital journal of some kind.  You browse through, and in between the (frankly awful) poetry and occasional story concepts, there are a couple actual journal entries.  The first is as follows:\n"
"\n"
"\"Killed someone today.  An actual, living person.  Well, a maybe, on that last part.  They seemed… feral.  I panicked, and none of the group got to me quick enough, so I just… hit them.  As hard as could.  With that hammer.  I hate that it felt good.\"\n"
"\n"
"The next readable entry mentions the author using a hammer and a large railroad spike together as a weapon.  It devolves into madness pretty quickly from there."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是某种数字日记。你浏览一下，在（坦率地说，糟糕的）诗歌和偶尔的故事概念之间，有一些实际的日记条目。第一条如下：\n"
"\n"
"“今天杀了一个人。一个真实的、活生生的人。好吧，也许，在最后一部分。他们看起来……很野性。我惊慌失措，没有人能足够快地找到我，所以我只是……打他们。狠狠地打他们。”可以。用那把锤子。我讨厌它的感觉很好。”\n"
"\n"
"下一个可读条目提到作者使用锤子和大型铁路道钉一起作为武器。从那里它很快就会变成疯狂。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This video is both extremely rocky and taken up by a bouncing and poorly shot view of a car's headrest, the tinted windscreen beyond, and, ultimately, a stretch of blacktop racing past in a vomit-inducing blur of black, grays, and browns.  The rear gate of a military Land Rover is visible through the armored sedan's windscreen, slaloming it's way through an ankle-deep stream of water as it spearheads a convoy of adjoining vehicles with a dual-column of Challenger II tanks looming to either side of the view, all lashed by rain that thunders from an iron gray sky and peppers the windscreen.  The video continues in this fashion for several minutes, with tombstones of concrete buildings and scraggly patches of green whipping by before, with a squeal of suspension and tires, the car swerves onto a broad stretch of asphalt and judders to a halt, the expanse of Heathrow's runway zone unfurling beyond.  As the escorting armored vehicles' hatches thump open, expelling uniformed soldiers that jump to the waterlogged ground, the camera judders: the perspective swinging about and filming the interior of the sedan's door before it's summarily booted open, and the perspective's trained towards the tarmac as a pair of well-appointed suede shoes plant themselves beyond the threshold.\n"
"\n"
"As an indistinct tumult of snarls and groans starts to grow audible over the rain and the chop of rotors slices into the audio, the view returns to the horizontal and briefly takes in the sight of an officious-looking helicopter with MOD markings idling upon a landing pad before the film assumes the view of the cameramen's footwear once again.  With speed that would make an Olympian proud, they all but fly across the concrete, stepping up and into the aircraft in a matter of moments as the boom of gunshots echoes over the throb of thunder.  What follows is a jumble of activity, the view buffeted about as the cameraman buckles into a seat and you see other pairs of legs carrying their owners into the cabin.  Eventually, the recorder swings the view up past a series of pallid faces and directs the perspective through the aircraft's side window.  Beyond the barrier, a line of Royal Marines are forming a rifle-bristling shield around the helicopter, white flashes flaring from their weapons as they direct warning volleys over the heads of a gargantuan mass of, what you recognize to be, nigh-unanimously zombies baring down on the procession like a meaty wave of mangled flesh.  Soon enough, you can see blood spurting from the horde and running in pink lines with the rain as the shots lose their friendly edge.\n"
"\n"
"As the last official-looking man boards the helicopter and collapses into a seat, three soldiers break away from the rifle wall and, wearing the faces of men who have just won the lottery, splash through the downpour, jumping aboard the aircraft a heartbeat before the Sikorsky abandons its contact with the Earth and lifts over the head of the massacre below.  As though the entryways of their vehicles had been magically transfigured into the mouths of vacuum cleaners, the marines still on the ground look as though they're all but sucked into their armor, with the last hatch slamming closed just as the horde crashes over the blocks of steel.  Plumes of exhaust rise from the vehicles as they gear into motion, and those members of the gnawing flesh wall that are recognizably feral have, largely, enough sense to bully their way clear of the heavy military armor.  The zombies, on the other hand, don't get the memo.  By the time the last Challenger bumps free of the tarmac, the vehicles unanimously look like someone's sprayed them down with ketchup."
msgstr ""
"这段视频非常崎岖不平，并且由汽车头枕、远处有色挡风玻璃的弹跳和拍摄不佳的视图组成，最后，一段柏油路在令人呕吐的黑色、灰色和棕色模糊中飞驰而过。  透过装甲轿车的挡风玻璃，可以看到一辆军用路虎的后门，它在齐踝深的水流中蜿蜒前行，它领先于相邻车辆组成的车队，两列挑战者II坦克隐约出现在视野的两侧，所有这些都被铁灰色天空中雷鸣般的暴雨袭击，洒在挡风玻璃上。  视频以这种方式持续了几分钟，混凝土建筑的墓碑和参差不齐的绿地在前面呼啸而过，伴随着悬架和轮胎的尖叫声，汽车突然转向宽阔的沥青路面并颤抖着停了下来，希思罗机场跑道区的广阔范围在远处展开。  当护送装甲车的舱门砰地打开，驱逐跳到积水地面上的身穿制服的士兵时，摄像机颤抖起来：视角在轿门突然打开之前摆动并拍摄轿车车门的内部，当一双精心设计的绒面革鞋踩在门槛之外时，视角转向停机坪。\n"
"\n"
"随着雨声中隐隐约约的咆哮声和呻吟声开始响起，旋翼的劈啪声切入音频，画面回到水平方向，短暂地看到一架看上去很管闲事的带有 MOD 标记的直升机在停机坪上空转，然后影片再次出现了摄影师的鞋子。  他们的速度足以让奥运会选手感到自豪，他们几乎都飞过混凝土，在枪声在雷声中回响时，他们在几分钟之内就迈进了飞机。  接下来是一连串的活动，当摄影师坐进座位时，景色发生了变化，你可以看到其他双腿带着它们的主人进入机舱。  最终，记录仪将视野转向一系列苍白的面孔，并将视角引导到飞机的侧窗。  屏障之外，一排皇家海军陆战队员正在直升机周围形成了一个步枪竖立的盾牌，他们的武器发出白色闪光，当他们在一大群僵尸的头顶上发出警告性齐射时，你认得，僵尸几乎一致地向游行队伍冲来，就像一波血肉模糊的肉。  很快，你就可以看到人群中喷出鲜血，随着枪声失去了友好的边缘，鲜血随着雨水在雨中流淌成粉红色的线条。\n"
"\n"
"当最后一个看上去像官员的人登上直升机并倒在座位上时，三名士兵挣脱了步枪墙，戴着刚刚中彩票的人的脸，在倾盆大雨中溅起水花，在西科斯基放弃与地球的接触并升到下面屠杀的头顶之前跳上飞机。  就好像他们的车辆的入口被神奇地变成了吸尘器的嘴一样，仍在地面上的海军陆战队员看起来好像都被吸入了他们的装甲中，最后一个舱门砰地关上，就在部落冲向钢铁块时。  当车辆启动时，尾气从车辆中升起，而那些啃食肉墙的成员，明显是野性的，在很大程度上，有足够的理智，可以从重型军用装甲中挤开。  另一方面，僵尸则没有收到备忘录。  当最后一辆挑战者冲出停机坪时，所有车辆看起来都像是有人向它们喷洒了番茄酱。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Tinged by the scarlet light of a sun all but sunken on the horizon, long shadows play across the view of concrete high-rises juxtaposed with historical facades: an expansive boulevard laying several stories below the camera's perspective and winding just beyond a vast structure that thrusts into the darkening sky.  It takes you multiple seconds of blankly staring before you realize that the sizable building in question is, or rather, used to be, the Sagrada Familia.  The vast sheets of resinous growths that cocoon the historical landmark and which almost seem to have been organically grown from ground to spire-top make it look like a vast, throbbing organ rising above the Barcelona skyline.\n"
"\n"
"As you watch, the view zooms out from the defaced structure, revealing a concrete rooftop upon which, crouching, laying, and kneeling behind a low parapet, a handful of soldiers dressed in Spanish army fatigues bustle about a squat, mortar-like piece of ordinance while an officer discreetly peers over the barrier with a pair of binoculars.  As the soldiers prepare the portable artillery, the rasping growl of high-speed jet engines grows audible through the tinny audio, resolving into a sonic boom that cracks through the soundscape as, following a gesture from the officer, the mortar discharges with a low thwump.  A plume of red follows the flare shell as it streaks into the sky in a looping ark, detonating in a bright swirl of color that bathes the Sagrada Familia in a relief of crimson and prompting its plasticky coating to refract myriads of ruby shades.  In the heartbeat before multi-role fighter jets dive from the sky, the flair's sputtering life casts into stark relief many hundreds of unclear silhouettes that team about and within the structure like ants.  To a speck, they collectively pause as though in confusion, moments before dozens of incendiary warheads spear through the structure and detonate in a shockwave of rubble: a vast flower violently spreading petals of fire.\n"
"\n"
"As the landmark implodes and flames dance across the skyline, the last few seconds of the video are centered on the soldiers.  Having abandoned their cover in favor of observing the awesome destruction unfolding below, the ragged men and women stand in a disheveled line, quietly gazing out at the inferno engulfing the megalithic building and slowly spreading to immolate surrounding structures.  As the last jet rolls free of its bombing run and thunders overhead, the little squad's officer solemnly takes off his beret and holds it to his heart as he watches the fire and, to the assembly's right, you can see two men mutely hugging one another.  As the video closes, atop that roof, there isn't a single pair of eyes or cheeks blackened from drifting ash that are dry as the soldiers watch their city burn."
msgstr ""
"太阳的猩红光芒几乎沉没在地平线上，长长的阴影在混凝土高层建筑与历史建筑并列的景色中投射出来：一条宽阔的林荫大道在相机的视角下铺设了几层楼，蜿蜒在一座巨大的建筑之外，直插到黑暗的天空中。  你花了好几秒钟茫然地凝视，才意识到这座巨大的建筑是，或者更确切地说，曾经是圣家族教堂。  巨大的树脂生长物包裹着这座历史地标，几乎像是从地面有机生长到尖顶，使它看起来像一个巨大的、颤动的器官，升起在巴塞罗那的天际线上。\n"
"\n"
"当你观看时，视野从被损毁的建筑中缩小，露出了一个混凝土屋顶，在屋顶上，在低矮的护墙后面，蹲着、躺着、跪着，一群穿着西班牙军装的士兵忙着执行一个矮矮的、迫击炮般的法令，而一名军官则用双筒望远镜小心翼翼地凝视着栅栏。  当士兵们准备便携式火炮时，微弱的音频中可以听到高速喷气发动机的刺耳咆哮，并分解成音爆，随着军官的手势，迫击炮以低沉的重击声发射，穿透了音景。  一道红色的羽毛跟随信号弹外壳，在环形方舟中划向天空，引爆出明亮的色彩漩涡，使圣家堂沐浴在深红色的浮雕中，并促使其塑料涂层折射出无数的红宝石色调。  在多用途战斗机从天而降之前的心跳中，这种天赋的溅射生命使数百个模糊的轮廓变得鲜明，这些轮廓像蚂蚁一样在结构周围和内部排列。  对于一个斑点来说，他们集体停了下来，仿佛陷入了混乱，随后数十枚燃烧弹头刺穿了建筑物并在瓦砾冲击波中引爆：一朵巨大的花朵猛烈地散布着火焰花瓣。\n"
"\n"
"当地标爆炸，火焰在天际线上舞动时，视频的最后几秒以士兵为中心。  放弃了掩体，转而观察下面正在发生的可怕破坏，衣衫褴褛的男女们凌乱地站成一排，静静地凝视着吞噬巨石建筑并慢慢蔓延并烧毁周围建筑的地狱。  当最后一架喷气式飞机从轰炸中滑过，在头顶上呼啸而过时，小队的军官庄严地摘下贝雷帽，将其戴在胸前，看着火势，在集会的右侧，你可以看到两个人默默地拥抱在一起。  当视频结束时，在屋顶上，当士兵们看着他们的城市被烧毁时，没有一双眼睛或脸颊被流灰弄黑。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"apps/Harmony\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: Dude, just met the most fucking terrifying thing in my life.  I was on my way home and I saw this deer on the side of the road and I had to do a double take because it had EIGHT legs!\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (real): bro are you high?\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: I'm serious!\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: I almost pissed my pants!\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: There was also something wrong with the eyes, but I didn't focus\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (real): Did you take a picture or something?\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: I think I got it on my dashcam, but I don't think it worked well - I stepped on a gas with full force because it started to approach me, almost killed myself\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (real): Mad things happened in the last few weeks, yeah\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: Yeah, it was bad.  I've been hearing all these stories about weird things happening and now I've seen it for myself\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (real): Maybe I need to buy a shotgun or two."
msgstr ""
"应用程序/和谐\n"
"\n"
"传奇牛排：伙计，刚刚遇到了我这辈子最可怕的事。我在回家的路上看到路边有一只鹿，我不得不仔细观察，因为它有八条腿！\n"
"\n"
"W.F.吉布森(皇马)：兄弟，你嗨了吗？\n"
"\n"
"传奇牛排：我是认真的！\n"
"\n"
"传奇牛排：我差点尿裤子了！\n"
"\n"
"传奇牛排：眼睛也有问题，但我没有对准\n"
"\n"
"W.F.吉布森(雷亚尔)：你是拍了张照片还是怎么的？\n"
"\n"
"传奇牛排：我想我把它放在我的仪表盘上了，但我觉得效果不太好--我全力以赴踩了一脚油门，因为它开始靠近我，差点害死我自己。\n"
"\n"
"W.F.吉布森(皇马)：过去几周发生了疯狂的事情，是的，\n"
"\n"
"传奇牛排：是的，很糟糕。我一直听到很多关于怪事发生的故事，现在我亲眼看到了。\n"
"\n"
"吉布森(皇马)：也许我需要买一两把猎枪。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"apps/myMail\n"
"\n"
"by:dnance@mymail.com\n"
"to:All\n"
"Subject: Tragic Loss of Rob Dixon\n"
"\n"
"Dear Colleagues,\n"
"\n"
"It is with a heavy heart that I have to inform you all of the passing of the head of the supply chain department, Rob Dixon.  He was at the office late last night trying to ensure that everything was under control when he was caught in one of the riots that have been happening all over the city.  Despite all the efforts, Rob did not make it.\n"
"Rob was more than just a boss to us, he was a friend and a mentor to many of us.  Rob always put the company and its employees first and he will be deeply missed.\n"
"Please keep Rob's family and loved ones in your thoughts and prayers during this difficult time.  The company is working closely with the authorities to ensure that Rob's death is fully investigated.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, all of Rob's responsibilities will be temporarily handled by James Sullivan, his senior assistant.  If you have any urgent matters, please reach out to James.\n"
"We will provide updates as they become available and further details on arrangements to celebrate Rob's life.\n"
"\n"
"Sincerely,\n"
"Dahila Nance\n"
"Head of HR department."
msgstr ""
"应用程序/我的邮件\n"
"\n"
"作者：dnance@mymail.com\n"
"至：全部\n"
"主题：罗布·迪克森的悲惨去世\n"
"\n"
"亲爱的同事们：\n"
"\n"
"我怀着沉重的心情向大家通报供应链部门负责人 Rob Dixon 去世的消息。  昨晚深夜，他在办公室试图确保一切都在控制之中，这时他被卷入了全市各地发生的一场骚乱。  尽管竭尽全力，罗布还是没能成功。\n"
"罗布不仅仅是我们的老板，他还是我们许多人的朋友和导师。  罗布始终把公司和员工放在第一位，我们将深深怀念他。\n"
"在这个困难的时刻，请惦记着罗布的家人和亲人，并为他祈祷。  该公司正在与当局密切合作，确保罗布的死亡得到充分调查。\n"
"\n"
"与此同时，罗布的所有职责将暂时由他的高级助理詹姆斯·沙利文承担。  如果您有任何紧急事宜，请联系 James。\n"
"我们将及时提供最新消息以及有关庆祝罗布一生的安排的更多详细信息。\n"
"\n"
"真诚的，\n"
"达希拉·南斯\n"
"人力资源部部长。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"downloads/real_alien_autopsy!.mp4\n"
"\n"
"An immaculately polished room fills the video's perspective, with various metal workspaces lining the metallic walls and the camera angled downward towards a stainless steel operating table.  Sprawled across the surface rests an enormous, vaguely cylindrical form, its shapeless pink flesh encased within an insectoid exoskeleton and sets of clawed appendages marching up the length of its segmented body.  Membranous wings spread out from beneath the organism's bulk, and a pyramidal construct, formed from petal-like ravels of flesh, crowns it.\n"
"\n"
"Asian voices softly converse in the background as latex-gloved hands appear from off frame and busy themselves with delicately cutting around one of the creature's armored plates, the entire scene gently swaying as though the room were located aboard an ocean-going vessel.  After much surgical manipulation, the segment of exoskeleton eventually relinquishes its grasp before the scalpel's insistent slicing, detaching with an unpleasantly wet, peeling sound.  Trailing strands of connective tissue, the plate is set aside as the blades dig into the comparatively delicate flesh beneath, laying the internals bare with a trickle of seeping fluid and a wave of excited gabbles from the unseen surgical crew.\n"
"\n"
"The beast's insides are a paradox of ordered chaos, with stacks of hairy, finger-like structures extending deep within the creature and, like the spokes of a wheel, connecting to a network of four interjoined sacks clustered in a square at the core.  A cartilaginous latticework encircles the sacks, a complicated network of piping running from the organs to various points about the body.  Two constructs, which vaguely resemble the general outline of a traditional lung but are composed of meaty disks connected to a central stock, fill the upper half of the creature's form, with a large amount of sickly yellow fluid flooding the entirety of its internal cavity.\n"
"\n"
"The rest of the video consists of various parts of the creature's anatomy being extricated and examined, with a thick, resin-like substance extruding from one of the sacks as it's sliced open."
msgstr ""
"下载/real_alien_autopsy!.mp4\n"
"\n"
"视频中充满了一个完美抛光的房间，各种金属工作区排列在金属墙壁上，摄像机向下倾斜朝向不锈钢手术台。  表面上躺着一个巨大的、模糊的圆柱形物体，它无形的粉红色肉体包裹在一个昆虫外骨骼中，还有一组带爪子的附属物沿着它分段的身体延伸。  膜质的翅膀从生物体的下方展开，而由花瓣状的肉碎片形成的金字塔结构覆盖在它的顶部。\n"
"\n"
"亚洲人的声音在背景中轻声交谈，戴着乳胶手套的手从画面外出现，忙着小心翼翼地切割该生物的一块装甲板，整个场景轻轻摇曳，仿佛房间位于一艘远洋船上。  经过多次手术操作后，这部分外骨骼最终在手术刀的持续切割之前放弃了它的抓握，并伴随着令人不愉快的潮湿剥落声而分离。  板子拖着结缔组织，被放在一边，刀片刺入下面相对脆弱的肉里，使内部裸露，滴下渗出的液体，看不见的手术人员发出一波兴奋的叽叽喳喳声。\n"
"\n"
"这种野兽的内部是一个有序混乱的悖论，成堆的毛茸茸的、手指状的结构在生物体内深处延伸，就像车轮的辐条一样，连接到一个由四个相互连接的麻袋组成的网络，这些麻袋聚集在核心的一个正方形中。  软骨格子围绕着麻袋，这是一个复杂的管道网络，从器官延伸到身体的各个部位。  两个构造体，隐约类似于传统肺的总体轮廓，但由连接到中央支架的肉圆盘组成，填充了该生物的上半部分，大量病态的黄色液体充满了其整个内腔。\n"
"\n"
"视频的其余部分包括该生物解剖结构的各个部分被解救和检查，其中一个麻袋被切开时，有一种厚厚的树脂状物质从其中挤出。"

