#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "<mi-go_harvest>  <mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
msgstr "<mi-go_harvest><mi-go_harvest_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
msgstr "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "A network of sacs and vessels carry different fluids through the mi-go's body, any of which you might call \"blood\".  One is thin and clear with a grayish cast, while another is thick, foamy, and bubblegum pink, almost like Pepto-Bismol."
msgstr "囊和血管网络将不同的液体输送到米戈的身体中，您可以将其中任何液体称为“血液”。  一种是薄而透明的，带有灰色的色调，而另一种是浓稠的，泡沫状的，呈泡泡糖粉色，几乎像Pepto-Bismol。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "Large pores all over the body connect short sections of tubing to small balloon-like organs throughout the body, possibly serving as its respiratory system."
msgstr "遍布全身的大毛孔将短段的管道连接到遍布全身的小气球状器官，可能充当其呼吸系统。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "Many short tentacles with rasping tips hang from beneath the subject's head.  They're too small to serve as weapons, and it would be tempting to assume these are how it eats if it had any apparent digestive tract."
msgstr "许多带有刺耳尖端的短触手悬挂在对象的头下。  它们太小而不能用作武器，如果它有任何明显的消化道，人们很容易认为它们就是这样吃的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "On close examination, the mi-go's rigid carapace is more of a pellicle, as though its spongy insides have merely dried into a hard crust where exposed to the air."
msgstr "仔细观察，米戈的坚硬甲壳更像是一层薄膜，就好像它的海绵内部只是在暴露在空气中干燥成硬壳一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "Owing to its many limbs and hard carapace, it is at first tempting to compare the mi-go to an insect.  Up close, there's little resemblance to be had.  Its multijointed legs are more akin to tentacles, a comparison that's easy to make because it also has a few of those."
msgstr "由于它有许多四肢和坚硬的甲壳，乍一看很容易将米戈比作昆虫。  近距离观察，几乎没有相似之处。  它的多关节腿更类似于触手，这种比较很容易，因为它也有一些触手。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "The \"skeleton\" of this creature is almost a single solid piece, merely softening at the joints to allow the limbs to bend."
msgstr "这种生物的“骨骼”几乎是一个完整的整体，只是在关节处软化以允许四肢弯曲。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "The creature contains a lot of irregular clumps of tissue that must serve as its organs, but it's difficult to guess at their purpose."
msgstr "这种生物含有许多不规则的组织团块，它们必须充当其器官，但很难猜测它们的用途。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "The front of the creature's head, riddled with eyestalks and antennae, folds open under gentle pressure to reveal a rippling interior like ruched mortadella.  Perhaps this structure is how the creatures vocalize."
msgstr "这种生物的头部前部布满了眼柄和触角，在轻轻的压力下会折叠起来，露出波纹状的内部，就像褶皱的熟香肠一样。  也许这种结构就是这些生物发声的方式。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "The mi-go's body is seemingly composed of a single material that merely varies in density.  It's as hard as bone at its core, spongy and almost gelatinous through the middle, and hard and crusty at the exterior.  Is this all the same tissue?"
msgstr "mi-go 的身体似乎是由单一材料组成，只是密度不同。  它的核心像骨头一样坚硬，中间呈海绵状，几乎呈凝胶状，外部又硬又硬。  这都是同一个组织吗？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "The smell emanating from the specimen is a noxious combination of chlorine and acetone.  There's none of the rot-stink or typical smells you'd expect from an animal carcass."
msgstr "标本散发出的气味是氯和丙酮的有毒混合物。  没有任何动物尸体的腐臭或典型气味。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "There's nothing that resembles an animal brain anywhere in the creature.  Whatever it used to interpret the world and make decisions is simply beyond your understanding."
msgstr "这种生物的任何地方都没有类似动物大脑的地方。  无论它用来解释世界和做出决定的是什么，都超出了你的理解范围。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "Tiny clumps of white crystal are buried throughout the creature's tissue like so many kidney stones.  They don't look functional, but then again, how would you know?"
msgstr "微小的白色晶体团块像许多肾结石一样埋藏在该生物的组织中。  它们看起来不起作用，但话又说回来，你怎么知道呢？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"!! HELP ME !!\n"
"My name is Pippa and I am lost!\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a long-haired cat with a round face and short muzzle sitting on a floral carpet.]\n"
"\n"
"I'm getting on with age, so I don't remember how to get home.  I am a (traditional) Persian longhair with silky white fur and brownish eyes.  I was wearing a red collar with my name tag on it.\n"
"\n"
"PLEASE CALL (413)555-1688 IF YOU SEE ME\n"
"(AND TAKE A PICTURE IF YOU CAN)"
msgstr ""
"!! 帮我 !!\n"
"我的名字是皮帕，我迷路了！\n"
"\n"
"[照片：一只长毛猫，圆脸，短嘴，坐在花毯上。]\n"
"\n"
"年纪大了，不记得怎么回家了。我是一只（传统的）波斯长毛猫，有着柔滑的白色毛皮和棕色的眼睛。我戴着一个红项圈，上面有我的名字标签。\n"
"\n"
"如果您看到我，请致电 (413)555-1688\n"
"（如果可以的话，拍一张照片）"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_dog"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"!MISSING DOG!\n"
"Male, 5 years old, fine and dense blue mottled fur, stands 19 inches, sharp ears.\n"
"Answers to the name \"Caesar\".\n"
"He is an Australian Cattle Dog.\n"
"He's NOT FRIENDLY and is irate at times.  But he's a good boy.  We miss him dearly.\n"
"\n"
"Last seen on Liberty Street, Canton.  Missing since May 13.\n"
"If found please contact 978-555-6865.\n"
"\n"
"$100 REWARD IF FOUND!"
msgstr ""
"!寻狗！\n"
"雄性，5岁，长着细密的蓝色斑点毛皮，身高19英寸，尖耳。\n"
"会对呼叫\"凯撒\"有回应。\n"
"他是一只澳大利亚牧羊犬。\n"
"他很不友善，时常发脾气。但他是个乖狗狗。我们非常想念他。\n"
"\n"
"5月13日在广州自由街走失。\n"
"如果发现，请联系978-555-6865。\n"
"\n"
"提供线索者奖励100美元！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_child"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"AMBER ALERT\n"
"\n"
"Child Find Case #01943\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a child with curly ginger hair celebrating her sixth birthday.]\n"
"\n"
"Olivia Clymer\n"
"\n"
"Age At Missing: 6\n"
"Hair: Ginger, Curly, Neck-Length\n"
"Eyes: Green\n"
"\n"
"Olivia was last seen playing in her backyard on 176 Farland Street under parental supervision.  When her mother was momentarily distracted, Olivia disappeared.  A police search is currently being conducted to find Olivia.  She was wearing a dark blue sweater, an ankle-length floral skirt, red cotton gloves and a knitted wool cap on the day of her disappearance.  Olivia has burn marks on her left arm.\n"
"\n"
"Last Seen: 1:30 pm, October 22\n"
"Concord, MA\n"
"\n"
"If you have any information regarding Olivia, please call\n"
"Concord Police Department: 617-555-7622\n"
"\n"
"PLEASE HELP US"
msgstr ""
"安珀警报\n"
"\n"
"儿童走失案 #01943\n"
"\n"
"[照片：一个姜黄色卷发的孩子正在庆祝她的六岁生日。]\n"
"\n"
"奥利维亚·克莱默\n"
"\n"
"失踪年龄：6\n"
"头发：姜黄色，卷曲，及颈\n"
"眼睛：绿色\n"
"\n"
"奥利维亚最后一次被人看到是在她位于法兰街 176 号的后院，在父母的监督下玩耍。当她的母亲暂时分心后，奥利维亚消失了。目前警方正在进行搜查以寻找奥利维亚。她失踪当天身穿深蓝色毛衣、及踝花裙、红色棉手套和针织羊毛帽。奥利维亚的左臂上有烧伤疤痕。\n"
"\n"
"最后出现时间：10 月 22 日下午 1:30\n"
"马萨诸塞州康科德\n"
"\n"
"如果您有任何关于奥利维亚的线索，请致电\n"
"马萨诸塞州康科德警察局：617-555-7622\n"
"\n"
"请帮助我们"

