#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A bundle of gigantic wasp eggs is buried in the beast, but all are pierced with wirey tubes draining nutrients and fluid from their fetal husks"
msgstr "一排巨大的黄蜂卵被埋在这只怪兽体内，但所有卵都被某种线管刺穿，将营养物质和体液从胎儿的外皮中不断吸出"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_heart_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  Despite its stone-like exterior, its inner flesh is much closer to mucus in all aspects.  Upon closer examination, this heart appears vestigial, as the inner flesh turns out to be blood, slowly moving on its own volition."
msgstr "来自变异动物的一块心脏。  尽管它的外表像石头一样，但它的内部肉质在各个方面都更接近粘液。  仔细一看，这颗心脏似乎已经退化了，里面的血肉竟然是血，在自行缓慢地移动。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_heart_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  Patches of hair and bits of bones are present all over and inside it, making it resemble a giant teratoma.  Despite this, it appears to have functioned as a heart."
msgstr "来自变异动物的一块心脏。  它的全身和内部都有一些毛发和骨头碎片，使它看起来像一个巨大的畸胎瘤。  尽管如此，它似乎仍具有心脏的功能。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_heart_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  The ventricles are filled with acidic fluids and bits of half-digested food, with the nearby veins and arteries being lined with mucus.  Looking at this macabre fusion of the circulatory and digestive systems, you wonder how such a thing could ever get food to reach the heart without clogging the arteries."
msgstr "来自变异动物的一块心脏。  心室充满酸性液体和半消化的食物，附近的静脉和动脉布满粘液。  看着循环系统和消化系统的这种可怕的融合，你会想知道这样的东西如何能够在不堵塞动脉的情况下让食物到达心脏。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_heart_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  This cancerous, gangrenous mass of flesh still beats, leaking out more of the foul fluids it used to push through a body.  Beating isn't the only thing it continues to do, as you witness what kept this heart beating: the gangrene eating the cancer as the cancer grows back all over the gangrene, in a sickening ouroboros."
msgstr "来自变异动物的一块心脏。  这块癌变的坏疽肉块仍在跳动，泄漏出更多用于推动身体的污浊液体。  跳动并不是它继续做的唯一事情，你会看到是什么让这颗心脏继续跳动：坏疽吞噬了癌症，而癌症则在坏疽各处重新生长，就像令人作呕的衔尾蛇一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  Most of its volume is taken up by a gigantic cyst filled with tiny, crab-like creatures.  Upon opening it the contents spray to the ground, with the suddenly homeless inhabitants scurrying for cover.  The rest of it looks relatively normal, if only in comparison."
msgstr "一大块从高度变异动物身上取下的肝脏。它其中的大部分被一个巨大的囊肿所占据，里面充满了微小的螃蟹状生物。在切开它之后，里面的东西飞溅到地上，突然无家可归的居民们纷纷寻找掩护。比较起来，它剩余的部分还相对更正常一些。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The gall bladder has transformed into a bundle of hair and skin, and what appeared to be brownish veins originating from it turn out to be solitary, curled hairs crisscrossing beneath the surface of the organ.  At least you can remove them with a gentle pull on the central mass, but the whole liver collapses in a gelatinous heap afterwards."
msgstr "一大块从高度变异动物身上取下的肝脏。胆囊已经变成了一束毛发和皮肤，看上去像是褐色血管的组织其实是在器官表面下纵横交错的坚硬卷发。至少你可以轻轻拉扯，把它们从主体上移除，但随后整个肝脏就会塌陷成一团凝胶。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The surface is blackened and hard but cracked, exposing a few strips of fresh pink tissue underneath.  After cracking the shell fully open, the inner tissue begins swelling at an alarming rate before turning gray and lifeless."
msgstr "一大块从高度变异动物身上取下的肝脏。表面坚硬发黑，但布满了裂缝，露出下面几条新鲜的粉红色组织。在完全打开外壳后，内部组织开始以惊人的速度膨胀，然后变灰，像死了一般。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The surface is pockmarked by hexagonal scar tissue, and some surprisingly active flatworms still seem to cling to it.  About half of them seem to be in the process of being digested by their meal, instead of the other way around."
msgstr "一大块从高度变异动物身上取下的肝脏。表面布满了六角形疤痕组织，一些异常活跃的扁形虫似乎仍然附着在它的表面。大约一半的虫子似乎正在被它们的食物消化，而不是相反。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_heart_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  It has partially melted as it cooked, making it gelatinous yet sinewy, as if the taste and odor weren't enough of a deterrent."
msgstr "一大块煮熟的变异生物的肉。加热使肌肉组织像活着一样扭曲移动，现在它已经扭成一个密集的肉结。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_heart_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  Most of it has softened under the heat, giving it a rubbery texture and a taste of cold grease, but the core became akin to a meaty jawbreaker with an unsettling but not revolting taste."
msgstr "一块煮熟的变异动物心脏。  它的大部分在高温下已经软化，赋予它橡胶般的质地和冷油脂的味道，但核心变得类似于肉质的下颚破碎机，具有令人不安但并不令人反感的味道。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_heart_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  The heat has turned this heart white and mushy, with a taste and texture reminiscent of eating wet ashes."
msgstr "一大块煮熟的变异生物的肉。加热使肌肉组织像活着一样扭曲移动，现在它已经扭成一个密集的肉结。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_heart_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  The removal of most fluid pockets has made what remains of this heart resemble to a mass of tough leather-like scraps, with a far fouler taste."
msgstr "一块煮熟的变异动物心脏。  大部分液体囊被去除后，这颗心脏的剩余部分就像是一大堆坚韧的皮革状碎片，味道更加难闻。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  Getting all the parasites - if that's what they were - off was more effort than this meal is probably worth, and the consistency suffered considerably from having to dig them out from the depth of the organ."
msgstr "一大块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肝脏。为了把所有的寄生虫——如果它们是的话——赶走所付出的努力可能比这顿饭自身价值要多得多，而且由于必须从器官深处把它们挖出来，使得它的一致性受到了相当大的影响。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  Instead of the matte gray-brown of a normal liver, this one turned disconcertingly orange after heating it up, and finger-sized flakes detach themselves from it at the slightest touch.  The taste reminds you of slightly overripe avocado, but that's still better than you expected."
msgstr "一大块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肝脏。与正常肝脏的哑光灰棕色不同，它在加热后变成令人不安的橙色，轻轻一碰就有手指大小的薄片从中脱落下来。它的味道让你想起了稍微熟过头的牛油果，但还是比你想象的要好。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The channels left by the hairs you removed have filled with an oily black liquid, lending a surprisingly nice look to the cut surface.  On biting into it the fluid hardens unexpectedly, leaving you to chew much longer than you'd like to."
msgstr "一大块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肝脏。你去除毛发后留下的沟道中充满了黑色的油状液体，让切开的表面看起来出奇的漂亮。咬下去后，液体会突然变硬，让你咀嚼它的时间比你想的要长得多。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The tissue split apart following the veins before hardening, reminding you of a warped gray flower with a sinuous vein for a stem.  Perhaps surprisingly, it tastes not entirely unlike liver."
msgstr "一大块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肝脏。组织在硬化前会沿着血管爆裂开来，让人联想起一朵扭曲的灰色花朵，它的茎上有一条蜿蜒的血管。也许有些出乎意料，它尝起来并不完全像肝脏。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  Deep within, the extraneous vocal cords you didn't manage to remove turned to chewy morsels.  The taste is almost good enough to make you forget the way they sounded while you were cooking it."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肺脏。在它深处，你没能完全去除的多余声带变成了不易嚼烂的小肉块。它的味道几乎足以让你忘掉烹饪时所发出的尖叫声。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  The glands exuding the green foam have solidified, and the foam itself seems to have evaporated without a trace.  The smell is detestable, but the glands have a taste and consistency remarkably like hardboiled egg yolk."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肺脏。分泌绿色泡沫的腺体已经凝固，泡沫本身似乎已经蒸发得无影无踪。气味很难闻，但腺体的味道和稠度非常像被煮熟的蛋黄。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  The heat somehow made the tissue swell up, with some alveoli bursting and collapsing on themselves.  The whole thing turned to the consistency of cotton candy, but with a faint taste of yeast replacing the sugary goodness."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肺脏。加热过程不知怎么地使组织膨胀起来，其中一些肺泡破裂并自行塌陷。整块东西都变成了粘稠的浆糊，如同棉花糖，但一种淡淡的酵母味取代了甜香味。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  With a lot of work you can cut around the hardened shell of translucent gunk, but your only reward is getting to the spongy, gray, mostly-flavorless mass of tissue beneath."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肺脏。你花费了大量精力围着坚硬的半透明粘液外壳周围切割开，但你所得到的唯一回报是下面海绵状、灰色、几乎无味的组织。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Cooking it exposed myriad tiny, glistening stones embedded into the tissue, making your teeth screech with every bite despite your care not to crack your teeth.  It tastes sickly sweet, and a stinging aftertaste lingers in your mouth for a long time."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肾脏。烹调它时，暴露出了无数微小的、闪闪发光的石头，这些石头嵌在组织中，每咬一口都会让你的牙齿发出刺耳的声音，尽管你很小心别让它把自己牙齿弄裂。它尝起来甜得让人恶心，一股刺鼻的余味在你嘴里萦绕了很长时间。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Cooking loosened the tissue enough for it to come apart from the lightest pull, while exposing long, off-white strands that connect the different parts together."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肾脏。煮熟后组织充分松开，轻轻一拉就会使其脱离，同时暴露出将不同部分连接在一起的长长的灰白色细丝。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  You swear it grew new cysts while you were cooking it, each of which sports a different color.  You're not sure you want to know how the dark blue one tastes."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的肾脏。你发誓它在烹饪时长出了新的囊肿，每个囊肿都有不同的颜色。你不确定自己是否想知道那颗深蓝色的味道如何。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A cooked piece of what passes for a brain in some mutant animals.  The whole thing came apart into a coarse jelly interspersed with hair-thin, branching nerves that seem to move slightly.  The texture is horrible, but it tastes better than starvation."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的大脑。整块东西变成了一大块粗糙的果冻，中间点缀着如同头发般稀疏而分叉的神经，似乎随着它轻轻移动。它的质地很糟糕，但吃起来总比饿肚子要好。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A fist-sized organ next to the chain of hearts still subtly throbs, and you find broken shards of chitin inside it after a swift hacking"
msgstr "心脏组成的链条旁边的拳头大小的器官仍在微妙地跳动，迅速切开后，你发现里面充满了破碎的甲壳碎片"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A huge reddish lump reveals itself to be a sort of lung with a deflating noise.  You're blasted with hot air and droplets of hemolymph"
msgstr "一个巨大的红色肿块发出放气声，表明自己是一种肺脏，你被喷出的热空气和血淋巴液滴炸了一身"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A lattice of glossy tubes still holds the mound of foamy fat and organs in place after the abdomen falls apart"
msgstr "腹部崩裂后，一排光滑的管状物仍然将泡沫状脂肪和器官固定在各自的位置上"

#. ~ Snippet in category "endochitin_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A long, flexible rod of chitin from inside a giant mutant bug.  It is laced with blood vessels and chitinous nodules."
msgstr "从巨大的变异昆虫体内切下的一根细长而有弹性的棍状昆虫躯壳。它的表面布满了血管和几丁质结节。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A much smaller second shell lies buried deep inside the beetle, an entomological matryoshka that contains within itself… oh, fecal matter"
msgstr "第二层更小的壳埋在甲虫体内深处，像是体内有个昆虫版的俄罗斯套娃，还有些……呃，粪便物质"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A new, fist-sized green bubo emerges from your cut before your eyes, as if it was waiting just below the surface.  You'll have to be careful"
msgstr "一个拳头大小的绿色全新液泡在你眼前从你的切口处冒出，就像它在表面下等待一样。你不得不更小心谨慎"

#. ~ Snippet in category "chitin_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of a bug's exoskeleton, but mutated.  The inner side is lined with veins and strange, hooked protuberances."
msgstr "一块昆虫的坚硬躯壳，但变异了。内侧布满了血管和奇怪的钩状突起。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "chitin_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of a bug's exoskeleton.  Stringy lines of nervous tissue and blood vessels still cling to the inner surface."
msgstr "一块昆虫的坚硬躯壳。细线一样的神经组织和血管仍然附着在内表面。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of cooked brain from a heavily-mutated animal.  A circulatory vessel at the base of it burst while cooking, slathering the whole thing in faintly citrus-smelling yellow liquid.  While the smell is almost appetizing, the faint taste of ammonia is anything but."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的大脑。在烹调它时，底部的一个循环器官破裂开来，整个东西都被一种略带柑橘味的黄色液体吞没。虽然这气味听上去很开胃，但那股淡淡的氨水味道表明它实际上绝非如此。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of cooked brain from a heavily-mutated animal.  The eyes jutting out of the surface have grown milky, and a good few of them fell off, each revealing a small depression dominated by a short root of veins and nerve.  Judging by the spongy texture, some remain buried in the deeper tissues."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的大脑。从表面突出的眼睛已经变成了乳白色，其中有好几只掉了下来，其中露出一个个小凹陷，由一团短的血管和神经簇控制。从它海绵状结构判断，有些仍然埋藏在深层组织中。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Accessory kidneys bud off the ureter in clumps, like red, slightly quivering grapes.  The main organ continues the same fractal structure, fraying  into myriad tiny berries still connected to a stem."
msgstr "一块从高度变异动物身上取下的肾脏。副肾成群结队地从输尿管上长出，像是许多红色的微微颤动的葡萄一般。主体延续着同样的分形结构，分散成无数颗仍然与茎相连的小浆果。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Most of the volume is taken up by clear cysts filled with liquid, leaving you to pop them one by one to try and salvage some usable tissue.  The result looks about as appetizing as it sounds, but you suppose it's technically edible."
msgstr "一块从高度变异动物身上取下的肾脏。它的大部分体积被许多充满液体的透明囊肿所占据，你一个接一个地切开它们，试图挽救一些有用的组织。结果看起来就和听上去那样开胃，但你认为它在理论上应该能够食用。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  The tissue is broken up by pointy, brittle crystals you need to carefully cut around, lest they embed in your hand.  When you're done about half the meat is gone."
msgstr "一块从高度变异动物身上取下的肾脏。其中的组织被许多尖利易碎的晶体打破了，你需要小心切割，以免它们刺入你的手。当你完成时，一半的肉都没了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  While cutting into it your knife slips, opening a large gash on its side from which tiny, beautiful pearls roll out.  Before your eyes they start glistening with humidity and melt, leaving no trace beyond a stinging stench."
msgstr "一块从高度变异动物身上取下的肾脏。你的刀子在切开它时打滑了，在它的侧面开了一个大口子，从这个口子里滚出许多美丽的小珍珠。在你的眼前，它们开始因潮湿而融化且闪闪发光，除了刺鼻的臭味之外，没有留下任何痕迹。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  Even after removing the diaphragm, the tissue itself keeps rhythmically expanding and contracting, sending a gurgling whine through the truncated windpipe with each breath.  It takes far too long for it to grow still."
msgstr "一块从高度变异动物身上取下的肺脏组织。即使除去横膈膜，肺脏组织自身依然会有节奏地扩张和收缩，每次呼吸都会通过截断的气管发出咕噜咕噜的呜咽声。它需要很长时间才变得停止不动。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  The airways are broken up in regular intervals by what resemble vocal cords, and whenever you push some air through the tissue a cacophony of screams erupts from them."
msgstr "一块从高度变异动物身上取下的肺脏组织。呼吸道被类似于声带的东西以固定的间隔分开，每当你把空气灌入肺脏组织时，就会从中发出刺耳的尖叫声。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  The airways are lined with rows of tiny, stone-hard barbs, each pointing towards the outside, as if they were made to keep something out."
msgstr "一块从高度变异动物身上取下的肺脏组织。呼吸道上排列着一排排细小的、坚硬的倒钩，每个倒钩都指向外面，好像它们是用来挡住什么东西似的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  The whole thing is filled with a foul-smelling, greenish foam bubbling from strange glands lining the trachea, making you wonder how the creature could breathe at all.  It does explain the attitude, at least."
msgstr "一块从高度变异动物身上取下的肺脏组织。整块东西内部充满了一股难闻的绿色泡沫，不断从气管内的奇怪腺体中冒出，让你想知道这种生物是如何呼吸的。但它至少表现出了自身的态度。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of lung you removed from a mutated animal.  Strange, transparent, swaying tubes filled with a clear liquid emerge from the mostly-normal lung tissue.  Some broke off during the butchery, and the escaped liquid coats your tools, hardening on contact with the air like superglue."
msgstr "一块从高度变异动物身上取下的肺脏组织。许多充满了透明液体的奇怪、透明、不停摇摆的管子，从大体正常的肺组织中冒出来。其中有一些在屠宰过程时破裂了，溢出的液体覆盖在你的工具上，与空气接触之后像强力胶一样变硬。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "endochitin_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A piece of rigid, tube-shaped chitin from the inside of a giant bug.  It seemed to be performing some kind of support role.  You're quite sure normal insects don't have these."
msgstr "从巨大的变异昆虫体内切下的一块坚硬的管状昆虫躯壳。它似乎在其体内起到某种支撑作用。你很确定普通昆虫没有这些器官结构。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "A small landslide of flesh and gristle buries you to the waist at one point, and you could swear something was slithering near your ankles"
msgstr "从尸体上滑落的小肉块和软组织一度将你埋到腰部，你敢肯定有什么东西在你的脚踝附近不停滑动"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "After cleaning away the rotten meat and mess of eggs shrouding the matriarch's hind segments, you find its carapace chewed open, and much of its flesh already eaten by its ever-hungry young"
msgstr "在清理掉母虫尾部覆盖的腐肉和杂乱的卵后，你发现它的甲壳已被咬开，大部分的肉已经被它饥饿的幼虫分食"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "After you cooked it, you tore this long thing into small pieces.  Maybe this can prevent it from reviving in your intestines."
msgstr "煮熟后，你把这个长东西撕成小块。也许这可以阻止它在你的肠道里复活。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "An errant cut coats your tools with foul-smelling, glowing goop"
msgstr "一次错误的切割让你的工具涂上了一层恶臭的发光粘液"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "As if they noticed the death of their mother, the dozens of centipedes still clinging to it attack each other with a sudden frenzy.  You decide to give them time to disperse before continuing"
msgstr "如同注意到它们的母亲已经死去一般，依附在这具尸体上的数十只蜈蚣突然开始疯狂地互相攻击。你决定等待它们全部离开再继续屠宰"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "As you cut into its abdomen you disturb a handful of normal-sized, wingless wasps clinging to a strange, tubular organ.  They crawl a few steps before falling lifelessly to the ground"
msgstr "当你切开它的腹部时，你惊动了许多正常大小的无翼黄蜂，它们紧紧抓住一个奇怪的管状器官。它们爬了几步，然后就死气沉沉地倒在地上"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "As you cut into its flesh you are disturbed by its sickly-sweet smell, like fermenting fruit."
msgstr "当你切开它的肉时，你被一股像腐烂水果的气味弄得有些恶心"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "As you cut more and more meat away, some of the resilient chitin plates fall away with a loud squelch"
msgstr "当你割掉越来越多的肉，一些充满弹性的甲壳嘎吱作响地掉了下来"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "As you open its intestines by mistake, you can barely pull your finger away from the dozen snapping mandibles on its inside"
msgstr "当你意外地切开内脏时，你差点没能把手指从其内部十几个不停咬合的下颌骨中撤出来"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "As you peel away the outer shell, you find veins lining the chitin plates"
msgstr "当你剥开它的外壳时，你发现甲壳板上布满了血管"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Beneath the chitin, the meat is covered in thick, bristly hair hiding a chaotic bramble of half-formed, mutated organs."
msgstr "在甲壳下面，肉被厚厚的刚毛覆盖，其中隐藏着一个由半成形的变异器官构成的混乱荆棘"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "By the time you reach the rear of the matriarch, most of its offspring have disappeared into the grass.  Some stuck around feeding on their unhatched siblings, unwilling to give up the easy meal until the last moment"
msgstr "当你达到母虫的尾部时，它大部分的幼虫都已经消失在草丛中。另一些停下来食用它们未孵化的同类，直到最后一刻都不愿放弃唾手可得的食物"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Chitinous ridges of hooked spines along struts and sheets of the same material give support the creature's interior and hold it all together."
msgstr "沿着相同材料的支柱和片材的钩状刺的几丁质脊支撑着该生物的内部并将其固定在一起。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Chunks of meat, bone, and fabric inside one of the digestive tracts are still easy to identify, and you wonder what their name was"
msgstr "其中一段消化道内的大块肉、骨头和布料仍然清晰可辨，你很好奇他们的名字叫什么"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Deep, deep within the dead queen you find a smooth, brightly colored plaque the size of your fingernail, reading <number><number>"
msgstr "在死去蜂后的身体深处，你发现了一块光滑、色彩鲜艳、指甲大小的牌子，上面写着<number><number>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Each leg bears too many hooks and outcrops to count, and they look far too much like teeth for your liking"
msgstr "每条腿上都长着许多钩子和凸起，难以计数，而且它们对你来说看起来太像牙齿了"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Each pair of legs is slightly different.  These end in hooks, the next in talons like a bird's, there's a pair of chitinous tentacles"
msgstr "每一对腿都有细微的差别。一些末端是钩状，一些如同鸟爪，一些则是带甲壳的触手"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Even as the body grows still, the wings keep on beating slowly"
msgstr "即使尸体已经静止不动，但它的翅膀仍在缓慢地跳动"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Even though it's made of something like flesh, you can't help but feel like you're disassembling an intricate machine"
msgstr "尽管它是由肉一样的的东西制成的，但你不禁会觉得你是在拆卸一台复杂的机器"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Every cut reveals an organ you can't quite recognize, and you start to wonder what your insides look like by now."
msgstr "每一刀都会显露出一个你不太认识的新器官，你现在开始怀疑自己的内脏变成了什么样"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Every so often your tool hits something bone-hard in the deep, but when you cut there the second time the flesh parts smoothly"
msgstr "每隔一段时间，你的工具就会在深处碰到一些坚硬的东西，但当你第二次在那里切割时，肉就会顺利地分开"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Finger-thick strands connect the glowing organ to the base of a limb, and the normally white flesh is blackened along its path"
msgstr "手指粗的脉络将发光的器官连接到肢体底部，沿路上原本是白色的肉都变成了黑色"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Flaps of soft tissue folded over each other like pages of a book line the creature's underside, almost resembling gills."
msgstr "软组织瓣像书页一样相互折叠，排列在该生物的下侧，几乎类似于鳃。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "For its apparent hunger for meat, its intestines seem almost atrophied"
msgstr "因为它对鲜肉的明显渴望，它的内脏几乎都萎缩了"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "For your first cut you connect the dozen openings on the creature's sides, only to reveal a finger-sized wriggling grub in each"
msgstr "在你一刀将尸体身体两侧的十几个开口连起来切开时，每个开口中都露出了手指般大小不停蠕动的幼虫"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "In a hidden organ without an obvious connection to the outside world, you find a seemingly forgotten handful of glistening eggs"
msgstr "在一个与外界没有明显连接的隐藏器官中，你发现了一些看似被遗忘的闪光的卵"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "In the beginning you take care to separate parasite and host, but after a while you give up and start cutting through."
msgstr "一开始你还能小心地将寄生虫和它的宿主分开，但过了一段时间你放弃了，直接切断任何挡路的虫子。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Inside is a tangled mess of organs and tissues that do not appear healthy or natural.  It's hard to make sense of it, but the knots of leather-hard dessicated tissue among its organs suggest disease."
msgstr "里面是一团混乱的器官和组织，看起来不健康或不自然。  很难理解它的含义，但其器官中皮革坚硬的干燥组织结表明有疾病。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "It is difficult to work as the slimy tissue tears apart like wet paper under your blade."
msgstr "屠宰工作进展得很慢，因为海绵一般的组织在你的工具下方不断裂开"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "It's cooked.  You can force yourself to believe that the cordlike tissue inside is noodles with ketchup and Italian spices."
msgstr "它煮熟了。你可以强迫自己相信里面的线状组织是加了番茄酱和意大利香料的面条。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Its chitin is sturdier than usual for the flying insects, and marked by the struggles of its previous victims"
msgstr "它的甲壳比普通飞虫来说更坚固，并且上面留下了曾经受害者的挣扎痕迹"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Its intestines grew into a labyrinthine tangle, like so many worms devouring each other."
msgstr "它的肠子缠绕成迷宫缠结，就像无数互相吞噬的蠕虫一般"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Its legs contain no muscles, just sinews hanging in yellow-green ichor"
msgstr "它的腿上没有肌肉，只有悬挂在黄绿色体液中的筋络"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Its parts don't want to stay apart, slowly moving to close your cuts.  You resign yourself to removing every chunk and placing it on the ground beside the corpse, where they finally grow still"
msgstr "它的各个部分不想分开，慢慢地移动，以合上你造成的伤口。你不甘心，把每一块都拿出来，放在尸体旁边的地上，它们终于在那里不动了"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Its skin feels less flexible than usual, and coated in a greasy film on the outside"
msgstr "它的皮肤没有看起来那么有弹性，而且外面涂有一层油腻的薄膜"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Its stomach is full of grubs even more malformed than the rest.  The runt of the litter got recycled, it seems."
msgstr "它的胃里充满了比其他地方更畸形的蛆虫。看起来其中的弱小幼虫似乎在这里被那些大虫们回收了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Looking at this pile of biological tissues with strange smell, you don't know what kind of organs they belong to in medicine.  Of course, you're pretty sure they're not boiled tomatoes."
msgstr "看着这堆散发着奇怪气味的生物组织，你不知道这些玩意在解剖学上属于什么器官。当然，不是煮熟的番茄，你十分确定。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although it came from muscle tissue, it has a curious swirling grain pattern, and at the center of each grain is a knot of hard, cartilaginous tissue.  It smells offputting."
msgstr "从严重变异的生物身上切下的一大块肉。虽然它来自肌肉组织，但它上面布满了奇怪的颗粒状旋转花纹，在每个颗粒中心是一团坚硬的软骨组织。闻起来很恶心。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although this came from muscle, it has a thick cordlike texture and smells like leather and bread mold."
msgstr "从严重变异的生物身上切下的一大块肉。虽然这是来自肌肉组织，但它表面布满了厚厚的绳索状纹理，闻起来像是皮革和发霉的面包。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It has an unsettling loose and spongy texture, but smells… mostly normal.  There are strange tangles and formations in it that don't appear natural at all: bits of bone and hair crusted up inside the muscle, as if trying to form another organism.  Still, it seems digestible at least, if you cook it and remove the worst parts."
msgstr "从严重变异的生物身上切下的一大块肉。这块肉有着恶心的海绵般的松散质感，不过闻起来……还算正常。肉的内部有着一些明显不自然的杂乱组织：骨头和毛发堆积在肌肉组织之间，就像是要生长出另一只生物一般。至少它看起来还能被消化，前提是你得把它烹饪加工并处理掉那些不好的部分。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  This is from muscle, but in the fascial tissue between the muscles, thick spiny hairs have grown.  Foul-smelling, cream-colored fluid gushes out whenever a hair pulls loose."
msgstr "从严重变异的生物身上切下的一大块肉。看上去像是来自肌肉组织，但在肌肉之间的筋膜组织中，长出了许多粗大的多刺毛发已经生长。一旦把毛发拔出，就会涌出一股臭气熏天的奶油色的液体。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Most of its insides are taken up by the warped organ still humming with electricity.  Cutting into it proves harder than expected, not the least because of the sparks"
msgstr "它的体内大部分被扭曲的器官所占据，仍在嗡嗡作响地发电。切开它比预期的要难，特别是由于电火花的存在"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Near its wings you find a black, bubbling organ still periodically emitting a bundle of floating bubbles"
msgstr "靠近翅膀，你会发现一个黑色的冒泡器官，仍然在周期性地释放出一串串漂浮的气泡"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "No organs beyond various sizes of the acid glands in neat rows, as if they were replacement parts ready to deploy"
msgstr "内部除了大大小小整齐排列酸性腺体外，没有其他器官，仿佛它们是准备部署的替换部件"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "On closer inspection, the head's armor is pocked by finger-sized holes with jagged edges, reminiscent of the creature's fangs"
msgstr "仔细看的话，它头上的甲壳布满了手指大小的带锯齿状边缘的小孔，与它的毒牙有几分相似"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "On its tail end the segments get smaller and smaller, until they terminate in a small copy of the head, looking backwards"
msgstr "它尾部的每一个体节越来越小，直到最后长出一个向后生长的头部的小型复制品"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "On some organs you see the same swollen ulcers as around your own wounds.  It seems not all of it is venom-proof"
msgstr "在它的一些器官上，你看见和你的伤口类似的肿胀的溃疡。看起来它也不是完全对毒液免疫"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "One of its eyes falls to the ground and shatters into a dozen jagged splinters"
msgstr "它的一只眼睛掉在地上，碎成了十几块锯齿状的碎片"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although it came from muscle tissue, it has a curious swirling grain pattern, and at the center of each grain is a knot of hard, cartilaginous tissue.  Its smell is nauseating."
msgstr "从严重变异的生物身上切下的有毒肉块。虽然它来自肌肉组织，但它上面布满了奇怪的颗粒状旋转花纹，在每个颗粒中心是一团坚硬的软骨组织。闻起来让人作呕。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although this came from muscle, it has a thick cordlike texture and smells like leather and bread mold."
msgstr "从严重变异的生物身上切下的有毒肉块。虽然这是来自肌肉组织，但它表面布满了厚厚的绳索状纹理，闻起来像是皮革和发霉的面包。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It has an unsettling loose and spongy texture and a putrid smell.  There are strange tangles and formations in it that don't appear natural at all: bits of bone and hair crusted up inside the muscle, as if trying to form another organism.  You'd have to be truly desperate to try eating this."
msgstr "从变异生物身上切下的有毒肉块。这块肉有着恶心的海绵般的松散质感，以及一股腐烂的恶臭。肉的内部有着一些明显不自然的杂乱组织：骨头和毛发堆积在肌肉组织之间，就像是要生长出另一只生物一般。只有真正绝望的人才会考虑吃下这坨玩意。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  This is from muscle, but in the fascial tissue between the muscles, thick spiny hairs have grown.  Foul-smelling, cream-colored fluid gushes out whenever a hair pulls loose."
msgstr "从严重变异的生物身上切下的有毒肉块。看上去像是来自肌肉组织，但在肌肉之间的筋膜组织中，长出了许多粗大的多刺毛发已经生长。一旦把毛发拔出，就会涌出一股臭气熏天的奶油色的液体。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Prying off the elytra is easier than you thought it would be, but a thicker duplicate lies beneath, melted into the veiny wings"
msgstr "撬开翅鞘比你想象的要容易，但它底下又有一层相同的复制，融化形成布满血管的翅膀"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Rudimentary vessels branch out from the creature's heart, spiraling through the muscle in chaotic, twisted patterns."
msgstr "原始血管从该生物的心脏分支出来，以混乱、扭曲的方式盘旋穿过肌肉。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Several acid glands rupture as you peel back the carapace, sending streams of steaming caustic fluids spraying around"
msgstr "当你剥开甲壳时，几个酸腺破裂，喷出一股股热气腾腾的酸液"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Several times, you nearly burn yourself piercing a concealed gland full of acid"
msgstr "有好几次，你在不小心刺穿一个充满酸液的隐藏腺体时差点烧伤自己"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Since your tools barely have purchase on its carapace you decide to dig the meat and viscera out from your first cut.  At times, you disappear up to your waist in its armored insides"
msgstr "因为你的工具对它的甲壳几乎毫无作用，你决定从你割开的第一个切口中把肉和内脏挖出来，时不时消失在甲壳内部及腰深的血肉之中"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Small bundles of fiber break loose as you work, splitting open to reveal twisted, half-formed copies of the creature itself."
msgstr "当你进行屠宰时，许多细小的纤维随着你的动作飞散分裂开来，露出这只生物自己扭曲的半成型的复制品"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Some disturbing hairs have been burned off during cooking, but you still have difficulty convincing yourself to eat them."
msgstr "一些令人不安的毛发在烹饪过程中被烧掉了，但你仍然难以说服自己去吃下它。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Some of the egg clusters are ransacked by fat, white worms tunneling blindly through its flesh"
msgstr "一些卵簇被盲目地钻过它血肉的肥胖白色幼虫洗劫一空"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Some of the innards look a bit like tomalley, more of a paste than a distinct organ."
msgstr "有些内脏看起来有点像托马利，更像是糊状物，而不是一个独特的器官。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Some of the now-familiar venom glands also contain dozens of shiny white eggs, undisturbed by their deadly surroundings"
msgstr "在现在已被你熟悉的一些毒腺中还含有几十个闪亮的白色的卵，它们不受周围致命环境的干扰"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Some of your cuts meet nerves, and the already stiff corpse shudders with movement each time."
msgstr "你下刀时偶尔会碰到神经，早已僵硬的尸体每次都会随之颤抖不已"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Something not unlike a heart still spasms in the depth of the corpse, and the legs twitch to its rhythm"
msgstr "尸体深处有某种与心脏相似的东西仍在痉挛，双腿随着节奏抽动"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Something that looks like it belongs in an engine lies between the splayed out lungs, and it sprays grease five paces when you puncture it"
msgstr "在切开的肺部中有某种看起来像是发动机的东西，当你刺穿它时，喷射出长达五步的油脂"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Something, probably the brain, from a heavily-mutated animal.  The spinal cord gives way to a chaotic tangle of loose neural fibers without any of semblance of a solid anatomy, and the whole mess is visibly shrinking now that you got it out of the creature's liquor."
msgstr "某种东西，可能是大脑，来自高度变异的动物。脊髓被松散的神经纤维杂乱无章的缠结所取代，没有任何可靠的解剖结构，而当你把它从这个生物的体液中取出来后，整团乱糟糟的玩意明显地缩小了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Sparks dance between your tool and its skin, but disappear without any harm"
msgstr "电火花在你的工具和它的皮肤之间闪烁，但没有造成任何伤害就消失了"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Sparks still dance around its limbs, and you're hesitant to start cutting"
msgstr "电火花仍然在它的四肢上跳舞，而你对开始动刀犹豫不决"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Steaming acid burbles from the creature's chitin as you peel it back"
msgstr "当你剥开它的外壳时，它所流出的热气腾腾的酸液汩汩作响"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Steaming puddles of acid spill from its outer shell as you pull it back"
msgstr "在你把它翻过来时，它的外壳上冒出了一滩热气腾腾的酸液"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The anatomy concealed beneath seems almost like a small mammal given a shell and twisted into the shape of an arthropod"
msgstr "隐藏在这只生物内部的解剖结构看起来像是一只长了甲壳的小型哺乳动物，被扭曲成节肢动物的形状"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The brain of a heavily-mutated animal.  A thick net of interlocking veins cocoons it, and the surface has a rainbow sheen like an oil slick.  When you reach towards it, the whole thing starts shuddering and it comes loose from the spinal cord, as if it's trying to escape."
msgstr "一块高度变异动物的大脑。一张密密麻麻的相互连接的血管网将它包裹起来，表面呈现出像浮油一样的彩虹色光泽。当你靠近它时，整个东西开始颤抖，从脊髓中松脱出来，好像在试图逃跑一般。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The brain of a heavily-mutated animal.  Shining white in color and brittle to the touch like hard cheese, you can hardly believe it was a living organ moments before.  On the base the pure whiteness is broken up by a huge, spasming artery filled with yellow gunk."
msgstr "一块高度变异动物的大脑。色泽洁白，触感脆如硬奶酪，你很难相信它是一个活的器官。在它的底部，纯白的白色被一条充满黄色黏液的巨大的还在痉挛的动脉打破了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The brain of a heavily-mutated animal.  Vestigial, still-twitching eyes are strewn across its surface, each with a different-shaped pupil.  Hidden between the hemispheres you find an embryonic copy of the creature's face, eyes darting around in a mad spasm."
msgstr "一块高度变异动物的大脑。残存的、仍在抽搐的眼睛散落在它的表面，每一只眼睛中都有一个不同形状的瞳孔。隐藏在两个半球之间，你会发现一张这种生物的脸的胚胎复制，眼睛正疯狂地痉挛着。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The carapace of this one still feels hot to the touch, especially around the wings"
msgstr "它的甲壳摸起来还是热的，尤其是在翅膀周围"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The caustic buboes connect to a web of sickly green veins running down the creature's limbs.  You take care not to nick them"
msgstr "腐蚀性的液泡连接着一张病态的绿色血管网，沿着生物的四肢蜿蜒而下。你在尝试尽量不弄破它们"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The chaotic bundle of organs in its torso look much like those of other mutated insects, but as you near the abdomen there's order to the madness: comparatively neat rows of venom-filled glands, each feeding into a reservoir at the base of the stinger"
msgstr "它躯干上混乱的器官体看起来很像其他变异的昆虫，但当你靠近腹部时，就逐渐变得疯狂起来：一排排排相对整齐的充满毒液的腺体，每一个都流入毒刺底部的一个储液罐"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The chitin holds tight to the creature, and you need to snap and tear it away, sawing at tough fibers beneath"
msgstr "甲壳紧紧地包裹着这只生物，你需要把它撕开，锯开下方坚硬的纤维"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The chitin of the head is caked in old blood and lymph of its previous victims"
msgstr "它头部的甲壳凝结着它之前的猎物的血液和淋巴"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The chitin of this one is light and brittle, like an empty eggshell"
msgstr "它的外部甲壳又轻又脆，像一个空蛋壳"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The creature's endolymph is a thick yellow-green with bits of brownish sediment suspended within."
msgstr "这种生物的内淋巴是浓稠的黄绿色，里面悬浮着一些褐色的沉积物。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The eyes are easily pulled loose, though with them spills out numerous coiled ropes of nerve, sinew, and something halfway between"
msgstr "眼睛很容易被扯下来，但大量缠绕在一起的神经、肌腱和介于两者之间的某种东西会跟着一起喷出来"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The fangs are connected to fist-sized venom glands, still churning with life"
msgstr "毒牙与拳头大小的毒腺相连，仍在带着生命地搏动"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The fangs spray a sickly green liquid to the ground when you touch them"
msgstr "当你碰到它的尸体时，毒牙向地面喷射出了一种病态的绿色液体"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The green veins stand out before the stark white background and there is a hair-thin space surrounding each, as if the flesh was hesitant to touch whatever is carried inside"
msgstr "绿色的血管在鲜明的白色背景前显得格外突出，每条脉络周围都有一个头发般细小的空间，仿佛肉体在犹豫是否要触碰里面承载的东西"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The head is occupied entirely by organic hydraulics wrapped in muscle, and you don't find tangled strands of brain tissue until the thorax"
msgstr "头部完全被包裹在肌肉中的液压器官系统所占据，直到胸部，你才发现缠绕在一起的类似脑的组织"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The imposing mandibles give way to a surprisingly thin tube and atrophied digestive track.  It must have done most of its digesting outside"
msgstr "移走它巨大的下颚，下面是意外细的管道和萎缩的消化道。它的大部分消化过程肯定是在外面完成的"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The indescribable stench of the remains of its last meal make you question your decision to butcher it"
msgstr "它最后一次进食的残骸在它体内发出的难以言喻的恶臭使你开始怀疑你屠宰它的决定"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The larvae seem to have taken care to leave enough intact not to kill their host, but the rest is practically hollow."
msgstr "幼虫似乎小心留下刚好不会杀死它们宿主的组织结构，但其余部分几乎都空了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The legs fall off easily, leaving the main body looking like an armored worm"
msgstr "它的腿轻易地脱离掉落下来，使得它的身体看起来就像是一只带着甲壳的蠕虫"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The light of its abdomen flickers with each cut, growing ever dimmer"
msgstr "它腹部器官发出的光随着每次切割而闪烁着，渐渐黯淡"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The mandibles keep snapping, and acrid-smelling venom wets the soil.  You decide to begin your work at its tail"
msgstr "它的颚部仍然在不停咬合，刺鼻的毒液浸湿了地面。你决定从它的尾部开始屠宰"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The meat inside gives off a horrifying stench and seems to be covered in thin damp hair, like a newborn animal gone horribly wrong."
msgstr "里面的肉散发出一股可怕的臭味，似乎被一团湿漉漉的细毛覆盖着，就像一只出了可怕毛病的新生动物"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The moment the matriarch grows still, the last third of its body flops to the ground, letting go of dozens of eggs and small centipedes"
msgstr "在母虫停止移动的一刹那，它尾端三分之一的身体坠向地面，数十只卵和小蜈蚣摔落下来"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The moment you start cutting into the corpse, a few of what you thought were extra legs detach and scurry off into the undergrowth"
msgstr "当你切开尸体时，几条你认为是多余的腿脱离了身体，匆匆窜进了附近的灌木丛中"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The muscles grow stiff, and begin leaking a dark gray liquid that pools around your feet."
msgstr "肌肉变得僵硬，开始渗出一种深灰色液体，聚集在你的脚周围"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The organs themselves have an acrid odor, but don't seem as caustically acidic as the outer shell"
msgstr "器官本身有一股刺鼻的气味，但不像外壳那样有腐蚀酸性"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The poor creature has stopped breathing, but there's still a lot of movement in the corpse."
msgstr "这只可怜的生物早已经停止了呼吸，但尸体里还有很多东西在动。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The powerfully acidic vapors coming from the carcass make it hard to work"
msgstr "尸体所喷出的强酸性蒸汽使你很难进行屠宰工作"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The reproductive organs of this beetle, sealed inside a chitin casket, have coiled into a mockery of nature and bristle with half-developed eggs"
msgstr "这只甲虫的生殖器官被密封在一层甲壳组成的棺材中，盘绕成非自然的形状，长满了发育不完全的卵"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The skin comes off with a sickening snap, and reveals a billion tiny black tendrils grasping after it"
msgstr "皮肤随着一声令人作呕的断裂声而脱落，下面有上亿条黑色的小触须在试图把皮肤抓回去"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The skin is filled with tiny black crystals embedded in a dizzying fractal pattern emanating from the central glowing organ"
msgstr "皮肤上布满了细小的黑色晶体，镶嵌成一个令人眼花缭乱的分形图案，从中央的发光器官铺展开"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The skin is so riddled with wounds that you barely need to cut to pull it away."
msgstr "皮肤上布满了伤口，你不费吹灰之力能把它切开剥掉。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The space not taken up by the now-familiar floating sacs is almost entirely filled by a sticky, homogenous yellow jelly that seems to actively try to avoid your knife"
msgstr "它体内尚未被你所熟悉的漂浮囊占据的空间内几乎完全充满了某种粘稠均质的黄色果冻状物质，而这些物质似乎会主动地试图避开你的刀锋"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The stiff hairs of its chitin seem to shift slightly, points reaching for your skin"
msgstr "它几丁质的硬毛似乎在轻微移动，指向你的皮肤"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The stripes -so uniform at a distance- reveal themselves to be jagged, strangely familiar patterns, like the cursive of an unknown language"
msgstr "这些条纹——在远处如此均匀——原来其实是锯齿状的，奇怪又熟悉的图案，就像一种未知语言的草书"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The stripes on the back of its abdomen are warped into a nauseating spiral you can't tear your eyes away from"
msgstr "它腹部后面的条纹扭曲成一个令人作呕的螺旋形，几乎让你无法把眼睛从上面移开"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The thick chitin is difficult to saw through, and rooted so deeply in fat that each panel you pull off comes with dangling ropes of sinew and grease"
msgstr "厚厚的甲壳很难被锯穿，而且根部深深扎入脂肪中，以至于你拔下每块甲壳板上都悬着许多肌腱和油脂"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The tissues of the creature are full of half-formed organs, their purpose unclear"
msgstr "这只生物的组织中充满了半成形的器官，它们的作用还不清楚"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The white flesh keeps quivering, grasping and pulling your tool occasionally"
msgstr "白色的肉体在不断颤抖，偶尔抓住并试图拉走你的工具"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The wings are held in place by stiff muscles, reaching into the deep"
msgstr "翅膀被早已僵硬的肌肉固定得死死的，深深插进体内深处"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The wings are rooted in its flesh by an almost transparent, fractal root structure, making you question if it always belonged to the creature"
msgstr "它的翅膀由一种几乎透明的分形根状结构深深扎入肉中，让你怀疑这种结构可能天生就属于这种生物的一部分"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The wings of this creature break apart upon the slightest touch into myriad identical rainbow crystals"
msgstr "这种生物的翅膀一碰就碎裂成无数外形相同的彩虹晶体"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "There are fist-sized globs of nervous tissue dotted about its insides, sending the corpse into a spasm every time you touch one."
msgstr "它的体内点缀着拳头大小的神经组织球，每当你碰到一个，尸体就会痉挛"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "There are no strange smells, no random organs strewn about its insides.  Somehow that is more disconcerting than the mutated animals you took apart until now"
msgstr "没有奇怪的气味，没有散落在其内部的随机器官。不知何故，这比你之前切开的的变异动物更让人不安"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "There is no movement from the body, but you can still hear a faint crackling from inside"
msgstr "尸体没有任何动静，但你仍然可以听到里面传出微弱的噼啪声"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "There is order to the chaos in this one.  Each segment's insides is a perfect copy of the last, down to each sinew"
msgstr "这只在混乱中包含着秩序。它的每一个体节都是上一个体节的完美复制品，精度直至每一条肌腱"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "There's a thin membrane, much like skin, spread over the chitin of this creature"
msgstr "这只生物的外层甲壳上长出了一层薄膜，很像皮肤"

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "These organs came from a giant mutant bug, and you really aren't sure what to make of them.  There are things you've never seen in any anatomy book, with spines and hair and other unidentified parts protruding seemingly at random."
msgstr "从巨大的变异昆虫身上切下的奇怪器官，你真的不知道如何利用它们。有些东西你从来没有在任何解剖学书上看到过，脊刺、毛发和其他不明的器官结构似乎是随意地从其中伸出来。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "These organs came from a giant mutant bug.  They have a sickly green color, and one of them ripped when you were removing it, revealing an inner surface that looks like row upon row of human fingers, nails and all."
msgstr "从巨大的变异昆虫身上切下的奇怪器官。它们有一种病态的绿色，其中一个在你取下它时被撕裂了，露出了它的内表面，看起来像是一排排像是人类手指或是指甲之类的结构。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Thick, ropey cords of tissue beneath its chitin protect an inner layer of strange organs, resembling those of a bird more than anything"
msgstr "甲壳素下面厚厚的、绳索状的组织保护着内层的奇怪器官，看上去最像鸟的器官"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This carcass is riddled with what look like immature clusters of eggs.  Whether these are parasites or part of the animal's reproductive system is unclear."
msgstr "这具尸体上布满了看起来像是未成熟的卵簇的东西。  目前还不清楚这些是寄生虫还是动物生殖系统的一部分。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This feels more like scrapping a car than butchering an animal.  Instead of veins and legs you find yourself thinking about joints, panels, and cabling"
msgstr "屠宰它感觉更像拆卸一辆车，而不是屠宰一只动物。你总是不禁想起关节、板材和线缆，而不是肌腱和肢体"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  Heat caused the muscles to twist and move as if they were alive, and now it has writhed itself into a dense knot."
msgstr "一大块煮熟的变异生物的肉。加热使肌肉组织像活着一样扭曲移动，现在它已经扭成一个密集的肉结。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  It has an unsettling, spongy texture, but otherwise tastes… mostly normal.  Hopefully you got all the bits of hair and bone out…"
msgstr "一块煮熟的变异肉块。这块肉有着恶心的海绵般的松散质感，不过尝起来……还算正常。但愿你已经把里面的毛发和骨头全部清理干净了……"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  It has an unsettling, spongy texture, but otherwise tastes… mostly normal.  Hopefully you won't vomit while eating this…"
msgstr "一块煮熟的变异肉块。这块肉有着恶心的海绵般的松散质感，不过尝起来……还算正常。但愿你吃下这玩意个的时候不会呕吐……"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  The surface is peppered with divots from the pieces you had to dig out to make it seem edible."
msgstr "一大块煮熟的变异生物的肉。它的表面布满了羽绒一样的硬茬，需要你清除干净，才勉强让它看起来可以食用。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  You thought you'd cleared out all the gross parts, but while cooking, a fluid-filled sac inside burst and covered it in some kind of foul-smelling thick grease."
msgstr "一大块煮熟的变异生物的肉。你本以为自己已经除掉了所有的脏物，但是在烹饪时，里面的一个充满奇怪液体的液囊破了，整块肉都被裹上了某种散发出恶臭的厚厚油脂。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  You thought you'd cleared out all the gross parts, but while cooking, a fluid-filled sac inside burst and covered it in some kind of thick grease."
msgstr "一大块煮熟的变异生物的肉。你本以为自己已经除掉了所有的脏物，但是在烹饪时，里面的一个充满奇怪液体的液囊破了，整块肉都被裹上了某种厚厚的油脂。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a huge, thick, fleshy sac you removed from a giant mutant bug.  The surface is covered in smooth, soft skin, and beneath it is a coiled, twisted mess of cordlike tissue."
msgstr "从巨大的变异昆虫身上切下的一个巨大的厚肉囊。表面覆盖着光滑柔软的皮肤，内部是一团盘绕扭曲的绳索状组织。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a long, corded organ you removed from a giant mutant bug.  It ran from the head to the abdomen and has long tendrils coming off it, not unlike a spinal cord."
msgstr "从巨大的变异昆虫身上切下的一个长长的绳索状器官。它从头部一直延伸到腹部，有长长的卷须从上面脱落，和脊柱没什么两样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a meaty gray organ you removed from a mutant.  It has a chalky yellow coating that burns your skin, and several unidentifiable fleshy tubes sticking out of it.  The smell it gives off stings your nostrils.  You're pretty confident no natural creature has one of these."
msgstr "从变异生物身上切下的一个肉质灰色器官。它有一层粉状黄色涂层，能灼伤你的皮肤，还有几根无法辨认的肉质管子从里面伸出来。它散发出的气味相当刺鼻。你很肯定任何自然生物都不会有这种器官。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This is a piece of cooked brain from a mutated animal.  Whatever gave its surface an oily sheen has coagulated into bluish clumps of goo settled into the grooves.  You try to scrape them off, but they seem fused with the tissue beneath."
msgstr "一块被煮熟的来自高度变异动物的大脑。之前使它的表面泛出油光的未知物质，凝结成了蓝色的黏液团，沉淀在凹槽中。你试图把它们刮下来，但它们似乎与下面的组织融合在一起。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This one smells disturbingly appetizing, like a memory of a childhood meal whose details you forgot"
msgstr "这一只闻起来美味得令人不适，就像是你记忆中童年的一顿细节早已忘记的美餐"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This one's skin consists of dozens of layers, each of slightly different color, sandwiched between a gelatinous mass"
msgstr "这只生物的皮肤有几十层，每层的颜色都略有不同，皮肤之间夹着胶状物"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This one's very blood stinks like its venom, and even the slightest drop makes your skin itch"
msgstr "这只的血液和它的毒液一般恶臭，就算是再小的一滴也使你的皮肤开始瘙痒"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This one's very flesh is glowing with a blinding intensity, lighting up your gruesome work"
msgstr "这具尸体发出几乎令人致盲的强光，照亮你所干的令人作呕的活"

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This organ meat, retrieved from a mutated creature, looks like a series of small mammalian hearts arranged in series on a long fleshy tube.  At the end of the chain is a large fleshy sac resembling a stomach."
msgstr "从变异生物身上切下的器官肉，看起来像是一系列排列在长长的肉质血管上的小型哺乳动物心脏。在长链的末端是一个巨大的肉质囊，看上去像是胃。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "This specimen looks much worse on the inside than out: malformed legs, mouthparts, and eyes compete for space with its organs like parasitic octuplets."
msgstr "这个标本的内部看起来比外部更糟糕：畸形的腿、口器和眼睛与它的器官争夺空间，就像寄生的八胞胎一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "To bypass the armor you had to start your work by its mandibles, inches away from its venom-coated fangs and the remains of chitin, bones, and strands of Kevlar stuck between their points"
msgstr "为了绕过它的甲壳，你只能从它的颚部着手，距离它的毒牙只有几寸之遥。你发现它的毒牙间塞满了甲壳、骨骼和凯夫拉纤维的残骸"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Under the carapace of this mutant is a bristly, velcro-like material"
msgstr "在这只变异生物的甲壳下是一层刚毛状、类似魔术贴的材质"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Underneath the chitin you find bundles of small, floating pearls, each held in place by a single strand of sinew"
msgstr "在甲壳下面，你发现了一团团漂浮在空中的小珍珠，每条珍珠都由被一股肌腱固定在恰当的位置上"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Underneath the surface, there are small plates of chitin dotted about, much harder than the rest"
msgstr "小型的甲壳点缀在体表之下，比其它甲壳更加坚硬"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Upon closer inspection, the uniform black stripes reveal themselves to be rows upon rows of glistening eyes"
msgstr "仔细观察，这些均匀的黑色条纹其实是一排闪闪发光的眼睛"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "What you saw as a homogenous light from a distance was the result of myriad strands of glowing chitin crisscrossing just beneath the carapace"
msgstr "你离远所看到的均匀光线其实是在甲壳下方交错的无数股发光的几丁质细丝的成果"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "What you thought was shuddering chitinous fuzz on the creature's back is, in reality, thousands of miniature copies of its main wings, flapping in unison"
msgstr "原本被你认为是长在它背上不停颤抖的甲壳质绒毛，其实是成百上千对主翅的缩影，全都一同整齐地不停地扇动着"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "What you thought were black veins under the skin are actually some sort of elastic net, snapping apart with a loud \"TWANG\" when your tool cuts them"
msgstr "皮肤下的黑色血管或许实际上是某种弹性网，当你用工具切割它们时，会发出响亮的\"tuang\"声而断裂"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Whatever this is, it doesn't look dead so much as staying still.  You still feel like it's looking at you, even as you cut it apart"
msgstr "不管这是什么，它看起来并没有死，而是静止不动。你仍然觉得它在看着你，即使在你把它切开的时候"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "When you grab one particularly bristled organ, it writhes and nearly escapes your grasp before you can smash it.  You find developing wings in the paste"
msgstr "当你抓住其中某个特别毛茸茸的器官时，它会扭动，在你捏碎它之前几乎快逃出你的抓握。你在碎浆中发现了正在发育的翅膀"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "When you sever the vestigial wings, a spurt of mud-thick fluid gushes up and every leg twitches"
msgstr "当你切断残存的翅膀时，一股泥浆状的液体喷涌而出，每条腿都抽搐起来"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Where you came to expect smooth chitin you find exposed flesh, shot with a web of hardened strands"
msgstr "在你以为会长着光滑的甲壳的地方，其实是裸露的血肉，被一层坚硬的细丝围成的网包裹"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "With each cut, the stinger springs from its sheath, tip bending ever so slightly towards your leg"
msgstr "每切一刀，它的毒刺都会从鞘中弹出来，尖端向你的腿微微弯曲"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "With every cut the creature shifts slightly, splayed limbs inching closer to how it looked when it was…alive?  Whatever the right word is you hope it stopped, if only for now"
msgstr "每切一刀，这个生物都会轻微挪动，伸展的四肢越来越接近它……活着时的样子？不管用什么词合适，你都希望它别再动了，哪怕只是暂时的"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "With the creature dead, its carapace comes away surprisingly easily"
msgstr "这只生物已经死了，它的甲壳出奇的容易剥开"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You are dizzied by the rainbow coloration of the creature's muscles, clashing with the bloody mess in its guts."
msgstr "你被这只生物体内彩虹色花纹的肌肉和血淋淋的混乱内脏弄得有些头晕"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You carefully avoid breaking through pockets of what you think may be acid-secreting glands"
msgstr "你小心地避免撕破你认为可能是酸液分泌腺的口袋形结构"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You cough as you inhale the fine, colorful dust shedded from the wings"
msgstr "你吸入了从翅膀上脱落下来的五颜六色的细尘，让你止不住地咳嗽"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You crack the beast open like a horrific lobster"
msgstr "你把这只怪兽的尸体像撕开一只可怕的龙虾一样撕开"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You find a clutch of stillborn grubs inside, curled up in their parent's fatty innards with eggshells nearby"
msgstr "你发现体内有一堆死去的蛴螬，它们蜷缩在父母肥嘟嘟的内脏里，旁边还有数不尽的卵壳"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You find a handful of dead grubs underneath its chitin, near a chewed-open venom gland"
msgstr "在它的甲壳下面，在一个被咬开的毒腺附近，你发现了一大把死去的幼虫"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You find vacuoles filled with its venom in the most unexpected nooks, forcing you to work carefully"
msgstr "你总是在它身体最意外的角落发现充满毒液的液泡，你不得不小心谨慎地进行屠宰"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You finish up, coming to grips with the fact that toxins suffuse every inch of the truckload of meat you just pulled from this mutant beetle"
msgstr "你辛苦完成了屠宰，最终终于意识到毒素充斥在你刚刚从这只变异甲虫身上所取下的每一寸肉之中"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You follow what you think are superfluous veins into the deep, finding a gorged, tick-like creature at their convergence."
msgstr "你沿着你认为多余的血管切进尸体深处，在它们的汇合处发现一只肠肥脑满、像虱子一样的生物"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You hack off the legs, finding them surprisingly light once the knotted veins within are drained"
msgstr "你把腿都砍下来，发现里面成结的血管排干后，它们的重量惊人地轻"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You have cooked a pile of *things* that used to be green, and it still looks green under the light.  You think your face will turn that color after eating them."
msgstr "你煮熟了一堆曾是绿色的*玩意*，在光线照射下它看上去还是有点发绿……你觉得吃下它们之后你的脸也会变绿。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You have to pause often to stomp on the slower grubs, who only now realized that their home is growing cold."
msgstr "你必须经常停下来踩死那些跑得慢些的虫子，它们现在才意识到它们的家变得越来越冷了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You hit a hard, scarred spot with your tool and reveal a cross-section of chitin with hundreds of stripes, like the rings of a tree"
msgstr "你用你的工具击中了一个坚硬的但伤痕累累的地方，然后露出一个带有数百条条纹的几丁质横截面，就像一棵树的年轮"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You open a stomach, releasing a gush of sweet-smelling gray fluid"
msgstr "你切开了一个胃囊，喷射出一股芳香的灰色液体"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You slip and tear into an acid gland and can't help but pause and watch as the substance inside dissolves a good chunk of flesh before growing inert"
msgstr "你手滑切开了一个酸液腺体，然后忍不住停顿下来，看着里面的物质溶解了一大块肉，最后又安静下来"

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You're glad it didn't break your kitchen utensils.  Now you hope it won't damage your digestive system."
msgstr "你很高兴烹饪它时没有毁掉你的厨房，现在你希望吃掉它后不会毁掉你的胃肠。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You're startled as its antenna whips out and briefly coils around your arm"
msgstr "它的触须突然展开并短暂地缠住了你的手臂，你被吓得不轻"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Your first few cuts only succeed in peeling back the upper, hairy layer of chitin, leaving a glassy green carapace"
msgstr "你最初的几次切割都只成功剥去了上面多毛的几丁质层，留下一个玻璃般的绿色甲壳"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Your knife reaches the retracted stinger and slips on its smooth surface, opening half a dozen venom glands in the process.  You dearly hope that you have not cut yourself"
msgstr "你的刀尖抵达了缩起的毒刺，在它光滑的表面滑动，在这个过程中切开了许多毒腺。你真希望你没有割伤自己"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Your smell ozone and burned hair as you hack the crackling corpse to pieces"
msgstr "当你把噼里啪啦的尸体砍成碎片时，闻到有臭氧和烧焦头发的气味"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Your tool takes on a rainbow sheen from working in the creature's innards, and seems to give off a thin smoke.  You might want to hurry"
msgstr "你的工具因为接触到生物的内脏，呈现出彩虹般的光泽，并似乎散发出一股薄薄的烟雾。感觉速度得快点了"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Your work disturbs the parasites still clinging to the joints of the creature, and a few size you up as a potential new home before scurrying away"
msgstr "你的动作惊扰了那些仍然藏匿在怪物关节内的寄生虫，有几只打量着你能否成为潜在新家，然后匆匆四散窜走"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<full_name>"
#: data/json/snippets/names.json
msgid "<female_full_name>"
msgstr "<female_full_name>"

