#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They depict a bladed weapon with some audio equipment implanted.  Doodles of hair metal rock stars line the page, as well as the words 'LETS, HEAR IT FOR FRANKY'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr "一堆用铅笔做了标记的草图和CAD设计图纸。图纸上描绘了一把带刃武器，内部安装了某种音频设备。图纸上画满了长发金属摇滚明星的涂鸦，还有\"让我们为弗兰基鼓掌喝彩\"的字样。上面用两套不同的笔迹做了批注。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They depict a classic rifle and several diagrams of curved wooden maces.  The word 'OBREZ?' is written clearly on the front sheet.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr "一堆用铅笔做了标记的草图和CAD设计图纸。图纸上描绘了一支老式步枪和几个弯曲的木锤图样。封面上清楚写着\"OBREZ?\"这个词。上面用两套不同的笔迹做了批注。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They depict a large mace with an internal gas reservoir and venting holes between the steel segments.  There are additional diagrams labeled 'IGNITION SYSTEM' and 'TRIGGER?'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr "一堆用铅笔做了标记的草图和CAD设计图纸。图纸上描绘了一根大狼牙棒，内部有储气罐，钢制分段之间有通风孔。上面还画了标记为\"点火系统\"和\"扳机\"的额外图样。上面用两套不同的笔迹做了批注。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They depict a sledgehammer with a moving center.  There is a references doc for a powder actuated nail gun stapled to the sheets.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr "一堆用铅笔做了标记的草图和CAD设计图纸。图纸上描绘了一个重心可变的大锤。一份关于火药驱动的射钉枪的参考论文被夹在了图纸上。上面用两套不同的笔迹做了批注。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "toxic_waste_corpse_disposal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A crumpled and dirty note containing some printed text.  The text contains detailed instructions on how to dispose of \"experiments\" in remote areas."
msgstr "一张皱巴巴、脏兮兮的便条，里面有一些印刷文字。文字中包含有关如何在偏远地区处置\"实验品\"的详细说明。"

