msgid "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>  <zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgstr "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>  <zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "A careless move dislodges some remaining air causing the throat of the undead monster to emit one more choked scream."
msgstr "一个不小心的举动，将一些残留的空气排出，导致不死怪物的喉咙再次发出一声窒息的尖叫。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "A clump of rotten entrails.  The sallow membranes that link these lobes of flesh together are lined with veins and capillaries.  A caul of slime coats them all in a greasy sheen.  You should not put this anywhere near your mouth."
msgstr "一坨腐烂的内脏。这些连接肉块的灰黄色薄膜上布满了血管和毛细血管。一层粘液覆盖在它们表面，闪着油腻的光。你最好不要把这个放到嘴边。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "A fat zombie haunch.  It doesn't look tasty but the shape is undeniably close to a large fried chicken leg.  The skin is even the right texture, though for the wrong reasons."
msgstr "一个肥胖的僵尸腰部。  看起来不怎么好吃，但形状无疑很接近大炸鸡腿。  皮肤的质地甚至是正确的，尽管出于错误的原因。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "A roaming insect attracted by the carcass gets fried after landing on an organ glowing a faint blue, making you decide to avoid it with the utmost care."
msgstr "一只被尸体吸引的漫游昆虫在落在发出淡蓝色光芒的器官后被炸死，让你决定极其小心地避开它。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "A rotted and then shredded arm.  Not much use unless you want to scrape the rancid meat from the bones."
msgstr "一条腐烂然后被撕碎的手臂。  没什么用，除非你想把骨头上的腐臭肉刮掉。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "A rotted skull from a human zombie.  It feels more flexible than it should, like stiff leather, no longer natural bone."
msgstr "人类僵尸腐烂的头骨。  它感觉比应有的更灵活，就像僵硬的皮革，不再是天然的骨头。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Along joints in the limbs and torso you find strange new muscly organs filled with fluid, suggesting this behemoth moved with some form of organic hydraulics."
msgstr "沿着四肢和躯干的关节，你会发现奇怪的新肌肉器官充满液体，这表明这个庞然大物通过某种形式的有机液压装置移动。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "An accidental cut opens a gland that spurts clear fluid across the creature's flesh, which bubbles and smokes as some of the acid undergoes a neutralizing reaction."
msgstr "一次意外的割伤打开了一个腺体，该腺体会在该生物的肉上喷射出透明的液体，当一些酸发生中和反应时，液体会冒泡并冒烟。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "As you cut into its stomach, the insane fragmentary remains of some creature it devoured, which appears to have melded with its own tissues, attempt to claw at your hand before you bludgeon them until they cease moving."
msgstr "你切开它的胃时，其中某种被吞掉的生物的疯狂碎块残骸几乎融入了它的本体，它们试图抓你的手，直到你用力把它们打到老实。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "As you cut through the muscle, it tenses up in reaction."
msgstr "当你切开肌肉时，它会产生紧张的反应。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "As you finish up, you notice your earliest cuts seem to be the tiniest bit smaller."
msgstr "当你完成时，你会发现你最早的切口似乎变小了一点点。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "As you make your first cut into its skin, a pressurized jet of decaying blood almost hits your face."
msgstr "当你第一次切入它的皮肤时，一股加压的腐烂血液几乎喷到了你的脸上。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Despite it not being very evident from the outside, it seems the entire digestive tract of the abomination was bloated with its obscuring smoke."
msgstr "尽管从外面看不太明显，但这个可憎之物的整个消化道似乎都被其模糊的烟雾所膨胀。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Despite the carcass lying still, you still notice churning while investigating its entrails, as if whatever was originally animating this corpse is wrestling with the mycelium fibers to retake control."
msgstr "尽管尸体静静地躺着，但在调查其内脏时，你仍然会注意到翻腾的情况，就好像最初赋予这具尸体生命的东西正在与菌丝体纤维搏斗，以重新获得控制权。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Every cavity in this creature's anatomy is puddled with a foaming mixture of acid and half-dissolved tissue.  It seems it wasn't entirely immune to its own secretions."
msgstr "这种生物身体的每个空腔都充满了酸和半溶解组织的泡沫混合物。  它似乎对自己的分泌物并没有完全免疫。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Fibers of Kevlar-like material spread through the body like a cobweb, originating from a tiny entry wound in the abdomen."
msgstr "类似凯夫拉纤维的材料纤维像蜘蛛网一样遍布全身，源自腹部的微小入口伤口。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Fungal stalks still sway gently despite the lack of movement of the formerly shambling corpse."
msgstr "尽管先前摇摇欲坠的尸体不再动弹，真菌茎仍然轻轻摇晃。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Inside its muzzle you notice strange glands and fibrous growths, almost as if the creature's sense of smell was in the process of being overhauled."
msgstr "在它的口鼻内，你会注意到奇怪的腺体和纤维生长，几乎就像这种生物的嗅觉正在被彻底改造一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Inside the chest is some unfamiliar organ, a hideous amalgam of disparate tissues and veins."
msgstr "胸腔里有一些未知的器官，是由不同的组织和血管恶心拼凑而成的混合体。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Inside the chest is some unfamiliar organ, fatty and wrinkled like brain tissue."
msgstr "胸部里面有一些陌生的器官，脂肪多，皱纹多，就像脑组织一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "It seems most of the creature was grown as some sort of suit looking as if it was piloted by the still normal sized human corpse found in a fetal position in its torso."
msgstr "该生物的大部分似乎都是作为某种套装而生长的，看起来好像是由躯干中以胎儿姿势发现的仍正常大小的人类尸体驾驶的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Its distended lungs seem to be partially lined with a black and sticky mucus membrane."
msgstr "它膨胀的肺部似乎部分覆盖着黑色粘液膜。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Its legs seem to have been reinforced with a strange lattice of skeletal bracing and muscle fibers to support its immense bulk."
msgstr "它的腿似乎被一种奇怪的骨骼支撑和肌肉纤维网格加固，以支撑其巨大的体积。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Its massive diaphragm seems to have been the only correctly sustained muscle of this starved corpse."
msgstr "它巨大的隔膜似乎是这具饥饿尸体唯一正确维持的肌肉。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Its tissue has significant trouble separating from the bone in some spots."
msgstr "它的组织在某些地方很难与骨头分离。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Little tainted meat remains on whatever limb bones these were.  It still bends at the joint but doesn't look to be moving on its own anymore."
msgstr "无论这些肢骨是什么，都几乎没有残留受污染的肉。  它在关节处仍然弯曲，但看起来不再自行移动。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Lodged into the neck area of the creature and grown over you find a corroded tag reading the following \"Max my best friend forever\"."
msgstr "在这个生物的颈部区域，你会发现一个腐蚀的标签，上面写着“麦克斯，我永远最好的朋友”。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Most cavities in its anatomy seem to have been filled with an acidic solution mixed with putrefied fat and pieces of its slowly melting tissues."
msgstr "它体内的大部分空腔似乎都充满了酸性液体，混合着腐烂的脂肪和它慢慢融化的组织碎片。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Opening its jaw wide, you notice the presence of multiple additional tongues deeper it in its throat."
msgstr "张开它的下巴，你会发现它的喉咙深处还有多条额外的舌头。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Organs in the lower abdomen, mainly the kidneys and the reproductive organs, are absent."
msgstr "下腹部的器官，主要是肾脏和生殖器官，缺失。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Portions of the spine and surrounding bones have grown and fused into a single piece, presumably to hold up the creature's bulk - but even then, it still shows signs of strain."
msgstr "脊柱和周围骨骼的部分已经生长并融合成一体，大概是为了支撑该生物的体积——但即便如此，它仍然显示出紧张的迹象。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Pressed against the liver is a swollen gland the size of a golfball, still somewhat functioning, pumping out acrid fluids."
msgstr "压在肝脏上的是一个高尔夫球大小的肿胀腺体，仍然有一定的功能，泵出辛辣的液体。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Putrefied blood bubbles like tar in the places where you managed to remove its skeletal growths."
msgstr "在你设法去除它骨骼生长的地方腐烂的血像焦油一样起泡。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Random cavities in its body make you think it was at least partially feeding on its own tissues to keep functioning."
msgstr "它体内的随机空腔让你认为它至少部分地以自己的组织为食来维持功能。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Removing its bone plates proves more arduous than you would have thought, requiring you to almost put your entire weight on your tool to pry them off."
msgstr "事实证明，拆除其骨板比您想象的要困难得多，需要您几乎将全部重量都放在工具上才能将其撬开。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Separating what is flesh and what is synthetic is difficult, as some parts appear to be between the two."
msgstr "区分肉体和合成物很困难，因为某些部分似乎介于两者之间。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Some organs have atrophied or outright dissolved entirely."
msgstr "有些器官已经萎缩或完全溶解。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Some strands of the bulletproof material snake deep into the body like roots of an invading organism."
msgstr "有些防弹材料像入侵生物的根一样蜿蜒深入人体。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Strong fibers run alongside the muscles in a way that you want to compare to marbling."
msgstr "强韧的纤维沿着肌肉排列，就像大理石花纹一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The black camouflage evaporates off the body where you put your tool through, completely odorless."
msgstr "黑色迷彩会从你放置工具的地方蒸发掉，完全无味。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The body stirs as you open it up, suggesting it's still trying to attack, and reminding you to be cautious."
msgstr "当你打开它时，身体会搅拌，表明它仍在尝试攻击，并提醒你要小心。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The brain has ossified inside this tainted skull.  It doesn't feel noticeably heavier and you surmise that the brain-turned-bone must be deeply porous or hollow itself."
msgstr "大脑已经在这个被污染的头骨内僵化了。  它并没有明显感觉更重，你推测大脑变成的骨头本身一定是有很深的多孔或空心的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The brain stem is swollen and packed with what looks like new growth bulging along the cervical vertebrae."
msgstr "脑干肿胀，看起来像是沿着颈椎鼓起的新生物。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The cavities of this creature are filled with lethargic winged creatures hanging off tubes oozing a greyish milky substance."
msgstr "这种生物的空腔里充满了昏昏欲睡的有翼生物，这些生物挂在管子上，渗出一种灰色的乳状物质。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The corpse is inundated with smaller forms, increasing in complexity and size as you near its central cavity where they wait for their release in neat clusters."
msgstr "尸体上充满了更小的生物，当你靠近它的中央空腔时，它们的复杂性和大小都会增加，它们会整齐地聚集在一起等待释放。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The corpse twitches as you begin.  It didn't feel like rigor mortis."
msgstr "当你开始时，尸体会抽搐。  感觉不像尸僵。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The front part of the brain is completely missing, with spongy, half-formed bone in its place."
msgstr "大脑的前部完全缺失，取而代之的是海绵状、半成形的骨头。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The heart is overtaken by a mass of fistulas and other growths."
msgstr "心脏被大量瘘管和其他赘生物占据。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The heart is overtaken by a mass of fistulas and other growths.  Healthy-looking arteries still spiderweb out of the tumorous mass."
msgstr "心脏被一堆瘘管和其他肿块占据。看起来健康的动脉仍然像蜘蛛网一样从肿瘤团块中堆出来。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The heart makes an odd, swallowing sound on occasion as you work around it."
msgstr "当你在周围工作时，心脏有时会发出奇怪的吞咽声。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The inner contents of the walking dead.  It's hard to tell exactly what kind of tissue this may have once been.  Several structures appear to have molded together."
msgstr "行尸走肉的内部内容。  很难准确判断这可能曾经是哪种组织。  几个结构似乎已经模制在一起。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The inner tissues are a mosaic of somewhat normal flesh and flesh interlaced with fibers of the armor."
msgstr "内部组织是一些正常的肉和与盔甲纤维交织的肉的镶嵌物。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The inside of the torso is stuffed with hair, fingers, and a distorted face, as if the zombie was growing a twin inside of itself."
msgstr "头发、手指和扭曲的脸往躯干内部塞满，就好像丧尸在自己体内孕育了个双胞胎。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The inside of this carcass resembles more an industrial production line than anything vaguely natural."
msgstr "这具尸体的内部更像是一条工业生产线，而不是任何模糊的自然物体。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The intestines have pushed their way up into the thoracic cavity.  Lined with teeth, they stretch up toward the throat like a swarm of eels."
msgstr "肠子已经挤到胸腔里了。它们像是有牙齿，一群鳗鱼一般向喉咙方向伸展。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The layout and segmentation of its bony carapace disturbingly resembles what you want to call plate mail, but it's closer to the armor of an arthropod."
msgstr "它的骨质甲壳的布局和分段令人不安地类似于你所说的板甲，但它更接近节肢动物的盔甲。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The lingering shadows surrounding it make your work quite a lot harder as they seem to deliberately grow more opaque around your tool as if they wished to hide the monster's secrets."
msgstr "它周围挥之不去的阴影使你的工作变得更加困难，因为它们似乎故意在你的工具周围变得更加不透明，就好像他们希望隐藏怪物的秘密一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The lungs of this creature are cavernous, seemingly having been repurposed from their respiratory function to house an impressive volume of air."
msgstr "这种生物的肺部呈海绵状，似乎已经从其呼吸功能中重新调整用途，以容纳大量空气。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The majority of the digestive tract seems to have reshaped into a singular stomach."
msgstr "消化道的大部分似乎已经重塑为一个单一的胃。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The more delicate joints in the body such as the wrists and neck have fused with surrounding tissue."
msgstr "身体上比较脆弱的关节，例如手腕和颈部，已经与周围组织融合。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The overall anatomy of this enormous monstrosity leaves you only to wonder how it possibly could achieve the range of motion you witnessed while it was still standing."
msgstr "这个巨大怪物的整体解剖结构让你不禁想知道它如何能够达到你在站立时所目睹的运动范围。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The overbearing sweet smell of decay emanating from the carcass forces you to take short breaks during your work to not puke."
msgstr "尸体散发出的令人难以忍受的腐烂气味迫使你在工作期间短暂休息以免呕吐。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The putrefied blood that leaks from your incisions is visibly saturated with spores."
msgstr "从你的切口漏出的腐烂的血液明显充满了孢子。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The putrid veins of the creature seem strangely rigid, and you see faint crackles of electricity course across them."
msgstr "这只生物腐烂的血管看起来异常僵硬，你看到微弱的电流沿着它们闪烁。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The rear of this greying zombified dog shows strange reinforcements, as if a previous pathology was being remediated."
msgstr "这只灰白的僵尸狗的背部显示出奇怪的强化物，就好像之前的病症正在得到治愈。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The ropey muscles are still unbelievably tense along the corpse's back, your own back aches just looking at them."
msgstr "尸体背上的绳状肌肉仍然紧张得令人难以置信，光是看着它们就让你的背部疼痛。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The sheer pungent acrid odor of the carcass makes you temporarily recoil and reconsider the safety of delving into its entrails."
msgstr "尸体的刺鼻刺鼻气味让你暂时退缩并重新考虑深入其内脏的安全性。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The sheer pungent acrid odor of the corpse makes you temporarily recoil and reconsider the safety of delving into its entrails."
msgstr "尸体的刺鼻刺鼻气味让你暂时退缩并重新考虑深入其内脏的安全性。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The sheer remaining tension in each of the muscles of its arms and shoulders makes them unwind with a sonorous thwang each time you cut one off the supporting bones."
msgstr "每当你从支撑骨头上砍下一根时，它的手臂和肩膀的每一块肌肉中剩余的绝对张力都会使它们随着一声响亮的声音而放松。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The sheer scale of the carcass leaves you only with a luxury of choice on where to start your work."
msgstr "尸体的巨大规模让您只能选择从哪里开始工作。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The skin is loose on the muscle in some places and melded with it in others."
msgstr "肌肉上的某些地方的皮肤松弛，而另一些地方则与肌肉融合。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The slack jaws and starved body of this creature make you think that it would have struggled to seriously harm anything on its own."
msgstr "这种生物松弛的下巴和饥饿的身体让你觉得它很难独自严重伤害任何东西。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The sputters of acid on your gear you earned by digging into this corpse could maybe warrant the use of some water to douse."
msgstr "通过挖掘这具尸体而获得的装备上溅出的酸液可能需要一些水来浇灭。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The stained skull of a former human.  Whatever turned their flesh to walking in death, it left its mark on their bones."
msgstr "前人类的染色头骨。  无论是什么让他们的肉体在死亡中行走，都会在他们的骨头上留下痕迹。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The stained skull of what was once a human being.  It is rotted and noticeably warped from its living form."
msgstr "曾经是人类的被染色的头骨。  它已经腐烂，并且与它的生命形式明显扭曲。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The stench coming off of this corpse is immediately reminiscent of vomit."
msgstr "这具尸体散发出的恶臭立即让人想起呕吐物。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The teeth of this lopsided human skull have melded together like hot wax and joined with the maxilla.  The eye sockets are drooping and canted to the side as if shaped while soft.  Most of the suture joints of the cranium are fused over with thick lines of growth as if soldered together with bone."
msgstr "这个不平衡的人类头骨的牙齿像热蜡一样融合在一起，并与上颌骨相连。  眼窝下垂并向一侧倾斜，仿佛形状柔软。  颅骨的大部分缝线都与粗的生长线融合在一起，就像与骨头焊接在一起一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The thing has extra teeth leading all the way down into the stomach."
msgstr "这个东西有多余的牙齿，一直通到胃里。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The thing's feet are entirely calloused and the smaller toes are completely vestigal, simply a bump with a dead nail on them."
msgstr "这个东西的脚完全长满了老茧，较小的脚趾也完全退化了，只是一个肿块，上面有一个死指甲。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The thing's innards churn slightly even as you dig through them."
msgstr "即使当你挖掘它时，它的内部也会轻微搅拌。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a human being."
msgstr "这东西的内脏更像是一个巨大的肿瘤，而不是人类的身体。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a living being."
msgstr "这东西的内脏更像是一个巨大的肿瘤，而不是一个生物的身体。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The tissue is rotting before your eyes, muscle turning to jelly and fat to a clear, reeking slime.  It's as if time is catching up with the cadaver now that it's no longer animated."
msgstr "组织在你眼前腐烂，肌肉变成果冻，脂肪变成透明的、散发着恶臭的粘液。  时间仿佛赶上了尸体，因为它不再有活力。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The tissue is rotting before your eyes, muscle turning to jelly and fat to a clear, reeking slime.  It's as if time is catching up with the carcass now that it's no longer animated."
msgstr "组织在你眼前腐烂，肌肉变成果冻，脂肪变成透明的、散发着恶臭的粘液。  就好像时间正在赶上尸体，因为它不再有活力。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The tremendous growth of its upper body's muscle mass must have rendered the creature almost incapable of efficiently surveying its surroundings."
msgstr "它上半身肌肉质量的巨大增长一定使得这种生物几乎无法有效地观察周围的环境。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The vestibular organs seem to be nonfunctional, but your question of how the creature balances itself is answered by an odd mass in the center of the brain, that you liken to a gyroscope."
msgstr "前庭器官似乎没有功能，但你关于生物如何平衡自身的问题可以通过大脑中心的一个奇怪的质量来回答，你将其比作陀螺仪。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "There are bundles of nerves snaking all throughout the tissues, still channeling small amounts of electricity."
msgstr "组织中遍布着蜿蜒的神经束，仍然在传导少量的电流。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "These plates are almost impossible to remove until you realize they are linked to the internal skeleton with calcified pillars you must break before removing its armor."
msgstr "这些板几乎不可能被移除，除非你意识到它们与内部骨骼相连，并有钙化的柱子，你必须在移除其装甲之前将其打破。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "This corpse seems completely ordinary now, and dissection brings you no further to asserting what gave the creature its peculiar properties."
msgstr "这具尸体现在看起来完全是普通的，解剖无法让你进一步断言是什么赋予了这个生物独特的属性。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "This jaundiced zombie's arm still bears a full sleeve tattoo.  Quality work from what you can tell through all the rot."
msgstr "这个黄疸僵尸的手臂上仍然有一个完整的袖子纹身。  从所有的腐烂中你可以看出高质量的工作。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "This looks like a stomach and length of intestine, if they were made of lung tissue.  Every now and then you notice it expanding or contracting slightly.  It looks dangerous to eat, maybe even to handle."
msgstr "如果它们是由肺组织组成的话，它看起来就像胃和一段肠子。  你时不时会注意到它轻微地扩张或收缩。  吃它看起来很危险，甚至处理起来也很危险。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "This one's armor falls off surprisingly easily, almost as if whatever puppets it wishes for it to lose the extra weight."
msgstr "这个人的盔甲出奇地容易脱落，几乎就像它希望它失去额外重量的木偶一样。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "This person had an artificial hip, but it's completely overgrown with bone now."
msgstr "这个人有一个人造髋关节，但现在已经长满了骨头。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "This person has undergone a horrific mutation.  Their stomach has ballooned outward to fill almost their entire thoracic cavity, crushing the lungs against the ribs.  Even now, the lining oozes a thin, greasy film of acid."
msgstr "此人发生了可怕的变异。  他们的胃向外膨胀，几乎填满了整个胸腔，将肺部压在肋骨上。  即使现在，内壁仍渗出一层薄薄的、油腻的酸膜。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "This pitted human skull is filled with teeth, few of them where they should be.  You can see them growing in the hollows that have developed, their roots grown long and winding, more like those of a tree."
msgstr "这个坑坑洼洼的人类头骨里长满了牙齿，但它们本该在的地方却很少。  你可以看到它们生长在已经形成的空洞中，它们的根长得又长又蜿蜒，更像是一棵树的根。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "To your \"delight,\" you find a tapeworm in its gut, turgid but seemingly dead."
msgstr "让你“高兴”的是，你在它的肠道里发现了一条绦虫，肿胀但似乎已经死了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Uncomfortable static forces you to ground yourself multiple times during your work."
msgstr "令人不舒服的静电迫使您在工作期间多次接地。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Under the skin, crushing against the ribcage, you find a thick growth of flesh and Kevlar formed from a mutated diaphragm."
msgstr "在皮肤下，挤压胸腔，你会发现厚厚的肉和由突变的隔膜形成的凯夫拉尔纤维。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Under the stomach you notice a wrinkled fruit that you can't help but think somewhat appetizing despite where you found it."
msgstr "你注意到胃下面有一个皱巴巴的水果，不管你在哪里找到它，你都会情不自禁地觉得它有点开胃。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Upon closer examination, some of the Kevlar isn't Kevlar - its off color and composition suggest it's the creature's flesh reformed to imitate it."
msgstr "经过仔细检查，一些凯夫拉纤维并不是凯夫拉纤维——它的颜色和成分表明它是该生物的肉体经过改造以模仿它的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "While its individual fingers appear to be losing their dexterity, the zombie's flexor muscles are tense and swollen."
msgstr "虽然它的各个手指似乎正在失去灵活性，但僵尸的屈肌却紧张且肿胀。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "While some parts of the brain have turned to mush, others appear healthy and pink."
msgstr "虽然大脑某些部分已变成糨糊，但其他部分看还很健康，粉嫩嫩的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "While some parts of the brain have turned to mush, others appear pink and almost healthy."
msgstr "虽然大脑某些部分已变成糨糊，但其他部分几乎还是很健康的粉红色。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "While you are cutting into it, the creature suddenly moves and grabs one of your limbs.  Despite considerable effort, you are unable to pry open the creature's iron grip and resign yourself to chop off the hand instead."
msgstr "当你切入它时，该生物突然移动并抓住你的四肢。  尽管付出了巨大的努力，你还是无法撬开该生物的铁握，只能砍掉它的手。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You are almost certain that its flesh should not be able to contain such a virulently aggressive liquid, yet, it does."
msgstr "你几乎可以肯定它的肉不应该含有如此剧毒的侵蚀性液体，但它确实含有。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You are almost certain this zombie was pregnant before its undeath, the fetus within the womb having been twisted into the abomination it was carrying."
msgstr "你几乎可以肯定，这只僵尸在死亡之前已经怀孕了，子宫内的胎儿已经被扭曲成它所携带的可憎之物。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You begin your dissection - though, vivisection would be more appropriate, as you find the corpse not as still as you once thought."
msgstr "你开始解剖——不过，活体解剖会更合适，因为你发现尸体并不像你想象的那么静止。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You cut into its abdomen, and discover its utter lack of internal organs, the expected cavity replaced by nothing but more flesh and muscle."
msgstr "你切开它的腹部，发现它完全没有内脏，预期的空腔被更多的肉和肌肉所取代。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You cut into the arms of the creature and realize that instead of what you would expect from what you know of normal human anatomy, its muscles wind around the bones in what looks like a tight spring."
msgstr "你切入该生物的手臂，发现它的肌肉与你所了解的正常人体解剖结构不同，它的肌肉像绷紧的弹簧一样缠绕在骨头上。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You cut off some scraps of the uniform that were still adhered to the body, finding tendrils of flesh anchored into them."
msgstr "你切掉了一些仍然粘在尸体上的制服碎片，发现里面有肉的卷须。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You find several unfinished creatures inside the main cavity, you have a vague feeling something greater discarded them, founding them wanting."
msgstr "你在主洞里发现了几个未完成的生物，你隐约感觉到有什么更大的东西抛弃了它们，发现它们还不够。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You find that shoulder and upper arm bones are supported by smaller, similar bone growths."
msgstr "您会发现肩骨和上臂骨由较小且相似的骨骼生长支撑。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You have to step back as a gland you inadvertently cut into seems to perform a neutralization reaction between its contents and the rest of its fluids."
msgstr "你必须后退一步，因为你无意中切入的腺体似乎在其内容物和其余液体之间进行了中和反应。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You make one incision and the resulting cloud of black smoke forces you to take a short break as it becomes impossible to see anything."
msgstr "你做了一个切口，由此产生的黑烟迫使你短暂休息，因为你看不到任何东西。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You notice cysts in its fur, you cut into them and alternatively find acrid fluids, flakes of bone or twitching strands of muscle."
msgstr "你会注意到它的皮毛上有囊肿，你把它们切开，或者发现辛辣的液体、骨头碎片或抽搐的肌肉。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You realize the muscles of the zombie's arms are hollow, their marrow replaced by a thick reddish liquid.  You wonder if the ridiculous muscle mass surrounding them is the other half of a strange hydraulic system."
msgstr "你意识到丧尸手臂的肌肉是空的，骨髓被一种浓稠的红色液体取代。你怀疑这些裹住骨髓的荒谬的肌肉，是不是充当某种奇特的液压系统的另一半。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You spot a few flies and maggots in the corpse, their chosen carcass not seeming to be very good for them, as most seem moribund."
msgstr "你在尸体里发现了一些苍蝇和蛆虫，它们选择的尸体似乎对它们来说不太好，因为大多数看起来都快要死了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You spot a few flies and maggots in the corpse.  Most are dead, but a few seem to be able to handle eating zombie flesh."
msgstr "你看到尸体上有几只苍蝇和蛆虫。大多数都死了，但似乎还有几只还吃着丧尸的肉。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You spot a few pores still weakly sputtering thin puffs of black smoke, investigating them further reveals glands full of fuming black liquid linked to the pores with long tubes."
msgstr "你发现一些毛孔仍在微弱地喷射出细细的黑烟，进一步研究它们会发现充满发烟黑色液体的腺体通过长管与毛孔相连。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You think this decaying severed limb ends in a foot.  It's actually hard to tell after the hell it's been through."
msgstr "你认为这个腐烂的断肢的末端是一只脚。  事实上，在经历了地狱般的事情之后，很难说清楚。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "You try pulling out some teeth to better analyze them, only to find they've fused with the jawbone."
msgstr "您尝试拔出一些牙齿以更好地分析它们，却发现它们已经与颌骨融合。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Your search for the source of the creature's size has you discover a cluster of glandular organs deep in the body, most of which you are unable to identify."
msgstr "在寻找该生物体型来源的过程中，你发现了身体深处的一组腺体器官，其中大部分你无法识别。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Zombie guts.  Your appetite may have been spoiled by one look at the twisted, compacted tubes and sacs that form this clump of foul entrails.  Why then does it make you think of frozen spaghetti and meatballs?"
msgstr "僵尸胆量。  一看这些形成这团肮脏内脏的扭曲、压实的管子和囊，你的胃口可能会被破坏。  那么为什么它会让你想到冷冻意大利面和肉丸呢？"

#. ~ Foot steps of species "INSECT_FLYING"
#: data/json/species.json
msgid "BZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"
msgstr "嗡~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"

#. ~ Foot steps of species "ROBOT_FLYING"
#: data/json/species.json
msgid "WHIRR"
