#. ~ Description of mission "Life vow"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Live your life to the fullest, prove to yourself that you can survive this new obstacle in the same way that you have survived the last."
msgstr "充实地度过你的一生，证明你自己，你可以像上次一样，面对这个新障碍仍然能活下去。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Make the cops pay"
msgstr "让警察偿债"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Master hand-to-hand combat"
msgstr "战斗杂技大师"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Prepare for your next show"
msgstr "为你的下场演出做好准备"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Protect your canine friends"
msgstr "保护你的狗狗"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Ready or Not"
msgstr "准备好了吗"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Refuel your helicopter."
msgstr "再次加油"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Return to base"
msgstr "回到基地"

#. ~ Description of mission "Survive your pursuer"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you relentlessly.  You can fight it but never truly kill it.  It won't end until you die."
msgstr "自从大灾变开始以来，有只怪物一直在永不停歇地追杀着你。你可以跑得比它快，但永远无法真正逃离它。只有你们中死一个，这一切才会结束。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your pursuer"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you relentlessly.  You can outrun it but never truly escape it.  It won't end until one of you dies."
msgstr "自从大灾变开始以来，有只怪物一直在永不停歇地追杀着你。你可以跑得比它快，但永远无法真正逃离它。只有你们中死一个，这一切才会结束。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Social butterfly"
msgstr "交际花"

#. ~ Description of mission "Ready or Not"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Survive all day from the crazy inhabitants of the mansion."
msgstr "在别墅豪宅里的疯狂居民的手底下活过一整天。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Survive your pursuer"
msgstr "杀死追着你的怪物"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_fancy_rapier" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Finish your mission"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The Aristocrat"
msgstr "昔日贵族"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_soldier" placed on map update on start of
#. mission "Finish your mission"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The Collaborator"
msgstr "卖国贼"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_labsecurity_9mm" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Finish your mission"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The Guard"
msgstr "守卫"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_maid_broom" placed on map update on start
#. of mission "Finish your mission"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The Servant"
msgstr "仆人"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_scientist_scalpel" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Finish your mission"
#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_zombie_prisoner_brute" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill your mark"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The Target"
msgstr "任务目标"

#. ~ Description of mission "Hunt big game"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The end of the world could have arrived, but you still crave for that one big hunt.  Search and kill a black bear to remember the old days."
msgstr "世界末日可能已经到来，但你仍然渴望来场狩猎大赛。找到并杀死一头黑熊，作为对过去的纪念。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Become the protagonist"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The world has become like an anime!  Zombies, mutants, the end of civilization as we know it…  You must become the protagonist if you want to survive, the plot armor will help you.  Go and kill 50 zombies to show your protagonist potential."
msgstr "这个世界变得像是一部动漫！丧尸，变异人，我们所知文明的终结……如果你想活下去，你必须成为主角，主角光环会帮你。去杀死50只丧尸，证明你有成为主角的潜力。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a real katana"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The world has ended, but as an authentic samurai you lack a katana, you must find one, quickly."
msgstr "世界已经终结，但要成为一名真正的武士，你还缺少一把武士刀，你必须尽快找到它。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Make the cops pay"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "They wanted to put you behind bars, but are now dead, make them pay with blood, unliving blood."
msgstr "他们想把你关进监狱，但现在全都死了，让他们用血、不死之血来偿债。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a new rifle"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "When you were escaping an evacuation point that was overrun, you had to leave your rifle behind.  Shame on you, what's a hunter without their hunting rifle?  You have to find one immediately."
msgstr "当你逃离一个被占领的疏散点时，你不得不丢下你的步枪。 你应该以此为耻，没有狩猎步枪的猎人算什么猎人？ 你必须马上找到一把。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find some skates"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "You are a skater at heart, and as such you need some skates to drive by, any kind will suffice."
msgstr "你内心深处总想滑冰，因此你需要一双能滑行的滑冰鞋，任何种类都可以。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Master hand-to-hand combat"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "You could have become a master in martial arts if you had the chance, so train until you achieve the level of a master in the old world."
msgstr "如果有机会的话，你本可以成为一名武术大师，所以要不断训练，直到达到往日世界大师的水平，并为自己找一条漂亮的黑带来纪念这一时刻。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Free yourself from your bionic failures"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "You currently have some bionics malfunctioning.  Remove them and avoid any more faulty bionics in your body."
msgstr "你现在体内有一些故障的生化插件。移除它们，避免在你体内再出现任何故障的生化插件。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Social butterfly"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "You have always had good social abilities.  Go and recruit 2 followers and establish your leadership among them.  Don't forget to order them to build a base of operations for you in the form of a survivor camp."
msgstr "你的社交能力一直都很强。去招募两名同伴，并在他们之中确立你的领导地位。别忘了命令他们以建设营地的形式为你建个作战基地。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Protect your canine friends"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "You have saved your dogs from the fall of the world, but they could still suffer from danger everywhere.  Police dogs used some Kevlar harnesses for protection…  Maybe your friends could use some too?"
msgstr "你救下了你的狗，使它们免于世界的沦陷，但它们仍然可能随时遭遇危险。听说警犬使用了某种凯夫拉犬具来当作防护……也许你的朋友也可以用？"

#. ~ Description of mission "Dress with style"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "You need to always dress in style and fashion.  Find a gown or tuxedo for your personal use."
msgstr "你总是需要一套时髦的时装。找一套适合你个人使用的礼服或燕尾服。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refuel your helicopter."
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "You were flying towards a nearby private airport before your forced landing.  You could still reach it by ground, and scavenge it for fuel."
msgstr "在你迫降前，你正朝着附近的一处私人机场飞去。你仍然可以在地面上找到它，在那里搜寻燃料。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Deliver Your Cargo"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "You're not sure who orders takeout when the world's ending, but that doesn't matter.  You have one final order to deliver.  The network is down, but you still have the address."
msgstr "你不知道谁会在世界末日的时候叫外卖，但这并不重要。疏散令同样也不重要。其实，再也没什么称得上是重要的了，除了安全地将你的珍贵货物送到目的地：某处偏僻的豪宅。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Go to the refueling stop"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Your bird is now on the ground, never again able to fly, you could search for a new one in the closest refueling stop requisitioned by the military."
msgstr "你的\"鸟\"现在停在地上，再也不能飞了，你可以在军队征用的最近的加油站找一个新的。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your mark"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Your employer could be no longer responding but you have decided to finish your mission.  Hunt down and kill your mark."
msgstr "你的雇主可能已经失去了联系，但你早已决心完成任务。追捕并杀死你的目标。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Return to base"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Your helicopter was crashed to the ground, communications were lost with ground base, and the rest of your team died while landing, at least you still know the way back to the base."
msgstr "你的直升机坠毁，与地面基地失去了联系，你的团队其他成员在降落时死亡，但至少你还知道回到基地的路。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Finish your mission"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Your mission required you to eliminate a certain high-ranking individual in hiding.  Your mark seems to have turned feral while escaping and the world appears to be ending, but not even that can stop you from finishing your mission."
msgstr "你的任务需要你击杀某个正在躲藏的高层人士。你的目标似乎在逃跑时已经疯了，而整个世界也似乎面临末日，但即便如此这也无法打消你完成任务的决心。"

