#. ~ Description of UI widget "zenfs_thick_sidebar"
#: data/json/ui/zenfs/sidebar-thick.json
msgid ""
"Meter-based sidebar for wide displays.\n"
"\n"
"Includes support for the following mods: <color_light_green>Magiclysm</color>, <color_light_green>Mind over Matter</color>, <color_light_green>Sky Island</color>, and <color_light_green>Xedra Evolved</color>.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_gray>* * * * Recommendations * * * *<color_dark_gray>\n"
"Draw Sidebar Spacers: <color_cyan>False<color_dark_gray>\n"
"Font Blending: <color_cyan>True<color_dark_gray>\n"
"Font Width/Height/Size: <color_cyan>\n"
"10/16/15<color_dark_gray>, <color_cyan>15/24/22<color_dark_gray>, or <color_cyan>20/32/29<color_dark_gray>\n"
"\n"
"Font: <color_cyan>DejaVuSansMono.ttf</color>"
