#. ~ Description of vehicle part "bike rack"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/cargo.json
msgid "A collection of pipes and frames for supporting a bike or other small vehicle and carrying it on your vehicle.  Move a single tile wide vehicle so that all of that vehicle's tiles are next to bike racks, and then 'e'xamine any bike rack to mount that vehicle onto the bike rack.  'e'xamine the bike rack to unmount the carried vehicle."
msgstr "一套由各式钢管、凸轮和带子组成的装置，安装在载具边缘，可托起并运输一辆摩托车。将待装载的单格宽的载具停放于摩托车托架旁，按\"e\"查看任意一处摩托车托架可装载载具。再次按\"e\"查看摩托车托架，可卸下所装载的载具。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "nose plate"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/cargo.json
msgid "An L-shaped aluminum plate with straps and skid runners.  This could help you move furniture or appliances more safely, but Jevons' Paradox also applies to throwing your back out."
msgstr "一块带有带子和滑行导轨的 L 形铝板。这可以帮助您更安全地搬动家具或电器，但也有腰部受伤的风险（杰文斯悖论）。"

