#. ~ Description of "pistol ammo, ball"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol.json
msgid "Modern ubiquitous medium pistol ammo, popularized by usage in two wars and almost a century of post-war defensive and duty usage.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr "近现代四处可见的中型手枪弹药，在两次世界大战和战后长达一个世纪的防御和执勤行动中得到广泛使用。全金属被甲弹在早期又被称为球形弹，与普通铅弹相比，它能减少残垢，提高枪械可靠性，并略微提高穿透力。"

#. ~ Description of "pistol ammo, JHP"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol.json
msgid "Modern ubiquitous medium pistol ammo, popularized by usage in two wars and almost a century of post-war defensive and duty usage.  Jacketed Hollow Points are defensive/duty projectiles that are more destructive to tissue than plain ball ammunition, and slightly reduce overpenetration concerns."
msgstr "近现代四处可见的中型手枪弹药，在两次世界大战和战后长达一个世纪的防御和执勤行动中得到广泛使用。空尖弹是一种防御/执勤用弹，比普通被甲弹对软组织的破坏性更大，并且稍微降低了对弹药过穿的担忧。"

