#. ~ Description of "rifle ammo, ball"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
msgid "Modern rifle ammunition, ubiquitous and affordable.  It's suitable for international conflicts, hunting small to large game, home defense, and these days, zombies.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr "现代步枪弹药，十分常见，价格实惠。它被广泛用于各类国际冲突，狩猎大小猎物，家庭防卫，而现在，对付丧尸。全金属被甲弹在早期又被称为球形弹，与普通铅弹相比，它能减少残垢，提高枪械可靠性，并略微提高穿透力。"

#. ~ Description of "rifle ammo, AP"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
msgid "Modern rifle ammunition, ubiquitous and affordable.  It's suitable for international conflicts, hunting small to large game, home defense, and these days, zombies.  This 'armor piercing' variant features a mild steel penetrator for environmental friendliness, improved barrier penetration, and enhanced effect on armor."
msgstr "现代步枪弹药，十分常见，价格实惠。它被广泛用于各类国际冲突，狩猎大小猎物，家庭防卫，而现在，对付丧尸。这个\"穿甲\"型号采用了软钢钢芯作为穿甲部件，十分环保，提高了穿透障碍物能力，以及增强了穿甲后效。"

#. ~ Description of "railgun rifle ammo"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
