#. ~ Description of gun "antique musket"
#. ~ Description of "antique musket"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/black_powder.json
msgid "An antique design, this smoothbore long arm would look more at home on a pre-1850's battlefield than in your hands in the cataclysm.  Its loading may be slow, but it does not require brass casings to fire, and is theoretically sustainable to fire.  Range and accuracy are hampered by lack of rifling, but this time-tested design is plenty lethal."
msgstr "这把火枪采用了十分古老的设计，它长长的滑膛枪管更适合被用在1850年以前的战场上，而不是在你的手中。虽然它的装填速度可能很慢，但它射击时不需要黄铜外壳的弹药，理论上可以持续射击。射程和精度因缺乏膛线而有所限制，但这种经过时间考验的设计仍旧致命。"

#. ~ Description of gun "antique pistol"
#. ~ Description of "antique pistol"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/black_powder.json
msgid "This antiquated single shot pistol would complete a pirate's outfit nicely.  While its loading may be slow, it does not require brass casings to fire, and is theoretically sustainable.  Range and accuracy are hampered by lack of rifling, but this old design is still plenty lethal."
msgstr "这把古董单发手枪能很好地当作一份海盗的行头。虽然它的装填速度可能很慢，但它射击时不需要黄铜弹壳的弹药，理论上可以持续射击。射程和精度因缺乏膛线而有所限制，但这种老式设计仍然具有很大的杀伤力。"

#. ~ Description of gun "antique revolver"
#. ~ Description of "antique revolver"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/black_powder.json
msgid "This is an old revolver designed during the period of westward expansion.  Black powder paper cartridges must be loaded for each shot, which is a fairly lengthy process.  Despite its age, this type of weapon would perform adequately against most two-legged threats."
msgstr "这是一把于美国西扩时期设计的古董左轮手枪。每次发射都必须装入包着黑色粉末火药的纸卷弹，耗时相当长。尽管年代久远，这种武器仍能有效对抗大多数长着两条腿的威胁。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/black_powder.json
msgid "antique musket"
