#. ~ Description of "standard rifle magazine"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/magazines/rifle.json
msgid "A 30 round standard capacity magazine for service rifles, cheaper than the cost of a meal due to its adoption by nearly every other common rifle.  They're made of aluminum and were originally meant to be disposable, so they're not the most durable; don't let them get damaged."
msgstr "一个30发标准容量的军用步枪弹匣，由于几乎所有普通步枪都采用这种弹匣，因此价格比一顿饭还要便宜。它们是由铝制成的，最初设计为一次性使用，所以不是非常耐用，不要让它们受损。"

#. ~ Description of magazine "railgun rifle magazine"
#. ~ Description of "railgun rifle magazine"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/magazines/rifle.json
msgid "A railgun rifle magazine which can hold up to 20 ferromagnetic projectiles."
