msgid "A shotshell 'speedloader', a long plastic tube with a prominent plastic follower.  You can feed 6 shotshells into an appropriately modified shotgun by pushing the follower against the shotgun's loading port.  Bulky, but sees use in competition occasionally."
msgstr "一个霰弹\"快速装弹器\"，一根带有突出的塑料随动件的长塑料管。你可以通过将随动件推到霰弹枪的装弹口上，将6颗霰弹一次性送入经过正确改造的霰弹枪之中。十分笨重，但偶尔也在竞赛中使用。"

#. ~ Description of magazine "shotgun box magazine"
#. ~ Description of "shotgun box magazine"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/magazines/shot.json
