#. ~ Description of "left peg leg"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/legs_prosthetics.json
msgid "A prosthetic leg, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  A primitive peg leg, often remembered for pirate movies and such, this was a go-to replacement for decades for those who couldn't afford an iron or steel one.  This comes up above the knee and is fastened on with straps or rope, with the interior cushioned by stuffing.  This one is for the left leg."
msgstr "一条用于替代缺失肢体的义肢腿。原始的木制假肢常常在海盗电影等中被提及，对于那些买不起铁制或钢制假肢的人来说，这是几十年来常用的替代品。它延伸至膝盖以上，并通过带子或绳索固定，内部填充物提供缓冲。这条是用于左腿的。"

#. ~ Description of "right peg leg"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/legs_prosthetics.json
msgid "A prosthetic leg, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  A primitive peg leg, often remembered for pirate movies and such, this was a go-to replacement for decades for those who couldn't afford an iron or steel one.  This comes up above the knee and is fastened on with straps or rope, with the interior cushioned by stuffing.  This one is for the right leg."
msgstr "一条用于替代缺失肢体的义肢腿。原始的木制假肢常常在海盗电影等中被提及，对于那些买不起铁制或钢制假肢的人来说，这是几十年来常用的替代品。它延伸至膝盖以上，并通过带子或绳索固定，内部填充物提供缓冲。这条是用于右腿的。"

#. ~ Description of "steel prosthetic left leg"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/legs_prosthetics.json
msgid "A prosthetic leg, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  Dating back to the Middle Ages and the Renaissance, this prosthetic is made of iron placed over a framework, and is attached with leather straps to the leg, padding placed inside for comfort.  Made in a better fashion than more common prosthetics at the time, this limb is incredibly durable, with many noble warriors wearing these into battle.  However, they were incredibly expensive, time-consuming to make, and quite heavy, leaving them out of the hands of poorer individuals.  This one is for the left leg."
msgstr "一条用于替代缺失肢体的义肢腿。这种假肢可以追溯到中世纪和文艺复兴时期，它是由覆盖在框架上的铁制成的，并用皮带固定于腿上，内部填充物提供舒适感。与当时更常见的假肢相比，这种假肢的制作工艺更为精良，极其耐用，许多贵族战士在战斗中都佩戴着它。然而，它们价格昂贵，制作费时，且相当沉重，穷人可没法用这种东西。这条是用于左腿的。"

