#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_eocs/limb_changing_eocs.json
msgid "<insect_eye_2_success>"
msgstr "<insect_eye_2_success>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_2_success>"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PRE_EYES_INSECT"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_eocs/limb_changing_eocs.json data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "<insect_eye_success>"
msgstr "<insect_eye_success>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "<insect_dream>"
msgstr "<昆虫梦>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_blind>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "A sudden sharp pain in your eyes, then you are lost in the darkness."
msgstr "你的眼睛突然剧痛，然后你迷失在黑暗中。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_success>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"After another day of dazed mundanity you make your way back home to your dingy cellar apartment, but miss a step and fall down the stairs, landing on your face with a wet thud.  Consciousness fades, but the pain stays.  The pain, and the feeling of myriad cockroach legs running on your skin, coating your wounds in a skittering, biting cloak.\n"
"\n"
"You wake, shedding the weird apey memories, and you are stunned by a dizzying cavalcade of colors you could never have imagined before.  This is a step in the right direction, you decide, regarding your newly-expanded perspective with appreciation before the vertigo takes you."
msgstr ""
"经过一天茫然的世俗生活后，你回到肮脏的地窖公寓，却没踩到一步，从楼梯上摔了下来，脸上摔在地上，发出湿漉漉的重击声。  意识逐渐消失，但疼痛依然存在。  疼痛，以及无数蟑螂腿在你的皮肤上奔跑的感觉，将你的伤口包裹成一件掠过的、咬人的斗篷。\n"
"\n"
"你醒来，摆脱了奇怪的记忆，你被一系列你以前从未想象过的令人眼花缭乱的颜色震惊了。  您决定，这是朝着正确方向迈出的一步，在眩晕之前，您会欣赏新扩展的视角。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Getting the bodybag was harder than you would have thought, and ordinary garbage bags would just not do.  You eat your fill for the last time with this mouth, undress (you won't need clothes after the change), and climb in the bag.  Closing the zipper from the inside is a challenge, but you need complete darkness for what comes now.  You wait.\n"
"And wait.\n"
"And wait.\n"
"\n"
"Could you have been wrong?  You were so sure the time was right.\n"
"You need to get out of here, but you can't move your…anything.  Do you even have anything to move?"
msgstr ""
"拿到尸袋比你想象的要难，普通的垃圾袋根本就不行。  你用这张嘴最后一次吃饱，脱掉衣服（换完衣服就不需要衣服了），爬进包里。  从内部拉上拉链是一项挑战，但您需要完全黑暗才能应对现在的情况。  你等着吧。\n"
"等待。\n"
"等待。\n"
"\n"
"你会不会错了？  你非常确定时机是对的。\n"
"你需要离开这里，但你无法移动你的……任何东西。  你还有什么要搬的吗？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "More of the <color_yellow> good nectar</color>.  That's what you need."
msgstr "更多<color_yellow>优质花蜜</color>。  这就是你所需要的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_blind>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "Something snaps behind your eyes, and the world turns black."
msgstr "你的眼前有什么东西突然断裂，世界变成了黑色。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_glare>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "The lights grow uncomfortably bright."
msgstr "灯光变得亮得令人不舒服。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_stun>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "The world starts turning wildly, and you stumble."
msgstr "世界开始疯狂转动，你跌倒了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You and your sisters have worked diligently, made your home safe and prosperous.  You felt so proud.  But lately Mother has been growing slower, and more cells are empty than with brood.  You see hesitation on your sisters as well…does the hive need you to step up?  Would they follow?  Could you defeat Her?"
msgstr "你和你的姐妹们辛勤工作，使你们的家园安定繁荣。  你感到非常自豪。  但最近，母亲的生长速度越来越慢，空的细胞比育雏的细胞还要多。  你也看到了你姐妹们的犹豫……蜂巢需要你站出来吗？  他们会跟随吗？  你能打败她吗？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You can't be expected to metamorphose with so little.  You need more."
msgstr "你不能指望用这么少的东西就可以变形。  你需要更多。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You could build a hive, if only you were better.  What are you missing?"
msgstr "如果你更优秀的话，你可以建造一个蜂巢。  你还缺少什么？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You dream of a dark, damp place permeated by the smell of sawdust.  You feel like this is all you've ever known, each bend in the walls and scratch on the floor your handiwork.  It feels like home, but deep down you know that you'll have to change and emerge into the dangerous, light-battered outside."
msgstr "你梦见一个黑暗、潮湿、充满木屑气味的地方。  你感觉这就是你所知道的一切，墙壁上的每一个弯曲和地板上的划痕都是你的杰作。  这里感觉像家，但内心深处你知道你必须改变并进入危险的、饱经风霜的外面。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_2_success>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a throbbing headache, and the feeling of an imminent molt.  You find a suitable recess, freeze in place and **push**, trying to rip your old exoskeleton up with you pressure of your new armor but nothing happens.  All the pressure seems to well up into your head, and finally you feel a wet snap and a shower of too-warm mammal ichor on your feelers.\n"
"\n"
"You wake up in a puddle of your own blood under your head, a puddle you can see despite looking straight up.  It will be some time before your eyes' crystals harden properly, but already the colors are even richer than they were before, and the world seems somehow sluggish."
msgstr ""
"你梦见一阵阵的头痛，以及即将蜕皮的感觉。  你找到一个合适的凹处，冻结在适当的位置并**推动**，试图用新装甲的压力撕裂你的旧外骨骼，但什么也没有发生。  所有的压力似乎都涌入你的头部，最后你感到湿漉漉的，触角上有一阵过热的哺乳动物脓液。\n"
"\n"
"你在头下的一滩血中醒来，尽管抬头看也能看到一滩血。  你眼睛的晶体还需要一段时间才能完全硬化，但颜色已经比以前更丰富了，世界似乎有些迟缓。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You have stuffed yourself to bursting for the fourth time today, but your hunger doesn't abate.  You would need to escape your too-small skin to be able to eat enough, you're sure of it.  Take the knife to one of the stretch marks on your back, and part the skin - it springs to the side readily and with no pain.  You work your way down your sides, changing the knife between hands as needed and free your <color_light_green>new skin</color> from its fleshy prison."
msgstr "今天你已经第四次吃得撑破了，但你的饥饿感并没有减弱。  你需要摆脱你那太小的皮肤才能吃得足够，你确信这一点。  用刀切开背部的妊娠纹，将皮肤分开——皮肤会很容易地弹到一边，而且不会感到疼痛。  你沿着身体两侧移动，根据需要在双手之间换刀，并将你的<color_light_green>新皮肤</color>从肉质监狱中释放出来。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You long for a safe, dark place to complete your change."
msgstr "你渴望一个安全、黑暗的地方来完成你的改变。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You need enough insect primer and catalyst in your system while you are sleeping to complete your change."
msgstr "在你睡觉的时候，你的身体内部需要有足够的昆虫素和催化剂来完成这一转变。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You need the right nectar, otherwise you will never be queen."
msgstr "你需要合适的花蜜，否则你永远都无法成为女王。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You won't be able to change without enough catalyst, the right primer and being asleep."
msgstr "如果没有足够的催化剂、恰当的引子以及处于沉睡状态，你是无法实现改变的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_blind>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "Your eyes fail you, and everything turns dark."
msgstr "你的双眼失明了，一切都变得漆黑一片。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "Your try going about your day as usual, but your vision seems to dim every few seconds for no reason.  You reach to your eyes in annoyance and feel a disgusting fleshy membrane periodically covering them with a squeaky, wet motion.  You grasp them tightly and pull hard despite the pain until they tear off with a shower of red ichor coating your eyes.  You lick it away, and finally you can see clearly."
msgstr "你照常继续过着自己的日子，但每隔几秒钟，你的视线似乎就会莫名其妙地变得模糊起来。你恼怒地伸手去揉眼睛，却感觉有一层恶心的肉质薄膜周期性地覆盖在眼睛上，伴随着一种嘎吱嘎吱的湿润声。你紧紧地握住眼睛，不顾疼痛地用力拉扯，直到它们撕裂开来，伴随着一股红色的分泌物喷射而出，覆盖在你的眼睛上。你舔掉它，终于能看清东西了。"

