#. ~ Description of mutation "Changing Eyes"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Something is shifting painfully behind your eyeballs.  <color_red>This change will be reversible.  The next one might not be, should you continue.</color>"
msgstr "你的眼球后面有东西正在痛苦地移动。  <color_red>此更改是可逆的。  如果你继续的话，下一个可能不会。</color>"

#. ~ Description of mutation "No Left Arm"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whether by a serious accident, birth defect, or other means, you have lost your left arm.  As such, you cannot use anything you normally could with it, like lifting with two hands."
msgstr "无论是由于严重事故、先天残疾还是其他原因，你失去了左臂。受此影响，你不能进行需要左臂的活动，比如使用双臂抬起物体。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "No Left Leg"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whether by a serious accident, birth defect, or other means, you have lost your left leg.  You can hobble around, but will likely need a wheelchair or other means of locomotion to get somewhere far."
msgstr "无论是由于严重事故、先天残疾还是其他原因，你失去了左腿。您可以一瘸一拐地走来走去，但可能需要轮椅或其他移动工具才能到达较远的地方。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "No Right Arm"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whether by a serious accident, birth defect, or other means, you have lost your right arm.  As such, you cannot use anything you normally could with it, like lifting with two hands."
msgstr "无论是由于严重事故、先天残疾还是其他原因，你失去了右臂。受此影响，你不能进行需要右臂的活动，比如使用双臂抬起物体。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "No Right Leg"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whether by a serious accident, birth defect, or other means, you have lost your right leg.  You can hobble around, but will likely need a wheelchair or other means of locomotion to get somewhere far."
msgstr "无论是由于严重事故、先天残疾还是其他原因，你失去了右腿。您可以一瘸一拐地走来走去，但可能需要轮椅或其他移动工具才能到达较远的地方。"

