#. ~ Description of monster "Mayfield's goat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Soergelia mayfieldi - a sturdily built ruminant, not unlike a goat but more massively built.  It has light-brown wool and two vicious looking horns that are curved forward."
msgstr "Soergelia mayfieldi——一种身材结实的反刍动物，与山羊无异，但身材更加魁梧。它有浅棕色的羊毛和两个向前弯曲的、看起来很凶恶的角。"

#. ~ Pet message of monster "shrub-ox"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "wood-ox"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s lets you pet its shaggy-haired head, mooing loudly in satisfaction."
msgstr "%s 可以让你抚摸它蓬松头发的头，满意地大声发出哞哞声。"

#. ~ Pet message of monster "Mayfield's goat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s lets you scratch its big belly, letting of a sonorous bleat in satisfaction."
msgstr "%s 让你挠它的大肚子，满足地发出响亮的咩咩声。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "shrub-ox"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "wood-ox"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It lets you pat its shaggy-haired head and seems friendly."
msgstr "%s 似乎喜欢你！  它可以让你拍拍它毛茸茸的头，看起来很友善。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "flat-headed peccary"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "flat-headed peccary piglet"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It squeals happily as you pet it."
msgstr "%s 似乎喜欢你！  当你抚摸它时，它会高兴地尖叫。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "Mayfield's goat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to tolerate you!  It cocks its head and stares at you with its strange goat-eyes as you approach."
msgstr "%s似乎容忍你了！  当你靠近时，它会歪着头，用奇怪的山羊眼盯着你。"

