#. ~ Description of monster "bobcat cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "A juvenile bobcat.  It already moves with enthusiasm, but with much less grace and dexterity than its parent."
msgstr "一只幼年的山猫。它的动作已经很有激情，但比起它的父母，它的优雅和敏捷要差得多。"

#. ~ Description of monster "cave lion cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "A juvenile cave lion.  Still sizable, but much less dangerous than its parent, which will fight fiercely to protect its offspring."
msgstr "一只幼年穴狮。它的体型仍然很大，但比它的父母要小得多，它的父母会为了保护后代而激烈战斗。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "A juvenile dire wolf.  It runs around as excited as aimless, occasionally barking joyously."
msgstr "一只幼年恐狼。它兴奋且漫无目的的到处乱跑，偶尔还会高兴地吠叫。"

#. ~ Description of monster "saber-toothed cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "A juvenile saber-toothed cat.  Still sizable, but much less dangerous than its parent, which will fight fiercely to protect its offspring."
msgstr "一只幼年剑齿虎。它的体型仍然很大，但比它的父母要小得多，它的父母会为了保护后代而激烈战斗。"

#. ~ Description of monster "titanis walleri chick"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "A juvenile titanis walleri.  It is already large for a bird, but it is still far from its parent."
msgstr "一只幼年的泰坦尼斯瓦勒里。  对于一只鸟来说，它已经很大了，但距离它的父母还很远。"

#. ~ Description of monster "titanis walleri"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "A large predatory flightless bird with monstrous beak and strong legs.  Truly, the dinosaurs never went extinct, they just grew more feathers."
msgstr "一种不会飞的大型掠食性鸟类，有着巨大的喙和强壮的腿。  确实，恐龙从未灭绝，它们只是长出了更多的羽毛。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "A large, muscular species of wolf, with incredibly strong and sharp teeth capable of penetrating the thick hides of mammoths and giant sloths."
msgstr "一头体型巨大、肌肉发达的狼，长着难以置信的强壮利齿，能够穿透猛犸象和巨树懒厚厚的毛皮。"

#. ~ Pet message of monster "titanis walleri"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bows to you, clicking its beak while you pat their massive head."
msgstr "%s 向你鞠躬，当你拍拍它们巨大的头时，它们会用喙敲击它们。"

#. ~ Pet message of monster "dire wolf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s reluctantly wags its tail while you pat their massive head."
msgstr "当你轻拍它们巨大的头部时，%s 有些不情愿地摇了摇尾巴。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "titanis walleri"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It clicks its beak a few times and lowers its head, allowing you to pet it."
msgstr "%s 似乎喜欢你！  它会用喙敲击几下，然后低下头，让你抚摸它。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "saber-toothed cat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It emits a growling purr as you pet it."
msgstr "%s 似乎喜欢你！  当你抚摸它时，它会发出咕噜声。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "bobcat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It emits a satisfied purr as you pet it."
msgstr "%s 似乎喜欢你！  当你抚摸它时，它会发出满足的咕噜声。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "dire wolf"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "stag moose"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to tolerate you.  It cautiously lets you pat its head and seems friendly for now."
msgstr "%s 似乎容忍你了。  它小心翼翼地让你拍拍它的头，目前看起来很友好。"

#. ~ Description of monster "cave lion"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "This fierce looking sister of the European cave lion is a fast hunter, but usually likes to spend its days laying in the sun."
msgstr "这只看起来凶猛的欧洲穴狮的姐妹是个速度很快的猎手，但通常喜欢整天躺在阳光下。"

#. ~ Description of monster "saber-toothed cat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "This tiger-sized, but more robustly built creature has a sand-colored, spotted coat and a short tail.  Its eponymous saber-like upper canine teeth look menacing."
msgstr "这只同老虎般大小，但体型更健壮的生物浑身长着沙色的斑点毛皮和一条短尾巴。它赖以得名的剑形犬齿看起来十分危险。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "bobcat cub"
msgid_plural "bobcat cubs"
msgstr[0] "山猫幼崽"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "cave lion"
msgid_plural "cave lions"
msgstr[0] "穴狮"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "cave lion cub"
msgid_plural "cave lion cubs"
msgstr[0] "幼年穴狮"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "dire wolf cub"
msgid_plural "dire wolf cubs"
msgstr[0] "幼年恐狼"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "saber-toothed cat"
msgid_plural "saber-toothed cats"
msgstr[0] "剑齿虎"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "saber-toothed cub"
msgid_plural "saber-toothed cubs"
msgstr[0] "剑齿虎幼崽"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "titanis walleri"
msgid_plural "titani walleri"
msgstr[0] "泰坦巨鸟"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "titanis walleri chick"
msgid_plural "titanis walleri chicks"
msgstr[0] "幼年泰坦巨鸟"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant short-faced bear"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A bear weighing about a ton, standing at literal eyelevel with man, as long as it isn't towering above you on it's long, muscular hind legs.  Has a wide, short snout, giving it's face an almost feline expression.  Its not particularly aggressive, but doesn't tolerate threats to itself or its cubs."
msgstr "一头重约一吨的熊，行走时与人同高，只要它不用它肌肉发达长长腿站起来压倒你。有个又宽又短的鼻子，让它的脸看起来像猫科动物一样。它不是特别好斗，但不容忍任何对自己或幼崽的威胁。"

#. ~ Description of monster "stag moose"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A big deer-like creature, standing more than 2m tall with impressive antlers crowning their head."
msgstr "一只类似鹿的巨型生物，身高超过2米，头上有令人印象深刻的鹿角。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant beaver"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A big rodent feeding off of wood, known for building dams that set entire regions under water.  About the size of a calf."
msgstr "一只以木材为食的大型啮齿动物，因筑坝将整个地区置于水下而闻名。体型大约有小牛那么大。"

#. ~ Description of monster "American zebra"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A hooved grazing mammal with a brown-and-white striped coat.  ."
msgstr "一种有蹄的食草哺乳动物，有棕色和白色的条纹被毛。"

#. ~ Description of monster "woolly mammoth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A huge elephant-like animal covered in thick, long hair, shielding it against the cold.  Its trunk lazily swings around its two massive, upward-curving tusks."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的类似大象的动物，长着厚厚的毛发，为它御寒。它的躯干懒洋洋地带动着两根巨大的向上弯曲的象牙摆动。"

#. ~ Description of monster "glyptotherium"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A huge herbivore that almost resembles a giant tortoise due to its hard outer shell, although it is a close relative to armadillos.  Normally, this species prefers much warmer climates.  This individual probably lost its way at some point."
msgstr "一种巨大的食草动物，由于其坚硬的外壳，非常形似巨龟，尽管它是犰狳的近亲。通常情况下，这个物种喜欢更温暖的气候。这个个体可能在某个时候迷失了方向。"

#. ~ Description of monster "large claw sloth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A huge lumbering sloth standing at over 3 meters, gracefully wandering through the woods at a glacial tempo.  It is constantly in search for food to support its massive body weight."
msgstr "一只巨大而笨重地懒，身高3米多，按照冰河时代的步伐优雅地在树林中漫步。它不断地寻找食物来支撑它巨大的体重。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Scott's horse foal"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile American zebra.  It gallops around its parent excitedly, throwing around its head joyously."
msgstr "一匹幼年的美洲斑马。它兴奋地在父母身边驰骋，欢快地甩着头。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant beaver cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile giant beaver.  Pretty big already."
msgstr "一只幼年巨河狸。体型已经相当大了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant short-faced bear cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile giant short-faced bear.  Still a massive bear and a considerable threat on its own, but the real danger will come from its highly protective parent."
msgstr "一只幼年巨型短面熊。尽管它本身仍旧是只体型巨大的熊，而且也是相当大的威胁，但真正的危险将来自其高度保护的母熊。"

#. ~ Description of monster "glyptotherium young"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile glyptotherium.  Its shell is not quite fully developed, having an almost leathery feel to it."
msgstr "一只幼年雕齿兽。他的外壳尚未完全长成，有一种皮质感。"

#. ~ Description of monster "large claw sloth cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile large claw sloth.  Pretty big already."
msgstr "一只幼年大地懒。体型已经相当大了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "stag moose cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile stag moose.  Pretty big already, but its antlers have not grown yet."
msgstr "一只幼年大角鹿。体型已经相当大了，但它的鹿角还没有长出来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "great auk"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A large flightless sea bird that bears some resemblance to penguins, although it has a much larger beak.  It has a black and white coat with a characteristic white spot around its eyes."
msgstr "一种不会飞的大型海鸟，与企鹅有些相似，不过它的嘴要大得多。它有黑色和白色的被毛，眼睛周围有一个特有的白点。"

#. ~ Description of monster "white chick"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A tiny grey-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species."
msgstr "一只体型很小的灰白色雏鸟，太小了以至于你无法分辨它的物种，它可能来自几种不同的物种。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "American zebra"
msgid_plural "American zebras"
msgstr[0] "美洲斑马"

#. ~ Description of monster "mastodon"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "Shorter, but more massive than a woolly mammoth, and - crucially - much less hairy.  Its trunk lazily swings around its two massive, upward-curving tusks."
msgstr "比长毛猛犸象要矮，但体型更壮，更重要的是，毛发更少。它的躯干懒洋洋地带动着两根巨大的向上弯曲的象牙摆动。"

#. ~ Pet message of monster "stag moose"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bows down its massive antlered head to nuzzle your face."
msgstr "%s 低下它巨大的鹿角头来蹭你的脸。"

#. ~ Pet message of monster "stag moose cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s nuzzles you, pressing its head against your petting hand."
msgstr "%s用鼻子蹭你，把它的头压在你爱抚的手上。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "large claw sloth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It lets you pat its head, giving off a bassy hum."
msgstr "%s 似乎喜欢你！  它可以让你拍拍它的头，发出低沉的嗡嗡声。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "stag moose cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you.  It lets you pat its head and seems friendly for now."
msgstr "%s 似乎喜欢你。  它可以让你拍拍它的头，目前看起来很友好。"

#. ~ Pet message of monster "large claw sloth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s turns on its back and lets you scratch its huge, moss-overgrown belly."
msgstr "%s 翻转过来，让你抓挠它长满青苔的巨大腹部。"

#. ~ Description of monster "woolly mammoth cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "This big baby mammoth is already covered in thick brown wool, but the menacing tusks of their parents have not grown yet."
msgstr "这头巨大的猛犸象宝宝已经被厚厚的棕色毛皮覆盖，但类似父母的可怕象牙还没有长出来。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mastodon cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "This big baby mastodon is already quite muscular, but the menacing tusks of their parents have not grown yet."
msgstr "这头巨大的乳齿象宝宝已经很强壮了，但类似父母的可怕象牙还没有长出来。"

