#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/proficiencies/mf_weakpoints.json
msgid "Megafaunal Biology"
msgstr "大型动物生物学"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Megafaunal Biology"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/proficiencies/mf_weakpoints.json
msgid "You are familiar with the general anatomy of megafauna, and can exploit potential weaknesses."
msgstr "您熟悉巨型动物的一般解剖结构，并且可以利用潜在的弱点。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/harvest.json
msgid "You crack open the hard chitin of the outer barrel to get at the alien flesh beneath."
msgstr "你切开它的桶形外壳的甲壳，好获取下方的怪肉。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A dead body of a deep one with a gaping stab wound in its back."
msgstr "一具后颈被刺了个大洞的深潜者尸体。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A dead body of a female deep one."
msgstr "一具女性深潜者的尸体。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A dead body of a male deep one."
msgstr "一具男性深潜者的尸体。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A deep one corpse gored by arms fire chest to thighs, leaving the face eerily and fishily pristine."
msgstr "一具无法分辨性别的深潜者尸体，被手臂从胸部到大腿的火焰刺伤，但却留下了一副诡异的干净鱼类面孔。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The corpse of a deep one shot several times in the back with a low-caliber weapon."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，它被一把小口径枪械从背后多次射击。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The corpse of a deep one unblemished but for the bloody hole atop its head, its bald scalp intermixed now with brain, viscera and shotgun pellets."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，完好无损，但由于她头顶上有一个血迹斑斑的窟窿，光秃秃的鳞片夹杂着大脑、内脏和猎枪子弹。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The corpse of a deep one who appears to have been shot to death.  Its right arm is only barely still attached to his shoulder."
msgstr "一具似乎被枪杀的深潜者尸体。它的右臂只是勉强依附在肩膀上。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The corpse of a deep one, its legs and arms covered in blood.  It appears to have been shot in the thigh."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，它的腿和手臂都沾满了鲜血。它似乎大腿中枪。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The corpse of a deep one.  It appears to have been shot in the forehead at a very close range leaving you a good view of its brain matter."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，似乎是在很近的地方被击中了前额，你可以清晰地看见它的脑子。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The dead body of a deep one, coated in congealed blood."
msgstr "一具沾满了凝固的血液的深潜者尸体。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The dead body of a deep one."
msgstr "一具深潜者的尸体。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The dead body of a deep one.  Its forehead bears a large bullet entrance wound.  An even larger exit wound is present on the back of its head."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，额头上有一个巨大的子弹入射伤口，后脑勺则有另一个更大的伤口。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The upper half of a dead deep one body, as if torn apart with enormous force.  Some organs are hanging out."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体的上半截，像是被蛮力撕开的一样。一些器官从里面漏了出来。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "deep one corpse"
msgid_plural "deep one corpses"
msgstr[0] "深潜者尸体"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/modinfo.json
msgid "Mythos Mod - Mythos Creatures Only"
msgstr "仅含克苏鲁生物"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Mythos Mod - Mythos Creatures Only"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes all the zombies (including fungus zombies), cyborgs and robots from the game and replaces them with a variety of Lovecraftian monsters - intended to be part of a total conversion mod but can be used as a standalone if wanted."
msgstr "从游戏中移除所有的丧尸（包括真菌丧尸），改造人和机器人并替换成克苏鲁生物——这是一个全面改动类模组的一部分，但如果想要也可以单独使用。"

#. ~ Description of species "MYTHOS"
#. ~ Description of species "MYTHOS_DM"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/modinteractions/Defense_Mode/species.json data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/species.json
msgid "a mythos creature"
msgstr "克苏鲁生物"

#. ~ Description of monster "servitor of the outer gods"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "A constantly-flickering mass of eyes, mouths, and tentacles hanging in the air, emitting a piping noise from flutes of bone."
msgstr "一团不断闪烁的眼睛、嘴巴和触手悬在空中，骨笛中不断发出刺耳的声音。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shoggoth"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "A gargantuan protoplasmic blob, constantly reshaping, forming new pseudopods seemingly at will.  All over its body are eyes that form and disappear.  It looks at you with malice."
msgstr "那是一个体型无比巨大的，身上不断分裂出四处挥舞的触手，外形不定的巨型变形怪。遍布它全身的无数只眼睛，不断地在体表形成又消失。它正怨恨地凝视着你。"

#. ~ Description of monster "flying polyp"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "A half polypous, utterly alien creature.  It's only partly material and has the ability to fly, despite the absence of wings.  It produces strange whistling noises which send cold shivers of primal terror down your spine."
msgstr "一只源自克苏鲁神话的盲目者亚种，完完全全的异界生物。它的身体仅有一半是由物质构成，虽然没有翅膀却能够在空中飞行。它在移动时发出奇怪的呼啸声，一阵阵远古的恐惧感让你的从头到脚的脊柱都不寒而栗。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dark young"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "A horrifying, pitch-black monstrosity, seemingly made of ropy tentacles.  It stands as tall as a tree on stumpy, hoofed legs, and its flanks covered in puckered maws, dripping green goo."
msgstr "一只可怕的漆黑色怪物，似乎是由粘稠的触手构成的。它像一棵树一样高，腿短而有蹄，两侧布满皱巴巴的大洞，滴着绿色的黏液。"

#. ~ Description of monster "deep one"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "A large, greenish-gray amphibious humanoid with webbed hands and feet.  It's wide, flabby head is distinctly fish like with wide staring eyes and its gangling limbs end in wickedly sharp claws.  It moves with an odd hopping gait, occasionally dropping down to walk on four limbs."
msgstr "一只大型灰绿色两栖人型生物，手和脚有蹼。它宽大、松弛的头部像鱼一样，眼睛瞪得大大的，瘦长的四肢末端有可怕的利爪。它用一种奇怪的跳跃步伐移动，偶尔会俯身用四肢行走。"

#. ~ Description of monster "rat-thing"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "A small brown rodent with long whiskers and beady eyes.  Its face is strangely human-like, as are its tiny hands."
msgstr "一只棕色的小型啮齿动物，长着长胡须和圆圆的眼睛。它的脸和它的小手都很像人类。"

#. ~ Description of monster "elder thing"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "A strange alien creature with a star-shaped head and numerous writhing appendages arranged radially around its barrel-shaped body."
msgstr "这是一种奇怪的外星生物，头部呈星形，无数蠕动的附肢呈放射状排列在桶状的身体周围。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shantak"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "An enormous, scaly avian monster larger than an elephant.  It has slimy, reptilian skin, a pair of membranous, bat-like wings and a horse-like head at the end of a long neck."
msgstr "一只体型比大象更大的巨大有着鳞的鸟类怪物。它体表长着黏糊糊的爬行动物皮肤，一对蝙蝠般的膜状翅膀，长长的脖子顶上长着马一样的头。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "servitor of the outer gods"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s folds into itself and disappears."
msgstr "%s折叠并消失。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "nightgaunt"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s melts into wisps of darkness."
msgstr "%s融化成一缕黑暗。"

#. ~ Description of monster "ghoul"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "This humanoid creature has a semi-canine head, hooved feet, and claws.  Its rubbery skin is pale and covered with grave-mold."
msgstr "这只人型生物长着犬类般的脸、有蹄的脚和利爪。它橡胶般的皮肤十分苍白，覆盖着严重的真菌。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hunting horror"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "This is some sort of great viperine creature, possessed of a curiously distorted head and massive clawed appendages.  It partially supports itself with the aid of black rubbery wings of monstrous dimensions.  Its form writhes and changes before your eyes, filling you with unnameable horror."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的如毒蛇一般的怪物，长着一个怪异而扭曲的头部和许许多多爪子一样的附肢。它的身体依靠着尺寸巨大的黑色且有弹性的翅膀支撑而部分竖起。它的身形不断的在你眼前扭曲变化，让你浑身充满了无名的恐惧。"

#. ~ Description of monster "nightgaunt"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "This lanky ebon humanoid has batlike wings and a long prehensile tail, yet its most unsettling feature is its lack of a face."
msgstr "这只瘦长而乌黑的人型动物长着蝙蝠般的翅膀和一条可缠绕的长尾巴，但它最令人不安的特征是没有脸。"

#. ~ Description of monster "ghast"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "This vaguely humanoid creature is almost as big as a pony.  It has long hooved legs on which it hops, clawed hands, and a hideous noseless head with oversized teeth."
msgstr "这只半人型生物的体型几乎和一匹小马一样大。它长着可以跳跃的蹄足，有利爪的手，还有一个丑陋的没有鼻子的脑袋和超大的尖牙。"

