#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
msgid ""
"Use the Warp Obelisk to reach the surface and begin an expedition to a random place on the surface.  Find the exit marked on your map and get there in time with all the loot you can carry and to bring it back to the island!\n"
"Dying on expedition will return you home safely, but you will lose EVERYTHING you had with you.  Keep spare gear at home so you can quickly resupply!\n"
"\n"
"The time limit is enforced by warp pulses, which hit you at regular intervals.  After 8 pulses, you suffer warpsickness, which rapidly reduces your stats with each pulse.  After 12 pulses, your body begins to disintegrate, taking damage until you die.  Get home safely to reset the pulses!\n"
"\n"
"Certain upgrades can unlock new varieties of expeditions, or improve your survivability."
msgstr ""
"使用扭曲方尖碑到达地表并开始前往地表随机地点的探险。  找到地图上标记的出口，带着你能携带的所有战利品及时到达那里，并将其带回岛上！\n"
"在探险中死亡会让你安全回家，但你会失去你所拥有的一切。  将备用装备留在家里，以便您可以快速补给！\n"
"\n"
"时间限制是由扭曲脉冲强制执行的，这些脉冲会定期击中你。  8 次脉冲后，你会遭受扭曲病，每次脉冲都会迅速降低你的统计数据。  12 次脉冲后，你的身体开始解体，受到伤害直至死亡。  安全回家重置脉冲！\n"
"\n"
"某些升级可以解锁新类型的探险，或提高你的生存能力。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
msgid "View my construction stats."
msgstr "查看我的建筑统计数据。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
msgid "View my expedition stats."
msgstr "查看我的探险统计数据。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
msgid "View my upgrade stats."
msgstr "查看我的升级统计数据。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
msgid ""
"Warp shards are rewarded for completing missions.  They can be spent on special warp-related recipes in your crafting menu, and are also required for various upgrades.  If you need, warp shards can be spent here to heal yourself instantly.\n"
"\n"
"You will also acquire material tokens, rewarded any time you complete an expedition, even if you did no missions.  Longer expeditions yield more tokens.  These tokens can be crafted into common raw resources, like wood, sand, scrap metal, and so on, as long as you have an infinity source nearby.  Infinity sources come in three varieties, each providing different resources, and are acquired by crafting.  Find them under the warp tools category of your crafting menu."
msgstr ""
"完成任务会获得扭曲碎片奖励。  它们可以用于制作菜单中与扭曲相关的特殊配方，也可以用于各种升级。  如果需要，可以在这里花费扭曲碎片来立即治愈自己。\n"
"\n"
"您还将获得物质代币，即使您没有执行任何任务，只要您完成一次探险，都会获得奖励。  更长的探险会产生更多的代币。  只要你附近有无限的资源，这些代币就可以被制作成常见的原始资源，如木材、沙子、废金属等。  无限源分为三种，每种提供不同的资源，并通过制作获得。  在制作菜单的扭曲工具类别下找到它们。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
msgid ""
"You can unlock and upgrade many features here.  For the right price, you can improve things like how much map is revealed around you, how many missions are available per trip, what sort of expeditions you can go on, and even instantly construct things on this island.\n"
"\n"
"To upgrade, simply accept a mission here, then turn in the required materials by just crafting the associated recipe.  Find them under the warp upgrades category of your crafting menu.\n"
"\n"
"Some upgrades and recipes will not be available to unlock until you have reached a higher rank.  To increase your rank, survive enough expeditions and you will be notified that a rank up mission has become available."
msgstr ""
"您可以在这里解锁和升级许多功能。  以合适的价格，你可以改进一些东西，比如你周围有多少地图，每次旅行有多少个任务，你可以进行什么样的探险，甚至可以立即在这个岛上建造东西。\n"
"\n"
"要升级，只需在这里接受任务，然后通过制作相关的配方来上交所需的材料。  在制作菜单的扭曲升级类别下找到它们。\n"
"\n"
"一些升级和食谱只有在您达到更高的等级后才能解锁。  要提高你的等级，请在足够多的探险中生存下来，然后你会收到升级任务已可用的通知。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpdisintegration"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Disintegrating!"
msgstr "解体！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Earthside"
msgstr "地表探险"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disintegrating!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Prolonged warp is destroying you.  You're coming apart."
msgstr "长期的翘曲正在摧毁你，你的身体正在分崩离析。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "The bile suddenly rises in your throat and your fingers feel like they're peeling themselves open.  Your warp sickness is getting worse.  You should get home soon."
msgstr "胆汁突然涌上你的喉咙，你的手指像裂开般的疼。你的翘曲失调越来越严重了，你应该快点回家。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "The ravages of the world intensify.  Everything hurts and existence is a surreal wash of pain.  Your warp sickness is unbearable.  You need to get home as soon as possible."
msgstr "世界的崩解在加剧。一切都是那么的痛苦，仅仅是存在就是一种超现实的折磨。你的翘曲失调开始难以忍受，你需要尽快回家。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Disintegrating!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "The rending of the warp has finally abated.  You feel like you exist again."
msgstr "翘曲的撕裂终于结束了。你感觉自己又活过来了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Necrosis"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "The very fabric of your being is unraveling!  You're in dire straits.  You need to get back to your sanctuary island NOW!"
msgstr "你的身体正在不断瓦解，你现在的状况举步维艰。你需要立即回到岛上！"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "The whole world shimmers in front of your eyes.  Everything feels slow and sticky.  Warp sickness is setting in.  You should focus on getting home."
msgstr "整个世界开始在你眼前闪烁，一切都变得缓慢而粘稠。你的翘曲失调开始发作了，你应该想想该怎么回家了。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "There are no words to describe how much trouble you're in.  Your body is crumbling to wet paste and your blood is twisting into a viny tangle.  All you know is pain.  You're not just dying, you're dying horribly.  Your only hope is escape to your sanctuary, but oblivion is only moments away."
msgstr "言语已无法形容你的麻烦有多大。你的身体正在崩溃成一滩烂泥，血液如藤蔓般扭曲。你所能感受到的只有痛苦。你不仅要死了，而且会死得很惨。你唯一的希望就是逃回你的避难岛，但消逝就在眼前。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Debilitation"
msgstr "翘曲虚弱"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Disintegration!"
msgstr "翘曲解体！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Nausea"
msgstr "翘曲反胃"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Necrosis"
msgstr "翘曲坏死"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Sickness"
msgstr "翘曲失调"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Stability"
msgstr "翘曲稳定"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpcloak"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warpcloaked"
msgstr "翘曲庇护"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthside"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You are away from your sanctuary island.  Over time, you will begin to succumb to the intangible miasma of the world below, and your stats will suffer.  You have several hours after warp before this becomes a problem, after which it will rapidly get worse until you warp home or die."
msgstr "你已经离开了你的避难岛。随着时间推移，你会受到地表上的无形瘴气的影响，属性开始减退。折跃之后的头几个小时还无大碍，但之后就会迅速恶化，直到你折跃回家或死在这里。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warpcloaked"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You are invisible for a very brief time.  Now's your chance to get to cover.  You're also incorporeal enough to not take fall damage, but hopefully that won't be relevant."
msgstr "你在短时间内是虚无的。现在是寻找掩护的机会了。肉体还未成型，不会受到坠落伤害，但希望你不会需要这个。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warpcloaked"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You fully materialize.  You're not invisible anymore!"
msgstr "你的身体已经成型，隐身效果消失了！"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You taste blood and your eyes sink back into their sockets.  You've stayed out too long.  Your warp sickness is about to consume you entirely and you're falling apart at the seams.  Get home NOW!"
msgstr "你嘴里有股血腥味，眼球深陷眼窝。你在外面逗留的时间太长了。你的翘曲失调即将吞噬你，你开始从空间的缝隙处裂开。回家！现在！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Disintegrating!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You're being unmade!"
msgstr "你的身体开始分崩离析！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You're fresh from your stay at your sanctuary island.  The intangible miasma of terra firma currently has no effect on you, and you feel fine.  This should last for several hours.  Stay too long, however, and you'll gradually begin to suffer ever-worsening debilitating effects."
msgstr "你刚刚从你的避难岛上传送下来。地表上无形的瘴气对你还没什么影响。现在你感觉良好。这种状态还能保持几个小时，但如果你呆得太久的话，就会逐渐开始受到越来越严重的影响。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Disintegration!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You're going to die.  And if you weren't busy leaking blood out of every pore, you'd find a better way to emphasize just how badly you're dying.  Your only hope is to return home immediately."
msgstr "你就要死了，没有什么能比你现在全身毛孔渗血的样子更能强调这点。你唯一的活路就是立即回到岛上。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Nausea"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You've overstayed your time earthside.  It's getting hard to concentrate, there's a painful ringing in your ears, and your muscles sting and jolt.  Every action feels delayed.  You need to warp home to refresh yourself, or this is going to get worse.  Probably within just a few hours."
msgstr "你在地表待得有些久了。你开始难以集中精力，耳膜里有种令人痛苦的响声，你的肌肉开始刺痛和抽搐，每一个动作都带着延迟。你需要折跃回家让自己恢复精神，否则情况将在几个小时内变得更糟。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Debilitation"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You've stayed earthside WAY too long!  Your body barely responds and your senses are slush.  The world itself feels barbed and frayed, and the very air is like breathing fiberglass.  If you want to survive, you need to warp home as soon as possible."
msgstr "你在地表待得太久了！你的身体几乎没有反应，你的感官一片混乱。现在的世界如同充满了刺痛和磨伤，空气就像呼吸着玻璃纤维。如果你还想活下去，就得尽快折跃回家。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Sickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You've stayed earthside too long.  Your body aches and your senses are dulling.  Every step feels like you're walking through thick mud and breathing hot tar.  You should warp home as soon as you can, or this is only going to get worse."
msgstr "你在地表停留太久了。你浑身作痛，反应变得迟钝，每一步都如在泥潭里蹒跚跋涉，像在呼吸着滚烫的焦油。你应该尽快折跃回家，否则情况会持续恶化。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity ore"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A roiling, rattling mass of ever-churning metal.  Flares of purple energy arc around the formless pile like electricity, and in their wake, thin metal rods and struts jut out, before disappearing into the half-molten heap which never seems to grow or diminish.  Its strange nature allows you to shift it around like furniture.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this ore allows you to produce raw and basic metal items from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"一团不断翻腾、嘎嘎作响的金属。  紫色能量的耀斑像电流一样围绕着无形的堆，在它们的尾迹中，细金属棒和支柱伸出，然后消失在半熔化的堆中，而半熔化的堆似乎永远不会增长或减少。  它奇怪的性质允许你像家具一样移动它。\n"
"\n"
"这种矿石的力量使您可以通过制作菜单从材料代币中生产原始和基本金属物品。\n"
"只要其中之一就可以永远持续下去。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "warpglass wall"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A shimmering translucent barrier that almost yields to the touch, but adamantly refuses entry."
msgstr "一道闪闪发光的半透明屏障，能够伸手触摸表面，但却无法伸入进去。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "warped rock"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A sparkly-black stone that's glassy smooth to the touch.  Seems indestructible by normal means."
msgstr "一种闪闪发光的黑色宝石，触感如玻璃般光滑。  通过正常手段似乎是坚不可摧的。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Return Obelisk"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A strange statue that will take you back home."
msgstr "一座奇怪的雕像，能让你返回浮空岛。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Island's Heart"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A swirling, surreal statue of organic shapes carved from dark stone.  In your head, a voice speaks faintly.  Despite its massive size, it's surprisingly easy to move around the island.\n"
"\n"
"It seems you can interact with it."
msgstr ""
"一座由深色石头雕刻而成的旋转、超现实的有机形状雕像。  你的脑海里，有一个声音微弱地说话。  尽管面积巨大，但在岛上移动却出奇地容易。\n"
"\n"
"看来你可以和它互动。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Island's Heart"
msgstr "空岛之心"

#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity tree"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Purple-blue shimmers sparkle around the leaves of this small sapling.  New growth seems to spring up in seconds, as if in a timelapse, and yet there never seem to be too many branches.  It's always in equilibrium.  Its strange nature allows you to push it around like furniture.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this tree allows you to produce raw wooden items from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"这棵小树苗的叶子周围闪烁着紫蓝色的光芒。  新的生长似乎在几秒钟内就出现了，就像在延时摄影中一样，但似乎从来没有太多的分支。  它始终处于平衡状态。  它奇特的性质让你可以像家具一样把它推来推去。\n"
"\n"
"这棵树的力量使您可以通过制作菜单从材料代币中生产原始木制物品。\n"
"只要其中之一就可以永远持续下去。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Return Obelisk"
msgstr "回归方尖碑"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open air"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "This is the edge of the island.  A metaphysical border stops you from going over the edge yourself, but anything you drop here will be gone forever."
msgstr "浮空岛的边缘。意在阻止你越过它，丢到这里的任何东西都将永远消失。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Warp Obelisk"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"This strange, towering monolith is the only lifeline you have to the outside world.  Despite its massive size, it's surprisingly easy to move around the island.\n"
"\n"
"It seems you can interact with it."
msgstr ""
"这座奇怪的、高耸的巨石是你与外界联系的唯一生命线。  尽管面积巨大，但在岛上移动却出奇地容易。\n"
"\n"
"看来你可以和它互动。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Warp Obelisk"
msgstr "折跃方尖碑"

#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity stone"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Wisps of iridescent energy spark around this immense stone like miniature fireworks, leaving behind a satisfying showers of pebbles.  Clay and soil shift around its base, erupting in slow motion yet never overflowing.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this stone allows you to produce rocks and natural earthen items from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"一缕虹彩能量在这块巨大的石头周围闪烁，就像微型烟花，留下令人满意的鹅卵石阵雨。  粘土和土壤在其底部移动，以缓慢的动作喷发，但从未溢出。\n"
"\n"
"这种石头的力量使您可以通过制作菜单从材料代币中生产岩石和天然土制品。\n"
"只要其中之一就可以永远持续下去。"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "warped rock"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "glzt!"
msgstr "GLZT！"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "infinity ore"
msgstr "无限矿石"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "infinity stone"
msgstr "无限宝石"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "infinity tree"
msgstr "无限树"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "nearby infinity ore"
msgid_plural "nearby infinity ores"
msgstr[0] "附近有无限矿石"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "nearby infinity stone"
msgid_plural "nearby infinity stones"
msgstr[0] "附近的无限宝石"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "nearby infinity tree"
msgid_plural "nearby infinity trees"
msgstr[0] "附近的无限树"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "nearby warp obelisk"
msgid_plural "nearby warp obelisks"
msgstr[0] "靠近折跃方尖碑"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "warped rock"
msgstr "扭曲的岩石"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "warpglass wall"
msgstr "翘曲屏障"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/island_mapgen.json
msgid "sky island"
msgstr "浮空岛"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_memorize_island"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/island_upgrades.json
msgid "Mapping island for future construction…"
msgstr "为未来的建设绘制岛屿地图……"

#. ~ Description of "Labs Catalyst"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A bit of warp power, a magnetic stripe keycard from a dangerous place, and a little hope, blended well.  This item is required to begin a Labs expedition, and is consumed when leaving."
msgstr "一点扭曲力量、一张来自危险地方的磁条钥匙卡和一点希望，完美地融合在一起。  该物品是开始实验室探险所必需的，并在离开时消耗。"

#. ~ Description of "infinity stone source"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A crackling little cluster of pebbles that spark as they knock together, tumbling about from forces unseen.  Activate this on your island to place an infinity stone, which can be used as a catalyst to turn material tokens into stony and earthen resources."
msgstr "一团噼啪作响的小卵石碰撞在一起时会发出火花，在看不见的力量的作用下翻滚。  在你的岛上激活它以放置一颗无限石头，它可以用作将材料代币转化为石质和土质资源的催化剂。"

#. ~ Description of "infinity tree sapling"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A fragile little wisp of a sapling.  Its leaves shake and quiver, shimmering with strange energies.  Activate this on your island to place an infinity tree, which can be used as a catalyst to turn material tokens into wooden resources."
msgstr "一棵脆弱的小树苗。  它的叶子颤抖着，闪烁着奇怪的能量。  在你的岛上激活它以放置一棵无限树，它可以用作将材料代币转化为木质资源的催化剂。"

#. ~ Description of "warped animal carrier"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A hand-sized cage with a shimmering portal at its aperture.  Despite being shaped more like a cat carrier, the power of warp enables it to capture creatures far bigger than you.  This may be your best bet for bringing animals home to your island sanctuary.  Activate to capture an adjacent animal, or to release a carried animal."
msgstr "一个手掌大小的笼子，开口处闪闪发光。尽管形状更像猫笼，但翘曲力量使其能够捕获比你大得多的生物。这可能是你将动物带回岛上的最佳选择。激活以捕获邻近的动物，或释放携带的动物。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "homeward mote"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A hasty escape."
msgstr "仓促逃跑。"

#. ~ Description of "warped hauler's harness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A looped pair of shimmering blue-black straps that can be worn over the shoulders like a harness.  They can snugly fit a single item of nearly any size in comfort, and any burdens carried here feel twice as light.  Ideal for squeezing one more bulky item home through the exit when your hands are already full, or even some container packed full of other items!  Just beware you don't break your back doing it."
msgstr "一对闪闪发光的蓝黑色环形带子，可以像安全带一样挂在肩膀上。  它们可以舒适地紧贴几乎任何尺寸的单件物品，并且在这里携带的任何负担都感觉轻了两倍。  当您的双手已经装满物品时，甚至是装满其他物品的容器时，非常适合从出口挤压一件大件物品！  只是要小心，不要这样做伤到你的背。"

#. ~ Description of "infinity ore crucible"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A miniature tangle of metal that resembles a dust bunny made of barbed wire.  It twists in upon itself endlessly, folding and unfolding in ways that don't seem possible.  Activate this on your island to place an infinity ore, which can be used as a catalyst to turn material tokens into metal resources."
msgstr "一种微型金属缠结，类似于由铁丝网制成的灰尘兔子。  它不断地自我扭曲，以看似不可能的方式折叠和展开。  在你的岛上激活它可以放置无限矿石，它可以用作将材料代币转化为金属资源的催化剂。"

#. ~ Description of "warp shards"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A small quantity of airy-thin material that resembles flaked obsidian.  It glints with a purplish shimmer that seems to stretch off the bounds of itself and into the air itself.  Offered to the powers that be, one could exchange it for valuable artifacts."
msgstr "一小份轻薄的材料，类似片状的黑曜石。它闪烁着紫色的微光，似乎延伸到了自身的边界，进入到空气之中。将其献给某种强大的存在，可以用来交换有价值的造物。"

#. ~ Description of "material token"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A very tiny disc-shaped blue wafer.  It seems to shift in your grasp, feeling one moment like a grain of sand, then a sharp metal fragment, then a wooden splinter.  These miniature tokens are rewarded for surviving a raid, and can be crafted on your island for a large supply of common resources by using infinity nodes as a catalyst."
msgstr "非常小的圆盘状蓝色晶圆。  它似乎在你的手中发生了变化，一会儿感觉像一粒沙子，一会儿感觉像一块锋利的金属碎片，然后感觉像一块木碎片。  这些微型代币因在突袭中幸存而获得奖励，并且可以通过使用无限节点作为催化剂在您的岛上制作以获得大量公共资源。"

#. ~ Description of "Heartseed"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A whorl of black stone that feels impossibly heavy for its size.  Activate this on your island to place the Heart of the Island, the catalyst of future upgrades."
msgstr "一个黑色石头的螺旋，相对于它的尺寸来说，感觉异常沉重。  在你的岛上激活它以放置岛屿之心，这是未来升级的催化剂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Autodoc copyplate (activated)"
msgid_plural "Autodoc copyplates (activated)"
msgstr[0] "全自动医疗仪复制板（就绪）"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Autodoc copyplate (inert)"
msgid_plural "Autodoc copyplates (inert)"
msgstr[0] "全自动医疗仪复制板（空白）"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Heartseed"
msgid_plural "Heartseeds"
msgstr[0] "心籽"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Labs Catalyst"
msgid_plural "Labs Catalysts"
msgstr[0] "实验室催化剂"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "skyward beacon"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Return to the sky."
msgstr "返回天空。"

#. ~ Description of "warped lumberjack's bag"
#. ~ Description of "warped excavator's bag"
#. ~ Description of "warped scrapper's bag"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "THIS ITEM HAS BEEN OBSOLETED.  If you have one from an old save, you may continue to use it, but no more may be crafted.  You can deconstruct this for a full refund on warp shards."
msgstr "该产品已被淘汰。  如果您有旧保存中的一张，您可以继续使用它，但不能再制作更多。  您可以解构它以获得经纱碎片的全额退款。"

#. ~ Description of "vortex token"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "This irregular purplish lump seems to slowly pull in air even while you hold it in your hand.  If you have one with you when you activate the return obelisk and the obelisk is correctly configured, it will drag the entire contents of the room with you back up to your island."
msgstr "这个不规则的紫红块状物看起来正在缓慢地向内吸气，即使你拿在手上也在继续吸。 如果你在启动回归方尖碑时带着它，并且方尖碑的设置正确，它会把放在房间里的所有东西一起拽回你的岛上。"

#. ~ Description of "warped bag"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "This is a template you shouldn't actually see."
msgstr "这是一个模板物品，你不应该看到它。"

#. ~ Description of "earthbound pill"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "This pseudomagical pill extends the amount of time you can stay earthside by 4 pulses, or about 50% of a normal trip.  They're precious, but should help buy time for a difficult extract."
msgstr "这种如魔法般的药丸可以将你在地表上停留的时间延长4次脉冲，即普通难度的一半时间左右。它们很珍贵，但能为你脱离险境赢得宝贵时间。"

#. ~ Description of "quickheal pill"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "This pseudomagical pill will heal all your damaged parts, but only if swallowed while on your sanctuary island.  No reason to bring this into the field."
msgstr "这种如魔法般的药丸能够治愈你的所有伤势，但只能在空岛上使用。就别想着把它带到地面上去了。"

#. ~ Description of "skyward beacon"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "This smooth purplish sphere seems like it wants to rise right out of your hand.  If you activate it, you will return directly to the island with everything you are carrying."
msgstr "这个光滑的紫色球体似乎想要从你的手中升起。  如果你激活它，你将带着你所携带的一切直接返回岛屿。"

#. ~ Description of "Autodoc copyplate (inert)"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "This strange obsidian-colored plate is capable of mimicking the advanced tech found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy at your sanctuary.  However, it is inert in its current state and must first be imprinted on a working Autodoc.  To do so, find an Autodoc during an expedition and use the construction menu to imprint this plate."
msgstr "这块奇异的黑曜石颜色板子可以拟态现代全自动医疗仪中的先进技术，在你的避难岛上创建一个可以运转的复制品。不过，目前它还处于休眠状态，必须先找到一个处于工作状态的全自动医疗仪进行拓印。如果要这么做，请在探险中找到一个自动医疗仪，然后使用建造菜单在板子上拓印。"

#. ~ Description of "Autodoc copyplate (activated)"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "This strange obsidian-colored plate is capable of mimicking the advanced tech found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy at your sanctuary.  It has been successfully activated and can be used as the catalyst to create a new Autodoc at a location of your choosing using the construction menu.  Be aware this cannot be safely moved once placed, and will also require you to add an adjacent couch, then convert it to an Autodoc couch."
msgstr "这块奇异的黑曜石颜色板子可以拟态现代全自动医疗仪中的先进技术，在你的避难岛上创建一个可以运转的复制品。它已被成功激活为建造用的引物，通过建造菜单在你选择的位置创建一个新的全自动医疗仪。请注意，全自动医疗仪一旦放置就不能再安全地移动了，旁边还需要放一个沙发，然后将其转换为全自动医疗仪用沙发。"

#. ~ Description of "homeward mote"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"Though visibly little more than a glowing dustbunny, this strange ethereal mote of warp essence reveals, on closer inspection, something more.  A tiny, twisting, half-visible thread of shimmering bluish-purple trails away into the sky and far out of sight, unimpeded by any obstacles.\n"
"\n"
"Taking this rare and valuable artifact with you on an expedition is essentially buying life insurance.  If you die with this mote in your inventory, you will instead be restored to full health and brought home, WITH all items and equipment carried.  But this effect will only last for a single expedition.  Even if you extract safely, any and all motes carried on your person when you return home will be DESTROYED."
msgstr ""
"看上去只是一小团发光的尘兔，但仔细观察后，这团奇异飘渺的翘曲微粒蕴含着更多的东西。一条纤细扭曲的半透明丝线闪烁着蓝紫色光芒，一直延伸到天空之中，远离视线，不受任何障碍物的阻碍。\n"
"\n"
"带着这件稀有而珍贵的神器去探险，本质上是给自己买了份保险。只要你携带着这件物品，如果在探险中死亡，你会完好无损的回到岛上，你身上的所有东西也都会保留。但这种效果只能生效一次。即使你从安全撤离，这件物品也会失效并消失。"

#. ~ Description of "warped grass seeds"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "While these are certainly imbued with warp, they don't seem to have any supernatural powers beyond just growing quickly.  A nice option if you want to re-plant grass on your island, for decoration's sake."
msgstr "虽然它们确实充满了翘曲能量，但除了快速生长之外并没有其他能力。如果你想在岛上种草以进行装饰，这是一个不错的选择。"

