#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining mi-go threat!"
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining mi-go overlord!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A group of lethal mi-gos are draining a location where warp resonance is high.  Destroy them all for a very large reward of warp shards."
msgstr "一群致命的米戈正在抽干扭曲共振高的地方。  将它们全部摧毁即可获得巨额亚空间碎片奖励。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombies!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A handful of zombies are congregating at a location where warp resonance is high.  Clear them out for a minimal reward of warp shards."
msgstr "一小群丧尸聚集在了一片翘曲波动较高的区域。消灭它们，可获得零星翘曲碎片。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining horde!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A horde of low level zombies are congregating at a location where warp resonance is high.  Clear them out for a small reward of warp shards."
msgstr "一大群普通丧尸聚集在了一片翘曲波动较高的区域。消灭它们，可获得少量翘曲碎片。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining evolved horde!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A huge horde of evolved zombies are congregating at a location where warp resonance is high.  Clear them out for a large reward of warp shards."
msgstr "一大群进化的僵尸正在亚空间共振高的地方聚集。  清除它们即可获得大量扭曲碎片奖励。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 3 nether creatures this expedition"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A rift to another dimension has drained latent energies which must be released into the stream of warp once more.  Kill at least 3 nether-born creatures before returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr "通往另一个维度的裂痕吸收了潜在的能量，这些能量必须重新释放到翘曲之中。杀死至少3只异界生物，回到空岛后可获得额外的翘曲碎片。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie lord!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A single supremely powerful zombie has been found at a location where warp resonance is high.  Destroy it for a very large reward of warp shards."
msgstr "在扭曲共振高的地方发现了一只极其强大的僵尸。  摧毁它可以获得大量的扭曲碎片奖励。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie leader!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A supremely powerful zombie has been found at a location where warp resonance is high.  Be warned that it will be accompanied by an elite swarm!  Destroy them all for a huge reward of warp shards."
msgstr "在扭曲共振高的地方发现了一只极其强大的僵尸。  请注意，它将伴随着精英群！  将它们全部摧毁即可获得亚空间碎片的巨额奖励。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie horde lord!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A supremely powerful zombie has been found at a location where warp resonance is high.  Be warned that it will be accompanied by an massive horde of weaker zombies!  Destroy them all for a huge reward of warp shards."
msgstr "在扭曲共振高的地方发现了一只极其强大的僵尸。  请注意，它会伴随着一大群较弱的僵尸！  将它们全部摧毁即可获得亚空间碎片的巨额奖励。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining evolved zombies!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A swarm of evolved zombies are congregating at a location where warp resonance is high.  Clear them out for a medium reward of warp shards."
msgstr "一群进化的僵尸正在亚空间共振高的地方聚集。  清除它们即可获得中等奖励的扭曲碎片。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining elite zombies!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A swarm of extremely dangerous zombies are congregating at a location where warp resonance is high.  Clear them out for a very large reward of warp shards."
msgstr "一群极其危险的僵尸正在亚空间共振高的地方聚集。  清除它们即可获得大量扭曲碎片奖励。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining fearsome zombies!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A swarm of rather powerful zombies are congregating at a location where warp resonance is high.  Clear them out for a large reward of warp shards."
msgstr "一群相当强大的僵尸正在亚空间共振高的地方聚集。  清除它们即可获得大量扭曲碎片奖励。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie superteam!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A team of supremely powerful zombies has been found at a location where warp resonance is high.  Destroy it for a very large reward of warp shards."
msgstr "在扭曲共振高的地方发现了一支极其强大的僵尸队伍。  摧毁它可以获得大量的扭曲碎片奖励。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find the warp shards!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "A very small cluster of warp energy has left shards behind at this location.  All you need to do is find and retrieve them.  There may be threats nearby, but unlike most tasks, no special guards are on-site.  A minimal reward, but little risk."
msgstr "一小团翘曲能量在此处留下了碎片。去找到它们然后带回家。附近可能存在危险，但不同于其他大部分任务，区域内没有特殊怪物。低收益但低风险。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 5 un-zombified birds this expedition"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Are the birds around here…  sparkling?  It seems even the local wildlife has started absorbing latent warp energy.  Kill at least 5 non-zombie birds of any kind before returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr "周围环绕的鸟……在闪闪发光？似乎连当地的野生动物也开始吸收翘曲能量了。杀死至少5只未丧尸化的鸟类，回到空岛后可获得额外的翘曲碎片。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 5 un-zombified mammals this expedition"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Are the critters around here…  sparkling?  It seems even the local wildlife has started absorbing latent warp energy.  Kill at least 5 non-zombie mammals of any kind before returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr "这里的小动物……在闪闪发光？似乎连当地的野生动物也开始吸收翘曲能量了。杀死至少5只未丧尸化的哺乳动物，回到空岛后可获得额外的翘曲碎片。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Find the warp shards!"
msgstr "寻找翘曲碎片！"

#. ~ Description of mission "Reach one of the exit points!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "If you want to get home with your stuff, you'll need to reach one of these nearby exit points.  They're only things that can bring you back to your sanctuary island in one piece."
msgstr "如果您想带着东西回家，您需要到达附近的出口之一。  它们是唯一能把你完整地带回你的庇护岛的东西。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "It's done.  They're all dead.  Warp shards filter in from seams in reality.  Your reward rains down on you."
msgstr "搞定。它们都被解决了。翘曲碎片从现实裂缝中渗透出来，奖励如雨点般降临在你身上。"

