#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_safely_landed"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Something went wrong.  The game could not find a suitable teleport location.  Please try using the obelisk again."
msgstr "出了点问题。  游戏找不到合适的传送位置。  请再次尝试使用方尖碑。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill a Mi-Go this expedition"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "The mi-go have sucked up latent energies which must be released into the stream of warp once more.  Kill at least one mi-go creature before returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr "这些米戈吸收了潜在的能量，这些能量必须重新释放到翘曲之中。杀死至少1只米戈，回到空岛后可获得额外的翘曲碎片。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the interloper!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "The warp has marked a single human being for death.  They will likely carry a melee weapon.  They will be alone.  Their sins are not your concern.  All you need to know is that it must be done."
msgstr "亚空间标志着一个人的死亡。  他们可能会携带近战武器。  他们将孤独一人。  他们的罪孽与你无关。  您需要知道的是必须完成它。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the armed interloper!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "The warp has marked a single human being for death.  They will likely carry a ranged weapon.  They will be alone.  Their sins are not your concern.  All you need to know is that it must be done."
msgstr "亚空间标志着一个人的死亡。  他们可能会携带远程武器。  他们将孤独一人。  他们的罪孽与你无关。  您需要知道的是必须完成它。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the guarded interlopers!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "The warp has marked human beings for death.  They may be accompanied.  Their sins are not your concern.  All you need to know is that it must be done."
msgstr "亚空间给人类标记了死亡。  他们可能会陪同。  他们的罪孽与你无关。  您需要知道的是必须完成它。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_safely_landed"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "You're still materializing and not fully visible yet.  In about <global_val:invistime> seconds, the world will be able to see you, so if you were warped into danger, now's your chance to get to cover."
msgstr "你仍在显现，尚未完全可见。  大约 <global_val:invistime> 秒后，全世界将能够看到您，因此，如果您陷入危险，现在是您躲避的机会。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_safely_landed"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid ""
"You've arrived!\n"
"Press a key when ready and random missions will be generated for this expedition.  This may take another minute."
msgstr ""
"你已抵达区域！\n"
"按下任意键继续，随机任务将会生成，这可能需要一分钟的时间。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 10 Zombies this expedition"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream of warp once more.  Kill at least 10 zombified humans or creatures before returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr "这些丧尸吸收了潜在的能量，这些能量必须重新释放到翘曲之中。杀死至少10只丧尸化人类或生物，回到空岛后可获得额外的翘曲碎片。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 100 Zombies this expedition"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream of warp once more.  Kill at least 100 zombified humans or creatures before returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr "这些丧尸吸收了潜在的能量，这些能量必须重新释放到翘曲之中。杀死至少100只丧尸化人类或生物，回到空岛后可获得额外的翘曲碎片。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 50 Zombies this expedition"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream of warp once more.  Kill at least 50 zombified humans or creatures before returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr "这些丧尸吸收了潜在的能量，这些能量必须重新释放到翘曲之中。杀死至少50只丧尸化人类或生物，回到空岛后可获得额外的翘曲碎片。"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Sky Island"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/modinfo.json
msgid "Note: This is an outdated version of TGW's mod and may cause issues until we are able to get it updated.  Use with caution!  An attempt at an entirely new way to play CDDA, inspired by games like Escape from Tarkov and Dark and Darker.  Begin on a floating island in the sky and warp down to random spots on the earth below to conduct expeditions for items you need.  Permadeath is gone - you will return to the island on death but lose any items you had on you.  Build up your stockpile, carry out missions for unique rewards, customize your home island, unlock upgrades, and be prudent about what you take on any given outing.  Be aware that 'PLAY NOW' will NOT work, you MUST make a custom character."
msgstr "注意：这是 TGW 模组的过时版本，在我们更新之前可能会导致问题。  谨慎使用！  受到《逃离塔科夫》和《黑暗与黑暗》等游戏的启发，尝试一种全新的 CDDA 游戏方式。  从天空中的浮岛开始，然后降落到地面上的随机地点，进行探险以获取您需要的物品。  永久死亡已经消失——你将在死亡后返回岛上，但会失去身上的所有物品。  建立你的库存，执行任务以获得独特的奖励，定制你的家乡岛屿，解锁升级，并谨慎对待你在任何特定郊游中携带的物品。  请注意，“立即玩”不起作用，您必须创建自定义角色。"

#. ~ MOD name
#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_skyisland"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/modinfo.json data/mods/Sky_Island/scenario.json
msgid "Sky Island"
msgstr "浮空岛"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_statue"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
msgid "A longer expedition that offers twice the time.  Missions and exits will be scattered over a wider area.  You will have more opportunity to dig deeper into surrounding points of interest, but also need more time to travel.  Missions offer extra warp shards as rewards."
msgstr "一次更长的探险，提供两倍的时间。  任务和出口将分散在更广阔的区域。  你将有更多的机会深入挖掘周边的景点，但也需要更多的时间去旅行。  任务提供额外的扭曲碎片作为奖励。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_statue"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
msgid "A simple, brief expedition at the normal time limit.  Missions and exits will be close together.  A good chance to quickly gather supplies and experience.  NOTE: Due to code limitations, this may take several real-life minutes to initate for the first time during a run."
msgstr "在正常时间限制内进行一次简单、简短的探险。  任务和出口将靠近。  快速收集物资和经验的好机会。  注意：由于代码限制，在运行过程中首次启动可能需要几分钟的时间。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_statue"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
msgid "A very long expedition that triples the time limit.  Missions and exits will be very far away.  You will have time for extended activities, but a good deal of your time will be spent trying to reach objectives over potentially dangerous terrain.  Missions offer even more warp shards as rewards."
msgstr "一次非常漫长的探险，时间限制增加了三倍。  任务和出口将会很远。  您将有时间进行扩展活动，但您的大量时间将花在试图在潜在危险的地形上达到目标上。  任务提供更多的扭曲碎片作为奖励。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
msgid "Arrive in a barren field.  This usually means landing in the open wilderness, but there's always the chance you'll find yourself at an empty lot in town."
msgstr "到达一片荒芜的田野。  这通常意味着降落在开阔的荒野中，但你总是有可能发现自己身处城镇的空地。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
msgid "Arrive inside an underground basement.  This will tend to put you somewhere in suburbia, but there are always exceptions."
msgstr "到达地下地下室。  这往往会把你带到郊区的某个地方，但总有例外。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
msgid "Arrive on a building roof someplace.  Usually this means houses, but you never know for sure.  This will always be one story off the ground."
msgstr "到达某处建筑物屋顶。  通常这意味着房屋，但你永远无法确定。  这永远是一个不切实际的故事。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
msgid ""
"Arrive somewhere in a subterranean science lab.  This is a highly dangerous method.  Due to the dimensional shielding these labs project, this expedition will cost 1 Labs Catalyst to begin.\n"
"BE WARNED!  You will begin inside a sealed lab, so make sure you have the means to get out!  A second card, to unlock the surface exit, is one option.  You may also consider a homeward mote or a warp skyward beacon."
msgstr ""
"到达地下科学实验室的某个地方。  这是一种非常危险的方法。  由于这些实验室项目的维度屏蔽，这次探险将花费 1 个实验室催化剂来开始。\n"
"请注意！  你将从一个密封的实验室开始，所以请确保你有办法出去！  一种选择是使用第二张卡来解锁表面出口。  你也可以考虑一个回家的微粒或一个扭曲的天空信标。"

