#. ~ Description of "Alpha Secure Container"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/secure_container.json
msgid "The most secure storage possible, even if it is tiny.  This metaphysical container is unique in that it is the only storage that will keep its contents on death.  Everything else will still be lost."
