#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Greater trespasses against the flow of the warpstream reveal themselves to you.  This interference cannot go unpunished.\n"
"The missions you are randomly assigned in each expedition are more varied, and can now pull from harder and more rewarding challenges."
msgstr ""
"对亚空间流的更大的侵犯向你展现了出来。  这种干扰不可能不受惩罚。\n"
"您在每次探险中随机分配的任务更加多样化，现在可以从更困难、更有价值的挑战中获取。"

