#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Mouth of the Island"
msgid_plural "Mouth of the Islands"
msgstr[0] "岛口"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that work on the island bunker has begun, a large central room would be ideal.  With all the loot you'll be scavenging on expeditions, it could make a useful storeroom and crafting center.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 1.  A hollow chamber beneath the island's center to serve as a multipurpose space, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"现在岛上掩体的工作已经开始，一个大的中央房间将是理想的选择。  有了你在探险中收集的所有战利品，它可以成为一个有用的储藏室和制作中心。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：主房间 1. 位于岛中心下方的空心房间，用作多功能空间，具有大量的扩展空间。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that you have a bunker under the island, you have a place to live.  But the small glass roof doesn't let in a lot of light; a larger skylight would be ideal.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Central Skylight 2.  A larger skylight over the main room."
msgstr ""
"现在你在岛下有了一个掩体，你就有了住的地方。  但小玻璃屋顶透光不多；更大的天窗将是理想的选择。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：中央天窗 2.主房间上方更大的天窗。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that you have corridors snaking beneath your island, you could build rooms in various areas.  The eastern quadrant might be a good place for another room.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: East Room 1.  A hollow chamber to the east of the island's center to serve as a multipurpose space, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"现在你的岛屿下方有蜿蜒的走廊，你可以在不同的区域建造房间。  东象限可能是另一个房间的好地方。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：东房 1. 位于岛中心以东的空心房间，用作多用途空间，有大量的扩展空间。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that you have corridors snaking beneath your island, you could build rooms in various areas.  The northern quadrant might be a good place for another room.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: North Room 1.  A hollow chamber to the north of the island's center with one wall a long window to look down on the world, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"现在你的岛屿下方有蜿蜒的走廊，你可以在不同的区域建造房间。  北象限可能是另一个房间的好地方。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：北房 1. 岛中心以北的一个中空房间，一面墙有一个长窗户，可以俯瞰世界，有大量的扩展空间。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that you have corridors snaking beneath your island, you could build rooms in various areas.  The western quadrant might be a good place for another room.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: West Room 1.  A hollow chamber to the west of the island's center to serve as a multipurpose space, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"现在你的岛屿下方有蜿蜒的走廊，你可以在不同的区域建造房间。  西象限可能是另一个房间的好地方。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：西房 1. 位于岛中心以西的空心房间，用作多用途空间，有大量的扩展空间。"

