#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Surreal Shield"
msgid_plural "Surreal Shields"
msgstr[0] "超现实盾牌"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"That you are still here, fighting on, makes your determination clear.  This new existence is strange and unpredictable, but you can adapt.  It's how you made it this far, and you're not about to stop now.\n"
"More unlockable upgrades will be available as you progress, and you may experience exits and targets in new locations."
msgstr ""
"你还在这里，继续战斗，这表明你的决心很明确。  这种新的存在是奇怪且不可预测的，但你可以适应。  这就是你走到这一步的方式，而且你现在不会停止。\n"
"随着您的进步，将提供更多可解锁的升级，并且您可能会在新位置遇到出口和目标。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The central room could use even more natural light.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Central Skylight 3.  Expand the skylight over the central room."
msgstr ""
"中央房间可以使用更多的自然光。  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：中央天窗 3. 将天窗扩展到中央房间。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The central room is a good start, but it could be much bigger.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 3.  Expand the central room to very generous dimensions."
msgstr ""
"中央房间是一个好的开始，但它可以更大。  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：主室 3. 将中央房间扩大到非常宽敞的尺寸。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The central room is big.  But not yet big enough.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 4.  Expand the central room to its maximum size."
msgstr ""
"中央房间很大。  但还不够大。  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：主房间 4. 将中央房间扩大到最大尺寸。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The central room would be a lot more useful if it were larger.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 2.  Expand the central room to fit more loot, furniture, or anything else you may need."
msgstr ""
"中央房间如果再大一点就更有用了。  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：主房间 2. 扩大中央房间以容纳更多战利品、家具或您可能需要的任何其他物品。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The central skylight should be enormous to allow in as much light as possible.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Central Skaylight 4.  Expand the central skylight to very generous dimensions."
msgstr ""
"中央天窗应该很大，以允许尽可能多的光线进入。  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：中央天窗 4. 将中央天窗扩展至非常宽敞的尺寸。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The eastern room is a good start, but it could be much bigger.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: East Room 3.  Expand the eastern room to very generous dimensions."
msgstr ""
"东边的房间是一个好的开始，但它可以更大。  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：东房 3. 将东房扩大到非常宽敞的尺寸。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The eastern room is a nice size, but you're on a floating island.  What if you had a place where you could admire the beautiful view without having to worry about the blowing winds?  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: East Room Gallery.  Add an enclosed gallery to the eastern room to allow viewing off the side of the island."
msgstr ""
"东边的房间面积不错，但你是在一个浮岛上。  如果你有一个地方可以欣赏美丽的景色而不必担心风吹，那该多好？  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：东室画廊。  在东侧房间添加一个封闭的画廊，以便可以观看岛的侧面。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The eastern room would be a lot more useful if it were larger.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: East Room 2.  Expand the eastern room to fit more loot, furniture, or anything else you may need."
msgstr ""
"东边的房间如果再大一点就更有用了。  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：东侧房间 2. 扩大东侧房间以容纳更多战利品、家具或您可能需要的任何其他物品。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The greatest trespasses against the island now glimmer in the dark, guiding your hand as a tool of order.  Return these chaotic energies to the tranquility of the warpstream.\n"
"The missions you are randomly assigned in each expedition are even more varied, and can now pull from the hardest and most rewarding challenges."
msgstr ""
"对岛屿的最大侵犯现在在黑暗中闪烁，引导你的手作为秩序的工具。  让这些混乱的能量回归亚空间流的宁静。\n"
"您在每次探险中随机分配的任务更加多样化，现在可以从最困难和最有价值的挑战中获取。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The island seems to be a suitable safe haven for staging future expeditions, but while there's no threat of monsters, it's still harshly exposed to the elements.  Having even minimal covered shelter would go a long way towards helping you rest and recuperate between expeditions.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Bunker Entrance.  A simple concrete entrance leading down into the lower levels of the island, including a small subterranean chamber."
msgstr ""
"该岛似乎是未来探险的合适避风港，但虽然没有怪物的威胁，但它仍然暴露在恶劣的环境中。  即使拥有最小的有盖庇护所也会对帮助您在探险之间休息和恢复大有帮助。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：地堡入口。  一个简单的混凝土入口通向岛屿的较低层，包括一个小型地下房间。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The island speaks in your head using words you cannot translate yet already understand.  Its wishes are your commands.\n"
"In every future expedition, you will now be given a randomly generated mission, from which you can earn valuable warp shards."
msgstr ""
"这座岛屿在你的脑海中用你无法翻译但已经理解的词语说话。  它的愿望就是你的命令。\n"
"在未来的每次探险中，您现在都会收到一个随机生成的任务，从中您可以获得宝贵的扭曲碎片。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The northern room is a good start, but it could be much bigger.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: North Room 3.  Expand the northern room to very generous dimensions."
msgstr ""
"北面的房间是一个好的开始，但它可以更大。  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：北房 3. 将北房扩大到非常宽敞的尺寸。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
