"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: North Room 2.  Expand the northern room to fit more loot, furniture, or anything else you may need."
msgstr ""
"北边的房间如果更大一些，窗户也更大的话，会更有用。  是时候去上班了。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新结构：北房 2. 扩大北房以容纳更多战利品、家具或您可能需要的任何其他物品。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "The strange metaphysical container churns inward with violent force, grinding loudly before suddenly expanding.  Your secure container can now carry more."
msgstr "奇异的玄容器，猛烈的向内翻腾，发出摩擦声，然后突然膨胀。  您的安全容器现在可以容纳更多。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "The strange metaphysical container suddenly snaps inward, clinging to the very core of your being.  Anything stored here will not be lost on death."
msgstr "这个奇怪的形而上学容器突然向内折断，紧贴着你存在的核心。  这里存储的任何东西在死亡时都不会丢失。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
