#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Those who disturb the warpstream must be put down.  There is no cruelty in this.  It is the order of the Island, and it will be kept.\n"
"In every future expedition, you will now be given 2 random missions."
msgstr ""
"那些扰乱亚空间流的人必须被镇压。  这并不残忍。  这是岛上的命令，我们会遵守。\n"
"在未来的每次探险中，您现在都会收到 2 个随机任务。"

