#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "When leaving from the warp obelisk, you can now guarantee you will begin your expedition in a basement.  Not glamorous, but at least it ensures you won't be stranded out in some desolate field."
msgstr "当离开亚空间方尖碑时，你现在可以保证你将在地下室开始你的探险。  不算光鲜亮丽，但至少可以保证你不会被困在荒凉的田野里。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "When leaving from the warp obelisk, you can now guarantee you will begin your expedition on some rooftop.  Dangerous, perhaps, but it ensures proximity to points of interest, and besides, there are all kinds of buildings this might land you on."
msgstr "当离开亚空间方尖碑时，你现在可以保证你会在某个屋顶上开始你的探险。  也许很危险，但它确保了靠近兴趣点，此外，还有各种各样的建筑物可能会让你着陆。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Will of the Island"
msgid_plural "Will of the Islands"
msgstr[0] "岛屿的意志"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"With some success under your belt, you feel ready to tackle more ambitious expeditions, and the island seems to know it.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select Large Expeditions when leaving via the warp obelisk.  Large Expeditions last 2x as long, but mission targets and exit points are significantly farther away."
msgstr ""
"取得了一些成功后，您感觉自己已经准备好进行更雄心勃勃的探险，而这座岛屿似乎也知道这一点。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果：当你通过曲速方尖碑离开时，你将能够选择大型探险。  大型探险的持续时间是原来的两倍，但任务目标和出口点距离要远得多。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Kappa"
#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"With the supplied recipe, you will be able to expand the capacity of your secure container to its maximum size.\n"
"\n"
"EMPTY YOUR SECURE CONTAINER FIRST!  Anything left inside when upgrading will be lost forever!"
msgstr ""
"使用提供的配方，您将能够将安全容器的容量扩展到最大尺寸。\n"
"\n"
"首先清空您的安全容器！  Anything left inside when upgrading will be lost forever!"

#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Beta"
#. ~ Player message in an effect
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Gamma"
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Epsilon"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"With the supplied recipe, you will be able to expand the capacity of your secure container.\n"
"\n"
"EMPTY YOUR SECURE CONTAINER FIRST!  Anything left inside when upgrading will be lost forever!"
msgstr ""
"使用提供的配方，您将能够扩展安全容器的容量。\n"
"\n"
"首先清空您的安全容器！  升级时留在里面的任何东西都将永远丢失！"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "With this upgrade, you're guaranteed to begin your expedition at an underground lab.  Be aware that you will need to have a Labs Catalyst on you when activating the warp obelisk, and these will be consumed on leaving."
msgstr "通过此升级，您一定会在地下实验室开始您的探险。  请注意，激活曲速方尖碑时，您需要携带实验室催化剂，这些催化剂将在离开时消耗。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"You are ready for a longer haul.\n"
"Large Expeditions are now available at the warp obelisk.  Exits and missions will be farther away, but you will have twice as long to spend earthside.  Use this time wisely, and set your sights on bigger targets.  What will you do with your newfound time?"
msgstr ""
"您已准备好进行更长时间的旅行。\n"
"大型探险现在可以在曲速方尖碑处进行。  出口和任务会更远，但你将有两倍的时间在地球上度过。  明智地利用这段时间，并把目光投向更大的目标。  你会用你的新时间做什么？"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"You are ready to ascend to a higher tier of strength and ability.  Complete this trial and prove yourself, and you will discover new powers for yourself and the island.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reach Rank 1.  Some upgrades and unlocks will not be available until you have ranked up.  You will also instantly learn several new warp-related crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"您已准备好提升到更高的力量和能力水平。  完成这次考验并证明自己，你将为自己和岛屿发现新的力量。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果：达到排名 1。某些升级和解锁只有在排名上升后才能使用。  您还将立即学习一些新的与扭曲相关的制作配方。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"You are ready to ascend to a higher tier of strength and ability.  Complete this trial and prove yourself, and you will discover new powers for yourself and the island.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reach Rank 2.  Some upgrades and unlocks will not be available until you have ranked up.  You will also instantly learn several new warp-related crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"您已准备好提升到更高的力量和能力水平。  完成这次考验并证明自己，你将为自己和岛屿发现新的力量。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果：达到排名 2。某些升级和解锁只有在排名上升后才能使用。  您还将立即学习一些新的与扭曲相关的制作配方。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"You close your eyes and through the flow of turbulent warpstream, an invisible maze manifests.  A thousand potential passages brush smooth stone across your consciousness, and the meaning of this reality glimmers faintly, a dancing splinter of light in the distance.  You've been here before, you are here now, and you will be here again.\n"
"When you open your eyes, you're back where you began.  You haven't moved, but it feels as though the world has.\n"
"\n"
"In every future expedition, you will now be able to find two different locations you can exit from."
msgstr ""
"你闭上眼睛，穿过湍急的亚空间流，一个看不见的迷宫显现出来。  一千条潜在的通道在你的意识中掠过光滑的石头，这个现实的意义微弱地闪烁着，就像远处舞动的光的碎片。  你以前来过这里，现在你在这里，你还会再来这里。\n"
"当你睁开眼睛时，你又回到了起点。  你没有动，但感觉整个世界都动了。\n"
"\n"
"在未来的每次探险中，您现在将能够找到两个可以退出的不同位置。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Alpha"
#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"You have been granted the recipe to craft an Alpha Secure Container.  This little miracle defies the very laws of physics and insists upon its own permanence.  In short, it will give you an integrated pocket you can always access.  The contents of this pocket are completely secure and will not be lost, even if you die and are returned to the island.\n"
"\n"
"You can only ever equip one secure container."
msgstr ""
"您已获得制作阿尔法安全容器的配方。  这个小奇迹违背了物理定律，并坚持其自身的永久性。  简而言之，它将为您提供一个可以随时取用的集成口袋。  这个口袋里的东西是完全安全的，即使你死了并返回岛上也不会丢失。\n"
"\n"
"您只能装备一个安全容器。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"You have proved your ability to survive to the island, to the warpstream, and to yourself.\n"
"More unlockable upgrades will be available as you progress, and you may experience exits and targets in new locations."
msgstr ""
"你已经向岛屿、亚空间流以及你自己证明了自己的生存能力。\n"
"随着您的进步，将提供更多可解锁的升级，并且您可能会在新位置遇到出口和目标。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"You're in it to win it, and are prepared to take a long time exploring the world below.\n"
"Extended Expeditions are now available at the warp obelisk.  Exits and missions will be much farther away, but you will have three times as long to spend earthside.  Pack supplies for a day trip and be sure to bring plenty of storage space.  Where will you go with your newfound time?"
msgstr ""
"您参与其中是为了赢得胜利，并准备好花很长时间探索下面的世界。\n"
"现在可以在曲速方尖碑处进行扩展探险。  出口和任务会更远，但你将有三倍的时间在地球上度过。  带上一日游所需的用品，并确保携带足够的存储空间。  新的时间你会去哪里？"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"You've seen enough safe returns to know your way around an expedition.  Now if you could spend even more time earthside, you'd be able to tackle even bigger and more ambitious goals.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select Extended Expeditions when leaving via the warp obelisk.  Extended Expeditions last 3x as long, but mission targets and exit points are much farther away."
msgstr ""
"您已经见过足够多的安全返回，足以了解探险的方式。  现在，如果您能花更多的时间在地球上，您就能够实现更大、更雄心勃勃的目标。\n"
"已经学会了新的食谱。  制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果：当你通过曲速方尖碑离开时，你将能够选择扩展探险。  长途探险的持续时间是原来的 3 倍，但任务目标和出口点距离更远。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Your focus tightens.  Landing points will reveal more of the map, and your warpcloak will last 100 seconds at the beginning of every expedition."
msgstr "你的注意力更加集中。  着陆点将显示更多地图，并且您的曲速斗篷将在每次探险开始时持续 100 秒。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
