#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Your focus tightens.  Landing points will reveal more of the map, and your warpcloak will last 90 seconds at the beginning of every expedition."
msgstr "你的注意力更加集中。  着陆点将显示更多地图，并且您的曲速斗篷将在每次探险开始时持续 90 秒。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your mind expands.  You have learned to craft:\n"
"Homeward mote\n"
"Autodoc copyplate\n"
msgstr ""
"你的思维会扩展。  你已经学会了制作：\n"
"归家微尘\n"
"自动文档复制板\n"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your mind expands.  You have learned to craft:\n"
"Materialize random artifact\n"
"Vortex token\n"
"Warped hauler's harness\n"
"Warped animal carrier"
msgstr ""
"你的思维会扩展。  你已经学会了制作：\n"
"实现随机工件\n"
"漩涡令牌\n"
"搬运工的背带变形\n"
"扭曲的动物载体"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Your resistance to the chaos of the warpstream increases.  In every future expedition, you will be able to endure an additional warp pulse and stay earthside longer."
msgstr "你对扭曲流混乱的抵抗力增强了。  在未来的每一次探险中，你将能够忍受额外的曲速脉冲并在地球上停留更长时间。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your strength is an extension of the island's will.  Let order be maintained.\n"
"In every future expedition, you will now be given 3 random missions."
msgstr ""
"你的力量是岛屿意志的延伸。  让秩序得以维持。\n"
"在未来的每次探险中，您现在将获得 3 个随机任务。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Your vision expands.  Future missions and exits will be provide exceptional scouting."
msgstr "你的视野会扩大。  未来的任务和出口将提供特殊的侦察。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Your vision expands.  Future missions and exits will be scouted just a little better."
msgstr "你的视野会扩大。  未来的任务和出口将会被更好地侦察。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Your vision expands.  Future missions and exits will provide a huge scouting radius."
msgstr "你的视野会扩大。  未来的任务和出口将提供巨大的侦察半径。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Your vision expands.  Future missions and exits will provide better map scouting."
msgstr "你的视野会扩大。  未来的任务和出口将提供更好的地图侦察。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid "Your vision expands.  Future missions and exits will provide even better scouting on your map."
msgstr "你的视野会扩大。  未来的任务和出口将在您的地图上提供更好的侦察。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/alt_map_key/modinfo.json
msgid "Alternative Map Key"
