#. ~ Description of gun "C7 assault rifle"
#. ~ Description of "C7 assault rifle"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "The C7A1 is the standard issue rifle for the Canadian military manufactured by Diemaco.  It is a gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle known for its accuracy and controllable recoil."
msgstr "C7A1 步枪是迪玛科公司为加拿大军方所制造的制式步枪。这是一种转拴式气动步枪，以其高命中率和易于掌控的后坐力而出名。"

#. ~ Description of gun "C6"
#. ~ Description of "C6"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "The Colt Canada C6 is a general-purpose machine gun developed to replace the .30-caliber C5 GPMG.  Heavy and difficult to handle fired from the shoulder, as most people aren't action-movie heroes."
msgstr "柯尔特公司出品的Canada M6是一种通用机枪，旨在取代.30口径的 C5 通用机枪。它十分沉重，由于大多数人不是动作片中的英雄，抵肩射击发射时也很难控制。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pump action varmint rifle" of gun "Winchester
#. 1890"
#. ~ Description of variant "Winchester 1890" of item "pump action varmint
#. rifle"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "The Winchester 1890 is a pump action rifle, chambered in .22 LR.  Holds 15 rounds of ammo, so go get plinking!"
msgstr "Winchester 1890 是一款泵动式步枪，使用 0.22 LR 口径。  可容纳 15 发子弹，所以去吧！"

#. ~ Description of variant "C8 carbine" of gun "C8"
#. ~ Description of variant "C8" of item "C8 carbine"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "The standard issue carbine for the Canadian armed forces, featuring a 14.5 in. long barrel and full auto capabilities when fed from STANAG magazines."
msgstr "加拿大武装部队所使用的制式卡宾枪，配备一根14.5英寸(约37厘米)长的枪管，使用STANAG弹匣时能全自动射击。"

#. ~ Description of variant "C7 assault rifle" of gun "C7"
#. ~ Description of variant "C7" of item "C7 assault rifle"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "The standard issue rifle for the Canadian armed forces, featuring a 20 in. long barrel and full auto capabilities when fed from STANAG magazines."
msgstr "加拿大武装部队所使用的制式步枪，配备一根20英寸(约50厘米)长的枪管，使用STANAG弹匣时能全自动射击。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M1911A1"
#. ~ Description of "M1911A1"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "This is a semi-automatic pistol, chambered in .45 ACP and accepting M1911 magazines."
msgstr "一把 .45 ACP 口径的半自动手枪，可使用 M1911 弹匣。"

#. ~ Description of variant "C7 assault rifle" of gun "C7A1"
#. ~ Description of variant "C7A1" of item "C7 assault rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "C8 carbine" of gun "C8CQB"
#. ~ Description of variant "C8CQB" of item "C8 carbine"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "This is the updated model of the C7 carbine, using a modified Weaver rail instead of a carrying handle/iron sight assembly to assist in mounting optics."
msgstr "这是C7步枪的升级型号，使用改进的韦弗式导轨，而非原本的拉柄/机瞄组件，可以用来协助安装其他瞄具。"

