#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
msgid "Dark Days of the Dead"
msgstr "亡者暗日"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Dark Days of the Dead"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
msgid "Turns the game into a classic Romero zombie game.  You must destroy the brain.  Getting bitten is fatal.  However, zombies don't evolve, and when they're down, they're down.  Removes the sci-fi and interdimensional aspects of CDDA."
msgstr "将游戏变成经典的罗梅罗丧尸游戏。你必须摧毁大脑。被咬伤将会致命。而且，丧尸们不会进化，它们倒下后，就真倒下了。移除原版CDDA的科幻和异界元素。"

#. ~ Message describing the effect of hitting the "leg_mangled" weakpoint
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/monsters/weakpoints.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is knocked down, and doesn't look like it can get back up!"
msgstr "%s 被击倒了，而且看上去再也站不起来了！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid "Find Antivirals Before You Die!"
msgstr "在你死之前找到抗病毒药！"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONSUMED_ANTIVIRAL"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid "Some of the lesions on your skin have begun to heal, but the itchiness remains."
msgstr "你皮肤上的一些损伤已经开始愈合，但瘙痒仍然存在。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONSUMED_ANTIVIRAL"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid "You no longer feel uncomfortably itchy, but your skin is still concerningly pale."
msgstr "你不再发痒，但你的皮肤仍然苍白得令人担忧。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONSUMED_ANTIVIRAL"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid "You seem to be feeling a little better, but the prickling sensation remains."
msgstr "你似乎感觉好点了，但刺痛感依然存在。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUMED_ANTIVIRAL"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUMED_ANTIVIRAL"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
