#. ~ Description of furniture "bulletin board"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A crude approximation of a 'real' bulletin board.  Good for pinning various notices for other survivors to read."
msgstr "一个对\"真正\"的告示牌的大致仿制品。也很适合订一些告示上去让其他幸存者来阅读。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fermenting vat"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A sealable vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."
msgstr "一个可以被密封的发酵罐，可用于食醋或者各种酒类的发酵。"

#. ~ Construction group name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "Build Innawood Bulletin Board"
msgstr "建造原始告示牌"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pavement"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A segment of asphalt, slowly degrading from cracks, frost heaves and lack of maintenance."
msgstr "一段铺了柏油的路面，因为裂缝、冻胀和缺乏维护而逐渐老化。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Book Hating"
msgstr "讨厌读书"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Book Hating"
msgstr "讨厌读书"

#. ~ Description of profession "Book Hating" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Reading is for nerds!  You've managed to make hatred of the written word a central part of your identity.  Or, perhaps, you have a barrier that makes books additionally challenging and frustrating for you.  Whatever the reason, boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun by reading books."
msgstr "读书是给书呆子的！你已经成功地将对文字的仇恨作为你认知身份的核心。或者，也许你有阅读障碍，读书对你来说更具挑战且让人沮丧。不管是什么原因，枯燥的书变得更枯燥，而且你不能从读书中获得乐趣。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Book Hating" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Reading is for nerds!  You've managed to make hatred of the written word a central part of your identity.  Or, perhaps, you have a barrier that makes books additionally challenging and frustrating for you.  Whatever the reason, boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun by reading books."
msgstr "读书是给书呆子的！你已经成功地将对文字的仇恨作为你认知身份的核心。或者，也许你有阅读障碍，读书对你来说更具挑战且让人沮丧。不管是什么原因，枯燥的书变得更枯燥，而且你不能从读书中获得乐趣。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift transformer"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid "A bundle of cables around an iron core.  Useful for controlling voltage."
msgstr "一圈围绕着铁芯的电线。用来控制电压。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift hand-crank charger"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid "A makeshift hand-powered battery charger based on homopolar generator."
msgstr "基于单极发电机的临时手动电池充电器。"

#. ~ Description of "electrolysis kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid "A set of wiring and electrodes for applying a direct current, usually to a liquid.  Useful for crafting.  Load with a storage battery or 12V vehicle battery to use."
msgstr "一整套能够进行直流电电解的线缆和电极设备，通常使用在液体上。可以用来制造物品。需要安装一个蓄电池或者12V的载具电池配合使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid "makeshift hand-crank charger"
msgid_plural "makeshift hand-crank chargers"
msgstr[0] "手摇充电器"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid "makeshift transformer"
msgid_plural "makeshift transformers"
msgstr[0] "简易变压器"

#. ~ Description of "fresh honeydew"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/food_other.json
msgid "Turgid, but still liquid honeydew, fresh from the… bug."
msgstr "十分饱满，但仍然是液体状蜜露，鲜榨自……虫子体内。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/food_other.json
msgid "fresh honeydew"
msgid_plural "fresh honeydew"
msgstr[0] "新鲜蜜露"

#. ~ Description of "torch"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/lighting.json
msgid "This is a large stick, wrapped in rags that are soaked with a flammable material.  It is burning, producing plenty of light."
msgstr "浸透了可燃材料的布胡乱地缠在棍子上，正在燃烧，光芒四射。"

#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/lighting.json
msgid "This is a specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil lamp.  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to be extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not provide much light, but lasts a long time.  It is lit, consuming oil and providing light.  Use it to extinguish the flame."
msgstr "一个带有灯芯的特殊小陶罐，是一种古老的油灯形式。与更新的设计不同，它不防风，因此如果暴露在风中，火焰可能会熄灭；最好在室内使用。它已经被点燃，消耗灯油并提供光亮。使用它以熄灭火焰。"

#. ~ Description of "oil lamp"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/lighting.json
msgid "This is an oil fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "一盏用石油燃料的油灯，灯光虽然不是很亮，但是可以持续亮很久。使用可以熄灭油灯。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/lighting.json
msgid "oil lamp"
msgid_plural "oil lamps"
msgstr[0] "油灯（开）"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark bandage"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid "A small roll of birchbark with cord, to tie around wounds to help stop bleeding and protect from dirt.  It's better than nothing."
msgstr "一小卷桦树皮，用绳子绑在伤口周围，帮助止血和防止污垢。总比什么都没有好。"

#. ~ Description of "salved birchbark bandage"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid "Birchbark bandages with added garlic salve.  They're better for wounds but not as good as real bandages."
msgstr "涂了大蒜膏桦树皮绷带。它们对伤口更好，但不如真正的绷带好。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid "birchbark bandage"
msgid_plural "birchbark bandages"
msgstr[0] "桦皮绷带"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid "salved birchbark bandage"
msgid_plural "salved birchbark bandages"
msgstr[0] "涂膏桦皮绷带"

#. ~ Description of "glue"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid "A thick, goopy glue that cures fast."
msgstr "一种粘稠的胶水，固化速度快。"

#. ~ Description of "slow-sand water filter"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "An improvised water filter made from a clay hydria filled with a layer of sand and a layer of gravel.  It can be used to remove particulates and some pathogens from water, but it is not 100% effective."
msgstr "一种由粘土水螅制成的简易滤水器，里面填充了一层沙子和一层砾石。  它可以用来去除水中的颗粒物和一些病原体，但并不是100%有效。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy battery shell"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid "This is the outer casing of a heavy battery.  It will need to be refilled to be useful."
msgstr "这是重型电池的外壳。需要重新装填才能使用。"

#. ~ Description of "light battery shell"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid "This is the outer casing of a light battery.  It will need to be refilled to be useful."
msgstr "这是轻型电池的外壳。需要重新装填才能使用。"

#. ~ Description of "medium battery shell"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid "This is the outer casing of a medium battery.  It will need to be refilled to be useful."
msgstr "这是中型电池的外壳。需要重新装填才能使用。"

