#. ~ Description of "fibercloth sheet"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid "A 12 inch by 24 inch sheet of fabric woven from plant fiber, suitable for making clothing."
msgstr "一片12英寸×24英寸(约30厘米×61厘米)植物纤维织成的织物面料，可以用来制造衣物。"

#. ~ Description of "fibercloth patch"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid "A 6 inch square fibercloth patch, suitable for use in repairing and tailoring of clothing."
msgstr "一块6英寸(约15厘米)见方的纤维布片，可以用来修补或缝制衣物。"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Kevlar cutters"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid "These are a pair of heavy-duty shears with a blade suitable for cutting particularly tough materials, from polyaramid fabrics to tough plastics and thin metals.  The blades feature a flat shearing edge and a fine serration."
msgstr "这是一对坚固耐用的剪刀，锋利的刀片能切开特别坚韧的材料，从聚胺纤维到硬塑料和薄金属板。刀片既具有平坦的剪切边缘也有细密的锯齿。"

#. ~ Description of "tailor's kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid "This is a high quality kit consisting of a variety of needles, some wooden spools for thread, some small scissors, and an awl.  Use a tailor's kit to customize your clothing and armor.  This uses your tailoring skill."
msgstr "一个装着各种针、几卷线，几把小剪刀，以及一把锥子的高品质缝纫套件。使用它可以修改你的衣服和装甲。它主要运用你的裁缝技能。"

#. ~ Description of "sewing kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid "This is a wrapped leather kit with a variety of needles, some wooden spools for thread, small scissors, and a few other useful textile tools.  Use a sewing kit on an article of clothing to attempt to repair or reinforce that clothing.  This uses your tailoring skill."
msgstr "这个包好的皮箱里面有各种针、木头线轴、小剪刀和其他有用的缝纫工具。在服装类物品上使用，可以尝试修理或加固该衣物。这会用到你的缝纫技能。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid "fibercloth patch"
msgid_plural "fibercloth patches"
msgstr[0] "纤维布片"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
