#. ~ Description of "blacksmith repair kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_workshop.json
msgid "This is a set of tools to repair damaged metal tools and armor.  It uses charcoal, contained in a small clay vessel, to heat the part and make it easier to work."
msgstr "这是一套修复受损金属工具和护甲的工具。它用装在小型陶制容器中的木炭加热工件，使其更容易加工。"

