#. ~ Description of "iron ore"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A chunk of iron-rich earth.  Could be refined with a bloomery."
msgstr "一块富含铁的泥土。可以用锻铁炉来提炼生铁。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of cassiterite"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A large chunk of cassiterite, an ore of tin.  It only needs to be smelted into a usable form."
msgstr "一大块锡石，锡的矿石形态。它只需进一步加工成更加便于制造的大小。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of cinnabar "
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A large chunk of cinnabar, an ore of mercury.  It is also the historic source for vermilion pigment."
msgstr "一大块朱砂，一种汞矿石。它也是曾经朱红色颜料的原料。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of native copper"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A large chunk of copper, in its native state.  It only needs to be worked into a more usable shape."
msgstr "一大块天然铜块。它只需进一步加工成更加便于制造的大小。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of galena"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A large chunk of galena, a lead ore with small amounts of silver.  It only needs to be smelted into a usable form."
msgstr "一大块方铅石，含银的铅的矿石形态。它只需进一步加工成更加便于制造的大小。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of hematite"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A large chunk of hematite, an ore of iron.  It only needs to be smelted into a usable form."
msgstr "一大块赤铁矿，铁的矿石形态。它只需进一步加工成更加便于制造的大小。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of magnetite"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A large chunk of magnetite, a ferrimagnetic oxide of iron.  It can be magnetized to become a permanent magnet itself."
msgstr "一大块赤铁矿，铁的矿石形态。它只需进一步加工成更加便于制造的大小。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of native aluminum"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A large chunk of native aluminum, which would have been priceless before other ways to obtain aluminum were invented.  It needs to be cast into an ingot."
msgstr "一大块天然铝块，在电解铝法被发明之前是无价之宝。它需要被铸成铝锭。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of native gold"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A large chunk of native gold, a rare find.  It only needs to be molded into a more usable shape."
msgstr "一大块天然金块。它只需进一步加工成更加便于制造的大小。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of native silver"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid "A large chunk of silver, in its native state.  It only needs to be molded into a more usable shape."
msgstr "一大块天然银块。它只需进一步加工成更加便于制造的大小。"

