#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Swordswoman" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "As a member of your tribe's elite guard, you sharpened your swordsmanship to the best that you could.  Now, you're a rōnin of the woods."
msgstr "作为你们部落中的精英护卫，你一直磨练着你的剑艺，日复一日。现在你得在森林中当浪人了。"

