#. ~ Description of profession "Spear Hunter" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and quickly developed a talent for chasing down your prey with a spear.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at your side more than your trusty spear.  So, when it did, you made sure to bring it along."
msgstr "打小你就喜欢打猎。很快你就获得了用长矛追捕狩猎的才能。不容置疑，如果世界毁灭了，能陪伴你的没有任何事物，只有能让你信赖的长矛。所以，世界毁灭时，你确保自己带上了它。"

