#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacker" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "For the past few years you've been traveling the world, sightseeing and living off tribal donations.  You came home to find your home abandoned, and the only thing between you and death is the open fields and your pack."
msgstr "在过去的几年里，你环游世界观光旅游，靠部落的捐款生活。你回家后发现世界已成废墟，而你和死亡之间的距离只有眼前的大路和你身后的背包。"

