#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Arbalist" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "From your first hunt, you showed talent with a crossbow.  While the tribe was well guarded by your aim, you're all alone now."
msgstr "自从你第一次狩猎，就展现出了你适用十字弩的天赋。尽管曾经你精密的瞄准将部落保护得很好，但最终你还是落到孤身一人的境地了。"

