#: src/consumption.cpp:808 src/consumption.cpp:827
msgid "That doesn't look edible."
msgstr "这看起来不能吃。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:823
msgid "That doesn't look edible to you."
msgstr "那对你来说似乎并不好吃。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:832
msgid "That doesn't look edible in its current form."
msgstr "这看起来目前还不能吃。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:837
msgid "This is full of dirt after being on the ground."
msgstr "它太脏了，沾满了泥土，不能食用。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:849 src/creature.cpp:471 src/iuse_actor.cpp:1592 src/iuse_actor.cpp:2255 src/iuse_actor.cpp:2382 src/iuse_actor.cpp:2561
msgid "You can't do that while underwater."
msgstr "你在水下时无法这样做。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:856
msgid "We can't eat that.  It's not right for us."
msgstr "吾等不可食用此物。那不适合吾等。"

