msgstr "召回同伴（收集柴火）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:919
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to do low level chores and sort supplies.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: fabrication\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Material left in the unsorted loot zone will be sorted into a defined loot zone.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Time: 3 Hours\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"说明：\n"
"选择一名同伴在营地内做低级杂务和物资分类的工作。\n"
"\n"
"技能：制造\n"
"需求等级：无\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 留在\"物资：待整理\"区中的物品将被分类并存放到对应的储存区。\n"
"\n"
"风险：无\n"
"耗时：3 小时\n"
"位置：%d/1\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:935
msgid " Recover Menial Laborer"
msgstr "召回同伴（干杂活）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:943
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to a nearby forest to cut logs.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: fabrication\n"
"Difficulty: 2\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> 50%% of trees/trunks at the forest position will be cut down.\n"
"> 100%% of total material will be brought back.\n"
"> Repeatable with diminishing returns.\n"
"> Will eventually turn forests into fields.\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Active\n"
"Time: 6 Hour Base + Travel Time + Cutting Time\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"说明：\n"
"选择一名同伴去附近森林中伐木。\n"
"\n"
"技能：制造\n"
"需求等级：2\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 森林区块内 50%% 的树和树干会被砍倒。\n"
"> 所砍倒树木 100%% 的材料会被带回营地。\n"
"> 可重复，但收益会逐渐减少。\n"
"> 最终会将森林转变为旷野。\n"
"\n"
"风险：无\n"
"活动程度：剧烈\n"
"耗时：基础 6 小时 + 往返时间 + 伐木时间\n"
"位置：%d/1\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:962
msgid " Recover Log Cutter"
msgstr "召回同伴（伐木）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:970
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to clear a nearby forest.\n"
"Note that it's likely both forest and field roads look exactly the same after having been cleared.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: fabrication\n"
"Difficulty: 1\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> 95%% of trees/trunks at the forest position will be cut down.\n"
"> 0%% of total material will be brought back.\n"
"> Forest should become a field tile.\n"
"> Useful for clearing land for another faction camp.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Active\n"
"Time: 6 Hour Base + Travel Time + Cutting Time\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"说明：\n"
"选择一名同伴去砍光附近森林的树。\n"
"\n"
"技能：制造\n"
"需求等级：1\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 森林区块内 95%% 的树和树干会被砍倒。\n"
"> 所砍倒树木 0%% 的材料会被带回营地。\n"
"> 森林将转变为旷野。\n"
"> 适用于为建设另一个新营地清理土地。\n"
"\n"
"风险：无\n"
"活动程度：剧烈\n"
"耗时：基础 6 小时 + 往返时间 + 伐木时间\n"
"位置：%d/1\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:990
msgid " Recover Clearcutter"
msgstr "召回同伴（清除森林）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:998
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to build an improvised shelter and stock it with equipment at a distant map location.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: ecology\n"
"Difficulty: 3\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Good for setting up resupply or contingency points.\n"
"> Gear is left unattended and could be stolen.\n"
"> Time dependent on weight of equipment being sent forward.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: Medium\n"
"Intensity: Light\n"
"Time: 6 Hour Construction + Travel\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"备注：\n"
"派一名同伴前往地图上的远距离地点，搭建简易庇护所并储备装备。\n"
"\n"
"所需技能：生态学\n"
"难度：3\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 适合建立补给点或应急点。\n"
"> 装备处于无人看管状态，存在被盗风险。\n"
"> 所需时间取决于预先运送的装备重量。\n"
"\n"
"风险：中等\n"
"强度：轻\n"
"耗时：6小时（建造 + 旅途）\n"
"位置：%d/1\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1016
msgid " Recover Hide Setup"
msgstr "召回同伴（设置藏匿点）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1024
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Push gear out to a hide site or bring gear back from one.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: ecology\n"
"Difficulty: 1\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Good for returning equipment you left in the hide site shelter.\n"
"> Gear is left unattended and could be stolen.\n"
"> Time dependent on weight of equipment being sent forward or back.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: Medium\n"
"Intensity: Light\n"
"Time: 1 Hour Base + Travel\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"备注：\n"
"将装备运送至隐蔽点，或从隐蔽点取回装备。\n"
"\n"
"使用技能：生态学\n"
"难度：1\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 适合取回留在隐蔽点掩体内的装备。\n"
"> 装备处于无人看管状态，存在被盗风险。\n"
"> 所需时间取决于运送装备的重量。\n"
"\n"
"风险：中等\n"
"强度：轻度\n"
"时间：1小时（基础）+ 途中耗时\n"
"位置：1/%d\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1043
msgid " Recover Hide Relay"
msgstr "召回同伴（补给藏匿点）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1051
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to forage for edible plants.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: ecology\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Foraging Possibilities:\n"
"> wild vegetables\n"
