"> 小型和微型动物尸体\n"
"食物产出量可能少于消耗！\n"
"风险：低\n"
"强度：轻\n"
"时间：14小时\n"
"位置：%d/2\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1093
msgid " Recover Trappers"
msgstr "召回同伴（设置陷阱）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1101
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to hunt large animals.\n"
"\n"
"Skills used: Marksmanship, Ecology\n"
"Stats used: Perception\n"
"Difficulty: Medium\n"
"Hunting Possibilities:\n"
"> small, medium, or large animal corpses\n"
