msgstr "完成地图防御工事升级"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1176
msgid " Recover Recruiter"
msgstr "召回同伴（招募）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1184
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion out into the great unknown.  High survival skills are needed to avoid combat but you should expect an encounter or two.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: ecology\n"
"Difficulty: 3\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Select checkpoints to customize path.\n"
"> Reveals terrain around the path.\n"
"> Can bounce off hide sites to extend range.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: High\n"
"Intensity: Brisk\n"
"Time: Travel\n"
"Positions: %d/3\n"
msgstr ""
"备注：\n"
"派一个伙伴去未知的地域。需要高生存技能以避免战斗，但你应预计会有一两次遭遇。\n"
"\n"
"使用技能：生态学\n"
"难度：3\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 选择检查点来自定义路线。\n"
"> 揭示路线周围的地形。\n"
"> 可以借助隐蔽地点反击以扩大范围。\n"
"\n"
"风险：高\n"
"强度：轻\n"
"时间：持续\n"
"位置：%d/3\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1203
msgid " Recover Scout"
msgstr "召回同伴（侦查）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1211
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to purge the wasteland.  Their goal is to kill anything hostile they encounter and return when their wounds are too great or the odds are stacked against them.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: ecology\n"
"Difficulty: 4\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Pulls creatures encountered into combat instead of fleeing.\n"
"> Select checkpoints to customize path.\n"
"> Can bounce off hide sites to extend range.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: Very High\n"
"Intensity: Brisk\n"
"Time: Travel\n"
"Positions: %d/3\n"
msgstr ""
"备注：\n"
"派一个同伴去清理废土。他们的目标是杀死遇到的任何敌对生物，并在伤势过重或对方占优势时返回。\n"
"\n"
"使用技能：生态学\n"
"难度：4\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 遇到生物时将其拉入战斗，而不是逃跑。\n"
"> 选择检查点来自定义路线。\n"
"> 可以借助隐蔽地点反击以扩大范围。\n"
"\n"
"风险：非常高\n"
"强度：轻\n"
"时间：持续\n"
"位置：%d/3\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1232
msgid " Recover Combat Patrol"
msgstr "召回同伴（武装巡逻）"

