#, c-format
msgid ""
"You can't climb because you have to wield a %s with both hands.\n"
"\n"
"Put it away?"
msgstr ""
"你不能攀爬，因为你要用双手来手持%s。\n"
"把它放下？"

#: src/game.cpp:11841 src/game.cpp:12428
msgid "You can't climb here - there is no terrain above you that would support your weight."
msgstr "你不能攀爬这里，这上面没有能支撑你的地形。"

#: src/game.cpp:11875
msgid "You can't go down here!"
msgstr "你在这里无法下楼！"

#: src/game.cpp:11880
msgid "You can't go up here!"
msgstr "你在这里无法上楼！"

#: src/game.cpp:11888
msgid "You can't drag things up and down stairs."
msgstr "你不能拽着东西上下楼梯。"

