#: src/iuse.cpp:802
msgid "You stop shaking."
msgstr "你不再颤抖了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:809
msgid "You snort a bump of coke."
msgstr "你吸食了一小撮可卡因。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:825
msgid "You inject the vaccine."
msgstr "你注射了一剂疫苗。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:830
msgid "You no longer need to fear the flu, at least for some time."
msgstr "你再也不必担心流感了。至少在一段时间内。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:834
msgid "You notice the date on the packaging is pretty old.  It may no longer be effective."
msgstr "你注意到包装上的日期已经很老了。它可能已经失效了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:852 src/iuse.cpp:874
msgid "Are you sure you want to eat this?  It looks poisonous…"
msgstr "有毒食物！确定要食用这个东西吗？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:900
#, c-format
msgid "This %s probably meant a lot to someone at one time."
msgstr "这个 %s 可能曾经是对谁有重要意义的东西。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:921
msgid "You feel completely exhausted."
msgstr "你觉得自己精疲力竭了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:925
msgid "You feel a bit wobbly."
msgstr "你觉得有点晃晃悠悠。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:942
msgid "A sense of dull ennui washes over you."
msgstr "一种强烈的恐惧感涌上了你的心头。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:956
msgid "You eat the datura seed."
msgstr "你吃下了 曼陀罗花种子。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:965
msgid "You take a puff from your inhaler."
msgstr "你吸了一口哮喘吸入器。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:966
msgid "<npcname> takes a puff from their inhaler."
msgstr "<npcname> 吸了一口哮喘吸入器。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:981
#, c-format
msgid "You breathe deeply from the %s."
msgstr "你深深地吸了一大口 %s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:983
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> breathes from the %s."
msgstr "<npcname> 吸了一口 %s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:999
msgid "This seems like a bad idea, are you sure you want to drink it?"
msgstr "这看上去很不干净，真的要喝吗？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1003
msgid "This seems like a bad idea, are you sure you want to eat it?"
msgstr "这看上去很不干净，真的要吃吗？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1010
msgid "Blech, that tastes gross!"
msgstr "呸，它尝起来真恶心！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1021
msgid "Blech, that burns your throat!"
msgstr "呸，它灼烧了你的喉咙！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1027
msgid "Blech, you don't feel you can stomach much of that."
msgstr "呸，你觉得你吞不下那么多。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1038
msgid "Automatically eating the gross food because a test told us to."
msgstr "因为测试告诉我们，我们会自动吃掉恶心的食物。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1042
msgid "This looks unclean; are you sure you want to drink it?"
msgstr "这看上去很不干净，真的要喝吗？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1046
msgid "This looks unclean; are you sure you want to eat it?"
msgstr "这看上去很不干净，真的要吃吗？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1060
msgid "The meal is revitalizing."
msgstr "这一餐让你活力四射。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1062
msgid "Oddly enough, this doesn't taste so bad."
msgstr "奇怪的是，尝着味道还行。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1088
msgid "You feel cleansed."
msgstr "你感觉到自己被净化了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1098
msgid "You feel a slight itching inside, but it passes."
msgstr "你觉得体内有些轻微的瘙痒，但它很快消失了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1117
msgid "You don't have any mutations to purify."
msgstr "你没有可以净化的变异。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1121
msgid "Choose a mutation to purify: "
msgstr "选择要净化的变异："

#: src/iuse.cpp:1129
msgid "You inject the purifier.  The liquid thrashes inside the tube and goes down reluctantly."
msgstr "你注射了净化剂。液体在针管里来回晃动，最后不情愿地往下流。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1187
#, c-format
msgid "As you eat the %s, you have a near-religious experience, feeling at one with your surroundings…"
msgstr "当你吃下%s，你感到一种近乎通灵般的体验，似乎与周围环境融为了一体……"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1219
msgid "It tastes extremely strange!"
msgstr "这东西的味道非常奇怪！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1227 src/iuse.cpp:1377
msgid "You feel better all over."
msgstr "你感觉到自己浑身舒爽。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1238
msgid "It is delicious, and very filling!"
msgstr "这东西尝起来味道鲜美，非常填肚子！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1243
msgid "It is delicious, but you can't eat any more."
msgstr "这很美味，但你吃不下更多了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1246
msgid "You take one bite, and immediately vomit!"
msgstr "你不知死活的咬了一口，立刻就呕吐了！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1251
msgid "You feel a familiar warmth, but suddenly it surges into an excruciating burn as you convulse, vomiting, and black out…"
msgstr "你感到了熟悉的温暖，但那突然就激增成了难以忍受的灼烧感，你抽筋，呕吐，眼前一黑……"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1254
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Suffered Marloss Rejection."
msgstr "遭受了马洛斯莓排斥反应。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1255
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Suffered Marloss Rejection."
msgstr "遭受了马洛斯莓排斥反应。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1271
msgid "You feel a familiar warmth, but suddenly it surges into painful burning as you convulse and collapse to the ground…"
msgstr "你感到了熟悉的温暖，但那突然就激增成了痛楚的灼烧感，使你抽搐着倒在了地上……"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1283 src/monattack.cpp:2055
msgid "You wake up in a Marloss bush.  Almost *cradled* in it, actually, as though it grew there for you."
msgstr "你在马洛斯灌木丛中醒来。像是被*孕育*在其中，事实上它似乎就是为你而生的。"

#. ~ Beginning to hear the Mycus while conscious: that's it speaking
#: src/iuse.cpp:1286
msgid "unity.  together we have reached the door.  we provide the final key.  now to pass through…"
msgstr "吾等生而为一。吾等一道已经触及那道门扉。吾等已经提供了最终的钥匙。现在是时候穿越那扇门了……"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1288
msgid "You feel a strange warmth spreading throughout your body…"
msgstr "你感觉到一种奇特的温暖蔓延全身……"

#. ~ "Nuh-uh" is a sound used for "nope", "no", etc.
#: src/iuse.cpp:1309
msgid "After what happened that last time?  Nuh-uh.  You're not eating that alien poison."
msgstr "还记得上次吃这玩意后发生的事了吗？啊~哦。你再也不想吃那种见鬼的外星毒药了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1314
msgid "we no longer require this scaffolding.  we reserve it for other uses."
msgstr "吾等已不需此等垫脚石了。吾等留之另有所用。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1335 src/iuse.cpp:5166
#, c-format
msgid "Are you sure you want to eat the %s?  You could plant it in a mound of dirt."
msgstr "真的要吃下 %s？你可以将其播种在土堆里。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1376
msgid "It tastes amazing, and you finish it quickly."
msgstr "这个尝起来棒极了，你很快就吃完了它。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1381
msgid "As it settles in, you feel ecstasy radiating through every part of your body…"
msgstr "当你咽下它时，你感觉到狂喜贯穿你身体的每一寸……"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1384
msgid "Your eyes roll back in your head.  Everything dissolves into a blissful haze…"
msgstr "你舒爽得直翻白眼。一切溶解成极乐的阴霾……"

#. ~ The Mycus does not use the term (or encourage the concept of) "you".  The
#. PC is a local/native organism, but is now the Mycus.
#. ~ It still understands the concept, but uninitelligent fungal zombies and
#. mind-bent symbiotes should not need it.
#. ~ We are the Mycus.
#: src/iuse.cpp:1393
msgid "we welcome into us.  we have endured long in this forbidding world."
msgstr "欢迎加入吾等。吾等已在这险恶世界中忍受太久了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1396
msgid "A sea of white caps, waving gently.  A haze of spores wafting silently over a forest."
msgstr "一片白色菌菇盖组成的海洋，如波浪一般缓缓起伏。一阵孢子组成的白雾，静悄悄地在森林中飘荡。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1398
msgid "the natives have a saying: \"e pluribus unum.\"  out of many, one."
msgstr "本地生物中有句谚语：\"E Pluribus Unum\"——合众为一。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1401
msgid "The blazing pink redness of the berry.  The juices spreading across our tongue, the warmth draping over us like a lover's embrace."
msgstr "粉红色的变异莓炽热发红。那汁液洒在你的舌尖上，一阵温暖像爱人的拥抱一般紧紧抱在吾等之身上。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1403
msgid "we welcome the union of our lines in our local guide.  we will prosper, and unite this world.  even now, our fruits adapt to better serve local physiology."
msgstr "吾等欢迎本地向导加入吾等阵线，合众为一。吾等必将繁荣，团结这个世界。从今往后，吾等之果实将更好地适应本地生态。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1406
msgid "The sky-blue of the seed.  The nutty, creamy flavors intermingling with the berry, a memory that will never leave us."
msgstr "如天一般蓝的种子。如同坚果混合奶油的味道与变异莓交织在一起，一段永远不会被吾等遗忘的记忆。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1408
msgid "as, in time, shall we adapt to better welcome those who have not received us."
msgstr "因此，假以时日，吾等终将更加适应此地环境，得以更好迎接那些尚未接受吾等存在之辈。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1411
msgid "The amber-yellow of the sap.  Feel it flowing through our veins, taking the place of the strange, thin red gruel called \"blood.\""
msgstr "如琥珀一般黄的汁液。感觉它流过吾等之血管，取代了被称为\"血液\"的奇怪而又淡薄的红色稀粥。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1413
msgid "we are the Mycus."
msgstr "吾等为马卡斯。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1449
msgid "This tastes really weird!  You're not sure it's good for you…"
msgstr "这个味道太诡异了！你不认为这玩意对你有好处……"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1466
#, c-format
msgid "You doubt someone would want to eat %1$s."
msgstr "你觉得应该不会有人想吃 %1$s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1471
#, c-format
msgid "Tame which animal with %s?"
msgstr "用%s驯服哪只动物？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1493
#, c-format
msgid "The %s doesn't want that kind of food."
msgstr "这只 %s 不想要这种食物。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1504
msgid "You want to feed it the dog food, but it bites your fingers!"
msgstr "你想用狗粮喂它，但它咬了你的手指头！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1507
msgid "Apparently, it's more interested in your flesh than the dog food in your hand!"
msgstr "显然比起你手里的狗粮，它对你的肉更感兴趣！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1519
#, c-format
msgid "You try to feed the %1$s some %2$s, but it vanishes!"
msgstr "你想喂 %1$s 一些 %2$s，但它消失了！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1525
#, c-format
msgid "You feed your %1$s to the %2$s."
msgstr "你将 %1$s 投喂给 %2$s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1530
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s seems full now."
msgstr "%1$s似乎已经满了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1537
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s is your pet now!"
msgstr "%1$s 现在成为了你的宠物。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1552
msgid "There is nothing to be fed here."
msgstr "这里没有可以喂食的对象。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1569
msgid "Modify what?"
msgstr "改造什么？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1572 src/iuse.cpp:2034 src/iuse.cpp:2129 src/iuse.cpp:4288 src/iuse.cpp:6762
msgid "You don't have that item!"
msgstr "你没有那个物品！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1577
msgid "Which signal should activate the item?"
msgstr "物品激活信号："

#: src/iuse.cpp:1578 src/iuse.cpp:1590
msgid "\"Blue\""
msgstr "\"蓝色\""

#: src/iuse.cpp:1578 src/iuse.cpp:1594
msgid "\"Green\""
msgstr "\"绿色\""

#: src/iuse.cpp:1578 src/iuse.cpp:1586
msgid "\"Red\""
msgstr "\"红色\""

#: src/iuse.cpp:1601
msgid "This item has been modified this way already."
msgstr "这件物品已经被如此改装过了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1608
#, c-format
msgid "You modify your %1$s to listen for the %2$s activation signal on the radio."
msgstr "你将 %1$s 改装成使用 %2$s 无线电信号来启动。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1631
msgid "Remove mods from tool?"
msgstr "真的要移除工具的模组吗？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1632
msgid "You don't have any modified tools."
msgstr "你没有任何安装了模组的工具。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1644
#, c-format
msgid "You remove the %s from the tool."
msgstr "你从工具里取出了 %s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1669
msgid "You doubt you will have much luck catching fish here."
msgstr "你觉得这儿可能钓不到鱼。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1693 src/iuse.cpp:1730
msgid "You can't fish there!"
msgstr "你不能在那里钓鱼！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1696
msgid "You cast your line and wait to hook something…"
msgstr "你把鱼线扔出，等待有什么东西上钩……"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1719
msgid "Fish aren't foolish enough to go in here without bait."
msgstr "鱼儿还没傻到会上这个没饵的钩。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1723
msgid "Put fish trap where?"
msgstr "在哪里安放捕鱼器？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1741
msgid "You place the fish trap; in three hours or so, you may catch some fish."
msgstr "你放置了捕鱼陷阱，估计两三个小时之后你可能会有所收获。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1836 src/iuse.cpp:1896 src/iuse.cpp:1927 src/iuse.cpp:3213 src/iuse.cpp:4408 src/iuse.cpp:4460 src/iuse.cpp:4551 src/iuse.cpp:4630
#, c-format
msgid "You need to be wielding the %s to use it."
msgstr "你需要停止手持后才能使用 %s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1841 src/iuse.cpp:1902 src/iuse.cpp:1933 src/iuse.cpp:4633
msgid "Spray where?"
msgstr "喷哪里？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1854
#, c-format
msgid "Since they're not on fire, this will probably make %s angry.  Continue?"
msgstr "由于它们没有着火，这可能会让%s生气。  继续？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1872 src/iuse.cpp:4664
#, c-format
msgid "%s is blinded by the spray."
msgstr "%s挡住路了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1959
#, c-format
msgid "You unpack your %s for use."
msgstr "你拆开了 %s 以便使用。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1970
msgid "Choose CBM to pack"
msgstr "选择要密封的CBM"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1970
msgid "You don't have any CBMs."
msgstr "你没有任何CBM。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1976
msgid "This CBM is faulty.  You should mend it first.  Do you want to try?"
msgstr "这个CBM有故障，你应该先修好它。你要尝试修理吗？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1982
msgid "You carefully prepare the CBM for sterilization."
msgstr "你仔细地准备好CBM的消毒。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2004
#, c-format
msgid "You can't pack your %s until you take it off."
msgstr "你无法打包你的 %s，除非先把它脱下来。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2016
#, c-format
msgid "You pack your %s for storage."
msgstr "你打包 %s 以便储存。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2031 src/iuse.cpp:2126
msgid "Purify what?"
msgstr "净化什么？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2031 src/iuse.cpp:2126
msgid "You don't have water to purify."
msgstr "你没有可以净化的水。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2046
msgid "That volume of water is too large to purify."
msgstr "水太多了，不能完成净化。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2084
#, c-format
msgid "Purifying %i water using %i %s"
msgstr "净化了 %i 份水（消耗 %i 片%s）"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2095
#, c-format
msgid "You need %i tablets to purify that.  You only have %i"
msgstr "你需要 %i 片来净化它。  你只有%i"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2150
msgid "You must have an active radio to check for signal direction."
msgstr "必须要有一个激活的无线电，才能够搜索信号来源。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2157
msgid "You can't find the direction if your radio isn't tuned."
msgstr "如果你的收音机没有改装过，你不能用它找到方位。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2163
#, c-format
msgid "The signal seems strongest to the %s."
msgstr "信号似乎强烈的指向 %s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2193
msgid "Radio: Kssssssssssssh."
msgstr "广播：嗞~~~~~。"

#. ~ radio noise
#: src/iuse.cpp:2209
msgid "ksssh"
msgstr "沙——"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2231
#, c-format
msgid "radio: %s"
msgstr "收音机：%s"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2268
msgid "Select a station"
msgstr "选择站点"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2275
msgctxt "radio station"
msgid " (selected)"
msgstr "（已选择）"

#. ~ Selected radio station, %d is a number in sequence (1,2,3...),
#. ~ %s is ' (selected)' if this is the radio station playing, else nothing
#: src/iuse.cpp:2279
#, c-format
msgid "Station %d%s"
msgstr "站点 %d%s"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2296
msgid "KXSHHHHRRCRKLKKK!"
msgstr "咳咳咳咳咳咳！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2332
msgid "BEEEEEEP BEEEEEEP"
msgstr "哔哔哔哔"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2335
msgid "BEEP BEEP"
msgstr "哔哔"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2338
msgid "beep… beep"
msgstr "哔……哔"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2390
msgid "Pry where?"
msgstr "撬哪里？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2390
msgid "There is nothing to pry nearby."
msgstr "附近没有可以撬开的东西。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2407
msgid "You try to hit yourself with the hammer."
msgstr "你打算抄起锤子砸自己的脚。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2408
msgid "But you can't touch this."
msgstr "但是你无法触摸这个。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2410
msgid "You attempt to pry open your wallet, but alas.  You are just too miserly."
msgstr "你试图撬开自己的钱包，但是你太过吝啬，唉！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2414
msgid "You can't pry that."
msgstr "你无法撬开它。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2434
#, c-format
msgid "You can't get sufficient leverage to open that with your %1$s."
msgstr "%1$s 不足以用来撬开它。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2455
msgid "Till soil where?"
msgstr "在哪里耕地？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2463
msgid "You think about jumping on a shovel, but then change your mind."
msgstr "你想在铲子上跳舞，但过会儿又改变了主意。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2470
msgid "You start churning up the earth here."
msgstr "你开始在这里翻地。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2475
msgid "You can't churn up this ground."
msgstr "你不能翻起这块地。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2596
msgid "Siphon from where?"
msgstr "从哪里抽取？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2596
msgid "There is nothing to siphon from nearby."
msgstr "附近没有可以抽取的对象。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2661
#, c-format
msgid "You can't make it through the %s there."
msgstr "你无法通过那里的%s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2672
msgid "There's a vehicle in the way!"
msgstr "有辆载具挡住了你！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2678
#, c-format
msgid "You can't mine a wall with a %s!"
msgstr "你不能用 %s 挖掘墙壁！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2705
msgid "Drill where?"
msgstr "钻哪里？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2705
msgid "You can't drill there."
msgstr "你不能钻那里。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2706
#, c-format
msgid "You start drilling into the %1$s with your %2$s."
msgstr "你开始用你的 %2$s 在 %1$s 上钻孔。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2760
msgid "Mine where?"
msgstr "挖掘哪里？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2760
msgid "You can't mine there."
msgstr "你不能挖那里。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2760
#, c-format
msgid "You strike the %1$s with your %2$s."
msgstr "你开始用你的 %2$s 在 %1$s 上挖掘。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2777
msgid "Geiger counter:"
msgstr "盖格计数："

#: src/iuse.cpp:2778
msgid "Scan the ground"
msgstr "扫描地面"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2778
msgid "Scan yourself or other person"
msgstr "扫描自己/他人"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2778
msgid "Turn continuous scan on"
msgstr "打开连续扫描"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2789
msgid "Scan whom?"
msgstr "扫描谁？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2790
msgid "There is no one to scan nearby."
msgstr "附近没有可以扫描的人。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:2801
