msgid "a soft robotic voice say, \"Unhand this patient immediately!  If you keep interfering with the procedure I'll be forced to call law enforcement.\""
msgstr "一个柔和的机器声音说：\"请立刻放开那位病人！如果您继续妨碍急救措施，我将不得不请求执法部门介入。\""

