#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1290
msgid ""
"\n"
"- Throwing range, accuracy, and damage\n"
"- Reload speed for bows and other muscle-powered weapons\n"
"- Grappling and escaping grabs and pull attacks\n"
"- Speed and effectiveness of smashing corpses and terrain\n"
"- Speed and effectiveness of prying things open, chopping wood, and mining\n"
"- Chance of breaking out of snares and bear traps\n"
"- Power produced by muscle-powered vehicles\n"
"- Most aspects of melee combat\n"
"- Resistance to many diseases and poisons\n"
"- Ability to drag heavy objects\n"
"- Ability to wield heavy weapons with one hand\n"
"- Ability to manage gun recoil\n"
"- Duration of action of various drugs and alcohol"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"- 投掷范围、精度和伤害\n"
"- 手动装弹武器的装弹速度\n"
"- 某些变异的拖动力量\n"
"- 怪物拖动或抓取的抗性\n"
"- 砸碎尸体的速度\n"
"- 劈柴、采矿和撬开东西的速度和效果\n"
"- 挣脱抓取和陷阱的几率\n"
"- 人力车辆的功率\n"
"- 近战的大多数方面\n"
"- 砸碎家具或地形的效果\n"
"- 疾病和毒素抗性\n"
"- 拖动重物的能力及拖动移速\n"
"- 单手挥舞重型武器的能力\n"
"- 控制枪支后坐力的能力\n"
"- 各种药物和酒精的作用时长"

#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1310
msgid ""
"Dexterity represents reaction speed, coordination, flexibility, and fine motor control.  Dextrous characters operate firearms more quickly, are faster and more accurate in melee combat, and can wriggle out of grabs even when they're not strong enough to overpower an opponent.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"敏捷代表反应速度、协调性、灵活性和精细运动控制。敏捷高的角色使用火器更快，近战战斗中更敏捷、命中率更高，即使力量不足以压制对手，也能从抓握中脱身。\n"
"\n"

#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1315
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
