"- Effectiveness of repairing and modifying clothes and armor\n"
"- Effectiveness of stealing\n"
"- Throwing speed\n"
"- Aiming speed\n"
"- Speed and effectiveness of chopping wood with powered tools\n"
"- Chance to get better results when butchering corpses or cutting items\n"
"- Chance of losing control of vehicle when driving\n"
"- Damage from falling"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"- 开锁成功率\n"
"- 对某些怪物的抓取抗性\n"
"- 逃脱抓取和陷阱的几率\n"
"- 拆除陷阱的成功率\n"
"- 改装枪械的成功率\n"
"- 修理改装盔甲和衣服的成功率\n"
"- 近战攻速和暴击率\n"
"- 偷窃成功率\n"
"- 投掷速度\n"
"- 瞄准速度\n"
"- 使用电动工具砍柴的速度和效果\n"
"- 避开陷阱的几率\n"
"- 屠宰或切割物品时获得更好产物的几率\n"
"- 在尖锐地形上被割伤的几率\n"
"- 驾驶时车辆失控的几率\n"
"- 攻击损坏近战武器的几率\n"
"- 坠落伤害"

#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1355
msgid ""
"Far more than just book smarts, intelligence represents willpower, analytical ability, open-mindedness, memory, and the ability to stay on-task even when bored or distracted.  Intelligent characters gain skills and proficiencies more quickly and complete crafting tasks with fewer delays.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"智力不仅仅是书本上的知识，它还代表意志力、分析能力、开放的心态、记忆力，以及即使感到无聊或分心也能保持专注的能力。智力高的角色学习技能和掌握熟练度的速度更快，完成制作任务时也会更少延误。\n"
"\n"
"\n"

