#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1373
msgid ""
"\n"
"- Speed of 'catching up' practical experience to theoretical knowledge\n"
"- Detection and disarming traps\n"
"- Bandaging wounds and stopping blood loss\n"
"- Chance of success when installing bionics\n"
"- Chance of success when manipulating with gun modifications\n"
"- Chance to learn a recipe when crafting from a book\n"
"- Chance of hacking/programming computers, card readers, robots, etc.\n"
"- Chance of bypassing vehicle security system\n"
"- Chance to get better results when disassembling items\n"
"- Bash damage with whips and flails\n"
"- Chance of being paralyzed by fear attack"
msgstr ""
