#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:798
msgid "You've got some kind of parasite.  It probably isn't immediately life-threatening, but taking antiparasitic medication should clear it up."
msgstr "你身上有某种寄生虫。它可能一时不会对生命造成威胁，吃抗寄生虫药应该能清除它。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:801
msgid "Looks like you have a pretty serious fungal infection.  Taking antifungal medication should clear it up, but I'd hurry if I were you."
msgstr "看上去你得了比较严重的真菌感染。吃抗真菌药应该能治好它，要是我是你的话就会马上行动。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:804
msgid "You have acute radiation syndrome.  Taking prussian blue every three hours should help treat it.  Most exposure comes from fine ash or dust in the environment, so in the future, try to mask up and wear clothing designed for environmental protection."
msgstr "你患有急性放射综合症。每隔三小时服用一次普鲁士蓝应有助于治疗。大多数暴露自环境中的细灰或灰尘，所以以后尽量戴口罩，穿防护环境的衣服。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:807
msgid "You have a bacterial infection.  There's a chance a healthy person can fight this sort of thing off, but it can be lethal for just about anybody.  Find the strongest antibiotics you can and take one every twelve hours until it's cleared up."
msgstr "你得了细菌感染。健康人能自己抵御这种情况，但几乎对任何人而言这都是可能致命的。找最强的抗生素，每十二小时服用一次，直到感染消退为止。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:810
msgid "You probably feel pretty horrible, but it's just the flu.  It should resolve itself within two to twelve days from the time you first started noticing symptoms.  Until then, you can take cough syrup to suppress most symptoms, or opioids and antihistamines if you can't find any."
msgstr "你可能感觉很糟，但这只是流感。从你出现症状算起，大约两到十二天内应该会自行好转。在此期间，你可以服用止咳糖浆来缓解大部分症状，或者找不到的话，也可以用类鸦片和抗组胺药。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:813
msgid "It seems you've caught a cold.  It should resolve itself within two days to three weeks from the time you first started noticing symptoms.  Until then, you can take cough syrup to suppress most symptoms, or opioids and antihistamines if you can't find any."
msgstr "你看起来感冒了。从你刚注意到症状起的两天到三周内感冒通常会自愈。在此期间，你可以服用止咳糖浆来缓解大部分症状，或者找不到的话，也可以使用阿片类药物和抗组胺药。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:817
msgid "You have a minor infenction of the conjunctiva - that is, pinkeye.  It should resolve itself within a couple of days.  If the itching is bothering you, try taking some antihistamines.  Cough syrup might also do the trick, but not the non-drowsy kind.  You could also try taking an antibiotic every twelve hours, but if the infection is viral, it won't have any effect."
msgstr "你有轻微的结膜感染——也就是红眼病。一般几天就会自己好。如果痒得烦人，可以试试抗过敏药。咳嗽药水可能也有效，但别用那种不致困的类型。你也可以尝试每十二小时吃一次抗生素，不过若是病毒感染，是没有作用的。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:820
msgid "Those irritated scratches look like rat bite fever.  You could try taking some aspirin or ibuprofen to relieve the symptoms.  It's safe to wait it out and let your body fight it off, but you can also take one antibiotic every twelve hours to deal with it."
msgstr "那些烦人的抓痕看起来像是鼠咬热。你可以试着吃一些阿司匹林或布洛芬来缓解症状。等着让身体自己对抗也没问题，但你也可以每十二小时吃一次抗生素来应对。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:823
msgid "Your muscle cramps are caused by tetanus.  A dose of antibiotics every twelve hours might get rid of it, otherwise you should look for benzodiazepines to relieve the symptoms."
msgstr "你的肌肉痉挛是由破伤风引起的。每十二小时打一剂抗生素可能会治好，要不然你该找一些苯二氮卓类药物来缓解症状。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:826
msgid "Neuropathy, cramps, and tremors.  I'm not sure what exactly is the matter with you, but if I had to guess, you've been eating or drinking something toxic.  Stop doing that, and maybe your body will filter out the poison over time."
msgstr "神经病变、抽筋和震颤。我不太确定你到底出了什么问题，但如果让我猜，你可能吃了或喝了什么有毒的东西。别再那样做了，也许随时间你的身体会把毒素排出去。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:829
msgid "You've got anemia.  It's often caused by bleeding, but sometimes a poor diet will do it, both are equally likely these days.  You need iron, either from leafy greens, multivitamins, or red meat, and you need rest so your body can rebuild itself."
msgstr "你得了贫血。通常是因为出血引起的，但有时也可能是饮食不良，现在两种情况发生的可能性一样。你需要补充铁，可以从绿叶蔬菜、多种维生素或红肉中获取，还需要休息，让身体恢复。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:832
msgid "Scurvy.  That's a vitamin C deficiency.  You're going to want to look for fruit, greens, or organ meat, and it's got to be fresh, the preserved stuff usually won't do.  Vitamin supplements would also do the trick."
msgstr "坏血病。那是维生素C缺乏症。你会想要找水果、蔬菜或动物内脏，而且一定要新鲜的，通常保存过的东西不行。维生素补充剂也能解决这个问题。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:848
msgid "Your pulse is elevated and I'm not liking the look of your blood pressure.  You need more exercise."
msgstr "你的脉搏升高了，我看你的血压状况也不太好。你需要多运动。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:850
msgid "I'd say you could stand to get more exercise."
msgstr "我想说你可以多运动运动。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:852
msgid "Your vitals look good."
msgstr "你的生命体征看着很好。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:854
msgid "It seems like you're in pretty good shape.  Your vitals look great, anyway."
msgstr "看起来你身体状况挺好的。而且，你的生命体征看上去极好。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:856
msgid "You're in incredible shape!  What exactly have you been doing out there?"
msgstr "你身材真棒！你到底在外面都做了些什么？"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:861
msgid "You probably don't need me to tell you this, but you're starving.  You're going to have a hard time staying healthy, let alone active, if your body doesn't have enough energy for its basic functions."
msgstr "你可能不需要我告诉你这个，但你的确饿坏了。如果你的身体没有足够的能量来维持基本功能，你会很难保持健康，更别说活跃起来。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:863
msgid "Your weight looks OK."
msgstr "你体重看上去很OK。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:865
msgid "You might benefit from losing some weight.  Things being how they are I'd say it's better to have too much than too little, but you're at the point where it's starting to put a strain on your body."
msgstr "你减点体重可能会有好处。照现在的情况，我会说宁多勿少，但你现在已经到了开始给身体带来压力的程度。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:867
msgid "We really should think about getting you on a diet.  I know, I know, I don't like saying it, but now more than ever, your health matters."
msgstr "我们真的应该考虑让你节食了。我懂我懂，我也不喜欢这么说，但现在你的健康比以往任何时候都更重要。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:870
msgid "I don't think your condition's going to improve without some sort of miracle, so you need to stay out of trouble."
msgstr "我觉得你的情况要是没有某种奇迹是不会好转的，所以你得别惹麻烦。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:872
msgid "One last thing: your immune system's probably shot.  That means you'll have a hard time fighting off infection and recovering from injury.  You need to avoid drugs and alcohol, mask up whenever possible, and don't eat anything weird.  Oh, and try to get some sleep.  You won't bounce back right away, but if you can stay active, stay clean, and try to maintain a healthy weight, you'll start feeling a lot better."
msgstr "最后一件事：你的免疫系统可能已经很糟了。意味着你很难抵抗感染，也难以从受伤中恢复。你需要避免药物和酒精，尽可能戴上口罩，不吃奇怪的东西。哦，还要尽量睡觉。你不会立刻恢复，但如果你能保持活跃、保持清洁，并尽量维持健康体重，你会开始感觉好转。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:874
msgid "That's everything.  You'd probably benefit from some lifestyle changes, though.  Little things, like exposure to toxins, junk food, smoke inhalation, even just dealing with a lot of negative emotions - all this stuff adds up, and it can really do a number on your health."
msgstr "就这些了。不过你做些生活方式上的调整或许会有好处。一些小事，比如接触毒素、垃圾食品、吸入烟雾，甚至只是处理大量负面情绪——这些都会堆积起来，然后对你的健康产生影响。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:876
msgid "It looks like apart from everything else, you've been maintaining good lifestyle habits.  Keep it up, it'll pay dividends the next time you're up against an injury or illness."
msgstr "看着除其他方面外，你一直有保持良好的生活习惯。继续坚持下去，当你下一次受伤或生病，其中的好处就会显现。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:878
msgid "Your health otherwise seems pretty good.  As long as you don't push it too far, you should be able to bounce back pretty well from most health problems."
msgstr "你健康状况看起来还不错。只要不过度操劳，大多数健康问题应该你都能挺过去。"

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:880
msgid "All else aside, your outlook seems great.  Clean living really is its own reward."
msgstr "撇开其他不谈，你的气色看起来很棒。健康的生活方式本身就是最大的回报。"

