#: src/options.cpp:1510
msgid "Auto pickup adjacent"
msgstr "自动拾取相邻物品"

#: src/options.cpp:1511
msgid "If true, enable auto pickup items one tile around to the player.  You can assign No Auto Pickup zones with the Zones manager for e.g. your homebase."
msgstr "开启时，玩家周围一格的东西将会被自动拾取。你可以用\"Y\"键的区域管理菜单设置不拾取区域，例如你的基地和家中。"

#: src/options.cpp:1517
msgid "Auto pickup owned items"
msgstr "自动拾取拥有物品"

#: src/options.cpp:1518
msgid "If true, items that belong to your faction will be included in auto pickup."
msgstr "开启时，已属于你派系的物品会被加入自动拾取。"

#: src/options.cpp:1524
msgid "Auto pickup weight limit"
msgstr "自动拾取重量上限"

#: src/options.cpp:1525
msgid "Auto pickup items with weight less than or equal to [option] * 50 grams.  You must also set the small items option.  0 = disabled."
msgstr "自动拾取重量小于等于设定值的物品，单位为 50 克。需要同时开启自动拾取小型物品模式。0 = 关闭此功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:1531
msgid "Auto pickup volume limit"
msgstr "自动拾取体积上限"

#: src/options.cpp:1532
msgid "Auto pickup items with volume less than or equal to [option] * 50 ml.  You must also set the light items option.  0 = disabled."
msgstr "自动拾取体积小于等于设定值的物品，单位为 50 毫升。需要同时开启自动拾取轻型物品模式。0 = 关闭此功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:1538
msgid "Auto pickup safe mode"
msgstr "自动拾取安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1539
msgid "If true, auto pickup is disabled as long as you can see monsters nearby.  This is affected by 'Safe mode proximity distance'."
msgstr "开启时，在附近有怪物时不会自动拾取物品，怪物距离可在\"安全模式判定距离\"选项中设置。"

#: src/options.cpp:1546
msgid "List items within no auto pickup zones"
msgstr "列出禁止自动拾取区内物品"

#: src/options.cpp:1547
msgid "If true, you will see messages about items you step on, within no auto pickup zones."
msgstr "开启时，在禁止自动拾取区内右侧消息栏会显示在玩家脚下的物品。"

#: src/options.cpp:1556
msgid "Auto Features Options"
msgstr "自动工作"

#: src/options.cpp:1557
msgid "Options regarding auto features."
msgstr "关于自动屠宰、拖地、砸碎等相关设置"

#: src/options.cpp:1559
msgid "Additional auto features"
msgstr "其他自动功能"

#: src/options.cpp:1560
msgid "If true, enables configured auto features below.  Disabled as long as any enemy monster is seen."
msgstr "开启时，下方设置的自动功能将被启用。当视野内有任何敌对生物时自动失效。"

#: src/options.cpp:1564
msgid "Auto pulp or butcher"
msgstr "自动屠宰/捣碎尸体"

#: src/options.cpp:1565
msgid "Action to perform when 'Auto pulp or butcher' is enabled.  Pulp: Pulp corpses you stand on.  - Pulp Adjacent: Also pulp corpses adjacent from you.  - Butcher: Butcher corpses you stand on."
msgstr "开启自动屠宰/捣碎尸体功能后进行的操作。捣碎：自动捣碎脚下的尸体。捣碎附近：自动捣碎身边的尸体。屠宰：自动屠宰脚下的尸体。"

#: src/options.cpp:1566 src/options.cpp:1588 src/options.cpp:1615 src/options.cpp:2134 src/options.cpp:2193
msgctxt "options"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "关"

#: src/options.cpp:1566
msgid "Pulp"
msgstr "捣碎"

#: src/options.cpp:1566
msgid "Pulp Adjacent"
msgstr "捣碎附近"

#: src/options.cpp:1566
msgid "Pulp Adjacent Zombie Only"
msgstr "捣碎附近丧尸"

#: src/options.cpp:1566
msgid "Pulp Zombies Only"
msgstr "捣碎丧尸"

#: src/options.cpp:1572
msgid "Auto mining"
msgstr "自动挖矿"

#: src/options.cpp:1573
msgid "If true, enables automatic use of wielded pickaxes and jackhammers whenever trying to move into mineable terrain."
msgstr "开启时，当手持鹤嘴锄或冲击钻并走向可破坏地形时将自动使用手中工具。"

#: src/options.cpp:1579
msgid "Auto mopping"
msgstr "自动拖地"

#: src/options.cpp:1580
msgid "If true, enables automatic use of wielded mops to clean surrounding terrain."
msgstr "开启时，则允许自动使用手持拖把清洁周围地块。"

#: src/options.cpp:1586
msgid "Auto foraging"
msgstr "自动采集"

#: src/options.cpp:1587
msgid "Action to perform when 'Auto foraging' is enabled.  Bushes: Only forage bushes.  - Trees: Only forage trees.  - Crops: Only forage crops.  - Everything: Forage bushes, trees, crops, and everything else including flowers, cattails etc."
msgstr "启用\"自动采集\"时进行的操作。灌木：只搜寻并采集灌木。- 树木：只搜寻并采集树木。- 作物：只搜寻并采集作物。- 所有：搜寻并采集一切可采集的物品，例如灌木和树木、作物、花朵、香蒲草等。"

#: src/options.cpp:1588
msgid "Bushes"
msgstr "灌木"

#: src/options.cpp:1588
msgid "Crops"
msgstr "作物"

#: src/options.cpp:1588
msgid "Everything"
msgstr "所有"

#: src/options.cpp:1588
msgid "Trees"
msgstr "树木"

#: src/options.cpp:1596
msgid "Player Safety Options"
msgstr "玩家安全"

#: src/options.cpp:1597
msgid "Options regarding player safety."
msgstr "阻止踏入特殊地形，打断玩家操作相关的安全设置"

#: src/options.cpp:1599
msgid "Dangerous pickups"
msgstr "强制拾取"

#: src/options.cpp:1600
msgid "If true, will allow player to pick new items, even if it causes them to exceed the weight limit."
msgstr "开启时，新拾取的超重物品仍将被拾取进物品栏中。关闭时，新拾取的超重物品将会被自动丢下。"

#: src/options.cpp:1605
msgid "Dangerous terrain warning prompt"
msgstr "危险地形警告提示"

#: src/options.cpp:1606
msgid "Always: You will be prompted to move onto dangerous tiles.  Running: You will only be able to move onto dangerous tiles while running and will be prompted.  Crouching: You will only be able to move onto a dangerous tile while crouching and will be prompted.  Never:  You will not be able to move onto a dangerous tile unless running and will not be warned or prompted."
msgstr "总是：在进入危险地形前总是提示你。奔跑：仅能在奔跑时进入危险地形，进入前提示。蹲伏：仅能在蹲伏时进入危险地形，进入前提示。从不：仅能在奔跑时进入危险地形，进入前无提示。"

#: src/options.cpp:1612
msgid "Force smart engine controller off"
msgstr "自动关闭智能引擎控制器"

#: src/options.cpp:1613
msgid "If enabled, turn off the smart engine controller when you turn off the engine of the car without an electric motor."
msgstr "如果启用，在没有电力引擎的载具上，熄火时自动关闭智能引擎控制器。"

#: src/options.cpp:1624
msgid "Safe Mode Options"
msgstr "安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1625
msgid "Options regarding safe mode."
msgstr "调整安全模式判定距离、重启时间等相关设置"

#: src/options.cpp:1627
msgid "Safe mode"
msgstr "安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1628
msgid "If true, will hold the game and display a warning if a hostile monster/NPC is approaching."
msgstr "开启时，当敌对怪物/NPC接近时，将暂停游戏并显示警告。"

#: src/options.cpp:1632
msgid "Safe mode proximity distance"
msgstr "安全模式判定距离"

#: src/options.cpp:1633
msgid "If safe mode is enabled, distance to hostiles at which safe mode should show a warning.  0 = Max player view distance.  This option only has effect when no safe mode rule is specified.  Otherwise, edit the default rule in Safe mode manager instead of this value."
msgstr "开启安全模式时，当任何敌对角色进入该距离内，安全模式会给出警告。0 = 玩家最大视野。此选项仅在未指定安全模式规则时才生效。否则，请在\"安全模式管理器\"中编辑默认规则，而不是此选项。"

#: src/options.cpp:1637
msgid "Safe mode when driving"
msgstr "驾驶安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1638
msgid "If true, safe mode will alert you of hostiles while you are driving a vehicle."
msgstr "开启时，安全模式会在你驾驶车辆并且发现敌对怪物/NPC时提示你。"

#: src/options.cpp:1642
msgid "Auto reactivate safe mode"
msgstr "自动重启安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1643
msgid "If true, safe mode will automatically reactivate after a certain number of turns.  See option 'Turns to auto reactivate safe mode.'"
msgstr "开启时，安全模式将在被关闭若干回合后自动重新开启。"

#: src/options.cpp:1647
msgid "Turns to auto reactivate safe mode"
msgstr "安全模式重启回合数"

#: src/options.cpp:1648
msgid "Number of turns after which safe mode is reactivated.  Will only reactivate if no hostiles are in 'Safe mode proximity distance.'"
msgstr "当\"安全模式判定距离\"内没有敌对怪物/NPC时，重新开启安全模式所需要的回合数。"

#: src/options.cpp:1652
msgid "Turns to remember ignored monsters"
msgstr "记住已忽略怪物回合数"

#: src/options.cpp:1653
msgid "Number of turns an ignored monster stays ignored after it is no longer seen.  0 disables this option and monsters are permanently ignored."
msgstr "当已忽略怪物离开视野后记忆已忽略状态的回合数。若为 0 时，该选项不生效，已忽略怪物一直保持已忽略状态。"

#: src/options.cpp:1660
msgid "Autosave Options"
msgstr "自动保存"

#: src/options.cpp:1661
msgid "Options regarding autosave."
msgstr "有关自动保存的设置"

#: src/options.cpp:1663
msgid "Autosave"
msgstr "自动存档"

#: src/options.cpp:1664
msgid "If true, game will periodically save the map.  Autosaves occur based on in-game turns or realtime minutes, whichever is larger."
msgstr "开启时，每隔一段时间会自动保存游戏。触发自动保存的条件依赖于游戏中的回合数或者真实的分钟数，两者取高者。"

#: src/options.cpp:1668
msgid "Game turns between autosaves"
msgstr "自动保存间隔的游戏回合数"

#: src/options.cpp:1669
msgid "Number of game turns between autosaves."
msgstr "每次自动保存所需经过的游戏回合数。"

#: src/options.cpp:1675
msgid "Real minutes between autosaves"
msgstr "自动保存间隔的现实分钟数"

#: src/options.cpp:1676
msgid "Number of realtime minutes between autosaves."
msgstr "每次自动保存所需经过的现实分钟数。"

#: src/options.cpp:1685
msgid "Auto notes Options"
msgstr "自动标记"

#: src/options.cpp:1686
msgid "Options regarding auto notes."
msgstr "大地图自动标记的相关设置"

#: src/options.cpp:1688
msgid "Auto notes"
msgstr "自动添加备注"

#: src/options.cpp:1689
msgid "If true, automatically sets notes on the map."
msgstr "开启时，将在地图上自动添加备注。"

#: src/options.cpp:1693
msgid "Auto notes (stairs)"
msgstr "自动备注（楼梯）"

#: src/options.cpp:1694
msgid "If true, automatically sets notes on places that have stairs that go up or down."
msgstr "开启时，将自动记录存在上下行楼梯的地点。"

#: src/options.cpp:1700
msgid "Auto notes (dropped favorites)"
msgstr "自动备注（丢弃收藏物品）"

#: src/options.cpp:1701
msgid "If true, automatically sets notes when player drops favorited items."
msgstr "开启时，将自动记录玩家丢下被收藏物品时的位置。"

#: src/options.cpp:1710 src/options.cpp:2728
msgid "Misc Options"
msgstr "杂项设置"

#: src/options.cpp:1711
msgid "Miscellaneous Options."
msgstr "杂项设置"

#: src/options.cpp:1713
msgid "Drop empty containers"
msgstr "丢下空容器"

#: src/options.cpp:1714
msgid "Set to drop empty containers after use.  No: Don't drop any.  - Watertight: All except watertight containers.  - All: Drop all containers."
msgstr "设置使用后丢下空容器。否：不丢弃 - 水密容器：水密容器不丢弃 - 全部：所有容器均丢弃。"

#: src/options.cpp:1715
msgid "Watertight"
msgstr "水密容器"

#: src/options.cpp:1719
msgid "DeathCam"
msgstr "死亡特写"

#: src/options.cpp:1720
msgid "Always: Always start deathcam.  Ask: Query upon death.  Never: Never show deathcam."
msgstr "总是：总是显示死亡特写。询问：在死亡前询问。从不：从不显示死亡特写。"

#: src/options.cpp:1729
msgid "Soundpack Options"
msgstr "游戏声音"

#: src/options.cpp:1730
msgid "Options regarding Soundpack."
msgstr "关于音效包选择与音量调整的设置"

#: src/options.cpp:1732
msgid "Sound enabled"
msgstr "开启声音"

#: src/options.cpp:1733
msgid "If true, music and sound are enabled."
msgstr "开启时，音乐和音效将被启用。"

#: src/options.cpp:1739
msgid "Choose soundpack"
msgstr "选择音效包"

#: src/options.cpp:1740
msgid "Choose the soundpack you want to use.  Requires restart."
msgstr "选择你要使用的音效包。需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp:1750
msgid "Music volume"
msgstr "音乐音量"

#: src/options.cpp:1751
msgid "Adjust the volume of the music being played in the background."
msgstr "调整背景音乐的音量。"

#: src/options.cpp:1757
msgid "Sound effect volume"
msgstr "音效音量"

#: src/options.cpp:1758
msgid "Adjust the volume of sound effects being played by the game."
msgstr "调整游戏音效的音量。"

#: src/options.cpp:1764
msgid "Ambient sound volume"
msgstr "环境音量"

#: src/options.cpp:1765
msgid "Adjust the volume of ambient sounds being played by the game."
msgstr "调节环境声音音量。"

#: src/options.cpp:1782
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: src/options.cpp:1783
msgid "Switch language.  Each percentage is the fraction of strings translated for that language."
msgstr "切换语言。百分比表示该语言的翻译完整度"

#: src/options.cpp:1789
msgid "Measurement Units"
msgstr "计量单位"

#: src/options.cpp:1790
msgid "Options regarding measurement units."
msgstr "关于各种计量单位的设置，如长度单位，重量单位等"

#: src/options.cpp:1792
msgid "Unit System"
msgstr "单位体系"

#: src/options.cpp:1793
msgid "Switch between metric and imperial units for speed, weight, volume, and distance."
msgstr "在公制和英制距离单位之间切换。"

#: src/options.cpp:1795
msgid "Imperial (mph, lbs, quarts)"
msgstr "英制（英里/时、磅、夸脱）"

#: src/options.cpp:1796
msgid "Metric (km/h, kg, liters)"
msgstr "公制（公里/时，千克，升）"

#: src/options.cpp:1800
msgid "Temperature units"
msgstr "温度单位"

#: src/options.cpp:1801
msgid "Switch between Fahrenheit, Celsius, and Kelvin."
msgstr "在华氏（℉）、摄氏（℃）和开尔文（K）之间切换。"

#: src/options.cpp:1802
msgid "Celsius"
msgstr "摄氏"

#: src/options.cpp:1802
msgid "Fahrenheit"
msgstr "华氏"

#: src/options.cpp:1802
msgid "Kelvin"
msgstr "开尔文"

#: src/options.cpp:1806
msgid "Time format"
msgstr "时间格式"

#: src/options.cpp:1807
msgid "12h: AM/PM, e.g. 7:31 AM - Military: 24h Military, e.g. 0731 - 24h: Normal 24h, e.g. 7:31"
msgstr "12小时制：AM/PM（默认），例：7:31 AM。军用制：24小时军用时间格式，例：0731。24小时制：24小时标准时间显示，例：7:31"

#. ~ 12h time, e.g.  11:59pm
#: src/options.cpp:1809
msgid "12h"
msgstr "12小时制"

#. ~ Military time, e.g.  2359
#: src/options.cpp:1811
msgid "Military"
msgstr "军方"

#. ~ 24h time, e.g.  23:59
#: src/options.cpp:1813
msgid "24h"
msgstr "24小时制"

#: src/options.cpp:1821
msgid "Additional messages in the log"
msgstr "日志额外项"

#: src/options.cpp:1822
msgid "If true, some additional messages will be shown in the sidebar message log."
msgstr "启用时，侧边栏信息日志将记录一些额外的信息。"

#: src/options.cpp:1825
msgid "Items on the ground"
msgstr "地面物品"

#: src/options.cpp:1826
msgid "Show messages about items lying on the ground when character steps on tile with them."
msgstr "当角色经过，显示地面物品信息。"

#: src/options.cpp:1830
msgid "Special monster movement"
msgstr "特殊怪物移动"

#: src/options.cpp:1831
msgid "Show messages about special monster movement: flying over the fence, diving into the water etc."
msgstr "显示特殊的怪物移动信息：飞过栅栏、潜入水中等..."

#: src/options.cpp:1835
msgid "Monster attempts to free itself"
msgstr "怪物尝试挣扎"

#: src/options.cpp:1836
msgid "Show messages about monster trying to free itself from effects preventing it from moving: downed, tied etc."
msgstr "显示怪物挣扎的尝试：从跌倒中站起、挣脱束缚等..."

#: src/options.cpp:1840
msgid "Monster/NPC attacking monster/NPC"
msgstr "怪物/NPC相互攻击"

#: src/options.cpp:1841
msgid "Show messages about non-playable creatures attacking other non-playable creatures."
msgstr "显示游戏内其余生物相互攻击的信息。"

#: src/options.cpp:1848
msgid "Naming Options"
msgstr "名称显示"

#: src/options.cpp:1849
msgid "Options regarding the naming of items."
msgstr "物品名称详细或缩略的相关设置项"

#: src/options.cpp:1851
msgid "Add ammo to weapon/magazine names"
msgstr "在武器/弹匣名称中添加弹药名"

#: src/options.cpp:1852
msgid "If true, the default ammo is added to weapon and magazine names.  For example \"Mosin-Nagant M44 (4/5)\" becomes \"Mosin-Nagant M44 (4/5 7.62x54mm)\"."
msgstr "开启时，武器/弹匣所使用的默认弹药将添加到其显示名称之中。例如，\"莫辛纳甘 M44 骑枪（4/5）\"莫辛纳甘 M44 骑枪（4/5 7.62x54mm 弹）\"。"

#: src/options.cpp:1855
msgid "Detailed containers"
msgstr "详细容器"

#: src/options.cpp:1856
msgid "All: every container has detailed remaining volume info.  - Worn: only worn containers have detailed remaining volume info.  - None: no additional info is provided."
msgstr "所有：每个容器都显示详细的剩余容积信息；穿着：只有穿着在身上的容器才显示详细的剩余容积信息；无：不显示额外信息"

#: src/options.cpp:1867
msgid "Accessibility Options"
msgstr "输入操作"

#: src/options.cpp:1868
msgid "Options regarding the accessibility."
msgstr "有关键盘输入与一些交互逻辑的许多设置选项"

#: src/options.cpp:1870
msgid "Use key code input mode"
msgstr "使用按键码输入模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1871
msgid "Use key code or symbol input on SDL.  Symbol is recommended for non-qwerty layouts since currently the default keybindings for key code mode only supports qwerty.  Key code is currently WIP and bypasses IMEs, caps lock, and num lock."
msgstr "使用按键码或符号输入模式。对于非QWERTY键盘，建议使用符号模式，因为按键码模式的按键设置目前仅支持QWERTY键盘。按键码模式仍在开发中，可以绕过输入法、大写锁定和小键盘数字锁定。"

#: src/options.cpp:1875
msgid "Key code"
msgstr "按键码"

#: src/options.cpp:1878
msgid "Use pinyin in search"
msgstr "使用拼音搜索"

#: src/options.cpp:1879
msgid "If true, pinyin (pronunciation of Chinese characters) can be used in searching/filtering (may cause major slowdown when searching through too many entries.)"
msgstr "开启时，可以使用拼音进行搜索与筛选。搜索过多条目时可致严重卡顿。"

#: src/options.cpp:1885
msgid "Force capital/modified letters in prompts"
msgstr "仅用大写字母/带修饰键输入确认"

#: src/options.cpp:1886
msgid "If true, prompts such as Y/N queries only accepts capital or modified letters, while lower case and unmodified letters only snap the cursor to the corresponding option."
msgstr "开启时，确认按键例如Y/N将仅接受大写字母或带修饰键的输入，小写字母或不带修饰键的输入仅将光标移动至对应选项上。"

#: src/options.cpp:1891
msgid "Snap to target"
msgstr "对齐至目标"

#: src/options.cpp:1892
msgid "If true, automatically follow the crosshair when firing/throwing."
msgstr "开启时，射击/投掷时会自动将画面中心对齐至目标。"

#: src/options.cpp:1896
msgid "Reaim after firing"
msgstr "开火后再次瞄准"

#: src/options.cpp:1897
msgid "If true, after firing automatically aim again if targets are available."
msgstr "开启时，如果开火后附近仍有目标，则自动再次进入瞄准状态。"

#: src/options.cpp:1901
msgid "Query on keybinding removal"
msgstr "移除快捷键前确认"

#: src/options.cpp:1902
msgid "If true, will query before removing a keybinding from a hotkey."
msgstr "开启时，移除已有快捷键时需要确认。"

#: src/options.cpp:1907
msgid "Open default advanced inventory layout"
msgstr "打开高级物品管理默认布局"

#: src/options.cpp:1908
msgid "If true, open default advanced inventory layout instead of last opened layout"
msgstr "开启时，采用默认布局打开高级物品管理页面，而非上次使用的布局。"

#: src/options.cpp:1912
msgid "Display actions in \"Use item\" menu"
msgstr "在\"使用物品\"菜单中显示可用操作"

#: src/options.cpp:1914
msgid "If true, actions (like \"Read\", \"Smoke\", \"Wrap tighter\") will be displayed next to the corresponding items."
msgstr "开启时，可执行的操作（如阅读、消耗、系紧等）会在物品信息栏一旁列出。"

#: src/options.cpp:1919
msgid "Autoselect if exactly one valid target"
msgstr "自动选择唯一目标"

#: src/options.cpp:1920
msgid "If true, directional actions ( like \"Examine\", \"Open\", \"Pickup\" ) will autoselect an adjacent tile if there is exactly one valid target."
msgstr "开启时，需要指定方向的操作（如查看、开启、拾取等）会在只有唯一有效目标时自动选择方向。"

#: src/options.cpp:1926
msgid "Inventory highlight mode"
msgstr "物品栏高亮模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1927
msgid "Highlight selected item's contents and parent container in inventory screen.  \"Symbol\" shows a highlighted caret and \"Highlight\" uses font highlighting."
msgstr "在物品栏中高亮突出显示所选物品的内容和上级容器。符号：使用高亮符号；高亮：使用高亮字体。"

#: src/options.cpp:1930
msgid "Highlight"
msgstr "高亮"

#: src/options.cpp:1937
msgid "Highlight unread recipes"
msgstr "高亮未读配方"

#: src/options.cpp:1938
msgid "If true, highlight unread recipes to allow tracking of newly learned recipes."
msgstr "开启时，高亮显示未读配方，可用于显示新习得配方。"

#: src/options.cpp:1942
msgid "Screen reader mode"
msgstr "屏幕阅读器模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1943
msgid "On supported UI screens, tweaks display of text to optimize for screen readers.  Targeted towards using the open-source screen reader 'orca' using curses for display."
msgstr "支持的 UI 界面中，调整文本显示以优化屏幕阅读器适配，适配基于 curses库 显示的开源阅读器 Orca。"

#: src/options.cpp:1952
msgid "Diagonal movement with cursor keys and modifiers"
msgstr "斜向操作"

#: src/options.cpp:1997
msgid "Allows diagonal movement with cursor keys using CTRL and SHIFT modifiers.  Diagonal movement action keys are taken from keybindings, so you need these to be configured."
msgstr "方向键配合Ctrl和Shift进行斜向移动。斜向移动将使用按键设置中对应的斜向移动键，你需要先配置这些按键才能生效。"

#: src/options.cpp:1997
msgid "Mode 1: Numpad Emulation"
msgstr "模式1：模拟小键盘（Ctrl长按设置偏移方向，松开Ctrl+移动键）"

#: src/options.cpp:1997
msgid "Mode 2: CW/CCW"
msgstr "模式2：Shift右旋/Ctrl左旋"

#: src/options.cpp:1997
msgid "Mode 3: L/R Tilt"
msgstr "模式3：左/右键斜向（Shift向上偏移/Ctrl向下偏移）"

#: src/options.cpp:1997
msgid "Mode 4: Diagonal Lock"
msgstr "模式4：斜向锁定（长按Ctrl/Shift，然后连续按方向，类似不可思议迷宫系列）"

#: src/options.cpp:2003
msgid "Vehicle Interface Options"
msgstr "载具驾驶"

#: src/options.cpp:2004
msgid "Options regarding vehicle interface."
msgstr "有关载具驾驶体验的一些相关设置"

