msgstr "指定地图记忆自定义亮色RGB值的红色值。"

#: src/options.cpp:2472
msgid "Custom bright color RGB overlay - GREEN"
msgstr "自定义亮色RGB（绿）"

#: src/options.cpp:2473
msgid "Specify RGB value for color GREEN for bright color overlay."
msgstr "指定地图记忆自定义亮色RGB值的绿色值。"

#: src/options.cpp:2479
msgid "Custom bright color RGB overlay - BLUE"
msgstr "自定义亮色RGB（蓝）"

#: src/options.cpp:2480
msgid "Specify RGB value for color BLUE for bright color overlay."
msgstr "指定地图记忆自定义亮色RGB值的蓝色值。"

#: src/options.cpp:2485
msgid "Custom gamma for overlay"
msgstr "自定义伽马"

#: src/options.cpp:2486
msgid "Specify gamma value for overlay."
msgstr "指定地图记忆自定义伽马值。"

#: src/options.cpp:2493
msgid "Pixel Minimap Options"
msgstr "小地图设置"

#: src/options.cpp:2494
msgid "Options regarding pixel minimap."
msgstr "关于侧边栏小地图的相关设置"

#: src/options.cpp:2496
msgid "Pixel minimap"
msgstr "小地图"

#: src/options.cpp:2497
msgid "If true, shows the pixel-detail minimap in game after the save is loaded.  Use the 'Toggle Pixel Minimap' action key to change its visibility during gameplay."
msgstr "开启时，进入游戏后将在侧边栏显示像素小地图。使用\"切换小地图\"快捷键在游戏中开启/关闭小地图。"

#: src/options.cpp:2501
msgid "Pixel minimap drawing mode"
msgstr "小地图绘制模式"

#: src/options.cpp:2502
msgid "Specified the mode in which the minimap drawn."
msgstr "选择小地图的绘制模式。"

#: src/options.cpp:2503
msgid "Solid"
msgstr "实心"

#: src/options.cpp:2504
msgid "Squares"
msgstr "方块"

#: src/options.cpp:2505
msgid "Dots"
msgstr "点阵"

#: src/options.cpp:2511
msgid "Pixel minimap brightness"
msgstr "小地图亮度"

#: src/options.cpp:2512
msgid "Overall brightness of pixel-detail minimap."
msgstr "选择小地图的绘制亮度。"

#: src/options.cpp:2518
msgid "Pixel minimap height"
msgstr "小地图高度"

#: src/options.cpp:2519
msgid "Height of pixel-detail minimap, measured in terminal rows.  Set to 0 for default spacing."
msgstr "像素小地图的高度，以行数为单位。设置为 0 代表默认值。"

#: src/options.cpp:2525
msgid "Scale pixel minimap"
msgstr "缩放小地图"

#: src/options.cpp:2526
msgid "If true, scale pixel minimap to fit its surroundings.  May produce crappy results, especially in modes other than \"Solid\"."
msgstr "开启时，缩放小地图以适应侧边栏。可能导致糟糕的显示效果，尤其是当小地图绘制模式不是\"实心\"时。"

#: src/options.cpp:2532
msgid "Maintain pixel minimap aspect ratio"
msgstr "保持像素小地图长宽比"

#: src/options.cpp:2533
msgid "If true, preserves the square shape of tiles shown on the pixel minimap."
msgstr "开启时，始终保持像素小地图的格子为方形。"

#: src/options.cpp:2540
msgid "Creature beacon size"
msgstr "生物标记大小"

#: src/options.cpp:2541
msgid "Controls how big the creature beacons are.  Value is in minimap tiles."
msgstr "控制小地图上生物标记的大小。单位为小地图格子的大小。"

#: src/options.cpp:2547
msgid "Hostile creature beacon blink speed"
msgstr "敌人标记闪烁速度"

#: src/options.cpp:2548
msgid "Controls how fast the hostile creature beacons blink on the pixel minimap.  Value is multiplied by 200ms.  0 = disabled."
msgstr "控制小地图上敌人标记的闪烁速度。单位为 200 毫秒。0 = 关闭此功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:2554
msgid "Background color"
msgstr "背景色"

#: src/options.cpp:2555
msgid "What color the minimap background should be.  Either based on color theme or (0,0,0) black."
msgstr "小地图的背景色。可以基于配色主题或者纯黑。"

#: src/options.cpp:2557
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主题"

#: src/options.cpp:2558
msgid "Black"
msgstr "黑"

#: src/options.cpp:2568
msgid "Graphical Display Options"
msgstr "渲染调整"

#: src/options.cpp:2569
msgid "Options regarding graphical display."
msgstr "一些关于软硬件渲染，批量渲染等特殊渲染项的设置"

#: src/options.cpp:2573
msgid "Display"
msgstr "切换显示"

#: src/options.cpp:2574
msgid "Sets which video display will be used to show the game.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置游戏使用的显示器。需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp:2580 src/options.cpp:2582
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "全屏模式"

#: src/options.cpp:2581
msgid "Starts Cataclysm in one of the fullscreen modes.  Requires restart."
msgstr "在全屏模式下开始游戏。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp:2582
msgid "Maximized"
msgstr "窗口最大化"

#: src/options.cpp:2582
msgid "Windowed borderless"
msgstr "无边框模式"

#: src/options.cpp:2595 src/options.cpp:2609
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "渲染器"

#: src/options.cpp:2596 src/options.cpp:2610
msgid "Set which renderer to use.  Requires restart."
msgstr "选择所使用的渲染器。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp:2615
msgid "Software rendering"
msgstr "软件渲染"

#: src/options.cpp:2616
msgid "Use software renderer instead of graphics card acceleration.  Requires restart."
msgstr "用软件渲染来替代硬件加速，需要重启。（安卓版采用软件渲染不稳定，可能导致闪退）"

#: src/options.cpp:2624
msgid "Allow render batching"
msgstr "启用批量渲染"

#: src/options.cpp:2625
msgid "If true, use render batching for 2D render API to make it more efficient.  Requires restart."
msgstr "开启时，使用 2D 渲染器 API 中的批量渲染功能加速渲染，需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp:2629
msgid "Software framebuffer acceleration"
msgstr "软件渲染帧缓冲区加速"

#: src/options.cpp:2630
msgid "If true, use hardware acceleration for the framebuffer when using software rendering.  Requires restart."
msgstr "开启时，在软件渲染开启时用硬件加速帧缓冲区，需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp:2640
msgid "Use color modulated textures"
msgstr "使用彩色调制纹理"

#: src/options.cpp:2641
msgid "If true, tries to use color modulated textures to speed-up ASCII drawing.  Requires restart."
msgstr "开启时，尝试使用彩色调制纹理加速ASCII渲染。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp:2645
msgid "Scaling mode"
msgstr "缩放模式"

#: src/options.cpp:2646
msgid "Sets the scaling mode, 'none' (default) displays at the game's native resolution, 'nearest' uses low-quality but fast scaling, and 'linear' provides high-quality scaling."
msgstr "设置放大模式，无（默认）：按原始分辨率显示，最近像素：快速但效果不高的缩放，线性过滤：使用双线性插值进行高质量的缩放。"

#. ~ Do not scale the game image to the window size.
#: src/options.cpp:2648
msgid "No scaling"
msgstr "无缩放"

#. ~ An algorithm for image scaling.
#: src/options.cpp:2650
msgid "Nearest neighbor"
msgstr "最近像素"

#. ~ An algorithm for image scaling.
#: src/options.cpp:2652
msgid "Linear filtering"
msgstr "线性过滤"

#: src/options.cpp:2657
msgid "Scaling factor"
msgstr "缩放比例"

#: src/options.cpp:2658
msgid "Factor by which to scale the display.  Requires restart."
msgstr "显示窗口的缩放比例。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp:2661
msgid "4x"
msgstr "4x"

#: src/options.cpp:2675
msgid "World end handling"
msgstr "死后世界存档处理"

#: src/options.cpp:2676
msgid "Handling of game world when last character dies."
msgstr "当该世界里最后一个角色死亡后如何处理世界存档。"

#: src/options.cpp:2678
msgid "Keep"
msgstr "保留"

#: src/options.cpp:2678
msgid "Query"
msgstr "询问"

#: src/options.cpp:2701
msgid "Monster evolution slowdown"
msgstr "怪物进化减速"

#: src/options.cpp:2702
msgid "A multiplier for the time between monster upgrades.  For example a value of 2.00 would cause evolution to occur at half speed.  Set to 0.00 to turn off monster upgrades."
msgstr "决定怪物每次进化时间间隔的比率。数字越大代表进化越慢。设为 0.00 会停止怪物进化。"

#: src/options.cpp:2708
msgid "World Time Options"
msgstr "当前世界设置"

#: src/options.cpp:2709
msgid "Options regarding the passage of time in the world."
msgstr "物品名称详细或缩略的相关设置项"

#: src/options.cpp:2712
msgid "Eternal season"
msgstr "锁定季节"

#: src/options.cpp:2713
msgid "If true, keep the initial season forever.  Warning: currently bugged and may not work properly."
msgstr "开启时，则一直保持初始季节。警告：目前存在bug，可能无法正常运作。"

#: src/options.cpp:2717
msgid "Day/night cycle"
msgstr "昼夜循环"

#: src/options.cpp:2718
msgid "Day/night cycle settings.  'Normal' sets a normal cycle.  'Eternal Day' sets eternal day.  'Eternal Night' sets eternal night."
msgstr "昼/夜循环设置。\"正常\"设定正常循环。\"永昼\"设定永远白天。\"永夜\"设定永远夜晚。"

#: src/options.cpp:2720
msgid "Eternal Day"
msgstr "永昼"

#: src/options.cpp:2721
msgid "Eternal Night"
msgstr "永夜"

#: src/options.cpp:2729
msgid "Miscellaneous options."
msgstr "杂项选项"

#: src/options.cpp:2731
msgid "Surrounded start"
msgstr "杀出丧尸重围"

#: src/options.cpp:2732
msgid "If true, spawn zombies at shelters.  Makes the starting game a lot harder."
msgstr "开启时，则将在避难所内生成丧尸，使游戏起始时期更加困难。"

#: src/options.cpp:2747
msgid "Distance initial visibility"
msgstr "起始大地图可视范围"

#: src/options.cpp:2748
msgid "Determines the scope, which is known in the beginning of the game."
msgstr "决定了游戏开始时大地图已被探索的范围。"

#: src/options.cpp:2754
msgid "Occlusion Options"
msgstr "贴图遮挡"

#: src/options.cpp:2755
msgid "Options regarding occlusion."
msgstr "关于防止贴图遮挡的相关设置"

#: src/options.cpp:2757
msgid "Handle occlusion by high sprites"
msgstr "处理高图像的视野阻挡"

#: src/options.cpp:2758
msgid "Draw walls normal (Off), retracted/transparent (On), or automatically retracting/transparent near player (Auto)."
msgstr "绘制墙壁时保持正常高度（关），降低墙体高度（开），或者玩家靠近时自动降低高度（自动）。"

#: src/options.cpp:2764
msgid "Prevent occlusion via transparency"
msgstr "通过改变透明度来防止视野阻挡"

#: src/options.cpp:2765
msgid "Prevent occlusion by using semi-transparent sprites."
msgstr "通过使用半透明图像来防止视野阻挡。"

#: src/options.cpp:2769
msgid "Prevent occlusion via retraction"
msgstr "通过缩回来防止视野阻挡"

#: src/options.cpp:2770
msgid "Prevent occlusion by retracting high sprites."
msgstr "通过缩回高图像来防止视野阻挡。"

#: src/options.cpp:2775
msgid "Minimum distance for auto occlusion handling"
msgstr "自动处理视野阻挡的最小距离"

#: src/options.cpp:2776
msgid "Minimum distance for auto occlusion handling.  Values above zero overwrite tileset settings."
msgstr "自动视野阻挡处理的最小距离。大于0的值会覆盖贴图包内置的设定。"

#: src/options.cpp:2781
msgid "Maximum distance for auto occlusion handling"
msgstr "自动处理视野阻挡的最大距离"

#: src/options.cpp:2782
msgid "Maximum distance for auto occlusion handling.  Values above zero overwrite tileset settings."
msgstr "自动视野阻挡处理的最大距离。大于0的值会覆盖贴图包内置的设定。"

#: src/options.cpp:2789
msgid "Skip verification step during loading"
msgstr "加载时跳过验证步骤"

#: src/options.cpp:2790
msgid "If enabled, this skips the JSON verification step during loading.  This may give a faster loading time, but risks JSON errors not being caught until runtime."
msgstr "如果启用，这将在加载时跳过 JSON 验证步骤。这样可能加载更快，但有风险，JSON 错误可能要到运行时才会被发现。"

#: src/options.cpp:2806
msgid "Quicksave on app lose focus"
msgstr "失焦后自动快速保存"

#: src/options.cpp:2807
msgid "If true, quicksave whenever the app loses focus (screen locked, app moved into background etc.)  WARNING: Experimental.  This may result in corrupt save games."
msgstr "开启时，当程序失焦时（锁屏、切换至后台等）将会自动快速保存。警告：实验性功能，可能导致游戏存档错误！"

#: src/options.cpp:2814
msgid "Android Keyboard Options"
msgstr "安卓键盘"

#: src/options.cpp:2815
msgid "Options regarding Android keyboard."
msgstr "关于安卓键盘菜单的一系列设置"

#: src/options.cpp:2817
msgid "Trap Back button"
msgstr "禁止返回按键退出APP"

#: src/options.cpp:2818
msgid "If true, the back button will NOT back out of the app and will be passed to the application as SDL_SCANCODE_AC_BACK.  Requires restart."
msgstr "开启时，按下手机的返回键不会退出游戏，而是将该按键指令解析为SDL_SCANCODE_AC_BACK发送给游戏程序。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp:2823
msgid "Use native Android UI menus"
msgstr "使用安卓原生界面菜单"

#: src/options.cpp:2824
msgid "If true, native Android dialogs are used for some in-game menus, such as popup messages and yes/no dialogs."
msgstr "开启时，游戏内部分菜单将采用安卓原生对话框，例如弹出消息和确认对话框。"

#: src/options.cpp:2829
msgid "Auto-manage virtual keyboard"
msgstr "自动开关虚拟键盘"

#: src/options.cpp:2830
msgid "If true, automatically show/hide the virtual keyboard when necessary based on context.  If false, virtual keyboard must be toggled manually."
msgstr "开启时，虚拟键盘将根据情况自动显示/隐藏；关闭时，虚拟键盘必须用返回键手动切换。"

#: src/options.cpp:2835
msgid "Virtual keyboard screen scale"
msgstr "虚拟键盘屏幕缩放"

#: src/options.cpp:2836
msgid "If true, when the virtual keyboard is visible, scale the screen to prevent overlapping.  Useful for text entry so you can see what you're typing."
msgstr "开启时，当显示虚拟键盘时，游戏窗口将自动缩放以避免被遮盖。便于在文本输入时看清你所输入的文字。"

#: src/options.cpp:2843
msgid "Vibration duration"
msgstr "振动时长"

#: src/options.cpp:2844
msgid "If non-zero, vibrate the device for this long on input, in milliseconds.  Ignored if hardware keyboard connected."
msgstr "当该值不为0时，每次按键输入时都会振动设备，单位为毫秒；该设置在外接键盘时无效。"

#: src/options.cpp:2851
msgid "Android Joystick Options"
msgstr "虚拟摇杆"

#: src/options.cpp:2852
msgid "Options regarding Android Joystick."
msgstr "关于虚拟手柄的一系列相关设设置"

#: src/options.cpp:2854
msgid "Show virtual joystick"
msgstr "显示虚拟手柄"

#: src/options.cpp:2855
msgid "If true, show the virtual joystick when touching and holding the screen.  Gives a visual indicator of deadzone and stick deflection."
msgstr "开启时，当触摸或按住屏幕时将显示虚拟手柄。"

#: src/options.cpp:2859
msgid "Virtual joystick opacity"
msgstr "虚拟手柄透明度"

#: src/options.cpp:2860
msgid "The opacity of the on-screen virtual joystick, as a percentage."
msgstr "调整虚拟手柄的透明度，以百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp:2864
msgid "Virtual joystick deadzone size"
msgstr "虚拟手柄盲区大小"

#: src/options.cpp:2865
msgid "While using the virtual joystick, deflecting the stick beyond this distance will trigger directional input.  Specified as a percentage of longest screen edge."
msgstr "当使用虚拟手柄时，划动手柄偏离超过该距离时将触发方向键输入。单位为最大屏幕边缘的百分比。"

#: src/options.cpp:2869
msgid "Virtual joystick size"
msgstr "虚拟手柄大小"

#: src/options.cpp:2870
msgid "While using the virtual joystick, deflecting the stick by this much will repeat input at the deflected rate (see below).  Specified as a percentage of longest screen edge."
msgstr "当使用虚拟手柄时，划动手柄偏离超过该距离是将按偏离时的频率触发方向键输入（偏离时的重复频率在下方设置）。单位为最大屏幕边缘的百分比。"

#: src/options.cpp:2875
msgid "Virtual joystick follows finger"
msgstr "虚拟手柄跟随手指"

#: src/options.cpp:2876
msgid "If true, the virtual joystick will follow when sliding beyond its range."
msgstr "开启时，虚拟手柄在手指超出划动范围后还会跟随其移动。"

#: src/options.cpp:2881
msgid "Virtual joystick repeat rate (centered)"
msgstr "虚拟手柄重复频率（中心）"

#: src/options.cpp:2882
msgid "When the virtual joystick is centered, how fast should input events repeat, in milliseconds."
msgstr "当虚拟手柄在中心附近时的方向键重复输入频率，单位为毫秒。"

#: src/options.cpp:2887
msgid "Virtual joystick repeat rate (deflected)"
msgstr "虚拟手柄重复频率（偏离）"

#: src/options.cpp:2888
msgid "When the virtual joystick is fully deflected, how fast should input events repeat, in milliseconds."
msgstr "当虚拟手柄完全偏离时的方向键重复输入频率，单位为毫秒。"

#: src/options.cpp:2893
msgid "Virtual joystick repeat rate sensitivity"
msgstr "虚拟手柄重复频率灵敏度"

#: src/options.cpp:2894
msgid "As the virtual joystick moves from centered to fully deflected, this value is an exponent that controls the blend between the two repeat rates defined above.  1.0 = linear."
msgstr "虚拟手柄在中心时至完全偏离时重复输入频率插值幂函数的幂值。1.0 = 线性插值。"

#: src/options.cpp:2898
msgid "Input repeat delay"
msgstr "输入重复延时"

#: src/options.cpp:2899
msgid "While touching the screen, wait this long before showing the virtual joystick and repeating input, in milliseconds.  Also used to determine tap/double-tap detection, flick detection and toggling quick shortcuts."
msgstr "从按住屏幕时至显示虚拟手柄并重复输入按键的时间间隔，单位为毫秒。该延时同时用于决定单击/双击事件检测，切换快捷键等。"

#: src/options.cpp:2903
msgid "Virtual joystick hides shortcuts"
msgstr "虚拟手柄时隐藏快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp:2904
msgid "If true, hides on-screen keyboard shortcuts while using the virtual joystick.  Helps keep the view uncluttered while traveling long distances and navigating menus."
msgstr "开启时，在使用虚拟手柄时隐藏屏幕上的快捷键栏。在长途旅行或者浏览菜单时保持屏幕整洁。"

#: src/options.cpp:2912 src/options.cpp:2986
msgid "Android Shortcut Options"
msgstr "快捷键列表"

#: src/options.cpp:2913
msgid "Options regarding Android shortcut."
msgstr "快捷栏里添加项目相关的选项"

#: src/options.cpp:2915
msgid "Default gameplay shortcuts"
msgstr "默认游戏快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp:2916
msgid "The default set of gameplay shortcuts to show.  Used on starting a new game and whenever all gameplay shortcuts are removed."
msgstr "每次游戏开始时显示的快捷键。用于开始新游戏时或当所有快捷键都被移除时自动显示的快捷键。"

#: src/options.cpp:2921
msgid "Add shortcuts for action menu selections"
msgstr "自动添加行动菜单选项至快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp:2922
msgid "If true, automatically add a shortcut for actions selected via the in-game action menu."
msgstr "开启时，自动将所选择过的行动菜单内的选项添加至快捷键栏中。"

#: src/options.cpp:2927
msgid "Add shortcuts for inventory selections"
msgstr "自动添加物品菜单选项至快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp:2928
msgid "If true, automatically add a shortcut for items selected via the inventory."
msgstr "开启时，自动添加物品栏的选项至快捷键栏中。"

#: src/options.cpp:2936
msgid "Android Gestures Options"
msgstr "手势映射"

#: src/options.cpp:2937
msgid "Options regarding Android gestures."
msgstr "将一些手势映射到键位，建议映射丢弃(D), 搬运地下(\\), 制作(&)和建造(*)等常用功能"

#: src/options.cpp:2939
msgid "Tap key (in-game)"
msgstr "单指轻击按键"

#: src/options.cpp:2940
msgid "The key to press when tapping during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时单指轻击屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp:2944
msgid "Two-finger tap key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指轻击按键"

#: src/options.cpp:2945
msgid "The key to press when tapping with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指轻击屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp:2949
msgid "Two-finger swipe up key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指上扫按键"

#: src/options.cpp:2950
msgid "The key to press when swiping up with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指向上扫过屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp:2955
msgid "Two-finger swipe down key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指下扫按键"

#: src/options.cpp:2956
msgid "The key to press when swiping down with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指向下扫过屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp:2961
msgid "Two-finger swipe left key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指左扫按键"

#: src/options.cpp:2962
msgid "The key to press when swiping left with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指向左扫过屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp:2967
msgid "Two-finger swipe right key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指右扫按键"

#: src/options.cpp:2968
msgid "The key to press when swiping right with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指向右扫过屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp:2972
msgid "Pinch in key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指内缩按键"

#: src/options.cpp:2973
msgid "The key to press when pinching in during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指内缩屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp:2977
msgid "Pinch out key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指外张按键"

#: src/options.cpp:2978
msgid "The key to press when pinching out during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指外张屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp:2987
msgid "Options regarding In-game shortcut."
msgstr "有关游戏过程中快捷键的一些功能行为的设置"

#: src/options.cpp:2990
msgid "Auto-manage contextual gameplay shortcuts"
msgstr "自动根据场景调整快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp:2991
msgid "If true, contextual in-game shortcuts are added and removed automatically as needed: examine, close, butcher, move up/down, control vehicle, pickup, toggle enemy + safe mode, sleep."
msgstr "开启时，根据需要自动添加/移除对应场景下的快捷键：查看，关闭，屠宰，上楼/下楼，控制载具，拾取，切换敌人/安全模式，睡觉等。"

#: src/options.cpp:2996
msgid "Move contextual gameplay shortcuts to front"
msgstr "场景快捷键移至最前"

#: src/options.cpp:2997
msgid "If the option above is enabled, specifies whether contextual in-game shortcuts will be added to the front or back of the shortcuts list.  If true, makes them easier to reach.  If false, reduces shuffling of shortcut positions."
msgstr "开启时，将自动将场景快捷键移动至快捷键列表最前端。开启时更容易控制场景快捷键，关闭时减少对快捷键栏快捷键的调整。"

#: src/options.cpp:3001
msgid "Move used shortcuts to front"
msgstr "使用快捷键移至最前"

#: src/options.cpp:3002
msgid "If true, using an existing shortcut will always move it to the front of the shortcuts list.  If false, only shortcuts typed via keyboard will move to the front."
msgstr "开启时，每次使用已在列表内的快捷键都会将其移动至快捷键列表最前端。关闭时，只有通过键盘输入的快捷键会移动至列表最前端。"

#: src/options.cpp:3007
msgid "Separate shortcuts for No Auto Pickup zones"
msgstr "禁止自动拾取区使用不同快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp:3008
msgid "If true, separate gameplay shortcuts will be used within No Auto Pickup zones.  Useful for keeping home base actions separate from exploring actions."
msgstr "开启时，进入禁止自动拾取区将会切换成另一套快捷键。便于玩家在基地时的行动按键与探索时的行动按键分开。"

#: src/options.cpp:3013
msgid "Turns to remove unused gameplay shortcuts"
msgstr "自动移除未使用快捷键回合数"

#: src/options.cpp:3014
msgid "If non-zero, unused gameplay shortcuts will be removed after this many turns (as in discrete player actions, not world calendar turns)."
msgstr "当不为0时，多个回合内未使用的快捷键将自动从快捷键列表中移除（以玩家回合为单位，而非世界时间）。"

#: src/options.cpp:3018
msgid "Shortcuts persistence"
msgstr "快捷键保存"

#: src/options.cpp:3019
msgid "If true, shortcuts are saved/restored with each save game.  If false, shortcuts reset between sessions."
msgstr "开启时，快捷键将在每个存档间均被保存/读取。关闭时，快捷键在进程重启时重置。"

#: src/options.cpp:3027
msgid "Shortcut Screen Options"
msgstr "快捷键样式"

#: src/options.cpp:3028
msgid "Options regarding shortcut screen."
msgstr "调整快捷键在屏幕上显示效果的相关设置"

#: src/options.cpp:3030
msgid "Shortcuts position"
msgstr "快捷键位置"

#: src/options.cpp:3031
msgid "Switch between shortcuts on the left or on the right side of the screen."
msgstr "切换快捷键栏按屏幕左侧或右侧对齐。"

#: src/options.cpp:3036
msgid "Shortcuts screen percentage"
msgstr "快捷键屏幕百分比"

#: src/options.cpp:3037
msgid "How much of the screen can shortcuts occupy, as a percentage of total screen width."
msgstr "快捷键栏占屏幕的大小，以总屏幕宽度百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp:3041
msgid "Shortcuts overlap screen"
msgstr "快捷键覆盖屏幕"

#: src/options.cpp:3042
msgid "If true, shortcuts will be drawn transparently overlapping the game screen.  If false, the game screen size will be reduced to fit the shortcuts below."
msgstr "开启时，快捷键会以透明的方式叠加在游戏屏幕上。关闭时，游戏屏幕会缩小以显示快捷键栏。"

#: src/options.cpp:3046
msgid "Shortcut opacity (background)"
msgstr "快捷键透明度（背景）"

#: src/options.cpp:3047
msgid "The background opacity of on-screen keyboard shortcuts, as a percentage."
msgstr "调整快捷键栏背景的透明度，以百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp:3051
msgid "Shortcut opacity (shadow)"
msgstr "快捷键透明度（阴影）"

#: src/options.cpp:3052
msgid "The shadow opacity of on-screen keyboard shortcuts, as a percentage."
msgstr "调整快捷键栏阴影的透明度，以百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp:3056
msgid "Shortcut opacity (text)"
msgstr "快捷键透明度（字符）"

#: src/options.cpp:3057
msgid "The foreground opacity of on-screen keyboard shortcuts, as a percentage."
msgstr "调整快捷键栏字符的透明度，以百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp:3061
msgid "Shortcut color"
msgstr "快捷键颜色"

#: src/options.cpp:3062
msgid "The color of on-screen keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr "调整快捷键的颜色。"

#: src/options.cpp:3066
msgid "Shortcut border"
msgstr "快捷键边框"

#: src/options.cpp:3067
msgid "The border of each on-screen keyboard shortcut in pixels."
msgstr "调整快捷键的边框大小，单位为像素。"

#: src/options.cpp:3071
msgid "Shortcut width (min)"
msgstr "快捷键最小宽度"

#: src/options.cpp:3072
msgid "The minimum width of each on-screen keyboard shortcut in pixels.  Only relevant when lots of shortcuts are visible at once."
msgstr "调整快捷键的最小宽度，单位为像素。仅在有许多快捷键同时显示时有意义。"

#: src/options.cpp:3076
msgid "Shortcut width (max)"
msgstr "快捷键最大宽度"

#: src/options.cpp:3077
msgid "The maximum width of each on-screen keyboard shortcut in pixels."
msgstr "调整快捷键的最大宽度，以像素为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp:3081
msgid "Shortcut height"
msgstr "快捷键高度"

#: src/options.cpp:3082
msgid "The height of each on-screen keyboard shortcut in pixels."
msgstr "调整快捷键的高度，以像素为单位。"

