#~ msgid "A black rubber duck with large white eyes.  Designed to dropped in the bath."
#~ msgstr "一只黑色的橡皮鸭，长着一双大大的白眼睛。可以丢进浴缸里。"

#~ msgid "A black-finished shotgun fit for the gentlemanly pursuit of blowing very large holes through the residence of the cataclysm, be it zombie, goose, or tiny abomination, this semi-automatic longarm fields five shotgun shells within its tubular magazine.  Aesthetically pleasing with its dimpled buttstock and forend, the weapon features an underslung pistol-style grip and a gel cushion on the back of the stock for recoil mitigation."
#~ msgstr "这是一把黑色表面的霰弹枪，适合绅士般地追求在灾难的住所中炸出大洞，无论是僵尸、鹅还是微小的可憎之物，这把半自动长臂霰弹枪在其管状弹匣内可发射五发霰弹。  该武器的枪托和前护木呈凹凸形状，美观大方，采用下挂式手枪式握把，枪托背面有凝胶垫以减轻后坐力。"

