#~ msgid "A brother of more typical hunting style shotguns, this particular model was most often seen utilized for self-defense or law-enforcement purposes.  Featuring a shortened 18.5 inch barrel and extended 7-round magazine tube, it's a very versatile and reliable weapon."
#~ msgstr "作为更经典的狩猎用霰弹枪的兄弟，这种特殊型号的霰弹枪最常被用于自卫或执法目的。它有根缩短的18.5英寸(约47厘米)枪管和加长的7发弹匣，是一种非常灵活和可靠的武器。"

#~ msgid "A bullpup pump-action shotgun, the Kel-Tec KSG uses a pair of magazine tubes to increase its capacity."
#~ msgstr "一支无托式泵动霰弹枪，Kel-Tec KSG 霰弹枪有两个单独的管仓供弹机构，以增加其载弹量。每条供弹管仓都要单独装填，射击时也只能选择其中一个管仓供弹，这样也提供了在不同情境下快速切换不同弹药的便利。"

#~ msgid "A bullpup pump-action shotgun, the Kel-Tec KSG-25 uses a pair of magazine tubes to increase its capacity.  Each tube has to be loaded separately, but this offers the option of loading different ammunition for different situations.  The big brother of the KSG, it has a longer barrel and longer magazine tubes."
#~ msgstr "一支无托式泵动霰弹枪，Kel-Tec KSG-25 霰弹枪有两个单独的管仓供弹机构，以增加其载弹量。每条供弹管仓都要单独装填，射击时也只能选择其中一个管仓供弹，这样也提供了在不同情境下快速切换不同弹药的便利。作为 KSG 霰弹枪的老大哥，它有根更长的枪管和更长的弹匣。"

#~ msgid "A bullpup, 12-gauge, pump-action, double-barrelled mouthful of a shotgun.  Each barrel feeds from its own magazine, making the weapon actually two firearms in a single frame, and, while each barrel has its own associated trigger, the presence of a single pump to actuate both mechanisms means that it cannot be used precisely.  This, however, isn't to say that the weapon isn't fit for the service of shooting zombies at point blank ranges."
#~ msgstr "一把 12 号口径、泵动式、双管口霰弹枪。  每个枪管都从自己的弹匣供弹，使得该武器实际上在一个框架中具有两支枪械，并且，虽然每个枪管都有其自己的相关扳机，但驱动两个机制的单个泵的存在意味着它无法精确使用。  然而，这并不是说该武器不适合近距离射击僵尸。"

#~ msgid "A canister grenade filled with a variety of pyrotechnic chemicals.  Use this item to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active smoke bomb.  Five seconds after you do that, it will begin to expel a thick black smoke.  This smoke will slow those who enter it, as well as obscuring vision and scent."
#~ msgstr "一个装满各种发烟物质的筒状手雷。使用该物品将会拔下插销并点燃引信。五秒后它会开始释放浓厚的黑烟，让所有进入其中的倒霉蛋速度下降，同时阻碍视线和掩盖气味。"

#~ msgid "A canister grenade filled with insecticidal solution.  Use this item to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active insecticidal grenade.  In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile gas that is highly toxic to insect life forms."
#~ msgstr "一个装满杀虫溶剂的筒状手雷。使用该物品将会拔下插销并点燃引信。五秒后它会开始释放对昆虫具有高度毒性的挥发性喷雾。"

#~ msgid "A cat-shaped sponge."
#~ msgstr "一块猫形海绵。"

#~ msgid "A chainsaw that has been lightened, tuned, and extensively modified to be easier to handle as a weapon.  Unfortunately, these modifications have rendered it much less effective as a woodcutting tool."
#~ msgstr "经过魔改之后，这把消声轻量链锯变得更加便于使用。不幸的是，它再也不能像从前那样畅快淋漓地切木头了。"

#~ msgid "A cheap menstrual pad.  The cotton somehow looks like sandpaper and is almost see-through thin."
#~ msgstr "便宜的月经垫。 棉花不知何故看起来像砂纸，薄如蝉翼。"

#~ msgid "A cheap-looking tampon.  The cotton looks rough, the plastic applicator has a few sharp edges, and the string is somehow already knotted."
#~ msgstr "一个看起来很便宜的卫生棉条。 棉花看起来很粗糙，塑料涂抹器有一些锋利的边缘，而且绳子不知何故已经打结了。"

#~ msgid "A chunk of cooked fatty meat properly seasoned with black pepper and salt.  Although absent of vitamins, it is very filling, tasty and delightfully greasy."
#~ msgstr "椒盐熟五花肉。盐之有物，口感丰富，油腻不过度，美味又饱腹，只是缺乏维生素。"

#~ msgid "A chunk of flint, the kind of rock that can make sparks if stuck against high-carbon steel.  It also chips in a semi-predictable way if struck, leaving a sharp edge."
#~ msgstr "一块燧石，这种岩石在击打高碳钢时会产生火花。按照特殊方式敲碎时会破碎，留下锋利的边缘。"

#~ msgid "A civilian AK pattern rifle, chambered in 5.56x45 NATO."
#~ msgstr "一把民用AK型步枪，使用 5.56x45 NATO 弹。"

#~ msgid "A civilian AK pattern rifle, chambered in 5.56x45 NATO.  This one is shorter and without a stock"
#~ msgstr "一把民用AK型手枪，使用 5.56x45 NATO 弹。这个版本更短，没有枪托。"

#~ msgid "A classic Mossberg 590 pump-action shotgun, modified by the manufacturer to utilize box magazines."
#~ msgstr "经典的 Mossberg 590 泵动式霰弹枪，由制造商改装以使用弹匣。"

#~ msgid "A classic shotgun in nearly every respect; big, bulky, and intimidating, guns such as this one have been made for over a century in one form or another, coming in both pump-action and semi-automatic models.  Serving both competition-shooting, law-enforcement, and hunting roles, this firearm is sporting a standard-capacity 5-round magazine tube.  Despite the firearm's low magazine space, what it lacks in capacity it makes up for in sheer close-range effectiveness and stopping power."
#~ msgstr "在几乎所有方面都称得上是非常经典的霰弹枪；一个多世纪以来，像这种又大又笨、非常吓人的枪支一直被以各种形式制造，既有泵动式，也有半自动式。这款枪满足了竞赛射击、执法和打猎的需要，具有标准容量的5发弹匣。尽管枪械的弹匣空间很小，但容量上的不足由它在近距离时的有效性和停止力所补偿。"

#~ msgid "A cleaning aid made of soft, porous material.  Typically used for cleaning hard objects."
#~ msgstr "一块质地柔软多孔的清洁海绵，通常用来清洗硬质物品。"

#~ msgid "A closed glass door with a grid of embedded wire to help hold it together in case of damage."
#~ msgstr "一扇封闭式玻璃门，嵌有金属网格以增强结构强度，确保在受损时仍能保持完整。"

#~ msgid "A clothing button carved from horn."
#~ msgstr "用牛角雕刻而成的衣服纽扣。"

#~ msgid "A clump of rotten entrails.  The sallow membranes that link these lobes of flesh together are lined with blackened veins and capillaries.  A caul of slime coats them all in a greasy sheen.  You should not put this anywhere near your mouth."
#~ msgstr "一团腐烂的内脏。  将这些肉瓣连接在一起的蜡黄膜上排列着黑色的静脉和毛细血管。  一层粘液将它们全部包裹在一层油腻的光泽中。  你不应该把它放在嘴附近的任何地方。"

#~ msgid "A colorful bottle of body and hair wash marketed for children."
#~ msgstr "一个用来装儿童沐浴露的五颜六色的瓶子。"

#~ msgid "A combination of a washboard and a scrubbing tool.  Everything you need to clean items after the apocalypse."
#~ msgstr "洗衣板和洗刷工具组成的工具，这就是大灾变后洗涤所需的一切用具。"

#~ msgid "A combination toothbrush and gum massager.  It has an ergonomic silicone grip.  Luxurious!"
#~ msgstr "一根带有牙龈按摩器的复合型牙刷。它有一个符合人体工程学的硅橡胶握把。真是豪华！"

#~ msgid "A compact submachine gun designed evidently under the 'spray and pray' mentality, this Calico M960 automatic carbine is not notably powerful, or dependable, or even particularly accurate to shoot.  Intended for military and law enforcement use, it never saw any noteworthy service due to its poor reliability and overall performance, and would be an unremarkable weapon in all respects, save for its enormous magazine capacity.  Making use of uniquely designed 50 or 100 round circular magazines, the Calico might not be a particularly good gun, but will throw an overwhelming amount of lead down range for a long time providing that it doesn't choke, jam, and die."
#~ msgstr "这支卡利科M960自动卡宾枪显然是在“倾泻火力，然后祈祷”的心态下设计的紧凑型冲锋枪，威力不大，也不可靠，甚至射击也不是很准确。它本来打算用于军事和执法，但由于其可靠性和整体性能较差，从来没有碰上任何应用场景，除了其巨大的弹匣容量外，在各方面都是一种不起眼的武器。因为其独特的50或100发圆形弹匣，它虽然可能不是一把特别好的枪，但只要它不卡壳、堵塞、不炸膛，就能持续射出大量的子弹。"

#~ msgid "A complex respiration augmentation system that increases the user's maximal oxygen uptake and allows for underwater breathing akin to gills.  Will automatically activate if the user is drowning."
#~ msgstr "一整套复杂的呼吸增强系统。可以强化受体对氧气的利用，并允许受体在水中呼吸，溺水后自动开启。"

#~ msgid "A complex respiration augmentation system.  Improves respiration ability in air and allows breathing water.  Will automatically turn on when drowning.  Turn on to recharge stamina faster, at moderate power cost.  Asthmatics may also use it to stop asthma attacks."
#~ msgstr "一个复杂的呼吸增强系统。可以强化在空气中的呼吸能力，并允许在水中呼吸，溺水后自动开启。开启后以中等能量消耗，快速恢复耐力。哮喘患者也可以用它来阻止哮喘发作。"

#~ msgid "A concave ballistic plate made of hard steel, designed to stop small-caliber rounds.  \"NIJ III A PROTECTION\" is etched into the back of the plate.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on its own."
#~ msgstr "一块带凹面的硬质钢防弹板，用来阻挡小口径子弹。插板背面蚀刻着\"NIJ III A级防护\"的字样。它需要放进防弹背心后穿着使用，无法直接穿着。"

#~ msgid "A construction tool for drilling through hard rock or other surfaces.  It runs on a cell compatible with a UPS.  Use it to blast a hole in adjacent solid terrain."
#~ msgstr "一种能够钻穿坚硬岩石或其他表面的建筑工具。它靠UPS驱动，开启后，可以把附近的地面或者敌人钻出一个大洞来。"

#~ msgid "A construction tool for drilling through hard rock or other surfaces.  It runs on gasoline.  Use it (if loaded) to blast a hole in adjacent solid terrain."
#~ msgstr "一种能够钻穿坚硬岩石或其他表面的建筑工具。它靠汽油驱动，使用它可以把附近的地面钻出一个大洞来。"

#~ msgid "A cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal which has been properly seasoned with black pepper and salt, will keep your hunger away, but even seasoned, it has a weird taste."
#~ msgstr "椒盐调味的变异动物熟肉。顶饿，就是味道不太好，虽然已经努力调过了。"

#~ msgid "A cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal."
#~ msgstr "一块煮熟的变异动物肉。"

#~ msgid "A cooked portion of human flesh seasoned with pepper and salt."
#~ msgstr "椒盐人肉片，也许生前没能取悦你的心，至少死后还能取悦你的胃。"

#~ msgid "A cooked scrap of meat that has been properly seasoned with pepper and salt.  Yet small, they have a good taste."
#~ msgstr "椒盐调味的熟碎肉，味道真挺好，只是有点少。"

#~ msgid "A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  It is currently on, ready to do some zombie topiary; use this item to turn it off."
#~ msgstr "一把汽油动力的灌木修剪机。现在已经启动，准备\"修剪\"丧尸们。使用此物品以将其关闭。"

#~ msgid "A crude gas bomb made using household chemicals.  Use this item to arm it.  In three seconds it will begin to expel a highly toxic gas for a short time.  This gas poisons those exposed to it, in addition to obscuring vision and scent."
#~ msgstr "一个由家用化学药品制成的自制催泪手雷。使用以激活它。在三秒后，它会开始释放有毒气体。这种气体会使吸入的生物中毒，也能遮蔽视野和掩盖气味。"

#~ msgid "A curved wooden club with a ball head carved from a root burl.  It is currently soaking in oil and won't be fit for combat for a while longer."
#~ msgstr "一种弯曲的木制球杆，其球头由根节雕刻而成。  它目前正浸泡在油中，一段时间内不适合战斗。"

#~ msgid "A cute and cuddly plushie with soft brown fur, a big, single hump, and friendly eyes."
#~ msgstr "可爱又惹人怜爱的毛绒玩具，有着柔软的棕色毛皮、一个大的单驼峰和友善的眼睛。"

#~ msgid "A deep pool full of water.  Never swim without a lifeguard present.  Even though monsters probably ate them."
#~ msgstr "一个充满水的深池。不要在没有救生员的情况下游泳，就算他们可能已经被怪物吃掉了。"

#~ msgid "A dolphin-shaped sponge.  It looks at home in the water."
#~ msgstr "一块海豚形状的海绵。它在水里就像回到家一样。"

#~ msgid "A farm must be a pretty safe place these days."
#~ msgstr "如今的农场应该会是个非常安全的地方。"

#~ msgid "A favorite among customers with sensitive skin."
#~ msgstr "一款敏感肌客户最喜欢的产品。"

#~ msgid "A favorite among mature customers, this moisturizer will smooth out the wrinkles on your face and make you appear younger."
#~ msgstr "年老客户的最爱。这种保湿霜会抚平你脸上的皱纹，让你看起来更年轻。"

#~ msgid "A finely put together rifle, constructed in the image of old west lever-guns, this weapon features an impressive chambering of .500 Magnum.  Less unmanageable and impractical than within a handgun platform, the power potential of the huge round is nevertheless preserved within this rifle sized package.  Capable of taking down most forms of game, including deer, boars, and small dinosaurs, this is a respectable weapon for only the most enthusiastic of large-calibre shooters."
#~ msgstr "一支精心组装的步枪，以老式西部杠杆枪械的形象制造，带有一个令人印象深刻的.500马格南枪膛。与手枪平台相比，它不太容易控制，也不太实用，但在这支大小的武器中，仍然留有能装填大威力子弹的空间。它能够搞定大多数形式的打猎，包括鹿、野猪和小型恐龙，对于最热衷于大口径射击的人来说，这是一把值得尊敬的武器。"

#~ msgid "A foil-wrapped batt of fibrous insulation; fire- and moisture-resistant, it's used for hot appliances like dishwashers and ovens."
#~ msgstr "一条覆盖着隔热玻璃纤维的垫子：防火防潮，用于洗碗机和烤箱等产热电器。"

#~ msgid "A folding grappling hook attached to a stout, 30-foot long piece of lightweight cord.  Useful for keeping yourself safe from falls.  Can be used in place of a long rope for butchering, in a pinch."
#~ msgstr "可折叠的精钢抓钩，系在一根30英尺(约9米)长的尼龙绳上。有效保护你从高处落下时的安全。足以吊起大型尸体以便屠宰。"

#~ msgid "A forked piece of wood with an elastic band stretched between two of its tips.  Can launch tiny pebbles and similar things at high speeds."
#~ msgstr "一根分叉的木头，两个叉头之间绑上了一条松紧带。可以高速发射小石子和类似物品。"

#~ msgid "A four barreled, adorably tiny pocket pistol, firing the equally minuscule .22 LR cartridge.  Produced in the early 20th century for trappers, its combat effectiveness is questionable to say the least."
#~ msgstr "一把迷人的四管袖珍手枪，发射弱鸡的.22 LR子弹。制造于20世纪早期，主要为猎户所用，在战斗中能发挥多大的效果还要打个问号。"

#~ msgid "A giant trench full of corpses, maybe even a mass graveyard.  The bodies seem to be fused together in some grotesque fashion."
#~ msgstr "一个巨大的深坑，里面堆满了尸体，甚至可能是一个万人坑。这些尸体似乎以某种怪异的方式融合在一起。"

#~ msgid "A gigantic mutated test subject, still wearing the tattered remains of an orange jumpsuit.  They walk on four warped legs ending in hooves, and their head is dominated by a glistening, tangled crown of antlers that scratch the ceiling."
#~ msgstr "一个巨大的变异实验对象，仍然穿着破烂的橙色连身衣。它用四条弯曲的腿走路，手脚变成了蹄子，头上有一个闪闪发光的、缠结在一起的鹿角，鹿角顶部划着天花板。"

#~ msgid "A glass door with a grid of embedded wire to help hold it together in case of damage.  It's open"
#~ msgstr "一扇玻璃门，嵌有金属网格以防损坏时散架。门是开着的。"

#~ msgid "A glass door with a grid of embedded wire to help hold it together in case of damage.  It's open."
#~ msgstr "一扇玻璃门，嵌有金属网格以防损坏时散架。门是开着的。"

#~ msgid "A grass sheet with cords to wear it like a Middle Eastern headdress.  It's a bit itchy, but can keep your head and mouth a bit warmer if there's nothing in the way."
#~ msgstr "一条带绳索的草席，可以像中东头巾一样戴在头上。戴起来有点痒，但如果实在没有其他衣物，它能让你的头和嘴稍微暖和一点。"

#~ msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
#~ msgid "A great fan of the archers of old, but at the same time a follower of the latest trends in archery.  You always tried to keep up with the times, acquiring a takedown bow as well as several accessories to complement it.  You can only hope all the training you did with them can help you survive in this trying times."
#~ msgstr "他是古代弓箭手的忠实粉丝，但同时也是射箭最新趋势的追随者。 你总是试图与时俱进，购买了一把取下弓以及几个配件来补充它。 你只能希望你和他们一起做的所有训练都能帮助你在这个艰难的时期生存下来。"

#~ msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
#~ msgid "A great fan of the archers of old, but at the same time a follower of the latest trends in archery.  You always tried to keep up with the times, acquiring a takedown bow as well as several accessories to complement it.  You can only hope all the training you did with them can help you survive in this trying times."
#~ msgstr "他是古代弓箭手的忠实粉丝，但同时也是射箭最新趋势的追随者。 你总是试图与时俱进，购买了一把取下弓以及几个配件来补充它。 你只能希望你和他们一起做的所有训练都能帮助你在这个艰难的时期生存下来。"

#~ msgid "A gun will probably help."
#~ msgstr "你可能有必要带把枪。"

#~ msgid "A handful of earthworms."
#~ msgstr "一些蚯蚓。"

#~ msgid "A handful of flesh wriggles loose from the mass and takes flight!"
#~ msgstr "几块血肉从主体中挣脱出来，然后飞起来了！"

#~ msgid "A handful of gravel, smaller than pebbles but larger than sand."
#~ msgstr "一把碎石，比石子略小，但又比沙子略大。"

#~ msgid "A heavy circular block of solid rubber, normally used for playing hockey.  You can throw it to cause some serious harm."
#~ msgstr "用固体橡胶制成的沉重的球状物，通常用于玩曲棍球。投掷它能造成严重的伤害。"

#~ msgid "A heavy concave ballistic plate made of tempered steel, designed to stop small-caliber rounds.  \"NIJ III PROTECTION\" is etched into the back of the plate.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on its own."
#~ msgstr "一块沉重的带凹面的回火碳钢防弹板，用来阻挡小口径子弹。插板背面蚀刻着\"NIJ III 级防护\"的字样。它需要放进防弹背心后穿着使用，无法直接穿着。"

#~ msgid "A hefty plastic bag, made to carry lots of trash.  It's sturdy and waterproof, and could easily be repurposed."
#~ msgstr "一个巨大的塑料袋，能装很多垃圾。它结实且防水，可以被重新利用。"

#~ msgid "A hellish, vaguely humanoid horror, two stories tall.  Its face is grotesquely stretched out, its limbs deformed to unrecognizable outgrowths."
#~ msgstr "犹如地狱出来的未知生物，类似人形，两层楼高，脸看上去完全畸变了，扭曲的四肢非常瘆人。"

#~ msgid "A high-drag projectile used in the sport of badminton."
#~ msgstr "一个羽毛球比赛中使用的高阻力羽毛球。"

#~ msgid "A large and sturdy sack, made out of some plastic material.  Popular choice to store sand, gravel, cement, or stop some local flood."
#~ msgstr "一个大而坚固的袋子，由某种塑料材料制成。  储存沙子、砾石、水泥或阻止当地洪水的流行选择。"

#~ msgid "A large log of wood, cut from a tree.  (a)ctivate a wood axe or wood saw to cut it into planks."
#~ msgstr "一根砍倒树木得到的巨大原木，斧头对着它使用可以把它切成木板。"

#~ msgid "A large menstrual pad meant for use overnight."
#~ msgstr "一个大的月经垫，用于过夜。"

#~ msgid "A large set of paddles which can be moved by flowing water to turn an axle and generate power."
#~ msgstr "一大组桨叶，它们可以通过流动的水来移动，从而转动轴并产生动力。"

#~ msgid "A large sheet of glass with wire mesh embedded inside to keep them from shattering as easily when damaged."
#~ msgstr "一大块玻璃，内部嵌入了金属丝网，以防止玻璃在受损时轻易破碎。"

#~ msgid "A large turbine that can convert wind into electric power."
#~ msgstr "能把风转化成电能的大型涡轮机。"

#~ msgid "A large, relatively sharp blade.  Could be used to make bladed weaponry, or attached to a car."
#~ msgstr "一个锋利的大刀片，用于装在车上对目标造成物理伤害，也经过可简易的加工成为一把砍刀。"

#~ msgid "A late 19th century semi-automatic German pistol with an integral magazine loaded from the top via stripper clips, and quite possibly the most steampunk gun one could ever possibly lay their hands on.  A red number '9' burned and painted into the weapon's broom handle-shaped grip marks it as a variant chambered for 9x19mm rounds.  Both exported for commercial use and produced for the German military during the First World War to make up for production shortages of the standard Luger, this example likely entered the US as a holdover from the Great War.  You suppose that it's only fitting that one of the globe's first produced and oldest semi-automatic handguns gets reinstated into service now that the planet's facing its end."
#~ msgstr "一把19世纪晚期的半自动德国手枪，带有一个通过直排弹夹从顶部装入的内置弹匣，很可能是人们所能接触到的最蒸汽朋克式的武器。在枪械的扫帚柄状握柄上印着一个烧焦并涂上红色的数字\"9\"，标记其使用9x19mm口径子弹。在第一次世界大战期间，这两款型号都作为民用产品出口，并为德军生产使用，以弥补标准鲁格手枪的生产短缺。这把枪很可能是作为第一次世界大战的遗物进入美国的。你觉得在地球即将走向末日的时候，让这把全球最早生产、也是最古老的半自动手枪之一恢复使用才是十分应景的。"

#~ msgid "A leather bandolier strapped around the torso for keeping 40mm grenades close to hand.  For some reason, wearing this makes you feel Austrian."
#~ msgstr "一条系在躯干上的皮革榴弹带，保证40mm榴弹随手可得。不知为何，戴上这个让你有一种奥地利人的感觉。"

#~ msgid "A leather sling, easy to use and accurate.  It uses pebbles as ammunition."
#~ msgstr "一个皮革制成的弹弓，使用简单且准度还行。使用小石子作为弹药。"

#~ msgid "A legacy of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Qi Dong.  Viper Style (originally called Snake Style) is punishing to stunned opponents.  Stunning a foe with a Viper Bite will allow you to finish them off with the legendary Viper Strike."
#~ msgstr "五毒教洪文通使用的神功，毒蛇功专注于攻击被击昏的对手。先用\"蛇嘴拳\"击晕，然后就能够使用传说中的\"蛇信掌\"终结对手。"

#~ msgid "A lengthy shotgun that accepts revolving 16-round magazines."
#~ msgstr "一把长霰弹枪，可装 16 发旋转弹匣。"

