#~ msgid "A massive handmade imitation of a proper ballistic vest for abnormally large folks.  Large and heavy, but will still fit under an abnormally large coat."
#~ msgstr "一件巨大的自制凯夫拉防弹背心，根据正品仿制，供体型异常大的人使用。又大又重，但仍然适合放在异常大的外套下面。"

#~ msgid "A mesh of string and weights, traditionally used to catch fish and to entangle opponents in combat."
#~ msgstr "由绳子和重物组成的网，传统上用来捕鱼，也可以在战斗中缠住敌人。"

#~ msgid "A metal keg filled with military explosives.  It has been activated and will soon explode, delivering its entire destructive power to everything in sight."
