#~ msgid "A popular carbine, long used by the US military.  Though accurate, small, and lightweight, it is infamous for its unreliability when not properly maintained.  It is chambered in 5.56x45mm and accepts STANAG magazines."
#~ msgstr "一款流行的卡宾枪，被美军长期使用。虽然精度高，体积小，重量轻，但是可靠性之差臭名昭著，特别是在未能正确保养时。它的口径为 5.56x45mm，可使用 STANAG 弹匣。"

#~ msgid "A portable coal-or-charcoal-fired kiln.  It is designed for firing bricks, but you could use it to fire anything made of clay."
