#~ msgid "Bringing a compact, highly modular, and soft-recoiling weapon system to the table, the Desert Tech Micro Dynamic Rifle Extreme (MDRX) is a gas-operated bullpup carbine originally unveiled in 2014, with this updated model of the weapon having been released in 2019.  One of the rifle's most notable features is the utter simplicity of swapping the carbine's chambering, with an easy change of the barrel, bolt, and a handful of other components being all the steps required to chamber the MDRX for either .223 Remington, .308 Winchester, or .300 AAC Blackout."
#~ msgstr "Desert Tech 微型动态步枪至尊 (MDRX) 带来了紧凑、高度模块化和软反冲的武器系统，是一款气动无托式卡宾枪，最初于 2014 年推出，这款武器的更新型号已于 2019 年发布。该步枪最显着的特点之一是更换卡宾枪的膛室非常简单，可以轻松更换枪管、枪机和一些其他组件，所有这些都可以轻松更换。将 MDRX 装入 0.223 Remington、0.308 Winchester 或 0.300 AAC Blackout 所需的步骤。"

