#~ msgid "He began killing others to get their bones as fresh as possible.  Later, he… he started carving the bones of the living.  Thought the anguish alone would empower the song.  The goal of the Kindred is to banish the shadow of the Cataclysm, not to cast it.  Such heinous acts will likely twist the song of the world, but I don't think Cooper realizes it.  To him, the end justifies any means."
#~ msgstr "他开始杀戮别人来获得尽可能新鲜的骨头。后来，他……他开始雕刻活人的骨头。他以为光靠痛苦就能强化这歌声。血族的目标是驱逐大灾变的阴影，而不是释放它。这种令人发指的行径只会扭曲世界之歌，但我认为库珀没有意识到这一点。对他来说，为达目的可以不择手段。"

