#~ msgid "Possibly the most popular pistol in existence, the Glock 19 can be summed up as being fundamentally a more compact brother to the full-sized Glock 17 pistol.  Sporting a mainly polymer-based design, the Glock 19 is often derided for its plastic construction which lends the handgun a deceptively flimsy feel.  Even so, the Glock 19 remains both a remarkably reliable firearm and a quite shootable gun in its own right."
