#~ msgid "Recognized the world over as one of the first practical self-loading pistols, the Mauser C96 and its derivatives are nearly universally regarded as some of the most classic and rugged guns in history, with the model being praised as a true marvel of industrial craftsmanship.  However, what rests before you is not an original production C96, but rather a modern American spin on the original Mauser recipe.  Feeding from detachable box magazines rather than an internal clip, the M714 is crafted out of a mix of modern and surplus parts, being chambered for 9x19mm rounds, with some other models being offered in the Mauser's own 7.63x25mm cartridge."
#~ msgstr "毛瑟C96及其衍生型号被公认是世界上首批实用的自动装填手枪之一，被广泛认为是枪械史上最经典、最耐用的手枪型号之一，被誉为工业制造的真正奇迹。然而，摆在你面前的并不是原版C96手枪，而是对原毛瑟设计图再次改版生产的现代美国版毛瑟手枪。M714驳壳枪采用可拆卸的盒式弹匣，而非内置弹夹，将现代配件和原厂备件组合制造而成，可使用9x19mm口径弹药，此外还有一些其他型号的弹匣采用毛瑟原本的7.63x25mm口径。"

