#~ msgid "She said it was… energy in bones?  Listen, I've heard a lot of crazy bullshit in my time and that's up there, for sure.  And I don't see how something like that explains all the crazy shit I've seen either.  But collecting bones to… save the world?  Fuck it, give it a shot.  Maybe that's something just YOU do, though.  I'm happy believing a lie if that's the truth, I'll be honest."
