#~ msgid "This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use of polymers and aluminum, using standard magazines from the AR-15 platform and the 5.56 NATO cartridge.  The name stands for rifle, downward-ejection, bullpup, and its design was intended to incorporate some technical solutions, such as downward case ejection and convenience for left-handers, to solve some problems with bullpup guns.  However, the good idea's execution is not as perfect as the manufacturer (and user) would like.  No good idea from Kel-Tec is immune to Kel-Tec manufacturing issues, sadly."
#~ msgstr "这是一把半自动无托式步枪，由于使用了聚合物和铝的材质枪体十分轻便。使用AR-15系标准弹匣及5.56×45mm口径弹药。其名字已经很好地代表了这把步枪：下方抛壳、无托结构、为特殊技术原因设计，例如，下方抛壳便于左手持枪使用，同时解决了一些无托式步枪的问题。不过虽然设计理念很美好，但制造厂商(及用户)就不一定喜欢了。\"没有一个好点子能避免被凯尔科技制造问题拖后腿，真可惜。\""

#~ msgid "This is a semi-automatic pistol chambered in 5.56 NATO, using a gas piston to reduce length and a frame constructed from reinforced polymer to make it both durable and light-weight.  This one comes with a plastic handguard."
#~ msgstr "这把半自动手枪适用5.56 NATO 子弹，使用气动活塞缩短长度，并采用加强聚合材料制作枪身以减轻重量并增加强度。这把枪的护手是塑料制成的。"

